# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"By convention, any argument whose name contains the name of a type (e.g., "
"<var class=\"var\">integer</var>, <var class=\"var\">integer1</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var>) is expected to be of that type.  A plural of a "
"type (such as <var class=\"var\">buffers</var>) often means a list of "
"objects of that type.  An argument named <var class=\"var\">object</var> may "
"be of any type.  (For a list of Emacs object types, see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Lisp-Data-Types.html\">Lisp Data Types</a>.)  An argument with any "
"other sort of name (e.g., <var class=\"var\">new-file</var>) is specific to "
"the function; if the function has a documentation string, the type of the "
"argument should be described there (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Documentation.html\">Documentation</a>)."
msgstr ""
"慣例として、名前に型名が含まれる引数（例：<var class=\"var\">integer</var>、"
"<var class=\"var\">integer1</var>、<var class=\"var\">buffer</var>）は、その"
"型であると想定されます。型の複数形（<var class=\"var\">buffers</var>など）"
"は、多くの場合、その型のオブジェクトのリストを意味します。<var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>という名前の引数は、任意の型である可能性がありま"
"す。（Emacsのオブジェクト型の一覧については、<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-"
"Data-Types.html\">Lispデータ型</a>を参照してください。）それ以外の形式の名前"
"を持つ引数（例：<var class=\"var\">new-file</var>）は、その関数固有のもので"
"す。関数にドキュメント文字列がある場合は、引数の型がそこに記述されているはず"
"です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Documentation.html\">ドキュメント</a>を参照し"
"てください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lambda-Expressions.html\">Lambda Expressions</"
"a>, for a more complete description of arguments modified by <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code> and <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> によって修飾される引数のより詳細な説明につい"
"ては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lambda-Expressions.html\">ラムダ式</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"Command, macro, and special form descriptions have the same format, but the "
"word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Function</samp>&rsquo; is replaced by "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Command</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Macro</samp>&rsquo;, or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Special "
"Form</samp>&rsquo;, respectively.  Commands are simply functions that may be "
"called interactively; macros process their arguments differently from "
"functions (the arguments are not evaluated), but are presented the same way."
msgstr ""
"コマンド、マクロ、および特殊形式の記述形式は同一ですが、「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Function</samp>」という語がそれぞれ「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Command</samp>」、「<samp class=\"samp\">Macro</samp>」、また"
"は「<samp class=\"samp\">Special Form</samp>」に置き換えられます。コマンドは"
"単に対話的に呼び出せる関数であり、マクロは引数を関数とは異なる方法で処理しま"
"すが（引数は評価されません）、提示形式は同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"The descriptions of macros and special forms use a more complex notation to "
"specify optional and repeated arguments, because they can break the argument "
"list down into separate arguments in more complicated ways.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><span class=\"r\">[</span><var class=\"var\">optional-arg</"
"var><span class=\"r\">]</span></samp>&rsquo; means that <var "
"class=\"var\">optional-arg</var> is optional and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">repeated-args</var>&hellip;</samp>&rsquo; "
"stands for zero or more arguments.  Parentheses are used when several "
"arguments are grouped into additional levels of list structure.  Here is an "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"マクロや特殊形式の記述では、任意引数や繰り返し引数を指定するために、より複雑"
"な記法が用いられます。これは、引数リストをより複雑な方法で個別の引数に分割で"
"きるためです。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><span class=\"r\">[</span><var "
"class=\"var\">optional-arg</var><span class=\"r\">]</span></samp>&rsquo;は"
"<var class=\"var\">optional-arg</var>が任意であることを意味し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">repeated-args</var>&hellip;</samp>&rsquo;は"
"0個以上の引数を表します。複数の引数をさらに階層的なリスト構造にグループ化する"
"場合には、括弧が使用されます。以下に例を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">count-loop</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(var [from to "
"[inc]]) body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"count_002dloop\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">count-loop</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(var [from to "
"[inc]]) body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"count_002dloop\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"This imaginary special form implements a loop that executes the <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> forms and then increments the variable <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> on each iteration.  On the first iteration, the "
"variable has the value <var class=\"var\">from</var>; on subsequent "
"iterations, it is incremented by one (or by <var class=\"var\">inc</var> if "
"that is given).  The loop exits before executing <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var> if <var class=\"var\">var</var> equals <var class=\"var\">to</var>.  "
"Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"この仮想的な特殊形式は、<var class=\"var\">body</var>形式を実行し、その後各反"
"復で変数<var class=\"var\">var</var>をインクリメントするループを実装していま"
"す。最初の反復では変数の値は<var class=\"var\">from</var>となり、それ以降の反"
"復では1ずつ（または<var class=\"var\">inc</var>が指定されている場合はその値だ"
"け）インクリメントされます。<var class=\"var\">var</var>が<var "
"class=\"var\">to</var>と等しい場合、<var class=\"var\">body</var>を実行する前"
"にループを終了します。以下に例を示します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(count-loop (i 0 10)\n"
"  (prin1 i) (princ &quot; &quot;)\n"
"  (prin1 (aref vector i))\n"
"  (terpri))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">from</var> and <var class=\"var\">to</var> are "
"omitted, <var class=\"var\">var</var> is bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> before the loop begins, and the loop exits if <var class=\"var\">var</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> at the beginning of an "
"iteration.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">from</var> と <var class=\"var\">to</var> が省略されている"
"場合、ループ開始前に <var class=\"var\">var</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドされ、反復処理の開始時に <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であればループ"
"を終了します。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(count-loop (done)\n"
"  (if (pending)\n"
"      (fixit)\n"
"    (setq done t)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/A-Sample-Function-Description.html
msgid ""
"In this special form, the arguments <var class=\"var\">from</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">to</var> are optional, but must both be present or both "
"absent.  If they are present, <var class=\"var\">inc</var> may optionally be "
"specified as well.  These arguments are grouped with the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> into a list, to distinguish them from <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>, which includes all remaining elements of the form."
msgstr ""
"この特殊な形式では、引数 <var class=\"var\">from</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">to</var> は省略可能ですが、両方が指定されているか、あるいは両方"
"が省略されている必要があります。これらが指定されている場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">inc</var> も任意で指定できます。これらの引数は、形式の残りのす"
"べての要素を含む <var class=\"var\">body</var> と区別するため、引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> とともにリストにまとめられています。"

