# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Abbrevs are usually expanded by certain interactive commands, including "
"<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>.  This section describes the "
"subroutines used in writing such commands, as well as the variables they use "
"for communication."
msgstr ""
"略語は通常、<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> を含む特定のイン"
"タラクティブコマンドによって展開されます。本節では、こうしたコマンドの記述に"
"使用されるサブルーチンと、通信に用いられる変数について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-symbol</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev "
"&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dsymbol\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-symbol</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev "
"&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dsymbol\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the symbol representing the abbrev named <var "
"class=\"var\">abbrev</var>.  It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"that abbrev is not defined.  The optional second argument <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> is the abbrev table in which to look it up.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">table</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function tries first the current buffer&rsquo;s local abbrev table, and "
"second the global abbrev table."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">abbrev</var> という名前の略語を表すシンボルを"
"返します。その略語が定義されていない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返します。オプションの第2引数 <var class=\"var\">table</var> は、検索対象とす"
"る略語テーブルです。<var class=\"var\">table</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、この関数はまず現在のバッファのローカル略語"
"テーブルを、次にグローバル略語テーブルを検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-expansion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev "
"&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dexpansion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-expansion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev "
"&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dexpansion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the string that <var class=\"var\">abbrev</var> would "
"expand into (as defined by the abbrev tables used for the current buffer).  "
"It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">abbrev</"
"var> is not a valid abbrev.  The optional argument <var class=\"var\">table</"
"var> specifies the abbrev table to use, as in <code class=\"code\">abbrev-"
"symbol</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">abbrev</var> が展開される文字列（現在のバッ"
"ファで使用されている略記テーブルで定義されたもの）を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">abbrev</var> が有効な略記でない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> は、<code class=\"code\">abbrev-symbol</code> と同"
"様に、使用する略記テーブルを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">expand-abbrev</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"expand_002dabbrev\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">expand-abbrev</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"expand_002dabbrev\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This command expands the abbrev before point, if any.  If point does not "
"follow an abbrev, this command does nothing.  To do the expansion, it calls "
"the function that is the value of the <code class=\"code\">abbrev-expand-"
"function</code> variable, with no arguments, and returns whatever that "
"function does."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ポイントの前に略語がある場合にそれを展開します。ポイントが略"
"語の後に続かない場合、このコマンドは何もしません。展開を行う際は、<code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-expand-function</code> 変数の値である関数を引数なしで呼"
"び出し、その関数が返した値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The default expansion function returns the abbrev symbol if it did "
"expansion, and <code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  If the abbrev "
"symbol has a hook function that is a symbol whose <code class=\"code\">no-"
"self-insert</code> property is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and if "
"the hook function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> as its value, then "
"the default expansion function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, even "
"though expansion did occur."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの展開関数は、展開が行われた場合は略記記号を、そうでない場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。略記記号に、<code "
"class=\"code\">no-self-insert</code> プロパティが non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である記号のフック関数が定義されており、そのフック"
"関数が値として <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す場合、展開が行われたとし"
"ても、デフォルトの展開関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-insert</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev "
"&amp;optional name start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dinsert\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-insert</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev "
"&amp;optional name start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dinsert\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This function inserts the abbrev expansion of <code class=\"code\">abbrev</"
"code>, replacing the text between <code class=\"code\">start</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">end</code>.  If <code class=\"code\">start</code> is "
"omitted, it defaults to point.  <code class=\"code\">name</code>, if non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, should be the name by which this abbrev was "
"found (a string); it is used to figure out whether to adjust the "
"capitalization of the expansion.  The function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev</code> if the abbrev was successfully inserted, "
"otherwise it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">abbrev</code> の略語展開を挿入し、<code "
"class=\"code\">start</code> と <code class=\"code\">end</code> の間のテキスト"
"を置き換えます。<code class=\"code\">start</code> が省略された場合は、デフォ"
"ルトで point となります。<code class=\"code\">name</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、それはこの略語が見つかった際の名称（文"
"字列）である必要があり、展開後の大文字・小文字を調整するかどうかを判断するた"
"めに使用されます。略語が正常に挿入された場合は <code class=\"code\">abbrev</"
"code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-prefix-mark</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional arg</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dprefix_002dmark\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-prefix-mark</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional arg</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dprefix_002dmark\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This command marks the current location of point as the beginning of an "
"abbrev.  The next call to <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> will use "
"the text from here to point (where it is then) as the abbrev to expand, "
"rather than using the previous word as usual."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、pointの現在位置を略語の開始位置として指定します。次に<code "
"class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code>を呼び出した際は、通常通り直前の単語を使用"
"するのではなく、ここからpoint（その時点での位置）までのテキストを展開用の略語"
"として使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"First, this command expands any abbrev before point, unless <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"(Interactively, <var class=\"var\">arg</var> is the prefix argument.)  Then "
"it inserts a hyphen before point, to indicate the start of the next abbrev "
"to be expanded.  The actual expansion removes the hyphen."
msgstr ""
"まず、このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限り、ポイントより前のあらゆる略語を展開しま"
"す。（対話モードでは、<var class=\"var\">arg</var> がプレフィックス引数となり"
"ます。）次に、次に展開される略語の開始位置を示すため、ポイントの前にハイフン"
"を挿入します。実際の展開では、このハイフンが削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-all-caps</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dall_002dcaps\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">abbrev-all-caps</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dall_002dcaps\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"When this is set non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, an abbrev entered "
"entirely in upper case is expanded using all upper case.  Otherwise, an "
"abbrev entered entirely in upper case is expanded by capitalizing each word "
"of the expansion."
msgstr ""
"これを non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、すべて大文字で入力さ"
"れた略語はすべて大文字で展開されます。それ以外の場合は、すべて大文字で入力さ"
"れた略語は、展開後の各単語の先頭を大文字にして展開されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-start-location</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dstart_002dlocation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-start-location</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dstart_002dlocation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a buffer position (an integer or a marker)  "
"for <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> to use as the start of the "
"next abbrev to be expanded.  The value can also be <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, which means to use the word before point instead.  <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-start-location</code> is set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> each time <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</"
"code> is called.  This variable is also set by <code class=\"code\">abbrev-"
"prefix-mark</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> が次に展開する略語"
"の開始位置として使用するバッファ位置（整数またはマーカー）です。また、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> とすることもでき、その場合は代わりにポイント"
"直前の単語を使用します。<code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> が呼び出さ"
"れるたびに、<code class=\"code\">abbrev-start-location</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されます。この変数は <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-prefix-mark</code> によっても設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-start-location-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dstart_002dlocation_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-start-location-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dstart_002dlocation_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the buffer for which <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-start-location</code> has been set.  Trying to expand "
"an abbrev in any other buffer clears <code class=\"code\">abbrev-start-"
"location</code>.  This variable is set by <code class=\"code\">abbrev-prefix-"
"mark</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">abbrev-start-location</code> が設定され"
"ているバッファです。他のバッファで略記を展開しようとすると、<code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-start-location</code> がクリアされます。この変数は "
"<code class=\"code\">abbrev-prefix-mark</code> によって設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-abbrev</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dabbrev\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-abbrev</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dabbrev\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This is the <code class=\"code\">abbrev-symbol</code> of the most recent "
"abbrev expanded.  This information is left by <code class=\"code\">expand-"
"abbrev</code> for the sake of the <code class=\"code\">unexpand-abbrev</"
"code> command (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html#Expanding-"
"Abbrevs\">Expanding Abbrevs</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"これは、直近で展開された略語の <code class=\"code\">abbrev-symbol</code> で"
"す。この情報は、<code class=\"code\">unexpand-abbrev</code> コマンドのために "
"<code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> によって残されています（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Expanding-"
"Abbrevs.html#Expanding-Abbrevs\">Expanding Abbrevs</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-abbrev-location</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dabbrev_002dlocation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-abbrev-location</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dabbrev_002dlocation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This is the location of the most recent abbrev expanded.  This contains "
"information left by <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> for the sake "
"of the <code class=\"code\">unexpand-abbrev</code> command."
msgstr ""
"ここは、直近で略語が展開された箇所です。ここには、<code "
"class=\"code\">unexpand-abbrev</code>コマンドのために<code "
"class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code>が残した情報が含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-abbrev-text</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dabbrev_002dtext\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-abbrev-text</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dabbrev_002dtext\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This is the exact expansion text of the most recent abbrev expanded, after "
"case conversion (if any).  Its value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"the abbrev has already been unexpanded.  This contains information left by "
"<code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> for the sake of the <code "
"class=\"code\">unexpand-abbrev</code> command."
msgstr ""
"これは、ケース変換（ある場合）後の、直近に展開された略語の正確な展開テキスト"
"です。略語が既に展開済みである場合、その値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"となります。ここには、<code class=\"code\">unexpand-abbrev</code> コマンドの"
"ために <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> が残した情報が含まれていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-expand-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dexpand_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-expand-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dexpand_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a function that <code class=\"code\">expand-"
"abbrev</code> will call with no arguments to do the expansion.  The function "
"can do anything it wants before and after performing the expansion.  It "
"should return the abbrev symbol if expansion took place."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> が引数なしで呼び出"
"して展開を行う関数です。この関数は、展開の前後で任意の処理を行うことができま"
"す。展開が行われた場合は、略記記号を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The following sample code shows a simple use of <code class=\"code\">abbrev-"
"expand-function</code>.  It assumes that <code class=\"code\">foo-mode</"
"code> is a mode for editing certain files in which lines that start with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; are comments.  You want to use "
"Text mode abbrevs for those lines.  The regular local abbrev table, <code "
"class=\"code\">foo-mode-abbrev-table</code> is appropriate for all other "
"lines.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html\">Standard "
"Abbrev Tables</a>, for the definitions of <code class=\"code\">local-abbrev-"
"table</code> and <code class=\"code\">text-mode-abbrev-table</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Advising-Functions.html\">Advising Emacs Lisp "
"Functions</a>, for details of <code class=\"code\">add-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下のサンプルコードは、<code class=\"code\">abbrev-expand-function</code> の"
"簡単な使用例を示しています。ここでは、<code class=\"code\">foo-mode</code> を"
"特定のファイルを編集するためのモードとし、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</"
"samp>&rsquo; で始まる行をコメントとして扱うものとします。これらの行にはテキス"
"トモードの略語を使用したいと考えています。それ以外のすべての行には、通常の"
"ローカル略語テーブルである <code class=\"code\">foo-mode-abbrev-table</code> "
"が適しています。<code class=\"code\">local-abbrev-table</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">text-mode-abbrev-table</code> の定義については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html\">標準略語テーブル</a> を参"
"照してください。<code class=\"code\">add-function</code> の詳細については、"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Advising-Functions.html\">Advising Emacs Lisp 関数</"
"a> を参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo-mode-abbrev-expand-function (expand)\n"
"  (if (not (save-excursion (forward-line 0) (eq (char-after) ?#)))\n"
"      ;; Performs normal expansion.\n"
"      (funcall expand)\n"
"    ;; We're inside a comment: use the text-mode abbrevs.\n"
"    (let ((local-abbrev-table text-mode-abbrev-table))\n"
"      (funcall expand))))\n"
"\n"
"(add-hook 'foo-mode-hook\n"
"          (lambda ()\n"
"            (add-function :around (local 'abbrev-expand-function)\n"
"                          #'foo-mode-abbrev-expand-function)))\n"
msgstr ""

