#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span>39.3 Saving Abbrevs in Files<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Saving-"
"Abbrevs-in-Files\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>39.3 ファイルへの略語の保存<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Saving-"
"Abbrevs-in-Files\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-save-abbrevs-in-files\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-save-abbrevs-in-files\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"A file of saved abbrev definitions is actually a file of Lisp code.  The "
"abbrevs are saved in the form of a Lisp program to define the same abbrev "
"tables with the same contents.  Therefore, you can load the file with <code "
"class=\"code\">load</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"How-Programs-Do-"
"Loading.html\">How Programs Do Loading</a>).  However, the function <code "
"class=\"code\">quietly-read-abbrev-file</code> is provided as a more "
"convenient interface.  Emacs automatically calls this function at startup."
msgstr ""
"保存された略語定義のファイルは、実際にはLispコードのファイルです。略語は、同"
"じ内容の略語テーブルを定義するためのLispプログラムの形式で保存されています。"
"したがって、<code class=\"code\">load</code> でこのファイルを読み込むことがで"
"きます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"How-Programs-Do-Loading.html\">プログラムの"
"読み込み方法</a>を参照）。ただし、より便利なインターフェースとして <code "
"class=\"code\">quietly-read-abbrev-file</code> 関数が用意されています。Emacs"
"は起動時にこの関数を自動的に呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"User-level facilities such as <code class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> "
"can save abbrevs in a file automatically, under the control of variables "
"described here."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> などのユーザーレベルの機能で"
"は、ここで説明する変数の制御により、ファイルに略記を自動的に保存できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrev_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">abbrev-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"This is the default file name for reading and saving abbrevs.  By default, "
"Emacs will look for <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/abbrev_defs</samp>, and, "
"if not found, for <samp class=\"file\">~/.abbrev_defs</samp>; if neither "
"file exists, Emacs will create <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/abbrev_defs</"
"samp>."
msgstr ""
"これは、略語の読み書きに使用されるデフォルトのファイル名です。デフォルトで"
"は、Emacsは<samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/abbrev_defs</samp>を探し、見つから"
"なければ<samp class=\"file\">~/.abbrev_defs</samp>を探します。どちらのファイ"
"ルも存在しない場合、Emacsは<samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/abbrev_defs</samp>"
"を作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
