msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quietly-read-abbrev-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-quietly_002dread_002dabbrev_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"This function reads abbrev definitions from a file named <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>, previously written with <code "
"class=\"code\">write-abbrev-file</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the file specified in "
"<code class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、あらかじめ <code class=\"code\">write-abbrev-file</code> で書き込"
"まれていた <var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前のファイルから略語の定"
"義を読み込みます。<var class=\"var\">filename</var> が省略されているか、ある"
"いは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、<code class=\"code\">abbrev-"
"file-name</code> で指定されたファイルが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid "As the name implies, this function does not display any messages."
msgstr "その名の通り、この関数はいかなるメッセージも表示しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-abbrevs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"save_002dabbrevs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">save-abbrevs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-save_002dabbrevs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"A non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value for <code class=\"code\">save-"
"abbrevs</code> means that Emacs should offer to save abbrevs (if any have "
"changed) when files are saved.  If the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">silently</code>, Emacs saves the abbrevs without asking the "
"user.  <code class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</code> specifies the file to "
"save the abbrevs in.  The default value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-abbrevs</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の値を指定すると、ファイル保存時に（変更があった場合に限り）略語の保存を "
"Emacs が促すようになります。値が <code class=\"code\">silently</code> の場"
"合、Emacs はユーザーに確認することなく略語を保存します。<code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</code> は略語を保存するファイルを指定します。"
"デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">t</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrevs-changed</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrevs_002dchanged\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrevs-changed</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abbrevs_002dchanged\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"This variable is set non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> by defining or "
"altering any abbrevs (except system abbrevs).  This serves as a flag for "
"various Emacs commands to offer to save your abbrevs."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、任意の略語（システム略語を除く）を定義または変更することで、non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されます。これは、各種Emacsコマンドが略"
"語の保存を提案する際のフラグとして機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">write-abbrev-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-write_002dabbrev_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">write-abbrev-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-write_002dabbrev_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Files.html
msgid ""
"Save all abbrev definitions (except system abbrevs), for all abbrev tables "
"listed in <code class=\"code\">abbrev-table-name-list</code>, in the file "
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var>, in the form of a Lisp program that when "
"loaded will define the same abbrevs.  Tables that do not have any abbrevs to "
"save are omitted.  If <var class=\"var\">filename</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or omitted, <code class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</"
"code> is used.  This function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">abbrev-table-name-list</code> に列挙されているすべての略"
"語テーブルについて、システム略語を除くすべての略語定義を、ロード時に同一の略"
"語を定義する Lisp プログラムの形式でファイル <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var> に保存する。保存すべき略語がないテーブルは省略される。<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、ま"
"たは省略されている場合は、<code class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</code> が使用"
"される。この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

