# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Abbrevs have properties, some of which influence the way they work.  You can "
"provide them as arguments to <code class=\"code\">define-abbrev</code>, and "
"manipulate them with the following functions:"
msgstr ""
"略語にはプロパティがあり、その一部は動作に影響を与えます。これらを<code "
"class=\"code\">define-abbrev</code>の引数として指定したり、以下の関数を用いて"
"操作したりできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-put</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev prop val</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-abbrev_002dput\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-put</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev prop val</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-abbrev_002dput\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Set the property <var class=\"var\">prop</var> of <var class=\"var\">abbrev</"
"var> to value <var class=\"var\">val</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">abbrev</var>のプロパティ<var class=\"var\">prop</var>に値"
"<var class=\"var\">val</var>を設定する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-get</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev prop</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-abbrev_002dget\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-get</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">abbrev prop</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-abbrev_002dget\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Return the property <var class=\"var\">prop</var> of <var "
"class=\"var\">abbrev</var>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the abbrev "
"has no such property."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">abbrev</var> のプロパティ <var class=\"var\">prop</var> を"
"返します。略語にそのようなプロパティがない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid "The following properties have special meanings:"
msgstr "以下のプロパティには特別な意味があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:count</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:count</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This property counts the number of times the abbrev has been expanded.  If "
"not explicitly set, it is initialized to 0 by <code class=\"code\">define-"
"abbrev</code>."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、略語が展開された回数をカウントします。明示的に設定されてい"
"ない場合は、<code class=\"code\">define-abbrev</code> によって 0 に初期化され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:system</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:system</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this property marks the abbrev as a "
"system abbrev.  Such abbrevs are not saved (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrev-Files.html\">Saving Abbrevs in Files</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このプロパティはその略語をシステ"
"ム略語として指定します。このような略語は保存されません（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrev-Files.html\">ファイルへの略語の保存</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Table-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:enable-function</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:enable-function</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this property should be a function "
"of no arguments which returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the abbrev "
"should not be used and <code class=\"code\">t</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このプロパティは引数を取らない関"
"数とし、略記を使用しない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、それ以外の"
"場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返すものとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Table-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:case-fixed</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:case-fixed</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this property indicates that the "
"case of the abbrev&rsquo;s name is significant and should only match a text "
"with the same pattern of capitalization.  It also disables the code that "
"modifies the capitalization of the expansion."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このプロパティは略語名の大文字・"
"小文字の区別が重要であり、同じ大文字・小文字のパターンを持つテキストにのみ一"
"致すべきであることを示します。また、展開後の大文字・小文字を変更するコードも"
"無効になります。"

