# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"This function defines <var class=\"var\">tabname</var> (a symbol) as an "
"abbrev table name, i.e., as a variable whose value is an abbrev table.  It "
"defines abbrevs in the table according to <var class=\"var\">definitions</"
"var>, a list of elements of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">abbrevname</var> <var class=\"var\">expansion</var> [<var "
"class=\"var\">hook</var>] [<var class=\"var\">props</var>...])</code>.  "
"These elements are passed as arguments to <code class=\"code\">define-"
"abbrev</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">tabname</var>（シンボル）を略語テーブル名、す"
"なわち値が略語テーブルとなる変数として定義します。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">abbrevname</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">expansion</var> [<var class=\"var\">hook</var>] [<var "
"class=\"var\">props</var>...])</code>形式の要素のリストである<var "
"class=\"var\">definitions</var>に従って、テーブル内に略語を定義します。これら"
"の要素は、<code class=\"code\">define-abbrev</code>の引数として渡されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The optional string <var class=\"var\">docstring</var> is the documentation "
"string of the variable <var class=\"var\">tabname</var>.  The property list "
"<var class=\"var\">props</var> is applied to the abbrev table (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abbrev-Table-Properties.html\">Abbrev Table "
"Properties</a>)."
msgstr ""
"オプションの文字列 <var class=\"var\">docstring</var> は、変数 <var "
"class=\"var\">tabname</var> のドキュメント文字列です。プロパティリスト <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var> は略語テーブルに適用されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrev-Table-Properties.html\">略語テーブルのプロパティ</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"If this function is called more than once for the same <var "
"class=\"var\">tabname</var>, subsequent calls add the definitions in <var "
"class=\"var\">definitions</var> to <var class=\"var\">tabname</var>, rather "
"than overwriting the entire original contents.  (A subsequent call only "
"overrides abbrevs explicitly redefined or undefined in <var "
"class=\"var\">definitions</var>.)"
msgstr ""
"同一の <var class=\"var\">tabname</var> に対してこの関数が複数回呼び出された"
"場合、それ以降の呼び出しでは、元の内容全体を上書きするのではなく、<var "
"class=\"var\">definitions</var> の定義が <var class=\"var\">tabname</var> に"
"追加されます。（それ以降の呼び出しで上書きされるのは、<var "
"class=\"var\">definitions</var> で明示的に再定義または未定義とされた略語のみ"
"です。）"

