# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In this subsection, <var class=\"var\">ewoc</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> stand for the structures described above (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abstract-Display.html\">Abstract Display</a>), while "
"<var class=\"var\">data</var> stands for an arbitrary Lisp object used as a "
"data element."
msgstr ""
"この小節では、<var class=\"var\">ewoc</var> と <var class=\"var\">node</var> "
"は上述の構造（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abstract-Display.html\">抽象表示</a> "
"を参照）を表し、<var class=\"var\">data</var> はデータ要素として用いられる任"
"意の Lisp オブジェクトを表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ewoc-create</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pretty-printer "
"&amp;optional header footer nosep</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-ewoc_002dcreate\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ewoc-create</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pretty-printer "
"&amp;optional header footer nosep</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-ewoc_002dcreate\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This constructs and returns a new ewoc, with no nodes (and thus no data "
"elements).  <var class=\"var\">pretty-printer</var> should be a function "
"that takes one argument, a data element of the sort you plan to use in this "
"ewoc, and inserts its textual description at point using <code "
"class=\"code\">insert</code> (and never <code class=\"code\">insert-before-"
"markers</code>, because that would interfere with the Ewoc package&rsquo;s "
"internal mechanisms)."
msgstr ""
"これにより、ノード（したがってデータ要素）を持たない新しい ewoc が構築され、"
"返されます。<var class=\"var\">pretty-printer</var> は、この ewoc で使用する"
