msgstr "チェーンにおける前後のノードへのリンク。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">pretty-printer</em> function which is responsible for "
"inserting the textual representation of a data element value into the "
"current buffer."
msgstr ""
"データ要素の値のテキスト表現を現在のバッファに挿入する役割を担う<em "
"class=\"dfn\">プリティプリンタ</em>関数。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display.html
msgid ""
"Typically, you define an ewoc with <code class=\"code\">ewoc-create</code>, "
"and then pass the resulting ewoc structure to other functions in the Ewoc "
"package to build nodes within it, and display it in the buffer.  Once it is "
"displayed in the buffer, other functions determine the correspondence "
"between buffer positions and nodes, move point from one node&rsquo;s textual "
"representation to another, and so forth.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Abstract-Display-Functions.html\">Abstract Display Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">ewoc-create</code> で ewoc を定義し、得られた "
"ewoc 構造体を Ewoc パッケージ内の他の関数に渡して、その中でノードを構築し、"
"バッファに表示します。バッファに表示されると、他の関数がバッファ位置とノード"
"の対応関係を決定し、あるノードのテキスト表現から別のノードのテキスト表現へと"
"ポイントを移動させる、といった処理を行います。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Abstract-Display-Functions.html\">抽象表示関数</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-encapsulation_002c-ewoc\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-encapsulation_002c-ewoc\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display.html
msgid ""
"A node <em class=\"dfn\">encapsulates</em> a data element much the way a "
"variable holds a value.  Normally, encapsulation occurs as a part of adding "
"a node to the ewoc.  You can retrieve the data element value and place a new "
"value in its place, like so:"
msgstr ""
"ノードは、変数が値を保持するのと同様に、データ要素を<em class=\"dfn\">カプセ"
"ル化</em>します。通常、カプセル化はノードをewocに追加する際の一環として行われ"
"ます。次のように、データ要素の値を取得し、そこに新しい値を代入することができ"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Abstract-Display.html
#, no-wrap
