# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the documentation string of <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>.  It handles macros, named keyboard macros, and "
"special forms, as well as ordinary functions."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">function</var> のドキュメント文字列を返しま"
"す。通常の関数だけでなく、マクロ、名前付きキーボードマクロ、特殊フォームも処"
"理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">function</var> is a symbol, this function first looks "
"for the <code class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> property of that "
"symbol; if that has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the "
"documentation comes from that value (if the value is not a string, it is "
"evaluated)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> がシンボルの場合、この関数はまずそのシンボ"
"ルの <code class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> プロパティを確認しま"
"す。そこに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値が設定されていれば、その値"
"からドキュメントが取得されます（値が文字列でない場合は評価されます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">function</var> is not a symbol, or if it has no <code "
"class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> property, then <code "
"class=\"code\">documentation</code> extracts the documentation string from "
"the actual function definition, reading it from a file if called for."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> がシンボルでない場合、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> プロパティを持たない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">documentation</code> は実際の関数定義からドキュメント文字列を"
"抽出し、呼び出された際にはファイルからそれを読み込みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"Finally, unless <var class=\"var\">verbatim</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function calls <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code>.  The result is the "
"documentation string to return."
msgstr ""
"最後に、<var class=\"var\">verbatim</var> が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない限り、この関数は <code class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</"
"code> を呼び出します。その結果が、返すドキュメント文字列となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">documentation</code> function signals a <code "
"class=\"code\">void-function</code> error if <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> has no function definition.  However, it is OK if the function "
"definition has no documentation string.  In that case, <code "
"class=\"code\">documentation</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">documentation</code> 関数は、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> に関数定義がない場合に <code "
"class=\"code\">void-function</code> エラーを通知します。ただし、関数定義にド"
"キュメント文字列がなくても問題ありません。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">documentation</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">function-documentation</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"function_002ddocumentation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">function-documentation</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"function_002ddocumentation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"Generic function used by <code class=\"code\">documentation</code> to "
"extract the raw docstring from a function object.  You can specify how to "
"get the docstring of a specific function type by adding a corresponding "
"method to it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">documentation</code> が関数オブジェクトから生のドキュメ"
"ント文字列を抽出する際に使用する汎用関数です。特定の関数型のドキュメント文字"
"列の取得方法は、対応するメソッドを追加することで指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-documentation</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">face</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-face_002ddocumentation\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-documentation</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">face</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-face_002ddocumentation\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the documentation string of <var class=\"var\">face</"
"var> as a face."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">face</var> のドキュメント文字列をフェイスとし"
"て返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using the two functions, <code "
"class=\"code\">documentation</code> and <code class=\"code\">documentation-"
"property</code>, to display the documentation strings for several symbols in "
"a <samp class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> buffer."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、2つの関数 <code class=\"code\">documentation</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">documentation-property</code> を使用して、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> バッファ内の複数のシンボルのドキュメント文字列を"
"表示する例を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"describe_002dsymbols-example\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"describe_002dsymbols-example\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun describe-symbols (pattern)\n"
"  &quot;Describe the Emacs Lisp symbols matching PATTERN.\n"
"All symbols that have PATTERN in their name are described\n"
"in the *Help* buffer.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;sDescribe symbols matching: &quot;)\n"
"  (let ((describe-func\n"
"         (lambda (s)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"           ;; <span class=\"r\">Print description of symbol.</span>\n"
"           (if (fboundp s)             ; <span class=\"r\">It is a function.</span>\n"
"               (princ\n"
"                (format &quot;%s\\t%s\\n%s\\n\\n&quot; s\n"
"                  (if (commandp s)\n"
"                      (let ((keys (where-is-internal s)))\n"
"                        (if keys\n"
"                            (concat\n"
"                             &quot;Keys: &quot;\n"
"                             (mapconcat 'key-description\n"
"                                        keys &quot; &quot;))\n"
"                          &quot;Keys: none&quot;))\n"
"                    &quot;Function&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                  (or (documentation s)\n"
"                      &quot;not documented&quot;))))\n"
"\n"
"           (if (boundp s)              ; <span class=\"r\">It is a variable.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"               (princ\n"
"                (format &quot;%s\\t%s\\n%s\\n\\n&quot; s\n"
"                  (if (custom-variable-p s)\n"
"                      &quot;Option &quot; &quot;Variable&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                  (or (documentation-property\n"
"                        s 'variable-documentation)\n"
"                      &quot;not documented&quot;))))))\n"
"        sym-list)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Build a list of symbols that match pattern.</span>\n"
"    (mapatoms (lambda (sym)\n"
"                (if (string-match pattern (symbol-name sym))\n"
"                    (setq sym-list (cons sym sym-list)))))\n"
