#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"This section describes convenient functions for accessing the data in a "
"mouse button or motion event.  Keyboard event data can be accessed using the "
"same functions, but data elements that aren&rsquo;t applicable to keyboard "
"events are zero or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
