# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Node-Information.html
msgid ""
"In general, nodes in a concrete syntax tree fall into two categories: <em "
"class=\"dfn\">named nodes</em> and <em class=\"dfn\">anonymous nodes</em>.  "
"Whether a node is named or anonymous is determined by the language grammar "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-Grammar.html#tree_002dsitter-named-"
"node\">named node</a>)."
msgstr ""
"一般に、具体構文木のノードは、<em class=\"dfn\">名前付きノード</em>と<em "
"class=\"dfn\">匿名ノード</em>の2つのカテゴリに分類されます。ノードが名前付き"
"か匿名かは、言語文法によって決定されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-"
"Grammar.html#tree_002dsitter-named-node\">名前付きノード</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Node-Information.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tree_002dsitter-missing-node\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-missing-node_002c-tree_002dsitter\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tree_002dsitter-missing-node\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-missing-node_002c-tree_002dsitter\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Node-Information.html
msgid ""
"Apart from being named or anonymous, a node can have other properties.  A "
"node can be &ldquo;missing&rdquo;: such nodes are inserted by the parser in "
"order to recover from certain kinds of syntax errors, i.e., something should "
"probably be there according to the grammar, but is not there.  This can "
"happen during editing of the program source, when the source is not yet in "
"its final form."
msgstr ""
"名前付きか匿名かという点以外に、ノードは他のプロパティを持つことがあります。"
"ノードが「欠落」している場合があり、こうしたノードは、特定の種類の構文エラー"
"（すなわち、文法上は本来あるべき箇所に記述がない状態）から復旧するために、"
"パーサーによって挿入されます。これは、プログラムソースがまだ最終的な形式に"
