#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Node-Information.html
msgid ""
"Named nodes have &ldquo;types&rdquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-"
"Grammar.html#tree_002dsitter-node-type\">node type</a>).  For example, a "
"named node can be a <code class=\"code\">string_literal</code> node, where "
"<code class=\"code\">string_literal</code> is its type.  The type of an "
"anonymous node is just the text that the node represents; e.g., the type of "
