# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid "These functions are useful for decoding scroll bar events."
msgstr "これらの関数は、スクロールバーイベントのデコードに役立ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-bar-event-ratio</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">event</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"scroll_002dbar_002devent_002dratio\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-bar-event-ratio</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">event</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"scroll_002dbar_002devent_002dratio\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the fractional vertical position of a scroll bar event "
"within the scroll bar.  The value is a cons cell <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">portion</var> . <var class=\"var\">whole</var>)</code> "
"containing two integers whose ratio is the fractional position."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、スクロールバー内におけるスクロールバーイベントの垂直方向の小数位"
"置を返します。値は、比率が小数位置となる2つの整数を含むコンスセル <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">portion</var> . <var class=\"var\">whole</"
"var>)</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-bar-scale</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">ratio "
"total</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"scroll_002dbar_002dscale\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-bar-scale</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">ratio "
"total</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"scroll_002dbar_002dscale\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid ""
"This function multiplies (in effect) <var class=\"var\">ratio</var> by <var "
"class=\"var\">total</var>, rounding the result to an integer.  The argument "
"<var class=\"var\">ratio</var> is not a number, but rather a pair <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">num</var> . <var class=\"var\">denom</"
"var>)</code>&mdash;typically a value returned by <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"bar-event-ratio</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は（実質的に）<var class=\"var\">ratio</var>に<var "
"class=\"var\">total</var>を乗算し、その結果を整数に丸めます。引数<var "
"class=\"var\">ratio</var>は数値ではなく、ペア<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">num</var> . <var class=\"var\">denom</var>)</code>――通常は"
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-bar-event-ratio</code>によって返される値――です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid ""
"This function is handy for scaling a position on a scroll bar into a buffer "
"position.  Here&rsquo;s how to do that:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、スクロールバー上の位置をバッファ位置にマッピングする際に便利で"
"す。使い方は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(+ (point-min)\n"
"   (scroll-bar-scale\n"
"      (posn-x-y (event-start event))\n"
"      (- (point-max) (point-min))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Scroll.html
msgid ""
"Recall that scroll bar events have two integers forming a ratio, in place of "
"a pair of x and y coordinates."
msgstr ""
"スクロールバーのイベントでは、x座標とy座標のペアの代わりに、比率をなす2つの整"
"数が用いられることを思い出してください。"

