# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>12.7 Accessing Variable Values<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Accessing-Variable-Values\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>12.7 変数の値へのアクセス<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Accessing-"
"Variable-Values\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The usual way to reference a variable is to write the symbol which names "
"it.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Symbol-Forms.html\">Symbol Forms</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数を参照する一般的な方法は、その変数名となる記号を記述することです。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Symbol-Forms.html\">記号形式</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Occasionally, you may want to reference a variable which is determined only "
"at run time.  In that case, you cannot specify the variable name in the text "
"of the program.  You can use the <code class=\"code\">symbol-value</code> "
"function to extract the value."
msgstr ""
"実行時に初めて決定される変数を参照したい場合があります。その場合、プログラム"
"の本文中で変数名を指定することはできません。<code class=\"code\">symbol-"
"value</code>関数を使用して値を抽出できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-value</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dvalue\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-value</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dvalue\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value stored in <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var>&rsquo;s value cell.  This is where the variable&rsquo;s current "
"(dynamic) value is stored.  If the variable has no local binding, this is "
"simply its global value.  If the variable is void, a <code "
"class=\"code\">void-variable</code> error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>の値セルに格納されている値を返しま"
"す。ここには、変数の現在の（動的な）値が格納されています。変数にローカルバイ"
"ンディングがない場合は、単にそのグローバル値となります。変数がvoid型の場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">void-variable</code>エラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If the variable is lexically bound, the value reported by <code "
"class=\"code\">symbol-value</code> is not necessarily the same as the "
"variable&rsquo;s lexical value, which is determined by the lexical "
"environment rather than the symbol&rsquo;s value cell.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">Scoping Rules for Variable "
"Bindings</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数が字句的に束縛されている場合、<code class=\"code\">symbol-value</code> が"
"返す値は必ずしもその変数の字句値と一致するとは限りません。字句値は、シンボル"
"の値セルではなく、字句環境によって決定されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">変数束縛のスコープ規則</a>を参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq abracadabra 5)\n"
"     &rArr; 5\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq foo 9)\n"
"     &rArr; 9\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Here the symbol <code class=\"code\">abracadabra</code></span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">is the symbol whose value is examined.</span>\n"
"(let ((abracadabra 'foo))\n"
"  (symbol-value 'abracadabra))\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Accessing-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Here, the value of <code class=\"code\">abracadabra</code>,</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">which is <code class=\"code\">foo</code>,</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">is the symbol whose value is examined.</span>\n"
"(let ((abracadabra 'foo))\n"
"  (symbol-value abracadabra))\n"
"     &rArr; 9\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
