# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.13 Adaptive Fill Mode<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Adaptive-"
"Fill-Mode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.13 アダプティブフィルモード<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Adaptive-Fill-Mode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"When <em class=\"dfn\">Adaptive Fill Mode</em> is enabled, Emacs determines "
"the fill prefix automatically from the text in each paragraph being filled "
"rather than using a predetermined value.  During filling, this fill prefix "
"gets inserted at the start of the second and subsequent lines of the "
"paragraph as described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Filling.html\">Filling</"
"a>, and in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Auto-Filling.html\">Auto Filling</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">適応型フィルモード</em>が有効な場合、Emacsはあらかじめ定め"
"られた値を使用するのではなく、フィル対象の各段落のテキストからフィルプレ"
"フィックスを自動的に決定します。フィル処理中、このフィルプレフィックスは、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Filling.html\">フィル</a>および<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Auto-Filling.html\">自動フィル</a>で説明されている通り、段落の2行目以"
"降の先頭に挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">adaptive-fill-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"adaptive_002dfill_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">adaptive-fill-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-adaptive_002dfill_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"Adaptive Fill mode is enabled when this variable is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It is <code class=\"code\">t</code> by default."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、Adaptive Fillモードが有"
"効になります。デフォルトでは<code class=\"code\">t</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-context-prefix</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from "
"to</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fill_002dcontext_002dprefix\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-context-prefix</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from "
"to</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fill_002dcontext_002dprefix\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"This function implements the heart of Adaptive Fill mode; it chooses a fill "
"prefix based on the text between <var class=\"var\">from</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">to</var>, typically the start and end of a paragraph.  It does "
"this by looking at the first two lines of the paragraph, based on the "
"variables described below."
msgstr ""
"この関数はAdaptive Fillモードの中核機能を実装しており、<var "
"class=\"var\">from</var>と<var class=\"var\">to</var>の間にあるテキスト（通常"
"は段落の開始位置と終了位置）に基づいて塗りつぶしプレフィックスを選択します。"
"具体的には、以下に説明する変数に基づき、段落の最初の2行を参照してこの処理を行"
"います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"Usually, this function returns the fill prefix, a string.  However, before "
"doing this, the function makes a final check (not specially mentioned in the "
"following) that a line starting with this prefix wouldn&rsquo;t look like "
"the start of a paragraph.  Should this happen, the function signals the "
"anomaly by returning <code class=\"code\">nil</code> instead."
msgstr ""
"通常、この関数は塗りつぶしプレフィックスを文字列として返します。ただし、その"
"前に、このプレフィックスで始まる行が段落の冒頭のように見えないかという最終"
"チェック（以下では特に言及していません）を行います。もしそのような状況になっ"
"た場合、関数は代わりに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すことでその異常を"
"通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid "In detail, <code class=\"code\">fill-context-prefix</code> does this:"
msgstr ""
"具体的には、<code class=\"code\">fill-context-prefix</code>は次のように動作し"
"ます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"It takes a candidate for the fill prefix from the first line&mdash;it tries "
"first the function in <code class=\"code\">adaptive-fill-function</code> (if "
"any), then the regular expression <code class=\"code\">adaptive-fill-regexp</"
"code> (see below).  The first non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> result of "
"these, or the empty string if they&rsquo;re both <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, becomes the first line&rsquo;s candidate."
msgstr ""
"1行目からフィルプレフィックスの候補が選ばれます。まず <code "
"class=\"code\">adaptive-fill-function</code> 内の関数（もしあれば）が試行さ"
"れ、次に正規表現 <code class=\"code\">adaptive-fill-regexp</code>（後述）が試"
"行されます。これらのうち、最初に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外となった"
"結果、あるいは両方が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であった場合は空文字列"
"が、1行目の候補となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"If the paragraph has as yet only one line, the function tests the validity "
"of the prefix candidate just found.  The function then returns the candidate "
"if it&rsquo;s valid, or a string of spaces otherwise.  (see the description "
"of <code class=\"code\">adaptive-fill-first-line-regexp</code> below)."
msgstr ""
"段落にまだ1行しかない場合、この関数は直前に見つかったプレフィックス候補の妥当"
"性を検証します。その後、候補が妥当であればそれを返し、そうでなければスペース"
"の文字列を返します。（後述の <code class=\"code\">adaptive-fill-first-line-"
"regexp</code> の説明を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"When the paragraph already has two lines, the function next looks for a "
"prefix candidate on the second line, in just the same way it did for the "
"first line.  If it doesn&rsquo;t find one, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"段落がすでに2行ある場合、next関数は1行目のときと同様に、2行目で接頭辞の候補を"
"探します。候補が見つからない場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"The function now compares the two candidate prefixes heuristically: if the "
"non-whitespace characters in the line 2 candidate occur in the same order in "
"the line 1 candidate, the function returns the line 2 candidate.  Otherwise, "
"it returns the largest initial substring which is common to both candidates "
"(which might be the empty string)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は現在、2つの候補プレフィックスをヒューリスティックに比較します。行2"
"の候補に含まれる非空白文字が行1の候補でも同じ順序で現れる場合、関数は行2の候"
"補を返します。そうでない場合は、両方の候補に共通する最大の先頭部分文字列（空"
"文字列となる場合もあります）を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">adaptive-fill-regexp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"adaptive_002dfill_002dregexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">adaptive-fill-regexp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-adaptive_002dfill_002dregexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"Adaptive Fill mode matches this regular expression against the text starting "
"after the left margin whitespace (if any) on a line; the characters it "
"matches are that line&rsquo;s candidate for the fill prefix."
msgstr ""
"Adaptive Fillモードでは、行の左マージンの空白（ある場合）以降のテキストに対し"
"てこの正規表現を照合し、一致した文字をその行のフィルプレフィックスの候補とし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adaptive-Fill.html
msgid ""
"The default value matches whitespace with certain punctuation characters "
"intermingled."
msgstr "デフォルト値では、空白文字と特定の句読点が混在してマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
