# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This section describes how to define new forms that <code "
"class=\"code\">setf</code> can operate on."
msgstr ""
"この節では、<code class=\"code\">setf</code> が操作可能な新しいフォームを定義"
"する方法について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-define-simple-setter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">name setter &amp;optional fix-return</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-gv_002ddefine_002dsimple_002dsetter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-define-simple-setter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">name setter &amp;optional fix-return</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-gv_002ddefine_002dsimple_002dsetter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This macro enables you to easily define <code class=\"code\">setf</code> "
"methods for simple cases.  <var class=\"var\">name</var> is the name of a "
"function, macro, or special form.  You can use this macro whenever <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> has a directly corresponding <var "
"class=\"var\">setter</var> function that updates it, e.g., <code "
"class=\"code\">(gv-define-simple-setter car setcar)</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロを使用すると、単純なケースにおいて <code class=\"code\">setf</"
"code> メソッドを簡単に定義できます。<var class=\"var\">name</var> は関数、マ"
"クロ、または特殊形式の名前です。<var class=\"var\">name</var> を更新する直接"
"対応する <var class=\"var\">setter</var> 関数（例：<code class=\"code\">(gv-"
"define-simple-setter car setcar)</code>）が存在する場合はいつでも、このマクロ"
"を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid "This macro translates a call of the form"
msgstr "このマクロは、次のような形式の呼び出しを変換します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setf (<var class=\"var\">name</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>...) <var class=\"var\">value</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid "into"
msgstr "～へ"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">setter</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>... <var class=\"var\">value</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Such a <code class=\"code\">setf</code> call is documented to return <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>.  This is no problem with, e.g., <code "
"class=\"code\">car</code> and <code class=\"code\">setcar</code>, because "
"<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> returns the value that it set.  If your "
"<var class=\"var\">setter</var> function does not return <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>, use a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value "
"for the <var class=\"var\">fix-return</var> argument of <code "
"class=\"code\">gv-define-simple-setter</code>.  This expands into something "
"equivalent to"
msgstr ""
"このような <code class=\"code\">setf</code> の呼び出しは、<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> を返すとドキュメントに記載されています。例えば "
"<code class=\"code\">car</code> や <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> の場合"
"は問題ありません。<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> は自身が設定した値を返す"
"ためです。もし <var class=\"var\">setter</var> 関数が <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> を返さない場合は、<code class=\"code\">gv-define-"
"simple-setter</code> の <var class=\"var\">fix-return</var> 引数に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定してください。これは、以下と同等の表"
"現に展開されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((temp <var class=\"var\">value</var>))\n"
"  (<var class=\"var\">setter</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>... temp)\n"
"  temp)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid "so ensuring that it returns the correct result."
msgstr "ですので、正しい結果が返されるようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-define-setter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"arglist &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gv_002ddefine_002dsetter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-define-setter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"arglist &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gv_002ddefine_002dsetter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This macro allows for more complex <code class=\"code\">setf</code> "
"expansions than the previous form.  You may need to use this form, for "
"example, if there is no simple setter function to call, or if there is one "
"but it requires different arguments to the place form."
msgstr ""
"このマクロを使用すると、従来の形式よりも複雑な <code class=\"code\">setf</"
"code> 展開が可能になります。例えば、呼び出すための単純なセッター関数がない場"
"合や、関数はあるものの place 形式とは異なる引数を必要とする場合などに、この形"
"式を利用する必要があるかもしれません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This macro expands the form <code class=\"code\">(setf (<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>&hellip;) <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>)</code> by first binding the <code "
"class=\"code\">setf</code> argument forms <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>&hellip;)</code> "
"according to <var class=\"var\">arglist</var>, and then executing <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>.  <var class=\"var\">body</var> should return a "
"Lisp form that does the assignment, and finally returns the value that was "
"set.  An example of using this macro is:"
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、まず <code class=\"code\">setf</code> 引数のフォーム <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">value</var> <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var>&hellip;)</code> を <var class=\"var\">arglist</var> に従ってバインドし、"
"次に <var class=\"var\">body</var> を実行することで、フォーム <code "
"class=\"code\">(setf (<var class=\"var\">name</var> <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var>&hellip;) <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code> を展開します。<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> は代入を行う Lisp フォームを返し、最終的に設定された"
"値を返す必要があります。このマクロの使用例は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(gv-define-setter caar (val x) `(setcar (car ,x) ,val))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-define-expander</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"handler</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gv_002ddefine_002dexpander\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-define-expander</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"handler</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gv_002ddefine_002dexpander\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"For more control over the expansion, the <code class=\"code\">gv-define-"
"expander</code> macro can be used.  For instance, a settable <code "
"class=\"code\">substring</code> could be implemented this way:"
msgstr ""
"展開をより細かく制御するには、<code class=\"code\">gv-define-expander</code> "
"マクロを使用できます。例えば、設定可能な <code class=\"code\">substring</"
"code> は次のように実装できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(gv-define-expander substring\n"
"  (lambda (do place from &amp;optional to)\n"
"    (gv-letplace (getter setter) place\n"
"      (macroexp-let2* (from to)\n"
"        (funcall do `(substring ,getter ,from ,to)\n"
"                 (lambda (v)\n"
"                   (macroexp-let2* (v)\n"
"                     `(progn\n"
"                        ,(funcall setter `(cl--set-substring\n"
"                                           ,getter ,from ,to ,v))\n"
"                        ,v))))))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-letplace</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(getter setter) "
"place &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gv_002dletplace\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gv-letplace</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(getter setter) "
"place &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gv_002dletplace\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The macro <code class=\"code\">gv-letplace</code> can be useful in defining "
"macros that perform similarly to <code class=\"code\">setf</code>; for "
"example, the <code class=\"code\">incf</code> macro of Common Lisp could be "
"implemented this way:"
msgstr ""
"マクロ <code class=\"code\">gv-letplace</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">setf</code> と同様に動作するマクロを定義する際に有用です。例え"
"ば、Common Lisp の <code class=\"code\">incf</code> マクロは次のように実装で"
"きます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro incf (place &amp;optional n)\n"
"  (gv-letplace (getter setter) place\n"
"    (macroexp-let2* ((v (or n 1)))\n"
"      (funcall setter `(+ ,v ,getter)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adding-Generalized-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">getter</var> will be bound to a copyable expression that "
"returns the value of <var class=\"var\">place</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">setter</var> will be bound to a function that takes an "
"expression <var class=\"var\">v</var> and returns a new expression that sets "
"<var class=\"var\">place</var> to <var class=\"var\">v</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> should return a Emacs Lisp expression manipulating "
"<var class=\"var\">place</var> via <var class=\"var\">getter</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">setter</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">getter</var> には、<var class=\"var\">place</var> の値を返"
"すコピー可能な式がバインドされます。<var class=\"var\">setter</var> には、式 "
"<var class=\"var\">v</var> を受け取り、<var class=\"var\">place</var> を "
"<var class=\"var\">v</var> に設定する新しい式を返す関数がバインドされます。"
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> は、<var class=\"var\">getter</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">setter</var> を介して <var class=\"var\">place</var> を操作す"
"る Emacs Lisp 式を返す必要があります。"

