# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"When a sequence of text has the <code class=\"code\">display</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">composition</code> property, or is invisible, there can be "
"several buffer positions that result in the cursor being displayed at same "
"place on the screen.  Therefore, after a command finishes and returns to the "
"command loop, if point is in such a sequence, the command loop normally "
"moves point to try and make this sequence effectively intangible."
msgstr ""
"テキストシーケンスが <code class=\"code\">display</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">composition</code> プロパティを持つか、あるいは不可視である場"
"合、カーソルが画面上の同じ位置に表示されるようなバッファ位置が複数存在するこ"
"とがあります。そのため、コマンドが終了してコマンドループに戻った際、ポイント"
"がこのようなシーケンス内にある場合、コマンドループは通常、ポイントを移動させ"
"ることで、このシーケンスを実質的に不可視にしようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"This <em class=\"emph\">point adjustment</em> follows the following general "
"rules: first, the adjustment should not change the overall direction of the "
"command; second if the command moved point, the adjustment tries to ensure "
"the cursor is also moved; third, Emacs prefers the edges of an intangible "
"sequence and among those edges it prefers the non sticky ones, such that "
"newly inserted text is visible."
msgstr ""
"この<em class=\"emph\">ポイント調整</em>は、以下の一般的なルールに従います。"
"第一に、調整によってコマンドの全体的な方向が変わってはなりません。第二に、コ"
"マンドによってポイントが移動した場合、調整によってカーソルも同様に移動するよ"
"う努めます。第三に、Emacsは実体のないシーケンスの端を優先し、それらの端の中で"
"も粘着性のないものを優先することで、新たに挿入されたテキストが視認できるよう"
"にします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"A command can inhibit this feature by setting the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">disable-point-adjustment</code>:"
msgstr ""
"コマンドは、変数 <code class=\"code\">disable-point-adjustment</code> を設定"
"することでこの機能を抑制できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">disable-point-adjustment</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-disable_002dpoint_002dadjustment\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">disable-point-adjustment</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-disable_002dpoint_002dadjustment\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> when a command "
"returns to the command loop, then the command loop does not check for those "
"text properties, and does not move point out of sequences that have them."
msgstr ""
"コマンドがコマンドループに戻った際にこの変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外である場合、コマンドループはそれらのテキストプロパティを確認せず、"
"またそれらを持つシーケンスからポインタを移動させません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"The command loop sets this variable to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"before each command, so if a command sets it, the effect applies only to "
"that command."
msgstr ""
"コマンドループは各コマンドの実行前にこの変数を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"に設定するため、あるコマンドがこの変数を設定した場合、その効果はそのコマンド"
"にのみ適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">global-disable-point-adjustment</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-global_002ddisable_002dpoint_002dadjustment\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">global-disable-point-adjustment</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-global_002ddisable_002dpoint_002dadjustment\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Adjusting-Point.html
msgid ""
"If you set this variable to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the "
"feature of moving point out of these sequences is completely turned off."
msgstr ""
"この変数に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を設定すると、これらのシーケ"
"ンスからポイントを移動させる機能が完全に無効になります。"

