# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-anonymous-function\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-anonymous-function\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Although functions are usually defined with <code class=\"code\">defun</"
"code> and given names at the same time, it is sometimes convenient to use an "
"explicit lambda expression&mdash;an <em class=\"dfn\">anonymous function</"
"em>.  Anonymous functions are valid wherever function names are.  They are "
"often assigned as variable values, or as arguments to functions; for "
"instance, you might pass one as the <var class=\"var\">function</var> "
"argument to <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>, which applies that function "
"to each element of a list (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mapping-"
"Functions.html\">Mapping Functions</a>).  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Accessing-Documentation.html#describe_002dsymbols-example\">describe-"
"symbols example</a>, for a realistic example of this."
msgstr ""
"通常、関数は <code class=\"code\">defun</code> で定義されると同時に名前も付与"
"されますが、明示的なラムダ式――<em class=\"dfn\">無名関数</em>――を用いる方が便"
"利な場合もあります。無名関数は、関数名が指定できるあらゆる場所で有効です。こ"
"れらは変数の値として、あるいは関数の引数として指定されることがよくあります。"
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> の <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> 引数として無名関数を渡すと、その関数がリストの各要素に適用されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mapping-Functions.html\">マッピング関数</a> を参照）。"
"これの具体的な例については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Accessing-"
"Documentation.html#describe_002dsymbols-example\">describe-symbols の例</a> "
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When defining a lambda expression that is to be used as an anonymous "
"function, you should use the <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> macro, or "
"the <code class=\"code\">function</code> special form, or the <code "
"class=\"code\">#'</code> read syntax:"
msgstr ""
"匿名関数として使用するラムダ式を定義する際は、<code class=\"code\">lambda</"
"code> マクロ、<code class=\"code\">function</code> 特殊形式、または <code "
"class=\"code\">#'</code> 読み取り構文を使用してください："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lambda</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">args [doc] "
"[interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"lambda\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lambda</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">args [doc] "
"[interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"lambda\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This macro returns an anonymous function with argument list <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var>, documentation string <var class=\"var\">doc</var> "
"(if any), interactive spec <var class=\"var\">interactive</var> (if any), "
"and body forms given by <var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、引数リスト <var class=\"var\">args</var>、ドキュメント文字列 "
"<var class=\"var\">doc</var>（あれば）、インタラクティブ仕様 <var "
"class=\"var\">interactive</var>（あれば）、および <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var> で指定されたボディフォームを持つ無名関数を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"For example, this macro makes <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> forms "
"almost self-quoting: evaluating a form whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> "
"is <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> yields a value that is almost like the "
"form itself:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、このマクロを使うと <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> フォームはほぼ"
"自己引用的になります。<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> が <code "
"class=\"code\">lambda</code> であるフォームを評価すると、ほぼそのフォーム自体"
"のような値が返されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(lambda (x) (* x x))\n"
"     &rArr; #f(lambda (x) :dynbind (* x x))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When evaluating under lexical binding the result is a similar closure "
"object, where the <code class=\"code\">:dynbind</code> marker is replaced by "
"the captured variables (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Closures.html\">Closures</a>)."
msgstr ""
"レキシカルバインディングの下で評価すると、結果は同様のクロージャオブジェクト"
"となり、<code class=\"code\">:dynbind</code>マーカーがキャプチャされた変数に"
"置き換えられます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Closures.html\">クロージャ</a>を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> form has one other effect: it tells "
"the Emacs evaluator and byte-compiler that its argument is a function, by "
"using <code class=\"code\">function</code> as a subroutine (see below)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">lambda</code> 形式にはもう一つ効果があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">function</code> をサブルーチンとして使用することで（後述）、そ"
"の引数が関数であることを Emacs の評価器とバイトコンパイラに伝えるというもので"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">function</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function-object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-function\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">関数</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function-object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-function\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-function-quoting\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-function-quoting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This special form returns the function value of the <var "
"class=\"var\">function-object</var>.  In many ways, it is similar to <code "
"class=\"code\">quote</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quoting.html\">Quoting</a>).  But unlike <code class=\"code\">quote</"
"code>, it also serves as a note to the Emacs evaluator and byte-compiler "
"that <var class=\"var\">function-object</var> is intended to be used as a "
"function.  Assuming <var class=\"var\">function-object</var> is a valid "
"lambda expression, this has two effects:"
msgstr ""
"この特殊な形式は、<var class=\"var\">function-object</var> の関数値を返しま"
"す。多くの点で <code class=\"code\">quote</code> と似ています（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quoting.html\">クォート</a> を参照）。しかし、<code "
"class=\"code\">quote</code> とは異なり、<var class=\"var\">function-object</"
"var> が関数として使用されることを意図しているという注記を、Emacs の評価器およ"
"びバイトコンパイラに伝える役割も果たします。<var class=\"var\">function-"
"object</var> が有効なラムダ式であるとすると、これには2つの効果があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When the code is byte-compiled, <var class=\"var\">function-object</var> is "
"compiled into a byte-code function object (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Byte-Compilation.html\">Byte Compilation</a>)."
msgstr ""
"コードがバイトコンパイルされると、<var class=\"var\">function-object</var> は"
"バイトコード関数オブジェクトにコンパイルされます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Byte-Compilation.html\">バイトコンパイル</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When lexical binding is enabled, <var class=\"var\">function-object</var> is "
"converted into a closure.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Closures.html\">Closures</a>."
msgstr ""
"語彙的束縛が有効な場合、<var class=\"var\">function-object</var> はクロージャ"
"に変換されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Closures.html\">クロージャ</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">function-object</var> is a symbol and the code is "
"byte compiled, the byte-compiler will warn if that function is not defined "
"or might not be known at run time."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function-object</var> がシンボルであり、コードがバイトコン"
"パイルされる場合、その関数が定義されていないか、あるいは実行時に認識されない"
"可能性があると、バイトコンパイラが警告を出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0023_0027-syntax\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0023_0027-syntax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The read syntax <code class=\"code\">#'</code> is a short-hand for using "
"<code class=\"code\">function</code>.  The following forms are all "
"equivalent:"
msgstr ""
"読み取り構文 <code class=\"code\">#'</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">function</code> を使用する際の短縮表記です。以下の形式はいずれ"
"も等価です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(lambda (x) (* x x))\n"
"(function (lambda (x) (* x x)))\n"
"#'(lambda (x) (* x x))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, we define a <code class=\"code\">change-property</"
"code> function that takes a function as its third argument, followed by a "
"<code class=\"code\">double-property</code> function that makes use of <code "
"class=\"code\">change-property</code> by passing it an anonymous function:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、第3引数に関数を受け取る <code class=\"code\">change-property</"
"code> 関数を定義し、続いて、匿名関数を渡すことで <code class=\"code\">change-"
"property</code> を利用する <code class=\"code\">double-property</code> 関数を"
"定義します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun change-property (symbol prop function)\n"
"  (let ((value (get symbol prop)))\n"
"    (put symbol prop (funcall function value))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun double-property (symbol prop)\n"
"  (change-property symbol prop (lambda (x) (* 2 x))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid "Note that we do not quote the <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> form."
msgstr "なお、<code class=\"code\">lambda</code>形式は記載していません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If you compile the above code, the anonymous function is also compiled.  "
"This would not happen if, say, you had constructed the anonymous function by "
"quoting it as a list:"
msgstr ""
"上記のコードをコンパイルすると、無名関数もコンパイルされます。例えば、無名関"
"数をリストとしてクォートして構築した場合には、このようなことは起こりません："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun double-property (symbol prop)\n"
"  (change-property symbol prop '(lambda (x) (* 2 x))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Anonymous-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In that case, the anonymous function is kept as a lambda expression in the "
"compiled code.  The byte-compiler cannot assume this list is a function, "
"even though it looks like one, since it does not know that <code "
"class=\"code\">change-property</code> intends to use it as a function."
msgstr ""
"その場合、匿名関数はコンパイル済みコード内でラムダ式として保持されます。バイ"
"トコンパイラは、<code class=\"code\">change-property</code> がこれを関数とし"
"て使用する意図があることを知らないため、一見すると関数のように見えても、この"
"リストが関数であるとは想定できません。"

