# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"When writing connection-aware code, you&rsquo;ll need to collect, and "
"possibly apply, any connection-local variables.  There are several ways to "
"do this, as described below."
msgstr ""
"コネクションを意識したコードを記述する際は、コネクションローカルな変数を収集"
"し、必要に応じて適用する必要があります。これを実現する方法はいくつかあり、以"
"下に説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">hack-connection-local-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">criteria</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"hack_002dconnection_002dlocal_002dvariables\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">hack-connection-local-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">criteria</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"hack_002dconnection_002dlocal_002dvariables\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function collects applicable connection-local variables associated with "
"<var class=\"var\">criteria</var> in <code class=\"code\">connection-local-"
"variables-alist</code>, without applying them.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">criteria</var> に関連付けられた適用可能な接続"
"ローカル変数を、適用することなく <code class=\"code\">connection-local-"
"variables-alist</code> に収集します。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(hack-connection-local-variables\n"
"  '(:application tramp :protocol &quot;ssh&quot; :machine &quot;localhost&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"connection-local-variables-alist\n"
"     &rArr; ((null-device . &quot;/dev/null&quot;)\n"
"        (shell-login-switch . &quot;-l&quot;)\n"
"        (shell-interactive-switch . &quot;-i&quot;)\n"
"        (shell-command-switch . &quot;-c&quot;)\n"
"        (shell-file-name . &quot;/bin/bash&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">hack-connection-local-variables-apply</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">criteria</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"hack_002dconnection_002dlocal_002dvariables_002dapply\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">hack-connection-local-variables-apply</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">criteria</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"hack_002dconnection_002dlocal_002dvariables_002dapply\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function looks for connection-local variables according to <var "
"class=\"var\">criteria</var>, and immediately applies them in the current "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">criteria</var> に従って接続ローカル変数を検索"
"し、現在のバッファに即座に適用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-connection-local-application-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-"
"var-arguments\">application &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002dconnection_002dlocal_002dapplication_002dvariables\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-connection-local-application-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-"
"var-arguments\">application &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002dconnection_002dlocal_002dapplication_002dvariables\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Apply all connection-local variables for <code class=\"code\">application</"
"code>, which are specified by <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> で指定された <code "
"class=\"code\">application</code> に対するすべての接続ローカル変数を適用しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"After that, <var class=\"var\">body</var> is executed, and the connection-"
"local variables are unwound.  Example:"
