# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The default application, a symbol, to be applied in <code "
"class=\"code\">with-connection-local-variables</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">connection-local-p</code> and <code class=\"code\">connection-"
"local-value</code>.  It defaults to <code class=\"code\">tramp</code>, but "
"you can let-bind it to change the application temporarily (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">Local Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">with-connection-local-variables</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">connection-local-p</code>、<code class=\"code\">connection-"
"local-value</code> で適用されるデフォルトのアプリケーション（シンボル）。デ"
"フォルトは <code class=\"code\">tramp</code> ですが、let-bind することで一時"
"的にアプリケーションを変更できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-"
