# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This macro sets each <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> connection-locally to "
"the result of evaluating the corresponding <var class=\"var\">form</var>, "
"using the connection-local profile specified in <code "
"class=\"code\">connection-local-profile-name-for-setq</code>; if the profile "
"name is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this macro will just set the "
"variables normally, as with <code class=\"code\">setq</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Setting-Variables.html\">Setting Variable Values</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<code class=\"code\">connection-local-profile-name-for-setq</"
"code>で指定されたコネクションローカルプロファイルを用いて、各<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>コネクションローカルを対応する<var "
"class=\"var\">form</var>の評価結果に設定します。プロファイル名が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合、このマクロは<code class=\"code\">setq</code>"
"と同様に、通常通り変数を設定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Setting-"
"Variables.html\">変数値の設定</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"For example, you can use this macro in combination with <code "
"class=\"code\">with-connection-local-variables</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">with-connection-local-application-variables</code> to lazily "
"initialize connection-local settings:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、このマクロを <code class=\"code\">with-connection-local-variables</"
"code> や <code class=\"code\">with-connection-local-application-variables</"
"code> と組み合わせて使用することで、接続ローカル設定を遅延初期化できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar my-app-variable nil)\n"
"\n"
"(connection-local-set-profile-variables\n"
" 'my-app-connection-default-profile\n"
" '((my-app-variable . nil)))\n"
"\n"
"(connection-local-set-profiles\n"
" '(:application my-app)\n"
" 'my-app-connection-default-profile)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun my-app-get-variable ()\n"
"  (with-connection-local-application-variables 'my-app\n"
"    (or my-app-variable\n"
"        (setq-connection-local my-app-variable\n"
"                               do something useful))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">connection-local-profile-name-for-setq</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"connection_002dlocal_002dprofile_002dname_002dfor_002dsetq\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">connection-local-profile-name-for-setq</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"connection_002dlocal_002dprofile_002dname_002dfor_002dsetq\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The connection-local profile name, a symbol, to use when setting variables "
"via <code class=\"code\">setq-connection-local</code>.  This is let-bound in "
"the body of <code class=\"code\">with-connection-local-variables</code>, but "
"you can also let-bind it yourself if you&rsquo;d like to set variables on a "
"different profile."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setq-connection-local</code> 経由で変数を設定する際に使"
"用する、シンボル形式の接続ローカルプロファイル名。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">with-connection-local-variables</code> の本体内で let 束縛され"
"ていますが、別のプロファイルで変数を設定したい場合は、自身で let 束縛すること"
"も可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">connection-local-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol "
"&amp;optional application</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"connection_002dlocal_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">connection-local-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol "
"&amp;optional application</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"connection_002dlocal_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This macro returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> has a connection-local binding for <var "
"class=\"var\">application</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">application</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">connection-local-default-application</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が <var "
"class=\"var\">application</var> に対して接続ローカルバインディングを持つ場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">application</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合"
"は、<code class=\"code\">connection-local-default-application</code> の値が使"
"用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">connection-local-value</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">symbol &amp;optional application</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-connection_002dlocal_002dvalue\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">connection-local-value</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">symbol &amp;optional application</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-connection_002dlocal_002dvalue\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This macro returns the connection-local value of <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var> for <var class=\"var\">application</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">application</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">connection-local-default-application</code> is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">application</var> に対する <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> の接続ローカル値を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">application</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">connection-local-default-application</code> の値が使用さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> does not have a connection-local binding, "
"the value is the default binding of the variable."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> に接続ローカルバインディングがない場合、値は"
"変数のデフォルトバインディングとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The difference to <code class=\"code\">with-connection-local{-application}-"
"variables</code> is, that <code class=\"code\">symbol</code> is not set "
"buffer-local.  A typical usage pattern is to use only the the connection "
"value of a variable if it exists, and not to use its default value otherwise "
"(using <code class=\"code\">my-app-variable</code> initialized above):"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">with-connection-local{-application}-variables</code>との"
"違いは、<code class=\"code\">symbol</code>がバッファローカルに設定されない点"
"です。典型的な使用パターンとしては、変数の接続値が存在する場合にのみそれを使"
"用し、そうでない場合はデフォルト値を使用するというものです（上記で初期化した"
"<code class=\"code\">my-app-variable</code>を使用）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Connection-Local-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (connection-local-p my-app-variable 'my-app)\n"
"    (connection-local-value my-app-variable 'my-app)\n"
"  ;; Something else.\n"
"  )\n"
msgstr ""

