# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"The following functions are responsible for installing the user&rsquo;s "
"customization settings for variables and faces, respectively.  When the user "
"invokes &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Save for future sessions</samp>&rsquo; "
"in the Customize interface, that takes effect by writing a <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-set-variables</code> and/or a <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-set-faces</code> form into the custom file, to be "
"evaluated the next time Emacs starts."
msgstr ""
"以下の関数は、それぞれ変数とフェイスに関するユーザーのカスタマイズ設定の適用"
"を担っています。ユーザーがカスタマイズインターフェースで &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Save for future sessions</samp>&rsquo; を呼び出すと、カスタム"
"ファイルに <code class=\"code\">custom-set-variables</code> および/または "
"<code class=\"code\">custom-set-faces</code> 形式が書き込まれ、次回の Emacs "
"起動時に評価されることで設定が反映されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">custom-set-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"custom_002dset_002dvariables\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">custom-set-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"custom_002dset_002dvariables\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"This function installs the variable customizations specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var>.  Each argument in <var class=\"var\">args</var> "
"should have the form"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">args</var> で指定された変数のカスタマイズを適"
"用します。<var class=\"var\">args</var> の各引数は、以下の形式である必要があ"
"ります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Customizations.html
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">var</var> <var class=\"var\">expression</var> [<var class=\"var\">now</var> [<var class=\"var\">request</var> [<var class=\"var\">comment</var>]]])\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">var</var> is a variable name (a symbol), and <var "
"class=\"var\">expression</var> is an expression which evaluates to the "
"desired customized value."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">var</var>は変数名（シンボル）であり、<var "
"class=\"var\">expression</var>は目的のカスタマイズ値を算出する式です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Applying-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"If the <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> form for <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> has been evaluated prior to this <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-set-variables</code> call, <var "
"class=\"var\">expression</var> is immediately evaluated, and the "
"variable&rsquo;s value is set to the result.  Otherwise, <var "
"class=\"var\">expression</var> is stored into the variable&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">saved-value</code> property, to be evaluated when the "
"relevant <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> is called (usually when the "
"library defining that variable is loaded into Emacs)."
msgstr ""
"この <code class=\"code\">custom-set-variables</code> の呼び出しより前に、"
"<var class=\"var\">var</var> 用の <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> "
"フォームが評価されていた場合、<var class=\"var\">expression</var> が直ちに評"
