# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Arithmetic-Operations.html
msgid ""
"Emacs Lisp provides the traditional four arithmetic operations (addition, "
"subtraction, multiplication, and division), as well as remainder and modulus "
"functions, and functions to add or subtract 1.  Except for <code "
"class=\"code\">%</code>, each of these functions accepts both integer and "
"floating-point arguments, and returns a floating-point number if any "
"argument is floating point."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispでは、従来の4つの算術演算（加算、減算、乗算、除算）に加え、剰余関数"
"やモジュロ関数、および1を加算または減算する関数が提供されています。<code "
"class=\"code\">%</code>を除き、これらの関数はいずれも整数と浮動小数点数の両方"
"の引数を受け付け、いずれかの引数が浮動小数点数である場合は浮動小数点数を返し"
"ます。"

