"<var class=\"var\">number</var> by each divisor in <var "
"class=\"var\">divisors</var> in turn, and returns the quotient.  With no "
"<var class=\"var\">divisors</var>, this function returns 1/<var "
"class=\"var\">number</var>, i.e., the multiplicative inverse of <var "
