# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a two-level deep copy of <var class=\"var\">alist</"
"var>: it creates a new copy of each association, so that you can alter the "
"associations of the new alist without changing the old one."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">alist</var> の2レベルのディープコピーを返しま"
"す。各アソシエーションの新しいコピーを作成するため、元のアリストを変更するこ"
"となく、新しいアリストのアソシエーションを変更できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq needles-per-cluster\n"
"      '((2 . (&quot;Austrian Pine&quot; &quot;Red Pine&quot;))\n"
"        (3 . (&quot;Pitch Pine&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        (5 . (&quot;White Pine&quot;))))\n"
"&rArr;\n"
"((2 &quot;Austrian Pine&quot; &quot;Red Pine&quot;)\n"
" (3 &quot;Pitch Pine&quot;)\n"
" (5 &quot;White Pine&quot;))\n"
"\n"
"(setq copy (copy-alist needles-per-cluster))\n"
"&rArr;\n"
"((2 &quot;Austrian Pine&quot; &quot;Red Pine&quot;)\n"
" (3 &quot;Pitch Pine&quot;)\n"
" (5 &quot;White Pine&quot;))\n"
"\n"
"(eq needles-per-cluster copy)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"(equal needles-per-cluster copy)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
"(eq (car needles-per-cluster) (car copy))\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"(cdr (car (cdr needles-per-cluster)))\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;Pitch Pine&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(eq (cdr (car (cdr needles-per-cluster)))\n"
"    (cdr (car (cdr copy))))\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
msgid ""
"This example shows how <code class=\"code\">copy-alist</code> makes it "
"possible to change the associations of one copy without affecting the other:"
msgstr ""
"この例では、<code class=\"code\">copy-alist</code> を用いることで、もう一方に"
"影響を与えることなく、一方のコピーの関連付けを変更できる様子を示しています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setcdr (assq 3 copy) '(&quot;Martian Vacuum Pine&quot;))\n"
"(cdr (assq 3 needles-per-cluster))\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;Pitch Pine&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

