# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Association-Lists.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes from <var class=\"var\">alist</var> all the elements "
"whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to "
"<var class=\"var\">key</var>, much as if you used <code class=\"code\">delq</"
"code> to delete each such element one by one.  It returns the shortened "
"alist, and often modifies the original list structure of <var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var>.  For correct results, use the return value of "
"<code class=\"code\">assq-delete-all</code> rather than looking at the saved "
"value of <var class=\"var\">alist</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">delq</code> を用いて各要素を一つずつ削除する"
"場合と同様に、<var class=\"var\">alist</var> から <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> が <code class=\"code\">eq</code> から <var class=\"var\">key</var> ま"
"でのすべての要素を削除します。短縮されたアリストを返し、多くの場合 <var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var> の元のリスト構造を変更します。正しい結果を得るに"
"は、<var class=\"var\">alist</var> の保存値を参照するのではなく、<code "
"class=\"code\">assq-delete-all</code> の戻り値を使用してください。"

