# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Use the string <var class=\"var\">name</var> as the process name; if a "
"process with this name already exists, then <var class=\"var\">name</var> is "
"modified (by appending &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;1&gt;</samp>&rsquo;, "
"etc.) to be unique."
msgstr ""
"プロセス名として文字列 <var class=\"var\">name</var> を使用し、この名前のプロ"
"セスが既に存在する場合は、<var class=\"var\">name</var> を（&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;1&gt;</samp>&rsquo; などを付加して）一意になるように変更し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
