msgid "<code class=\"code\">:buffer <var class=\"var\">buffer</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:buffer <var class=\"var\">buffer</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Use <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> as the process buffer.  If the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the subprocess is not associated with any "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"プロセスバッファとして <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> を使用してください。値"
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、サブプロセスはどのバッファにも関連"
"付けられません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:command <var class=\"var\">command</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:command <var class=\"var\">command</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Use <var class=\"var\">command</var> as the command line of the process.  "
"The value should be a list starting with the program&rsquo;s executable file "
"name, followed by strings to give to the program as its arguments.  If the "
"first element of the list is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs opens a "
"new pseudoterminal (pty) and associates its input and output with <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var>, without actually running any program; the rest "
"of the list elements are ignored in that case."
msgstr ""
"プロセスのコマンドラインとして <var class=\"var\">command</var> を指定してく"
"ださい。この値は、プログラムの実行ファイル名で始まり、その後にプログラムに引"
"数として渡す文字列が続くリストである必要があります。リストの最初の要素が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、Emacs は新しい擬似端末 (pty) を開き、"
"その入出力を <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> に関連付けますが、実際にプログラ"
"ムを実行することはありません。その場合、リストの残りの要素は無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html build/html/elisp/Network.html
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:coding <var class=\"var\">coding</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:coding <var class=\"var\">coding</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">coding</var> is a symbol, it specifies the coding "
"system to be used for both reading and writing of data from and to the "
"connection.  If <var class=\"var\">coding</var> is a cons cell <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">decoding</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">encoding</var>)</code>, then <var class=\"var\">decoding</var> "
"will be used for reading and <var class=\"var\">encoding</var> for writing.  "
"The coding system used for encoding the data written to the program is also "
"used for encoding the command-line arguments (but not the program itself, "
"whose file name is encoded as any other file name; see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Encoding-and-I_002fO.html\">file-name-coding-system</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">coding</var> がシンボルの場合、接続とのデータの読み書きの"
"両方に使用するコーディングシステムを指定します。<var class=\"var\">coding</"
"var> がコンスセル <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">decoding</"
"var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">encoding</var>)</code> の場合、読み取りに"
"は <var class=\"var\">decoding</var> が、書き込みには <var "
"class=\"var\">encoding</var> が使用されます。プログラムに書き込まれるデータの"
"エンコードに使用されるコーディングシステムは、コマンドライン引数のエンコード"
"にも使用されます（ただし、プログラム自体は例外で、ファイル名は他のファイルと"
"同様にエンコードされます。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Encoding-and-"
"I_002fO.html\">file-name-coding-system</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">coding</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"default rules for finding the coding system will apply.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Default-Coding-Systems.html\">Default Coding Systems</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">coding</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、"
"コーディングシステムを特定するためのデフォルトルールが適用されます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Default-Coding-Systems.html\">デフォルトのコーディング"
"システム</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:connection-type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:connection-type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Initialize the type of device used to communicate with the subprocess.  "
"Possible values are <code class=\"code\">pty</code> to use a pty, <code "
"class=\"code\">pipe</code> to use a pipe, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"to use the default derived from the value of the <code "
"class=\"code\">process-connection-type</code> variable.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> is a cons cell <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">input</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">output</var>)</"
"code>, then <var class=\"var\">input</var> will be used for standard input "
"and <var class=\"var\">output</var> for standard output (and standard error "
"if <code class=\"code\">:stderr</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>)."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセスとの通信に使用するデバイスの種類を初期化します。指定可能な値は、"
"ptyを使用する場合は<code class=\"code\">pty</code>、パイプを使用する場合は"
"<code class=\"code\">pipe</code>、<code class=\"code\">process-connection-"
"type</code>変数の値から導出されるデフォルトを使用する場合は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>です。<var class=\"var\">type</var>がコンスセル"
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">input</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">output</var>)</code>である場合、標準入力には<var "
"class=\"var\">input</var>が、標準出力には<var class=\"var\">output</var>"
"（<code class=\"code\">:stderr</code>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合"
"は標準エラー出力にも）が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"On systems where ptys are not available (MS-Windows), this parameter is "
"ignored, and pipes are used unconditionally."
msgstr ""
"pty が利用できないシステム (MS-Windows) では、このパラメータは無視され、無条"
"件にパイプが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html build/html/elisp/Network.html
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:noquery <var class=\"var\">query-flag</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:noquery <var class=\"var\">query-flag</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html build/html/elisp/Network.html
msgid ""
"Initialize the process query flag to <var class=\"var\">query-flag</var>.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">Querying Before Exit</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"プロセスクエリフラグを<var class=\"var\">query-flag</var>に初期化します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">終了前のクエリ</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:stop <var class=\"var\">stopped</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:stop <var class=\"var\">stopped</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If provided, <var class=\"var\">stopped</var> must be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>; it is an error to use any non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value.  The <code class=\"code\">:stop</code> key "
"is ignored otherwise and is retained for compatibility with other process "
"types such as pipe processes.  Asynchronous subprocesses never start in the "
"stopped state."
msgstr ""
"指定された場合、<var class=\"var\">stopped</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である必要があり、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の値を使用することはエラーとなります。それ以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">:stop</code> キーは無視され、パイププロセスなどの他のプロセス"
"タイプとの互換性のために保持されます。非同期サブプロセスが停止状態で開始され"
"ることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:filter <var class=\"var\">filter</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:filter <var class=\"var\">filter</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Initialize the process filter to <var class=\"var\">filter</var>.  If not "
"specified, a default filter will be provided, which can be overridden "
"later.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">Process Filter "
"Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"プロセスフィルタを <var class=\"var\">filter</var> に初期化します。指定しない"
"場合はデフォルトのフィルタが提供され、後で上書きすることも可能です。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">プロセスフィルタ関数</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:sentinel <var class=\"var\">sentinel</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:sentinel <var class=\"var\">sentinel</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Initialize the process sentinel to <var class=\"var\">sentinel</var>.  If "
"not specified, a default sentinel will be used, which can be overridden "
"later.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">Sentinels: Detecting "
"Process Status Changes</a>."
msgstr ""
"プロセスセンティネルを <var class=\"var\">sentinel</var> に初期化します。指定"
"しない場合はデフォルトのセンティネルが使用され、後で上書きすることも可能で"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">センティネル：プロセスステータ"
"スの変更検出</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:stderr <var class=\"var\">stderr</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:stderr <var class=\"var\">stderr</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Associate <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> with the standard error of the "
"process.  A non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value should be either a "
"buffer or a pipe process created with <code class=\"code\">make-pipe-"
"process</code>, described below.  If <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, standard error is mixed with standard "
"output, and both are sent to <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">filter</var>."
msgstr ""
"アソシエート <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> をプロセスの標準エラー出力に関連"
"付けます。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値は、後述する <code "
"class=\"code\">make-pipe-process</code> で作成されたバッファまたはパイププロ"
"セスである必要があります。<var class=\"var\">stderr</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、標準エラー出力は標準出力と混合され、両者が "
"<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> または <var class=\"var\">filter</var> に送ら"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-standard-error-process\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-standard-error-process\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> is a buffer, Emacs will create a pipe "
"process, the <em class=\"dfn\">standard error process</em>.  This process "
"will have the default filter (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html\">Process Filter Functions</a>), sentinel (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">Sentinels: Detecting Process Status "
"Changes</a>), and coding systems (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Default-"
"Coding-Systems.html\">Default Coding Systems</a>).  On the other hand, it "
"will use <var class=\"var\">query-flag</var> as its query-on-exit flag (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">Querying Before Exit</"
"a>).  It will be associated with the <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> buffer "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-Buffers.html\">Process Buffers</a>) "
"and send its output (which is the standard error of the main process) "
"there.  To get the process object for the standard error process, pass the "
"<var class=\"var\">stderr</var> buffer to <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-"
"process</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">stderr</var> がバッファである場合、Emacs はパイププロセス"
"である <em class=\"dfn\">標準エラープロセス</em> を作成します。このプロセスに"
"は、デフォルトのフィルタ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">"
"プロセスフィルタ関数</a> を参照）、センチネル（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Sentinels.html\">センチネル：プロセス状態の変化の検出</a> を参照）、お"
"よびコーディングシステム（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Default-Coding-"
"Systems.html\">デフォルトのコーディングシステム</a> を参照）が設定されます。"
"一方で、<var class=\"var\">query-flag</var> を終了時クエリフラグ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">終了前のクエリ</a> を参照）と"
"して使用します。また、このプロセスは <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> バッファ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-Buffers.html\">プロセスバッファ</a> を参"
"照）に関連付けられ、その出力（メインプロセスの標準エラー）をそこに送信しま"
"す。標準エラープロセスのプロセスオブジェクトを取得するには、<var "
"class=\"var\">stderr</var> バッファを <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-"
"process</code> に渡します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">stderr</var> is a pipe process, Emacs will use it as "
"standard error process for the new process."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">stderr</var> がパイププロセスである場合、Emacs はそれを新"
"しいプロセスの標準エラープロセスとして使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:file-handler <var class=\"var\">file-handler</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:file-handler <var class=\"var\">file-handler</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">file-handler</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then look for a file name handler for the current buffer&rsquo;s "
"<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>, and invoke that file name "
"handler to make the process.  If there is no such handler, proceed as if "
"<var class=\"var\">file-handler</var> were <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">file-handler</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でな"
"い場合は、現在のバッファの <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> に対"
"応するファイル名ハンドラを探し、そのファイル名ハンドラを呼び出して処理を行"
"う。そのようなハンドラが存在しない場合は、<var class=\"var\">file-handler</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるものとして処理を進める。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The original argument list, modified with the actual connection information, "
"is available via the <code class=\"code\">process-contact</code> function."
msgstr ""
"実際の接続情報で修正された元の引数リストは、<code class=\"code\">process-"
"contact</code>関数経由で利用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The current working directory of the subprocess is set to the current "
"buffer&rsquo;s value of <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> if "
"that is local (as determined by <code class=\"code\">unhandled-file-name-"
"directory</code>), or <samp class=\"file\">~</samp> otherwise.  If you want "
"to run a process in a remote directory, pass <code class=\"code\">:file-"
"handler t</code> to <code class=\"code\">make-process</code>.  In that case, "
"the current working directory is the local name component of <code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> (as determined by <code "
"class=\"code\">file-local-name</code>)."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセスの現在の作業ディレクトリは、現在のバッファの値がローカルである場"
"合（<code class=\"code\">unhandled-file-name-directory</code> で判定）は "
"<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> に、そうでない場合は <samp "
"class=\"file\">~</samp> に設定されます。リモートディレクトリでプロセスを実行"
"したい場合は、<code class=\"code\">:file-handler t</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">make-process</code> に渡してください。その場合、現在の作業ディ"
"レクトリは <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> のローカル名コンポー"
"ネント（<code class=\"code\">file-local-name</code> で判定）となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Depending on the implementation of the file name handler, it might not be "
"possible to apply <var class=\"var\">filter</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">sentinel</var> to the resulting process object.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">:stderr</code> argument cannot be a pipe process, file name "
"handlers do not support pipe processes for this.  A buffer as <code "
"class=\"code\">:stderr</code> argument is accepted, its contents is shown "
"without the use of pipe processes.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html\">Process Filter Functions</a>, <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Sentinels.html\">Sentinels: Detecting Process Status Changes</a>, and "
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Accepting-Output.html\">Accepting Output from "
"Processes</a>."
msgstr ""
