# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">stopped</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"start the process in the stopped state.  In the stopped state, a pipe "
"process does not accept incoming data, but you can send outgoing data.  The "
"stopped state is set by <code class=\"code\">stop-process</code> and cleared "
"by <code class=\"code\">continue-process</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Signals-to-Processes.html\">Sending Signals to Processes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">stopped</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、停止状態でプロセスを開始します。停止状態では、パイププロセスは受信データ"
"を受け付けませんが、送信データを送ることは可能です。停止状態は <code "
"class=\"code\">stop-process</code> によって設定され、<code "
"class=\"code\">continue-process</code> によって解除されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Signals-to-Processes.html\">プロセスへのシグナル送信</"
"a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
