# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">start-process-shell-command</"
"code>, but uses <code class=\"code\">start-file-process</code> internally.  "
"Because of this, <var class=\"var\">command</var> can also be executed on "
"remote hosts, depending on <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">start-process-shell-command</code> と同様です"
"が、内部的には <code class=\"code\">start-file-process</code> を使用していま"
"す。このため、<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> 次第で <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> もリモートホスト上で実行可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-connection-type</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002dconnection_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-connection-type</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002dconnection_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls the type of device used to communicate with "
"asynchronous subprocesses.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then ptys are used, when available.  Otherwise, pipes are used."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、非同期サブプロセスとの通信に使用するデバイスの種類を制御します。"
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、利用可能な場合は pty が使用"
"されます。それ以外の場合は、パイプが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The value of <code class=\"code\">process-connection-type</code> takes "
"effect when <code class=\"code\">make-process</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">start-process</code> is called.  So you can specify how to "
"communicate with one subprocess by binding the variable around the call to "
"these functions."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">process-connection-type</code> の値は、<code "
"class=\"code\">make-process</code> または <code class=\"code\">start-"
"process</code> が呼び出された際に有効になります。そのため、これらの関数の呼び"
"出し箇所で変数をバインドすることで、サブプロセスとの通信方法を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Note that the value of this variable is ignored when <code "
"class=\"code\">make-process</code> is called with a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value of the <code class=\"code\">:stderr</code> "
"parameter; in that case, Emacs will communicate with the process using "
"pipes.  It is also ignored if ptys are unavailable (MS-Windows)."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">:stderr</code> パラメータに <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定して <code class=\"code\">make-"
"process</code> を呼び出した場合、この変数の値は無視されます。その場合、Emacs "
"はパイプを用いてプロセスと通信します。また、pty が利用できない場合（MS-"
"Windows）にも無視されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((process-connection-type nil))  ; <span class=\"r\">use a pipe</span>\n"
"  (start-process ...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"To determine whether a given subprocess actually got a pipe or a pty, use "
"the function <code class=\"code\">process-tty-name</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-Information.html\">Process Information</a>)."
msgstr ""
"特定のサブプロセスが実際にパイプまたはptyを取得したかどうかを判断するには、関"
"数 <code class=\"code\">process-tty-name</code> を使用してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-Information.html\">プロセス情報</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-error-pause-time</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002derror_002dpause_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-error-pause-time</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002derror_002dpause_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Asynchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If a process sentinel/filter function has an error, Emacs will (by default) "
"pause Emacs for <code class=\"code\">process-error-pause-time</code> seconds "
"after displaying this error, so that users will see the error in question.  "
"However, this can lead to situations where Emacs becomes unresponsive (if "
"there&rsquo;s a lot of these errors happening), so this can be disabled by "
"setting <code class=\"code\">process-error-pause-time</code> to 0."
msgstr ""
"プロセスセンティネル/フィルタ関数でエラーが発生した場合、Emacsは（デフォルト"
"では）このエラーを表示した後、<code class=\"code\">process-error-pause-time</"
"code>秒間処理を一時停止し、ユーザーが当該エラーを確認できるようにします。ただ"
"し、（こうしたエラーが頻発すると）Emacsが応答しなくなる状況を招く可能性がある"
"ため、<code class=\"code\">process-error-pause-time</code>を0に設定することで"
"この機能を無効にできます。"

