# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This hook is used for automatically assigning faces to text in the buffer.  "
"It is part of the implementation of Jit-Lock mode, used by Font-Lock."
msgstr ""
"このフックは、バッファ内のテキストにフェイスを自動的に割り当てるために使用さ"
"れます。これは、Font-Lockで使用されるJit-Lockモードの実装の一部です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fontification-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fontification_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fontification-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fontification_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a list of functions that are called by Emacs redisplay "
"as needed, just before doing redisplay.  They are called even when Font Lock "
"Mode isn&rsquo;t enabled.  When Font Lock Mode is enabled, this variable "
"usually holds just one function, <code class=\"code\">jit-lock-function</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、Emacsが再表示を行う直前に、必要に応じて呼び出される関数のリスト"
"が格納されています。これらの関数は、Font Lockモードが有効でない場合でも呼び出"
"されます。Font Lockモードが有効な場合、この変数には通常、<code "
"class=\"code\">jit-lock-function</code> という1つの関数のみが格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"The functions are called in the order listed, with one argument, a buffer "
"position <var class=\"var\">pos</var>.  Collectively they should attempt to "
"assign faces to the text in the current buffer starting at <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var>."
msgstr ""
"各関数は記載された順に呼び出され、引数としてバッファ位置 <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> を1つ取ります。これらの関数は連携して、現在のバッファ"
"内の <var class=\"var\">pos</var> から始まるテキストに面を割り当てようとしま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"The functions should record the faces they assign by setting the <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> property.  They should also add a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">fontified</code> property to "
"all the text they have assigned faces to.  That property tells redisplay "
"that faces have been assigned to that text already."
msgstr ""
"関数は、<code class=\"code\">face</code> プロパティを設定することで、割り当て"
"たフェイスを記録する必要があります。また、フェイスを割り当てたすべてのテキス"
"トに、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の <code class=\"code\">fontified</"
"code> プロパティを追加する必要があります。このプロパティは、そのテキストにす"
"でにフェイスが割り当てられていることを再表示側に知らせるものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"It is probably a good idea for the functions to do nothing if the character "
"after <var class=\"var\">pos</var> already has a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">fontified</code> property, "
"but this is not required.  If one function overrides the assignments made by "
"a previous one, the properties after the last function finishes are the ones "
"that really matter."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pos</var> の後の文字がすでに <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> や <code class=\"code\">fontified</code> 以外のプロパティを持っている場"
"合、関数が何も行わないようにするのはおそらく良い考えでしょうが、必須ではあり"
"ません。ある関数が直前の関数による代入を上書きする場合、最後の関数が終了した"
"後のプロパティこそが実質的に重要となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"For efficiency, we recommend writing these functions so that they usually "
"assign faces to around 400 to 600 characters at each call."
msgstr ""
"効率性の観点から、これらの関数は、呼び出しごとに通常400〜600文字程度に面を割"
"り当てるように記述することをお勧めします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Faces.html
msgid ""
"Note that, when the buffer text includes very long lines, these functions "
"are called as if they were in a <code class=\"code\">with-restriction</code> "
"form (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>), with a "
"<code class=\"code\">long-line-optimizations-in-fontification-functions</"
"code> label and with the buffer narrowed to a portion around <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var>."
msgstr ""
"なお、バッファテキストに非常に長い行が含まれている場合、これらの関数は、"
"<code class=\"code\">with-restriction</code>形式（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>を参照）であるかのように呼び出され、"
"<code class=\"code\">long-line-optimizations-in-fontification-functions</"
"code>ラベルが付与され、バッファは<var class=\"var\">pos</var>周辺の範囲に狭め"
"られます。"

