"<span>33.14 Auto Filling<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Auto-Filling-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.14 自動入力<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Auto-Filling-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-filling_002c-automatic\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Auto-Fill-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-filling_002c-automatic\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Auto-Fill-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"Auto Fill mode is a minor mode that fills lines automatically as text is "
"inserted.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Auto-Fill.html#Auto-Fill\">Auto Fill</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  This section describes "
"some variables used by Auto Fill mode.  For a description of functions that "
"you can call explicitly to fill and justify existing text, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Filling.html\">Filling</a>."
msgstr ""
"オートフィルモードは、テキストの挿入に合わせて行を自動的に埋めるマイナーモー"
"ドです。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Auto-Fill.html#Auto-Fill\">Auto Fill</a>を参照してください。本節では、"
"オートフィルモードで使用されるいくつかの変数について説明します。既存のテキス"
"トを埋めたり揃えたりするために明示的に呼び出せる関数の説明については、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Filling.html\">Filling</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"Auto Fill mode also enables the functions that change the margins and "
"justification style to refill portions of the text.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Margins.html\">Margins for Filling</a>."
msgstr ""
"自動入力モードでは、余白や揃えスタイルを変更してテキストの一部を再入力する機"
"能も利用可能です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Margins.html\">再入力用の余白</a>"
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-fill-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dfill_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-fill-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dfill_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"The value of this buffer-local variable should be a function (of no "
"arguments) to be called after self-inserting a character from the table "
"<code class=\"code\">auto-fill-chars</code>, see below.  It may be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case nothing special is done in that "
"case."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数の値は、テーブル <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-"
"chars</code> から文字を自己挿入した後に呼び出される（引数なしの）関数である必"
"要があります（後述）。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であっても構いません"
"が、その場合は特に何も行われません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"The value of <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">do-auto-fill</code> when Auto Fill mode is enabled.  That is "
"a function whose sole purpose is to implement the usual strategy for "
"breaking a line."
msgstr ""
"オートフィルモードが有効な場合、<code class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</"
"code> の値は <code class=\"code\">do-auto-fill</code> となります。これは、改"
"行を行うための一般的な手法を実装することのみを目的とした関数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">normal-auto-fill-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-normal_002dauto_002dfill_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">normal-auto-fill-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-normal_002dauto_002dfill_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the function to use for <code class=\"code\">auto-"
"fill-function</code>, if and when Auto Fill is turned on.  Major modes can "
"set buffer-local values for this variable to alter how Auto Fill works."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、オートフィルが有効な場合に <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-"
"function</code> で使用する関数を指定します。メジャーモードでは、この変数に"
"バッファローカルな値を設定することで、オートフィルの動作を変更できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-fill-chars</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dfill_002dchars\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-fill-chars</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dfill_002dchars\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"A char table of characters which invoke <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-"
"function</code> when self-inserted&mdash;space and newline in most language "
"environments.  They have an entry <code class=\"code\">t</code> in the table."
msgstr ""
"自己挿入時に<code class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</code>を呼び出す文字の"
"charテーブル&mdash;ほとんどの言語環境ではスペースと改行。これらの文字はテーブ"
"ル内に<code class=\"code\">t</code>というエントリを持つ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">comment-auto-fill-only-comments</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-comment_002dauto_002dfill_002donly_002dcomments\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">comment-auto-fill-only-comments</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"comment_002dauto_002dfill_002donly_002dcomments\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Filling.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, means to fill lines "
"automatically within comments only.  More precisely, this means that if a "
"comment syntax was defined for the current buffer, then self-inserting a "
"character outside of a comment will not call <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-"
"function</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、コメント内のみで行を自"
"動的に埋めることを意味します。より正確には、現在のバッファにコメント構文が定"
"義されている場合、コメント外で文字を自己挿入しても <code class=\"code\">auto-"
"fill-function</code> は呼び出されないということです。"

