# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.2.2 How Emacs Chooses a Major Mode<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#How-Emacs-Chooses-a-Major-Mode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.2.2 Emacsがメジャーモードを選択する方法<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#How-Emacs-Chooses-a-Major-Mode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-major-mode_002c-automatic-"
"selection\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-major-mode_002c-automatic-"
"selection\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs visits a file, it automatically selects a major mode for the "
"buffer based on information in the file name or in the file itself.  It also "
"processes local variables specified in the file text."
msgstr ""
"Emacsがファイルを開く際、ファイル名やファイル自体の情報に基づいて、バッファ用"
"のメジャーモードを自動的に選択します。また、ファイル本文で指定されたローカル"
"変数も処理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">normal-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"find-file</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-normal_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">normal-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"find-file</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-normal_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This function establishes the proper major mode and buffer-local variable "
"bindings for the current buffer.  It calls <code class=\"code\">set-auto-"
"mode</code> (see below).  As of Emacs 26.1, it no longer runs <code "
"class=\"code\">hack-local-variables</code>, this now being done in <code "
"class=\"code\">run-mode-hooks</code> at the initialization of major modes "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mode-Hooks.html\">Mode Hooks</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファに対して適切なメジャーモードとバッファローカル変数"
"のバインディングを設定します。<code class=\"code\">set-auto-mode</code>（後"
"述）を呼び出します。Emacs 26.1以降、<code class=\"code\">hack-local-"
"variables</code>は実行されなくなりました。現在はメジャーモードの初期化時に"
"<code class=\"code\">run-mode-hooks</code>で処理が行われます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mode-Hooks.html\">モードフック</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"If the <var class=\"var\">find-file</var> argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> assumes that the <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> function is calling it.  In this case, it "
"may process local variables in the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-*-</"
"samp>&rsquo; line or at the end of the file.  The variable <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code> controls whether to do so.  See "
"<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/File-Variables.html#File-Variables\">Local Variables in "
"Files</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for the "
"syntax of the local variables section of a file."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> の引数 <var class=\"var\">find-file</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> は <code class=\"code\">find-file</code> 関"
"数が自身を呼び出しているとみなします。この場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-"
"*-</samp>&rsquo; 行またはファイルの末尾でローカル変数を処理することがありま"
"す。変数 <code class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code> によって、その処"
"理を行うかどうかが制御されます。ファイルのローカル変数セクションの構文につい"
"ては、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/File-Variables.html#File-Variables\">Local Variables in Files</a> を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"If you run <code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> interactively, the "
"argument <var class=\"var\">find-file</var> is normally <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In this case, <code class=\"code\">normal-mode</"
"code> unconditionally processes any file local variables."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> を対話的に実行した場合、引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">find-file</var> は通常 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となりま"
"す。この場合、<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> は無条件に任意のファイ"
"ルローカル変数を処理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The function calls <code class=\"code\">set-auto-mode</code> to choose and "
"set a major mode.  If this does not specify a mode, the buffer stays in the "
"major mode determined by the default value of <code class=\"code\">major-"
"mode</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">set-auto-mode</code> を呼び出してメジャーモー"
"ドを選択し、設定します。ここでモードが指定されない場合、バッファは <code "
"class=\"code\">major-mode</code> のデフォルト値（後述）で決定されたメジャー"
"モードのままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-mode-specification-error\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-mode-specification-error\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> uses <code class=\"code\">condition-"
"case</code> around the call to the major mode command, so errors are caught "
"and reported as a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File mode specification error</"
"samp>&rsquo;, followed by the original error message."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> はメジャーモードコマンドの呼び出しを "
"<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> で囲んでいるため、エラーが捕捉さ"
"れ、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File mode specification error</samp>&rsquo; "
"に続いて元のエラーメッセージが報告されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-auto-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"keep-mode-if-same</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dauto_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-auto-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"keep-mode-if-same</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
