# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto-Major-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This variable&rsquo;s value is an alist with elements of the form <code "
