# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span>27.2 Auto-Saving<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Auto_002dSaving-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>27.2 自動保存<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Auto_002dSaving-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"Emacs periodically saves all files that you are visiting; this is called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">auto-saving</em>.  Auto-saving prevents you from losing more "
"than a limited amount of work if the system crashes.  By default, auto-saves "
"happen every 300 keystrokes, or after around 30 seconds of idle time.  See "
"<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Auto-Save.html#Auto-Save\">Auto-Saving: Protection Against "
"Disasters</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for "
"information on auto-save for users.  Here we describe the functions used to "
"implement auto-saving and the variables that control them."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、閲覧中のすべてのファイルを定期的に保存します。これを<em "
"class=\"dfn\">自動保存</em>と呼びます。自動保存により、システムがクラッシュし"
"ても、失われる作業量を限定的に抑えることができます。デフォルトでは、300回の"
"キー入力ごと、または約30秒間のアイドル状態の後に自動保存が行われます。ユー"
"ザー向けの自動保存に関する情報については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Auto-Save.html#Auto-Save\">自動保存：災害からの"
"保護</a>を参照してください。ここでは、自動保存を実現するために使用される関数"
"と、それらを制御する変数について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-auto-save-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002dauto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-auto-save-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002dauto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable is the name of the file used for auto-saving the "
"current buffer.  It is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the buffer should "
"not be auto-saved."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、現在のバッファを自動保存する際に使用されるファイ"
"ル名です。バッファを自動保存しない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> とな"
"ります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"buffer-auto-save-file-name\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/lewis/#backups.texi#&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-auto_002dsave_002dmode\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-auto_002dsave_002dmode\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This is the mode command for Auto Save mode, a buffer-local minor mode.  "
"When Auto Save mode is enabled, auto-saving is enabled in the buffer.  The "
"calling convention is the same as for other minor mode commands (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minor-Mode-Conventions.html\">Conventions for Writing "
"Minor Modes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これは、バッファローカルなマイナーモードである Auto Save モードのコマンドで"
"す。Auto Save モードが有効になると、そのバッファで自動保存が有効になります。"
"呼び出し規約は、他のマイナーモードコマンドと同様です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minor-Mode-Conventions.html\">マイナーモード記述の規約</a>を参照してく"
"ださい）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"Unlike most minor modes, there is no <code class=\"code\">auto-save-mode</"
"code> variable.  Auto Save mode is enabled if <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"auto-save-file-name</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-saved-size</code> (see below) is non-zero."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどのマイナーモードとは異なり、<code class=\"code\">auto-save-mode</"
"code> 変数は存在しません。<code class=\"code\">buffer-auto-save-file-name</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく、かつ <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-saved-size</code>（後述）が 0 でない場合に、オートセー"
"ブモードが有効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-file-name-transforms</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-auto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname_002dtransforms\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-file-name-transforms</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-auto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname_002dtransforms\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This variable lists transforms to apply to buffer&rsquo;s file name before "
"making the auto-save file name."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、自動保存ファイル名を生成する前にバッファのファイル名に適用する"
"変換が列挙されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"Each transform is a list of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">replacement</var>&nbsp;"
"[<var class=\"var\">uniquify</var>])</code>.  <var class=\"var\">regexp</"
"var> is a regular expression to match against the file name; if it matches, "
"<code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> is used to replace the matching "
"part with <var class=\"var\">replacement</var>.  If the optional element "
"<var class=\"var\">uniquify</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the auto-save file name is constructed by concatenating the directory part "
"of the transformed file name with the buffer&rsquo;s file name in which all "
"directory separators were changed to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</"
"samp>&rsquo; to prevent clashes.  (This will not work correctly if your "
"filesystem truncates the resulting name.)"
msgstr ""
"各変換は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">regexp</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">replacement</var>&nbsp;[<var class=\"var\">uniquify</var>])</"
"code> 形式のリストです。<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> はファイル名に照合す"
"るための正規表現であり、一致した場合は <code class=\"code\">replace-match</"
"code> を用いて一致部分を <var class=\"var\">replacement</var> に置き換えま"
"す。オプション要素 <var class=\"var\">uniquify</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、自動保存ファイル名は、変換後のファイル"
"名のディレクトリ部分と、競合を防ぐためにすべてのディレクトリ区切り文字を "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo; に置換したバッファのファイル名を"
"連結して構成されます。（ファイルシステムが結果として得られた名前を切り詰める"
"場合、正しく動作しません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">uniquify</var> is one of the members of <code "
"class=\"code\">secure-hash-algorithms</code>, Emacs constructs the "
"nondirectory part of the auto-save file name by applying that <code "
"class=\"code\">secure-hash</code> to the buffer file name.  This avoids any "
"risk of excessively long file names."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">uniquify</var> が <code class=\"code\">secure-hash-"
"algorithms</code> の構成要素の一つである場合、Emacs はその <code "
"class=\"code\">secure-hash</code> をバッファファイル名に適用することで、自動"
"保存ファイル名のディレクトリ以外の部分を生成します。これにより、ファイル名が"
"過度に長くなるリスクを回避できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"All the transforms in the list are tried, in the order they are listed.  "
"When one transform applies, its result is final; no further transforms are "
"tried."
msgstr ""
"リスト内のすべての変換は、記載された順に試行されます。いずれかの変換が適用さ"
"れた場合、その結果が確定し、それ以降の変換は試行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"The default value is set up to put the auto-save files of remote files into "
"the temporary directory (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Unique-File-"
"Names.html\">Generating Unique File Names</a>)."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、リモートファイルの自動保存ファイルを一時ディレクトリに保存す"
"るように設定されています（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Unique-File-Names.html\">"
"一意のファイル名の生成</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html build/html/elisp/Making-Backups.html
msgid ""
"On MS-DOS filesystems without long names this variable is always ignored."
msgstr ""
"ロングファイル名に対応していないMS-DOSファイルシステムでは、この変数は常に無"
"視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-file-name-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-file-name-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value if <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> is a string that could be the name of an auto-"
"save file.  It assumes the usual naming convention for auto-save files: a "
"name that begins and ends with hash marks (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</"
"samp>&rsquo;) is a possible auto-save file name.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> should not contain a directory part."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> が自動保存ファイル名となり得る"
"文字列である場合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返します。本関数"
"は、自動保存ファイルの一般的な命名規則（先頭と末尾がハッシュ記号 (&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo;) である名前が自動保存ファイル名となり得"
"る）を前提としています。引数 <var class=\"var\">filename</var> にディレクトリ"
"部分を含めてはなりません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-auto-save-file-name)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/lewis/#backups.texi#&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(auto-save-file-name-p &quot;#backups.texi#&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; 0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(auto-save-file-name-p &quot;backups.texi&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-auto-save-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dauto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-auto-save-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dauto_002dsave_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the file name to use for auto-saving the current "
"buffer.  This is just the file name with hash marks (&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo;) prepended and appended to it.  This function "
"does not look at the variable <code class=\"code\">auto-save-visited-file-"
"name</code> (described below); callers of this function should check that "
"variable first."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファを自動保存する際に使用するファイル名を返します。こ"
"れは、ファイル名の前後にハッシュ記号 (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</"
"samp>&rsquo;) を付加したものです。この関数は変数 <code class=\"code\">auto-"
"save-visited-file-name</code>（後述）を参照しません。この関数を呼び出す側は、"
"まずその変数を確認する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">auto-save-visited-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-auto_002dsave_002dvisited_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">auto-save-visited-file-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-auto_002dsave_002dvisited_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs auto-saves "
"buffers in the files they are visiting.  That is, the auto-save is done in "
"the same file that you are editing.  Normally, this variable is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, so auto-save files have distinct names that are "
"created by <code class=\"code\">make-auto-save-file-name</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は閲覧中のファイ"
"ルにバッファを自動保存します。つまり、自動保存は編集中のファイルに対して行わ"
"れます。通常、この変数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるため、自動保存"
"ファイルには <code class=\"code\">make-auto-save-file-name</code> によって生"
"成される固有の名前が付けられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"When you change the value of this variable, the new value does not take "
"effect in an existing buffer until the next time auto-save mode is reenabled "
"in it.  If auto-save mode is already enabled, auto-saves continue to go in "
"the same file name until <code class=\"code\">auto-save-mode</code> is "
"called again."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値を変更しても、次回そのバッファで自動保存モードが再度有効になるま"
"で、新しい値は既存のバッファに反映されません。すでに自動保存モードが有効に"
"なっている場合は、<code class=\"code\">auto-save-mode</code> が再度呼び出され"
"るまで、同じファイル名で自動保存が継続されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"Note that setting this variable to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value does not change the fact that auto-saving is different from saving the "
"buffer; e.g., the hooks described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Saving-"
"Buffers.html\">Saving Buffers</a> are <em class=\"emph\">not</em> run when a "
"buffer is auto-saved."
msgstr ""
"なお、この変数に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を設定しても、自動保存"
"がバッファの保存とは異なるという事実に変わりはありません。例えば、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Saving-Buffers.html\">バッファの保存</a>で説明されている"
"フックは、バッファが自動保存される際には<em class=\"emph\">実行されません</"
"em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
