# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable specifies how often to do auto-saving, in terms "
"of number of input events.  Each time this many additional input events are "
"read, Emacs does auto-saving for all buffers in which that is enabled.  "
"Setting this to zero disables autosaving based on the number of characters "
"typed."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、入力イベント数単位で自動保存を行う頻度を指定します。この数だ"
"け追加の入力イベントが読み込まれるたびに、Emacsは自動保存が有効なすべてのバッ"
"ファに対して自動保存を行います。この値を0に設定すると、入力された文字数に基づ"
"く自動保存が無効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
