# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"If any buffers are auto-saved, <code class=\"code\">do-auto-save</code> "
