#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes the current buffer&rsquo;s auto-save file if <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-auto-save-files</code> is non-<code "
