# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"Unless <var class=\"var\">force</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, this function only deletes the file if it was written by the current "
"Emacs session since the last true save."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">force</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限"
"り、この関数は、前回の真の保存以降に現在の Emacs セッションによって書き込まれ"
"たファイルのみを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
