"href=\"#index-delete_002dauto_002dsave_002dfiles\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"This variable is used by the function <code class=\"code\">delete-auto-save-"
"file-if-necessary</code>.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"Emacs deletes auto-save files when a true save is done (in the visited "
"file).  This saves disk space and unclutters your directory."
msgstr ""
"この変数は関数 <code class=\"code\">delete-auto-save-file-if-necessary</"
"code> で使用されます。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"Emacs は（訪問中のファイルで）実際の保存が行われた際に自動保存ファイルを削除"
"します。これにより、ディスク容量が節約され、ディレクトリが整理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Auto_002dSaving.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rename-auto-save-file</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-rename_002dauto_002dsave_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
