# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Autoload.html
msgid ""
"You can also use a magic comment to execute a form at build time <em "
"class=\"emph\">without</em> executing it when the file itself is loaded.  To "
"do this, write the form <em class=\"emph\">on the same line</em> as the "
"magic comment.  Since it is in a comment, it does nothing when you load the "
"source file; but <code class=\"code\">loaddefs-generate</code> copies it to "
"<samp class=\"file\">loaddefs.el</samp>, where it is executed while building "
"Emacs."
msgstr ""
"また、マジックコメントを使用して、ファイル自体が読み込まれる際には実行<em "
"class=\"emph\">せず</em>、ビルド時にフォームを実行させることもできます。これ"
"を行うには、マジックコメントと<em class=\"emph\">同じ行</em>にフォームを記述"
"します。コメント内であるため、ソースファイルを読み込む際には何も行われません"
"が、<code class=\"code\">loaddefs-generate</code> がそれを <samp "
"class=\"file\">loaddefs.el</samp> にコピーし、Emacs のビルド時に実行されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Autoload.html
msgid ""
"The following example shows how <code class=\"code\">doctor</code> is "
"prepared for autoloading with a magic comment:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、マジックコメントを用いて <code class=\"code\">doctor</code> を"
"オートロード用に準備する方法を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Autoload.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;;###autoload\n"
"(defun doctor ()\n"
"  &quot;Switch to *doctor* buffer and start giving psychotherapy.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (switch-to-buffer &quot;*doctor*&quot;)\n"
"  (doctor-mode))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Autoload.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s what that produces in <samp class=\"file\">loaddefs.el</samp>:"
msgstr ""
"その結果、<samp class=\"file\">loaddefs.el</samp>では次のようになります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Autoload.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(autoload 'doctor &quot;doctor&quot; &quot;\\\n"
"Switch to *doctor* buffer and start giving psychotherapy.\n"
"\n"
"\\(fn)&quot; t nil)\n"
msgstr ""

