# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Backquote constructs</em> allow you to quote a list, but "
"selectively evaluate elements of that list.  In the simplest case, it is "
"identical to the special form <code class=\"code\">quote</code> (described "
"in the previous section; see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quoting.html\">Quoting</a>).  For example, these two forms yield "
"identical results:"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">バッククォート構文</em>を使うと、リストを引用しつつ、そのリ"
"ストの要素を選択的に評価することができます。最も単純なケースでは、特殊形式 "
"<code class=\"code\">quote</code>（前節で説明。<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quoting.html\">引用</a>を参照）と同じになります。例えば、次の2つの形式"
"は同一の結果をもたらします："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`(a list of (+ 2 3) elements)\n"
"     &rArr; (a list of (+ 2 3) elements)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"'(a list of (+ 2 3) elements)\n"
"     &rArr; (a list of (+ 2 3) elements)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002c-_0028with-backquote_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002c-_0028with-backquote_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"The special marker &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</samp>&rsquo; inside of the "
"argument to backquote indicates a value that isn&rsquo;t constant.  The "
"Emacs Lisp evaluator evaluates the argument of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,"
"</samp>&rsquo;, and puts the value in the list structure:"
msgstr ""
"バッククォートの引数内にある特殊マーカー &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、定数ではない値であることを示します。Emacs Lisp 評価器は "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</samp>&rsquo; の引数を評価し、その値をリスト構"
"造に格納します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`(a list of ,(+ 2 3) elements)\n"
"     &rArr; (a list of 5 elements)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"Substitution with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</samp>&rsquo; is allowed at "
"deeper levels of the list structure also.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"リスト構造のより深い階層においても、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</"
"samp>&rsquo;による置換が可能です。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`(1 2 (3 ,(+ 4 5)))\n"
"     &rArr; (1 2 (3 9))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002c_0040-_0028with-"
"backquote_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-splicing-"
"_0028with-backquote_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002c_0040-_0028with-"
"backquote_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-splicing-"
"_0028with-backquote_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"You can also <em class=\"dfn\">splice</em> an evaluated value into the "
"resulting list, using the special marker &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,@</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  The elements of the spliced list become elements at the same "
"level as the other elements of the resulting list.  The equivalent code "
"without using &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">`</samp>&rsquo; is often "
"unreadable.  Here are some examples:"
msgstr ""
"また、特殊なマーカー &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,@</samp>&rsquo; を使用し"
"て、評価済みの値を結果のリストに<em class=\"dfn\">挿入</em>することもできま"
"す。挿入されたリストの要素は、結果のリストの他の要素と同じ階層の要素となりま"
"す。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">`</samp>&rsquo; を使用しない同等のコードは、"
"しばしば可読性に欠けます。以下にいくつかの例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq some-list '(2 3))\n"
"     &rArr; (2 3)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cons 1 (append some-list '(4) some-list))\n"
"     &rArr; (1 2 3 4 2 3)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`(1 ,@some-list 4 ,@some-list)\n"
"     &rArr; (1 2 3 4 2 3)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq list '(hack foo bar))\n"
"     &rArr; (hack foo bar)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cons 'use\n"
"  (cons 'the\n"
"    (cons 'words (append (cdr list) '(as elements)))))\n"
"     &rArr; (use the words foo bar as elements)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`(use the words ,@(cdr list) as elements)\n"
"     &rArr; (use the words foo bar as elements)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Backquote.html
msgid ""
"A backquote construct acts like <code class=\"code\">quote</code> in that it "
"yields conses, vectors and strings that might be shared and should not be "
"modified.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Self_002dEvaluating-"
"Forms.html\">Self-Evaluating Forms</a>."
msgstr ""
"バッククォート構文は、共有される可能性があり、変更すべきではないコンス、ベク"
"トル、文字列を返すという点で <code class=\"code\">quote</code> と同様に動作し"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Self_002dEvaluating-Forms.html\">自己評価形式"
"</a>を参照してください。"

