#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Backup-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of all the backup file names for <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there "
"are none.  The files are sorted by modification time, descending, so that "
"the most recent files are first."
