"&amp;optional no-line-break</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"base64_002dencode_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Base-64.html
msgid ""
"This function converts the string <var class=\"var\">string</var> into base "
