# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Char-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"You can express the characters control-g, backspace, tab, newline, vertical "
"tab, formfeed, space, return, del, and escape as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\a</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\b</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\t</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\n</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\v</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\f</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\s</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\r</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\d</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">?\\e</samp>&rsquo;, respectively.  (&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\s</samp>&rsquo; followed by a dash has a different "
"meaning&mdash;it applies the Super modifier to the following character.)  "
"Thus,"
msgstr ""
"文字の control-g、backspace、tab、newline、vertical tab、formfeed、space、"
"return、del、および escape は、それぞれ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\a</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\b</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\t</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\n</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\v</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\f</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\s</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\r</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\d</samp>&rsquo;、および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\e</"
"samp>&rsquo; と表現できます。（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\s</"
"samp>&rsquo; の後にハイフンが続く場合は意味が異なり、後続の文字に Super 修飾"
"子を適用します。）したがって、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
