"Completion-Functions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The following completion functions have nothing in themselves to do with "
"minibuffers.  We describe them here to keep them near the higher-level "
"completion features that do use the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"以下の補完機能は、それ自体はミニバッファとは無関係です。ミニバッファを利用す"
"る上位レベルの補完機能の近くに配置するため、ここで説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">try-completion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"collection &amp;optional predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-try_002dcompletion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">try-completion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"collection &amp;optional predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-try_002dcompletion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the longest common substring of all possible "
"completions of <var class=\"var\">string</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">collection</var> における <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> の考えられるすべての補完の中で、最長の共通部分文字"
"列を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-table\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-table\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> is called the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">completion table</em>.  Its value must be a list of strings or "
"cons cells, an obarray, a hash table, or a completion function."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> は <em class=\"dfn\">補完テーブル</em> と"
"呼ばれます。その値は、文字列またはコンスセルのリスト、オブアレイ、ハッシュ"
"テーブル、あるいは補完関数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> compares <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> against each of the permissible completions "
"specified by the completion table.  If no permissible completions match, it "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If there is just one matching "
"completion, and the match is exact, it returns <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>.  Otherwise, it returns the longest initial sequence common to all "
"possible matching completions."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> は、<var class=\"var\">string</"
"var> を完了テーブルで指定された許容される完了候補のそれぞれと照合します。一致"
"する許容される完了候補がない場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。一致する完了候補が1つのみあり、かつそれが完全一致である場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。それ以外の場合は、一致する可能性のあるす"
"べての完了候補に共通する最長の先頭シーケンスを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a list, the permissible "
"completions are specified by the elements of the list, each of which should "
"be either a string, or a cons cell whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is "
"either a string or a symbol (a symbol is converted to a string using <code "
"class=\"code\">symbol-name</code>).  If the list contains elements of any "
"other type, those are ignored."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> がリストである場合、許容される補完内容は"
"リストの要素によって指定され、各要素は文字列、または <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> が文字列もしくはシンボルであるコンスセルのいずれかで"
"ある必要があります（シンボルは <code class=\"code\">symbol-name</code> を用い"
"て文字列に変換されます）。リストにそれ以外の型の要素が含まれている場合は、そ"
"れらは無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obarray-in-completion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obarray-in-completion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is an obarray (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Creating-Symbols.html\">Creating and Interning Symbols</a>), the "
"names of all symbols in the obarray form the set of permissible completions."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> が obarray である場合（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-Symbols.html\">シンボルの作成とインターニング"
"</a>を参照）、その obarray 内のすべてのシンボル名が、許容される補完候補となり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a hash table, then the keys that "
"are strings or symbols are the possible completions.  Other keys are ignored."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> がハッシュテーブルである場合、文字列また"
"はシンボルであるキーが補完候補となります。それ以外のキーは無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"You can also use a function as <var class=\"var\">collection</var>.  Then "
"the function is solely responsible for performing completion; <code "
"class=\"code\">try-completion</code> returns whatever this function "
"returns.  The function is called with three arguments: <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (the third argument is so that the same function "
"can be used in <code class=\"code\">all-completions</code> and do the "
"appropriate thing in either case).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Programmed-"
"Completion.html\">Programmed Completion</a>."
msgstr ""
"また、関数を <var class=\"var\">collection</var> として使用することもできま"
"す。この場合、関数が補完処理を単独で担い、<code class=\"code\">try-"
"completion</code> はその関数が返す値をそのまま返します。関数には <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>、<var class=\"var\">predicate</var>、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の3つの引数が渡されます（3番目の引数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">all-completions</code> でも同じ関数を使用し、いずれの場合にお"
"いても適切な処理を行えるようにするためのものです）。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Programmed-Completion.html\">プログラムによる補完</a> を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If the argument <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then it must be a function of one argument, "
"unless <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a hash table, in which case it "
"should be a function of two arguments.  It is used to test each possible "
"match, and the match is accepted only if <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> "
"returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The argument given to <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> is either a string or a cons cell (the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of which is a string) from the alist, or a symbol "
"(<em class=\"emph\">not</em> a symbol name) from the obarray.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> is a hash table, <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> is called with two arguments, the string key "
"and the associated value."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ない場合、それは1つの引数を取る関数でなければなりません。ただし、<var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> がハッシュテーブルである場合は、2つの引数を取"
"る関数である必要があります。これは考えられる各マッチを判定するために使用さ"
"れ、<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外を返す場合にのみ、マッチが受理されます。<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> "
"に渡される引数は、alist からの文字列またはコンスセル（その <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> が文字列であるもの）、あるいは obarray からのシンボ"
"ル（シンボル名では<em class=\"emph\">ない</em>もの）のいずれかです。<var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> がハッシュテーブルである場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> は文字列のキーとそれに関連付けられた値という2つ"
"の引数で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"In addition, to be acceptable, a completion must also match all the regular "
"expressions in <code class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code>.  (Unless "
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a function, in which case that "
"function has to handle <code class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code> "
"itself.)"
msgstr ""
"さらに、受理されるためには、完了形は<code class=\"code\">completion-regexp-"
"list</code>内のすべての正規表現にも一致しなければなりません。（ただし、<var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var>が関数である場合は、その関数が<code "
"class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code>自体を処理する必要があります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"In the first of the following examples, the string &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; is matched by three of the alist <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small>s.  All of the matches begin with the characters "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fooba</samp>&rsquo;, so that is the result.  In "
"the second example, there is only one possible match, and it is exact, so "
"the return value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の例の1つ目では、文字列 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; が"
"アリスト <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> のうち3つにマッチします。すべての"
"マッチは文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fooba</samp>&rsquo; から始まるため、"
"この結果となります。2つ目の例では、考えられるマッチは1つのみであり、かつ完全"
"一致であるため、戻り値は <code class=\"code\">t</code> となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(try-completion\n"
" &quot;foo&quot;\n"
" '((&quot;foobar1&quot; 1) (&quot;barfoo&quot; 2) (&quot;foobaz&quot; 3) (&quot;foobar2&quot; 4)))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;fooba&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(try-completion &quot;foo&quot; '((&quot;barfoo&quot; 2) (&quot;foo&quot; 3)))\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, numerous symbols begin with the characters &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">forw</samp>&rsquo;, and all of them begin with the word "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">forward</samp>&rsquo;.  In most of the symbols, "
"this is followed with a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;, but not "
"in all, so no more than &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">forward</samp>&rsquo; "
"can be completed."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、多くの記号が文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">forw</"
"samp>&rsquo; で始まり、それらはすべて &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">forward</"
"samp>&rsquo; という単語で始まっています。ほとんどの記号では、その後に &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; が続きますが、すべてがそうであるわけでは"
"ないため、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">forward</samp>&rsquo; までしか完成しま"
"せん。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(try-completion &quot;forw&quot; obarray)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;forward&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"Finally, in the following example, only two of the three possible matches "
"pass the predicate <code class=\"code\">test</code> (the string &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foobaz</samp>&rsquo; is too short).  Both of those begin with "
"the string &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobar</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"最後に、以下の例では、考えられる3つのマッチのうち2つのみが述語 <code "
"class=\"code\">test</code> を満たします（文字列 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foobaz</samp>&rsquo; は短すぎます）。これらはいずれも文字列 "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobar</samp>&rsquo; で始まっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun test (s)\n"
"  (&gt; (length (car s)) 6))\n"
"     &rArr; test\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(try-completion\n"
" &quot;foo&quot;\n"
" '((&quot;foobar1&quot; 1) (&quot;barfoo&quot; 2) (&quot;foobaz&quot; 3) (&quot;foobar2&quot; 4))\n"
" 'test)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;foobar&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">all-completions</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"collection &amp;optional predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-all_002dcompletions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">all-completions</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"collection &amp;optional predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-all_002dcompletions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of all possible completions of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  The arguments to this function are the same as "
"those of <code class=\"code\">try-completion</code>, and it uses <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code> in the same way that <code "
"class=\"code\">try-completion</code> does."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> の考えられるすべての補完候補のリ"
"ストを返します。この関数の引数は <code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> "
"のものと同じであり、<code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> と同様に "
"<code class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code> を利用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a function, it is called with "
"three arguments: <var class=\"var\">string</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> and <code class=\"code\">t</code>; then <code "
"class=\"code\">all-completions</code> returns whatever the function "
"returns.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Programmed-"
"Completion.html\">Programmed Completion</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> が関数である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>、<var class=\"var\">predicate</var>、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> の3つの引数で呼び出され、<code class=\"code\">all-"
"completions</code> はその関数が返す値をそのまま返します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Programmed-Completion.html\">プログラムによる補完</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example, using the function <code class=\"code\">test</code> "
"shown in the example for <code class=\"code\">try-completion</code>:"
msgstr ""
"以下に、<code class=\"code\">try-completion</code>の例で示した関数<code "
"class=\"code\">test</code>を用いた例を挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(all-completions\n"
" &quot;foo&quot;\n"
" '((&quot;foobar1&quot; 1) (&quot;barfoo&quot; 2) (&quot;foobaz&quot; 3) (&quot;foobar2&quot; 4))\n"
" 'test)\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;foobar1&quot; &quot;foobar2&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">test-completion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"collection &amp;optional predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-test_002dcompletion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">test-completion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"collection &amp;optional predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-test_002dcompletion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-test_002dcompletion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-test_002dcompletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> is a valid completion alternative specified by "
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> and <var class=\"var\">predicate</var>.  "
"The arguments are the same as in <code class=\"code\">try-completion</"
"code>.  For instance, if <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a list of "
"strings, this is true if <var class=\"var\">string</var> appears in the list "
"and <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> is satisfied."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> が <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> および <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> に"
"よって指定された有効な補完候補である場合、non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。引数は <code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> と同様で"
"す。例えば、<var class=\"var\">collection</var> が文字列のリストである場合、"
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> がそのリストに含まれ、かつ <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> が満たされていれば、この条件は成立します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function uses <code class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code> in the "
"same way that <code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> does."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">try-completion</code>と同様に<code "
"class=\"code\">completion-regexp-list</code>を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"and if <var class=\"var\">collection</var> contains several strings that are "
"equal to each other, as determined by <code class=\"code\">compare-strings</"
"code> according to <code class=\"code\">completion-ignore-case</code>, then "
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> should accept either all or none of "
"them.  Otherwise, the return value of <code class=\"code\">test-completion</"
"code> is essentially unpredictable."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではな"
"く、かつ <var class=\"var\">collection</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-ignore-case</code> に従って <code "
"class=\"code\">compare-strings</code> で判定される互いに等しい文字列が複数含"
"まれている場合、<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> はそれらのすべて、あるいは"
"いずれも受け付けるべきである。そうでない場合、<code class=\"code\">test-"
"completion</code> の戻り値は実質的に予測不能となる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">collection</var> is a function, it is called with "
"three arguments, the values <var class=\"var\">string</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> and <code class=\"code\">lambda</code>; "
