# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, case "
"is not considered significant in completion.  Within <code "
"class=\"code\">read-file-name</code>, this variable is overridden by <code "
"class=\"code\">read-file-name-completion-ignore-case</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-File-Names.html\">Reading File Names</a>); "
"within <code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code>, it is overridden by <code "
"class=\"code\">read-buffer-completion-ignore-case</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"High_002dLevel-Completion.html\">High-Level "
"Completion Functions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、補完において大文"
"字・小文字は区別されません。<code class=\"code\">read-file-name</code> の範囲"
"内では、この変数は <code class=\"code\">read-file-name-completion-ignore-"
"case</code> によって上書きされます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-File-"
"Names.html\">ファイル名の読み取り</a> を参照）。<code class=\"code\">read-"
"buffer</code> の範囲内では、<code class=\"code\">read-buffer-completion-"
"ignore-case</code> によって上書きされます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"High_002dLevel-Completion.html\">高レベル補完関数</a> を参照）。"

