# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"These frame parameters give the most basic information about the frame.  "
"<code class=\"code\">title</code> and <code class=\"code\">name</code> are "
"meaningful on all terminals."
msgstr ""
"これらのフレームパラメータは、フレームに関する最も基本的な情報を提供します。"
"<code class=\"code\">title</code> と <code class=\"code\">name</code> はすべ"
"ての端末で有効です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-display_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">display</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-display_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">display</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The display on which to open this frame.  It should be a string of the form "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">host</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">dpy</var>.<var class=\"var\">screen</var></samp>&rsquo;, just "
"like the <code class=\"env\">DISPLAY</code> environment variable.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple Terminals</a>, for "
"more details about display names."
msgstr ""
"このフレームを開く際に使用するディスプレイ。<code class=\"env\">DISPLAY</"
"code>環境変数と同様に、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">host</"
"var>:<var class=\"var\">dpy</var>.<var class=\"var\">screen</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;という形式の文字列である必要があります。ディスプレイ名の詳細につ"
"いては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple "
"Terminals</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-display_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">display-type</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-display_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
