# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If a frame has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> title, that title "
"appears in the window system&rsquo;s title bar at the top of the frame, and "
"also in the mode line of windows in that frame if <code class=\"code\">mode-"
