# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span>40.1 Basic Thread Functions<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Basic-"
"Thread-Functions-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>40.1 基本的なスレッド関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Basic-"
"Thread-Functions-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Threads can be created and waited for.  A thread cannot be exited directly, "
"but the current thread can be exited implicitly, and other threads can be "
"signaled."
msgstr ""
"スレッドの作成や待機が可能です。スレッドを直接終了させることはできませんが、"
"現在のスレッドを暗黙的に終了させたり、他のスレッドにシグナルを送ったりするこ"
"とはできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-thread</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function "
"&amp;optional name buffer-disposition</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dthread\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-thread</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function "
"&amp;optional name buffer-disposition</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dthread\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Create a new thread of execution which invokes <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var>.  When <var class=\"var\">function</var> returns, the thread exits."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var>を呼び出す新しい実行スレッドを作成する。"
"<var class=\"var\">function</var>が返ると、そのスレッドは終了する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The new thread is created with no local variable bindings in effect.  The "
"new thread&rsquo;s current buffer is inherited from the current thread."
msgstr ""
"新しいスレッドは、ローカル変数の束縛が適用されていない状態で生成されます。新"
"しいスレッドの現在のバッファは、現在のスレッドから継承されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> can be supplied to give a name to the thread.  "
"The name is used for debugging and informational purposes only; it has no "
"meaning to Emacs.  If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is provided, it must be "
"a string."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> を指定すると、スレッドに名前を付けることができ"
"ます。この名前はデバッグや情報提供目的のみに使用され、Emacs にとっては意味を"
"持ちません。<var class=\"var\">name</var> を指定する場合は、文字列である必要"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-disposition</var> indicates what happens if the "
"thread&rsquo;s current buffer is about to be killed.  If the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, killing the buffer is not allowed.  Any other "
"value, including <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (which is the default), "
"means that the buffer is killed and the thread is assigned another current "
"buffer, and it&rsquo;s signaled the error <code class=\"code\">thread-buffer-"
"killed</code>.  But if the value is the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">silently</code>, the error is not signaled."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-disposition</var> は、スレッドの現在のバッファが破"
"棄されようとしている場合に何が起こるかを示します。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、バッファの破棄は許可されません。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）を含むそれ以外の値は、バッファが破棄さ"
"れ、スレッドに別の現在のバッファが割り当てられ、エラー <code "
"class=\"code\">thread-buffer-killed</code> が通知されることを意味します。ただ"
"し、値がシンボル <code class=\"code\">silently</code> の場合は、エラーは通知"
"されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid "This function returns the new thread."
msgstr "この関数は新しいスレッドを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
