"thread_002dset_002dbuffer_002ddisposition\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"After a thread had been created, you can inspect or change its buffer-"
"disposition using functions <code class=\"code\">thread-buffer-disposition</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">thread-set-buffer-disposition</code>."
msgstr ""
"スレッドが作成された後は、関数 <code class=\"code\">thread-buffer-"
"disposition</code> および <code class=\"code\">thread-set-buffer-"
"disposition</code> を使用して、そのバッファ処理を確認または変更できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">threadp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-threadp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">threadp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-threadp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> represents an Emacs thread, <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が Emacs スレッドを表す場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thread-join</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">thread</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-thread_002djoin\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thread-join</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">thread</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-thread_002djoin\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Block until <var class=\"var\">thread</var> exits, or until the current "
"thread is signaled.  It returns the result of the <var class=\"var\">thread</"
"var> function.  If <var class=\"var\">thread</var> has already exited, this "
"returns immediately."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">thread</var> が終了するか、現在のスレッドにシグナルが送ら"
"れるまでブロックします。<var class=\"var\">thread</var> 関数の結果を返しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">thread</var> が既に終了している場合は、直ちに戻りま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thread-signal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">thread error-"
"symbol data</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"thread_002dsignal\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thread-signal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">thread error-"
"symbol data</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"thread_002dsignal\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Thread-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">signal</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Signaling-Errors.html\">How to Signal an Error</a>), but the signal "
"is delivered in the thread <var class=\"var\">thread</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">thread</var> is the current thread, then this just calls <code "
"class=\"code\">signal</code> immediately.  Otherwise, <var "
"class=\"var\">thread</var> will receive the signal as soon as it becomes "
"current.  If <var class=\"var\">thread</var> was blocked by a call to <code "
"class=\"code\">mutex-lock</code>, <code class=\"code\">condition-wait</"
"code>, or <code class=\"code\">thread-join</code>; <code "
"class=\"code\">thread-signal</code> will unblock it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">signal</code> と同様（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Signaling-Errors.html\">エラーの通知方法</a> を参照）ですが、シグナル"
"はスレッド <var class=\"var\">thread</var> で送出されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">thread</var> が現在のスレッドである場合、これは直ちに <code "
"class=\"code\">signal</code> を呼び出します。そうでない場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">thread</var> が現在のスレッドになった時点でシグナルを受信しま"
