"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-windowp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a window (whether or not it displays a "
"buffer).  Otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> がウィンドウ（バッファを表示する"
"か否かにかかわらず）である場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。そ"
"れ以外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-live-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-live-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">live window</em> is one that is actually displaying a "
"buffer in a frame."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ライブウィンドウ</em>とは、フレーム内にバッファを実際に表示"
"しているもののことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-live-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dlive_002dp\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-live-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dlive_002dp\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a live window and <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> otherwise.  A live window is one that displays a buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> がライブウィンドウであれば <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでなければ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返します。ライブウィンドウとは、バッファを表示しているウィンドウのことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-internal-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-internal-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The windows in each frame are organized into a <em class=\"dfn\">window "
"tree</em>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">Windows "
"and Frames</a>.  The leaf nodes of each window tree are live "
"windows&mdash;the ones actually displaying buffers.  The internal nodes of "
"the window tree are <em class=\"dfn\">internal windows</em>, which are not "
"live."
msgstr ""
"各フレームのウィンドウは、<em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウツリー</em>として構成さ"
"れています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">ウィンドウとフ"
"レーム</a>を参照してください。各ウィンドウツリーのリーフノードはライブウィン"
"ドウ&mdash;実際にバッファを表示しているウィンドウのことです。ウィンドウツリー"
"の内部ノードは<em class=\"dfn\">内部ウィンドウ</em>であり、ライブではありませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-valid-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-valid-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">valid window</em> is one that is either live or "
"internal.  A valid window can be <em class=\"dfn\">deleted</em>, i.e., "
"removed from its frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-"
"Windows.html\">Deleting Windows</a>); then it is no longer valid, but the "
"Lisp object representing it might be still referenced from other Lisp "
"objects.  A deleted window may be made valid again by restoring a saved "
"window configuration (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Configurations.html\">Window Configurations</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">有効なウィンドウ</em>とは、ライブまたは内部のいずれかである"
"ウィンドウのことです。有効なウィンドウは<em class=\"dfn\">削除</em>、すなわち"
"フレームから除去することができます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-"
"Windows.html\">ウィンドウの削除</a>を参照）。削除されるともはや有効ではありま"
"せんが、それを表すLispオブジェクトは、他のLispオブジェクトから依然として参照"
"されている可能性があります。削除されたウィンドウは、保存済みのウィンドウ構成"
"を復元することで、再び有効にすることができます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ構成</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"You can distinguish valid windows from deleted windows with <code "
"class=\"code\">window-valid-p</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">window-valid-p</code> を使えば、有効なウィンドウと削除済"
"みのウィンドウを区別できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-valid-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dvalid_002dp\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-valid-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dvalid_002dp\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Basic-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a live window, or an internal window in a "
"window tree.  Otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"including for the case where <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a deleted "
"window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> がライブウィンドウ、またはウィン"
"ドウツリー内の内部ウィンドウである場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返し"
"ます。それ以外の場合は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が削除済みウィンドウ"
"である場合も含めて <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
