# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-batch-mode\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-batch-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The command-line option &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-batch</samp>&rsquo; "
"causes Emacs to run noninteractively.  In this mode, Emacs does not read "
"commands from the terminal, it does not alter the terminal modes, and it "
"does not expect to be outputting to an erasable screen.  The idea is that "
"you specify Lisp programs to run; when they are finished, Emacs should "
"exit.  The way to specify the programs to run is with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-l <var class=\"var\">file</var></samp>&rsquo;, which loads "
"the library named <var class=\"var\">file</var>, or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-f <var class=\"var\">function</var></samp>&rsquo;, which "
"calls <var class=\"var\">function</var> with no arguments, or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">--eval=<var class=\"var\">form</var></samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"コマンドラインオプション &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-batch</samp>&rsquo; を"
"指定すると、Emacsは非対話モードで動作します。このモードでは、Emacsはターミナ"
"ルからコマンドを読み取らず、ターミナルモードを変更せず、また消去可能な画面へ"
"の出力も想定しません。その考え方は、実行するLispプログラムを指定し、それらの"
"プログラムが完了した時点でEmacsが終了するというものです。実行するプログラムを"
"指定する方法としては、<var class=\"var\">file</var> という名前のライブラリを"
"読み込む &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-l <var class=\"var\">file</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;、引数なしで <var class=\"var\">function</var> を呼び出す &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-f <var class=\"var\">function</var></samp>&rsquo;、ある"
"いは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--eval=<var class=\"var\">form</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
