# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> when Emacs is running "
"in batch mode."
msgstr ""
"Emacsがバッチモードで動作している場合、この変数は<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>ではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
msgid ""
"If the specified Lisp program signals an unhandled error in batch mode, "
"Emacs exits with a non-zero exit status after invoking the Lisp debugger "
"which shows the Lisp backtrace (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Invoking-the-"
"Debugger.html\">Invoking the Debugger</a>) on the standard error stream:"
msgstr ""
"指定したLispプログラムがバッチモードで未処理のエラーを発生させた場合、Emacsは"
"Lispデバッガを起動した後、非ゼロの終了ステータスで終了します。この際、標準エ"
"ラーストリームにLispのバックトレース（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Invoking-the-"
"Debugger.html\">デバッガの起動</a>を参照）が表示されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ emacs -Q --batch --eval '(error &quot;foo&quot;)'; echo $?\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Batch-Mode.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error: error (&quot;foo&quot;)\n"
"mapbacktrace(#f(compiled-function (evald func args flags) #&lt;bytecode -0x4f85c5\n"
"7c45e2f81&gt;))\n"
"debug-early-backtrace()\n"
"debug-early(error (error &quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"signal(error (&quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"error(&quot;foo&quot;)\n"
"eval((error &quot;foo&quot;) t)\n"
"command-line-1((&quot;--eval&quot; &quot;(error \\&quot;foo\\&quot;)&quot;))\n"
"command-line()\n"
"normal-top-level()\n"
msgstr ""

