#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Beeping.html
msgid ""
"This function beeps, or flashes the screen (see <code class=\"code\">visible-"
"bell</code> below).  It also terminates any keyboard macro currently "
"executing unless <var class=\"var\">do-not-terminate</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
