# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Beeping.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies how Emacs "
"should ring the bell.  Its value should be a function of no arguments.  If "
"this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it takes precedence over the "
"<code class=\"code\">visible-bell</code> variable."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs がどのようにベルを鳴"
