# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"Where exactly paragraphs start and end, for the purpose of the Emacs <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UBA</abbr> implementation, is determined by the following "
"two buffer-local variables (note that <code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> have no influence "
"on this).  By default both of these variables are <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, and paragraphs are bounded by empty lines, i.e., lines that consist "
"entirely of zero or more whitespace characters followed by a newline."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの<abbr class=\"acronym\">UBA</abbr>実装において、段落が具体的にどこで始"
"まりどこで終わるかは、以下の2つのバッファローカル変数によって決定されます（な"
"お、<code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code>および<code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code>はこれに影響しません）。デフォルトで"
"はこれら両方の変数は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となっており、段落は空行、"
"すなわち0個以上の空白文字のみで構成され、その後に改行が続く行によって区切られ"
"ます。"

