# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"This function returns its argument <var class=\"var\">string</var>, possibly "
"modified, such that the result can be safely concatenated with another "
"string, or juxtaposed with another string in a buffer, without disrupting "
"the relative layout of this string and the next one on display.  If the "
"string returned by this function is displayed as part of a left-to-right "
"paragraph, it will always appear on display to the left of the text that "
"follows it.  The function works by examining the characters of its argument, "
"and if any of those characters could cause reordering on display, the "
"function appends the <abbr class=\"acronym\">LRM</abbr> character to the "
"string.  The appended <abbr class=\"acronym\">LRM</abbr> character is made "
"invisible by giving it an <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> text "
"property of <code class=\"code\">t</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Invisible-Text.html\">Invisible Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数 <var class=\"var\">string</var> を（必要に応じて変更した上"
"で）返します。これにより、結果を別の文字列と安全に連結したり、バッファ内で別"
"の文字列と隣接させたりしても、画面上のこの文字列と次の文字列の相対的な配置が"
"崩れることはありません。この関数が返す文字列が左から右へ流れる段落の一部とし"
"て表示される場合、それは常に、後続のテキストの左側に表示されます。この関数"
"は、引数の文字を検査し、それらの文字のいずれかが画面上の順序変更を引き起こす"
"可能性がある場合、文字列に <abbr class=\"acronym\">LRM</abbr> 文字を付加する"
"ことで動作します。付加された <abbr class=\"acronym\">LRM</abbr> 文字は、"
"<code class=\"code\">invisible</code> のテキストプロパティに <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を設定することで不可視になります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Invisible-Text.html\">不可視テキスト</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"The reordering algorithm uses the bidirectional properties of the characters "
"stored as their <code class=\"code\">bidi-class</code> property (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">Character Properties</"
"a>).  Lisp programs can change these properties by calling the <code "
"class=\"code\">put-char-code-property</code> function.  However, doing this "
"requires a thorough understanding of the <abbr class=\"acronym\">UBA</abbr>, "
"and is therefore not recommended.  Any changes to the bidirectional "
"properties of a character have global effect: they affect all Emacs frames "
"and windows."
msgstr ""
"並べ替えアルゴリズムは、<code class=\"code\">bidi-class</code>プロパティとし"
"て格納されている文字の双方向プロパティを利用します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参照）。Lispプログラム"
"は、<code class=\"code\">put-char-code-property</code>関数を呼び出すことでこ"
"れらのプロパティを変更できます。ただし、これには<abbr class=\"acronym\">UBA</"
"abbr>に関する深い理解が必要となるため、推奨されません。文字の双方向プロパティ"
"への変更はグローバルな影響を及ぼし、すべてのEmacsフレームおよびウィンドウに影"
"響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, the <code class=\"code\">mirroring</code> property is used to "
"display the appropriate mirrored character in the reordered text.  Lisp "
"programs can affect the mirrored display by changing this property.  Again, "
"any such changes affect all of Emacs display."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<code class=\"code\">mirroring</code> プロパティは、並べ替え後のテキ"
"ストに適切な鏡像文字を表示するために使用されます。Lisp プログラムは、このプロ"
"パティを変更することで鏡像表示に影響を与えることができます。ここでも、こうし"
"た変更は Emacs の表示全体に影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overriding-bidirectional-"
"properties\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-directional-"
"overrides\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-LRO\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RLO\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overriding-bidirectional-"
"properties\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-directional-"
"overrides\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-LRO\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RLO\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"The bidirectional properties of characters can be overridden by inserting "
"into the text special directional control characters, LEFT-TO-RIGHT OVERRIDE "
"(<abbr class=\"acronym\">LRO</abbr>) and RIGHT-TO-LEFT OVERRIDE (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">RLO</abbr>).  Any characters between a <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">RLO</abbr> and the following newline or POP DIRECTIONAL "
"FORMATTING (<abbr class=\"acronym\">PDF</abbr>)  control character, "
"whichever comes first, will be displayed as if they were strong right-to-"
"left characters, i.e. they will be reversed on display.  Similarly, any "
"characters between <abbr class=\"acronym\">LRO</abbr> and <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">PDF</abbr> or newline will display as if they were strong "
"left-to-right, and will <em class=\"emph\">not</em> be reversed even if they "
"are strong right-to-left characters."
msgstr ""
"文字の双方向性は、テキストに特殊な方向制御文字である LEFT-TO-RIGHT OVERRIDE "
"(<abbr class=\"acronym\">LRO</abbr>) および RIGHT-TO-LEFT OVERRIDE (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">RLO</abbr>) を挿入することで上書きできます。<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">RLO</abbr> と、その後に続く改行または POP DIRECTIONAL "
"FORMATTING (<abbr class=\"acronym\">PDF</abbr>) 制御文字のいずれか早い方まで"
"の間にある文字は、すべて強い右から左への文字であるかのように表示されます。つ"
"まり、表示上は反転します。同様に、<abbr class=\"acronym\">LRO</abbr> と "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">PDF</abbr> または改行までの間にある文字は、すべて強い"
"左から右への文字であるかのように表示され、たとえ強い右から左への文字であって"
"も反転<em class=\"emph\">しません</em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-phishing-using-directional-"
"overrides\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-malicious-use-of-"
"directional-overrides\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-phishing-using-directional-"
"overrides\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-malicious-use-of-"
"directional-overrides\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"These overrides are useful when you want to make some text unaffected by the "
"reordering algorithm, and instead directly control the display order.  But "
"they can also be used for malicious purposes, known as <em "
"class=\"dfn\">phishing</em>.  Specifically, a URL on a Web page or a link in "
"an email message can be manipulated to make its visual appearance "
"unrecognizable, or similar to some popular benign location, while the real "
"location, interpreted by a browser in the logical order, is very different."
msgstr ""
"これらのオーバーライドは、一部のテキストを並べ替えアルゴリズムの影響を受けな"
"いようにし、代わりに表示順序を直接制御したい場合に有用です。しかし、これらは"
"<em class=\"dfn\">フィッシング</em>として知られる悪意のある目的に利用されるこ"
"ともあります。具体的には、ウェブページ上のURLやメールメッセージ内のリンクを操"
"作して、見た目を判別不能にしたり、よく知られた無害な場所に似せたりしつつ、ブ"
"ラウザが論理的な順序で解釈した実際の場所は全く異なるものにすることが可能で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"Emacs provides a primitive that applications can use to detect instances of "
"text whose bidirectional properties were overridden so as to make a left-to-"
"right character display as if it were a right-to-left character, or vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、左から右へ書く文字を右から左へ書く文字であるかのように、あるいはその"
"逆に表示させるために、双方向性のプロパティが上書きされたテキストの箇所をアプ"
"リケーションが検出できるプリミティブを提供しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bidi-find-overridden-directionality</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">from to &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-bidi_002dfind_002doverridden_002ddirectionality\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bidi-find-overridden-directionality</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">from to &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-bidi_002dfind_002doverridden_002ddirectionality\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"This function looks at the text of the specified <var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> between positions <var class=\"var\">from</var> (inclusive) and <var "
"class=\"var\">to</var> (exclusive), and returns the first position where it "
"finds a strong left-to-right character whose directional properties were "
"forced to display the character as right-to-left, or for a strong right-to-"
"left character that was forced to display as left-to-right.  If it finds no "
"such characters in the specified region of text, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された <var class=\"var\">object</var> の位置 <var "
"class=\"var\">from</var>（含む）から <var class=\"var\">to</var>（含まない）"
"までのテキストを参照し、方向特性によって右から左への表示が強制された強い左か"
"ら右への文字、または左から右への表示が強制された強い右から左への文字が最初に"
"見つかった位置を返します。指定されたテキスト領域内にそのような文字が見つから"
"ない場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">object</var> specifies which text "
"to search, and defaults to the current buffer.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it can be "
"some other buffer, or it can be a string or a window.  If it is a string, "
"the function searches that string.  If it is a window, the function searches "
"the buffer displayed in that window.  If a buffer whose text you want to "
"examine is displayed in some window, we recommend to specify it by that "
"window, rather than pass the buffer to the function.  This is because "
"telling the function about the window allows it to correctly account for "
"window-specific overlays, which might change the result of the function if "
"some text in the buffer is covered by overlays."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">object</var> で検索対象のテキストを指定しま"
"す。デフォルトでは現在のバッファが指定されます。<var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、別のバッファ、あるいは文"
"字列やウィンドウを指定できます。文字列の場合はその文字列を検索し、ウィンドウ"
"の場合はそのウィンドウに表示されているバッファを検索します。テキストを確認し"
"たいバッファが何らかのウィンドウに表示されている場合は、バッファを関数に渡す"
"のではなく、そのウィンドウを指定して呼び出すことを推奨します。これは、ウィン"
"ドウ情報を関数に伝えることで、ウィンドウ固有のオーバーレイを正しく考慮できる"
"ためです。バッファ内のテキストがオーバーレイで覆われている場合、関数の結果が"
"変わってしまう可能性があるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-bidirectional-text_002c-"
"preserve-visual-order\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-visual-"
"order_002c-preserve-when-copying-bidirectional-text\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-bidirectional-text_002c-"
"preserve-visual-order\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-visual-"
"order_002c-preserve-when-copying-bidirectional-text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"When text that includes mixed right-to-left and left-to-right characters and "
"bidirectional controls is copied into a different location, it can change "
"its visual appearance, and also can affect the visual appearance of the "
"surrounding text at destination.  This is because reordering of "
"bidirectional text specified by the <abbr class=\"acronym\">UBA</abbr> has "
"non-trivial context-dependent effects both on the copied text and on the "
"text at copy destination that will surround it."
msgstr ""
"右から左、および左から右への文字と双方向制御要素が混在するテキストを別の場所"
"にコピーすると、その視覚的な表示が変化することがあり、またコピー先の周囲のテ"
"キストの視覚的な表示にも影響を及ぼすことがあります。これは、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UBA</abbr>で指定された双方向テキストの順序変更が、コピーさ"
"れたテキストと、それを囲むことになるコピー先のテキストの両方に対して、文脈に"
"依存した無視できない影響を及ぼすためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, a Lisp program may need to preserve the exact visual appearance "
"of the copied text at destination, and of the text that surrounds the copy.  "
"Lisp programs can use the following function to achieve that effect."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラムでは、コピー先のテキストや、その周囲のテキストの正確な見た目を"
"保持する必要がある場合があります。Lispプログラムでは、以下の関数を使用するこ"
"とでこの処理を実現できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-substring-with-bidi-context</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end &amp;optional no-properties</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-buffer_002dsubstring_002dwith_002dbidi_002dcontext\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-substring-with-bidi-context</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end &amp;optional no-properties</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-buffer_002dsubstring_002dwith_002dbidi_002dcontext\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bidirectional-Display.html
msgid ""
"This function works similar to <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Contents.html\">Examining Buffer "
"Contents</a>), but it prepends and appends to the copied text bidi "
"directional control characters necessary to preserve the visual appearance "
"of the text when it is inserted at another place.  Optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">no-properties</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"means remove the text properties from the copy of the text."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> と同様に動作しますが"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Contents.html\">バッファ内容の確認</a> を"
"参照）、コピーしたテキストの先頭と末尾に、別の場所に挿入した際にテキストの視"
"覚的な外観を維持するために必要な双方向方向制御文字を付加します。オプション引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">no-properties</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の場合、テキストのコピーからテキストプロパティを削除します。"

