msgid ""
"Bindat type expressions are not limited to the types described earlier.  "
"They can also be arbitrary Lisp forms returning Bindat type expressions.  "
"For example, the type below describes data which can either contain a 24-bit "
"error code or a vector of bytes:"
msgstr ""
"Bindat型の式は、前述の型に限定されるものではありません。Bindat型の式を返す任"
"意のLisp形式である場合もあります。例えば、以下の型は、24ビットのエラーコード"
"またはバイトベクトルのいずれかを保持できるデータを記述しています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(bindat-type\n"
"  (len      u8)\n"
"  (payload  . (if (zerop len) (uint 24) (vec (1- len)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bindat-packing-and-unpacking-into-"
"arbitrary-types\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bindat-packing-and-unpacking-into-"
"arbitrary-types\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"Furthermore, while composite types are normally unpacked to (and packed "
"from) association lists, this can be changed via the use of the following "
"special keyword arguments:"
msgstr ""
"さらに、複合型は通常アソシエーションリストに展開（およびそこからパック）され"
"ますが、以下の特殊なキーワード引数を用いることでこれを変更できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:unpack-val <var class=\"var\">exp</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:unpack-val <var class=\"var\">exp</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"When the list of fields ends with this keyword argument, then the value "
"returned when unpacking is the value of <var class=\"var\">exp</var> instead "
"of the standard alist.  <var class=\"var\">exp</var> can refer to all the "
"previous fields by their name."
msgstr ""
"フィールドのリストがこのキーワード引数で終わっている場合、アンパック時に返さ"
"れる値は、標準的なalistではなく<var class=\"var\">exp</var>の値となります。"
"<var class=\"var\">exp</var>では、それまでのすべてのフィールドを名前で参照で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:pack-val <var class=\"var\">exp</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:pack-val <var class=\"var\">exp</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"If a field&rsquo;s type is followed by this keyword argument, then the value "
"packed into this field is returned by <var class=\"var\">exp</var> instead "
"of being extracted from the alist."
msgstr ""
"フィールドの型の後にこのキーワード引数が続く場合、このフィールドに格納された"
"値は、alistから抽出されるのではなく <var class=\"var\">exp</var> によって返さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:pack-var <var class=\"var\">name</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:pack-var <var class=\"var\">name</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"If the list of fields is preceded by this keyword argument, then all the "
"subsequent <code class=\"code\">:pack-val</code> arguments can refer to the "
"overall value to pack into this composite type via the variable named <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>."
msgstr ""
"フィールドのリストの前にこのキーワード引数がある場合、それ以降のすべての "
"<code class=\"code\">:pack-val</code> 引数は、<var class=\"var\">name</var> "
"という名前の変数を介して、この複合型にパックする全体の値を参照できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid "For example, one could describe a 16-bit signed integer as follows:"
msgstr "例えば、16ビット符号付き整数を次のように記述できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defconst sint16-bindat-spec\n"
"  (let* ((max (ash 1 15))\n"
"         (wrap (+ max max)))\n"
"    (bindat-type :pack-var v\n"
"                 (n uint 16 :pack-val (if (&lt; v 0) (+ v wrap) v))\n"
"                 :unpack-val (if (&gt;= n max) (- n wrap) n))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid "Which would then behave as follows:"
msgstr "すると、次のように動作します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(bindat-pack sint16-bindat-spec -8)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;\\377\\370&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(bindat-unpack sint16-bindat-spec &quot;\\300\\100&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; -16320\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define-new-bindat-type-forms\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bindat_002c-define-new-type-forms\"></"
