# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"Finally, you can define new Bindat type forms to use in Bindat type "
"expressions with <code class=\"code\">bindat-defmacro</code>:"
msgstr ""
"最後に、<code class=\"code\">bindat-defmacro</code> を使用して、Bindat型式で"
"用いる新しいBindat型フォームを定義できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-defmacro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args "
"&amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002ddefmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-defmacro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args "
"&amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002ddefmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Computed-Types.html
msgid ""
"Define a new Bindat type expression named <var class=\"var\">name</var> and "
"taking arguments <var class=\"var\">args</var>.  Its behavior follows that "
"of <code class=\"code\">defmacro</code>, which the important difference that "
"the new forms can only be used within Bindat type expressions."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> という名前で、引数 <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var> を取る新しい Bindat 型の式を定義します。その挙動は <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code> に従いますが、重要な違いは、新しい形式が "
"Bindat 型の式内でのみ使用可能であるという点です。"

