msgstr ""
"<span>41.20.2 バイトをアンパックおよびパックする関数<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Functions-to-Unpack-and-Pack-Bytes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bindat-functions\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bindat-functions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In the following documentation, <var class=\"var\">type</var> refers to a "
"Bindat type value as returned from <code class=\"code\">bindat-type</code>, "
"<var class=\"var\">raw</var> to a byte array, and <var class=\"var\">struct</"
"var> to an alist representing unpacked field data."
msgstr ""
"以下のドキュメントにおいて、<var class=\"var\">type</var>は<code "
"class=\"code\">bindat-type</code>から返されるBindat型の値を、<var "
"class=\"var\">raw</var>はバイト配列を、<var class=\"var\">struct</var>はアン"
"パックされたフィールドデータを表すalistをそれぞれ指します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-unpack</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type raw "
"&amp;optional idx</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002dunpack\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-unpack</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type raw "
"&amp;optional idx</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002dunpack\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function unpacks data from the unibyte string or byte array <var "
"class=\"var\">raw</var> according to <var class=\"var\">type</var>.  "
"Normally, this starts unpacking at the beginning of the byte array, but if "
"<var class=\"var\">idx</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"specifies a zero-based starting position to use instead."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ユニバイト文字列またはバイト配列 <var class=\"var\">raw</var> か"
"ら、<var class=\"var\">type</var> に従ってデータを展開します。通常はバイト配"
"列の先頭から展開を開始しますが、<var class=\"var\">idx</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、代わりに使用する0ベースの開始位置を指"
"定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The value is an alist or nested alist in which each element describes one "
"unpacked field."
msgstr ""
"値はアリストまたはネストされたアリストであり、各要素は展開後のフィールド1つを"
"表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-get-field</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">struct "
"&amp;rest name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002dget_002dfield\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-get-field</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">struct "
"&amp;rest name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002dget_002dfield\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function selects a field&rsquo;s data from the nested alist <var "
"class=\"var\">struct</var>.  Usually <var class=\"var\">struct</var> was "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">bindat-unpack</code>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> corresponds to just one argument, that means to "
"extract a top-level field value.  Multiple <var class=\"var\">name</var> "
"arguments specify repeated lookup of sub-structures.  An integer <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> acts as an array index."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ネストされたalist <var class=\"var\">struct</var> からフィールド"
"のデータを選択します。通常、<var class=\"var\">struct</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">bindat-unpack</code> によって返されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> が単一の引数に対応する場合、それはトップレベルの"
"フィールド値を抽出することを意味します。複数の <var class=\"var\">name</var> "
"引数を指定すると、サブ構造の繰り返し検索が行われます。整数 <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> は配列のインデックスとして機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"For example, <code class=\"code\">(bindat-get-field&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">struct</var>&nbsp;a&nbsp;b&nbsp;2&nbsp;c)</code> means to find "
"field <code class=\"code\">c</code> in the third element of subfield <code "
"class=\"code\">b</code> of field <code class=\"code\">a</code>.  (This "
"corresponds to <code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">struct</"
"var>.a.b[2].c</code> in the C programming language syntax.)"
msgstr ""
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">(bindat-get-field&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">struct</var>&nbsp;a&nbsp;b&nbsp;2&nbsp;c)</code>は、フィールド"
"<code class=\"code\">a</code>のサブフィールド<code class=\"code\">b</code>の"
"第3要素にあるフィールド<code class=\"code\">c</code>を探すことを意味します。"
"（これはC言語の構文における<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">struct</"
"var>.a.b[2].c</code>に相当します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Although packing and unpacking operations change the organization of data "
"(in memory), they preserve the data&rsquo;s <em class=\"dfn\">total length</"
"em>, which is the sum of all the fields&rsquo; lengths, in bytes.  This "
"value is not generally inherent in either the specification or alist alone; "
"instead, both pieces of information contribute to its calculation.  "
"Likewise, the length of a string or array being unpacked may be longer than "
"the data&rsquo;s total length as described by the specification."
msgstr ""
"パッキングおよびアンパッキング処理によって（メモリ上の）データの構成は変化し"
"ますが、すべてのフィールド長の合計であるデータの<em class=\"dfn\">総長</em>"
"（バイト単位）は保持されます。この値は、通常、仕様書やalistのいずれか一方にの"
"み固有のものではなく、両方の情報がその算出に寄与します。同様に、アンパッキン"
"グされる文字列や配列の長さは、仕様書で規定されているデータの総長よりも長くな"
"る場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-length</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type struct</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-bindat_002dlength\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-length</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type struct</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-bindat_002dlength\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the total length of the data in <var "
"class=\"var\">struct</var>, according to <var class=\"var\">type</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">type</var> に従って <var "
"class=\"var\">struct</var> 内のデータの総長を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-pack</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type struct "
"&amp;optional raw idx</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002dpack\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">bindat-pack</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type struct "
"&amp;optional raw idx</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bindat_002dpack\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a byte array packed according to <var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> from the data in the alist <var "
"class=\"var\">struct</var>.  It normally creates and fills a new byte array "
"starting at the beginning.  However, if <var class=\"var\">raw</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies a pre-allocated unibyte string "
"or vector to pack into.  If <var class=\"var\">idx</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies the starting offset for packing into "
"<var class=\"var\">raw</var>."
msgstr ""
