#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">str <var class=\"var\">len</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">str <var class=\"var\">len</var></code>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid ""
"Unibyte string (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-"
"Representations.html\">Text Representations</a>) of length <var "
"class=\"var\">len</var> bytes.  When packing, the first <var "
"class=\"var\">len</var> bytes of the input string are copied to the packed "
"output.  If the input string is shorter than <var class=\"var\">len</var>, "
"the remaining bytes will be null (zero) unless a pre-allocated string was "
"provided to <code class=\"code\">bindat-pack</code>, in which case the "
"remaining bytes are left unmodified.  If the input string is multibyte with "
"only ASCII and <code class=\"code\">eight-bit</code> characters, it is "
"converted to unibyte before it is packed; other multibyte strings signal an "
"error.  When unpacking, any null bytes in the packed input string will "
"appear in the unpacked output."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">strz &amp;optional <var class=\"var\">len</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">strz &amp;optional <var class=\"var\">len</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">len</var> is not provided, this is a variable-length "
"null-terminated unibyte string (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-"
"Representations.html\">Text Representations</a>).  When packing into <code "
"class=\"code\">strz</code>, the entire input string is copied to the packed "
"output followed by a null (zero) byte.  (If pre-allocated string is provided "
"for packing into <code class=\"code\">strz</code>, that pre-allocated string "
"should have enough space for the additional null byte appended to the output "
"string contents, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bindat-"
"Functions.html\">Functions to Unpack and Pack Bytes</a>).  The length of the "
"packed output is the length of the input string plus one (for the null "
"terminator).  The input string must not contain any null bytes.  If the "
"input string is multibyte with only ASCII and <code class=\"code\">eight-"
"bit</code> characters, it is converted to unibyte before it is packed; other "
"multibyte strings signal an error.  When unpacking a <code "
"class=\"code\">strz</code>, the resulting output string will contain all "
"bytes up to (but excluding) the null byte that terminated the input string."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">len</var> が指定されていない場合、これは可変長のヌル終端ユ"
"ニバイト文字列となります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-"
"Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a>を参照）。<code class=\"code\">strz</"
"code> にパックする場合、入力文字列全体がパック済み出力にコピーされ、その後に"
"ヌル（ゼロ）バイトが付加されます。（<code class=\"code\">strz</code> へのパッ"
"ク用に事前割り当て済みの文字列が指定されている場合、その事前割り当て済み文字"
"列には、出力文字列の内容に付加される追加のヌルバイト分の十分な領域が必要です"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bindat-Functions.html\">バイトのアンパックおよび"
"パック用関数</a>を参照））。パック済み出力の長さは、入力文字列の長さに1（ヌル"
"終端文字分）を加算した値となります。入力文字列にヌルバイトを含めてはなりませ"
"ん。入力文字列が ASCII および <code class=\"code\">eight-bit</code> 文字のみ"
"からなるマルチバイト文字列である場合、パック前にユニバイトに変換されます。そ"
"れ以外のマルチバイト文字列はエラーとなります。<code class=\"code\">strz</"
"code> をアンパックする場合、結果として得られる出力文字列には、入力文字列を終"
"端させたヌルバイトまでの（ただしヌルバイト自体は含まない）すべてのバイトが含"
"まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">len</var> is provided, <code class=\"code\">strz</"
"code> behaves the same as <code class=\"code\">str</code>, but with a couple "
"of differences:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">len</var> が指定されている場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">strz</code> は <code class=\"code\">str</code> と同様に動作し"
"ますが、いくつか異なる点があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid ""
"When packing, a null terminator is written after the packed input string if "
"the number of characters in the input string is less than <var "
"class=\"var\">len</var>."
msgstr ""
"パック処理の際、入力文字列の文字数が <var class=\"var\">len</var> 未満であれ"
"ば、パックされた入力文字列の末尾にヌル終端文字が書き込まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Bindat-Types.html
msgid ""
"When unpacking, the first null byte encountered in the packed string is "
"interpreted as the terminating byte, and it and all subsequent bytes are "
"excluded from the result of the unpacking."
msgstr ""
"アンパック時、パック済み文字列内で最初に見つかったヌルバイトが終端バイトとし"
"て解釈され、当該バイトおよびそれ以降のすべてのバイトはアンパック結果から除外"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
