# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-logical-shift\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-logical-shift\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">lsh</code>, which is an abbreviation for <em "
"class=\"dfn\">logical shift</em>, shifts the bits in <var "
"class=\"var\">integer</var> to the left <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"places, or to the right if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative, "
"bringing zeros into the vacated bits.  If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is "
"negative, then <var class=\"var\">integer</var> must be either a fixnum or a "
"positive bignum, and <code class=\"code\">lsh</code> treats a negative "
"fixnum as if it were unsigned by subtracting twice <code class=\"code\">most-"
"negative-fixnum</code> before shifting, producing a nonnegative result.  "
"This quirky behavior dates back to when Emacs supported only fixnums; "
"nowadays <code class=\"code\">ash</code> is a better choice."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">lsh</code>（<em class=\"dfn\">論理シフト</em>の略）は、"
"<var class=\"var\">integer</var>のビットを左に<var class=\"var\">count</var>"
"桁分、あるいは<var class=\"var\">count</var>が負の場合は右にシフトし、空いた"
"ビットに0を補います。<var class=\"var\">count</var>が負の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">integer</var>は固定小数点数または正のビッグナンバーである必要が"
"あり、<code class=\"code\">lsh</code>はシフト前に<code class=\"code\">most-"
"negative-fixnum</code>を2回減算することで、負の固定小数点数をあたかも符号なし"
"であるかのように扱い、非負の結果を導き出します。この特異な挙動は、Emacsが固定"
"小数点数のみをサポートしていた時代にまで遡ります。現在では<code "
"class=\"code\">ash</code>の方が適切な選択肢です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"As <code class=\"code\">lsh</code> behaves like <code class=\"code\">ash</"
"code> except when <var class=\"var\">integer</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> are both negative, the following examples focus on "
"these exceptional cases.  These examples assume 30-bit fixnums."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">lsh</code> は、<var class=\"var\">integer</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> がともに負である場合を除き <code "
"class=\"code\">ash</code> と同様に動作するため、以下の例ではこれらの例外的な"
"ケースに焦点を当てます。  これらの例では、30ビットの固定小数点数を想定してい"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                 ; <span class=\"r\">     binary values</span>\n"
"(ash -7 -1)      ; -7 = <span class=\"r\">...111111111111111111111111111001</span>\n"
"     &rArr; -4        ;    = <span class=\"r\">...111111111111111111111111111100</span>\n"
"(lsh -7 -1)\n"
"     &rArr; 536870908 ;    = <span class=\"r\">...011111111111111111111111111100</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(ash -5 -2)      ; -5 = <span class=\"r\">...111111111111111111111111111011</span>\n"
"     &rArr; -2        ;    = <span class=\"r\">...111111111111111111111111111110</span>\n"
"(lsh -5 -2)\n"
"     &rArr; 268435454 ;    = <span class=\"r\">...001111111111111111111111111110</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">logand</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest ints-or-"
"markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-logand\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">logand</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest ints-or-"
"markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-logand\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the bitwise AND of the arguments: the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is 1 in the result if, and only if, the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is 1 in all the arguments."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数のビット単位のAND演算結果を返します。すべての引数において"
"<var class=\"var\">n</var>番目のビットが1である場合に限り、結果の<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>番目のビットが1となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"For example, using 4-bit binary numbers, the bitwise AND of 13 and 12 is 12: "
"1101 combined with 1100 produces 1100.  In both the binary numbers, the "
"leftmost two bits are both 1 so the leftmost two bits of the returned value "
"are both 1.  However, for the rightmost two bits, each is 0 in at least one "
"of the arguments, so the rightmost two bits of the returned value are both 0."
msgstr ""
"例えば、4ビットの2進数を用いると、13と12のビット単位のAND演算の結果は12となり"
"ます。1101と1100をAND演算すると1100が得られます。どちらの2進数においても、左"
"端の2ビットはともに1であるため、戻り値の左端の2ビットもともに1となります。一"
"方、右端の2ビットについては、少なくとも一方の引数でそれぞれが0となっているた"
"め、戻り値の右端の2ビットはともに0となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid "Therefore,"
msgstr "したがって、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(logand 13 12)\n"
"     &rArr; 12\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">logand</code> is not passed any argument, it returns "
"a value of &minus;1.  This number is an identity element for <code "
"class=\"code\">logand</code> because its binary representation consists "
"entirely of ones.  If <code class=\"code\">logand</code> is passed just one "
"argument, it returns that argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">logand</code> に引数が渡されない場合、&minus;1 を返しま"
"す。この数値の2進表現はすべて1で構成されているため、<code "
"class=\"code\">logand</code> の単位元となります。<code "
"class=\"code\">logand</code> に引数が1つだけ渡された場合は、その引数を返しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                   ; <span class=\"r\">       binary values</span>\n"
"\n"
"(logand 14 13)     ; 14  =  <span class=\"r\">...001110</span>\n"
"                   ; 13  =  <span class=\"r\">...001101</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 12         ; 12  =  <span class=\"r\">...001100</span>\n"
msgstr ""

