msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">logior</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest ints-or-"
"markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-logior\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">logior</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest ints-or-"
"markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-logior\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the bitwise inclusive OR of its arguments: the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is 1 in the result if, and only if, the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is 1 in at least one of the arguments.  If there "
"are no arguments, the result is 0, which is an identity element for this "
"operation.  If <code class=\"code\">logior</code> is passed just one "
"argument, it returns that argument."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数のビット単位の包含論理和を返します。結果の <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 番目のビットが 1 となるのは、少なくとも一方の引数におい"
"て <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目のビットが 1 である場合、かつその場合に限り"
"ます。引数がない場合は結果は 0 となり、これはこの演算における単位元となりま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">logior</code> に引数が 1 つだけ渡された場合は、その"
"引数をそのまま返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                   ; <span class=\"r\">       binary values</span>\n"
"\n"
"(logior 12 5)      ; 12  =  <span class=\"r\">...001100</span>\n"
"                   ;  5  =  <span class=\"r\">...000101</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 13         ; 13  =  <span class=\"r\">...001101</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(logior 12 5 7)    ; 12  =  <span class=\"r\">...001100</span>\n"
"                   ;  5  =  <span class=\"r\">...000101</span>\n"
"                   ;  7  =  <span class=\"r\">...000111</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 15         ; 15  =  <span class=\"r\">...001111</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">logxor</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest ints-or-"
"markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-logxor\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">logxor</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest ints-or-"
"markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-logxor\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the bitwise exclusive OR of its arguments: the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is 1 in the result if, and only if, the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is 1 in an odd number of the arguments.  If "
"there are no arguments, the result is 0, which is an identity element for "
"this operation.  If <code class=\"code\">logxor</code> is passed just one "
"argument, it returns that argument."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数のビット単位の排他的論理和を返します。結果の <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 番目のビットが 1 となるのは、引数のうち <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 番目のビットが 1 であるものが奇数個存在する場合、かつそ"
"の場合に限ります。引数がない場合は結果は 0 となり、これはこの演算における単位"
"元となります。<code class=\"code\">logxor</code> に引数が 1 つだけ渡された場"
"合は、その引数をそのまま返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                   ; <span class=\"r\">       binary values</span>\n"
"\n"
"(logxor 12 5)      ; 12  =  <span class=\"r\">...001100</span>\n"
"                   ;  5  =  <span class=\"r\">...000101</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 9          ;  9  =  <span class=\"r\">...001001</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(logxor 12 5 7)    ; 12  =  <span class=\"r\">...001100</span>\n"
"                   ;  5  =  <span class=\"r\">...000101</span>\n"
"                   ;  7  =  <span class=\"r\">...000111</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 14         ; 14  =  <span class=\"r\">...001110</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lognot</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">integer</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-lognot\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lognot</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">integer</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-lognot\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the bitwise complement of its argument: the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is one in the result if, and only if, the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th bit is zero in <var class=\"var\">integer</var>, and "
"vice-versa.  The result equals &minus;1 &minus; <var class=\"var\">integer</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数のビット単位の補数を返します。結果の <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> 番目のビットが 1 となるのは、<var class=\"var\">integer</var> の <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 番目のビットが 0 であるとき、かつそのときに限ります。逆"
"も同様です。結果は &minus;1 &minus; <var class=\"var\">integer</var> となりま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bitwise-Operations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(lognot 5)\n"
"     &rArr; -6\n"
";;  5  =  <span class=\"r\">...000101</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">becomes</span>\n"
";; -6  =  <span class=\"r\">...111010</span>\n"
msgstr ""

