# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the mechanism by which Emacs shows a matching open "
"parenthesis when the user inserts a close parenthesis."
msgstr ""
"この節では、ユーザーが閉じ括弧を挿入した際に、Emacs が対応する開き括弧を表示"
"する仕組みについて説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-paren-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"blink_002dparen_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-paren-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"blink_002dparen_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable should be a function (of no arguments) to be "
"called whenever a character with close parenthesis syntax is inserted.  The "
"value of <code class=\"code\">blink-paren-function</code> may be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case nothing is done."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、閉じ括弧の構文を持つ文字が挿入されるたびに呼び出される（引数"
"なしの）関数である必要があります。<code class=\"code\">blink-paren-function</"
"code> の値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となる場合があり、その場合は何も"
"行われません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-matching-paren</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"blink_002dmatching_002dparen\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">blink-matching-paren</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-blink_002dmatching_002dparen\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then <code "
"class=\"code\">blink-matching-open</code> does nothing."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">blink-matching-open</code> は何もしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-matching-paren-distance</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-blink_002dmatching_002dparen_002ddistance\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">blink-matching-paren-distance</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-blink_002dmatching_002dparen_002ddistance\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the maximum distance to scan for a matching "
"parenthesis before giving up."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、探索を断念するまでに一致する括弧をスキャンする最大距離を指定しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-matching-delay</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"blink_002dmatching_002ddelay\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">blink-matching-delay</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-blink_002dmatching_002ddelay\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the number of seconds to keep indicating the "
"matching parenthesis.  A fraction of a second often gives good results, but "
"the default is 1, which works on all systems."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、対応する括弧を表示し続ける秒数を指定します。0.1秒単位の値でも良好"
"な結果が得られることが多いですが、デフォルトは1となっており、あらゆるシステム"
"で動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-matching-open</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"blink_002dmatching_002dopen\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">blink-matching-open</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"blink_002dmatching_002dopen\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid ""
"This function is the default value of <code class=\"code\">blink-paren-"
"function</code>.  It assumes that point follows a character with close "
"parenthesis syntax and applies the appropriate effect momentarily to the "
"matching opening character.  If that character is not already on the screen, "
"it displays the character&rsquo;s context in the echo area.  To avoid long "
"delays, this function does not search farther than <code "
"class=\"code\">blink-matching-paren-distance</code> characters."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">blink-paren-function</code> のデフォルト値で"
"す。ポイントが閉じ括弧構文を持つ文字の後にあると想定し、対応する開き文字に一"
"時的に適切な効果を適用します。その文字がまだ画面に表示されていない場合は、エ"
"コー領域にその文字のコンテキストを表示します。長い遅延を避けるため、この関数"
"は <code class=\"code\">blink-matching-paren-distance</code> 文字より先まで検"
"索しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
msgid "Here is an example of calling this function explicitly."
msgstr "この関数を明示的に呼び出す例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun interactive-blink-matching-open ()\n"
"  &quot;Indicate momentarily the start of parenthesized sexp before point.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Blinking.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((blink-matching-paren-distance\n"
"         (buffer-size))\n"
"        (blink-matching-paren t))\n"
"    (blink-matching-open)))\n"
msgstr ""

