# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
msgid ""
"<span>2.4.11 Bool-Vector Type<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Bool_002dVector-Type-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.11 Bool-Vector型<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Bool_002dVector-"
"Type-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">bool-vector</em> is a one-dimensional array whose "
"elements must be <code class=\"code\">t</code> or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">bool-vector</em>とは、要素が<code class=\"code\">t</code>ま"
"たは<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でなければならない1次元配列のことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
msgid ""
"The printed representation of a bool-vector is like a string, except that it "
"begins with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#&amp;</samp>&rsquo; followed by the "
"length.  The string constant that follows actually specifies the contents of "
"the bool-vector as a bitmap&mdash;each character in the string contains 8 "
"bits, which specify the next 8 elements of the bool-vector (1 stands for "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>, and 0 for <code class=\"code\">nil</code>).  "
"The least significant bits of the character correspond to the lowest indices "
"in the bool-vector."
msgstr ""
"bool-vectorの文字列表現は文字列に似ていますが、先頭に&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#&amp;</samp>&rsquo;が続き、その後に長さが記述される点が異なり"
"ます。それに続く文字列定数は、実際にはbool-vectorの内容をビットマップとして指"
"定しています。文字列の各文字は8ビットで構成されており、それがbool-vectorの次"
"の8つの要素を指定します（1は<code class=\"code\">t</code>を、0は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を表します）。文字の最下位ビットは、bool-vectorの最"
"も低いインデックスに対応します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-bool-vector 3 t)\n"
"     &rArr; #&amp;3&quot;^G&quot;\n"
"(make-bool-vector 3 nil)\n"
"     &rArr; #&amp;3&quot;^@&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
msgid ""
"These results make sense, because the binary code for &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-g</samp>&rsquo; is 111 and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-@</"
"samp>&rsquo; is the character with code 0."
msgstr ""
"これらの結果は理にかなっている。というのも、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-g</"
"samp>&rsquo;の2進コードは111であり、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-@</"
"samp>&rsquo;はコード0の文字だからである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
msgid ""
"If the length is not a multiple of 8, the printed representation shows extra "
"elements, but these extras really make no difference.  For instance, in the "
"next example, the two bool-vectors are equal, because only the first 3 bits "
"are used:"
msgstr ""
"長さが8の倍数でない場合、出力表示には余分な要素が現れますが、これらが実質的な"
"影響を及ぼすことはありません。例えば、次の例では、最初の3ビットのみが使用され"
"るため、2つのbool-vectorは等しくなります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Bool_002dVector-Type.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(equal #&amp;3&quot;\\377&quot; #&amp;3&quot;\\007&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

