# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Box-Diagrams.html
msgid ""
"A list with no elements in it is the <em class=\"dfn\">empty list</em>; it "
"is identical to the symbol <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In other words, "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> is both a symbol and a list."
msgstr ""
"要素を一つも持たないリストは<em class=\"dfn\">空リスト</em>であり、シンボル"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>と同一です。言い換えれば、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>はシンボルであると同時にリストでもあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Box-Diagrams.html
msgid ""
"Here is the list <code class=\"code\">(A ())</code>, or equivalently <code "
