# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-breakpoints-_0028Edebug_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-breakpoints-_0028Edebug_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"While using Edebug, you can specify <em class=\"dfn\">breakpoints</em> in "
"the program you are testing: these are places where execution should stop.  "
"You can set a breakpoint at any stop point, as defined in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Using-Edebug.html\">Using Edebug</a>.  For setting and unsetting "
"breakpoints, the stop point that is affected is the first one at or after "
"point in the source code buffer.  Here are the Edebug commands for "
"breakpoints:"
msgstr ""
"Edebugの使用中、テスト対象のプログラムに<em class=\"dfn\">ブレークポイント</"
"em>を指定できます。これは、実行を停止させる箇所のことです。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Using-Edebug.html\">Edebugの使用</a>で説明されている通り、任意の停止地"
"点にブレークポイントを設定できます。ブレークポイントの設定および解除におい"
"て、影響を受ける停止地点は、ソースコードバッファ内のpoint以降で最初に現れる地"
"点となります。以下に、ブレークポイントに関するEdebugコマンドを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-edebug_002denabled_002dbreakpoint-"
"_0028face_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002ddisabled_002dbreakpoint-_0028face_0029\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dset_002dbreakpoint\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">b</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dset_002dbreakpoint\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-edebug_002denabled_002dbreakpoint-"
"_0028face_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002ddisabled_002dbreakpoint-_0028face_0029\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dset_002dbreakpoint\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">b</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dset_002dbreakpoint\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"Set a breakpoint at the stop point at or after point (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-set-breakpoint</code>).  If you use a prefix argument, "
"the breakpoint is temporary&mdash;it turns off the first time it stops the "
"program.  An overlay with the <code class=\"code\">edebug-enabled-"
"breakpoint</code> or <code class=\"code\">edebug-disabled-breakpoint</code> "
"faces is put at the breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"ポイント (<code class=\"code\">edebug-set-breakpoint</code>) 以降の停止地点に"
"ブレークポイントを設定します。プレフィックス引数を指定した場合、ブレークポイ"
"ントは一時的なものとなり、プログラムが最初に停止した時点で解除されます。ブ"
"レークポイントには、<code class=\"code\">edebug-enabled-breakpoint</code> ま"
"たは <code class=\"code\">edebug-disabled-breakpoint</code> 面のオーバーレイ"
"が配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dunset_002dbreakpoint\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">u</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dunset_002dbreakpoint\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dunset_002dbreakpoint\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">u</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dunset_002dbreakpoint\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"Unset the breakpoint (if any) at the stop point at or after point (<code "
