#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Breakpoints.html
msgid ""
"Set a conditional breakpoint which stops the program only if evaluating <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> produces a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
