# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions that allow a Lisp program to convert any "
"portion of the text in the buffer into a string."
msgstr ""
"この節では、Lispプログラムがバッファ内のテキストの任意の部分を文字列に変換で"
"きる関数について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-buffer_002dsubstring\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-buffer_002dsubstring\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string containing a copy of the text of the region "
"defined by positions <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> in the current buffer.  If the arguments are not "
"positions in the accessible portion of the buffer, <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> signals an <code class=\"code\">args-"
"out-of-range</code> error."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにおいて位置 <var class=\"var\">start</var> と "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> で定義される領域のテキストのコピーを含む文字列を"
"返します。引数がバッファのアクセス可能な範囲内の位置でない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> は <code class=\"code\">args-out-of-"
"range</code> エラーを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid "Here&rsquo;s an example which assumes Font-Lock mode is not enabled:"
msgstr "以下は、Font-Lockモードが有効になっていないことを想定した例です："

