#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-substring-no-properties</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dsubstring_002dno_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-substring-no-properties</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dsubstring_002dno_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code>, except that it "
"does not copy text properties, just the characters themselves.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Properties.html\">Text Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> と同様ですが、テキストプ"
"ロパティはコピーせず、文字そのもののみをコピーします。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Text-Properties.html\">テキストプロパティ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-string</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-string</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the contents of the entire accessible portion of the "
"current buffer, as a string.  If the text being copied has any text "
"properties, these are copied into the string along with the characters they "
"belong to."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファのアクセス可能な全領域の内容を文字列として返しま"
"す。コピー対象のテキストにテキストプロパティが設定されている場合、それらは対"
"応する文字とともに文字列にコピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"If you need to make sure the resulting string, when copied to a different "
"location, will not change its visual appearance due to reordering of "
"bidirectional text, use the <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring-with-bidi-"
"context</code> function (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-"
"Display.html\">buffer-substring-with-bidi-context</a>)."
msgstr ""
"生成された文字列を別の場所にコピーした際、双方向テキストの並べ替えによって見"
"た目が変わってしまわないようにしたい場合は、<code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"substring-with-bidi-context</code> 関数を使用してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">buffer-substring-with-"
"bidi-context</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">filter-buffer-substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end &amp;optional delete</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-filter_002dbuffer_002dsubstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">filter-buffer-substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end &amp;optional delete</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-filter_002dbuffer_002dsubstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"This function filters the buffer text between <var class=\"var\">start</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">end</var> using a function specified by the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring-function</code>, and returns "
"the result.  The order of buffer positions specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> should not "
"matter, since this function is frequently used for extracting text passed to "
"kill functions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Kill-"
"Functions.html\">Functions for Killing</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、変数 <code class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring-function</"
"code> で指定された関数を用いて <var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> の間のバッファテキストをフィルタリングし、その結果を"
"返します。  <var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> で"
"指定されるバッファ位置の順序は問題にならないはずです。というのも、この関数は "
"kill 関数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Kill-Functions.html\">キル用の関数</a> "
"を参照）に渡されるテキストの抽出に頻繁に用いられるからです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"The default filter function consults the obsolete wrapper hook <code "
"class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring-functions</code> (see the "
"documentation string of the macro <code class=\"code\">with-wrapper-hook</"
"code> for the details about this obsolete facility).  If it is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it returns the unaltered text from the buffer, "
"i.e., what <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> would return."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトのフィルタ関数は、廃止されたラッパーフック <code "
"class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring-functions</code> を参照します（この廃"
"止された機能の詳細については、マクロ <code class=\"code\">with-wrapper-hook</"
"code> のドキュメント文字列を参照してください）。これが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、バッファ内の変更されていないテキスト、すな"
"わち <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> が返す内容を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">delete</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the function deletes the text between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> after copying it, like <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">delete</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、関数は <code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code> と同様に、"
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> の間のテキスト"
"をコピーした後に削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"Lisp code should use this function instead of <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"substring</code>, <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring-no-properties</"
"code>, or <code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code> when copying "
"into user-accessible data structures such as the kill-ring, X clipboard, and "
"registers.  Major and minor modes can modify <code class=\"code\">filter-"
"buffer-substring-function</code> to alter such text as it is copied out of "
"the buffer."
msgstr ""
"Lispコードでは、キルリング、Xクリップボード、レジスタといったユーザーアクセス"
"可能なデータ構造にコピーする際、<code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">buffer-substring-no-properties</code>、または"
"<code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code>の代わりにこの関数を使用"
"する必要があります。メジャーモードおよびマイナーモードでは、バッファからコ"
"ピーされる際に<code class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring-function</code>を"
"変更して、こうしたテキストを改変することができます。"

