"functions interpret the action alist entries they care about.  Here we give "
"a reference list of all known action alist entries according to their "
"symbols, together with their values and action functions (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">Action "
"Functions for Buffer Display</a>) that recognize them.  Throughout this "
"list, the terms &ldquo;buffer&rdquo; will refer to the buffer <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> is supposed to display, and "
"&ldquo;value&rdquo; refers to the entry&rsquo;s value."
msgstr ""
