# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means consider only windows on the selected "
"frame.  (Actually, the last frame used that is not a minibuffer-only frame.)"
