# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> means consider windows on all frames.  (Note "
"that this value is rarely the right thing to use&mdash;it might also return "
"a tooltip frame.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> は、すべてのフレームでウィンドウを考慮すること"
