"される場合もあります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html
msgid ""
"Note that the meaning of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> differs slightly "
