# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html
msgid ""
"The value specifies an alist of window parameters to give the chosen "
"window.  All action functions that choose a window should process this entry."
