# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html
msgid ""
"If the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or <code class=\"code\">lru</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-use-some-window</code> prefers "
"the least recently used window while avoiding selecting windows that are not "
