# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"An <em class=\"dfn\">action function</em> is a function <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> calls for choosing a window to display "
"a buffer.  Action functions take two arguments: <var class=\"var\">buffer</"
"var>, the buffer to display, and <var class=\"var\">alist</var>, an action "
"alist (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Alists.html\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a>).  They are supposed to "
"return a window displaying <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> if they succeed "
"and <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if they fail."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">アクション関数</em>とは、バッファを表示するためのウィンドウ"
"を選択するために <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> が呼び出す関数の"
"ことです。アクション関数は、表示するバッファである <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var> と、アクションアリストである <var "
