"during future resize operations (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Preserving-"
"Window-Sizes.html\">Preserving Window Sizes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"新しいウィンドウのサイズは、<var class=\"var\">alist</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">window-height</code> および <code class=\"code\">window-"
