"code> <var class=\"var\">alist</var> entry is <code class=\"code\">lru</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> which is the default.  Another "
"possible value is <code class=\"code\">mru</code>.  If, for example, <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> is customized to <code "
"class=\"code\">(nil&nbsp;.&nbsp;((some-window&nbsp;.&nbsp;mru)))</code>, "
