#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If a window displaying the buffer is located in any reusable tab then that "
"tab and window are selected."
msgstr ""
"バッファを表示するウィンドウがいずれかの再利用可能なタブにある場合、そのタブ"
"とウィンドウが選択されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If no such window is located, the buffer is displayed in a new or existing "
"tab based on the <var class=\"var\">alist</var> entry <code "
"class=\"code\">tab-name</code> (which may be a string or a function).  If a "
"tab with this name already exists then that tab is selected, otherwise a new "
"tab with that name is created.  If the <code class=\"code\">tab-name</code> "
"entry is a function, it is called with two arguments (<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var> and <var class=\"var\">alist</var>), and should "
"return the tab name.  If the <code class=\"code\">tab-name</code> entry is "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, a new tab is created without an "
"explicit name."
msgstr ""
"該当するウィンドウが見つからない場合、バッファは <var class=\"var\">alist</"
"var> エントリ <code class=\"code\">tab-name</code>（文字列または関数）に基づ"
"いて、新規または既存のタブに表示されます。この名前のタブが既に存在する場合は"
"そのタブが選択され、そうでない場合はその名前の新しいタブが作成されます。"
"<code class=\"code\">tab-name</code> エントリが関数である場合、2つの引数"
"（<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> と <var class=\"var\">alist</var>）で呼び出"
"され、タブ名を返す必要があります。<code class=\"code\">tab-name</code> エント"
"リが省略されているか、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、明"
"示的な名前のない新しいタブが作成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If a new tab is created and <var class=\"var\">alist</var> contains a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">tab-group</code> entry, "
"this defines the tab group, overriding user option <code class=\"code\">tab-"
"bar-new-tab-group</code>.  This entry may again be a string or a function "
"which is called in the same manner as <code class=\"code\">tab-name</code>."
msgstr ""
"新しいタブが作成され、<var class=\"var\">alist</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の <code class=\"code\">tab-group</code> エント"
"リが含まれている場合、これによりタブグループが定義され、ユーザーオプション "
"<code class=\"code\">tab-bar-new-tab-group</code> が上書きされます。このエン"
"トリもまた、文字列、あるいは <code class=\"code\">tab-name</code> と同様の方"
"法で呼び出される関数である場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-no-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">buffer alist</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002dbuffer_002dno_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-no-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">buffer alist</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002dbuffer_002dno_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">alist</var> has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"<code class=\"code\">allow-no-window</code> entry, then this function does "
"not display <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> and returns the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">fail</code>.  This constitutes the only exception to the "
"convention that an action function returns either <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> or a window showing <var class=\"var\">buffer</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var> has no such <code class=\"code\">allow-no-window</"
"code> entry, this function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">alist</var> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の "
"<code class=\"code\">allow-no-window</code> エントリがある場合、この関数は "
"<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> を表示せず、シンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">fail</code> を返します。これは、アクション関数が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> または <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> を表示する"
"ウィンドウのいずれかを返すという規約に対する唯一の例外となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var> にそのような <code class=\"code\">allow-no-window</"
"code> エントリがない場合、この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If this function returns <code class=\"code\">fail</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> will skip the execution of any further "
"display actions and return <code class=\"code\">nil</code> immediately.  If "
"this function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> will continue with the next display "
"action, if any."
msgstr ""
"この関数が <code class=\"code\">fail</code> を返す場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> はそれ以降の表示処理の実行をスキップし、"
"直ちに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。この関数が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す場合、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code> は（もしあれば）次の表示処理へと進みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"It is assumed that when a caller of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code> specifies a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">allow-no-window</code> entry, it is also able to handle a "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> return value."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> の呼び出し元が非 <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">allow-no-window</code> エント"
"リを指定する場合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の戻り値も扱えるものとす"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
