# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-List.html
msgid ""
"This is a normal hook run whenever the buffer list changes.  Functions "
"(implicitly) running this hook are <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-Buffers.html\">Creating "
