#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffer-Modification.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">set-buffer-modified-p</code>, but does not force "
"redisplay of mode lines.  This function also allows <var class=\"var\">flag</"
"var>&rsquo;s value to be the symbol <code class=\"code\">autosaved</code>, "
"which marks the buffer as modified and auto-saved after the last "
"modification."
