# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This section describes low-level functions for examining and setting the "
"contents of windows.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Switching-"
"Buffers.html\">Switching to a Buffer in a Window</a>, for higher-level "
"functions for displaying a specific buffer in a window."
msgstr ""
"本節では、ウィンドウの内容を確認・設定するための低レベル関数について説明しま"
"す。ウィンドウに特定のバッファを表示するための高レベル関数については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">ウィンドウ内のバッファへの切り"
"替え</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dbuffer\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dbuffer\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the buffer that <var class=\"var\">window</var> is "
"displaying.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> it defaults to the selected window.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is an internal window, this function returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> が表示しているバッファを返しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が省略されているか、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、選択中のウィンドウがデフォルトとなりま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が内部ウィンドウである場合、この関数は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"buffer-or-name &amp;optional keep-margins</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dwindow_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"buffer-or-name &amp;optional keep-margins</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dwindow_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function makes <var class=\"var\">window</var> display <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>.  <var class=\"var\">window</var> should "
"be a live window; if <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the "
"selected window.  <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> should be a "
"buffer, or the name of an existing buffer.  This function does not change "
"which window is selected, nor does it directly change which buffer is "
"current (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Current-Buffer.html\">The Current "
"Buffer</a>).  Its return value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> に <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> を表示させます。<var class=\"var\">window</var> はライブウィンドウ"
"である必要があり、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は選択中のウィンドウ"
"がデフォルトとなります。<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> はバッファ、"
"または既存のバッファ名である必要があります。この関数は、どのウィンドウが選択"
"されているかを変更せず、またどのバッファがカレントであるかを直接変更すること"
"もありません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Current-Buffer.html\">カレントバッ"
"ファ</a>を参照）。戻り値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is <em class=\"dfn\">strongly dedicated</"
"em> to a buffer and <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> does not specify "
"that buffer, this function signals an error.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Dedicated-Windows.html\">Dedicated Windows</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> がバッファに<em class=\"dfn\">強く専用</em>さ"
"れており、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> がそのバッファを指定してい"
"ない場合、この関数はエラーを通知します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Dedicated-"
"Windows.html\">専用ウィンドウ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"By default, this function resets <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s "
"position, display margins, fringe widths, and scroll bar settings, based on "
"the local variables in the specified buffer.  However, if the optional "
"argument <var class=\"var\">keep-margins</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it leaves <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s "
"display margins, fringes and scroll bar settings alone."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、この関数は指定されたバッファ内のローカル変数に基づいて、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>の位置、表示マージン、フリンジ幅、およびスクロール"
"バーの設定をリセットします。ただし、オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">keep-"
"margins</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> の表示マージン、フリンジ、およびスクロールバーの設"
"定はそのまま保持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"When writing an application, you should normally use <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-"
"Window.html\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>) or the higher-"
"level functions described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Switching-"
"Buffers.html\">Switching to a Buffer in a Window</a>, instead of calling "
"<code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> directly."
msgstr ""
"アプリケーションを記述する際は、通常、<code class=\"code\">set-window-"
"buffer</code> を直接呼び出すのではなく、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用のウィ"
"ンドウの選択</a>を参照）や、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">"
"ウィンドウ内のバッファへの切り替え</a>で説明されている上位レベルの関数を使用"
"すべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This runs <code class=\"code\">window-scroll-functions</code>, followed by "
"<code class=\"code\">window-configuration-change-hook</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Hooks.html\">Hooks for Window Scrolling and "
"Changes</a>."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">window-scroll-functions</code> を実行し、続いて "
"<code class=\"code\">window-configuration-change-hook</code> を実行します。"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Hooks.html\">ウィンドウのスクロールおよび変更"
"時のフック</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-display-count</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002ddisplay_002dcount\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-display-count</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002ddisplay_002dcount\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable records the number of times a buffer has been "
"displayed in a window.  It is incremented each time <code class=\"code\">set-"
"window-buffer</code> is called for the buffer."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、バッファがウィンドウに表示された回数を記録しま"
"す。バッファに対して <code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> が呼び出さ"
"れるたびにインクリメントされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-display-time</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002ddisplay_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-display-time</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002ddisplay_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable records the time at which a buffer was last "
"displayed in a window.  The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the "
"buffer has never been displayed.  It is updated each time <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> is called for the buffer, with the "
"value returned by <code class=\"code\">current-time</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、バッファが最後にウィンドウに表示された時刻を記録"
"します。バッファが一度も表示されていない場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となります。バッファに対して <code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</"
"code> が呼び出されるたびに更新され、<code class=\"code\">current-time</code> "
"が返す値が代入されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of "
"Day</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-buffer-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-get_002dbuffer_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-buffer-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-get_002dbuffer_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the first window displaying <var class=\"var\">buffer-"
"or-name</var> in the cyclic ordering of windows, starting from the selected "
"window (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">Cyclic "
"Ordering of Windows</a>).  If no such window exists, the return value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、選択されたウィンドウを起点として、ウィンドウの循環順で <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を表示している最初のウィンドウを返します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">ウィンドウの循環順"
"</a> を参照）。そのようなウィンドウが存在しない場合、戻り値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> should be a buffer or the name of a "
"buffer; if omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the "
"current buffer.  The optional argument <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> "
"specifies which windows to consider:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> にはバッファまたはバッファ名を指定し"
"ます。省略した場合や <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、現在のバッファ"
"がデフォルトとなります。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> で"
"は、対象とするウィンドウを指定します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> means consider windows on all existing frames."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> は、既存のすべてのフレームにおけるウィンドウを"
"考慮することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid "Any other value means consider windows on the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の値の場合は、選択したフレーム上のウィンドウを考慮してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that these meanings differ slightly from those of the <var "
"class=\"var\">all-frames</var> argument to <code class=\"code\">next-window</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">Cyclic "
"Ordering of Windows</a>).  This function may be changed in a future version "
"of Emacs to eliminate this discrepancy."
msgstr ""
"なお、これらの意味は <code class=\"code\">next-window</code> の引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">all-frames</var> の意味とはわずかに異なります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">ウィンドウの循環順序</"
"a> を参照）。この不一致を解消するため、今後の Emacs のバージョンでこの関数が"
"変更される可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The following function can tell for a specific window whether its buffer "
"shares the text of some other buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Indirect-"
"Buffers.html\">Indirect Buffers</a>)."
msgstr ""
"以下の関数を使用すると、特定のウィンドウのバッファが他のバッファのテキストを"
"共有しているかどうかを判定できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Indirect-"
"Buffers.html\">間接バッファ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-indirect-buffer-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002dindirect_002dbuffer_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-indirect-buffer-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002dindirect_002dbuffer_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is indirectly related to <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>.  <var class=\"var\">window</var> must be "
"a live window and defaults to the selected window.  <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> may be a buffer or the name of an "
"existing buffer and defaults to the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> が <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> と間接的に関連している場合に non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> はライブウィンドウである必要があ"
"り、デフォルトでは選択中のウィンドウが指定されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> はバッファまたは既存のバッファ名を指定で"
"き、デフォルトでは現在のバッファが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> is indirectly related to <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> if one of the following conditions hold:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> は、以下のいずれかの条件が成り立つ場合に "
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> と間接的に関連します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> specifies an indirect buffer and "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s buffer is its base buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>は間接バッファを指定し、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>のバッファはそのベースバッファとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s buffer is an indirect buffer whose "
"base buffer is the buffer specified by <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>のバッファは、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var>で指定されたバッファをベースバッファとする間接バッファです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Both, <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s buffer and the buffer "
"specified by <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>, are indirect "
"buffer&rsquo;s sharing the same base buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>のバッファと<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var>で指定されたバッファは、いずれも同一のベースバッファを共有する間接"
"バッファです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid "It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if none of the above holds."
msgstr ""
"上記のいずれにも該当しない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-buffer-window-list</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name minibuf all-frames indirect</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get_002dbuffer_002dwindow_002dlist\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-buffer-window-list</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name minibuf all-frames indirect</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get_002dbuffer_002dwindow_002dlist\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of all windows currently displaying <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>.  <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> "
"should be a buffer or the name of an existing buffer.  If omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the current buffer.  If the "
"currently selected window displays <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>, "
"it will be the first in the list returned by this function."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在 <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を表示しているすべて"
"のウィンドウのリストを返します。<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> には"
"バッファまたは既存のバッファ名を指定します。省略するか <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定した場合は、現在のバッファがデフォルトとなり"
"ます。現在選択されているウィンドウが <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> "
"を表示している場合、この関数が返すリストの先頭に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The arguments <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> and <var class=\"var\">all-"
"frames</var> have the same meanings as in the function <code "
"class=\"code\">next-window</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-"
"Window-Ordering.html\">Cyclic Ordering of Windows</a>).  Note that the <var "
"class=\"var\">all-frames</var> argument does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> "
"behave exactly like in <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-window</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> と <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> "
"は、関数 <code class=\"code\">next-window</code> におけるものと同じ意味を持ち"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">ウィンドウの循"
"環順序</a> を参照）。なお、引数 <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">get-buffer-window</code> と全く同じようには動作<em "
"class=\"emph\">しません</em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">indirect</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means to append to the list of windows showing "
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> a list of all windows that are "
"indirectly related to <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>, that is, "
"windows for which <code class=\"code\">window-indirect-buffer-p</code> (see "
"above) with the window and the buffer specified by <var class=\"var\">buffer-"
"or-name</var> as arguments returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">indirect</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> は、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を表示"
"しているウィンドウのリストに、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> に間接"
"的に関連するすべてのウィンドウ、すなわち、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</"
"var> で指定されたウィンドウとバッファを引数として <code "
"class=\"code\">window-indirect-buffer-p</code>（上記参照）を呼び出した際に "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すウィンドウのリストを追記することを"
"意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">replace-buffer-in-windows</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-replace_002dbuffer_002din_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">replace-buffer-in-windows</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-replace_002dbuffer_002din_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This command replaces <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> with some "
"other buffer, in all windows displaying it.  <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> should be a buffer, or the name of an existing buffer; if omitted "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、それを表示しているすべてのウィンドウにおいて、<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>を別のバッファに置き換えます。<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>にはバッファまたは既存のバッファ名を指定し"
"ます。省略した場合や<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を指定した場合は、現在の"
"バッファがデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The replacement buffer in each window is usually chosen via <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-History.html\">Window History</a>).  With the exception of "
"side windows (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Side-Windows.html\">Side "
"Windows</a>), any dedicated window displaying <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> is deleted if possible (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dedicated-"
"Windows.html\">Dedicated Windows</a>).  If such a window is the only window "
"on its frame and there are other frames on the same terminal, the frame is "
"deleted as well.  If the dedicated window is the only window on the only "
"frame on its terminal, the buffer is replaced anyway."
msgstr ""
"各ウィンドウの置換バッファは、通常 <code class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-"
"buffer</code> によって選択されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"History.html\">ウィンドウ履歴</a> を参照）。サイドウィンドウ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Side-Windows.html\">サイドウィンドウ</a> を参照）を除"
"き、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を表示している専用ウィンドウは、"
"可能であれば削除されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dedicated-Windows.html\">"
"専用ウィンドウ</a> を参照）。そのようなウィンドウが自身のフレーム上の唯一の"
"ウィンドウであり、かつ同一ターミナル上に他のフレームが存在する場合、そのフ"
"レームも削除されます。専用ウィンドウが自身のターミナル上の唯一のフレームにお"
"ける唯一のウィンドウである場合でも、バッファはいずれにせよ置換されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The main purpose of this function is to decide what to do with windows whose "
"buffers are about to be killed by <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing-Buffers.html\">Killing Buffers</a>).  "
"It will, however, also remove the buffer specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> from the lists of previous and next "
"buffers (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-History.html\">Window History</"
"a>) of all windows (including dead windows that are only referenced by "
"window configurations) and remove any <code class=\"code\">quit-restore</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-prev</code> parameters (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">Window Parameters</a>) "
"referencing that buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数の主な目的は、<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> によってバッ"
"ファが破棄されようとしているウィンドウをどう処理するかを決定することです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing-Buffers.html\">バッファの破棄</a>を参照）。た"
"だし、同時に、すべてのウィンドウ（ウィンドウ構成によってのみ参照されている破"
"棄済みウィンドウを含む）の前後のバッファリスト（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-History.html\">ウィンドウ履歴</a>を参照）から <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> で指定されたバッファを削除し、そのバッファ"
"を参照している <code class=\"code\">quit-restore</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-restore-prev</code> パラメータ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">ウィンドウパラメータ</a>を参照）も削除しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function does not replace the buffer specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> in any minibuffer window showing it, nor "
"does it delete minibuffer windows or minibuffer frames.  It removes, "
"however, that buffer from the lists of previous and next buffers of all "
"minibuffer windows."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、表示中のいずれのミニバッファウィンドウにおいても <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> で指定されたバッファを置き換えることはな"
"く、またミニバッファウィンドウやミニバッファフレームを削除することもありませ"
"ん。ただし、すべてのミニバッファウィンドウの前後のバッファリストから、その"
"バッファを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"By default, <code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> deletes "
"only windows dedicated to their buffers and ignores any <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-restore</code> or <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-"
"prev</code> parameters of the windows it works on.  The following option is "
"useful for circumventing these restrictions."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> はバッ"
"ファ専用のウィンドウのみを削除し、処理対象のウィンドウにおける <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-restore</code> や <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-"
"prev</code> パラメータは無視します。これらの制限を回避するには、以下のオプ"
"ションが有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer-quit-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-kill_002dbuffer_002dquit_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">kill-buffer-quit-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-kill_002dbuffer_002dquit_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Buffers-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If this option is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"buffer</code> (and in consequence <code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-"
"windows</code>) may only delete windows that are dedicated to the buffer "
"about to be killed.  If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> has <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quitting-Windows.html\">Quitting Windows</a>) deal with any such "
"window.  That function may delete such a window even if it&rsquo;s not "
"dedicated to its buffer.  Also, <code class=\"code\">delete-windows-on</"
"code> will use <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code> as fallback "
"when a window cannot be deleted and another buffer must be shown in it."
msgstr ""
"このオプションが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>（ひいては <code class=\"code\">replace-"
"buffer-in-windows</code>）は、削除対象のバッファ専用となっているウィンドウの"
"みを削除できます。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> は <code class=\"code\">quit-"
"restore-window</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quitting-Windows.html\">ウィ"
"ンドウの終了</a> を参照）を用いて、そのようなウィンドウを処理します。この関数"
"は、たとえバッファ専用となっていなくても、そのようなウィンドウを削除すること"
"があります。また、ウィンドウを削除できず、そこに別のバッファを表示する必要が"
"ある場合、<code class=\"code\">delete-windows-on</code> はフォールバックとし"
"て <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code> を使用します。"

