# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This section explains the steps involved in building the Emacs executable.  "
"You don&rsquo;t have to know this material to build and install Emacs, since "
"the makefiles do all these things automatically.  This information is "
"pertinent to Emacs developers."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Emacsの実行ファイルをビルドする手順について説明します。makefileがこ"
"れらの処理をすべて自動的に行うため、Emacsをビルド・インストールする際にこの内"
"容を把握しておく必要はありません。この情報は、Emacsの開発者向けの内容となりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid "Building Emacs requires GNU Make version 3.81 or later."
msgstr "Emacsのビルドには、GNU Make バージョン 3.81 以降が必要です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Compilation of the C source files in the <samp class=\"file\">src</samp> "
"directory produces an executable file called <samp class=\"file\">temacs</"
"samp>, also called a <em class=\"dfn\">bare impure Emacs</em>.  It contains "
"the Emacs Lisp interpreter and I/O routines, but not the editing commands."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">src</samp>ディレクトリ内のCソースファイルをコンパイルす"
"ると、<samp class=\"file\">temacs</samp>と呼ばれる実行ファイルが生成されま"
"す。これは<em class=\"dfn\">ベア・インピュアEmacs</em>とも呼ばれます。これに"
"はEmacs LispインタプリタとI/Oルーチンが含まれていますが、編集コマンドは含まれ"
"ていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-loadup_002eel\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-loadup_002eel\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"command\">temacs&nbsp;-l&nbsp;loadup</code> would "
"run <samp class=\"file\">temacs</samp> and direct it to load <samp "
"class=\"file\">loadup.el</samp>.  The <code class=\"code\">loadup</code> "
"library loads additional Lisp libraries, which set up the normal Emacs "
"editing environment.  After this step, the Emacs executable is no longer <em "
"class=\"dfn\">bare</em>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"command\">temacs&nbsp;-l&nbsp;loadup</code> は <samp "
"class=\"file\">temacs</samp> を実行し、<samp class=\"file\">loadup.el</samp> "
"をロードするよう指示します。<code class=\"code\">loadup</code> ライブラリは追"
"加の Lisp ライブラリをロードし、これにより通常の Emacs 編集環境が構築されま"
"す。このステップを経て、Emacs の実行ファイルはもはや <em class=\"dfn\">素の状"
"態</em> ではなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dumping-Emacs\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-_002d_002dtemacs-option_002c-and-dumping-method\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dumping-Emacs\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-_002d_002dtemacs-option_002c-and-dumping-method\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Because it takes some time to load the standard Lisp files, the <samp "
"class=\"file\">temacs</samp> executable usually isn&rsquo;t run directly by "
"users.  Instead, one of the last steps of building Emacs runs the command "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">temacs&nbsp;-batch&nbsp;-l&nbsp;loadup&nbsp;--"
"temacs=<var class=\"var\">dump-method</var></samp>&rsquo;.  The special "
"option <samp class=\"option\">--temacs</samp> tells <code "
"class=\"command\">temacs</code> how to record all the standard preloaded "
"Lisp functions and variables, so that when you subsequently run Emacs, it "
"will start much faster.  The <samp class=\"option\">--temacs</samp> option "
"requires an argument <var class=\"var\">dump-method</var>, which can be one "
"of the following:"
msgstr ""
"標準のLispファイルの読み込みには時間がかかるため、<samp "
"class=\"file\">temacs</samp> 実行ファイルは通常、ユーザーによって直接実行され"
"ることはありません。代わりに、Emacsのビルドにおける最終段階の一つで、コマン"
"ド &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">temacs&nbsp;-batch&nbsp;-l&nbsp;loadup&nbsp;--"
"temacs=<var class=\"var\">dump-method</var></samp>&rsquo; が実行されます。特"
"殊なオプション <samp class=\"option\">--temacs</samp> は、すべての標準プリ"
"ロード済みLisp関数と変数を記録する方法を <code class=\"command\">temacs</"
"code> に指示するもので、これによりその後Emacsを起動した際に、起動が大幅に速く"
"なります。<samp class=\"option\">--temacs</samp> オプションには引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">dump-method</var> が必要であり、これは以下のいずれかになりま"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-dump-file\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pdump</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dump-file\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-dump-file\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pdump</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dump-file\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Record the preloaded Lisp data in a <em class=\"dfn\">dump file</em>.  This "
"method produces an additional data file which Emacs will load at startup.  "
"The produced dump file is usually called <samp class=\"file\">emacs.pdmp</"
"samp>, and is installed in the Emacs <code class=\"code\">exec-directory</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Help-Functions.html\">Help Functions</"
"a>).  This method is the most preferred one, as it does not require Emacs to "
"employ any special techniques of memory allocation, which might get in the "
"way of various memory-layout techniques used by modern systems to enhance "
"security and privacy."
msgstr ""
"プリロード済みのLispデータを<em class=\"dfn\">ダンプファイル</em>に記録しま"
"す。この方法では、Emacsが起動時に読み込む追加のデータファイルが生成されます。"
"生成されるダンプファイルは通常<samp class=\"file\">emacs.pdmp</samp>と呼ば"
"れ、Emacsの<code class=\"code\">exec-directory</code>にインストールされます"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Help-Functions.html\">ヘルプ関数</a>を参照）。こ"
"の方法は、Emacsがメモリ割り当ての特殊な手法を用いる必要がないため、最も推奨さ"
"れます。そうした手法は、セキュリティやプライバシーを向上させるために現代のシ"
"ステムで採用されているさまざまなメモリレイアウト手法の妨げになる可能性がある"
"ためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-bootstrapping-Emacs\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pbootstrap</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-bootstrapping-Emacs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-bootstrapping-Emacs\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pbootstrap</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-bootstrapping-Emacs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pdump</samp>&rsquo;, but used while <em "
"class=\"dfn\">bootstrapping</em> Emacs, when no previous Emacs binary and no "
"<samp class=\"file\">*.elc</samp> byte-compiled Lisp files are available.  "
"The produced dump file is usually named <samp class=\"file\">bootstrap-"
"emacs.pdmp</samp> in this case."
msgstr ""
"「<samp class=\"samp\">pdump</samp>」と同様ですが、以前のEmacsバイナリや"
"<samp class=\"file\">*.elc</samp>バイトコンパイル済みLispファイルがいずれも存"
"在しない状態で、Emacsを<em class=\"dfn\">ブートストラップ</em>する際に使用さ"
"れます。この場合、生成されるダンプファイルは通常<samp "
"class=\"file\">bootstrap-emacs.pdmp</samp>という名前になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-preloaded-Lisp-files\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-preloaded_002dfile_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-preloaded-Lisp-files\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-preloaded_002dfile_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"The dumped <samp class=\"file\">emacs</samp> executable (also called a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">pure</em> Emacs)  is the one which is installed.  If the "
"portable dumper was used to build Emacs, the <samp class=\"file\">emacs</"
"samp> executable is actually an exact copy of <samp class=\"file\">temacs</"
"samp>, and the corresponding <samp class=\"file\">emacs.pdmp</samp> file is "
"installed as well.  The variable <code class=\"code\">preloaded-file-list</"
"code> stores a list of the preloaded Lisp files recorded in the dump file or "
"in the dumped Emacs executable.  If you port Emacs to a new operating "
"system, and are not able to implement dumping of any kind, then Emacs must "
"load <samp class=\"file\">loadup.el</samp> each time it starts."
msgstr ""
"ダンプされた <samp class=\"file\">emacs</samp> 実行ファイル（<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ピュア</em> Emacs とも呼ばれる）がインストールされます。ポータ"
"ブル版のダンパーを使用して Emacs をビルドした場合、<samp "
"class=\"file\">emacs</samp> 実行ファイルは実際には <samp "
"class=\"file\">temacs</samp> の完全なコピーであり、対応する <samp "
"class=\"file\">emacs.pdmp</samp> ファイルも併せてインストールされます。変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">preloaded-file-list</code> には、ダンプファイルまたはダ"
"ンプされた Emacs 実行ファイルに記録されているプリロード済み Lisp ファイルのリ"
"ストが格納されます。Emacs を新しいオペレーティングシステムに移植し、いかなる"
"形式のダンプも実装できない場合は、Emacs は起動するたびに <samp "
"class=\"file\">loadup.el</samp> をロードする必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-build-details\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-deterministic-build\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-_002d_002ddisable_002dbuild_002ddetails-option-to-configure\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-build-details\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-deterministic-build\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-_002d_002ddisable_002dbuild_002ddetails-option-to-configure\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"By default the dumped <samp class=\"file\">emacs</samp> executable records "
"details such as the build time and host name.  Use the <samp "
"class=\"option\">--disable-build-details</samp> option of <code "
"class=\"command\">configure</code> to suppress these details, so that "
"building and installing Emacs twice from the same sources is more likely to "
"result in identical copies of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、ダンプされた <samp class=\"file\">emacs</samp> 実行ファイルに"
"ビルド時刻やホスト名などの詳細情報が記録されます。<code "
"class=\"command\">configure</code> の <samp class=\"option\">--disable-build-"
"details</samp> オプションを使用してこれらの詳細情報を抑制すれば、同一のソース"
"から Emacs を2回ビルド・インストールした際に、同一の Emacs コピーが得られる可"
"能性が高まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-site_002dload_002eel\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-site_002dload_002eel\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"You can specify additional files to preload by writing a library named <samp "
"class=\"file\">site-load.el</samp> that loads them.  However, the advantage "
"of preloading additional files decreases as machines get faster.  On modern "
"machines, it is usually not advisable."
msgstr ""
"追加のファイルをプリロードするには、それらを読み込む <samp "
"class=\"file\">site-load.el</samp> という名前のライブラリを記述します。ただ"
"し、マシンの高速化に伴い、追加ファイルをプリロードするメリットは小さくなりま"
"す。現代のマシンでは、通常推奨されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"After <samp class=\"file\">loadup.el</samp> reads <samp class=\"file\">site-"
"load.el</samp>, it finds the documentation strings for primitive and "
"preloaded functions (and variables) in the file <samp class=\"file\">etc/"
"DOC</samp> where they are stored, by calling <code class=\"code\">Snarf-"
"documentation</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accessing-"
"Documentation.html#Definition-of-Snarf_002ddocumentation\">Accessing "
"Documentation</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">loadup.el</samp> が <samp class=\"file\">site-load.el</"
"samp> を読み込んだ後、<code class=\"code\">Snarf-documentation</code> を呼び"
"出すことで、プリミティブ関数やプリロード済み関数（および変数）のドキュメント"
"文字列が格納されているファイル <samp class=\"file\">etc/DOC</samp> を探し出し"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accessing-Documentation.html#Definition-of-"
"Snarf_002ddocumentation\">ドキュメントへのアクセス</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
