# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This function delays the initialization of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> "
"to the next Emacs start.  You normally use this function by specifying it as "
"the <code class=\"code\">:initialize</code> property of a customizable "
"variable.  (The argument <var class=\"var\">value</var> is unused, and is "
"provided only for compatibility with the form Custom expects.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の初期化を次回の Emacs 起動時まで"
"遅延させます。通常、この関数はカスタマイズ可能な変数の <code "
"class=\"code\">:initialize</code> プロパティとして指定して使用します。（引数 "
"<var class=\"var\">value</var> は使用されず、Custom が想定する形式との互換性"
"のためにのみ用意されています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Building-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"In the unlikely event that you need a more general functionality than <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-initialize-delay</code> provides, you can use <code "
"class=\"code\">before-init-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">Summary: Sequence of Actions at Startup</a>)."
msgstr ""
"万が一、<code class=\"code\">custom-initialize-delay</code> が提供するものよ"
"りも汎用的な機能が必要な場合は、<code class=\"code\">before-init-hook</code> "
"を使用できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">概要：起動時"
"の動作シーケンス</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
