"href=\"#index-forward_002dbutton\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Button-Buffer-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Move to the <var class=\"var\">n</var>th next button, or <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th previous button if <var class=\"var\">n</var> is "
"negative.  If <var class=\"var\">n</var> is zero, move to the start of any "
"button at point.  If <var class=\"var\">wrap</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, moving past either end of the buffer continues "
"from the other end.  If <var class=\"var\">display-message</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the button&rsquo;s help-echo string is "
"displayed.  Any button with a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">skip</code> property is skipped over.  Returns the button "
"found, and signals an error if no buttons can be found.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">no-error</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, return "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> instead of signaling the error."
msgstr ""

