# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Button-Buffer-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Return the next button after (for <code class=\"code\">next-button</code>) "
"or before (for <code class=\"code\">previous-button</code>) position <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> in the current buffer.  If <var class=\"var\">count-"
