"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte-packing-and-unpacking\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Byte-Packing.html
msgid ""
"This section describes how to pack and unpack arrays of bytes, usually for "
"binary network protocols.  These functions convert byte arrays to alists, "
"and vice versa.  The byte array can be represented as a unibyte string or as "
"a vector of integers, while the alist associates symbols either with fixed-"
"size objects or with recursive sub-alists.  To use the functions referred to "
"in this section, load the <code class=\"code\">bindat</code> library."
msgstr ""
"本節では、主にバイナリネットワークプロトコル向けに、バイト配列のパックおよび"
"アンパックの方法について説明します。これらの関数は、バイト配列をalistに、また"
"その逆に変換します。バイト配列はユニバイト文字列または整数のベクトルとして表"
"現でき、一方でalistはシンボルを固定サイズのオブジェクトまたは再帰的なサブ"
"alistに関連付けます。本節で言及する関数を使用するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">bindat</code>ライブラリをロードしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Byte-Packing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-serializing\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-deserializing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-packing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"unpacking\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-serializing\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-deserializing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-packing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"unpacking\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Byte-Packing.html
msgid ""
"Conversion from byte arrays to nested alists is also known as <em "
"class=\"dfn\">deserializing</em> or <em class=\"dfn\">unpacking</em>, while "
"going in the opposite direction is also known as <em "
"class=\"dfn\">serializing</em> or <em class=\"dfn\">packing</em>."
msgstr ""
"バイト配列からネストされたalistへの変換は、<em class=\"dfn\">デシリアライズ</"
"em>または<em class=\"dfn\">アンパッキング</em>とも呼ばれ、逆方向の処理は<em "
"class=\"dfn\">シリアライズ</em>または<em class=\"dfn\">パッキング</em>とも呼"
"ばれます。"

