# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/C-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"The C part of Emacs is portable to C99 or later: later C features such as "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;stdckdint.h&gt;</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">[[noreturn]]</samp>&rsquo; are not used without a "
"check, typically at configuration time, and the Emacs build procedure "
"provides a substitute implementation if necessary.  Some later features, "
"such as anonymous structures and unions, are too difficult to emulate, so "
"they are avoided entirely."
msgstr ""
"EmacsのC言語部分は、C99以降に移植可能です。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;stdckdint.h&gt;</samp>&rsquo;や&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[[noreturn]]</samp>&rsquo;といった後続のC言語の機能は、通常は"
"設定時などのチェックなしには使用されず、必要に応じてEmacsのビルド手順で代替実"
"装が提供されます。匿名構造体や共用体など、一部の後続機能はエミュレートが困難"
"すぎるため、完全に回避されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/C-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"At some point in the future the base C dialect will no doubt change to "
"something later than C99."
msgstr ""
"将来的には、Cのベース方言は間違いなくC99より後の規格へと移行するだろう。"

