# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Defining functions is only half the battle.  Functions don&rsquo;t do "
"anything until you <em class=\"dfn\">call</em> them, i.e., tell them to "
"run.  Calling a function is also known as <em class=\"dfn\">invocation</em>."
msgstr ""
"関数を定義するのは、まだ道のりの半分に過ぎません。関数は、<em class=\"dfn\">"
"呼び出し</em>、つまり実行を指示するまで何もしません。関数を呼び出すことは、"
"<em class=\"dfn\">呼出し</em>とも呼ばれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The most common way of invoking a function is by evaluating a list.  For "
"example, evaluating the list <code class=\"code\">(concat &quot;a&quot; "
"&quot;b&quot;)</code> calls the function <code class=\"code\">concat</code> "
"with arguments <code class=\"code\">&quot;a&quot;</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;b&quot;</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Evaluation.html\">Evaluation</a>, for a description of evaluation."
msgstr ""
"関数を呼び出す最も一般的な方法は、リストを評価することです。例えば、リスト "
"<code class=\"code\">(concat &quot;a&quot; &quot;b&quot;)</code> を評価する"
"と、引数 <code class=\"code\">&quot;a&quot;</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;b&quot;</code> を指定して関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">concat</code> が呼び出されます。評価の説明については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Evaluation.html\">評価</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When you write a list as an expression in your program, you specify which "
"function to call, and how many arguments to give it, in the text of the "
"program.  Usually that&rsquo;s just what you want.  Occasionally you need to "
"compute at run time which function to call.  To do that, use the function "
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code>.  When you also need to determine at run "
"time how many arguments to pass, use <code class=\"code\">apply</code>."
msgstr ""
"プログラム内で式としてリストを記述する場合、どの関数を呼び出し、いくつの引数"
"を渡すかをプログラムの本文中で指定します。通常はこれで十分です。場合によって"
"は、実行時にどの関数を呼び出すかを計算する必要があります。そのためには、関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> を使用してください。また、渡す引数の数も"
"実行時に決定する必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">apply</code> を使用し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">funcall</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function &amp;rest "
"arguments</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-funcall\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">funcall</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function &amp;rest "
"arguments</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-funcall\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> calls <var class=\"var\">function</var> "
"with <var class=\"var\">arguments</var>, and returns whatever <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> returns."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code>は<var class=\"var\">arguments</var>を指定"
"して<var class=\"var\">function</var>を呼び出し、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>が返す値をそのまま返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Since <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> is a function, all of its "
"arguments, including <var class=\"var\">function</var>, are evaluated before "
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> is called.  This means that you can use "
"any expression to obtain the function to be called.  It also means that "
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> does not see the expressions you write "
"for the <var class=\"var\">arguments</var>, only their values.  These values "
"are <em class=\"emph\">not</em> evaluated a second time in the act of "
"calling <var class=\"var\">function</var>; the operation of <code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> is like the normal procedure for calling a "
"function, once its arguments have already been evaluated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> は関数であるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> が呼び出される前に、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> を含むすべての引数が評価されます。つまり、任意の"
"式を用いて、呼び出す関数を得ることができます。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> は <var class=\"var\">arguments</var> に対して"
"記述した式を認識せず、その値のみを参照します。これらの値は、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> を呼び出す際に二度目の評価を受けることは<em "
"class=\"emph\">ありません</em>。<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> の動作"
"は、引数がすでに評価された後の通常の関数呼び出し手順と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">function</var> must be either a Lisp "
"function or a primitive function.  Special forms and macros are not allowed, "
"because they make sense only when given the unevaluated argument "
"expressions.  <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> cannot provide these "
"because, as we saw above, it never knows them in the first place."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">function</var> は、Lisp関数またはプリミティブ関数のい"
"ずれかである必要があります。特殊形式やマクロは、未評価の引数式が与えられた場"
"合にのみ意味をなすため、許可されません。前述の通り、<code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> はそもそもこれらを知ることがないため、提供する"
"ことはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If you need to use <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> to call a command and "
"make it behave as if invoked interactively, use <code class=\"code\">funcall-"
"interactively</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-"
"Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> を使用してコマンドを呼び出し、対話的に実"
"行したかのように動作させる必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">funcall-"
"interactively</code> を使用してください（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">対話的呼び出し</a>を参照）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq f 'list)\n"
"     &rArr; list\n"
msgstr ""

