#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Compare these examples with the examples of <code class=\"code\">apply</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"これらの例を <code class=\"code\">apply</code> の例と比較してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">apply</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function &amp;rest "
"arguments</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-apply\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">apply</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function &amp;rest "
"arguments</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-apply\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> calls <var class=\"var\">function</var> "
"with <var class=\"var\">arguments</var>, just like <code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> but with one difference: the last of <var "
"class=\"var\">arguments</var> is a list of objects, which are passed to <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> as separate arguments, rather than a single "
"list.  We say that <code class=\"code\">apply</code> <em "
"class=\"dfn\">spreads</em> this list so that each individual element becomes "
"an argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> は <var class=\"var\">function</var> を "
"<var class=\"var\">arguments</var> と共に呼び出します。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> と同様ですが、一点だけ異なります。<var "
"class=\"var\">arguments</var> の末尾はオブジェクトのリストになっており、単一"
"のリストとしてではなく、個別の引数として <var class=\"var\">function</var> に"
"渡されます。これを、<code class=\"code\">apply</code> がこのリストを<em "
"class=\"dfn\">展開</em>し、個々の要素がそれぞれ引数になると言います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> with a single argument is special: the "
"first element of the argument, which must be a non-empty list, is called as "
"a function with the remaining elements as individual arguments.  Passing two "
"or more arguments will be faster."
msgstr ""
"単一の引数を取る <code class=\"code\">apply</code> は特殊な挙動を示します。空"
"でないリストである必要がある引数の第1要素は、残りの要素を個別の引数として関数"
"呼び出しされます。2つ以上の引数を渡す方が高速になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> returns the result of calling <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>.  As with <code class=\"code\">funcall</code>, "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> must either be a Lisp function or a "
"primitive function; special forms and macros do not make sense in <code "
"class=\"code\">apply</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> は <var class=\"var\">function</var> を呼び"
"出した結果を返します。<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> と同様に、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> は Lisp 関数またはプリミティブ関数である必要があ"
"ります。特殊フォームやマクロは <code class=\"code\">apply</code> では意味をな"
"しません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(apply f 'x 'y 'z)\n"
"error&rarr; Wrong type argument: listp, z\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(apply '+ 1 2 '(3 4))\n"
"     &rArr; 10\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(apply '+ '(1 2 3 4))\n"
"     &rArr; 10\n"
