# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to fix some of the function&rsquo;s arguments at "
"certain values, and leave the rest of arguments for when the function is "
"actually called.  The act of fixing some of the function&rsquo;s arguments "
"is called <em class=\"dfn\">partial application</em> of the function<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF16\" href=\"#FOOT16\"><sup>16</sup></a>.  The "
"result is a new function that accepts the rest of arguments and calls the "
"original function with all the arguments combined."
msgstr ""
"関数の引数の一部を特定の値に固定し、残りの引数を実際に関数が呼び出される際ま"
"で残しておくことが有用な場合があります。関数の引数の一部を固定する操作を、そ"
"の関数の<em class=\"dfn\">部分適用</em>と呼びます<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF16\" href=\"#FOOT16\"><sup>16</sup></a>。その結果、残りの引数を受け"
"取り、すべての引数を組み合わせて元の関数を呼び出す新しい関数が得られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In Emacs Lisp, this is best done with an anonymous function.  For example, "
"if you have a function &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">my-function</samp>&rsquo; "
"that takes two arguments, you could do something like this:"
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispでは、匿名関数を使うのが最適です。例えば、2つの引数を取る関数 "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">my-function</samp>&rsquo; がある場合、次のように"
"記述できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(mapcar (lambda (x) (my-function 123 x)) ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"You can also do partial application using the function <code "
"class=\"code\">apply-partially</code>.  However, this will be slower than "
"using an anonymous function with <code class=\"code\">lambda</code>."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> 関数を使って部分的な適用を"
"行うこともできます。ただし、<code class=\"code\">lambda</code> で無名関数を使"
"う場合よりも処理速度は遅くなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
