"apply_002dpartially\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">apply-partially</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">func "
"&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"apply_002dpartially\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new function which, when called, will call <var "
"class=\"var\">func</var> with the list of arguments composed from <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> and additional arguments specified at the time of "
"the call.  If <var class=\"var\">func</var> accepts <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> arguments, then a call to <code class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> "
"with <code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">m</var>&nbsp;&lt;=&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var></code> arguments will produce a new function of <code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">n</var>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">m</"
"var></code> arguments<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF17\" "
"href=\"#FOOT17\"><sup>17</sup></a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、呼び出された際に、<var class=\"var\">args</var> と呼び出し時に指"
"定された追加引数から構成される引数リストを用いて <var class=\"var\">func</"
"var> を呼び出す新しい関数を返します。<var class=\"var\">func</var> が <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 個の引数を受け取る場合、<code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">m</var>&nbsp;&lt;=&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">n</var></code> 個の"
"引数を用いて <code class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> を呼び出すと、<code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">n</var>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">m</"
"var></code> 個の引数を持つ新しい関数が生成されます<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF17\" href=\"#FOOT17\"><sup>17</sup></a>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s how we could define the built-in function <code "
"class=\"code\">1+</code>, if it didn&rsquo;t exist, using <code "
"class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> and <code class=\"code\">+</code>, "
"another built-in function<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF18\" "
"href=\"#FOOT18\"><sup>18</sup></a>:"
msgstr ""
"組み込み関数 <code class=\"code\">1+</code> が存在しない場合に、<code "
"class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> と別の組み込み関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">+</code><a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF18\" "
"href=\"#FOOT18\"><sup>18</sup></a> を用いてそれを定義する方法は以下の通りで"
"す。"

