# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Some functions are user-visible <em class=\"dfn\">commands</em>, which can "
"be called interactively (usually by a key sequence).  It is possible to "
"invoke such a command exactly as though it was called interactively, by "
"using the <code class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> function.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>."
msgstr ""
"一部の関数はユーザーから見える<em class=\"dfn\">コマンド</em>であり、対話的に"
"（通常はキーシーケンスによって）呼び出すことができます。<code "
"class=\"code\">call-interactively</code>関数を使用することで、このようなコマ"
"ンドをあたかも対話的に呼び出した場合と全く同様に実行することが可能です。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">対話的呼び出し</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT16\" href=\"#DOCF16\">(16)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT16\" href=\"#DOCF16\">(16)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This is related to, but different from <em class=\"dfn\">currying</em>, "
"which transforms a function that takes multiple arguments in such a way that "
"it can be called as a chain of functions, each one with a single argument."
msgstr ""
"これは、複数の引数を取る関数を、それぞれ単一の引数を持つ関数の連鎖として呼び"
"出せるように変換する<em class=\"dfn\">カリー化</em>に関連していますが、それと"
"は異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT17\" href=\"#DOCF17\">(17)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT17\" href=\"#DOCF17\">(17)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Calling-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If the number of arguments that <var class=\"var\">func</var> can accept is "
"unlimited, then the new function will also accept an unlimited number of "
"arguments, so in that case <code class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> "
"doesn&rsquo;t reduce the number of arguments that the new function could "
"accept."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">func</var> が受け付けられる引数の数が無制限である場合、新"
"しい関数も無制限の数の引数を受け付けるため、その場合 <code "
"class=\"code\">apply-partially</code> は新しい関数が受け付けられる引数の数を"
"減らすことはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
