# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.17.11 Canvas Images<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Canvas-"
"Images-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.17.11 Canvas 画像<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Canvas-"
"Images-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-canvas-image\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-canvas-image\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"Canvas images can be updated and displayed efficiently with high frame "
"rates, for example by document viewers, visualization tools, dynamically "
"computed animations or games.  Canvas images have an associated writeable "
"pixel buffer in ARGB32 format.  For portability the format is the same on "
"all platforms.  Unlike other image types supported in Emacs, canvas images "
"do not require creating a new Emacs Lisp object every time they get updated."
msgstr ""
"Canvas画像は、ドキュメントビューアや可視化ツール、動的に計算されるアニメー"
"ションやゲームなどで、高いフレームレートで効率的に更新・表示できます。Canvas"
"画像には、ARGB32形式の書き込み可能なピクセルバッファが付随しています。移植性"
"を確保するため、この形式はすべてのプラットフォームで共通です。Emacsでサポート"
"されている他の画像タイプとは異なり、Canvas画像は更新のたびに新しいEmacs Lisp"
"オブジェクトを作成する必要はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"An image specifier with <code class=\"code\">:type canvas</code> creates a "
"canvas, for instance as follows:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:type canvas</code> を用いた画像指定子は、例えば次のよう"
"にキャンバスを作成します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar my-canvas\n"
"  '(image :type canvas\n"
"          :id my-canvas\n"
"          :data-width 800\n"
"          :data-height 600))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"The image specification object uniquely (with respect to <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>)  identifies a canvas image object.  The properties "
"<code class=\"code\">:data-width</code>, <code class=\"code\">:data-height</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">:id</code> are mandatory.  The width and "
"height must both be positive integers and the id must be a symbol."
msgstr ""
"画像指定オブジェクトは、（<code class=\"code\">eq</code> に対して）一意にキャ"
"ンバス画像オブジェクトを識別します。プロパティ <code class=\"code\">:data-"
"width</code>、<code class=\"code\">:data-height</code>、および <code "
"class=\"code\">:id</code> は必須です。幅と高さはともに正の整数である必要があ"
"り、id はシンボルである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"Canvases can be created by either providing ARGB32 data as a vector of "
"fixnums or as an unibyte string in <code class=\"code\">:data</code>.  Path "
"to a file containing the ARGB32 data in <code class=\"code\">:file</code> "
"can also be provided.  Furthermore <code class=\"code\">create-image</code> "
"can create canvas images as follows, where the data is initially loaded from "
"a file, or from a vector:"
msgstr ""
"キャンバスは、ARGB32データを固定小数点数のベクトルとして、あるいは<code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code>にユニバイト文字列として指定することで作成できま"
"す。また、<code class=\"code\">:file</code>にARGB32データを含むファイルへのパ"
"スを指定することも可能です。さらに、<code class=\"code\">create-image</code>"
"では以下のようにキャンバス画像を作成でき、その際、データは最初にファイルまた"
"はベクトルから読み込まれます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq my-file-canvas (create-image &quot;/path/to/file&quot;\n"
"                                   'canvas nil\n"
"                                   :data-width 800\n"
"                                   :data-height 600))\n"
"(setq my-vec (make-vector (* 800 600) #xFFFF0000))\n"
"(setq my-vec-canvas (create-image my-vec\n"
"                                  'canvas t\n"
"                                  :data-width 800\n"
"                                  :data-height 600))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"If the values for dimensions change (i.e., <code class=\"code\">:data-"
"height</code> or <code class=\"code\">:data-width</code>), then Emacs will "
"automatically adjust the underlying pixel buffer and resize the canvas."
msgstr ""
"寸法の値が変更された場合（すなわち <code class=\"code\">:data-height</code> "
"または <code class=\"code\">:data-width</code>）、Emacs は基盤となるピクセル"
"バッファを自動的に調整し、キャンバスのサイズを変更します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"Other image properties like <code class=\"code\">:scale</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">:margin</code>, <code class=\"code\">:relief</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">:transform-smoothing</code> and <code class=\"code\">:map</"
"code> are supported.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Image-"
"Descriptors.html\">Image Descriptors</a>, for further details on these "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:scale</code>、<code class=\"code\">:margin</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">:relief</code>、<code class=\"code\">:transform-"
"smoothing</code>、<code class=\"code\">:map</code> といったその他の画像プロパ"
"ティもサポートされています。これらのプロパティの詳細については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Image-Descriptors.html\">画像記述子</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"In order to display the canvas, specify it as the display property of a "
"string or overlay:"
msgstr ""
"キャンバスを表示するには、文字列またはオーバーレイの display プロパティとして"
"指定してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(insert (propertize &quot;#&quot; 'display my-canvas))\n"
"(overlay-put some-overlay 'display my-canvas)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"Once a canvas image object has been created and displayed, it can be "
"&ldquo;refreshed&rdquo; via <code class=\"code\">canvas-refresh</code>."
msgstr ""
"キャンバス画像オブジェクトが作成・表示された後は、<code "
"class=\"code\">canvas-refresh</code> を介して「リフレッシュ」することができま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">canvas-refresh</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">image "
"&amp;optional reload-data</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"canvas_002drefresh\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">canvas-refresh</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">image "
"&amp;optional reload-data</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"canvas_002drefresh\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"Refresh canvas <var class=\"var\">image</var> and update it on screen.  If "
"the optional argument <var class=\"var\">reload-data</var> is non-nil, "
"reload the <code class=\"code\">:data</code> or <code class=\"code\">file</"
"code> from the image specification before redrawing the canvas."
msgstr ""
"キャンバス <var class=\"var\">image</var> をリフレッシュし、画面上に更新しま"
"す。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">reload-data</var> が nil でない場合は、"
"キャンバスを再描画する前に、画像指定から <code class=\"code\">:data</code> ま"
"たは <code class=\"code\">file</code> を再読み込みします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid "The following code refreshes the canvas by reloading the data or file:"
msgstr ""
"以下のコードは、データやファイルを再読み込みすることでキャンバスを更新しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Draw pixels\n"
"(aset my-vec &lt;index&gt; &lt;color&gt;)\n"
";; Reload and refresh canvas images\n"
"(canvas-refresh my-vec-canvas 'reload-data)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"When refreshing the canvas in a loop, we must explicitly call <code "
"class=\"code\">redisplay</code>:"
msgstr ""
"ループ内でキャンバスを更新する際は、明示的に <code class=\"code\">redisplay</"
"code> を呼び出す必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq canvas (create-image (make-vector (* 100 100) 0) 'canvas t\n"
"\t\t\t   :data-width 100 :data-height 100))\n"
"(insert (propertize &quot;#&quot; 'display canvas))\n"
"(dotimes (i (* 100 100))\n"
"  (aset (plist-get (cdr canvas) :data) i #xFF)\n"
"  (canvas-refresh canvas 'reload-data)\n"
"  (redisplay))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"But, if we are refreshing the canvas via a timer or a command, <code "
"class=\"code\">redisplay</code> is implicitly called after the timer or "
"command.  The following example updates the above canvas in a timer ~30 "
"times per second:"
msgstr ""
"ただし、タイマーやコマンドでキャンバスを更新する場合、タイマーやコマンドの実"
"行後に <code class=\"code\">redisplay</code> が暗黙的に呼び出されます。以下の"
"例では、上記のキャンバスをタイマーによって1秒間に約30回更新します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((i 0))\n"
"  (run-at-time nil 0.033 (lambda ()\n"
"\t\t\t  (when (&lt; i (* 100 100))\n"
"\t\t\t    (aset (plist-get (cdr canvas) :data) i #xFF)\n"
"\t\t\t    (incf i)\n"
"\t\t\t    (canvas-refresh canvas 'reload-data)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Canvas-Images.html
msgid ""
"Canvas images can be manipulated and refreshed via dynamic modules.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Module-Canvas-API.html\">Using Canvas API With "
"Modules</a>, for further details."
msgstr ""
"Canvas画像は、ダイナミックモジュールを通じて操作や更新が可能です。詳細につい"
"ては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Module-Canvas-API.html\">モジュールでのCanvas "
"APIの使用</a>を参照してください。"

