# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Changes.html
msgid ""
"The case change commands described here work on text in the current buffer.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Case-Conversion.html\">Case Conversion in Lisp</"
"a>, for case conversion functions that work on strings and characters.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">The Case Table</a>, for how to "
"customize which characters are upper or lower case and how to convert them."
msgstr ""
"ここで説明するケース変更コマンドは、現在のバッファ内のテキストに対して動作し"
"ます。文字列や文字を対象とするケース変換関数については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Case-Conversion.html\">Lispにおけるケース変換</a>を参照してください。"
"どの文字を大文字または小文字にするか、またそれらをどのように変換するかをカス"
"タマイズする方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">ケー"
"ステーブル</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Changes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">capitalize-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-capitalize_002dregion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">capitalize-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-capitalize_002dregion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Changes.html
msgid ""
"This function capitalizes all words in the region defined by <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>.  To capitalize "
"means to convert each word&rsquo;s first character to upper case and convert "
"the rest of each word to lower case.  The function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> で"
"定義された領域内のすべての単語を大文字に変換します。大文字に変換するとは、各"
"単語の先頭文字を大文字に、それ以外の文字を小文字に変換することを意味します。"
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Changes.html
msgid ""
"If one end of the region is in the middle of a word, the part of the word "
"within the region is treated as an entire word."
msgstr ""
"領域の一端が単語の途中にある場合、領域内の単語部分は一つの単語として扱われ"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Changes.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">capitalize-region</code> is called interactively, "
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> are point "
"and the mark, with the smallest first."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">capitalize-region</code> を対話的に呼び出すと、<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> はそれぞれポイント"
"とマークとなり、小さい方が先になります。"

