"<span>4.9 Case Conversion in Lisp<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Case-"
"Conversion-in-Lisp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>4.9 Lispにおけるケース変換<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Case-"
"Conversion-in-Lisp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-upper-case\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-lower-case\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-character-case\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-"
"conversion-in-Lisp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-upper-case\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-lower-case\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-character-case\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-"
"conversion-in-Lisp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"The character case functions change the case of single characters or of the "
"contents of strings.  The functions normally convert only alphabetic "
"characters (the letters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; through "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Z</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; through &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">z</"
"samp>&rsquo;, as well as non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> letters); "
"other characters are not altered.  You can specify a different case "
"conversion mapping by specifying a case table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Case-Tables.html\">The Case Table</a>)."
msgstr ""
"文字の大文字・小文字変換関数は、単一の文字または文字列の内容の大文字・小文字"
"を変換します。通常、これらの関数はアルファベット文字（文字 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; から &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Z</"
"samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; から &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">z</samp>&rsquo; 、ならびに非<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字）のみを変換し、その他の文字は変更されませ"
"ん。ケーステーブルを指定することで、別の大文字・小文字変換マッピングを指定で"
"きます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">ケーステーブル</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"These functions do not modify the strings that are passed to them as "
"arguments."
msgstr "これらの関数は、引数として渡された文字列を変更しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"The examples below use the characters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">X</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo; which have "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> codes 88 and 120 respectively."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、それぞれ<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>コード88と120を持つ"
"文字&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">X</samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo;を使用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">downcase</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-char</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-downcase\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">downcase</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-char</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-downcase\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"This function converts <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var>, which should "
"be either a character or a string, to lower case."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字または文字列であるはずの <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</"
"var> を小文字に変換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is a string, this function "
"returns a new string in which each letter in the argument that is upper case "
"is converted to lower case.  When <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is "
"a character, this function returns the corresponding lower case character "
"(an integer); if the original character is lower case, or is not a letter, "
"the return value is equal to the original character."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> が文字列の場合、この関数は、引数に含"
"まれる大文字をそれぞれ小文字に変換した新しい文字列を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> が文字の場合、この関数は対応する小文字（整"
"数）を返します。元の文字が小文字であるか、あるいは文字でない場合、戻り値は元"
"の文字と等しくなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(downcase &quot;The cat in the hat&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;the cat in the hat&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(downcase ?X)\n"
"     &rArr; 120\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">upcase</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-char</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-upcase\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">upcase</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-char</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-upcase\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"This function converts <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var>, which should "
"be either a character or a string, to upper case."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字または文字列であるはずの <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</"
"var> を大文字に変換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is a string, this function "
"returns a new string in which each letter in the argument that is lower case "
"is converted to upper case.  When <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is "
"a character, this function returns the corresponding upper case character "
"(an integer); if the original character is upper case, or is not a letter, "
"the return value is equal to the original character."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> が文字列の場合、この関数は、引数に含"
"まれる小文字をそれぞれ大文字に変換した新しい文字列を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> が文字の場合、この関数は対応する大文字（整"
"数）を返します。元の文字が大文字であるか、あるいは文字でない場合、戻り値は元"
"の文字と等しくなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(upcase &quot;The cat in the hat&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;THE CAT IN THE HAT&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(upcase ?x)\n"
"     &rArr; 88\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">capitalize</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-char</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-capitalize\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">capitalize</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-char</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-capitalize\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-capitalization\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-capitalization\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"This function capitalizes strings or characters.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is a string, the function returns a new "
"string whose contents are a copy of <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> "
"in which each word has been capitalized.  This means that the first "
"character of each word is converted to upper case, and the rest are "
"converted to lower case."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列や文字を大文字に変換します。<var class=\"var\">string-or-"
"char</var> が文字列の場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</"
"var> の各単語を大文字に変換したコピーを内容とする新しい文字列を返します。つま"
"り、各単語の先頭文字は大文字に、それ以外の文字は小文字に変換されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dsymbols_002das_002dwords\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dsymbols_002das_002dwords\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"The definition of a word is any sequence of consecutive characters that are "
"assigned to the word constituent syntax class in the current syntax table "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">Table of Syntax "
"Classes</a>); if <code class=\"code\">case-symbols-as-words</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, characters assigned to the symbol "
"constituent syntax class are also considered as word constituent."
msgstr ""
"単語の定義とは、現在の構文テーブルにおいて単語構成要素構文クラスに割り当てら"
"れた、連続する任意の文字列のことである（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Class-Table.html\">構文クラス表</a>を参照）。<code class=\"code\">case-"
"symbols-as-words</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、記号構"
"成要素構文クラスに割り当てられた文字も単語構成要素とみなされる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is a character, this function "
"does the same thing as <code class=\"code\">upcase</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> が文字の場合、この関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">upcase</code> と同じ動作をします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(capitalize &quot;The cat in the hat&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The Cat In The Hat&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(capitalize &quot;THE 77TH-HATTED CAT&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The 77th-Hatted Cat&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(capitalize ?x)\n"
"     &rArr; 88\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">upcase-initials</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-"
"char</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-upcase_002dinitials\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">upcase-initials</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string-or-"
"char</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-upcase_002dinitials\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> is a string, this function "
"capitalizes the initials of the words in <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</"
"var>, without altering any letters other than the initials.  It returns a "
"new string whose contents are a copy of <var class=\"var\">string-or-char</"
"var>, in which each word has had its initial letter converted to upper case."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> が文字列の場合、この関数は <var "
"class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> の各単語の頭文字を大文字にし、頭文字以外の"
"文字は変更しません。そして、<var class=\"var\">string-or-char</var> のコピー"
"の各単語の頭文字を大文字に変換した新しい文字列を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"The definition of a word for this function is the same as described for "
"<code class=\"code\">capitalize</code> above, and <code class=\"code\">case-"
"symbols-as-words</code> has the same effect on word constituent characters."
msgstr ""
"この関数における単語の定義は、前述の <code class=\"code\">capitalize</code> "
"で説明したものと同様であり、<code class=\"code\">case-symbols-as-words</"
"code> も単語構成文字に対して同様の効果を持ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"When the argument to <code class=\"code\">upcase-initials</code> is a "
"character, <code class=\"code\">upcase-initials</code> has the same result "
"as <code class=\"code\">upcase</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">upcase-initials</code> の引数が文字の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">upcase-initials</code> は <code class=\"code\">upcase</code> "
"と同じ結果になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(upcase-initials &quot;The CAT in the hAt&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The CAT In The HAt&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Note that case conversion is not a one-to-one mapping of codepoints and "
"length of the result may differ from length of the argument.  Furthermore, "
"because passing a character forces return type to be a character, functions "
"are unable to perform proper substitution and result may differ compared to "
"treating a one-character string.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"なお、大文字・小文字の変換はコードポイントと1対1の対応関係にあるわけではな"
"く、結果の長さが引数の長さと異なる場合があります。さらに、文字を渡すと戻り値"
"の型が文字に強制されるため、関数で適切な置換が行えず、1文字の文字列として扱っ"
"た場合と結果が異なる可能性があります。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(upcase &quot;ﬁ&quot;)  ; note: single character, ligature &quot;fi&quot;\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;FI&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(upcase ?ﬁ)\n"
"     &rArr; 64257  ; i.e. ?ﬁ\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"To avoid this, a character must first be converted into a string, using "
"<code class=\"code\">string</code> function, before being passed to one of "
"the casing functions.  Of course, no assumptions on the length of the result "
"may be made."
msgstr ""
"これを避けるには、文字を大文字・小文字変換関数のいずれかに渡す前に、<code "
"class=\"code\">string</code> 関数を用いてまず文字列に変換する必要があります。"
"当然ながら、結果の長さについていかなる前提も置くことはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Other characters can also have special case-conversion rules.  They all have "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> character properties <code "
"class=\"code\">special-uppercase</code>, <code class=\"code\">special-"
"lowercase</code>, or <code class=\"code\">special-titlecase</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>) "
"defined by the Unicode Standard.  These properties define special case-"
"conversion rules which override the current case table (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">The Case Table</a>)."
msgstr ""
"他の文字にも特殊な大文字・小文字変換規則が設定されている場合があります。これ"
"らの文字はすべて、Unicode標準で定義された<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外"
"の文字プロパティ<code class=\"code\">special-uppercase</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">special-lowercase</code>、または<code class=\"code\">special-"
"titlecase</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字"
"プロパティ</a>を参照）を持っています。これらのプロパティは、現在の大文字・小"
"文字変換テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">大文字・小文字"
"変換テーブル</a>を参照）を上書きする特殊な大文字・小文字変換規則を定義しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Comparison.html\">Comparison of Characters "
"and Strings</a>, for functions that compare strings; some of them ignore "
"case differences, or can optionally ignore case differences."
msgstr ""
"文字列を比較する関数については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-"
"Comparison.html\">文字と文字列の比較</a>を参照してください。これらの関数の中"
"には、大文字と小文字の区別を無視するもの、あるいは任意で無視できるものがあり"
"ます。"

