# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"<span>4.10 The Case Table<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Case-"
"Table\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>4.10 ケーステーブル<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Case-"
"Table\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"You can customize case conversion by installing a special <em "
"class=\"dfn\">case table</em>.  A case table specifies the mapping between "
"upper case and lower case letters.  It affects both the case conversion "
"functions for Lisp objects (see the previous section) and those that apply "
"to text in the buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-"
"Changes.html\">Case Changes</a>).  Each buffer has a case table; there is "
"also a standard case table which is used to initialize the case table of new "
"buffers."
msgstr ""
"専用の<em class=\"dfn\">ケーステーブル</em>をインストールすることで、大文字・"
"小文字の変換をカスタマイズできます。ケーステーブルは、大文字と小文字の対応関"
"係を定義します。これは、Lispオブジェクト用の大文字・小文字変換関数（前節参"
"照）と、バッファ内のテキストに適用される関数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-"
"Changes.html\">Case Changes</a>参照）の両方に影響します。各バッファにはケース"
"テーブルが用意されており、また、新しいバッファのケーステーブルを初期化するた"
"めに使用される標準ケーステーブルも存在します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"A case table is a char-table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>) whose subtype is <code "
"class=\"code\">case-table</code>.  This char-table maps each character into "
"the corresponding lower case character.  It has three extra slots, which "
"hold related tables:"
msgstr ""
"ケーステーブルとは、サブタイプが <code class=\"code\">case-table</code> であ"
"る文字テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">文字テーブル"
"</a> を参照）のことです。この文字テーブルは、各文字を対応する小文字にマッピン"
"グします。また、関連するテーブルを保持する3つの追加スロットを備えています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">upcase</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">upcase</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The upcase table maps each character into the corresponding upper case "
"character."
msgstr "upcaseテーブルは、各文字を対応する大文字にマッピングします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The canonicalize table maps all of a set of case-related characters into a "
"particular member of that set."
msgstr ""
"正準化テーブルは、大文字・小文字関連文字の集合に含まれるすべての文字を、当該"
"集合の特定の要素にマッピングします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">equivalences</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">equivalences</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The equivalences table maps each one of a set of case-related characters "
"into the next character in that set."
msgstr ""
"等価表は、ケース関連文字の集合の各文字を、同集合内の次の文字に対応付けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"In simple cases, all you need to specify is the mapping to lower-case; the "
"three related tables will be calculated automatically from that one."
msgstr ""
"単純なケースでは、小文字へのマッピングを指定するだけでよく、関連する3つのテー"
"ブルはその1つから自動的に算出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"For some languages, upper and lower case letters are not in one-to-one "
"correspondence.  There may be two different lower case letters with the same "
"upper case equivalent.  In these cases, you need to specify the maps for "
"both lower case and upper case."
msgstr ""
"言語によっては、大文字と小文字が一対一に対応していない場合があります。同じ大"
"文字に対応する小文字が2種類存在することもあります。このような場合には、小文字"
"と大文字の両方の対応関係を指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"Some characters have special case-conversion rules defined for them, which "
"by default override the current case table.  These characters have non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> character properties <code class=\"code\">special-"
"uppercase</code>, <code class=\"code\">special-lowercase</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">special-titlecase</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Character-Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>) defined by the "
"Unicode Standard.  An example is U+00DF LATIN SMALL LETTER SHARP S, &szlig;, "
"which by default up-cases to the string <code class=\"code\">&quot;SS&quot;</"
"code>, not to U+1E9E LATIN CAPITAL LETTER SHARP S.  To force these "
"characters to follow the case-table conversions, set the corresponding "
"Unicode property to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>:"
msgstr ""
"一部の文字には特別な大文字・小文字変換ルールが定義されており、デフォルトでは"
"現在の大文字・小文字テーブルよりも優先されます。これらの文字には、Unicode標準"
"で定義された<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の文字プロパティ<code "
"class=\"code\">special-uppercase</code>、<code class=\"code\">special-"
"lowercase</code>、または<code class=\"code\">special-titlecase</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参照）"
"が付与されています。例として、U+00DF LATIN SMALL LETTER SHARP S, &szlig; は、"
"デフォルトではU+1E9E LATIN CAPITAL LETTER SHARP Sではなく、文字列<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;SS&quot;</code>に大文字変換されます。これらの文字に大文"
"字・小文字テーブルの変換を強制的に適用させるには、対応するUnicodeプロパティを"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (upcase &quot;&szlig;&quot;)\n"
"  =&gt; &quot;SS&quot;\n"
" (put-char-code-property ?&szlig; 'special-uppercase nil)\n"
" (upcase &quot;&szlig;&quot;)\n"
"  =&gt; &quot;ẞ&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The extra slot <var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var> of a case table maps "
"each character to a canonical equivalent; any two characters that are "
"related by case-conversion have the same canonical equivalent character.  "
"For example, since &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; are related by case-conversion, they "
"should have the same canonical equivalent character (which should be either "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; for both of them, or &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; for both of them)."
msgstr ""
"ケーステーブルの追加スロット <var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var> は、各文字"
"を正準等価文字にマッピングします。大文字・小文字変換によって関連付けられる任"
"意の2文字は、同一の正準等価文字を持ちます。例えば、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo; は大文字・小文字変換によって関連付けられているため、同一の正準等"
"価文字を持つはずです（その文字は、両者にとって &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; か、あるいは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo; のいずれかになります）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The extra slot <var class=\"var\">equivalences</var> is a map that "
"cyclically permutes each equivalence class (of characters with the same "
"canonical equivalent).  (For ordinary <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>, "
"this would map &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; into &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo; into &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;, and likewise "
"for each set of equivalent characters.)"
msgstr ""
"追加スロット <var class=\"var\">equivalences</var> は、各同値類（同一の正準同"
"値を持つ文字の集合）を巡回的に置換するマップです。（通常の <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> の場合、これにより &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo; に、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; にマッピングされ、同様の処理が各同値文字集合に"
"対して行われます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"When constructing a case table, you can provide <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> for <var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var>; then Emacs fills in this "
"slot from the lower case and upper case mappings.  You can also provide "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var class=\"var\">equivalences</var>; "
"then Emacs fills in this slot from <var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var>.  "
"In a case table that is actually in use, those components are non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Do not try to specify <var "
"class=\"var\">equivalences</var> without also specifying <var "
"class=\"var\">canonicalize</var>."
msgstr ""
"ケーステーブルを作成する際、<var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すると、Emacs は小文字および大文字のマッピン"
"グからこのスロットを補完します。また、<var class=\"var\">equivalences</var> "
"に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すると、Emacs は <var "
"class=\"var\">canonicalize</var> からこのスロットを補完します。実際に使用され"
"ているケーステーブルでは、これらのコンポーネントは non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。<var class=\"var\">canonicalize</var> "
"を指定せずに <var class=\"var\">equivalences</var> を指定しようとしないでくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid "Here are the functions for working with case tables:"
