"set_002dstandard_002dcase_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"This function makes <var class=\"var\">table</var> the standard case table, "
"so that it will be used in any buffers created subsequently."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">table</var> を標準ケーステーブルとして設定し、"
"それ以降に作成されるすべてのバッファでこれが使用されるようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
