"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-case-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">table</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-set_002dcase_002dtable\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"This sets the current buffer&rsquo;s case table to <var class=\"var\">table</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"これにより、現在のバッファのケーステーブルが<var class=\"var\">table</var>に"
"設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-case-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">table "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dcase_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-case-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">table "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dcase_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">with-case-table</code> macro saves the current case "
"table, makes <var class=\"var\">table</var> the current case table, "
"evaluates the <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms, and finally restores the "
"case table.  The return value is the value of the last form in <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>.  The case table is restored even in case of an "
"abnormal exit via <code class=\"code\">throw</code> or error (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">Nonlocal Exits</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">with-case-table</code> マクロは、現在のケーステーブルを"
"保存し、<var class=\"var\">table</var> を現在のケーステーブルとし、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> のフォームを評価し、最後にケーステーブルを復元しま"
"す。戻り値は、<var class=\"var\">body</var> の最後のフォームの値です。<code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> による異常終了やエラーが発生した場合でも、ケース"
"テーブルは復元されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">非局"
"所終了</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Case-Tables.html
msgid ""
"Some language environments modify the case conversions of <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters; for example, in the Turkish "
"language environment, the <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> capital I is "
"downcased into a Turkish dotless i (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&inodot;</"
"samp>&rsquo;).  This can interfere with code that requires ordinary <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> case conversion, such as implementations of "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>-based network protocols.  In that case, "
"use the <code class=\"code\">with-case-table</code> macro with the variable "
"<var class=\"var\">ascii-case-table</var>, which stores the unmodified case "
"table for the <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character set."
msgstr ""
"言語環境によっては、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字の大文字・小文字"
"変換を変更するものがあります。例えば、トルコ語環境では、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>の大文字Iがトルコ語のドットなしi (&lsquo;<samp "
