msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-forms-for-nonlocal-exits\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"Most control constructs affect only the flow of control within the construct "
"itself.  The function <code class=\"code\">throw</code> is the exception to "
"this rule of normal program execution: it performs a nonlocal exit on "
"request.  (There are other exceptions, but they are for error handling "
"only.)  <code class=\"code\">throw</code> is used inside a <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>, and jumps back to that <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの制御構造は、その構造内部の制御フローにのみ影響を与えます。関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">throw</code> は、通常のプログラム実行におけるこの規則の"
"例外であり、要求に応じて非局所的な脱出を行います。（他にも例外はありますが、"
"それらはエラー処理専用です。）<code class=\"code\">throw</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code> 内で使用され、その <code class=\"code\">catch</"
"code> へと戻ります。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo-outer ()\n"
"  (catch 'foo\n"
"    (foo-inner)))\n"
"\n"
"(defun foo-inner ()\n"
"  ...\n"
"  (if x\n"
"      (throw 'foo t))\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">throw</code> form, if executed, transfers control "
"straight back to the corresponding <code class=\"code\">catch</code>, which "
"returns immediately.  The code following the <code class=\"code\">throw</"
"code> is not executed.  The second argument of <code class=\"code\">throw</"
"code> is used as the return value of the <code class=\"code\">catch</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">throw</code> finds the matching <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code> based on the first argument: it searches for a "
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> whose first argument is <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> to the one specified in the <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code>.  If there is more than one applicable <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>, the innermost one takes precedence.  Thus, in "
"the above example, the <code class=\"code\">throw</code> specifies <code "
"class=\"code\">foo</code>, and the <code class=\"code\">catch</code> in "
"<code class=\"code\">foo-outer</code> specifies the same symbol, so that "
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> is the applicable one (assuming there is "
"no other matching <code class=\"code\">catch</code> in between)."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">throw</code> は、第1引数に基づいて一致する <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code> を探します。具体的には、<code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> で指定されたものに対し、第1引数が <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> である <code class=\"code\">catch</code> を検索しま"
"す。該当する <code class=\"code\">catch</code> が複数ある場合は、最も内側のも"
"のが優先されます。したがって、上記の例では、<code class=\"code\">throw</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">foo</code> を指定し、<code class=\"code\">foo-"
"outer</code> 内の <code class=\"code\">catch</code> も同じ記号を指定している"
"ため、<code class=\"code\">catch</code> が該当します（その間に他に一致する "
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> がないと仮定した場合）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"Executing <code class=\"code\">throw</code> exits all Lisp constructs up to "
"the matching <code class=\"code\">catch</code>, including function calls.  "
"When binding constructs such as <code class=\"code\">let</code> or function "
"calls are exited in this way, the bindings are unbound, just as they are "
"when these constructs exit normally (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-"
"Variables.html\">Local Variables</a>).  Likewise, <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> restores the buffer and position saved by <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Excursions.html\">Excursions</a>), and the narrowing status saved by "
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code>.  It also runs any cleanups "
"established with the <code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> special form "
"when it exits that form (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Cleanups.html\">Cleaning Up from Nonlocal Exits</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">throw</code> を実行すると、関数呼び出しを含む、対応する "
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> までのすべての Lisp 構文が終了します。"
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> などの束縛構文や関数呼び出しがこのように終了"
"した場合、これらの構文が正常に終了したときと同様に、束縛が解除されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">ローカル変数</a> を参照）。同様"
"に、<code class=\"code\">throw</code> は <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> によって保存されたバッファと位置（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Excursions.html\">エクスカーション</a> を参照）、および <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> によって保存されたナローイング状態を復"
"元します。また、<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> 特殊フォームを終了"
"する際に、そのフォームで設定されたクリーンアップ処理を実行します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cleanups.html\">非ローカル終了からのクリーンアップ</"
"a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">throw</code> need not appear lexically within the "
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> that it jumps to.  It can equally well be "
"called from another function called within the <code class=\"code\">catch</"
"code>.  As long as the <code class=\"code\">throw</code> takes place "
"chronologically after entry to the <code class=\"code\">catch</code>, and "
"chronologically before exit from it, it has access to that <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>.  This is why <code class=\"code\">throw</code> "
"can be used in commands such as <code class=\"code\">exit-recursive-edit</"
"code> that throw back to the editor command loop (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Recursive-Editing.html\">Recursive Editing</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">throw</code>は、ジャンプ先となる<code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>の字句解析上の範囲内に現れる必要はありません。同様"
"に、<code class=\"code\">catch</code>内で呼び出された別の関数から呼び出される"
"ことも可能です。<code class=\"code\">throw</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>への進入より時系列的に後、かつそこからの退出より時"
"系列的に前に行われる限り、<code class=\"code\">catch</code>にアクセスできま"
"す。このため、<code class=\"code\">throw</code>は、エディタのコマンドループに"
"戻る<code class=\"code\">exit-recursive-edit</code>のようなコマンドで使用でき"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Recursive-Editing.html\">再帰的編集</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-CL-note_002d_002d_002donly-throw-in-"
"Emacs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-CL-note_002d_002d_002donly-throw-in-"
"Emacs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><blockquote><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"<b class=\"b\">Common Lisp note:</b> Most other versions of Lisp, including "
"Common Lisp, have several ways of transferring control nonsequentially: "
"<code class=\"code\">return</code>, <code class=\"code\">return-from</code>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">go</code>, for example.  Emacs Lisp has only <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code>.  The <samp class=\"file\">cl-lib</samp> library "
"provides versions of some of these.  See <a data-manual=\"cl\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/cl/Blocks-and-"
"Exits.html#Blocks-and-Exits\">Blocks and Exits</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">Common Lisp Extensions</cite>."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"b\">Common Lispに関する注記：</b> Common Lispを含む他のほとんどの"
"Lispバージョンでは、非逐次的に制御を移す方法がいくつか用意されています（例え"
"ば <code class=\"code\">return</code>、<code class=\"code\">return-from</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">go</code> など）。Emacs Lispにあるのは <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> のみです。<samp class=\"file\">cl-lib</samp> ライ"
"ブラリでは、これらの一部のバージョンが提供されています。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">Common Lisp Extensions</cite> の <a data-manual=\"cl\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/cl/Blocks-and-"
"Exits.html#Blocks-and-Exits\">Blocks and Exits</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
