#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tag-on-run-time-stack\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tag-on-run-time-stack\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> establishes a return point for the <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> function.  The return point is distinguished "
"from other such return points by <var class=\"var\">tag</var>, which may be "
"any Lisp object except <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">tag</var> is evaluated normally before the return point is "
"established."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> は <code class=\"code\">throw</code> 関数の"
"復帰点を設定します。復帰点は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の任意の "
"Lisp オブジェクトとなり得る <var class=\"var\">tag</var> によって、他の同様の"
"復帰点と区別されます。引数 <var class=\"var\">tag</var> は、復帰点が設定され"
"る前に通常通り評価されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"With the return point in effect, <code class=\"code\">catch</code> evaluates "
"the forms of the <var class=\"var\">body</var> in textual order.  If the "
"forms execute normally (without error or nonlocal exit) the value of the "
"last body form is returned from the <code class=\"code\">catch</code>."
msgstr ""
"リターンポイントが有効な状態では、<code class=\"code\">catch</code> は <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> のフォームをテキスト順に評価します。フォームが正常に"
"実行された場合（エラーや nonlocal exit が発生しなかった場合）、最後のボディ"
"フォームの値が <code class=\"code\">catch</code> から返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"If a <code class=\"code\">throw</code> is executed during the execution of "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>, specifying the same value <var "
"class=\"var\">tag</var>, the <code class=\"code\">catch</code> form exits "
"immediately; the value it returns is whatever was specified as the second "
"argument of <code class=\"code\">throw</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> の実行中に同じ値 <var class=\"var\">tag</var> "
"を指定した <code class=\"code\">throw</code> が実行されると、<code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code> フォームは直ちに終了し、返される値は <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> の第2引数として指定されたものになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">throw</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">tag value</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-throw\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">throw</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">tag value</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-throw\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"The purpose of <code class=\"code\">throw</code> is to return from a return "
"point previously established with <code class=\"code\">catch</code>.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">tag</var> is used to choose among the various "
"existing return points; it must be <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to the "
"value specified in the <code class=\"code\">catch</code>.  If multiple "
"return points match <var class=\"var\">tag</var>, the innermost one is used."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">throw</code> の目的は、<code class=\"code\">catch</"
"code> であらかじめ設定された戻り先から復帰することです。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">tag</var> は、既存のさまざまな戻り先の中から選択するために使用"
"され、<code class=\"code\">eq</code> から <code class=\"code\">catch</code> "
"で指定された値である必要があります。複数の戻り先が <var class=\"var\">tag</"
"var> に一致する場合は、最も内側のものが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">value</var> is used as the value to return "
"from that <code class=\"code\">catch</code>."
msgstr ""
"その <code class=\"code\">catch</code> から返す値として、引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-no_002dcatch\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-no_002dcatch\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Catch-and-Throw.html
msgid ""
"If no return point is in effect with tag <var class=\"var\">tag</var>, then "
"a <code class=\"code\">no-catch</code> error is signaled with data <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">tag</var> <var class=\"var\">value</"
"var>)</code>."
msgstr ""
"タグ <var class=\"var\">tag</var> で戻り先が指定されていない場合、データ "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">tag</var> <var class=\"var\">value</"
"var>)</code> とともに <code class=\"code\">no-catch</code> エラーが通知されま"
"す。"

