# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-categories-of-characters\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-categories\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-categories-of-characters\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-categories\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Categories</em> provide an alternate way of classifying "
"characters syntactically.  You can define several categories as needed, then "
"independently assign each character to one or more categories.  Unlike "
"syntax classes, categories are not mutually exclusive; it is normal for one "
"character to belong to several categories."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">カテゴリ</em>は、文字を構文的に分類するための別の手法を提供"
"します。必要に応じて複数のカテゴリを定義し、各文字を独立して1つ以上のカテゴリ"
"に割り当てることができます。構文クラスとは異なり、カテゴリは相互に排他的では"
"ありません。1つの文字が複数のカテゴリに属することは一般的です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category-table\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category-table\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"Each buffer has a <em class=\"dfn\">category table</em> which records which "
"categories are defined and also which characters belong to each category.  "
"Each category table defines its own categories, but normally these are "
"initialized by copying from the standard categories table, so that the "
"standard categories are available in all modes."
msgstr ""
"各バッファには、どのカテゴリが定義されているか、またどの文字が各カテゴリに属"
"しているかを記録した<em class=\"dfn\">カテゴリテーブル</em>があります。各カテ"
"ゴリテーブルは独自のカテゴリを定義しますが、通常は標準カテゴリテーブルからコ"
"ピーして初期化されるため、すべてのモードで標準カテゴリが利用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"Each category has a name, which is an <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"printing character in the range &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&nbsp;</"
"samp>&rsquo; to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;.  You specify "
"the name of a category when you define it with <code class=\"code\">define-"
"category</code>."
msgstr ""
"各カテゴリには名前があり、これは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&nbsp;</"
"samp>&rsquo; から &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; の範囲の <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 印字文字です。<code class=\"code\">define-"
"category</code> を用いてカテゴリを定義する際に、その名前を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category-set\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category-set\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"The category table is actually a char-table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>).  The element of the category "
"table at index <var class=\"var\">c</var> is a <em class=\"dfn\">category "
"set</em>&mdash;a bool-vector&mdash;that indicates which categories character "
"<var class=\"var\">c</var> belongs to.  In this category set, if the element "
"at index <var class=\"var\">cat</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, that "
"means category <var class=\"var\">cat</var> is a member of the set, and that "
"character <var class=\"var\">c</var> belongs to category <var "
"class=\"var\">cat</var>."
msgstr ""
"カテゴリテーブルは、実際にはcharテーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>を参照）です。インデックス<var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>のカテゴリテーブルの要素は<em class=\"dfn\">カテゴリセッ"
"ト</em>&mdash;bool型のベクトル&mdash;であり、文字<var class=\"var\">c</var>が"
"どのカテゴリに属するかを示します。このカテゴリセットにおいて、インデックス"
"<var class=\"var\">cat</var>の要素が<code class=\"code\">t</code>である場合、"
"カテゴリ<var class=\"var\">cat</var>がセットのメンバーであり、文字<var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>がカテゴリ<var class=\"var\">cat</var>に属することを意味"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"For the next three functions, the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> defaults to the current buffer&rsquo;s category "
"table."
msgstr ""
"続く3つの関数では、オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">table</var> のデフォルト"
"値は現在のバッファのカテゴリテーブルとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
