"docstring &amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dcategory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"This function defines a new category, with name <var class=\"var\">char</"
"var> and documentation <var class=\"var\">docstring</var>, for the category "
"table <var class=\"var\">table</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、カテゴリテーブル <var class=\"var\">table</var> に対して、名称 "
"<var class=\"var\">char</var>、ドキュメント <var class=\"var\">docstring</"
"var> を持つ新しいカテゴリを定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s an example of defining a new category for characters that have "
"strong right-to-left directionality (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">Bidirectional Display</a>)  and using it "
"in a special category table.  To obtain the information about the "
"directionality of characters, the example code uses the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">bidi-class</samp>&rsquo; Unicode property (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">bidi-class</a>)."
msgstr ""
"以下に、強い右から左への書字方向を持つ文字（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">双方向表示</a>を参照）のための新しいカテ"
"ゴリを定義し、それを特殊なカテゴリテーブルで使用する例を示します。文字の書字"
"方向に関する情報を取得するため、このサンプルコードではUnicodeプロパティ"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">bidi-class</samp>」（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Character-Properties.html\">bidi-class</a>を参照）を使用しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Categories.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar special-category-table-for-bidi\n"
"  ;;     Make an empty category-table.\n"
"  (let ((category-table (make-category-table))\n"
"        ;; Create a char-table which gives the 'bidi-class' Unicode\n"
"        ;; property for each character.\n"
"        (uniprop-table\n"
"         (unicode-property-table-internal 'bidi-class)))\n"
"    (define-category ?R &quot;Characters of bidi-class R, AL, or RLO&quot;\n"
"                     category-table)\n"
"    ;; Modify the category entry of each character whose\n"
"    ;; 'bidi-class' Unicode property is R, AL, or RLO --\n"
"    ;; these have a right-to-left directionality.\n"
"    (map-char-table\n"
"     (lambda (key val)\n"
"       (if (memq val '(R AL RLO))\n"
"           (modify-category-entry key ?R category-table)))\n"
"     uniprop-table)\n"
"    category-table))\n"
msgstr ""

