# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Caveats.html
msgid ""
"This manual has gone through numerous drafts.  It is nearly complete but not "
"flawless.  There are a few topics that are not covered, either because we "
"consider them secondary (such as most of the individual modes) or because "
"they are yet to be written.  Because we are not able to deal with them "
"completely, we have left out several parts intentionally."
msgstr ""
"本マニュアルは幾度もの草案を経て作成されてきました。ほぼ完成していますが、完"
"璧というわけではありません。二次的なものと考えている項目（ほとんどの個別モー"
"ドなど）や、まだ執筆されていない項目など、網羅されていないトピックがいくつか"
"あります。これらを完全に扱うことは困難であるため、意図的にいくつかの部分を割"
"愛しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Caveats.html
msgid ""
"The manual should be fully correct in what it does cover, and it is "
"therefore open to criticism on anything it says&mdash;from specific examples "
"and descriptive text, to the ordering of chapters and sections.  If "
"something is confusing, or you find that you have to look at the sources or "
"experiment to learn something not covered in the manual, then perhaps the "
"manual should be fixed.  Please let us know."
msgstr ""
