# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"These hook variables let you arrange to take notice of changes in buffers "
"(or in a particular buffer, if you make them buffer-local).  See also <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">Properties with Special "
"Meanings</a>, for how to detect changes to specific parts of the text."
msgstr ""
"これらのフック変数を使用すると、バッファ（あるいはバッファローカルに設定した"
"場合は特定のバッファ）の変更を検知するように設定できます。テキストの特定部分"
"の変更を検知する方法については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持つプロパティ</a>も参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"The functions you use in these hooks should save and restore the match data "
"if they do anything that uses regular expressions; otherwise, they will "
"interfere in bizarre ways with the editing operations that call them.  In "
"addition, the functions in these hooks should avoid changing buffer text, "
"faces, properties, overlays, and other aspects of the buffer-specific state "
"except those that the hook functions themselves create and manage, because "
"other parts of Emacs might become confused by such changes behind their back."
msgstr ""
"これらのフックで使用する関数は、正規表現を用いる処理を行う場合は、マッチデー"
"タを保存および復元する必要があります。そうしないと、それらを呼び出す編集操作"
"に予期せぬ形で干渉することになります。さらに、これらのフック内の関数は、バッ"
"ファ固有の状態のうち、フック関数自身が作成・管理する要素以外のバッファテキス"
"ト、フェイス、プロパティ、オーバーレイ、およびその他の項目を変更することを避"
"けるべきです。というのも、Emacsの他の部分が、こうした変更に気づかぬまま影響を"
"受ける可能性があるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">before-change-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-before_002dchange_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">before-change-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-before_002dchange_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a list of functions to call when Emacs is about to "
"modify a buffer.  Each function gets two arguments, the beginning and end of "
"the region that is about to change, represented as integers.  The buffer "
"that is about to change is always the current buffer when the function is "
"called."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、Emacsがバッファを変更しようとする際に呼び出される関数のリストが"
"格納されています。各関数には、変更対象となるリージョンの開始位置と終了位置を"
"表す2つの引数（整数）が渡されます。変更対象となるバッファは、関数が呼び出され"
"た時点でのカレントバッファとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">after-change-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-after_002dchange_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">after-change-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-after_002dchange_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a list of functions to call after Emacs modifies a "
"buffer.  Each function receives three arguments: the beginning and end of "
"the region just changed, and the length of the text that existed before the "
"change.  All three arguments are integers.  The buffer that has been changed "
"is always the current buffer when the function is called."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、Emacsがバッファを変更した後に呼び出す関数のリストが格納されてい"
"ます。各関数には、変更されたばかりのリージョンの開始位置と終了位置、および変"
"更前に存在していたテキストの長さという3つの引数が渡されます。これら3つの引数"
"はいずれも整数です。変更されたバッファは、関数が呼び出された時点のカレント"
"バッファとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"The length of the old text is the difference between the buffer positions "
"before and after that text as it was before the change.  As for the changed "
"text, its length is simply the difference between the first two arguments."
msgstr ""
"元のテキストの長さは、変更前のそのテキストにおける前後のバッファ位置の差とな"
"ります。変更後のテキストについては、その長さは単に最初の2つの引数の差となりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"Output of messages into the <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer "
"does not call these functions, and neither do certain internal buffer "
"changes, such as changes in buffers created by Emacs internally for certain "
"jobs, that should not be visible to Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファへのメッセージ出力ではこれらの"
"関数は呼び出されず、また、Lisp プログラムからは参照できないはずの特定の内部"
"バッファの変更（特定のジョブ向けに Emacs が内部的に作成したバッファの変更な"
"ど）においても同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"The vast majority of buffer changing primitives will call <code "
"class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> and <code class=\"code\">after-"
"change-functions</code> in balanced pairs, once for each change, where the "
"arguments to these hooks exactly delimit the change being made.  Yet, hook "
"functions should not rely on this always being the case, because some "
"complex primitives call <code class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> "
"once before making changes, and then call <code class=\"code\">after-change-"
"functions</code> zero or more times, depending on how many individual "
"changes the primitive is making.  When that happens, the arguments to <code "
"class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> will enclose a region in which "
"the individual changes are made, but won&rsquo;t necessarily be the minimal "
"such region, and the arguments to each successive call of <code "
"class=\"code\">after-change-functions</code> will then delimit the part of "
"text being changed exactly.  In general, we advise using either the before- "
"or the after-change hook, but not both."
msgstr ""
"バッファ変更プリミティブの大部分は、変更ごとに <code class=\"code\">before-"
"change-functions</code> と <code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</"
"code> をバランスの取れたペアで呼び出し、これらのフックへの引数がまさに行われ"
"る変更範囲を画定します。しかし、一部の複雑なプリミティブでは、変更を行う前に"
"一度 <code class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> を呼び出し、その後、"
"プリミティブが行う個々の変更回数に応じて <code class=\"code\">after-change-"
"functions</code> を 0 回以上呼び出すため、フック関数は常にこの挙動になると想"
"定すべきではありません。その場合、<code class=\"code\">before-change-"
"functions</code> への引数は個々の変更が行われる領域を囲みますが、それが必ずし"
"も最小の領域になるとは限らず、続く <code class=\"code\">after-change-"
"functions</code> の各呼び出しにおける引数が、変更されるテキスト部分を正確に画"
"定することになります。一般的に、before-change または after-change のいずれか"
"一方のフックを使用し、両方を併用しないことを推奨します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">combine-after-change-calls</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"combine_002dafter_002dchange_002dcalls\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">combine-after-change-calls</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"combine_002dafter_002dchange_002dcalls\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"The macro executes <var class=\"var\">body</var> normally, but arranges to "
"call the after-change functions just once for a series of several "
"changes&mdash;if that seems safe."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは通常 <var class=\"var\">body</var> を実行しますが、一連の複数回の"
"変更に対して、変更後の関数を一度だけ呼び出すように構成されています&mdash;それ"
"が安全であると思われる場合に限ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"If a program makes several text changes in the same area of the buffer, "
"using the macro <code class=\"code\">combine-after-change-calls</code> "
"around that part of the program can make it run considerably faster when "
"after-change hooks are in use.  When the after-change hooks are ultimately "
"called, the arguments specify a portion of the buffer including all of the "
"changes made within the <code class=\"code\">combine-after-change-calls</"
"code> body."
msgstr ""
"プログラムがバッファの同一領域で複数回のテキスト変更を行う場合、その部分をマ"
"クロ <code class=\"code\">combine-after-change-calls</code> で囲むことで、変"
"更後フックが使用されている際に実行速度を大幅に向上させることができます。最終"
"的に変更後フックが呼び出される際、引数には <code class=\"code\">combine-"
"after-change-calls</code> 本体内で行われたすべての変更を含むバッファの一部が"
"指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> You must not alter the values of "
"<code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</code> within the body of a "
"<code class=\"code\">combine-after-change-calls</code> form."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告:</strong> <code class=\"code\">combine-after-"
"change-calls</code> フォームの本文内で <code class=\"code\">after-change-"
"functions</code> の値を変更してはいけません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> If the changes you combine occur "
"in widely scattered parts of the buffer, this will still work, but it is not "
"advisable, because it may lead to inefficient behavior for some change hook "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> 組み合わせる変更がバッファ内の広範囲"
"に分散している場合でも、動作はしますが、一部の変更フック関数において非効率な"
"挙動を招く可能性があるため、推奨されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">combine-change-calls</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg "
"end body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"combine_002dchange_002dcalls\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">combine-change-calls</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg "
"end body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"combine_002dchange_002dcalls\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This executes <var class=\"var\">body</var> normally, except any buffer "
"changes it makes do not trigger the calls to <code class=\"code\">before-"
"change-functions</code> and <code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</"
"code>.  Instead there is a single call of each of these hooks for the region "
"enclosed by <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>, "
"the parameters supplied to <code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</"
"code> reflecting the changes made to the size of the region by <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"これは <var class=\"var\">body</var> を通常通り実行しますが、その際に行われる"
"バッファの変更によって <code class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> お"
"よび <code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</code> の呼び出しがトリガー"
"されることはありません。代わりに、<var class=\"var\">beg</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> で囲まれた領域に対してこれらのフックがそれぞれ1回ずつ"
"呼び出され、<code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</code> に渡されるパラ"
"メータには <var class=\"var\">body</var> によって行われた領域サイズの変更が反"
"映されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"The result of this macro is the result returned by <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロの結果は、<var class=\"var\">body</var> が返す結果となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This macro is useful when a function makes a possibly large number of "
"repetitive changes to the buffer, and the change hooks would otherwise take "
"a long time to run, were they to be run for each individual buffer "
"modification.  Emacs itself uses this macro, for example, in the commands "
"<code class=\"code\">comment-region</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">uncomment-region</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、関数がバッファに対して（場合によっては）大量の反復的な変更を行"
"い、個々のバッファ変更ごとに変更フックを実行すると実行に時間がかかってしまう"
"場合に有用です。Emacs自体も、例えば <code class=\"code\">comment-region</"
"code> や <code class=\"code\">uncomment-region</code> といったコマンドでこの"
"マクロを使用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> You must not alter the values of "
"<code class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">after-change-function</code> within <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
