# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Change-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a normal hook that is run whenever a buffer is changed that "
"was previously in the unmodified state."
