# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"The functions in this section rename, copy, delete, link, and set the modes "
"(permissions) of files.  Typically, they signal a <code class=\"code\">file-"
"error</code> error if they fail to perform their function, reporting the "
"system-dependent error message that describes the reason for the failure.  "
"If they fail because a file is missing, they signal a <code "
"class=\"code\">file-missing</code> error instead."
msgstr ""
"本セクションの関数は、ファイルの名前変更、コピー、削除、リンク、およびモード"
"（権限）の設定を行います。通常、これらの関数は処理に失敗した場合に <code "
"class=\"code\">file-error</code> エラーを返し、失敗の原因を説明するシステム固"
"有のエラーメッセージを報告します。ファイルが存在しないために失敗した場合は、"
"代わりに <code class=\"code\">file-missing</code> エラーを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"For performance, the operating system may cache or alias changes made by "
"these functions instead of writing them immediately to secondary storage.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Files-and-Storage.html\">Files and Secondary "
"Storage</a>."
msgstr ""
"パフォーマンス向上のため、オペレーティングシステムは、これらの関数による変更"
"内容を直ちに二次記憶装置に書き込むのではなく、キャッシュしたりエイリアス化し"
"たりすることがあります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Files-and-Storage.html\">"
"ファイルと二次記憶装置</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"In the functions that have an argument <var class=\"var\">newname</var>, if "
"this argument is a directory name it is treated as if the nondirectory part "
"of the source name were appended.  Typically, a directory name is one that "
"ends in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Directory-Names.html\">Directory Names</a>).  For example, if the old "
"name is <samp class=\"file\">a/b/c</samp>, the <var class=\"var\">newname</"
"var> <samp class=\"file\">d/e/f/</samp> is treated as if it were <samp "
"class=\"file\">d/e/f/c</samp>.  This special treatment does not apply if "
"<var class=\"var\">newname</var> is not a directory name but names a file "
"that is a directory; for example, the <var class=\"var\">newname</var> <samp "
"class=\"file\">d/e/f</samp> is left as-is even if <samp class=\"file\">d/e/"
"f</samp> happens to be a directory."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">newname</var> を持つ関数において、この引数がディレク"
"トリ名である場合、ソース名のディレクトリ以外の部分が付加されたものとして扱わ"
"れます。通常、ディレクトリ名とは末尾が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</"
"samp>&rsquo; で終わるものを指します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Directory-"
"Names.html\">ディレクトリ名</a>を参照）。例えば、旧名が <samp "
"class=\"file\">a/b/c</samp> である場合、<var class=\"var\">newname</var> "
"<samp class=\"file\">d/e/f/</samp> は <samp class=\"file\">d/e/f/c</samp> で"
"あるかのように扱われます。この特別な処理は、<var class=\"var\">newname</var> "
"がディレクトリ名ではなく、ディレクトリであるファイルを指定している場合には適"
"用されません。例えば、<samp class=\"file\">d/e/f</samp> がディレクトリであっ"
"ても、<var class=\"var\">newname</var> <samp class=\"file\">d/e/f</samp> はそ"
"のまま保持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"In the functions that have an argument <var class=\"var\">newname</var>, if "
"a file by the name of <var class=\"var\">newname</var> already exists, the "
"actions taken depend on the value of the argument <var class=\"var\">ok-if-"
"already-exists</var>:"
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">newname</var> を持つ関数において、<var "
"class=\"var\">newname</var> という名前のファイルが既に存在する場合、実行され"
"る処理は引数 <var class=\"var\">ok-if-already-exists</var> の値によって異なり"
"ます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"Signal a <code class=\"code\">file-already-exists</code> error if <var "
"class=\"var\">ok-if-already-exists</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ok-if-already-exists</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、<code class=\"code\">file-already-exists</code> エラーを通知す"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"Request confirmation if <var class=\"var\">ok-if-already-exists</var> is a "
"number."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ok-if-already-exists</var> が数値である場合に確認を求め"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"Replace the old file without confirmation if <var class=\"var\">ok-if-"
"already-exists</var> is any other value."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ok-if-already-exists</var> がそれ以外の値である場合は、確"
"認なしに古いファイルを置き換える。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">add-name-to-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">oldname "
"newname &amp;optional ok-if-already-exists</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-add_002dname_002dto_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
