# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes the file <var class=\"var\">filename</var>.  If the "
"file has multiple names, it continues to exist under the other names.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var> is a symbolic link, <code "
