"This function sets the Emacs-recognized extended file attributes for <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>.  The second argument <var "
"class=\"var\">attribute-alist</var> should be an alist of the same form "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">file-extended-attributes</code>.  The "
"return value is <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the attributes are "
