#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Files.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the SELinux security context for <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> to <var class=\"var\">context</var>.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">context</var> argument should be a list <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">user</var> <var class=\"var\">role</var> "
