# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-set</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"binding</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keymap_002dset-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-set</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"binding</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keymap_002dset-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the binding for <var class=\"var\">key</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">key</var> is a "
"string that must satisfy <code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">Key Sequences</a>).  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">binding</var> can be any Lisp object, but only "
"certain types are meaningful.  (For a list of meaningful types, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Key-Lookup.html\">Key Lookup</a>.)  The value returned "
"by <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> is <var class=\"var\">binding</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> における <var class=\"var\">key</"
"var> のバインディングを設定します。引数 <var class=\"var\">key</var> は、"
"<code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> を満たす文字列である必要があります"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">キーシーケンス</a> を参"
"照）。引数 <var class=\"var\">binding</var> には任意の Lisp オブジェクトを指"
"定できますが、意味を持つのは特定の型のみです。（意味を持つ型の一覧について"
"は、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Key-Lookup.html\">キールックアップ</a> を参照して"
"ください。）<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> が返す値は <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invalid-prefix-key-error\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-sequence-error\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invalid-prefix-key-error\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-sequence-error\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"Every prefix of <var class=\"var\">key</var> must be a prefix key (i.e., "
"bound to a keymap)  or undefined; otherwise an error is signaled.  If some "
"prefix of <var class=\"var\">key</var> is undefined, then <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> defines it as a prefix key so that the rest "
"of <var class=\"var\">key</var> can be defined as specified."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">key</var> のすべてのプレフィックスは、プレフィックスキー"
"（すなわちキーマップにバインドされているもの）であるか、あるいは未定義である"
"必要があります。そうでない場合はエラーが通知されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> の何らかのプレフィックスが未定義である場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> がそれをプレフィックスキーとして定義すること"
"で、<var class=\"var\">key</var> の残りの部分を仕様通りに定義できるようになり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"If there was previously no binding for <var class=\"var\">key</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>, the new binding is added at the beginning of "
"<var class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  The order of bindings in a keymap makes no "
"difference for keyboard input, but it does matter for menu keymaps (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-Keymaps.html\">Menu Keymaps</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> に <var class=\"var\">key</var> のバインディ"
"ングが以前は存在しなかった場合、新しいバインディングは <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> の先頭に追加されます。キーマップにおけるバインディ"
"ングの順序は、キーボード入力では影響しませんが、メニューキーマップでは重要に"
"なります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-Keymaps.html\">メニューキーマップ</"
"a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap_002dunset\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap_002dunset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-unset</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"&amp;optional remove</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keymap_002dunset-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-unset</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"&amp;optional remove</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keymap_002dunset-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This function is the inverse of <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code>, it "
"unsets the binding for <var class=\"var\">key</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>, which is the same as setting the binding to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In order to instead remove the binding "
"completely, specify <var class=\"var\">remove</var> as non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  This only makes a difference if <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> has a parent keymap: if you just unset a key in a "
"child map, it will still shadow the same key in the parent keymap; using "
"<var class=\"var\">remove</var> instead will allow the key in the parent "
"keymap to be used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> の逆の動作を行い、<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> における <var class=\"var\">key</var> のバインディ"
"ングを解除します。これは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインディングを設"
"定することと同等です。代わりにバインディングを完全に削除するには、<var "
"class=\"var\">remove</var> を non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> として指定"
"してください。この違いが生じるのは、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> に親キー"
"マップがある場合のみです。子マップで単にキーのバインディングを解除しても、親"
"キーマップにある同じキーは引き続きシャドウイングされます。代わりに <var "
"class=\"var\">remove</var> を使用すれば、親キーマップのキーを利用できるように"
"なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"Note: using <code class=\"code\">keymap-unset</code> with <var "
"class=\"var\">remove</var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> is intended "
"for users to put in their init file; Emacs packages should avoid using it if "
"possible, since they have complete control over their own keymaps anyway, "
"and they should not be altering other packages&rsquo; keymaps."
msgstr ""
"注：<code class=\"code\">keymap-unset</code> を <var class=\"var\">remove</"
"var> や <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のキーと併用するのは、ユーザーが "
"init ファイルに記述することを想定したものです。Emacs パッケージは、そもそも自"
"前のキーマップを完全に制御できるため、可能な限りこの用法を避けるべきであり、"
"他のパッケージのキーマップを変更すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This example creates a sparse keymap and makes a number of bindings in it:"
msgstr ""
"この例では、疎なキーマップを作成し、そこに複数のバインディングを設定します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq map (make-sparse-keymap))\n"
"    &rArr; (keymap)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-set map &quot;C-f&quot; 'forward-char)\n"
"    &rArr; forward-char\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"map\n"
"    &rArr; (keymap (6 . forward-char))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Build sparse submap for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> and bind <kbd class=\"kbd\">f</kbd> in that.</span>\n"
"(keymap-set map &quot;C-x f&quot; 'forward-word)\n"
"    &rArr; forward-word\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"map\n"
"&rArr; (keymap\n"
"    (24 keymap                ; <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>\n"
"        (102 . forward-word)) ;      <kbd class=\"kbd\">f</kbd>\n"
"    (6 . forward-char))       ; <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Bind <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> to the <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</code>.</span>\n"
"(keymap-set map &quot;C-p&quot; ctl-x-map)\n"
";; <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</code>\n"
"&rArr; [nil ... find-file ... backward-kill-sentence]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Bind <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> to <code class=\"code\">foo</code> in the <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</code>.</span>\n"
"(keymap-set map &quot;C-p C-f&quot; 'foo)\n"
"&rArr; 'foo\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"map\n"
"&rArr; (keymap     ; <span class=\"r\">Note <code class=\"code\">foo</code> in <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</code>.</span>\n"
"    (16 keymap [nil ... foo ... backward-kill-sentence])\n"
"    (24 keymap\n"
"        (102 . forward-word))\n"
"    (6 . forward-char))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"Note that storing a new binding for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p C-f</kbd> "
"actually works by changing an entry in <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</"
"code>, and this has the effect of changing the bindings of both <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p C-f</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> in the "
"default global map."
msgstr ""
"なお、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p C-f</kbd> に新しいバインディングを格納すると、実"
"際には <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</code> のエントリが変更され、これにより"
"デフォルトのグローバルマップにおける <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p C-f</kbd> と "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> 両方のバインディングが変更される点に注意して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> is the general work horse for "
"defining a key in a keymap.  When writing modes, however, you frequently "
"have to bind a large number of keys at once, and using <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> on them all can be tedious and error-"
"prone.  Instead you can use <code class=\"code\">define-keymap</code>, which "
"creates a keymap and binds a number of keys.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Creating-Keymaps.html\">Creating Keymaps</a>, for details."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> は、キーマップでキーを定義する際の汎用"
"的な手段です。しかし、モードを記述する際には、一度に多数のキーをバインドする"
"必要があることが多く、すべてに <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> を使用"
"すると煩雑でミスが発生しやすくなります。代わりに <code class=\"code\">define-"
"keymap</code> を使用すれば、キーマップを作成して複数のキーをバインドできま"
"す。詳細は <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Creating-Keymaps.html\">キーマップの作成"
"</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">substitute-key-definition</code> scans a "
"keymap for keys that have a certain binding and rebinds them with a "
"different binding.  Another feature which is cleaner and can often produce "
"the same results is to remap one command into another (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remapping-Commands.html\">Remapping Commands</a>)."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">substitute-key-definition</code> は、キーマップの中"
"から特定のバインドを持つキーをスキャンし、それらを別のバインドに再バインドし"
"ます。より簡潔で、多くの場合同様の結果が得られるもう一つの機能として、あるコ"
"マンドを別のコマンドにリマップする方法があります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Remapping-Commands.html\">コマンドのリマッピング</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substitute-key-definition</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">olddef newdef keymap &amp;optional oldmap</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-substitute_002dkey_002ddefinition\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substitute-key-definition</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">olddef newdef keymap &amp;optional oldmap</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-substitute_002dkey_002ddefinition\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replace-bindings\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replace-bindings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces <var class=\"var\">olddef</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">newdef</var> for any keys in <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> "
"that were bound to <var class=\"var\">olddef</var>.  In other words, <var "
"class=\"var\">olddef</var> is replaced with <var class=\"var\">newdef</var> "
"wherever it appears.  The function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> 内で <var class=\"var\">olddef</"
"var> にバインドされていたすべてのキーについて、<var class=\"var\">olddef</"
"var> を <var class=\"var\">newdef</var> に置き換えます。言い換えれば、<var "
"class=\"var\">olddef</var> が現れる箇所はすべて <var class=\"var\">newdef</"
"var> に置き換えられます。この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"For example, this redefines <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd>, if you do it "
"in an Emacs with standard bindings:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、標準バインディングが設定されたEmacsでこれを行うと、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd>が再定義されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-key-definition\n"
" 'find-file 'find-file-read-only (current-global-map))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">oldmap</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"that changes the behavior of <code class=\"code\">substitute-key-definition</"
"code>: the bindings in <var class=\"var\">oldmap</var> determine which keys "
"to rebind.  The rebindings still happen in <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>, "
"not in <var class=\"var\">oldmap</var>.  Thus, you can change one map under "
"the control of the bindings in another.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">oldmap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">substitute-key-definition</code> の動作が変わりま"
"す。具体的には、<var class=\"var\">oldmap</var> のバインディングによって、ど"
"のキーを再バインドするかが決定されます。再バインドは依然として <var "
"class=\"var\">oldmap</var> ではなく <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> で行われ"
"ます。したがって、あるマップを、別のマップのバインディング制御下で変更するこ"
"とが可能です。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-key-definition\n"
"  'delete-backward-char 'my-funny-delete\n"
"  my-map global-map)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"puts the special deletion command in <code class=\"code\">my-map</code> for "
"whichever keys are globally bound to the standard deletion command."
msgstr ""
"標準の削除コマンドにグローバルにバインドされているキーに対し、<code "
"class=\"code\">my-map</code> に特殊な削除コマンドを設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid "Here is an example showing a keymap before and after substitution:"
msgstr "置換前後のキーマップを示す例を以下に挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq map (list 'keymap\n"
"                (cons ?1 olddef-1)\n"
"                (cons ?2 olddef-2)\n"
"                (cons ?3 olddef-1)))\n"
"&rArr; (keymap (49 . olddef-1) (50 . olddef-2) (51 . olddef-1))\n"
