#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">suppress-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"&amp;optional nodigits</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"suppress_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">suppress-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"&amp;optional nodigits</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"suppress_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-self_002dinsert_002dcommand-"
"override\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-self_002dinsert_002dcommand-"
"override\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This function changes the contents of the full keymap <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> by remapping <code class=\"code\">self-insert-"
"command</code> to the command <code class=\"code\">undefined</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remapping-Commands.html\">Remapping Commands</a>).  "
"This has the effect of undefining all printing characters, thus making "
"ordinary insertion of text impossible.  <code class=\"code\">suppress-"
"keymap</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> をコマンド <code "
"class=\"code\">undefined</code> に再マッピングすることで、キーマップ <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> 全体の内容を変更します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Remapping-Commands.html\">コマンドの再マッピング</a> を参照）。これに"
"より、すべての印字文字が未定義となり、通常のテキスト挿入が不可能になります。"
"<code class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">nodigits</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then <code class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> defines digits to run <code "
"class=\"code\">digit-argument</code>, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">-</kbd> to run "
"<code class=\"code\">negative-argument</code>.  Otherwise it makes them "
"undefined like the rest of the printing characters."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">nodigits</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">digit-argument</code> を、<kbd class=\"kbd\">-</kbd> は <code "
"class=\"code\">negative-argument</code> を実行するための数字を定義します。そ"
"うでない場合は、他の印字文字と同様に、それらは未定義となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yank-suppression\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quoted_002dinsert-suppression\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yank-suppression\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quoted_002dinsert-suppression\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> function does not make it "
"impossible to modify a buffer, as it does not suppress commands such as "
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> and <code class=\"code\">quoted-insert</"
"code>.  To prevent any modification of a buffer, make it read-only (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">Read-Only Buffers</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> 関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code> や <code class=\"code\">quoted-insert</code> と"
"いったコマンドを抑制しないため、バッファの変更が不可能になるわけではありませ"
"ん。バッファの変更を一切禁止するには、読み取り専用にしてください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">読み取り専用バッファ</a> を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"Since this function modifies <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>, you would "
"normally use it on a newly created keymap.  Operating on an existing keymap "
"that is used for some other purpose is likely to cause trouble; for example, "
"suppressing <code class=\"code\">global-map</code> would make it impossible "
"to use most of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> を変更するため、通常は新しく作成し"
"たキーマップに対して使用します。他の目的で使用されている既存のキーマップに対"
"して操作を行うと、問題が発生する可能性が高くなります。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">global-map</code> を抑制すると、Emacs の大部分が利用できなくな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This function can be used to initialize the local keymap of a major mode for "
"which insertion of text is not desirable.  But usually such a mode should be "
"derived from <code class=\"code\">special-mode</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Major-Modes.html\">Basic Major Modes</a>); then "
"its keymap will automatically inherit from <code class=\"code\">special-mode-"
"map</code>, which is already suppressed.  Here is how <code "
"class=\"code\">special-mode-map</code> is defined:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、テキストの挿入が望ましくないメジャーモードのローカルキーマップを"
"初期化するために使用できます。ただし、通常このようなモードは <code "
"class=\"code\">special-mode</code> から派生させるべきであり（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Major-Modes.html\">基本メジャーモード</a> を参"
"照）、その場合、キーマップはすでに抑制されている <code "
"class=\"code\">special-mode-map</code> を自動的に継承します。<code "
"class=\"code\">special-mode-map</code> の定義は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Key-Bindings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar special-mode-map\n"
"  (let ((map (make-sparse-keymap)))\n"
"    (suppress-keymap map)\n"
"    (keymap-set map &quot;q&quot; 'quit-window)\n"
"    ...\n"
"    map))\n"
msgstr ""

