# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function acts on the text between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var>, adding the face <var class=\"var\">face</var> "
"to the <code class=\"code\">face</code> text property.  <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> should be a valid value for the <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">Properties with Special Meanings</a>), such as a face name "
"or an anonymous face (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">Faces</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> の"
"間のテキストに対して作用し、<code class=\"code\">face</code> テキストプロパ"
"ティにフェイス <var class=\"var\">face</var> を追加します。<var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> は、フェイス名や匿名フェイス（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Faces.html\">フェイス</a> を参照）など、<code class=\"code\">face</"
"code> プロパティの有効な値（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">特別な意味を持つプロパティ</a> を参照）である必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If any text in the region already has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"<code class=\"code\">face</code> property, those face(s) are retained.  This "
"function sets the <code class=\"code\">face</code> property to a list of "
"faces, with <var class=\"var\">face</var> as the first element (by default) "
"and the pre-existing faces as the remaining elements.  If the optional "
"argument <var class=\"var\">appendp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, <var class=\"var\">face</var> is appended to the end of the list "
"instead.  Note that in a face list, the first occurring value for each "
"attribute takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"領域内のテキストに既に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> 以外のプロパティが設定されている場合、それらの面は"
"保持されます。この関数は、<code class=\"code\">face</code> プロパティに面のリ"
"ストを設定します。その際、<var class=\"var\">face</var> が（デフォルトで）最"
"初の要素となり、既存の面が残りの要素となります。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">appendp</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合"
"は、代わりに <var class=\"var\">face</var> がリストの末尾に追加されます。な"
"お、面のリストでは、各属性について最初に出現する値が優先される点に注意してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
msgid ""
"For example, the following code would assign an italicized green face to the "
"text between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、以下のコードでは、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> の間のテキストに斜体の緑色のフェイスが割り当てられま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-face-text-property <var class=\"var\">start</var> <var class=\"var\">end</var> 'italic)\n"
"(add-face-text-property <var class=\"var\">start</var> <var class=\"var\">end</var> '(:foreground &quot;red&quot;))\n"
"(add-face-text-property <var class=\"var\">start</var> <var class=\"var\">end</var> '(:foreground &quot;green&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">object</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies a buffer or string to act on, rather "
"than the current buffer.  If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a string, "
"then <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> are "
"zero-based indices into the string."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">object</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、現在のバッファではなく、処理対象のバッファまたは文字列を指"
"定します。<var class=\"var\">object</var> が文字列である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> はその文字列内の0始"
"まりのインデックスとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
