# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a copy of <var class=\"var\">string</var> with the "
"text properties <var class=\"var\">properties</var> added.  These properties "
"apply to all the characters in the string that is returned.  Here is an "
