# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"This command rotates the window layout clockwise by 90 degrees.  Imagine a "
