#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"This command reorganizes windows such that every horizontal split becomes a "
"vertical split and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、すべての水平分割を垂直分割に、またその逆に変換してウィンドウ"
"を再配置します。"

