#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rotating-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rotating-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"The final two commands can be used to <em class=\"dfn\">rotate windows</em> "
"within the existing layout.  They are like the commands that rotate the "
"layout but leave the underlying structure of the layout unchanged.  What "
"actually changes are the positions of windows within the existing layout.  "
"This happens in a way that the space formerly occupied by any window will be "
"occupied by the window preceding (following if <var class=\"var\">reverse</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>) it in the cyclic ordering of "
"windows (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">Cyclic "
"Ordering of Windows</a>) on <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s frame."
msgstr ""
"最後の2つのコマンドを使用すると、既存のレイアウト内で<em class=\"dfn\">ウィン"
"ドウを回転</em>させることができます。これらはレイアウトを回転させるコマンドに"
"似ていますが、レイアウトの基礎となる構造は変更しません。実際に変更されるの"
"は、既存のレイアウト内におけるウィンドウの位置です。具体的には、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>のフレームにおけるウィンドウの循環順序（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">ウィンドウの循環順序</a>"
"を参照）において、あるウィンドウが占めていた位置に、その直前（<var "
"class=\"var\">reverse</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合はその"
"直後）のウィンドウが配置されるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rotate-windows</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window reverse</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-rotate_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rotate-windows</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window reverse</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-rotate_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"This command rotates <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s child windows "
"in cyclic ordering.  The optional argument <var class=\"var\">reverse</var> "
"means to rotate windows backwards, in reverse cyclic order."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">window</var>の子ウィンドウを循環順に回転さ"
"せます。オプション引数<var class=\"var\">reverse</var>を指定すると、ウィンド"
"ウを逆循環順に回転させます。"

