# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"If this is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the functions described in this "
"section will report an error when they encounter a dedicated window (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dedicated-Windows.html\">Dedicated Windows</a>).  If "
"this is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, they handle dedicated windows like "
"non-dedicated ones."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、本節で説明する関数は、専用ウィ"
"ンドウ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dedicated-Windows.html\">専用ウィンドウ</"
"a> を参照）に遭遇した際にエラーを報告します。これが <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> の場合、専用ウィンドウを非専用ウィンドウと同様に扱います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
