"name\">rotate-windows-change-selected</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-rotate_002dwindows_002dchange_002dselected\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">rotate-windows-change-selected</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"rotate_002dwindows_002dchange_002dselected\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Changing-Window-Layouts.html
msgid ""
"If this is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the selected window will remain "
"unaffected by <code class=\"code\">rotate-windows</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">rotate-windows-back</code>.  If this is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> (the default), the selected window will change to "
"the window that appears at the location of the window selected before any of "
"these commands were invoked."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、選択中のウィンドウは <code "
"class=\"code\">rotate-windows</code> および <code class=\"code\">rotate-"
"windows-back</code> の影響を受けません。これが <code class=\"code\">t</code>"
"（デフォルト）の場合、選択中のウィンドウは、これらのコマンドがいずれも呼び出"
"される前に選択されていたウィンドウの位置に表示されるウィンドウに変更されま"
"す。"

