# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"Below is a table of the classes you can use in a bracket expression (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexp-Special.html\">bracket expression</a>), and "
"what they mean.  Note that the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[</samp>&rsquo; "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo; characters that enclose the "
"class name are part of the name, so a regular expression using these classes "
"needs one more pair of brackets.  For example, a regular expression matching "
"a sequence of one or more letters and digits would be &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[[:alnum:]]+</samp>&rsquo;, not &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[:alnum:]+</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"以下に、括弧式（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexp-Special.html\">括弧式</a>を"
"参照）で使用できるクラスとその意味をまとめた表を示します。なお、クラス名を囲"
"む &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo; という文字も名前の一部となるため、これらのクラ"
"スを使用する正規表現では、さらにもう一組の括弧が必要になります。例えば、1文字"
"以上の英数字の並びにマッチする正規表現は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[:alnum:]+</samp>&rsquo; ではなく、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[[:alnum:]]+</samp>&rsquo; となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:ascii:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:ascii:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches any <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character (codes "
"0&ndash;127)."
msgstr ""
"これは任意の<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字（コード 0&ndash;127）に"
"一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:alnum:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:alnum:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches any letter or digit.  For multibyte characters, it matches "
"characters whose Unicode &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</"
"samp>&rsquo; property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-"
"Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>) indicates they are alphabetic or "
"decimal number characters."
msgstr ""
"これは任意の文字または数字に一致します。マルチバイト文字の場合、Unicodeの "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</samp>&rsquo; プロパティ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参照）"
"によって、アルファベットまたは10進数文字であることが示されている文字に一致し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:alpha:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:alpha:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches any letter.  For multibyte characters, it matches characters "
"whose Unicode &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</samp>&rsquo; "
"property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-"
"Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>) indicates they are alphabetic "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"これは任意の文字にマッチします。マルチバイト文字の場合、Unicodeの &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</samp>&rsquo; プロパティ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参照）"
"でアルファベット文字であることが示されている文字にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:blank:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:blank:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches horizontal whitespace, as defined by Annex C of the Unicode "
"Technical Standard #18.  In particular, it matches spaces, tabs, and other "
"characters whose Unicode &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</"
"samp>&rsquo; property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-"
"Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>) indicates they are spacing "
"separators.  (If you only need to look for ASCII whitespace characters, we "
"suggest using an explicit set of character alternatives, such as &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">[&nbsp;\\t]</samp>&rsquo;, instead, as it will be "
"faster than <code class=\"code\">[[:blank:]]</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"これは、Unicode Technical Standard #18 の附属書 C で定義されている水平空白文"
"字に一致します。具体的には、スペース、タブ、および Unicode の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">general-category</samp>&rsquo; プロパティ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a> を参照）によって空白区"
"切り文字であることが示されるその他の文字に一致します。（ASCII の空白文字のみ"
"を探す必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">[[:blank:]]</code> よりも高速で"
"あるため、代わりに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[&nbsp;\\t]</samp>&rsquo; のよ"
"うな明示的な代替文字セットを使用することをお勧めします。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:cntrl:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:cntrl:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "This matches any character whose code is in the range 0&ndash;31."
msgstr "これは、コードが 0&ndash;31 の範囲にある任意の文字に一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
