#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:digit:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:digit:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; through &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">9</samp>&rsquo;.  Thus, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[-+"
"[:digit:]]</samp>&rsquo; matches any digit, as well as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-graphic-characters\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"これは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; から &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">9</samp>&rsquo; までに一致します。したがって、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[-+[:digit:]]</samp>&rsquo; は任意の数字に加え、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo; にも一致します。  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"graphic-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:graph:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:graph:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches graphic characters&mdash;everything except spaces, <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> and non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"control characters, surrogates, and codepoints unassigned by Unicode, as "
"indicated by the Unicode &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</"
"samp>&rsquo; property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-"
"Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これはグラフィック文字に一致します。ただし、スペース、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>および非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>制"
"御文字、サロゲート、およびUnicodeの「<samp class=\"samp\">general-category</"
"samp>」プロパティで示されるUnicode未割り当てのコードポイントは除きます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
