msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:lower:]</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:lower:]</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char-Classes.html
msgid ""
"This matches any lower-case letter, as determined by the current case table "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">The Case Table</a>).  If "
"<code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this also matches any upper-case letter.  Note "
"that a buffer can have its own local case table different from the default "
"one."
msgstr ""
"これは、現在のケーステーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-Tables.html\">"
