msgstr ""
"<span>6.6 文字テーブル<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Char_002dTables-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-char_002dtables\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-extra-slots-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-char_002dtables\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-extra-slots-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"A char-table is much like a vector, except that it is indexed by character "
"codes.  Any valid character code, without modifiers, can be used as an index "
"in a char-table.  You can access a char-table&rsquo;s elements with <code "
"class=\"code\">aref</code> and <code class=\"code\">aset</code>, as with any "
"array.  In addition, a char-table can have <em class=\"dfn\">extra slots</"
"em> to hold additional data not associated with particular character codes.  "
"Like vectors, char-tables are constants when evaluated, and can hold "
"elements of any type."
msgstr ""
"char-tableはベクトルによく似ていますが、文字コードでインデックス付けされる点"
"が異なります。修飾子のない有効な文字コードであれば、いずれもchar-tableのイン"
"デックスとして使用できます。他の配列と同様に、<code class=\"code\">aref</"
"code>や<code class=\"code\">aset</code>を用いてchar-tableの要素にアクセスでき"
"ます。さらに、char-tableには、特定の文字コードに関連付けられていない追加デー"
"タを保持するための<em class=\"dfn\">エクストラスロット</em>を設けることができ"
"ます。ベクトルと同様に、char-tableは評価時に定数となり、任意の型の要素を保持"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-subtype-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-subtype-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"Each char-table has a <em class=\"dfn\">subtype</em>, a symbol, which serves "
"two purposes:"
msgstr ""
"各文字テーブルには<em class=\"dfn\">サブタイプ</em>というシンボルがあり、これ"
"には2つの役割があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"The subtype provides an easy way to tell what the char-table is for.  For "
"instance, display tables are char-tables with <code class=\"code\">display-"
"table</code> as the subtype, and syntax tables are char-tables with <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> as the subtype.  The subtype can be "
"queried using the function <code class=\"code\">char-table-subtype</code>, "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"サブタイプを利用すれば、char-tableがどのような用途のものかを簡単に判別できま"
"す。例えば、表示テーブルはサブタイプが<code class=\"code\">display-table</"
"code>のchar-tableであり、構文テーブルはサブタイプが<code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code>のchar-tableです。サブタイプは、後述する関"
"数<code class=\"code\">char-table-subtype</code>を用いて照会できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-char_002dtable_002dextra_002dslots-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a> The subtype controls the number of <em "
"class=\"dfn\">extra slots</em> in the char-table.  This number is specified "
"by the subtype&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">char-table-extra-slots</code> "
"symbol property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-"
"Properties.html\">Symbol Properties</a>), whose value should be an integer "
"between 0 and 10.  If the subtype has no such symbol property, the char-"
"table has no extra slots."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-char_002dtable_002dextra_002dslots-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a> サブタイプは、文字テーブル内の<em "
"class=\"dfn\">追加スロット</em>の数を制御します。この数は、サブタイプの<code "
"class=\"code\">char-table-extra-slots</code>シンボルプロパティ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Properties.html\">シンボルプロパティ</a>を参"
"照）で指定され、その値は0から10までの整数である必要があります。サブタイプにこ"
"のようなシンボルプロパティがない場合、文字テーブルに追加スロットは存在しませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parent-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parent-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"A char-table can have a <em class=\"dfn\">parent</em>, which is another char-"
"table.  If it does, then whenever the char-table specifies <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> for a particular character <var class=\"var\">c</"
"var>, it inherits the value specified in the parent.  In other words, <code "
"class=\"code\">(aref <var class=\"var\">char-table</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>)</code> returns the value from the parent of <var "
"class=\"var\">char-table</var> if <var class=\"var\">char-table</var> itself "
"specifies <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"char-tableは、別のchar-tableである<em class=\"dfn\">親</em>を持つことができま"
"す。その場合、char-tableが特定の文字<var class=\"var\">c</var>に対して<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を指定するたびに、親で指定された値を継承します。言い"
"換えれば、<var class=\"var\">char-table</var>自体が<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>を指定している場合、<code class=\"code\">(aref <var class=\"var\">char-"
"table</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var>)</code>は<var class=\"var\">char-"
"table</var>の親の値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default-value-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default-value-of-char_002dtable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"A char-table can also have a <em class=\"dfn\">default value</em>.  If so, "
"then <code class=\"code\">(aref <var class=\"var\">char-table</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>)</code> returns the default value whenever the char-"
"table does not specify any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"char-tableには<em class=\"dfn\">デフォルト値</em>を設定することもできます。そ"
"の場合、char-tableに<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値が指定されていない"
"限り、<code class=\"code\">(aref <var class=\"var\">char-table</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>)</code>はデフォルト値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-char-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">subtype "
"&amp;optional init</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dchar_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-char-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">subtype "
"&amp;optional init</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dchar_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"Return a newly-created char-table, with subtype <var class=\"var\">subtype</"
"var> (a symbol).  Each element is initialized to <var class=\"var\">init</"
"var>, which defaults to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  You cannot alter "
"the subtype of a char-table after the char-table is created."
msgstr ""
"サブタイプ <var class=\"var\">subtype</var>（シンボル）を持つ、新規に作成され"
"た char-table を返します。各要素は <var class=\"var\">init</var> で初期化さ"
"れ、デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。char-table の作成後、"
"そのサブタイプを変更することはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"There is no argument to specify the length of the char-table, because all "
"char-tables have room for any valid character code as an index."
msgstr ""
"すべての文字テーブルは、任意の有効な文字コードをインデックスとして格納できる"
"容量を備えているため、文字テーブルの長さを指定する引数はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">subtype</var> has the <code class=\"code\">char-table-"
"extra-slots</code> symbol property, that specifies the number of extra slots "
"in the char-table.  This should be an integer between 0 and 10; otherwise, "
"<code class=\"code\">make-char-table</code> raises an error.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">subtype</var> has no <code class=\"code\">char-table-extra-"
"slots</code> symbol property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Property-"
"Lists.html\">Property Lists</a>), the char-table has no extra slots."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">subtype</var> が <code class=\"code\">char-table-extra-"
"slots</code> シンボルプロパティを持つ場合、これにより文字テーブル内の追加ス"
"ロット数が指定されます。この値は 0 から 10 までの整数である必要があり、そうで"
"ない場合は <code class=\"code\">make-char-table</code> がエラーを発生させま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">subtype</var> が <code class=\"code\">char-table-"
"extra-slots</code> シンボルプロパティを持たない場合（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Property-Lists.html\">プロパティリスト</a> を参照）、文字テーブルに追"
"加スロットはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-table-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dtable_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-table-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dtable_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a char-table, and <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が文字テーブルであれば <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでなければ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-table-subtype</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char-"
"table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"char_002dtable_002dsubtype\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-table-subtype</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char-"
"table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"char_002dtable_002dsubtype\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the subtype symbol of <var class=\"var\">char-table</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">char-table</var> のサブタイプシンボルを返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"There is no special function to access default values in a char-table.  To "
"do that, use <code class=\"code\">char-table-range</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"char-table のデフォルト値にアクセスするための特別な関数はありません。その場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">char-table-range</code> を使用してください（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-table-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char-"
"table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"char_002dtable_002dparent\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-table-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char-"
"table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"char_002dtable_002dparent\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the parent of <var class=\"var\">char-table</var>.  "
"The parent is always either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or another char-"
"table."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">char-table</var> の親を返します。親は常に "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> または別の char-table のいずれかです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-char-table-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char-"
"table new-parent</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dchar_002dtable_002dparent\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-char-table-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char-"
"table new-parent</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dchar_002dtable_002dparent\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the parent of <var class=\"var\">char-table</var> to <var "
"class=\"var\">new-parent</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">char-table</var> の親を <var "
