"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Char_002dTables.html
msgid ""
"The return value is always <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; to make calls to "
"<code class=\"code\">map-char-table</code> useful, <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> should have side effects.  For example, here is "
"how to examine the elements of the syntax table:"
