msgstr ""
"<span>31.2.1 キャラクターによる動き<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Motion-"
"by-Characters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"These functions move point based on a count of characters.  <code "
"class=\"code\">goto-char</code> is the fundamental primitive; the other "
"functions use that."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、文字数に基づいてポイントを移動させます。<code "
"class=\"code\">goto-char</code>が基本プリミティブであり、他の関数はそれを利用"
"しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">goto-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-goto_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">goto-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-goto_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This function sets point in the current buffer to the value <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファの現在位置を値 <var class=\"var\">position</var> に"
"設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If narrowing is in effect, <var class=\"var\">position</var> still counts "
"from the beginning of the buffer, but point cannot go outside the accessible "
"portion.  If <var class=\"var\">position</var> is out of range, <code "
"class=\"code\">goto-char</code> moves point to the beginning or the end of "
"the accessible portion."
msgstr ""
"ナローイングが有効な場合、<var class=\"var\">position</var> は引き続きバッ"
"ファの先頭からカウントされますが、ポイントはアクセス可能な範囲外に移動するこ"
"とはできません。<var class=\"var\">position</var> が範囲外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">goto-char</code> はポイントをアクセス可能な範囲の先頭または末"
"尾に移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"When this function is called interactively, <var class=\"var\">position</"
"var> is the numeric prefix argument, if provided; otherwise it is read from "
"the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数が対話的に呼び出された場合、<var class=\"var\">position</var> は数値"
"の接頭辞引数（指定されている場合）となり、そうでない場合はミニバッファから読"
"み込まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">goto-char</code> returns <var class=\"var\">position</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">goto-char</code> は <var class=\"var\">position</var> を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-forward_002dchar\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-forward_002dchar\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point <var class=\"var\">count</var> characters forward, "
"towards the end of the buffer (or backward, towards the beginning of the "
"buffer, if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative).  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the default is "
"1."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポインタを <var class=\"var\">count</var> 文字分、バッファの末尾"
"方向へ進めます（<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の場合は、バッファの先頭方"
"向へ戻します）。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、デフォルト値は 1 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If this attempts to move past the beginning or end of the buffer (or the "
"limits of the accessible portion, when narrowing is in effect), it signals "
"an error with error symbol <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">end-of-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"これがバッファの先頭または末尾（あるいはナローイングが有効な場合はアクセス可"
"能な領域の境界）を越えようとした場合、エラーシンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> または <code class=\"code\">end-of-"
"buffer</code> でエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Motion.html
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html build/html/elisp/Text-Lines.html
