# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span>34.6 Character Properties<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Character-"
"Properties-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>34.6 文字プロパティ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Character-"
"Properties-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-properties\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-properties\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">character property</em> is a named attribute of a "
"character that specifies how the character behaves and how it should be "
"handled during text processing and display.  Thus, character properties are "
"an important part of specifying the character&rsquo;s semantics."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">文字プロパティ</em>とは、文字の名前付き属性であり、テキスト"
"処理や表示時にその文字がどのように振る舞い、どのように扱われるべきかを規定す"
"るものです。したがって、文字プロパティは文字のセマンティクスを規定する上で重"
"要な要素となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"On the whole, Emacs follows the Unicode Standard in its implementation of "
"character properties.  In particular, Emacs supports the <a class=\"uref\" "
"href=\"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr23/\">Unicode Character Property "
"Model</a>, and the Emacs character property database is derived from the "
"Unicode Character Database (<abbr class=\"acronym\">UCD</abbr>).  See the <a "
"class=\"uref\" href=\"https://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode15.0.0/"
"ch04.pdf\">Character Properties chapter of the Unicode Standard</a>, for a "
"detailed description of Unicode character properties and their meaning.  "
"This section assumes you are already familiar with that chapter of the "
"Unicode Standard, and want to apply that knowledge to Emacs Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"概して、Emacsは文字プロパティの実装においてUnicode標準に準拠しています。具体"
"的には、Emacsは<a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://www.unicode.org/reports/"
"tr23/\">Unicode文字プロパティモデル</a>をサポートしており、Emacsの文字プロパ"
"ティデータベースはUnicode文字データベース（<abbr class=\"acronym\">UCD</"
"abbr>）から派生しています。Unicode文字プロパティとその意味に関する詳細な説明"
"については、<a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://www.unicode.org/versions/"
"Unicode15.0.0/ch04.pdf\">Unicode標準の「文字プロパティ」章</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。本節では、読者がすでにUnicode標準の同章に精通しており、その知識をEmacs "
"Lispプログラムに適用したいと考えていることを前提としています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"In Emacs, each property has a name, which is a symbol, and a set of possible "
"values, whose types depend on the property; if a character does not have a "
"certain property, the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  As a "
"general rule, the names of character properties in Emacs are produced from "
"the corresponding Unicode properties by downcasing them and replacing each "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">_</samp>&rsquo; character with a dash &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;.  For example, <code "
"class=\"code\">Canonical_Combining_Class</code> becomes <code "
"class=\"code\">canonical-combining-class</code>.  However, sometimes we "
"shorten the names to make their use easier."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、各プロパティにはシンボルである名前と、プロパティに応じて型が決まる"
"取り得る値の集合があります。文字が特定のプロパティを持たない場合、その値は"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。原則として、Emacsにおける文字プロ"
"パティの名前は、対応するUnicodeプロパティを小文字化し、各&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">_</samp>&rsquo;文字をハイフン&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo;に置き換えることで生成されます。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">Canonical_Combining_Class</code>は<code "
"class=\"code\">canonical-combining-class</code>になります。ただし、利用しやす"
"くするために名前を短縮する場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unassigned-character-codepoints\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unassigned-character-codepoints\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Some codepoints are left <em class=\"dfn\">unassigned</em> by the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UCD</abbr>&mdash;they don&rsquo;t correspond to any "
"character.  The Unicode Standard defines default values of properties for "
"such codepoints; they are mentioned below for each property."
msgstr ""
"一部のコードポイントは、<abbr class=\"acronym\">UCD</abbr>によって<em "
"class=\"dfn\">未割り当て</em>のままとなっており、いかなる文字にも対応していま"
"せん。Unicode標準では、こうしたコードポイントに対するプロパティのデフォルト値"
"を定義しており、各プロパティについて以下に記載しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Here is the full list of value types for all the character properties that "
"Emacs knows about:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsが認識しているすべての文字プロパティの値型の一覧は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the <code class=\"code\">Name</code> Unicode property.  The "
"value is a string consisting of upper-case Latin letters A to Z, digits, "
"spaces, and hyphen &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; characters.  "
"For unassigned codepoints, the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeプロパティ <code class=\"code\">Name</code> に対応します。値は、英大文"
"字 A から Z、数字、スペース、およびハイフン &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo; 文字からなる文字列です。未割り当てのコードポイントの場合、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-unicode-general-category\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">general-category</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-unicode-general-category\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-unicode-general-category\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">general-category</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-unicode-general-category\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the <code class=\"code\">General_Category</code> Unicode "
"property.  The value is a symbol whose name is a 2-letter abbreviation of "
"the character&rsquo;s classification.  For unassigned codepoints, the value "
"is <code class=\"code\">Cn</code>."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeプロパティ <code class=\"code\">General_Category</code> に対応します。"
"値は、文字の分類を2文字の略称で表したシンボルです。未割り当てのコードポイント"
"の場合、値は <code class=\"code\">Cn</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">canonical-combining-class</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">canonical-combining-class</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the <code class=\"code\">Canonical_Combining_Class</code> "
"Unicode property.  The value is an integer.  For unassigned codepoints, the "
"value is zero."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeプロパティ <code class=\"code\">Canonical_Combining_Class</code> に対"
"応します。値は整数です。未割り当てのコードポイントの場合、値は 0 となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-bidirectional-class-of-characters\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">bidi-class</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bidirectional-class-of-characters\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-bidirectional-class-of-characters\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">bidi-class</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bidirectional-class-of-characters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the Unicode <code class=\"code\">Bidi_Class</code> property.  "
"The value is a symbol whose name is the Unicode <em "
"class=\"dfn\">directional type</em> of the character.  Emacs uses this "
"property when it reorders bidirectional text for display (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">Bidirectional Display</"
"a>).  For unassigned codepoints, the value depends on the code blocks to "
"which the codepoint belongs: most unassigned codepoints get the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">L</code> (strong L), but some get values of <code "
"class=\"code\">AL</code> (Arabic letter)  or <code class=\"code\">R</code> "
"(strong R)."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeの<code class=\"code\">Bidi_Class</code>プロパティに対応します。値は、"
"その文字のUnicode<em class=\"dfn\">方向タイプ</em>を名称とするシンボルです。"
"Emacsは、表示用に双方向テキストを再配置する際にこのプロパティを使用します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">双方向表示</a>を参"
