# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the Unicode <code class=\"code\">Bidi_Mirrored</code> "
"property.  The value of this property is a symbol, either <code "
"class=\"code\">Y</code> or <code class=\"code\">N</code>.  For unassigned "
"codepoints, the value is <code class=\"code\">N</code>."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeの<code class=\"code\">Bidi_Mirrored</code>プロパティに対応します。こ"
"のプロパティの値は、<code class=\"code\">Y</code>または<code "
"class=\"code\">N</code>のいずれかの記号です。未割り当てのコードポイントの場"
"合、値は<code class=\"code\">N</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">mirroring</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">mirroring</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to the Unicode <code class=\"code\">Bidi_Mirroring_Glyph</code> "
"property.  The value of this property is a character whose glyph represents "
"the mirror image of the character&rsquo;s glyph, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if there&rsquo;s no defined mirroring glyph.  All "
"the characters whose <code class=\"code\">mirrored</code> property is <code "
"class=\"code\">N</code> have <code class=\"code\">nil</code> as their <code "
"class=\"code\">mirroring</code> property; however, some characters whose "
"<code class=\"code\">mirrored</code> property is <code class=\"code\">Y</"
"code> also have <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <code "
"class=\"code\">mirroring</code>, because no appropriate characters exist "
"with mirrored glyphs.  Emacs uses this property to display mirror images of "
"characters when appropriate (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-"
"Display.html\">Bidirectional Display</a>).  For unassigned codepoints, the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeの<code class=\"code\">Bidi_Mirroring_Glyph</code>プロパティに対応しま"
"す。このプロパティの値は、そのグリフが文字のグリフの鏡像を表す文字、あるいは"
"鏡像グリフが定義されていない場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"
"<code class=\"code\">mirrored</code>プロパティが<code class=\"code\">N</code>"
"であるすべての文字は、<code class=\"code\">mirroring</code>プロパティとして"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を持ちます。ただし、<code "
"class=\"code\">mirrored</code>プロパティが<code class=\"code\">Y</code>である"
"文字の中には、鏡像グリフを持つ適切な文字が存在しないため、<code "
"class=\"code\">mirroring</code>として<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を持つも"
"のもあります。Emacsはこのプロパティを使用して、適切な場合に文字の鏡像を表示し"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">双方向表示</a>を"
"参照）。未割り当てのコードポイントの場合、値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
