# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">special-uppercase</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">special-uppercase</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to Unicode language- and context-independent special upper-"
"casing rules.  The value of this property is a string (which may be empty).  "
"For example for U+00DF <small class=\"sc\">LATIN SMALL LETTER SHARP S</"
"small> the value is <code class=\"code\">&quot;SS&quot;</code>.  This "
"mapping overrides the <code class=\"code\">uppercase</code> property, and "
"thus the current case table.  For characters with no special mapping, the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means the <code "
"class=\"code\">uppercase</code> property needs to be consulted instead."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeの言語およびコンテキストに依存しない特殊な大文字化ルールに対応します。"
"このプロパティの値は文字列（空の場合もあり）です。例えば、U+00DF <small "
"class=\"sc\">LATIN SMALL LETTER SHARP S</small> の場合、値は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;SS&quot;</code> となります。このマッピングは <code "
"class=\"code\">uppercase</code> プロパティ、ひいては現在のケーステーブルを上"
"書きします。特別なマッピングがない文字の場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となり、代わりに <code class=\"code\">uppercase</code> プロパティを参照"
"する必要があることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">special-lowercase</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">special-lowercase</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to Unicode language- and context-independent special lower-"
"casing rules.  The value of this property is a string (which may be empty).  "
"For example for U+0130 <small class=\"sc\">LATIN CAPITAL LETTER I WITH DOT "
"ABOVE</small> the value is <code class=\"code\">&quot;i\\u0307&quot;</code> "
"(i.e., a 2-character string consisting of <small class=\"sc\">LATIN SMALL "
"LETTER I</small> followed by U+0307 <small class=\"sc\">COMBINING DOT ABOVE</"
"small>).  This mapping overrides the <code class=\"code\">lowercase</code> "
"property, and thus the current case table.  For characters with no special "
"mapping, the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means the <code "
"class=\"code\">lowercase</code> property needs to be consulted instead."
msgstr ""
"Unicodeの言語およびコンテキストに依存しない特殊な小文字化ルールに対応します。"
"このプロパティの値は文字列（空の場合もあります）です。例えば、U+0130 <small "
"class=\"sc\">LATIN CAPITAL LETTER I WITH DOT ABOVE</small> の場合、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;i\\u0307&quot;</code>（すなわち、<small "
"class=\"sc\">LATIN SMALL LETTER I</small> に続いて U+0307 <small "
"class=\"sc\">COMBINING DOT ABOVE</small> が続く2文字の文字列）となります。こ"
"のマッピングは <code class=\"code\">lowercase</code> プロパティ、ひいては現在"
