# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Corresponds to Unicode unconditional special title-casing rules.  The value "
"of this property is a string (which may be empty).  For example for U+FB01 "
"<small class=\"sc\">LATIN SMALL LIGATURE FI</small> the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;Fi&quot;</code>.  This mapping overrides the <code "
"class=\"code\">titlecase</code> property, and thus the current case table.  "
"For characters with no special mapping, the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means the <code class=\"code\">titlecase</"
"code> property needs to be consulted instead."
msgstr ""
