"to obtain the list of all the scripts known to Emacs.  Note that "
"Emacs&rsquo;s classification of characters into scripts is not a 1-for-1 "
"reflection of the Unicode standard, for example there is no &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">symbol</samp>&rsquo; script in Unicode."
