"name\">printable-chars</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"printable_002dchars\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">printable-chars</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"printable_002dchars\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Character-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a char-table that specifies, for each "
"character, whether it is printable or not.  That is, if evaluating <code "
"class=\"code\">(aref printable-chars char)</code> results in <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, the character is printable, and if it results in "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it is not.  The definition of what is a "
"printable character is the same as for the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[:print:]</samp>&rsquo; character class in regular "
"expressions, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char-Classes.html\">Character "
"Classes</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、各文字について印字可能か否かを指定する文字テーブルです。つま"
"り、<code class=\"code\">(aref printable-chars char)</code> を評価した結果が "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> であればその文字は印字可能であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> であれば印字不可能です。印字可能な文字の定義は、正"
"規表現における &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[:print:]</samp>&rsquo; 文字クラス"
"と同様です。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char-Classes.html\">文字クラス</a>を参"
"照してください。"

