"class=\"samp\">&lt;..&gt;</samp>&rsquo; brackets, but the tag names in Emacs "
"do not include the brackets; e.g., Unicode specifies &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;small&gt;</samp>&rsquo; where Emacs uses &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">small</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
