# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"The behavior of buffer display actions (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>) "
"can be further modified by the following user options."
msgstr ""
"バッファ表示操作（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表"
"示用のウィンドウの選択</a>を参照）の動作は、以下のユーザーオプションでさらに"
"変更できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pop-up-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">pop-up-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dup_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> is allowed to split an existing window "
"to make a new window for displaying in.  This is the default."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は既存のウィンドウを分割して、表示用の新"
"しいウィンドウを作成することができます。これがデフォルトです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable is provided for backward compatibility only.  It is obeyed by "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> via a special mechanism in <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>, which calls the action "
"function <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-window</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">Action "
"Functions for Buffer Display</a>) when the value of this option is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It is not consulted by <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-window</code> itself, which the user "
"may specify directly in <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> etc."
msgstr ""
"この変数は後方互換性のためだけに提供されています。<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"fallback-action</code> 内の特殊な機構を通じてこの変数に従い、このオプションの"
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合には、アクション関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-window</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">バッファ表示用アクション関数</"
"a> を参照）を呼び出します。<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-"
"window</code> 自体はこの変数を参照せず、ユーザーは <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> などで直接指定することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-preferred-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dpreferred_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">split-window-preferred-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"split_002dwindow_002dpreferred_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies a function for splitting a window, in order to make "
"a new window for displaying a buffer.  It is used by the <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-window</code> action function to "
"actually split the window."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、バッファ表示用の新しいウィンドウを作成するために、ウィンドウを分"
"割する関数を指定します。これは、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-"
"window</code> アクション関数によって実際にウィンドウを分割する際に使用されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a function that takes one argument, a window, and returns "
"either a new window (which will be used to display the desired buffer) or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (which means the splitting failed).  The "
"default value is <code class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</code>, which is "
"documented next."
msgstr ""
"この値は、ウィンドウを1つの引数として受け取り、新しいウィンドウ（目的のバッ"
"ファの表示に使用されます）または <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（分割に失敗"
"したことを意味します）のいずれかを返す関数である必要があります。デフォルト値"
"は <code class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</code> であり、これについては次"
"に説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-sensibly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dsensibly\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-sensibly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dsensibly\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This function tries to split <var class=\"var\">window</var> and return the "
"newly created window.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> cannot be split, "
"it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the "
"selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">window</var> を分割し、新たに作成されたウィンド"
"ウを返そうとします。<var class=\"var\">window</var> を分割できない場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"が省略されているか、あるいは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、選択中"
"のウィンドウがデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This function obeys the usual rules that determine when a window may be "
"split (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Splitting-Windows.html\">Splitting "
"Windows</a>).  It first tries either a vertical split by placing the new "
"window below, subject to the restriction imposed by <code "
"class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> (see below), or a horizontal "
"split that places the new window to the right, subject to <code "
"class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code>, in addition to any other "
"restrictions.  Whether it tries first to split vertically or horizontally "
"depends on the value of the user option <code class=\"code\">split-window-"
"preferred-direction</code>.  If splitting along the first dimension fails, "
"it tries to split along the other dimension.  If that also fails, and the "
"window is the only window on its frame, this function again tries to split "
"and place the new window below, disregarding <code class=\"code\">split-"
"height-threshold</code>.  If this fails as well, this function gives up and "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウを分割できるタイミングを決定する通常のルールに従います"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Splitting-Windows.html\">ウィンドウの分割</a>を参"
"照）。まず、<code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code>による制約（後"
"述）に従い、新しいウィンドウを下に配置する垂直分割か、あるいは<code "
"class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code>およびその他の制約に従い、新しい"
"ウィンドウを右側に配置する水平分割のいずれかを試みます。最初に垂直分割を試み"
"るか水平分割を試みるかは、ユーザーオプション<code class=\"code\">split-"
"window-preferred-direction</code>の値によって決まります。第1次元に沿った分割"
"が失敗した場合は、もう一方の次元に沿った分割を試みます。それも失敗し、かつそ"
"のウィンドウがフレーム上の唯一のウィンドウである場合、この関数は再び分割を試"
"み、<code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code>を無視して新しいウィン"
"ドウを下に配置します。これも失敗した場合、この関数は処理を断念し、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-height-threshold</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dheight_002dthreshold\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">split-height-threshold</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dheight_002dthreshold\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies whether <code class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</"
"code> is allowed to split the window placing the new window below.  If it is "
"an integer, that means to split only if the original window has at least "
"that many lines.  If it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means not "
"to split this way."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</code> がウィンドウを"
"分割して新しいウィンドウを下に配置することを許可するかどうかを指定します。整"
"数の場合は、元のウィンドウに少なくともその行数がある場合にのみ分割することを"
"意味します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、この方法で分割しないこ"
"とを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-width-threshold</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwidth_002dthreshold\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">split-width-threshold</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwidth_002dthreshold\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies whether <code class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</"
"code> is allowed to split the window placing the new window to the right.  "
"If the value is an integer, that means to split only if the original window "
"has at least that many columns.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that means not to split this way."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</code> がウィンドウを"
"分割して新しいウィンドウを右側に配置することを許可するかどうかを指定します。"
"値が整数の場合、元のウィンドウに少なくともその列数がある場合にのみ分割するこ"
"とを意味します。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、この方法で分割し"
"ないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-preferred-direction</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dpreferred_002ddirection\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">split-window-preferred-direction</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"split_002dwindow_002dpreferred_002ddirection\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable determines the first dimension along which <code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-sensibly</code> tries to split the window, if "
"the window could be split both vertically and horizontally, as determined by "
"the values of <code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code>.  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">longest</code>, which means to split vertically if the height "
"of the window&rsquo;s frame is greater or equal to its width, and "
"horizontally otherwise.  The values <code class=\"code\">vertical</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">horizontal</code> specify the direction in which to "
"attempt the first split."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code> の値によってウィンドウを垂直方向"
"と水平方向の両方に分割可能と判断された場合に、<code class=\"code\">split-"
"window-sensibly</code> がウィンドウを分割しようとする最初の次元を決定します。"
"デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">longest</code> であり、これはウィンドウフ"
"レームの高さが幅以上であれば垂直方向に、それ以外の場合は水平方向に分割するこ"
"とを意味します。<code class=\"code\">vertical</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">horizontal</code> の値は、最初の分割を試みる方向を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">even-window-sizes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"even_002dwindow_002dsizes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">even-window-sizes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-even_002dwindow_002dsizes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, causes <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> to even window sizes whenever it reuses "
"an existing window, and that window is adjacent to the selected one."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>は既存のウィンドウを再利用する際にウィン"
"ドウサイズを偶数にし、そのウィンドウは選択中のウィンドウに隣接します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"If its value is <code class=\"code\">width-only</code>, sizes are evened "
"only if the reused window is on the left or right of the selected one and "
"the selected window is wider than the reused one.  If its value is <code "
"class=\"code\">height-only</code> sizes are evened only if the reused window "
"is above or beneath the selected window and the selected window is higher "
"than the reused one.  Any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value "
"means to even sizes in any of these cases provided the selected window is "
"larger than the reused one in the sense of their combination."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">width-only</code> の場合、再利用ウィンドウが選択"
"ウィンドウの左側または右側にあり、かつ選択ウィンドウが再利用ウィンドウよりも"
"広い場合にのみ、サイズが均等化されます。値が <code class=\"code\">height-"
"only</code> の場合、再利用ウィンドウが選択ウィンドウの上側または下側にあり、"
"かつ選択ウィンドウが再利用ウィンドウよりも高い場合にのみ、サイズが均等化され"
"ます。それ以外の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値は、選択ウィンドウが"
"組み合わせの観点から再利用ウィンドウよりも大きい場合に限り、これらのいずれか"
"のケースでサイズを均等化することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pop-up-frames</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dframes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">pop-up-frames</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dup_002dframes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that "
"means <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> may display buffers by "
"making new frames.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は新しいフレームを作成することでバッファ"
"を表示することがあります。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"A non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value also means that when <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> is looking for a window already "
"displaying <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>, it can search any "
"visible or iconified frame, not just the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値は、<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> が既に <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を表示している"
"ウィンドウを探す際、選択中のフレームだけでなく、表示されているフレームやアイ"
"コン化されたフレームであればどれでも検索できることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"An entry by the same name in <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code>&rsquo;s <var class=\"var\">alist</var> takes precedence over the "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>の<var class=\"var\">alist</var>に"
"ある同名のエントリは、変数よりも優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable is provided mainly for backward compatibility.  It is obeyed "
"by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> via a special mechanism in "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>, which calls the "
"action function <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">Action "
"Functions for Buffer Display</a>) if the value is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  (This is done before attempting to split a "
"window.)  This variable is not consulted by <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-pop-up-frame</code> itself, which the user may specify directly in "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> etc."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、主に後方互換性のために提供されています。<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"fallback-action</code> 内の特殊な機構を通じてこの変数に従い、値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合には、アクション関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">バッファ表示用アクション関数</"
"a> を参照）を呼び出します。（これはウィンドウを分割しようとする前に行われま"
"す。）この変数は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> 自身"
"では参照されず、ユーザーは <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> "
"などで直接指定することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pop-up-frame-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dup_002dframe_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">pop-up-frame-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dup_002dframe_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies a function for creating a new frame, in order to "
"make a new window for displaying a buffer.  It is used by the <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> action function."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、バッファ表示用の新しいウィンドウを作成するための、新規フレーム生"
"成関数を指定します。これは<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</"
"code>アクション関数で使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a function that takes no arguments and returns a frame, "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if no frame could be created.  The "
"default value is a function that creates a frame using the parameters "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"値は、引数を取らずにフレームを返すか、あるいはフレームを作成できなかった場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す関数である必要があります。デフォルト"
"値は、<code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code> で指定されたパラメータ"
"（後述）を用いてフレームを作成する関数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pop-up-frame-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dframe_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">pop-up-frame-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dup_002dframe_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds an alist of frame parameters (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frame-Parameters.html\">Frame Parameters</a>), which is used by the "
"function specified by <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-function</code> to "
"make a new frame.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数にはフレームパラメータ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Parameters.html\">フレームパラメータ</a>を参照）のalistが格納されており、"
"<code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-function</code>で指定された関数がこれを用い"
"て新しいフレームを作成します。デフォルトは<code class=\"code\">nil</code>で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This option is provided for backward compatibility only.  Note, that when "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> calls the function "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-function</code>, it prepends "
"the value of all <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-parameters</code> action "
"alist entries to <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code> so that the "
"values specified by the action alist entry effectively override any "
"corresponding values of <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code>."
msgstr ""
"このオプションは後方互換性のためにのみ提供されています。なお、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-function</code> で指定された関数を呼び出す際、す"
"べての <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-parameters</code> アクションアリスト"
"エントリの値が <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code> の先頭に付加さ"
"れるため、アクションアリストエントリで指定された値が、<code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code> の対応する値を実質的に上書きすること"
"になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"Hence, users should set up a <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-parameters</"
"code> action alist entry in <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> "
"instead of customizing <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code>.  Only "
"this will guarantee that the value of a parameter specified by the user "
"overrides the value of that parameter specified by the caller of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"したがって、ユーザーは<code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code>をカスタ"
"マイズするのではなく、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>に"
"<code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-parameters</code>アクションリストのエントリ"
"を設定すべきです。そうすることで初めて、ユーザーが指定したパラメータの値が、"
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>の呼び出し元が指定した同パラメータ"
"の値を上書きすることが保証されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"Many efforts in the design of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> "
"have been given to maintain compatibility with code that uses older options "
"like <code class=\"code\">pop-up-windows</code>, <code class=\"code\">pop-up-"
"frames</code>, <code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">same-window-buffer-names</code> and <code class=\"code\">same-"
"window-regexps</code>.  Lisp Programs and users should refrain from using "
"these options.  Above we already warned against customizing <code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code>.  Here we describe how to convert "
"the remaining options to use display actions instead."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> の設計にあたっては、<code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-windows</code>、<code class=\"code\">pop-up-frames</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">same-window-buffer-names</code>、<code class=\"code\">same-"
"window-regexps</code> といった旧来のオプションを使用するコードとの互換性を維"
"持するため、多くの工夫が凝らされてきました。Lisp プログラムおよびユーザーは、"
"これらのオプションの使用を控えるべきです。前述の通り、<code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-frame-alist</code> のカスタマイズについては既に警告しま"
"した。ここでは、残りのオプションを代わりに表示アクションを使用するように変換"
"する方法について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-pop_002dup_002dwindows_002c-replacement-for\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-windows</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dwindows_002c-replacement-for\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-pop_002dup_002dwindows_002c-replacement-for\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-windows</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dwindows_002c-replacement-for\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"This variable is <code class=\"code\">t</code> by default.  Instead of "
"customizing it to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and thus telling <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> what not to do, it&rsquo;s much better "
"to list in <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> the action "
"functions it should try instead as, for example:"
msgstr ""
"この変数はデフォルトで <code class=\"code\">t</code> となっています。これを "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> にカスタマイズして <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> に「やってはいけないこと」を伝えるのでは"
"なく、代わりに試すべきアクション関数を <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"base-action</code> に列挙する方がはるかに好ましいです。例えば次のように記述し"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-base-action\n"
" '((display-buffer-reuse-window display-buffer-same-window\n"
"    display-buffer-in-previous-window\n"
"    display-buffer-use-some-window)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-pop_002dup_002dframes_002c-replacement-for\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-frames</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dframes_002c-replacement-for\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-pop_002dup_002dframes_002c-replacement-for\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pop-up-frames</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pop_002dup_002dframes_002c-replacement-for\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"Instead of customizing this variable to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, you "
"can customize <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code>, for "
