# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window-Options.html
msgid ""
"Instead of adding a buffer name or a regular expression to one of these "
"options use a <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> entry for "
"that buffer specifying the action function <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-same-window</code>."
msgstr ""
"これらのオプションのいずれかにバッファ名や正規表現を追加する代わりに、その"
