# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.15.1 Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Choosing-a-Window-for-Displaying-a-Buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.15.1 バッファ表示用のウィンドウの選択<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Choosing-a-Window-for-Displaying-a-Buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> flexibly chooses a "
"window for display, and displays a specified buffer in that window.  It can "
"be called interactively, via the key binding <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-o</"
"kbd>.  It is also used as a subroutine by many functions and commands, "
"including <code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Switching-"
"Buffers.html\">Switching to a Buffer in a Window</a>)."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は、表示するウィンドウを"
"柔軟に選択し、そのウィンドウに指定したバッファを表示します。キーバインド "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-o</kbd> を介して対話的に呼び出すことができます。ま"
"た、<code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> や <code class=\"code\">pop-"
"to-buffer</code> を含む多くの関数やコマンドでサブルーチンとしても利用されてい"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">ウィンドウ内のバッ"
"ファへの切り替え</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-display-display-action\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-action\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-display-display-action\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-action\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"This command performs several complex steps to find a window to display in.  "
"These steps are described by means of <em class=\"dfn\">display actions</"
"em>, which have the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">functions</"
"var> . <var class=\"var\">alist</var>)</code>.  Here, <var "
"class=\"var\">functions</var> is either a single function or a list of "
"functions, referred to as &ldquo;action functions&rdquo; (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">Action "
"Functions for Buffer Display</a>); and <var class=\"var\">alist</var> is an "
"association list, referred to as &ldquo;action alist&rdquo; (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html\">Action Alists for "
"Buffer Display</a>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"The-Zen-of-Buffer-"
"Display.html\">The Zen of Buffer Display</a>, for samples of display actions."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、表示先のウィンドウを見つけるために、いくつかの複雑な手順を実"
"行します。これらの手順は<em class=\"dfn\">表示アクション</em>を用いて記述さ"
"れ、<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">functions</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var>)</code>という形式をとります。ここで、<var "
"class=\"var\">functions</var>は単一の関数または関数のリストであり、「アクショ"
"ン関数」と呼ばれます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Functions.html\">バッファ表示用のアクション関数</a>を参照）。また、<var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var>は連想リストであり、「アクションアリスト」と呼ばれま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html\">バッファ表"
"示用のアクションアリスト</a>を参照）。表示アクションの例については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"The-Zen-of-Buffer-Display.html\">バッファ表示の禅</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"An action function accepts two arguments: the buffer to display and an "
"action alist.  It attempts to display the buffer in some window, picking or "
"creating a window according to its own criteria.  If successful, it returns "
"the window; otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"アクション関数は、表示対象のバッファとアクションのalistという2つの引数を受け"
"取ります。独自の基準に従ってウィンドウを選択または作成し、いずれかのウィンド"
"ウにバッファを表示しようと試みます。成功した場合はそのウィンドウを返し、そう"
"でない場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> works by combining display "
"actions from several sources, and calling the action functions in turn, "
"until one of them manages to display the buffer and returns a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>は、複数のソースからの表示アクショ"
"ンを組み合わせ、いずれかがバッファの表示に成功して<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>以外の値を返すまで、順次アクション関数を呼び出すことで動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-"
"name &amp;optional action frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-"
"name &amp;optional action frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"This command makes <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> appear in some "
"window, without selecting the window or making the buffer current.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> must be a buffer or the "
"name of an existing buffer.  The return value is the window chosen to "
"display the buffer, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if no suitable window "
"was found."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ウィンドウを選択したりバッファをカレントにしたりすることな"
"く、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> をいずれかのウィンドウに表示しま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> には、バッファまたは既存の"
"バッファ名を指定する必要があります。戻り値は、バッファの表示に選択されたウィ"
"ンドウ、または適切なウィンドウが見つからなかった場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">action</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, should normally be a display action (described "
"above).  <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> builds a list of action "
"functions and an action alist, by consolidating display actions from the "
"following sources (in order of their precedence, from highest to lowest):"
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">action</var> は、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、通常は表示アクション（前述）である必要があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は、以下のソース（優先順位の高い順に）か"
"ら表示アクションを集約することで、アクション関数のリストとアクションアリスト"
"を作成します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code>."
msgstr "変数 <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid "The user option <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>."
msgstr "ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid "The variable <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code>."
msgstr "変数 <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid "The <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument."
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid "The user option <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code>."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The constant <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>."
msgstr "定数 <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"In practice this means that <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> "
"builds a list of all action functions specified by these display actions.  "
"The first element of this list is the first action function specified by "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code>, if any.  Its "
"last element is <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</"
"code>&mdash;the last action function specified by <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>.  Duplicates are not "
"removed from this list&mdash;hence one and the same action function may be "
"called multiple times during one call of <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"実際には、これは <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> がこれらの表示ア"
"クションで指定されたすべてのアクション関数のリストを作成することを意味しま"
"す。このリストの最初の要素は、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-"
"action</code> で指定された最初のアクション関数（もしあれば）です。最後の要素"
"は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code>&mdash;<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code> で指定された最後のアク"
"ション関数です。このリストから重複は削除されません&mdash;したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> を1回呼び出す間に、同一のアクション関数"
"が複数回呼び出される可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> calls the action functions "
"specified by this list in turn, passing the buffer as the first argument and "
"the combined action alist as the second argument, until one of the functions "
"returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html\">Precedence of Action Functions</"
"a>, for examples how display actions specified by different sources are "
"processed by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は、このリストで指定されたアクショ"
"ン関数を順に呼び出し、第1引数にバッファを、第2引数に結合されたアクションアリ"
"スタを渡し、いずれかの関数が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すまで処"
"理を続けます。異なるソースで指定された表示アクションが <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> によってどのように処理されるかの例につい"
"ては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html\">アクショ"
"ン関数の優先順位</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"Note that the second argument is always the list of <em class=\"emph\">all</"
"em> action alist entries specified by the sources named above.  Hence, the "
"first element of that list is the first action alist entry specified by "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code>, if any.  Its "
"last element is the last alist entry of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"base-action</code>, if any (the action alist of <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-fallback-action</code> is empty)."
msgstr ""
"なお、第2引数は、常に上記で指定されたソースによって指定される<em "
"class=\"emph\">すべて</em>のアクションalistエントリのリストとなります。した"
"がって、そのリストの最初の要素は、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"overriding-action</code>で指定された最初のアクションalistエントリ（もしあれ"
"ば）となります。最後の要素は、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-"
"action</code>の最後のalistエントリ（もしあれば）となります（<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>のアクションalistは空で"
"す）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"Note also, that the combined action alist may contain duplicate entries and "
"entries for the same key with different values.  As a rule, action functions "
"always use the first association of a key they find.  Hence, the association "
"an action function uses is not necessarily the association provided by the "
"display action that specified that action function,"
msgstr ""
"また、統合されたアクションリストには、重複したエントリや、同一キーに対して異"
"なる値を持つエントリが含まれる場合がある点にも注意してください。原則として、"
"アクション関数は常に、最初に見つかったキーの関連付けを使用します。したがっ"
"て、アクション関数が使用する関連付けは、必ずしもそのアクション関数を指定した"
"表示アクションによって提供された関連付けであるとは限りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">action</var> can also have a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, non-list value.  This has the special meaning "
"that the buffer should be displayed in a window other than the selected one, "
"even if the selected window is already displaying it.  If called "
"interactively with a prefix argument, <var class=\"var\">action</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>.  Lisp programs should always supply a list "
"value."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">action</var> には、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"もリストでもない値を指定することも可能です。これは、選択中のウィンドウですで"
"に表示されていたとしても、バッファを選択中のウィンドウ以外のウィンドウに表示"
"させるという特別な意味を持ちます。接頭辞引数を用いて対話的に呼び出された場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">action</var> は <code class=\"code\">t</code> となりま"
"す。Lisp プログラムでは、常にリスト値を指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">frame</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies which frames to check when deciding "
"whether the buffer is already displayed.  It is equivalent to adding an "
"element <code class=\"code\">(reusable-frames&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>)</code> to the action alist of <var "
"class=\"var\">action</var> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-"
"Action-Alists.html\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a>).  The <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> argument is provided for compatibility reasons, "
"Lisp programs should not use it."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">frame</var> は、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、バッファが既に表示されているかを判定する際にどのフレームを"
"確認するかを指定します。これは、<var class=\"var\">action</var> のアクション"
"アリスタに要素 <code class=\"code\">(reusable-frames&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>)</code> を追加することと同等です（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html\">バッファ表示用のア"
"クションアリスタ</a> を参照）。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> 引数は互換性の"
"ために用意されており、Lisp プログラムで使用すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-overriding-action</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer_002doverriding_002daction\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-overriding-action</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer_002doverriding_002daction\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable should be a display action, which is treated with "
"the highest priority by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>.  The "
"default value is an empty display action, i.e., <code "
"class=\"code\">(nil&nbsp;.&nbsp;nil)</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は表示アクションである必要があり、<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> によって最優先で処理されます。デフォルト値は空の表示アクショ"
"ン、すなわち <code class=\"code\">(nil&nbsp;.&nbsp;nil)</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-default-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer_002ddefault_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-default-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer_002ddefault_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is an alist mapping conditions to display actions "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"#display_002dbuffer_002dalist\">display-"
"buffer-alist</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、条件を表示アクションにマッピングするalistです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"#display_002dbuffer_002dalist\">display-buffer-alist</"
"a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"Lisp programs may let-bind this variable to specify conditional actions for "
"wrapped <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> calls.  Users are not "
"supposed to set this variable.  They should customize <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> instead which has higher priority "
"and, as a rule, is left alone by Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラムでは、この変数をlet-bindすることで、ラップされた<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>呼び出しに対する条件付き動作を指定できま"
"す。ユーザーがこの変数を設定することは想定されていません。代わりに、より優先"
"度が高く、原則としてLispプログラムによってそのまま保持される<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>をカスタマイズすべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"display_002dbuffer_002dalist\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"display_002dbuffer_002dalist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002dbuffer_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">display-buffer-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"The value of this option is an alist mapping conditions to display actions.  "
"Each condition is passed to <code class=\"code\">buffer-match-p</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer List</a>), along "
"with the buffer name and the <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument passed "
"to <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>.  If it returns a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, then <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code> uses the corresponding display action to display the buffer.  Caveat: "
"if you use <code class=\"code\">derived-mode</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">major-mode</code> as condition, <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"match-p</code> could fail to report a match if <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> is called before the major mode of the buffer is set."
msgstr ""
"このオプションの値は、条件と表示アクションを対応付けたalistです。各条件は、"
"バッファ名および<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>に渡される<var "
"class=\"var\">action</var>引数とともに、<code class=\"code\">buffer-match-p</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">バッファリスト</a>を参"
"照）に渡されます。<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値が返された場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>は対応する表示アクションを用いて"
"バッファを表示します。注意点として、<code class=\"code\">derived-mode</code>"
"または<code class=\"code\">major-mode</code>を条件として使用する場合、バッ"
"ファのメジャーモードが設定される前に<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code>が呼び出されると、<code class=\"code\">buffer-match-p</code>がマッチを報"
"告できない可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"If the caller of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> passes a "
"category as a symbol in its <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument, then "
"you can use the same category in <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code> to match "
"buffers with different names, for example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> の呼び出し元が <var "
"class=\"var\">action</var> 引数にカテゴリをシンボルとして渡す場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code> でも同じカテゴリを使用し"
"て、異なる名前のバッファをマッチングさせることができます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-to-list 'display-buffer-alist\n"
"             '((category . comint)\n"
"               (display-buffer-same-window)\n"
"               (inhibit-same-window . nil)))\n"
"\n"
"(display-buffer (get-buffer-create &quot;*my-shell*&quot;)\n"
"                '(nil (category . comint)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\"><code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"match-p</code></a>."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\"><code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"match-p</code></a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"Regardless of the displayed buffer&rsquo;s name the caller defines a "
"category as a symbol <code class=\"code\">comint</code>.  Then <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> and <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-default-alist</code> match this category for all buffers displayed "
"with the same category.  This avoids the need to construct a complex regular "
"expression that matches a buffer name."
msgstr ""
"表示されるバッファ名に関わらず、呼び出し側はシンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">comint</code> としてカテゴリを定義します。すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> や <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-default-alist</code> は、同じカテゴリで表示されるすべてのバッファに対"
"してこのカテゴリに一致します。これにより、バッファ名にマッチする複雑な正規表"
"現を構築する必要がなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"You can also match on the command now being executed.  This is useful when "
"different commands display buffers with the same name, but you want "
"different command&rsquo;s buffers to be displayed differently.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"現在実行中のコマンドでマッチさせることも可能です。これは、異なるコマンドが同"
"じ名前のバッファを表示するものの、コマンドごとにバッファの表示方法を変えたい"
"場合に便利です。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-to-list 'display-buffer-alist\n"
"             '((and &quot;^\\\\*vc-diff\\\\*&quot;\n"
"                    (not (this-command . vc-root-diff)))\n"
"\t       nil\n"
"\t       (post-command-select-window . nil)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"This means that windows displaying VC diffs, such as those generated by <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x v =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-diff</code>, see <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Old-Revisions.html#Old-Revisions\">Old Revisions</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">the Emacs Manual</cite>) are not left selected, except "
"for windows displaying buffers generated by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v D</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff</code>), which are left selected."
msgstr ""
"これは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v =</kbd>（<code class=\"code\">vc-diff</"
"code>、<cite class=\"cite\">Emacs マニュアル</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Old-Revisions.html#Old-Revisions\">Old Revisions</a>を参照）によって生"
"成された VC 差分を表示するウィンドウは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v D</kbd>"
"（<code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff</code>）によって生成されたバッファを表示"
"するウィンドウを除いて選択状態のままにならないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Choosing-Window.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">display-buffer-base-action</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-display_002dbuffer_002dbase_002daction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
