#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.7.14 Classifying Events<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Classifying-Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.7.14 イベントの分類<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Classifying-"
"Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-event-type\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-classifying-events\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-event-type\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-classifying-events\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"Every event has an <em class=\"dfn\">event type</em>, which classifies the "
"event for key binding purposes.  For a keyboard event, the event type equals "
"the event value; thus, the event type for a character is the character, and "
"the event type for a function key symbol is the symbol itself.  For events "
"that are lists, the event type is the symbol in the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> of the list.  Thus, the event type is always a symbol or a character."
msgstr ""
"すべてのイベントには<em class=\"dfn\">イベントタイプ</em>があり、キーバインド"
"の目的でイベントを分類します。キーボードイベントの場合、イベントタイプはイベ"
"ント値と一致します。したがって、文字のイベントタイプはその文字となり、ファン"
"クションキー記号のイベントタイプはその記号自体となります。リスト形式のイベン"
"トの場合、イベントタイプはリストの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>にある記号と"
"なります。このように、イベントタイプは常に記号または文字となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"Two events of the same type are equivalent where key bindings are concerned; "
"thus, they always run the same command.  That does not necessarily mean they "
"do the same things, however, as some commands look at the whole event to "
"decide what to do.  For example, some commands use the location of a mouse "
"event to decide where in the buffer to act."
msgstr ""
"同一種類の2つのイベントは、キーバインドに関しては等価であり、したがって常に同"
"じコマンドが実行されます。ただし、一部のコマンドはイベント全体を参照して動作"
"を決定するため、必ずしも同じ処理が行われるとは限りません。例えば、マウスイベ"
"ントの位置を利用して、バッファ内のどこで動作させるかを決定するコマンドもあり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes broader classifications of events are useful.  For example, you "
"might want to ask whether an event involved the <kbd class=\"key\">META</"
"kbd> key, regardless of which other key or mouse button was used."
msgstr ""
"場合によっては、イベントをより広範に分類することが有用なこともあります。例え"
"ば、他にどのキーやマウスボタンが使用されたかにかかわらず、そのイベントに<kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd>キーが関与していたかどうかを確認したい場合などが考え"
"られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"The functions <code class=\"code\">event-modifiers</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">event-basic-type</code> are provided to get such information "
"conveniently."
msgstr ""
"こうした情報を手軽に取得できるよう、関数 <code class=\"code\">event-"
"modifiers</code> と <code class=\"code\">event-basic-type</code> が用意されて"
"います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">event-modifiers</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">event</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-event_002dmodifiers\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">event-modifiers</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">event</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-event_002dmodifiers\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of the modifiers that <var class=\"var\">event</"
"var> has.  The modifiers are symbols; they include <code "
"class=\"code\">shift</code>, <code class=\"code\">control</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">meta</code>, <code class=\"code\">alt</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">hyper</code> and <code class=\"code\">super</code>.  In "
"addition, the modifiers list of a mouse event symbol always contains one of "
"<code class=\"code\">click</code>, <code class=\"code\">drag</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">down</code>.  For double or triple events, it also "
"contains <code class=\"code\">double</code> or <code class=\"code\">triple</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">event</var> が持つモディファイアのリストを返し"
"ます。モディファイアはシンボルであり、<code class=\"code\">shift</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">control</code>、<code class=\"code\">meta</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">alt</code>、<code class=\"code\">hyper</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">super</code> が含まれます。さらに、マウスイベントシンボルのモ"
"ディファイアリストには、常に <code class=\"code\">click</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">drag</code>、<code class=\"code\">down</code> のいずれかが含ま"
"れます。ダブルまたはトリプルイベントの場合は、<code class=\"code\">double</"
"code> または <code class=\"code\">triple</code> も含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">event</var> may be an entire event object, "
"or just an event type.  If <var class=\"var\">event</var> is a symbol that "
"has never been used in an event that has been read as input in the current "
"Emacs session, then <code class=\"code\">event-modifiers</code> can return "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, even when <var class=\"var\">event</var> "
"actually has modifiers."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">event</var> は、イベントオブジェクト全体である場合も"
"あれば、単にイベントタイプである場合もあります。現在の Emacs セッションで入力"
"として読み込まれたイベントにおいて、<var class=\"var\">event</var> が一度も使"
"用されたことのないシンボルである場合、<var class=\"var\">event</var> に実際に"
"修飾子が付いていても、<code class=\"code\">event-modifiers</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Functions.html
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid "Here are some examples:"
msgstr "以下にいくつか例を挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(event-modifiers ?a)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"(event-modifiers ?A)\n"
"     &rArr; (shift)\n"
"(event-modifiers ?\\C-a)\n"
"     &rArr; (control)\n"
"(event-modifiers ?\\C-%)\n"
"     &rArr; (control)\n"
"(event-modifiers ?\\C-\\S-a)\n"
"     &rArr; (control shift)\n"
"(event-modifiers 'f5)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"(event-modifiers 's-f5)\n"
"     &rArr; (super)\n"
"(event-modifiers 'M-S-f5)\n"
"     &rArr; (meta shift)\n"
"(event-modifiers 'mouse-1)\n"
"     &rArr; (click)\n"
"(event-modifiers 'down-mouse-1)\n"
"     &rArr; (down)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"The modifiers list for a click event explicitly contains <code "
"class=\"code\">click</code>, but the event symbol name itself does not "
"contain &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">click</samp>&rsquo;.  Similarly, the "
"modifiers list for an <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> control "
"character, such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-a</samp>&rsquo;, contains "
"<code class=\"code\">control</code>, even though reading such an event via "
"<code class=\"code\">read-char</code> will return the value 1 with the "
"control modifier bit removed."
msgstr ""
"クリックイベントの修飾子リストには明示的に <code class=\"code\">click</code> "
"が含まれていますが、イベントシンボル名自体には &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">click</samp>&rsquo; は含まれていません。同様に、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-a</samp>&rsquo; のような <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> 制御文字の修飾子リストには <code class=\"code\">control</code> が含まれ"
"ていますが、このようなイベントを <code class=\"code\">read-char</code> 経由で"
"読み取ると、制御修飾子ビットが除去された値 1 が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">event-basic-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">event</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-event_002dbasic_002dtype\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">event-basic-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">event</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-event_002dbasic_002dtype\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Classifying-Events.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the key or mouse button that <var class=\"var\">event</"
"var> describes, with all modifiers removed.  The <var class=\"var\">event</"
"var> argument is as in <code class=\"code\">event-modifiers</code>.  For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
