# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> construct is essential "
"whenever you temporarily put a data structure in an inconsistent state; it "
"permits you to make the data consistent again in the event of an error or "
"throw.  (Another more specific cleanup construct that is used only for "
"changes in buffer contents is the atomic change group; <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Atomic-Changes.html\">Atomic Change Groups</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> 構文は、データ構造を一時的に不整合"
"な状態にする場合に不可欠です。これにより、エラーや throw が発生した際に、デー"
"タを再び整合性のある状態に戻すことができます。（バッファ内容の変更にのみ使用"
"される、より特化した別のクリーンアップ構文として、アトミック変更グループがあ"
"ります。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Atomic-Changes.html\">アトミック変更グループ"
"</a>。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">unwind-protect</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body-form "
"cleanup-forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"unwind_002dprotect\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">unwind-protect</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body-form "
"cleanup-forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"unwind_002dprotect\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cleanup-forms\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-protected-forms\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-error-cleanup\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"unwinding\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cleanup-forms\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-protected-forms\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-error-cleanup\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"unwinding\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> executes <var class=\"var\">body-"
"form</var> with a guarantee that the <var class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var> "
"will be evaluated if control leaves <var class=\"var\">body-form</var>, no "
"matter how that happens.  <var class=\"var\">body-form</var> may complete "
"normally, or execute a <code class=\"code\">throw</code> out of the <code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>, or cause an error; in all cases, the "
"<var class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var> will be evaluated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> は、いかなる経緯で制御が <var "
"class=\"var\">body-form</var> を離れたとしても <var class=\"var\">cleanup-"
"forms</var> が評価されるという保証のもとで <var class=\"var\">body-form</"
"var> を実行する。<var class=\"var\">body-form</var> は正常に終了する場合もあ"
"れば、<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> から <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> を実行する場合やエラーを発生させる場合もあるが、"
"いずれの場合においても <var class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var> は評価される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">body-form</var> finishes normally, <code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> returns the value of <var "
"class=\"var\">body-form</var>, after it evaluates the <var "
"class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">body-form</var> "
"does not finish, <code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> does not return "
"any value in the normal sense."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body-form</var>が正常に終了した場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>は<var class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var>"
"を評価した後に<var class=\"var\">body-form</var>の値を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">body-form</var>が終了しなかった場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>は通常の意味での値を返しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"Only <var class=\"var\">body-form</var> is protected by the <code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>.  If any of the <var "
"class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var> themselves exits nonlocally (via a <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> or an error), <code class=\"code\">unwind-"
"protect</code> is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> guaranteed to evaluate the "
"rest of them.  If the failure of one of the <var class=\"var\">cleanup-"
"forms</var> has the potential to cause trouble, then protect it with another "
"<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> around that form."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body-form</var>のみが<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</"
"code>によって保護されています。<var class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var>のいずれ"
"かが非局所的に終了した場合（<code class=\"code\">throw</code>やエラー経由）、"
"<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>が残りの部分を評価することは<em "
"class=\"emph\">保証されません</em>。<var class=\"var\">cleanup-forms</var>の"
"いずれかの失敗が問題を引き起こす可能性がある場合は、そのフォームを別の<code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>で囲んで保護してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"For example, here we make an invisible buffer for temporary use, and make "
"sure to kill it before finishing:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、ここでは一時的に使用する不可視バッファを作成し、終了前に必ず破棄する"
"ようにしています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((buffer (get-buffer-create &quot; *temp*&quot;)))\n"
"  (with-current-buffer buffer\n"
"    (unwind-protect\n"
"        <var class=\"var\">body-form</var>\n"
"      (kill-buffer buffer))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"You might think that we could just as well write <code class=\"code\">(kill-"
"buffer (current-buffer))</code> and dispense with the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer</code>.  However, the way shown above is safer, if "
"<var class=\"var\">body-form</var> happens to get an error after switching "
"to a different buffer! (Alternatively, you could write a <code "
"class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> around <var class=\"var\">body-"
"form</var>, to ensure that the temporary buffer becomes current again in "
"time to kill it.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(kill-buffer (current-buffer))</code> と記述して、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer</code> を省いてもよいと思うかもしれません。しか"
"し、別のバッファに切り替えた後に万が一 <var class=\"var\">body-form</var> で"
"エラーが発生した場合、上述の方法の方が安全です！（あるいは、<var "
"class=\"var\">body-form</var> を <code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</"
"code> で囲むことで、一時バッファが破棄されるタイミングまでに再びカレントにな"
"ることを確実にすることもできます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"Emacs includes a standard macro called <code class=\"code\">with-temp-"
"buffer</code> which expands into more or less the code shown above (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Current-Buffer.html#Definition-of-"
"with_002dtemp_002dbuffer\">Current Buffer</a>).  Several of the macros "
"defined in this manual use <code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> in "
"this way."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには<code class=\"code\">with-temp-buffer</code>という標準マクロが用意さ"
"れており、これは概ね上述のコードに展開されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Current-Buffer.html#Definition-of-with_002dtemp_002dbuffer\">カレント"
"バッファ</a>を参照）。本マニュアルで定義されているマクロのいくつかは、このよ"
"うに<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>を使用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ftp_002dlogin\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ftp_002dlogin\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"Here is an actual example derived from an FTP package.  It creates a process "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Processes.html\">Processes</a>) to try to "
"establish a connection to a remote machine.  As the function <code "
"class=\"code\">ftp-login</code> is highly susceptible to numerous problems "
"that the writer of the function cannot anticipate, it is protected with a "
"form that guarantees deletion of the process in the event of failure.  "
"Otherwise, Emacs might fill up with useless subprocesses."
msgstr ""
"以下に、FTPパッケージから引用した実際の例を示します。これは、リモートマシンへ"
"の接続を確立しようとするプロセス（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Processes.html\">"
"プロセス</a>を参照）を生成します。関数 <code class=\"code\">ftp-login</code> "
"は、作成者が想定し得ない数多くの問題が発生しやすいため、失敗時にプロセスの削"
"除を保証する形式で保護されています。そうしないと、Emacs が不要なサブプロセス"
"で溢れてしまう可能性があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((win nil))\n"
"  (unwind-protect\n"
"      (progn\n"
"        (setq process (ftp-setup-buffer host file))\n"
"        (if (setq win (ftp-login process host user password))\n"
"            (message &quot;Logged in&quot;)\n"
"          (error &quot;Ftp login failed&quot;)))\n"
"    (or win (and process (delete-process process)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cleanups.html
msgid ""
"This example has a small bug: if the user types <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> "
"to quit, and the quit happens immediately after the function <code "
"class=\"code\">ftp-setup-buffer</code> returns but before the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">process</code> is set, the process will not be killed.  There "
"is no easy way to fix this bug, but at least it is very unlikely."
msgstr ""
"この例には小さなバグがあります。ユーザーが終了するために <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力し、関数 <code class=\"code\">ftp-setup-"
"buffer</code> が戻った直後、かつ変数 <code class=\"code\">process</code> が設"
"定される前に終了処理が行われた場合、プロセスは強制終了されません。このバグを"
"簡単に修正する方法はありませんが、少なくとも発生する可能性は極めて低いです。"

