# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.7.4 Click Events<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Click-"
"Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.7.4 クリックイベント<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Click-"
"Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-click-event\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-click-event\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-mouse-wheel-event\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-click-event\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-click-event\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-mouse-wheel-event\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"When the user presses a mouse button and releases it at the same location, "
"that generates a <em class=\"dfn\">click</em> event.  Depending on how your "
"window-system reports mouse-wheel events, turning the mouse wheel can "
"generate either a mouse click or a mouse-wheel event.  All mouse event share "
"the same format:"
msgstr ""
"ユーザーがマウスボタンを押し、同じ位置で離すと、<em class=\"dfn\">クリック</"
"em>イベントが発生します。ウィンドウシステムがマウスホイールイベントをどのよう"
"に報告するかによって、マウスホイールを回すとマウスクリックまたはマウスホイー"
"ルイベントのいずれかが発生する場合があります。すべてのマウスイベントは共通の"
"形式を持っています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">event-type</var> <var class=\"var\">position</var> <var class=\"var\">click-count</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">event-type</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">event-type</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"This is a symbol that indicates which mouse button was used.  It is one of "
"the symbols <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-2</code>, &hellip;, where the buttons are numbered left "
"to right.  For mouse-wheel event, it can be <code class=\"code\">wheel-up</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">wheel-down</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは、どのマウスボタンが使用されたかを示す記号です。<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>、<code class=\"code\">mouse-2</code>、&hellip; "
"といった記号の一つで、ボタンには左から右へ番号が振られています。マウスホイー"
"ルイベントの場合は、<code class=\"code\">wheel-up</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">wheel-down</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"You can also use prefixes &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A-</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">H-"
"</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">S-</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">s-</"
"samp>&rsquo; for modifiers alt, control, hyper, meta, shift and super, just "
"as you would with function keys."
msgstr ""
"また、ファンクションキーと同様に、修飾キー alt、control、hyper、meta、shift、"
"super に対して、接頭辞 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A-</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">H-</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">S-</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">s-</"
"samp>&rsquo; を使用することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"This symbol also serves as the event type of the event.  Key bindings "
"describe events by their types; thus, if there is a key binding for <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>, that binding would apply to all events whose "
"<var class=\"var\">event-type</var> is <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>."
msgstr ""
"このシンボルは、イベントのイベントタイプとしても機能します。キーバインドはイ"
"ベントをそのタイプで記述するため、<code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> のキー"
"バインドがある場合、そのバインドは <var class=\"var\">event-type</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> であるすべてのイベントに適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse-position-list\"></a><span><var class=\"var\">position</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mouse-position-list\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse-position-list\"></a><span><var class=\"var\">position</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mouse-position-list\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"This is a <em class=\"dfn\">mouse position list</em> specifying where the "
"mouse event occurred; see below for details."
msgstr ""
"これはマウスイベントが発生した場所を指定する<em class=\"dfn\">マウス位置リス"
"ト</em>です。詳細は以下を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">click-count</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">click-count</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"This is the number of rapid repeated presses so far of the same mouse button "
"or the number of repeated turns of the wheel.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Repeat-Events.html\">Repeat Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"これは、同一のマウスボタンがこれまでに高速で繰り返し押された回数、またはホ"
"イールが繰り返し回転した回数です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Repeat-"
"Events.html\">リピートイベント</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"To access the contents of a mouse position list in the <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> slot of a mouse event, you should typically use "
"the functions documented in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Accessing-"
"Mouse.html\">Accessing Mouse Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"マウスイベントの <var class=\"var\">position</var> スロットにあるマウス位置リ"
"ストの内容にアクセスするには、通常、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Accessing-"
"Mouse.html\">マウスイベントへのアクセス</a> に記載されている関数を使用しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"The explicit format of the list depends on where the event occurred.  For "
"clicks in the text area, mode line, header line, tab line, or in the fringe "
"or marginal areas, the mouse position list has the form"
msgstr ""
"リストの明示的な形式は、イベントが発生した場所によって異なります。テキストエ"
"リア、モードライン、ヘッダーライン、タブライン、あるいはフリンジやマージン領"
"域でのクリックの場合、マウス位置リストは以下の形式になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(<var class=\"var\">window</var> <var class=\"var\">pos-or-area</var> (<var class=\"var\">x</var> . <var class=\"var\">y</var>) <var class=\"var\">timestamp</var>\n"
" <var class=\"var\">object</var> <var class=\"var\">text-pos</var> (<var class=\"var\">col</var> . <var class=\"var\">row</var>)\n"
" <var class=\"var\">image</var> (<var class=\"var\">dx</var> . <var class=\"var\">dy</var>) (<var class=\"var\">width</var> . <var class=\"var\">height</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "The meanings of these list elements are as follows:"
msgstr "これらのリスト要素の意味は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">window</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">window</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "The window in which the mouse event occurred."
msgstr "マウスイベントが発生したウィンドウ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">pos-or-area</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">pos-or-area</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"The buffer position of the character clicked on in the text area; or, if the "
"event was outside the text area, the window area where it occurred.  It is "
"one of the symbols <code class=\"code\">mode-line</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">header-line</code>, <code class=\"code\">tab-line</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">vertical-line</code>, <code class=\"code\">left-margin</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">right-margin</code>, <code class=\"code\">left-"
"fringe</code>, or <code class=\"code\">right-fringe</code>."
msgstr ""
"テキストエリアでクリックされた文字のバッファ位置、またはイベントがテキストエ"
"リア外で発生した場合は、その発生したウィンドウ領域。<code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line</code>、<code class=\"code\">header-line</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">tab-line</code>、<code class=\"code\">vertical-line</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">left-margin</code>、<code class=\"code\">right-"
"margin</code>、<code class=\"code\">left-fringe</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">right-fringe</code> のいずれかの記号です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"In one special case, <var class=\"var\">pos-or-area</var> is a list "
"containing a symbol (one of the symbols listed above) instead of just the "
"symbol.  This happens after the imaginary prefix keys for the event are "
"registered by Emacs.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-"
"Input.html\">Key Sequence Input</a>."
msgstr ""
"特殊なケースとして、<var class=\"var\">pos-or-area</var> が単なるシンボルでは"
"なく、シンボル（上述のシンボルのいずれか）を含むリストとなる場合があります。"
"これは、Emacs によってイベント用の仮想プレフィックスキーが登録された後に発生"
"します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力"
"</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">x</var>, <var class=\"var\">y</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">x</var>, <var class=\"var\">y</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"The relative pixel coordinates of the event.  For events in the text area of "
"a window, the coordinate origin <code class=\"code\">(0 . 0)</code> is taken "
"to be the top left corner of the text area.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">Window Sizes</a>.  For events in a mode line, "
"header line or tab line, the coordinate origin is the top left corner of the "
"window itself.  For fringes, margins, and the vertical border, <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> does not have meaningful data.  For fringes and "
"margins, <var class=\"var\">y</var> is relative to the bottom edge of the "
"header line.  In all cases, the <var class=\"var\">x</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">y</var> coordinates increase rightward and downward "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"イベントの相対ピクセル座標。ウィンドウのテキスト領域内で発生するイベントの場"
"合、座標原点 <code class=\"code\">(0 . 0)</code> はテキスト領域の左上隅とされ"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">ウィンドウサイズ</a> を参"
"照してください。モードライン、ヘッダーライン、またはタブライン内で発生するイ"
"ベントの場合、座標原点はウィンドウ自体の左上隅となります。フリンジ、マージ"
"ン、および垂直ボーダーの場合、<var class=\"var\">x</var> には意味のあるデータ"
"がありません。フリンジおよびマージンの場合、<var class=\"var\">y</var> はヘッ"
"ダーラインの下端を基準とします。いずれの場合も、<var class=\"var\">x</var> お"
"よび <var class=\"var\">y</var> 座標はそれぞれ右方向および下方向に増加しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">timestamp</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">timestamp</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"The time at which the event occurred, as an integer number of milliseconds "
"since a system-dependent initial time."
msgstr ""
"システム依存の初期時刻からのミリ秒単位の整数値で表される、イベント発生時刻。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">object</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">object</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"Either <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means the event occurred on "
"buffer text, or a cons cell of the form (<var class=\"var\">string</"
"var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">string-pos</var>) if there is a string "
"from a text property or an overlay at the event position."
msgstr ""
"バッファテキストでイベントが発生したことを示す <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> か、イベント位置にテキストプロパティの文字列またはオーバーレイが存在す"
"る場合の (<var class=\"var\">string</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">string-pos</var>) 形式のコンスセルのいずれか。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">string</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">string</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "The string which was clicked on, including any properties."
msgstr "クリックされた文字列（プロパティを含む）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">string-pos</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">string-pos</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "The position in the string where the click occurred."
msgstr "クリックが発生した文字列上の位置。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">text-pos</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">text-pos</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"For clicks on a marginal area or on a fringe, this is the buffer position of "
"the first visible character in the corresponding line in the window.  For "
"clicks on the mode line, the header line or the tab line, this is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  For other events, it is the buffer position "
"closest to the click."
msgstr ""
"余白領域や端部をクリックした場合、これはウィンドウ内の該当行で最初に視認でき"
"る文字のバッファ位置となります。モード行、ヘッダー行、またはタブ行をクリック"
"した場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。その他のイベントの場合"
"は、クリック位置に最も近いバッファ位置となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">col</var>, <var class=\"var\">row</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">col</var>, <var class=\"var\">row</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"These are the actual column and row coordinate numbers of the glyph under "
"the <var class=\"var\">x</var>, <var class=\"var\">y</var> position.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">x</var> lies beyond the last column of actual text on its "
"line, <var class=\"var\">col</var> is reported by adding fictional extra "
"columns that have the default character width.  Row 0 is taken to be the "
"header line if the window has one, or Row 1 if the window also has the tab "
"line, or the topmost row of the text area otherwise.  Column 0 is taken to "
"be the leftmost column of the text area for clicks on a window text area, or "
"the leftmost mode line or header line column for clicks there.  For clicks "
"on fringes or vertical borders, these have no meaningful data.  For clicks "
"on margins, <var class=\"var\">col</var> is measured from the left edge of "
"the margin area and <var class=\"var\">row</var> is measured from the top of "
"the margin area."
msgstr ""
"これらは、<var class=\"var\">x</var>、<var class=\"var\">y</var> 位置にあるグ"
"リフの実際の列および行の座標番号です。<var class=\"var\">x</var> が当該行の実"
"際のテキストの最終列を超える場合、デフォルトの文字幅を持つ仮想的な追加列を加"
"算して <var class=\"var\">col</var> が報告されます。行 0 は、ウィンドウにヘッ"
"ダー行がある場合はその行、ウィンドウにタブ行もある場合は行 1、それ以外の場合"
"はテキスト領域の最上行とみなされます。列 0 は、ウィンドウのテキスト領域へのク"
"リックの場合はテキスト領域の最左列、それ以外の場合は最左のモード行またはヘッ"
"ダー行の列とみなされます。フリンジや垂直境界へのクリックについては、意味のあ"
"るデータはありません。マージンへのクリックの場合、<var class=\"var\">col</"
"var> はマージン領域の左端から、<var class=\"var\">row</var> はマージン領域の"
"上端から測定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">image</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">image</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"If there is an image at the click location, this is the image object as "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">find-image</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Images.html\">Defining Images</a>); otherwise this is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"クリック位置に画像がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">find-image</code> によっ"
"て返される画像オブジェクトとなります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Defining-"
"Images.html\">画像の定義</a>を参照）。そうでない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">dx</var>, <var class=\"var\">dy</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">dx</var>, <var class=\"var\">dy</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Click-Events.html
msgid ""
"These are the pixel offsets of the click relative to the top left corner of "
"the <var class=\"var\">object</var>&rsquo;s glyph that is the nearest one to "
"the click.  The relevant <var class=\"var\">object</var>s can be either a "
"buffer, or a string, or an image, see above.  If <var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or a string, the coordinates are "
"relative to the top left corner of the character glyph clicked on.  Note "
"that the offsets are always zero on text-mode frames, when <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, since each "
"glyph there is considered to have exactly 1x1 pixel dimensions."
msgstr ""
"これらは、クリック位置に最も近い<var class=\"var\">object</var>のグリフの左上"
"隅を基準とした、クリック位置のピクセルオフセットです。関連する<var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>は、バッファ、文字列、または画像のいずれかとなり得"
"ます（上記参照）。<var class=\"var\">object</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>または文字列である場合、座標はクリックされた文字グリフの左上隅を基準とし"
"ます。なお、テキストモードフレームにおいて<var class=\"var\">object</var>が"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合、各グリフの寸法はちょうど1x1ピクセ"
"ルとみなされるため、オフセットは常に0となります。"

