msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">クリック可能なテキスト</em>とは、マウスまたはキーボード操作"
"でクリックすることで、何らかの結果が得られるテキストのことです。多くの主要な"
"モードでは、クリック可能なテキストを用いてテキストハイパーリンク、略して<em "
"class=\"dfn\">リンク</em>を実装しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"The easiest way to insert and manipulate links is to use the <code "
"class=\"code\">button</code> package.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Buttons.html\">Buttons</a>.  In this section, we will explain how to "
"manually set up clickable text in a buffer, using text properties.  For "
"simplicity, we will refer to the clickable text as a <em class=\"dfn\">link</"
"em>."
msgstr ""
"リンクを挿入・操作する最も簡単な方法は、<code class=\"code\">button</code>"
"パッケージを使用することです。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buttons.html\">ボタン"
"</a>を参照してください。本節では、テキストプロパティを用いて、バッファ内にク"
"リック可能なテキストを手動で設定する方法について説明します。簡略化のため、こ"
"のクリック可能なテキストを<em class=\"dfn\">リンク</em>と呼びます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"Implementing a link involves three separate steps: (1) indicating "
"clickability when the mouse moves over the link; (2) making <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> on that link do "
"something; and (3) setting up a <code class=\"code\">follow-link</code> "
"condition so that the link obeys <code class=\"code\">mouse-1-click-follows-"
"link</code>."
msgstr ""
"リンクの実装には、(1) リンク上にマウスが移動した際にクリック可能であることを"
"示す、(2) そのリンク上の <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> に何らかの動作をさせる、(3) リンクが <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-1-click-follows-link</code> に従うように <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> 条件を設定する、という3つの個別の手順が必要"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"To indicate clickability, add the <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> "
"text property to the text of the link; then Emacs will highlight the link "
"when the mouse moves over it.  In addition, you should define a tooltip or "
"echo area message, using the <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> text "
"property.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">Properties "
"with Special Meanings</a>.  For instance, here is how Dired indicates that "
"file names are clickable:"
msgstr ""
"クリック可能であることを示すには、リンクのテキストに <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> テキストプロパティを追加してください。これに"
"より、マウスがリンク上に移動した際に Emacs がリンクをハイライトします。さら"
"に、<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> テキストプロパティを使用して、ツー"
"ルチップまたはエコーエリアのメッセージを定義してください。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Special-Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持つプロパティ</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。例えば、Dired がファイル名のクリック可能であることを示す方法は以下の通"
"りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (if (dired-move-to-filename)\n"
"     (add-text-properties\n"
"       (point)\n"
"       (save-excursion\n"
"         (dired-move-to-end-of-filename)\n"
"         (point))\n"
"       '(mouse-face highlight\n"
"         help-echo &quot;mouse-2: visit this file in other window&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"To make the link clickable, bind <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> to commands that perform the desired action.  "
"Each command should check to see whether it was called on a link, and act "
"accordingly.  For instance, Dired&rsquo;s major mode keymap binds <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> to the following command:"
msgstr ""
"リンクをクリック可能にするには、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> を、目的の動作を実行するコマンドにバインドしま"
"す。各コマンドは、リンクに対して呼び出されたかどうかを判定し、それに応じて動"
"作する必要があります。例えば、Dired のメジャーモードのキーマップでは、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> が以下のコマンドにバインドされています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun dired-mouse-find-file-other-window (event)\n"
"  &quot;In Dired, visit the file or directory name you click on.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;e&quot;)\n"
"  (let ((window (posn-window (event-end event)))\n"
"        (pos (posn-point (event-end event)))\n"
"        file)\n"
"    (if (not (windowp window))\n"
"        (error &quot;No file chosen&quot;))\n"
"    (with-current-buffer (window-buffer window)\n"
"      (goto-char pos)\n"
"      (setq file (dired-get-file-for-visit)))\n"
"    (if (file-directory-p file)\n"
"        (or (and (cdr dired-subdir-alist)\n"
"                 (dired-goto-subdir file))\n"
"            (progn\n"
"              (select-window window)\n"
"              (dired-other-window file)))\n"
"      (select-window window)\n"
"      (find-file-other-window (file-name-sans-versions file t)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"This command uses the functions <code class=\"code\">posn-window</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">posn-point</code> to determine where the click "
"occurred, and <code class=\"code\">dired-get-file-for-visit</code> to "
"determine which file to visit."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<code class=\"code\">posn-window</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">posn-point</code> の関数でクリックが発生した位置を、<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-get-file-for-visit</code> でどのファイルにアクセスするか"
"を判定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"Instead of binding the mouse command in a major mode keymap, you can bind it "
"within the link text, using the <code class=\"code\">keymap</code> text "
"property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">Properties "
"with Special Meanings</a>).  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"マウスコマンドをメジャーモードのキーマップにバインドする代わりに、<code "
"class=\"code\">keymap</code> テキストプロパティ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Special-Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持つプロパティ</a>を参照）を使用"
"して、リンクテキスト内にバインドすることもできます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((map (make-sparse-keymap)))\n"
"  (keymap-set map &quot;&lt;mouse-2&gt;&quot; 'operate-this-button)\n"
"  (put-text-property link-start link-end 'keymap map))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"With this method, you can easily define different commands for different "
"links.  Furthermore, the global definition of <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> remain available for the rest of the "
"text in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"この方法を使えば、リンクごとに異なるコマンドを簡単に定義できます。さらに、"
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> のグローバル"
"定義は、バッファ内の残りのテキストに対しても引き続き有効です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002d1_002dclick_002dfollows_002dlink\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002d1_002dclick_002dfollows_002dlink\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"The basic Emacs command for clicking on links is <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd>.  However, for compatibility with other graphical applications, Emacs "
"also recognizes <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> clicks on links, provided "
"the user clicks on the link quickly without moving the mouse.  This behavior "
"is controlled by the user option <code class=\"code\">mouse-1-click-follows-"
"link</code>.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Mouse-References.html#Mouse-"
"References\">Mouse References</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"リンクをクリックするためのEmacsの基本コマンドは<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd>です。ただし、他のグラフィカルアプリケーションとの互換性のため、マウスを"
"動かさずに素早くリンクをクリックした場合に限り、Emacsは<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>によるリンククリックも認識します。この動作はユー"
"ザーオプション<code class=\"code\">mouse-1-click-follows-link</code>で制御さ"
"れます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Mouse-References.html#Mouse-References\">Mouse References</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-follow_002dlink-_0028text-or-overlay-"
"property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-follow_002dlink-_0028text-or-overlay-"
"property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"To set up the link so that it obeys <code class=\"code\">mouse-1-click-"
"follows-link</code>, you must either (1) apply a <code class=\"code\">follow-"
"link</code> text or overlay property to the link text, or (2)  bind the "
"<code class=\"code\">follow-link</code> event to a keymap (which can be a "
"major mode keymap or a local keymap specified via the <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap</code> text property).  The value of the <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> property, or the binding for the <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> event, acts as a condition for the link "
"action.  This condition tells Emacs two things: the circumstances under "
"which a <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> click should be regarded as "
"occurring inside the link, and how to compute an action code that says what "
"to translate the <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> click into.  The link "
"action condition can be one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"リンクを <code class=\"code\">mouse-1-click-follows-link</code> に従うように"
"設定するには、(1) リンクテキストに <code class=\"code\">follow-link</code> テ"
"キストまたはオーバーレイプロパティを適用するか、(2) <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> イベントをキーマップ（メジャーモードのキー"
"マップ、または <code class=\"code\">keymap</code> テキストプロパティで指定さ"
"れるローカルキーマップ）にバインドする必要があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> プロパティの値、または <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> イベントのバインドは、リンクアクションの条"
"件として機能します。この条件は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> クリックをリ"
"ンク内部で発生したとみなすべき状況と、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> クリッ"
"クを何に変換すべきかを示すアクションコードをどのように計算するかという2点を "
"Emacs に伝えます。リンクアクションの条件は、以下のいずれかになります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"If the condition is the symbol <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code>, a "
"position is inside a link if there is a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> property at that position.  The "
"action code is always <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"条件がシンボル <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> の場合、その位置に "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でも <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> "
"でもないプロパティがあれば、その位置はリンク内となります。アクションコードは"
"常に <code class=\"code\">t</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"For example, here is how Info mode handles <kbd class=\"key\">mouse-1</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、Info mode が <kbd class=\"key\">mouse-1</kbd> をどのように扱うかは以"
"下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-set Info-mode-map &quot;&lt;follow-link&gt;&quot; 'mouse-face)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#: build/html/elisp/Native_002dCompilation-Functions.html
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid "a function"
msgstr "関数"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"If the condition is a function, <var class=\"var\">func</var>, then a "
"position <var class=\"var\">pos</var> is inside a link if <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">func</var> <var class=\"var\">pos</var>)</"
"code> evaluates to non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The value returned "
"by <var class=\"var\">func</var> serves as the action code."
msgstr ""
"条件が関数 <var class=\"var\">func</var> である場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">func</var> <var class=\"var\">pos</var>)</"
"code> の評価結果が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、位置 <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> はリンク内となります。<var class=\"var\">func</var> "
"が返す値がアクションコードとして機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"For example, here is how pcvs enables <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> to "
"follow links on file names only:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、pcvs が <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> でファイル名のみのリンクを辿"
"れるようにする仕組みは以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-set map &quot;&lt;follow-link&gt;&quot;\n"
"            (lambda (pos)\n"
"              (eq (get-char-property pos 'face) 'cvs-filename-face)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
#: build/html/elisp/Finding-All-Frames.html build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid "anything else"
msgstr "その他"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"If the condition value is anything else, then the position is inside a link "
"and the condition itself is the action code.  Clearly, you should specify "
"this kind of condition only when applying the condition via a text or "
"overlay property on the link text (so that it does not apply to the entire "
"buffer)."
msgstr ""
"条件値がそれ以外の場合は、その位置はリンク内にあり、条件自体がアクションコー"
"ドとなります。当然ながら、この種の条件を指定すべきなのは、リンクテキストのテ"
"キストプロパティやオーバーレイプロパティを介して条件を適用する場合（バッファ"
"全体に適用されないようにするため）に限られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"The action code tells <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> how to follow the "
"link:"
msgstr ""
"アクションコードは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> にリンクの辿り方を指示し"
"ます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid "a string or vector"
msgstr "文字列またはベクトル"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"If the action code is a string or vector, the <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</"
"kbd> event is translated into the first element of the string or vector; "
"i.e., the action of the <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> click is the local "
"or global binding of that character or symbol.  Thus, if the action code is "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;foo&quot;</code>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</"
"kbd> translates into <kbd class=\"kbd\">f</kbd>.  If it is <code "
"class=\"code\">[foo]</code>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> translates "
"into <kbd class=\"key\">foo</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"アクションコードが文字列またはベクトルの場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</"
"kbd> イベントはその文字列またはベクトルの第1要素に変換されます。つまり、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> クリックのアクションは、その文字または記号のロー"
"カルまたはグローバルバインディングとなります。したがって、アクションコードが "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;foo&quot;</code> であれば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">f</kbd> に変換されます。"
"<code class=\"code\">[foo]</code> であれば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> "
"は <kbd class=\"key\">foo</kbd> に変換されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"For any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> action code, the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> event is translated into a <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> event at the same position."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外のアクションコードの場合、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>イベントは同じ位置の<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd>イベントに変換されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"To define <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> to activate a button defined with "
"<code class=\"code\">define-button-type</code>, give the button a <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> property.  The property value should be a "
"link action condition, as described above.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Buttons.html\">Buttons</a>.  For example, here is how Help mode "
"handles <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">define-button-type</code> で定義されたボタンを有効化する"
"ために <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> を定義するには、そのボタンに <code "
"class=\"code\">follow-link</code> プロパティを指定します。このプロパティの値"
"は、前述の通りリンクアクション条件とする必要があります。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Buttons.html\">ボタン</a>を参照してください。例えば、ヘルプモードでは "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> を次のように処理します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(define-button-type 'help-xref\n"
"  'follow-link t\n"
"  'action #'help-button-action)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Clickable-Text.html
msgid ""
"To define <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> on a widget defined with <code "
"class=\"code\">define-widget</code>, give the widget a <code "
"class=\"code\">:follow-link</code> property.  The property value should be a "
"link action condition, as described above.  For example, here is how the "
"<code class=\"code\">link</code> widget specifies that a <kbd "
