# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Closure-Objects.html
msgid ""
"This function constructs and returns a closure which represents the byte-"
"code function object with <var class=\"var\">elements</var> as its elements."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">elements</var>を要素とするバイトコード関数オブ"
