# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coding-System-Basics.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the specified property of the coding system <var "
"class=\"var\">coding-system</var>.  Most coding system properties exist for "
"internal purposes, but one that you might find useful is <code "
"class=\"code\">:mime-charset</code>.  That property&rsquo;s value is the "
"name used in MIME for the character coding which this coding system can read "
"and write.  Examples:"
msgstr ""
