# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"A color name is text (usually in a string) that specifies a color.  Symbolic "
"names such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">black</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">white</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">red</"
"samp>&rsquo;, etc., are allowed; use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-colors-"
"display</kbd> to see a list of defined names.  You can also specify colors "
"numerically in forms such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#<var "
"class=\"var\">rgb</var></samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">RGB:"
"<var class=\"var\">r</var>/<var class=\"var\">g</var>/<var class=\"var\">b</"
"var></samp>&rsquo;, where <var class=\"var\">r</var> specifies the red "
"level, <var class=\"var\">g</var> specifies the green level, and <var "
"class=\"var\">b</var> specifies the blue level.  You can use either one, "
"two, three, or four hex digits for <var class=\"var\">r</var>; then you must "
"use the same number of hex digits for all <var class=\"var\">g</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">b</var> as well, making either 3, 6, 9 or 12 hex digits "
"in all.  (See the documentation of the X Window System for more details "
"about numerical RGB specification of colors.)"
msgstr ""
"色名とは、色を指定するテキスト（通常は文字列）のことです。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">black</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">white</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">red</samp>&rsquo;などの記号名も使用"
"可能です。定義済みの名前の一覧を確認するには <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-"
"colors-display</kbd> を使用してください。また、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#<var class=\"var\">rgb</var></samp>&rsquo;や&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">RGB:<var class=\"var\">r</var>/<var class=\"var\">g</var>/"
"<var class=\"var\">b</var></samp>&rsquo;のような形式で色を数値指定することも"
"できます。ここで <var class=\"var\">r</var> は赤成分を、<var "
"class=\"var\">g</var> は緑成分を、<var class=\"var\">b</var> は青成分を指定し"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">r</var> には1桁、2桁、3桁、または4桁の16進数を使用で"
"きます。その場合、すべての <var class=\"var\">g</var> および <var "
"class=\"var\">b</var> にも同数の16進数を使用する必要があり、合計で3桁、6桁、9"
"桁、または12桁の16進数となります。（色の数値RGB指定に関する詳細については、X "
"Window Systemのドキュメントを参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"These functions provide a way to determine which color names are valid, and "
"what they look like.  In some cases, the value depends on the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">selected frame</em>, as described below; see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Input-Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>, for the meaning of the term "
"&ldquo;selected frame&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数を使用すると、どの色名が有効であるか、またそれらがどのような見た"
"目であるかを確認できます。場合によっては、値は後述するように<em "
"class=\"dfn\">選択中のフレーム</em>に依存します。「選択中のフレーム」という用"
"語の意味については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">入力フォーカス"
"</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"To read user input of color names with completion, use <code "
"class=\"code\">read-color</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"High_002dLevel-Completion.html\">read-color</a>)."
msgstr ""
"色名のユーザー入力を補完付きで読み取るには、<code class=\"code\">read-color</"
"code> を使用してください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"High_002dLevel-"
"Completion.html\">read-color</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-defined-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002ddefined_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-defined-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002ddefined_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function reports whether a color name is meaningful.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if so; otherwise, <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"The argument <var class=\"var\">frame</var> says which frame&rsquo;s display "
"to ask about; if <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the selected frame is used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、色名に意味があるかどうかを判定します。意味がある場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">frame</var> はどのフレームの表示について"
"問い合わせるかを指定し、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が省略されているか、あ"
"るいは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定されている場合は、選択中のフレー"
"ムが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"Note that this does not tell you whether the display you are using really "
"supports that color.  When using X, you can ask for any defined color on any "
"kind of display, and you will get some result&mdash;typically, the closest "
"it can do.  To determine whether a frame can really display a certain color, "
"use <code class=\"code\">color-supported-p</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"なお、これだけでは、使用しているディスプレイが実際にその色をサポートしている"
"かどうかは分かりません。Xを使用している場合、あらゆる種類のディスプレイで定義"
"済みの任意の色を指定でき、何らかの結果が得られます&mdash;通常は、それに最も近"
"い色が表示されます。フレームが特定の色を実際に表示できるかどうかを確認するに"
"は、<code class=\"code\">color-supported-p</code>を使用してください（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defined-colors</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-defined_002dcolors\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defined-colors</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-defined_002dcolors\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of the color names that are defined and "
"supported on frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var> (default, the selected "
"frame).  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> does not support colors, the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、フレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var>（デフォルト、選択中のフ"
"レーム）で定義され、サポートされている色名のリストを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> が色をサポートしていない場合、値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-supported-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame background-p</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-color_002dsupported_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-supported-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame background-p</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-color_002dsupported_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var class=\"var\">frame</var> "
"can really display the color <var class=\"var\">color</var> (or at least "
"something close to it).  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the question applies to the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が実際に色 <var class=\"var\">color</var>（あ"
"るいは少なくともそれに近い色）を表示できる場合は、<code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> が返されます。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が省略されているか、あるい"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、この判定は選択されたフレームに適"
"用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"Some terminals support a different set of colors for foreground and "
"background.  If <var class=\"var\">background-p</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means you are asking whether <var "
"class=\"var\">color</var> can be used as a background; otherwise you are "
"asking whether it can be used as a foreground."
msgstr ""
"端末によっては、前景色と背景色に異なる色セットをサポートしているものがありま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">background-p</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でない場合は、<var class=\"var\">color</var> を背景色として使用できるかを問い"
"合わせていることになり、そうでない場合は、前景色として使用できるかを問い合わ"
"せていることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid "The argument <var class=\"var\">color</var> must be a valid color name."
msgstr "引数 <var class=\"var\">color</var> は有効な色名である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-gray-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002dgray_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-gray-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002dgray_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var class=\"var\">color</var> "
"is a shade of gray, as defined on <var class=\"var\">frame</var>&rsquo;s "
"display.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the question applies to the selected frame.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">color</var> is not a valid color name, this function "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">color</var> が <var class=\"var\">frame</var> のディスプレ"
"イで定義されたグレーの階調である場合、<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が省略されているか、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、この問いは選択されたフレームに適用され"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">color</var> が有効な色名でない場合、この関数は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-values</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002dvalues\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-values</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002dvalues\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rgb-value\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rgb-value\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a value that describes what <var class=\"var\">color</"
"var> should ideally look like on <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">color</var> is defined, the value is a list of three integers, "
"which give the amount of red, the amount of green, and the amount of blue.  "
"Each integer ranges in principle from 0 to 65535, but some displays may not "
"use the full range.  This three-element list is called the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">rgb values</em> of the color."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> 上で <var class=\"var\">color</"
"var> が理想的にどのような見た目であるべきかを示す値を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">color</var> が定義されている場合、その値は赤、緑、青の量を表す3"
"つの整数のリストとなります。各整数は原則として 0 から 65535 までの範囲です"
"が、ディスプレイによってはこの全範囲を使用しない場合があります。この3要素のリ"
"ストは、その色の <em class=\"dfn\">RGB値</em> と呼ばれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">color</var> is not defined, the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">color</var> が定義されていない場合、値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(color-values &quot;black&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; (0 0 0)\n"
"(color-values &quot;white&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; (65535 65535 65535)\n"
"(color-values &quot;red&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; (65535 0 0)\n"
"(color-values &quot;pink&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; (65535 49344 52171)\n"
"(color-values &quot;hungry&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"The color values are returned for <var class=\"var\">frame</var>&rsquo;s "
"display.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the information is returned for the selected "
"frame&rsquo;s display.  If the frame cannot display colors, the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var>の表示に対する色値が返されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>が省略されているか、または<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>の場合は、選択されたフレームの表示に対する情報が返されます。フレームが色"
"を表示できない場合は、値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-name-to-rgb</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002dname_002dto_002drgb\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-name-to-rgb</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">color "
"&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"color_002dname_002dto_002drgb\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function does the same as <code class=\"code\">color-values</code>, but "
"it returns color values as floating-point numbers between 0.0 and 1.0 "
"inclusive."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">color-values</code> と同じ動作をしますが、色"
"値を 0.0 以上 1.0 以下の浮動小数点数として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-dark-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">rgb</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-color_002ddark_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">color-dark-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">rgb</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-color_002ddark_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Color-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the color "
"described by its RGB triplet <var class=\"var\">rgb</var> is more readable "
"against white background than against dark background.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">rgb</var> should be a list of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">r</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">g</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">b</var>)</code>, with each component a floating-"
"point number in the range 0.0 to 1.0 inclusive.  You can use <code "
"class=\"code\">color-name-to-rgb</code> to convert a color&rsquo;s name to "
"such a list."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、RGBトリプレット <var class=\"var\">rgb</var> で指定された色が、暗"
"い背景よりも白い背景に対して視認性が高い場合に non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">rgb</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">r</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">g</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">b</var>)</code> 形式のリストである必要があり、各"
"要素は 0.0 から 1.0 までの範囲（両端を含む）の浮動小数点数である必要がありま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">color-name-to-rgb</code> を使用すると、色名をこのよ"
"うなリストに変換できます。"

