# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"The column functions convert between a character position (counting "
"characters from the beginning of the buffer) and a column position (counting "
"screen characters from the beginning of a line)."
msgstr ""
"列関数は、文字位置（バッファの先頭から文字数をカウント）と列位置（行の先頭か"
"ら画面文字数をカウント）を相互に変換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"These functions count each character according to the number of columns it "
"occupies on the screen.  This means control characters count as occupying 2 "
"or 4 columns, depending upon the value of <code class=\"code\">ctl-arrow</"
"code>, and tabs count as occupying a number of columns that depends on the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">tab-width</code> and on the column where the "
"tab begins.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Usual-Display.html\">Usual Display "
"Conventions</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、各文字が画面上で占有する列数に基づいてカウントします。つま"
"り、制御文字は<code class=\"code\">ctl-arrow</code>の値に応じて2列または4列を"
"占有するものと数えられ、タブは<code class=\"code\">tab-width</code>の値および"
"タブが始まる列に応じて、一定の列数を占有するものと数えられます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Usual-Display.html\">一般的な表示規約</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"Column number computations ignore the width of the window and the amount of "
"horizontal scrolling.  Consequently, a column value can be arbitrarily "
"high.  The first (or leftmost) column is numbered 0.  They also ignore "
"overlays and text properties, aside from invisibility.  Invisible text is "
"considered as having zero width, unless <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"invisibility-spec</code> specifies that invisible text should be displayed "
"as ellipsis (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Invisible-Text.html\">Invisible "
"Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"列番号の計算では、ウィンドウの幅や水平スクロール量は考慮されません。そのた"
"め、列の値は任意に大きな値になる可能性があります。最初の（または最も左側の）"
"列は0番となります。また、不可視状態を除き、オーバーレイやテキストプロパティも"
"無視されます。不可視テキストは幅が0とみなされますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> で不可視テキストを省略記号とし"
"て表示するように指定した場合はこの限りではありません（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Invisible-Text.html\">不可視テキスト</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-column</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-column</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the horizontal position of point, measured in columns, "
"counting from 0 at the left margin.  The column position is the sum of the "
"widths of all the displayed representations of the characters between the "
"start of the current line and point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、左端を0として列数で計測した、pointの水平位置を返します。列位置"
"は、現在の行の先頭からpointまでの間に表示されるすべての文字表現の幅の合計とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">move-to-column</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">column "
"&amp;optional force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"move_002dto_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">move-to-column</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">column "
"&amp;optional force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"move_002dto_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point to <var class=\"var\">column</var> in the current "
"line.  The calculation of <var class=\"var\">column</var> takes into account "
"the widths of the displayed representations of the characters between the "
"start of the line and point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポイントを現在の行の <var class=\"var\">column</var> に移動しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">column</var> の計算では、行頭からポイントまでの文字の"
"表示幅が考慮されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"When called interactively, <var class=\"var\">column</var> is the value of "
"prefix numeric argument.  If <var class=\"var\">column</var> is not an "
"integer, an error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"対話的に呼び出された場合、<var class=\"var\">column</var> は接頭辞付き数値引"
"数の値となります。<var class=\"var\">column</var> が整数でない場合は、エラー"
"が報告されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"If it is impossible to move to column <var class=\"var\">column</var> "
"because that is in the middle of a multicolumn character such as a tab, "
"point moves to the end of that character.  However, if <var "
"class=\"var\">force</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">column</var> is in the middle of a tab, then <code "
"class=\"code\">move-to-column</code> either converts the tab into spaces "
"(when <code class=\"code\">indent-tabs-mode</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>), or inserts enough spaces before it (otherwise), "
"so that point can move precisely to column <var class=\"var\">column</var>.  "
"Other multicolumn characters can cause anomalies despite <var "
"class=\"var\">force</var>, since there is no way to split them."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">column</var> 列への移動が不可能な場合（そこがタブなどの複"
"数列文字の途中であるため）、ポイントはその文字の末尾に移動します。ただし、"
"<var class=\"var\">force</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく、"
"かつ <var class=\"var\">column</var> がタブの途中にある場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">move-to-column</code> はタブをスペースに変換するか（<code "
"class=\"code\">indent-tabs-mode</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の"
"場合）、あるいはその前に十分なスペースを挿入し（それ以外の場合）、ポイントが"
"正確に <var class=\"var\">column</var> 列に移動できるようにします。その他の複"
"数列文字は、分割する方法がないため、<var class=\"var\">force</var> があっても"
"異常が発生することがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">force</var> also has an effect if the line "
"isn&rsquo;t long enough to reach column <var class=\"var\">column</var>; if "
"it is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, that means to add whitespace at the end "
"of the line to reach that column."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">force</var> は、行の長さが列 <var "
"class=\"var\">column</var> に達するのに不十分な場合にも効果を発揮します。も"
"し <code class=\"code\">t</code> であれば、その列に達するために行末に空白を追"
"加することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Columns.html
msgid "The return value is the column number actually moved to."
msgstr "戻り値は、実際に移動した列番号です。"

