#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.3 Constructs for Combining Conditions<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Constructs-for-Combining-Conditions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.3 条件を組み合わせるための構文<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Constructs-for-Combining-Conditions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-combining-conditions\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-combining-conditions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"This section describes constructs that are often used together with <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> and <code class=\"code\">cond</code> to express "
"complicated conditions.  The constructs <code class=\"code\">and</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> can also be used individually as kinds of "
"multiple conditional constructs."
msgstr ""
"本節では、複雑な条件を表現するために <code class=\"code\">if</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> と組み合わせてよく用いられる構文について解説しま"
"す。また、<code class=\"code\">and</code> や <code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"といった構文も、複数条件構文の一種として単独で使用することが可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">not</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-not\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">not</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-not\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"This function tests for the falsehood of <var class=\"var\">condition</"
"var>.  It returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  The function <code class=\"code\">not</"
"code> is identical to <code class=\"code\">null</code>, and we recommend "
"using the name <code class=\"code\">null</code> if you are testing for an "
"empty list or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">condition</var> が偽であるかどうかを判定しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">condition</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"あれば <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでなければ <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。関数 <code class=\"code\">not</code> "
"は <code class=\"code\">null</code> と同一であり、空のリストや <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を判定する場合は、<code class=\"code\">null</"
"code> という名前を使用することを推奨します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">and</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">conditions&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-and\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">and</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">conditions&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-and\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">and</code> special form tests whether all the <var "
"class=\"var\">conditions</var> are true.  It works by evaluating the <var "
"class=\"var\">conditions</var> one by one in the order written."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> 特殊形式は、すべての <var "
"class=\"var\">conditions</var> が真であるかどうかを判定します。これは、<var "
"class=\"var\">conditions</var> を記述された順に一つずつ評価することで動作しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"If any of the <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the result of the <code class=\"code\">and</"
"code> must be <code class=\"code\">nil</code> regardless of the remaining "
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var>; so <code class=\"code\">and</code> "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> right away, ignoring the remaining "
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var> のいずれかが <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> と評価される場合、残りの <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> に関わら"
"ず <code class=\"code\">and</code> の結果は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でなければなりません。したがって、<code class=\"code\">and</code> は残りの "
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var> を無視して、直ちに <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"If all the <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> turn out non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the value of the last of them becomes the "
"value of the <code class=\"code\">and</code> form.  Just <code "
"class=\"code\">(and)</code>, with no <var class=\"var\">conditions</var>, "
"returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>, appropriate because all the <var "
"class=\"var\">conditions</var> turned out non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  (Think about it; which one did not?)"
msgstr ""
"すべての <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外となった場合、最後の一つの値が <code class=\"code\">and</code> 形式"
"の値となります。<var class=\"var\">conditions</var> がなく <code "
"class=\"code\">(and)</code> だけの場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> が返さ"
"れますが、これはすべての <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外となったため妥当です。（考えてみてください。ど"
"れがそうではなかったでしょうか？）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example.  The first condition returns the integer 1, which is not "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Similarly, the second condition returns "
"the integer 2, which is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The third "
"condition is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, so the remaining condition is "
"never evaluated."
msgstr ""
"以下に例を示します。最初の条件は整数 1 を返しますが、これは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではありません。同様に、2番目の条件は整数 2 を返し"
"ますが、これも <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではありません。3番目の条件は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるため、残りの条件が評価されることはあり"
"ません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(and (print 1) (print 2) nil (print 3))\n"
"     &#8867; 1\n"
"     &#8867; 2\n"
"&rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"Here is a more realistic example of using <code class=\"code\">and</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> を使用した、より現実的な例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (and (consp foo) (eq (car foo) 'x))\n"
"    (message &quot;foo is a list starting with x&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">(car foo)</code> is not executed if <code "
"class=\"code\">(consp foo)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"thus avoiding an error."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">(consp foo)</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返す場合は <code class=\"code\">(car foo)</code> は実行されないため、"
"エラーを回避できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> expressions can also be written using either "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> or <code class=\"code\">cond</code>.  "
"Here&rsquo;s how:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> 式は、<code class=\"code\">if</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> のいずれかを使って記述することもできます。方"
"法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(and <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(if <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> (if <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>))\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(cond (<var class=\"var\">arg1</var> (cond (<var class=\"var\">arg2</var> <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">or</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">conditions&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-or\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">or</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">conditions&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-or\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">or</code> special form tests whether at least one "
"of the <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> is true.  It works by evaluating "
"all the <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> one by one in the order written."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> 特殊形式は、<var class=\"var\">conditions</"
"var> のうち少なくとも1つが真であるかどうかを判定します。これは、すべての "
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var> を記述された順に一つずつ評価することで動"
"作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"If any of the <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> evaluates to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, then the result of the <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> must be non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>; so "
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> returns right away, ignoring the remaining "
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var>.  The value it returns is the non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value of the condition just evaluated."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">conditions</var> のいずれかが <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の値と評価された場合、<code class=\"code\">or</code> の結果は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である必要があります。そのため、<code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> は残りの <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> を無視"
"して直ちに戻ります。返される値は、直前に評価された条件の <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"If all the <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> turn out <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the <code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"expression returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Just <code "
"class=\"code\">(or)</code>, with no <var class=\"var\">conditions</var>, "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, appropriate because all the <var "
"class=\"var\">conditions</var> turned out <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"(Think about it; which one did not?)"
msgstr ""
"すべての <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となった場合、<code class=\"code\">or</code> 式は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">conditions</var> が"
"なく <code class=\"code\">(or)</code> だけが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返すのは、すべての <var class=\"var\">conditions</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となったため妥当です。（考えてみてください。どれが"
"そうではありませんでしたか？）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"For example, this expression tests whether <code class=\"code\">x</code> is "
"either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or the integer zero:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、この式は <code class=\"code\">x</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> または整数の 0 であるかどうかを判定します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(or (eq x nil) (eq x 0))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"Like the <code class=\"code\">and</code> construct, <code class=\"code\">or</"
"code> can be written in terms of <code class=\"code\">cond</code>.  For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> 構文と同様に、<code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"は <code class=\"code\">cond</code> を用いて記述できます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(or <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(cond (<var class=\"var\">arg1</var>)\n"
"      (<var class=\"var\">arg2</var>)\n"
"      (<var class=\"var\">arg3</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"You could almost write <code class=\"code\">or</code> in terms of <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code>, but not quite:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">or</code>を<code class=\"code\">if</code>を用いて書き表"
"すこともできそうですが、完全にはそうはいきません："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> <var class=\"var\">arg1</var>\n"
"  (if <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> <var class=\"var\">arg2</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"This is not completely equivalent because it can evaluate <var "
"class=\"var\">arg1</var> or <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> twice.  By "
"contrast, <code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">arg2</var> <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>)</code> never "
"evaluates any argument more than once."
msgstr ""
"これは <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> や <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> を2回評"
"価する可能性があるため、完全には等価ではありません。対照的に、<code "
"class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> <var class=\"var\">arg2</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">arg3</var>)</code> はいかなる引数も2回以上評価するこ"
"とはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">xor</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition1 condition2</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-xor\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">xor</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition1 condition2</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-xor\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the boolean exclusive-or of <var "
"class=\"var\">condition1</var> and <var class=\"var\">condition2</var>.  "
"That is, <code class=\"code\">xor</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> if either both arguments are <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, or both "
"are non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Otherwise, it returns the value of "
"that argument which is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">condition1</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">condition2</var> のブール値による排他的論理和を返します。つま"
"り、両方の引数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、あるいは両方が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<code class=\"code\">xor</"
"code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。それ以外の場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である方の引数の値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Combining-Conditions.html
msgid ""
"Note that in contrast to <code class=\"code\">or</code>, both arguments are "
"always evaluated."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">or</code> とは異なり、両方の引数は常に評価される点"
"に注意してください。"

