#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-History.html
msgid ""
"This history list is actually a special case of minibuffer history (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">Minibuffer History</a>), "
