# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.5 Information from the Command Loop<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Information-from-the-Command-Loop\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.5 コマンドループからの情報<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Information-from-the-Command-Loop\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command-loop-variables\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command-loop-variables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"The editor command loop sets several Lisp variables to keep status records "
"for itself and for commands that are run.  With the exception of <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command</code> and <code class=\"code\">last-command</"
"code> it&rsquo;s generally a bad idea to change any of these variables in a "
"Lisp program."
msgstr ""
"エディタのコマンドループでは、自身および実行されるコマンドのステータス記録を"
"保持するため、いくつかのLisp変数を設定します。<code class=\"code\">this-"
"command</code> と <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> を除き、Lispプログ"
"ラム内でこれらの変数を変更することは一般的に避けるべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable records the name of the previous command executed by the "
"command loop (the one before the current command).  Normally the value is a "
"symbol with a function definition, but this is not guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、コマンドループによって実行された直前のコマンド（現在のコマンド"
"のひとつ前）の名前が記録されます。通常、その値は関数定義を持つシンボルです"
"が、必ずしもそうであるとは限りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"The value is copied from <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> when a "
"command returns to the command loop, except when the command has specified a "
"prefix argument for the following command."
msgstr ""
"コマンドがコマンドループに戻る際、当該コマンドが次のコマンド用のプレフィック"
"ス引数を指定していない限り、値は <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> か"
"らコピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable is always local to the current terminal and cannot be buffer-"
"local.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple "
"Terminals</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は常に現在のターミナルにローカルであり、バッファローカルにはなり得ま"
"せん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">real-last-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"real_002dlast_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">real-last-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"real_002dlast_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable is set up by Emacs just like <code class=\"code\">last-"
"command</code>, but never altered by Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"この変数はEmacsによって<code class=\"code\">last-command</code>と同様に設定さ"
"れますが、Lispプログラムによって変更されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-repeatable-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-last_002drepeatable_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-repeatable-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-last_002drepeatable_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable stores the most recently executed command that was not part of "
"an input event.  This is the command <code class=\"code\">repeat</code> will "
"try to repeat, See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Repeating.html#Repeating\">Repeating</"
"a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、入力イベントの一部ではなかった、直近に実行されたコマンドが格納"
"されます。これは <code class=\"code\">repeat</code> が繰り返そうとするコマン"
"ドです。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Repeating.html#Repeating\">Repeating</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">this-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"this_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">this-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"this_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current-command\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current-command\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable records the name of the command now being executed by the "
"editor command loop.  Like <code class=\"code\">last-command</code>, it is "
"normally a symbol with a function definition."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、エディタのコマンドループで現在実行されているコマンドの名前が記"
"録されます。<code class=\"code\">last-command</code>と同様に、通常は関数定義"
"を持つシンボルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"The command loop sets this variable just before running a command, and "
"copies its value into <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> when the "
"command finishes (unless the command specified a prefix argument for the "
"following command)."
msgstr ""
"コマンドループは、コマンドを実行する直前にこの変数を設定し、コマンドの終了時"
"にその値を <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> にコピーします（ただし、"
"コマンドが次のコマンド用のプレフィックス引数を指定している場合は除きます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill-command-repetition\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill-command-repetition\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"Some commands set this variable during their execution, as a flag for "
"whatever command runs next.  In particular, the functions for killing text "
"set <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> to <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"region</code> so that any kill commands immediately following will know to "
"append the killed text to the previous kill."
msgstr ""
"一部のコマンドは、実行中にこの変数を、次に実行されるコマンドのフラグとして設"
"定します。具体的には、テキストをキルする関数は <code class=\"code\">this-"
"command</code> を <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> に設定し、これによ"
"り直後に続くキルコマンドが、キルしたテキストを直前のキル内容に追記するように"
"認識します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"If you do not want a particular command to be recognized as the previous "
"command in the case where it got an error, you must code that command to "
"prevent this.  One way is to set <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> at the beginning of the command, and set <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command</code> back to its proper value at the end, like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"エラーが発生した際に、特定のコマンドが直前のコマンドとして認識されるのを防ぎ"
"たい場合は、そのコマンドにそれを防ぐ処理を組み込む必要があります。一つの方法"
"は、コマンドの冒頭で <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に設定し、末尾で <code class=\"code\">this-command</"
"code> を本来の値に戻すことです。具体的には次のように記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo (args...)\n"
"  (interactive ...)\n"
"  (let ((old-this-command this-command))\n"
"    (setq this-command t)\n"
"    <span class=\"r\">...do the work...</span>\n"
"    (setq this-command old-this-command)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"We do not bind <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> with <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> because that would restore the old value in case "
"of error&mdash;a feature of <code class=\"code\">let</code> which in this "
"case does precisely what we want to avoid."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">this-command</code> を <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"と紐付けないのは、そうするとエラー時に元の値が復元されてしまうためです&mdash;"
"これは <code class=\"code\">let</code> の機能であり、今回のケースではまさに避"
"けたい挙動となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">this-original-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-this_002doriginal_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">this-original-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-this_002doriginal_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This has the same value as <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> except "
"when command remapping occurs (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remapping-"
"Commands.html\">Remapping Commands</a>).  In that case, <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command</code> gives the command actually run (the "
"result of remapping), and <code class=\"code\">this-original-command</code> "
"gives the command that was specified to run but remapped into another "
"command."
msgstr ""
"これは、コマンドのリマッピングが行われる場合（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Remapping-Commands.html\">コマンドのリマッピング</a>を参照）を除き、"
"<code class=\"code\">this-command</code>と同じ値となります。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">this-command</code>は実際に実行されたコマンド（リマッピングの"
"結果）を、<code class=\"code\">this-original-command</code>は実行するように指"
"定されたものの別のコマンドにリマッピングされたコマンドをそれぞれ示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-minibuffer-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-current_002dminibuffer_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-minibuffer-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-current_002dminibuffer_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This has the same value as <code class=\"code\">this-command</code>, but is "
"bound recursively when entering a minibuffer.  This variable can be used "
"from minibuffer hooks and the like to determine what command opened the "
"current minibuffer session."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> と同じ値を持ちますが、ミニ"
"バッファに入る際に再帰的にバインドされます。この変数は、ミニバッファフックな"
"どで、現在のミニバッファセッションを開いたコマンドを判定するために利用できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">this-command-keys</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"this_002dcommand_002dkeys\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">this-command-keys</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"this_002dcommand_002dkeys\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string or vector containing the key sequence that "
"invoked the present command.  Any events read by the command using <code "
"class=\"code\">read-event</code> without a timeout get tacked on to the end."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のコマンドを呼び出したキーシーケンスを含む文字列またはベクト"
"ルを返します。タイムアウトを指定せずに <code class=\"code\">read-event</"
"code> を用いてコマンドが読み取ったイベントは、末尾に付加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"However, if the command has called <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</"
"code>, it returns the last read key sequence.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">Key Sequence Input</a>.  The value is a "
"string if all events in the sequence were characters that fit in a string.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Events.html\">Input Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"ただし、コマンドが <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> を呼び出した"
"場合は、最後に読み込まれたキーシーケンスを返します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力</a> を参照してください。"
"シーケンス内のすべてのイベントが文字列に収まる文字であった場合、その値は文字"
"列となります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Events.html\">入力イベント</a> "
"を参照してください。"

