# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code>, except that it always "
"returns the events in a vector, so you don&rsquo;t need to deal with the "
"complexities of storing input events in a string (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
