# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This function empties out the table of events for <code class=\"code\">this-"
"command-keys</code> to return.  Unless <var class=\"var\">keep-record</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it also empties the records that the "
"function <code class=\"code\">recent-keys</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Recording-Input.html\">Recording Input</a>) will subsequently "
"return.  This is useful after reading a password, to prevent the password "
"from echoing inadvertently as part of the next command in certain cases."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code> が返すイベントテー"
"ブルを空にします。<var class=\"var\">keep-record</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限り、関数 <code class=\"code\">recent-keys</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Recording-Input.html\">Recording Input</a> "
"を参照）がその後返すレコードも空にします。これは、パスワードを読み取った後、"
"特定のケースでパスワードが意図せず次のコマンドの一部としてエコーされるのを防"
"ぐのに有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
