# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds the last input event read as part of a key sequence, not "
"counting events resulting from mouse menus."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、マウスメニューに起因するイベントを除き、キーシーケンスの一部と"
"して読み取られた直近の入力イベントが格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"One use of this variable is for telling <code class=\"code\">x-popup-menu</"
"code> where to pop up a menu.  It is also used internally by <code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html\">Yes-or-No Queries</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数の用途の一つに、<code class=\"code\">x-popup-menu</code> にメニューを"
"ポップアップさせる場所を指定することがあります。また、<code class=\"code\">y-"
"or-n-p</code> でも内部的に使用されています（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html\">Yes-or-No Queries</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-command-event</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dcommand_002devent\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-command-event</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dcommand_002devent\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"This variable is set to the last input event that was read by the command "
"loop as part of a command.  The principal use of this variable is in <code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>, which uses it to decide which "
"character to insert, and in <code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-hook</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Commands-for-Insertion.html\">User-"
"Level Insertion Commands</a>), which uses it to access the character that "
"was just inserted."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、コマンドループがコマンドの一部として読み取った直近の入力イベン"
"トが設定されます。この変数の主な用途は、どの文字を挿入するかを決定するために"
"使用する<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>と、直前に挿入された文"
"字にアクセスするために使用する<code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-hook</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Commands-for-Insertion.html\">ユーザーレベル"
"の挿入コマンド</a>を参照）です。"

