"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Loop-Info.html
msgid ""
"There are various different types of devices, which can be determined from "
"their names.  This function can be used to determined the correct type of "
"the device <var class=\"var\">name</var> for an event originating from <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>."
msgstr ""
"デバイスにはさまざまな種類があり、それらは名称から判別できます。この関数を使"
"用すると、<var class=\"var\">frame</var>から発生したイベントに対する正しいデ"
"バイスタイプ<var class=\"var\">name</var>を特定できます。"

