# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.1 Command Loop Overview<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Command-"
"Loop-Overview\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.1 コマンドループの概要<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Command-"
"Loop-Overview\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"The first thing the command loop must do is read a key sequence, which is a "
"sequence of input events that translates into a command.  It does this by "
"calling the function <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>.  Lisp "
"programs can also call this function (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Sequence-Input.html\">Key Sequence Input</a>).  They can also read input at "
"a lower level with <code class=\"code\">read-key</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">read-event</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-One-"
"Event.html\">Reading One Event</a>), or discard pending input with <code "
"class=\"code\">discard-input</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Event-"
"Input-Misc.html\">Miscellaneous Event Input Features</a>)."
msgstr ""
"コマンドループが最初に行うべきことは、コマンドに変換される入力イベントのシー"
"ケンスであるキーシーケンスを読み取ることです。これは、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> を呼び出すことで行われます。Lispプロ"
"グラムでもこの関数を呼び出すことができます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力</a>を参照）。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-key</code> や <code class=\"code\">read-event</code> を用"
"いてより低いレベルで入力を読み取ったり（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-"
"One-Event.html\">単一イベントの読み取り</a>を参照）、<code "
"class=\"code\">discard-input</code> を用いて保留中の入力を破棄したりすること"
"も可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Event-Input-Misc.html\">イベント入力の"
"その他の機能</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"The key sequence is translated into a command through the currently active "
"keymaps.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Lookup.html\">Key Lookup</a>, for "
"information on how this is done.  The result should be a keyboard macro or "
"an interactively callable function.  If the key is <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</"
"kbd>, then it reads the name of another command, which it then calls.  This "
"is done by the command <code class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>)."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスは、現在有効なキーマップを通じてコマンドに変換されます。その仕"
"組みについては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Lookup.html\">キールックアップ</"
"a>を参照してください。結果として、キーボードマクロまたはインタラクティブに呼"
"び出し可能な関数が生成されます。キーが<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>の場合、別"
"のコマンド名を読み取り、そのコマンドを呼び出します。これは<code "
"class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code>コマンドによって行われます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">インタラクティブ呼び出し</a>を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"Prior to executing the command, Emacs runs <code class=\"code\">undo-"
"boundary</code> to create an undo boundary.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Maintaining-Undo.html\">Maintaining Undo Lists</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンドを実行する前に、Emacsは<code class=\"code\">undo-boundary</code>を実"
"行してアンドゥ境界を作成します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Maintaining-"
"Undo.html\">アンドゥリストの管理</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"To execute a command, Emacs first reads its arguments by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">command-execute</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>).  For commands written "
"in Lisp, the <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> specification says how "
"to read the arguments.  This may use the prefix argument (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-Command-Arguments.html\">Prefix Command "
"Arguments</a>) or may read with prompting in the minibuffer (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffers.html\">Minibuffers</a>).  For example, "
"the command <code class=\"code\">find-file</code> has an <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> specification which says to read a file "
"name using the minibuffer.  The function body of <code class=\"code\">find-"
"file</code> does not use the minibuffer, so if you call <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> as a function from Lisp code, you must "
"supply the file name string as an ordinary Lisp function argument."
msgstr ""
"コマンドを実行する際、Emacsはまず <code class=\"code\">command-execute</"
"code> を呼び出してその引数を読み込みます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">インタラクティブ呼び出し</a>を参照）。Lispで記"
"述されたコマンドの場合、<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の仕様で引数"
"の読み込み方法が規定されています。これにはプレフィックス引数（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-Command-Arguments.html\">プレフィックスコマンド"
"引数</a>を参照）を使用する場合や、ミニバッファでのプロンプティングによって読"
"み込む場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffers.html\">ミニバッファ</a>を参"
"照）があります。例えば、コマンド <code class=\"code\">find-file</code> の "
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> 仕様では、ミニバッファを使用してファ"
"イル名を読み込むよう規定されています。<code class=\"code\">find-file</code> "
"の関数本体ではミニバッファを使用しないため、Lispコードから関数として <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> を呼び出す場合は、ファイル名の文字列を通常の"
"Lisp関数引数として渡す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"If the command is a keyboard macro (i.e., a string or vector), Emacs "
"executes it using <code class=\"code\">execute-kbd-macro</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">Keyboard Macros</a>)."
msgstr ""
"コマンドがキーボードマクロ（すなわち文字列またはベクトル）である場合、Emacs "
"は <code class=\"code\">execute-kbd-macro</code> を用いてそれを実行します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">キーボードマクロ</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pre-command-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pre_002dcommand_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pre-command-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pre_002dcommand_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"This normal hook is run by the editor command loop before it executes each "
"command.  At that time, <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> contains "
"the command that is about to run, and <code class=\"code\">last-command</"
"code> describes the previous command.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-"
"Loop-Info.html\">Information from the Command Loop</a>."
msgstr ""
"この通常のフックは、エディタのコマンドループによって各コマンドが実行される前"
"に呼び出されます。このとき、<code class=\"code\">this-command</code> には実行"
"直前のコマンドが、<code class=\"code\">last-command</code> には直前のコマンド"
"が格納されています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html\">コマン"
"ドループからの情報</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">post-command-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"post_002dcommand_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">post-command-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"post_002dcommand_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"This normal hook is run by the editor command loop after it executes each "
"command (including commands terminated prematurely by quitting or by "
"errors).  At that time, <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> refers to "
"the command that just ran, and <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> "
"refers to the command before that."
msgstr ""
"この通常のフックは、エディタのコマンドループが各コマンド（終了やエラーによっ"
"て途中で中断されたコマンドを含む）を実行した後に呼び出されます。このとき、"
"<code class=\"code\">this-command</code>は直前に実行されたコマンドを、<code "
"class=\"code\">last-command</code>はその前のコマンドを指します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"This hook is also run when Emacs first enters the command loop (at which "
"point <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> and <code class=\"code\">last-"
"command</code> are both <code class=\"code\">nil</code>)."
msgstr ""
"このフックは、Emacsが最初にコマンドループに入った際にも実行されます（この時点"
"では <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> と <code class=\"code\">last-"
"command</code> はともに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"Quitting is suppressed while running <code class=\"code\">pre-command-hook</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">post-command-hook</code>.  If an error "
"happens while executing one of these hooks, it does not terminate execution "
"of the hook; instead the error is silenced and the function in which the "
"error occurred is removed from the hook."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">pre-command-hook</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">post-command-hook</code> の実行中は、終了処理が抑制されます。"
"これらのフックのいずれかの実行中にエラーが発生しても、フックの実行は終了せ"
"ず、代わりにエラーは抑制され、エラーが発生した関数はフックから削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"A request coming into the Emacs server (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Emacs-"
"Server.html#Emacs-Server\">Emacs Server</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>) runs these two hooks just as a keyboard command does."
msgstr ""
"Emacsサーバーに届くリクエスト（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Emacs-Server.html#Emacs-Server\">Emacs Server</a>を参"
"照）は、キーボードコマンドと同様に、これら2つのフックを実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command-Overview.html
msgid ""
"Note that, when the buffer text includes very long lines, these two hooks "
"are called as if they were in a <code class=\"code\">with-restriction</code> "
"form (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>), with a "
"<code class=\"code\">long-line-optimizations-in-command-hooks</code> label "
"and with the buffer narrowed to a portion around point."
msgstr ""
"なお、バッファテキストに非常に長い行が含まれている場合、これら2つのフックは、"
"<code class=\"code\">with-restriction</code>形式（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>を参照）であるかのように呼び出され、"
"<code class=\"code\">long-line-optimizations-in-command-hooks</code>ラベルが"
"付与され、バッファはポイント周辺の範囲に狭められます。"

