# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"This variable is an alist of user-defined command-line options and "
"associated handler functions.  By default it is empty, but you can add "
"elements if you wish."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、ユーザー定義のコマンドラインオプションとそれに関連付けられたハン"
"ドラ関数のalistです。デフォルトでは空ですが、必要に応じて要素を追加できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">command-line option</em> is an argument on the command "
"line, which has the form:"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">コマンドラインオプション</em>とは、コマンドライン上の引数で"
"あり、次のような形式をとります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "-<var class=\"var\">option</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"The elements of the <code class=\"code\">command-switch-alist</code> look "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">command-switch-alist</code>の要素は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">option</var> . <var class=\"var\">handler-function</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"The <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">option</var>, is a "
"string, the name of a command-line option (including the initial hyphen).  "
"The <var class=\"var\">handler-function</var> is called to handle <var "
"class=\"var\">option</var>, and receives the option name as its sole "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">option</var> は文字列であ"
"り、コマンドラインオプションの名前（先頭のハイフンを含む）です。<var "
"class=\"var\">handler-function</var> は <var class=\"var\">option</var> を処"
"理するために呼び出され、オプション名を唯一の引数として受け取ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"In some cases, the option is followed in the command line by an argument.  "
"In these cases, the <var class=\"var\">handler-function</var> can find all "
"the remaining command-line arguments in the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">command-line-args-left</code> (see below).  (The entire list "
"of command-line arguments is in <code class=\"code\">command-line-args</"
"code>.)"
msgstr ""
"場合によっては、コマンドラインにおいてオプションの後に引数が続きます。このよ"
"うな場合、<var class=\"var\">handler-function</var> は残りのすべてのコマンド"
"ライン引数を変数 <code class=\"code\">command-line-args-left</code> で取得で"
"きます（後述）。（コマンドライン引数の全リストは <code "
"class=\"code\">command-line-args</code> に含まれます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"Note that the handling of <code class=\"code\">command-switch-alist</code> "
"doesn&rsquo;t treat equals signs in <var class=\"var\">option</var> "
"specially.  That is, if there&rsquo;s an option like <code class=\"code\">--"
"name=value</code> on the command line, then only a <code "
"class=\"code\">command-switch-alist</code> member whose <code "
"class=\"code\">car</code> is literally <code class=\"code\">--name=value</"
"code> will match this option.  If you want to parse such options, you need "
"to use <code class=\"code\">command-line-functions</code> instead (see "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">command-switch-alist</code> の処理では、<var "
"class=\"var\">option</var> 内の等号を特別に扱うことはありません。つまり、コマ"
"ンドラインに <code class=\"code\">--name=value</code> のようなオプションがあ"
"る場合、<code class=\"code\">car</code> が文字通り <code class=\"code\">--"
"name=value</code> である <code class=\"code\">command-switch-alist</code> メ"
"ンバのみがこのオプションに一致します。このようなオプションをパースしたい場合"
"は、代わりに <code class=\"code\">command-line-functions</code> を使用する必"
"要があります（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"The command-line arguments are parsed by the <code class=\"code\">command-"
"line-1</code> function in the <samp class=\"file\">startup.el</samp> file.  "
"See also <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Emacs-Invocation.html#Emacs-Invocation\">Command Line "
"Arguments for Emacs Invocation</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
