#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the list of command-line arguments that have "
"not yet been processed."
msgstr "この変数の値は、まだ処理されていないコマンドライン引数のリストです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-line-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-command_002dline_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-line-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-command_002dline_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"This variable&rsquo;s value is a list of functions for handling an "
"unrecognized command-line argument.  Each time the next argument to be "
"processed has no special meaning, the functions in this list are called, in "
"order of appearance, until one of them returns a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、認識されないコマンドライン引数を処理するための関数リストで"
"す。処理対象となる次の引数に特別な意味がない場合、このリスト内の関数が、いず"
"れかが非<code class=\"code\">nil</code>値を返すまで、出現順に呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"These functions are called with no arguments.  They can access the command-"
"line argument under consideration through the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">argi</code>, which is bound temporarily at this point.  The "
"remaining arguments (not including the current one) are in the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">command-line-args-left</code>."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は引数なしで呼び出されます。この時点で一時的にバインドされる変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">argi</code> を通じて、対象のコマンドライン引数にアクセス"
"できます。残りの引数（現在の引数を除く）は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">command-line-args-left</code> に格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"When a function recognizes and processes the argument in <code "
"class=\"code\">argi</code>, it should return a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value to say it has dealt with that argument.  If it has also dealt "
"with some of the following arguments, it can indicate that by deleting them "
"from <code class=\"code\">command-line-args-left</code>."
msgstr ""
"関数が <code class=\"code\">argi</code> 内の引数を認識して処理した際は、その"
"引数を処理したことを示すために、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返"
"す必要があります。また、以下の引数の一部も処理した場合は、それらを <code "
"class=\"code\">command-line-args-left</code> から削除することでその旨を示すこ"
"とができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Command_002dLine-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"If all of these functions return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the "
"argument is treated as a file name to visit."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数がすべて <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す場合、その引数はア"
"クセス対象のファイル名として扱われます。"

