#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.5 User-Level Insertion Commands<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#User_002dLevel-Insertion-Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.5 ユーザーレベルの挿入コマンド<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#User_002dLevel-Insertion-Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This section describes higher-level commands for inserting text, commands "
"intended primarily for the user but useful also in Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"この節では、テキストを挿入するための上位レベルのコマンドや、主にユーザー向け"
"でありながらLispプログラムにおいても有用なコマンドについて説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from-buffer-"
"or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-insert_002dbuffer\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from-buffer-"
"or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-insert_002dbuffer\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts the entire accessible contents of <var "
"class=\"var\">from-buffer-or-name</var> (which must exist) into the current "
"buffer after point.  It leaves the mark after the inserted text.  The value "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">from-buffer-or-name</var>（存在している必"
"要があります）のアクセス可能な内容全体を、ポイント以降の現在のバッファに挿入"
"します。挿入されたテキストの後にマークを残します。値は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">self-insert-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional char</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"self_002dinsert_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">self-insert-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional char</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"self_002dinsert_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-insertion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-self_002dinsertion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-insertion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-self_002dinsertion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts the character <var class=\"var\">char</var> (the last "
"character typed); it does so <var class=\"var\">count</var> times, before "
"point, and returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Most printing "
"characters are bound to this command.  In routine use, <code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> is the most frequently called "
"function in Emacs, but programs rarely use it except to install it on a "
"keymap."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、文字 <var class=\"var\">char</var>（最後に入力された文字）を"
"挿入します。ポイントより前で <var class=\"var\">count</var> 回この処理を行"
"い、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。ほとんどの印刷文字はこのコマ"
"ンドにバインドされています。日常的な使用において、<code class=\"code\">self-"
"insert-command</code> は Emacs で最も頻繁に呼び出される関数ですが、キーマップ"
"に設定する場合を除き、プログラムがこれを使用することは稀です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"Self-insertion translates the input character through <code "
"class=\"code\">translation-table-for-input</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Translation-of-Characters.html\">Translation of Characters</a>."
msgstr ""
"自己挿入では、入力文字を<code class=\"code\">translation-table-for-input</"
"code>経由で変換します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Translation-of-"
"Characters.html\">文字の変換</a>を参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command calls <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</code> whenever "
"that is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and the character inserted is in "
"the table <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-chars</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Filling.html\">Auto Filling</a>)."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command performs abbrev expansion if Abbrev mode is enabled and the "
"inserted character does not have word-constituent syntax.  (See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Abbrevs.html\">Abbrevs and Abbrev Expansion</a>, and "
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">Table of Syntax Classes</"
"a>.)  It is also responsible for calling <code class=\"code\">blink-paren-"
"function</code> when the inserted character has close parenthesis syntax "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Blinking.html\">Blinking Parentheses</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、Abbrevモードが有効で、挿入された文字が単語構成要素の構文を持"
"たない場合に、略語展開を行います。（<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Abbrevs.html\">"
"略語と略語展開</a>、および<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">"
"構文クラス表</a>を参照してください。）また、挿入された文字が閉じ括弧の構文を"
"持つ場合に<code class=\"code\">blink-paren-function</code>を呼び出す役割も"
"担っています（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Blinking.html\">点滅する括弧</a>を参"
"照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-post_002dself_002dinsert_002dhook\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"self_002dinsert_002duses_002dregion_002dfunctions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-post_002dself_002dinsert_002dhook\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"self_002dinsert_002duses_002dregion_002dfunctions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"The final thing this command does is to run the hook <code "
"class=\"code\">post-self-insert-hook</code>.  You could use this to "
"automatically reindent text as it is typed, for example.  The functions on "
"this hook can use <code class=\"code\">last-command-event</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html\">Information from the Command "
"Loop</a>) to access the character just inserted."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドが最後に行う処理は、フック <code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-"
"hook</code> の実行です。例えば、これを利用して、テキストの入力に合わせて自動"
"的にインデントを再設定するといった使い方ができます。このフック内の関数では、"
"<code class=\"code\">last-command-event</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html\">コマンドループからの情報</a>を参照）を使用し"
"て、直前に挿入された文字にアクセスできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"If any function on this hook needs to act on the region (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-Region.html\">The Region</a>), it should make "
"sure Delete Selection mode (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Using-Region.html#Using-"
"Region\">Delete Selection</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>) doesn&rsquo;t delete the region before <code class=\"code\">post-self-"
"insert-hook</code> functions are invoked.  The way to do so is to add a "
"function that returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-uses-region-functions</code>, a special hook that "
"tells Delete Selection mode it should not delete the region."
msgstr ""
"このフック内の関数でリージョン（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-Region.html\">"
"リージョン</a>を参照）を操作する必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">post-"
"self-insert-hook</code> 関数が呼び出される前に、Delete Selection モード"
"（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Using-Region.html#Using-Region\">Delete Selection</a> を参照）がリー"
"ジョンを削除しないようにする必要があります。その方法は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> から <code class=\"code\">self-insert-uses-region-"
"functions</code> を返す関数を追加することです。これは、Delete Selection モー"
"ドに対してリージョンを削除しないよう指示する特殊なフックとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"Do not try substituting your own definition of <code class=\"code\">self-"
"insert-command</code> for the standard one.  The editor command loop handles "
"this function specially."
msgstr ""
"標準の <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> を独自の定義で置き換え"
"ようとしないでください。エディタのコマンドループでは、この関数を特別に処理し"
"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">newline</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"number-of-newlines interactive</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"newline-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">newline</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"number-of-newlines interactive</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"newline-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts newlines into the current buffer before point.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">number-of-newlines</var> is supplied, that many newline "
"characters are inserted.  In an interactive call, <var class=\"var\">number-"
"of-newlines</var> is the numeric prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ポイントより前の現在のバッファに改行を挿入します。<var "
"class=\"var\">number-of-newlines</var> を指定すると、その数だけ改行文字が挿入"
"されます。対話的な呼び出しでは、<var class=\"var\">number-of-newlines</var> "
"は数値のプレフィックス引数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-newline-and-Auto-Fill-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-newline-and-Auto-Fill-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command calls <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> to insert "
"newlines, which may subsequently break the preceding line by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-"
"Filling.html\">Auto Filling</a>).  Typically what <code class=\"code\">auto-"
"fill-function</code> does is insert a newline; thus, the overall result in "
"this case is to insert two newlines at different places: one at point, and "
"another earlier in the line.  <code class=\"code\">newline</code> does not "
"auto-fill if <var class=\"var\">number-of-newlines</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> を呼び出して改"
"行を挿入しますが、これによりその後 <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</"
"code> が呼び出され、直前の行が途切れることがあります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Auto-Filling.html\">自動補完</a> を参照）。通常、<code "
"class=\"code\">auto-fill-function</code> は改行を挿入します。したがって、この"
"場合の全体的な結果として、異なる2箇所（ポイントと、行のより前の位置）にそれぞ"
"れ改行が挿入されます。<var class=\"var\">number-of-newlines</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、<code class=\"code\">newline</code> は"
"自動補完を行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command does not run the hook <code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-"
"hook</code> unless called interactively or <var class=\"var\">interactive</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、対話的に呼び出された場合、または <var "
"class=\"var\">interactive</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合"
"を除き、フック <code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-hook</code> を実行しませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command indents to the left margin if that is not zero.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Margins.html\">Margins for Filling</a>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、左マージンが0でない場合に左マージンに合わせてインデントしま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Margins.html\">余白の設定</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid "The value returned is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr "返される値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ensure-empty-lines</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional number-of-empty-lines</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-ensure_002dempty_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ensure-empty-lines</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional number-of-empty-lines</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-ensure_002dempty_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command can be used to ensure that you have a specific number of empty "
"lines before point.  (An &ldquo;empty line&rdquo; is here defined as a line "
"with no characters on it&mdash;a line with space characters isn&rsquo;t an "
"empty line.)  It defaults to ensuring that there&rsquo;s a single empty line "
"before point."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドを使用すると、ポイントの前に指定した数の空行があることを確実にで"
"きます。（ここでの「空行」とは、文字が一切含まれていない行と定義されます。ス"
"ペース文字が含まれる行は空行ではありません。）デフォルトでは、ポイントの前に1"
"行の空行があることが保証されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"If point isn&rsquo;t at the beginning of a line, a newline character is "
"inserted first.  If there&rsquo;s more empty lines before point than "
"specified, the number of empty lines is reduced.  Otherwise it&rsquo;s "
"increased to the specified number."
msgstr ""
"ポイントが行頭にない場合、まず改行文字が挿入されます。ポイントの前に指定数よ"
"り多い空行がある場合は、空行の数が減らされます。そうでない場合は、指定数まで"
"増やされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overwrite-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"overwrite_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overwrite-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"overwrite_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Commands-for-Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls whether overwrite mode is in effect.  The value "
"should be <code class=\"code\">overwrite-mode-textual</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">overwrite-mode-binary</code>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  <code class=\"code\">overwrite-mode-textual</code> specifies textual "
"overwrite mode (treats newlines and tabs specially), and <code "
"class=\"code\">overwrite-mode-binary</code> specifies binary overwrite mode "
"(treats newlines and tabs like any other characters)."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、上書きモードが有効かどうかを制御します。値は <code "
"class=\"code\">overwrite-mode-textual</code>、<code class=\"code\">overwrite-"
"mode-binary</code>、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> のいずれかである必"
"要があります。<code class=\"code\">overwrite-mode-textual</code> はテキスト上"
"書きモード（改行やタブを特別に扱う）を指定し、<code class=\"code\">overwrite-"
"mode-binary</code> はバイナリ上書きモード（改行やタブを他の文字と同様に扱う）"
"を指定します。"

