#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<span>15.1 Common Item Keywords<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Common-"
"Item-Keywords\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>15.1 共通項目キーワード<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Common-Item-"
"Keywords\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customization-keywords\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customization-keywords\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"The customization declarations that we will describe in the next few "
"sections&mdash;<code class=\"code\">defcustom</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">defgroup</code>, etc.&mdash;all accept keyword arguments (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Constant-Variables.html\">Variables that Never "
"Change</a>) for specifying various information.  This section describes "
"keywords that apply to all types of customization declarations."
msgstr ""
"次のいくつかのセクションで説明するカスタマイズ宣言&mdash;<code "
"class=\"code\">defcustom</code>、<code class=\"code\">defgroup</code>など"
"&mdash;はいずれも、さまざまな情報を指定するためのキーワード引数（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Constant-Variables.html\">不変の変数</a>を参照）を受け"
"付けます。本セクションでは、すべての種類のカスタマイズ宣言に適用されるキー"
"ワードについて説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"All of these keywords, except <code class=\"code\">:tag</code>, can be used "
"more than once in a given item.  Each use of the keyword has an independent "
"effect.  The keyword <code class=\"code\">:tag</code> is an exception "
"because any given item can only display one name."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:tag</code>を除くこれらのキーワードはすべて、同一項目内"
"で複数回使用できます。キーワードを使用するたびに、それぞれ独立した効果が生じ"
"ます。ただし、<code class=\"code\">:tag</code>キーワードは例外で、同一項目に"
"表示できる名前は1つのみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-tag_002c-customization-keyword\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">:tag <var class=\"var\">label</var></code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-tag_002c-customization-keyword\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-tag_002c-customization-keyword\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">:tag <var class=\"var\">label</var></code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-tag_002c-customization-keyword\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Use <var class=\"var\">label</var>, a string, instead of the item&rsquo;s "
"name, to label the item in customization menus and buffers.  <strong "
"class=\"strong\">Don&rsquo;t use a tag which is substantially different from "
"the item&rsquo;s real name; that would cause confusion.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズメニューやバッファでアイテムにラベルを付ける際は、アイテム名の代"
"わりに文字列 <var class=\"var\">label</var> を使用してください。  <strong "
"class=\"strong\">アイテムの実際の名称と著しく異なるタグは使用しないでくださ"
"い。混乱を招く恐れがあります。</strong>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-group_002c-customization-keyword\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">:group <var class=\"var\">group</var></code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-group_002c-customization-keyword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-group_002c-customization-keyword\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">:group <var class=\"var\">group</var></code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-group_002c-customization-keyword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Put this customization item in group <var class=\"var\">group</var>.  If "
"this keyword is missing from a customization item, it&rsquo;ll be placed in "
"the same group that was last defined (in the current file)."
msgstr ""
"このカスタマイズ項目をグループ <var class=\"var\">group</var> に配置します。"
"カスタマイズ項目にこのキーワードが含まれていない場合は、（現在のファイル内"
"で）最後に定義されたグループに配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"When you use <code class=\"code\">:group</code> in a <code "
"class=\"code\">defgroup</code>, it makes the new group a subgroup of <var "
"class=\"var\">group</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">defgroup</code> 内で <code class=\"code\">:group</code> "
"を使用すると、新しいグループは <var class=\"var\">group</var> の部分群になり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"If you use this keyword more than once, you can put a single item into more "
"than one group.  Displaying any of those groups will show this item.  Please "
"don&rsquo;t overdo this, since the result would be annoying."
msgstr ""
"このキーワードを複数回使用すると、1つのアイテムを複数のグループに振り分けるこ"
"とができます。いずれかのグループを表示すると、このアイテムが表示されます。結"
"果が煩わしくなるため、使いすぎにはご注意ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-link_002c-customization-keyword\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">:link <var class=\"var\">link-data</var></code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-link_002c-customization-keyword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-link_002c-customization-keyword\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">:link <var class=\"var\">link-data</var></code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-link_002c-customization-keyword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Include an external link after the documentation string for this item.  This "
"is a sentence containing a button that references some other documentation."
msgstr ""
"この項目のドキュメント文字列の後に外部リンクを含めてください。これは、他のド"
"キュメントを参照するボタンを含む文章です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"There are several alternatives you can use for <var class=\"var\">link-data</"
"var>:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">link-data</var> の代わりに使用できる代替手段がいくつかあり"
"ます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(custom-manual <var class=\"var\">info-node</var>)</"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(custom-manual <var class=\"var\">info-node</var>)</"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Link to an Info node; <var class=\"var\">info-node</var> is a string which "
"specifies the node name, as in <code class=\"code\">&quot;(emacs)Top&quot;</"
"code>.  The link appears as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Manual]</"
"samp>&rsquo; in the customization buffer and enters the built-in Info reader "
"on <var class=\"var\">info-node</var>."
msgstr ""
"Infoノードへのリンク。<var class=\"var\">info-node</var>は、<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;(emacs)Top&quot;</code>のようにノード名を指定する文字列"
"です。リンクはカスタマイズバッファに&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Manual]</"
"samp>&rsquo;として表示され、<var class=\"var\">info-node</var>で組み込みの"
"Infoリーダーに入ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(info-link <var class=\"var\">info-node</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(info-link <var class=\"var\">info-node</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">custom-manual</code> except that the link appears "
"in the customization buffer with the Info node name."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">custom-manual</code>と同様ですが、リンクがInfoノード名と"
"共にカスタマイズバッファに表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(url-link <var class=\"var\">url</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(url-link <var class=\"var\">url</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Link to a web page; <var class=\"var\">url</var> is a string which specifies "
"the <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>.  The link appears in the "
"customization buffer as <var class=\"var\">url</var> and invokes the WWW "
"browser specified by <code class=\"code\">browse-url-browser-function</code>."
