# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"The most common reason to use <code class=\"code\">:require</code> is when a "
"variable enables a feature such as a minor mode, and just setting the "
"variable won&rsquo;t have any effect unless the code which implements the "
"mode is loaded."
