#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Common-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"For each <var class=\"var\">package</var>, which is a symbol, there are one "
"or more elements that contain a package version <var class=\"var\">pversion</"
