# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Comparing-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function lets you compare portions of the text in a buffer, without "
"copying them into strings first."
msgstr ""
"この関数を使うと、バッファ内のテキストの一部を、あらかじめ文字列にコピーする"
"ことなく比較できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Comparing-Text.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compare-buffer-substrings</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">buffer1 start1 end1 buffer2 start2 end2</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-compare_002dbuffer_002dsubstrings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compare-buffer-substrings</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">buffer1 start1 end1 buffer2 start2 end2</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-compare_002dbuffer_002dsubstrings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Comparing-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function lets you compare two substrings of the same buffer or two "
"different buffers.  The first three arguments specify one substring, giving "
"a buffer (or a buffer name) and two positions within the buffer.  The last "
"three arguments specify the other substring in the same way.  You can use "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var class=\"var\">buffer1</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer2</var>, or both to stand for the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数を使用すると、同一バッファ内の2つの部分文字列、または異なる2つのバッ"
"ファを比較できます。最初の3つの引数で一方の部分文字列を指定し、バッファ（また"
"はバッファ名）とバッファ内の2つの位置を指定します。最後の3つの引数で、もう一"
"方の部分文字列を同様に指定します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer1</var>、<var class=\"var\">buffer2</var>、またはその両方"
"に使用することで、現在のバッファを表すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Comparing-Text.html
msgid ""
"The value is negative if the first substring is less, positive if the first "
"is greater, and zero if they are equal.  The absolute value of the result is "
"one plus the index of the first differing characters within the substrings."
msgstr ""
"最初の部分文字列が小さい場合は値が負、大きい場合は正、等しい場合は0となりま"
"す。結果の絶対値は、部分文字列内で最初に異なる文字が現れるインデックスに1を加"
"えた値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Comparing-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function ignores case when comparing characters if <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  It always ignores text properties."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、文字の比較時に大文字小文字を区別しませ"
"ん。また、テキストプロパティは常に無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Comparing-Text.html
msgid ""
"Suppose you have the text &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobarbar&nbsp;haha!"
"rara!</samp>&rsquo; in the current buffer; then in this example the two "
"substrings are &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">rbar </samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">rara!</samp>&rsquo;.  The value is 2 because the first "
"substring is greater at the second character."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファにテキスト &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobarbar&nbsp;haha!"
"rara!</samp>&rsquo; があるとします。この例では、2つの部分文字列は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">rbar </samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">rara!"
"</samp>&rsquo; になります。最初の部分文字列の方が2文字目で大きいため、値は2と"
"なります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
