#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span>17.2 Byte-Compilation Functions<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Byte_002dCompilation-Functions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>17.2 バイトコンパイル関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Byte_002dCompilation-Functions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compilation-functions\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compilation-functions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"You can byte-compile an individual function or macro definition with the "
"<code class=\"code\">byte-compile</code> function.  You can compile a whole "
"file with <code class=\"code\">byte-compile-file</code>, or several files "
"with <code class=\"code\">byte-recompile-directory</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">batch-byte-compile</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">byte-compile</code> 関数を使えば、個別の関数やマクロ定義"
"をバイトコンパイルできます。<code class=\"code\">byte-compile-file</code> で"
"ファイル全体を、<code class=\"code\">byte-recompile-directory</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">batch-byte-compile</code> で複数のファイルをコンパイルで"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte_002dcompile_002ddebug\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte_002dcompile_002ddebug\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the byte compiler produces warning and/or error messages (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Compiler-Errors.html\">Compiler Errors</a>, for "
"details).  These messages are normally recorded in a buffer called <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Compile-Log*</samp>, which uses Compilation mode.  See <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Compilation-Mode.html#Compilation-Mode\">Compilation Mode</"
"a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  However, if the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">byte-compile-debug</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, error messages will be signaled as Lisp errors "
"instead (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Errors.html\">Errors</a>)."
msgstr ""
"バイトコンパイラは、時に警告および／またはエラーメッセージを生成します（詳細"
"は<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Compiler-Errors.html\">コンパイラエラー</a>を参"
"照）。これらのメッセージは通常、コンパイルモードを使用する<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Compile-Log*</samp>と呼ばれるバッファに記録されます。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Compilation-"
"Mode.html#Compilation-Mode\">コンパイルモード</a>を参照してください。ただし、"
"変数<code class=\"code\">byte-compile-debug</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合、エラーメッセージは代わりにLispエラーとし"
"て通知されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Errors.html\">エラー</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-compilation\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-compilation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Be careful when writing macro calls in files that you intend to byte-"
"compile.  Since macro calls are expanded when they are compiled, the macros "
"need to be loaded into Emacs or the byte compiler will not do the right "
"thing.  The usual way to handle this is with <code class=\"code\">require</"
"code> forms which specify the files containing the needed macro definitions "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Named-Features.html\">Features</a>).  "
"Normally, the byte compiler does not evaluate the code that it is compiling, "
"but it handles <code class=\"code\">require</code> forms specially, by "
"loading the specified libraries.  To avoid loading the macro definition "
"files when someone <em class=\"emph\">runs</em> the compiled program, write "
"<code class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code> around the <code "
"class=\"code\">require</code> calls (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Eval-"
"During-Compile.html\">Evaluation During Compilation</a>).  For more details, "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Compiling-Macros.html\">Macros and Byte "
"Compilation</a>."
msgstr ""
"バイトコンパイルを予定しているファイルにマクロ呼び出しを記述する際はご注意く"
"ださい。マクロ呼び出しはコンパイル時に展開されるため、マクロをEmacsにロードし"
"ておく必要があります。そうしないと、バイトコンパイラが正しく動作しません。こ"
"れを解決する一般的な方法は、必要なマクロ定義を含むファイルを指定する<code "
"class=\"code\">require</code>フォームを使用することです（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Named-Features.html\">Features</a>を参照）。通常、バイトコンパイラはコ"
"ンパイル対象のコードを評価しませんが、<code class=\"code\">require</code>"
"フォームについては特別に処理を行い、指定されたライブラリをロードします。コン"
"パイル済みプログラムを<em class=\"emph\">実行</em>する際にマクロ定義ファイル"
"のロードを避けるには、<code class=\"code\">require</code>呼び出しを<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code>で囲んで記述してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Eval-During-Compile.html\">Evaluation During "
"Compilation</a>を参照）。詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Compiling-"
"Macros.html\">Macros and Byte Compilation</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Inline (<code class=\"code\">defsubst</code>) functions are less "
"troublesome; if you compile a call to such a function before its definition "
"is known, the call will still work right, it will just run slower."
msgstr ""
"インライン (<code class=\"code\">defsubst</code>) 関数はそれほど厄介ではあり"
"ません。定義が知られる前にそのような関数の呼び出しをコンパイルしておけば、呼"
"び出しは問題なく動作し、単に実行速度が遅くなるだけです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-compile</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-byte_002dcompile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-compile</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-byte_002dcompile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function byte-compiles the function definition of <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>, replacing the previous definition with the "
"compiled one.  The function definition of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> "
"must be the actual code for the function; <code class=\"code\">byte-compile</"
"code> does not handle function indirection.  The return value is the byte-"
"code function object which is the compiled definition of <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Closure-"
"Objects.html\">Closure Function Objects</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の関数定義をバイトコンパイルし、元"
"の定義をコンパイル済みのものに置き換えます。<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> "
"の関数定義は、関数の実際のコードである必要があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">byte-compile</code> は関数の間接参照を処理しません。戻り値は、"
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> のコンパイル済み定義であるバイトコード関数オ"
"ブジェクトです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Closure-Objects.html\">クロージャ関"
"数オブジェクト</a>を参照）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun factorial (integer)\n"
"  &quot;Compute factorial of INTEGER.&quot;\n"
"  (if (= 1 integer) 1\n"
"    (* integer (factorial (1- integer)))))\n"
"&rArr; factorial\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(byte-compile 'factorial)\n"
"&rArr;\n"
"#[257\n"
"  &quot;\\211\\300U\\203^H^@\\300\\207\\211\\301^BS!_\\207&quot;\n"
"  [1 factorial] 4\n"
"  &quot;Compute factorial of INTEGER.\\n\\n(fn INTEGER)&quot;]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>&rsquo;s definition is a byte-code "
"function object, <code class=\"code\">byte-compile</code> does nothing and "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It does not compile the "
"symbol&rsquo;s definition again, since the original (non-compiled) code has "
"already been replaced in the symbol&rsquo;s function cell by the byte-"
"compiled code."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>の定義がバイトコード関数オブジェクトである場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">byte-compile</code>は何も行わず、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。元の（コンパイルされていない）コードが、"
"シンボルの関数セル内で既にバイトコンパイル済みコードに置き換えられているた"
"め、シンボルの定義を再コンパイルすることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The argument to <code class=\"code\">byte-compile</code> can also be a <code "
"class=\"code\">lambda</code> expression.  In that case, the function returns "
"the corresponding compiled code but does not store it anywhere."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">byte-compile</code> への引数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">lambda</code> 式であっても構いません。その場合、関数は対応する"
"コンパイル済みコードを返しますが、それをどこかに保存することはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compile-defun</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"arg</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-compile_002ddefun\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compile-defun</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"arg</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-compile_002ddefun\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This command reads the defun containing point, compiles it, and evaluates "
"the result.  If you use this on a defun that is actually a function "
"definition, the effect is to install a compiled version of that function."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、pointを含むdefunを読み込み、コンパイルし、その結果を評価しま"
"す。これを実際には関数定義であるdefunに対して使用した場合、その関数のコンパイ"
"ル済みバージョンをインストールすることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">compile-defun</code> normally displays the result of "
"evaluation in the echo area, but if <var class=\"var\">arg</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it inserts the result in the current buffer "
"after the form it has compiled."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">compile-defun</code> は通常、評価結果をエコー領域に表示"
"しますが、<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外の場合は、コンパイル済みのフォームの後に結果を現在のバッファに挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-compile-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-byte_002dcompile_002dfile\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-compile-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-byte_002dcompile_002dfile\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function compiles a file of Lisp code named <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> into a file of byte-code.  The output "
"file&rsquo;s name is made by changing the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</"
"samp>&rsquo; suffix into &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo;; if "
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var> does not end in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo;, it adds &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</"
"samp>&rsquo; to the end of <var class=\"var\">filename</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前の Lisp コードファイ"
"ルをバイトコードファイルにコンパイルします。出力ファイル名は、接尾辞の "
"'<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>' を '<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>' に変"
"更することで生成されます。もし <var class=\"var\">filename</var> が '<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>' で終わっていない場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> の末尾に '<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>' を付"
"加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Compilation works by reading the input file one form at a time.  If it is a "
"definition of a function or macro, the compiled function or macro definition "
"is written out.  Other forms are batched together, then each batch is "
"compiled, and written so that its compiled code will be executed when the "
"file is read.  All comments are discarded when the input file is read."
msgstr ""
"入力ファイルを1フォームずつ読み込んでコンパイルを行います。関数またはマクロの"
"定義である場合は、コンパイル済みの関数またはマクロ定義が出力されます。それ以"
"外のフォームはまとめて処理され、各バッチがコンパイルされた後、ファイル読み込"
"み時にそのコンパイル済みコードが実行されるように出力されます。入力ファイルの"
"読み込み時、すべてのコメントは破棄されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This command returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if there were no errors "
"and <code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  When called interactively, "
"it prompts for the file name."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、エラーがなければ <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでなけ"
"れば <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。対話的に呼び出された場合は、"
"ファイル名の入力を求めます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ ls -l push*\n"
"-rw-r--r-- 1 lewis lewis 791 Oct  5 20:31 push.el\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(byte-compile-file &quot;~/emacs/push.el&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ ls -l push*\n"
"-rw-r--r-- 1 lewis lewis 791 Oct  5 20:31 push.el\n"
"-rw-rw-rw- 1 lewis lewis 638 Oct  8 20:25 push.elc\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-recompile-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">directory &amp;optional flag force follow-symlinks</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-byte_002drecompile_002ddirectory\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-recompile-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">directory &amp;optional flag force follow-symlinks</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-byte_002drecompile_002ddirectory\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-library-compilation\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-library-compilation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This command recompiles every &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; "
"file in <var class=\"var\">directory</var> (or its subdirectories) that "
"needs recompilation.  A file needs recompilation if a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo; file exists but is older than the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; file."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">directory</var>（またはそのサブディレクト"
"リ）内にある、再コンパイルが必要なすべての &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</"
"samp>&rsquo; ファイルを再コンパイルします。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</"
"samp>&rsquo; ファイルが存在し、かつ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</"
"samp>&rsquo; ファイルよりも古い場合、そのファイルは再コンパイルが必要となりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; file has no "
"corresponding &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo; file, <var "
"class=\"var\">flag</var> says what to do.  If it is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this command ignores these files.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">flag</var> is 0, it compiles them.  If it is neither <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> nor 0, it asks the user whether to compile each "
"such file, and asks about each subdirectory as well."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo;ファイルに対応する&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo;ファイルがない場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">flag</var>で処理方法を指定します。これが<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合、このコマンドはこれらのファイルを無視します。"
"<var class=\"var\">flag</var>が0の場合、それらをコンパイルします。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>でも0でもない場合は、そのような各ファイルをコンパイ"
"ルするかどうかをユーザーに確認し、各サブディレクトリについても同様に確認しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Interactively, <code class=\"code\">byte-recompile-directory</code> prompts "
"for <var class=\"var\">directory</var> and <var class=\"var\">flag</var> is "
"the prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"対話的には、<code class=\"code\">byte-recompile-directory</code> が <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> の入力を求め、<var class=\"var\">flag</var> が"
"接頭辞引数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">force</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"this command recompiles every &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; "
"file that has a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo; file."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">force</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、このコマンドは <samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp> ファイルを持つすべての "
"<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp> ファイルを再コンパイルします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This command will normally not compile &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</"
"samp>&rsquo; files that are symlinked.  If the optional <var "
"class=\"var\">follow-symlink</var> parameter is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, symlinked &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</"
"samp>&rsquo; will also be compiled."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは通常、シンボリックリンクされた &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; ファイルはコンパイルしません。オプションの "
"<var class=\"var\">follow-symlink</var> パラメータが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、シンボリックリンクされた &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; もコンパイルされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compilation-Functions.html
msgid "The returned value is unpredictable."
msgstr "戻り値は予測不能です。"

