# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compiler-errors\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte_002dcompiler-errors\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compiler-errors\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte_002dcompiler-errors\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"Error and warning messages from byte compilation are printed in a buffer "
"named <samp class=\"file\">*Compile-Log*</samp>.  These messages include "
"file names and line numbers identifying the location of the problem.  The "
"usual Emacs commands for operating on compiler output can be used on these "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"バイトコンパイルによるエラーおよび警告メッセージは、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Compile-Log*</samp> という名前のバッファに出力されます。これ"
"らのメッセージには、問題の箇所を特定するためのファイル名と行番号が含まれてい"
"ます。コンパイラ出力を操作するための通常の Emacs コマンドを、これらのメッセー"
"ジに対しても使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"When an error is due to invalid syntax in the program, the byte compiler "
"might get confused about the error&rsquo;s exact location.  One way to "
"investigate is to switch to the buffer <samp "
"class=\"file\">&nbsp;*Compiler&nbsp;Input*</samp>.  (This buffer name starts "
"with a space, so it does not show up in the Buffer Menu.)  This buffer "
"contains the program being compiled, and point shows how far the byte "
"compiler was able to read; the cause of the error might be nearby.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-Errors.html\">Debugging Invalid Lisp Syntax</"
"a>, for some tips for locating syntax errors."
msgstr ""
"プログラムの構文が不正であることに起因するエラーが発生した場合、バイトコンパ"
"イラはエラーの正確な位置を特定できなくなることがあります。調査方法の一つとし"
"て、バッファ <samp class=\"file\">&nbsp;*Compiler&nbsp;Input*</samp> に切り替"
"える方法があります。（このバッファ名はスペースで始まるため、バッファメニュー"
"には表示されません。）このバッファにはコンパイル中のプログラムが含まれてお"
"り、ポインタはバイトコンパイラがどこまで読み込めたかを示しています。エラーの"
"原因はその付近にある可能性があります。構文エラーの特定に関するヒントについて"
"は、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-Errors.html\">無効なLisp構文のデバッグ</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte_002dcompiler-warnings\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-free-variable_002c-byte_002dcompiler-"
"warning\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reference-to-free-"
"variable_002c-compilation-warning\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-function-not-known-to-be-defined_002c-compilation-warning\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-byte_002dcompiler-warnings\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-free-variable_002c-byte_002dcompiler-"
"warning\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reference-to-free-"
"variable_002c-compilation-warning\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-function-not-known-to-be-defined_002c-compilation-warning\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"A common type of warning issued by the byte compiler is for functions and "
"variables that were used but not defined.  Such warnings report the line "
"number for the end of the file, not the locations where the missing "
"functions or variables were used; to find these, you must search the file "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"バイトコンパイラが出力する一般的な警告の一つに、使用されたものの定義されてい"
"ない関数や変数に関するものがあります。こうした警告では、欠落している関数や変"
"数が使用されていた箇所ではなく、ファイル末尾の行番号が報告されます。これらを"
"特定するには、ファイルを手動で検索する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"If you are sure that a warning message about a missing function or variable "
"is unjustified, there are several ways to suppress it:"
msgstr ""
"関数や変数が見つからないという警告メッセージが不当であると確信している場合"
"は、それを抑制する方法がいくつかあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"You can suppress the warning for a specific call to a function <var "
"class=\"var\">func</var> by conditionalizing it on an <code "
"class=\"code\">fboundp</code> test, like this:"
msgstr ""
"次のように、<code class=\"code\">fboundp</code> の判定を条件にすることで、特"
"定の関数呼び出し <var class=\"var\">func</var> に対する警告を抑制できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(if (fboundp '<var class=\"var\">func</var>) ...(<var class=\"var\">func</var> ...)...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"The call to <var class=\"var\">func</var> must be in the <var "
"class=\"var\">then-form</var> of the <code class=\"code\">if</code>, and "
"<var class=\"var\">func</var> must appear quoted in the call to <code "
"class=\"code\">fboundp</code>.  (This feature operates for <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> as well.)"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">func</var> への呼び出しは <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"の <var class=\"var\">then-form</var> 内に記述する必要があり、<var "
"class=\"var\">func</var> は <code class=\"code\">fboundp</code> への呼び出し"
"の中で引用符で囲んで記述しなければなりません。（この機能は <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> でも同様に動作します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, you can suppress the warning for a specific use of a variable <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> by conditionalizing it on a <code "
"class=\"code\">boundp</code> test:"
msgstr ""
"同様に、<code class=\"code\">boundp</code> の判定を条件とすることで、変数 "
"<var class=\"var\">variable</var> の特定の使用箇所における警告を抑制できま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(if (boundp '<var class=\"var\">variable</var>) ...<var class=\"var\">variable</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"The reference to <var class=\"var\">variable</var> must be in the <var "
"class=\"var\">then-form</var> of the <code class=\"code\">if</code>, and "
"<var class=\"var\">variable</var> must appear quoted in the call to <code "
"class=\"code\">boundp</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">variable</var>への参照は<code class=\"code\">if</code>の"
"<var class=\"var\">then-form</var>内になければならず、<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var>は<code class=\"code\">boundp</code>の呼び出しに"
"おいて引用符で囲まれて出現しなければならない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"You can tell the compiler that a function is defined using <code "
"class=\"code\">declare-function</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Declaring-Functions.html\">Telling the Compiler that a Function is "
"Defined</a>."
msgstr ""
"関数が<code class=\"code\">declare-function</code>を用いて定義されていること"
"をコンパイラに伝えることができます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Declaring-"
"Functions.html\">関数が定義されていることをコンパイラに伝える</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, you can tell the compiler that a variable is defined using <code "
"class=\"code\">defvar</code> with no initial value.  (Note that this marks "
"the variable as special, i.e. dynamically bound, but only within the current "
"lexical scope, or file if at top-level.)  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Variables.html\">Defining Global Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"同様に、変数を初期値なしで <code class=\"code\">defvar</code> を用いて定義す"
"ることをコンパイラに指定できます。（なお、これにより変数は特殊、すなわち動的"
"束縛として扱われますが、これは現在の字句スコープ内、あるいはトップレベルであ"
"ればファイル内でのみ適用されます。）<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-"
"Variables.html\">グローバル変数の定義</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"You can also suppress compiler warnings within a certain expression using "
"the <code class=\"code\">with-suppressed-warnings</code> macro:"
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">with-suppressed-warnings</code> マクロを使用して、"
"特定の式内でのコンパイラ警告を抑制することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-suppressed-warnings</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">warnings body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002dsuppressed_002dwarnings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-suppressed-warnings</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">warnings body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002dsuppressed_002dwarnings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"In execution, this is equivalent to <code class=\"code\">(progn <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>...)</code>, but the compiler does not issue "
"warnings for the specified conditions in <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  "
"<var class=\"var\">warnings</var> is an association list of warning symbols "
"and function/variable symbols they apply to.  For instance, if you wish to "
"call an obsolete function called <code class=\"code\">foo</code>, but want "
"to suppress the compilation warning, say:"
msgstr ""
"実行上、これは <code class=\"code\">(progn <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>...)</code> と同等ですが、コンパイラは <var class=\"var\">body</var> で指"
"定された条件に対して警告を出しません。  <var class=\"var\">warnings</var> "
"は、警告シンボルと、それらが適用される関数・変数シンボルの関連付けリストで"
"す。  例えば、<code class=\"code\">foo</code> という廃止された関数を呼び出し"
"たいが、コンパイル警告を抑制したい場合は、次のように記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(with-suppressed-warnings ((obsolete foo))\n"
"  (foo ...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"For more coarse-grained suppression of compiler warnings, you can use the "
"<code class=\"code\">with-no-warnings</code> construct:"
msgstr ""
"コンパイラ警告をより粗粒度に抑制するには、<code class=\"code\">with-no-"
"warnings</code> 構文を使用できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
