# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Compiler-Errors.html
msgid ""
"In execution, this is equivalent to <code class=\"code\">(progn <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>...)</code>, but the compiler does not issue "
"warnings for anything that occurs inside <var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"実行上は <code class=\"code\">(progn <var class=\"var\">body</var>...)</"
"code> と同等ですが、コンパイラは <var class=\"var\">body</var> の内部で発生す"
