# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the completion table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>) used for "
"completion in the minibuffer.  This is the buffer-local variable that "
