"class=\"var\">require-match</var> argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> is <code class=\"code\">confirm-after-"
"completion</code>.  The confirmation is requested if the user attempts to "
"exit the minibuffer immediately after calling any command in this list."
msgstr ""
