# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Here are some variables that can be used to alter the default completion "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの補完動作を変更するために使用できる変数をいくつか紹介します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-styles\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-styles\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-styles</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"completion_002dstyles\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">completion-styles</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completion_002dstyles\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of completion style (symbols) to use "
"for performing completion.  A <em class=\"dfn\">completion style</em> is a "
"set of rules for generating completions.  Each symbol occurring this list "
"must have a corresponding entry in <code class=\"code\">completion-styles-"
"alist</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、補完を行う際に使用する補完スタイル（シンボル）のリストです。"
"<em class=\"dfn\">補完スタイル</em>とは、補完を生成するためのルールセットのこ"
"とです。このリストに含まれる各シンボルは、<code class=\"code\">completion-"
"styles-alist</code>に対応するエントリを持っている必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-styles-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completion_002dstyles_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-styles-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completion_002dstyles_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable stores a list of available completion styles.  Each element in "
"the list has the form"
msgstr ""
"この変数には、利用可能な補完スタイルの一覧が格納されています。一覧の各要素は"
"以下の形式となっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">style</var> <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> <var class=\"var\">all-completions</var> <var class=\"var\">doc</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Here, <var class=\"var\">style</var> is the name of the completion style (a "
"symbol), which may be used in the <code class=\"code\">completion-styles</"
"code> variable to refer to this style; <var class=\"var\">try-completion</"
"var> is the function that does the completion; <var class=\"var\">all-"
"completions</var> is the function that lists the completions; and <var "
"class=\"var\">doc</var> is a string describing the completion style."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">style</var> は補完スタイルの名前（シンボル）であ"
"り、<code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> 変数でこのスタイルを参照す"
"る際に使用できます。<var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> は補完を行う関"
"数、<var class=\"var\">all-completions</var> は補完内容を一覧表示する関数、そ"
"して <var class=\"var\">doc</var> は補完スタイルを説明する文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> and <var class=\"var\">all-"
"completions</var> functions should each accept four arguments: <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, <var class=\"var\">collection</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var>, and <var class=\"var\">point</var>.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, <var class=\"var\">collection</var>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> arguments have the same meanings as in <code "
"class=\"code\">try-completion</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>), and the <var "
"class=\"var\">point</var> argument is the position of point within <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  Each function should return a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value if it performed its job, and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if it did not (e.g., if there is no way to "
"complete <var class=\"var\">string</var> according to the completion style)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> および <var class=\"var\">all-"
"completions</var> 関数は、それぞれ <var class=\"var\">string</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var>、<var class=\"var\">predicate</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">point</var> の4つの引数を受け取る必要があります。<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>、<var class=\"var\">collection</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> 引数の意味は <code class=\"code\">try-"
"completion</code> と同様であり（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">基本補完関数</a> を参照）、<var class=\"var\">point</var> "
"引数は <var class=\"var\">string</var> 内におけるポイントの位置です。各関数"
"は、処理を完了した場合は non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 値を、完了しな"
"かった場合（例：補完スタイルに従って <var class=\"var\">string</var> を補完す"
"る方法がない場合など）は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"When the user calls a completion command like <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">Minibuffer Commands that Do Completion</"
"a>), Emacs looks for the first style listed in <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> and calls its <var class=\"var\">try-"
"completion</var> function.  If this function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs moves to the next listed completion style "
"and calls its <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> function, and so on "
"until one of the <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> functions "
"successfully performs completion and returns a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value.  A similar procedure is used for listing completions, via the "
"<var class=\"var\">all-completions</var> functions."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーが <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete</code> のような補完コマン"
"ド（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">補完を行うミニバッ"
"ファコマンド</a>を参照）を呼び出すと、Emacs は <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> に列挙されている最初のスタイルを探"
"し、その <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> 関数を呼び出します。この関数"
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すと、Emacs は次に列挙されている補完ス"
"タイルに移動してその <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> 関数を呼び出し、"
"いずれかの <var class=\"var\">try-completion</var> 関数が正常に補完を実行し"
"て <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返すまでこれを繰り返します。補完"
"の一覧表示についても、<var class=\"var\">all-completions</var> 関数を介して同"
"様の手順が用いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Completion-Styles.html#Completion-Styles\">Completion "
"Styles</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for a "
"description of the available completion styles."
msgstr ""
"利用可能な補完スタイルの説明については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Completion-Styles.html#Completion-"
"Styles\">Completion Styles</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
