# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-in-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Although completion is usually done in the minibuffer, the completion "
"facility can also be used on the text in ordinary Emacs buffers.  In many "
"major modes, in-buffer completion is performed by the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-"
"i</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> command, "
"bound to <code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code>.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Symbol-Completion.html#Symbol-Completion\">Symbol Completion</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  This command uses the "
"abnormal hook variable <code class=\"code\">completion-at-point-functions</"
"code>:"
msgstr ""
"補完は通常ミニバッファで行われますが、補完機能は通常のEmacsバッファ内のテキス"
"トに対しても利用可能です。多くのメジャーモードでは、バッファ内での補完は"
"<code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code>にバインドされた<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd>または<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd>コマンドによって行われます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Symbol-Completion.html#Symbol-"
"Completion\">Symbol Completion</a>を参照してください。このコマンドは、異常"
"フック変数<code class=\"code\">completion-at-point-functions</code>を使用しま"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-in-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-at-point-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completion_002dat_002dpoint_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-at-point-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completion_002dat_002dpoint_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-in-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The value of this abnormal hook should be a list of functions, which are "
"used to compute a completion table (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>) for completing the text at "
"point.  It can be used by major modes to provide mode-specific completion "
"tables (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">Major "
"Mode Conventions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この異常なフックの値は、ポイントにあるテキストを補完するための補完テーブル"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Completion.html\">基本補完関数</a>を参照）"
"を計算するために使用される関数のリストである必要があります。メジャーモードで"
"は、モード固有の補完テーブルを提供するためにこれを利用できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">メジャーモードの規約</a>"
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-in-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"When the command <code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code> runs, it "
"calls the functions in the list one by one, without any argument.  Each "
"function should return <code class=\"code\">nil</code> unless it can and "
"wants to take responsibility for the completion data for the text at point.  "
"Otherwise it should return a list of the following form:"
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code> が実行されると、リス"
"ト内の関数が引数なしで順次呼び出されます。各関数は、ポイント位置にあるテキス"
"トの完了データについて責任を負うことができ、かつそうしたい場合を除き、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要があります。それ以外の場合は、以下の形式"
"のリストを返す必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-in-Buffers.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">start</var> <var class=\"var\">end</var> <var class=\"var\">collection</var> . <var class=\"var\">props</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Completion-in-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> delimit the "
"text to complete (which should enclose point).  <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> is a completion table for completing that "
"text, in a form suitable for passing as the second argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">try-completion</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>); completion alternatives "
"will be generated from this completion table in the usual way, via the "
"completion styles defined in <code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Variables.html\">Completion "
"Variables</a>).  <var class=\"var\">props</var> is a property list for "
"additional information; any of the properties in <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-extra-properties</code> are recognized (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Variables.html\">Completion Variables</"
"a>), as well as the following additional ones:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> は、テキストを"
"補完するための範囲を区切ります（この範囲にはポイントが含まれる必要がありま"
"す）。<var class=\"var\">collection</var> は、そのテキストを補完するための補"
"完テーブルであり、<code class=\"code\">try-completion</code> の第2引数として"
"渡すのに適した形式になっています（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">基本補完関数</a>を参照）。補完の候補は、この補完テーブルか"
"ら、<code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> で定義された補完スタイルを"
"介して、通常の方法で生成されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-"
"Variables.html\">補完変数</a>を参照）。<var class=\"var\">props</var> は追加"
"情報のプロパティリストであり、<code class=\"code\">completion-extra-"
"properties</code> に含まれるプロパティのいずれか（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion-Variables.html\">補完変数</a>を参照）に加え、以下の追加プロ"
"パティも認識されます："

