#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>40.3 Condition Variables<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Condition-"
"Variables-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>40.3 条件変数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Condition-"
"Variables-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">condition variable</em> is a way for a thread to block "
"until some event occurs.  A thread can wait on a condition variable, to be "
"woken up when some other thread notifies the condition."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">条件変数</em>とは、スレッドがあるイベントが発生するまでブ"
"ロックするための仕組みです。スレッドは条件変数を待機し、別のスレッドがその条"
"件を通知した際にウェイクアップされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"A condition variable is associated with a mutex and, conceptually, with some "
"condition.  For proper operation, the mutex must be acquired, and then a "
"waiting thread must loop, testing the condition and waiting on the condition "
"variable.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"条件変数はミューテックスに関連付けられており、概念的にはある条件に関連付けら"
"れています。正しく動作させるには、ミューテックスを取得し、その後、待機中のス"
"レッドがループして条件を判定し、条件変数で待機する必要があります。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(with-mutex mutex\n"
"  (while (not global-variable)\n"
"    (condition-wait cond-var)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The mutex ensures atomicity, and the loop is for robustness&mdash;there may "
"be spurious notifications."
msgstr ""
"ミューテックスにより原子性が確保され、ループは堅牢性を高めるためのものです――"
"誤通知が発生する可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, the mutex must be held before notifying the condition.  The "
"typical, and best, approach is to acquire the mutex, make the changes "
"associated with this condition, and then notify it:"
msgstr ""
"同様に、条件を通知する前にミューテックスを保持する必要があります。一般的かつ"
"最適な手法は、ミューテックスを取得し、この条件に関連する変更を行った上で、通"
"知を行うことです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(with-mutex mutex\n"
"  (setq global-variable (some-computation))\n"
"  (condition-notify cond-var))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-condition-variable</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">mutex &amp;optional name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dcondition_002dvariable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-condition-variable</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">mutex &amp;optional name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dcondition_002dvariable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Make a new condition variable associated with <var class=\"var\">mutex</"
"var>.  If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is specified, it is a name given to "
"the condition variable.  It must be a string.  The name is for debugging "
"purposes only; it has no meaning to Emacs."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">mutex</var> に関連付けられた新しい条件変数を作成します。"
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> が指定されている場合、それは条件変数に付けられ"
"る名前です。文字列である必要があります。この名前はデバッグ目的のみであり、"
"Emacs にとっては意味を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">condition-variable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"condition_002dvariable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">condition-variable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"condition_002dvariable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> represents a condition variable, <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が条件変数を表す場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">condition-wait</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cond</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-condition_002dwait\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">condition-wait</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cond</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-condition_002dwait\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Wait for another thread to notify <var class=\"var\">cond</var>, a condition "
"variable.  This function will block until the condition is notified, or "
"until a signal is delivered to this thread using <code class=\"code\">thread-"
"signal</code>."
msgstr ""
"条件変数 <var class=\"var\">cond</var> に通知が入るまで待機します。この関数"
"は、条件が通知されるか、あるいは <code class=\"code\">thread-signal</code> を"
"用いてこのスレッドにシグナルが配信されるまでブロックされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"It is an error to call <code class=\"code\">condition-wait</code> without "
"holding the condition&rsquo;s associated mutex."
msgstr ""
"条件に関連付けられたミューテックスを保持せずに <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-wait</code> を呼び出すのはエラーです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">condition-wait</code> releases the associated mutex "
"while waiting.  This allows other threads to acquire the mutex in order to "
"notify the condition."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">condition-wait</code> は待機中に関連付けられたミューテッ"
"クスを解放します。これにより、他のスレッドがミューテックスを取得して条件を通"
"知できるようになります。"

