"name\">condition-notify</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cond "
"&amp;optional all</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"condition_002dnotify\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">condition-notify</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cond "
"&amp;optional all</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"condition_002dnotify\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Notify <var class=\"var\">cond</var>.  The mutex with <var "
"class=\"var\">cond</var> must be held before calling this.  Ordinarily a "
"single waiting thread is woken by <code class=\"code\">condition-notify</"
"code>; but if <var class=\"var\">all</var> is not <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then all threads waiting on <var class=\"var\">cond</var> are "
"notified."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">cond</var> に通知する。この呼び出しを行う前に、<var "
"class=\"var\">cond</var> のミューテックスを保持しておく必要がある。通常、"
"<code class=\"code\">condition-notify</code> によって待機中の単一スレッドが"
"ウェイクアップされるが、<var class=\"var\">all</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合は、<var class=\"var\">cond</var> で待機"
"しているすべてのスレッドに通知される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Condition-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">condition-notify</code> releases the associated mutex.  "
"This allows other threads to acquire the mutex in order to wait on the "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">condition-notify</code> は関連付けられたミューテックスを"
"解放します。これにより、他のスレッドがミューテックスを取得して条件待ちを行う"
"ことが可能になります。"

