#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.8 Conditional Compilation<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Conditional-Compilation-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.8 条件付きコンパイル<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Conditional-"
"Compilation-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"There will be times when you want certain code to be compiled only when a "
"certain condition holds.  This is particularly the case when maintaining "
"Emacs packages; to keep the package compatible with older versions of Emacs "
"you may need to use a function or variable which has become obsolete in the "
"current version of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"特定の条件が成立したときにのみ、あるコードをコンパイルさせたい場面があるで"
"しょう。これは特にEmacsパッケージのメンテナンスにおいて顕著です。パッケージを"
"旧バージョンのEmacsと互換性に保つためには、現行バージョンのEmacsでは廃止され"
"た関数や変数を使用する必要が生じる場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"You could just use a conditional form to select the old or new form at run "
"time, but this tends to output annoying warning messages about the obsolete "
"function/variable.  For such situations, the macro <code "
"class=\"code\">static-if</code> comes in handy.  It is patterned after the "
"special form <code class=\"code\">if</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Conditionals.html\">Conditionals</a>)."
msgstr ""
"実行時に条件式を用いて新旧のフォームを選択することもできますが、そうすると廃"
"止された関数や変数に関する煩わしい警告メッセージが出力されがちです。こうした"
"状況では、マクロ <code class=\"code\">static-if</code> が便利です。これは特殊"
"フォーム <code class=\"code\">if</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Conditionals.html\">条件式</a>を参照）をモデルにしています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"To use this facility for an older version of Emacs, copy the source for "
"<code class=\"code\">static-if</code> from the Emacs source file <samp "
"class=\"file\">lisp/subr.el</samp> into your package."
msgstr ""
"この機能を旧バージョンのEmacsで使用するには、Emacsのソースファイル <samp "
"class=\"file\">lisp/subr.el</samp> から <code class=\"code\">static-if</"
"code> のソースをパッケージにコピーしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">static-if</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition then-"
"form else-forms...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"static_002dif\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">static-if</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition then-"
"form else-forms...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"static_002dif\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"Test <var class=\"var\">condition</var> at macro-expansion time.  If its "
"value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, expand the macro to <var "
"class=\"var\">then-form</var>, otherwise expand it to <var "
"class=\"var\">else-forms</var> enclosed in a <code class=\"code\">progn</"
"code>.  <var class=\"var\">else-forms</var> may be empty."
msgstr ""
"マクロ展開時に <var class=\"var\">condition</var> をテストする。その値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であればマクロを <var class=\"var\">then-"
"form</var> に展開し、そうでなければ <code class=\"code\">progn</code> で囲ま"
"れた <var class=\"var\">else-forms</var> に展開する。<var class=\"var\">else-"
"forms</var> は空であってもよい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">static-when</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"body...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-static_002dwhen\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">static-when</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"body...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-static_002dwhen\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"Test <var class=\"var\">condition</var> at macro-expansion time.  If its "
"value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, expand the macro to evaluate "
"all <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms sequentially and return the value of "
"the last one, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there are none."
msgstr ""
"マクロ展開時に <var class=\"var\">condition</var> をテストする。その値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、マクロを展開してすべての <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> 形式を順次評価し、最後のものの値を返す。該当するもの"
"がない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">static-unless</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"body...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-static_002dunless\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">static-unless</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"body...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-static_002dunless\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"Test <var class=\"var\">condition</var> at macro-expansion time.  If its "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, expand the macro to evaluate all "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> forms sequentially and return the value of the "
"last one, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there are none."
msgstr ""
"マクロ展開時に <var class=\"var\">condition</var> をテストする。その値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であれば、マクロを展開してすべての <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> 形式を順次評価し、最後のものの値を返す。該当するもの"
"がない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of its use from CC Mode, which prevents a <code "
"class=\"code\">defadvice</code> form being compiled in newer versions of "
"Emacs:"
msgstr ""
"以下は、新しいバージョンのEmacsで<code class=\"code\">defadvice</code>形式が"
"コンパイルされるのを防ぐCC Modeにおける使用例です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditional-Compilation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(static-if (boundp 'comment-line-break-function)\n"
"    (progn)\n"
"  (defvar c-inside-line-break-advice nil)\n"
"  (defadvice indent-new-comment-line (around c-line-break-advice\n"
"                                             activate preactivate)\n"
"    &quot;Call `c-indent-new-comment-line' if in CC Mode.&quot;\n"
"    (if (or c-inside-line-break-advice\n"
"            (not c-buffer-is-cc-mode))\n"
"        ad-do-it\n"
"      (let ((c-inside-line-break-advice t))\n"
"        (c-indent-new-comment-line (ad-get-arg 0))))))\n"
msgstr ""

