# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Conditional control structures choose among alternatives.  Emacs Lisp has "
"five conditional forms: <code class=\"code\">if</code>, which is much the "
"same as in other languages; <code class=\"code\">when</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">unless</code>, which are variants of <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code>; <code class=\"code\">cond</code>, which is a generalized case "
"statement; and <code class=\"code\">pcase</code>, which is a generalization "
"of <code class=\"code\">cond</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html\">Pattern-Matching Conditional</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"条件制御構造は、複数の選択肢から一つを選びます。Emacs Lispには5つの条件形式が"
"あります。他の言語とほぼ同様の<code class=\"code\">if</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">if</code>のバリエーションである<code class=\"code\">when</"
"code>と<code class=\"code\">unless</code>、一般化されたcase文である<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code>、そして<code class=\"code\">cond</code>を一般化し"
"た<code class=\"code\">pcase</code>です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html\">パターンマッチング条件</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">if</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition then-form else-"
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-if\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">if</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition then-form else-"
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-if\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> chooses between the <var class=\"var\">then-"
"form</var> and the <var class=\"var\">else-forms</var> based on the value of "
"<var class=\"var\">condition</var>.  If the evaluated <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">then-form</var> is evaluated and the result returned.  "
"Otherwise, the <var class=\"var\">else-forms</var> are evaluated in textual "
"order, and the value of the last one is returned.  (The <var "
"class=\"var\">else</var> part of <code class=\"code\">if</code> is an "
"example of an implicit <code class=\"code\">progn</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Sequencing.html\">Sequencing</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> は、<var class=\"var\">condition</var> の値に"
"基づいて <var class=\"var\">then-form</var> と <var class=\"var\">else-"
"forms</var> のいずれかを選択します。評価された <var class=\"var\">condition</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<var class=\"var\">then-"
"form</var> が評価され、その結果が返されます。それ以外の場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">else-forms</var> がテキスト順に評価され、最後のものの値が返され"
"ます。（<code class=\"code\">if</code> の <var class=\"var\">else</var> 部分"
"は、暗黙的な <code class=\"code\">progn</code> の一例です。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Sequencing.html\">シーケンシング</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">condition</var> has the value <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, and no <var class=\"var\">else-forms</var> are "
"given, <code class=\"code\">if</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">condition</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を"
"持ち、<var class=\"var\">else-forms</var> が指定されていない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> is a special form because the branch that is "
"not selected is never evaluated&mdash;it is ignored.  Thus, in this example, "
"<code class=\"code\">true</code> is not printed because <code "
"class=\"code\">print</code> is never called:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> は、選択されなかった分岐が決して評価されず"
"&mdash;無視されるため、特殊な形式となります。したがって、この例では <code "
"class=\"code\">print</code> が呼び出されないため、<code class=\"code\">true</"
"code> は出力されません："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if nil\n"
"    (print 'true)\n"
"  'very-false)\n"
"&rArr; very-false\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">when</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition then-"
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-when\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">when</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition then-"
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-when\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"This is a variant of <code class=\"code\">if</code> where there are no <var "
"class=\"var\">else-forms</var>, and possibly several <var class=\"var\">then-"
"forms</var>.  In particular,"
msgstr ""
"これは<code class=\"code\">if</code>の変種であり、<var class=\"var\">else-"
"forms</var>が存在せず、<var class=\"var\">then-forms</var>が複数存在する場合"
"がある。具体的には、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(when <var class=\"var\">condition</var> <var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid "is entirely equivalent to"
msgstr "と完全に等価である"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(if <var class=\"var\">condition</var> (progn <var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var>) nil)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">unless</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-unless\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">unless</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-unless\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"This is a variant of <code class=\"code\">if</code> where there is no <var "
"class=\"var\">then-form</var>:"
msgstr ""
"これは <var class=\"var\">then-form</var> が存在しない <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> のバリアントです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(unless <var class=\"var\">condition</var> <var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if <var class=\"var\">condition</var> nil\n"
"   <var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">cond</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">clause&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-cond\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">cond</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">clause&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-cond\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> chooses among an arbitrary number of "
"alternatives.  Each <var class=\"var\">clause</var> in the <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> must be a list.  The <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> of this list is the <var class=\"var\">condition</var>; the remaining "
"elements, if any, the <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>.  Thus, a clause "
"looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> は任意の数の選択肢から一つを選びます。<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> 内の各 <var class=\"var\">clause</var> はリストで"
"ある必要があります。このリストの <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> が <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> であり、残りの要素（もしあれば）が <var "
"class=\"var\">body-forms</var> となります。したがって、節は次のようになりま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">condition</var> <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> tries the clauses in textual order, by "
"evaluating the <var class=\"var\">condition</var> of each clause.  If the "
"value of <var class=\"var\">condition</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the clause succeeds; then <code class=\"code\">cond</code> evaluates "
"its <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>, and returns the value of the last "
"of <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>.  Any remaining clauses are ignored."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> は、各節の <var class=\"var\">condition</"
"var> を評価することで、節をテキスト順に試行します。<var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であ"
"れば、その節は成功します。その後、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> が自身の "
"<var class=\"var\">body-forms</var> を評価し、<var class=\"var\">body-forms</"
"var> の最後の値を返します。残りの節は無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"If the value of <var class=\"var\">condition</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the clause fails, so the <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> moves on to the following clause, trying its <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">condition</var> の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の"
"場合、その節は失敗するため、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> は次の節へと進"
"み、自身の <var class=\"var\">condition</var> を試みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid "A clause may also look like this:"
msgstr "条項は、次のような形式になることもあります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">condition</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Then, if <var class=\"var\">condition</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> when tested, the <code class=\"code\">cond</code> form returns the "
"value of <var class=\"var\">condition</var>."
msgstr ""
"そして、テスト時に <var class=\"var\">condition</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> 形"
"式は <var class=\"var\">condition</var> の値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"If every <var class=\"var\">condition</var> evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, so that every clause fails, <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"すべての <var class=\"var\">condition</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> と評価され、すべての節が偽となる場合、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> "
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"The following example has four clauses, which test for the cases where the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">x</code> is a number, string, buffer and "
"symbol, respectively:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例には4つの節があり、それぞれ<code class=\"code\">x</code>の値が数値、"
"文字列、バッファ、シンボルである場合を判定します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cond ((numberp x) x)\n"
"      ((stringp x) x)\n"
"      ((bufferp x)\n"
"       (setq temporary-hack x) ; <span class=\"r\">multiple body-forms</span>\n"
"       (buffer-name x))        ; <span class=\"r\">in one clause</span>\n"
"      ((symbolp x) (symbol-value x)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Often we want to execute the last clause whenever none of the previous "
"clauses was successful.  To do this, we use <code class=\"code\">t</code> as "
"the <var class=\"var\">condition</var> of the last clause, like this: <code "
"class=\"code\">(t <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>)</code>.  The form "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> evaluates to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, "
"which is never <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, so this clause never fails, "
"provided the <code class=\"code\">cond</code> gets to it at all.  For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"多くの場合、それまでのどの節も成功しなかったときに、最後の節を実行したいと考"
"えます。これを実現するには、最後の節の <var class=\"var\">condition</var> と"
"して <code class=\"code\">t</code> を使用し、次のように記述します：<code "
"class=\"code\">(t <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>)</code>。形式 <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> は <code class=\"code\">t</code> と評価され、それが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> になることは決してないため、<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> がそこに到達しさえすれば、この節が失敗することはあ"
"りません。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq a 5)\n"
"(cond ((eq a 'hack) 'foo)\n"
"      (t &quot;default&quot;))\n"
"&rArr; &quot;default&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"This <code class=\"code\">cond</code> expression returns <code "
"class=\"code\">foo</code> if the value of <code class=\"code\">a</code> is "
"<code class=\"code\">hack</code>, and returns the string <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;default&quot;</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この <code class=\"code\">cond</code> 式は、<code class=\"code\">a</code> の"
"値が <code class=\"code\">hack</code> であれば <code class=\"code\">foo</"
"code> を、そうでなければ文字列 <code class=\"code\">&quot;default&quot;</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Any conditional construct can be expressed with <code class=\"code\">cond</"
"code> or with <code class=\"code\">if</code>.  Therefore, the choice between "
"them is a matter of style.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"任意の条件式は、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> で表現できます。したがって、どちらを選択するかはスタ"
"イルの問題です。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if <var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(cond (<var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var>) (t <var class=\"var\">c</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"It can be convenient to bind variables in conjunction with using a "
"conditional.  It&rsquo;s often the case that you compute a value, and then "
"want to do something with that value if it&rsquo;s non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The straightforward way to do that is to just "
"write, for instance:"
msgstr ""
"条件式と併せて変数をバインドしておくと便利な場合があります。値を計算し、その"
"値が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合にその値を使って何らかの処理を行"
"いたいというケースはよくあります。これを実現する単純な方法は、例えば次のよう"
"に記述することです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((result1 (do-computation)))\n"
"  (when result1\n"
"    (let ((result2 (do-more result1)))\n"
"      (when result2\n"
"        (do-something result2)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Since this is a very common pattern, Emacs provides a number of macros to "
"make this easier and more readable.  The above can be written the following "
"way instead:"
msgstr ""
"これは非常によくあるパターンであるため、Emacsではこれをより簡単かつ読みやすく"
"するためのマクロが数多く用意されています。上記は、代わりに次のように記述する"
"ことも可能です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(when-let* ((result1 (do-computation))\n"
"            (result2 (do-more result1)))\n"
"  (do-something result2))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"There&rsquo;s a number of variations on this theme, and they&rsquo;re "
"described below."
msgstr "このテーマにはいくつかのバリエーションがあり、以下に説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">if-let*</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">varlist then-form "
"else-forms...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"if_002dlet_002a\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">if-let*</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">varlist then-form "
"else-forms...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"if_002dlet_002a\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate each binding in <var class=\"var\">varlist</var>, stopping if a "
"binding value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If all are non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, return the value of <var class=\"var\">then-form</"
"var>, otherwise the last form in <var class=\"var\">else-forms</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">varlist</var>内の各バインディングを評価し、バインディング"
"値が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>であればそこで停止する。すべてが<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外であれば<var class=\"var\">then-form</var>の値"
"を、そうでなければ<var class=\"var\">else-forms</var>内の最後のフォームを返"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Conditionals.html
msgid ""
"Each element of <code class=\"code\">varlist</code> has the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">value-form</var>)</code>: <var class=\"var\">value-form</var> "
"is evaluated and <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is locally bound to the "
"result.  Bindings are sequential, as in <code class=\"code\">let*</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">Local Variables</a>).  "
"If only the test result of <var class=\"var\">value-form</var> is of "
"interest, use <code class=\"code\">_</code> for <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var>.  Then <var class=\"var\">value-form</var> is evaluated and checked for "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, but its value is not bound.  As a special "
"case, an entry of <code class=\"code\">varlist</code> may be of the form "
"just <code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">symbol</var></code>, which "
