"class=\"var\">profile</var>, which is a symbol.  You can later assign the "
"connection profile to one or more remote connections, and Emacs will apply "
"those variable settings to all process buffers for those connections.  The "
"list in <var class=\"var\">variables</var> is an alist of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>.  Example:"
