# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Connection-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Connection-local variables provide a general mechanism for different "
"variable settings in buffers with a remote connection (see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Remote-Files.html#Remote-Files\">Remote Files</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>).  They are bound and set "
"depending on the remote connection a buffer is dedicated to."
msgstr ""
"接続ローカル変数は、リモート接続先のバッファにおいて異なる変数設定を行うため"
"の汎用的な仕組みを提供します（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Remote-Files.html#Remote-Files\">Remote Files</a>を参"
"照）。これらの変数は、バッファが専用に割り当てられているリモート接続に応じて"
"バインドされ、設定されます。"

