# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">cons cell</em> is an object that consists of two slots, "
"called the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> slot and the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> slot.  Each slot can <em class=\"dfn\">hold</em> "
"any Lisp object.  We also say that the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of "
"this cons cell is whatever object its <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> slot "
"currently holds, and likewise for the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">コンスセル</em>とは、<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>スロッ"
"トと<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>スロットと呼ばれる2つのスロットからなるオ"
"ブジェクトです。各スロットには、任意のLispオブジェクトを<em class=\"dfn\">保"
"持</em>できます。また、このコンスセルの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>とは、"
"その<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>スロットが現在保持しているオブジェクトのこ"
"とであり、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>についても同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list-structure\"></a>"
