# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">list</em> is a series of cons cells, linked together so "
"that the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> slot of each cons cell holds either "
"the next cons cell or the empty list.  The empty list is actually the symbol "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Lists.html\">Lists</a>, for details.  Because most cons cells are "
"used as part of lists, we refer to any structure made out of cons cells as a "
"<em class=\"dfn\">list structure</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">リスト</em>とは、一連のコンスセルが連結されたもので、各コン"
"スセルの<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>スロットに、次のコンスセルまたは空リス"
"トのいずれかが格納されています。空リストは実際にはシンボル<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>です。詳細は<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lists.html\">リ"
"スト</a>を参照してください。ほとんどのコンスセルはリストの一部として用いられ"
"るため、コンスセルで構成されるあらゆる構造を<em class=\"dfn\">リスト構造</em>"
"と呼びます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-linked-list\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-linked-list\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><blockquote><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid ""
"A note to C programmers: a Lisp list thus works as a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">linked list</em> built up of cons cells.  Because pointers in "
"Lisp are implicit, we do not distinguish between a cons cell slot holding a "
"value versus pointing to the value."
msgstr ""
"C言語プログラマーへの注記：したがって、Lispのリストはコンスセルで構成される"
"<em class=\"dfn\">連結リスト</em>として機能します。Lispではポインタが暗黙的で"
"あるため、値を保持するコンスセルスロットと、値を指すスロットを区別しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-atoms\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-atoms\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid ""
"Because cons cells are so central to Lisp, we also have a word for an object "
"which is not a cons cell.  These objects are called <em class=\"dfn\">atoms</"
"em>."
msgstr ""
"コンスセルはLispにおいて極めて中心的な存在であるため、コンスセルではないオブ"
"ジェクトを指す言葉も用意されています。こうしたオブジェクトは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">アトム</em>と呼ばれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parenthesis\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
