# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Constant-Variables.html
msgid ""
"A small number of additional symbols are made read-only for various "
"practical reasons.  These include <code class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-"
"characters</code>, <code class=\"code\">most-positive-fixnum</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">most-negative-fixnum</code>, and a few others.  Any attempt "
"to set or bind these also signals a <code class=\"code\">setting-constant</"
"code> error."
msgstr ""
"さまざまな実用上の理由から、少数の追加シンボルが読み取り専用となっています。"
"これには <code class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-characters</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">most-positive-fixnum</code>、<code class=\"code\">most-"
"negative-fixnum</code> などが含まれます。これらを設定またはバインドしようとす"
"る試みも、<code class=\"code\">setting-constant</code> エラーとなります。"

