# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"A directory is a kind of file that contains other files entered under "
"various names.  Directories are a feature of the file system."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリとは、さまざまな名前で登録された他のファイルを格納するファイルの"
"一種です。ディレクトリはファイルシステムの機能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can list the names of the files in a directory as a Lisp list, or "
"display the names in a buffer using the <code class=\"code\">ls</code> shell "
"command.  In the latter case, it can optionally display information about "
"each file, depending on the options passed to the <code class=\"code\">ls</"
"code> command."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、ディレクトリ内のファイル名をLispリストとして出力したり、<code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code>シェルコマンドを用いてバッファにファイル名を表示した"
"りできます。後者の場合、<code class=\"code\">ls</code>コマンドに渡すオプショ"
"ンに応じて、各ファイルに関する情報を任意で表示することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">directory-files</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">directory "
"&amp;optional full-name match-regexp nosort count</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-directory_002dfiles\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">directory-files</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">directory "
"&amp;optional full-name match-regexp nosort count</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-directory_002dfiles\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of the names of the files in the directory <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var>.  By default, the list is in alphabetical "
"order."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ディレクトリ <var class=\"var\">directory</var> 内のファイル名の"
"一覧を返します。デフォルトでは、一覧はアルファベット順になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">full-name</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the function returns the files&rsquo; absolute file names.  "
"Otherwise, it returns the names relative to the specified directory."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">full-name</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、この関数はファイルの絶対ファイル名を返します。それ以外の場合は、指定し"
"たディレクトリを基準とした相対ファイル名を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">match-regexp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, this function returns only those file names whose non-directory part "
"contain a match for that regular expression&mdash;the other file names are "
"excluded from the list.  On case-insensitive filesystems, the regular "
