# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Contents-of-Directories.html
msgid ""
"By default, the file names returned are sorted lexicographically by basename "
"per subdirectory.  If <var class=\"var\">lessp</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, they are not sorted and appear in arbitrary order "
"in each subdirectory.  If <var class=\"var\">lessp</var> is neither <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> nor <code class=\"code\">t</code>, it should be a "
"function suitable as a <code class=\"code\">:lessp</code> predicate for "
