"name\">current-local-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dlocal_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the current buffer&rsquo;s local keymap, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if it has none.  In the following example, the "
"keymap for the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer (using Lisp "
"Interaction mode) is a sparse keymap in which the entry for <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>, <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> code 27, is "
