# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This variable is an alist describing keymaps that may or may not be active "
"according to the values of certain variables.  Its elements look like this:"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、特定の変数の値に応じて有効になったりならなかったりするキーマップ"
"を記述したalistです。その要素は以下のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">variable</var> . <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"The keymap <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is active whenever <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value.  Typically <var class=\"var\">variable</var> is the variable that "
"enables or disables a minor mode.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Keymaps-and-"
"Minor-Modes.html\">Keymaps and Minor Modes</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーマップ <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> は、<var class=\"var\">variable</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を持つ場合に有効になります。"
"通常、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> はマイナーモードを有効化または無効化"
"する変数です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html\">キー"
"マップとマイナーモード</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"Note that elements of <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code> do "
"not have the same structure as elements of <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-"
"alist</code>.  The map must be the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the "
"element; a list with the map as the second element will not do.  The <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> can be either a keymap (a list) or a symbol whose "
"function definition is a keymap."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code> の要素は <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-alist</code> の要素と同じ構造を持たない点に注意して"
"ください。マップはその要素の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> である必要があ"
"り、マップを第2要素とするリストでは不十分です。<small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> は、キーマップ（リスト）か、あるいは関数定義がキーマップであるシンボル"
"のいずれかとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"When more than one minor mode keymap is active, the earlier one in <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code> takes priority.  But you should "
"design minor modes so that they don&rsquo;t interfere with each other.  If "
"you do this properly, the order will not matter."
msgstr ""
"複数のマイナーモードキーマップが有効な場合、<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-"
"map-alist</code> で先に指定されている方が優先されます。ただし、マイナーモード"
"同士が干渉しないように設計すべきです。適切に設計すれば、順序は問題になりませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html\">Keymaps and "
"Minor Modes</a>, for more information about minor modes.  See also <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-key-binding</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html\">Functions for Key Lookup</a>)."
msgstr ""
"マイナーモードの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Keymaps-and-Minor-"
"Modes.html\">キーマップとマイナーモード</a>を参照してください。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-key-binding</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html\">キールックアップ用関数</a>を参照）も参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-minor_002dmode_002doverriding_002dmap_002dalist\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
