"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This variable allows major modes to override the key bindings for particular "
"minor modes.  The elements of this alist look like the elements of <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code>: <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> . <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>)</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数を使用すると、メジャーモードが特定のマイナーモードのキーバインドを上"
"書きできます。このalistの要素は、<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</"
"code>: <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">variable</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>)</code> の要素と同様の形式になっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"If a variable appears as an element of <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-"
"overriding-map-alist</code>, the map specified by that element totally "
"replaces any map specified for the same variable in <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数が <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</code> の要素とし"
"て現れる場合、その要素で指定されたマップは、<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-"
"map-alist</code> において同一の変数に対して指定されているあらゆるマップを完全"
"に置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</code> is automatically "
"buffer-local in all buffers."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</code> はすべてのバッ"
"ファにおいて自動的にバッファローカルになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overriding-local-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"overriding_002dlocal_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overriding-local-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"overriding_002dlocal_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this variable holds a keymap to use "
"instead of the buffer&rsquo;s local keymap, any text property or overlay "
"keymaps, and any minor mode keymaps.  This keymap, if specified, overrides "
"all other maps that would have been active, except for the current global "
"map."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、この変数には、バッファのローカル"
"キーマップ、テキストプロパティやオーバーレイのキーマップ、およびマイナーモー"
"ドのキーマップの代わりに使用するキーマップが格納されます。このキーマップが指"
"定されている場合、現在のグローバルマップを除き、有効になっていたはずの他のす"
"べてのマップを上書きします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overriding-terminal-local-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-overriding_002dterminal_002dlocal_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overriding-terminal-local-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-overriding_002dterminal_002dlocal_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this variable holds a keymap to use "
"instead of <code class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code>, the "
"buffer&rsquo;s local keymap, text property or overlay keymaps, and all the "
"minor mode keymaps."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、この変数には、<code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code>、バッファのローカルキーマップ、テ"
"キストプロパティまたはオーバーレイキーマップ、およびすべてのマイナーモード"
"キーマップの代わりに使用するキーマップが格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This variable is always local to the current terminal and cannot be buffer-"
"local.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple "
"Terminals</a>.  It is used to implement incremental search mode."
msgstr ""
"この変数は常に現在のターミナルにローカルであり、バッファローカルにはなり得ま"
"せん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を"
"参照してください。この変数は、インクリメンタル検索モードの実装に使用されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overriding-local-map-menu-flag</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-overriding_002dlocal_002dmap_002dmenu_002dflag\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overriding-local-map-menu-flag</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-overriding_002dlocal_002dmap_002dmenu_002dflag\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code> can affect the display "
"of the menu bar.  The default value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, so "
"those map variables have no effect on the menu bar."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code>または<code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code>の値がメニューバーの表示に"
"影響を与えることがあります。デフォルト値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>であ"
"るため、これらのマップ変数はメニューバーに影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"Note that these two map variables do affect the execution of key sequences "
"entered using the menu bar, even if they do not affect the menu bar "
"display.  So if a menu bar key sequence comes in, you should clear the "
"variables before looking up and executing that key sequence.  Modes that use "
"the variables would typically do this anyway; normally they respond to "
"events that they do not handle by &ldquo;unreading&rdquo; them and exiting."
msgstr ""
"なお、これら2つのマップ変数は、メニューバーの表示には影響しないものの、メ"
"ニューバーを使用して入力されたキーシーケンスの実行には影響を及ぼします。した"
"がって、メニューバーのキーシーケンスが入力された場合は、そのキーシーケンスを"
"参照して実行する前に、変数をクリアする必要があります。これらの変数を使用する"
"モードでは、通常いずれにせよこの処理が行われます。一般的に、処理対象外のイベ"
"ントに対しては、「アンリード（unreading）」して終了することで対応します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">special-event-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"special_002devent_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">special-event-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"special_002devent_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a keymap for special events.  If an event type has a "
"binding in this keymap, then it is special, and the binding for the event is "
"run directly by <code class=\"code\">read-event</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Special-Events.html\">Special Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、特殊イベント用のキーマップが格納されています。イベントタイプが"
"このキーマップにバインドされている場合、それは特殊イベントとなり、そのイベン"
"トのバインドは<code class=\"code\">read-event</code>によって直接実行されま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Special-Events.html\">特殊イベント</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">emulation-mode-map-alists</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-emulation_002dmode_002dmap_002dalists\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">emulation-mode-map-alists</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-emulation_002dmode_002dmap_002dalists\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a list of keymap alists to use for emulation modes.  It "
"is intended for modes or packages using multiple minor-mode keymaps.  Each "
"element is a keymap alist which has the same format and meaning as <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code>, or a symbol with a variable "
"binding which is such an alist.  The active keymaps in each alist are used "
"before <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、エミュレーションモードで使用するキーマップのalistのリストが格納"
"されています。これは、複数のマイナーモードキーマップを使用するモードやパッ"
"ケージ向けに用意されています。各要素は、<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-"
"alist</code>と同じ形式と意味を持つキーマップのalistか、あるいはそのような"
"alistである変数バインディングを持つシンボルです。各alist内で有効なキーマップ"
"は、<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code>および<code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-overriding-map-alist</code>よりも先に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transient-keymap\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transient-keymap\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-transient-map</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"&amp;optional keep-pred on-exit message timeout</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-set_002dtransient_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-transient-map</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"&amp;optional keep-pred on-exit message timeout</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-set_002dtransient_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This function adds <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> as a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">transient</em> keymap, which takes precedence over other "
"keymaps for one (or more) subsequent keys."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> を<em class=\"dfn\">一時的</em>な"
"キーマップとして追加します。これにより、後続の1つ（または複数）のキーにおい"
"て、他のキーマップよりも優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is used just once, to look up the "
"very next key.  If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">keep-pred</var> "
"is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the map stays active as long as the user "
"types keys defined in <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>; when the user types a "
"key that is not in <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>, the transient keymap is "
"deactivated and normal key lookup continues for that key."
msgstr ""
"通常、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> は直後のキーを参照するために一度だけ使"
"用されます。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">keep-pred</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、ユーザーが <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> で"
"定義されたキーを入力する限りマップは有効なままとなり、ユーザーが <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> に含まれないキーを入力すると、一時キーマップは無効"
"化され、そのキーに対する通常のキー参照が継続されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">keep-pred</var> argument can also be a function.  In "
"that case, the function is called with no arguments, prior to running each "
"command, while <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is active; it should return "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> "
"should stay active."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keep-pred</var> 引数には関数を指定することも可能です。その"
"場合、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> が有効な間、各コマンドを実行する前にそ"
"の関数が引数なしで呼び出されます。<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> を有効に保"
"つべき場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">on-exit</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies a function that is called, with no "
"arguments, after <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is deactivated."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">on-exit</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> が無効化された後に引数なし"
"で呼び出される関数を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">message</var> specifies the message "
"to display after activating the transient map.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">message</var> is a string, it is the format string for the "
"message, and any &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%k</samp>&rsquo; specifier in "
"that string is replaced with the list of keys from the transient map.  Any "
"other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value of <var "
"class=\"var\">message</var> stands for the default message format &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Repeat with %k</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">message</var> は、トランジェントマップを有"
"効にした後に表示するメッセージを指定します。<var class=\"var\">message</var> "
"が文字列の場合、それはメッセージのフォーマット文字列となり、その文字列内の任"
"意の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%k</samp>&rsquo; 指定子はトランジェントマッ"
"プのキー一覧に置き換えられます。<var class=\"var\">message</var> の値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、デフォルトのメッセージフォー"
"マット &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Repeat with %k</samp>&rsquo; となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"set_002dtransient_002dmap_002dtimeout\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"set_002dtransient_002dmap_002dtimeout\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">timeout</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should be a number that specifies how many "
"seconds of idle time to wait before deactivating <var class=\"var\">keymap</"
"var>.  The value of the variable <code class=\"code\">set-transient-map-"
"timeout</code>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, overrides the value "
"of this argument."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">timeout</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> を非アクティブにする前に何"
"秒間待機するかを指定する数値である必要があります。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">set-transient-map-timeout</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、この引数の値が上書きされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Controlling-Active-Maps.html
msgid ""
"This function works by adding and removing <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> "
"from the variable <code class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code>, "
"which takes precedence over all other active keymaps (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Searching-Keymaps.html\">Searching the Active Keymaps</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、変数 <code class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code> "
"に <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> を追加・削除することで動作し、他のすべての"
"有効なキーマップよりも優先されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Searching-"
"Keymaps.html\">有効なキーマップの検索</a>を参照）。"

