msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frame_002drelative-coordinate\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-coordinate_002c-relative-to-frame\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-position-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions that report positions of and within a "
"window.  Most of these functions report positions relative to an origin at "
"the native position of the window&rsquo;s frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">Frame Geometry</a>).  Some functions report "
"positions relative to the origin of the display of the window&rsquo;s "
"frame.  In any case, the origin has the coordinates (0, 0)  and X and Y "
"coordinates increase rightward and downward respectively."
msgstr ""
"本節では、ウィンドウ上およびウィンドウ内の位置を報告する関数について説明しま"
"す。これらの関数の多くは、ウィンドウフレームのネイティブ位置にある原点を基準"
"とした位置を報告します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">フ"
"レームジオメトリ</a>を参照）。一部の関数は、ウィンドウフレームのディスプレイ"
"の原点を基準とした位置を報告します。いずれの場合も、原点の座標は (0, 0) であ"
"り、X座標およびY座標はそれぞれ右方向および下方向に進むにつれて増加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"For the following functions, X and Y coordinates are reported in integer "
"character units, i.e., numbers of lines and columns respectively.  On a "
"graphical display, each &ldquo;line&rdquo; and &ldquo;column&rdquo; "
"corresponds to the height and width of the default character specified by "
"the frame&rsquo;s default font (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Font.html\">Frame Font</a>)."
msgstr ""
"以下の関数では、X座標およびY座標は整数文字単位（すなわち、それぞれ行数と列"
"数）で報告されます。グラフィカルディスプレイでは、各「行」および「列」は、フ"
"レームのデフォルトフォントで指定されたデフォルト文字の高さと幅に対応します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレームフォント</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-edges</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window body absolute pixelwise</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dedges\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-edges</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window body absolute pixelwise</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dedges\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of the edge coordinates of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is omitted "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の辺の座標のリストを返します。"
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が省略された場合、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が省略された場合は、選択中のウィンドウがデフォルト"
"となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The return value has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">top</var> <var class=\"var\">right</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">bottom</var>)</code>.  These list elements are, respectively, "
"the X coordinate of the leftmost column occupied by the window, the Y "
"coordinate of the topmost row, the X coordinate one column to the right of "
"the rightmost column, and the Y coordinate one row down from the bottommost "
"row."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">top</var> <var class=\"var\">right</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">bottom</var>)</code> という形式になります。これらのリスト要素"
"は、それぞれ、ウィンドウが占める最左列のX座標、最上行のY座標、最右列から右に1"
"列離れた位置のX座標、および最下行から1行下のY座標です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that these are the actual outer edges of the window, including any of "
"its decorations.  On a text terminal, if the window has a neighbor on its "
"right, its right edge includes the separator line between the window and its "
"neighbor."
msgstr ""
"なお、これらは装飾部分を含む、ウィンドウの実際の外縁であることに注意してくだ"
"さい。テキスト端末において、ウィンドウの右側に隣接ウィンドウがある場合、その"
"右端にはウィンドウと隣接ウィンドウの間の区切り線が含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">body</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means to return the edges corresponding to "
"the total size of <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means to return the edges of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s body.  If <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var class=\"var\">window</var> must "
"specify a live window."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">body</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、これは <var class=\"var\">window</var> の総サイズに対応するエッ"
"ジを返すことを意味します。<var class=\"var\">body</var> が non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のボディ"
"のエッジを返すことを意味します。<var class=\"var\">body</var> が non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<var class=\"var\">window</var> はライブ"
"ウィンドウを指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">absolute</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means to return edges relative to the native "
"position of <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s frame.  <var "
"class=\"var\">absolute</var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means to "
"return coordinates relative to the origin (0, 0) of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s display.  On non-graphical systems this "
"argument has no effect."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">absolute</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、これは <var class=\"var\">window</var> のフ"
"レームの本来の位置を基準としたエッジを返すことを意味します。<var "
"class=\"var\">absolute</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合"
"は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のディスプレイの原点 (0, 0) を基準とした"
"座標を返すことを意味します。非グラフィカルなシステムでは、この引数は効果を持"
"ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means to return the coordinates in terms of "
"the default character width and height of <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var>&rsquo;s frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">Frame "
"Font</a>), rounded if necessary.  <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means to return the coordinates in pixels.  "
"Note that the pixel specified by <var class=\"var\">right</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">bottom</var> is immediately outside of these edges.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">absolute</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> is implicitly non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> too."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、これは <var class=\"var\">window</var> のフ"
"レームのデフォルトの文字幅および高さ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Font.html\">フレームフォント</a> を参照）に基づいて、必要に応じて丸めた座標を"
"返すことを意味します。<var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、座標をピクセル単位で返すことを意味し"
"ます。なお、<var class=\"var\">right</var> および <var class=\"var\">bottom</"
"var> で指定されるピクセルは、これらの辺のすぐ外側に位置します。<var "
"class=\"var\">absolute</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"<var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> も暗黙的に <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-body-edges</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dbody_002dedges\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-body-edges</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dbody_002dedges\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the edges of <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s "
"body (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">Window Sizes</a>).  "
"Calling <code class=\"code\">(window-body-edges window)</code> is equivalent "
"to calling <code class=\"code\">(window-edges window t)</code>, see above."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var>のボディのエッジを返します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">ウィンドウサイズ</a>を参照）。"
"<code class=\"code\">(window-body-edges window)</code>を呼び出すことは<code "
"class=\"code\">(window-edges window t)</code>を呼び出すことと同等です（上記参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The following functions can be used to relate a set of frame-relative "
"coordinates to a window:"
msgstr ""
"以下の関数を使用して、フレーム相対座標の集合をウィンドウに関連付けることがで"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-at</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">x y &amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dat\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-at</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">x y &amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dat\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the live window at the coordinates <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> and <var class=\"var\">y</var> given in default "
"character sizes (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">Frame Font</"
"a>) relative to the native position of <var class=\"var\">frame</var> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">Frame Geometry</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> の本来の位置（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">フレームジオメトリ</a>を参照）を基準として、デ"
"フォルトの文字サイズ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレーム"
"フォント</a>を参照）における座標 <var class=\"var\">x</var> および <var "
"class=\"var\">y</var> のライブウィンドウを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coordinates-and-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If there is no window at that position, the return value is <code "
