# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Core-Advising-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"This macro removes <var class=\"var\">function</var> from the function "
"stored in <var class=\"var\">place</var>.  This only works if <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> was added to <var class=\"var\">place</var> "
"using <code class=\"code\">add-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">place</var>に格納されている関数から<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>を削除します。これは、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>が<code class=\"code\">add-function</code>を用い"
"て<var class=\"var\">place</var>に追加されている場合にのみ動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Core-Advising-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> is compared with functions added to <var "
"class=\"var\">place</var> using <code class=\"code\">equal</code>, to try "
"and make it work also with lambda expressions.  It is additionally compared "
"also with the <code class=\"code\">name</code> property of the functions "
"added to <var class=\"var\">place</var>, which can be more reliable than "
"comparing lambda expressions using <code class=\"code\">equal</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> は、ラムダ式でも動作するように、<code "
"class=\"code\">equal</code> を用いて <var class=\"var\">place</var> に追加さ"
"れた関数と比較されます。さらに、<var class=\"var\">place</var> に追加された関"
"数の <code class=\"code\">name</code> プロパティとも比較されますが、こちらは "
"<code class=\"code\">equal</code> を用いてラムダ式を比較するよりも信頼性が高"
"い場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
