"href=\"#index-advice_002dfunction_002dmember_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Core-Advising-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">advice</"
"var> is already in <var class=\"var\">function-def</var>.  Like for <code "
"class=\"code\">remove-function</code> above, instead of <var "
"class=\"var\">advice</var> being the actual function, it can also be the "
"<code class=\"code\">name</code> of the piece of advice."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">advice</var> が既に <var class=\"var\">function-def</var> "
"に含まれている場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を返してください。"
"前述の <code class=\"code\">remove-function</code> と同様に、<var "
"class=\"var\">advice</var> は実際の関数である代わりに、アドバイスの <code "
"class=\"code\">name</code> である場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
