# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Core-Advising-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate the interactive <var class=\"var\">spec</var> just like an "
"interactive call to a function with such a spec would, and then return the "
"corresponding list of arguments that was built.  E.g., <code "
"class=\"code\">(advice-eval-interactive-spec &quot;r\\nP&quot;)</code> will "
"return a list of three elements, containing the boundaries of the region and "
"the current prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"このような仕様を持つインタラクティブな<var class=\"var\">spec</var>を、関数へ"
"のインタラクティブな呼び出しと同様に評価し、構築された対応する引数リストを返"
"します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">(advice-eval-interactive-spec "
"&quot;r\\nP&quot;)</code>は、領域の境界と現在のプレフィックス引数を含む3つの"
"要素からなるリストを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Core-Advising-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"For instance, if you want to make the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x m</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">compose-mail</code>) command prompt for a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">From:</samp>&rsquo; header, you could say something like this:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x m</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">compose-mail</"
"code>) コマンドを &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">From:</samp>&rsquo; ヘッダーの"
"プロンプトにしたい場合は、次のように記述できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Core-Advising-Primitives.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun my-compose-mail-advice (&amp;rest _)\n"
"  &quot;Read From: address interactively.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive\n"
"   (lambda (spec)\n"
"     (let* ((user-mail-address\n"
"             (completing-read &quot;From: &quot;\n"
"                              '(&quot;one.address@example.net&quot;\n"
"                                &quot;alternative.address@example.net&quot;)))\n"
"            (from (message-make-from user-full-name\n"
"                                     user-mail-address))\n"
"            (spec (advice-eval-interactive-spec spec)))\n"
"       ;; Put the From header into the OTHER-HEADERS argument.\n"
"       (push (cons 'From from) (nth 2 spec))\n"
"       spec)))\n"
"  ;; This body is not used.\n"
"  nil)\n"
"\n"
"(advice-add 'compose-mail :interactive-only #'my-compose-mail-advice)\n"
msgstr ""

