# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"Edebug provides rudimentary coverage testing and display of execution "
"frequency."
msgstr "Edebugは、簡易的なカバレッジテストと実行頻度の表示機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"Coverage testing works by comparing the result of each expression with the "
"previous result; each form in the program is considered covered if it has "
"returned two different values since you began testing coverage in the "
"current Emacs session.  Thus, to do coverage testing on your program, "
"execute it under various conditions and note whether it behaves correctly; "
"Edebug will tell you when you have tried enough different conditions that "
"each form has returned two different values."
msgstr ""
"カバレッジテストは、各式の結果を直前の結果と比較することで行われます。現在の"
"Emacsセッションでカバレッジテストを開始して以来、各フォームが2つの異なる値を"
"返した場合、そのフォームはカバレッジ済みとみなされます。したがって、プログラ"
"ムのカバレッジテストを行うには、さまざまな条件下でプログラムを実行し、正しく"
"動作するかどうかを確認してください。十分な数の異なる条件を試し、各フォームが2"
"つの異なる値を返すようになった時点で、Edebugが通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"Coverage testing makes execution slower, so it is only done if <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-test-coverage</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</"
"a>).  Frequency counting is performed for all executions of an instrumented "
"function, even if the execution mode is Go-nonstop, and regardless of "
"whether coverage testing is enabled."
msgstr ""
"カバレッジテストは実行速度を低下させるため、<code class=\"code\">edebug-test-"
"coverage</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合にのみ実行されま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</a> を参"
"照）。頻度カウントは、実行モードが Go-nonstop である場合や、カバレッジテスト"
"が有効であるかどうかにかかわらず、インストルメンテーション対象関数のすべての"
"実行に対して行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-X-_003d\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dtemp_002ddisplay_002dfreq_002dcount\"></a>"
