# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x X =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edebug-display-"
"freq-count</code>) to display both the coverage information and the "
"frequency counts for a definition.  Just <kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-temp-display-freq-count</code>) displays the same "
"information temporarily, only until you type another key."
msgstr ""
"定義のカバレッジ情報と出現回数の両方を表示するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x X "
"=</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edebug-display-freq-count</code>) を使用してく"
"ださい。<kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edebug-temp-display-"
"freq-count</code>) では、別のキーを入力するまでの間だけ、同じ情報が一時的に表"
"示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-display-freq-count</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002ddisplay_002dfreq_002dcount\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
