"href=\"#index-edebug_002ddisplay_002dfreq_002dcount\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"This command displays the frequency count data for each line of the current "
"definition."
msgstr "このコマンドは、現在の定義の各行の周波数カウントデータを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"It inserts frequency counts as comment lines after each line of code.  You "
"can undo all insertions with one <code class=\"code\">undo</code> command.  "
"The counts appear under the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(</samp>&rsquo; "
"before an expression or the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo; "
"after an expression, or on the last character of a variable.  To simplify "
"the display, a count is not shown if it is equal to the count of an earlier "
"expression on the same line."
msgstr ""
"コードの各行の後に、コメント行として出現回数が挿入されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">undo</code> コマンドを1回実行することで、すべての挿入を取り消"
"すことができます。出現回数は、式の前の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(</"
"samp>&rsquo; 、式の後の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo; 、または"
"変数の最後の文字に表示されます。表示を簡素化するため、同じ行にある先行する式"
"の出現回数と一致する場合は、カウントは表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"The character &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">=</samp>&rsquo; following the "
"count for an expression says that the expression has returned the same value "
"each time it was evaluated.  In other words, it is not yet covered for "
"coverage testing purposes."
msgstr ""
"式のカウントに続く文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">=</samp>&rsquo; は、その式"
"が評価されるたびに同じ値を返してきたことを示します。言い換えれば、カバレッジ"
"テストの対象にはまだなっていないということです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"To clear the frequency count and coverage data for a definition, simply "
"reinstrument it with <code class=\"code\">eval-defun</code>."
msgstr ""
"定義の周波数カウントとカバレッジデータをクリアするには、単に <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-defun</code> で再計測してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"For example, after evaluating <code class=\"code\">(fac 5)</code> with a "
"source breakpoint, and setting <code class=\"code\">edebug-test-coverage</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, when the breakpoint is reached, the "
"frequency data looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、ソースブレークポイントで<code class=\"code\">(fac 5)</code>を評価し、"
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-test-coverage</code>を<code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>に設定した後、ブレークポイントに到達すると、周波数データは次のようになり"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun fac (n)\n"
"  (if (= n 0) (edebug))\n"
";#6           1      = =5\n"
"  (if (&lt; 0 n)\n"
";#5         =\n"
"      (* n (fac (1- n)))\n"
";#    5               0\n"
"    1))\n"
"a;#   0\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Coverage-Testing.html
msgid ""
"The comment lines show that <code class=\"code\">fac</code> was called 6 "
"times.  The first <code class=\"code\">if</code> statement returned 5 times "
"with the same result each time; the same is true of the condition on the "
"second <code class=\"code\">if</code>.  The recursive call of <code "
"class=\"code\">fac</code> did not return at all."
msgstr ""
"コメント行から、<code class=\"code\">fac</code> が 6 回呼び出されたことがわか"
"ります。最初の <code class=\"code\">if</code> 文は 5 回返り、その都度同じ結果"
"となりました。2 番目の <code class=\"code\">if</code> の条件についても同様で"
"す。<code class=\"code\">fac</code> の再帰呼び出しは、一度も返りませんでし"
"た。"

