#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<span>26.11 Creating, Copying and Deleting Directories<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Creating_002c-Copying-and-Deleting-Directories\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>26.11 ディレクトリの作成、コピー、削除<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Creating_002c-Copying-and-Deleting-Directories\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-creating_002c-copying-and-deleting-"
"directories\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-creating_002c-copying-and-deleting-"
"directories\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"Most Emacs Lisp file-manipulation functions get errors when used on files "
"that are directories.  For example, you cannot delete a directory with <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-file</code>.  These special functions exist to create "
"and delete directories."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどのEmacs Lispのファイル操作関数は、ディレクトリに対して使用するとエ"
"ラーが発生します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">delete-file</code>でディレクト"
"リを削除することはできません。ディレクトリの作成や削除を行うための専用関数が"
"用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mkdir\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mkdir\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">dirname "
"&amp;optional parents</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">dirname "
"&amp;optional parents</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"This command creates a directory named <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">parents</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, as "
"is always the case in an interactive call, that means to create the parent "
"directories first, if they don&rsquo;t already exist.  As a function, <code "
"class=\"code\">make-directory</code> returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> if <var class=\"var\">dirname</var> already exists as a directory and "
"<var class=\"var\">parents</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it successfully created <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var>.  <code class=\"code\">mkdir</code> is an alias "
"for this."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは <var class=\"var\">dirname</var> という名前のディレクトリを作"
"成します。インタラクティブな呼び出しでは常にそうであるように、<var "
"class=\"var\">parents</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、そ"
"れは親ディレクトリがまだ存在しないのであれば、まずそれらを作成することを意味"
"します。関数としての <code class=\"code\">make-directory</code> は、<var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> が既にディレクトリとして存在し、かつ <var "
"class=\"var\">parents</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合に "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を返し、<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> "
"の作成に成功した場合には <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">mkdir</code> はこれのエイリアスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-empty-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"&amp;optional parents</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dempty_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-empty-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"&amp;optional parents</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dempty_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"This command creates an empty file named <var class=\"var\">filename</var>.  "
"As <code class=\"code\">make-directory</code>, this command creates parent "
"directories if <var class=\"var\">parents</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">filename</var> already "
"exists, this command signals an error."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前の空ファイルを作"
"成します。<code class=\"code\">make-directory</code> として、<var "
"class=\"var\">parents</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合は、"
"親ディレクトリを作成します。<var class=\"var\">filename</var> が既に存在する"
"場合、このコマンドはエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">copy-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">dirname "
"newname &amp;optional keep-time parents copy-contents</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-copy_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">copy-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">dirname "
"newname &amp;optional keep-time parents copy-contents</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-copy_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"This command copies the directory named <var class=\"var\">dirname</var> to "
"<var class=\"var\">newname</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">newname</var> is a "
"directory name, <var class=\"var\">dirname</var> will be copied to a "
"subdirectory there.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Directory-"
"Names.html\">Directory Names</a>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> という名前のディレクトリを "
"<var class=\"var\">newname</var> にコピーします。<var class=\"var\">newname</"
"var> がディレクトリ名である場合、<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> はその配下"
"のサブディレクトリにコピーされます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Directory-"
"Names.html\">ディレクトリ名</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"It always sets the file modes of the copied files to match the corresponding "
"original file."
msgstr ""
"コピーしたファイルのファイルモードを、常に対応する元のファイルと同じに設定し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"The third argument <var class=\"var\">keep-time</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means to preserve the modification time of the "
"copied files.  A prefix arg makes <var class=\"var\">keep-time</var> non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"第3引数 <var class=\"var\">keep-time</var> が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> であることは、コピーしたファイルの更新日時を保持することを意味します。"
"接頭辞引数を指定すると、<var class=\"var\">keep-time</var> は non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"The fourth argument <var class=\"var\">parents</var> says whether to create "
"parent directories if they don&rsquo;t exist.  Interactively, this happens "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"4番目の引数 <var class=\"var\">parents</var> は、親ディレクトリが存在しない場"
"合に作成するかどうかを指定します。対話モードでは、デフォルトでこの処理が行わ"
"れます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"The fifth argument <var class=\"var\">copy-contents</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, means to copy the contents of <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> directly into <var class=\"var\">newname</var> "
"if the latter is a directory name, instead of copying <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> into it as a subdirectory."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-trash-1\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-delete_002dby_002dmoving_002dto_002dtrash-1\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-trash-1\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-delete_002dby_002dmoving_002dto_002dtrash-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">dirname "
"&amp;optional recursive trash</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">dirname "
"&amp;optional recursive trash</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes the directory named <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>.  "
"The function <code class=\"code\">delete-file</code> does not work for files "
"that are directories; you must use <code class=\"code\">delete-directory</"
"code> for them.  If <var class=\"var\">recursive</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, and the directory contains any files, <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-directory</code> signals an error.  If recursive is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, there is no error merely because the "
"directory or its files are deleted by some other process before <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-directory</code> gets to them."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> という名前のディレクトリを削"
"除します。関数 <code class=\"code\">delete-file</code> はディレクトリである"
"ファイルには適用されず、それらには <code class=\"code\">delete-directory</"
"code> を使用する必要があります。<var class=\"var\">recursive</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> であり、かつディレクトリにファイルが含まれている場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">delete-directory</code> はエラーを通知します。"
"recursive が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">delete-directory</code> が処理を行う前に他のプロセスによって"
"ディレクトリやそのファイルが削除されたという理由だけで、エラーになることはあ"
"りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Create_002fDelete-Dirs.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">delete-directory</code> only follows symbolic links at "
"the level of parent directories."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">delete-directory</code> は親ディレクトリレベルでのみシン"
"ボリックリンクを辿ります。"

