# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a buffer-local binding in the current buffer for <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> (a symbol).  Other buffers are not affected.  "
"The value returned is <var class=\"var\">variable</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにおいて <var class=\"var\">variable</var>（シンボ"
"ル）に対するバッファローカルなバインディングを作成します。他のバッファには影"
"響しません。返される値は <var class=\"var\">variable</var> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"The buffer-local value of <var class=\"var\">variable</var> starts out as "
"the same value <var class=\"var\">variable</var> previously had.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> was void, it remains void."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">variable</var> のバッファローカル値は、当初 <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> が持っていた値と同じになります。<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> が void だった場合は、引き続き void のままとなり"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">In buffer &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b1</samp>&rsquo;:</span>\n"
"(setq foo 5)                ; <span class=\"r\">Affects all buffers.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 5\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-local-variable 'foo)  ; <span class=\"r\">Now it is local in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b1</samp>&rsquo;.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"foo                         ; <span class=\"r\">That did not change</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 5                   ;   <span class=\"r\">the value.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq foo 6)                ; <span class=\"r\">Change the value</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 6                   ;   <span class=\"r\">in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b1</samp>&rsquo;.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"foo\n"
"     &rArr; 6\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">In buffer &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b2</samp>&rsquo;, the value hasn&rsquo;t changed.</span>\n"
"(with-current-buffer &quot;b2&quot;\n"
"  foo)\n"
"     &rArr; 5\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"Making a variable buffer-local within a <code class=\"code\">let</code>-"
"binding for that variable does not work reliably, unless the buffer in which "
"you do this is not current either on entry to or exit from the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>.  This is because <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"does not distinguish between different kinds of bindings; it knows only "
"which variable the binding was made for."
msgstr ""
"ある変数に対して <code class=\"code\">let</code> バインディング内でバッファ"
"ローカル変数を作成しても、その処理を行うバッファが <code class=\"code\">let</"
"code> への進入時および退出時のいずれにおいてもカレントでない限り、確実に動作"
"しません。これは、<code class=\"code\">let</code> が異なる種類のバインディン"
"グを区別せず、単にどの変数に対してバインディングが行われたかしか把握していな"
"いためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"It is an error to make a constant or a read-only variable buffer-local.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Constant-Variables.html\">Variables that Never "
"Change</a>."
msgstr ""
"定数や読み取り専用変数をバッファローカルにするのは誤りです。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Constant-Variables.html\">決して変化しない変数</a>を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"If the variable is terminal-local (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Multiple-"
"Terminals.html\">Multiple Terminals</a>), this function signals an error.  "
"Such variables cannot have buffer-local bindings as well."
msgstr ""
"変数がターミナルローカル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Multiple-"
"Terminals.html\">複数のターミナル</a>を参照）である場合、この関数はエラーを通"
"知します。このような変数は、バッファローカルな束縛を同時に持つことはできませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> do not use <code "
"class=\"code\">make-local-variable</code> for a hook variable.  The hook "
"variables are automatically made buffer-local as needed if you use the <var "
"class=\"var\">local</var> argument to <code class=\"code\">add-hook</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">remove-hook</code>."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> フック変数に <code "
"class=\"code\">make-local-variable</code> を使用しないでください。<code "
"class=\"code\">add-hook</code> または <code class=\"code\">remove-hook</"
"code> で <var class=\"var\">local</var> 引数を使用すれば、フック変数は必要に"
"応じて自動的にバッファローカルになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setq-local</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest pairs</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setq_002dlocal\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setq-local</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest pairs</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setq_002dlocal\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">pairs</var> is a list of variable and value pairs.  This "
"macro creates a buffer-local binding in the current buffer for each of the "
"variables, and gives them a buffer-local value.  It is equivalent to calling "
"<code class=\"code\">make-local-variable</code> followed by <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> for each of the variables.  The variables should "
"be unquoted symbols."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pairs</var> は変数と値のペアのリストです。このマクロは、現"
"在のバッファ内で各変数に対してバッファローカルなバインディングを作成し、それ"
"らにバッファローカルな値を割り当てます。これは、各変数に対して <code "
"class=\"code\">make-local-variable</code> を呼び、続いて <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> を呼び出すのと同等です。変数にはクォートされていな"
"いシンボルを指定してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq-local var1 &quot;value1&quot;\n"
"            var2 &quot;value2&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-variable-buffer-local</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">variable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dvariable_002dbuffer_002dlocal\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-variable-buffer-local</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">variable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dvariable_002dbuffer_002dlocal\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"This function marks <var class=\"var\">variable</var> (a symbol) "
"automatically buffer-local, so that any subsequent attempt to set it will "
"make it local to the current buffer at the time.  Unlike <code "
"class=\"code\">make-local-variable</code>, with which it is often confused, "
"this cannot be undone, and affects the behavior of the variable in all "
"buffers."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">variable</var>（シンボル）を自動的にバッファ"
"ローカルに設定するため、それ以降にこれを設定しようとするたびに、その時点での"
"カレントバッファに対してローカルになります。よく混同される <code "
"class=\"code\">make-local-variable</code> とは異なり、この設定を取り消すこと"
"はできず、すべてのバッファにおける変数の挙動に影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"A peculiar wrinkle of this feature is that binding the variable (with <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> or other binding constructs) does not create a "
"buffer-local binding for it.  Only setting the variable (with <code "
"class=\"code\">set</code> or <code class=\"code\">setq</code>), while the "
"variable does not have a <code class=\"code\">let</code>-style binding that "
"was made in the current buffer, does so."
msgstr ""
"この機能の特異な点は、変数をバインドしても（<code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"やその他のバインド構文を用いて）、バッファローカルなバインドが作成されないこ"
"とです。現在のバッファ内で作成された <code class=\"code\">let</code> 形式のバ"
"インドが存在しない状態で、単に変数を設定する（<code class=\"code\">set</"
"code> や <code class=\"code\">setq</code> を用いる）場合にのみ、バッファロー"
"カルなバインドが作成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">variable</var> does not have a default value, then "
"calling this command will give it a default value of <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">variable</var> already has "
"a default value, that value remains unchanged.  Subsequently calling <code "
"class=\"code\">makunbound</code> on <var class=\"var\">variable</var> will "
"result in a void buffer-local value and leave the default value unaffected."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">variable</var> にデフォルト値が設定されていない場合、この"
"コマンドを呼び出すと <code class=\"code\">nil</code> というデフォルト値が設定"
"されます。<var class=\"var\">variable</var> に既にデフォルト値が設定されてい"
"る場合は、その値は変更されません。その後、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> "
"に対して <code class=\"code\">makunbound</code> を呼び出すと、void 型のバッ"
"ファローカル値となり、デフォルト値には影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid "The value returned is <var class=\"var\">variable</var>."
msgstr "返される値は <var class=\"var\">variable</var> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> Don&rsquo;t assume that you "
"should use <code class=\"code\">make-variable-buffer-local</code> for user-"
"option variables, simply because users <em class=\"emph\">might</em> want to "
"customize them differently in different buffers.  Users can make any "
"variable local, when they wish to.  It is better to leave the choice to them."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> ユーザーがバッファごとに異なるカスタ"
"マイズを<em class=\"emph\">望む可能性がある</em>という理由だけで、ユーザーオ"
"プション変数に <code class=\"code\">make-variable-buffer-local</code> を使用"
"すべきだと決めつけないでください。ユーザーは必要に応じて、任意の変数をローカ"
"ルに設定できます。その選択はユーザーに任せるのが得策です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"The time to use <code class=\"code\">make-variable-buffer-local</code> is "
"when it is crucial that no two buffers ever share the same binding.  For "
"example, when a variable is used for internal purposes in a Lisp program "
"which depends on having separate values in separate buffers, then using "
"<code class=\"code\">make-variable-buffer-local</code> can be the best "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">make-variable-buffer-local</code> を使用するべきなのは、"
"2つのバッファが決して同じバインディングを共有しないことが極めて重要な場合で"
"す。例えば、別々のバッファに個別の値を保持することに依存しているLispプログラ"
"ムにおいて、変数を内部的な目的で使用する場合、<code class=\"code\">make-"
"variable-buffer-local</code> の使用が最善の解決策となり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defvar-local</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variable "
"&amp;optional value docstring</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defvar_002dlocal\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defvar-local</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variable "
"&amp;optional value docstring</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defvar_002dlocal\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"This macro defines <var class=\"var\">variable</var> as a variable with "
"initial value <var class=\"var\">value</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">docstring</var>, and marks it as automatically buffer-local.  "
"It is equivalent to calling <code class=\"code\">defvar</code> followed by "
"<code class=\"code\">make-variable-buffer-local</code>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> should be an unquoted symbol."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> を初期値 <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> および <var class=\"var\">docstring</var> を持つ変"
"数として定義し、自動的にバッファローカルとしてマークします。これは、<code "
"class=\"code\">defvar</code> を呼び出した後に <code class=\"code\">make-"
"variable-buffer-local</code> を呼び出すことと同等です。<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> はクォートされていないシンボルである必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">local-variable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variable "
"&amp;optional buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"local_002dvariable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">local-variable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variable "
"&amp;optional buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"local_002dvariable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffer_002dLocal.html
msgid ""
"This returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var class=\"var\">variable</"
"var> is buffer-local in buffer <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> (which "
"defaults to the current buffer); otherwise, <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> がバッファ <var "
