# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the two primitives for creating buffers.  <code "
"class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</code> creates a buffer if it finds no "
"existing buffer with the specified name; <code class=\"code\">generate-new-"
"buffer</code> always creates a new buffer and gives it a unique name."
msgstr ""
"本節では、バッファを作成するための2つのプリミティブについて説明します。<code "
"class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</code>は、指定された名前の既存バッファが見つ"
"からない場合にバッファを作成し、<code class=\"code\">generate-new-buffer</"
"code>は常に新しいバッファを作成して一意の名前を付与します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Both functions accept an optional argument <var class=\"var\">inhibit-buffer-"
"hooks</var>.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the buffer they "
"create does not run the hooks <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-query-functions</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing-Buffers.html\">Killing Buffers</a>), and "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-list-update-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer List</a>).  This avoids slowing down "
"internal or temporary buffers that are never presented to users or passed on "
"to other applications."
msgstr ""
"どちらの関数も、オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">inhibit-buffer-hooks</var> "
"を受け付けます。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、作成される"
"バッファではフック <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer-query-functions</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Killing-Buffers.html\">バッファの破棄</a> を参照）、および <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-list-update-hook</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-List.html\">バッファリスト</a> を参照）が実行されません。これに"
"より、ユーザーに提示されることも他のアプリケーションに渡されることもない内部"
"バッファや一時バッファの動作が遅くなるのを防ぎます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Other functions you can use to create buffers include <code "
"class=\"code\">with-output-to-temp-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Temporary-Displays.html\">Temporary Displays</a>) and <code "
"class=\"code\">create-file-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Visiting-Files.html\">Visiting Files</a>).  Starting a subprocess can "
"also create a buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Processes.html\">Processes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファを作成するために利用できるその他の機能には、<code "
"class=\"code\">with-output-to-temp-buffer</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Temporary-Displays.html\">一時ディスプレイ</a>を参照）や<code "
"class=\"code\">create-file-buffer</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Visiting-"
"Files.html\">ファイルの参照</a>を参照）があります。また、サブプロセスを起動す"
"ることでもバッファを作成できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Processes.html\">"
"プロセス</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-buffer-create</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-"
"name &amp;optional inhibit-buffer-hooks</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-get_002dbuffer_002dcreate\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-buffer-create</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-"
"name &amp;optional inhibit-buffer-hooks</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-get_002dbuffer_002dcreate\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a buffer named <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</"
"var>.  The buffer returned does not become the current buffer&mdash;this "
"function does not change which buffer is current."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> という名前のバッファを返し"
"ます。返されたバッファが現在のバッファになるわけではありません。この関数は現"
"在のバッファを変更しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> must be either a string or an "
"existing buffer.  If it is a string and a live buffer with that name already "
"exists, <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</code> returns that buffer.  "
"If no such buffer exists, it creates a new buffer.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is a buffer instead of a string, it is "
"returned as given, even if it is dead."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> は文字列か、既存のバッファのいずれか"
"である必要があります。文字列であり、かつ同名の有効なバッファが既に存在する場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</code> はそのバッファを返します。"
"そのようなバッファが存在しない場合は、新しいバッファを作成します。<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> が文字列ではなくバッファである場合は、たと"
"え無効であってもそのまま返されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(get-buffer-create &quot;foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;buffer foo&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The major mode for a newly created buffer is set to Fundamental mode.  (The "
"default value of the variable <code class=\"code\">major-mode</code> is "
"handled at a higher level; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Auto-Major-"
"Mode.html\">How Emacs Chooses a Major Mode</a>.)  If the name begins with a "
"space, the buffer initially disables undo information recording (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>)."
msgstr ""
"新規に作成されたバッファのメジャーモードは、ファンダメンタルモードに設定され"
"ます。（変数 <code class=\"code\">major-mode</code> のデフォルト値はより上位"
"のレベルで処理されます。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Auto-Major-Mode.html\">Emacs "
"がメジャーモードを選択する仕組み</a> を参照してください。）名前がスペースで始"
"まる場合、そのバッファでは初期状態でアンドゥ情報の記録が無効になります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">アンドゥ</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">generate-new-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"&amp;optional inhibit-buffer-hooks</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-generate_002dnew_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">generate-new-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"&amp;optional inhibit-buffer-hooks</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-generate_002dnew_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a newly created, empty buffer, but does not make it "
"current.  The name of the buffer is generated by passing <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> to the function <code class=\"code\">generate-new-"
"buffer-name</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Names.html\">Buffer "
"Names</a>).  Thus, if there is no buffer named <var class=\"var\">name</"
"var>, then that is the name of the new buffer; if that name is in use, a "
"suffix of the form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;<var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>&gt;</samp>&rsquo;, where <var class=\"var\">n</var> is an integer, is "
"appended to <var class=\"var\">name</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、新しく作成された空のバッファを返しますが、それをカレントにはしま"
"せん。バッファ名は、関数 <code class=\"code\">generate-new-buffer-name</"
"code> に <var class=\"var\">name</var> を渡すことで生成されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Names.html\">バッファ名</a> を参照）。したがっ"
"て、<var class=\"var\">name</var> という名前のバッファが存在しない場合、それ"
"が新しいバッファの名前になります。その名前が既に使用されている場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> に <var class=\"var\">n</var> を整数とした &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;<var class=\"var\">n</var>&gt;</samp>&rsquo; 形式の"
"接尾辞が付加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Buffers.html
msgid "An error is signaled if <var class=\"var\">name</var> is not a string."
