# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Frames.html
msgid ""
"A normal hook run when the Emacs server starts using a client frame.  When "
"this hook is called, the client frame is the selected one.  Note that, "
"depending on how <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> was invoked (see "
"<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
