# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a new sparse keymap with no entries.  (A "
"sparse keymap is the kind of keymap you usually want.)  The new keymap does "
"not contain a char-table, unlike <code class=\"code\">make-keymap</code>, "
"and does not bind any events."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、エントリのない新しいスパースキーマップを作成して返します。（ス"
"パースキーマップは、通常必要とされる種類のキーマップです。）新しいキーマップ"
"は、<code class=\"code\">make-keymap</code>とは異なり文字テーブルを含まず、い"
"かなるイベントもバインドしません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-sparse-keymap)\n"
"    &rArr; (keymap)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If you specify <var class=\"var\">prompt</var>, that becomes the overall "
"prompt string for the keymap.  You should specify this only for menu keymaps "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Defining-Menus.html\">Defining Menus</a>).  A "
"keymap with an overall prompt string will always present a mouse menu or a "
"keyboard menu if it is active for looking up the next input event.  "
"Don&rsquo;t specify an overall prompt string for the main map of a major or "
"minor mode, because that would cause the command loop to present a keyboard "
"menu every time."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">prompt</var> を指定すると、それがキーマップ全体のプロンプ"
"ト文字列になります。これはメニューキーマップに対してのみ指定してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Defining-Menus.html\">メニューの定義</a>を参照）。全体"
"のプロンプト文字列が設定されたキーマップは、次の入力イベントを調べるためにア"
"クティブな場合、常にマウスメニューまたはキーボードメニューを表示します。メ"
"ジャーモードやマイナーモードのメインマップに全体のプロンプト文字列を指定しな"
"いでください。そうすると、コマンドループが実行されるたびにキーボードメニュー"
"が表示されるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"prompt</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dkeymap\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"prompt</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dkeymap\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a new full keymap.  That keymap contains a "
"char-table (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-"
"Tables</a>) with slots for all characters without modifiers.  The new keymap "
"initially binds all these characters to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and "
"does not bind any other kind of event.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> specifies a prompt string, as in <code "
"class=\"code\">make-sparse-keymap</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、新しい完全なキーマップを作成して返します。このキーマップには、修"
"飾子のないすべての文字用のスロットを持つ文字テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">文字テーブル</a>を参照）が含まれています。新し"
"いキーマップは、初期状態でこれらすべての文字を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"にバインドし、それ以外の種類のイベントはバインドしません。引数<var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var>は、<code class=\"code\">make-sparse-keymap</code>"
"と同様にプロンプト文字列を指定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-keymap)\n"
"    &rArr; (keymap #^[nil nil keymap nil nil nil ...])\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"A full keymap is more efficient than a sparse keymap when it holds lots of "
"bindings; for just a few, the sparse keymap is better."
msgstr ""
"キーマップに多くのバインドがある場合、フルキーマップの方がスパースキーマップ"
"よりも効率的です。バインドがわずか数個であれば、スパースキーマップの方が適し"
"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;key "
"options... &amp;rest pairs...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;key "
"options... &amp;rest pairs...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"You can create a keymap with the functions described above, and then use "
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">Changing Key Bindings</a>) to specify "
"key bindings in that map.  When writing modes, however, you frequently have "
"to bind a large number of keys at once, and using <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> on them all can be tedious and error-"
"prone.  Instead you can use <code class=\"code\">define-keymap</code>, which "
"creates a keymap and binds a number of keys.  Here&rsquo;s a very basic "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"上述の機能を用いてキーマップを作成し、そのマップ内でキーバインドを指定するた"
"めに <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> を使用できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">キーバインドの変更</a> を"
"参照）。ただし、書き込みモードでは、一度に多数のキーをバインドする必要がある"
"ことが多く、すべてに <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> を使用するのは煩"
"雑でミスの原因にもなりかねません。代わりに <code class=\"code\">define-"
"keymap</code> を使用すれば、キーマップを作成して複数のキーをバインドできま"
"す。以下に非常に基本的な例を示します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(define-keymap\n"
"  &quot;n&quot; #'forward-line\n"
"  &quot;f&quot; #'previous-line\n"
"  &quot;C-c C-c&quot; #'quit-window)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a new sparse keymap, defines the keystrokes in <var "
"class=\"var\">pairs</var>, and returns the new keymap.  It signals an error "
"if there are duplicate key bindings in <var class=\"var\">pairs</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、新しいスパースキーマップを作成し、<var class=\"var\">pairs</var> "
"でキーストロークを定義して、新しいキーマップを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">pairs</var> に重複するキーバインドがある場合は、エラーを通知し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">pairs</var> is a list of alternating key bindings and key "
"definitions, as accepted by <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code>.  In "
"addition, the key can be the special symbol <code class=\"code\">:menu</"
"code>, in which case the definition should be a menu definition as accepted "
"by <code class=\"code\">easy-menu-define</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Easy-Menu.html\">Easy Menu</a>).  Here&rsquo;s a brief example of "
"this usage:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pairs</var> は、<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> で"
"受け付けられるキーバインドとキー定義を交互に並べたリストです。また、キーに特"
"殊記号 <code class=\"code\">:menu</code> を指定することもでき、その場合は定義"
"を <code class=\"code\">easy-menu-define</code> で受け付けられるメニュー定義"
"とする必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-Menu.html\">Easy Menu</"
"a> を参照）。以下に、この用法の簡単な例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(define-keymap :full t\n"
"  &quot;g&quot; #'eww-reload\n"
"  :menu '(&quot;Eww&quot;\n"
"          [&quot;Exit&quot; quit-window t]\n"
"          [&quot;Reload&quot; eww-reload t]))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"A number of keywords can be used before the key/definition pairs to change "
"features of the new keymap.  If any of the feature keywords is missing from "
"the <code class=\"code\">define-keymap</code> call, the default value for "
"that feature is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Here&rsquo;s a list of the "
"available feature keywords:"
msgstr ""
"キー/定義ペアの前に複数のキーワードを指定することで、新しいキーマップの機能を"
"変更できます。<code class=\"code\">define-keymap</code> の呼び出しにおいて機"
"能キーワードのいずれかが省略されている場合、その機能のデフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。利用可能な機能キーワードの一覧は以下の"
"通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:full</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:full</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, create a char-table keymap (as from "
"<code class=\"code\">make-keymap</code>) instead of a sparse keymap (as from "
"<code class=\"code\">make-sparse-keymap</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"#Creating-Keymaps\">Creating Keymaps</a>).  A sparse keymap is the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、スパースキーマップ（<code "
"class=\"code\">make-sparse-keymap</code> と同様。<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"#Creating-Keymaps\">キーマップの作成</a> を参照）ではなく、char-table "
"キーマップ（<code class=\"code\">make-keymap</code> と同様）を作成します。ス"
"パースキーマップがデフォルトです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:parent</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:parent</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value should be a keymap to use "
"as the parent (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Inheritance-and-"
"Keymaps.html\">Inheritance and Keymaps</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その値は親として使用するキーマッ"
"プである必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Inheritance-and-"
"Keymaps.html\">継承とキーマップ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:keymap</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:keymap</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value should be a keymap.  "
"Instead of creating a new keymap, the specified keymap is modified instead."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、値はキーマップである必要がありま"
"す。新しいキーマップを作成するのではなく、指定されたキーマップが変更されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:suppress</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:suppress</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the keymap will be suppressed with "
"<code class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">Changing Key Bindings</a>).  By default, "
"digits and the minus sign are exempt from suppressing, but if the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nodigits</code>, this suppresses digits and minus-sign "
"like it does with other characters."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、キーマップは <code "
"class=\"code\">suppress-keymap</code> で抑制されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">キーバインドの変更</a> を参照）。デフォル"
"トでは、数字とマイナス記号は抑制の対象外となりますが、値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nodigits</code> の場合は、他の文字と同様に数字とマイナス記号も"
"抑制されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:name</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:name</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value should be a string to use "
"as the menu for the keymap if you use it as a menu with <code "
"class=\"code\">x-popup-menu</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pop_002dUp-"
"Menus.html\">Pop-Up Menus</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">x-popup-"
"menu</code> でメニューとして使用するのであれば、その値はキーマップのメニュー"
"として使用する文字列とする必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Pop_002dUp-Menus.html\">ポップアップメニュー</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:prefix</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:prefix</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value should be a symbol to be "
"used as a prefix command (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-"
"Keys.html\">Prefix Keys</a>).  If this is the case, this symbol is returned "
"by <code class=\"code\">define-keymap</code> instead of the map itself."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、値はプレフィックスコマンドとして"
"使用されるシンボルである必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-"
"Keys.html\">プレフィックスキー</a>を参照）。この場合、マップ自体の代わりに、"
"このシンボルが <code class=\"code\">define-keymap</code> によって返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defvar-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name &amp;key "
"options... &amp;rest pairs...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defvar_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defvar-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name &amp;key "
"options... &amp;rest pairs...</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defvar_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"By far, the most common thing to do with a keymap is to bind it to a "
"variable.  This is what virtually all modes do&mdash;a mode called <code "
"class=\"code\">foo</code> almost always has a variable called <code "
"class=\"code\">foo-mode-map</code>."
msgstr ""
"キーマップで最も一般的な使い方は、変数にバインドすることです。ほぼすべての"
"モードがそうしており、<code class=\"code\">foo</code> というモードには、ほぼ"
"必ず <code class=\"code\">foo-mode-map</code> という変数が用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This macro defines <var class=\"var\">name</var> as a variable, passes <var "
"class=\"var\">options</var> and <var class=\"var\">pairs</var> to <code "
"class=\"code\">define-keymap</code>, and uses the result as the default "
"value for the variable.  It signals an error if there are duplicate key "
"bindings in <var class=\"var\">pairs</var>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">name</var>を変数として定義し、<var "
"class=\"var\">options</var>と<var class=\"var\">pairs</var>を<code "
"class=\"code\">define-keymap</code>に渡し、その結果を変数のデフォルト値として"
"使用します。また、<var class=\"var\">pairs</var>に重複するキーバインドがある"
"場合はエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">options</var> is mostly like the keywords in <code "
"class=\"code\">define-keymap</code>.  There&rsquo;s an additional <code "
"class=\"code\">:doc</code> keyword that provides the doc string for the "
"defined variable.  Here&rsquo;s an example:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">options</var> は基本的に <code class=\"code\">define-"
"keymap</code> のキーワードと同様です。さらに、定義された変数の docstring を提"
"供する <code class=\"code\">:doc</code> キーワードもあります。以下に例を示し"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap eww-textarea-map\n"
"  :parent text-mode-map\n"
"  :doc &quot;Keymap for the eww text area.&quot;\n"
"  &quot;RET&quot; #'forward-line\n"
"  &quot;TAB&quot; #'shr-next-link)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">:prefix</code> keyword can take an additional "
"value, <code class=\"code\">t</code>, which is an abbreviation for using "
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> as the value of that option.  I.e. instead of "
"writing"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:prefix</code> キーワードには、追加の値として <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を指定できます。これは <var class=\"var\">name</var> "
"をそのオプションの値として使用することの略記です。つまり、次のように記述する"
"代わりに"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap foo-map\n"
"  :prefix 'foo-map\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "you can write"
msgstr "書けます"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap foo-map\n"
"  :prefix t\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003arepeat\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-repeat_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-repeatable-key-bindings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003arepeat\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-repeat_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-repeatable-key-bindings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Each command in the keymap can be marked as &lsquo;repeatable&rsquo;, i.e. "
"usable in <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>, by putting a <code "
"class=\"code\">repeat-map</code> property on it, for example:"
msgstr ""
"キーマップ内の各コマンドには、例えば次のように<code class=\"code\">repeat-"
"map</code>プロパティを付与することで、「繰り返し可能」、すなわち<code "
"class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>で使用可能としてマークできます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(put 'undo 'repeat-map 'undo-repeat-map)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"where the value of the property is the map to be used by <code "
"class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>."
msgstr ""
"ここで、プロパティの値が <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code> で使用される"
"マップとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"To avoid repetitive invocations of <code class=\"code\">put</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">defvar-keymap</code> also has a <code class=\"code\">:repeat</"
"code> keyword, which can be used to specify which commands in the keymap are "
"usable by <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>.  The following values are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">put</code> の繰り返し呼び出しを避けるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">defvar-keymap</code> には <code class=\"code\">:repeat</code> "
"キーワードも用意されており、これを用いてキーマップ内のどのコマンドを <code "
"class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code> で使用可能にするかを指定できます。利用可能"
"な値は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This means all the commands in the keymap are repeatable, and is the most "
"common usage."
msgstr ""
"つまり、キーマップ内のすべてのコマンドが繰り返し実行可能であり、これが最も一"
"般的な使い方です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(:enter (commands ...) :exit (commands ...)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(:enter (commands ...) :exit (commands ...)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:continue (commands ...) :hints ((command . "
"&quot;hint&quot;) ...))</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:continue (commands ...) :hints ((command . "
"&quot;hint&quot;) ...))</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This specifies that the commands in the <code class=\"code\">:enter</code> "
"list enter <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>, and the commands in the "
"<code class=\"code\">:exit</code> list exit repeat mode."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">:enter</code> リストのコマンドが <code "
"class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code> に入り、<code class=\"code\">:exit</code> "
"リストのコマンドがリピートモードを抜けることを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If the <code class=\"code\">:enter</code> list is empty, then all commands "
"in the map enter <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>.  Specifying one or "
"more commands in this list is useful if there is a command which "
"doesn&rsquo;t exist in the map being defined, but which should have the "
"<code class=\"code\">repeat-map</code> property."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:enter</code> リストが空の場合、マップ内のすべてのコマン"
"ドが <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code> に入ります。このリストに1つ以上"
"のコマンドを指定することは、定義対象のマップに存在しないものの、<code "
"class=\"code\">repeat-map</code> プロパティを持つべきコマンドがある場合に有用"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If the <code class=\"code\">:exit</code> list is empty then no commands in "
"the map exit <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>.  Specifying one or "
"more commands in this list is useful if the keymap being defined contains a "
"command that should not have the <code class=\"code\">repeat-map</code> "
"property."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:exit</code> リストが空の場合、マップ内のどのコマンドも "
"<code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code> を終了しません。定義するキーマップ"
"に、<code class=\"code\">repeat-map</code> プロパティを持つべきではないコマン"
"ドが含まれている場合、このリストに1つ以上のコマンドを指定すると便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">:continue</code> list specifies the commands that "
"should not enter <code class=\"code\">repeat-mode</code>.  These command "
"should only continue the already activated repeating sequence."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:continue</code> リストは、<code class=\"code\">repeat-"
"mode</code> に入ってはならないコマンドを指定します。これらのコマンドは、すで"
"に有効化されている繰り返しシーケンスを継続させるものである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">:hints</code> list can contain cons pairs where the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is a command and the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> is a string that is displayed alongside of the "
"repeatable key in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:hints</code> リストには、<small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> がコマンドで、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> がエコー領域で繰り返し可"
"能なキーと共に表示される文字列であるコンスペアを含めることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"In order to make e.g. <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> repeat the <code "
"class=\"code\">undo</code> command, the following two stanzas are equivalent:"
msgstr ""
"例えば <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> に <code class=\"code\">undo</code> コマン"
"ドを繰り返させるには、以下の2つのスタンザは同等です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap undo-repeat-map\n"
"  &quot;u&quot; #'undo)\n"
"(put 'undo 'repeat-map 'undo-repeat-map)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html build/html/elisp/Library-Search.html
msgid "and"
msgstr "および"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap undo-repeat-map\n"
"  :repeat t\n"
"  &quot;u&quot; #'undo)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The latter is preferred when there are many commands in the map, all of "
"which should be repeatable."
msgstr ""
