# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Markers.html
msgid ""
"If passed a marker as its argument, <code class=\"code\">copy-marker</code> "
"returns a new marker that points to the same place and the same buffer as "
"does <var class=\"var\">marker-or-integer</var>.  If passed an integer as "
"its argument, <code class=\"code\">copy-marker</code> returns a new marker "
"that points to position <var class=\"var\">marker-or-integer</var> in the "
"current buffer."
