# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"The following functions create strings, either from scratch, or by putting "
"strings together, or by taking them apart.  (For functions that create "
"strings based on the modified contents of other strings, like <code "
"class=\"code\">string-replace</code> and <code class=\"code\">replace-regexp-"
"in-string</code>, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Search-and-"
"Replace.html\">Search and Replace</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"以下の関数は、文字列をゼロから作成したり、文字列を連結したり、あるいは分割し"
"たりして生成します。（<code class=\"code\">string-replace</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-regexp-in-string</code> のように、他の文字列の変更後の"
"内容に基づいて文字列を生成する関数については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Search-"
"and-Replace.html\">検索と置換</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count character "
"&amp;optional multibyte</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count character "
"&amp;optional multibyte</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string made up of <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"repetitions of <var class=\"var\">character</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is negative, an error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">character</var> を <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> 回繰り返した文字列を返します。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の値の"
"場合、エラーが通知されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-string 5 ?x)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;xxxxx&quot;\n"
"(make-string 0 ?x)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Normally, if <var class=\"var\">character</var> is an <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character, the result is a unibyte string.  "
"But if the optional argument <var class=\"var\">multibyte</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function will produce a multibyte string "
"instead.  This is useful when you later need to concatenate the result with "
"non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> strings or replace some of its "
"characters with non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters."
msgstr ""
"通常、<var class=\"var\">character</var> が <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> 文字である場合、結果はユニバイト文字列となります。しかし、オプション引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">multibyte</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"の場合、この関数は代わりにマルチバイト文字列を生成します。これは、後で結果を"
"非 <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字列と連結したり、一部の文字を非 "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字に置換したりする必要がある場合に有用"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Other functions to compare with this one include <code class=\"code\">make-"
"vector</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Vectors.html\">Vectors</a>) and "
"<code class=\"code\">make-list</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Building-Lists.html\">Building Cons Cells and Lists</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これと比較すべき他の関数には、<code class=\"code\">make-vector</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Vectors.html\">ベクトル</a>を参照）や<code "
"class=\"code\">make-list</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Building-"
"Lists.html\">Consセルとリストの構築</a>を参照）があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"characters</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-string\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"characters</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-string\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This returns a string containing the characters <var "
"class=\"var\">characters</var>."
msgstr ""
"これは、<var class=\"var\">characters</var> という文字を含む文字列を返しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(string ?a ?b ?c)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;abc&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"substring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"substring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new string which consists of those characters from "
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> in the range from (and including) the "
"character at the index <var class=\"var\">start</var> up to (but excluding) "
"the character at the index <var class=\"var\">end</var>.  The first "
"character is at index zero.  If <var class=\"var\">start</var> is omitted or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the first character; if <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"stands for the length of <var class=\"var\">string</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> のうち、インデックス <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> の文字から（含む）インデックス <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> の文字まで（ただし含まない）の文字で構成される新しい"
"文字列を返します。最初の文字のインデックスは 0 です。<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> が省略された場合、または <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> が指定された場合は、デフォルトで最初の文字となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> が省略された場合、または <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> が指定された場合は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> の長さを表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"With one argument, this function just copies <var class=\"var\">string</var>."
msgstr ""
"引数が1つの場合、この関数は単に <var class=\"var\">string</var> をコピーしま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substring &quot;abcdefg&quot; 0 3)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;abc&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"In the above example, the index for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</"
"samp>&rsquo; is 0, the index for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b</samp>&rsquo; "
"is 1, and the index for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo; is 2.  "
"The index 3&mdash;which is the fourth character in the string&mdash;marks "
"the character position up to which the substring is copied.  Thus, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">abc</samp>&rsquo; is copied from the string <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;abcdefg&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"上記の例では、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;のインデックスは0、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b</samp>&rsquo;のインデックスは1、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;のインデックスは2となります。インデックス"
"3&mdash;文字列の4番目の文字&mdash;は、部分文字列がコピーされる文字位置を示し"
"ます。したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">abc</samp>&rsquo;は文字列<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;abcdefg&quot;</code>からコピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"A negative number counts from the end of the string, so that &minus;1 "
"signifies the index of the last character of the string.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"負の数は文字列の末尾から数えられるため、&minus;1は文字列の最後の文字のイン"
"デックスを表します。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substring &quot;abcdefg&quot; -3 -1)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;ef&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"In this example, the index for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo; "
"is &minus;3, the index for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">f</samp>&rsquo; is "
"&minus;2, and the index for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">g</samp>&rsquo; is "
"&minus;1.  Therefore, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">f</samp>&rsquo; are included, and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">g</samp>&rsquo; is excluded."
msgstr ""
"この例では、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo;のインデックスは"
"&minus;3、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">f</samp>&rsquo;のインデックスは"
"&minus;2、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">g</samp>&rsquo;のインデックスは&minus;1"
"となります。したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo;と&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">f</samp>&rsquo;は含まれ、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">g</"
"samp>&rsquo;は除外されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is used for <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var>, it stands for the length of the string.  Thus,"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を用いる場"
"合、それは文字列の長さを表します。したがって、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substring &quot;abcdefg&quot; -3 nil)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;efg&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Omitting the argument <var class=\"var\">end</var> is equivalent to "
"specifying <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It follows that <code "
"class=\"code\">(substring <var class=\"var\">string</var> 0)</code> returns "
"a copy of all of <var class=\"var\">string</var>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">end</var> を省略することは、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定することと同等である。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">(substring <var class=\"var\">string</var> 0)</code> は <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> 全体のコピーを返すことになる。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substring &quot;abcdefg&quot; 0)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;abcdefg&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"But we recommend <code class=\"code\">copy-sequence</code> for this purpose "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sequence-Functions.html\">Sequences</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ただし、この目的には <code class=\"code\">copy-sequence</code> を推奨します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sequence-Functions.html\">シーケンス</a> を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If the characters copied from <var class=\"var\">string</var> have text "
"properties, the properties are copied into the new string also.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Properties.html\">Text Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> からコピーされた文字にテキストプロパティがあ"
"る場合、そのプロパティも新しい文字列にコピーされます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Text-Properties.html\">テキストプロパティ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">substring</code> also accepts a vector for the first "
"argument.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">substring</code> は第1引数にベクトルも指定できます。例え"
"ば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substring [a b (c) &quot;d&quot;] 1 3)\n"
"     &rArr; [b (c)]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"A <code class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code> error is signaled if <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> is not an integer or if <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> is neither an integer nor <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  An <code "
"class=\"code\">args-out-of-range</code> error is signaled if <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> indicates a character following <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>, or if either integer is out of range for <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> が整数でない場合、または <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> が整数でも <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でもない場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code> エラーが報告されます。"
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> が <var class=\"var\">end</var> に続く文字を示"
"している場合、またはいずれかの整数が <var class=\"var\">string</var> の範囲外"
"である場合、<code class=\"code\">args-out-of-range</code> エラーが報告されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Contrast this function with <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Contents.html\">Examining Buffer "
"Contents</a>), which returns a string containing a portion of the text in "
"the current buffer.  The beginning of a string is at index 0, but the "
"beginning of a buffer is at index 1."
msgstr ""
"この関数を、現在のバッファ内のテキストの一部を含む文字列を返す <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"Contents.html\">バッファ内容の確認</a>を参照）と比較してください。文字列の先"
"頭はインデックス 0 ですが、バッファの先頭はインデックス 1 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substring-no-properties</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">string &amp;optional start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-substring_002dno_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substring-no-properties</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">string &amp;optional start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-substring_002dno_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This works like <code class=\"code\">substring</code> but discards all text "
"properties from the value.  Also, <var class=\"var\">start</var> may be "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which is equivalent to 0.  Thus, "
"<code class=\"code\">(substring-no-properties&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>)</code> returns a copy of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, with all text properties removed."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">substring</code> と同様に動作しますが、値からすべ"
"てのテキストプロパティを削除します。また、<var class=\"var\">start</var> は省"
"略可能であり、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は 0 と同等です。したがって、"
"<code class=\"code\">(substring-no-properties&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>)</code> はすべてのテキストプロパティが削除された "
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> のコピーを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">concat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest sequences</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-concat\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">concat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest sequences</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-concat\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-strings\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-concatenating-strings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-strings\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-concatenating-strings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string consisting of the characters in the arguments "
"passed to it (along with their text properties, if any).  The arguments may "
"be strings, lists of numbers, or vectors of numbers; they are not themselves "
"changed.  If <code class=\"code\">concat</code> receives no arguments, it "
"returns an empty string."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、渡された引数に含まれる文字（および、あればそのテキストプロパ"
"ティ）からなる文字列を返します。引数には文字列、数値のリスト、または数値のベ"
"クトルを指定でき、引数自体が変更されることはありません。<code "
"class=\"code\">concat</code> に引数が渡されない場合は、空文字列を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(concat &quot;abc&quot; &quot;-def&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;abc-def&quot;\n"
"(concat &quot;abc&quot; (list 120 121) [122])\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;abcxyz&quot;\n"
";; <span class=\"r\"><code class=\"code\">nil</code> is an empty sequence.</span>\n"
"(concat &quot;abc&quot; nil &quot;-def&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;abc-def&quot;\n"
"(concat &quot;The &quot; &quot;quick brown &quot; &quot;fox.&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The quick brown fox.&quot;\n"
"(concat)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This function does not always allocate a new string.  Callers are advised "
"not rely on the result being a new string nor on it being <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> to an existing string."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、必ずしも新しい文字列を割り当てるとは限りません。呼び出し側は、結"
"果が新しい文字列であることや、既存の文字列に対する <code class=\"code\">eq</"
"code> であることに依存しないよう注意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"In particular, mutating the returned value may inadvertently change another "
"string, alter a constant string in the program, or even raise an error.  To "
"obtain a string that you can safely mutate, use <code class=\"code\">copy-"
"sequence</code> on the result."
msgstr ""
"特に、返された値を変更することで、意図せず別の文字列が変更されたり、プログラ"
"ム内の定数文字列が書き換えられたり、さらにはエラーが発生したりする可能性があ"
"ります。安全に変更できる文字列を得るには、結果に対して <code "
"class=\"code\">copy-sequence</code> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If you need to create a string made from <var class=\"var\">n</var> copies "
"of a given source string <var class=\"var\">source</var>, you can use <code "
"class=\"code\">concat</code> as follows:"
msgstr ""
"与えられたソース文字列 <var class=\"var\">source</var> を <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 回繰り返した文字列を作成する必要がある場合は、次のよう"
"に <code class=\"code\">concat</code> を使用できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "  (apply #'concat (make-list <var class=\"var\">n</var> <var class=\"var\">source</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This uses the fact that <code class=\"code\">concat</code> can take any kind "
"of sequence as its arguments."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">concat</code> が任意の種類のシーケンスを引数とし"
"て取れるという事実を利用したものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"For information about other concatenation functions, see the description of "
"<code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code> in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Mapping-"
"Functions.html\">Mapping Functions</a>, <code class=\"code\">vconcat</code> "
"in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Vector-Functions.html\">Functions for Vectors</"
"a>, and <code class=\"code\">append</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Building-Lists.html\">Building Cons Cells and Lists</a>.  For "
"concatenating individual command-line arguments into a string to be used as "
"a shell command, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Shell-Arguments.html\">combine-"
"and-quote-strings</a>."
msgstr ""
"その他の連結関数に関する情報については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Mapping-"
"Functions.html\">マッピング関数</a>の<code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code>、"
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Vector-Functions.html\">ベクトル用関数</a>の<code "
"class=\"code\">vconcat</code>、および<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Building-"
"Lists.html\">Consセルとリストの構築</a>の<code class=\"code\">append</code>の"
"説明を参照してください。個別のコマンドライン引数を文字列に連結してシェルコマ"
"ンドとして使用する場合は、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Shell-"
"Arguments.html\">combine-and-quote-strings</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional separators omit-empty trim</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional separators omit-empty trim</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This function splits <var class=\"var\">string</var> into substrings based "
"on the regular expression <var class=\"var\">separators</var> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regular-Expressions.html\">Regular Expressions</a>).  "
"Each match for <var class=\"var\">separators</var> defines a splitting "
"point; the substrings between splitting points are made into a list, which "
"is returned."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、正規表現 <var class=\"var\">separators</var>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Regular-Expressions.html\">正規表現</a>を参照）に基づいて <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> を部分文字列に分割します。<var "
"class=\"var\">separators</var> の各マッチ箇所が分割点となり、分割点間の部分文"
"字列がリストにまとめられて返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">separators</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"(or omitted), the default is the value of <code class=\"code\">split-string-"
"default-separators</code> and the function behaves as if <var "
"class=\"var\">omit-empty</var> were <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">separators</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である"
"（または省略されている）場合、デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">split-"
"string-default-separators</code> となり、関数は <var class=\"var\">omit-"
"empty</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> であるかのように動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">omit-empty</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"(or omitted), the result contains empty strings whenever there are two "
"consecutive matches for <var class=\"var\">separators</var>, or a match is "
"adjacent to the beginning or end of <var class=\"var\">string</var>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">omit-empty</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, these "
"empty strings are omitted from the result."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">omit-empty</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> （また"
"は省略）の場合、<var class=\"var\">separators</var> のマッチが2回連続する場"
"合、またはマッチが <var class=\"var\">string</var> の先頭もしくは末尾に隣接す"
"る場合、結果に空文字列が含まれます。<var class=\"var\">omit-empty</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、これらの空文字列は結果から省略されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">trim</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should be a regular expression to match text "
"to trim from the beginning and end of each substring.  Trimming may make the "
"substring empty and omitted from the result if <var class=\"var\">omit-"
"empty</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code> as above."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">trim</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、各部分文字列の先頭と末尾からトリミングするテキストにマッチ"
"する正規表現を指定する必要があります。前述の通り <var class=\"var\">omit-"
"empty</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合、トリミングによって部"
"分文字列が空になり、結果から除外されることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If you need to split a string into a list of individual command-line "
"arguments suitable for <code class=\"code\">call-process</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">start-process</code>, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Shell-"
"Arguments.html\">split-string-and-unquote</a>."
msgstr ""
"文字列を <code class=\"code\">call-process</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">start-process</code> に適した個別のコマンドライン引数のリスト"
"に分割する必要がある場合は、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Shell-"
"Arguments.html\">split-string-and-unquote</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Do not use a value for <var class=\"var\">separators</var> that matches the "
"empty string, or the results will be unpredictable.  To split a string into "
"individual characters, use <code class=\"code\">string-to-list</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">string-to-vector</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">separators</var> に空文字列と一致する値を指定しないでくだ"
"さい。結果が予測不能になります。文字列を個々の文字に分割するには、<code "
