# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Attempt to Word-wrap <var class=\"var\">string</var> so that it displays "
"with lines no wider than <var class=\"var\">width</var>.  Filling is done on "
"whitespace boundaries only.  If there are individual words that are longer "
"than <var class=\"var\">width</var>, these will not be shortened, and "
"therefore <var class=\"var\">string</var> might be shown with lines wider "
"than <var class=\"var\">width</var> in that case."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> を、行幅が <var class=\"var\">width</var> を"
"超えないようにワードラップしようと試みます。埋め合わせは空白境界でのみ行われ"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">width</var> より長い単語が個別に存在する場合、それら"
"は短縮されないため、その場合 <var class=\"var\">string</var> は <var "
"class=\"var\">width</var> より広い行幅で表示される可能性があります。"

