"boundaries.  If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">omit-empty</var> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, remove empty lines from the results.  "
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">keep-newlines</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, don&rsquo;t remove the trailing newlines from the "
"result strings."
