# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span>9.3 Creating and Interning Symbols<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Creating-and-Interning-Symbols\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>9.3 シンボルの作成とインターニング<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Creating-and-Interning-Symbols\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reading-symbols\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reading-symbols\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"To understand how symbols are created in GNU Emacs Lisp, you must know how "
"Lisp reads them.  Lisp must ensure that it finds the same symbol every time "
"it reads the same sequence of characters in the same context.  Failure to do "
"so would cause complete confusion."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacs Lispでシンボルがどのように生成されるかを理解するには、Lispがそれら"
"をどのように読み取るかを知る必要があります。Lispは、同じコンテキストで同じ文"
"字シーケンスを読み取るたびに、必ず同じシンボルを見つけられるようにしなければ"
"なりません。そうでなければ、完全な混乱を招くことになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obarray\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obarray\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"When the Lisp reader encounters a name that references a symbol in the "
"source code, it looks up that name in a table called an <em "
"class=\"dfn\">obarray</em> to find the symbol that the programmer meant.  An "
"obarray is an unordered container of symbols, indexed by name."
msgstr ""
"Lispリーダーがソースコード内のシンボルを参照する名前に遭遇すると、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">obarray</em>と呼ばれるテーブルでその名前を検索し、プログラマが"
"意図したシンボルを特定します。obarrayは、名前をインデックスとするシンボルの順"
"序のないコンテナです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"The Lisp reader also considers &ldquo;shorthands&rdquo;.  If the programmer "
"supplied them, this allows the reader to find a symbol even if its name "
"isn&rsquo;t present in its full form in the source code.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Shorthands.html\">Shorthands</a>."
msgstr ""
"Lispリーダーは「ショートハンド」も認識します。プログラマがこれらを定義してい"
"れば、ソースコード内にシンボル名が完全な形で記述されていなくても、リーダーは"
"そのシンボルを特定できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Shorthands.html\">ショー"
"トハンド</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interning\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interning\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"If a symbol with the desired name is found, the reader uses that symbol.  If "
"the obarray does not contain a symbol with that name, the reader makes a new "
"symbol and adds it to the obarray.  Finding or adding a symbol with a "
"certain name is called <em class=\"dfn\">interning</em> it, and the symbol "
"is then called an <em class=\"dfn\">interned symbol</em>."
msgstr ""
"目的の名前を持つシンボルが見つかった場合、リーダーはそのシンボルを使用しま"
"す。obarrayにその名前のシンボルが含まれていない場合、リーダーは新しいシンボル"
"を作成し、それをobarrayに追加します。特定の名前を持つシンボルを検索または追加"
"することを<em class=\"dfn\">インターニング</em>と呼び、その結果得られたシンボ"
"ルを<em class=\"dfn\">インターニング済みシンボル</em>と呼びます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"Interning ensures that each obarray has just one symbol with any particular "
"name.  Other like-named symbols may exist, but not in the same obarray.  "
"Thus, the reader gets the same symbols for the same names, as long as you "
"keep reading with the same obarray."
msgstr ""
"インターニングにより、各obarrayには特定の名前を持つシンボルがただ一つしか存在"
"しなくなります。同様の名前を持つ他のシンボルが存在することはあっても、同じ"
"obarray内には存在しません。したがって、同じobarrayを用いて読み進める限り、読"
"者は同じ名前に対して常に同じシンボルを得ることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"Interning usually happens automatically in the reader, but sometimes other "
"programs may want to do it.  For example, after the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</"
"kbd> command obtains the command name as a string using the minibuffer, it "
"then interns the string, to get the interned symbol with that name.  As "
"another example, a hypothetical telephone book program could intern the name "
"of each looked up person&rsquo;s name as a symbol, even if the obarray did "
"not contain it, so that it could attach information to that new symbol, such "
"as the last time someone looked it up."
msgstr ""
"インターニングは通常、リーダー内で自動的に行われますが、他のプログラムがイン"
"ターニングを行いたい場合もあります。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>コマ"
"ンドがミニバッファを用いてコマンド名を文字列として取得した後、その文字列をイ"
"ンターニングすることで、その名前を持つインターニング済みシンボルを取得しま"
"す。別の例として、架空の電話帳プログラムであれば、obarrayに含まれていない場合"
"でも、検索された各人物の名前をシンボルとしてインターニングし、最後に誰が検索"
"したかといった情報をその新しいシンボルに紐付けることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-symbol-equality\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uninterned-symbol\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-symbol-equality\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uninterned-symbol\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"No obarray contains all symbols; in fact, some symbols are not in any "
"obarray.  They are called <em class=\"dfn\">uninterned symbols</em>.  An "
"uninterned symbol has the same four cells as other symbols; however, the "
"only way to gain access to it is by finding it in some other object or as "
"the value of a variable.  Uninterned symbols are sometimes useful in "
"generating Lisp code, see below."
msgstr ""
"いかなる obarray にもすべてのシンボルが含まれているわけではなく、実際、いかな"
"る obarray にも含まれないシンボルが存在します。これらは <em class=\"dfn\">未"
"インターニング・シンボル</em> と呼ばれます。未インターニング・シンボルは、他"
"のシンボルと同様に4つのセルを持っていますが、これにアクセスする唯一の方法は、"
"他のオブジェクト内や変数の値としてそれを見つけることです。未インターニング・"
"シンボルは、Lispコードを生成する際に有用な場合があり、詳細は後述します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-CL-note_002d_002d_002dsymbol-in-"
"obarrays\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-CL-note_002d_002d_002dsymbol-in-"
"obarrays\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><blockquote><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<b class=\"b\">Common Lisp note:</b> Unlike Common Lisp, Emacs Lisp does not "
"provide for interning the same name in several different "
"&ldquo;packages&rdquo;, thus creating multiple symbols with the same name "
"but different packages.  Emacs Lisp provides a different namespacing system "
"called &ldquo;shorthands&rdquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Shorthands.html\">Shorthands</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"b\">Common Lispに関する注記：</b> Common Lispとは異なり、Emacs "
"Lispでは、同一の名前を複数の異なる「パッケージ」にインターニングして、同じ名"
"前でパッケージが異なる複数のシンボルを作成することはできません。Emacs Lispで"
"は、「ショートハンド」と呼ばれる別の名前空間システムが提供されています（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Shorthands.html\">ショートハンド</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">obarray-make</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"size</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-obarray_002dmake\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">obarray-make</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"size</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-obarray_002dmake\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a new obarray.  The optional <var "
"class=\"var\">size</var> may be used to specify the number of symbols that "
"it is expected to hold, but since obarrays grow automatically as needed, "
"this rarely provides any benefit."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、新しい obarray を作成して返します。オプションの <var "
"class=\"var\">size</var> を使用して保持するシンボル数を指定できますが、"
"obarray は必要に応じて自動的に拡張されるため、これが役立つことはほとんどあり"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">obarrayp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-obarrayp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">obarrayp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-obarrayp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is an obarray, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が obarray であれば <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでなければ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"Most of the functions below take a name and sometimes an obarray as "
"arguments.  A <code class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code> error is "
"signaled if the name is not a string, or if the obarray is not an obarray "
"object."
msgstr ""
"以下の関数の多くは、引数として名前、および場合によってはobarrayを取ります。名"
"前が文字列でない場合、またはobarrayがobarrayオブジェクトでない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code>エラーが発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the string that is <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var>&rsquo;s name.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>の名前を表す文字列を返します。例え"
"ば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(symbol-name 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> Never alter the string returned "
"by that function.  Doing that might make Emacs dysfunctional, and might even "
"crash Emacs."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> その関数が返す文字列を絶対に変更しな"
"いでください。変更するとEmacsが正常に動作しなくなったり、最悪の場合はクラッ"
"シュしたりする恐れがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uninterned-symbol_002c-and-generating-"
"Lisp-code\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uninterned-symbol_002c-and-generating-"
"Lisp-code\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"Creating an uninterned symbol is useful in generating Lisp code, because an "
"uninterned symbol used as a variable in the code you generate cannot clash "
"with any variables used in other Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"アンインターンドシンボルを作成することは、Lispコードを生成する際に有用です。"
"生成するコード内で変数として使用されるアンインターンドシンボルは、他のLispプ"
"ログラムで使用されるいかなる変数とも衝突することがないためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-symbol</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dsymbol\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-symbol</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dsymbol\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a newly-allocated, uninterned symbol whose name is "
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> (which must be a string).  Its value and "
"function definition are void, and its property list is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In the example below, the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">sym</code> is not <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">foo</code> because it is a distinct uninterned symbol whose "
"name is also &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、名前が <var class=\"var\">name</var>（文字列である必要がありま"
"す）である、新たに割り当てられた未インターニングのシンボルを返します。その値"
"と関数定義は void であり、プロパティリストは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"です。以下の例では、<code class=\"code\">sym</code> の値は <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> から <code class=\"code\">foo</code> ではありませ"
"ん。これは、名前が同じく &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; である"
"別の未インターニングのシンボルであるためです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq sym (make-symbol &quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
"(eq sym 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gensym</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"prefix</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-gensym\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gensym</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"prefix</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-gensym\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a symbol using <code class=\"code\">make-symbol</"
"code>, whose name is made by appending <code class=\"code\">gensym-counter</"
"code> to <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> and incrementing that counter, "
"guaranteeing that no two calls to this function will generate a symbol with "
"the same name.  The prefix defaults to <code class=\"code\">&quot;g&quot;</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">make-symbol</code> を用いたシンボルを返しま"
"す。その名称は、<var class=\"var\">prefix</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">gensym-counter</code> を付加し、そのカウンタをインクリメントす"
"ることで生成されるため、この関数を2回呼び出しても同一名称のシンボルが生成され"
"ることはありません。プレフィックスのデフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;g&quot;</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"To avoid problems when accidentally interning printed representation of "
"generated code (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Printed-"
"Representation.html\">Printed Representation and Read Syntax</a>), it is "
"recommended to use <code class=\"code\">gensym</code> instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">make-symbol</code>."
msgstr ""
"生成されたコードの印刷表現（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Printed-"
"Representation.html\">印刷表現と読み取り構文</a>を参照）を誤ってインターニン"
"グした際に問題が発生するのを避けるため、<code class=\"code\">make-symbol</"
"code> ではなく <code class=\"code\">gensym</code> を使用することが推奨されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">intern</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name &amp;optional "
"obarray</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-intern\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">intern</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name &amp;optional "
"obarray</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-intern\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the interned symbol whose name is <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>.  If there is no such symbol in the obarray <var "
"class=\"var\">obarray</var>, <code class=\"code\">intern</code> creates a "
"new one, adds it to the obarray, and returns it.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">obarray</var> is omitted, the value of the global variable "
"<code class=\"code\">obarray</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、名前が <var class=\"var\">name</var> であるインターニング済みシン"
"ボルを返します。obarray <var class=\"var\">obarray</var> にそのようなシンボル"
"が存在しない場合、<code class=\"code\">intern</code> は新しいシンボルを作成し"
"て obarray に追加し、それを返します。<var class=\"var\">obarray</var> を省略"
"した場合は、グローバル変数 <code class=\"code\">obarray</code> の値が使用され"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq sym (intern &quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
"(eq sym 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
"\n"
"(setq sym1 (intern &quot;foo&quot; other-obarray))\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
"(eq sym1 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

