#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-CL-note_002d_002d_002dinterning-"
"existing-symbol\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-CL-note_002d_002d_002dinterning-"
"existing-symbol\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><blockquote><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<b class=\"b\">Common Lisp note:</b> In Common Lisp, you can intern an "
"existing symbol in an obarray.  In Emacs Lisp, you cannot do this, because "
"the argument to <code class=\"code\">intern</code> must be a string, not a "
"symbol."
msgstr ""
"<b class=\"b\">Common Lispに関する注記：</b> Common Lispでは、既存のシンボル"
"をobarrayにinternできます。Emacs Lispでは、<code class=\"code\">intern</code>"
"の引数はシンボルではなく文字列である必要があるため、この操作はできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">intern-soft</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"&amp;optional obarray</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"intern_002dsoft\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">intern-soft</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name "
"&amp;optional obarray</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"intern_002dsoft\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the symbol in <var class=\"var\">obarray</var> whose "
"name is <var class=\"var\">name</var>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"<var class=\"var\">obarray</var> has no symbol with that name.  Therefore, "
"you can use <code class=\"code\">intern-soft</code> to test whether a symbol "
"with a given name is already interned.  If <var class=\"var\">obarray</var> "
"is omitted, the value of the global variable <code class=\"code\">obarray</"
"code> is used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">obarray</var> の中で名前が <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> であるシンボルを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">obarray</var> にその名前のシンボルが存在しない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">intern-soft</code> を使用して、指定した名前のシンボルが既にイ"
"ンターニングされているかどうかを判定できます。<var class=\"var\">obarray</"
"var> を省略した場合は、グローバル変数 <code class=\"code\">obarray</code> の"
"値が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">name</var> may also be a symbol; in that "
"case, the function returns <var class=\"var\">name</var> if <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is interned in the specified obarray, and otherwise "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">name</var> はシンボルであってもよく、その場合、関数"
"は <var class=\"var\">name</var> が指定された obarray にインターニングされて"
"いれば <var class=\"var\">name</var> を、そうでなければ <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(intern-soft &quot;frazzle&quot;)        ; <span class=\"r\">No such symbol exists.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"(make-symbol &quot;frazzle&quot;)        ; <span class=\"r\">Create an uninterned one.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; frazzle\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(intern-soft &quot;frazzle&quot;)        ; <span class=\"r\">That one cannot be found.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq sym (intern &quot;frazzle&quot;))  ; <span class=\"r\">Create an interned one.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; frazzle\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(intern-soft &quot;frazzle&quot;)        ; <span class=\"r\">That one can be found!</span>\n"
"     &rArr; frazzle\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(eq sym 'frazzle)              ; <span class=\"r\">And it is the same one.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

