# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This variable is the standard obarray for use by <code "
"class=\"code\">intern</code> and <code class=\"code\">read</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">intern</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">read</code> で使用する標準的な obarray です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapatoms</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function "
"&amp;optional obarray</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mapatoms\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapatoms</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function "
"&amp;optional obarray</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mapatoms\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-mapatoms\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-mapatoms\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
msgid ""
"This function calls <var class=\"var\">function</var> once with each symbol "
"in the obarray <var class=\"var\">obarray</var>.  Then it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">obarray</var> is omitted, "
"it defaults to the value of <code class=\"code\">obarray</code>, the "
"standard obarray for ordinary symbols."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、obarray <var class=\"var\">obarray</var> 内の各シンボルに対して "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> を1回呼び出します。その後、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">obarray</var> が省略"
"された場合は、通常のシンボル用の標準 obarray である <code "
"class=\"code\">obarray</code> の値がデフォルトとなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Creating-Symbols.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq count 0)\n"
"     &rArr; 0\n"
"(defun count-syms (s)\n"
"  (setq count (1+ count)))\n"
"     &rArr; count-syms\n"
"(mapatoms 'count-syms)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"count\n"
"     &rArr; 1871\n"
msgstr ""

