msgid ""
"<span>2.4.3.3 Control-Character Syntax<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Control_002dCharacter-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.3.3 制御文字構文<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Control_002dCharacter-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-control-characters\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-control-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"Control characters can be represented using yet another read syntax.  This "
"consists of a question mark followed by a backslash, caret, and the "
"corresponding non-control character, in either upper or lower case.  For "
"example, both &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^I</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^i</samp>&rsquo; are valid read syntax for the "
"character <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-i</kbd>, the character whose value is 9."
msgstr ""
"制御文字は、さらに別の読み取り構文を用いて表現できます。これは、疑問符に続"
"き、バックスラッシュ、キャレット、および対応する非制御文字（大文字または小文"
"字）を並べたものです。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^I</samp>&rsquo;"
"と&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^i</samp>&rsquo;はいずれも、値が9である文字"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-i</kbd>に対する有効な読み取り構文です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"Instead of the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;, you can use "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;; thus, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\C-i</samp>&rsquo; is equivalent to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\^I</samp>&rsquo; and to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^i</"
"samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;の代わりに&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;を使用できます。したがって、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\C-i</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^I</"
"samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\^i</samp>&rsquo;と同等になり"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "?\\^I &rArr; 9     ?\\C-I &rArr; 9\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In strings and buffers, the only control characters allowed are those that "
"exist in <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>; but for keyboard input "
"purposes, you can turn any character into a control character with &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;.  The character codes for these non-"
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> control characters include the 2**26 "
"bit as well as the code for the corresponding non-control character.  Not "
"all text terminals can generate non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"control characters, but it is straightforward to generate them using X and "
"other window systems."
msgstr ""
"文字列やバッファで許可される制御文字は、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>"
"に含まれるものに限られますが、キーボード入力においては、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;を用いることで任意の文字を制御文字に変換できま"
"す。これらの非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>制御文字の文字コードには、"
"2**26ビット分に加え、対応する非制御文字のコードも含まれています。すべてのテキ"
"スト端末で非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>制御文字を生成できるわけでは"
"ありませんが、Xやその他のウィンドウシステムを用いれば容易に生成可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"For historical reasons, Emacs treats the <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> "
"character as the control equivalent of <kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"歴史的な経緯により、Emacsでは<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>文字を<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">?</kbd>の制御文字相当として扱います："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "?\\^? &rArr; 127     ?\\C-? &rArr; 127\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"As a result, it is currently not possible to represent the character <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">Control-?</kbd>, which is a meaningful input character under "
"X, using &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-</samp>&rsquo;.  It is not easy to "
"change this, as various Lisp files refer to <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> in "
"this way."
msgstr ""
"その結果、X では意味のある入力文字である <kbd class=\"kbd\">Control-?</kbd> "
"を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-</samp>&rsquo; で表現することは現状では不"
"可能です。さまざまな Lisp ファイルがこのように <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> "
"を参照しているため、これを変更するのは容易ではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Ctl_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"For representing control characters to be found in files or strings, we "
"recommend the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; syntax; for "
"control characters in keyboard input, we prefer the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo; syntax.  Which one you use does not affect "
"the meaning of the program, but may guide the understanding of people who "
"read it."
msgstr ""
"ファイルや文字列に含まれる制御文字を表すには、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo; 構文を推奨します。キーボード入力における制御文字には、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo; 構文を好んで使用します。どちらを使用す"
"るかはプログラムの意味に影響しませんが、読み手の理解を助ける可能性がありま"
"す。"

