# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"There are, in general, many buffers in an Emacs session.  At any time, one "
"of them is designated the <em class=\"dfn\">current buffer</em>&mdash;the "
"buffer in which most editing takes place.  Most of the primitives for "
"examining or changing text operate implicitly on the current buffer (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text.html\">Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"一般的に、Emacsセッションには多くのバッファが存在します。常にそのうちの1つが"
"<em class=\"dfn\">カレントバッファ</em>――ほとんどの編集が行われるバッファ――と"
"して指定されています。テキストの確認や変更を行うプリミティブの多くは、暗黙的"
"にカレントバッファに対して動作します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text.html\">Text</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Normally, the buffer displayed in the selected window (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-Windows.html\">Selecting Windows</a>) is "
"the current buffer, but this is not always so: a Lisp program can "
"temporarily designate any buffer as current in order to operate on its "
"contents, without changing what is displayed on the screen.  The most basic "
"function for designating a current buffer is <code class=\"code\">set-"
"buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"通常、選択中のウィンドウ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-Windows.html\">"
"ウィンドウの選択</a>を参照）に表示されるバッファが現在のバッファとなります"
"が、必ずしもそうとは限りません。Lispプログラムは、画面上の表示内容を変更する"
"ことなく、任意のバッファを一時的に現在のバッファとして指定し、その内容を操作"
"することができます。現在のバッファを指定するための最も基本的な関数は<code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid "This function returns the current buffer."
msgstr "この関数は、現在のバッファを返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(current-buffer)\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;buffer buffers.texi&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-set_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-set_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"This function makes <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> the current "
"buffer.  <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> must be an existing buffer "
"or the name of an existing buffer.  The return value is the buffer made "
"current."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> をカレントバッファに設定し"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> は既存のバッファ、または既存の"
"バッファ名である必要があります。戻り値は、カレントに設定されたバッファです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"This function does not display the buffer in any window, so the user cannot "
"necessarily see the buffer.  But Lisp programs will now operate on it."
msgstr ""
"この関数はバッファをどのウィンドウにも表示しないため、ユーザーが必ずしもバッ"
"ファを確認できるとは限りません。しかし、これでLispプログラムはバッファを操作"
"できるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"When an editing command returns to the editor command loop, Emacs "
"automatically calls <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> on the buffer "
"shown in the selected window (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-"
"Windows.html\">Selecting Windows</a>).  This is to prevent confusion: it "
"ensures that the buffer that the cursor is in, when Emacs reads a command, "
"is the buffer to which that command applies (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Command-Loop.html\">Command Loop</a>).  Thus, you should not use "
"<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> to switch visibly to a different "
"buffer; for that, use the functions described in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">Switching to a Buffer in a Window</a>."
msgstr ""
"編集コマンドがエディタのコマンドループに戻ると、Emacsは選択中のウィンドウに表"
"示されているバッファに対して自動的に <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> "
"を呼び出します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-Windows.html\">ウィンドウ"
"の選択</a>を参照）。これは混乱を防ぐためです。これにより、Emacsがコマンドを読"
"み取る際に、カーソルがあるバッファが、そのコマンドが適用されるバッファになる"
"ことが保証されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Loop.html\">コマンド"
"ループ</a>を参照）。したがって、<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> を使用"
"して視覚的に別のバッファに切り替えるべきではありません。その場合は、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">ウィンドウ内のバッファへの切り"
"替え</a>で説明されている関数を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"When writing a Lisp function, do <em class=\"emph\">not</em> rely on this "
"behavior of the command loop to restore the current buffer after an "
"operation.  Editing commands can also be called as Lisp functions by other "
"programs, not just from the command loop; it is convenient for the caller if "
"the subroutine does not change which buffer is current (unless, of course, "
"that is the subroutine&rsquo;s purpose)."
msgstr ""
"Lisp関数を記述する際は、操作後に現在のバッファを復元するというコマンドループ"
"のこの挙動に<em class=\"emph\">依存しないでください</em>。編集コマンドは、コ"
"マンドループからだけでなく、他のプログラムからもLisp関数として呼び出されるこ"
"とがあります。サブルーチンが現在のバッファを変更しない方が、呼び出し側にとっ"
"て便利です（もちろん、それがサブルーチンの目的である場合は除きます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"To operate temporarily on another buffer, put the <code class=\"code\">set-"
"buffer</code> within a <code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> "
"form.  Here, as an example, is a simplified version of the command <code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>:"
msgstr ""
"別のバッファで一時的に操作するには、<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>を"
"<code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code>形式で記述します。以下に、コマ"
"ンド<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>の簡略版を例として示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun append-to-buffer (buffer start end)\n"
"  &quot;Append the text of the region to BUFFER.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;BAppend to buffer: \\nr&quot;)\n"
"  (let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"    (save-current-buffer\n"
"      (set-buffer (get-buffer-create buffer))\n"
"      (insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Here, we bind a local variable to record the current buffer, and then <code "
"class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> arranges to make it current again "
"later.  Next, <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> makes the specified "
"buffer current, and <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> "
"copies the string from the original buffer to the specified (and now "
"current) buffer."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、ローカル変数をバインドして現在のバッファを記録し、その後 <code "
"class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> で再びそれをカレントにするよう手配"
"します。次に、<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> で指定したバッファをカレ"
"ントにし、<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> で元のバッファ"
"から指定した（そして現在はカレントとなっている）バッファへ文字列をコピーしま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, we can use the <code class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</"
"code> macro:"
msgstr ""
"あるいは、<code class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code> マクロを使用するこ"
"ともできます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun append-to-buffer (buffer start end)\n"
"  &quot;Append the text of the region to BUFFER.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;BAppend to buffer: \\nr&quot;)\n"
"  (let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"    (with-current-buffer (get-buffer-create buffer)\n"
"      (insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"In either case, if the buffer appended to happens to be displayed in some "
"window, the next redisplay will show how its text has changed.  If it is not "
"displayed in any window, you will not see the change immediately on the "
"screen.  The command causes the buffer to become current temporarily, but "
"does not cause it to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"いずれの場合も、追加したバッファがいずれかのウィンドウに表示されているなら、"
"次回の再表示時にテキストの変更が反映されます。どのウィンドウにも表示されてい"
"ない場合は、画面上で即座に変更を確認することはできません。このコマンドによっ"
"てバッファは一時的にカレントになりますが、表示されるわけではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"If you make local bindings (with <code class=\"code\">let</code> or function "
"arguments)  for a variable that may also have buffer-local bindings, make "
"sure that the same buffer is current at the beginning and at the end of the "
"local binding&rsquo;s scope.  Otherwise you might bind it in one buffer and "
"unbind it in another!"
msgstr ""
"バッファローカルなバインディングを持つ可能性のある変数に対して、ローカルなバ"
"インディング（<code class=\"code\">let</code> や関数引数を使用）を作成する場"
"合は、ローカルバインディングのスコープの開始時点と終了時点の両方で、同じバッ"
"ファがカレントになっていることを確認してください。そうしないと、あるバッファ"
"でバインドし、別のバッファでアンバインドしてしまう恐れがあります！"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Do not rely on using <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> to change the "
"current buffer back, because that won&rsquo;t do the job if a quit happens "
"while the wrong buffer is current.  For instance, in the previous example, "
"it would have been wrong to do this:"
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファを元に戻すために <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> を使う"
"ことに頼らないでください。誤ったバッファが現在の状態である間に終了が発生した"
"場合、それでは対処できないためです。例えば、前述の例では、次のようにするのは"
"誤りでした："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"    (set-buffer (get-buffer-create buffer))\n"
"    (insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end)\n"
"    (set-buffer oldbuf))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Using <code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code>, as we did, correctly handles "
"quitting, errors, and <code class=\"code\">throw</code>, as well as ordinary "
"evaluation."
msgstr ""
"今回のように <code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code> を用いると、通常の評価だけでなく、"
"終了やエラー、<code class=\"code\">throw</code> も正しく処理できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-current-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"save_002dcurrent_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-current-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"save_002dcurrent_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> special form saves the "
"identity of the current buffer, evaluates the <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"forms, and finally restores that buffer as current.  The return value is the "
"value of the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  The current buffer "
"is restored even in case of an abnormal exit via <code class=\"code\">throw</"
"code> or error (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">Nonlocal "
"Exits</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> 特殊形式は、現在のバッファの"
"識別子を保存し、<var class=\"var\">body</var> 形式を評価し、最後にそのバッ"
"ファを現在のバッファとして復元します。戻り値は <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"の最後の形式の値となります。<code class=\"code\">throw</code> による異常終了"
"やエラーが発生した場合でも、現在のバッファは復元されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">非局所終了</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer that used to be current has been killed by the time of exit "
"from <code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code>, then it is not made "
"current again, of course.  Instead, whichever buffer was current just before "
"exit remains current."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> を抜ける時点で、それまでカレ"
"ントだったバッファが破棄されていた場合、当然ながらそのバッファが再びカレント"
"になることはありません。代わりに、抜ける直前にカレントだったバッファがそのま"
"まカレントとして残ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-current-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-"
"or-name body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dcurrent_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-current-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-"
"or-name body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dcurrent_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code> macro saves the identity "
"of the current buffer, makes <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> "
"current, evaluates the <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms, and finally "
"restores the current buffer.  <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> must "
"specify an existing buffer or the name of an existing buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code> マクロは、現在のバッファの識"
"別情報を保存し、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> をカレントに設定し、"
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> のフォームを評価し、最後に現在のバッファを復元"
"します。<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> には、既存のバッファまたは既"
"存のバッファ名を指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The return value is the value of the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>.  The current buffer is restored even in case of an abnormal exit via "
"<code class=\"code\">throw</code> or error (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">Nonlocal Exits</a>)."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は、<var class=\"var\">body</var> 内の最後のフォームの値です。<code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> による異常終了やエラーが発生した場合でも、現在の"
"バッファは復元されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">非局"
"所終了</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
