"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer_002dlist_002dupdate_002dhook-in-"
"temporary-buffers\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"By default, undo information (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>) is not recorded in the buffer created by this "
"macro (but <var class=\"var\">body</var> can enable that, if needed).  The "
"temporary buffer also does not run the hooks <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"buffer-hook</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-query-functions</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing-Buffers.html\">Killing Buffers</a>), "
"and <code class=\"code\">buffer-list-update-hook</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer List</a>)."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、このマクロによって作成されるバッファにアンドゥ情報（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>を参照）は記録されません（ただし、"
"必要に応じて <var class=\"var\">body</var> で有効にできます）。また、一時バッ"
"ファではフック <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer-query-functions</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Killing-Buffers.html\">Killing Buffers</a>を参照）、および <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-list-update-hook</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer List</a>を参照）は実行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Current-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The return value is the value of the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>.  You can return the contents of the temporary buffer by using <code "
"class=\"code\">(buffer-string)</code> as the last form."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は、<var class=\"var\">body</var> における最後のフォームの値です。最後"
"のフォームに <code class=\"code\">(buffer-string)</code> を指定することで、一"
"時バッファの内容を返すことができます。"

