"<span>15.6 カスタムテーマ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Custom-"
"Themes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-custom-themes\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-custom-themes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Custom themes</em> are collections of settings that can be "
"enabled or disabled as a unit.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Custom-Themes.html#Custom-"
"Themes\">Custom Themes</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>.  Each Custom theme is defined by an Emacs Lisp source file, which "
"should follow the conventions described in this section.  (Instead of "
"writing a Custom theme by hand, you can also create one using a Customize-"
"like interface; see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Creating-Custom-Themes.html#Creating-"
"Custom-Themes\">Creating Custom Themes</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>.)"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">カスタムテーマ</em>とは、一括して有効化または無効化できる設"
"定の集合のことです。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Custom-Themes.html#Custom-Themes\">Custom Themes</a>を参照し"
"てください。各カスタムテーマはEmacs Lispのソースファイルによって定義され、こ"
"のファイルは本節で説明する規約に従う必要があります。（カスタムテーマを手作業"
"で記述する代わりに、Customizeのようなインターフェースを使用して作成することも"
"可能です。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Creating-Custom-Themes.html#Creating-Custom-Themes\">Creating Custom "
"Themes</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"A Custom theme file should be named <samp class=\"file\"><var "
"class=\"var\">foo</var>-theme.el</samp>, where <var class=\"var\">foo</var> "
"is the theme name.  The first Lisp form in the file should be a call to "
"<code class=\"code\">deftheme</code>, and the last form should be a call to "
"<code class=\"code\">provide-theme</code>."
msgstr ""
"カスタムテーマファイルの名前は <samp class=\"file\"><var class=\"var\">foo</"
"var>-theme.el</samp> とし、<var class=\"var\">foo</var> をテーマ名とします。"
"ファイル内の最初の Lisp フォームは <code class=\"code\">deftheme</code> の呼"
"び出しとし、最後のフォームは <code class=\"code\">provide-theme</code> の呼び"
"出しとします。"

