# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"A symbol designating what &ldquo;family&rdquo; a theme belongs to.  A <em "
"class=\"dfn\">family</em> of themes is a set of similar themes that differ "
"by minor aspects, such as face colors that are meant for the light vs dark "
"background of the frame."
msgstr ""
"テーマがどの「ファミリー」に属するかを示すシンボル。テーマの<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ファミリー</em>とは、フレームの明るい背景用と暗い背景用といった"
"顔の色など、細かな点で異なる類似テーマの集合のことである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
