#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"This function return a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value if <var "
"class=\"var\">theme</var> (a symbol)  is the name of a Custom theme (i.e., a "
"Custom theme which has been loaded into Emacs, whether or not the theme is "
"enabled).  Otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">theme</var>（シンボル）がカスタムテーマの名前"
"である場合（すなわち、テーマが有効であるか否かにかかわらず、Emacsにロードされ"
"ているカスタムテーマである場合）、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を"
"返します。それ以外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">custom-known-themes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"custom_002dknown_002dthemes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">custom-known-themes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"custom_002dknown_002dthemes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of themes loaded into Emacs.  Each "
"theme is represented by a Lisp symbol (the theme name).  The default value "
"of this variable is a list containing two dummy themes: <code "
"class=\"code\">(user changed)</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">changed</"
"code> theme stores settings made before any Custom themes are applied (e.g., "
"variables set outside of Customize).  The <code class=\"code\">user</code> "
"theme stores settings the user has customized and saved.  Any additional "
"themes declared with the <code class=\"code\">deftheme</code> macro are "
"added to the front of this list."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、Emacsにロードされたテーマのリストです。各テーマはLispシンボル"
"（テーマ名）で表されます。この変数のデフォルト値は、2つのダミーテーマ <code "
"class=\"code\">(user changed)</code> を含むリストです。<code "
"class=\"code\">changed</code> テーマには、Customテーマが適用される前に行われ"
"た設定（例：Customize以外で設定された変数）が格納されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">user</code> テーマには、ユーザーがカスタマイズして保存した設定"
"が格納されます。<code class=\"code\">deftheme</code> マクロで宣言された追加の"
"テーマは、このリストの先頭に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-theme</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">theme "
"&amp;optional no-confirm no-enable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dtheme\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-theme</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">theme "
"&amp;optional no-confirm no-enable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dtheme\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"This function loads the Custom theme named <var class=\"var\">theme</var> "
"from its source file, looking for the source file in the directories "
"specified by the variable <code class=\"code\">custom-theme-load-path</"
"code>.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Custom-Themes.html#Custom-Themes\">Custom "
"Themes</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  It also <em "
"class=\"dfn\">enables</em> the theme (unless the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">no-enable</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>), "
"causing its variable and face settings to take effect.  It prompts the user "
"for confirmation before loading the theme, unless the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">no-confirm</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">theme</var> という名前のカスタムテーマをソース"
"ファイルから読み込み、変数 <code class=\"code\">custom-theme-load-path</"
"code> で指定されたディレクトリの中からソースファイルを探します。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Custom-"
"Themes.html#Custom-Themes\">Custom Themes</a> を参照してください。また、（オ"
"プション引数 <var class=\"var\">no-enable</var> が non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限り）テーマを <em class=\"dfn\">有効化</em> "
"し、その変数およびフェイスの設定を適用します。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">no-confirm</var> が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない"
"限り、テーマを読み込む前にユーザーに確認を求めます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">require-theme</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">feature "
"&amp;optional noerror</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"require_002dtheme\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">require-theme</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">feature "
"&amp;optional noerror</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"require_002dtheme\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"This function searches <code class=\"code\">custom-theme-load-path</code> "
"for a file that provides <var class=\"var\">feature</var> and then loads "
"it.  This is like the function <code class=\"code\">require</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Named-Features.html\">Features</a>), except it "
"searches <code class=\"code\">custom-theme-load-path</code> instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Library-"
"Search.html\">Library Search</a>).  This can be useful in Custom themes that "
"need to load supporting Lisp files when <code class=\"code\">require</code> "
"is unsuitable for that."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">custom-theme-load-path</code> 内で <var "
"class=\"var\">feature</var> を提供するファイルを検索し、それを読み込みます。"
"これは関数 <code class=\"code\">require</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Named-Features.html\">Features</a> を参照）と同様ですが、<code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code> ではなく <code class=\"code\">custom-theme-"
"load-path</code> を検索する点が異なります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Library-"
"Search.html\">Library Search</a> を参照）。これは、<code "
"class=\"code\">require</code> が適さない場合に補助的な Lisp ファイルを読み込"
"む必要があるカスタムテーマにおいて有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">feature</var>, which should be a symbol, is not "
"already present in the current Emacs session according to <code "
"class=\"code\">featurep</code>, then <code class=\"code\">require-theme</"
"code> searches for a file named <var class=\"var\">feature</var> with an "
"added &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; suffix, in that order, in the directories "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">custom-theme-load-path</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">featurep</code> によれば、シンボルであるべき <var "
"class=\"var\">feature</var> が現在の Emacs セッションにまだ存在しない場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">require-theme</code> は <code class=\"code\">custom-"
"theme-load-path</code> で指定されたディレクトリ内で、<var "
"class=\"var\">feature</var> という名前のファイルに、順に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.elc</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</"
"samp>&rsquo; という接尾辞を付加したものを探します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"If a file providing <var class=\"var\">feature</var> is successfully found "
"and loaded, then <code class=\"code\">require-theme</code> returns <var "
"class=\"var\">feature</var>.  The optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">noerror</var> determines what happens if the search or loading "
"fails.  If it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function signals an "
"error; otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If the file "
"loads successfully but does not provide <var class=\"var\">feature</var>, "
"then <code class=\"code\">require-theme</code> signals an error; this cannot "
"be suppressed."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">feature</var> を提供するファイルが正常に見つかり、読み込ま"
"れた場合、<code class=\"code\">require-theme</code> は <var "
"class=\"var\">feature</var> を返します。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">noerror</var> は、検索または読み込みに失敗した場合にどうなるか"
"を決定します。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は関数がエラーを通"
"知し、それ以外の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。ファイルが"
"正常に読み込まれたものの、<var class=\"var\">feature</var> を提供していない場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">require-theme</code> はエラーを通知します。これは抑"
"制できません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">enable-theme</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">theme</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-enable_002dtheme\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
