"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-enable_002dtheme\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"This function enables the Custom theme named <var class=\"var\">theme</"
"var>.  It signals an error if no such theme has been loaded."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">theme</var> という名前のカスタムテーマを有効に"
"します。該当するテーマが読み込まれていない場合は、エラーを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
