# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"This function disables the Custom theme named <var class=\"var\">theme</"
"var>.  The theme remains loaded, so that a subsequent call to <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-theme</code> will re-enable it."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">theme</var> という名前のカスタムテーマを無効に"
"します。テーマはロードされたままとなるため、その後 <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-theme</code> を呼び出すと再び有効になります。"

