# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fringe-bitmaps_002c-customizing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fringe-bitmaps_002c-customizing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-fringe-bitmap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">bitmap "
"bits &amp;optional height width align</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-define_002dfringe_002dbitmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-fringe-bitmap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">bitmap "
"bits &amp;optional height width align</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-define_002dfringe_002dbitmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"This function defines the symbol <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> as a new "
"fringe bitmap, or replaces an existing bitmap with that name."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、シンボル <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> を新しいフリンジビット"
"マップとして定義するか、同名の既存のビットマップを置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">bits</var> specifies the image to use.  It "
"should be either a string or a vector of integers, where each element (an "
"integer) corresponds to one row of the bitmap.  Each bit of an integer "
"corresponds to one pixel of the bitmap, where the low bit corresponds to the "
"rightmost pixel of the bitmap.  (Note that this order of bits is the "
"opposite of the order in XBM images; see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"XBM-"
"Images.html\">XBM Images</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">bits</var> で使用する画像を指定します。文字列または整"
"数のベクトルのいずれかである必要があり、各要素（整数）はビットマップの1行に対"
"応します。整数の各ビットはビットマップの1ピクセルに対応し、下位ビットがビット"
"マップの最右端のピクセルに対応します。（なお、このビットの順序は XBM 画像の順"
"序とは逆であることに注意してください。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"XBM-"
"Images.html\">XBM 画像</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"The height is normally the length of <var class=\"var\">bits</var>.  "
"However, you can specify a different height with non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">height</var>.  The width is "
"normally 8, but you can specify a different width with non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">width</var>.  The width must be "
"an integer between 1 and 16."
msgstr ""
"高さは通常 <var class=\"var\">bits</var> の長さとなります。ただし、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">height</var> 以外の値を指定する"
"ことで、異なる高さを設定できます。幅は通常 8 ですが、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">width</var> 以外の値を指定するこ"
"とで、異なる幅を設定できます。幅は 1 から 16 までの整数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">align</var> specifies the positioning of the "
"bitmap relative to the range of rows where it is used; the default is to "
"center the bitmap.  The allowed values are <code class=\"code\">top</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">center</code>, or <code class=\"code\">bottom</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">align</var> は、ビットマップが使用される行範囲に対す"
"る相対的な位置を指定します。デフォルトでは、ビットマップは中央に配置されま"
"す。指定可能な値は <code class=\"code\">top</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">center</code>、または <code class=\"code\">bottom</code> で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">align</var> argument may also be a list <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">align</var> <var class=\"var\">periodic</"
"var>)</code> where <var class=\"var\">align</var> is interpreted as "
"described above.  If <var class=\"var\">periodic</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies that the rows in <code "
"class=\"code\">bits</code> should be repeated enough times to reach the "
"specified height."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">align</var> 引数はリスト <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">align</var> <var class=\"var\">periodic</var>)</code> であって"
"もよく、その場合 <var class=\"var\">align</var> は前述の通りに解釈されます。"
"<var class=\"var\">periodic</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であ"
"る場合、<code class=\"code\">bits</code> の行を指定された高さに達するまで十分"
"な回数繰り返すことを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">destroy-fringe-bitmap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">bitmap</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"destroy_002dfringe_002dbitmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">destroy-fringe-bitmap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">bitmap</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"destroy_002dfringe_002dbitmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"This function destroys the fringe bitmap identified by <var "
"class=\"var\">bitmap</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> identifies a "
"standard fringe bitmap, it actually restores the standard definition of that "
"bitmap, instead of eliminating it entirely."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> で指定されたフリンジビットマップ"
"を破棄します。<var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> が標準のフリンジビットマップを"
"指している場合、そのビットマップを完全に削除するのではなく、実際にはその標準"
"定義を復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-fringe-bitmap-face</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">bitmap &amp;optional face</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dfringe_002dbitmap_002dface\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-fringe-bitmap-face</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">bitmap &amp;optional face</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dfringe_002dbitmap_002dface\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"This sets the face for the fringe bitmap <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> to "
"<var class=\"var\">face</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">face</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it selects the <code class=\"code\">fringe</code> "
"face.  The bitmap&rsquo;s face controls the color to draw it in."
msgstr ""
"これにより、フリンジビットマップ <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> の面が <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> に設定されます。<var class=\"var\">face</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<code class=\"code\">fringe</code> の"
"面が選択されます。ビットマップの面によって、描画時の色が制御されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">face</var> is merged with the <code "
"class=\"code\">fringe</code> face, so normally <var class=\"var\">face</var> "
"should specify only the foreground color."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">face</var> は <code class=\"code\">fringe</code> 面と統合"
"されるため、通常 <var class=\"var\">face</var> では前景色のみを指定すべきで"
"す。"

