# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"This function adds highlighting <var class=\"var\">keywords</var>, for the "
"current buffer or for major mode <var class=\"var\">mode</var>.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> should be a list with the same "
"format as the variable <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファまたはメジャーモード <var class=\"var\">mode</var> "
"に対してハイライト <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> を追加します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">keywords</var> は、変数 <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"keywords</code> と同じ形式のリストである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">mode</var> is a symbol which is a major mode command "
"name, such as <code class=\"code\">c-mode</code>, the effect is that "
"enabling Font Lock mode in <var class=\"var\">mode</var> will add <var "
"class=\"var\">keywords</var> to <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</"
"code>.  Calling with a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value of <var "
"class=\"var\">mode</var> is correct only in your <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs</samp> file."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">mode</var> が <code class=\"code\">c-mode</code> のような"
"メジャーモードコマンド名である場合、<var class=\"var\">mode</var> で Font "
"Lock モードを有効にすると、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> に "
"<var class=\"var\">keywords</var> が追加されることになります。<var "
"class=\"var\">mode</var> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定し"
"て呼び出すのが正しいのは、お使いの <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs</samp> ファ"
"イル内のみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">mode</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function adds <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> to <code class=\"code\">font-"
"lock-keywords</code> in the current buffer.  This way of calling <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> is usually used in mode hook "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">mode</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、"
"この関数は現在のバッファ内の <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> "
"に <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> を加算します。このような <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> の呼び出し方は、通常モードフック"
"関数で用いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"By default, <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> are added at the beginning of "
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code>.  If the optional argument "
"<var class=\"var\">how</var> is <code class=\"code\">set</code>, they are "
"used to replace the value of <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</"
"code>.  If <var class=\"var\">how</var> is any other non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, they are added at the end of <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<var class=\"var\">keywords</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> の先頭に追加されます。オプション引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">how</var> が <code class=\"code\">set</code> である場"
"合、これらは <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> の値を置き換える"
"ために使用されます。<var class=\"var\">how</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値である場合、これらは <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> の末尾に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"Some modes provide specialized support you can use in additional "
"highlighting patterns.  See the variables <code class=\"code\">c-font-lock-"
"extra-types</code>, <code class=\"code\">c++-font-lock-extra-types</code>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">java-font-lock-extra-types</code>, for example."
msgstr ""
"一部のモードでは、追加のハイライトパターンで活用できる専用のサポートが提供さ"
"れています。例えば、変数 <code class=\"code\">c-font-lock-extra-types</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">c++-font-lock-extra-types</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">java-font-lock-extra-types</code> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> Major mode commands must not call "
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> under any circumstances, "
"either directly or indirectly, except through their mode hooks.  (Doing so "
"would lead to incorrect behavior for some minor modes.)  They should set up "
"their rules for search-based fontification by setting <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code>."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> メジャーモードのコマンドは、モード"
"フックを介する場合を除き、直接的・間接的を問わず、いかなる状況においても "
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> を呼び出してはなりません。"
"（これを行うと、一部のマイナーモードで誤った動作が発生します。）代わりに、"
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> を設定することで、検索ベースの"
"フォント化に関するルールを定義する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-remove-keywords</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">mode keywords</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"font_002dlock_002dremove_002dkeywords\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-remove-keywords</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">mode keywords</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"font_002dlock_002dremove_002dkeywords\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"This function removes <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> from <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> for the current buffer or for major "
"mode <var class=\"var\">mode</var>.  As in <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"add-keywords</code>, <var class=\"var\">mode</var> should be a major mode "
"command name or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  All the caveats and "
"requirements for <code class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> apply "
"here too.  The argument <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> must exactly match "
"the one used by the corresponding <code class=\"code\">font-lock-add-"
"keywords</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファまたはメジャーモード <var class=\"var\">mode</var> "
"に対して、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> から <var "
"class=\"var\">keywords</var> を削除します。<code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"add-keywords</code> と同様に、<var class=\"var\">mode</var> にはメジャーモー"
"ドのコマンド名または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定する必要がありま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> に関するすべての注意事"
"項および要件は、ここでも適用されます。引数 <var class=\"var\">keywords</var> "
"は、対応する <code class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code> で使用されて"
"いるものと完全に一致している必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"For example, the following code adds two fontification patterns for C mode: "
"one to fontify the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FIXME</samp>&rsquo;, "
"even in comments, and another to fontify the words &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">and</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">or</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">not</samp>&rsquo; as keywords."
msgstr ""
"例えば、以下のコードはCモード向けに2つのフォント化パターンを追加しています。"
"一つはコメント内であっても単語 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FIXME</"
"samp>&rsquo; をフォント化するもの、もう一つは単語 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">and</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">or</"
"samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">not</samp>&rsquo; をキーワー"
"ドとしてフォント化するものです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(font-lock-add-keywords 'c-mode\n"
" '((&quot;\\\\&lt;\\\\(FIXME\\\\):&quot; 1 font-lock-warning-face prepend)\n"
"   (&quot;\\\\&lt;\\\\(and\\\\|or\\\\|not\\\\)\\\\&gt;&quot; . font-lock-keyword-face)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"This example affects only C mode proper.  To add the same patterns to C mode "
"<em class=\"emph\">and</em> all modes derived from it, do this instead:"
msgstr ""
"この例はCモード本体にのみ影響します。Cモード<em class=\"emph\">および</em>そ"
"こから派生したすべてのモードに同じパターンを追加するには、代わりに次のように"
"してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'c-mode-hook\n"
" (lambda ()\n"
"  (font-lock-add-keywords nil\n"
"   '((&quot;\\\\&lt;\\\\(FIXME\\\\):&quot; 1 font-lock-warning-face prepend)\n"
"     (&quot;\\\\&lt;\\\\(and\\\\|or\\\\|not\\\\)\\\\&gt;&quot; .\n"
"      font-lock-keyword-face)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
