# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"In all programming modes, disable fontifications due to all font-lock "
"keywords that apply one of the standard font-lock faces (excluding strings "
"and comments, which are covered by syntactic Font Lock)."
msgstr ""
"すべてのプログラミングモードにおいて、標準的な Font Lock フェイスのいずれかを"
"適用するすべての Font Lock キーワードによるフォント化を無効にします（構文用 "
"Font Lock で処理される文字列およびコメントは除きます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"However, keep any keywords that add a <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> "
"text property."
msgstr ""
"ただし、<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> テキストプロパティを追加する"
"キーワードは保持してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"In Emacs Lisp mode, also keep the highlighting of autoload cookies, which "
"would have been excluded by the first condition."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispモードでは、最初の条件によって除外されていたであろうオートロード"
"クッキーのハイライトも維持する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">whitespace-mode</code> (a minor mode) is enabled, "
"also don&rsquo;t highlight an empty line at beginning of buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">whitespace-mode</code>（マイナーモード）が有効な場合、"
"バッファ先頭の空行もハイライトしないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Customizing-Keywords.html
msgid "Finally, in Makefile mode, don&rsquo;t apply any conditions."
msgstr "最後に、Makefileモードでは、いかなる条件も適用しないでください。"

