# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.12 Cyclic Ordering of Windows<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Cyclic-Ordering-of-Windows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.12 ウィンドウの循環順序<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Cyclic-"
"Ordering-of-Windows\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cyclic-ordering-of-windows\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ordering-of-windows_002c-cyclic\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-ordering_002c-cyclic\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cyclic-ordering-of-windows\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ordering-of-windows_002c-cyclic\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-ordering_002c-cyclic\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"When you use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">other-window</code>) to select some other window, it moves "
"through live windows in a specific order.  For any given configuration of "
"windows, this order never varies.  It is called the <em class=\"dfn\">cyclic "
"ordering of windows</em>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">other-"
"window</code>) を使用して別のウィンドウを選択すると、ライブウィンドウを特定の"
"順序で移動します。どのようなウィンドウ構成であっても、この順序が変わることは"
"ありません。これは <em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウの巡回順序</em> と呼ばれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"The ordering is determined by a depth-first traversal of each frame&rsquo;s "
"window tree, retrieving the live windows which are the leaf nodes of the "
"tree (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">Windows and "
"Frames</a>).  If the minibuffer is active, the minibuffer window is included "
"too.  The ordering is cyclic, so the last window in the sequence is followed "
"by the first one."
msgstr ""
"順序は、各フレームのウィンドウツリーを深さ優先探索し、ツリーの葉ノードである"
"ライブウィンドウを取得することで決定されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">ウィンドウとフレーム</a>を参照）。ミニバッ"
"ファがアクティブな場合は、ミニバッファウィンドウも含まれます。順序は循環して"
"いるため、シーケンスの最後のウィンドウの後には最初のウィンドウが続きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">next-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window minibuf all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"next_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">next-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window minibuf all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"next_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-window_002c-and-"
"next_002dwindow\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-window_002c-and-"
"next_002dwindow\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a live window, the one following <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> in the cyclic ordering of windows.  <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> should be a live window; if omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウの循環順において <var class=\"var\">window</var> の次に"
"来るライブウィンドウを返します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> にはライブ"
"ウィンドウを指定する必要があります。省略した場合や <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を指定した場合は、選択中のウィンドウがデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> specifies whether "
"minibuffer windows should be included in the cyclic ordering.  Normally, "
"when <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, a "
"minibuffer window is included only if it is currently active; this matches "
"the behavior of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd>.  (Note that a "
"minibuffer window is active as long as its minibuffer is in use; see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffers.html\">Minibuffers</a>)."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> は、ミニバッファウィンドウを"
"循環順列に含めるかどうかを指定します。通常、<var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> のとき、ミニバッファウィンドウは現在アク"
"ティブな場合にのみ含まれます。これは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> の動"
"作と一致します。（なお、ミニバッファウィンドウは、そのミニバッファが使用され"
"ている限りアクティブです。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffers.html\">ミニバッ"
"ファ</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the "
"cyclic ordering includes all minibuffer windows.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">minibuf</var> is neither <code class=\"code\">t</code> nor "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, minibuffer windows are not included even if "
"they are active."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、循"
"環順序にはすべてのミニバッファウィンドウが含まれます。<var "
"class=\"var\">minibuf</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> でも <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でもない場合、ミニバッファウィンドウはアクティブで"
"あっても含まれません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> specifies which "
"frames to consider:"
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> で、対象とするフレームを指"
"定します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means to consider windows on <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s frame.  If the minibuffer window is "
"considered (as specified by the <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> argument), "
"then frames that share the minibuffer window are considered too."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のフレー"
"ム上のウィンドウを考慮することを意味します。ミニバッファウィンドウが考慮され"
"る場合（<var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> 引数で指定）、ミニバッファウィンドウ"
"を共有するフレームも同様に考慮されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> means to consider windows on all existing "
"frames."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> は、存在するすべてのフレーム上のウィンドウを考"
"慮することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">visible</code> means to consider windows on all visible "
"frames."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">visible</code> は、表示されているすべてのフレームのウィ"
"ンドウを考慮することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid "0 means to consider windows on all visible or iconified frames."
msgstr ""
"0は、表示されている、またはアイコン化されたすべてのフレームのウィンドウを考慮"
"することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid "A frame means to consider windows on that specific frame."
msgstr ""
"フレームとは、その特定のフレーム上のウィンドウを考慮することを意味する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"Anything else means to consider windows on <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var>&rsquo;s frame, and no others."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の場合は、<var class=\"var\">window</var>のフレーム上のウィンドウのみ"
"を考慮し、それ以外は考慮しない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"If more than one frame is considered, the cyclic ordering is obtained by "
"appending the orderings for those frames, in the same order as the list of "
"all live frames (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Finding-All-"
"Frames.html\">Finding All Frames</a>)."
msgstr ""
"複数のフレームを考慮する場合、それらのフレームの順序を、すべてのライブフレー"
"ムのリストと同じ順序で連結することで、循環順序が得られます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Finding-All-Frames.html\">Finding All Frames</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">previous-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window minibuf all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-previous_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">previous-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window minibuf all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-previous_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a live window, the one preceding <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> in the cyclic ordering of windows.  The other "
"arguments are handled like in <code class=\"code\">next-window</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウの循環順において <var class=\"var\">window</var> の直前"
"に位置するライブウィンドウを返します。その他の引数の扱いは <code "
"class=\"code\">next-window</code> と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">other-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"other_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">other-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional all-frames</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"other_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"This function selects a live window, one <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"places from the selected window in the cyclic ordering of windows.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is a positive number, it skips <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> windows forwards; if <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> is negative, it skips &minus;<var class=\"var\">count</var> windows "
"backwards; if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is zero, that simply re-selects "
"the selected window.  When called interactively, <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> is the numeric prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ライブウィンドウを、ウィンドウの循環順において選択済みウィンドウ"
"から <var class=\"var\">count</var> 番目の位置に選択します。<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が正の数の場合は <var class=\"var\">count</var> 個"
"先のウィンドウをスキップし、<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の数の場合は "
"&minus;<var class=\"var\">count</var> 個前のウィンドウをスキップし、<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が 0 の場合は、単に選択済みウィンドウを再選択しま"
"す。対話的に呼び出された場合、<var class=\"var\">count</var> は数値のプレ"
"フィックス引数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">all-frames</var> has the same "
"meaning as in <code class=\"code\">next-window</code>, like a <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">next-window</code>.  When called interactively, <var "
