#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">get-lru-window</code>, but it "
"returns the most recently used window instead.  The <em class=\"dfn\">most "
"recently used window</em> is the most recently selected one&mdash;the window "
