"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-database-access_002c-SQLite\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can be compiled with built-in support for accessing SQLite databases.  "
"This section describes the facilities available for accessing SQLite "
"databases from Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、SQLiteデータベースへのアクセス機能を標準で備えてコンパイルできます。"
"本節では、LispプログラムからSQLiteデータベースにアクセスするために利用可能な"
"機能について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-available-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002davailable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-available-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002davailable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"The function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if built-in SQLite "
"support is available in this Emacs session."
msgstr ""
"このEmacsセッションでSQLiteの組み込みサポートが利用可能な場合、この関数はnon-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid "When SQLite support is available, the following functions can be used."
msgstr "SQLite がサポートされている場合、以下の関数が使用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-database-object\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-database-object\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-open</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"file readonly disable-uri</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002dopen\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-open</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"file readonly disable-uri</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002dopen\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"This function opens <var class=\"var\">file</var> as an SQLite database "
"file.  If <var class=\"var\">file</var> doesn&rsquo;t exist, a new database "
"will be created and stored in that file.  If <var class=\"var\">file</var> "
"is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, a new in-memory database is "
"created instead.  Second optional argument <var class=\"var\">readonly</"
"var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, means open the database only "
"for reading; the database must already exist in that case.  By default, <var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> can be a <samp class=\"file\">file://</samp> URI as "
"well as a file name; in the unusual case that you have a local file whose "
"name begins with <samp class=\"file\">file:</samp>, specify a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value for the third optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">disable-uri</var> to disable the automatic recognition and "
"processing of URIs."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">file</var> を SQLite データベースファイルとし"
"て開きます。<var class=\"var\">file</var> が存在しない場合は、新しいデータ"
"ベースが作成され、そのファイルに保存されます。<var class=\"var\">file</var> "
"が省略されているか、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定されている場"
"合は、代わりに新しいインメモリデータベースが作成されます。2番目のオプション引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">readonly</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"の場合、データベースを読み取り専用で開くことを意味します。この場合、データ"
"ベースが既に存在している必要があります。デフォルトでは、<var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> にはファイル名だけでなく <samp "
"class=\"file\">file://</samp> URI も指定可能です。名前が <samp "
"class=\"file\">file:</samp> で始まるローカルファイルがあるという特殊なケース"
"では、3番目のオプション引数 <var class=\"var\">disable-uri</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定して、URI の自動認識および処理を無効"
"にしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"The return value is a <em class=\"dfn\">database object</em> that can be "
"used as the argument to most of the subsequent functions described below."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は、以下で説明する後続の関数のほとんどで引数として使用できる<em "
"class=\"dfn\">データベースオブジェクト</em>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlitep</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-sqlitep\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlitep</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-sqlitep\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"This predicate returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is an SQLite database object.  The database "
"object returned by the <code class=\"code\">sqlite-open</code> function "
"satisfies this predicate."
msgstr ""
"この述語は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が SQLite データベースオブジェク"
"トである場合に non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">sqlite-open</code> 関数によって返されるデータベースオブジェク"
"トは、この述語を満たします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-close</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">db</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-sqlite_002dclose\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-close</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">db</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-sqlite_002dclose\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"Close the database <var class=\"var\">db</var>.  It&rsquo;s usually not "
"necessary to call this function explicitly&mdash;the database will "
"automatically be closed if Emacs shuts down or the database object is "
"garbage collected.  If the connection identified by <var class=\"var\">db</"
"var> is already closed, this function does nothing."
msgstr ""
"データベース <var class=\"var\">db</var> を閉じます。通常、この関数を明示的に"
"呼び出す必要はありません。Emacs が終了するか、データベースオブジェクトがガ"
"ベージコレクションされると、データベースは自動的に閉じられます。<var "
"class=\"var\">db</var> で指定された接続が既に閉じられている場合、この関数は何"
"もしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-execute</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">db statement "
"&amp;optional values</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002dexecute\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-execute</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">db statement "
"&amp;optional values</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002dexecute\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"Execute the <abbr class=\"acronym\">SQL</abbr> <var class=\"var\">statement</"
"var>.  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">SQL</abbr> <var class=\"var\">statement</var> を実行"
"します。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(sqlite-execute db &quot;insert into foo values ('bar', 2)&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"If the optional <var class=\"var\">values</var> parameter is present, it "
"should be either a list or a vector of values to bind while executing the "
"statement.  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"オプションの <var class=\"var\">values</var> パラメータが指定されている場合、"
"それはステートメントの実行時にバインドする値のリストまたはベクトルである必要"
"があります。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(sqlite-execute db &quot;insert into foo values (?, ?)&quot; '(&quot;bar&quot; 2))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"This has exactly the same effect as the previous example, but is more "
"efficient and safer (because it doesn&rsquo;t involve any string parsing or "
"interpolation)."
msgstr ""
"これは前述の例と全く同じ効果がありますが、より効率的で安全です（文字列のパー"
"スや補間を伴わないため）。"

#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">sqlite-execute</code> usually returns the number of "
"affected rows.  For instance, an &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">insert</"
"samp>&rsquo; statement will typically return &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1</"
"samp>&rsquo;, whereas an &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">update</samp>&rsquo; "
"statement may return zero or a higher number.  However, when using <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">SQL</abbr> statements like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">insert&nbsp;into&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;returning&nbsp;&hellip;</"
"samp>&rsquo; and the like, the values specified by &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">returning&nbsp;&hellip;</samp>&rsquo; will be returned "
"instead."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"Strings in SQLite are, by default, stored as <code class=\"code\">utf-8</"
"code>, and selecting a text column will decode the string using that "
"charset.  Selecting a blob column will return the raw data without any "
"decoding (i.e., it will return a unibyte string containing the bytes as "
"stored in the database).  Inserting binary data into blob columns, however, "
"requires some care, as <code class=\"code\">sqlite-execute</code> will, by "
"default, interpret all strings as <code class=\"code\">utf-8</code>."
msgstr ""
"SQLiteの文字列は、デフォルトでは<code class=\"code\">utf-8</code>として格納さ"
"れており、テキスト列を選択すると、その文字セットを用いて文字列がデコードされ"
"ます。BLOB列を選択すると、デコードなしで生データが返されます（つまり、データ"
"ベースに格納されているバイト列を含むユニバイト文字列が返されます）。ただし、"
"BLOB列にバイナリデータを挿入する場合は注意が必要です。デフォルトでは<code "
"class=\"code\">sqlite-execute</code>がすべての文字列を<code "
"class=\"code\">utf-8</code>として解釈するためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"So if you have, for instance, <abbr class=\"acronym\">GIF</abbr> data in a "
"unibyte string called <var class=\"var\">gif</var>, you have to mark it "
"specially to let <code class=\"code\">sqlite-execute</code> know this:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、<var class=\"var\">gif</var> というユニバイト文字列に <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">GIF</abbr> データが含まれている場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">sqlite-execute</code> にそのことを知らせるために、特別にマーク"
"を付ける必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(put-text-property 0 1 'coding-system 'binary gif)\n"
"(sqlite-execute db &quot;insert into foo values (?, ?)&quot; (list gif 2))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-execute-batch</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">db "
"statements</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002dexecute_002dbatch\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sqlite-execute-batch</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">db "
"statements</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sqlite_002dexecute_002dbatch\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"Execute the <abbr class=\"acronym\">SQL</abbr> <var "
"class=\"var\">statements</var>.  <var class=\"var\">statements</var> is a "
"string containing 0 or more <abbr class=\"acronym\">SQL</abbr> statements.  "
"This command might be useful when a Lisp program needs to execute multiple "
"Data Definition Language (<abbr class=\"acronym\">DDL</abbr>) statements in "
"one go."
