"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
msgid ""
"Execute <var class=\"var\">pragma</var> in <var class=\"var\">db</var>.  A "
"<em class=\"dfn\">pragma</em> is usually a command that affects the database "
"overall, instead of any particular table.  For instance, to make SQLite "
"automatically garbage collect data that&rsquo;s no longer needed, you can "
"say:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">db</var> 内で <var class=\"var\">pragma</var> を実行しま"
"す。<em class=\"dfn\">プラグマ</em> は通常、特定のテーブルではなく、データ"
"ベース全体に影響を与えるコマンドです。例えば、SQLite に不要になったデータを自"
"動的にガベージコレクションさせるには、次のように記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Database.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(sqlite-pragma db &quot;auto_vacuum = FULL&quot;)\n"
