"<span>41.16 Datagrams<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Datagrams-1\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>41.16 データグラム<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Datagrams-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-datagrams\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-datagrams\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">datagram</em> connection communicates with individual "
"packets rather than streams of data.  Each call to <code "
"class=\"code\">process-send</code> sends one datagram packet (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-to-Processes.html\">Sending Input to Processes</"
"a>), and each datagram received results in one call to the filter function."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">データグラム</em>接続は、データストリームではなく個々のパ"
"ケットを用いて通信を行います。<code class=\"code\">process-send</code> を呼び"
"出すたびに1つのデータグラムパケットが送信され（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Input-to-Processes.html\">プロセスへの入力送信</a>を参照）、受信した"
"データグラムごとにフィルタ関数が1回呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid ""
"The datagram connection doesn&rsquo;t have to talk with the same remote peer "
"all the time.  It has a <em class=\"dfn\">remote peer address</em> which "
"specifies where to send datagrams to.  Each time an incoming datagram is "
"passed to the filter function, the peer address is set to the address that "
"datagram came from; that way, if the filter function sends a datagram, it "
"will go back to that place.  You can specify the remote peer address when "
"you create the datagram connection using the <code class=\"code\">:remote</"
"code> keyword.  You can change it later on by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">set-process-datagram-address</code>."
msgstr ""
"データグラム接続は、常に同一のリモートピアと通信する必要はありません。データ"
"グラムの送信先を指定する<em class=\"dfn\">リモートピアアドレス</em>を持ってい"
"ます。受信したデータグラムがフィルタ関数に渡されるたびに、ピアアドレスはその"
"データグラムの送信元アドレスに設定されます。これにより、フィルタ関数がデータ"
"グラムを送信した場合、その送信先へと戻ることになります。<code "
"class=\"code\">:remote</code>キーワードを使用してデータグラム接続を作成する際"
"に、リモートピアアドレスを指定できます。また、後で<code class=\"code\">set-"
"process-datagram-address</code>を呼び出すことでこのアドレスを変更することも可"
"能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-datagram-address</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002ddatagram_002daddress\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-datagram-address</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002ddatagram_002daddress\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">process</var> is a datagram connection or server, this "
"function returns its remote peer address."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> がデータグラム接続またはサーバーである場合、"
"この関数はそのリモートピアアドレスを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-process-datagram-address</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process address</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dprocess_002ddatagram_002daddress\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-process-datagram-address</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process address</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dprocess_002ddatagram_002daddress\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Datagrams.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">process</var> is a datagram connection or server, this "
"function sets its remote peer address to <var class=\"var\">address</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> がデータグラム接続またはサーバーである場合、"
"この関数はそのリモートピアアドレスを <var class=\"var\">address</var> に設定"
"します。"

