# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"This macro ignores its arguments and evaluates to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>; it has no run-time effect.  However, when a <code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> form occurs in the <var class=\"var\">declare</"
"var> argument of a <code class=\"code\">defun</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">defsubst</code> function definition (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Functions.html\">Defining Functions</a>) or a <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code> macro definition (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Macros.html\">Defining Macros</a>), it appends the "
"properties specified by <var class=\"var\">specs</var> to the function or "
"macro.  This work is specially performed by <code class=\"code\">defun</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">defsubst</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは引数を無視し、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> と評価されます。実"
"行時の影響はありません。ただし、<code class=\"code\">defun</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">defsubst</code> 関数定義（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Functions.html\">関数の定義</a> を参照）、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code> マクロ定義（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Macros.html\">マクロの定義</a> を参照）の <var "
"class=\"var\">declare</var> 引数に <code class=\"code\">declare</code> 形式が"
"現れると、<var class=\"var\">specs</var> で指定されたプロパティを関数またはマ"
"クロに追加します。この処理は、<code class=\"code\">defun</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">defsubst</code>、および <code class=\"code\">defmacro</code> "
"によって特別に行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
