"<a id=\"index-advertised_002dcalling_002dconvention-_0028declare-"
"spec_0029\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(advertised-calling-convention "
"<var class=\"var\">signature</var> <var class=\"var\">when</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-advertised_002dcalling_002dconvention-"
"_0028declare-spec_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"This acts like a call to <code class=\"code\">set-advertised-calling-"
"convention</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Obsolete-"
"Functions.html\">Declaring Functions Obsolete</a>); <var "
"class=\"var\">signature</var> specifies the correct argument list for "
"calling the function or macro, and <var class=\"var\">when</var> should be a "
"string indicating when the old argument list was first made obsolete."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">set-advertised-calling-convention</code> への呼び"
"出しとして機能します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Obsolete-Functions.html\">関"
"数の廃止宣言</a> を参照）。<var class=\"var\">signature</var> は関数またはマ"
"クロを呼び出す際の正しい引数リストを指定し、<var class=\"var\">when</var> は"
"古い引数リストが最初に廃止された時期を示す文字列である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(debug <var class=\"var\">edebug-form-spec</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(debug <var class=\"var\">edebug-form-spec</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"This is valid for macros only.  When stepping through the macro with Edebug, "
"use <var class=\"var\">edebug-form-spec</var>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Instrumenting-Macro-Calls.html\">Instrumenting Macro Calls</a>."
msgstr ""
"これはマクロにのみ適用されます。Edebugでマクロをステップ実行する場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">edebug-form-spec</var>を使用してください。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Instrumenting-Macro-Calls.html\">マクロ呼び出しのインストルメンテー"
"ション</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(doc-string <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(doc-string <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"This is used when defining a function or macro which itself will be used to "
"define entities like functions, macros, or variables.  It indicates that the "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var>th argument, if any, should be considered as a "
"documentation string."
msgstr ""
"これは、関数やマクロ、あるいは変数といったエンティティを定義するために用いら"
"れる関数やマクロを定義する際に使用されます。これにより、第<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>引数（もしあれば）をドキュメント文字列として扱うことが示"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(indent <var class=\"var\">indent-spec</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(indent <var class=\"var\">indent-spec</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Indent calls to this function or macro according to <var "
"class=\"var\">indent-spec</var>.  This is typically used for macros, though "
"it works for functions too.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Indenting-"
"Macros.html\">Indenting Macros</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数またはマクロの呼び出しを <var class=\"var\">indent-spec</var> に従っ"
"てインデントします。通常はマクロに使用されますが、関数でも有効です。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Indenting-Macros.html\">マクロのインデント</a> を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-autoload_002dmacro-_0028declare-spec_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(autoload-macro <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-autoload_002dmacro-_0028declare-"
"spec_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-autoload_002dmacro-_0028declare-spec_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(autoload-macro <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-autoload_002dmacro-_0028declare-"
"spec_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"This is used when defining a macro.  If <var class=\"var\">value</var> is "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">expand</samp>&rsquo;, any calls to the macro "
"which follow an autoload comment will first be expanded during generation of "
"the autoloads.  This declaration is used as an alternative to hard-coding "
"lists of macros to expand in <code class=\"code\">loaddefs-generate--make-"
"autoload</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Autoload.html\">Autoload</a>."
msgstr ""
"これはマクロを定義する際に使用されます。<var class=\"var\">value</var> が "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">expand</samp>&rsquo; である場合、オートロードコメ"
"ントに続くマクロの呼び出しは、オートロードの生成時にまず展開されます。この宣"
"言は、<code class=\"code\">loaddefs-generate--make-autoload</code> で展開する"
"マクロのリストをハードコードする代わりの手段として使用されます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Autoload.html\">オートロード</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(interactive-only <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(interactive-only <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Set the function&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">interactive-only</code> "
"property to <var class=\"var\">value</var>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Commands.html#The-interactive_002donly-property\">The "
"interactive-only property</a>."
msgstr ""
"関数の <code class=\"code\">interactive-only</code> プロパティを <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> に設定します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-"
"Commands.html#The-interactive_002donly-property\">インタラクティブ専用プロパ"
"ティ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-obsolete-_0028declare-spec_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(obsolete <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">when</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"obsolete-_0028declare-spec_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-obsolete-_0028declare-spec_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(obsolete <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">when</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"obsolete-_0028declare-spec_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Mark the function or macro as obsolete, similar to a call to <code "
"class=\"code\">make-obsolete</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Obsolete-"
"Functions.html\">Declaring Functions Obsolete</a>).  <var "
"class=\"var\">current-name</var> should be a symbol (in which case the "
"warning message says to use that instead), a string (specifying the warning "
"message), or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (in which case the warning "
"message gives no extra details).  <var class=\"var\">when</var> should be a "
"string indicating when the function or macro was first made obsolete."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">make-obsolete</code> の呼び出しと同様に、関数またはマク"
"ロを廃止済みとしてマークします（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Obsolete-"
"Functions.html\">関数の廃止宣言</a>を参照）。<var class=\"var\">current-"
"name</var> には、シンボル（この場合、警告メッセージでは代わりにそのシンボルを"
"使用するよう指示されます）、文字列（警告メッセージを指定）、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>（この場合、警告メッセージに詳細な情報は含まれませ"
"ん）を指定します。<var class=\"var\">when</var> には、関数またはマクロが最初"
"に廃止された時期を示す文字列を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-compiler-macro\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(compiler-"
"macro <var class=\"var\">expander</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-compiler-macro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-compiler-macro\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(compiler-"
"macro <var class=\"var\">expander</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-compiler-macro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"This can only be used for functions, and tells the compiler to use <var "
"class=\"var\">expander</var> as an optimization function.  When encountering "
"a call to the function, of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>&hellip;)</code>, "
"the macro expander will call <var class=\"var\">expander</var> with that "
"form as well as with <var class=\"var\">args</var>&hellip;, and <var "
"class=\"var\">expander</var> can either return a new expression to use "
"instead of the function call, or it can return just the form unchanged, to "
"indicate that the function call should be left alone."
msgstr ""
"これは関数に対してのみ使用でき、コンパイラに <var class=\"var\">expander</"
"var> を最適化関数として使用するよう指示します。<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> <var class=\"var\">args</var>&hellip;)</code> と"
"いう形式の関数呼び出しに遭遇すると、マクロ展開器はその形式に加えて <var "
"class=\"var\">expander</var>、<var class=\"var\">args</var>&hellip; を呼び出"
"します。また、<var class=\"var\">expander</var> は、関数呼び出しの代わりに使"
"用する新しい式を返すか、あるいは関数呼び出しをそのままにするよう示すために形"
"式をそのまま返すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">expander</var> is a lambda form it should be written "
"with a single argument (i.e., be of the form <code class=\"code\">(lambda "
"(<var class=\"var\">arg</var>)  <var class=\"var\">body</var>)</code>) "
"because the function&rsquo;s formal arguments are automatically added to the "
"lambda&rsquo;s list of arguments for you."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">expander</var> がラムダ形式である場合は、単一の引数で記述"
"する必要があります（すなわち、<code class=\"code\">(lambda (<var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>)  <var class=\"var\">body</var>)</code> の形式になり"
"ます）。これは、関数の仮引数がラムダの引数リストに自動的に追加されるためで"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(gv-expander <var class=\"var\">expander</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(gv-expander <var class=\"var\">expander</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Declare <var class=\"var\">expander</var> to be the function to handle calls "
"to the macro (or function) as a generalized variable, similarly to <code "
"class=\"code\">gv-define-expander</code>.  <var class=\"var\">expander</var> "
"can be a symbol or it can be of the form <code class=\"code\">(lambda (<var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>) <var class=\"var\">body</var>)</code> in which case "
"that function will additionally have access to the macro (or "
"function)&rsquo;s arguments."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">expander</var> を、<code class=\"code\">gv-define-"
"expander</code> と同様に、マクロ（または関数）への呼び出しを処理する関数とし"
"て一般化変数に宣言します。<var class=\"var\">expander</var> はシンボルである"
"か、あるいは <code class=\"code\">(lambda (<var class=\"var\">arg</var>) "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>)</code> の形式をとることができ、その場合、当該"
"関数はマクロ（または関数）の引数にもアクセスできるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(gv-setter <var class=\"var\">setter</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(gv-setter <var class=\"var\">setter</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Declare <var class=\"var\">setter</var> to be the function to handle calls "
"to the macro (or function) as a generalized variable.  <var "
"class=\"var\">setter</var> can be a symbol in which case it will be passed "
"to <code class=\"code\">gv-define-simple-setter</code>, or it can be of the "
"form <code class=\"code\">(lambda (<var class=\"var\">arg</var>) <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>)</code> in which case that function will "
"additionally have access to the macro (or function)&rsquo;s arguments and it "
"will be passed to <code class=\"code\">gv-define-setter</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">setter</var> を、マクロ（または関数）への呼び出しを処理す"
"る関数として、一般化変数に指定します。<var class=\"var\">setter</var> はシン"
"ボルを指定でき、その場合は <code class=\"code\">gv-define-simple-setter</"
"code> に渡されます。あるいは、<code class=\"code\">(lambda (<var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>) <var class=\"var\">body</var>)</code> の形式を指定す"
"ることもでき、その場合は当該関数がマクロ（または関数）の引数にもアクセスで"
"き、さらに <code class=\"code\">gv-define-setter</code> に渡されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(completion <var class=\"var\">completion-predicate</"
"var>)</code>"
