"<code class=\"code\">(completion <var class=\"var\">completion-predicate</"
"var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Declare <var class=\"var\">completion-predicate</var> as a function to "
"determine whether to include a function&rsquo;s symbol in the list of "
"functions when asking for completions in <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>.  This "
"predicate function will only be called when <code class=\"code\">read-"
"extended-command-predicate</code> is customized to <code "
"class=\"code\">command-completion-default-include-p</code>; by default the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">read-extended-command-predicate</code> is nil "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">execute-extended-"
"command</a>).  The predicate <var class=\"var\">completion-predicate</var> "
"is called with two arguments: the function&rsquo;s symbol and the current "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">completion-predicate</var> を関数として宣言し、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> で補完を求める際に、関数のシンボルを関数リストに含め"
"るかどうかを判定します。この述語関数は、<code class=\"code\">read-extended-"
"command-predicate</code> が <code class=\"code\">command-completion-default-"
"include-p</code> にカスタマイズされている場合にのみ呼び出されます。デフォルト"
"では <code class=\"code\">read-extended-command-predicate</code> の値は nil "
"です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">execute-extended-"
"command</a> を参照）。述語 <var class=\"var\">completion-predicate</var> は、"
"関数のシンボルと現在のバッファという2つの引数で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
