"href=\"Standard-Properties.html\">標準シンボルプロパティ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(side-effect-free <var class=\"var\">val</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(side-effect-free <var class=\"var\">val</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">val</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function is free of side effects, so the byte compiler can ignore calls "
"whose value is ignored.  This is the same as the <code class=\"code\">side-"
"effect-free</code> property of the function&rsquo;s symbol, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Standard-Properties.html\">Standard Symbol "
"Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">val</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、"
