msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(important-return-value <var class=\"var\">val</var>)</"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">val</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
