"returned value.  This is the same as the <code class=\"code\">important-"
"return-value</code> property of the function&rsquo;s symbol, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Standard-Properties.html\">Standard Symbol "
"Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
