"す。これは、関数のシンボルの <code class=\"code\">important-return-value</"
"code> プロパティと同様です。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Standard-"
"Properties.html\">標準シンボルプロパティ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(speed <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(speed <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Specify the value of <code class=\"code\">native-comp-speed</code> in effect "
"for native compilation of this function (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Native_002dCompilation-Variables.html\">Native-Compilation Variables</"
"a>).  This allows function-level control of the optimization level used for "
"native code emitted for the function.  In particular, if <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> is &minus;1, native compilation of the function will "
"emit bytecode instead of native code for the function."
msgstr ""
"この関数のネイティブコンパイル時に適用される <code class=\"code\">native-"
"comp-speed</code> の値を指定してください（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Native_002dCompilation-Variables.html\">ネイティブコンパイル変数</a>を"
"参照）。これにより、関数向けに生成されるネイティブコードに使用される最適化レ"
"ベルを、関数レベルで制御できます。具体的には、<var class=\"var\">n</var> が "
"&minus;1 の場合、この関数のネイティブコンパイルではネイティブコードではなくバ"
"イトコードが生成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(safety <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(safety <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Specify the value of <code class=\"code\">compilation-safety</code> in "
"effect for this function.  This allows function-level control of the safety "
"level used for the code emitted for the function (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Native_002dCompilation-Variables.html\">Native-Compilation Variables</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数で有効な <code class=\"code\">compilation-safety</code> の値を指定し"
"ます。これにより、関数向けに生成されるコードに使用されるセーフティレベルを、"
"関数レベルで制御できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Native_002dCompilation-"
"Variables.html\">ネイティブコンパイル変数</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inferred-type-of-function\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-function-type-declaration\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(ftype "
"<var class=\"var\">type</var> &amp;optional <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-function-type-"
"declaration\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inferred-type-of-function\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-function-type-declaration\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(ftype "
"<var class=\"var\">type</var> &amp;optional <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-function-type-"
"declaration\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Declare <var class=\"var\">type</var> to be the type of this function.  This "
"type is used by <code class=\"code\">describe-function</code> for "
"documentation, and by the native compiler (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Native-Compilation.html\">Compilation of Lisp to Native Code</a>) for "
"optimizing code generation and inferring types.  Incorrect type declarations "
"may cause crashes in natively compiled code (see below).  Functions with "
"type declarations are shown by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h C-f</kbd> as having a "
"<em class=\"dfn\">declared type</em>, as opposed to an <em "
"class=\"dfn\">inferred type</em> for functions without them."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">type</var> をこの関数の型として宣言します。この型は、"
"<code class=\"code\">describe-function</code> によるドキュメント作成や、ネイ"
"ティブコンパイラ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Native-Compilation.html\">Lispか"
"らネイティブコードへのコンパイル</a>を参照）によるコード生成の最適化および型"
"推論に使用されます。型宣言が不適切だと、ネイティブコンパイルされたコードでク"
"ラッシュが発生する可能性があります（後述）。型宣言がある関数は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h C-f</kbd> によって<em class=\"dfn\">宣言された型</em>を持つ"
"ものとして表示されます。これに対し、型宣言がない関数は<em class=\"dfn\">推論"
"された型</em>を持つものとして表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">type</var> is a <em class=\"dfn\">type specifier</em> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Type-Specifiers.html\">Type Specifiers</a>) "
"of the form <code class=\"code\">(function&nbsp;(<var class=\"var\">arg-1-"
"type</var>&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">arg-n-type</"
"var>)&nbsp;RETURN-TYPE)</code>.  Argument types can be interleaved with "
"<code class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> to reflect the function&rsquo;s calling "
"convention (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-List.html\">Features of "
"Argument Lists</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">type</var> は、<code class=\"code\">(function&nbsp;(<var "
"class=\"var\">arg-1-type</var>&nbsp;&hellip;&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">arg-n-"
"type</var>)&nbsp;RETURN-TYPE)</code> 形式の<em class=\"dfn\">型指定子</em>"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Type-Specifiers.html\">型指定子</a>を参照）です。"
"引数の型は、関数の呼び出し規約を反映させるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code> や <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> "
"と混在させることができます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-List.html\">引"
"数リストの特徴</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> if present should be the name of function "
"being defined."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> 存在する場合は、定義される関数名とする必要"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s an example of using <code class=\"code\">ftype</code> inside "
"<code class=\"code\">declare</code> to define a function <code "
"class=\"code\">positive-p</code>, which takes an argument of type <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> and returns a <var class=\"var\">boolean</var>:"
msgstr ""
"以下は、<code class=\"code\">declare</code> 内で <code class=\"code\">ftype</"
"code> を使用して、<var class=\"var\">number</var> 型の引数を受け取り <var "
"class=\"var\">boolean</var> を返す関数 <code class=\"code\">positive-p</"
"code> を定義する例です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun positive-p (x)\n"
"  (declare (ftype (function (number) boolean)))\n"
"  (when (&gt; x 0)\n"
"    t))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, this defines a function <code class=\"code\">cons-or-number</"
"code> that takes a first argument of type <var class=\"var\">cons</var> or a "
"<var class=\"var\">number</var>, a second optional argument of type <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, and returns one of the symbols <code "
"class=\"code\">is-cons</code> or <code class=\"code\">is-number</code>:"
msgstr ""
"同様に、これにより第1引数に型 <var class=\"var\">cons</var> または <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> を、第2引数に型 <var class=\"var\">string</var> の"
"省略可能な引数を取り、シンボル <code class=\"code\">is-cons</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">is-number</code> のいずれかを返す関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">cons-or-number</code> が定義されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun cons-or-number (x &amp;optional err-msg)\n"
"  (declare (ftype (function ((or cons number) &amp;optional string)\n"
"\t\t\t    (member is-cons is-number))))\n"
"  (if (consp x)\n"
"      'is-cons\n"
"    (if (numberp x)\n"
"\t'is-number\n"
"      (error (or err-msg &quot;Unexpected input&quot;)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"For description of additional types, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Lisp-Data-"
"Types.html\">Lisp Data Types</a>)."
msgstr ""
"その他の型の説明については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Lisp-Data-"
"Types.html\">Lispのデータ型</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Declare-Form.html
msgid ""
"Declaring a function with an incorrect type causes undefined behavior.  If "
"such a function is natively compiled with <code class=\"code\">compilation-"
"safety</code> set to zero (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Native_002dCompilation-"
"Variables.html#compilation_002dsafety\">compilation-safety</a>), this may "
"result in incorrect execution or even Emacs crashing when the compiled code "
"is loaded.  Redefining or advising a type-declared function must preserve "
"the original signature to avoid these issues."
msgstr ""
"誤った型で関数を宣言すると、未定義動作が発生します。このような関数を <code "
"class=\"code\">compilation-safety</code> を 0 に設定してネイティブコンパイル"
"した場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Native_002dCompilation-"
"Variables.html#compilation_002dsafety\">コンパイルの安全性</a> を参照）、実行"
"結果が不正になったり、コンパイル済みコードをロードした際に Emacs がクラッシュ"
"したりすることがあります。型宣言された関数を再定義またはアドバイズする際は、"
"これらの問題を回避するため、元のシグネチャを維持する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
