#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.24 Dealing With Compressed Data<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Dealing-With-Compressed-Data\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.24 圧縮データの取り扱い<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Dealing-"
"With-Compressed-Data\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">auto-compression-mode</code> is enabled, Emacs "
"automatically uncompresses compressed files when you visit them, and "
"automatically recompresses them if you alter and save them.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Compressed-Files.html#Compressed-Files\">Compressed Files</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">auto-compression-mode</code> が有効になっている場合、"
"Emacs は圧縮ファイルにアクセスした際に自動的に展開し、ファイルを変更して保存"
"した際には自動的に再圧縮します。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Compressed-Files.html#Compressed-Files\">Compressed "
"Files</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"The above feature works by calling an external executable (e.g., <code "
"class=\"command\">gzip</code>).  Emacs can also be compiled with support for "
"built-in decompression using the zlib library, which is faster than calling "
"an external program."
msgstr ""
"上記の機能は、外部実行ファイル（例：<code class=\"command\">gzip</code>）を呼"
"び出すことで動作します。また、外部プログラムを呼び出すよりも高速な、zlibライ"
"ブラリを用いた組み込み解凍機能をサポートしてEmacsをコンパイルすることも可能で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">zlib-available-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"zlib_002davailable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">zlib-available-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"zlib_002davailable_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if built-in zlib "
"decompression is available."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、組み込みのzlib解凍機能が利用可能な場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">zlib-decompress-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end &amp;optional allow-partial</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-zlib_002ddecompress_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">zlib-decompress-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end &amp;optional allow-partial</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-zlib_002ddecompress_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Decompression.html
msgid ""
"This function decompresses the region between <var class=\"var\">start</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">end</var>, using built-in zlib decompression.  The "
"region should contain data that were compressed with gzip or zlib.  On "
"success, the function replaces the contents of the region with the "
"decompressed data.  If <var class=\"var\">allow-partial</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or omitted, then on failure, the function leaves "
"the region unchanged and returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"Otherwise, it returns the number of bytes that were not decompressed and "
"replaces the region text by whatever data was successfully decompressed.  "
"This function can be called only in unibyte buffers."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、組み込みの zlib 解凍機能を用いて、<var class=\"var\">start</var> "
"から <var class=\"var\">end</var> までの領域を解凍します。この領域には、gzip "
"または zlib で圧縮されたデータが含まれている必要があります。成功した場合、関"
"数はこの領域の内容を解凍後のデータで置き換えます。<var class=\"var\">allow-"
"partial</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、あるいは省略されて"
"いる場合、失敗時に関数はこの領域をそのまま保持し、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。それ以外の場合は、解凍されなかったバイト数を返し、領域のテ"
"キストを正常に解凍されたデータで置き換えます。この関数はユニバイトバッファ内"
"でのみ呼び出すことができます。"

