# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.17 Dedicated Windows<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Dedicated-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.17 専用 Windows<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Dedicated-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dedicated-window\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dedicated-window\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Functions for displaying a buffer can be told to not use specific windows by "
"marking these windows as <em class=\"dfn\">dedicated</em> to their buffers.  "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>) "
"never uses a dedicated window for displaying another buffer in it.  <code "
"class=\"code\">get-lru-window</code> and <code class=\"code\">get-largest-"
"window</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-"
"Ordering.html\">Cyclic Ordering of Windows</a>) do not consider dedicated "
"windows as candidates when their <var class=\"var\">dedicated</var> argument "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The behavior of <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">Buffers and Windows</a>) with respect to "
"dedicated windows is slightly different, see below."
msgstr ""
"バッファを表示する関数は、特定のウィンドウをそのバッファの<em class=\"dfn\">"
"専用</em>としてマークすることで、そのウィンドウを使用しないように指定できま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用のウィンドウの選択</a>を参照）"
"は、別のバッファを表示するために専用ウィンドウを使用することはありません。"
"<code class=\"code\">get-lru-window</code>および<code class=\"code\">get-"
"largest-window</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-"
"Ordering.html\">ウィンドウの循環順序</a>を参照）は、<var "
"class=\"var\">dedicated</var>引数がnon-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である"
"場合、専用ウィンドウを候補として考慮しません。専用ウィンドウに関する<code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-"
"and-Windows.html\">バッファとウィンドウ</a>を参照）の動作はわずかに異なりま"
"す。詳細は以下を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Functions supposed to remove a buffer from a window or a window from a frame "
"can behave specially when a window they operate on is dedicated.  We will "
"distinguish four basic cases, namely where (1) the window is not the only "
"window on its frame, (2) the window is the only window on its frame but "
"there are other frames on the same terminal left, (3)  the window is the "
"only window on the only frame on the same terminal, and (4) the "
"dedication&rsquo;s value is <code class=\"code\">side</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Displaying-Buffers-in-Side-Windows.html\">Displaying "
"Buffers in Side Windows</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウからバッファを、あるいはフレームからウィンドウを削除する関数は、操"
"作対象のウィンドウが専用である場合に特殊な挙動を示すことがあります。ここで"
"は、(1) ウィンドウがフレーム上の唯一のウィンドウではない、(2) ウィンドウがフ"
"レーム上の唯一のウィンドウであるが、同一端末上に他のフレームが残っている、"
"(3) ウィンドウが同一端末上の唯一のフレームにおける唯一のウィンドウである、"
"(4) 専用化の値が <code class=\"code\">side</code> である、という4つの基本ケー"
"スを区別します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Displaying-Buffers-in-Side-"
"Windows.html\">サイドウィンドウでのバッファ表示</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"In particular, <code class=\"code\">delete-windows-on</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-Windows.html\">Deleting Windows</a>)  "
"handles case (2) by deleting the associated frame and cases (3) and (4)  by "
"showing another buffer in that frame&rsquo;s only window.  The function "
"<code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">Buffers and Windows</a>) "
"which is called when a buffer gets killed, deletes the window in case (1) "
"and behaves like <code class=\"code\">delete-windows-on</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"具体的には、<code class=\"code\">delete-windows-on</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-Windows.html\">ウィンドウの削除</a>を参照）"
"は、関連するフレームを削除することでケース(2)を処理し、そのフレームの唯一の"
"ウィンドウに別のバッファを表示することでケース(3)および(4)を処理します。バッ"
"ファが破棄された際に呼び出される関数<code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-"
"windows</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">バッファ"
"とウィンドウ</a>を参照）は、ケース(1)ではウィンドウを削除し、それ以外の場合は"
"<code class=\"code\">delete-windows-on</code>と同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">bury-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer List</a>) operates on the selected "
"window (which shows the buffer that shall be buried), it handles case (2) by "
"calling <code class=\"code\">frame-auto-hide-function</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quitting-Windows.html\">Quitting Windows</a>) to deal "
"with the selected frame.  The other two cases are handled as with <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">bury-buffer</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"List.html\">バッファリスト</a>を参照）が選択中のウィンドウ（非表示にするバッ"
"ファが表示されているウィンドウ）に対して動作する場合、ケース(2)では<code "
"class=\"code\">frame-auto-hide-function</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quitting-Windows.html\">ウィンドウの終了</a>を参照）を呼び出して選択中"
"のフレームを処理します。その他の2つのケースは、<code class=\"code\">replace-"
"buffer-in-windows</code>と同様に処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-dedicated-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002ddedicated_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-dedicated-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002ddedicated_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is dedicated to its buffer and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  More precisely, the return value is "
"the value assigned by the last call of <code class=\"code\">set-window-"
"dedicated-p</code> for <var class=\"var\">window</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if that function was never called with <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> as its argument.  The default for <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is the selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> がそのバッファ専用である場合は "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、そうでない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。より正確には、戻り値は、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> に対する <code class=\"code\">set-window-"
"dedicated-p</code> の最後の呼び出しで代入された値、あるいは <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> を引数としてその関数が一度も呼び出されなかった場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。<var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> のデフォルト値は、選択中のウィンドウです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Dedicated-Windows.html
msgid ""
