"ム）の入出力に使用するコーディングシステムを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Default-Coding-Systems.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a cons cell of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">input-coding</var> . <var class=\"var\">output-coding</var>)</"
"code>.  Here <var class=\"var\">input-coding</var> applies to input from the "
"subprocess, and <var class=\"var\">output-coding</var> applies to output to "
