# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to delay the evaluation of an expression, for example "
"if you want to avoid performing a time-consuming calculation if it turns out "
"that the result is not needed in the future of the program.  The <samp "
"class=\"file\">thunk</samp> library provides the following functions and "
"macros to support such <em class=\"dfn\">deferred evaluation</em>:"
msgstr ""
"式の評価を遅延させることが有用な場合があります。例えば、プログラムの後続処理"
"で結果が不要であることが判明した場合に、時間のかかる計算の実行を避けたい場合"
"などが挙げられます。<samp class=\"file\">thunk</samp> ライブラリでは、このよ"
"うな<em class=\"dfn\">遅延評価</em>をサポートするために、以下の関数とマクロを"
"提供しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-thunk\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-thunk\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-delay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">forms&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-thunk_002ddelay\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-delay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">forms&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-thunk_002ddelay\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"Return a <em class=\"dfn\">thunk</em> for evaluating the <var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var>.  A thunk is a closure (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Closures.html\">Closures</a>) that inherits the lexical environment "
"of the <code class=\"code\">thunk-delay</code> call.  Using this macro "
"requires <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">forms</var> を評価するための <em class=\"dfn\">サンク</"
"em> を返します。サンクとは、<code class=\"code\">thunk-delay</code> の呼び出"
"しのレキシカル環境を継承するクロージャ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Closures.html\">クロージャ</a> を参照）のことです。このマクロを使用す"
"るには <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code> が必要です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-force</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">thunk</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-thunk_002dforce\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-force</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">thunk</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-thunk_002dforce\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"Force <var class=\"var\">thunk</var> to perform the evaluation of the forms "
"specified in the <code class=\"code\">thunk-delay</code> that created the "
"thunk.  The result of the evaluation of the last form is returned.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">thunk</var> also &ldquo;remembers&rdquo; that it has been "
"forced: Any further calls of <code class=\"code\">thunk-force</code> with "
"the same <var class=\"var\">thunk</var> will just return the same result "
"without evaluating the forms again."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">thunk</var> を強制し、thunk を生成した <code "
"class=\"code\">thunk-delay</code> で指定されたフォームの評価を行わせます。最"
"後のフォームの評価結果が返されます。また、<var class=\"var\">thunk</var> は自"
"身が強制されたことを「記憶」しており、同じ <var class=\"var\">thunk</var> を"
"用いて <code class=\"code\">thunk-force</code> をさらに呼び出しても、フォーム"
"を再評価することなく同じ結果が返されるだけとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-let</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">(bindings&hellip;) forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-thunk_002dlet\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-let</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">(bindings&hellip;) forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-thunk_002dlet\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"This macro is analogous to <code class=\"code\">let</code> but creates "
"&ldquo;lazy&rdquo; variable bindings.  Any binding has the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">value-form</var>)</code>.  Unlike <code class=\"code\">let</"
"code>, the evaluation of any <var class=\"var\">value-form</var> is deferred "
"until the binding of the according <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is used "
"for the first time when evaluating the <var class=\"var\">forms</var>.  Any "
"<var class=\"var\">value-form</var> is evaluated at most once.  Using this "
"macro requires <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは <code class=\"code\">let</code> と同様ですが、「遅延」変数バイン"
"ディングを生成します。任意のバインディングは <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">value-form</var>)</code> "
"という形式をとります。<code class=\"code\">let</code> とは異なり、任意の "
"<var class=\"var\">value-form</var> の評価は、<var class=\"var\">forms</var> "
"の評価時に対応する <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> のバインディングが初めて使"
"用されるまで延期されます。任意の <var class=\"var\">value-form</var> は最大で"
"1回のみ評価されます。このマクロを使用するには <code class=\"code\">lexical-"
"binding</code> が必要です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html build/html/elisp/Multiple-Languages.html
#: build/html/elisp/Retrieving-Nodes.html
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun f (number)\n"
"  (thunk-let ((derived-number\n"
"              (progn (message &quot;Calculating 1 plus 2 times %d&quot; number)\n"
"                     (1+ (* 2 number)))))\n"
"    (if (&gt; number 10)\n"
"        derived-number\n"
"      number)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(f 5)\n"
"&rArr; 5\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(f 12)\n"
"&#8867; Calculating 1 plus 2 times 12\n"
"&rArr; 25\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"Because of the special nature of lazily bound variables, it is an error to "
"set them (e.g. with <code class=\"code\">setq</code>)."
msgstr ""
"lazily bound 変数はその特殊な性質から、これらに値を代入すること（例：<code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code>）はエラーとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-let*</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">(bindings&hellip;) forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-thunk_002dlet_002a\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thunk-let*</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">(bindings&hellip;) forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-thunk_002dlet_002a\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">thunk-let</code> but any expression in "
"<var class=\"var\">bindings</var> is allowed to refer to preceding bindings "
"in this <code class=\"code\">thunk-let*</code> form.  Using this macro "
"requires <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">thunk-let</code> と同様ですが、<var "
"class=\"var\">bindings</var> 内の任意の式は、この <code class=\"code\">thunk-"
"let*</code> 形式における先行する束縛を参照できます。このマクロを使用するには "
"<code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code> が必要です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(thunk-let* ((x (prog2 (message &quot;Calculating x...&quot;)\n"
"                    (+ 1 1)\n"
"                  (message &quot;Finished calculating x&quot;)))\n"
"             (y (prog2 (message &quot;Calculating y...&quot;)\n"
"                    (+ x 1)\n"
"                  (message &quot;Finished calculating y&quot;)))\n"
"             (z (prog2 (message &quot;Calculating z...&quot;)\n"
"                    (+ y 1)\n"
"                  (message &quot;Finished calculating z&quot;)))\n"
"             (a (prog2 (message &quot;Calculating a...&quot;)\n"
"                    (+ z 1)\n"
"                  (message &quot;Finished calculating a&quot;))))\n"
"  (* z x))\n"
"\n"
"&#8867; Calculating z...\n"
"&#8867; Calculating y...\n"
"&#8867; Calculating x...\n"
"&#8867; Finished calculating x\n"
"&#8867; Finished calculating y\n"
"&#8867; Finished calculating z\n"
"&rArr; 8\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deferred-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">thunk-let</code> and <code class=\"code\">thunk-let*</"
"code> use thunks implicitly: their expansion creates helper symbols and "
"binds them to thunks wrapping the binding expressions.  All references to "
"the original variables in the body <var class=\"var\">forms</var> are then "
"replaced by an expression that calls <code class=\"code\">thunk-force</code> "
"with the according helper variable as the argument.  So, any code using "
"<code class=\"code\">thunk-let</code> or <code class=\"code\">thunk-let*</"
"code> could be rewritten to use thunks, but in many cases using these macros "
"results in nicer code than using thunks explicitly."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">thunk-let</code> と <code class=\"code\">thunk-let*</"
"code> は暗黙的にサンクを使用します。これらの展開によってヘルパーシンボルが生"
"成され、それらが束縛式をラップするサンクにバインドされます。その後、本体 "
"<var class=\"var\">forms</var> 内の元の変数へのすべての参照が、対応するヘル"
"パー変数を引数として <code class=\"code\">thunk-force</code> を呼び出す式に置"
"き換えられます。したがって、<code class=\"code\">thunk-let</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">thunk-let*</code> を使用するコードはすべてサンクを使うように書"
"き換えることが可能ですが、多くの場合、これらのマクロを使用した方が、サンクを"
"明示的に使用するよりも洗練されたコードになります。"

