"link\" href=\"#index-define_002dabbrev\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"This function defines an abbrev named <var class=\"var\">name</var>, in <var "
"class=\"var\">abbrev-table</var>, to expand to <var class=\"var\">expansion</"
"var> and call <var class=\"var\">hook</var>, with properties <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abbrev-"
"Properties.html\">Abbrev Properties</a>).  The return value is <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>.  The <code class=\"code\">:system</code> property "
"in <var class=\"var\">props</var> is treated specially here: if it has the "
"value <code class=\"code\">force</code>, then it will overwrite an existing "
"definition even for a non-system abbrev of the same name."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">abbrev-table</var> 内に <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> という名前の略語を定義します。この略語は <var "
"class=\"var\">expansion</var> に展開され、プロパティ <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var> を持つ <var class=\"var\">hook</var> を呼び出します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abbrev-Properties.html\">略語のプロパティ</a> を"
"参照）。戻り値は <var class=\"var\">name</var> です。<var "
"class=\"var\">props</var> 内の <code class=\"code\">:system</code> プロパティ"
"はここで特別に扱われます。もしこのプロパティの値が <code "
"class=\"code\">force</code> である場合、同名の非システム略語であっても、既存"
"の定義を上書きします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> should be a string.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">expansion</var> is normally the desired expansion (a string), "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to undefine the abbrev.  If it is "
"anything but a string or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the "
"abbreviation expands solely by running <var class=\"var\">hook</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> は文字列である必要があります。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">expansion</var> は通常、意図する展開内容（文字列）であり、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は略語を未定義にします。文字列または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、その略語は <var class=\"var\">hook</"
"var> を実行することによってのみ展開されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">hook</var> is a function or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">hook</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then it is called with no arguments after the "
"abbrev is replaced with <var class=\"var\">expansion</var>; point is located "
"at the end of <var class=\"var\">expansion</var> when <var "
"class=\"var\">hook</var> is called."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">hook</var> は関数または <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> です。<var class=\"var\">hook</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でない場合、略記が <var class=\"var\">expansion</var> に置き換えられた後、引"
"数なしで呼び出されます。<var class=\"var\">hook</var> が呼び出される際、ポイ"
"ンタは <var class=\"var\">expansion</var> の末尾に位置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-no_002dself_002dinsert-property\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-no_002dself_002dinsert-property\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">hook</var> is a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"symbol whose <code class=\"code\">no-self-insert</code> property is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var class=\"var\">hook</var> can "
"explicitly control whether to insert the self-inserting input character that "
"triggered the expansion.  If <var class=\"var\">hook</var> returns non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> in this case, that inhibits insertion of the "
"character.  By contrast, if <var class=\"var\">hook</var> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> (or "
"<code class=\"code\">abbrev-insert</code>)  also returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, as if expansion had not really occurred."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">hook</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の記号で"
"あり、その <code class=\"code\">no-self-insert</code> プロパティが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<var class=\"var\">hook</var> に"
"よって、展開をトリガーした自己挿入入力文字を挿入するかどうかを明示的に制御で"
"きます。この場合に <var class=\"var\">hook</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を返すと、その文字の挿入が抑制されます。対照的"
"に、<var class=\"var\">hook</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返し、"
"<code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code>（または <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-insert</code>）も <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返"
"す場合は、あたかも実際に展開が行われなかったかのようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <code class=\"code\">define-abbrev</code> sets the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrevs-changed</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, if "
"it actually changes the abbrev.  This is so that some commands will offer to "
"save the abbrevs.  It does not do this for a system abbrev, since those "
"aren&rsquo;t saved anyway."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">define-abbrev</code> は実際に略語を変更する場合、"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">abbrevs-changed</code> に <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> を設定します。これは、一部のコマンドが略語の保存を提案できるようにする"
"ためです。システム略語については、そもそも保存されないため、この処理は行われ"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">only-global-abbrevs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"only_002dglobal_002dabbrevs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">only-global-abbrevs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-only_002dglobal_002dabbrevs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it means that the "
"user plans to use global abbrevs only.  This tells the commands that define "
"mode-specific abbrevs to define global ones instead.  This variable does not "
"alter the behavior of the functions in this section; it is examined by their "
"callers."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、ユーザーはグローバル略"
"語のみを使用する意向であることを意味します。これにより、モード固有の略語を定"
"義するコマンドは、代わりにグローバル略語を定義するようになります。この変数は"
"本セクションの関数の動作を変更するものではなく、呼び出し元によって参照されま"
"す。"

