"<span>42.12.2 フェイスの定義<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Defining-"
"Faces-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-faces\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-spec\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-faces\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-spec\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"The usual way to define a face is through the <code class=\"code\">defface</"
"code> macro.  This macro associates a face name (a symbol) with a default "
"<em class=\"dfn\">face spec</em>.  A face spec is a construct which "
"specifies what attributes a face should have on any given terminal; for "
"example, a face spec might specify one foreground color on high-color "
"terminals, and a different foreground color on low-color terminals."
msgstr ""
"フェイスを定義する一般的な方法は、<code class=\"code\">defface</code> マクロ"
"を用いることです。このマクロは、フェイス名（シンボル）をデフォルトの <em "
"class=\"dfn\">フェイススペック</em> に関連付けます。フェイススペックとは、任"
"意の端末においてフェイスが持つべき属性を指定する構成要素です。例えば、フェイ"
"ススペックによって、高色端末ではある前景色を、低色端末では別の前景色を指定す"
"るといったことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"People are sometimes tempted to create a variable whose value is a face "
"name.  In the vast majority of cases, this is not necessary; the usual "
"procedure is to define a face with <code class=\"code\">defface</code>, and "
"then use its name directly."
msgstr ""
"人名を値とする変数を作成したくなることがあります。しかし、ほとんどの場合、そ"
"の必要はありません。通常の手順は、<code class=\"code\">defface</code> でフェ"
"イスを定義し、その名前を直接使用することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-_0028non_002dremovability-"
"of_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-_0028non_002dremovability-"
"of_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"Note that once you have defined a face (usually with <code "
"class=\"code\">defface</code>), you cannot later undefine this face safely, "
"except by restarting Emacs."
msgstr ""
"なお、一度フェイスを定義すると（通常は <code class=\"code\">defface</code> を"
"用いて）、Emacs を再起動しない限り、後から安全にそのフェイスを解除することは"
"できない点に注意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defface</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">face spec doc "
"[keyword value]&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defface\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defface</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">face spec doc "
"[keyword value]&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defface\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This macro declares <var class=\"var\">face</var> as a named face whose "
"default face spec is given by <var class=\"var\">spec</var>.  You should not "
"quote the symbol <var class=\"var\">face</var>, and it should not end in "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-face</samp>&rsquo; (that would be redundant).  "
"The argument <var class=\"var\">doc</var> is a documentation string for the "
"face.  The additional <var class=\"var\">keyword</var> arguments have the "
"same meanings as in <code class=\"code\">defgroup</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">defcustom</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Common-"
"Keywords.html\">Common Item Keywords</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">face</var> を、デフォルトのフェイス仕様が "
"<var class=\"var\">spec</var> で指定される名前付きフェイスとして宣言します。"
"シンボル <var class=\"var\">face</var> をクォートしてはならず、また &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-face</samp>&rsquo; で終わるべきではありません（それは冗"
"長になります）。引数 <var class=\"var\">doc</var> は、そのフェイスのドキュメ"
"ント文字列です。追加の引数 <var class=\"var\">keyword</var> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">defgroup</code> および <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> "
"と同様の意味を持ちます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Common-Keywords.html\">共通"
"項目キーワード</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">face</var> already has a default face spec, this macro "
"does nothing."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">face</var> に既にデフォルトのフェイス仕様が設定されている"
"場合、このマクロは何もしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"The default face spec determines <var class=\"var\">face</var>&rsquo;s "
"appearance when no customizations are in effect (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Customization.html\">Customization Settings</a>).  If <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> has already been customized (via Custom themes or "
"via customizations read from the init file), its appearance is determined by "
"the custom face spec(s), which override the default face spec <var "
"class=\"var\">spec</var>.  However, if the customizations are subsequently "
"removed, the appearance of <var class=\"var\">face</var> will again be "
"determined by its default face spec."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトのフェイス仕様は、カスタマイズが適用されていない場合の <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> の外観を決定します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Customization.html\">カスタマイズ設定</a> を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> がすでにカスタマイズされている場合（カスタムテーマ経"
"由、または init ファイルから読み込まれたカスタマイズ経由）、その外観はカスタ"
"ムフェイス仕様によって決定され、デフォルトのフェイス仕様 <var "
"class=\"var\">spec</var> よりも優先されます。ただし、その後カスタマイズが削除"
"されると、<var class=\"var\">face</var> の外観は再びデフォルトのフェイス仕様"
"によって決定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval_002ddefun_002c-and-defface-"
"forms\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"eval_002dlast_002dsexp_002c-and-defface-forms\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval_002ddefun_002c-and-defface-"
