#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"An integer that represents the minimum number of colors the terminal should "
"support.  This matches a terminal if its <code class=\"code\">display-color-"
"cells</code> value is at least the specified integer."
msgstr ""
"ターミナルがサポートすべき最小の色数を表す整数。<code class=\"code\">display-"
