"ストが具体的にどのように行われるかについての詳細は、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Display-Feature-Testing.html#Display-Face-Attribute-Testing\">顔属性の"
"表示テスト</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Faces.html
msgid ""
"If an element of <var class=\"var\">display</var> specifies more than one "
"<var class=\"var\">value</var> for a given <var "
"class=\"var\">characteristic</var>, any of those values is acceptable.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">display</var> has more than one element, each element "
"should specify a different <var class=\"var\">characteristic</var>; then <em "
"class=\"emph\">each</em> characteristic of the terminal must match one of "
"the <var class=\"var\">value</var>s specified for it in <var "
"class=\"var\">display</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">display</var> の要素が、特定の <var "
"class=\"var\">characteristic</var> に対して複数の <var class=\"var\">value</"
