msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-a-function\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Functions.html
msgid ""
"We usually give a name to a function when it is first created.  This is "
"called <em class=\"dfn\">defining a function</em>, and we usually do it with "
"the <code class=\"code\">defun</code> macro.  This section also describes "
"other ways to define a function."
msgstr ""
"通常、関数を最初に作成する際に名前を付けます。これを<em class=\"dfn\">関数の"
"定義</em>と呼び、一般的には<code class=\"code\">defun</code>マクロを用いて行"
"います。本節では、関数を定義するその他の方法についても説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defun</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args [doc] "
"[declare] [interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-defun\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defun</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args [doc] "
"[declare] [interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-defun\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">defun</code> is the usual way to define new Lisp "
"functions.  It defines the symbol <var class=\"var\">name</var> as a "
"function with argument list <var class=\"var\">args</var> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-List.html\">Features of Argument Lists</a>) "
"and body forms given by <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  Neither <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> nor <var class=\"var\">args</var> should be quoted."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">defun</code> は、Lisp の新しい関数を定義する際の一般的な"
"方法です。これにより、シンボル <var class=\"var\">name</var> が、引数リスト "
"<var class=\"var\">args</var>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-"
"List.html\">引数リストの特徴</a> を参照）と、<var class=\"var\">body</var> で"
"与えられるボディ形式を持つ関数として定義されます。<var class=\"var\">name</"
"var> と <var class=\"var\">args</var> のいずれもクォートしてはいけません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">doc</var>, if present, should be a string specifying the "
"function&rsquo;s documentation string (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Function-Documentation.html\">Documentation Strings of Functions</"
"a>).  <var class=\"var\">declare</var>, if present, should be a <code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> form specifying function metadata (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\">The <code class=\"code\">declare</"
"code> Form</a>).  <var class=\"var\">interactive</var>, if present, should "
"be an <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> form specifying how the "
"function is to be called interactively (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">doc</var>（存在する場合）は、関数のドキュメント文字列を指"
"定する文字列である必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Function-"
"Documentation.html\">関数のドキュメント文字列</a>を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">declare</var>（存在する場合）は、関数のメタデータを指定する"
"<code class=\"code\">declare</code>形式である必要があります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\"><code class=\"code\">declare</"
"code>形式</a>を参照）。<var class=\"var\">interactive</var>（存在する場合）"
"は、関数を対話的に呼び出す方法を指定する<code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code>形式である必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-"
"Call.html\">対話的呼び出し</a>を参照）。"

