# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"The functions <code class=\"code\">create-image</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">defimage</code> and <code class=\"code\">find-image</code> "
"provide convenient ways to create image descriptors."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">create-image</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">defimage</code>、<code class=\"code\">find-image</code> は、画"
"像記述子を手軽に作成するための手段を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">create-image</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">file-or-data "
"&amp;optional type data-p &amp;rest props</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-create_002dimage\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">create-image</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">file-or-data "
"&amp;optional type data-p &amp;rest props</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-create_002dimage\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns an image descriptor which uses the data in "
"<var class=\"var\">file-or-data</var>.  <var class=\"var\">file-or-data</"
"var> can be a file name or a string containing the image data; <var "
"class=\"var\">data-p</var> should be <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for the "
"former case, non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> for the latter case.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">file-or-data</var> is a relative file name, the function "
"will search for it in directories mentioned in <code class=\"code\">image-"
"load-path</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">file-or-data</var> のデータを使用する画像記述"
"子を作成して返します。<var class=\"var\">file-or-data</var> にはファイル名ま"
"たは画像データを含む文字列を指定でき、<var class=\"var\">data-p</var> は前者"
"の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>、後者の場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外とする必要があります。<var class=\"var\">file-"
"or-data</var> が相対ファイル名である場合、関数は <code class=\"code\">image-"
"load-path</code> で指定されたディレクトリ内からそれを検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">type</var> is a symbol specifying "
"the image type.  If <var class=\"var\">type</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">create-image</code> tries to "
"determine the image type from the file&rsquo;s first few bytes, or else from "
"the file&rsquo;s name."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">type</var> は、画像タイプを指定するシンボル"
"です。<var class=\"var\">type</var> が省略されているか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>、<code class=\"code\">create-image</code> の場合"
"は、ファイルの先頭数バイト、またはファイル名から画像タイプを判定しようとしま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"The remaining arguments, <var class=\"var\">props</var>, specify additional "
"image properties&mdash;for example,"
msgstr ""
"残りの引数 <var class=\"var\">props</var> では、追加の画像プロパティを指定し"
"ます&mdash;例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(create-image &quot;foo.xpm&quot; 'xpm nil :mask 'heuristic)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Image-Descriptors.html\">Image Descriptors</a>, "
"for the list of supported properties.  Some properties are specific to "
"certain image types, and are described in subsections specific to those "
"types."
msgstr ""
"サポートされているプロパティの一覧については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Image-"
"Descriptors.html\">画像記述子</a>を参照してください。一部のプロパティは特定の"
"画像タイプに固有のものであり、それらのタイプ専用のサブセクションで説明されて"
"います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"The function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if images of this type "
"are not supported.  Otherwise it returns an image descriptor."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、この種類の画像がサポートされていない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。それ以外の場合は、画像記述子を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defimage</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol specs "
"&amp;optional doc</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-defimage\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defimage</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol specs "
"&amp;optional doc</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-defimage\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"This macro defines <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> as an image name.  The "
"arguments <var class=\"var\">specs</var> is a list which specifies how to "
"display the image.  The third argument, <var class=\"var\">doc</var>, is an "
"optional documentation string."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> を画像名として定義します。引数 "
"<var class=\"var\">specs</var> は、画像の表示方法を指定するリストです。第3引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">doc</var> は、任意のドキュメント文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"Each argument in <var class=\"var\">specs</var> has the form of a property "
"list, and each one should specify at least the <code class=\"code\">:type</"
"code> property and either the <code class=\"code\">:file</code> or the <code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code> property.  The value of <code "
"class=\"code\">:type</code> should be a symbol specifying the image type, "
"the value of <code class=\"code\">:file</code> is the file to load the image "
"from, and the value of <code class=\"code\">:data</code> is a string "
"containing the actual image data.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">specs</var> 内の各引数はプロパティリストの形式をとり、それ"
"ぞれ少なくとも <code class=\"code\">:type</code> プロパティと、<code "
"class=\"code\">:file</code> または <code class=\"code\">:data</code> のいずれ"
"かのプロパティを指定する必要があります。<code class=\"code\">:type</code> の"
"値は画像タイプを指定するシンボル、<code class=\"code\">:file</code> の値は画"
"像を読み込むファイル、<code class=\"code\">:data</code> の値は実際の画像デー"
"タを含む文字列である必要があります。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defimage test-image\n"
"  ((:type xpm :file &quot;~/test1.xpm&quot;)\n"
"   (:type xbm :file &quot;~/test1.xbm&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">defimage</code> tests each argument, one by one, to see "
"if it is usable&mdash;that is, if the type is supported and the file "
"exists.  The first usable argument is used to make an image descriptor which "
"is stored in <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">defimage</code> は各引数を一つずつ検証し、使用可能かどう"
"か（すなわち、型がサポートされており、かつファイルが存在するか）を判定しま"
"す。最初に使用可能と判定された引数を用いてイメージ記述子が作成され、<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> に格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"If none of the alternatives will work, then <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> "
"is defined as <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"いずれの代替案も機能しない場合は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>として定義されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">image-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">image "
"property</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-image_002dproperty\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">image-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">image "
"property</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-image_002dproperty\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"Return the value of <var class=\"var\">property</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">image</var>.  Properties can be set by using <code "
"class=\"code\">setf</code>.  Setting a property to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> will remove the property from the image."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">property</var> の値を <var class=\"var\">image</var> に返"
"します。プロパティは <code class=\"code\">setf</code> を使用して設定できま"
"す。プロパティを <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、画像からそのプ"
"ロパティが削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-image</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">specs</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-find_002dimage\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-image</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">specs</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-find_002dimage\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"This function provides a convenient way to find an image satisfying one of a "
"list of image specifications <var class=\"var\">specs</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、画像仕様のリスト <var class=\"var\">specs</var> のいずれかを満た"
"す画像を手軽に検索する手段を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"Each specification in <var class=\"var\">specs</var> is a property list with "
"contents depending on image type.  All specifications must at least contain "
"the properties <code class=\"code\">:type <var class=\"var\">type</var></"
"code> and either <code class=\"code\">:file&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">file</"
"var></code> or <code class=\"code\">:data&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">data</"
"var></code>, where <var class=\"var\">type</var> is a symbol specifying the "
"image type, e.g., <code class=\"code\">xbm</code>, <var class=\"var\">file</"
"var> is the file to load the image from, and <var class=\"var\">data</var> "
"is a string containing the actual image data.  The first specification in "
"the list whose <var class=\"var\">type</var> is supported, and <var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> exists, is used to construct the image "
"specification to be returned.  If no specification is satisfied, <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> is returned."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">specs</var> 内の各仕様はプロパティリストであり、その内容は"
"画像タイプによって異なります。すべての仕様には、少なくともプロパティ <code "
"class=\"code\">:type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code> と、<code "
"class=\"code\">:file&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">file</var></code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">:data&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">data</var></code> のいずれかが含"
"まれている必要があります。ここで、<var class=\"var\">type</var> は画像タイプ"
"を指定するシンボル（例：<code class=\"code\">xbm</code>）、<var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> は画像を読み込むファイル、<var class=\"var\">data</"
"var> は実際の画像データを含む文字列です。リスト内の仕様のうち、<var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> がサポートされており、かつ <var class=\"var\">file</"
"var> が存在する最初の仕様が、返される画像仕様の構築に使用されます。条件を満た"
"す仕様がない場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid "The image is looked for in <code class=\"code\">image-load-path</code>."
msgstr "画像は <code class=\"code\">image-load-path</code> 内で検索されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">image-load-path</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"image_002dload_002dpath\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">image-load-path</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-image_002dload_002dpath\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"This variable&rsquo;s value is a list of locations in which to search for "
"image files.  If an element is a string or a variable symbol whose value is "
"a string, the string is taken to be the name of a directory to search.  If "
"an element is a variable symbol whose value is a list, that is taken to be a "
"list of directories to search."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、画像ファイルを検索対象とする場所のリストです。要素が文字列で"
"あるか、あるいは値が文字列である変数シンボルである場合、その文字列は検索対象"
"のディレクトリ名とみなされます。要素が値がリストである変数シンボルである場"
"合、それは検索対象のディレクトリリストとみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"The default is to search in the <samp class=\"file\">images</samp> "
"subdirectory of the directory specified by <code class=\"code\">data-"
"directory</code>, then the directory specified by <code class=\"code\">data-"
"directory</code>, and finally in the directories in <code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code>.  Subdirectories are not automatically "
"included in the search, so if you put an image file in a subdirectory, you "
"have to supply the subdirectory explicitly.  For example, to find the image "
"<samp class=\"file\">images/foo/bar.xpm</samp> within <code "
"class=\"code\">data-directory</code>, you should specify the image as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">data-directory</code>で指定されたディレ"
"クトリの<samp class=\"file\">images</samp>サブディレクトリ、次に<code "
"class=\"code\">data-directory</code>で指定されたディレクトリ、そして最後に"
"<code class=\"code\">load-path</code>内のディレクトリが検索対象となります。サ"
"ブディレクトリは自動的に検索対象に含まれないため、画像ファイルをサブディレク"
"トリに配置した場合は、そのサブディレクトリを明示的に指定する必要があります。"
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">data-directory</code>内の画像<samp "
"class=\"file\">images/foo/bar.xpm</samp>を探す場合は、次のように画像を指定し"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(defimage foo-image '((:type xpm :file &quot;foo/bar.xpm&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
