"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"image_002dload_002dpath_002dfor_002dlibrary\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a suitable search path for images used by the Lisp "
"package <var class=\"var\">library</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、Lispパッケージ <var class=\"var\">library</var> で使用される画像"
"に適した検索パスを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"The function searches for <var class=\"var\">image</var> first using <code "
"class=\"code\">image-load-path</code>, excluding <samp class=\"file\"><code "
"class=\"code\">data-directory</code>/images</samp>, and then in <code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code>, followed by a path suitable for <var "
"class=\"var\">library</var>, which includes <samp class=\"file\">../../etc/"
"images</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">../etc/images</samp> relative to the "
"library file itself, and finally in <samp class=\"file\"><code "
"class=\"code\">data-directory</code>/images</samp>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、まず <code class=\"code\">image-load-path</code> を用いて <var "
"class=\"var\">image</var> を検索し（<samp class=\"file\"><code "
"class=\"code\">data-directory</code>/images</samp> は除外）、次に <code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code> で検索し、続いて <var class=\"var\">library</"
"var> に適したパス（ライブラリファイル自体を基準として <samp "
"class=\"file\">../../etc/images</samp> と <samp class=\"file\">../etc/"
"images</samp> を含む）を検索し、最後に <samp class=\"file\"><code "
"class=\"code\">data-directory</code>/images</samp> で検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"Then this function returns a list of directories which contains first the "
"directory in which <var class=\"var\">image</var> was found, followed by the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">load-path</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">path</"
"var> is given, it is used instead of <code class=\"code\">load-path</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">image</var>が見つかったディレクトリを先頭と"
"し、続いて<code class=\"code\">load-path</code>の値を並べたディレクトリの一覧"
"を返します。<var class=\"var\">path</var>が指定されている場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code>の代わりにそれが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">no-error</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"and a suitable path can&rsquo;t be found, don&rsquo;t signal an error.  "
"Instead, return a list of directories as before, except that <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> appears in place of the image directory."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">no-error</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではな"
"く、適切なパスが見つからない場合は、エラーを通知しないでください。代わりに、"
"従来通りディレクトリの一覧を返しますが、イメージディレクトリの代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が表示されるようにしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using <code class=\"code\">image-load-path-for-"
"library</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">image-load-path-for-library</code> の使用例を以下に示し"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar image-load-path) ; shush compiler\n"
"(let* ((load-path (image-load-path-for-library\n"
"                    &quot;mh-e&quot; &quot;mh-logo.xpm&quot;))\n"
"       (image-load-path (cons (car load-path)\n"
"                              image-load-path)))\n"
"  (mh-tool-bar-folder-buttons-init))\n"
