# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-macros\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro_002c-how-to-define\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-macros\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro_002c-how-to-define\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"A Lisp macro object is a list whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is <code "
"class=\"code\">macro</code>, and whose <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> is a "
"function.  Expansion of the macro works by applying the function (with <code "
"class=\"code\">apply</code>) to the list of <em class=\"emph\">unevaluated</"
"em> arguments from the macro call."
msgstr ""
"Lispのマクロオブジェクトとは、<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>が<code "
"class=\"code\">macro</code>であり、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>が関数であ"
"るリストのことです。マクロの展開は、マクロ呼び出し時の<em class=\"emph\">未評"
"価</em>な引数のリストに対して、その関数（<code class=\"code\">apply</code>を"
"引数として）を適用することで行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"It is possible to use an anonymous Lisp macro just like an anonymous "
"function, but this is never done, because it does not make sense to pass an "
"anonymous macro to functionals such as <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>.  "
"In practice, all Lisp macros have names, and they are almost always defined "
"with the <code class=\"code\">defmacro</code> macro."
msgstr ""
"匿名関数と同様に、匿名Lispマクロを使用することも可能ですが、<code "
"class=\"code\">mapcar</code>のような関数に匿名マクロを渡すことは意味をなさな"
"いため、実際にそのようなことは行われません。実務上、すべてのLispマクロには名"
"前が付いており、ほぼ常に<code class=\"code\">defmacro</code>マクロを用いて定"
"義されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defmacro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args [doc] "
"[declare] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defmacro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args [doc] "
"[declare] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">defmacro</code> defines the symbol <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> (which should not be quoted) as a macro that looks "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">defmacro</code> は、シンボル <var class=\"var\">name</"
"var>（引用符で囲まないこと）を、次のような形式のマクロとして定義します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(macro lambda <var class=\"var\">args</var> . <var class=\"var\">body</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"(Note that the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of this list is a lambda "
"expression.)  This macro object is stored in the function cell of <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>.  The meaning of <var class=\"var\">args</var> is "
"the same as in a function, and the keywords <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code> may be used (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-List.html\">Features of Argument Lists</"
"a>).  Neither <var class=\"var\">name</var> nor <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var> should be quoted.  The return value of <code class=\"code\">defmacro</"
"code> is undefined."
msgstr ""
"（なお、このリストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> はラムダ式です。）  この"
"マクロオブジェクトは <var class=\"var\">name</var> の関数セルに格納されま"
"す。  <var class=\"var\">args</var> の意味は関数の場合と同じで、キーワード "
"<code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> と <code class=\"code\">&amp;optional</"
"code> を使用できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-List.html\">引数リス"
"トの特徴</a> を参照）。  <var class=\"var\">name</var> も <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> もクォートしてはいけません。  <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code> の戻り値は未定義です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">doc</var>, if present, should be a string specifying the "
"macro&rsquo;s documentation string.  <var class=\"var\">declare</var>, if "
"present, should be a <code class=\"code\">declare</code> form specifying "
"metadata for the macro (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-"
"Form.html\">The <code class=\"code\">declare</code> Form</a>).  Note that "
"macros cannot have interactive declarations, since they cannot be called "
"interactively."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">doc</var> が存在する場合、マクロのドキュメント文字列を指定"
"する文字列である必要があります。<var class=\"var\">declare</var> が存在する場"
"合、マクロのメタデータを指定する <code class=\"code\">declare</code> 形式であ"
"る必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> 形式</a> を参照）。なお、マクロは対話的に呼び出"
"すことができないため、対話的な宣言を行うことはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
msgid ""
"Macros often need to construct large list structures from a mixture of "
"constants and nonconstant parts.  To make this easier, use the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">`</samp>&rsquo; syntax (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Backquote.html\">Backquote</a>).  For example:"
msgstr ""
"マクロでは、定数と非定数部分を組み合わせて大規模なリスト構造を構築する必要が"
"あることがよくあります。これを容易にするには、「<samp class=\"samp\">`</"
"samp>」構文（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Backquote.html\">Backquote</a>を参照）"
"を使用してください。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro t-becomes-nil (variable)\n"
"  `(if (eq ,variable t)\n"
"       (setq ,variable nil)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Defining-Macros.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(t-becomes-nil foo)\n"
"     &equiv; (if (eq foo t) (setq foo nil))\n"
msgstr ""

