# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you may wish to avoid showing a warning while a command is "
"running, and only show it only after the end of the command.  You can use "
"the function <code class=\"code\">delay-warning</code> for this.  Emacs "
"automatically delays any warnings emitted during the early stages of "
"startup, and shows them only after the init files are processed."
msgstr ""
"コマンドの実行中に警告を表示せず、コマンドの終了後にのみ表示したい場合があり"
"ます。これには <code class=\"code\">delay-warning</code> 関数を使用できます。"
"Emacs は、起動初期段階で出力される警告を自動的に遅延させ、init ファイルの処理"
"が完了した後にのみ表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delay-warning</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type message "
"&amp;optional level buffer-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delay_002dwarning\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delay-warning</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">type message "
"&amp;optional level buffer-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delay_002dwarning\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"This function is the delayed counterpart to <code class=\"code\">display-"
"warning</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Warning-Basics.html\">Warning "
"Basics</a>), and it is called with the same arguments.  The warning message "
"is queued into <code class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">display-warning</code> の遅延版であり（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Warning-Basics.html\">警告の基本</a>を参照）、同じ引数"
"で呼び出されます。警告メッセージは <code class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-"
"list</code> にキューに追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delayed-warnings-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delayed_002dwarnings_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delayed-warnings-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delayed_002dwarnings_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of warnings to be displayed after the "
"current command has finished.  Each element must be a list"
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、現在のコマンドの終了後に表示される警告のリストです。各要素は"
"リストである必要があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">type</var> <var class=\"var\">message</var> [<var class=\"var\">level</var> [<var class=\"var\">buffer-name</var>]])\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"with the same form, and the same meanings, as the argument list of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-warning</code>.  Immediately after running <code "
"class=\"code\">post-command-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Command-Overview.html\">Command Loop Overview</a>), the Emacs command "
"loop displays all the warnings specified by this variable, then resets the "
"variable to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-warning</code> の引数リストと同じ形式および意味"
"を持ちます。<code class=\"code\">post-command-hook</code> を実行した直後（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Overview.html\">コマンドループの概要</a>を参"
"照）、Emacs のコマンドループはこの変数で指定されたすべての警告を表示し、その"
"後、変数を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にリセットします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"Programs which need to further customize the delayed warnings mechanism can "
"change the variable <code class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-hook</code>:"
msgstr ""
"遅延警告機構をさらにカスタマイズする必要があるプログラムは、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-hook</code> を変更できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delayed-warnings-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delayed_002dwarnings_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delayed-warnings-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delayed_002dwarnings_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"This is a normal hook which is run by the Emacs command loop, after <code "
"class=\"code\">post-command-hook</code>, in order to process and display "
"delayed warnings.  Emacs also runs this hook during startup, after loading "
"the site-start and user init files (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Startup-"
"Summary.html\">Summary: Sequence of Actions at Startup</a>), because "
"warnings emitted before that are automatically delayed."
msgstr ""
"これは、遅延された警告を処理・表示するために、<code class=\"code\">post-"
"command-hook</code> の後に Emacs のコマンドループによって実行される通常のフッ"
"クです。また、それ以前に出力された警告は自動的に遅延されるため、Emacs は起動"
"時に site-start および user init ファイルを読み込んだ後（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">概要：起動時の動作シーケンス</a> を参照）にもこ"
"のフックを実行します。"

