msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-collapse_002ddelayed_002dwarnings\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002ddelayed_002dwarnings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Delayed-Warnings.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">collapse-delayed-warnings</code> removes "
"repeated entries from <code class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code>.  "
"The function <code class=\"code\">display-delayed-warnings</code> calls "
"<code class=\"code\">display-warning</code> on each of the entries in <code "
"class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code>, in turn, and then sets <code "
"class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">collapse-delayed-warnings</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code> から重複するエントリを削除しま"
"す。関数 <code class=\"code\">display-delayed-warnings</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code> の各エントリに対して順に <code "
"class=\"code\">display-warning</code> を呼び出し、その後 <code "
"class=\"code\">delayed-warnings-list</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を代入します。"

