# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-frames\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-frames\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">live frame</em> is one that has not been deleted.  When "
"a frame is deleted, it is removed from its terminal display, although it may "
"continue to exist as a Lisp object until there are no more references to it."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ライブフレーム</em>とは、削除されていないフレームのことであ"
"る。フレームが削除されると、そのフレームは端末ディスプレイから消去されるが、"
"参照がなくなるまではLispオブジェクトとして存在し続けることがある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dframe\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dframe\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dframe_002dfunctions\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"after_002ddelete_002dframe_002dfunctions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dframe_002dfunctions\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"after_002ddelete_002dframe_002dfunctions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes the frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">frame</var> must specify a live frame (see "
"below) and defaults to the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"この関数はフレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> を削除します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> には有効なフレームを指定する必要があり（後述）、デ"
"フォルトでは選択中のフレームが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"It first deletes any child frame of <var class=\"var\">frame</var> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>)  and any frame "
"whose <code class=\"code\">delete-before</code> frame parameter (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html\">Frame Interaction "
"Parameters</a>) specifies <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  All such "
"deletions are performed recursively; so this step makes sure that no other "
"frames with <var class=\"var\">frame</var> as their ancestor will exist.  "
"Then, unless <var class=\"var\">frame</var> specifies a tooltip, this "
"function runs the hook <code class=\"code\">delete-frame-functions</code> "
"(each function getting one argument, <var class=\"var\">frame</var>) before "
"actually killing the frame.  After actually killing the frame and removing "
"the frame from the frame list, <code class=\"code\">delete-frame</code> runs "
"<code class=\"code\">after-delete-frame-functions</code>."
msgstr ""
"まず、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> の子フレーム（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a>を参照）と、<code "
"class=\"code\">delete-before</code> フレームパラメータ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html\">フレーム相互作用パラメータ</a>を参"
"照）で <var class=\"var\">frame</var> が指定されているすべてのフレームを削除"
"します。こうした削除はすべて再帰的に行われます。したがって、このステップによ"
"り、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> を祖先とする他のフレームが存在しないことが"
