#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the frame <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> has not been deleted.  The possible non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> return values are like those of <code "
