# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Frames.html
msgid ""
"These conditions cover most cases where <code class=\"code\">delete-frame</"
"code> might fail when called from top-level.  They do not catch some special "
"cases like, for example, deleting a frame during a drag-and-drop operation "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Drag-and-Drop.html\">Drag and Drop</a>).  In "
"any such case, it will be better to wrap the <code class=\"code\">delete-"
