"Processes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>41.5 プロセスの削除<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Deleting-"
"Processes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-processes\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-processes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Deleting a process</em> disconnects Emacs immediately from "
"the subprocess.  Processes are deleted automatically after they terminate, "
"but not necessarily right away.  You can delete a process explicitly at any "
"time.  If you explicitly delete a terminated process before it is deleted "
"automatically, no harm results.  Deleting a running process sends a signal "
"to terminate it (and its child processes, if any), and calls the process "
"sentinel.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">Sentinels: "
"Detecting Process Status Changes</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">プロセスの削除</em>を行うと、Emacsは直ちにサブプロセスとの"
"接続を切断します。プロセスは終了後に自動的に削除されますが、必ずしも即座に削"
"除されるとは限りません。また、いつでも明示的にプロセスを削除できます。自動的"
"に削除される前に、終了したプロセスを明示的に削除しても、特に問題はありませ"
"ん。実行中のプロセスを削除すると、そのプロセス（および子プロセスがある場合は"
"それらも）を終了させるシグナルが送信され、プロセスセンチネルが呼び出されま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">センチネル：プロセスの状態変化"
"の検出</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"When a process is deleted, the process object itself continues to exist as "
"long as other Lisp objects point to it.  All the Lisp primitives that work "
"on process objects accept deleted processes, but those that do I/O or send "
"signals will report an error.  The process mark continues to point to the "
"same place as before, usually into a buffer where output from the process "
"was being inserted."
msgstr ""
"プロセスが削除されても、他のLispオブジェクトがそれを指している限り、プロセス"
"オブジェクト自体は存在し続けます。プロセスオブジェクトを操作するすべてのLisp"
"プリミティブは、削除済みのプロセスも受け付けますが、I/Oやシグナル送信を行うも"
"のはエラーを報告します。プロセスマークは引き続き以前と同じ場所（通常はプロセ"
"スからの出力が挿入されていたバッファ）を指し続けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-exited-processes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dexited_002dprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">delete-exited-processes</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-delete_002dexited_002dprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls automatic deletion of processes that have terminated "
"(due to calling <code class=\"code\">exit</code> or to a signal).  If it is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then they continue to exist until the user "
"runs <code class=\"code\">list-processes</code>.  Otherwise, they are "
"deleted immediately after they exit."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、終了したプロセス（<code class=\"code\">exit</code>の呼び出しやシ"
"グナルによるもの）の自動削除を制御します。値が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"の場合、ユーザーが<code class=\"code\">list-processes</code>を実行するまでプ"
"ロセスは存続し続けます。それ以外の場合は、終了直後に削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes a process, killing it with a <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGKILL</code> signal if the process was running a program.  "
"The argument may be a process, the name of a process, a buffer, or the name "
"of a buffer.  (A buffer or buffer-name stands for the process that <code "
"class=\"code\">get-buffer-process</code> returns, and a missing or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">process</var> means that the "
"current buffer&rsquo;s process should be killed.)  Calling <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-process</code> on a running process terminates it, "
"updates the process status, and runs the sentinel immediately.  If the "
"process has already terminated, calling <code class=\"code\">delete-process</"
"code> has no effect on its status, or on the running of its sentinel (which "
"will happen sooner or later)."
msgstr ""
"この関数はプロセスを削除し、当該プロセスがプログラムを実行していた場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">SIGKILL</code> シグナルで強制終了させます。引数には、プ"
"ロセス、プロセス名、バッファ、またはバッファ名を指定できます。（バッファまた"
"はバッファ名は <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-process</code> が返すプロセス"
"を指し、指定がない場合や <code class=\"code\">nil</code> または <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> が指定されている場合は、現在のバッファのプロセス"
"を強制終了させることを意味します。）実行中のプロセスに対して <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-process</code> を呼び出すと、そのプロセスが終了し、プロ"
"セスステータスが更新され、直ちにセンチネルが実行されます。プロセスが既に終了"
"している場合、<code class=\"code\">delete-process</code> を呼び出してもステー"
"タスやセンチネルの実行（いずれにせよ実行されます）に影響はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deleting-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If the process object represents a network, serial, or pipe connection, its "
"status changes to <code class=\"code\">closed</code>; otherwise, it changes "
"to <code class=\"code\">signal</code>, unless the process already exited.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Process-Information.html\">process-status</a>."
msgstr ""
"プロセスオブジェクトがネットワーク、シリアル、またはパイプ接続を表す場合、そ"
"のステータスは<code class=\"code\">closed</code>に変更されます。それ以外の場"
"合は<code class=\"code\">signal</code>に変更されますが、プロセスが既に終了し"
"ている場合はこの限りではありません。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Process-"
"Information.html\">process-status</a>を参照してください。"

