#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.6 Deleting Text<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Deleting-Text\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.6 テキストの削除<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Deleting-Text\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-deletion\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-text-vs-killing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-deletion\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-text-vs-killing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"Deletion means removing part of the text in a buffer, without saving it in "
"the kill ring (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-Kill-Ring.html\">The Kill "
"Ring</a>).  Deleted text can&rsquo;t be yanked, but can be reinserted using "
"the undo mechanism (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>).  "
"Some deletion functions do save text in the kill ring in some special cases."
msgstr ""
"削除とは、バッファ内のテキストの一部を、キルリングに保存せずに取り除くことを"
"指します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-Kill-Ring.html\">キルリング</a>を参"
"照）。削除されたテキストはヤンクできませんが、アンドゥ機能（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">アンドゥ</a>を参照）を使用して再挿入できま"
"す。一部の削除機能では、特殊なケースにおいてテキストをキルリングに保存するこ"
"とがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid "All of the deletion functions operate on the current buffer."
msgstr "すべての削除関数は、現在のバッファに対して動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">erase-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"erase_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">erase-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"erase_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes the entire text of the current buffer (<em "
"class=\"emph\">not</em> just the accessible portion), leaving it empty.  If "
"the buffer is read-only, it signals a <code class=\"code\">buffer-read-only</"
"code> error; if some of the text in it is read-only, it signals a <code "
"class=\"code\">text-read-only</code> error.  Otherwise, it deletes the text "
"without asking for any confirmation.  It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファのテキスト全体（アクセス可能な部分だけでなく<em "
"class=\"emph\">すべて</em>）を削除し、空の状態にします。バッファが読み取り専"
"用の場合は<code class=\"code\">buffer-read-only</code>エラーを、テキストの一"
"部が読み取り専用の場合は<code class=\"code\">text-read-only</code>エラーを発"
"生させます。それ以外の場合は、確認を求めることなくテキストを削除します。戻り"
"値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"Normally, deleting a large amount of text from a buffer inhibits further "
"auto-saving of that buffer because it has shrunk.  However, <code "
"class=\"code\">erase-buffer</code> does not do this, the idea being that the "
"future text is not really related to the former text, and its size should "
"not be compared with that of the former text."
msgstr ""
"通常、バッファから大量のテキストを削除すると、バッファが縮小するため、それ以"
"降の自動保存が抑制されます。しかし、<code class=\"code\">erase-buffer</code>"
"ではこのような処理は行われません。これは、後続のテキストが元のテキストと実質"
"的に関連しておらず、そのサイズを元のテキストのサイズと比較すべきではないとい"
"う考えに基づいています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-delete_002dregion\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-delete_002dregion\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes the text between positions <var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> in the current buffer, and returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If point was inside the deleted region, "
"its value afterward is <var class=\"var\">start</var>.  Otherwise, point "
"relocates with the surrounding text, as markers do."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、現在のバッファ内の位置 <var class=\"var\">start</var> から "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> までのテキストを削除し、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。point が削除された領域内にあった場合、"
"その後の値は <var class=\"var\">start</var> となります。そうでない場合は、"
"マーカーと同様に、point は周囲のテキストと共に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-and-extract-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dand_002dextract_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-and-extract-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dand_002dextract_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes the text between positions <var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> in the current buffer, and returns a "
"string containing the text just deleted."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内の位置 <var class=\"var\">start</var> から <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> までのテキストを削除し、削除したばかりのテキストを含"
"む文字列を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"If point was inside the deleted region, its value afterward is <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var>.  Otherwise, point relocates with the surrounding "
"text, as markers do."
msgstr ""
"pointが削除領域内にあった場合、それ以降の値は <var class=\"var\">start</var> "
"となります。そうでない場合は、マーカーと同様に、pointは周囲のテキストと共に移"
"動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional killp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional killp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes <var class=\"var\">count</var> characters directly "
"after point, or before point if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">killp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then it saves the deleted characters in the kill ring."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"In an interactive call, <var class=\"var\">count</var> is the numeric prefix "
"argument, and <var class=\"var\">killp</var> is the unprocessed prefix "
"argument.  Therefore, if a prefix argument is supplied, the text is saved in "
"the kill ring.  If no prefix argument is supplied, then one character is "
"deleted, but not saved in the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"対話型コールにおいて、<var class=\"var\">count</var>は数値のプレフィックス引"
"数、<var class=\"var\">killp</var>は未処理のプレフィックス引数です。したがっ"
"て、プレフィックス引数が指定された場合、テキストはキルリングに保存されます。"
"プレフィックス引数が指定されない場合は、1文字が削除されますが、キルリングには"
"保存されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid "The value returned is always <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr "返される値は常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-backward-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional killp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dbackward_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-backward-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional killp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dbackward_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-previous-char\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-previous-char\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes <var class=\"var\">count</var> characters directly "
"before point, or after point if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">killp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then it saves the deleted characters in the kill ring."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backward-delete-char-untabify</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">count &amp;optional killp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-backward_002ddelete_002dchar_002duntabify\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backward-delete-char-untabify</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">count &amp;optional killp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-backward_002ddelete_002dchar_002duntabify\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab-deletion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab-deletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes <var class=\"var\">count</var> characters backward, "
"changing tabs into spaces.  When the next character to be deleted is a tab, "
"it is first replaced with the proper number of spaces to preserve alignment "
"and then one of those spaces is deleted instead of the tab.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">killp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the "
"command saves the deleted characters in the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは <var class=\"var\">count</var> 文字を後方から削除し、タブをス"
"ペースに変換します。次に削除する文字がタブである場合、まず位置合わせを維持す"
"るために適切な数のスペースに置き換えられ、その後、タブの代わりにそれらのス"
"ペースのうち1つが削除されます。<var class=\"var\">killp</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このコマンドは削除した文字をキルリング"
"に保存します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"Conversion of tabs to spaces happens only if <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"is positive.  If it is negative, exactly &minus;<var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> characters after point are deleted."
msgstr ""
"タブからスペースへの変換は、<var class=\"var\">count</var> が正の場合にのみ行"
"われます。負の場合は、ポイントからちょうど &minus;<var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> 文字分が削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backward-delete-char-untabify-method</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-backward_002ddelete_002dchar_002duntabify_002dmethod\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">backward-delete-char-untabify-method</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backward_002ddelete_002dchar_002duntabify_002dmethod\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This option specifies how <code class=\"code\">backward-delete-char-"
"untabify</code> should deal with whitespace.  Possible values include <code "
"class=\"code\">untabify</code>, the default, meaning convert a tab to many "
"spaces and delete one; <code class=\"code\">hungry</code>, meaning delete "
"all tabs and spaces before point with one command; <code class=\"code\">all</"
"code> meaning delete all tabs, spaces and newlines before point, and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, meaning do nothing special for whitespace "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"このオプションは、<code class=\"code\">backward-delete-char-untabify</code> "
"が空白文字をどのように処理するかを指定します。指定可能な値には、タブを複数の"
"スペースに変換して1つを削除するデフォルトの <code class=\"code\">untabify</"
"code>、ポイントより前のすべてのタブとスペースを1つのコマンドで削除する <code "
"class=\"code\">hungry</code>、ポイントより前のすべてのタブ、スペース、および"
"改行を削除する <code class=\"code\">all</code>、そして空白文字に対して特別な"
"処理を行わない <code class=\"code\">nil</code> があります。"

