# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-derived-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-parent-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-derived-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-parent-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The recommended way to define a new major mode is to derive it from an "
"existing one using <code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code>.  If "
"there is no closely related mode, you should inherit from either <code "
"class=\"code\">text-mode</code>, <code class=\"code\">special-mode</code>, "
"or <code class=\"code\">prog-mode</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Major-Modes.html\">Basic Major Modes</a>.  If none of these are "
"suitable, you can inherit from <code class=\"code\">fundamental-mode</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Modes.html\">Major Modes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"新しいメジャーモードを定義する推奨方法は、<code class=\"code\">define-"
"derived-mode</code> を用いて既存のモードから派生させることです。密接に関連す"
"るモードがない場合は、<code class=\"code\">text-mode</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">special-mode</code>、または <code class=\"code\">prog-mode</"
"code> のいずれかを継承してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Basic-Major-"
"Modes.html\">基本メジャーモード</a>を参照してください。これらがいずれも適さな"
"い場合は、<code class=\"code\">fundamental-mode</code> を継承できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Modes.html\">メジャーモード</a>を参照してくださ"
"い）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-derived-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variant "
"parent name docstring keyword-args&hellip; body&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-define_002dderived_002dmode\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-derived-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variant "
"parent name docstring keyword-args&hellip; body&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-define_002dderived_002dmode\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This macro defines <var class=\"var\">variant</var> as a major mode command, "
"using <var class=\"var\">name</var> as the string form of the mode name.  "
"<var class=\"var\">variant</var> and <var class=\"var\">parent</var> should "
"be unquoted symbols."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">variant</var> をメジャーモードコマンドとして"
"定義し、モード名の文字列形式として <var class=\"var\">name</var> を使用しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">variant</var> と <var class=\"var\">parent</var> は"
"クォートなしのシンボルとする必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The new command <var class=\"var\">variant</var> is defined to call the "
"function <var class=\"var\">parent</var>, then override certain aspects of "
"that parent mode:"
msgstr ""
"新しいコマンド <var class=\"var\">variant</var> は、関数 <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> を呼び出し、その後、その親モードの特定の側面を上書"
"きするように定義されています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The new mode has its own sparse keymap, named <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var>-map</code>.  <code class=\"code\">define-derived-"
"mode</code> makes the parent mode&rsquo;s keymap the parent of the new map, "
"unless <code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">variant</var>-map</code> is "
"already set and already has a parent."
msgstr ""
"新しいモードには、<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">variant</var>-map</"
"code> という名前の独自のスパースキーマップがあります。<code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">variant</var>-map</code> が既に設定されてお"
"り、かつ既に親を持っている場合を除き、<code class=\"code\">define-derived-"
"mode</code> は親モードのキーマップを新しいマップの親とします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The new mode has its own syntax table, kept in the variable <code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">variant</var>-syntax-table</code>, unless "
"you override this using the <code class=\"code\">:syntax-table</code> "
"keyword (see below).  <code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> makes "
"the parent mode&rsquo;s syntax-table the parent of <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var>-syntax-table</code>, unless the latter is "
"already set and already has a parent different from the standard syntax "
"table."
msgstr ""
"新しいモードには独自の構文テーブルがあり、変数 <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var>-syntax-table</code> に保持されています。ただし、"
"<code class=\"code\">:syntax-table</code> キーワードを使用してこれを上書きし"
"た場合は除きます（後述）。<code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> "
"は、親モードの構文テーブルを <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var>-syntax-table</code> の親にします。ただし、後者が"
"既に設定されており、かつ標準の構文テーブルとは異なる親を持っている場合は除き"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The new mode has its own abbrev table, kept in the variable <code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">variant</var>-abbrev-table</code>, unless "
"you override this using the <code class=\"code\">:abbrev-table</code> "
"keyword (see below)."
msgstr ""
"新しいモードには独自の略語テーブルがあり、変数 <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var>-abbrev-table</code> に格納されています。ただし、"
"<code class=\"code\">:abbrev-table</code> キーワードを使用してこれを上書きし"
"た場合は除きます（後述）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The new mode has its own mode hook, <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var>-hook</code>.  It runs this hook, after running "
"the hooks of its ancestor modes, with <code class=\"code\">run-mode-hooks</"
"code>, as the last thing it does, apart from running any <code "
"class=\"code\">:after-hook</code> form it may have.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mode-Hooks.html\">Mode Hooks</a>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"In addition, you can specify how to override other aspects of <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> with <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  The command "
"<var class=\"var\">variant</var> evaluates the forms in <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> after setting up all its usual overrides, just "
"before running the mode hooks."
msgstr ""
"さらに、<var class=\"var\">body</var> を用いて <var class=\"var\">parent</"
"var> の他の側面をどのように上書きするかを指定できます。コマンド <var "
"class=\"var\">variant</var> は、通常のオーバーライドをすべて適用した後、モー"
"ドフックを実行する直前に <var class=\"var\">body</var> 内のフォームを評価しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">parent</var> has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"<code class=\"code\">mode-class</code> symbol property, then <code "
"class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> sets the <code class=\"code\">mode-"
"class</code> property of <var class=\"var\">variant</var> to the same "
"value.  This ensures, for example, that if <var class=\"var\">parent</var> "
"is a special mode, then <var class=\"var\">variant</var> is also a special "
"mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">Major Mode "
"Conventions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">parent</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-class</code> 以外のシンボルプロパティを持つ場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> は <var class=\"var\">variant</"
"var> の <code class=\"code\">mode-class</code> プロパティに同じ値を設定しま"
"す。これにより、例えば <var class=\"var\">parent</var> が特殊モードであれば、"
"<var class=\"var\">variant</var> も特殊モードになることが保証されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">メジャーモードの規約</"
"a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"You can also specify <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var>.  This gives the new mode no parent.  Then <code "
"class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> behaves as described above, but, "
"of course, omits all actions connected with <var class=\"var\">parent</"
"var>.  Conversely, you can use <code class=\"code\">derived-mode-set-parent</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">derived-mode-add-parents</code>, described "
"below, to explicitly set the ancestry of the new mode."
msgstr ""
"また、<var class=\"var\">parent</var> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指"
"定することもできます。これにより、新しいモードに親がなくなります。すると "
"<code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> は前述の通りに動作しますが、"
"当然ながら <var class=\"var\">parent</var> に関連するすべてのアクションは省略"
"されます。逆に、後述する <code class=\"code\">derived-mode-set-parent</code> "
"や <code class=\"code\">derived-mode-add-parents</code> を使用して、新しい"
"モードの祖先を明示的に設定することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">docstring</var> specifies the documentation "
"string for the new mode.  <code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> "
"adds some general information about the mode&rsquo;s hook, followed by the "
"mode&rsquo;s keymap, at the end of this documentation string.  If you omit "
"<var class=\"var\">docstring</var>, <code class=\"code\">define-derived-"
"mode</code> generates a documentation string."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">docstring</var> は、新しいモードのドキュメント文字列"
"を指定します。<code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> は、そのドキュ"
"メント文字列の末尾に、モードのフックに関する一般的な情報と、続いてモードの"
"キーマップを追加します。<var class=\"var\">docstring</var> を省略した場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> がドキュメント文字列を生成し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">keyword-args</var> are pairs of keywords and values.  "
"The values, except for <code class=\"code\">:after-hook</code>&rsquo;s, are "
"evaluated.  The following keywords are currently supported:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keyword-args</var> はキーワードと値のペアです。<code "
"class=\"code\">:after-hook</code> 以外の値は評価されます。現在、以下のキー"
"ワードがサポートされています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:syntax-table</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:syntax-table</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"You can use this to explicitly specify a syntax table for the new mode.  If "
"you specify a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the new mode uses the "
"same syntax table as <var class=\"var\">parent</var>, or the standard syntax "
"table if <var class=\"var\">parent</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  (Note that this does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> follow the "
"convention used for non-keyword arguments that a <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value is equivalent with not specifying the argument.)"
msgstr ""
"これを使用して、新しいモード用の構文テーブルを明示的に指定できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を指定した場合、新しいモードは <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> と同じ構文テーブルを使用し、<var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は標準の"
"構文テーブルを使用します。（なお、これは非キーワード引数で用いられる「<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値は引数を指定しないのと同等である」という慣例に"
"<em class=\"emph\">従わない</em>点に注意してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:abbrev-table</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:abbrev-table</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"You can use this to explicitly specify an abbrev table for the new mode.  If "
"you specify a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the new mode uses the "
"same abbrev table as <var class=\"var\">parent</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">fundamental-mode-abbrev-table</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  (Again, a "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> "
"equivalent to not specifying this keyword.)"
msgstr ""
"これを使用して、新しいモード用の略語テーブルを明示的に指定できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を指定した場合、新しいモードは <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> と同じ略語テーブルを使用し、<var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">fundamental-mode-abbrev-table</code> と同じテーブルを使用しま"
"す。（繰り返しになりますが、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値は、このキー"
"ワードを指定しないことと<em class=\"emph\">同等ではありません</em>。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:interactive</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:interactive</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Modes are interactive commands by default.  If you specify a <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the mode defined here won&rsquo;t be "
"interactive.  This is useful for modes that are never meant to be activated "
"by users manually, but are only supposed to be used in some specially-"
"formatted buffer."
msgstr ""
"モードはデフォルトでインタラクティブなコマンドです。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を指定すると、ここで定義されるモードはインタラ"
"クティブではなくなります。これは、ユーザーが手動で起動することを想定しておら"
"ず、特定の形式のバッファ内でのみ使用されるべきモードに有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html build/html/elisp/Icons.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:group</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:group</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"If this is specified, the value should be the customization group for this "
"mode.  (Not all major modes have one.)  The command <code "
"class=\"code\">customize-mode</code> uses this.  <code class=\"code\">define-"
"derived-mode</code> does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> automatically define "
"the specified customization group."
msgstr ""
"これを指定した場合、値はこのモード用のカスタマイズグループとする必要がありま"
"す。（すべてのメジャーモードに設定されているわけではありません。）コマンド "
"<code class=\"code\">customize-mode</code> がこれを利用します。<code "
"class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> は、指定したカスタマイズグループを"
"自動的に定義<em class=\"emph\">しません</em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:after-hook</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:after-hook</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This optional keyword specifies a single Lisp form to evaluate as the final "
"act of the mode function, after the mode hooks have been run.  It should not "
"be quoted.  Since the form might be evaluated after the mode function has "
"terminated, it should not access any element of the mode function&rsquo;s "
"local state.  An <code class=\"code\">:after-hook</code> form is useful for "
"setting up aspects of the mode which depend on the user&rsquo;s settings, "
"which in turn may have been changed in a mode hook."
msgstr ""
"このオプションキーワードは、モードフックが実行された後、モード関数の最終処理"
"として評価する単一のLispフォームを指定します。クォートで囲んではいけません。"
"このフォームはモード関数の終了後に評価される可能性があるため、モード関数の"
"ローカル状態のいかなる要素にもアクセスしてはなりません。<code "
"class=\"code\">:after-hook</code> フォームは、ユーザーの設定に依存するモード"
"の各種設定を行う際に有用であり、こうした設定はモードフック内で変更されている"
"場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid "Here is a hypothetical example:"
msgstr "以下に架空の例を挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap hypertext-mode-map\n"
"  &quot;&lt;down-mouse-3&gt;&quot; #'do-hyper-link)\n"
"\n"
"(define-derived-mode hypertext-mode\n"
"  text-mode &quot;Hypertext&quot;\n"
"  &quot;Major mode for hypertext.&quot;\n"
"  (setq-local case-fold-search nil))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Do not write an <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> spec in the "
"definition; <code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> does that "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"定義に <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の指定を記述しないでください。"
"<code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> が自動的に行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
