# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Derived-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the list of all the modes in the ancestry of <var "
"class=\"var\">mode</var>, ordered from the most specific to the least "
"specific, and starting with <var class=\"var\">mode</var> itself.  This "
"includes the additional parent modes, if any, added by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">derived-mode-add-parents</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">mode</var> の祖先にあるすべてのモードの一覧"
"を、最も具体的なものから最も一般的なものに順に並べ、<var class=\"var\">mode</"
"var> 自身を先頭として返します。これには、<code class=\"code\">derived-mode-"
"add-parents</code> を呼び出すことで追加された追加の親モード（もしあれば）も含"
"まれます。"

