#: build/html/elisp/Describing-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string containing the Emacs standard notation for "
"the input events in <var class=\"var\">sequence</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">prefix</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it is a "
"sequence of input events leading up to <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> and "
"is included in the return value.  Both arguments may be strings, vectors or "
"lists.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Events.html\">Input Events</a>, "
"for more information about valid events."
msgstr ""
