# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs runs on MS-Windows as a GUI session, it supports a small subset "
"of the D-Bus notifications functionality via a native primitive:"
msgstr ""
"EmacsをMS-Windows上でGUIセッションとして動作させる際、ネイティブプリミティブ"
"を介してD-Bus通知機能のごく一部をサポートしています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">w32-notification-notify</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest params</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"w32_002dnotification_002dnotify\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">w32-notification-notify</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest params</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"w32_002dnotification_002dnotify\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"This function displays an MS-Windows tray notification as specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">params</var>.  MS-Windows tray notifications are displayed in "
"a balloon from an icon in the notification area of the taskbar."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">params</var>で指定されたMS-Windowsのトレイ通知"
"を表示します。MS-Windowsのトレイ通知は、タスクバーの通知領域にあるアイコンか"
"らバルーン形式で表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"Value is the integer unique ID of the notification that can be used to "
"remove the notification using <code class=\"code\">w32-notification-close</"
"code>, described below.  If the function fails, the return value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"valueは、後述の<code class=\"code\">w32-notification-close</code>を用いて通知"
"を削除する際に使用できる、通知の一意の整数IDです。関数が失敗した場合、戻り値"
"は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"The arguments <var class=\"var\">params</var> are specified as keyword/value "
"pairs.  All the parameters are optional, but if no parameters are specified, "
"the function will do nothing and return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">params</var> はキーワードと値のペアとして指定します。"
"すべてのパラメータは省略可能ですが、パラメータが指定されない場合、関数は何も"
"行わず <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid "The following parameters are supported:"
msgstr "以下のパラメータがサポートされています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:icon <var class=\"var\">icon</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:icon <var class=\"var\">icon</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"Display <var class=\"var\">icon</var> in the system tray.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">icon</var> is a string, it should specify a file name from "
"which to load the icon; the specified file should be a <samp "
"class=\"file\">.ico</samp> Windows icon file.  If <var class=\"var\">icon</"
"var> is not a string, or if this parameter is not specified, the standard "
"Emacs icon will be used."
msgstr ""
"システムトレイに <var class=\"var\">icon</var> を表示します。<var "
"class=\"var\">icon</var> が文字列の場合、アイコンを読み込むファイル名を指定す"
"る必要があります。指定するファイルは <samp class=\"file\">.ico</samp> "
"Windows アイコンファイルである必要があります。<var class=\"var\">icon</var> "
"が文字列でない場合、またはこのパラメータが指定されていない場合は、標準の "
"Emacs アイコンが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:tip <var class=\"var\">tip</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:tip <var class=\"var\">tip</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"Use <var class=\"var\">tip</var> as the tooltip for the notification.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">tip</var> is a string, this is the text of a tooltip that "
"will be shown when the mouse pointer hovers over the tray icon added by the "
"notification.  If <var class=\"var\">tip</var> is not a string, or if this "
"parameter is not specified, the default tooltip text is &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Emacs notification</samp>&rsquo;.  The tooltip text can be up "
"to 127 characters long (63 on Windows versions before W2K).  Longer strings "
"will be truncated."
msgstr ""
"通知のツールチップには <var class=\"var\">tip</var> を指定してください。<var "
"class=\"var\">tip</var> が文字列の場合、これは通知によって追加されたトレイア"
"イコンにマウスポインタを合わせた際に表示されるツールチップのテキストとなりま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">tip</var> が文字列でない場合、またはこのパラメータが指"
"定されていない場合、デフォルトのツールチップテキストは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Emacs notification</samp>&rsquo; となります。ツールチップのテ"
"キストは最大127文字（W2Kより前のWindowsバージョンでは63文字）まで指定可能で"
"す。これより長い文字列は切り捨てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:level <var class=\"var\">level</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:level <var class=\"var\">level</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"Notification severity level, one of <code class=\"code\">info</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">warning</code>, or <code class=\"code\">error</code>.  If "
"given, the value determines the icon displayed to the left of the "
"notification title, but only if the <code class=\"code\">:title</code> "
"parameter (see below) is also specified and is a string."
msgstr ""
"通知の重大度レベル。<code class=\"code\">info</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">warning</code>、または<code class=\"code\">error</code>のいず"
"れか。指定された場合、その値は通知タイトルの左側に表示されるアイコンを決定し"
"ますが、これは<code class=\"code\">:title</code>パラメータ（後述）も指定され"
"ており、かつ文字列である場合に限ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"The title of the notification.  If <var class=\"var\">title</var> is a "
"string, it is displayed in a larger font immediately above the body text.  "
"The title text can be up to 63 characters long; longer text will be "
"truncated."
msgstr ""
"通知のタイトル。<var class=\"var\">title</var> が文字列の場合、本文の直上の大"
"きなフォントで表示されます。タイトルのテキストは最大 63 文字まで指定でき、そ"
"れより長い場合は切り捨てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:body <var class=\"var\">body</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:body <var class=\"var\">body</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"The body of the notification.  If <var class=\"var\">body</var> is a string, "
"it specifies the text of the notification message.  Use embedded newlines to "
"control how the text is broken into lines.  The body text can be up to 255 "
"characters long, and will be truncated if it&rsquo;s longer.  Unlike with D-"
"Bus, the body text should be plain text, with no markup."
msgstr ""
"通知の本文。<var class=\"var\">body</var> が文字列の場合、通知メッセージのテ"
"キストを指定します。テキストの改行方法を制御するには、改行文字を埋め込んでく"
"ださい。本文は最大255文字まで指定でき、それを超える場合は切り捨てられます。D-"
"Busとは異なり、本文はマークアップのないプレーンテキストである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"Note that versions of Windows before W2K support only <code "
"class=\"code\">:icon</code> and <code class=\"code\">:tip</code>.  The other "
"parameters can be passed, but they will be ignored on those old systems."
msgstr ""
"なお、W2Kより前のバージョンのWindowsでは、<code class=\"code\">:icon</code>と"
"<code class=\"code\">:tip</code>のみがサポートされている点にご注意ください。"
"その他のパラメータも指定可能ですが、これらの旧システムでは無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"There can be at most one active notification at any given time for each "
"Emacs frame.  An active notification must be removed by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">w32-notification-close</code> before a new one can be shown "
"for the same frame."
msgstr ""
"各Emacsフレームにおいて、同時にアクティブな通知は最大1つまでです。同じフレー"
"ムに新しい通知を表示するには、まず<code class=\"code\">w32-notification-"
"close</code>を呼び出してアクティブな通知を削除する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"To remove the notification and its icon from the taskbar, use the following "
"function:"
msgstr ""
"タスクバーから通知とそのアイコンを削除するには、以下の関数を使用してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">w32-notification-close</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">id</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"w32_002dnotification_002dclose\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">w32-notification-close</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">id</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"w32_002dnotification_002dclose\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"This function removes the tray notification given by its unique <var "
"class=\"var\">id</var>.  The same Emacs frame which was the selected frame "
"when the notification was created must be selected when removing the "
"notification.  A Lisp program which shows notifications must track which "
"frame corresponds to which notification <var class=\"var\">id</var>, and "
"select that frame when removing the notification.  (When a frame is deleted, "
"a notification it created, if any, will be removed by MS-Windows.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、一意の <var class=\"var\">id</var> で指定されたトレイ通知を削除し"
"ます。通知作成時に選択されていたのと同じ Emacs フレームを、通知削除時にも選択"
