"present within <var class=\"var\">params</var>, it is replaced by the string "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;Desktop Notifications&quot;</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">group</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、"
"または <var class=\"var\">params</var> 内に存在しない場合、文字列 &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;Desktop Notifications&quot;</samp>&rsquo; に置換さ"
"れます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"Callers should provide one stable combination of <var class=\"var\">urgency</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">group</var> for each kind of notification they "
"send, given that the system may elect to disregard <var "
"class=\"var\">urgency</var> if it does not match that of any notification "
"previously delivered to <var class=\"var\">group</var>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
