"If it is not provided within <var class=\"var\">params</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">icon</var> does not exist, it defaults to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;ic_dialog_alert&quot;</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">params</var> 内で指定されていないか、<var "
"class=\"var\">icon</var> が存在しない場合は、デフォルトで &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;ic_dialog_alert&quot;</samp>&rsquo; となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
