# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Desktop-Notifications.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs is not afforded the permission to display notifications (see <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Android-Environment.html#Android-Environment\">Android "
