#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, directory-local variables are ignored.  "
"This variable may be useful for modes that want to ignore directory-locals "
"while still respecting file-local variables (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"File-Local-Variables.html\">File Local Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
