# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string representing <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var> in a form that the operating system will interpret as the name of a "
"directory (a directory name).  On most systems, this means appending a slash "
