# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Names.html
msgid ""
"Concatenate <var class=\"var\">components</var> to <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var>, inserting a slash before the components if "
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> or the preceding component didn&rsquo;t "
"end with a slash."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">components</var>から<var class=\"var\">directory</var>まで"
"を連結し、<var class=\"var\">directory</var>または直前のコンポーネントがス"
"ラッシュで終わっていない場合は、コンポーネントの前にスラッシュを挿入する。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-name-concat &quot;/tmp&quot; &quot;foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/tmp/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Names.html
msgid ""
"A <var class=\"var\">directory</var> or components that are <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or the empty string are ignored&mdash;they are "
"filtered out first and do not affect the results in any way."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> や、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> または"
"空文字列であるコンポーネントは無視されます&mdash;まずフィルタリングされ、結果"
"に一切影響を与えません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Names.html
msgid ""
"This is almost the same as using <code class=\"code\">concat</code>, but "
"<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> (and the non-final components) may or may "
"not end with slash characters, and this function will not double those "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">concat</code> を使うのとほぼ同じですが、<var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var>（および末尾以外のコンポーネント）はスラッシュ文字"
"で終わる場合と終わらない場合があり、この関数ではそれらの文字を重複させませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Directory-Names.html
msgid ""
"In most cases, one or more calls to <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html\">Functions "
"that Expand Filenames</a> are better suited for the job of generating file "
"names with leading directories than this function.  Use this function only "
"if some of the special features of <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</"
"code> get in the way of what your program needs to do.  For example, the "
"special handling by <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> of <samp "
"class=\"file\">~</samp>, <samp class=\"file\">~<var class=\"var\">user</"
"var></samp>, and <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, or the removal of <samp "
"class=\"file\">.</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">..</samp> might not be what "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの場合、<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> への1回以上の呼"
"び出し（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html\">ファイル名を展開"
"する関数</a>を参照）の方が、先頭にディレクトリを含むファイル名を生成する処理"
"には本関数よりも適しています。<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> の"
"特殊な機能の一部がプログラムの動作の妨げになる場合にのみ、本関数を使用してく"
"ださい。例えば、<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> による <samp "
"class=\"file\">~</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">~<var class=\"var\">user</"
"var></samp>、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の特殊な処理や、<samp "
"class=\"file\">.</samp> および <samp class=\"file\">..</samp> の削除などは、"
"意図した動作ではない可能性があります。"

