# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The low-level mechanism for disabling a command is to put a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> property on "
"the Lisp symbol for the command.  These properties are normally set up by "
"the user&rsquo;s init file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">The Init File</a>) with Lisp expressions such as this:"
msgstr ""
"コマンドを無効化するための低レベルな仕組みは、そのコマンドのLispシンボルに"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">disabled</code>以外のプ"
"ロパティを設定することです。これらのプロパティは通常、ユーザーのinitファイル"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Initファイル</a>を参照）におい"
"て、次のようなLisp式を用いて設定されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(put 'upcase-region 'disabled t)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"For a few commands, these properties are present by default (you can remove "
"them in your init file if you wish)."
msgstr ""
"一部のコマンドでは、これらのプロパティがデフォルトで設定されています（必要に"
"応じて、initファイルで削除することも可能です）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If the value of the <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> property is a "
"string, the message saying the command is disabled includes that string.  "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">disabled</code> プロパティの値が文字列の場合、コマンドが"
"無効であることを示すメッセージにその文字列が含まれます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(put 'delete-region 'disabled\n"
"     &quot;Text deleted this way cannot be yanked back!\\n&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Disabling.html#Disabling\">Disabling</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for the details on what happens "
"when a disabled command is invoked interactively.  Disabling a command has "
"no effect on calling it as a function from Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"無効化されたコマンドを対話的に呼び出した際に何が起こるかの詳細については、"
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Disabling.html#Disabling\">無効化</a>を参照してください。コマンドを無効化して"
"も、Lispプログラムから関数として呼び出す際には影響はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command_002dquery\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command_002dquery\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The value of the <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> property can also be a "
"list where the first element is the symbol <code class=\"code\">query</"
"code>.  In that case, the user will be queried whether to execute the "
"command.  The second element in the list should be <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> or non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> to say whether to use <code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> or <code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-p</code>, "
"respectively, and the third element is the question to use.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">command-query</code> convenience function should be used to "
"enable querying for a command."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">disabled</code> プロパティの値には、第1要素がシンボル "
"<code class=\"code\">query</code> であるリストを指定することも可能です。その"
"場合、コマンドを実行するかどうかの確認がユーザーに求められます。リストの第2要"
"素は、<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> と <code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-"
"p</code> のどちらを使用するかをそれぞれ示す <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"または non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> とし、第3要素は使用する質問としま"
"す。コマンドの確認機能を有効にするには、<code class=\"code\">command-query</"
"code> 利便性関数を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">enable-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-enable_002dcommand\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">enable-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-enable_002dcommand\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Allow <var class=\"var\">command</var> (a symbol) to be executed without "
"special confirmation from now on, and alter the user&rsquo;s init file (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Init File</a>) so that this "
"will apply to future sessions."
msgstr ""
"今後は <var class=\"var\">command</var>（シンボル）を特別な確認なしに実行でき"
"るようにし、今後のセッションにもこれが適用されるよう、ユーザーの init ファイ"
"ル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Init ファイル</a> を参照）を変"
"更してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">disable-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-disable_002dcommand\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">disable-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-disable_002dcommand\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Require special confirmation to execute <var class=\"var\">command</var> "
"from now on, and alter the user&rsquo;s init file so that this will apply to "
"future sessions."
msgstr ""
"今後は <var class=\"var\">command</var> を実行する際に特別な確認を必須とし、"
"今後のセッションにもこれが適用されるようユーザーの init ファイルを変更してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">disabled-command-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-disabled_002dcommand_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">disabled-command-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-disabled_002dcommand_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable should be a function.  When the user invokes a "
"disabled command interactively, this function is called instead of the "
"disabled command.  It can use <code class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code> "
"to determine what the user typed to run the command, and thus find the "
"command itself."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は関数である必要があります。ユーザーが無効化されたコマンドを対話"
"的に実行すると、そのコマンドの代わりにこの関数が呼び出されます。この関数では "
"<code class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code> を使用して、ユーザーがコマンド"
"実行のために何を入力したかを判定し、それによってコマンド自体を特定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The value may also be <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Then all commands "
"work normally, even disabled ones."
msgstr ""
"値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でも構いません。その場合、無効化されたコ"
"マンドも含め、すべてのコマンドが正常に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Disabling-Commands.html
msgid ""
"By default, the value is a function that asks the user whether to proceed."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、値はユーザーに続行するかどうかを尋ねる関数となっています。"

