# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Display-Feature-Testing.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the visual class for the screen.  The value is one of "
"the symbols <code class=\"code\">static-gray</code> (a limited, unchangeable "
"number of grays), <code class=\"code\">gray-scale</code> (a full range of "
"grays), <code class=\"code\">static-color</code> (a limited, unchangeable "
"number of colors), <code class=\"code\">pseudo-color</code> (a limited "
"number of colors), <code class=\"code\">true-color</code> (a full range of "
"colors), and <code class=\"code\">direct-color</code> (a full range of "
"colors)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、画面のビジュアルクラスを返します。値は、<code "
"class=\"code\">static-gray</code>（限定的で変更不可能な数のグレー）、<code "
"class=\"code\">gray-scale</code>（グレーの全範囲）、<code "
"class=\"code\">static-color</code>（限定的で変更不可能な数の色）、<code "
"class=\"code\">pseudo-color</code>（限定的な数の色）、<code "
"class=\"code\">true-color</code>（色の全範囲）、および<code "
"class=\"code\">direct-color</code>（色の全範囲）のいずれかのシンボルとなりま"
"す。"

