#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Display-Property.html
msgid ""
"Add the display specification <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">prop</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code> to the text from <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> to <var class=\"var\">end</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var>から<var class=\"var\">end</var>までのテキスト"
"に表示指定<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">prop</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>を追加してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Display-Property.html
msgid ""
"If any text in the region has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> property, those properties are retained.  For "
"instance:"
msgstr ""
"領域内のテキストに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> 以外のプロパティがある場合、それらのプロパティ"
"は保持されます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Display-Property.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-display-text-property 4 8 'height 2.0)\n"
"(add-display-text-property 2 12 'raise 0.5)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Display-Property.html
msgid ""
"After doing this, the region from 2 to 4 will have the <code "
"class=\"code\">raise</code> display specification, the region from 4 to 8 "
"will have both the <code class=\"code\">raise</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">height</code> display specifications, and finally the region "
"from 8 to 12 will only have the <code class=\"code\">raise</code> display "
"specification."
msgstr ""
"この操作を行うと、2から4の範囲には<code class=\"code\">raise</code>の表示指定"
"が、4から8の範囲には<code class=\"code\">raise</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">height</code>の両方の表示指定が、そして最後に8から12の範囲には"
"<code class=\"code\">raise</code>の表示指定のみが適用されるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Display-Property.html
msgid ""
