# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.4 Distinguish Interactive Calls<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Distinguish-Interactive-Calls\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.4 対話型コールの判別<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Distinguish-"
"Interactive-Calls\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-distinguish-interactive-calls\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-is-this-call-interactive\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-distinguish-interactive-calls\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-is-this-call-interactive\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes a command should display additional visual feedback (such as an "
"informative message in the echo area) for interactive calls only.  There are "
"three ways to do this.  The recommended way to test whether the function was "
"called using <code class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> is to give it an "
"optional argument <code class=\"code\">print-message</code> and use the "
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> spec to make it non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> in interactive calls.  Here&rsquo;s an example:"
msgstr ""
"コマンドによっては、インタラクティブな呼び出し時のみ追加の視覚的フィードバッ"
"ク（エコー領域への情報メッセージなど）を表示させる必要がある場合があります。"
"これを実現する方法は3通りあります。関数が<code class=\"code\">call-"
"interactively</code>を用いて呼び出されたかどうかを判定する推奨方法は、オプ"
"ション引数<code class=\"code\">print-message</code>を指定し、<code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code>仕様を用いてインタラクティブな呼び出し時には"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>にならないようにすることです。以下に例を示しま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo (&amp;optional print-message)\n"
"  (interactive &quot;p&quot;)\n"
"  (when print-message\n"
"    (message &quot;foo&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"We use <code class=\"code\">&quot;p&quot;</code> because the numeric prefix "
"argument is never <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Defined in this way, the "
"function does display the message when called from a keyboard macro."
msgstr ""
"数値プレフィックス引数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> になることがないた"
"め、<code class=\"code\">&quot;p&quot;</code> を使用しています。このように定"
"義することで、キーボードマクロから呼び出された際に、関数がメッセージを表示す"
"るようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"The above method with the additional argument is usually best, because it "
"allows callers to say &ldquo;treat this call as interactive&rdquo;.  But you "
"can also do the job by testing <code class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"追加引数を用いた上記の手法は、呼び出し側が「この呼び出しを対話的なものとして"
"扱う」と指定できるため、通常は最適です。ただし、<code class=\"code\">called-"
"interactively-p</code> を判定することでも同様の処理が可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">called-interactively-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">kind</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"called_002dinteractively_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">called-interactively-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">kind</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"called_002dinteractively_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> when the calling "
"function was called using <code class=\"code\">call-interactively</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、呼び出し元の関数が <code class=\"code\">call-interactively</"
"code> を用いて呼び出された場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">kind</var> should be either the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> or the symbol <code class=\"code\">any</"
"code>.  If it is <code class=\"code\">interactive</code>, then <code "
"class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code> returns <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> only if the call was made directly by the user&mdash;e.g., if the user "
"typed a key sequence bound to the calling function, but <em "
"class=\"emph\">not</em> if the user ran a keyboard macro that called the "
"function (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">Keyboard "
"Macros</a>).  If <var class=\"var\">kind</var> is <code class=\"code\">any</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> for any kind of interactive call, including keyboard "
"macros."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">kind</var> は、シンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> またはシンボル <code class=\"code\">any</"
"code> のいずれかである必要があります。<code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code> の場合、<code class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返すのは、ユーザーによって直接呼び出された場合に限"
"られます（例えば、ユーザーが呼び出し関数にバインドされたキーシーケンスを入力"
"した場合などです。ただし、ユーザーがその関数を呼び出すキーボードマクロを実行"
"した場合は<em class=\"emph\">除きます</em>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">キーボードマクロ</a>を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">kind</var> が <code class=\"code\">any</code> の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code> はキーボードマクロを含むあらゆる"
"種類の対話的な呼び出しに対して <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"If in doubt, use <code class=\"code\">any</code>; the only known proper use "
"of <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> is if you need to decide whether "
"to display a helpful message while a function is running."
msgstr ""
"迷った場合は <code class=\"code\">any</code> を使用してください。<code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> の唯一知られている適切な用途は、関数の実行"
"中にヘルプメッセージを表示するかどうかを判断する必要がある場合です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"A function is never considered to be called interactively if it was called "
"via Lisp evaluation (or with <code class=\"code\">apply</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Lispによる評価（または <code class=\"code\">apply</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> による呼び出し）を介して呼び出された関数は、イ"
"ンタラクティブに呼び出されたとはみなされない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using <code class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</"
"code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code> の使用例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo ()\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (when (called-interactively-p 'any)\n"
"    (message &quot;Interactive!&quot;)\n"
"    'foo-called-interactively))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x foo</kbd>.</span>\n"
"     &#8867; Interactive!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(foo)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"Here is another example that contrasts direct and indirect calls to <code "
"class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code>への直接呼び出しと間接呼び"
"出しを対比させた別の例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun bar ()\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (message &quot;%s&quot; (list (foo) (called-interactively-p 'any))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Distinguish-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x bar</kbd>.</span>\n"
"     &#8867; (nil t)\n"
msgstr ""

