"ント文字列の動的ロードに対応したコンパイル済みファイルを生成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Docs-and-Compilation.html
msgid ""
"To disable the dynamic loading feature for a specific file, set this option "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> in its header line (see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/File-Variables.html#File-Variables\">Local Variables in Files</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>), like this:"
msgstr ""
