# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Basics.html
msgid ""
"A documentation string is written using the Lisp syntax for strings, with "
"double-quote characters surrounding the text.  It is, in fact, an actual "
"Lisp string.  When the string appears in the proper place in a function or "
"variable definition, it serves as the function&rsquo;s or variable&rsquo;s "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメント文字列は、テキストをダブルクォート文字で囲むというLispの文字列構"
"文を用いて記述されます。これは実質的に、実際のLisp文字列です。関数や変数の定"
"義における適切な箇所にこの文字列が記述されると、その関数や変数のドキュメント"
"として機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-function_002ddocumentation-"
"property\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-function_002ddocumentation-"
"property\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Basics.html
msgid ""
"In a function definition (a <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">defun</code> form), the documentation string is specified "
"after the argument list, and is normally stored directly in the function "
"object.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Function-"
"Documentation.html\">Documentation Strings of Functions</a>.  You can also "
"put function documentation in the <code class=\"code\">function-"
"documentation</code> property of a function name (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Accessing-Documentation.html\">Access to Documentation Strings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"関数定義（<code class=\"code\">lambda</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">defun</code> 形式）では、ドキュメント文字列は引数リストの後に"
"指定され、通常は関数オブジェクトに直接格納されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Function-Documentation.html\">関数のドキュメント文字列</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。また、関数名の <code class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> プ"
"ロパティに関数のドキュメントを記述することも可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Accessing-Documentation.html\">ドキュメント文字列へのアクセス</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-variable_002ddocumentation-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-variable_002ddocumentation-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Basics.html
msgid ""
"In a variable definition (a <code class=\"code\">defvar</code> form), the "
"documentation string is specified after the initial value.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Variables.html\">Defining Global Variables</"
"a>.  The string is stored in the variable&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">variable-documentation</code> property."
msgstr ""
"変数定義（<code class=\"code\">defvar</code>形式）では、ドキュメント文字列は"
"初期値の後に指定されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Variables.html\">"
"グローバル変数の定義</a>を参照してください。この文字列は、変数の<code "
"class=\"code\">variable-documentation</code>プロパティに格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Basics.html
