# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can list functions based on various groupings.  For instance, <code "
"class=\"code\">string-trim</code> and <code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code> "
"are &ldquo;string&rdquo; functions, so <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x shortdoc RET "
"string RET</kbd> will give an overview of these and other functions that "
"operate on strings."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、さまざまなグループ分けに基づいて関数を一覧表示できます。例えば、"
"<code class=\"code\">string-trim</code>と<code class=\"code\">mapconcat</"
"code>は「文字列」関数であるため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x shortdoc RET string "
"RET</kbd>ではこれらや、文字列を操作するその他の関数の概要が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
