"Define <var class=\"var\">group</var> as a group of functions, and provide "
"short summaries of using those functions.  The optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">functions</var> is a list whose elements are of the form:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">group</var> を関数群として定義し、それらの関数の使用方法に"
"ついて簡潔な説明を記載してください。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">functions</var> は、要素が以下の形式であるリストです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">func</var> [<var class=\"var\">keyword</var> <var class=\"var\">val</var>]...)\n"
msgstr ""

