"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-documentation-group-keywords\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid "The following keywords are recognized:"
msgstr "以下のキーワードが認識されます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:eval</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:eval</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a form that has no side effect when evaluated.  The form "
"will be used in the documentation by printing it with <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-"
"Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>).  However, if the form is a string, "
"it will be inserted as-is, and the string will then be <code "
"class=\"code\">read</code> to yield the form.  In any case, the form will "
"then be evaluated, and the result used.  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"値は、評価時に副作用のないフォームである必要があります。このフォームは、ド"
"キュメント内で <code class=\"code\">prin1</code> を用いて出力されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出力関数</a>を参照）。ただし、"
"フォームが文字列である場合はそのまま挿入され、その文字列が <code "
"class=\"code\">read</code> となることでフォームが生成されます。いずれの場合"
"も、その後フォームが評価され、その結果が使用されます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
":eval (concat &quot;foo&quot; &quot;bar&quot; &quot;zot&quot;)\n"
":eval &quot;(make-string 5 ?x)&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid "will result in:"
msgstr "以下の結果となります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(concat &quot;foo&quot; &quot;bar&quot; &quot;zot&quot;)\n"
"&rArr; &quot;foobarzot&quot;\n"
"(make-string 5 ?x)\n"
"&rArr; &quot;xxxxx&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"(The reason for allowing both Lisp forms and strings here is so that "
"printing could be controlled in the few cases where a certain presentation "
"of the form is wished for.  In the example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?x</"
"samp>&rsquo; would otherwise have been printed as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">120</samp>&rsquo; if it hadn&rsquo;t been included in a "
"string.)"
msgstr ""
"（ここでLispのフォームと文字列の両方を許容しているのは、フォームの特定の表現"
"が望ましいごく少数のケースにおいて、出力を制御できるようにするためである。例"
"では、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?x</samp>&rsquo;が文字列に含まれていなけれ"
"ば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">120</samp>&rsquo;として出力されていただろ"
"う。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:no-eval</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:no-eval</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">:eval</code>, except that the form will "
"not be evaluated.  In these cases, a <code class=\"code\">:result</code> "
"element of some kind (see below)  should be included."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">:eval</code> と同様ですが、フォームは評価されませ"
"ん。このような場合は、何らかの <code class=\"code\">:result</code> 要素（後"
"述）を含める必要があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
":no-eval (file-symlink-p &quot;/tmp/foo&quot;)\n"
":eg-result t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:no-eval*</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:no-eval*</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">:no-eval</code>, but always inserts &lsquo;<samp "
