# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"These two are the same as <code class=\"code\">:result</code> and <code "
