# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"By default, the function&rsquo;s actual argument list is shown.  If <code "
