"section elem</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"shortdoc_002dadd_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">shortdoc-add-function</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">group "
"section elem</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"shortdoc_002dadd_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"Lisp packages can add functions to groups with this function.  Each <var "
"class=\"var\">elem</var> should be a function description, as described "
"above.  <var class=\"var\">group</var> is the function group, and <var "
"class=\"var\">section</var> is what section in the function group to insert "
"the function into."
msgstr ""
"Lispパッケージでは、この関数を用いてグループに関数を追加できます。各<var "
"class=\"var\">elem</var>は、前述の通り関数の説明である必要があります。<var "
"class=\"var\">group</var>は関数グループ、<var class=\"var\">section</var>は関"
"数グループ内のどのセクションに関数を挿入するかを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">group</var> doesn&rsquo;t exist, it will be created.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">section</var> doesn&rsquo;t exist, it will be added to "
"the end of the function group."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">group</var> が存在しない場合は、作成されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">section</var> が存在しない場合は、関数グループの末尾に追加され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
