# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
"This function returns all shortdoc examples for <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var>.  The return value is an alist with items of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">group</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">examples</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">group</var> "
"is a documentation group where <var class=\"var\">function</var> appears, "
"and <var class=\"var\">examples</var> is a string with the examples of <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>s use as defined in <var class=\"var\">group</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">function</var> に関するすべての shortdoc 例を"
"返します。戻り値はアリストであり、各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">group</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">examples</var>)</"
"code> という形式をしています。ここで、<var class=\"var\">group</var> は <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> が含まれるドキュメントグループであり、<var "
"class=\"var\">examples</var> は <var class=\"var\">group</var> で定義された "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> の例を含む文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Groups.html
msgid ""
