# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Documentation-Tips.html
msgid ""
"Hyperlinks for faces are only made if the face name is preceded or followed "
"by the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">face</samp>&rsquo;.  In that case, "
