# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Drag-and-Drop.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-drag-and-drop\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-drag-and-drop\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Drag-and-Drop.html
msgid ""
"Data transferred by drag and drop is generally either plain text or a list "
"of URLs designating files or other resources.  When text is dropped, it is "
"inserted at the location of the drop, with recourse to saving it into the "
"kill ring if that is not possible."
msgstr ""
"ドラッグ＆ドロップで転送されるデータは、一般的にプレーンテキストか、ファイル"
"やその他のリソースを指定するURLのリストのいずれかです。テキストをドロップする"
"と、その位置に挿入され、それが不可能な場合はキルリングに保存されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Drag-and-Drop.html
msgid ""
"URLs dropped are supplied to pertinent <em class=\"dfn\">DND handler "
"functions</em> in the variable <code class=\"code\">dnd-protocol-alist</"
"code>, or alternatively &ldquo;URL handlers&rdquo; as set forth by the "
"variables <code class=\"code\">browse-url-handlers</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">browse-url-default-handlers</code>; absent matching handlers "
"of either type, they are treated as plain text and inserted in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ドロップされたURLは、変数<code class=\"code\">dnd-protocol-alist</code>を介し"
"て該当する<em class=\"dfn\">DNDハンドラ関数</em>に、あるいは変数<code "
"class=\"code\">browse-url-handlers</code>および<code class=\"code\">browse-"
"url-default-handlers</code>で定義される「URLハンドラ」に渡されます。いずれの"
"タイプの対応するハンドラも存在しない場合は、プレーンテキストとして扱われ、"
"バッファに挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Drag-and-Drop.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dnd-protocol-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"dnd_002dprotocol_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
