#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"<span>43.23 Dynamically Loaded Libraries<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Dynamically-Loaded-Libraries\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>43.23 動的にロードされるライブラリ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Dynamically-Loaded-Libraries\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dynamic-libraries\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dynamic-libraries\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">dynamically loaded library</em> is a library that is "
"loaded on demand, when its facilities are first needed.  Emacs supports such "
"on-demand loading of support libraries for some of its features."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">動的ロードライブラリ</em>とは、その機能が初めて必要になった"
"際に、オンデマンドでロードされるライブラリのことです。Emacsでは、一部の機能向"
"けに、サポートライブラリのこのようなオンデマンドロードをサポートしています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dynamic-library-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dynamic_002dlibrary_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dynamic-library-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dynamic_002dlibrary_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"This is an alist of dynamic libraries and external library files "
"implementing them."
msgstr ""
"これは、動的ライブラリと、それらを実装する外部ライブラリファイルのalistです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"Each element is a list of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">library</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">files</var>&hellip;)</"
"code>, where the <code class=\"code\">car</code> is a symbol representing a "
"supported external library, and the rest are strings giving alternate "
"filenames for that library."
msgstr ""
"各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">library</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">files</var>&hellip;)</code> 形式のリストであり、ここで <code "
"class=\"code\">car</code> はサポートされている外部ライブラリを表すシンボル、"
"それ以外はそのライブラリの代替ファイル名を示す文字列となっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"Emacs tries to load the library from the files in the order they appear in "
"the list; if none is found, the Emacs session won&rsquo;t have access to "
"that library, and the features it provides will be unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、リストに並んでいる順にファイルからライブラリを読み込もうとします。も"
"し一つも見つからない場合、Emacsセッションはそのライブラリにアクセスできず、提"
"供される機能も利用できなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"Image support on some platforms uses this facility.  Here&rsquo;s an example "
"of setting this variable for supporting images on MS-Windows:"
msgstr ""
"一部のプラットフォームにおける画像サポートでは、この機能が利用されています。"
"以下に、MS-Windowsで画像サポートを有効にするためのこの変数の設定例を示しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq dynamic-library-alist\n"
"      '((xpm &quot;libxpm.dll&quot; &quot;xpm4.dll&quot; &quot;libXpm-nox4.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (png &quot;libpng12d.dll&quot; &quot;libpng12.dll&quot; &quot;libpng.dll&quot;\n"
"             &quot;libpng13d.dll&quot; &quot;libpng13.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (jpeg &quot;jpeg62.dll&quot; &quot;libjpeg.dll&quot; &quot;jpeg-62.dll&quot;\n"
"              &quot;jpeg.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (tiff &quot;libtiff3.dll&quot; &quot;libtiff.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (gif &quot;giflib4.dll&quot; &quot;libungif4.dll&quot; &quot;libungif.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (svg &quot;librsvg-2-2.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (gdk-pixbuf &quot;libgdk_pixbuf-2.0-0.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (glib &quot;libglib-2.0-0.dll&quot;)\n"
"        (gobject &quot;libgobject-2.0-0.dll&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"Note that image types <code class=\"code\">pbm</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">xbm</code> do not need entries in this variable because they "
"do not depend on external libraries and are always available in Emacs."
msgstr ""
"なお、画像タイプ <code class=\"code\">pbm</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">xbm</code> は外部ライブラリに依存せず、Emacs で常に利用可能で"
"あるため、この変数にエントリを設ける必要はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"Also note that this variable is not meant to be a generic facility for "
"accessing external libraries; only those already known by Emacs can be "
"loaded through it."
msgstr ""
"また、この変数は外部ライブラリにアクセスするための汎用的な仕組みとして意図さ"
"れたものではなく、Emacsが既に認識しているライブラリのみを読み込める点にご注意"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Libraries.html
msgid ""
"This variable is ignored if the given <var class=\"var\">library</var> is "
"statically linked into Emacs."
msgstr ""
"指定された <var class=\"var\">library</var> が Emacs に静的にリンクされている"
"場合、この変数は無視されます。"

