#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.11 Emacs Dynamic Modules<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Emacs-"
"Dynamic-Modules\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.11 Emacs 動的モジュール<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Emacs-"
"Dynamic-Modules\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dynamic-modules\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dynamic-modules\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">dynamic Emacs module</em> is a shared library that "
"provides additional functionality for use in Emacs Lisp programs, just like "
"a package written in Emacs Lisp would."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">動的なEmacsモジュール</em>とは、Emacs Lispで記述されたパッ"
"ケージと同様に、Emacs Lispプログラムで利用するための追加機能を提供する共有ラ"
"イブラリのことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"Functions that load Emacs Lisp packages can also load dynamic modules.  They "
"recognize dynamic modules by looking at their file-name extension, a.k.a. "
"&ldquo;suffix&rdquo;.  This suffix is platform-dependent."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispパッケージを読み込む関数は、動的モジュールも読み込むことができま"
"す。これらの関数は、動的モジュールのファイル名の拡張子（いわゆる「サフィック"
"ス」）を参照して識別します。このサフィックスはプラットフォームに依存します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">module-file-suffix</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"module_002dfile_002dsuffix\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">module-file-suffix</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"module_002dfile_002dsuffix\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds the system-dependent value of the file-name extension of "
"the module files.  Its value is <samp class=\"file\">.so</samp> on POSIX "
"hosts, <samp class=\"file\">.dylib</samp> on macOS, and <samp "
"class=\"file\">.dll</samp> on MS-Windows."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、モジュールファイルのファイル名拡張子のシステム依存の値が格納さ"
"れます。その値は、POSIXホストでは <samp class=\"file\">.so</samp>、macOSでは "
"<samp class=\"file\">.dylib</samp>、MS-Windowsでは <samp "
"class=\"file\">.dll</samp> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"On macOS, dynamic modules can also have the suffix <samp class=\"file\">.so</"
"samp> in addition to <samp class=\"file\">.dylib</samp>."
msgstr ""
"macOSでは、動的モジュールに<samp class=\"file\">.dylib</samp>に加えて<samp "
"class=\"file\">.so</samp>というサフィックスを付けることもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emacs_005fmodule_005finit\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-plugin_005fis_005fGPL_005fcompatible\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emacs_005fmodule_005finit\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-plugin_005fis_005fGPL_005fcompatible\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"Every dynamic module should export a C-callable function named <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs_module_init</code>, which Emacs will call as part of "
"the call to <code class=\"code\">load</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">require</code> which loads the module.  It should also export "
"a symbol named <code class=\"code\">plugin_is_GPL_compatible</code> to "
"indicate that its code is released under the GPL or compatible license; "
"Emacs will signal an error if your program tries to load modules that "
"don&rsquo;t export such a symbol."
msgstr ""
"すべての動的モジュールは、<code class=\"code\">emacs_module_init</code> とい"
"う名前の C から呼び出し可能な関数をエクスポートする必要があります。Emacs は、"
"モジュールをロードする <code class=\"code\">load</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">require</code> の呼び出しの一環として、この関数を呼び出しま"
"す。また、コードが GPL または互換ライセンスの下で公開されていることを示すた"
"め、<code class=\"code\">plugin_is_GPL_compatible</code> という名前のシンボル"
"もエクスポートする必要があります。プログラムがこのようなシンボルをエクスポー"
"トしていないモジュールをロードしようとした場合、Emacs はエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"If a module needs to call Emacs functions, it should do so through the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">API</abbr> (Application Programming Interface) defined and "
"documented in the header file <samp class=\"file\">emacs-module.h</samp> "
"that is part of the Emacs distribution.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Writing-Dynamic-Modules.html\">Writing Dynamically-Loaded Modules</"
"a>, for details of using that API when writing your own modules."
msgstr ""
