msgstr ""
"<span>23.18.8 簡単メニュー<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Easy-Menu-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"The following macro provides a convenient way to define pop-up menus and/or "
"menu bar menus."
msgstr ""
"以下のマクロを使用すると、ポップアップメニューやメニューバーメニューを手軽に"
"定義できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">easy-menu-define</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol "
"maps doc menu</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"easy_002dmenu_002ddefine\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">easy-menu-define</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol "
"maps doc menu</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"easy_002dmenu_002ddefine\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"This macro defines a pop-up menu and/or menu bar submenu, whose contents are "
"given by <var class=\"var\">menu</var>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">menu</var> で内容が指定されるポップアップメ"
"ニューおよび/またはメニューバーのサブメニューを定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it should be a symbol; then this macro defines <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var> as a function for popping up the menu (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Pop_002dUp-Menus.html\">Pop-Up Menus</a>), with <var "
"class=\"var\">doc</var> as its documentation string.  It also defines <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> as a variable whose value is the menu.  <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> should not be quoted."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合"
"はシンボルである必要があります。このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var> をメニューをポップアップ表示するための関数（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Pop_002dUp-Menus.html\">ポップアップメニュー</a> を参照）として定義"
"し、<var class=\"var\">doc</var> をそのドキュメント文字列とします。また、"
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> をメニューを値とする変数として定義します。"
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> はクォートで囲まないものとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"Regardless of the value of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>, if <var "
"class=\"var\">maps</var> is a keymap, the menu is added to that keymap, as a "
"top-level menu for the menu bar (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-"
"Bar.html\">The Menu Bar</a>).  It can also be a list of keymaps, in which "
"case the menu is added separately to each of those keymaps."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の値にかかわらず、<var class=\"var\">maps</"
"var> がキーマップである場合、メニューはメニューバーのトップレベルメニューとし"
"て、そのキーマップに追加されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-Bar.html\">"
"メニューバー</a>を参照）。また、キーマップのリストである場合もあり、その場合"
"はメニューがそれぞれのキーマップに個別に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"The first element of <var class=\"var\">menu</var> must be a string, which "
"serves as the menu label.  It may be followed by any number of the following "
"keyword-argument pairs:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">menu</var> の最初の要素は文字列である必要があり、これがメ"
"ニューラベルとなります。その後には、以下のキーワード引数ペアを任意の数だけ続"
"けることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:filter <var class=\"var\">function</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:filter <var class=\"var\">function</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> must be a function which, if called with "
"one argument&mdash;the list of the other menu items&mdash;returns the actual "
"items to be displayed in the menu."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> は、1つの引数（他のメニュー項目のリスト）を"
"指定して呼び出された際に、メニューに表示すべき実際の項目を返す関数である必要"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:visible <var class=\"var\">include</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:visible <var class=\"var\">include</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">include</var> is an expression; if it evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the menu is made invisible.  <code "
"class=\"code\">:included</code> is an alias for <code "
"class=\"code\">:visible</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">include</var> は式であり、これが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> と評価された場合、メニューは非表示になります。  "
"<code class=\"code\">:included</code> は <code class=\"code\">:visible</"
"code> のエイリアスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:active <var class=\"var\">enable</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:active <var class=\"var\">enable</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">enable</var> is an expression; if it evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the menu is not selectable.  <code "
"class=\"code\">:enable</code> is an alias for <code class=\"code\">:active</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">enable</var> は式で、これが <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> と評価される場合、メニューは選択できません。  <code "
"class=\"code\">:enable</code> は <code class=\"code\">:active</code> のエイリ"
"アスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "The remaining elements in <var class=\"var\">menu</var> are menu items."
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">menu</var> の残りの要素はメニュー項目です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"A menu item can be a vector of three elements, <code class=\"code\">[<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> <var class=\"var\">callback</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">enable</var>]</code>.  <var class=\"var\">name</var> is the "
"menu item name (a string).  <var class=\"var\">callback</var> is a command "
"to run, or an expression to evaluate, when the item is chosen.  <var "
"class=\"var\">enable</var> is an expression; if it evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the item is disabled for selection."
msgstr ""
"メニュー項目は、3つの要素からなるベクトル <code class=\"code\">[<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> <var class=\"var\">callback</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">enable</var>]</code> で表されます。<var class=\"var\">name</"
"var> はメニュー項目名（文字列）です。<var class=\"var\">callback</var> は、項"
"目が選択された際に実行するコマンド、または評価する式です。<var "
"class=\"var\">enable</var> は式であり、これが <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> と評価される場合、その項目は選択不可となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "Alternatively, a menu item may have the form:"
