msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:keys <var class=\"var\">keys</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">keys</var> is a string to display as keyboard equivalent "
"to the menu item.  This is normally not needed, as keyboard equivalents are "
"computed automatically.  <var class=\"var\">keys</var> is expanded with "
"<code class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code> before it is displayed "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys-in-Documentation.html\">Substituting Key "
"Bindings in Documentation</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keys</var> は、メニュー項目のキーボード相当として表示する"
"文字列です。通常、キーボード相当は自動的に算出されるため、この指定は不要で"
"す。<var class=\"var\">keys</var> は、表示される前に <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code> で展開されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys-in-Documentation.html\">ドキュメント内でのキーバ"
"インドの置換</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:key-sequence <var class=\"var\">keys</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:key-sequence <var class=\"var\">keys</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">keys</var> is a hint indicating which key sequence to "
"display as keyboard equivalent, in case the command is bound to several key "
"sequences.  It has no effect if <var class=\"var\">keys</var> is not bound "
"to same command as this menu item."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keys</var> は、コマンドが複数のキーシーケンスに割り当てら"
"れている場合に、どのキーシーケンスをキーボード相当として表示するかを示すヒン"
"トです。<var class=\"var\">keys</var> がこのメニュー項目と同じコマンドに割り"
"当てられていない場合は、効果はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">enable</var> is an expression; if it evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the item is made unselectable.  <code "
"class=\"code\">:enable</code> is an alias for <code class=\"code\">:active</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">enable</var> は式であり、これが <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> と評価される場合、その項目は選択不能になります。  <code "
"class=\"code\">:enable</code> は <code class=\"code\">:active</code> のエイリ"
"アスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">include</var> is an expression; if it evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the item is made invisible.  <code "
"class=\"code\">:included</code> is an alias for <code "
"class=\"code\">:visible</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">include</var> は式であり、これが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> と評価される場合、その項目は非表示になります。  "
"<code class=\"code\">:included</code> は <code class=\"code\">:visible</"
"code> のエイリアスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:label <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:label <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">form</var> is an expression that is evaluated to obtain a "
"value which serves as the menu item&rsquo;s label (the default is <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">form</var> は、メニュー項目のラベルとなる値を得るために評"
"価される式です（デフォルトは <var class=\"var\">name</var> です）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:suffix <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:suffix <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">form</var> is an expression that is dynamically evaluated "
"and whose value is concatenated with the menu entry&rsquo;s label."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">form</var> は動的に評価される式であり、その値がメニュー項"
"目のラベルと連結されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:style <var class=\"var\">style</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:style <var class=\"var\">style</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">style</var> is a symbol describing the type of menu item; "
"it should be <code class=\"code\">toggle</code> (a checkbox), or <code "
"class=\"code\">radio</code> (a radio button), or anything else (meaning an "
"ordinary menu item)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">style</var> はメニュー項目の種類を表す記号で、<code "
"class=\"code\">toggle</code>（チェックボックス）、<code "
"class=\"code\">radio</code>（ラジオボタン）、あるいはそれ以外（通常のメニュー"
"項目）である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:selected <var class=\"var\">selected</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:selected <var class=\"var\">selected</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">selected</var> is an expression; the checkbox or radio "
"button is selected whenever the expression&rsquo;s value is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">selected</var> は式であり、式の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合にチェックボックスまたはラジオボタン"
"が選択されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:help <var class=\"var\">help</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:help <var class=\"var\">help</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">help</var> is a string describing the menu item."
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">help</var> はメニュー項目を説明する文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, a menu item can be a string.  Then that string appears in the "
"menu as unselectable text.  A string consisting of dashes is displayed as a "
"separator (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-Separators.html\">Menu "
"Separators</a>)."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、メニュー項目を文字列にすることもできます。その場合、その文字列は選"
"択不能なテキストとしてメニューに表示されます。ハイフンで構成される文字列は、"
"区切り文字として表示されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-"
"Separators.html\">メニューの区切り文字</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, a menu item can be a list with the same format as <var "
"class=\"var\">menu</var>.  This is a submenu."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、メニュー項目を <var class=\"var\">menu</var> と同じ形式のリストにす"
"ることもできます。これはサブメニューです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using <code class=\"code\">easy-menu-define</code> to "
"define a menu similar to the one defined in the example in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Menu-Bar.html\">The Menu Bar</a>:"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Menu-Bar.html\">メニューバー</a>の例で定義されている"
"ものと同様のメニューを<code class=\"code\">easy-menu-define</code>を用いて定"
"義する例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Easy-Menu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(easy-menu-define words-menu global-map\n"
