# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo-area-customization\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo-area-customization\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid "These variables control details of how the echo area works."
msgstr "これらの変数は、エコー領域の動作の詳細を制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">cursor-in-echo-area</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"cursor_002din_002decho_002darea\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">cursor-in-echo-area</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"cursor_002din_002decho_002darea\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls where the cursor appears when a message is displayed "
"in the echo area.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the "
"cursor appears at the end of the message.  Otherwise, the cursor appears at "
"point&mdash;not in the echo area at all."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、エコー領域にメッセージが表示される際のカーソルの位置を制御しま"
"す。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、カーソルはメッセージの末"
"尾に表示されます。それ以外の場合、カーソルは point に表示されます――エコー領域"
"には一切表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"The value is normally <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; Lisp programs bind it "
"to <code class=\"code\">t</code> for brief periods of time."
msgstr ""
"この値は通常 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ですが、Lispプログラムは短期間、"
"これを <code class=\"code\">t</code> にバインドします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">echo-area-clear-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"echo_002darea_002dclear_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">echo-area-clear-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"echo_002darea_002dclear_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This normal hook is run whenever the echo area is cleared&mdash;either by "
"<code class=\"code\">(message nil)</code> or for any other reason."
msgstr ""
"この通常のフックは、<code class=\"code\">(message nil)</code>による場合やその"
"他の理由でエコー領域がクリアされるたびに実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">echo-keystrokes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"echo_002dkeystrokes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">echo-keystrokes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-echo_002dkeystrokes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This variable determines how much time should elapse before command "
"characters echo.  Its value must be a number, and specifies the number of "
"seconds to wait before echoing.  If the user types a prefix key (such as "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>) and then delays this many seconds before "
"continuing, the prefix key is echoed in the echo area.  (Once echoing begins "
"in a key sequence, all subsequent characters in the same key sequence are "
"echoed immediately.)"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、コマンド文字がエコーされるまでに経過させる時間を決定します。その"
"値は数値である必要があり、エコーされるまで待機する秒数を指定します。ユーザー"
"がプレフィックスキー（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>など）を入力し、その後この"
"秒数分だけ待機してから入力を続けると、そのプレフィックスキーがエコー領域にエ"
"コーされます。（キーシーケンスでエコーが開始されると、同じキーシーケンス内の"
"それ以降のすべての文字が即座にエコーされます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid "If the value is zero, then command input is not echoed."
msgstr "値が0の場合、コマンド入力はエコーされません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">message-truncate-lines</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-message_002dtruncate_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">message-truncate-lines</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-message_002dtruncate_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"Normally, displaying a long message resizes the echo area to display the "
"entire message, wrapping long line as needed.  But if the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">message-truncate-lines</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, long lines of echo-area message are instead "
"truncated to fit the mini-window width."
msgstr ""
"通常、長いメッセージを表示すると、エコー領域のサイズが調整されてメッセージ全"
"体が表示され、必要に応じて長い行が折り返されます。しかし、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">message-truncate-lines</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、エコー領域のメッセージの長い行は、代わりにミニウィンドウの"
"幅に合わせて切り捨てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Echo-Area-Customization.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">max-mini-window-height</code>, which "
"specifies the maximum height for resizing minibuffer windows, also applies "
"to the echo area (which is really a special use of the minibuffer window; "
"see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Windows.html\">Minibuffer Windows</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファウィンドウのリサイズにおける最大高さを指定する変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">max-mini-window-height</code> は、エコーエリアにも適用されます"
"（エコーエリアは実質的にミニバッファウィンドウの特殊な用途です。<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Windows.html\">ミニバッファウィンドウ</a> "
"を参照してください）。"

