msgstr ""
"<span>19.2.14.2 Edebug表示の更新<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Edebug-"
"Display-Update-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Edebug-and-display-updates\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-updates_002c-and-Edebug\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Edebug-and-display-updates\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-updates_002c-and-Edebug\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"When Edebug needs to display something (e.g., in trace mode), it saves the "
"current window configuration from outside Edebug (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">Window Configurations</a>).  When you "
"exit Edebug, it restores the previous window configuration."
msgstr ""
"Edebugが何らかの表示を行う必要がある場合（例：トレースモード時）、Edebug外部"
"から現在のウィンドウ設定を保存します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ設定</a>を参照）。Edebugを終了すると、以前の"
"ウィンドウ設定が復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"Emacs redisplays only when it pauses.  Usually, when you continue execution, "
"the program re-enters Edebug at a breakpoint or after stepping, without "
"pausing or reading input in between.  In such cases, Emacs never gets a "
"chance to redisplay the outside configuration.  Consequently, what you see "
"is the same window configuration as the last time Edebug was active, with no "
"interruption."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが再表示を行うのは、一時停止したときのみです。通常、実行を再開すると、プ"
"ログラムは途中で一時停止したり入力を読んだりすることなく、ブレークポイントや"
"ステップ実行後に再びEdebugに入ります。このような場合、Emacsが外部設定を再表示"
"する機会は得られません。その結果、表示されるのは、中断なく前回Edebugがアク"
"ティブだったときと同じウィンドウ設定になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"Entry to Edebug for displaying something also saves and restores the "
"following data (though some of them are deliberately not restored if an "
"error or quit signal occurs)."
msgstr ""
"何かを表示するために Edebug に入ると、以下のデータも保存・復元されます（ただ"
"し、エラーや終了シグナルが発生した場合には、一部のデータは意図的に復元されま"
"せん）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current-buffer-point-and-mark-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> Which buffer is current, and the positions of point "
"and the mark in the current buffer, are saved and restored."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current-buffer-point-and-mark-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> 現在のバッファと、現在のバッファにおけるポイントおよ"
"びマークの位置が保存・復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-configuration-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> The outside window configuration is saved and "
"restored if <code class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-"
"Options.html\">Edebug Options</a>).  If the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> is a list, only the listed windows "
"are saved and restored."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-configuration-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <code class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、外部ウィンドウ構成が保存および復"
"元されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</"
"a> を参照）。<code class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> の値がリストであ"
"る場合は、リストに指定されたウィンドウのみが保存および復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"The window configuration is not restored on error or quit, but the outside "
"selected window <em class=\"emph\">is</em> reselected even on error or quit "
"in case a <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> is active."
msgstr ""
"エラーや終了時にウィンドウ構成は復元されませんが、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> が有効な場合は、エラーや終了時であっても外側で選択されていた"
"ウィンドウが<em class=\"emph\">再選択されます</em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"The window start and horizontal scrolling of the source code buffer are not "
"restored, however, so that the display remains coherent within Edebug."
msgstr ""
"ただし、Edebug内での表示の整合性を保つため、ウィンドウの開始位置とソースコー"
"ドバッファの水平スクロールは復元されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-point-changed-by-Edebug\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Edebug-overwrites-buffer-point-"
"position\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-point-changed-by-Edebug\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Edebug-overwrites-buffer-point-"
"position\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"Saving and restoring the outside window configuration can sometimes change "
"the positions of point in the buffers on which the Lisp program you are "
"debugging operates, especially if your program moves point.  If this happens "
"and interferes with your debugging, we recommend to set <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</a>)."
msgstr ""
"外部ウィンドウの設定を保存・復元すると、デバッグ対象のLispプログラムが動作す"
"るバッファ内のポイント位置が変更されることがあります。特に、プログラムがポイ"
"ントを移動させる場合にこの現象が起こりやすくなります。このような現象が発生"
"し、デバッグの妨げになる場合は、<code class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定することを推奨します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</a> を参照してく"
"ださい）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"The value of point in each displayed buffer is saved and restored if <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-save-displayed-buffer-points</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"各表示バッファにおけるポイントの値は保存され、<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"save-displayed-buffer-points</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない"
"場合には復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overlay_002darrow_002dposition-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"overlay_002darrow_002dstring-_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> The variables <code "
"class=\"code\">overlay-arrow-position</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">overlay-arrow-string</code> are saved and restored, so you "
"can safely invoke Edebug from the recursive edit elsewhere in the same "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overlay_002darrow_002dposition-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"overlay_002darrow_002dstring-_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> 変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">overlay-arrow-position</code> と <code class=\"code\">overlay-"
"arrow-string</code> は保存・復元されるため、同じバッファ内の別の場所にある再"
"帰的な編集箇所からでも、安全に Edebug を呼び出すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Display-Update.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cursor_002din_002decho_002darea-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <code class=\"code\">cursor-in-echo-area</code> is "
"locally bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> so that the cursor shows up "
"in the window."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cursor_002din_002decho_002darea-"
"_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <code class=\"code\">cursor-in-echo-area</code> は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> にローカルにバインドされており、これにより"
"カーソルがウィンドウ内に表示されます。"

