# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.2.9 Evaluation<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Evaluation-2\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.2.9 評価<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Evaluation-2\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Eval.html
msgid ""
"While within Edebug, you can evaluate expressions as if Edebug were not "
"running.  Edebug tries to be invisible to the expression&rsquo;s evaluation "
"and printing.  Evaluation of expressions that cause side effects will work "
"as expected, except for changes to data that Edebug explicitly saves and "
"restores.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"The-Outside-Context.html\">The "
"Outside Context</a>, for details on this process."
msgstr ""
"Edebugの実行中であっても、Edebugが動作していないときと同様に式を評価できま"
"す。Edebugは、式の評価や出力に影響を与えないよう努めます。副作用を引き起こす"
"式の評価は、Edebugが明示的に保存・復元するデータへの変更を除き、期待通りに動"
"作します。このプロセスの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"The-Outside-"
"Context.html\">外部コンテキスト</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002deval_002dexpression\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">e <var class=\"var\">exp</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002deval_002dexpression\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002deval_002dexpression\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">e <var class=\"var\">exp</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002deval_002dexpression\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Eval.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate expression <var class=\"var\">exp</var> in the context outside of "
"Edebug (<code class=\"code\">edebug-eval-expression</code>).  That is, "
"Edebug tries to minimize its interference with the evaluation.  The result "
"is shown in the echo area, or, if this command is given a prefix, pop up a "
"new buffer and pretty-print the result there."
msgstr ""
"Edebug 以外のコンテキスト (<code class=\"code\">edebug-eval-expression</"
"code>) で式 <var class=\"var\">exp</var> を評価します。つまり、Edebug は評価"
"への干渉を最小限に抑えようとします。結果は echo 領域に表示されます。また、こ"
"のコマンドにプレフィックスが指定されている場合は、新しいバッファをポップアッ"
"プし、そこに結果を見やすく表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Eval.html
msgid ""
"By default, this command suppresses the debugger during evaluation, so that "
"an error in the evaluated expression won&rsquo;t add a new error on top of "
"the existing one.  Set the <code class=\"code\">debug-allow-recursive-debug</"
"code> user option (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Error-"
"Debugging.html\">Entering the Debugger on an Error</a>) to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value to override this."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、このコマンドは評価中にデバッガを抑制します。これにより、評価"
"対象の式にエラーが発生しても、既存のエラーの上に新たなエラーが追加されること"
"はありません。この動作を上書きするには、ユーザーオプション <code "
"class=\"code\">debug-allow-recursive-debug</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Error-Debugging.html\">エラー発生時のデバッガ起動</a>を参照）を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Eval.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-eval_002dexpression-_0028Edebug_0029-1\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-: <var class=\"var\">exp</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-eval_002dexpression-"
