# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Edebug-execution-modes\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Edebug-execution-modes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Edebug supports several execution modes for running the program you are "
"debugging.  We call these alternatives <em class=\"dfn\">Edebug execution "
"modes</em>; do not confuse them with major or minor modes.  The current "
"Edebug execution mode determines how far Edebug continues execution before "
"stopping&mdash;whether it stops at each stop point, or continues to the next "
"breakpoint, for example&mdash;and how much Edebug displays the progress of "
"the evaluation before it stops."
msgstr ""
"Edebugでは、デバッグ対象のプログラムを実行するための複数の実行モードが用意さ"
"れています。これらの選択肢を<em class=\"dfn\">Edebug実行モード</em>と呼びま"
"す。メジャーモードやマイナーモードと混同しないようご注意ください。現在の"
"Edebug実行モードによって、Edebugが停止するまでどこまで実行を継続するか（例え"
"ば、各停止ポイントで停止するのか、あるいは次のブレークポイントまで継続するの"
"か）、および停止前に評価の進捗状況をどの程度表示するかが決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Normally, you specify the Edebug execution mode by typing a command to "
"continue the program in a certain mode.  Here is a table of these commands; "
"all except for <kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd> resume execution of the program, "
"at least for a certain distance."
msgstr ""
"通常、Edebug実行モードは、プログラムを特定のモードで続行するためのコマンドを"
"入力することで指定します。以下にこれらのコマンドの一覧を示します。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">S</kbd>を除くすべてのコマンドは、少なくとも一定の距離までプログ"
"ラムの実行を再開します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dstop\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dstop\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dstop\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dstop\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Stop: don&rsquo;t execute any more of the program, but wait for more Edebug "
"commands (<code class=\"code\">edebug-stop</code>)."
msgstr ""
"停止: プログラムの実行をこれ以上行わず、さらなる Edebug コマンド (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-stop</code>) を待機してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dstep_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dstep_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dstep_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dstep_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Step: stop at the next stop point encountered (<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"step-mode</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ステップ：次に遭遇する停止地点（<code class=\"code\">edebug-step-mode</"
"code>）で停止する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dnext_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">n</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dnext_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dnext_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">n</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dnext_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Next: stop at the next stop point encountered after an expression (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-next-mode</code>).  Also see <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-forward-sexp</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Jumping.html\">Jumping</a>."
msgstr ""
"次：式 (<code class=\"code\">edebug-next-mode</code>) の後に現れる次の停止点"
"で停止します。また、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Jumping.html\">Jumping</a> の "
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-forward-sexp</code> も参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dtrace_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">t</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dtrace_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dtrace_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">t</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dtrace_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Trace: pause (normally one second) at each Edebug stop point (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-trace-mode</code>)."
msgstr ""
"トレース: 各Edebug停止ポイント (<code class=\"code\">edebug-trace-mode</"
"code>) で一時停止（通常は1秒）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dTrace_002dfast_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">T</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dTrace_002dfast_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
