"edebug_002dTrace_002dfast_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Rapid trace: update the display at each stop point, but don&rsquo;t actually "
"pause (<code class=\"code\">edebug-Trace-fast-mode</code>)."
