"class=\"code\">edebug-Trace-fast-mode</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dgo_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">g</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dgo_002dmode\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dgo_002dmode\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">g</"
