# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Go: run until the next breakpoint (<code class=\"code\">edebug-go-mode</"
