# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Go non-stop: ignore breakpoints (<code class=\"code\">edebug-Go-nonstop-"
"mode</code>).  You can still stop the program by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">S</kbd>, or any editing command."
msgstr ""
"ノンストップで実行：ブレークポイント (<code class=\"code\">edebug-Go-nonstop-"
"mode</code>) は無視されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd> や任意の編集コマンド"
"を入力すれば、引き続きプログラムを停止できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"In general, the execution modes earlier in the above list run the program "
"more slowly or stop sooner than the modes later in the list."
msgstr ""
"一般的に、上記のリストの前半にある実行モードは、後半のモードに比べてプログラ"
"ムの動作が遅かったり、より早く停止したりします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"When you enter a new Edebug level, Edebug will normally stop at the first "
"instrumented function it encounters.  If you prefer to stop only at a break "
"point, or not at all (for example, when gathering coverage data), change the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">edebug-initial-mode</code> from its default "
"<code class=\"code\">step</code> to <code class=\"code\">go</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">Go-nonstop</code>, or one of its other values (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</a>).  You can "
"do this readily with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a C-m</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-set-initial-mode</code>):"
msgstr ""
"新しいEdebugレベルに入ると、通常、Edebugは最初に検出したインストルメンテー"
"ション済み関数で停止します。ブレークポイントでのみ停止させたい場合や、全く停"
"止させたくない場合（例えばカバレッジデータを収集する場合など）は、<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-initial-mode</code>の値をデフォルトの<code "
"class=\"code\">step</code>から<code class=\"code\">go</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">Go-nonstop</code>、またはその他の値に変更してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</a>を参照）。これ"
"は<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a C-m</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edebug-set-"
"initial-mode</code>)を使用することで簡単に行えます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-set-initial-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dset_002dinitial_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-set-initial-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dset_002dinitial_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002da-C_002dm\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002da-C_002dm\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This command, bound to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a C-m</kbd>, sets <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-initial-mode</code>.  It prompts you for a key to "
"indicate the mode.  You should enter one of the eight keys listed above, "
"which sets the corresponding mode."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a C-m</kbd> にバインドされたこのコマンドは、<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-initial-mode</code> を設定します。モードを指定するため"
"のキーの入力が求められます。上記に挙げた8つのキーのいずれかを入力すると、対応"
"するモードが設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Note that you may reenter the same Edebug level several times if, for "
"example, an instrumented function is called several times from one command."
msgstr ""
"なお、例えば1つのコマンドから計測対象関数が複数回呼び出される場合など、同じ"
"Edebugレベルに複数回再進入することがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"While executing or tracing, you can interrupt the execution by typing any "
"Edebug command.  Edebug stops the program at the next stop point and then "
"executes the command you typed.  For example, typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">t</"
"kbd> during execution switches to trace mode at the next stop point.  You "
"can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd> to stop execution without doing anything "
"else."
msgstr ""
"実行中またはトレース中に、任意のEdebugコマンドを入力することで実行を中断でき"
"ます。Edebugは次の停止点でプログラムを停止し、入力したコマンドを実行します。"
"例えば、実行中に<kbd class=\"kbd\">t</kbd>と入力すると、次の停止点でトレース"
"モードに切り替わります。また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd>を使用すれば、他に何"
"も操作することなく実行を停止できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"If your function happens to read input, a character you type intending to "
"interrupt execution may be read by the function instead.  You can avoid such "
"unintended results by paying attention to when your program wants input."
msgstr ""
"関数が入力を読み取る場合、実行を中断させるつもりで入力した文字が、代わりに関"
"数によって読み取られてしまうことがあります。プログラムがいつ入力を必要とする"
"かに注意を払うことで、こうした意図しない結果を避けることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-macros-_0028Edebug_0029\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-macros-_0028Edebug_0029\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Keyboard macros containing the commands in this section do not completely "
"work: exiting from Edebug, to resume the program, loses track of the "
"keyboard macro.  This is not easy to fix.  Also, defining or executing a "
"keyboard macro outside of Edebug does not affect commands inside Edebug.  "
"This is usually an advantage.  See also the <code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"continue-kbd-macro</code> option in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Edebug-"
"Options.html\">Edebug Options</a>."
msgstr ""
"本セクションのコマンドを含むキーボードマクロは、完全には動作しません。Edebug"
"から終了してプログラムを再開すると、キーボードマクロの追跡が途切れてしまいま"
"す。これを修正するのは容易ではありません。また、Edebug外でキーボードマクロを"
"定義または実行しても、Edebug内のコマンドには影響しません。これは通常、利点と"
"なります。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebugオプション</a>"
"の<code class=\"code\">edebug-continue-kbd-macro</code>オプションも参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-sit-for-seconds</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dsit_002dfor_002dseconds\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-sit-for-seconds</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dsit_002dfor_002dseconds\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Execution-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This option specifies how many seconds to wait between execution steps in "
"trace mode or continue mode.  The default is 1 second."
msgstr ""
"このオプションでは、トレースモードまたは継続モードにおける実行ステップ間の待"
"機時間を秒単位で指定します。デフォルトは1秒です。"

