#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.2.16 Edebug Options<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Edebug-"
"Options-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.2.16 Edebugオプション<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Edebug-"
"Options-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid "These options affect the behavior of Edebug:"
msgstr "これらのオプションはEdebugの動作に影響します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-setup-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dsetup_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-setup-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dsetup_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"Functions to call before Edebug is used.  Each time it is set to a new "
"value, Edebug will call those functions once and then reset <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-setup-hook</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"You could use this to load up Edebug specifications associated with a "
"package you are using, but only when you also use Edebug.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Instrumenting.html\">Instrumenting for Edebug</a>."
msgstr ""
"Edebug が使用される前に呼び出される関数です。新しい値が設定されるたびに、"
"Edebug はこれらの関数を1回呼び出し、その後 <code class=\"code\">edebug-setup-"
"hook</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にリセットします。これを利用し"
"て、使用しているパッケージに関連付けられた Edebug 仕様を読み込むことも可能で"
"すが、その場合は Edebug も併せて使用している必要があります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Instrumenting.html\">Edebug のインストルメンテーション"
"</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-all-defs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dall_002ddefs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-all-defs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dall_002ddefs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, normal evaluation of "
"defining forms such as <code class=\"code\">defun</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code> instruments them for Edebug.  This applies to "
"<code class=\"code\">eval-defun</code>, <code class=\"code\">eval-region</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">eval-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"これが non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">defun</code> や <code class=\"code\">defmacro</code> といった"
"定義形式の通常の評価により、Edebug 用にインストゥルメント化されます。これは "
"<code class=\"code\">eval-defun</code>、<code class=\"code\">eval-region</"
"code>、および <code class=\"code\">eval-buffer</code> にも適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"Use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x edebug-all-defs</kbd> to toggle the "
"value of this option.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Instrumenting.html\">Instrumenting for Edebug</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x edebug-all-defs</kbd> を使用して、このオプ"
"ションの値を切り替えます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Instrumenting.html\">Edebug 用のインストルメンテーション</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-all-forms</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dall_002dforms\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-all-forms</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dall_002dforms\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the commands <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-defun</code>, <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">eval-buffer</code> instrument all forms, even those "
"that don&rsquo;t define anything.  This doesn&rsquo;t apply to loading or "
"evaluations in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"これが non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、コマンド <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-defun</code>、<code class=\"code\">eval-region</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">eval-buffer</code> は、何も定義していないフォームも含"
"め、すべてのフォームに適用されます。これは、ミニバッファでの読み込みや評価に"
"は適用されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"Use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x edebug-all-forms</kbd> to toggle the "
"value of this option.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Instrumenting.html\">Instrumenting for Edebug</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x edebug-all-forms</kbd> を使用して、このオプ"
"ションの値を切り替えます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Instrumenting.html\">Edebug 用のインストルメンテーション</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-eval-macro-args</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002deval_002dmacro_002dargs-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-eval-macro-args</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002deval_002dmacro_002dargs-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"When this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, all macro arguments will "
"be instrumented in the generated code.  For any macro, the <code "
"class=\"code\">debug</code> declaration overrides this option.  So to "
"specify exceptions for macros that have some arguments evaluated and some "
"not, use the <code class=\"code\">debug</code> declaration specify an Edebug "
"form specification."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、生成されるコード内ですべて"
"のマクロ引数がインストルメンテーションされます。任意のマクロにおいて、<code "
"class=\"code\">debug</code> 宣言はこのオプションを上書きします。したがって、"
"一部の引数が評価され、一部が評価されないマクロに対して例外を指定するには、"
"<code class=\"code\">debug</code> 宣言を用いて Edebug フォームの仕様を指定し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-save-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dsave_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-save-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dsave_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Edebug saves and restores "
"the window configuration.  That takes some time, so if your program does not "
"care what happens to the window configurations, it is better to set this "
"variable to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  We also recommend to set this "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the default value causes Edebug to "
"overwrite the positions of point in buffers that are involved in the program "
"you are debugging, as result of saving and restoring the window "
"configuration; this could happen if your program moves point in one or more "
"of those buffers.  Another option to try to customize in this case is <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-save-displayed-buffer-points</code>, described below."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Edebug はウィンドウ構成を"
"保存および復元します。これには時間がかかるため、プログラムがウィンドウ構成の"
"状態を問わないのであれば、この変数を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定す"
"るのが適切です。また、デフォルト値のせいで、ウィンドウ構成の保存・復元によ"
"り、デバッグ対象のプログラムで使用されているバッファ内の point の位置が "
"Edebug によって上書きされてしまう場合は、この値を <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> に設定することを推奨します。これは、プログラムがそれらのバッファの1つ以"
"上で point を移動させた場合に起こり得ます。この場合にカスタマイズを試みるもう"
"一つの選択肢として、後述する <code class=\"code\">edebug-save-displayed-"
"buffer-points</code> があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"If the value of <code class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> is a list, "
"only the listed windows are saved and restored."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-save-windows</code> の値がリストの場合、リストに"
"指定されたウィンドウのみが保存および復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"You can use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">W</kbd> command in Edebug to change this "
"variable interactively.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Edebug-Display-"
"Update.html\">Edebug Display Update</a>."
msgstr ""
"Edebug の <kbd class=\"kbd\">W</kbd> コマンドを使用すると、この変数を対話的に"
"変更できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Edebug-Display-Update.html\">Edebug "
"ディスプレイの更新</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-save-displayed-buffer-points</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dsave_002ddisplayed_002dbuffer_002dpoints\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-save-displayed-buffer-points</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dsave_002ddisplayed_002dbuffer_002dpoints\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Edebug saves and restores "
"point in all displayed buffers."
msgstr ""
"これが non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、Edebug は表示されているす"
"べてのバッファでポイントを保存・復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"Saving and restoring point in other buffers is necessary if you are "
"debugging code that changes the buffer point (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Point.html\">Point</a>) of a buffer that is displayed in a non-"
"selected window.  If Edebug or the user then selects the window, point in "
"that buffer will move to the window&rsquo;s value of point."
msgstr ""
"選択されていないウィンドウに表示されているバッファのポイント（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Point.html\">Point</a>を参照）を変更するコードをデバッ"
"グする場合、他のバッファのポイントを保存および復元する必要があります。Edebug"
"またはユーザーがそのウィンドウを選択すると、そのバッファのポイントはウィンド"
"ウのポイント値に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"Saving and restoring point in all buffers is expensive, since it requires "
"selecting each window twice, so enable this only if you need it.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Edebug-Display-Update.html\">Edebug Display Update</a>."
msgstr ""
"すべてのバッファでポイントを保存・復元する処理は、各ウィンドウを2回選択する必"
"要があるためコストがかかります。そのため、必要な場合にのみ有効にしてくださ"
"い。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Edebug-Display-Update.html\">Edebug Display "
"Update</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-initial-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dinitial_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-initial-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dinitial_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Options.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies the "
"initial execution mode for Edebug when it is first activated.  Possible "
"values are <code class=\"code\">step</code>, <code class=\"code\">next</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">go</code>, <code class=\"code\">Go-nonstop</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">trace</code>, <code class=\"code\">Trace-fast</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">continue</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">Continue-fast</code>."
msgstr ""
