# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"When Edebug is entered and actually reads commands from the user, it saves "
"(and later restores) these additional data:"
msgstr ""
"Edebugが起動し、実際にユーザーからコマンドを読み込む際、これらの追加データを"
"保存（および後で復元）します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"The current match data.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Match-Data.html\">The "
"Match Data</a>."
msgstr ""
"現在の試合データ。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Match-Data.html\">試合データ</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"The variables <code class=\"code\">last-command</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command</code>, <code class=\"code\">last-command-event</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">last-input-event</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">last-event-frame</code>, <code class=\"code\">last-nonmenu-"
"event</code>, and <code class=\"code\">track-mouse</code>.  Commands in "
"Edebug do not affect these variables outside of Edebug."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">last-command</code>、<code class=\"code\">this-"
"command</code>、<code class=\"code\">last-command-event</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">last-input-event</code>、<code class=\"code\">last-event-"
"frame</code>、<code class=\"code\">last-nonmenu-event</code>、および <code "
"class=\"code\">track-mouse</code>。Edebug 内のコマンドは、Edebug 外ではこれら"
"の変数に影響を与えません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Executing commands within Edebug can change the key sequence that would be "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code>, and there is no "
"way to reset the key sequence from Lisp."
msgstr ""
"Edebug 内でコマンドを実行すると、<code class=\"code\">this-command-keys</"
"code> が返すキーシーケンスが変更されることがあり、Lisp 側からキーシーケンスを"
"リセットする方法はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Edebug cannot save and restore the value of <code class=\"code\">unread-"
"command-events</code>.  Entering Edebug while this variable has a nontrivial "
"value can interfere with execution of the program you are debugging."
msgstr ""
"Edebugでは<code class=\"code\">unread-command-events</code>の値を保存・復元す"
"ることができません。この変数に非自明な値が代入されている状態でEdebugに入る"
"と、デバッグ対象プログラムの実行に支障をきたす可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Complex commands executed while in Edebug are added to the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">command-history</code>.  In rare cases this can alter "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"Edebug実行中に発行された複雑なコマンドは、変数 <code class=\"code\">command-"
"history</code> に追加されます。まれに、これにより実行内容が変更されることがあ"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Within Edebug, the recursion depth appears one deeper than the recursion "
"depth outside Edebug.  This is not true of the automatically updated "
"evaluation list window."
msgstr ""
"Edebug内では、再帰深度がEdebug外よりも1段階深く表示されます。自動的に更新され"
"る評価リストウィンドウでは、この現象は起こりません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">standard-output</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">standard-input</code> are bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> by the <code class=\"code\">recursive-edit</code>, but Edebug "
"temporarily restores them during evaluations."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">standard-output</code> と <code class=\"code\">standard-"
"input</code> は <code class=\"code\">recursive-edit</code> によって <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に束縛されていますが、Edebug は評価時にこれらを一時"
"的に復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Recursive-Edit.html
msgid ""
"The state of keyboard macro definition is saved and restored.  While Edebug "
"is active, <code class=\"code\">defining-kbd-macro</code> is bound to <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-continue-kbd-macro</code>."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロ定義の状態が保存・復元されます。Edebugが有効な間、<code "
"class=\"code\">defining-kbd-macro</code>は<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"continue-kbd-macro</code>にバインドされます。"

