# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Views.html
msgid ""
"These Edebug commands let you view aspects of the buffer and window status "
"as they were before entry to Edebug.  The outside window configuration is "
"the collection of windows and contents that were in effect outside of Edebug."
msgstr ""
"これらのEdebugコマンドを使用すると、Edebugに入る前のバッファの状態やウィンド"
"ウの状態を確認できます。「外部ウィンドウ構成」とは、Edebugの外で有効だった"
"ウィンドウとコンテンツの集合のことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Views.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dview_002doutside\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">v</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dview_002doutside\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dview_002doutside\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">v</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dview_002doutside\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Views.html
msgid ""
"Switch to viewing the outside window configuration (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-view-outside</code>).  Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x X "
"w</kbd> to return to Edebug."
msgstr ""
"外部ウィンドウ構成 (<code class=\"code\">edebug-view-outside</code>) の表示に"
"切り替えます。Edebugに戻るには <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x X w</kbd> と入力してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Views.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dbounce_002dpoint\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">p</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dbounce_002dpoint\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dbounce_002dpoint\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">p</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-edebug_002dbounce_002dpoint\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Views.html
msgid ""
"Temporarily display the outside current buffer with point at its outside "
"position (<code class=\"code\">edebug-bounce-point</code>), pausing for one "
"second before returning to Edebug.  With a prefix argument <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>, pause for <var class=\"var\">n</var> seconds instead."
msgstr ""
"外部カレントバッファを、ポイントをその外部位置（<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"bounce-point</code>）に置いた状態で一時的に表示し、1秒間一時停止してから"
"Edebugに戻ります。プレフィックス引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定する"
"と、代わりに <var class=\"var\">n</var> 秒間一時停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug-Views.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dbounce_002dto_002dprevious_002dvalue\"></"
