# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid ""
"Edebug is a source-level debugger for Emacs Lisp programs, with which you "
"can:"
msgstr ""
"EdebugはEmacs Lispプログラム向けのソースレベルデバッガで、以下のことが可能で"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Step through evaluation, stopping before and after each expression."
msgstr "評価をステップ実行し、各式の前後で停止する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Set conditional or unconditional breakpoints."
msgstr "条件付きまたは無条件のブレークポイントを設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Stop when a specified condition is true (the global break event)."
msgstr ""
"指定した条件が真になったときに停止する（グローバルなブレークイベント）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid ""
"Trace slow or fast, stopping briefly at each stop point, or at each "
"breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"低速または高速でトレースし、各停止地点または各ブレークポイントで一時的に停止"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid ""
"Display expression results and evaluate expressions as if outside of Edebug."
msgstr "式の結果を表示し、Edebug の外にいるかのように式を評価する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid ""
"Automatically re-evaluate a list of expressions and display their results "
"each time Edebug updates the display."
msgstr ""
"Edebugが表示を更新するたびに、式のリストを自動的に再評価し、その結果を表示し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Output trace information on function calls and returns."
msgstr "関数呼び出しと戻りに関するトレース情報を出力する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Stop when an error occurs."
msgstr "エラーが発生したら停止してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Display a backtrace, omitting Edebug&rsquo;s own frames."
msgstr "Edebug自身のフレームを除いたバックトレースを表示する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Specify argument evaluation for macros and defining forms."
msgstr "マクロおよび定義フォームにおける引数の評価を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Edebug.html
msgid "Obtain rudimentary coverage testing and frequency counts."
msgstr "簡易的なカバレッジテストと周波数カウントを実施する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
