#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.6.3 Accessing the Entire Match Data<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Accessing-the-Entire-Match-Data\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.6.3 試合データ全体へのアクセス<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Accessing-the-Entire-Match-Data\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"The functions <code class=\"code\">match-data</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">set-match-data</code> read or write the entire match data, "
"all at once."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">match-data</code> と <code class=\"code\">set-"
"match-data</code> は、マッチデータ全体を一括して読み書きします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-data</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"integers reuse reseat</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"match_002ddata\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-data</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"integers reuse reseat</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"match_002ddata\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of positions (markers or integers) that record "
"all the information on the text that the last search matched.  Element zero "
"is the position of the beginning of the match for the whole expression; "
"element one is the position of the end of the match for the expression.  The "
"next two elements are the positions of the beginning and end of the match "
"for the first subexpression, and so on.  In general, element number 2<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> corresponds to <code class=\"code\">(match-beginning "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>; and element number 2<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> + 1 corresponds to <code class=\"code\">(match-end "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、直前の検索で一致したテキストに関するすべての情報を記録する位置"
"（マーカーまたは整数）のリストを返します。0番目の要素は式全体の一致開始位置、"
"1番目の要素は式の一致終了位置です。続く2つの要素は最初の部分式の一致開始位置"
"と終了位置であり、以降も同様です。一般に、要素番号 2<var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> は <code class=\"code\">(match-beginning <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</"
"code> に、要素番号 2<var class=\"var\">n</var> + 1 は <code "
"class=\"code\">(match-end <var class=\"var\">n</var>)</code> に対応します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"Normally all the elements are markers or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"but if <var class=\"var\">integers</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that means to use integers instead of markers.  (In that case, the "
"buffer itself is appended as an additional element at the end of the list, "
"to facilitate complete restoration of the match data.)  If the last match "
"was done on a string with <code class=\"code\">string-match</code>, then "
"integers are always used, since markers can&rsquo;t point into a string."
msgstr ""
"通常、すべての要素はマーカーまたは<code class=\"code\">nil</code>ですが、"
"<var class=\"var\">integers</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合"
"は、マーカーの代わりに整数を使用することになります。（この場合、マッチデータ"
"の完全な復元を容易にするため、バッファ自体がリストの末尾に追加要素として付加"
"されます。）直前のマッチが<code class=\"code\">string-match</code>を持つ文字"
"列に対して行われた場合は、マーカーで文字列を指すことはできないため、常に整数"
"が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">reuse</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"should be a list.  In that case, <code class=\"code\">match-data</code> "
"stores the match data in <var class=\"var\">reuse</var>.  That is, <var "
"class=\"var\">reuse</var> is destructively modified.  <var "
"class=\"var\">reuse</var> does not need to have the right length.  If it is "
"not long enough to contain the match data, it is extended.  If it is too "
"long, the length of <var class=\"var\">reuse</var> stays the same, but the "
"elements that were not used are set to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The "
"purpose of this feature is to reduce the need for garbage collection."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">reuse</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、それはリストである必要があります。その場合、<code class=\"code\">match-"
"data</code> はマッチデータを <var class=\"var\">reuse</var> に格納します。つ"
"まり、<var class=\"var\">reuse</var> は破壊的に変更されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">reuse</var> は適切な長さである必要はありません。マッチデータを"
"格納するのに十分な長さでない場合は、拡張されます。長すぎる場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">reuse</var> の長さはそのままで、使用されなかった要素は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されます。この機能の目的は、ガベージコレク"
"ションの必要性を減らすことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">reseat</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"all markers on the <var class=\"var\">reuse</var> list are reseated to point "
"to nowhere."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">reseat</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">reuse</var> リスト上のすべてのマーカーは、どこにも指さ"
"ないよう再配置される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"As always, there must be no possibility of intervening searches between the "
"call to a search function and the call to <code class=\"code\">match-data</"
"code> that is intended to access the match data for that search."
msgstr ""
"従来通り、検索関数の呼び出しと、その検索のマッチデータにアクセスするための"
"<code class=\"code\">match-data</code>の呼び出しとの間に、介在する検索が行わ"
"れる可能性があってはならない。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(match-data)\n"
"     &rArr;  (#&lt;marker at 9 in foo&gt;\n"
"          #&lt;marker at 17 in foo&gt;\n"
"          #&lt;marker at 13 in foo&gt;\n"
"          #&lt;marker at 17 in foo&gt;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-match-data</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">match-list "
"&amp;optional reseat</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dmatch_002ddata\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-match-data</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">match-list "
"&amp;optional reseat</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dmatch_002ddata\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the match data from the elements of <var "
"class=\"var\">match-list</var>, which should be a list that was the value of "
"a previous call to <code class=\"code\">match-data</code>.  (More precisely, "
"anything that has the same format will work.)"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">match-list</var> refers to a buffer that doesn&rsquo;t "
"exist, you don&rsquo;t get an error; that sets the match data in a "
"meaningless but harmless way."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">match-list</var> が存在しないバッファを参照している場合、"
"エラーは発生しません。その代わり、マッチデータが無意味ながらも無害な形で設定"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Entire-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">reseat</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"all markers on the <var class=\"var\">match-list</var> list are reseated to "
"point to nowhere."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">reseat</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">match-list</var> リスト上のすべてのマーカーは、どこに"
"も指さないよう再配置される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
