# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">equal</code> function compares strings and bool-"
"vectors by value.  Numbers are compared by type and numeric value, using "
"<code class=\"code\">eql</code>.  Lists, cons cells, vectors, records, "
"markers, char-tables, font objects, and function objects (closures)<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF2\" href=\"#FOOT2\"><sup>2</sup></a> are "
"compared recursively by using <code class=\"code\">equal</code> on their "
"constituent parts."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">equal</code> 関数は、文字列と bool-vector を値に基づいて"
"比較します。数値は <code class=\"code\">eql</code> を用いて、型と数値値に基づ"
"いて比較されます。リスト、cons セル、ベクトル、レコード、マーカー、文字テーブ"
"ル、フォントオブジェクト、および関数オブジェクト（クロージャ）<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF2\" href=\"#FOOT2\"><sup>2</sup></a> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">equal</code> を用いてその構成要素を再帰的に比較します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"Comparison of strings is case-sensitive, but does not take account of text "
"properties&mdash;it compares only the characters in the strings.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Properties.html\">Text Properties</a>.  Use <code "
"class=\"code\">equal-including-properties</code> to also compare text "
"properties.  For technical reasons, a unibyte string and a multibyte string "
"are <code class=\"code\">equal</code> if and only if they contain the same "
"sequence of character codes and all these codes are in the range 0 through "
"127 (<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>)."
msgstr ""
"文字列の比較は大文字小文字を区別しますが、テキストプロパティは考慮されず、文"
"字列内の文字のみが比較されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-"
"Properties.html\">テキストプロパティ</a>を参照してください。テキストプロパ"
"ティも含めて比較する場合は、<code class=\"code\">equal-including-properties</"
"code> を使用してください。技術的な理由により、ユニバイト文字列とマルチバイト"
"文字列が <code class=\"code\">equal</code> となるのは、両者が同じ文字コード列"
"を持ち、かつそれらすべてのコードが 0 から 127 の範囲（<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>）にある場合に限られます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(equal &quot;asdf&quot; &quot;ASDF&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">object1</var> or <var class=\"var\">object2</var> "
"contains symbols with position, <code class=\"code\">equal</code> treats "
"them as if they were their bare symbols when <code class=\"code\">symbols-"
"with-pos-enabled</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Otherwise "
"<code class=\"code\">equal</code> compares two symbols with position by "
"comparing their components.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Symbols-with-"
"Position.html\">Symbols with Position</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">object1</var> または <var class=\"var\">object2</var> に位"
"置を持つ記号が含まれている場合、<code class=\"code\">symbols-with-pos-"
"enabled</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でないとき、<code "
"class=\"code\">equal</code> はそれらを単なる記号として扱います。それ以外の場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">equal</code> は位置を持つ2つの記号を、それぞれの構成"
"要素を比較することで比較します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Symbols-with-"
"Position.html\">位置を持つ記号</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"Other objects are considered <code class=\"code\">equal</code> only if they "
"are <code class=\"code\">eq</code>.  For example, two distinct buffers are "
"never considered <code class=\"code\">equal</code>, even if their textual "
"contents are the same."
msgstr ""
"その他のオブジェクトは、<code class=\"code\">eq</code>である場合にのみ<code "
"class=\"code\">equal</code>とみなされます。例えば、2つの異なるバッファは、テ"
"キスト内容が同一であっても、決して<code class=\"code\">equal</code>とはみなさ"
"れません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"For <code class=\"code\">equal</code>, equality is defined recursively; for "
"example, given two cons cells <var class=\"var\">x</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">y</var>, <code class=\"code\">(equal <var class=\"var\">x</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> if and only if both the expressions below return <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">equal</code> については、等価性が再帰的に定義されます。"
"例えば、2つのコンスセル <var class=\"var\">x</var> と <var class=\"var\">y</"
"var> があるとき、<code class=\"code\">(equal <var class=\"var\">x</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">y</var>)</code> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返すのは、以"
"下の式がいずれも <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返す場合に限られます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(equal (car <var class=\"var\">x</var>) (car <var class=\"var\">y</var>))\n"
"(equal (cdr <var class=\"var\">x</var>) (cdr <var class=\"var\">y</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Equality-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"Comparing very deeply nested objects may therefore cause deep recursion that "
"leads to an error."
msgstr ""
"したがって、非常に深くネストされたオブジェクトを比較すると、深い再帰が発生"
"し、エラーにつながる可能性があります。"

