# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Error-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"If you set <code class=\"code\">debug-on-message</code> to a regular "
"expression, Emacs will enter the debugger if it displays a matching message "
"in the echo area.  For example, this can be useful when trying to find the "
"cause of a particular message."
