#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"<span>17.4 Evaluation During Compilation<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Evaluation-During-Compilation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>17.4 コンパイル時の評価<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Evaluation-"
"During-Compilation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval-during-compilation\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval-during-compilation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"These features permit you to write code to be evaluated during compilation "
"of a program."
msgstr ""
"これらの機能により、プログラムのコンパイル時に評価されるコードを記述できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-and-compile</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"eval_002dand_002dcompile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-and-compile</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"eval_002dand_002dcompile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"This form marks <var class=\"var\">body</var> to be evaluated both when you "
"compile the containing code and when you run it (whether compiled or not)."
msgstr ""
"このフォームは、包含するコードをコンパイルする際と、実行する際（コンパイル済"
"みか否かを問わず）の両方で、<var class=\"var\">body</var> が評価されるよう指"
"定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"You can get a similar result by putting <var class=\"var\">body</var> in a "
"separate file and referring to that file with <code class=\"code\">require</"
"code>.  That method is preferable when <var class=\"var\">body</var> is "
"large.  Effectively <code class=\"code\">require</code> is automatically "
"<code class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code>, the package is loaded both "
"when compiling and executing."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>を別ファイルに記述し、<code "
"class=\"code\">require</code>でそのファイルを参照することでも同様の結果が得ら"
"れます。<var class=\"var\">body</var>が大きい場合は、こちらの方法が好ましいで"
"す。実質的に<code class=\"code\">require</code>は自動的に<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code>となり、コンパイル時と実行時の両方で"
"パッケージが読み込まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">autoload</code> is also effectively <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code> too.  It&rsquo;s recognized when "
"compiling, so uses of such a function don&rsquo;t produce &ldquo;not known "
"to be defined&rdquo; warnings."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">autoload</code> も実質的に <code class=\"code\">eval-"
"and-compile</code> と同じです。コンパイル時に認識されるため、このような関数を"
"使用しても「定義されていることが不明」という警告は発生しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"Most uses of <code class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code> are fairly "
"sophisticated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code> の用途の多くは、かなり高度なもの"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"If a macro has a helper function to build its result, and that macro is used "
"both locally and outside the package, then <code class=\"code\">eval-and-"
"compile</code> should be used to get the helper both when compiling and then "
"later when running."
msgstr ""
"マクロに結果を生成するためのヘルパー関数があり、そのマクロがローカルおよび"
"パッケージ外の両方で使用される場合は、コンパイル時とその後の実行時の両方でヘ"
"ルパーを取得できるよう、<code class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code> を使用す"
"る必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"If functions are defined programmatically (with <code class=\"code\">fset</"
"code> say), then <code class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code> can be used to "
"have that done at compile-time as well as run-time, so calls to those "
"functions are checked (and warnings about &ldquo;not known to be "
"defined&rdquo; suppressed)."
msgstr ""
"関数がプログラム的に定義されている場合（例えば <code class=\"code\">fset</"
"code> のように）、<code class=\"code\">eval-and-compile</code> を使用すること"
"で、実行時だけでなくコンパイル時にも定義を行うことができ、その結果、それらの"
"関数への呼び出しがチェックされ（「定義されていることが不明」という警告も抑制"
"されます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-when-compile</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"eval_002dwhen_002dcompile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-when-compile</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"eval_002dwhen_002dcompile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"This form marks <var class=\"var\">body</var> to be evaluated at compile "
"time but not when the compiled program is loaded.  The result of evaluation "
"by the compiler becomes a constant which appears in the compiled program.  "
"If you load the source file, rather than compiling it, <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> is evaluated normally."
msgstr ""
"この形式では、<var class=\"var\">body</var> はコンパイル時に評価されますが、"
"コンパイル済みプログラムのロード時には評価されません。コンパイラによる評価結"
"果は定数となり、コンパイル済みプログラムに組み込まれます。ソースファイルをコ"
"ンパイルせずにロードした場合、<var class=\"var\">body</var> は通常通り評価さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compile_002dtime-constant\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compile_002dtime-constant\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"If you have a constant that needs some calculation to produce, <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code> can do that at compile-time.  For "
"example,"
msgstr ""
"計算によって値を求める必要がある定数がある場合、<code class=\"code\">eval-"
"when-compile</code> を使えばコンパイル時に処理できます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar gauss-schoolboy-problem\n"
"  (eval-when-compile (apply #'+ (number-sequence 1 100))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macros_002c-at-compile-time\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macros_002c-at-compile-time\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"If you&rsquo;re using another package, but only need macros from it (the "
"byte compiler will expand those), then <code class=\"code\">eval-when-"
"compile</code> can be used to load it for compiling, but not executing.  For "
"example,"
msgstr ""
"別のパッケージを使用しており、そこからマクロだけが必要な場合（バイトコンパイ"
"ラがそれらを展開します）、<code class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code> を"
"使ってコンパイル用にはロードしつつ、実行はさせないようにできます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(eval-when-compile\n"
"  (require 'my-macro-package))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"The same sort of thing goes for macros and <code class=\"code\">defsubst</"
"code> functions defined locally and only for use within the file.  They are "
"needed for compiling the file, but in most cases they are not needed for "
"execution of the compiled file.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"ローカルで定義され、ファイル内のみで使用されるマクロや<code "
"class=\"code\">defsubst</code>関数についても、同様のことが言えます。これらは"
"ファイルのコンパイルには必要ですが、ほとんどの場合、コンパイル済みファイルの"
"実行には不要です。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(eval-when-compile\n"
"  (unless (fboundp 'some-new-thing)\n"
"    (defmacro some-new-thing ()\n"
"      (compatibility code))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"This is often good for code that&rsquo;s only a fallback for compatibility "
"with other versions of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"これは、他のバージョンのEmacsとの互換性のためのフォールバックに過ぎないコード"
"によく適しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Compile.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Common Lisp Note:</strong> At top level, <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code> is analogous to the Common Lisp "
"idiom <code class=\"code\">(eval-when (compile eval) &hellip;)</code>.  "
"Elsewhere, the Common Lisp &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#.</samp>&rsquo; "
"reader macro (but not when interpreting) is closer to what <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code> does."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Common Lispに関する注記：</strong> トップレベルにお"
"いて、<code class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</code>はCommon Lispのイディオム"
"<code class=\"code\">(eval-when (compile eval) &hellip;)</code>に相当します。"
"それ以外の箇所では、Common Lispのリーダーマクロ「<samp class=\"samp\">#.</"
"samp>」（ただし解釈時は除く）の方が、<code class=\"code\">eval-when-compile</"
"code>の動作に近いです。"

