# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.5.4 Evaluating Macro Arguments in Expansion<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Evaluating-Macro-Arguments-in-Expansion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.5.4 展開におけるマクロ引数の評価<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Evaluating-Macro-Arguments-in-Expansion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Another problem can happen if the macro definition itself evaluates any of "
"the macro argument expressions, such as by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Eval.html\">Eval</"
"a>).  You have to take into account that macro expansion may take place long "
"before the code is executed, when the context of the caller (where the macro "
"expansion will be evaluated) is not yet accessible."
msgstr ""
"マクロ定義自体が、<code class=\"code\">eval</code> を呼び出すなどしてマクロ引"
"数式のいずれかを評価する場合、別の問題が発生する可能性があります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Eval.html\">Eval</a> を参照）。マクロ展開は、コードが"
"実行されるずっと前、呼び出し元のコンテキスト（マクロ展開が評価される場所）が"
"まだ参照できない段階で発生する場合があることに留意する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Also, if your macro definition does not use <code class=\"code\">lexical-"
"binding</code>, its formal arguments may hide the user&rsquo;s variables of "
"the same name.  Inside the macro body, the macro argument binding is the "
"most local binding of such variable, so any references inside the form being "
"evaluated do refer to it.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"また、マクロの定義で <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code> を使用してい"
"ない場合、その仮引数が同名のユーザー変数を隠蔽することがあります。マクロ本体"
"内では、マクロ引数の束縛が当該変数の最も局所的な束縛となるため、評価対象の式"
"内のあらゆる参照はその変数を指すことになります。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro foo (a)\n"
"  (list 'setq (eval a) t))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq x 'b)\n"
"(foo x) &rarr; (setq b t)\n"
"     &rArr; t                  ; <span class=\"r\">and <code class=\"code\">b</code> has been set.</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">but</span>\n"
"(setq a 'c)\n"
"(foo a) &rarr; (setq a t)\n"
"     &rArr; t                  ; <span class=\"r\">but this set <code class=\"code\">a</code>, not <code class=\"code\">c</code>.</span>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"It makes a difference whether the user&rsquo;s variable is named <code "
"class=\"code\">a</code> or <code class=\"code\">x</code>, because <code "
"class=\"code\">a</code> conflicts with the macro argument variable <code "
"class=\"code\">a</code>."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーの変数名が <code class=\"code\">a</code> か <code class=\"code\">x</"
"code> かによって結果が変わります。というのも、<code class=\"code\">a</code> "
"はマクロの引数変数 <code class=\"code\">a</code> と衝突するためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Also, the expansion of <code class=\"code\">(foo x)</code> above will return "
"something different or signal an error when the code is compiled, since in "
"that case <code class=\"code\">(foo x)</code> is expanded during "
"compilation, whereas the execution of <code class=\"code\">(setq x 'b)</"
"code> will only take place later when the code is executed."
msgstr ""
"また、上記の <code class=\"code\">(foo x)</code> の展開は、コードのコンパイル"
"時に異なる結果を返すか、あるいはエラーを発生させます。というのも、この場合 "
"<code class=\"code\">(foo x)</code> はコンパイル時に展開されるのに対し、"
"<code class=\"code\">(setq x 'b)</code> の実行はコードの実行時になってから行"
"われるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-During-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"To avoid these problems, <strong class=\"strong\">don&rsquo;t evaluate an "
"argument expression while computing the macro expansion</strong>.  Instead, "
"substitute the expression into the macro expansion, so that its value will "
"be computed as part of executing the expansion.  This is how the other "
"examples in this chapter work."
msgstr ""
"これらの問題を回避するには、<strong class=\"strong\">マクロ展開の計算中に引数"
"式を評価しないでください</strong>。代わりに、その式をマクロ展開に代入すること"
"で、展開の実行過程でその値が計算されるようになります。本章の他の例も、この仕"
"組みで動作しています。"

