#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.2.10 Evaluation List Buffer<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Evaluation-List-Buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.2.10 評価リストバッファ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Evaluation-List-Buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-evaluation-list-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-evaluation-list-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"You can use the <em class=\"dfn\">evaluation list buffer</em>, called <samp "
"class=\"file\">*edebug*</samp>, to evaluate expressions interactively.  You "
"can also set up the <em class=\"dfn\">evaluation list</em> of expressions to "
"be evaluated automatically each time Edebug updates the display."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*edebug*</samp> と呼ばれる <em class=\"dfn\">評価リスト"
"バッファ</em> を使用して、式を対話的に評価できます。また、Edebug がディスプレ"
"イを更新するたびに自動的に評価される式の <em class=\"dfn\">評価リスト</em> を"
"設定することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dvisit_002deval_002dlist\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">E</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dvisit_002deval_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dvisit_002deval_002dlist\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">E</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dvisit_002deval_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Switch to the evaluation list buffer <samp class=\"file\">*edebug*</samp> "
"(<code class=\"code\">edebug-visit-eval-list</code>)."
msgstr ""
"評価リストバッファ <samp class=\"file\">*edebug*</samp> (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-visit-eval-list</code>) に切り替える。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"In the <samp class=\"file\">*edebug*</samp> buffer you can use the commands "
"of Lisp Interaction mode (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Lisp-Interaction.html#Lisp-"
"Interaction\">Lisp Interaction</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>) as well as these special commands:"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*edebug*</samp> バッファでは、Lisp Interaction モードの"
"コマンド（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Lisp-Interaction.html#Lisp-Interaction\">Lisp Interaction</a> を参照）"
"のほか、以下の特殊コマンドも使用できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002deval_002dprint_002dlast_002dsexp\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002deval_002dprint_002dlast_002dsexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002deval_002dprint_002dlast_002dsexp\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002deval_002dprint_002dlast_002dsexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate the expression before point, in the outside context, and insert the "
"value in the buffer (<code class=\"code\">edebug-eval-print-last-sexp</"
"code>).  With prefix argument of zero (<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 0 C-j</kbd>), "
"don&rsquo;t shorten long items (like strings and lists) due to <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-print-length</code> and <code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"print-level</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Printing-in-"
"Edebug.html\">Printing in Edebug</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントより前の式を外部コンテキストで評価し、バッファ内の値（<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-eval-print-last-sexp</code>）を挿入します。接頭辞引数が"
"0（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 0 C-j</kbd>）の場合、<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"print-length</code>および<code class=\"code\">edebug-print-level</code>の影響"
"で長い項目（文字列やリストなど）を短縮しません（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Printing-in-Edebug.html\">Edebugでの出力</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002deval_002dlast_002dsexp-1\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002deval_002dlast_002dsexp-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002deval_002dlast_002dsexp-1\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002deval_002dlast_002dsexp-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate the expression before point, in the context outside of Edebug "
"(<code class=\"code\">edebug-eval-last-sexp</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Edebug外のコンテキスト（<code class=\"code\">edebug-eval-last-sexp</code>）に"
"おいて、ドットより前の式を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dupdate_002deval_002dlist\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dupdate_002deval_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dupdate_002deval_002dlist\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dupdate_002deval_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Build a new evaluation list from the contents of the buffer (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-update-eval-list</code>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファの内容 (<code class=\"code\">edebug-update-eval-list</code>) から新し"
"い評価リストを作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002ddelete_002deval_002ditem\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-d</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002ddelete_002deval_002ditem\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002ddelete_002deval_002ditem\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-d</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002ddelete_002deval_002ditem\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Delete the evaluation list group that point is in (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-delete-eval-item</code>)."
msgstr ""
"そのポインタが属する評価リストグループを削除する (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-delete-eval-item</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-w</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-w</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Switch back to the source code buffer at the current stop point (<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-where</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の停止位置（<code class=\"code\">edebug-where</code>）でソースコードバッ"
"ファに戻る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"You can evaluate expressions in the evaluation list window with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>, just as you "
"would in <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>; but they are evaluated in "
"the context outside of Edebug."
msgstr ""
"評価リストウィンドウ内の式は、<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> と同様に "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> で評価できま"
"すが、Edebug 外のコンテキストで評価されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"The expressions you enter interactively (and their results) are lost when "
"you continue execution; but you can set up an <em class=\"dfn\">evaluation "
"list</em> consisting of expressions to be evaluated each time execution "
"stops."
msgstr ""
"対話的に入力した式（およびその結果）は、実行を継続すると失われます。しかし、"
"実行が停止するたびに評価される式からなる<em class=\"dfn\">評価リスト</em>を設"
"定することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-evaluation-list-group\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-evaluation-list-group\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"To do this, write one or more <em class=\"dfn\">evaluation list groups</em> "
"in the evaluation list buffer.  An evaluation list group consists of one or "
"more Lisp expressions.  Groups are separated by comment lines."
msgstr ""
"これを行うには、評価リストバッファに1つ以上の<em class=\"dfn\">評価リストグ"
"ループ</em>を記述します。評価リストグループは、1つ以上のLisp式で構成されま"
"す。グループ間はコメント行で区切られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"update-eval-list</code>) rebuilds the evaluation list, scanning the buffer "
"and using the first expression of each group.  (The idea is that the second "
"expression of the group is the value previously computed and displayed.)"
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"update-eval-list</code>) は、バッファを走査し、各グループの最初の式を用いて評"
"価リストを再構成します。（これは、グループの2番目の式が、以前に計算・表示され"
"た値であるという考え方に基づいています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"Each entry to Edebug redisplays the evaluation list by inserting each "
"expression in the buffer, followed by its current value.  It also inserts "
"comment lines so that each expression becomes its own group.  Thus, if you "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd> again without changing the buffer "
"text, the evaluation list is effectively unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Edebugへの各入力により、バッファ内の各式とその現在の値を順に挿入することで、"
"評価リストが再表示されます。また、各式が独立したグループとなるよう、コメント"
"行も挿入されます。したがって、バッファの内容を変えずに再度 <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd> と入力しても、評価リストは実質的に変わりません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval-List.html
msgid ""
"If an error occurs during an evaluation from the evaluation list, the error "
"message is displayed in a string as if it were the result.  Therefore, "
"expressions using variables that are not currently valid do not interrupt "
"your debugging."
msgstr ""
"評価リストからの評価中にエラーが発生した場合、エラーメッセージは結果であるか"
"のように文字列として表示されます。そのため、現在有効ではない変数を使用した式"
"があっても、デバッグが中断されることはありません。"

