# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span>10.5 Eval<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Eval-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.5 Eval<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Eval-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"Most often, forms are evaluated automatically, by virtue of their occurrence "
"in a program being run.  On rare occasions, you may need to write code that "
"evaluates a form that is computed at run time, such as after reading a form "
"from text being edited or getting one from a property list.  On these "
"occasions, use the <code class=\"code\">eval</code> function.  Often <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> is not needed and something else should be used "
"instead.  For example, to get the value of a variable, while <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> works, <code class=\"code\">symbol-value</code> "
"is preferable; or rather than store expressions in a property list that then "
"need to go through <code class=\"code\">eval</code>, it is better to store "
"functions instead that are then passed to <code class=\"code\">funcall</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"多くの場合、フォームは実行中のプログラム内に存在することで、自動的に評価され"
"ます。まれに、編集中のテキストからフォームを読み込んだり、プロパティリストか"
"ら取得したりするなど、実行時に計算されるフォームを評価するコードを記述する必"
"要がある場合があります。そのような場合には、<code class=\"code\">eval</code> "
"関数を使用してください。多くの場合、<code class=\"code\">eval</code> は不要で"
"あり、代わりに別の方法を用いるべきです。例えば、変数の値を取得する場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">eval</code> でも動作しますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">symbol-value</code> の方が好ましいです。あるいは、式をプロパ"
"ティリストに格納して <code class=\"code\">eval</code> を通すのではなく、代わ"
"りに関数を格納して <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> に渡す方が適切です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The functions and variables described in this section evaluate forms, "
"specify limits to the evaluation process, or record recently returned "
"values.  Loading a file also does evaluation (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Loading.html\">Loading</a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節で説明する関数や変数は、フォームを評価したり、評価処理の制限を指定した"
"り、あるいは直近に返された値を記録したりします。ファイルの読み込み時にも評価"
"が行われます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loading.html\">読み込み</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"It is generally cleaner and more flexible to store a function in a data "
"structure, and call it with <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">apply</code>, than to store an expression in the data "
"structure and evaluate it.  Using functions provides the ability to pass "
"information to them as arguments."
msgstr ""
"データ構造に式を格納して評価するよりも、関数をデータ構造に格納し、<code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> や <code class=\"code\">apply</code> で呼び出す"
"方が、一般的に簡潔で柔軟です。関数を用いることで、情報を引数として渡すことが"
"可能になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form &amp;optional "
"lexical</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-eval\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form &amp;optional "
"lexical</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-eval\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"This is the basic function for evaluating an expression.  It evaluates <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var> in the current environment, and returns the "
"result.  The type of the <var class=\"var\">form</var> object determines how "
"it is evaluated.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Forms.html\">Kinds of Forms</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"これは式を評価するための基本機能です。現在の環境で <var class=\"var\">form</"
"var> を評価し、その結果を返します。<var class=\"var\">form</var> オブジェクト"
"の型によって、評価方法が決まります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Forms.html\">"
"フォームの種類</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">lexical</var> specifies the scoping rule for "
"local variables (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Scoping.html\">Scoping Rules for Variable Bindings</a>).  If it is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, that means to evaluate <var class=\"var\">form</"
"var> using lexical scoping; this is the recommended value.  If it is omitted "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means to use the old dynamic-only "
"variable scoping rule."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">lexical</var> は、ローカル変数のスコープ規則を指定し"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">変数束縛のスコープ規"
"則</a>を参照）。<code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合は、レキシカルスコープを"
"用いて <var class=\"var\">form</var> を評価することを意味し、これが推奨される"
"値です。省略されているか <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、従来の動的"
"スコープのみの変数スコープ規則を使用することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The value of <var class=\"var\">lexical</var> can also be a non-empty list "
"specifying a particular <em class=\"dfn\">lexical environment</em> for "
"lexical bindings; however, this feature is only useful for specialized "
"purposes, such as in Emacs Lisp debuggers.  Each member of the list is "
"either a cons cell which represents a lexical symbol-value pair, or a symbol "
"representing a (special) variable that would use dynamic scoping if bound."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">lexical</var> の値には、字句束縛のための特定の <em "
"class=\"dfn\">字句環境</em> を指定する空でないリストを用いることもできます"
"が、この機能は Emacs Lisp デバッガなどの特殊な用途においてのみ有用です。リス"
"トの各要素は、字句シンボルと値のペアを表すコンスセルか、あるいは束縛された場"
"合に動的スコープが適用される（特殊な）変数を表すシンボルのいずれかです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"Since <code class=\"code\">eval</code> is a function, the argument "
"expression that appears in a call to <code class=\"code\">eval</code> is "
"evaluated twice: once as preparation before <code class=\"code\">eval</code> "
"is called, and again by the <code class=\"code\">eval</code> function "
"itself.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">eval</code> は関数であるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> の呼び出しに現れる引数式は、<code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> が呼び出される前の準備として一度、そして <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> 関数自身によってもう一度、計2回評価されます。以下"
"に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq foo 'bar)\n"
"     &rArr; bar\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq bar 'baz)\n"
"     &rArr; baz\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">Here <code class=\"code\">eval</code> receives argument <code class=\"code\">foo</code></span>\n"
"(eval 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; bar\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">Here <code class=\"code\">eval</code> receives argument <code class=\"code\">bar</code>, which is the value of <code class=\"code\">foo</code></span>\n"
"(eval foo)\n"
"     &rArr; baz\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The number of currently active calls to <code class=\"code\">eval</code> is "
"limited to <code class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">eval</code> への現在アクティブな呼数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</code> に制限されています（以下参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"&amp;optional stream read-function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-eval_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"&amp;optional stream read-function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-eval_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-eval_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-eval_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"This function evaluates the forms in the current buffer in the region "
"defined by the positions <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>.  It reads forms from the region and calls <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code> on them until the end of the region is reached, "
"or until an error is signaled and not handled."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、位置 <var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> で定義される領域内の現在のバッファにあるフォームを評価します。当該領域か"
"らフォームを読み込み、領域の終端に達するか、あるいはエラーがシグナルされ処理"
"されない限り、それらに対して <code class=\"code\">eval</code> を呼び出しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"By default, <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> does not produce any "
"output.  However, if <var class=\"var\">stream</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, any output produced by output functions (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>), as "
"well as the values that result from evaluating the expressions in the region "
"are printed using <var class=\"var\">stream</var>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Output-Streams.html\">Output Streams</a>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> は何も出力しません。"
"ただし、<var class=\"var\">stream</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外の場合、出力関数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出力関"
"数</a> を参照）によって生成される出力や、リージョン内の式の評価結果は、<var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var> を用いて出力されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Output-Streams.html\">出力ストリーム</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">read-function</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it should be a function, which is used instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">read</code> to read expressions one by one.  This function is "
"called with one argument, the stream for reading input.  You can also use "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">load-read-function</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"How-Programs-Do-Loading.html#Definition-of-"
"load_002dread_002dfunction\">How Programs Do Loading</a>)  to specify this "
"function, but it is more robust to use the <var class=\"var\">read-function</"
"var> argument."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">read-function</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ない場合、それは関数である必要があり、<code class=\"code\">read</code> の代わ"
"りに用いられて式を一つずつ読み出します。この関数は、入力を読み出すためのスト"
"リームを1つの引数として呼び出されます。また、変数 <code class=\"code\">load-"
"read-function</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"How-Programs-Do-"
"Loading.html#Definition-of-load_002dread_002dfunction\">プログラムによる読み"
"込みの仕組み</a> を参照）を使用してこの関数を指定することもできますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">read-function</var> 引数を使用する方がより堅牢です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> does not move point.  It always "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> はポイントを移動しません。常に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-evaluation-of-buffer-contents\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-evaluation-of-buffer-contents\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"buffer-or-name stream filename unibyte print</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-eval_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"buffer-or-name stream filename unibyte print</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-eval_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"This is similar to <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code>, but the "
"arguments provide different optional features.  <code class=\"code\">eval-"
"buffer</code> operates on the entire accessible portion of buffer <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Narrowing.html#Narrowing\">Narrowing</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>).  <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> can be a "
"buffer, a buffer name (a string), or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (or "
"omitted), which means to use the current buffer.  <var class=\"var\">stream</"
"var> is used as in <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code>, unless <var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and <var "
"class=\"var\">print</var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In that "
"case, values that result from evaluating the expressions are still "
"discarded, but the output of the output functions is printed in the echo "
"area.  <var class=\"var\">filename</var> is the file name to use for <code "
"class=\"code\">load-history</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Unloading.html\">Unloading</a>), and defaults to <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-file-name</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"File-Name.html\">Buffer File Name</a>).  If <var class=\"var\">unibyte</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">read</code> "
"converts strings to unibyte whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> と同様ですが、引数によって提供"
"されるオプション機能が異なります。<code class=\"code\">eval-buffer</code> は"
"バッファ <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> のアクセス可能な全領域に対し"
"て動作します（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Narrowing.html#Narrowing\">Narrowing</a> を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> にはバッファ、バッファ名（文字列）、また"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（あるいは省略）を指定でき、後者は現在の"
"バッファを使用することを意味します。<var class=\"var\">stream</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-region</code> と同様に使用されますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> かつ <var "
"class=\"var\">print</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は除き"
"ます。その場合、式の評価結果は引き続き破棄されますが、出力関数の出力はエコー"
"エリアに表示されます。<var class=\"var\">filename</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">load-history</code> で使用するファイル名であり（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Unloading.html\">Unloading</a> を参照）、デフォルトは "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-file-name</code> です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-File-Name.html\">Buffer File Name</a> を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">unibyte</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">read</code> は可能な限り文字列をユニバイトに変換します。"

