# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"This variable defines the maximum depth allowed in calls to <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code>, <code class=\"code\">apply</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code> before an error is signaled (with error "
"message <code class=\"code\">&quot;Lisp nesting exceeds max-lisp-eval-"
"depth&quot;</code>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、エラーが通知される（エラーメッセージ <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;Lisp nesting exceeds max-lisp-eval-depth&quot;</code> を"
"伴う）までに、<code class=\"code\">eval</code>、<code class=\"code\">apply</"
"code>、および <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> の呼び出しで許容される最大"
"深度を定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"This limit, with the associated error when it is exceeded, is how Emacs Lisp "
"avoids infinite recursion on an ill-defined function.  If you increase the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</code> too much, such code "
"can cause stack overflow instead.  On some systems, this overflow can be "
"handled.  In that case, normal Lisp evaluation is interrupted and control is "
"transferred back to the top level command loop (<code class=\"code\">top-"
"level</code>).  Note that there is no way to enter Emacs Lisp debugger in "
"this situation.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Error-"
"Debugging.html\">Entering the Debugger on an Error</a>."
msgstr ""
"この制限と、それを超えた際に生じるエラーにより、Emacs Lispでは定義が不十分な"
"関数による無限再帰を回避しています。<code class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-"
"depth</code> の値を大きくしすぎると、代わりにこのようなコードがスタックオー"
"バーフローを引き起こす可能性があります。システムによっては、このオーバーフ"
"ローを処理できる場合があります。その場合、通常のLisp評価は中断され、制御は最"
"上位のコマンドループ（<code class=\"code\">top-level</code>）に戻されます。な"
"お、この状況でEmacs Lispデバッガに入る方法はありません。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Error-Debugging.html\">エラー発生時のデバッガ起動</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Lisp-nesting-error\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Lisp-nesting-error\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The depth limit counts internal uses of <code class=\"code\">eval</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code>, and <code class=\"code\">funcall</code>, "
"such as for calling the functions mentioned in Lisp expressions, and "
"recursive evaluation of function call arguments and function body forms, as "
"well as explicit calls in Lisp code."
msgstr ""
"深度制限には、Lisp式で言及されている関数の呼び出しや、関数呼び出しの引数およ"
"び関数本体形式の再帰的評価、ならびにLispコード内での明示的な呼び出しなど、"
"<code class=\"code\">eval</code>、<code class=\"code\">apply</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code>の内部的な使用も含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The default value of this variable is 1600.  If you set it to a value less "
"than 100, Lisp will reset it to 100 if the given value is reached."
msgstr ""
"この変数のデフォルト値は1600です。100未満の値を設定した場合、指定された値に達"
"するとLispはそれを100にリセットします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lisp-eval-depth-reserve</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-lisp_002deval_002ddepth_002dreserve\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">lisp-eval-depth-reserve</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-lisp_002deval_002ddepth_002dreserve\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"In order to be able to debug infinite recursion errors, when invoking the "
"Lisp debugger, Emacs increases temporarily the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</code>, if there is little room left, to "
"make sure the debugger itself has room to execute.  The same happens when "
"running the handler of a <code class=\"code\">handler-bind</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Handling-Errors.html\">Writing Code to Handle Errors</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"無限再帰エラーをデバッグできるように、Lispデバッガを呼び出す際、Emacsは空き領"
"域が少ない場合に<code class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</code>の値を一時的に"
"増加させ、デバッガ自体が実行するための領域を確保します。<code "
"class=\"code\">handler-bind</code>のハンドラを実行する場合も同様です。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Handling-Errors.html\">エラー処理コードの書き方</a>を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">lisp-eval-depth-reserve</code> bounds the "
"extra depth that Emacs can add to <code class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</"
"code> for those exceptional circumstances."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">lisp-eval-depth-reserve</code> は、そうした例外的な"
"状況において Emacs が <code class=\"code\">max-lisp-eval-depth</code> に付加"
"できる追加の深さを制限します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid "The default value of this variable is 200."
msgstr "この変数のデフォルト値は200です。"

