# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of the values returned by all the "
"expressions that were read, evaluated, and printed from buffers (including "
"the minibuffer) by the standard Emacs commands which do this.  (Note that "
"this does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> include evaluation in <samp "
"class=\"file\">*ielm*</samp> buffers, nor evaluation using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>, and similar "
"evaluation commands in <code class=\"code\">lisp-interaction-mode</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、これを行う標準的なEmacsコマンドによって、バッファ（ミニバッ"
"ファを含む）から読み込まれ、評価され、出力されたすべての式が返した値のリスト"
"です。（なお、これには<samp class=\"file\">*ielm*</samp>バッファ内での評価"
"や、<code class=\"code\">lisp-interaction-mode</code>内での<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>および同様の評価コマ"
"ンドを用いた評価は<em class=\"emph\">含まれません</em>。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Eval.html
msgid ""
"This variable is obsolete, and will be removed in a future version, since it "
"constantly enlarges the memory footprint of the Emacs process.  For that "
"reason, we recommend against using it."
msgstr ""
"この変数は廃止されており、Emacsプロセスのメモリ使用量を絶えず増大させるため、"
"今後のバージョンで削除される予定です。そのため、使用しないことを推奨します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
