# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Evaluation-Notation.html
msgid ""
"A Lisp expression that you can evaluate is called a <em class=\"dfn\">form</"
"em>.  Evaluating a form always produces a result, which is a Lisp object.  "
"In the examples in this manual, this is indicated with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&rArr;</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"評価可能なLisp式を<em class=\"dfn\">フォーム</em>と呼びます。フォームを評価す"
"ると常に結果が得られ、それはLispオブジェクトとなります。本マニュアルの例で"
"は、これを&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&rArr;</samp>&rsquo;で示しています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Evaluation-Notation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(car '(1 2))\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Evaluation-Notation.html
msgid ""
"You can read this as &ldquo;<code class=\"code\">(car '(1 2))</code> "
"evaluates to 1&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"これは「<code class=\"code\">(car '(1 2))</code>は1と評価される」と読み替える"
"ことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Evaluation-Notation.html
msgid ""
"When a form is a macro call, it expands into a new form for Lisp to "
"evaluate.  We show the result of the expansion with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&rarr;</samp>&rsquo;.  We may or may not show the result of "
"the evaluation of the expanded form."
msgstr ""
"フォームがマクロ呼び出しである場合、それはLispが評価するための新しいフォーム"
"へと展開されます。展開結果を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&rarr;</"
"samp>&rsquo; で示します。展開されたフォームの評価結果を示す場合と示さない場合"
"があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Evaluation-Notation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
