"格納されています。イベントはリストに現れた順に使用され、使用されるたびに一つ"
"ずつ削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"The variable is needed because in some cases a function reads an event and "
"then decides not to use it.  Storing the event in this variable causes it to "
"be processed normally, by the command loop or by the functions to read "
"command input."
msgstr ""
"この変数が必要なのは、場合によっては関数がイベントを読み取った後、それを使用"
"しないと判断することがあるためです。この変数にイベントを格納しておくことで、"
"コマンドループや、コマンド入力を読み取る関数によって通常通り処理されるように"
"なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prefix-argument-unreading\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prefix-argument-unreading\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"For example, the function that implements numeric prefix arguments reads any "
"number of digits.  When it finds a non-digit event, it must unread the event "
"so that it can be read normally by the command loop.  Likewise, incremental "
"search uses this feature to unread events with no special meaning in a "
"search, because these events should exit the search and then execute "
"normally."
msgstr ""
"例えば、数値プレフィックス引数を実装する関数は、任意の桁数を読み取ります。数"
"字以外のイベントを検出した際は、コマンドループで通常通り読み取れるよう、その"
"イベントを読み戻さなければなりません。同様に、インクリメンタルサーチでもこの"
"機能を利用して、検索において特別な意味を持たないイベントを読み戻します。こう"
"したイベントは、検索を終了して通常通り実行されるべきだからです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"The reliable and easy way to extract events from a key sequence so as to put "
"them in <code class=\"code\">unread-command-events</code> is to use <code "
"class=\"code\">listify-key-sequence</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスからイベントを抽出して <code class=\"code\">unread-command-"
"events</code> に格納する、確実で簡単な方法は、<code class=\"code\">listify-"
"key-sequence</code> を使用することです（以下参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"Normally you add events to the front of this list, so that the events most "
"recently unread will be reread first."
msgstr ""
"通常は、このリストの先頭にイベントを追加し、直近に未読となったイベントから順"
"に再読するようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"Events read from this list are not normally added to the current "
"command&rsquo;s key sequence (as returned by, e.g., <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code>), as the events will already have "
"been added once as they were read for the first time.  An element of the "
"form <code class=\"code\">(t&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">event</var>)</"
"code> forces <var class=\"var\">event</var> to be added to the current "
"command&rsquo;s key sequence."
msgstr ""
"このリストから読み込まれたイベントは、最初に読み込まれた時点で既に一度追加さ"
"れているため、通常は現在のコマンドのキーシーケンス（例えば <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command-keys</code> などで返されるもの）には追加されませ"
"ん。<code class=\"code\">(t&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">event</var>)</"
"code> 形式の要素を指定すると、<var class=\"var\">event</var> が現在のコマンド"
"のキーシーケンスに強制的に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-not-recording-input-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-input-events_002c-prevent-recording\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-not-recording-input-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-input-events_002c-prevent-recording\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"Elements read from this list are normally recorded by the record-keeping "
"features (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Recording-Input.html\">Recording "
"Input</a>) and while defining a keyboard macro (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">Keyboard Macros</a>).  However, an element of "
"the form <code class=\"code\">(no-record&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">event</var>)</code> causes <var class=\"var\">event</var> to "
"be processed normally without recording it."
msgstr ""
"このリストから読み取られた要素は、通常、記録機能（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Recording-Input.html\">入力の記録</a>を参照）や、キーボードマクロの定"
"義時（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">キーボードマクロ</a>を"
"参照）に記録されます。ただし、<code class=\"code\">(no-record&nbsp;.&nbsp;"
"<var class=\"var\">event</var>)</code> 形式の要素は、<var "
"class=\"var\">event</var> を記録せずに通常通り処理させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
