# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function converts the string or vector <var class=\"var\">key</var> to "
"a list of individual events, which you can put in <code "
"class=\"code\">unread-command-events</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列またはベクトル <var class=\"var\">key</var> を個々のイベン"
"トのリストに変換し、それを <code class=\"code\">unread-command-events</code> "
"に代入できるようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
