"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-waiting-for-command-key-input\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function determines whether any command input is currently available to "
"be read.  It returns immediately, with value <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"if there is available input, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  On "
"rare occasions it may return <code class=\"code\">t</code> when no input is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在読み取り可能なコマンド入力があるかどうかを判定します。入力が"
"ある場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code>、ない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返して直ちに処理を終了します。まれに、入力がない"
"場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返すことがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">check-timers</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then if no input is available, Emacs runs any "
"timers which are ready.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Timers.html\">Timers "
"for Delayed Execution</a>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">check-timers</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、入力がない場合は、Emacs は準備が整って"
"いるタイマーを実行します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Timers.html\">遅延実行用タ"
"イマー</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-input-event</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dinput_002devent\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-input-event</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dinput_002devent\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This variable records the last terminal input event read, whether as part of "
"a command or explicitly by a Lisp program."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、コマンドの一部として、あるいはLispプログラムによって明示的に読み"
"取られた、直近の端末入力イベントを記録します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"In the example below, the Lisp program reads the character <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">1</kbd>, <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> code 49.  It "
"becomes the value of <code class=\"code\">last-input-event</code>, while "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd> (we assume <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> "
"command is used to evaluate this expression) remains the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">last-command-event</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、Lispプログラムは文字 <kbd class=\"kbd\">1</kbd>（<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>コード 49）を読み込みます。これが <code "
"class=\"code\">last-input-event</code> の値となり、一方で <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd>（この式の評価には <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> コ"
"マンドが使用されていると想定します）は <code class=\"code\">last-command-"
"event</code> の値のままとなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(progn (print (read-char))\n"
"       (print last-command-event)\n"
"       last-input-event)\n"
"     &#8867; 49\n"
"     &#8867; 5\n"
"     &rArr; 49\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">while-no-input</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-while_002dno_002dinput\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">while-no-input</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-while_002dno_002dinput\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This construct runs the <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms and returns the "
"value of the last one&mdash;but only if no input arrives.  If any input "
"arrives during the execution of the <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms, it "
"aborts them (working much like a quit).  The <code class=\"code\">while-no-"
"input</code> form returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if aborted by a "
"real quit, and returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if aborted by arrival "
"of other input."
msgstr ""
"このコンストラクトは<var class=\"var\">body</var>フォームを実行し、最後の"
"フォームの値を返します&mdash;ただし、入力が一切届かない場合に限ります。<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>フォームの実行中に何らかの入力が届くと、それらの実行"
"を中断します（quitとほぼ同様に動作します）。<code class=\"code\">while-no-"
"input</code>フォームは、実際のquitによって中断された場合は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を、他の入力の到着によって中断された場合は<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"If a part of <var class=\"var\">body</var> binds <code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> to non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"arrival of input during those parts won&rsquo;t cause an abort until the end "
"of that part."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>の一部が<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code>"
"をnon-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>にバインドしている場合、その部分の途中で"
"入力が届いても、その部分が終わるまでアボートは発生しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"If you want to be able to distinguish all possible values computed by <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> from both kinds of abort conditions, write the code "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> によって計算されるあらゆる値を、両方の種類のア"
"ボート条件から区別できるようにしたい場合は、次のようにコードを記述してくださ"
"い。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while-no-input\n"
"  (list\n"
"    (progn . <var class=\"var\">body</var>)))\n"
msgstr ""

