# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Input-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This variable allow setting which special events <code class=\"code\">while-"
"no-input</code> should ignore.  It is a list of event symbols (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Event-Examples.html\">Event Examples</a>)."
