# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.8.3 Modifying and Translating Input Events<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Modifying-and-Translating-Input-Events\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.8.3 入力イベントの変更と翻訳<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Modifying-and-Translating-Input-Events\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modifiers-of-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-translating-input-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-event-translation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modifiers-of-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-translating-input-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-event-translation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"Emacs modifies every event it reads according to <code class=\"code\">extra-"
"keyboard-modifiers</code>, then translates it through <code "
"class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-table</code> (if applicable), before "
"returning it from <code class=\"code\">read-event</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、読み取ったすべてのイベントを<code class=\"code\">extra-keyboard-"
"modifiers</code>に従って変更し、次に<code class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-"
"table</code>（該当する場合）を介して変換した上で、<code class=\"code\">read-"
"event</code>から返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">extra-keyboard-modifiers</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-extra_002dkeyboard_002dmodifiers\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">extra-keyboard-modifiers</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-extra_002dkeyboard_002dmodifiers\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"This variable lets Lisp programs &ldquo;press&rdquo; the modifier keys on "
"the keyboard.  The value is a character.  Only the modifiers of the "
"character matter.  Each time the user types a keyboard key, it is altered as "
"if those modifier keys were held down.  For instance, if you bind <code "
"class=\"code\">extra-keyboard-modifiers</code> to <code class=\"code\">?\\C-"
"\\M-a</code>, then all keyboard input characters typed during the scope of "
"the binding will have the control and meta modifiers applied to them.  The "
"character <code class=\"code\">?\\C-@</code>, equivalent to the integer 0, "
"does not count as a control character for this purpose, but as a character "
"with no modifiers.  Thus, setting <code class=\"code\">extra-keyboard-"
"modifiers</code> to zero cancels any modification."
msgstr ""
"この変数により、Lispプログラムはキーボードの修飾キーを「押す」ことができま"
"す。値は文字です。その文字の修飾キーのみが考慮されます。ユーザーがキーボード"
"キーを入力するたびに、あたかもそれらの修飾キーが押し下げられているかのように"
"値が変更されます。例えば、<code class=\"code\">extra-keyboard-modifiers</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">?\\C-\\M-a</code> にバインドした場合、そのバイ"
"ンドのスコープ内で入力されるすべてのキーボード文字に、control および meta 修"
"飾キーが適用されます。整数 0 に相当する文字 <code class=\"code\">?\\C-@</"
"code> は、この目的においては control 文字とはみなされず、修飾キーを持たない文"
"字として扱われます。したがって、<code class=\"code\">extra-keyboard-"
"modifiers</code> を 0 に設定すると、あらゆる修飾が解除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"When using a window system, the program can press any of the modifier keys "
"in this way.  Otherwise, only the <kbd class=\"key\">CTL</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd> keys can be virtually pressed."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウシステムを使用している場合、プログラムはこの方法で任意の修飾キーを"
"押すことができます。それ以外の場合は、<kbd class=\"key\">CTL</kbd> および "
"<kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd> キーのみを仮想的に押すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"Note that this variable applies only to events that really come from the "
"keyboard, and has no effect on mouse events or any other events."
msgstr ""
"なお、この変数は実際にキーボードから発生したイベントにのみ適用され、マウスイ"
"ベントやその他のイベントには影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keyboard-translate-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-keyboard_002dtranslate_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keyboard-translate-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-keyboard_002dtranslate_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"This terminal-local variable is the translate table for keyboard "
"characters.  It lets you reshuffle the keys on the keyboard without changing "
"any command bindings.  Its value is normally a char-table, or else <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  (It can also be a string or vector, but this is "
"considered obsolete.)"
msgstr ""
"この端末ローカル変数は、キーボード文字の変換テーブルです。これにより、コマン"
"ドバインディングを変更することなく、キーボードのキー配置を入れ替えることがで"
"きます。その値は通常、char-table または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"す。（文字列やベクトルである場合もありますが、これらは非推奨とされていま"
"す。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-table</code> is a char-table (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>), then each "
"character read from the keyboard is looked up in this char-table.  If the "
"value found there is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then it is used "
"instead of the actual input character."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-table</code> が文字テーブル（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">文字テーブル</a>を参照）である"
"場合、キーボードから読み込まれた各文字はこの文字テーブルで検索されます。そこ"
"で見つかった値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、実際の入力文字"
"の代わりにその値が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"Note that this translation is the first thing that happens to a character "
"after it is read from the terminal.  Record-keeping features such as <code "
"class=\"code\">recent-keys</code> and dribble files record the characters "
"after translation."
msgstr ""
"なお、この変換は、ターミナルから文字が読み込まれた後に最初に行われる処理であ"
"ることに注意してください。<code class=\"code\">recent-keys</code> やドリブ"
"ファイルなどの記録機能は、変換後の文字を記録します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"Note also that this translation is done before the characters are supplied "
"to input methods (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input "
"Methods</a>).  Use <code class=\"code\">translation-table-for-input</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Translation-of-Characters.html\">Translation "
"of Characters</a>), if you want to translate characters after input methods "
"operate."
msgstr ""
"また、この翻訳は文字が入力メソッドに提供される前に行われる点にご注意ください"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">入力メソッド</a>を参照）。入"
"力メソッドが動作した後に文字を翻訳したい場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">translation-table-for-input</code> を使用してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Translation-of-Characters.html\">文字の翻訳</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">key-translate</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from to</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-key_002dtranslate\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">key-translate</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from to</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-key_002dtranslate\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"This command modifies <code class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-table</code> "
"to translate character code <var class=\"var\">from</var> into character "
"code <var class=\"var\">to</var>.  Interactively, it prompts for <var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> and <var class=\"var\">to</var>.  It creates the "
"keyboard translate table if necessary.  Both <var class=\"var\">from</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">to</var> should be strings that satisfy <code "
"class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Sequences.html\">Key Sequences</a>).  If <var class=\"var\">to</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function removes any existing "
"translation for <var class=\"var\">from</var>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、文字コード <var class=\"var\">from</var> を文字コード <var "
"class=\"var\">to</var> に変換するため、<code class=\"code\">keyboard-"
"translate-table</code> を変更します。対話モードでは、<var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> と <var class=\"var\">to</var> の入力を求めます。必"
"要に応じて、キーボード変換テーブルを作成します。<var class=\"var\">from</"
"var> と <var class=\"var\">to</var> はともに <code class=\"code\">key-valid-"
"p</code> を満たす文字列である必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Sequences.html\">キーシーケンス</a> を参照）。<var class=\"var\">to</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">from</"
"var> に対する既存の変換をすべて削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s an example of using the <code class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-"
"table</code> to make <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</"
"kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd> perform the cut, copy and paste "
"operations:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keyboard-translate-table</code> を使用して <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"v</kbd> に切り取り、コピー、貼り付け操作を行わせる例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(key-translate &quot;C-x&quot; &quot;&lt;control-x&gt;&quot;)\n"
"(key-translate &quot;C-c&quot; &quot;&lt;control-c&gt;&quot;)\n"
"(key-translate &quot;C-v&quot; &quot;&lt;control-v&gt;&quot;)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;&lt;control-x&gt;&quot; 'kill-region)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;&lt;control-c&gt;&quot; 'kill-ring-save)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;&lt;control-v&gt;&quot; 'yank)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"On a graphical terminal that supports extended <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> input, you can still get the standard Emacs "
"meanings of one of those characters by typing it with the shift key.  That "
"makes it a different character as far as keyboard translation is concerned, "
"but it has the same usual meaning."
msgstr ""
"拡張<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>入力に対応したグラフィカル端末では、"
"Shiftキーを押しながら入力することで、それらの文字のうちの1つにEmacs標準の意味"
"を持たせることができます。これにより、キーボード変換上は別の文字になります"
"が、通常の意味は同じです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Translation-Keymaps.html\">Keymaps for "
"Translating Sequences of Events</a>, for mechanisms that translate event "
"sequences at the level of <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>.  If "
"you need to translate input events that are not characters (i.e., <code "
"class=\"code\">characterp</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for "
"them), you must use the event translation mechanism described there."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>レベルでイベントシーケンスを変換"
"する仕組みについては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Translation-Keymaps.html\">イ"
"ベントシーケンス変換用のキーマップ</a>を参照してください。文字ではない入力イ"
"ベント（すなわち、<code class=\"code\">characterp</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すもの）を変換する必要がある場合は、そこで説明"
"されているイベント変換メカニズムを使用する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">key-translate-remove</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-key_002dtranslate_002dremove\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">key-translate-remove</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-key_002dtranslate_002dremove\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Event-Mod.html
msgid ""
"This command prompts for a key <var class=\"var\">from</var> and its "
"translation, and removes the translation from the translation table.  When "
"calling from Lisp, specify just the key <var class=\"var\">from</var>, "
"without its translation."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、キー <var class=\"var\">from</var> とその訳語の入力を求め、訳"
"語テーブルからその訳語を削除します。Lisp から呼び出す際は、訳語を指定せず、"
"キー <var class=\"var\">from</var> のみを指定してください。"

