# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The simplest way to examine text properties is to ask for the value of a "
"particular property of a particular character.  For that, use <code "
"class=\"code\">get-text-property</code>.  Use <code class=\"code\">text-"
"properties-at</code> to get the entire property list of a character.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Property-Search.html\">Text Property Search Functions</"
"a>, for functions to examine the properties of a number of characters at "
"once."
msgstr ""
"テキストプロパティを調べる最も簡単な方法は、特定の文字の特定のプロパティの値"
"を取得することです。これには <code class=\"code\">get-text-property</code> を"
"使用します。文字のプロパティ一覧全体を取得するには <code class=\"code\">text-"
"properties-at</code> を使用します。複数の文字のプロパティを一度に調べる関数に"
"ついては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Property-Search.html\">テキストプロパティ"
"検索関数</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"These functions handle both strings and buffers.  Keep in mind that "
"positions in a string start from 0, whereas positions in a buffer start from "
"1.  Passing a buffer other than the current buffer may be slow."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、文字列とバッファの両方を扱います。文字列の位置は 0 から始まり"
"ますが、バッファの位置は 1 から始まる点に注意してください。現在のバッファ以外"
"のバッファを渡すと、処理が遅くなる場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-text-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pos prop "
"&amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dtext_002dproperty\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-text-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pos prop "
"&amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dtext_002dproperty\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value of the <var class=\"var\">prop</var> "
"property of the character after position <var class=\"var\">pos</var> in "
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> (a buffer or string).  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is optional and defaults to the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var>（バッファまたは文字列）内の位置 "
"<var class=\"var\">pos</var> 以降の文字の <var class=\"var\">prop</var> プロ"
"パティの値を返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">object</var> は省略可能で、デ"
"フォルトでは現在のバッファが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">position</var> is at the end of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>, the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"but note that buffer narrowing does not affect the value.  That is, if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a buffer or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"and the buffer is narrowed and <var class=\"var\">position</var> is at the "
"end of the narrowed buffer, the result may be non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">position</var> が <var class=\"var\">object</var> の末尾に"
"ある場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となりますが、バッファの狭小化"
"は値に影響しない点に注意してください。つまり、<var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> がバッファまたは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であり、バッファが狭小"
"化され、<var class=\"var\">position</var> がその狭小化されたバッファの末尾に"
"ある場合、結果は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にならない可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If there is no <var class=\"var\">prop</var> property strictly speaking, but "
"the character has a property category that is a symbol, then <code "
"class=\"code\">get-text-property</code> returns the <var class=\"var\">prop</"
"var> property of that symbol."
msgstr ""
"厳密には <var class=\"var\">prop</var> プロパティが存在しないものの、その文字"
"がシンボルであるプロパティカテゴリを持つ場合、<code class=\"code\">get-text-"
"property</code> はそのシンボルの <var class=\"var\">prop</var> プロパティを返"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-char-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position "
"prop &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dchar_002dproperty\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-char-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position "
"prop &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dchar_002dproperty\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">get-text-property</code>, except "
"that it checks overlays first and then text properties.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Overlays.html\">Overlays</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">get-text-property</code> と同様ですが、まず"
"オーバーレイを確認し、次にテキストプロパティを確認します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Overlays.html\">オーバーレイ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">object</var> may be a string, a buffer, or a "
"window.  If it is a window, then the buffer displayed in that window is used "
"for text properties and overlays, but only the overlays active for that "
"window are considered.  If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a buffer, then "
"overlays in that buffer are considered first, in order of decreasing "
"priority, followed by the text properties.  If <var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> is a string, only text properties are considered, since strings never "
"have overlays."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">object</var> は、文字列、バッファ、またはウィンドウの"
"いずれかです。ウィンドウである場合、そのウィンドウに表示されているバッファが"
"テキストプロパティおよびオーバーレイに使用されますが、そのウィンドウで有効な"
"オーバーレイのみが考慮されます。<var class=\"var\">object</var> がバッファで"
"ある場合、まずそのバッファ内のオーバーレイが優先度の降順で考慮され、次にテキ"
"ストプロパティが考慮されます。<var class=\"var\">object</var> が文字列である"
"場合、文字列にオーバーレイは存在しないため、テキストプロパティのみが考慮され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Boundaries-of-text-and-overlay-properties\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Boundaries-of-text-and-overlay-properties\"></a>"

