"prop &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dpos_002dproperty\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-pos-property</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position "
"prop &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dpos_002dproperty\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">get-char-property</code>, except "
"that it pays attention to properties&rsquo; stickiness and overlays&rsquo; "
"advancement settings instead of the property of the character at (i.e., "
"right after)  <var class=\"var\">position</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は<code class=\"code\">get-char-property</code>と同様ですが、<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var>の位置（つまりその直後）にあるキャラクターのプロ"
"パティではなく、プロパティの「粘着性」や「オーバーレイ」の進行設定を考慮する"
"点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-char-property-and-overlay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">position prop &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-get_002dchar_002dproperty_002dand_002doverlay\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-char-property-and-overlay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">position prop &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-get_002dchar_002dproperty_002dand_002doverlay\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">get-char-property</code>, but gives extra "
"information about the overlay that the property value comes from."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">get-char-property</code> に似ていますが、プロパ"
"ティ値の由来となるオーバーレイに関する追加情報を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Its value is a cons cell whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is the "
"property value, the same value <code class=\"code\">get-char-property</code> "
"would return with the same arguments.  Its <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"is the overlay in which the property was found, or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, if it was found as a text property or not found at all."
msgstr ""
"その値は、<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> がプロパティ値となる cons セルであ"
"り、これは同じ引数で <code class=\"code\">get-char-property</code> が返す値と"
"同じです。<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> は、プロパティが見つかったオーバー"
"レイ、あるいはテキストプロパティとして見つかったか全く見つからなかった場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">position</var> is at the end of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>, both the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> and the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the value are <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">position</var> が <var class=\"var\">object</var> の末尾に"
"ある場合、その値の <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> と <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> はともに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-property-alias-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-char_002dproperty_002dalias_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-property-alias-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-char_002dproperty_002dalias_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds an alist which maps property names to a list of "
"alternative property names.  If a character does not specify a direct value "
"for a property, the alternative property names are consulted in order; the "
"first non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value is used.  This variable "
"takes precedence over <code class=\"code\">default-text-properties</code>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">category</code> properties take precedence over "
"this variable."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、プロパティ名を代替プロパティ名のリストにマッピングするalistが格"
"納されています。文字がプロパティの直接値を指定していない場合、代替プロパティ"
"名が順に参照され、最初の<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値が使用されま"
"す。この変数は<code class=\"code\">default-text-properties</code>よりも優先さ"
"れ、<code class=\"code\">category</code>プロパティはこの変数よりも優先されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">text-properties-at</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position "
"&amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"text_002dproperties_002dat\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">text-properties-at</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position "
"&amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"text_002dproperties_002dat\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the entire property list of the character at <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> in the string or buffer <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列またはバッファ <var class=\"var\">object</var> の <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> 番目の文字のプロパティリスト全体を返します。"
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、"
"現在のバッファがデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">default-text-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-default_002dtext_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">default-text-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-default_002dtext_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a property list giving default values for text "
"properties.  Whenever a character does not specify a value for a property, "
"neither directly, through a category symbol, or through <code "
"class=\"code\">char-property-alias-alist</code>, the value stored in this "
"list is used instead.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"この変数には、テキストプロパティのデフォルト値を指定したプロパティリストが格"
"納されています。文字がプロパティの値を、直接的に、カテゴリシンボルを介して、"
"あるいは <code class=\"code\">char-property-alias-alist</code> を通じて指定し"
"ていない場合は、代わりにこのリストに格納されている値が使用されます。以下に例"
"を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq default-text-properties '(foo 69)\n"
"      char-property-alias-alist nil)\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">Make sure character 1 has no properties of its own.</span>\n"
"(set-text-properties 1 2 nil)\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">What we get, when we ask, is the default value.</span>\n"
"(get-text-property 1 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; 69\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">object-intervals</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">OBJECT</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-object_002dintervals\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">object-intervals</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">OBJECT</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-object_002dintervals\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a copy of the intervals (i.e., text properties)  in "
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> as a list of intervals.  <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> must be a string or a buffer.  Altering the "
"structure of this list does not change the intervals in the object."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> 内の区間（すなわちテキストプロパ"
"ティ）のコピーを、区間のリストとして返します。<var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> は文字列またはバッファである必要があります。このリストの構造を変更して"
"も、オブジェクト内の区間は変更されません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(object-intervals (propertize &quot;foo&quot; 'face 'bold))\n"
"     &rArr; ((0 3 (face bold)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examining-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Each element in the returned list represents one interval.  Each interval "
"has three parts: The first is the start, the second is the end, and the "
"third part is the text property itself."
msgstr ""
"返されるリストの各要素は、1つの区間を表します。各区間は3つの部分で構成されて"
"おり、1つ目は開始位置、2つ目は終了位置、そして3つ目はテキストプロパティそのも"
"のです。"

