# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.7.2 Examples of <code class=\"code\">catch</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Examples-of-"
"catch-and-throw\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.7.2 <code class=\"code\">catch</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> の例<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Examples-"
"of-catch-and-throw\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"One way to use <code class=\"code\">catch</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> is to exit from a doubly nested loop.  (In most "
"languages, this would be done with a <code class=\"code\">goto</code>.)  "
"Here we compute <code class=\"code\">(foo <var class=\"var\">i</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">j</var>)</code> for <var class=\"var\">i</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">j</var> varying from 0 to 9:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">catch</code> と <code class=\"code\">throw</code> の使い"
"方の一つに、二重にネストされたループから抜けるというものがあります。（ほとん"
"どの言語では、これは <code class=\"code\">goto</code> を用いて行われます。）"
"ここでは、0から9まで変化する <var class=\"var\">i</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">j</var> に対して <code class=\"code\">(foo <var "
"class=\"var\">i</var> <var class=\"var\">j</var>)</code> を計算します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun search-foo ()\n"
"  (catch 'loop\n"
"    (let ((i 0))\n"
"      (while (&lt; i 10)\n"
"        (let ((j 0))\n"
"          (while (&lt; j 10)\n"
"            (if (foo i j)\n"
"                (throw 'loop (list i j)))\n"
"            (setq j (1+ j))))\n"
"        (setq i (1+ i))))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">foo</code> ever returns non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, we stop immediately and return a list of <var "
"class=\"var\">i</var> and <var class=\"var\">j</var>.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">foo</code> always returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the <code class=\"code\">catch</code> returns normally, and the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, since that is the result of the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"Here are two tricky examples, slightly different, showing two return points "
"at once.  First, two return points with the same tag, <code "
"class=\"code\">hack</code>:"
msgstr ""
"ここでは、2つの戻り点を同時に示す、わずかに異なる2つのトリッキーな例を挙げま"
"す。まず、同じタグ <code class=\"code\">hack</code> を持つ2つの戻り点です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun catch2 (tag)\n"
"  (catch tag\n"
"    (throw 'hack 'yes)))\n"
"&rArr; catch2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(catch 'hack\n"
"  (print (catch2 'hack))\n"
"  'no)\n"
"&#8867; yes\n"
"&rArr; no\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"Since both return points have tags that match the <code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code>, it goes to the inner one, the one established "
"in <code class=\"code\">catch2</code>.  Therefore, <code "
"class=\"code\">catch2</code> returns normally with value <code "
"class=\"code\">yes</code>, and this value is printed.  Finally the second "
"body form in the outer <code class=\"code\">catch</code>, which is <code "
"class=\"code\">'no</code>, is evaluated and returned from the outer <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code>."
msgstr ""
"両方の戻り値に <code class=\"code\">throw</code> と一致するタグがあるため、内"
"側の <code class=\"code\">catch2</code> で設定された方へと進みます。したがっ"
"て、<code class=\"code\">catch2</code> は値 <code class=\"code\">yes</code> "
"を通常通り返し、この値が出力されます。最後に、外側の <code "
"class=\"code\">catch</code> にある2番目のボディフォームである <code "
"class=\"code\">'no</code> が評価され、外側の <code class=\"code\">catch</"
"code> から返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"Now let&rsquo;s change the argument given to <code class=\"code\">catch2</"
"code>:"
msgstr ""
"それでは、<code class=\"code\">catch2</code>に与えられた引数を変更しましょ"
"う："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(catch 'hack\n"
"  (print (catch2 'quux))\n"
"  'no)\n"
"&rArr; yes\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"We still have two return points, but this time only the outer one has the "
"tag <code class=\"code\">hack</code>; the inner one has the tag <code "
"class=\"code\">quux</code> instead.  Therefore, <code class=\"code\">throw</"
"code> makes the outer <code class=\"code\">catch</code> return the value "
"<code class=\"code\">yes</code>.  The function <code class=\"code\">print</"
"code> is never called, and the body-form <code class=\"code\">'no</code> is "
"never evaluated."
msgstr ""
"戻り値の箇所はまだ2つありますが、今回は外側の箇所にのみタグ <code "
"class=\"code\">hack</code> が付いており、内側の箇所には代わりにタグ <code "
"class=\"code\">quux</code> が付いています。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> によって外側の <code class=\"code\">catch</code> "
"が値 <code class=\"code\">yes</code> を返します。関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">print</code> が呼び出されることはなく、ボディフォーム <code "
"class=\"code\">'no</code> が評価されることもありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Examples-of-Catch.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-label\">Next: </span><span "
