#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Close.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.3.2 Excess Close Parentheses<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Excess-Close-Parentheses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.3.2 閉じ括弧の過剰<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Excess-Close-"
"Parentheses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Close.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-excess-close-parentheses\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-excess-close-parentheses\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Close.html
msgid ""
"To deal with an excess close parenthesis, first go to the beginning of the "
"file, then type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u -1 C-M-u</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">backward-up-list</code> with an argument of &minus;1) to find "
"the end of the first unbalanced defun."
msgstr ""
"閉じ括弧が多すぎた場合は、まずファイルの先頭に移動し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u "
"-1 C-M-u</kbd>（引数に&minus;1を指定した<code class=\"code\">backward-up-"
"list</code>）と入力して、最初のバランスの取れていないdefunの末尾を探してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Close.html
msgid ""
"Then find the actual matching close parenthesis by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code>, see <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Expressions.html#Expressions\">Expressions</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)  at the beginning of that "
"defun.  This will leave you somewhere short of the place where the defun "
"ought to end.  It is possible that you will find a spurious close "
"parenthesis in that vicinity."
msgstr ""
"次に、その defun の先頭に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code>、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Expressions.html#Expressions\">Expressions</a> を参照) と入力して、実際に対応"
"する閉じ括弧を探してください。これにより、defun が終了すべき位置よりも手前の"
"場所にいることになります。その付近に、不要な閉じ括弧が見つかる可能性がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Close.html
msgid ""
"If you don&rsquo;t see a problem at that point, the next thing to do is to "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">indent-pp-sexp</"
"code>) at the beginning of the defun.  A range of lines will probably shift "
"left; if so, the missing open parenthesis or spurious close parenthesis is "
"probably near the first of those lines.  (However, don&rsquo;t assume this "
"is true; study the code to make sure.)  Once you have found the discrepancy, "
"undo the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-_</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">undo</code>), since the old indentation is probably "
"appropriate to the intended parentheses."
msgstr ""
"その時点で問題が見当たらない場合は、次に defun の先頭に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"M-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">indent-pp-sexp</code>) と入力してください。お"
"そらく数行分が左にずれます。もしそうであれば、欠落している開き括弧や不要な閉"
"じ括弧は、おそらくそれらの行の先頭付近にあるはずです。（ただし、必ずしもそう"
"であるとは限りません。コードを確認して確かめてください。）不一致箇所が見つ"
"かったら、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> を <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-_</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">undo</code>) で元に戻してください。元のインデントは、意"
"図した括弧に対して適切である可能性が高いためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Close.html
msgid ""
"After you think you have fixed the problem, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</"
"kbd> again.  If the old indentation actually fits the intended nesting of "
"parentheses, and you have put back those parentheses, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-"
"q</kbd> should not change anything."
msgstr ""
"問題が解決したと思ったら、再度 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> を使用してくだ"
"さい。元のインデントが実際には意図した括弧の入れ子構造に適合しており、かつそ"
"れらの括弧を元に戻したのであれば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> で何も変わる"
"ことはありません。"

