# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.3.1 Excess Open Parentheses<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Excess-Open-Parentheses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.3.1 開き括弧の過剰<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Excess-Open-"
"Parentheses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-excess-open-parentheses\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-excess-open-parentheses\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid ""
"The first step is to find the defun that is unbalanced.  If there is an "
"excess open parenthesis, the way to do this is to go to the end of the file "
"and type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-M-u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-"
"up-list</code>, see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Moving-by-Parens.html#Moving-by-"
"Parens\">Moving by Parens</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>).  This will move you to the beginning of the first defun that is "
"unbalanced."
msgstr ""
"最初のステップは、バランスが崩れている defun を見つけることです。開き括弧が"
"余っている場合は、ファイルの末尾に移動して <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-M-u</kbd>"
"（<code class=\"code\">backward-up-list</code>、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Moving-by-Parens.html#Moving-by-"
"Parens\">Moving by Parens</a> を参照）を入力します。これにより、バランスが崩"
"れている最初の defun の先頭に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid ""
"The next step is to determine precisely what is wrong.  There is no way to "
"be sure of this except by studying the program, but often the existing "
"indentation is a clue to where the parentheses should have been.  The "
"easiest way to use this clue is to reindent with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">indent-pp-sexp</code>, see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Multi_002dline-Indent.html#Multi_002dline-Indent\">Multi-line Indent</"
"a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>) and see what moves.  "
"<strong class=\"strong\">But don&rsquo;t do this yet!</strong> Keep reading, "
"first."
msgstr ""
"次のステップは、具体的に何が問題なのかを突き止めることです。プログラムを解析"
"する以外に確実な方法はありませんが、既存のインデントが、本来括弧があるべき場"
"所を示す手がかりになることがよくあります。この手がかりを利用する最も簡単な方"
"法は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd>（<code class=\"code\">indent-pp-sexp</"
"code>、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Multi_002dline-Indent.html#Multi_002dline-Indent\">Multi-line Indent</"
"a>を参照）で再インデントし、何が動くかを確認することです。<strong "
"class=\"strong\">ですが、まだこれは行わないでください！</strong> まずは読み進"
"めてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid ""
"Before you do this, make sure the defun has enough close parentheses.  "
"Otherwise, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> will get an error, or will "
"reindent all the rest of the file until the end.  So move to the end of the "
"defun and insert a close parenthesis there.  Don&rsquo;t use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code>) to move "
"there, since that too will fail to work until the defun is balanced."
msgstr ""
"この操作を行う前に、defun に閉じ括弧が十分にあることを確認してください。そう"
"でない場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> でエラーが発生するか、ファイルの末"
"尾まで残りの部分すべてが再インデントされてしまいます。そこで、defun の末尾に"
"移動し、そこに閉じ括弧を挿入してください。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-e</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code>) を使って移動しようとしないでくださ"
"い。defun のバランスが取れるまで、それらも同様に機能しないためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid ""
"Now you can go to the beginning of the defun and type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-"
"q</kbd>.  Usually all the lines from a certain point to the end of the "
"function will shift to the right.  There is probably a missing close "
"parenthesis, or a superfluous open parenthesis, near that point.  (However, "
"don&rsquo;t assume this is true; study the code to make sure.)  Once you "
"have found the discrepancy, undo the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> with "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-_</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">undo</code>), since the "
"old indentation is probably appropriate to the intended parentheses."
msgstr ""
"これで、関数の先頭に移動して <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> と入力できます。"
"通常、ある地点から関数の末尾までのすべての行が右にずれます。その地点の付近"
"に、閉じ括弧の抜けや、不要な開き括弧があるはずです。（ただし、必ずしもそうで"
"あるとは限りません。コードを確認して確かめてください。）不整合箇所が見つかっ"
"たら、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> を <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-_</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">undo</code>) で元に戻してください。元のインデントは、おそらく"
"意図された括弧の位置に適しているためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excess-Open.html
msgid ""
"After you think you have fixed the problem, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</"
"kbd> again.  If the old indentation actually fit the intended nesting of "
"parentheses, and you have put back those parentheses, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-"
"q</kbd> should not change anything."
msgstr ""
"問題が解決したと思ったら、再度 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> を使用してくだ"
"さい。元のインデントが実際には意図した括弧の入れ子構造に適合しており、それら"
"の括弧を元に戻したのであれば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> で何も変わること"
"はありません。"

