#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"<span>31.3 Excursions<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Excursions-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>31.3 エクスカーション<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Excursions-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-excursion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-excursion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"It is often useful to move point temporarily within a localized portion of "
"the program.  This is called an <em class=\"dfn\">excursion</em>, and it is "
"done with the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> special form.  This "
"construct remembers the initial identity of the current buffer, and its "
"value of point, and restores them after the excursion completes.  It is the "
"standard way to move point within one part of a program and avoid affecting "
"the rest of the program, and is used thousands of times in the Lisp sources "
"of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"プログラムの局所的な範囲内で一時的にポイントを移動させることは、しばしば有用"
"です。これは<em class=\"dfn\">エクスカーション</em>と呼ばれ、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>という特殊形式で行われます。この構文は、"
"現在のバッファの初期状態とポイントの値を記憶し、エクスカーション完了後にそれ"
"らを復元します。これは、プログラムの一部分内でポイントを移動させつつ、プログ"
"ラムの他の部分に影響を与えないための標準的な手法であり、EmacsのLispソース内で"
"数千回も使用されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"If you only need to save and restore the identity of the current buffer, use "
"<code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> or <code class=\"code\">with-"
"current-buffer</code> instead (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Current-"
"Buffer.html\">The Current Buffer</a>).  If you need to save or restore "
"window configurations, see the forms described in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">Window Configurations</a> and in <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Frame-Configurations.html\">Frame Configurations</a>."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファのアイデンティティを保存・復元するだけでよい場合は、代わりに "
"<code class=\"code\">save-current-buffer</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code> を使用してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Current-Buffer.html\">現在のバッファ</a> を参照）。"
"ウィンドウ構成を保存または復元する必要がある場合は、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ構成</a> および <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Frame-Configurations.html\">フレーム構成</a> で説明され"
"ている形式を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-excursion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-save_002dexcursion\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-excursion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-save_002dexcursion\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-point-excursion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-point-excursion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"This special form saves the identity of the current buffer and the value of "
"point in it, evaluates <var class=\"var\">body</var>, and finally restores "
"the buffer and its saved value of point.  Both saved values are restored "
"even in case of an abnormal exit via <code class=\"code\">throw</code> or "
"error (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">Nonlocal Exits</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"この特殊なフォームは、現在のバッファの識別子とその中のポイントの値を保存し、"
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>を評価し、最後にバッファと保存されたポイントの値"
"を復元します。<code class=\"code\">throw</code>やエラーによる異常終了の場合で"
"も、保存された両方の値は復元されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-"
"Exits.html\">非局所終了</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"The value returned by <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> is the "
"result of the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if no body forms were given."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> が返す値は、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> 内の最後のフォームの結果であり、ボディフォームが指定"
"されていない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の結果となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"Because <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> only saves point for the "
"buffer that was current at the start of the excursion, any changes made to "
"point in other buffers, during the excursion, will remain in effect "
"afterward.  This frequently leads to unintended consequences, so the byte "
"compiler warns if you call <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> during an "
"excursion:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> はエクスカーション開始時に有効だっ"
"たバッファの point のみを保存するため、エクスカーション中に他のバッファの "
"point に加えられた変更は、その後もそのまま保持されます。これにより意図しない"
"結果が生じることが多いため、バイトコンパイラはエクスカーション中に <code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> を呼び出した場合に警告を発します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Warning: Use ‘with-current-buffer’ rather than\n"
"         save-excursion+set-buffer\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"To avoid such problems, you should call <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> only after setting the desired current buffer, as in the following "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"このような問題を回避するには、以下の例のように、目的のカレントバッファを設定"
"してから <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> を呼び出すようにしてくだ"
"さい。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun append-string-to-buffer (string buffer)\n"
"  &quot;Append STRING to the end of BUFFER.&quot;\n"
"  (with-current-buffer buffer\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      (goto-char (point-max))\n"
"      (insert string))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-excursions\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-excursions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> does not restore window-"
"buffer correspondences altered by functions such as <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> などの関数によって変更されたウィンド"
"ウ・バッファの対応関係を復元しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> Ordinary insertion of text "
"adjacent to the saved point value relocates the saved value, just as it "
"relocates all markers.  More precisely, the saved value is a marker with "
"insertion type <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Marker-Insertion-Types.html\">Marker Insertion Types</a>.  Therefore, "
"when the saved point value is restored, it normally comes before the "
"inserted text."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> 保存済みポイント値の隣接箇所に通常の"
"テキストを挿入すると、すべてのマーカーと同様に、保存済み値の位置が移動しま"
"す。より正確には、保存済み値は挿入タイプ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の"
"マーカーです。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Marker-Insertion-Types.html\">マーカー"
"挿入タイプ</a>を参照してください。したがって、保存済みポイント値を復元する"
"と、通常は挿入されたテキストよりも前に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-mark-and-excursion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"save_002dmark_002dand_002dexcursion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
