# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Excursions.html
msgid ""
"This macro is like <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>, but also "
"saves and restores the mark location and <code class=\"code\">mark-active</"
"code>.  This macro does what <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> did "
