# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.2 Expansion of a Macro Call<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Expansion-of-a-Macro-Call\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.2 マクロ呼び出しの展開<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Expansion-"
"of-a-Macro-Call\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-expansion-of-macros\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-call\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-expansion-of-macros\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-call\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"A macro call looks just like a function call in that it is a list which "
"starts with the name of the macro.  The rest of the elements of the list are "
"the arguments of the macro."
msgstr ""
"マクロ呼び出しは、マクロ名で始まるリストであるという点で、関数呼び出しと全く"
"同じです。リストの残りの要素は、マクロの引数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Evaluation of the macro call begins like evaluation of a function call "
"except for one crucial difference: the macro arguments are the actual "
"expressions appearing in the macro call.  They are not evaluated before they "
"are given to the macro definition.  By contrast, the arguments of a function "
"are results of evaluating the elements of the function call list."
msgstr ""
"マクロ呼び出しの評価は、関数呼び出しの評価と同様に始まりますが、一点だけ決定"
"的な違いがあります。それは、マクロの引数が、マクロ呼び出し内に現れる実際の式"
"であるということです。これらの式は、マクロ定義に渡される前に評価されることは"
"ありません。対照的に、関数の引数は、関数呼び出しリストの各要素を評価した結果"
"となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Having obtained the arguments, Lisp invokes the macro definition just as a "
"function is invoked.  The argument variables of the macro are bound to the "
"argument values from the macro call, or to a list of them in the case of a "
"<code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> argument.  And the macro body executes "
"and returns its value just as a function body does."
msgstr ""
"引数を受け取ると、Lispは関数を呼び出すのと同様にマクロ定義を呼び出します。マ"
"クロの引数変数には、マクロ呼び出し時の引数値がバインドされ、<code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> 引数の場合はそのリストがバインドされます。そ"
"して、マクロ本体は関数本体と同様に実行され、その値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The second crucial difference between macros and functions is that the value "
"returned by the macro body is an alternate Lisp expression, also known as "
"the <em class=\"dfn\">expansion</em> of the macro.  The Lisp interpreter "
"proceeds to evaluate the expansion as soon as it comes back from the macro."
msgstr ""
"マクロと関数の2つ目の重要な違いは、マクロ本体から返される値が別のLisp式、すな"
"わちマクロの<em class=\"dfn\">展開</em>と呼ばれる点にある。Lispインタプリタ"
"は、マクロから戻るとすぐにその展開の評価を行う。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Since the expansion is evaluated in the normal manner, it may contain calls "
"to other macros.  It may even be a call to the same macro, though this is "
"unusual."
msgstr ""
"展開は通常の手順で評価されるため、他のマクロへの呼び出しが含まれる場合があり"
"ます。場合によっては同じマクロへの呼び出しになることもありますが、これは稀で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Note that Emacs tries to expand macros when loading an uncompiled Lisp "
"file.  This is not always possible, but if it is, it speeds up subsequent "
"execution.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"How-Programs-Do-Loading.html\">How "
"Programs Do Loading</a>."
msgstr ""
"なお、EmacsはコンパイルされていないLispファイルを読み込む際に、マクロを展開し"
"ようとします。これが常に可能とは限りませんが、可能な場合はその後の実行速度が"
"向上します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"How-Programs-Do-Loading.html\">プログラ"
"ムの読み込み方法</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"You can see the expansion of a given macro call by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code>を呼び出すことで、特定のマクロ呼び出し"
"の展開内容を確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">macroexpand</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form "
"&amp;optional environment</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"macroexpand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">macroexpand</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form "
"&amp;optional environment</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"macroexpand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-expansion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-expansion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This function expands <var class=\"var\">form</var>, if it is a macro call.  "
"If the result is another macro call, it is expanded in turn, until something "
"which is not a macro call results.  That is the value returned by <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">form</var> is not "
"a macro call to begin with, it is returned as given."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">form</var> がマクロ呼び出しである場合にそれを"
"展開します。その結果が別のマクロ呼び出しである場合は、マクロ呼び出しではない"
"ものが得られるまで、順次展開されます。それが <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> によって返される値となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">form</var> がそもそもマクロ呼び出しでない場合は、そのまま返され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> does not look at the "
"subexpressions of <var class=\"var\">form</var> (although some macro "
"definitions may do so).  Even if they are macro calls themselves, <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> does not expand them."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> は <var class=\"var\">form</"
"var> の部分式を参照しません（一部のマクロ定義では参照する場合もあります）。た"
"とえそれら自体がマクロ呼び出しであっても、<code class=\"code\">macroexpand</"
"code> はそれらを展開しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> does not expand calls "
"to inline functions.  Normally there is no need for that, since a call to an "
"inline function is no harder to understand than a call to an ordinary "
"function."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> は、インライン関数の呼び出しを展"
"開しません。通常、インライン関数の呼び出しは通常の関数の呼び出しと比べて理解"
"しにくいわけではないため、そのような処理は不要です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">environment</var> is provided, it specifies an alist "
"of macro definitions that shadow the currently defined macros.  Byte "
"compilation uses this feature."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">environment</var> が指定されている場合、現在定義されている"
"マクロをシャドウするマクロ定義のアリリストを指定します。バイトコンパイルでは"
"この機能を利用します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro inc (var)\n"
"    (list 'setq var (list '1+ var)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(macroexpand '(inc r))\n"
"     &rArr; (setq r (1+ r))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro inc2 (var1 var2)\n"
"    (list 'progn (list 'inc var1) (list 'inc var2)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(macroexpand '(inc2 r s))\n"
"     &rArr; (progn (inc r) (inc s))  ; <span class=\"r\"><code class=\"code\">inc</code> not expanded here.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">macroexpand-all</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form "
"&amp;optional environment</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"macroexpand_002dall\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">macroexpand-all</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form "
"&amp;optional environment</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"macroexpand_002dall\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">macroexpand-all</code> expands macros like <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand</code>, but will look for and expand all macros "
"in <var class=\"var\">form</var>, not just at the top-level.  If no macros "
"are expanded, the return value is <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">macroexpand-all</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> のようなマクロを展開しますが、トップレベル"
"だけでなく、<var class=\"var\">form</var> 内のすべてのマクロを探して展開しま"
"す。マクロが一つも展開されない場合、戻り値は <code class=\"code\">eq</code> "
"から <var class=\"var\">form</var> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Repeating the example used for <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> above "
"with <code class=\"code\">macroexpand-all</code>, we see that <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand-all</code> <em class=\"emph\">does</em> expand "
"the embedded calls to <code class=\"code\">inc</code>:"
msgstr ""
"上記の <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> で用いた例を <code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand-all</code> でも繰り返すと、<code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand-all</code> が埋め込まれた呼び出しを <code "
"class=\"code\">inc</code> へと<em class=\"emph\">実際に</em>展開することがわ"
"かります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(macroexpand-all '(inc2 r s))\n"
"     &rArr; (progn (setq r (1+ r)) (setq s (1+ s)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">macroexpand-1</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form "
"&amp;optional environment</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"macroexpand_002d1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">macroexpand-1</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form "
"&amp;optional environment</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"macroexpand_002d1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This function expands macros like <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code>, "
"but it only performs one step of the expansion: if the result is another "
"macro call, <code class=\"code\">macroexpand-1</code> will not expand it."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">macroexpand</code> のようなマクロを展開します"
"が、展開は1ステップのみ行われます。結果が別のマクロ呼び出しである場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">macroexpand-1</code> はそれを展開しません。"

