# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<span>23.18.1.2 Extended Menu Items<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Extended-Menu-Items-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.18.1.2 拡張メニュー項目<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Extended-"
"Menu-Items-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-menu_002ditem\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-extended-menu-item\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-menu_002ditem\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-extended-menu-item\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"An extended-format menu item is a more flexible and also cleaner alternative "
"to the simple format.  You define an event type with a binding that&rsquo;s "
"a list starting with the symbol <code class=\"code\">menu-item</code>.  For "
"a non-selectable string, the binding looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"拡張形式のメニュー項目は、シンプル形式に比べて柔軟性が高く、よりすっきりとし"
"た代替手段となります。イベントタイプは、シンボル <code class=\"code\">menu-"
"item</code> で始まるリスト形式のバインディングで定義します。選択不可の文字列"
"の場合、バインディングは次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(menu-item <var class=\"var\">item-name</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"A string starting with two or more dashes specifies a separator line; see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Menu-Separators.html\">Menu Separators</a>."
msgstr ""
"2つ以上のハイフンで始まる文字列は区切り線を指定します。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Menu-Separators.html\">メニューの区切り線</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"To define a real menu item which can be selected, the extended format "
"binding looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"選択可能な実際のメニュー項目を定義する場合、拡張フォーマットバインディングは"
"次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(menu-item <var class=\"var\">item-name</var> <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var>\n"
"    . <var class=\"var\">item-property-list</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"Here, <var class=\"var\">item-name</var> is an expression which evaluates to "
"the menu item string.  Thus, the string need not be a constant."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">item-name</var> はメニュー項目の文字列として評価さ"
"れる式です。したがって、その文字列は定数である必要はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The third element, <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var>, can be the command "
"to execute (in which case you get a normal menu item).  It can also be a "
"keymap, which will result in a submenu, and <var class=\"var\">item-name</"
"var> is used as the submenu name.  Finally, it can be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case you will get a non-selectable menu "
"item.  This is mostly useful when creating separator lines and the like."
msgstr ""
"3番目の要素 <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var> は、実行するコマンドを指定"
"できます（この場合、通常のメニュー項目になります）。また、キーマップを指定す"
"ることもでき、その場合はサブメニューとなり、<var class=\"var\">item-name</"
"var> がサブメニュー名として使用されます。最後に、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を指定することもでき、この場合は選択不能なメニュー項目になります。これ"
"は主に区切り線などを作成する際に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The tail of the list, <var class=\"var\">item-property-list</var>, has the "
"form of a property list (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Property-"
"Lists.html\">Property Lists</a>) which contains other information."
msgstr ""
"リストの末尾にある <var class=\"var\">item-property-list</var> は、他の情報を"
"含むプロパティリスト（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Property-Lists.html\">プロパ"
"ティリスト</a> を参照）の形式をしています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "Here is a table of the properties that are supported:"
msgstr "サポートされているプロパティの一覧は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:enable <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:enable <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The result of evaluating <var class=\"var\">form</var> determines whether "
"the item is enabled (non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means yes).  If the "
"item is not enabled, you can&rsquo;t really click on it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">form</var> を評価した結果によって、その項目が有効かどうか"
"が決まります（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は有効です）。項目が"
"有効でない場合、実際にはクリックできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:visible <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:visible <var class=\"var\">form</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The result of evaluating <var class=\"var\">form</var> determines whether "
"the item should actually appear in the menu (non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> means yes).  If the item does not appear, then the menu is displayed "
"as if this item were not defined at all."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">form</var> を評価した結果によって、その項目を実際にメ"
"ニューに表示するかどうかが決定されます（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"の場合は表示されます）。項目が表示されない場合は、その項目が一切定義されてい"
"ないかのようにメニューが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The value of this property, <var class=\"var\">help</var>, specifies a help-"
"echo string to display while the mouse is on that item.  This is displayed "
"in the same way as <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> text properties "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html#Help-display\">Help "
"display</a>).  Note that this must be a constant string, unlike the <code "
"class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property for text and overlays."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティ <var class=\"var\">help</var> の値は、マウスがそのアイテム上に"
"ある間に表示されるヘルプエコー文字列を指定します。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">help-echo</code> のテキストプロパティと同様に表示されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html#Help-display\">ヘルプ表示</a> "
"を参照）。なお、テキストやオーバーレイ用の <code class=\"code\">help-echo</"
"code> プロパティとは異なり、これは定数文字列である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:button (<var class=\"var\">type</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">selected</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:button (<var class=\"var\">type</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">selected</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"This property provides a way to define radio buttons and toggle buttons.  "
"The <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">type</var>, says "
"which: it should be <code class=\"code\">:toggle</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">:radio</code>.  The <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>, <var "
"class=\"var\">selected</var>, should be a form; the result of evaluating it "
"says whether this button is currently selected."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティでは、ラジオボタンやトグルボタンを定義できます。<small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">type</var> は、どちらであるか"
"（<code class=\"code\">:toggle</code> か <code class=\"code\">:radio</code> "
"か）を示します。<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>, <var "
"class=\"var\">selected</var> はフォームである必要があり、それを評価した結果に"
"よって、このボタンが現在選択されているかどうかが分かります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">toggle</em> is a menu item which is labeled as either on "
"or off according to the value of <var class=\"var\">selected</var>.  The "
"command itself should toggle <var class=\"var\">selected</var>, setting it "
"to <code class=\"code\">t</code> if it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"and to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>.  Here is how the menu item to toggle the <code class=\"code\">debug-"
"on-error</code> flag is defined:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(menu-item &quot;Debug on Error&quot; toggle-debug-on-error\n"
"           :button (:toggle\n"
"                    . (and (boundp 'debug-on-error)\n"
"                           debug-on-error)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"This works because <code class=\"code\">toggle-debug-on-error</code> is "
"defined as a command which toggles the variable <code class=\"code\">debug-"
"on-error</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">toggle-debug-on-error</code> が変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">debug-on-error</code> を切り替えるコマンドとして定義されている"
"ためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Radio buttons</em> are a group of menu items, in which at "
"any time one and only one is selected.  There should be a variable whose "
"value says which one is selected at any time.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">selected</var> form for each radio button in the group should "
"check whether the variable has the right value for selecting that button.  "
"Clicking on the button should set the variable so that the button you "
"clicked on becomes selected."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ラジオボタン</em>はメニュー項目のグループであり、任意の時点"
"でただ1つだけが選択されます。どの項目が選択されているかを示す値を持つ変数を用"
"意する必要があります。グループ内の各ラジオボタンの<var "
"class=\"var\">selected</var>フォームでは、その変数がそのボタンを選択するため"
"の正しい値を持っているかを確認する必要があります。ボタンをクリックすると、ク"
"リックしたボタンが選択されるように変数が設定される必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:key-sequence <var class=\"var\">key-sequence</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:key-sequence <var class=\"var\">key-sequence</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"This property specifies which key sequence to display as keyboard "
"equivalent.  Before Emacs displays <var class=\"var\">key-sequence</var> in "
"the menu, it verifies that <var class=\"var\">key-sequence</var> is really "
"equivalent to this menu item, so it only has an effect if you specify a "
"correct key sequence.  Specifying <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">key-sequence</var> is equivalent to the <code "
"class=\"code\">:key-sequence</code> attribute being absent."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、キーボード相当として表示するキーシーケンスを指定します。"
"Emacsはメニューに<var class=\"var\">key-sequence</var>を表示する前に、<var "
"class=\"var\">key-sequence</var>が実際にこのメニュー項目と同等であるかを確認"
"するため、正しいキーシーケンスを指定した場合にのみ効果が現れます。<var "
"class=\"var\">key-sequence</var>に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を指定するこ"
"とは、<code class=\"code\">:key-sequence</code>属性が存在しないことと同等で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:keys <var class=\"var\">string</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:keys <var class=\"var\">string</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"This property specifies that <var class=\"var\">string</var> is the string "
"to display as the keyboard equivalent for this menu item.  You can use the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\[...]</samp>&rsquo; documentation construct "
"in <var class=\"var\">string</var>."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、<var class=\"var\">string</var> がこのメニュー項目のキー"
"ボード相当として表示される文字列であることを指定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> では &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\[...]</"
"samp>&rsquo; ドキュメント構文を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"This property can also be a function (which will be called with no "
"arguments).  This function should return a string.  This function will be "
"called every time the menu is computed, so using a function that takes a lot "
"of time to compute is not a good idea, and it should expect to be called "
"from any context."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティには関数を指定することもできます（この場合、引数なしで呼び出さ"
"れます）。この関数は文字列を返す必要があります。この関数はメニューが計算され"
"るたびに呼び出されるため、計算に時間を要する関数を使用するのは得策ではなく、"
"また、あらゆるコンテキストから呼び出されることを想定して設計する必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:filter <var class=\"var\">filter-fn</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:filter <var class=\"var\">filter-fn</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"This property provides a way to compute the menu item dynamically.  The "
"property value <var class=\"var\">filter-fn</var> should be a function of "
"one argument; when it is called, its argument will be <var "
"class=\"var\">real-binding</var>.  The function should return the binding to "
"use instead."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティを使用すると、メニュー項目を動的に計算できます。プロパティ値 "
"<var class=\"var\">filter-fn</var> は1つの引数を取る関数である必要があり、呼"
"び出された際の引数は <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var> となります。この関"
"数は、代わりに使用すべきバインディングを返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can call this function at any time that it does redisplay or operates "
"on menu data structures, so you should write it so it can safely be called "
"at any time."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、再表示を行う際やメニューのデータ構造を操作する際にいつでもこの関数を"
"呼び出すことができるため、いつでも安全に呼び出せるように記述してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:wrap <var class=\"var\">wrap-p</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:wrap <var class=\"var\">wrap-p</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">wrap-p</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"inside a tool bar, the menu item is not displayed, but instead causes "
"subsequent items to be displayed on a new line.  This is not supported when "
"Emacs uses the GTK+ or Nextstep toolkits."
msgstr ""
"ツールバー内で <var class=\"var\">wrap-p</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、メニュー項目は表示されず、代わりに後続の項目が改行して表示"
"されます。これは、Emacs が GTK+ または Nextstep ツールキットを使用している場"
"合にはサポートされていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extended-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-label\">Next: </span><span "
"class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"Menu-Separators.html\">Menu Separators</a></"
"span></span>, <span class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-label\">Previous: "
"</span><span class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"Simple-Menu-Items.html\">Simple "
