# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.3.3.3 Defining new <code class=\"code\">rx</code> forms<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Defining-new-rx-forms\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.3.3.3 新しい <code class=\"code\">rx</code> フォームの定義<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Defining-new-rx-forms\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">rx</code> notation can be extended by defining new "
"symbols and parameterized forms in terms of other <code class=\"code\">rx</"
"code> expressions.  This is handy for sharing parts between several regexps, "
"and for making complex ones easier to build and understand by putting them "
"together from smaller pieces."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">rx</code> 記法は、他の <code class=\"code\">rx</code> 式"
"を用いて新しい記号やパラメータ化された形式を定義することで、拡張可能です。こ"
"れは、複数の正規表現間で部分を共有したり、複雑な正規表現を小さな構成要素から"
"組み合わせることで、構築や理解を容易にしたりする際に便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"For example, you could define <code class=\"code\">name</code> to mean <code "
"class=\"code\">(one-or-more letter)</code>, and <code class=\"code\">(quoted "
"<var class=\"var\">x</var>)</code> to mean <code class=\"code\">(seq ?' <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> ?')</code> for any <var class=\"var\">x</var>.  These "
"forms could then be used in <code class=\"code\">rx</code> expressions like "
"any other: <code class=\"code\">(rx (quoted name))</code> would match a "
"nonempty sequence of letters inside single quotes."
msgstr ""
"例えば、任意の <var class=\"var\">x</var> に対して、<code "
"class=\"code\">name</code> を <code class=\"code\">(one-or-more letter)</"
"code> の意味に、<code class=\"code\">(quoted <var class=\"var\">x</var>)</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">(seq ?' <var class=\"var\">x</var> ?')</code> "
"の意味に定義することができます。これらの形式は、他の形式と同様に <code "
"class=\"code\">rx</code> 式で使用でき、例えば <code class=\"code\">(rx "
"(quoted name))</code> はシングルクォートで囲まれた空でない文字シーケンスに"
"マッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"The Lisp macros below provide different ways of binding names to "
"definitions.  Common to all of them are the following rules:"
msgstr ""
"以下のLispマクロは、名前を定義に結びつけるためのさまざまな方法を提供します。"
"これらすべてに共通するルールは以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Built-in <code class=\"code\">rx</code> forms, like <code "
"class=\"code\">digit</code> and <code class=\"code\">group</code>, cannot be "
"redefined."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">digit</code> や <code class=\"code\">group</code> のよう"
"な組み込みの <code class=\"code\">rx</code> フォームは、再定義できません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"The definitions live in a name space of their own, separate from that of "
"Lisp variables.  There is thus no need to attach a suffix like <code "
"class=\"code\">-regexp</code> to names; they cannot collide with anything "
"else."
msgstr ""
"定義はLisp変数の名前空間とは別の、独自の名前空間に存在します。したがって、名"
"前に<code class=\"code\">-regexp</code>のような接尾辞を付ける必要はなく、他の"
"何かと衝突することもありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Definitions cannot refer to themselves recursively, directly or indirectly.  "
"If you find yourself needing this, you want a parser, not a regular "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"定義は、直接的か間接的かを問わず、自分自身を再帰的に参照することはできませ"
"ん。もしそのような機能が必要になったのであれば、正規表現ではなくパーサーが必"
"要です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Definitions are only ever expanded in calls to <code class=\"code\">rx</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">rx-to-string</code>, not merely by their "
"presence in definition macros.  This means that the order of definitions "
"doesn&rsquo;t matter, even when they refer to each other, and that syntax "
"errors only show up when they are used, not when they are defined."
msgstr ""
"定義が拡張されるのは、<code class=\"code\">rx</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">rx-to-string</code> の呼び出し時のみであり、単に定義マクロに含"
"まれているだけでは拡張されません。つまり、定義同士が互いに参照し合っている場"
"合であっても定義の順序は関係なく、構文エラーは定義時ではなく、使用された時に"
"のみ発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"User-defined forms are allowed wherever arbitrary <code class=\"code\">rx</"
"code> expressions are expected; for example, in the body of a <code "
"class=\"code\">zero-or-one</code> form, but not inside <code "
"class=\"code\">any</code> or <code class=\"code\">category</code> forms.  "
"They are also allowed inside <code class=\"code\">not</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">intersection</code> forms."
msgstr ""
"ユーザー定義フォームは、任意の <code class=\"code\">rx</code> 式が期待される"
"箇所であればどこでも使用可能です。例えば、<code class=\"code\">zero-or-one</"
"code> フォームの本文内では使用できますが、<code class=\"code\">any</code> や "
"<code class=\"code\">category</code> フォーム内では使用できません。また、"
"<code class=\"code\">not</code> および <code class=\"code\">intersection</"
"code> フォーム内でも使用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rx-define</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name [arglist] rx-"
"form</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-rx_002ddefine\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rx-define</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name [arglist] rx-"
"form</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-rx_002ddefine\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Define <var class=\"var\">name</var> globally in all subsequent calls to "
"<code class=\"code\">rx</code> and <code class=\"code\">rx-to-string</"
"code>.  If <var class=\"var\">arglist</var> is absent, then <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is defined as a plain symbol to be replaced with "
"<var class=\"var\">rx-form</var>.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"それ以降の <code class=\"code\">rx</code> および <code class=\"code\">rx-to-"
"string</code> のすべての呼び出しにおいて、<var class=\"var\">name</var> をグ"
"ローバルに定義します。<var class=\"var\">arglist</var> が存在しない場合、"
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> は <var class=\"var\">rx-form</var> に置き換え"
"られる通常のシンボルとして定義されます。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(rx-define haskell-comment (seq &quot;--&quot; (zero-or-more nonl)))\n"
"(rx haskell-comment)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;--.*&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">arglist</var> is present, it must be a list of zero or "
"more argument names, and <var class=\"var\">name</var> is then defined as a "
"parameterized form.  When used in an <code class=\"code\">rx</code> "
"expression as <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>&hellip;)</code>, each <var class=\"var\">arg</var> "
"will replace the corresponding argument name inside <var class=\"var\">rx-"
"form</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">arglist</var> が存在する場合、それは0個以上の引数名のリス"
"トである必要があり、<var class=\"var\">name</var> はパラメータ化された形式と"
"して定義されます。<code class=\"code\">rx</code> 式の中で <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var> <var class=\"var\">arg</"
"var>&hellip;)</code> として使用される場合、各 <var class=\"var\">arg</var> "
"は <var class=\"var\">rx-form</var> 内の対応する引数名を置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">arglist</var> may end in <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</"
"code> and one final argument name, denoting a rest parameter.  The rest "
"parameter will expand to all extra actual argument values not matched by any "
"other parameter in <var class=\"var\">arglist</var>, spliced into <var "
"class=\"var\">rx-form</var> where it occurs.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">arglist</var> は <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> と"
"最後の引数名で終了する場合があり、これは rest パラメータを表します。rest パラ"
"メータは、<var class=\"var\">arglist</var> の他のどのパラメータにも一致しな"
"かったすべての追加の実引数値に展開され、<var class=\"var\">rx-form</var> の該"
"当する箇所に挿入されます。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(rx-define moan (x y &amp;rest r) (seq x (one-or-more y) r &quot;!&quot;))\n"
"(rx (moan &quot;MOO&quot; &quot;A&quot; &quot;MEE&quot; &quot;OW&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;MOOA+MEEOW!&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Since the definition is global, it is recommended to give <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> a package prefix to avoid name clashes with "
"definitions elsewhere, as is usual when naming non-local variables and "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"定義はグローバルであるため、非ローカル変数や関数に名前を付ける際の慣例に従"
"い、他の箇所の定義との名前の衝突を避けるため、<var class=\"var\">name</var> "
"にパッケージプレフィックスを付与することが推奨されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Forms defined this way only perform simple template substitution.  For "
"arbitrary computations, use them together with the <code class=\"code\">rx</"
"code> forms <code class=\"code\">eval</code>, <code class=\"code\">regexp</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">literal</code>.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"このように定義されたフォームは、単純なテンプレート置換のみを行います。任意の"
"計算を行う場合は、<code class=\"code\">rx</code> フォームを <code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code>、<code class=\"code\">regexp</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">literal</code> と組み合わせて使用してください。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun n-tuple-rx (n element)\n"
"  `(seq &quot;&lt;&quot;\n"
"        (group-n 1 ,element)\n"
"        ,@(mapcar (lambda (i) `(seq ?, (group-n ,i ,element)))\n"
"                  (number-sequence 2 n))\n"
"        &quot;&gt;&quot;))\n"
"(rx-define n-tuple (n element) (eval (n-tuple-rx n 'element)))\n"
"(rx (n-tuple 3 (+ (in &quot;0-9&quot;))))\n"
"  &rArr; &quot;&lt;\\\\(?1:[0-9]+\\\\),\\\\(?2:[0-9]+\\\\),\\\\(?3:[0-9]+\\\\)&gt;&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rx-let</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(bindings&hellip;) "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-rx_002dlet\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rx-let</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(bindings&hellip;) "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-rx_002dlet\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Make the <code class=\"code\">rx</code> definitions in <var "
"class=\"var\">bindings</var> available locally for <code class=\"code\">rx</"
"code> macro invocations in <var class=\"var\">body</var>, which is then "
"evaluated."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Each element of <var class=\"var\">bindings</var> is on the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var>&nbsp;[<var "
"class=\"var\">arglist</var>]&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">rx-form</var>)</code>, "
"where the parts have the same meaning as in <code class=\"code\">rx-define</"
"code> above.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">bindings</var> の各要素は形式 <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>&nbsp;[<var class=\"var\">arglist</var>]&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">rx-form</var>)</code> に従っており、各部分は上記の <code "
"class=\"code\">rx-define</code> と同様の意味を持ちます。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(rx-let ((comma-separated (item) (seq item (0+ &quot;,&quot; item)))\n"
"         (number (1+ digit))\n"
"         (numbers (comma-separated number)))\n"
"  (re-search-forward (rx &quot;(&quot; numbers &quot;)&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"The definitions are only available during the macro-expansion of <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>, and are thus not present during execution of "
"compiled code."
msgstr ""
"定義は<var class=\"var\">body</var>のマクロ展開時にのみ利用可能であるため、コ"
"ンパイル済みコードの実行時には存在しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">rx-let</code> can be used not only inside a function, "
"but also at top level to include global variable and function definitions "
"that need to share a common set of <code class=\"code\">rx</code> forms.  "
"Since the names are local inside <var class=\"var\">body</var>, there is no "
"need for any package prefixes.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">rx-let</code>は関数内だけでなく、トップレベルでも使用で"
"き、共通の<code class=\"code\">rx</code>形式セットを共有する必要があるグロー"
"バル変数や関数の定義を含めることができます。名前は<var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>内ではローカルであるため、パッケージプレフィックスは不要です。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(rx-let ((phone-number (seq (opt ?+) (1+ (any digit ?-)))))\n"
"  (defun find-next-phone-number ()\n"
"    (re-search-forward (rx phone-number)))\n"
"  (defun phone-number-p (string)\n"
"    (string-match-p (rx bos phone-number eos) string)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"The scope of the <code class=\"code\">rx-let</code> bindings is lexical, "
"which means that they are not visible outside <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"itself, even in functions called from <var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">rx-let</code> バインディングのスコープはレキシカルであ"
"り、つまり <var class=\"var\">body</var> から呼び出された関数内であっても、"
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> の外部からは参照できません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rx-let-eval</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">bindings "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"rx_002dlet_002deval\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">rx-let-eval</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">bindings "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"rx_002dlet_002deval\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate <var class=\"var\">bindings</var> to a list of bindings as in <code "
"class=\"code\">rx-let</code>, and evaluate <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"with those bindings in effect for calls to <code class=\"code\">rx-to-"
"string</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">bindings</var> を <code class=\"code\">rx-let</code> と同"
"様に束縛のリストとして評価し、<code class=\"code\">rx-to-string</code> の呼び"
"出しに対しては、それらの束縛が有効である状態で <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"を評価する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"This macro is similar to <code class=\"code\">rx-let</code>, except that the "
"<var class=\"var\">bindings</var> argument is evaluated (and thus needs to "
"be quoted if it is a list literal), and the definitions are substituted at "
"run time, which is required for <code class=\"code\">rx-to-string</code> to "
"work.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"このマクロは <code class=\"code\">rx-let</code> と似ていますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">bindings</var> 引数が評価される点（そのため、リストリテラルの場"
"合はクォートする必要があります）と、定義が実行時に置換される点が異なります。"
"<code class=\"code\">rx-to-string</code> を動作させるには、この置換が必要で"
"す。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(rx-let-eval\n"
"    '((ponder (x) (seq &quot;Where have all the &quot; x &quot; gone?&quot;)))\n"
"  (looking-at (rx-to-string\n"
"               '(ponder (or &quot;flowers&quot; &quot;young girls&quot;\n"
"                            &quot;left socks&quot;)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-Rx.html
msgid ""
"Another difference from <code class=\"code\">rx-let</code> is that the <var "
"class=\"var\">bindings</var> are dynamically scoped, and thus also available "
"in functions called from <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  However, they are "
"not visible inside functions defined in <var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">rx-let</code>とのもう一つの違いは、<var "
"class=\"var\">bindings</var>が動的にスコープされるため、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>から呼び出される関数内でも利用可能である点です。ただ"
"し、<var class=\"var\">body</var>で定義された関数内では参照できません。"

