#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.4.2 Extending <code class=\"code\">pcase</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Extending-pcase-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.4.2 <code class=\"code\">pcase</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Extending-pcase-1\"> &para;</a> の拡張</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pcase_002c-defining-new-kinds-of-"
"patterns\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pcase_002c-defining-new-kinds-of-"
"patterns\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">pcase</code> macro supports several kinds of "
"patterns (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pattern_002dMatching-"
"Conditional.html\">Pattern-Matching Conditional</a>).  You can add support "
"for other kinds of patterns using the <code class=\"code\">pcase-defmacro</"
"code> macro."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">pcase</code> マクロは、数種類のパターンをサポートしてい"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html\">パ"
"ターンマッチング条件</a>を参照）。<code class=\"code\">pcase-defmacro</code> "
"マクロを使用することで、他の種類のパターンへの対応を追加できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pcase-defmacro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args "
"[doc] &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pcase_002ddefmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pcase-defmacro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args "
"[doc] &amp;rest body</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"pcase_002ddefmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"Define a new kind of pattern for <code class=\"code\">pcase</code>, to be "
"invoked as <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">actual-args</var>)</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">pcase</"
"code> macro expands this into a function call that evaluates <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>, whose job it is to rewrite the invoked pattern "
"into some other pattern, in an environment where <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var> are bound to <var class=\"var\">actual-args</var>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"Additionally, arrange to display <var class=\"var\">doc</var> along with the "
"docstring of <code class=\"code\">pcase</code>.  By convention, <var "
"class=\"var\">doc</var> should use <code class=\"code\">EXPVAL</code> to "
"stand for the result of evaluating <var class=\"var\">expression</var> "
"(first arg to <code class=\"code\">pcase</code>)."
msgstr ""
"さらに、<var class=\"var\">doc</var> を <code class=\"code\">pcase</code> の"
"ドキュメント文字列と共に表示するように設定してください。慣例として、<var "
"class=\"var\">doc</var> では <code class=\"code\">EXPVAL</code> を用いて "
"<var class=\"var\">expression</var> の評価結果（<code class=\"code\">pcase</"
"code> の第1引数）を表すものとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"Typically, <var class=\"var\">body</var> rewrites the invoked pattern to use "
"more basic patterns.  Although all patterns eventually reduce to core "
"patterns, <code class=\"code\">body</code> need not use core patterns "
"straight away.  The following example defines two patterns, named <code "
"class=\"code\">less-than</code> and <code class=\"code\">integer-less-than</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"通常、<var class=\"var\">body</var> は呼び出されたパターンを、より基本的なパ"
"ターンを用いて書き換えます。すべてのパターンは最終的にコアパターンに帰着しま"
"すが、<code class=\"code\">body</code> が直ちにコアパターンを使用する必要はあ"
"りません。以下の例では、<code class=\"code\">less-than</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">integer-less-than</code> という2つのパターンを定義しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(pcase-defmacro less-than (n)\n"
"  &quot;Matches if EXPVAL is a number less than N.&quot;\n"
"  `(pred (&gt; ,n)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(pcase-defmacro integer-less-than (n)\n"
"  &quot;Matches if EXPVAL is an integer less than N.&quot;\n"
"  `(and (pred integerp)\n"
"        (less-than ,n)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Extending-pcase.html
msgid ""
"Note that the docstrings mention <var class=\"var\">args</var> (in this "
"case, only one: <code class=\"code\">n</code>) in the usual way, and also "
"mention <code class=\"code\">EXPVAL</code> by convention.  The first rewrite "
"(i.e., <var class=\"var\">body</var> for <code class=\"code\">less-than</"
"code>)  uses one core pattern: <code class=\"code\">pred</code>.  The second "
"uses two core patterns: <code class=\"code\">and</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">pred</code>, as well as the newly-defined pattern <code "
"class=\"code\">less-than</code>.  Both use a single backquote construct (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Backquote.html\">Backquote</a>)."
msgstr ""
"なお、ドキュメント文字列では、通常通り <var class=\"var\">args</var>（この場"
"合は <code class=\"code\">n</code> のみ）に言及しており、また慣習的に <code "
"class=\"code\">EXPVAL</code> についても言及しています。1回目の書き換え（すな"
"わち <code class=\"code\">less-than</code> を <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"に書き換える処理）では、1つのコアパターン <code class=\"code\">pred</code> が"
"使用されています。2回目では、2つのコアパターン <code class=\"code\">and</"
"code> と <code class=\"code\">pred</code>、および新たに定義されたパターン "
"<code class=\"code\">less-than</code> が使用されています。どちらも単一のバッ"
"ククォート構文（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Backquote.html\">バッククォート</"
"a> を参照）を使用しています。"

