# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Face attributes</em> determine the visual appearance of a "
"face.  The following table lists all the face attributes, their possible "
"values, and their effects."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">顔属性</em>は、顔の視覚的な外観を決定します。以下の表に、す"
"べての顔属性とその取り得る値、およびそれらの効果を記載します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unspecified_002c-face-attribute-"
"value\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unspecified_002c-face-attribute-"
"value\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Apart from the values given below, each face attribute can have the value "
"<code class=\"code\">unspecified</code>.  This special value means that the "
"face doesn&rsquo;t specify that attribute directly.  An <code "
"class=\"code\">unspecified</code> attribute tells Emacs to refer instead to "
"a parent face (see the description <code class=\"code\">:inherit</code> "
"attribute below); or, failing that, to an underlying face (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Displaying-Faces.html\">Displaying Faces</a>).  "
"(However, <code class=\"code\">unspecified</code> is not a valid value in "
"<code class=\"code\">defface</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"以下に示す値のほか、各フェイス属性には <code class=\"code\">unspecified</"
"code> という値を指定できます。この特殊な値は、そのフェイスが当該属性を直接指"
"定していないことを意味します。<code class=\"code\">unspecified</code> 属性"
"は、Emacs に対して代わりに親フェイス（後述の <code class=\"code\">:inherit</"
"code> 属性の説明を参照）、あるいはそれがなければ下位のフェイス（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Displaying-Faces.html\">フェイスの表示</a> を参照）を"
"参照するように指示します。（ただし、<code class=\"code\">defface</code> にお"
"いて <code class=\"code\">unspecified</code> は有効な値ではありません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reset_002c-face-attribute-value\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reset_002c-face-attribute-value\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"A face attribute can also have the value <code class=\"code\">reset</code>.  "
"This special value stands for the value of the corresponding attribute of "
"the <code class=\"code\">default</code> face."
msgstr ""
"顔属性には <code class=\"code\">reset</code> という値を指定することもできま"
"す。この特殊な値は、<code class=\"code\">default</code> 顔の対応する属性の値"
"を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">default</code> face must explicitly specify all "
"attributes, and cannot use the special value <code class=\"code\">reset</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">default</code> フェイスはすべての属性を明示的に指定する"
"必要があり、特殊値 <code class=\"code\">reset</code> は使用できません。"

