# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Background color, a string.  The value can be a system-defined color name, "
"or a hexadecimal color specification.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Color-"
"Names.html\">Color Names</a>."
msgstr ""
"背景色（文字列）。値には、システムで定義された色名、または16進数による色指定"
"を指定できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Color-Names.html\">色名</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-underlined-text\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:underline</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-underlined-text\"> &para;</a></"
