"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Whether or not characters should be underlined, and in what way.  The "
"possible values of the <code class=\"code\">:underline</code> attribute are:"
msgstr ""
"文字に下線を引くべきか否か、またどのような方法で引くか。<code "
"class=\"code\">:underline</code>属性の取り得る値は以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
