"href=\"#index-define_002dobsolete_002dface_002dalias\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-obsolete-face-alias</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">obsolete-face current-face when</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-define_002dobsolete_002dface_002dalias\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This macro defines <var class=\"var\">obsolete-face</var> as an alias for "
"<var class=\"var\">current-face</var>, and also marks it as obsolete, "
"indicating that it may be removed in the future.  <var class=\"var\">when</"
"var> should be a string indicating when <var class=\"var\">obsolete-face</"
"var> was made obsolete (usually a version number string)."
msgstr ""
