# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Remapping.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">face-remapping-alist</code> is used for "
"buffer-local or global changes in the appearance of a face.  For instance, "
"it is used to implement the <code class=\"code\">text-scale-adjust</code> "
"command (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Text-Scale.html#Text-Scale\">Text Scale</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">face-remapping-alist</code> は、フェイスの外観にお"
"けるバッファローカルまたはグローバルな変更に使用されます。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">text-scale-adjust</code> コマンドの実装に用いられます（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Text-"
"Scale.html#Text-Scale\">Text Scale</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Remapping.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-remapping-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"face_002dremapping_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-remapping-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"face_002dremapping_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Remapping.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is an alist whose elements have the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">face</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">remapping</var>)</code>.  This causes Emacs to display any "
"text having the face <var class=\"var\">face</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">remapping</var>, rather than the ordinary definition of <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、要素が <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">face</var> . "
"<var class=\"var\">remapping</var>)</code> という形式を持つアリストです。これ"
"により、Emacs はフェイス <var class=\"var\">face</var> を持つテキストを、通常"
"の <var class=\"var\">face</var> の定義ではなく、<var "
"class=\"var\">remapping</var> で表示するようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Remapping.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">remapping</var> may be any face spec suitable for a <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> text property: either a face (i.e., a face name "
"or a property list of attribute/value pairs), or a list of faces.  For "
"details, see the description of the <code class=\"code\">face</code> text "
"property in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">Properties "
"with Special Meanings</a>.  <var class=\"var\">remapping</var> serves as the "
"complete specification for the remapped face&mdash;it replaces the normal "
"definition of <var class=\"var\">face</var>, instead of modifying it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">remapping</var> は、<code class=\"code\">face</code> テキ"
"ストプロパティに適した任意のフェイス指定子（フェイス、すなわちフェイス名、ま"
"たは属性/値ペアのプロパティリスト、あるいはフェイスのリスト）を指定できます。"
"詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">特殊な意味"
"を持つプロパティ</a> における <code class=\"code\">face</code> テキストプロパ"
"ティの説明を参照してください。<var class=\"var\">remapping</var> は再マッピン"
"グされたフェイスの完全な仕様として機能し、<var class=\"var\">face</var> の通"
"常の定義を変更するのではなく、それに代わるものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Remapping.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">face-remapping-alist</code> is buffer-local, its "
"local value takes effect only within that buffer.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">face-remapping-alist</code> includes faces applicable only to "
"certain windows, by using the <code class=\"code\">(:filtered&nbsp;"
"(:window&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">param</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">val</"
"var>)&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">spec</var>)</code>, that face takes effect "
"only in windows that match the filter conditions (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Special-Properties.html\">Properties with Special Meanings</a>).  To "
"turn off face filtering temporarily, bind <code class=\"code\">face-filters-"
"always-match</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, then all "
"face filters will match any window."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">face-remapping-alist</code> がバッファローカルな場合、そ"
"のローカル値は当該バッファ内でのみ有効となります。<code class=\"code\">face-"
"remapping-alist</code> に特定のウィンドウにのみ適用されるフェイスが含まれてい"
"る場合、<code class=\"code\">(:filtered&nbsp;(:window&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">param</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">val</var>)&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">spec</var>)</code> を使用することで、そのフェイスはフィルタ条件"
"に一致するウィンドウでのみ有効になります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持つプロパティ</a>を参照）。フェイスフィルタリ"
"ングを一時的に無効にするには、<code class=\"code\">face-filters-always-"
"match</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値をバインドしてくださ"
"い。これにより、すべてのフェイスフィルタが任意のウィンドウに一致するようにな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Face-Remapping.html
msgid ""
