# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"This function constrains <var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> to the field that "
"<var class=\"var\">old-pos</var> belongs to&mdash;in other words, it returns "
"the position closest to <var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> that is in the same "
"field as <var class=\"var\">old-pos</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> を <var class=\"var\">old-pos</"
"var> が属するフィールドに制約します。言い換えれば、<var class=\"var\">old-"
"pos</var> と同じフィールド内で、<var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> に最も近い位"
"置を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then "
"<code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> uses the value of point "
"instead, and moves point to the resulting position in addition to returning "
"that position."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> は代わりにポイントの値を使"
"用し、その位置を返すとともに、ポイントを結果として得られた位置に移動させま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">old-pos</var> is at the boundary of two fields, then "
"the acceptable final positions depend on the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">escape-from-edge</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">escape-from-"
"edge</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then <var class=\"var\">new-"
"pos</var> must be in the field whose <code class=\"code\">field</code> "
"property equals what new characters inserted at <var class=\"var\">old-pos</"
"var> would inherit.  (This depends on the stickiness of the <code "
"class=\"code\">field</code> property for the characters before and after "
"<var class=\"var\">old-pos</var>.)  If <var class=\"var\">escape-from-edge</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var class=\"var\">new-pos</"
"var> can be anywhere in the two adjacent fields.  Additionally, if two "
"fields are separated by another field with the special value <code "
"class=\"code\">boundary</code>, then any point within this special field is "
"also considered to be on the boundary."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">old-pos</var> が2つのフィールドの境界にある場合、許容され"
"る最終位置は引数 <var class=\"var\">escape-from-edge</var> に依存します。"
"<var class=\"var\">escape-from-edge</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"である場合、<var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> は、<var class=\"var\">old-pos</"
"var> に挿入される新しい文字が継承する <code class=\"code\">field</code> プロ"
"パティの値と等しいフィールド内になければなりません。（これは、<var "
"class=\"var\">old-pos</var> の前後の文字における <code class=\"code\">field</"
"code> プロパティのスティッキネスに依存します。）<var class=\"var\">escape-"
"from-edge</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">new-pos</var> は隣接する2つのフィールド内の任意の場所に配置でき"
"ます。さらに、2つのフィールドが特殊な値 <code class=\"code\">boundary</code> "
"を持つ別のフィールドによって隔てられている場合、この特殊なフィールド内の任意"
"の点も境界上にあるものとみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"Commands like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> with no argument, that normally "
"move backward to a specific kind of location and stay there once there, "
"probably should specify <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">escape-from-edge</var>.  Other motion commands that check "
"fields should probably pass <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数のない <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> のようなコマンドは、通常、特定の種類"
"の場所まで後退してそこに留まるため、<var class=\"var\">escape-from-edge</"
"var> に対しては <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すべきでしょう。フィー"
"ルドを確認するその他の移動コマンドについても、<code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"を渡すのが望ましいでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">only-in-line</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, and constraining <var class=\"var\">new-pos</var> "
"in the usual way would move it to a different line, <var class=\"var\">new-"
"pos</var> is returned unconstrained.  This used in commands that move by "
"line, such as <code class=\"code\">next-line</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-line</code>, so that they respect field "
"boundaries only in the case where they can still move to the right line."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">only-in-line</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく、通常の方法で <var class=\"var\">new-pos</"
"var> を制約すると別の行に移動してしまう場合、<var class=\"var\">new-pos</"
"var> は制約なしで返されます。これは、<code class=\"code\">next-line</code> "
"や <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-line</code> のように行単位で移動するコマ"
"ンドにおいて、右の行へ移動可能な場合にのみフィールド境界を遵守させるために用"
"いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">inhibit-capture-property</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and <var class=\"var\">old-pos</var> "
"has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> property of that name, then any "
"field boundaries are ignored."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">inhibit-capture-property</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく、かつ <var class=\"var\">old-pos</var> が"
"同名の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のプロパティを持つ場合、フィールド"
"境界はすべて無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fields.html
msgid ""
"You can cause <code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> to ignore all "
"field boundaries (and so never constrain anything) by binding the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-field-text-motion</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">inhibit-field-text-motion</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値をバインドすることで、<code "
"class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> にすべてのフィールド境界を無視させる"
"（つまり、一切の制約を設けない）ことができます。"

