# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Some local variable settings will, by default, be heeded even if <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  By default, this is the case only for the <code "
"class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code> local variable setting, but this can "
"be controlled by using this variable, which is a list of symbols."
msgstr ""
"一部のローカル変数設定は、<code class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であってもデフォルトで適用されます。デフォ"
"ルトでは、これは <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code> のローカル変数設"
"定にのみ適用されますが、シンボルのリストであるこの変数を使用することで制御可"
"能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">safe-local-variable-directories</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-safe_002dlocal_002dvariable_002ddirectories\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
