"name\">safe-local-variable-directories</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-safe_002dlocal_002dvariable_002ddirectories\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This is a list of directories where local variables are always enabled.  "
"Directory-local variables loaded from these directories, such as the "
"variables in <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>, will be enabled "
"even if they are risky.  The directories in this list must be fully-expanded "
"absolute file names.  They may also be remote directories if the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">enable-remote-dir-locals</code> is set non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは、ローカル変数が常に有効になるディレクトリの一覧です。<samp "
"class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> の変数など、これらのディレクトリから読み"
"込まれるディレクトリローカル変数は、リスクがある場合でも有効になります。この"
"一覧に含まれるディレクトリは、完全展開された絶対ファイル名である必要がありま"
"す。また、変数 <code class=\"code\">enable-remote-dir-locals</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外に設定されている場合は、リモートディレクトリで"
"あっても構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">hack-local-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional handle-mode</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-hack_002dlocal_002dvariables\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">hack-local-variables</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional handle-mode</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-hack_002dlocal_002dvariables\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function parses, and binds or evaluates as appropriate, any local "
"variables specified by the contents of the current buffer.  The variable "
"<code class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code> has its effect here.  "
"However, this function does not look for the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">mode:</samp>&rsquo; local variable in the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-*-</samp>&rsquo; line.  <code class=\"code\">set-auto-mode</"
"code> does that, also taking <code class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</"
"code> into account (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-Mode.html\">How "
"Emacs Chooses a Major Mode</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファの内容で指定されたローカル変数を解析し、適宜バイン"
"ドまたは評価します。ここでは変数 <code class=\"code\">enable-local-"
"variables</code> が機能します。ただし、この関数は <samp class=\"samp\">-*-</"
"samp> 行の中でローカル変数 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mode:</samp>&rsquo; を"
"探しません。それを行うのが <code class=\"code\">set-auto-mode</code> であり、"
"<code class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code> も考慮に入れます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-Mode.html\">Emacs がメジャーモードを選択す"
"る仕組み</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function also puts into effect directory-local variables as specified "
"in <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>.  If the buffer is not "
"visiting any file, then the directory-local variables that apply are those "
"which would be applicable to files in the <code class=\"code\">default-"
