# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function completes the file name <var class=\"var\">filename</var> in "
"directory <var class=\"var\">directory</var>.  It returns the longest prefix "
"common to all file names in directory <var class=\"var\">directory</var> "
"that start with <var class=\"var\">filename</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> then it "
"ignores possible completions that don&rsquo;t satisfy <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var>, after calling that function with one "
"argument, the expanded absolute file name."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ディレクトリ <var class=\"var\">directory</var> 内のファイル名 "
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var> を補完します。また、ディレクトリ <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> 内の <var class=\"var\">filename</var> で始まる"
"すべてのファイル名に共通する最長の接頭辞を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"展開後の絶対ファイル名を1つの引数として当該関数を呼び出した後、<var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> を満たさない可能性のある補完結果を無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If only one match exists and <var class=\"var\">filename</var> matches it "
"exactly, the function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  The function "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if directory <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> contains no name starting with <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>."
msgstr ""
"マッチが1件のみ存在し、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> がそれに完全一致する"
"場合、関数は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。ディレクトリ <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> に <var class=\"var\">filename</var> で始まる名"
"前が存在しない場合、関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

