# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">file-name-completion</code> usually ignores file names "
"that end in any string in this list.  It does not ignore them when all the "
"possible completions end in one of these suffixes.  This variable has no "
"effect on <code class=\"code\">file-name-all-completions</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">file-name-completion</code> は通常、このリストに含まれる"
"いずれかの文字列で終わるファイル名を無視します。考えられる補完候補がすべてこ"
"れらの接尾辞のいずれかで終わる場合は、無視しません。この変数は <code "
"class=\"code\">file-name-all-completions</code> には影響しません。"

