# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Expanding</em> a file name means converting a relative "
"file name to an absolute one.  Since this is done relative to a default "
"directory, you must specify the default directory as well as the file name "
"to be expanded.  It also involves expanding abbreviations like <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/</samp> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Directory-"
"Names.html#abbreviate_002dfile_002dname\">abbreviate-file-name</a>), and "
"eliminating redundancies like <samp class=\"file\">./</samp> and <samp "
"class=\"file\"><var class=\"var\">name</var>/../</samp>."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名を<em class=\"dfn\">展開</em>するとは、相対ファイル名を絶対ファイル"
"名に変換することを指します。これはデフォルトディレクトリを基準に行われるた"
"め、展開対象のファイル名に加えて、デフォルトディレクトリも指定する必要があり"
"ます。また、<samp class=\"file\">~/</samp>のような略記の展開（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Directory-"
"Names.html#abbreviate_002dfile_002dname\">abbreviate-file-name</a>を参照）"
"や、<samp class=\"file\">./</samp>や<samp class=\"file\"><var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>/../</samp>といった冗長な表記の排除も含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
