"name.  If <var class=\"var\">directory</var> is supplied, it is the default "
"directory to start with if <var class=\"var\">filename</var> is relative and "
"does not start with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;.  (The value "
"of <var class=\"var\">directory</var> should itself be an absolute directory "
"name or directory file name; it may start with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;.)  Otherwise, the current buffer&rsquo;s "
"value of <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> is used.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">filename</var> を絶対ファイル名に変換します。"
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> が指定されている場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> が相対パスであり、かつ &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; で始まっていないときに、開始点となるデフォルト"
"のディレクトリとなります。（<var class=\"var\">directory</var> の値自体は、絶"
"対ディレクトリ名またはディレクトリファイル名である必要があり、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; で始まっていても構いません。）それ以外の場合"
"は、現在のバッファの <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> の値が使用"
"されます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/lewis/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;../foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;foo&quot; &quot;/usr/spool/&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/usr/spool/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"If the part of <var class=\"var\">filename</var> before the first slash is "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;, it expands to your home "
"directory, which is typically specified by the value of the <code "
"class=\"env\">HOME</code> environment variable (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/General-"
"Variables.html#General-Variables\">General Variables</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>).  If the part before the first "
"slash is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~<var class=\"var\">user</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; and if <var class=\"var\">user</var> is a valid login name, it "
"expands to <var class=\"var\">user</var>&rsquo;s home directory.  If you do "
"not want this expansion for a relative <var class=\"var\">filename</var> "
"that might begin with a literal &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;, "
"you can use <code class=\"code\">(concat (file-name-as-directory directory) "
"filename)</code> instead of <code class=\"code\">(expand-file-name filename "
"directory)</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var> の最初のスラッシュより前の部分が &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; である場合、それはホームディレクトリに展"
"開されます。ホームディレクトリは通常、環境変数 <code class=\"env\">HOME</"
"code> の値によって指定されます（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/General-Variables.html#General-Variables\">General "
"Variables</a> を参照してください）。最初のスラッシュより前の部分が &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">~<var class=\"var\">user</var></samp>&rsquo; であり、か"
"つ <var class=\"var\">user</var> が有効なログイン名である場合、それは <var "
"class=\"var\">user</var> のホームディレクトリに展開されます。リテラルの "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; で始まる可能性のある相対パスの "
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var> に対してこの展開を行いたくない場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">(expand-file-name filename directory)</code> の代わりに "
"<code class=\"code\">(concat (file-name-as-directory directory) filename)</"
"code> を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"File names containing &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; are simplified to their canonical form:"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; を含むファイル名は、正規形に簡略化されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;bar/../foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/lewis/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"In some cases, a leading &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; "
"component can remain in the output:"
msgstr ""
"場合によっては、先頭の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; コンポー"
"ネントが出力に残ることがあります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;../home&quot; &quot;/&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/../home&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This is for the sake of filesystems that have the concept of a superroot "
"above the root directory <samp class=\"file\">/</samp>.  On other "
"filesystems, <samp class=\"file\">/../</samp> is interpreted exactly the "
"same as <samp class=\"file\">/</samp>."
msgstr ""
"これは、ルートディレクトリの上にスーパールートという概念を持つファイルシステ"
"ム <samp class=\"file\">/</samp> を想定したものです。その他のファイルシステム"
"では、<samp class=\"file\">/../</samp> は <samp class=\"file\">/</samp> と全"
"く同様に解釈されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-empty-file-names_002c-and-"
"expand_002dfile_002dname\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-empty-file-names_002c-and-"
"expand_002dfile_002dname\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Expanding <samp class=\"file\">.</samp> or the empty string returns the "
"default directory:"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">.</samp> または空文字列を展開すると、デフォルトのディレ"
"クトリが返されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;.&quot; &quot;/usr/spool/&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/usr/spool&quot;\n"
"(expand-file-name &quot;&quot; &quot;/usr/spool/&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/usr/spool&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> does <em "
"class=\"emph\">not</em> expand environment variables; only <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> does that:"
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> は環境変数を展開<em "
"class=\"emph\">しません</em>。展開するのは <code class=\"code\">substitute-"
"in-file-name</code> のみです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;$HOME/foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/lewis/$HOME/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Note also that <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> does not follow "
"symbolic links at any level.  This results in a difference between the way "
"<code class=\"code\">file-truename</code> and <code class=\"code\">expand-"
"file-name</code> treat &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Assuming that &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/tmp/bar</samp>&rsquo; is a "
"symbolic link to the directory &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/tmp/foo/bar</"
"samp>&rsquo; we get:"
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> はいかなる階層においてもシ"
"ンボリックリンクを辿らない点にも注意してください。これにより、<code "
"class=\"code\">file-truename</code> と <code class=\"code\">expand-file-"
"name</code> が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; を扱う方法に違い"
"が生じます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/tmp/bar</samp>&rsquo; がディレクト"
"リ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/tmp/foo/bar</samp>&rsquo; へのシンボリックリ"
"ンクであると仮定すると、次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-truename &quot;/tmp/bar/../myfile&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/tmp/foo/myfile&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(expand-file-name &quot;/tmp/bar/../myfile&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/tmp/myfile&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"If you may need to follow symbolic links preceding &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo;, you should make sure to call <code "
"class=\"code\">file-truename</code> without prior direct or indirect calls "
"to <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Truenames.html\">Truenames</a>."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; より前のシンボリックリンクを辿る"
"必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> への直接的また"
"は間接的な呼び出しを事前に行わずに、必ず <code class=\"code\">file-truename</"
"code> を呼び出すようにしてください。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Truenames.html\">Truenames</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">default-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"default_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">default-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"default_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The value of this buffer-local variable is the default directory for the "
"current buffer.  It should be an absolute directory name; it may start with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;.  This variable is buffer-local "
"in every buffer."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数の値は、現在のバッファのデフォルトディレクトリです。"
"絶対ディレクトリ名である必要があり、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</"
"samp>&rsquo;で始まることができます。この変数は、すべてのバッファにおいてバッ"
"ファローカルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> uses the default directory when "
"its second argument is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> は、第2引数が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合にデフォルトのディレクトリを使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid "The value is always a string ending with a slash."
msgstr "値は常にスラッシュで終わる文字列です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"default-directory\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/user/lewis/manual/&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substitute-in-file-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"substitute_002din_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">substitute-in-file-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"substitute_002din_002dfile_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-"
"substitute_002din_002dfile_002dname\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-"
"substitute_002din_002dfile_002dname\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces environment variable references in <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> with the environment variable values.  "
"Following standard Unix shell syntax, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</"
"samp>&rsquo; is the prefix to substitute an environment variable value.  If "
"the input contains &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$$</samp>&rsquo;, that is "
"converted to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;; this gives the "
"user a way to quote a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> 内の環境変数参照を環境変数の値"
"で置換します。標準的な Unix シェルの構文に従い、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; は環境変数の値を置換するための接頭辞となりま"
"す。入力に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$$</samp>&rsquo; が含まれている場合、"
"それは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; に変換されます。これによ"
"り、ユーザーは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; をクォートすること"
"ができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The environment variable name is the series of alphanumeric characters "
"(including underscores) that follow the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  If the character following the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</"
"samp>&rsquo; is a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">{</samp>&rsquo;, then the "
"variable name is everything up to the matching &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">}"
"</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"環境変数名は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;に続く英数字（アン"
"ダースコアを含む）の文字列です。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;に"
"続く文字が&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">{</samp>&rsquo;である場合、変数名は対応"
"する&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">}</samp>&rsquo;までのすべての文字列となりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Calling <code class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> on output "
"produced by <code class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> tends to "
"give incorrect results.  For instance, use of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$"
"$</samp>&rsquo; to quote a single &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</"
"samp>&rsquo; won&rsquo;t work properly, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</"
"samp>&rsquo; in an environment variable&rsquo;s value could lead to repeated "
"substitution.  Therefore, programs that call this function and put the "
"output where it will be passed to this function need to double all &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; characters to prevent subsequent "
"incorrect results."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> によって生成された出力に"
"対して <code class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> を呼び出すと、誤っ"
"た結果になる傾向があります。例えば、単一の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</"
"samp>&rsquo; をクォートするために &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$$</"
"samp>&rsquo; を使用しても正しく動作しませんし、環境変数の値に含まれる &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; は置換の繰り返しを招く可能性があります。"
"したがって、この関数を呼び出し、その出力を同関数に渡すプログラムでは、後続の"
"誤った結果を防ぐため、すべての &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; 文"
"字を二重に記述する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Here we assume that the environment variable <code class=\"env\">HOME</"
"code>, which holds the user&rsquo;s home directory, has value &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/xcssun/users/rms</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、ユーザーのホームディレクトリを保持する環境変数 <code "
"class=\"env\">HOME</code> の値が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/xcssun/users/"
"rms</samp>&rsquo; であると仮定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-in-file-name &quot;$HOME/foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"After substitution, if a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; or a "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo; appears immediately after "
"another &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo;, the function discards "
"everything before it (up through the immediately preceding &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo;)."
msgstr ""
"置換後、別の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo; の直後に &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</"
"samp>&rsquo; が現れた場合、関数はそれより前の部分（直前の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo; まで）をすべて破棄します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-in-file-name &quot;bar/~/foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;~/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-in-file-name &quot;/usr/local/$HOME/foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/xcssun/users/rms/foo&quot;\n"
"     ;; <span class=\"r\"><samp class=\"file\">/usr/local/</samp> has been discarded.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is not desired to expand file names.  In such cases, the file "
"name can be quoted to suppress the expansion, and to handle the file name "
"literally.  Quoting happens by prefixing the file name with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/:</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名を展開したくない場合があります。そのような場合は、ファイル名を"
"クォートすることで展開を抑制し、ファイル名をリテラルとして扱うことができま"
"す。クォートは、ファイル名の先頭に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</"
"samp>&rsquo; を付加することで行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-name-quote</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dname_002dquote\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-name-quote</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dname_002dquote\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This macro adds the quotation prefix &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</"
"samp>&rsquo; to the file <var class=\"var\">name</var>.  For a local file "
"<var class=\"var\">name</var>, it prefixes <var class=\"var\">name</var> "
"with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</samp>&rsquo;.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is a remote file name, the local part of <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Magic-File-"
"Names.html\">Making Certain File Names &ldquo;Magic&rdquo;</a>) is quoted.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is already a quoted file name, <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is returned unchanged."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、ファイル <var class=\"var\">name</var> に引用符プレフィックス "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</samp>&rsquo; を追加します。ローカルファイル "
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> の場合は、<var class=\"var\">name</var> の先頭"
"に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</samp>&rsquo; を付加します。<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> がリモートファイル名である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> のローカル部分（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Magic-"
"File-Names.html\">特定のファイル名を「マジック」にする</a> を参照）が引用符で"
"囲まれます。<var class=\"var\">name</var> がすでに引用符で囲まれたファイル名"
"である場合、<var class=\"var\">name</var> はそのまま返されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-in-file-name (file-name-quote &quot;bar/~/foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/:bar/~/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(substitute-in-file-name (file-name-quote &quot;/ssh:host:bar/~/foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/ssh:host:/:bar/~/foo&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"The macro cannot be used to suppress file name handlers from magic file "
"names (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Magic-File-Names.html\">Making Certain "
"File Names &ldquo;Magic&rdquo;</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このマクロを使用して、マジックファイル名によるファイル名ハンドラを抑制するこ"
"とはできません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Magic-File-Names.html\">特定のファ"
"イル名を「マジック」にする</a>を参照）。"

