# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
msgid ""
"This macro removes the quotation prefix &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</"
"samp>&rsquo; from the file <var class=\"var\">name</var>, if any.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is a remote file name, the local part of <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is unquoted."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、ファイル <var class=\"var\">name</var> から引用符の接頭辞 "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/:</samp>&rsquo; があればそれを削除します。<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> がリモートファイル名の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> のローカル部分は引用符なしで扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/File-Name-Expansion.html
