"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-filling-text\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-filling-text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Filling</em> means adjusting the lengths of lines (by "
"moving the line breaks) so that they are nearly (but no greater than) a "
"specified maximum width.  Additionally, lines can be <em "
"class=\"dfn\">justified</em>, which means inserting spaces to make the left "
"and/or right margins line up precisely.  The width is controlled by the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code>.  For ease of reading, "
"lines should be no longer than 70 or so columns."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">詰め</em>とは、行の長さを（改行位置を移動させることで）指定"
"された最大幅とほぼ等しく（ただし最大幅を超えないように）調整することを指しま"
"す。また、行を<em class=\"dfn\">両端揃え</em>にすることもでき、これはスペース"
"を挿入して左右の余白を正確に揃えることを意味します。幅は変数<code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code>によって制御されます。読みやすさの観点から、"
"行の長さは70列程度以内に抑えるべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"You can use Auto Fill mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-"
"Filling.html\">Auto Filling</a>) to fill text automatically as you insert "
"it, but changes to existing text may leave it improperly filled.  Then you "
"must fill the text explicitly."
msgstr ""
"自動入力モード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Filling.html\">自動入力</a>を"
"参照）を使用すると、テキストの挿入に合わせて自動的に入力できますが、既存のテ"
"キストに変更が加えられた場合、正しく入力されないことがあります。その場合は、"
"手動でテキストを入力する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"Most of the commands in this section return values that are not meaningful.  "
"All the functions that do filling take note of the current left margin, "
"current right margin, and current justification style (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Margins.html\">Margins for Filling</a>).  If the "
"current justification style is <code class=\"code\">none</code>, the filling "
"functions don&rsquo;t actually do anything."
msgstr ""
"本セクションのコマンドの多くは、意味のない値を返します。塗りつぶしを行うすべ"
"ての関数は、現在の左マージン、現在の右マージン、および現在の配置スタイルを認"
"識します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Margins.html\">塗りつぶし用のマージン</a>"
"を参照）。現在の配置スタイルが <code class=\"code\">none</code> の場合、塗り"
"つぶし関数は実際には何も行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"Several of the filling functions have an argument <var "
"class=\"var\">justify</var>.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"that requests some kind of justification.  It can be <code "
"class=\"code\">left</code>, <code class=\"code\">right</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">full</code>, or <code class=\"code\">center</code>, to "
"request a specific style of justification.  If it is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, that means to use the current justification style for this part of "
"the text (see <code class=\"code\">current-justification</code>, below).  "
"Any other value is treated as <code class=\"code\">full</code>."
msgstr ""
"いくつかの充填関数には引数 <var class=\"var\">justify</var> があります。これ"
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、何らかの正当化が求められます。"
"特定の形式の正当化を求めるには、<code class=\"code\">left</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">right</code>、<code class=\"code\">full</code>、または <code "
"class=\"code\">center</code> を指定できます。<code class=\"code\">t</code> の"
"場合は、このテキスト部分に対して現在の正当化スタイルを使用することを意味しま"
"す（後述の <code class=\"code\">current-justification</code> を参照）。それ以"
"外の値はすべて <code class=\"code\">full</code> として扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"When you call the filling functions interactively, using a prefix argument "
"implies the value <code class=\"code\">full</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">justify</var>."
msgstr ""
"フィリング関数を対話的に呼び出す際、接頭辞引数を指定すると、<var "
"class=\"var\">justify</var> に値 <code class=\"code\">full</code> が代入され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-paragraph</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional justify region</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fill_002dparagraph\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-paragraph</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional justify region</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fill_002dparagraph\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"This command fills the paragraph at or after point.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">justify</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, each "
"line is justified as well.  It uses the ordinary paragraph motion commands "
"to find paragraph boundaries.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Paragraphs.html#Paragraphs\">Paragraphs</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ポイント以降の段落を埋めます。<var class=\"var\">justify</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、各行も均等揃えされます。"
"段落の境界の検出には、通常の段落移動コマンドが使用されます。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Paragraphs.html#Paragraphs\">Paragraphs</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">region</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then if Transient Mark mode is enabled and the mark is active, this command "
"calls <code class=\"code\">fill-region</code> to fill all the paragraphs in "
"the region, instead of filling only the current paragraph.  When this "
"command is called interactively, <var class=\"var\">region</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">region</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、一時マークモードが有効でマークがアクティブであれば、このコマンドは現在の"
"段落のみを埋めるのではなく、領域内のすべての段落を埋めるために <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-region</code> を呼び出します。このコマンドを対話的に呼び"
"出した場合、<var class=\"var\">region</var> は <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">unfill-paragraph</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg "
"&amp;optional beg end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"unfill_002dparagraph\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">unfill-paragraph</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg "
"&amp;optional beg end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"unfill_002dparagraph\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"This command is the inverse of the previous one: it joins up the lines of "
"the current paragraph.  With a numeric prefix argument <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>, it applies the operation to that many paragraphs.  "
"With no prefix argument and an active region, unfill each paragraph in that "
"region.  When called from Lisp with <var class=\"var\">arg</var> <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, unfill "
"paragraphs in the region delimited by <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは直前のコマンドの逆の動作を行い、現在の段落の行を結合します。数"
"値の接頭辞引数 <var class=\"var\">arg</var> を指定すると、その数だけ段落に対"
"してこの操作が適用されます。接頭辞引数がなく、かつアクティブリージョンがある"
"場合は、そのリージョン内の各段落の空白を削除します。Lispから <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var> <code class=\"code\">nil</code> および <var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない状態で呼び出された場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> で区切られたリージョ"
"ン内の段落の空白を削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"&amp;optional justify nosqueeze to-eop</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fill_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"&amp;optional justify nosqueeze to-eop</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fill_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"This command fills each of the paragraphs in the region from <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> to <var class=\"var\">end</var>.  It justifies as "
"well if <var class=\"var\">justify</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">start</var>から<var class=\"var\">end</"
"var>までの範囲にある各段落を均等割り付けします。また、<var "
"class=\"var\">justify</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合は、両"
"端揃えも行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">nosqueeze</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that means to leave whitespace other than line breaks untouched.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">to-eop</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that "
"means to keep filling to the end of the paragraph&mdash;or the next hard "
"newline, if <code class=\"code\">use-hard-newlines</code> is enabled (see "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">nosqueeze</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、改行以外の空白はそのままにすることを意味します。<var class=\"var\">to-"
"eop</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、段落の末尾まで――ある"
"いは <code class=\"code\">use-hard-newlines</code> が有効であれば次のハード改"
"行まで――埋め続けることを意味します（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> controls how to "
"distinguish paragraphs.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Standard-"
"Regexps.html\">Standard Regular Expressions Used in Editing</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> は、段落の区切り方を制御"
"します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Standard-Regexps.html\">編集で使用される標準"
"正規表現</a>を参照してください。"

