# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"This command considers a region of text as a single paragraph and fills it.  "
"The behavior of this command is controlled by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-region-as-paragraph-function</code>, with the default "
"implementation being <code class=\"code\">fill-region-as-paragraph-default</"
"code>, which is described in detail below."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、テキストの領域を一つの段落とみなして塗りつぶします。このコマ"
"ンドの動作は変数 <code class=\"code\">fill-region-as-paragraph-function</"
"code> によって制御され、デフォルトの実装は <code class=\"code\">fill-region-"
"as-paragraph-default</code> となっており、これについては以下で詳しく説明しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"If the region was made up of many paragraphs, the blank lines between "
"paragraphs are removed.  This function justifies as well as filling when "
"<var class=\"var\">justify</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"リージョンが多数の段落で構成されている場合、段落間の空行は削除されます。この"
"関数は、<var class=\"var\">justify</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でない場合に、正当化と塗りつぶしの両方を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">nosqueeze</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that means to leave whitespace other than line breaks untouched.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">squeeze-after</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it specifies a position in the region, and means that whitespace "
"other than line breaks should be left untouched before that position."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">nosqueeze</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、改行以外の空白はそのままにすることを意味します。<var "
"class=\"var\">squeeze-after</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、領域内の位置を指定し、その位置より前の改行以外の空白はそのままにすること"
"を意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"In Adaptive Fill mode, this command calls <code class=\"code\">fill-context-"
"prefix</code> to choose a fill prefix by default.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Adaptive-Fill.html\">Adaptive Fill Mode</a>."
msgstr ""
"Adaptive Fillモードでは、このコマンドはデフォルトで塗りつぶしプレフィックスを"
"選択するために<code class=\"code\">fill-context-prefix</code>を呼び出します。"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Adaptive-Fill.html\">Adaptive Fillモード</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
