# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts spaces between the words of the current line so that "
"the line ends exactly at <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code>.  It "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、現在の行の単語間にスペースを挿入し、行がちょうど <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> で終わるようにします。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">how</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> specifies explicitly the style of justification.  It can be <code "
"class=\"code\">left</code>, <code class=\"code\">right</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">full</code>, <code class=\"code\">center</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">none</code>.  If it is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, that "
"means to follow specified justification style (see <code "
"class=\"code\">current-justification</code>, below).  <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means to do full justification."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">how</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、正当化スタイルを明示的に指定します。値は <code class=\"code\">left</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">right</code>、<code class=\"code\">full</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">center</code>、または <code class=\"code\">none</code> "
"のいずれかとなります。<code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合は、指定された正当"
"化スタイルに従うことを意味します（後述の <code class=\"code\">current-"
"justification</code> を参照）。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は、完全な正当"
"化を行うことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">eop</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that "
"means do only left-justification if <code class=\"code\">current-"
"justification</code> specifies full justification.  This is used for the "
"last line of a paragraph; even if the paragraph as a whole is fully "
"justified, the last line should not be."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">eop</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">current-justification</code> で完全均等割り付けが指定さ"
"れているときのみ、左揃えを行うことを意味します。これは段落の最終行に使用さ"
"れ、段落全体が完全均等割り付けであっても、最終行は均等割り付けにすべきではあ"
"りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">nosqueeze</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that means do not change interior whitespace."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">nosqueeze</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない"
"場合、内部の空白文字を変更しないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
