# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Filling.html
msgid ""
"This variable provides a way to override how the filling functions, such as "
"<code class=\"code\">fill-region</code> and <code class=\"code\">fill-"
"paragraph</code>, move forward to the next paragraph.  Its value should be a "
"function, which is called with a single argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, "
"the number of paragraphs to move, and should return the difference between "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var> and the number of paragraphs actually moved.  The "
"default value of this variable is <code class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</"
"code>.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Paragraphs.html#Paragraphs\">Paragraphs</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"この変数を使用すると、<code class=\"code\">fill-region</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-paragraph</code> といったフィル機能が次の段落へどのように"
"進むかを上書きできます。その値は関数である必要があり、移動させる段落数である"
"単一の引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を受け取って呼び出され、<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> と実際の移動段落数との差分を返す必要があります。この変"
"数のデフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</code> です。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Paragraphs.html#Paragraphs\">Paragraphs</a> を参照してください。"

