# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Finalizer-Type.html
msgid ""
"<span>2.4.21 Finalizer Type<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Finalizer-"
"Type-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.21 Finalizer Type<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Finalizer-"
"Type-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Finalizer-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">finalizer object</em> helps Lisp code clean up after "
"objects that are no longer needed.  A finalizer holds a Lisp function "
"object.  When a finalizer object becomes unreachable after a garbage "
"collection pass, Emacs calls the finalizer&rsquo;s associated function "
"object.  When deciding whether a finalizer is reachable, Emacs does not "
"count references from finalizer objects themselves, allowing you to use "
"finalizers without having to worry about accidentally capturing references "
"to finalized objects themselves."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ファイナライザオブジェクト</em>は、不要になったオブジェクト"
"の後処理をLispコードで行うのに役立ちます。ファイナライザはLispの関数オブジェ"
"クトを保持します。ガベージコレクションのパスを経てファイナライザオブジェクト"
"が到達不能になると、Emacsはそのファイナライザに関連付けられた関数オブジェクト"
"を呼び出します。ファイナライザが到達可能かどうかを判定する際、Emacsはファイナ"
"ライザオブジェクト自身からの参照をカウントしません。これにより、ファイナライ"
"ズされたオブジェクト自体への参照を誤ってキャプチャしてしまう心配なく、ファイ"
"ナライザを利用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Finalizer-Type.html
msgid ""
"Errors in finalizers are printed to <code class=\"code\">*Messages*</code>.  "
"Emacs runs a given finalizer object&rsquo;s associated function exactly "
"once, even if that function fails."
msgstr ""
"ファイナライザのエラーは <code class=\"code\">*Messages*</code> に出力されま"
"す。Emacs は、指定されたファイナライザオブジェクトに関連付けられた関数を、た"
"とえその関数が失敗したとしても、ちょうど1回だけ実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Finalizer-Type.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-finalizer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dfinalizer\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-finalizer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dfinalizer\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Finalizer-Type.html
msgid ""
"Make a finalizer that will run <var class=\"var\">function</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> will be called after garbage collection when "
"the returned finalizer object becomes unreachable.  If the finalizer object "
"is reachable only through references from finalizer objects, it does not "
"count as reachable for the purpose of deciding whether to run <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var>.  <var class=\"var\">function</var> will be run "
"once per finalizer object."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> を実行するファイナライザを作成してくださ"
"い。返されたファイナライザオブジェクトがガベージコレクション後に到達不能にな"
