# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Finding-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of all the overlays that contain the character "
"at position <var class=\"var\">pos</var> in the current buffer.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">sorted</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"returned list is in decreasing order of priority, otherwise it is in no "
"particular order.  An overlay contains the character at <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> if it begins at or before <var class=\"var\">pos</"
"var>, and ends after <var class=\"var\">pos</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにおいて位置 <var class=\"var\">pos</var> に文字を"
"含むすべてのオーバーレイのリストを返します。<var class=\"var\">sorted</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、返されるリストは優先度の降順と"
"なり、そうでない場合は特に順序はありません。オーバーレイが <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> 以降に始まり、かつ <var class=\"var\">pos</var> より"
"後に終わる場合、そのオーバーレイは <var class=\"var\">pos</var> の文字を含み"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Finding-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"To illustrate usage, here is a Lisp function that returns a list of the "
"overlays that specify property <var class=\"var\">prop</var> for the "
"character at point:"
msgstr ""
"使い方の例として、ポイントにある文字のプロパティ <var class=\"var\">prop</"
"var> を指定するオーバーレイのリストを返す Lisp 関数を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Finding-Overlays.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun find-overlays-specifying (prop)\n"
"  (let ((overlays (overlays-at (point)))\n"
"        found)\n"
"    (while overlays\n"
"      (let ((overlay (car overlays)))\n"
"        (if (overlay-get overlay prop)\n"
"            (setq found (cons overlay found))))\n"
"      (setq overlays (cdr overlays)))\n"
"    found))\n"
msgstr ""

