# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Finding-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"As an example, here&rsquo;s a simplified (and inefficient) version of the "
"primitive function <code class=\"code\">next-single-char-property-change</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Property-Search.html\">Text Property "
"Search Functions</a>).  It searches forward from position <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> for the next position where the value of a given "
"property <code class=\"code\">prop</code>, as obtained from either overlays "
"or text properties, changes."
msgstr ""
"例として、プリミティブ関数 <code class=\"code\">next-single-char-property-"
"change</code> の簡略版（かつ非効率な実装）を以下に示します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Property-Search.html\">テキストプロパティ検索関数</a>"
"を参照）。この関数は、位置 <var class=\"var\">pos</var> から前方を検索し、"
"オーバーレイまたはテキストプロパティのいずれかから取得した特定のプロパティ "
"<code class=\"code\">prop</code> の値が変更される次の位置を探します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Finding-Overlays.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun next-single-char-property-change (position prop)\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (goto-char position)\n"
"    (let ((propval (get-char-property (point) prop)))\n"
"      (while (and (not (eobp))\n"
"                  (eq (get-char-property (point) prop) propval))\n"
"        (goto-char (min (next-overlay-change (point))\n"
"                        (next-single-property-change (point) prop)))))\n"
"    (point)))\n"
msgstr ""

