# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Float-Basics.html
msgid ""
"The <abbr class=\"acronym\">IEEE</abbr> floating-point standard supports "
"positive infinity and negative infinity as floating-point values.  It also "
"provides for a class of values called NaN, or &ldquo;not a number&rdquo;; "
"numerical functions return such values in cases where there is no correct "
"answer.  For example, <code class=\"code\">(/ 0.0 0.0)</code> returns a "
"NaN.  A NaN is never numerically equal to any value, not even to itself.  "
"NaNs carry a sign and a significand, and non-numeric functions treat two "
"NaNs as equal when their signs and significands agree.  Significands of NaNs "
"are machine-dependent, as are the digits in their string representation."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">IEEE</abbr>浮動小数点規格では、正の無限大と負の無限大"
"を浮動小数点値としてサポートしています。また、NaN（「not a number」）と呼ばれ"
"る値のクラスも規定されており、数値関数は正しい答えが得られない場合にこのよう"
"な値を返します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">(/ 0.0 0.0)</code>はNaNを返しま"
"す。NaNは、自分自身を含め、いかなる値とも数値的に等しくなることはありません。"
"NaNは符号と仮数を持ち、非数値関数は、符号と仮数が一致する場合に2つのNaNを等し"
"いものとして扱います。NaNの仮数および文字列表現における各桁は、マシン依存とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Float-Basics.html
msgid ""
"When NaNs and signed zeros are involved, non-numeric functions like <code "
"class=\"code\">eql</code>, <code class=\"code\">equal</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">sxhash-eql</code>, <code class=\"code\">sxhash-equal</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">gethash</code> determine whether values are "
"indistinguishable, not whether they are numerically equal.  For example, "
"when <var class=\"var\">x</var> and <var class=\"var\">y</var> are the same "
"NaN, <code class=\"code\">(equal x y)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> whereas <code class=\"code\">(= x y)</code> uses numeric comparison "
"and returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; conversely, <code "
"class=\"code\">(equal 0.0 -0.0)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> whereas <code class=\"code\">(= 0.0 -0.0)</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"NaNや符号付きゼロが関わる場合、<code class=\"code\">eql</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">equal</code>、<code class=\"code\">sxhash-eql</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">sxhash-equal</code>、<code class=\"code\">gethash</code>といっ"
"た非数値関数は、値が数値的に等しいかどうかではなく、区別不能であるかどうかを"
"判定します。例えば、<var class=\"var\">x</var>と<var class=\"var\">y</var>が"
"同一のNaNである場合、<code class=\"code\">(equal x y)</code>は<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>を返しますが、<code class=\"code\">(= x y)</code>は数"
"値比較を行い<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。逆に、<code "
"class=\"code\">(equal 0.0 -0.0)</code>は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返し"
"ますが、<code class=\"code\">(= 0.0 -0.0)</code>は<code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>を返します。"

