"class=\"var\">e</var>)</code> を返します。ここで <var class=\"var\">s</var> "
"と <var class=\"var\">e</var> は、それぞれ浮動小数点数 <var class=\"var\">x</"
"var> の仮数部と指数部です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Float-Basics.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">x</var> is finite, then <var class=\"var\">s</var> is "
"a floating-point number between 0.5 (inclusive) and 1.0 (exclusive), <var "
"class=\"var\">e</var> is an integer, and <var class=\"var\">x</var> = <var "
"class=\"var\">s</var> * 2**<var class=\"var\">e</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> is zero or infinity, then <var class=\"var\">s</var> "
"is the same as <var class=\"var\">x</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">x</var> is "
"a NaN, then <var class=\"var\">s</var> is also a NaN.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> is zero, then <var class=\"var\">e</var> is 0."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">x</var> が有限数の場合、<var class=\"var\">s</var> は 0.5"
"（含む）から 1.0（含まない）までの浮動小数点数、<var class=\"var\">e</var> は"
"整数、<var class=\"var\">x</var> = <var class=\"var\">s</var> * 2**<var "
"class=\"var\">e</var> となります。<var class=\"var\">x</var> が 0 または無限"
"大の場合、<var class=\"var\">s</var> は <var class=\"var\">x</var> と同じ値に"
"なります。<var class=\"var\">x</var> が NaN の場合、<var class=\"var\">s</"
"var> も NaN となります。<var class=\"var\">x</var> が 0 の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">e</var> は 0 となります。"

