# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.7.1 Font Lock Basics<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Font-Lock-"
"Basics-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.7.1 Font Lockの基本<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Font-Lock-"
"Basics-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"The Font Lock functionality is based on several basic functions.  Each of "
"these calls the function specified by the corresponding variable.  This "
"indirection allows major and minor modes to modify the way fontification "
"works in the buffers of that mode, and even use the Font Lock mechanisms for "
"features that have nothing to do with fontification.  (This is why the "
"description below says &ldquo;should&rdquo; when it describes what the "
"functions do: the mode can customize the values of the corresponding "
"variables to do something entirely different.)  The variables mentioned "
"below are described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Other-Font-Lock-"
"Variables.html\">Other Font Lock Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"Font Lock の機能は、いくつかの基本関数に基づいています。これらの関数はそれぞ"
"れ、対応する変数で指定された関数を呼び出します。この間接参照により、メジャー"
"モードやマイナーモードは、当該モードのバッファにおけるフォント化の動作を変更"
"できるほか、フォント化とは全く関係のない機能に Font Lock の仕組みを利用するこ"
"とさえ可能です。（そのため、以下の説明で関数の動作について述べる際に「～すべ"
"きである」と表現しています。モード側で対応する変数の値をカスタマイズすること"
"で、全く異なる動作を実現できるためです。）以下で言及する変数については、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Other-Font-Lock-Variables.html\">その他の Font Lock 変数"
"</a>で説明しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dbuffer\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-buffer</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dbuffer\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-buffer</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"This function should fontify the current buffer&rsquo;s accessible portion, "
"by calling the function specified by <code class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-"
"buffer-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-buffer-function</code>で指"
"定された関数を呼び出すことで、現在のバッファのアクセス可能な部分をフォント化"
"する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dunfontify_002dbuffer\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-unfontify-buffer</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dunfontify_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dunfontify_002dbuffer\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-unfontify-buffer</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dunfontify_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Used when turning Font Lock off to remove the fontification.  Calls the "
"function specified by <code class=\"code\">font-lock-unfontify-buffer-"
"function</code>."
msgstr ""
"Font Lock をオフにしてフォント化を解除する際に使用します。<code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-unfontify-buffer-function</code> で指定された関数を"
"呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dregion-beg-end-_0026optional-"
"loudly\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-region beg end "
"&amp;optional loudly</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dregion-beg-end-_0026optional-loudly\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dregion-beg-end-_0026optional-"
"loudly\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-region beg end "
"&amp;optional loudly</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"font_002dlock_002dfontify_002dregion-beg-end-_0026optional-loudly\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Lock-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Should fontify the region between <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">loudly</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, should display status messages while fontifying.  "
"Calls the function specified by <code class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-"
"region-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">beg</var> から <var class=\"var\">end</var> までの範囲を"
"フォント化する。<var class=\"var\">loudly</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合は、フォント化中にステータスメッセージを表示する。<code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-fontify-region-function</code> で指定された関数を呼"
"び出す。"

