#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.12.9 Font Selection<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Font-"
"Selection-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.12.9 フォントの選択<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Font-"
"Selection-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font-selection\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-selecting-a-font\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font-selection\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-selecting-a-font\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"Before Emacs can draw a character on a graphical display, it must select a "
"<em class=\"dfn\">font</em> for that character<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF34\" href=\"#FOOT34\"><sup>34</sup></a>.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Fonts.html#Fonts\">Fonts</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>.  Normally, Emacs automatically chooses a font based on the "
"faces assigned to that character&mdash;specifically, the face attributes "
"<code class=\"code\">:family</code>, <code class=\"code\">:weight</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">:slant</code>, and <code class=\"code\">:width</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-Attributes.html\">Face Attributes</a>).  "
"The choice of font also depends on the character to be displayed; some fonts "
"can only display a limited set of characters.  If no available font exactly "
"fits the requirements, Emacs looks for the <em class=\"dfn\">closest "
"matching font</em>.  The variables in this section control how Emacs makes "
"this selection."
msgstr ""
"Emacsがグラフィカルディスプレイ上に文字を描画する前に、その文字に使用する<em "
"class=\"dfn\">フォント</em>を選択する必要があります<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF34\" href=\"#FOOT34\"><sup>34</sup></a>。<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Fonts.html#Fonts\">Fonts</a>を参照して"
"ください。通常、Emacsはその文字に割り当てられたフェイス、具体的にはフェイス属"
"性<code class=\"code\">:family</code>、<code class=\"code\">:weight</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">:slant</code>、および<code class=\"code\">:width</code>"
"に基づいてフォントを自動的に選択します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-"
"Attributes.html\">Face Attributes</a>を参照）。フォントの選択は表示する文字に"
"も依存し、フォントによっては表示できる文字が限られている場合があります。利用"
"可能なフォントの中に要件に完全に合致するものがない場合、Emacsは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">最も近い適合フォント</em>を探します。このセクションの変数は、"
"Emacsがこの選択を行う方法を制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-font-family-alternatives</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-face_002dfont_002dfamily_002dalternatives\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">face-font-family-alternatives</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-face_002dfont_002dfamily_002dalternatives\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"If a given family is specified but does not exist, this variable specifies "
"alternative font families to try.  Each element should have this form:"
msgstr ""
"指定したフォントファミリーが存在しない場合、この変数で代替となるフォントファ"
"ミリーを指定します。各要素は以下の形式とする必要があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">family</var> <var class=\"var\">alternate-families</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">family</var> is specified but not available, Emacs "
"will try the other families given in <var class=\"var\">alternate-families</"
"var>, one by one, until it finds a family that does exist."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">family</var> が指定されているが存在しない場合、Emacs は "
"<var class=\"var\">alternate-families</var> で指定された他のファミリーを、存"
"在するものが見つかるまで一つずつ試行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-font-selection-order</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-face_002dfont_002dselection_002dorder\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">face-font-selection-order</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-face_002dfont_002dselection_002dorder\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"If there is no font that exactly matches all desired face attributes (<code "
"class=\"code\">:width</code>, <code class=\"code\">:height</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">:weight</code>, and <code class=\"code\">:slant</code>), this "
"variable specifies the order in which these attributes should be considered "
"when selecting the closest matching font.  The value should be a list "
"containing those four attribute symbols, in order of decreasing importance.  "
"The default is <code class=\"code\">(:width :height :weight :slant)</code>."
msgstr ""
"希望するすべての書体属性（<code class=\"code\">:width</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">:height</code>、<code class=\"code\">:weight</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">:slant</code>）に完全に一致するフォントがない場合、この変数"
"は、最も近い一致フォントを選択する際にこれらの属性をどの順序で考慮すべきかを"
"指定します。値は、重要度の高い順にこれら4つの属性記号を並べたリストである必要"
"があります。デフォルトは<code "
"class=\"code\">(:width :height :weight :slant)</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"Font selection first finds the best available matches for the first "
"attribute in the list; then, among the fonts which are best in that way, it "
"searches for the best matches in the second attribute, and so on."
msgstr ""
"フォント選択では、まずリスト内の第1属性に対して利用可能な最適な候補を探し、次"
"にその中で最適なフォントの中から第2属性に対する最適な候補を探し、という手順を"
"繰り返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"The attributes <code class=\"code\">:weight</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">:width</code> have symbolic values in a range centered around "
"<code class=\"code\">normal</code>.  Matches that are more extreme (farther "
"from <code class=\"code\">normal</code>) are somewhat preferred to matches "
"that are less extreme (closer to <code class=\"code\">normal</code>); this "
"is designed to ensure that non-normal faces contrast with normal ones, "
"whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"属性 <code class=\"code\">:weight</code> および <code class=\"code\">:width</"
"code> は、<code class=\"code\">normal</code> を中心とした範囲の記号値を持ちま"
"す。より極端な（<code class=\"code\">normal</code> から遠い）一致は、それほど"
"極端でない（<code class=\"code\">normal</code> に近い）一致よりもある程度優先"
"されます。これは、可能な限り、非正常な顔が正常な顔と対比されるように設計され"
"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"One example of a case where this variable makes a difference is when the "
"default font has no italic equivalent.  With the default ordering, the <code "
"class=\"code\">italic</code> face will use a non-italic font that is similar "
"to the default one.  But if you put <code class=\"code\">:slant</code> "
"before <code class=\"code\">:height</code>, the <code class=\"code\">italic</"
"code> face will use an italic font, even if its height is not quite right."
msgstr ""
"この変数が影響を及ぼすケースの一例として、デフォルトフォントにイタリック体の"
"対応フォントがない場合が挙げられます。デフォルトの順序では、<code "
"class=\"code\">italic</code> フェイスはデフォルトに近い非イタリック体のフォン"
"トを使用します。しかし、<code class=\"code\">:slant</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">:height</code> より前に配置すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">italic</code> フェイスは、たとえ高さが完全ではなくても、イタ"
"リック体のフォントを使用するようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">face-font-registry-alternatives</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-face_002dfont_002dregistry_002dalternatives\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">face-font-registry-alternatives</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"face_002dfont_002dregistry_002dalternatives\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"This variable lets you specify alternative font registries to try, if a "
"given registry is specified and doesn&rsquo;t exist.  Each element should "
"have this form:"
msgstr ""
"この変数を使用すると、指定したレジストリが存在しなかった場合に、試行する代替"
"フォントレジストリを指定できます。各要素は以下の形式である必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">registry</var> <var class=\"var\">alternate-registries</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">registry</var> is specified but not available, Emacs "
"will try the other registries given in <var class=\"var\">alternate-"
"registries</var>, one by one, until it finds a registry that does exist."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">registry</var> が指定されているにもかかわらず利用できない"
"場合、Emacs は <var class=\"var\">alternate-registries</var> で指定された他の"
"レジストリを、存在するレジストリが見つかるまで一つずつ試行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
