# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"allows the use of scalable fonts with registry <code "
"class=\"code\">iso10646-1</code>."
