# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies scaling for certain faces.  Its value should be a "
"list of elements of the form"
