# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Font-Selection.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">fontname-regexp</var> matches the font name that is "
