# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.2 Forcing Redisplay<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Forcing-"
"Redisplay-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.2 再表示の強制<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Forcing-"
"Redisplay-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-forcing-redisplay\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-forcing-redisplay\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"Emacs normally tries to redisplay the screen whenever it waits for input.  "
"With the following function, you can request an immediate attempt to "
"redisplay, in the middle of Lisp code, without actually waiting for input."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは通常、入力待ちの際に画面の再表示を試みます。以下の関数を使えば、Lisp"
"コードの途中で、実際に入力を待たずに即座に再表示を試みるようリクエストできま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">redisplay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-redisplay\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">redisplay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-redisplay\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"This function tries immediately to redisplay.  The optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">force</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, forces "
"the redisplay to be performed, instead of being preempted if input is "
"pending."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、直ちに再表示を試みます。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">force</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、入力待ちで処理が中断され"
"るのではなく、強制的に再表示が行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"The function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if it actually tried to "
"redisplay, and <code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  A value of <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> does not mean that redisplay proceeded to "
"completion; it could have been preempted by newly arriving input."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、実際に再表示を試みた場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そう"
"でない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> という値は、再表示が正常に完了したことを意味するわけ"
"ではなく、新たに入力があったことで中断された可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"Although <code class=\"code\">redisplay</code> tries immediately to "
"redisplay, it does not change how Emacs decides which parts of its frame(s) "
"to redisplay.  By contrast, the following function adds certain windows to "
"the pending redisplay work (as if their contents had completely changed), "
"but does not immediately try to perform redisplay."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">redisplay</code> は直ちに再表示を試みますが、Emacs がフ"
"レームのどの部分を再表示するかを決定する仕組みを変更するものではありません。"
"対照的に、以下の関数は、特定のウィンドウを（内容が完全に変更されたかのよう"
"に）再表示待ちの処理に追加しますが、直ちに再表示を試みることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">force-window-update</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-force_002dwindow_002dupdate\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">force-window-update</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-force_002dwindow_002dupdate\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"This function forces some or all windows to be updated the next time Emacs "
"does a redisplay.  If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a window, that "
"window is to be updated.  If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a buffer or "
"buffer name, all windows displaying that buffer are to be updated.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (or omitted), "
"all windows are to be updated."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、次にEmacsが再表示を行う際に、一部またはすべてのウィンドウを強制的"
"に更新します。<var class=\"var\">object</var> がウィンドウである場合、その"
"ウィンドウが更新されます。<var class=\"var\">object</var> がバッファまたは"
"バッファ名である場合、そのバッファを表示しているすべてのウィンドウが更新され"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">object</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であ"
"る（または省略されている）場合、すべてのウィンドウが更新されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"This function does not do a redisplay immediately; Emacs does that as it "
"waits for input, or when the function <code class=\"code\">redisplay</code> "
"is called."
msgstr ""
"この関数は直ちに再表示を行うわけではありません。Emacsは、入力を待機している"
"間、あるいは関数 <code class=\"code\">redisplay</code> が呼び出された際に再表"
"示を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pre-redisplay-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pre_002dredisplay_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pre-redisplay-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pre_002dredisplay_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"A function run just before redisplay.  It is called with one argument, the "
"set of windows to be redisplayed.  The set can be <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, meaning only the selected window, or <code class=\"code\">t</code>, "
"meaning all the windows."
msgstr ""
"再表示の直前に実行される関数です。再表示対象のウィンドウ集合を1つの引数として"
"受け取ります。この集合には、選択中のウィンドウのみを意味する <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> や、すべてのウィンドウを意味する <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pre-redisplay-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pre_002dredisplay_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pre-redisplay-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pre_002dredisplay_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forcing-Redisplay.html
msgid ""
"This hook is run just before redisplay.  It is called once in each window "
"that is about to be redisplayed, with <code class=\"code\">current-buffer</"
"code> set to the buffer displayed in that window."
msgstr ""
"このフックは再表示の直前に実行されます。再表示予定の各ウィンドウで1回ずつ呼び"
"出され、<code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> にはそのウィンドウに表示さ"
"れているバッファが設定されます。"

