# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> is a string, it is a shell command; Emacs "
"runs the command as a filter to perform the conversion."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> が文字列の場合はシェルコマンドであり、Emacs は"
"そのコマンドをフィルタとして実行して変換を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> is a function, it is called with three "
"arguments: <var class=\"var\">begin</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>, "
"which specify the part of the buffer it should convert, and <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var>, which specifies which buffer.  There are two "
"ways it can do the conversion:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> が関数である場合、バッファのどの部分を変換する"
"かを指定する <var class=\"var\">begin</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var>、"
"およびどのバッファを指定する <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> という3つの引数"
"で呼び出されます。変換を行う方法は2通りあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"By editing the buffer in place.  In this case, <var class=\"var\">to-fn</"
"var> should return the end-position of the range of text, as modified."
msgstr ""
"バッファをその場で編集することで。この場合、<var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> は"
"修正後のテキスト範囲の終端位置を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"By returning a list of annotations.  This is a list of elements of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">position</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">position</var> "
"is an integer specifying the relative position in the text to be written, "
"and <var class=\"var\">string</var> is the annotation to add there.  The "
"list must be sorted in order of position when <var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> "
"returns it."
msgstr ""
"アノテーションのリストを返します。これは <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> . <var class=\"var\">string</var>)</code> 形式の"
"要素のリストであり、<var class=\"var\">position</var> は書き込むテキスト内で"
"の相対位置を指定する整数、<var class=\"var\">string</var> はそこに追加するア"
"ノテーションです。<var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> がリストを返す際は、位置順に"
"ソートされている必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">write-region</code> actually writes the text from "
"the buffer to the file, it intermixes the specified annotations at the "
"corresponding positions.  All this takes place without modifying the buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">write-region</code> が実際にバッファ内のテキストをファイ"
"ルに書き出す際、指定されたアノテーションを対応する位置に挿入します。これらす"
"べては、バッファを変更することなく行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> must not involve buffers or files other than "
"the one being encoded, otherwise the internal buffer used for formatting "
"might be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">to-fn</var> には、エンコード対象以外のバッファやファイルを"
"含めてはなりません。さもないと、フォーマットに使用される内部バッファが上書き"
"される可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">modify</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">modify</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"A flag, <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the encoding function modifies the "
