# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"A flag, <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <code class=\"code\">format-write-"
"file</code> should not remove this format from <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"file-format</code>."
msgstr ""
"フラグ。<code class=\"code\">format-write-file</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code> からこのフォーマットを削除すべきでな"
"い場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code> automatically "
"recognizes file formats when it reads the specified file.  It checks the "
"text of the beginning of the file against the regular expressions of the "
"format definitions, and if it finds a match, it calls the decoding function "
"for that format.  Then it checks all the known formats over again.  It keeps "
"checking them until none of them is applicable."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code> 関数は、指定されたファイルを"
"読み込む際にファイル形式を自動的に認識します。ファイル先頭のテキストを形式定"
"義の正規表現と照合し、一致が見つかった場合はその形式のデコード関数を呼び出し"
"ます。その後、既知のすべての形式を改めて照合します。いずれの形式も該当しなく"
"なるまで、この照合を繰り返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"Visiting a file, with <code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> or the "
"commands that use it, performs conversion likewise (because it calls <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code>); it also calls the mode function "
"for each format that it decodes.  It stores a list of the format names in "
"the buffer-local variable <code class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> やそれを利用するコマンドを用い"
"てファイルにアクセスする場合も、同様に変換が行われます（<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code> を呼び出すためです）。また、デコー"
"ドする各フォーマットのモード関数も呼び出されます。フォーマット名のリストは、"
"バッファローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code> に格納さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-file-format</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dfile_002dformat\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-file-format</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dfile_002dformat\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"This variable states the format of the visited file.  More precisely, this "
"is a list of the file format names that were decoded in the course of "
"visiting the current buffer&rsquo;s file.  It is always buffer-local in all "
"buffers."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、参照先ファイルのフォーマットを示します。より正確には、現在のバッ"
"ファのファイルを参照する過程でデコードされたファイルフォーマット名のリストで"
"す。すべてのバッファにおいて、常にバッファローカルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">write-region</code> writes data into a file, it "
"first calls the encoding functions for the formats listed in <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code>, in the order of appearance in the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">write-region</code> がファイルにデータを書き込む際は、ま"
"ず <code class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code> に列挙されている形式のエン"
"コーディング関数を、リストの出現順に呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">format-write-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">file "
"format &amp;optional confirm</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"format_002dwrite_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">format-write-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">file "
"format &amp;optional confirm</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"format_002dwrite_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"This command writes the current buffer contents into the file <var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> in a format based on <var class=\"var\">format</"
"var>, which is a list of format names.  It constructs the actual format "
"starting from <var class=\"var\">format</var>, then appending any elements "
"from the value of <code class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code> with a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">preserve</var> flag (see "
"above), if they are not already present in <var class=\"var\">format</var>.  "
"It then updates <code class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code> with this "
"format, making it the default for future saves.  Except for the <var "
"class=\"var\">format</var> argument, this command is similar to <code "
"class=\"code\">write-file</code>.  In particular, <var "
"class=\"var\">confirm</var> has the same meaning and interactive treatment "
"as the corresponding argument to <code class=\"code\">write-file</code>.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Saving-Buffers.html#Definition-of-"
"write_002dfile\">Definition of write-file</a>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、現在のバッファ内容を、フォーマット名のリストである <var "
"class=\"var\">format</var> に基づく形式でファイル <var class=\"var\">file</"
"var> に書き込みます。<var class=\"var\">format</var> から実際のフォーマットを"
"構築し、<var class=\"var\">format</var> にまだ含まれていない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-file-format</code> の値から得られる要素を、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の <var class=\"var\">preserve</var> フラグ（前"
"述）と共に追記します。その後、このフォーマットで <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"file-format</code> を更新し、今後の保存時のデフォルトとします。<var "
"class=\"var\">format</var> 引数を除けば、このコマンドは <code "
"class=\"code\">write-file</code> と同様です。特に、<var "
"class=\"var\">confirm</var> は <code class=\"code\">write-file</code> の対応"
"する引数と同じ意味を持ち、同様のインタラクティブな処理が行われます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Saving-Buffers.html#Definition-of-"
"write_002dfile\">write-file の定義</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
