# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"This command finds the file <var class=\"var\">file</var>, converting it "
"according to format <var class=\"var\">format</var>.  It also makes <var "
"class=\"var\">format</var> the default if the buffer is saved later."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドはファイル <var class=\"var\">file</var> を探し、フォーマット "
