"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">format</var> is a list of format names.  If "
