#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts the contents of file <var class=\"var\">file</var>, "
"converting it according to format <var class=\"var\">format</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> are non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, they specify which part of the file to read, as "
"in <code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Reading-from-Files.html\">Reading from Files</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ファイル <var class=\"var\">file</var> の内容を、フォーマッ"
"ト <var class=\"var\">format</var> に従って変換して挿入します。<var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">insert-file-"
"contents</code> と同様に、ファイルのどの部分を読み込むかを指定します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-from-Files.html\">ファイルからの読み込み</a> "
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
"The return value is like what <code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</"
"code> returns: a list of the absolute file name and the length of the data "
"inserted (after conversion)."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は <code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code> が返すものと同様"
"で、絶対ファイル名と（変換後の）挿入データの長さのリストとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-Conversion-Round_002dTrip.html
msgid ""
