# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"The inputs to GnuTLS cryptographic functions can be specified in several "
"ways, both as primitive Emacs Lisp types or as lists."
msgstr ""
"GnuTLS暗号関数への入力は、Emacs Lispのプリミティブ型またはリストのいずれの形"
"式でも、いくつかの方法で指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"The list form is currently similar to how <code class=\"code\">md5</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">secure-hash</code> operate."
msgstr ""
"リスト形式は現在、<code class=\"code\">md5</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">secure-hash</code> の動作と同様になっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">buffer</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">buffer</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid "Simply passing a buffer as input means the whole buffer should be used."
msgstr ""
"バッファを入力として渡すだけで、そのバッファ全体を使用することになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"A string as input will be used directly.  It may be modified by the function "
"(unlike most other Emacs Lisp functions) to reduce the chance of exposing "
"sensitive data after the function does its work."
msgstr ""
"入力として与えられた文字列はそのまま使用されます。（他の多くのEmacs Lisp関数"
"とは異なり）関数によって文字列が変更される場合があり、これにより関数の処理後"
"に機密データが漏洩するリスクを低減できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-string</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> <var class=\"var\">end</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">coding-system</var> <var class=\"var\">noerror</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-string</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> <var class=\"var\">end</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">coding-system</var> <var class=\"var\">noerror</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"This specifies a buffer or a string as described above, but an optional "
"range can be specified with <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>."
msgstr ""
"これは上述のようにバッファまたは文字列を指定しますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> で任意の範囲を指定"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"In addition an optional <var class=\"var\">coding-system</var> can be "
"specified if needed."
msgstr ""
"さらに、必要に応じてオプションの <var class=\"var\">coding-system</var> を指"
"定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"The last optional item, <var class=\"var\">noerror</var>, overrides the "
"normal error when the text can&rsquo;t be encoded using the specified or "
"chosen coding system.  When <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function silently uses <code "
"class=\"code\">raw-text</code> coding instead."
msgstr ""
"最後のオプション項目 <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> は、指定された、あるい"
"は選択された符号化方式でテキストを符号化できない場合の通常のエラーを上書きし"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">noerror</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外の場合、この関数は代わりに <code class=\"code\">raw-text</code> 符号化を暗"
"黙的に使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<code class=\"code\">iv-auto</code> <var "
"class=\"var\">length</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<code class=\"code\">iv-auto</code> <var "
"class=\"var\">length</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-Inputs.html
msgid ""
"This generates a random IV (Initialization Vector) of the specified length "
"and passes it to the function.  This ensures that the IV is unpredictable "
"and unlikely to be reused in the same session."
msgstr ""
"これにより、指定された長さのランダムなIV（初期化ベクトル）が生成され、関数に"
"渡されます。  これにより、IVが予測不可能となり、同一セッション内で再利用され"
"る可能性が低くなります。"

