# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Each keymap is a list whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is the symbol "
"<code class=\"code\">keymap</code>.  The remaining elements of the list "
"define the key bindings of the keymap.  A symbol whose function definition "
"is a keymap is also a keymap.  Use the function <code "
"class=\"code\">keymapp</code> (see below) to test whether an object is a "
"keymap."
msgstr ""
"各キーマップは、<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> がシンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap</code> であるリストです。リストの残りの要素が、そのキー"
"マップのキーバインドを定義します。関数定義がキーマップであるシンボルもまた、"
"キーマップとなります。オブジェクトがキーマップであるかどうかを判定するには、"
"関数 <code class=\"code\">keymapp</code>（後述）を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Several kinds of elements may appear in a keymap, after the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap</code> that begins it:"
msgstr ""
"キーマップでは、開始記号 <code class=\"code\">keymap</code> の後に、数種類の"
"要素が現れることがあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This specifies one binding, for events of type <var class=\"var\">type</"
"var>.  Each ordinary binding applies to events of a particular <em "
"class=\"dfn\">event type</em>, which is always a character or a symbol.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Classifying-Events.html\">Classifying Events</a>.  "
"In this kind of binding, <var class=\"var\">binding</var> is a command."
msgstr ""
"これは、<var class=\"var\">type</var> 型のイベントに対する1つのバインディング"
"を指定します。各通常のバインディングは、特定の<em class=\"dfn\">イベント型</"
"em>（常に文字または記号）のイベントに適用されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Classifying-Events.html\">イベントの分類</a>を参照してください。この種"
"のバインディングにおいて、<var class=\"var\">binding</var> はコマンドです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> <var class=\"var\">item-"
"name</var> . <var class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> <var class=\"var\">item-"
"name</var> . <var class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This specifies a binding which is also a simple menu item that displays as "
"<var class=\"var\">item-name</var> in the menu.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Simple-Menu-Items.html\">Simple Menu Items</a>."
msgstr ""
"これは、メニュー内で <var class=\"var\">item-name</var> として表示されるシン"
"プルなメニュー項目でもあるバインディングを指定します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Simple-Menu-Items.html\">シンプルなメニュー項目</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> <var class=\"var\">item-"
"name</var> <var class=\"var\">help-string</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> <var class=\"var\">item-"
"name</var> <var class=\"var\">help-string</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This is a simple menu item with help string <var class=\"var\">help-string</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"これはヘルプ文字列 <var class=\"var\">help-string</var> を持つシンプルなメ"
"ニュー項目です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> menu-item . <var "
"class=\"var\">details</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> menu-item . <var "
"class=\"var\">details</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This specifies a binding which is also an extended menu item.  This allows "
"use of other features.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Extended-Menu-"
"Items.html\">Extended Menu Items</a>."
msgstr ""
"これは、拡張メニュー項目でもあるバインディングを指定します。これにより、他の"
"機能を利用できるようになります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Extended-Menu-"
"Items.html\">拡張メニュー項目</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-default-key-binding\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(t . <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"default-key-binding\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-default-key-binding\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">(t . <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"default-key-binding\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This specifies a <em class=\"dfn\">default key binding</em>; any event not "
"bound by other elements of the keymap is given <var class=\"var\">binding</"
"var> as its binding.  Default bindings allow a keymap to bind all possible "
"event types without having to enumerate all of them.  A keymap that has a "
"default binding completely masks any lower-precedence keymap, except for "
"events explicitly bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"これは<em class=\"dfn\">デフォルトのキーバインド</em>を指定します。キーマップ"
"の他の要素でバインドされていないイベントには、<var class=\"var\">binding</"
"var> がバインドとして割り当てられます。デフォルトのバインドを利用することで、"
"キーマップは考えられるすべてのイベントタイプを個別に列挙することなく、それら"
"すべてをバインドできます。デフォルトのバインドを持つキーマップは、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に明示的にバインドされたイベント（後述）を除き、優"
"先度の低いあらゆるキーマップを完全に上書きします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">char-table</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">char-table</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If an element of a keymap is a char-table, it counts as holding bindings for "
"all character events with no modifier bits (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Other-Char-Bits.html#modifier-bits\">modifier bits</a>): the element "
"whose index is <var class=\"var\">c</var> is the binding for the character "
"<var class=\"var\">c</var>.  This is a compact way to record lots of "
"bindings.  A keymap with such a char-table is called a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">full keymap</em>.  Other keymaps are called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">sparse keymaps</em>."
msgstr ""
"キーマップの要素が文字テーブルである場合、修飾ビットを持たないすべての文字イ"
"ベントに対するバインディングを保持しているものとみなされます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Char-Bits.html#modifier-bits\">修飾ビット</a>を"
"参照）。インデックスが<var class=\"var\">c</var>の要素は、文字<var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>に対するバインディングとなります。これは、多数のバイン"
"ディングをコンパクトに記録する方法です。このような文字テーブルを持つキーマッ"
"プは、<em class=\"dfn\">フルキーマップ</em>と呼ばれます。それ以外のキーマップ"
"は、<em class=\"dfn\">スパースキーマップ</em>と呼ばれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">vector</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">vector</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This kind of element is similar to a char-table: the element whose index is "
"<var class=\"var\">c</var> is the binding for the character <var "
"class=\"var\">c</var>.  Since the range of characters that can be bound this "
"way is limited by the vector size, and vector creation allocates space for "
"all character codes from 0 up, this format should not be used except for "
"creating menu keymaps (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-"
"Keymaps.html\">Menu Keymaps</a>), where the bindings themselves don&rsquo;t "
"matter."
msgstr ""
"この種の要素は文字テーブルに似ており、インデックスが <var class=\"var\">c</"
"var> の要素が文字 <var class=\"var\">c</var> のバインディングとなります。この"
"ようにバインドできる文字の範囲はベクトルサイズによって制限されており、またベ"
"クトルの生成時には 0 から始まるすべての文字コード分の領域が割り当てられるた"
"め、この形式は、バインディング自体を問わないメニューキーマップ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-Keymaps.html\">メニューキーマップ</a> を参照）の"
"作成以外では使用すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overall-prompt-string\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prompt-string-of-keymap\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-keymap-prompt-string\"></a><span><code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">string</var></code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keymap-prompt-string\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overall-prompt-string\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prompt-string-of-keymap\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-keymap-prompt-string\"></a><span><code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">string</var></code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keymap-prompt-string\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Aside from elements that specify bindings for keys, a keymap can also have a "
"string as an element.  This is called the <em class=\"dfn\">overall prompt "
"string</em> and makes it possible to use the keymap as a menu.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Menus.html\">Defining Menus</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーへのバインドを指定する要素のほかに、キーマップには文字列を要素として含め"
"ることもできます。これは<em class=\"dfn\">全体プロンプト文字列</em>と呼ばれ、"
"キーマップをメニューとして利用することを可能にします。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Menus.html\">メニューの定義</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(keymap &hellip;)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(keymap &hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If an element of a keymap is itself a keymap, it counts as if this inner "
"keymap were inlined in the outer keymap.  This is used for multiple-"
"inheritance, such as in <code class=\"code\">make-composed-keymap</code>."
msgstr ""
"キーマップの要素自体がキーマップである場合、その内部キーマップが外部キーマッ"
"プにインライン展開されたものとしてカウントされます。これは、<code "
"class=\"code\">make-composed-keymap</code> のような多重継承で使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"When the binding is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it doesn&rsquo;t "
"constitute a definition but it does take precedence over a default binding "
"or a binding in the parent keymap.  On the other hand, a binding of <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> override lower-"
"precedence keymaps; thus, if the local map gives a binding of <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs uses the binding from the global map."
msgstr ""
"バインディングが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、それは定義とはなりま"
"せんが、デフォルトのバインディングや親キーマップ内のバインディングよりも優先"
"されます。一方、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> のバインディングは、優先度の"
"低いキーマップを上書き<em class=\"emph\">しません</em>。したがって、ローカル"
"マップに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> のバインディングが指定されている場"
"合、Emacs はグローバルマップのバインディングを使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-meta-characters-lookup\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-meta-characters-lookup\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Keymaps do not directly record bindings for the meta characters.  Instead, "
"meta characters are regarded for purposes of key lookup as sequences of two "
"characters, the first of which is <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> (or whatever "
"is currently the value of <code class=\"code\">meta-prefix-char</code>).  "
"Thus, the key <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> is internally represented as <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> a</kbd>, and its global binding "
"is found at the slot for <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> in <code "
"class=\"code\">esc-map</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-"
"Keys.html\">Prefix Keys</a>)."
msgstr ""
"キーマップでは、メタ文字のバインディングを直接記録しません。代わりに、キー検"
"索の際にはメタ文字は2文字のシーケンスとして扱われ、その先頭は <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>（またはその時点での <code class=\"code\">meta-prefix-"
"char</code> の値）となります。したがって、キー <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> "
"は内部的に <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> a</kbd> として表現"
"され、そのグローバルバインディングは <code class=\"code\">esc-map</code> 内"
"の <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> のスロットで見つかります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Prefix-Keys.html\">プレフィックスキー</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This conversion applies only to characters, not to function keys or other "
"input events; thus, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">end</kbd></kbd> "
"has nothing to do with <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">end</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"この変換は文字にのみ適用され、ファンクションキーやその他の入力イベントには適"
"用されません。したがって、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">end</kbd></"
"kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">end</kbd></kbd> とは無関係です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Here as an example is the local keymap for Lisp mode, a sparse keymap.  It "
"defines bindings for <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-"
"z</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd>, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> "
"(the actual value also contains a menu binding, which is omitted here for "
"the sake of brevity)."
msgstr ""
"例として、Lispモードのローカルキーマップ（スパースなキーマップ）を挙げます。"
"ここでは <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-z</kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> のバインドが定"
"義されています（実際の値にはメニューバインドも含まれていますが、簡潔にするた"
"めここでは省略しています）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lisp-mode-map\n"
"&rArr;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap\n"
" (3 keymap\n"
"    ;; <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-z</kbd>\n"
"    (26 . run-lisp))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (27 keymap\n"
"     ;; <span class=\"r\"><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd>, treated as <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> C-x</kbd></span>\n"
"     (24 . lisp-send-defun))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" ;; <span class=\"r\">This part is inherited from <code class=\"code\">lisp-mode-shared-map</code>.</span>\n"
" keymap\n"
" ;; <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>\n"
" (127 . backward-delete-char-untabify)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (27 keymap\n"
"     ;; <span class=\"r\"><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd>, treated as <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> C-q</kbd></span>\n"
"     (17 . indent-sexp)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymapp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keymapp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymapp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keymapp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a keymap, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"otherwise.  More precisely, this function tests for a list whose <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> is <code class=\"code\">keymap</code>, or for a "
"symbol whose function definition satisfies <code class=\"code\">keymapp</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> がキーマップであれば <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでなければ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返します。より正確には、この関数は、<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> が <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap</code> であるリスト、または関数定義が <code "
"class=\"code\">keymapp</code> を満たすシンボルを判定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymapp '(keymap))\n"
"    &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Format-of-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(fset 'foo '(keymap))\n"
"(keymapp 'foo)\n"
"    &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

