# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"A format specification is a sequence of characters beginning with a &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;.  Thus, if there is a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; in <var class=\"var\">string</var>, the "
"<code class=\"code\">format</code> function replaces it with the printed "
"representation of one of the values to be formatted (one of the arguments "
"<var class=\"var\">objects</var>).  For example:"
msgstr ""
"フォーマット仕様は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;で始まる文字列"
"です。したがって、<var class=\"var\">string</var>の中に&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;がある場合、<code class=\"code\">format</code>"
"関数はそれをフォーマット対象の値（引数<var class=\"var\">objects</var>のいず"
"れか）の表示形式に置き換えます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(format &quot;The value of fill-column is %d.&quot; fill-column)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The value of fill-column is 72.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Since <code class=\"code\">format</code> interprets &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; characters as format specifications, you "
"should <em class=\"emph\">never</em> pass an arbitrary string as the first "
"argument.  This is particularly true when the string is generated by some "
"Lisp code.  Unless the string is <em class=\"emph\">known</em> to never "
"include any &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; characters, pass "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;%s&quot;</code>, described below, as the first "
"argument, and the string as the second, like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">format</code> は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo; という文字を書式指定として解釈するため、第1引数に任意の文字列を"
"<em class=\"emph\">決して</em>渡してはいけません。特に、その文字列が何らかの "
"Lisp コードによって生成される場合はなおさらです。その文字列に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; という文字が一切含まれないことが<em "
"class=\"emph\">分かっている</em>場合を除き、以下に説明する <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;%s&quot;</code> を第1引数に、文字列を第2引数として、次の"
"ように渡してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "  (format &quot;%s&quot; <var class=\"var\">arbitrary-string</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Certain format specifications require values of particular types.  If you "
"supply a value that doesn&rsquo;t fit the requirements, an error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"一部のフォーマット仕様では、特定の型の値が求められます。要件に適合しない値を"
"指定すると、エラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid "Here is a table of valid format specifications:"
