msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Replace the specification with the printed representation of the object, "
"made without quoting (that is, using <code class=\"code\">princ</code>, not "
"<code class=\"code\">prin1</code>&mdash;see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-"
"Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>).  Thus, strings are represented by "
"their contents alone, with no &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo; characters, and symbols appear without &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; characters."
msgstr ""
"仕様を、クォートを用いない（すなわち <code class=\"code\">prin1</code> ではな"
"く <code class=\"code\">princ</code> を使用する――<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出力関数</a>を参照）オブジェクトの印刷表現に置"
"き換えます。したがって、文字列は内容のみで表現され、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; 文字は含まれず、シンボルは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; 文字なしで表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If the object is a string, its text properties are copied into the output.  "
"The text properties of the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; "
"itself are also copied, but those of the object take priority."
msgstr ""
"オブジェクトが文字列の場合、そのテキストプロパティが出力にコピーされます。"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;自体のテキストプロパティもコピー"
"されますが、オブジェクト側のものが優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
