# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Replace the specification with the base-eight representation of an integer.  "
"Like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</samp>&rsquo;, the representation has "
"leading &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; if negative; The object "
"can also be a floating-point number that is formatted as an integer, "
"dropping any fraction."
msgstr ""
"仕様を整数の8進数表現に置き換えます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</"
"samp>&rsquo;と同様に、負の値の場合は先頭に&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo;が付きます。また、オブジェクトは、小数部分を切り捨てて整数として"
"フォーマットされた浮動小数点数である場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
