# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Replace the specification with the base-sixteen representation of an "
"integer.  Like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</samp>&rsquo;, the "
"representation has leading &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; if "
"negative.  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%x</samp>&rsquo; uses lower case and "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%X</samp>&rsquo; uses upper case.  The object "
"can also be a floating-point number that is formatted as an integer, "
"dropping any fraction."
msgstr ""
"仕様を整数の16進数表記に置き換えます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</"
"samp>&rsquo;と同様に、負の値の場合は先頭に&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo;が付きます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%x</samp>&rsquo;では小文"
"字が、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%X</samp>&rsquo;では大文字が使用されます。"
"また、整数としてフォーマットされ、小数部分を切り捨てた浮動小数点数を指定する"
"ことも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
