"数が &minus;4 未満、または精度（デフォルト: 6）以上となる場合は、指数表記が使"
"用されます。デフォルトでは、結果の小数部分から末尾のゼロが削除され、小数点文"
"字はその後に数字が続く場合にのみ表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
#: build/html/elisp/Type-Keywords.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Replace the specification with a single &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  This format specification is unusual in that its only form is "
"plain &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo; and that it does not use "
"a value.  For example, <code class=\"code\">(format &quot;%% %d&quot; 30)</"
"code> returns <code class=\"code\">&quot;% 30&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"仕様を単一の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; に置き換えます。この"
"形式仕様は、唯一の形式が単純な &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo; "
"であり、値を用いないという点で異例です。例えば、<code class=\"code\">(format "
"&quot;%% %d&quot; 30)</code> は <code class=\"code\">&quot;% 30&quot;</code> "
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Any other format character results in an &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Invalid "
"format operation</samp>&rsquo; error."
msgstr ""
"その他のフォーマット文字を指定すると、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Invalid "
"format operation</samp>&rsquo;エラーが発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"Here are several examples, which assume the typical <code "
"class=\"code\">text-quoting-style</code> settings:"
msgstr ""
"以下に、一般的な <code class=\"code\">text-quoting-style</code> 設定を想定し"
"た例をいくつか挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(format &quot;The octal value of %d is %o,\n"
"         and the hex value is %x.&quot; 18 18 18)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The octal value of 18 is 22,\n"
"         and the hex value is 12.&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(format-message\n"
" &quot;The name of this buffer is ‘%s’.&quot; (buffer-name))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The name of this buffer is ‘strings.texi’.&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(format-message\n"
" &quot;The buffer object prints as `%s'.&quot; (current-buffer))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The buffer object prints as ‘strings.texi’.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"By default, format specifications correspond to successive values from <var "
"class=\"var\">objects</var>.  Thus, the first format specification in <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> uses the first such value, the second format "
"specification uses the second such value, and so on.  Any extra format "
"specifications (those for which there are no corresponding values) cause an "
"error.  Any extra values to be formatted are ignored."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、フォーマット指定は <var class=\"var\">objects</var> 以降の連"
"続する値に対応します。したがって、<var class=\"var\">string</var> 内の最初の"
"フォーマット指定にはその最初の値が、2番目のフォーマット指定には2番目の値が、"
"というように使用されます。余分なフォーマット指定（対応する値がないもの）があ"
"る場合はエラーとなります。フォーマット対象の余分な値は無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-field-numbers-in-format-spec\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-field-numbers-in-format-spec\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"A format specification can have a <em class=\"dfn\">field number</em>, which "
"is a decimal number immediately after the initial &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;, followed by a literal dollar sign &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;.  It causes the format specification to "
"convert the argument with the given number instead of the next argument.  "
"Field numbers start at 1.  A format can contain either numbered or "
"unnumbered format specifications but not both, except that &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo; can be mixed with numbered specifications."
msgstr ""
"フォーマット指定には<em class=\"dfn\">フィールド番号</em>を指定できます。これ"
"は、先頭の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;の直後に10進数が続き、そ"
"の後にリテラルのドル記号&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;が続く形式"
"です。これにより、フォーマット指定は、次の引数ではなく、指定された番号の引数"
"を変換します。フィールド番号は1から始まります。フォーマットには、番号付きまた"
"は番号なしのフォーマット指定のいずれか一方を含めることができますが、両方を含"
"めることはできません。ただし、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo;は"
"番号付き指定と混在させることができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(format &quot;%2$s, %3$s, %%, %1$s&quot; &quot;x&quot; &quot;y&quot; &quot;z&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;y, z, %, x&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-flags-in-format-specifications\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-flags-in-format-specifications\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"After the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; and any field number, "
"you can put certain <em class=\"dfn\">flag characters</em>."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; および任意のフィールド番号の後に"
"は、特定の<em class=\"dfn\">フラグ文字</em>を記述できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"The flag &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; inserts a plus sign "
"before a nonnegative number, so that it always has a sign.  A space "
"character as flag inserts a space before a nonnegative number.  (Otherwise, "
"nonnegative numbers start with the first digit.)  These flags are useful for "
"ensuring that nonnegative and negative numbers use the same number of "
"columns.  They are ignored except for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%e</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%f</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%g</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and if both flags are used, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</"
"samp>&rsquo; takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"フラグ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; は、非負数の前にプラス記号"
"を挿入し、常に符号が付くようにします。フラグとしてスペース文字を指定すると、"
"非負数の前にスペースが挿入されます。（それ以外の場合、非負数は最初の桁から始"
"まります。）これらのフラグは、非負数と負数で同じ列数が使用されるようにするた"
"めに有用です。これらは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%e</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%f</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo; を除き無視され、両"
"方のフラグが使用されている場合は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; "
"が優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"The flag &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; specifies an alternate "
"form which depends on the format in use.  For &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%o</samp>&rsquo;, it ensures that the result begins with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;.  For &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%x</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%X</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%B</samp>&rsquo;, it prefixes nonzero results with &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">0x</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0X</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0b</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">0B</samp>&rsquo;, respectively.  For &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%e</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%f</"
"samp>&rsquo;, the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; flag means "
"include a decimal point even if the precision is zero.  For &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo;, it always includes a decimal point, and "
"also forces any trailing zeros after the decimal point to be left in place "
"where they would otherwise be removed."
msgstr ""
"フラグ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; は、使用されているフォー"
"マットに応じた代替形式を指定します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%o</"
"samp>&rsquo; の場合、結果が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; で始"
"まることを保証します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%x</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%X</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</"
"samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%B</samp>&rsquo; の場合、0以"
"外の結果の先頭に、それぞれ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0x</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0X</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">0b</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0B</"
"samp>&rsquo; を付加します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%e</samp>&rsquo; およ"
"び &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%f</samp>&rsquo; の場合、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; フラグは、精度が0であっても小数点を含めること"
"を意味します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo; の場合、常に小数点"
"を含め、さらに小数点後の末尾の0を、本来であれば削除される箇所にそのまま残すよ"
"うにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"The flag &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; ensures that the "
"padding consists of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; characters "
"instead of spaces.  This flag is ignored for non-numerical specification "
"characters like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%c</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  These specification characters accept the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; flag, but still pad with <em "
"class=\"emph\">spaces</em>."
msgstr ""
"フラグ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; は、パディングにスペースで"
"はなく &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; 文字が使用されるようにしま"
"す。このフラグは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%c</"
"samp>&rsquo; といった数値以外の指定文字に対しては無視されます。これらの指定文"
"字は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; フラグを受け付けますが、それ"
"でも <em class=\"emph\">スペース</em> でパディングされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"The flag &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; causes any padding "
"inserted by the width, if specified, to be inserted on the right rather than "
"the left.  If both &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; are present, the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; flag is ignored."
msgstr ""
"フラグ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; を指定すると、width で指定"
"されたパディングが左側ではなく右側に挿入されます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</"
"samp>&rsquo; の両方が指定されている場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</"
"samp>&rsquo; フラグは無視されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(format &quot;%06d is padded on the left with zeros&quot; 123)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;000123 is padded on the left with zeros&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(format &quot;'%-6d' is padded on the right&quot; 123)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;'123   ' is padded on the right&quot;\n"
"\n"
"(format &quot;The word '%-7s' actually has %d letters in it.&quot;\n"
"        &quot;foo&quot; (length &quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The word 'foo    ' actually has 3 letters in it.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-field-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-padding\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-field-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-padding\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"A specification can have a <em class=\"dfn\">width</em>, which is a decimal "
"number that appears after any field number and flags.  If the printed "
"representation of the object contains fewer characters than this width, "
"<code class=\"code\">format</code> extends it with padding.  Any padding "
"introduced by the width normally consists of spaces inserted on the left:"
msgstr ""
"仕様には<em class=\"dfn\">幅</em>を指定でき、これは任意のフィールド番号やフラ"
"グの後に続く10進数です。オブジェクトの出力表現に含まれる文字数がこの幅より少"
"ない場合、<code class=\"code\">format</code>はパディングによって幅を拡張しま"
"す。幅によって導入されるパディングは、通常、左側に挿入されるスペースで構成さ"
"れます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(format &quot;%5d is padded on the left with spaces&quot; 123)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;  123 is padded on the left with spaces&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If the width is too small, <code class=\"code\">format</code> does not "
"truncate the object&rsquo;s printed representation.  Thus, you can use a "
"width to specify a minimum spacing between columns with no risk of losing "
"information.  In the following two examples, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%7s</samp>&rsquo; specifies a minimum width of 7.  In the "
"first case, the string inserted in place of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%7s</"
"samp>&rsquo; has only 3 letters, and needs 4 blank spaces as padding.  In "
"the second case, the string <code class=\"code\">&quot;specification&quot;</"
"code> is 13 letters wide but is not truncated."
msgstr ""
"幅が狭すぎる場合、<code class=\"code\">format</code> はオブジェクトの表示表現"
"を切り捨てません。したがって、情報が失われるリスクなく、幅を指定して列間の最"
"小間隔を設けることができます。以下の2つの例では、「<samp class=\"samp\">%7s</"
"samp>」が最小幅7を指定しています。1つ目の例では、「<samp class=\"samp\">%7s</"
"samp>」の代わりに挿入された文字列は3文字しかなく、パディングとして4つの空白が"
"必要です。2つ目の例では、文字列 <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;specification&quot;</code> は13文字幅ですが、切り捨てら"
"れません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(format &quot;The word '%7s' has %d letters in it.&quot;\n"
"        &quot;foo&quot; (length &quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The word '    foo' has 3 letters in it.&quot;\n"
"(format &quot;The word '%7s' has %d letters in it.&quot;\n"
"        &quot;specification&quot; (length &quot;specification&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The word 'specification' has 13 letters in it.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-precision-in-format-"
"specifications\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-precision-in-format-"
"specifications\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"All the specification characters allow an optional <em "
"class=\"dfn\">precision</em> after the field number, flags and width, if "
"present.  The precision is a decimal-point &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</"
"samp>&rsquo; followed by a digit-string.  For the floating-point "
"specifications (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%e</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%f</samp>&rsquo;), the precision specifies how many "
"digits following the decimal point to show; if zero, the decimal-point "
"itself is also omitted.  For &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo;, "
"the precision specifies how many significant digits to show (significant "
"digits are the first digit before the decimal point and all the digits after "
"it).  If the precision of %g is zero or unspecified, it is treated as 1.  "
"For &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo;, the precision truncates the string to the "
"given width, so &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%.3s</samp>&rsquo; shows only "
"the first three characters of the representation for <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>.  For other specification characters, the effect "
"of precision is what the local library functions of the <code "
"class=\"code\">printf</code> family produce."
msgstr ""
"すべての指定文字において、フィールド番号、フラグ、および幅の後に、任意で<em "
"class=\"dfn\">精度</em>を指定できます。精度は、小数点 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo; とそれに続く数字列で構成されます。浮動小数点指"
"定（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%e</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%f</samp>&rsquo;）の場合、精度は小数点の後に表示する桁数を指定"
"します。0 の場合は、小数点自体も省略されます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo; の場合、精度は有効桁数を指定します（有効桁数"
"とは、小数点より前の最初の桁と、小数点より後のすべての桁を指します）。%g の精"
"度が 0 または未指定の場合、1 として扱われます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%S</"
"samp>&rsquo; の場合、精度によって文字列が指定された幅で切り詰められるため、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%.3s</samp>&rsquo; では <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> の表現の最初の 3 文字のみが表示されます。その他の"
"指定文字の場合、精度の効果は <code class=\"code\">printf</code> 系のローカル"
"ライブラリ関数が生成する結果となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-formatting-numbers-for-rereading-"
"later\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-formatting-numbers-for-rereading-"
"later\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html
msgid ""
"If you plan to use <code class=\"code\">read</code> later on the formatted "
"string to retrieve a copy of the formatted value, use a specification that "
"lets <code class=\"code\">read</code> reconstruct the value.  To format "
"numbers in this reversible way you can use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo;, to format "
"just integers you can also use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#x%x</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#o%o</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#b%b</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Other formats do not guarantee preservation of all values; "
"for example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo; can lose precision "
"and type and does not preserve NaN or infinity.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Input-Functions.html\">Input Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"フォーマット済み文字列の後で <code class=\"code\">read</code> を使用して"
"フォーマット済み値のコピーを取得したい場合は、<code class=\"code\">read</"
"code> で値を再構成できる仕様を使用してください。数値をこのような可逆的な方法"
"でフォーマットするには &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; や "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo; が利用でき、整数のみをフォーマッ"
"トする場合は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#x%x</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#o%o</"
"samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#b%b</samp>&rsquo; も使用でき"
"ます。その他のフォーマットでは、すべての値が保持されるとは限りません。例え"
"ば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%g</samp>&rsquo; では精度や型が失われる可能性"
"があり、NaN や無限大は保持されません。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-"
"Functions.html\">入力関数</a>を参照してください。"

