#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"<span>44.6 Supporting older versions of Emacs<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Supporting-older-versions-of-Emacs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>44.6 Emacsの旧バージョンへの対応<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Supporting-older-versions-of-Emacs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compatibility-compat\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compatibility-compat\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"Packages that wish to support older releases of Emacs, without giving up on "
"newer functionality from recent Emacs releases, one can make use of the "
"Compat package on GNU ELPA.  By depending on the package, Emacs can provide "
"compatibility definitions for missing functionality."
msgstr ""
"最新のEmacsリリースで導入された新機能を活用しつつ、旧バージョンのEmacsもサ"
"ポートしたいパッケージは、GNU ELPAのCompatパッケージを利用できます。このパッ"
"ケージに依存することで、Emacsは不足している機能に対する互換性定義を提供できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"The versioning of Compat follows that of Emacs, so next to the oldest "
"version that a package relies on (via the <code class=\"code\">emacs</code>-"
"package), one can also indicate what the newest version of Emacs is, that a "
"package wishes to use definitions from:"
msgstr ""
"Compatのバージョン管理はEmacsに準拠しているため、パッケージが依存している最古"
"のバージョン（<code class=\"code\">emacs</code>-package経由）に加えて、パッ"
"ケージが定義の利用を希望するEmacsの最新バージョンを指定することも可能です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ";; Package-Requires: ((emacs &quot;27.2&quot;) (compat &quot;29.1&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"Note that Compat provides replacement functions with extended functionality "
"for functions that are already defined (<code class=\"code\">sort</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">assoc</code>, &hellip;).  These functions may have "
"changed their calling convention (additional optional arguments) or may have "
"changed their behavior.  These functions must be looked up explicitly with "
"<code class=\"code\">compat-function</code> or called explicitly with <code "
"class=\"code\">compat-call</code>.  We call them <em class=\"dfn\">Extended "
"Definitions</em>.  In contrast, newly <em class=\"dfn\">Added Definitions</"
"em> can be called as usual."
msgstr ""
"なお、Compatでは、すでに定義されている関数（<code class=\"code\">sort</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">assoc</code>、&hellip;）に対して、機能を拡張した"
"代替関数を提供しています。これらの関数は、呼び出し規約（追加のオプション引"
"数）が変更されていたり、動作が変更されていたりする場合があります。これらの関"
"数は、<code class=\"code\">compat-function</code>を用いて明示的に参照するか、"
"<code class=\"code\">compat-call</code>を用いて明示的に呼び出す必要がありま"
"す。これらを<em class=\"dfn\">拡張定義</em>と呼びます。これに対し、新たに<em "
"class=\"dfn\">追加された定義</em>は、通常通り呼び出すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compat-call</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">fun &amp;rest "
"args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-compat_002dcall\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compat-call</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">fun &amp;rest "
"args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-compat_002dcall\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"This macro calls the compatibility function <var class=\"var\">fun</var> "
"with <var class=\"var\">args</var>.  Many functions provided by Compat can "
"be called directly without this macro.  However in the case where Compat "
"provides an alternative version of an existing function, the function call "
"has to go through <code class=\"code\">compat-call</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、互換性関数 <var class=\"var\">fun</var> を <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> と共に呼び出します。Compat が提供する多くの関数は、"
"このマクロを介さずに直接呼び出すことができます。ただし、Compat が既存の関数の"
"代替バージョンを提供している場合は、関数呼び出しを <code "
"class=\"code\">compat-call</code> 経由させる必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compat-function</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">fun</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-compat_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compat-function</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">fun</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-compat_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Forwards_002dCompatibility.html
msgid ""
"This macro returns the compatibility function symbol for <var "
"class=\"var\">fun</var>.  See <code class=\"code\">compat-call</code> for a "
"more convenient macro to directly call compatibility functions."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">fun</var> に対応する互換性関数のシンボルを返"
"します。互換性関数を直接呼び出すためのより便利なマクロについては、<code "
"class=\"code\">compat-call</code> を参照してください。"

