# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configuration-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">frame configuration</em> stores information about the "
"positions, sizes, and contents of the windows in all frames.  It is not a "
"primitive type&mdash;it is actually a list whose <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> is <code class=\"code\">frame-configuration</code> and whose <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> is an alist.  Each alist element describes one "
"frame, which appears as the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of that element."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">フレーム構成</em>は、すべてのフレームにおけるウィンドウの位"
"置、サイズ、および内容に関する情報を保持します。これはプリミティブ型ではな"
"く、実際には<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>が<code class=\"code\">frame-"
"configuration</code>で、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>がalistであるリストで"
"す。各alist要素は1つのフレームを記述しており、その要素の<small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small>として現れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
