# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">frame configuration</em> records the current arrangement "
"of frames, all their properties, and the window configuration of each one.  "
"(See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">Window "
"Configurations</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">フレーム構成</em>には、現在のフレームの配置、すべてのプロパ"
"ティ、および各フレームのウィンドウ構成が記録されます。（<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ構成</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-frame-configuration</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-current_002dframe_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-frame-configuration</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-current_002dframe_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a frame configuration list that describes the current "
"arrangement of frames and their contents."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、フレームの現在の配置とその内容を記述したフレーム構成リストを返し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-frame-configuration</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">configuration &amp;optional nodelete</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-set_002dframe_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
