# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function restores the state of frames described in <var "
"class=\"var\">configuration</var>.  However, this function does not restore "
"deleted frames."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">configuration</var> で記述されたフレームの状態"
"を復元します。ただし、削除されたフレームは復元しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Ordinarily, this function deletes all existing frames not listed in <var "
"class=\"var\">configuration</var>.  But if <var class=\"var\">nodelete</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the unwanted frames are iconified "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"通常、この関数は<var class=\"var\">configuration</var>に記載されていない既存"
"のフレームをすべて削除します。ただし、<var class=\"var\">nodelete</var>が"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合は、不要なフレームは代わりにアイコン"
"化されます。"

