"id=\"index-default-height-of-character\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default-font\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-default-character-size\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-default-character-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-default-width-of-character\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-default-character-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-default-height-of-character\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"Each frame has a <em class=\"dfn\">default font</em> which specifies the "
"default character size for that frame.  This size is meant when retrieving "
"or changing the size of a frame in terms of columns or lines (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Size-Parameters.html\">Size Parameters</a>).  It is "
"also used when resizing (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Sizes.html\">Window Sizes</a>) or splitting (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Splitting-Windows.html\">Splitting Windows</a>) windows."
msgstr ""
"各フレームには、そのフレームのデフォルトの文字サイズを指定する<em "
"class=\"dfn\">デフォルトフォント</em>が設定されています。このサイズは、フレー"
"ムのサイズを列数や行数単位で取得または変更する際に使用されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Size-Parameters.html\">サイズパラメータ</a>を参照）。"
"また、ウィンドウのサイズ変更（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">"
"ウィンドウサイズ</a>を参照）や分割（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Splitting-"
"Windows.html\">ウィンドウの分割</a>を参照）の際にも使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-column-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-canonical-character-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-canonical-character-width\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-column-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-canonical-character-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-canonical-character-width\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"The terms <em class=\"dfn\">line height</em> and <em class=\"dfn\">canonical "
"character height</em> are sometimes used instead of &ldquo;default character "
"height&rdquo;.  Similarly, the terms <em class=\"dfn\">column width</em> and "
"<em class=\"dfn\">canonical character width</em> are used instead of "
"&ldquo;default character width&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"「デフォルト文字高さ」の代わりに、<em class=\"dfn\">行高さ</em>や<em "
"class=\"dfn\">正準文字高さ</em>という用語が用いられることがあります。同様に、"
"「デフォルト文字幅」の代わりに、<em class=\"dfn\">列幅</em>や<em "
"class=\"dfn\">正準文字幅</em>という用語が用いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-char-height</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-frame_002dchar_002dheight\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-char-height</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-frame_002dchar_002dheight\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-char-width</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-frame_002dchar_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-char-width</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-frame_002dchar_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"These functions return the default height and width of a character in <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>, measured in pixels.  Together, these values "
"establish the size of the default font on <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  "
"The values depend on the choice of font for <var class=\"var\">frame</var>, "
"see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Font-and-Color-Parameters.html\">Font and Color "
"Parameters</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> における文字のデフォルトの高さ"
"と幅をピクセル単位で返します。これらの値を合わせて、<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> のデフォルトフォントのサイズが決定されます。これら"
"の値は <var class=\"var\">frame</var> で選択されるフォントによって異なりま"
"す。詳細は <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Font-and-Color-Parameters.html\">フォント"
"およびカラーパラメータ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid "The default font can be also set directly with the following function:"
msgstr "デフォルトのフォントは、以下の関数で直接設定することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-frame-font</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">font "
"&amp;optional keep-size frames</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dframe_002dfont\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-frame-font</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">font "
"&amp;optional keep-size frames</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dframe_002dfont\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"This sets the default font to <var class=\"var\">font</var>.  When called "
"interactively, it prompts for the name of a font, and uses that font on the "
"selected frame.  When called from Lisp, <var class=\"var\">font</var> should "
"be a font name (a string), a font object, font entity, or a font spec."
msgstr ""
"これにより、デフォルトのフォントが <var class=\"var\">font</var> に設定されま"
"す。対話的に呼び出された場合は、フォント名の入力を求め、選択されたフレームに"
"そのフォントを適用します。Lispから呼び出された場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">font</var> にフォント名（文字列）、フォントオブジェクト、フォン"
"トエンティティ、またはフォント仕様を指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">keep-size</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this keeps the number of frame lines and columns "
"fixed.  (If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the option <code "
"class=\"code\">frame-inhibit-implied-resize</code> described in the next "
"section will override this.)  If <var class=\"var\">keep-size</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (or with a prefix argument), it tries to "
"keep the size of the display area of the current frame fixed by adjusting "
"the number of lines and columns."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">keep-size</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、フレームの行数と列数が固定されます。"
"（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、次節で説明するオプション <code "
"class=\"code\">frame-inhibit-implied-resize</code> がこれを上書きします。）"
"<var class=\"var\">keep-size</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"（または接頭辞引数付き）の場合、行数と列数を調整することで、現在のフレームの"
"表示領域のサイズを固定しようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Font.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">frames</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this applies the font to the selected frame "
"only.  If <var class=\"var\">frames</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it should be a list of frames to act upon, or <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> meaning all existing and all future graphical frames."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">frames</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、このフォントは選択されたフレームにのみ適用されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">frames</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、"
"適用対象とするフレームのリスト、または既存および将来のすべてのグラフィカルフ"
"レームを意味する <code class=\"code\">t</code> を指定する必要があります。"

