# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The state of visibility of the frame.  There are three possibilities: <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> for invisible, <code class=\"code\">t</code> for "
"visible, and <code class=\"code\">icon</code> for iconified.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Visibility-of-Frames.html\">Visibility of Frames</a>."
msgstr ""
"フレームの表示状態。以下の3つの可能性があります。非表示の場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>、表示中の場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code>、アイ"
"コン化されている場合は <code class=\"code\">icon</code> です。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Visibility-of-Frames.html\">フレームの表示状態</a> を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-parent_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">parent-frame</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"parent_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-parent_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">parent-frame</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"parent_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means that this frame is a "
"child frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">Child Frames</"
"a>), and this parameter specifies its parent frame.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means that this frame is a normal, top-level "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このフレームは子フレーム（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a>を参照）であることを"
"意味し、このパラメータはその親フレームを指定します。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、このフレームは通常のトップレベルフレームで"
"あることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-delete_002dbefore_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">delete-before</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dbefore_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-delete_002dbefore_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">delete-before</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"delete_002dbefore_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this parameter specifies another "
"frame whose deletion will automatically trigger the deletion of this frame.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Deleting-Frames.html\">Deleting Frames</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このパラメータは、削除することで"
"自動的にこのフレームの削除がトリガーされる別のフレームを指定します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Deleting-Frames.html\">フレームの削除</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002dwheel_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">mouse-wheel-frame</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-mouse_002dwheel_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002dwheel_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">mouse-wheel-frame</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-mouse_002dwheel_002dframe_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this parameter specifies the frame "
"whose windows will be scrolled whenever the mouse wheel is scrolled with the "
"mouse pointer hovering over this frame, see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Mouse-"
"Commands.html#Mouse-Commands\">Mouse Commands</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  This parameter has no meaning "
"on a text terminal."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このパラメータは、マウスポインタ"
"がこのフレーム上にある状態でマウスホイールを操作した際にウィンドウがスクロー"
"ルされるフレームを指定します。詳細は <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html#Mouse-"
"Commands\">Mouse Commands</a> を参照してください。このパラメータはテキスト端"
"末では意味を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html
msgid ""
