# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The following example illustrates how window parameters (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">Window Parameters</a>) can "
"be used with <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-in-side-window</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Displaying-Buffers-in-Side-"
"Windows.html\">Displaying Buffers in Side Windows</a>) to set up code for "
"producing the frame layout sketched above."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、ウィンドウパラメータ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Parameters.html\">ウィンドウパラメータ</a>を参照）を<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-in-side-window</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Displaying-Buffers-in-Side-Windows.html\">サイドウィンドウでのバッファ"
"表示</a>を参照）と組み合わせて、上述のフレームレイアウトを生成するためのコー"
"ドを設定する方法を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar parameters\n"
"  '(window-parameters . ((no-other-window . t)\n"
"                         (no-delete-other-windows . t))))\n"
"\n"
"(setq fit-window-to-buffer-horizontally t)\n"
"(setq window-resize-pixelwise t)\n"
"\n"
"(setq\n"
" display-buffer-alist\n"
" `((&quot;\\\\*Buffer List\\\\*&quot; display-buffer-in-side-window\n"
"    (side . top) (slot . 0) (window-height . fit-window-to-buffer)\n"
"    (preserve-size . (nil . t)) ,parameters)\n"
"   (&quot;\\\\*Tags List\\\\*&quot; display-buffer-in-side-window\n"
"    (side . right) (slot . 0) (window-width . fit-window-to-buffer)\n"
"    (preserve-size . (t . nil)) ,parameters)\n"
"   (&quot;\\\\*\\\\(?:help\\\\|grep\\\\|Completions\\\\)\\\\*&quot;\n"
"    display-buffer-in-side-window\n"
"    (side . bottom) (slot . -1) (preserve-size . (nil . t))\n"
"    ,parameters)\n"
"   (&quot;\\\\*\\\\(?:shell\\\\|compilation\\\\)\\\\*&quot; display-buffer-in-side-window\n"
"    (side . bottom) (slot . 1) (preserve-size . (nil . t))\n"
"    ,parameters)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This specifies <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> entries (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a>) for buffers with fixed names.  In particular, it "
"asks for showing <samp class=\"file\">*Buffer List*</samp> with adjustable "
"height at the top of the frame and <samp class=\"file\">*Tags List*</samp> "
"with adjustable width on the frame&rsquo;s right.  It also asks for having "
"the <samp class=\"file\">*help*</samp>, <samp class=\"file\">*grep*</samp> "
"and <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffers share a window on the "
"bottom left side of the frame and the <samp class=\"file\">*shell*</samp> "
"and <samp class=\"file\">*compilation*</samp> buffers appear in a window on "
"the bottom right side of the frame."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、固定名を持つバッファに対して <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"alist</code> エントリを指定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-"
"Window.html\">バッファ表示用のウィンドウの選択</a> を参照）。具体的には、フ"
"レーム上部に高さ調整可能な <samp class=\"file\">*Buffer List*</samp> を、フ"
"レーム右側に幅調整可能な <samp class=\"file\">*Tags List*</samp> を表示するよ"
"う指定しています。また、<samp class=\"file\">*help*</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*grep*</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> バッ"
"ファをフレームの左下側で一つのウィンドウに共有し、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*shell*</samp> と <samp class=\"file\">*compilation*</samp> "
"バッファをフレームの右下側のウィンドウに表示するよう指定しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that the option <code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer-horizontally</"
"code> must have a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value in order to "
"allow horizontal adjustment of windows.  Entries are also added that ask for "
"preserving the height of side windows at the top and bottom of the frame and "
"the width of side windows at the left or right of the frame.  To assure that "
"side windows retain their respective sizes when maximizing the frame, the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">window-resize-pixelwise</code> is set to a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Resizing-Windows.html\">Resizing Windows</a>."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウの水平方向の調整を可能にするには、オプション <code "
"class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer-horizontally</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定する必要がある点に注意してください。"
"また、フレームの上下にあるサイドウィンドウの高さと、フレームの左右にあるサイ"
"ドウィンドウの幅を保持するよう指定する項目も追加されています。フレームを最大"
"化した際にサイドウィンドウがそれぞれのサイズを維持するように、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">window-resize-pixelwise</code> には <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の値が設定されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Resizing-"
"Windows.html\">ウィンドウのサイズ変更</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The last form also makes sure that none of the created side windows are "
"accessible via <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> by installing the <code "
"class=\"code\">no-other-window</code> parameter for each of these windows.  "
"In addition, it makes sure that side windows are not deleted via <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> by installing the <code class=\"code\">no-"
"delete-other-windows</code> parameter for each of these windows."
msgstr ""
"最後のフォームでは、これらの各ウィンドウに<code class=\"code\">no-other-"
"window</code>パラメータを設定することで、作成されたサイドウィンドウのいずれも"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd>経由でアクセスできないようにしています。さ"
"らに、これらの各ウィンドウに<code class=\"code\">no-delete-other-windows</"
"code>パラメータを設定することで、サイドウィンドウが<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;1</kbd>経由で削除されないようにしています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Since <code class=\"code\">dired</code> buffers have no fixed names, we use "
"a special function <code class=\"code\">dired-default-directory-on-left</"
"code> in order to display a lean directory buffer on the left side of the "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dired</code> バッファには固定名がないため、フレームの左"
"側にシンプルなディレクトリバッファを表示させる専用関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-default-directory-on-left</code> を使用しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun dired-default-directory-on-left ()\n"
"  &quot;Display `default-directory' in side window on left, hiding details.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (let ((buffer (dired-noselect default-directory)))\n"
"    (with-current-buffer buffer (dired-hide-details-mode t))\n"
"    (display-buffer-in-side-window\n"
"     buffer `((side . left) (slot . 0)\n"
"              (window-width . fit-window-to-buffer)\n"
"              (preserve-size . (t . nil)) ,parameters))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Layouts-with-Side-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Evaluating the preceding forms and typing, in any order, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;list-buffers</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x shell</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;list-tags</"
"kbd>, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x dired-default-directory-on-left</kbd> "
"should now reproduce the frame layout sketched above."
msgstr ""
"前述のフォームとタイピングを評価し、任意の順序で <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x&nbsp;list-buffers</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x shell</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;list-tags</kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x dired-default-directory-on-left</kbd> と入力すれば、上"
"記でスケッチしたフレームレイアウトが再現されるはずです。"

