# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Size.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the size of the text area of <var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var>, measured in terms of the canonical height and width of a character on "
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Font.html\">Frame Font</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> における文字の正準高さおよび幅を基"
"準として、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> のテキスト領域のサイズを設定します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレームフォント</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Size.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means to measure the new width and height in units "
"of pixels instead.  Note that if <code class=\"code\">frame-resize-"
"pixelwise</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, some toolkits may "
"refuse to truly honor the request if it does not increase/decrease the frame "
"size to a multiple of its character size."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すると、代わりに新しい幅と高さをピクセル単位"
"で計測します。なお、<code class=\"code\">frame-resize-pixelwise</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、フレームサイズを文字サイズの倍数"
"に増減させない限り、一部のツールキットではリクエストに正しく応じない可能性が"
"ある点にご注意ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Frame-Size.html
