# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the fringe bitmaps of the display line containing "
"position <var class=\"var\">pos</var> in window <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var>.  The return value has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">left</var> <var class=\"var\">right</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">ov</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">left</var> is the "
"symbol for the fringe bitmap in the left fringe (or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if no bitmap), <var class=\"var\">right</var> is "
"similar for the right fringe, and <var class=\"var\">ov</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if there is an overlay arrow in the left fringe."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window</var> 内の位置 <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> を含む表示行のフリンジビットマップを返します。戻り値"
"は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">right</var> <var class=\"var\">ov</var>)</code> の形式となり、"
"ここで <var class=\"var\">left</var> は左フリンジのフリンジビットマップを表す"
"シンボル（ビットマップがない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>）、<var "
"class=\"var\">right</var> は右フリンジについても同様に、<var "
"class=\"var\">ov</var> は左フリンジにオーバーレイ矢印がある場合に non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Bitmaps.html
msgid ""
"The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">pos</var> "
"is not visible in <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that stands "
"for the selected window.  If <var class=\"var\">pos</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, that stands for the value of point in <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> に <var class=\"var\">pos</var> が表示されな"
"い場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、そ"
"れは選択中のウィンドウを表します。<var class=\"var\">pos</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、それは <var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"におけるポイントの値を表します。"

