# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.13.3 Fringe Cursors<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Fringe-"
"Cursors-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.13.3 フリンジカーソル<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Fringe-"
"Cursors-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fringe-cursors\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cursor_002c-fringe\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fringe-cursors\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-cursor_002c-fringe\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"When a line is exactly as wide as the window, Emacs displays the cursor in "
"the right fringe instead of using two lines.  Different bitmaps are used to "
"represent the cursor in the fringe depending on the current buffer&rsquo;s "
"cursor type."
msgstr ""
"行幅がウィンドウ幅とちょうど同じ場合、Emacsは2行分を使うのではなく、右フリン"
"ジにカーソルを表示します。フリンジ内のカーソルの表示には、現在のバッファの"
"カーソルタイプに応じて異なるビットマップが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">overflow-newline-into-fringe</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-overflow_002dnewline_002dinto_002dfringe\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">overflow-newline-into-fringe</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-overflow_002dnewline_002dinto_002dfringe\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, lines exactly as wide as the "
"window (not counting the final newline character) are not continued.  "
"Instead, when point is at the end of the line, the cursor appears in the "
"right fringe."
msgstr ""
"これが non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ウィンドウとちょうど同じ幅"
"の行（末尾の改行文字を除く）は継続されません。代わりに、ポイントが行末にある"
"とき、カーソルは右フリンジに表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fringe-cursor-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fringe_002dcursor_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fringe-cursor-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fringe_002dcursor_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the mapping from logical cursor type to the actual "
"fringe bitmaps displayed in the right fringe.  The value is an alist where "
"each element has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">cursor-"
"type</var> . <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var>)</code>, which means to use the "
"fringe bitmap <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> to display cursors of type "
"<var class=\"var\">cursor-type</var>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、論理カーソルタイプから右フリンジに表示される実際のフリンジビット"
"マップへのマッピングを指定します。値はアリストであり、各要素は <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">cursor-type</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">bitmap</var>)</code> という形式をとります。これは、タイプ <var "
"class=\"var\">cursor-type</var> のカーソルを表示する際に、フリンジビットマッ"
"プ <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> を使用することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"Each <var class=\"var\">cursor-type</var> should be one of <code "
"class=\"code\">box</code>, <code class=\"code\">hollow</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">bar</code>, <code class=\"code\">hbar</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">hollow-small</code>.  The first four have the same meanings "
"as in the <code class=\"code\">cursor-type</code> frame parameter (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cursor-Parameters.html\">Cursor Parameters</a>).  The "
"<code class=\"code\">hollow-small</code> type is used instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">hollow</code> when the normal <code class=\"code\">hollow-"
"rectangle</code> bitmap is too tall to fit on a specific display line."
msgstr ""
"各 <var class=\"var\">cursor-type</var> は、<code class=\"code\">box</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">hollow</code>、<code class=\"code\">bar</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">hbar</code>、または <code class=\"code\">hollow-small</code> "
"のいずれかである必要があります。最初の4つは、<code class=\"code\">cursor-"
"type</code> フレームパラメータ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cursor-"
"Parameters.html\">カーソルパラメータ</a> を参照）と同じ意味を持ちます。通常"
"の <code class=\"code\">hollow-rectangle</code> ビットマップが高すぎて特定の"
"表示行に収まらない場合は、<code class=\"code\">hollow</code> の代わりに "
"<code class=\"code\">hollow-small</code> 型が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"Each <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> should be a symbol specifying the "
"fringe bitmap to be displayed for that logical cursor type.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Fringe-Bitmaps.html\">Fringe Bitmaps</a>."
msgstr ""
"各 <var class=\"var\">bitmap</var> は、その論理カーソルタイプに対して表示する"
"フリンジビットマップを指定するシンボルである必要があります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Fringe-Bitmaps.html\">フリンジビットマップ</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Cursors.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">fringe-cursor-alist</code> has a buffer-local "
"value, and there is no bitmap defined for a cursor type, the corresponding "
"value from the default value of <code class=\"code\">fringes-indicator-"
"alist</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">fringe-cursor-alist</code> がバッファローカルな値を持"
"ち、かつカーソル型にビットマップが定義されていない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">fringes-indicator-alist</code> のデフォルト値に対応する値が使"
"用されます。"

