# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Fringe indicators</em> are tiny icons displayed in the "
"window fringe to indicate truncated or continued lines, buffer boundaries, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">フリンジインジケーター</em>とは、省略または継続された行や"
"バッファ境界などを示すために、ウィンドウのフリンジに表示される小さなアイコン"
"のことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
