# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"When this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs displays a special "
"glyph in the fringe of each empty line at the end of the buffer, on "
"graphical displays.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Fringes.html\">Fringes</"
"a>.  This variable is automatically buffer-local in every buffer."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、グラフィカルディスプレイで"
"は、Emacs はバッファ末尾の各空行のフリンジに特殊なグリフを表示します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Fringes.html\">フリンジ</a> を参照してください。この変"
"数は、すべてのバッファにおいて自動的にバッファローカルになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indicate-buffer-boundaries</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-indicate_002dbuffer_002dboundaries\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">indicate-buffer-boundaries</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-indicate_002dbuffer_002dboundaries\"> &para;</a></span>"

