"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-boundaries_002c-indicating\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable controls how the buffer boundaries and window "
"scrolling are indicated in the window fringes."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、ウィンドウフリンジにおけるバッファ境界とウィンド"
"ウスクロールの表示方法を制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can indicate the buffer boundaries&mdash;that is, the first and last "
"line in the buffer&mdash;with angle icons when they appear on the screen.  "
"In addition, Emacs can display an up-arrow in the fringe to show that there "
"is text above the screen, and a down-arrow to show there is text below the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、バッファの境界（つまりバッファ内の最初と最後の行）が画面に表示され"
"る際、アングルアイコンで示すことができます。さらに、Emacsはフリンジに上向き矢"
"印を表示して画面上部にテキストがあることを示し、下向き矢印を表示して画面下部"
"にテキストがあることを示すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "There are three kinds of basic values:"
msgstr "基本値には3種類あります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "Don&rsquo;t display any of these fringe icons."
msgstr "これらのフリンジアイコンは一切表示しないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">left</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">left</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "Display the angle icons and arrows in the left fringe."
msgstr "左端の余白に角度アイコンと矢印を表示してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">right</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">right</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "Display the angle icons and arrows in the right fringe."
msgstr "右端に角度アイコンと矢印を表示してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "any non-alist"
msgstr "alist以外のもの"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Display the angle icons in the left fringe and don&rsquo;t display the "
"arrows."
msgstr "左端の余白に角度アイコンを表示し、矢印は表示しないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise the value should be an alist that specifies which fringe "
"indicators to display and where.  Each element of the alist should have the "
"form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">indicator</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var>)</code>.  Here, <var class=\"var\">indicator</"
"var> is one of <code class=\"code\">top</code>, <code class=\"code\">bottom</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">up</code>, <code class=\"code\">down</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> (which covers all the icons not yet "
"specified), while <var class=\"var\">position</var> is one of <code "
"class=\"code\">left</code>, <code class=\"code\">right</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の場合、値は表示するフリンジインジケータとその位置を指定するalistであ"
"る必要があります。alistの各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">indicator</var> . <var class=\"var\">position</var>)</code> の"
"形式である必要があります。ここで、<var class=\"var\">indicator</var> は "
"<code class=\"code\">top</code>、<code class=\"code\">bottom</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">up</code>、<code class=\"code\">down</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> のいずれか（これにより、まだ指定されていないすべての"
"アイコンを網羅します）であり、<var class=\"var\">position</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">left</code>、<code class=\"code\">right</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> のいずれかとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"For example, <code class=\"code\">((top . left) (t . right))</code> places "
"the top angle bitmap in left fringe, and the bottom angle bitmap as well as "
"both arrow bitmaps in right fringe.  To show the angle bitmaps in the left "
"fringe, and no arrow bitmaps, use <code class=\"code\">((top .  left) "
"(bottom . left))</code>."
msgstr ""
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">((top . left) (t . right))</code> は上部の角度"
"ビットマップを左フリンジに、下部の角度ビットマップおよび両方の矢印ビットマッ"
"プを右フリンジに配置します。左フリンジに角度ビットマップを表示し、矢印ビット"
"マップを表示しない場合は、<code class=\"code\">((top .  left) (bottom . "
"left))</code> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fringe-indicator-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fringe_002dindicator_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fringe-indicator-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fringe_002dindicator_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable specifies the mapping from logical fringe "
"indicators to the actual bitmaps displayed in the window fringes.  The value "
"is an alist of elements <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">indicator</"
"var> . <var class=\"var\">bitmaps</var>)</code>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">indicator</var> specifies a logical indicator type and <var "
"class=\"var\">bitmaps</var> specifies the fringe bitmaps to use for that "
"indicator."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、論理フリンジインジケータからウィンドウフリンジに"
"表示される実際のビットマップへのマッピングを指定します。値は要素 <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">indicator</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">bitmaps</var>)</code> のアリスタであり、<var "
"class=\"var\">indicator</var> で論理インジケータの型を、<var "
"class=\"var\">bitmaps</var> でそのインジケータに使用するフリンジビットマップ"
"を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Each <var class=\"var\">indicator</var> should be one of the following "
"symbols:"
msgstr ""
"各 <var class=\"var\">indicator</var> は、以下の記号のいずれかである必要があ"
"ります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">truncation</code>, <code class=\"code\">continuation</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">truncation</code>, <code class=\"code\">continuation</"
"code>."

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "Used for truncation and continuation lines."
msgstr "切り捨て線や継続線に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">up</code>, <code class=\"code\">down</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">top</code>, <code class=\"code\">bottom</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">top-bottom</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">up</code>, <code class=\"code\">down</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">top</code>, <code class=\"code\">bottom</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">top-bottom</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Used when <code class=\"code\">indicate-buffer-boundaries</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>: <code class=\"code\">up</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">down</code> indicate a buffer boundary lying above or below "
"the window edge; <code class=\"code\">top</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">bottom</code> indicate the topmost and bottommost buffer text "
"line; and <code class=\"code\">top-bottom</code> indicates where there is "
"just one line of text in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">indicate-buffer-boundaries</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合に使用されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">up</code> と <code class=\"code\">down</code> はウィンドウ端の"
"上または下に位置するバッファ境界を示し、<code class=\"code\">top</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">bottom</code> はバッファ内の最上部および最下部のテキスト"
"行を示し、<code class=\"code\">top-bottom</code> はバッファ内にテキストが1行"
"しかない箇所を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Used to indicate empty lines after the buffer end when <code "
"class=\"code\">indicate-empty-lines</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">indicate-empty-lines</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合に、バッファ終端後の空行を示すために使用"
"される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">overlay-arrow</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">overlay-arrow</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Used for overlay arrows (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Overlay-"
"Arrow.html\">The Overlay Arrow</a>)."
msgstr ""
"オーバーレイ矢印に使用します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Overlay-Arrow.html\">"
"オーバーレイ矢印</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"Each <var class=\"var\">bitmaps</var> value may be a list of symbols <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left</var> <var class=\"var\">right</var> "
"[<var class=\"var\">left1</var> <var class=\"var\">right1</var>])</code>.  "
"The <var class=\"var\">left</var> and <var class=\"var\">right</var> symbols "
"specify the bitmaps shown in the left and/or right fringe, for the specific "
"indicator.  <var class=\"var\">left1</var> and <var class=\"var\">right1</"
"var> are specific to the <code class=\"code\">bottom</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">top-bottom</code> indicators, and are used to indicate that "
"the last text line has no final newline.  Alternatively, <var "
"class=\"var\">bitmaps</var> may be a single symbol which is used in both "
"left and right fringes."
msgstr ""
"各<var class=\"var\">bitmaps</var>の値は、シンボル<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">left</var> <var class=\"var\">right</var> [<var "
"class=\"var\">left1</var> <var class=\"var\">right1</var>])</code>のリストで"
"ある場合があります。<var class=\"var\">left</var>および<var "
"class=\"var\">right</var>のシンボルは、特定のインジケータについて、左および/"
"または右フリンジに表示されるビットマップを指定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">left1</var>および<var class=\"var\">right1</var>は<code "
"class=\"code\">bottom</code>および<code class=\"code\">top-bottom</code>イン"
"ジケータに固有のもので、最後のテキスト行に末尾の改行がないことを示すために使"
"用されます。あるいは、<var class=\"var\">bitmaps</var>は左右両方のフリンジで"
"使用される単一のシンボルである場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Fringe-Bitmaps.html\">Fringe Bitmaps</a>, for a "
"list of standard bitmap symbols and how to define your own.  In addition, "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> represents the empty bitmap (i.e., an "
"indicator that is not shown)."
msgstr ""
"標準的なビットマップシンボルの一覧および独自のシンボルの定義方法については、"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Fringe-Bitmaps.html\">Fringe Bitmaps</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。また、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>は空のビットマップ（すなわち、表"
"示されないインジケーター）を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Indicators.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">fringe-indicator-alist</code> has a buffer-local "
"value, and there is no bitmap defined for a logical indicator, or the bitmap "
"is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the corresponding value from the default "
"value of <code class=\"code\">fringe-indicator-alist</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">fringe-indicator-alist</code> がバッファローカルな値を持"
"ち、論理インジケータにビットマップが定義されていないか、あるいはビットマップ"
"が <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合、<code class=\"code\">fringe-"
"indicator-alist</code> のデフォルト値のうち対応する値が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
