# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.13.1 Fringe Size and Position<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Fringe-Size-and-Position\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.13.1 フリンジのサイズと位置<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Fringe-Size-and-Position\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"The following buffer-local variables control the position and width of "
"fringes in windows showing that buffer."
msgstr ""
"以下のバッファローカル変数は、そのバッファを表示しているウィンドウにおけるフ"
"リンジの位置と幅を制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fringes-outside-margins</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fringes_002doutside_002dmargins\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fringes-outside-margins</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fringes_002doutside_002dmargins\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"The fringes normally appear between the display margins and the window "
"text.  If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, they appear "
"outside the display margins.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-"
"Margins.html\">Displaying in the Margins</a>."
msgstr ""
"フリンジは通常、表示マージンとウィンドウテキストの間に表示されます。値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、表示マージンの外側に表示されま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-Margins.html\">マージン内での表示</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">left-fringe-width</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"left_002dfringe_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">left-fringe-width</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"left_002dfringe_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies the width "
"of the left fringe in pixels.  A value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"means to use the left fringe width from the window&rsquo;s frame."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、左フリンジの幅をピクセル"
"単位で指定します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code>という値は、ウィンドウのフ"
"レームから左フリンジの幅を使用することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">right-fringe-width</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"right_002dfringe_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">right-fringe-width</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"right_002dfringe_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies the width "
"of the right fringe in pixels.  A value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"means to use the right fringe width from the window&rsquo;s frame."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、右フリンジの幅をピクセル"
"単位で指定します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code>という値は、ウィンドウのフ"
"レームから右フリンジの幅を使用することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"Any buffer which does not specify values for these variables uses the values "
"specified by the <code class=\"code\">left-fringe</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">right-fringe</code> frame parameters (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Layout-Parameters.html\">Layout Parameters</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これらの変数に値を指定していないバッファは、<code class=\"code\">left-"
"fringe</code> および <code class=\"code\">right-fringe</code> フレームパラ"
"メータで指定された値を使用します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Layout-"
"Parameters.html\">レイアウトパラメータ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"The above variables actually take effect via the function <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">Buffers and Windows</a>), which calls "
"<code class=\"code\">set-window-fringes</code> as a subroutine.  If you "
"change one of these variables, the fringe display is not updated in existing "
"windows showing the buffer, unless you call <code class=\"code\">set-window-"
"buffer</code> again in each affected window.  You can also use <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-fringes</code> to control the fringe display in "
"individual windows."
msgstr ""
"上記の変数は、実際には<code class=\"code\">set-window-fringes</code>をサブ"
"ルーチンとして呼び出す関数<code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">バッファとウィンドウ</a>を"
"参照）を介して作用します。これらの変数のいずれかを変更しても、影響を受ける各"
"ウィンドウで再度<code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code>を呼び出さない限"
"り、バッファを表示している既存のウィンドウのフリンジ表示は更新されません。ま"
"た、<code class=\"code\">set-window-fringes</code>を使用して個々のウィンドウ"
"のフリンジ表示を制御することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-fringes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"left &amp;optional right outside-margins persistent</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-set_002dwindow_002dfringes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-fringes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"left &amp;optional right outside-margins persistent</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-set_002dwindow_002dfringes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the fringe widths of window <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the selected window is used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window</var> のフリンジ幅を設定しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場"
"合、選択中のウィンドウが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">left</var> specifies the width in pixels of "
"the left fringe, and likewise <var class=\"var\">right</var> for the right "
"fringe.  A value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for either one stands "
"for the default width.  If <var class=\"var\">outside-margins</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that specifies that fringes should appear "
"outside of the display margins."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">left</var> は左フリンジの幅をピクセル単位で指定し、同"
"様に <var class=\"var\">right</var> は右フリンジの幅を指定します。いずれかに "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すると、デフォルトの幅となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">outside-margins</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、フリンジをディスプレイの余白の外側に表示することを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is not large enough to accommodate "
"fringes of the desired width, this leaves the fringes of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> unchanged."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が所望の幅のフリンジを収めるのに十分な大きさ"
"でない場合、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のフリンジはそのままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"The values specified here may be later overridden by invoking <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">Buffers and Windows</a>) on <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> with its <var class=\"var\">keep-margins</var> "
"argument <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or omitted.  However, if the "
"optional fifth argument <var class=\"var\">persistent</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and the other arguments are processed "
"successfully, the values specified here unconditionally survive subsequent "
"invocations of <code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code>.  This can be "
"used to permanently turn off fringes in the minibuffer window, consult the "
"description of <code class=\"code\">set-window-scroll-bars</code> for an "
"example (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Scroll-Bars.html\">Scroll Bars</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ここで指定された値は、後に <var class=\"var\">window</var> に対して <var "
"class=\"var\">keep-margins</var> 引数 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定"
"して <code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> を呼び出すか（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">バッファとウィンドウ</a> を"
"参照）、あるいは省略することで、上書きされる場合があります。ただし、省略可能"
"な第5引数 <var class=\"var\">persistent</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外であり、かつ他の引数が正常に処理された場合、ここで指定された値はそ"
"の後の <code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> の呼び出しにおいても無条"
"件に保持されます。これを利用して、ミニバッファウィンドウのフリンジを恒久的に"
"オフにすることができます。例については <code class=\"code\">set-window-"
"scroll-bars</code> の説明を参照してください（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Scroll-Bars.html\">スクロールバー</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-fringes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dfringes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-fringes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dfringes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Fringe-Size_002fPos.html
msgid ""
"This function returns information about the fringes of a window <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is omitted "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the selected window is used.  The value "
"has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left-width</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">right-width</var> <var class=\"var\">outside-margins</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">persistent</var>)</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window</var> の端に関する情報を返し"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が省略された場合、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、選択中のウィンドウが使用されま"
"す。戻り値は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left-width</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">right-width</var> <var class=\"var\">outside-margins</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">persistent</var>)</code> の形式となります。"

