# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"<span>13.9 Accessing Function Cell Contents<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Accessing-Function-Cell-Contents\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13.9 関数セルの内容へのアクセス<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Accessing-Function-Cell-Contents\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">function definition</em> of a symbol is the object "
"stored in the function cell of the symbol.  The functions described here "
"access, test, and set the function cell of symbols."
msgstr ""
"シンボルの<em class=\"dfn\">関数定義</em>とは、そのシンボルの関数セルに格納さ"
"れているオブジェクトのことです。ここで説明する関数は、シンボルの関数セルへの"
"アクセス、判定、および設定を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"See also the function <code class=\"code\">indirect-function</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Function-Indirection.html#Definition-of-"
"indirect_002dfunction\">Definition of indirect-function</a>."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">indirect-function</code> も参照してください。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Function-Indirection.html#Definition-of-"
"indirect_002dfunction\">間接関数の定義</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-function</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-function</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"This returns the object in the function cell of <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var>.  It does not check that the returned object is a legitimate function.  "
"If the function is void, the return value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の関数セルにあるオブジェクトを返しま"
"す。返されたオブジェクトが有効な関数であるかどうかは判定しません。関数が "
"void の場合、戻り値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun bar (n) (+ n 2))\n"
"(symbol-function 'bar)\n"
"     &rArr; #f(lambda (n) [t] (+ n 2))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(fset 'baz 'bar)\n"
"     &rArr; bar\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(symbol-function 'baz)\n"
"     &rArr; bar\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void-function-cell\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void-function-cell\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"If you have never given a symbol any function definition, its function cell "
"contains the default value <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and we say that "
"that function is <em class=\"dfn\">void</em>.  If you try to call the symbol "
"as a function, Emacs signals a <code class=\"code\">void-function</code> "
"error."
msgstr ""
"シンボルに関数定義を一度も行ったことがない場合、その関数セルにはデフォルト値 "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が格納されており、その関数は <em "
"class=\"dfn\">void</em> であると言います。シンボルを関数として呼び出そうとす"
"ると、Emacs は <code class=\"code\">void-function</code> エラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"Unlike with void variables (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Void-"
"Variables.html\">When a Variable is Void</a>), a symbol&rsquo;s function "
"cell that contains <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is indistinguishable from "
"the function&rsquo;s being void.  Note that void is not the same as the "
"symbol <code class=\"code\">void</code>: <code class=\"code\">void</code> "
"can be a valid function if you define it with <code class=\"code\">defun</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"void変数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Void-Variables.html\">変数がvoidの場合</"
"a>を参照）とは異なり、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を含むシンボルの関数セル"
"は、その関数がvoidであることと区別がつきません。なお、voidはシンボル<code "
"class=\"code\">void</code>とは異なる点に注意してください。<code "
"class=\"code\">void</code>を<code class=\"code\">defun</code>で定義すれば、有"
"効な関数となり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"You can test the voidness of a symbol&rsquo;s function definition with <code "
"class=\"code\">fboundp</code>.  After you have given a symbol a function "
"definition, you can make it void once more using <code "
"class=\"code\">fmakunbound</code>."
msgstr ""
"シンボルの関数定義が void であるかどうかは、<code class=\"code\">fboundp</"
"code> で確認できます。シンボルに関数定義を与えた後、<code "
"class=\"code\">fmakunbound</code> を用いて再び void にすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fboundp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-fboundp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fboundp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-fboundp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the symbol has a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> object in its function cell, <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  It does not check that the object is a "
"legitimate function."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、シンボルの関数セルに<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外のオブジェ"
"クトが含まれている場合は<code class=\"code\">t</code>を、そうでない場合は"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。また、そのオブジェクトが正当な関数"
"であるかどうかの判定は行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fmakunbound</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-fmakunbound\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fmakunbound</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-fmakunbound\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"This function makes <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>&rsquo;s function cell "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, so that a subsequent attempt to access this "
"cell will cause a <code class=\"code\">void-function</code> error.  It "
"returns <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>.  (See also <code "
"class=\"code\">makunbound</code>, in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Void-"
"Variables.html\">When a Variable is Void</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の関数セル <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を作成し、その後このセルにアクセスしようとすると "
"<code class=\"code\">void-function</code> エラーが発生します。戻り値は <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> です。（<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Void-"
"Variables.html\">変数が void の場合</a> の <code class=\"code\">makunbound</"
"code> も参照してください。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo (x) x)\n"
"(foo 1)\n"
"     &rArr;1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(fmakunbound 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(foo 1)\n"
"error&rarr; Symbol's function definition is void: foo\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fset</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol definition</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-fset\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fset</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol definition</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-fset\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"This function stores <var class=\"var\">definition</var> in the function "
"cell of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>.  The result is <var "
"class=\"var\">definition</var>.  Normally <var class=\"var\">definition</"
"var> should be a function or the name of a function, but this is not "
"checked.  The argument <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is an ordinary "
"evaluated argument."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の関数セルに <var "
"class=\"var\">definition</var> を格納します。結果は <var "
"class=\"var\">definition</var> となります。通常、<var "
"class=\"var\">definition</var> は関数または関数名であるべきですが、この点は"
"チェックされません。引数 <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> は、通常の評価済み引"
"数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"The primary use of this function is as a subroutine by constructs that "
"define or alter functions, like <code class=\"code\">defun</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">advice-add</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Advising-"
"Functions.html\">Advising Emacs Lisp Functions</a>).  You can also use it to "
"give a symbol a function definition that is not a function, e.g., a keyboard "
"macro (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">Keyboard Macros</"
"a>):"
msgstr ""
"この関数の主な用途は、<code class=\"code\">defun</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">advice-add</code> のように関数を定義または変更する構文におい"
"て、サブルーチンとして利用することです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Advising-"
"Functions.html\">Advising Emacs Lisp Functions</a> を参照）。また、シンボルに"
"対して、関数ではない関数定義（例えばキーボードマクロなど）を付与するためにも"
"使用できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">Keyboard "
"Macros</a> を参照）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Define a named keyboard macro.</span>\n"
"(fset 'kill-two-lines &quot;\\^u2\\^k&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;\\^u2\\^k&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Cells.html
msgid ""
"If you wish to use <code class=\"code\">fset</code> to make an alternate "
"name for a function, consider using <code class=\"code\">defalias</code> "
"instead.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Functions.html#Definition-of-"
"defalias\">Definition of defalias</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">fset</code> を使用して関数の別名を指定したい場合は、代わ"
"りに <code class=\"code\">defalias</code> の使用を検討してください。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Functions.html#Definition-of-"
"defalias\">defalias の定義</a> を参照してください。"

