#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-computed-documentation-string\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003adocumentation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-computed-documentation-string\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003adocumentation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"Documentation strings are usually static, but occasionally it can be "
"necessary to generate them dynamically.  In some cases you can do so by "
"writing a macro which generates at compile time the code of the function, "
"including the desired documentation string.  But you can also generate the "
"docstring dynamically by writing <code class=\"code\">(:documentation <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var>)</code> instead of the documentation string.  This "
"will evaluate <var class=\"var\">form</var> at run-time when the function is "
"defined and use it as the documentation string<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF15\" href=\"#FOOT15\"><sup>15</sup></a>.  You can also compute the "
"documentation string on the fly when it is requested, by setting the <code "
"class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> property of the "
"function&rsquo;s symbol to a Lisp form that evaluates to a string."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメント文字列は通常静的ですが、場合によっては動的に生成する必要がありま"
"す。状況によっては、目的のドキュメント文字列を含む関数のコードをコンパイル時"
"に生成するマクロを記述することで、これを実現できます。また、ドキュメント文字"
"列の代わりに <code class=\"code\">(:documentation <var class=\"var\">form</"
"var>)</code> を記述することで、ドキュメント文字列を動的に生成することも可能で"
"す。これにより、関数が定義される実行時に <var class=\"var\">form</var> が評価"
"され、それがドキュメント文字列として使用されます<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF15\" href=\"#FOOT15\"><sup>15</sup></a>。さらに、関数のシンボルの "
"<code class=\"code\">function-documentation</code> プロパティに、文字列として"
"評価される Lisp フォームを設定することで、要求があった際にその場でドキュメン"
"ト文字列を計算することもできます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun adder (x)\n"
"  (lambda (y)\n"
"    (:documentation (format &quot;Add %S to the argument Y.&quot; x))\n"
"    (+ x y)))\n"
"(defalias 'adder5 (adder 5))\n"
"(documentation 'adder5)\n"
"    &rArr; &quot;Add 5 to the argument Y.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Documentation.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(put 'adder5 'function-documentation\n"
"     '(concat (documentation (symbol-function 'adder5) 'raw)\n"
"              &quot;  Consulted at &quot; (format-time-string &quot;%H:%M:%S&quot;)))\n"
"(documentation 'adder5)\n"
"    &rArr; &quot;Add 5 to the argument Y.  Consulted at 15:52:13&quot;\n"
"(documentation 'adder5)\n"
"    &rArr; &quot;Add 5 to the argument Y.  Consulted at 15:52:18&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

