msgid ""
"<span>10.2.4 Symbol Function Indirection<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Symbol-Function-Indirection\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.2.4 シンボル関数の間接参照<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Symbol-"
"Function-Indirection\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-symbol-function-indirection\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indirection-for-functions\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void-function\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-symbol-function-indirection\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indirection-for-functions\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void-function\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"If the first element of the list is a symbol then evaluation examines the "
"symbol&rsquo;s function cell, and uses its contents instead of the original "
"symbol.  If the contents are another symbol, this process, called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">symbol function indirection</em>, is repeated until it obtains "
"a non-symbol.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Function-Names.html\">Naming a "
"Function</a>, for more information about symbol function indirection.  We "
"eventually obtain a non-symbol, which ought to be a function or other "
"suitable object."
msgstr ""
"リストの先頭要素がシンボルである場合、評価ではそのシンボルの関数セルを調べ、"
"元のシンボルの代わりにその内容を使用します。その内容が別のシンボルである場"
"合、<em class=\"dfn\">シンボル関数間接参照</em>と呼ばれるこの処理は、シンボル"
"ではないものが得られるまで繰り返されます。シンボル関数間接参照の詳細について"
"は、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Function-Names.html\">関数の命名</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。最終的にシンボルではないものが得られ、それは関数またはその他の適切な"
"オブジェクトであるはずです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invalid_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invalid_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"More precisely, we should now have a Lisp function (a lambda expression), a "
"byte-code function, a primitive function, a Lisp macro, a special form, or "
"an autoload object.  Each of these types is a case described in one of the "
"following sections.  If the object is not one of these types, Emacs signals "
"an <code class=\"code\">invalid-function</code> error."
msgstr ""
"より正確には、現在はLisp関数（ラムダ式）、バイトコード関数、プリミティブ関"
"数、Lispマクロ、特殊フォーム、またはオートロードオブジェクトのいずれかである"
"はずです。これらの型はそれぞれ、以下のセクションのいずれかで説明されていま"
"す。オブジェクトがこれらの型のいずれでもない場合、Emacsは<code "
"class=\"code\">invalid-function</code>エラーを発生させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"The following example illustrates the symbol indirection process.  We use "
"<code class=\"code\">fset</code> to set the function cell of a symbol and "
"<code class=\"code\">symbol-function</code> to get the function cell "
"contents (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Function-Cells.html\">Accessing "
"Function Cell Contents</a>).  Specifically, we store the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">car</code> into the function cell of <code "
"class=\"code\">first</code>, and the symbol <code class=\"code\">first</"
"code> into the function cell of <code class=\"code\">erste</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、シンボル間接参照の処理について説明します。シンボルの関数セルを"
"設定するには <code class=\"code\">fset</code> を、関数セルの内容を取得するに"
"は <code class=\"code\">symbol-function</code> を使用します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Function-Cells.html\">関数セルの内容へのアクセス</a> "
"を参照）。具体的には、シンボル <code class=\"code\">car</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">first</code> の関数セルに、シンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">first</code> を <code class=\"code\">erste</code> の関数セルに"
"格納します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Build this function cell linkage:</span>\n"
";;   -------------       -----        -------        -------\n"
";;  | #&lt;subr car&gt; | &lt;-- | car |  &lt;-- | first |  &lt;-- | erste |\n"
";;   -------------       -----        -------        -------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(symbol-function 'car)\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;subr car&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(fset 'first 'car)\n"
"     &rArr; car\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(fset 'erste 'first)\n"
"     &rArr; first\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(erste '(1 2 3))   ; <span class=\"r\">Call the function referenced by <code class=\"code\">erste</code>.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"By contrast, the following example calls a function without any symbol "
"function indirection, because the first element is an anonymous Lisp "
"function, not a symbol."
msgstr ""
"これに対し、以下の例では、最初の要素がシンボルではなく匿名のLisp関数であるた"
"め、シンボル関数の間接参照を介さずに関数を呼び出しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"((lambda (arg) (erste arg))\n"
" '(1 2 3))\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"Executing the function itself evaluates its body; this does involve symbol "
"function indirection when calling <code class=\"code\">erste</code>."
msgstr ""
"関数自体を実行するとその本体が評価されますが、この際、<code "
"class=\"code\">erste</code>を呼び出すときにシンボル関数の間接参照が行われま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"This form is rarely used and is now deprecated.  Instead, you should write "
"it as:"
msgstr ""
"この形式はほとんど使われず、現在は非推奨となっています。代わりに、次のように"
"記述してください："

