# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"The built-in function <code class=\"code\">indirect-function</code> provides "
"an easy way to perform symbol function indirection explicitly."
msgstr ""
"組み込み関数 <code class=\"code\">indirect-function</code> を使用すると、シン"
"ボル関数の間接参照を明示的に簡単に実行できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
