"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-indirect_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-indirect_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the meaning of <var class=\"var\">function</var> as a "
"function.  If <var class=\"var\">function</var> is a symbol, then it finds "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var>&rsquo;s function definition and starts "
"over with that value.  If <var class=\"var\">function</var> is not a symbol, "
"then it returns <var class=\"var\">function</var> itself."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">function</var> の意味を関数として返します。"
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> がシンボルである場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> の関数定義を探し、その値から処理を再開します。"
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> がシンボルでない場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> 自体を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the final symbol is "
"unbound."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、最後のシンボルが未束縛である場合に <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
msgid ""
"Here is how you could define <code class=\"code\">indirect-function</code> "
"in Lisp:"
msgstr ""
"Lispで<code class=\"code\">indirect-function</code>を定義する方法は以下の通り"
"です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Indirection.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun indirect-function (function)\n"
"  (if (and function\n"
"           (symbolp function))\n"
"      (indirect-function (symbol-function function))\n"
"    function))\n"
msgstr ""

