# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Keys.html
msgid ""
"You can use the modifier keys <kbd class=\"key\">ALT</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">HYPER</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">SHIFT</kbd>, and <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SUPER</kbd> with function keys.  The way to represent them is "
"with prefixes in the symbol name:"
msgstr ""
"ファンクションキーでは、修飾キー <kbd class=\"key\">ALT</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">HYPER</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">SHIFT</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SUPER</kbd> を使用できます。表記方法は、シンボル名にプレフィッ"
"クスを付ける形式です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Function-Keys.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A-</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A-</samp>&rsquo;"

