"href=\"#Functions-for-Key-Lookup-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.11 キー検索用の関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Functions-for-"
"Key-Lookup-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid "Here are the functions and variables pertaining to key lookup."
msgstr "キールックアップに関する関数と変数は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-lookup</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"&amp;optional accept-defaults no-remap position</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-keymap_002dlookup\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-lookup</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"&amp;optional accept-defaults no-remap position</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-keymap_002dlookup\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the definition of <var class=\"var\">key</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  All the other functions described in this "
"chapter that look up keys use <code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code>.  "
"Here are examples:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> における <var class=\"var\">key</"
"var> の定義を返します。本章で説明されている、キーを参照するその他の関数はすべ"
"て <code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> を使用します。以下に例を示しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-lookup (current-global-map) &quot;C-x C-f&quot;)\n"
"    &rArr; find-file\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-lookup (current-global-map) &quot;C-x C-f 1 2 3 4 5&quot;)\n"
"    &rArr; 2\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"If the string or vector <var class=\"var\">key</var> is not a valid key "
"sequence according to the prefix keys specified in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>, it must be too long and have extra events at the "
"end that do not fit into a single key sequence.  Then the value is a number, "
"the number of events at the front of <var class=\"var\">key</var> that "
"compose a complete key."
msgstr ""
"文字列またはベクトル <var class=\"var\">key</var> が、<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> で指定されたプレフィックスキーに従った有効なキー"
"シーケンスでない場合、それは長すぎるとともに、単一のキーシーケンスに収まりき"
"らない余分なイベントが末尾に存在している必要があります。その場合、値は数値と"
"なり、<var class=\"var\">key</var> の先頭にあり、完全なキーを構成するイベント"
"の数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">accept-defaults</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then <code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> considers default "
"bindings as well as bindings for the specific events in <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var>.  Otherwise, <code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</"
"code> reports only bindings for the specific sequence <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var>, ignoring default bindings except when you "
"explicitly ask about them.  (To do this, supply <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> as an element of <var class=\"var\">key</var>; see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Format-of-Keymaps.html\">Format of Keymaps</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">accept-defaults</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> はデフォルトのバイン"
"ディングに加え、<var class=\"var\">key</var> で指定された特定のイベントに対す"
"るバインディングも考慮します。そうでない場合、<code class=\"code\">keymap-"
"lookup</code> は特定のシーケンス <var class=\"var\">key</var> に対するバイン"
"ディングのみを報告し、明示的に問い合わせた場合を除き、デフォルトのバインディ"
"ングは無視します。（これを行うには、<var class=\"var\">key</var> の要素とし"
"て <code class=\"code\">t</code> を指定してください。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Format-of-Keymaps.html\">キーマップの形式</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">key</var> contains a meta character (not a function "
"key), that character is implicitly replaced by a two-character sequence: the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">meta-prefix-char</code>, followed by the "
"corresponding non-meta character.  Thus, the first example below is handled "
"by conversion into the second example."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">key</var> にメタ文字（ファンクションキーではない）が含まれ"
"ている場合、その文字は暗黙的に2文字のシーケンス（<code class=\"code\">meta-"
"prefix-char</code> の値と、それに続く対応する非メタ文字）に置き換えられます。"
"したがって、以下の最初の例は、2番目の例への変換によって処理されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-lookup (current-global-map) &quot;M-f&quot;)\n"
"    &rArr; forward-word\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-lookup (current-global-map) &quot;ESC f&quot;)\n"
"    &rArr; forward-word\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> argument can be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, meaning to look up <var class=\"var\">key</var> "
"in the current keymaps (as returned by <code class=\"code\">current-active-"
"maps</code>, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Active-Keymaps.html\">Active "
"Keymaps</a>); or it can be a keymap or a list of keymaps, meaning to look up "
"<var class=\"var\">key</var> only in the specified keymaps."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> 引数には <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指"
"定でき、これは現在のキーマップ（<code class=\"code\">current-active-maps</"
"code> によって返されるもの。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Active-"
"Keymaps.html\">Active Keymaps</a> を参照）から <var class=\"var\">key</var> "
"を参照することを意味します。あるいは、キーマップまたはキーマップのリストを指"
"定することもでき、この場合は指定されたキーマップのみから <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> を参照します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"Unlike <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>, this function does not "
"modify the specified events in ways that discard information (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">Key Sequence Input</a>).  "
"In particular, it does not convert letters to lower case and it does not "
"change drag events to clicks."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>とは異なり、この関数は指定された"
"イベントを情報が破棄されるような形で変更することはありません（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力</a>を参"
"照）。特に、文字を小文字に変換したり、ドラッグイベントをクリックに変更したり"
"することはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"Like the normal command loop, <code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> will "
"remap the command resulting from looking up <var class=\"var\">key</var> by "
"looking up the command in the current keymaps.  However, if the optional "
"third argument <var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> returns "
"the command without remapping."
msgstr ""
"通常のコマンドループと同様に、<code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> は現"
"在のキーマップからコマンドを参照することで、<var class=\"var\">key</var> の参"
"照結果となるコマンドを再マッピングします。ただし、オプションの第3引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">no-remap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> は再マッピングを行わずにコマンドを"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">position</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies a mouse position as returned by "
"<code class=\"code\">event-start</code> and <code class=\"code\">event-end</"
"code>, and the lookup occurs in the keymaps associated with that position, "
"instead of in <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  <var class=\"var\">position</"
"var> can also be a number or a marker, in which case it is interpreted as a "
"buffer position, and the function uses the keymap properties at that "
"position instead of at point."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">position</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、それは <code class=\"code\">event-"
"start</code> および <code class=\"code\">event-end</code> によって返されるマ"
"ウス位置を指定し、ルックアップは <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> ではなく、そ"
"の位置に関連付けられたキーマップで行われます。<var class=\"var\">position</"
"var> も数値またはマーカーを指定でき、その場合はバッファ位置として解釈され、関"
"数は point ではなくその位置にあるキーマップのプロパティを使用します。"

