"href=\"#index-meta_002dprefix_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ESC\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ESC\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"This variable is the meta-prefix character code.  It is used for translating "
"a meta character to a two-character sequence so it can be looked up in a "
"keymap.  For useful results, the value should be a prefix event (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-Keys.html\">Prefix Keys</a>).  The default "
"value is 27, which is the <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> code for <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"この変数はメタプレフィックス文字コードです。メタ文字を2文字のシーケンスに変換"
"し、キーマップで検索できるようにするために使用されます。有用な結果を得るに"
"は、値をプレフィックスイベントにする必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Prefix-Keys.html\">プレフィックスキー</a>を参照）。デフォルト値は27"
"で、これは<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>の<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>"
"コードです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"As long as the value of <code class=\"code\">meta-prefix-char</code> remains "
"27, key lookup translates <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> into <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> b</kbd>, which is normally "
"defined as the <code class=\"code\">backward-word</code> command.  However, "
"if you were to set <code class=\"code\">meta-prefix-char</code> to 24, the "
"code for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>, then Emacs will translate <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> into <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x b</kbd>, whose standard "
"binding is the <code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> command.  "
"(Don&rsquo;t actually do this!)  Here is an illustration of what would "
"happen:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"meta-prefix-char                    ; <span class=\"r\">The default value.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 27\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(key-binding &quot;\\M-b&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; backward-word\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"?\\C-x                               ; <span class=\"r\">The print representation</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 24                          ;   <span class=\"r\">of a character.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq meta-prefix-char 24)\n"
"     &rArr; 24\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(key-binding &quot;\\M-b&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; switch-to-buffer            ; <span class=\"r\">Now, typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> is</span>\n"
"                                    ;   <span class=\"r\">like typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x b</kbd>.</span>\n"
"\n"
"(setq meta-prefix-char 27)          ; <span class=\"r\">Avoid confusion!</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 27                          ; <span class=\"r\">Restore the default value!</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Functions-for-Key-Lookup.html
msgid ""
"This translation of one event into two happens only for characters, not for "
"other kinds of input events.  Thus, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd>, a function key, is not converted into <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"1つのイベントを2つに分割するこの変換は、文字に対してのみ行われ、その他の種類"
"の入力イベントには適用されません。したがって、ファンクションキーである<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd>は<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd>に変換されません。"

