#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"<span>2.4.3.2 General Escape Syntax<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#General-Escape-Syntax-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.3.2 汎用エスケープ構文<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#General-"
"Escape-Syntax-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the specific escape sequences for special important control "
"characters, Emacs provides several types of escape syntax that you can use "
"to specify non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> text characters."
msgstr ""
"特に重要な制御文字用の専用エスケープシーケンスに加え、Emacsでは<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>以外のテキスト文字を指定するために使用できる、"
"数種類のエスケープ構文が用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005c-in-character-constant\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backslash-in-character-constants\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unicode-character-escape\"></a> You "
"can specify characters by their Unicode names, if any.  <code "
"class=\"code\">?\\N{<var class=\"var\">NAME</var>}</code> represents the "
"Unicode character named <var class=\"var\">NAME</var>.  Thus, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\N{LATIN SMALL LETTER A WITH GRAVE}</samp>&rsquo; is "
"equivalent to <code class=\"code\">?à</code> and denotes the Unicode "
"character U+00E0.  To simplify entering multi-line strings, you can replace "
"spaces in the names by non-empty sequences of whitespace (e.g., newlines)."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005c-in-character-constant\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backslash-in-character-constants\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unicode-character-escape\"></a> 文字"
"は、Unicode名がある場合はそれを用いて指定できます。  <code class=\"code\">?"
"\\N{<var class=\"var\">NAME</var>}</code> は <var class=\"var\">NAME</var> と"
"いう名前のUnicode文字を表します。  したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?"
"\\N{LATIN SMALL LETTER A WITH GRAVE}</samp>&rsquo; は <code class=\"code\">?"
"à</code> と等価であり、Unicode文字 U+00E0 を表します。  複数行の文字列の入力"
"を簡略化するため、名前の中のスペースを空文字以外の空白シーケンス（例：改行）"
"に置き換えることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"You can specify characters by their Unicode values.  <code class=\"code\">?"
"\\N{U+<var class=\"var\">X</var>}</code> represents a character with Unicode "
"code point <var class=\"var\">X</var>, where <var class=\"var\">X</var> is a "
"hexadecimal number.  Also, <code class=\"code\">?\\u<var class=\"var\">xxxx</"
"var></code> and <code class=\"code\">?\\U<var class=\"var\">xxxxxxxx</var></"
"code> represent code points <var class=\"var\">xxxx</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">xxxxxxxx</var>, respectively, where each <var class=\"var\">x</"
"var> is a single hexadecimal digit.  For example, <code class=\"code\">?"
"\\N{U+E0}</code>, <code class=\"code\">?\\u00e0</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">?\\U000000E0</code> are all equivalent to <code "
"class=\"code\">?&agrave;</code> and to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?"
"\\N{LATIN SMALL LETTER A WITH GRAVE}</samp>&rsquo;.  The Unicode Standard "
"defines code points only up to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">U+<var "
"class=\"var\">10ffff</var></samp>&rsquo;, so if you specify a code point "
"higher than that, Emacs signals an error."
msgstr ""
"文字はUnicode値で指定できます。<code class=\"code\">?\\N{U+<var "
"class=\"var\">X</var>}</code>はUnicodeコードポイント<var class=\"var\">X</"
"var>の文字を表し、ここで<var class=\"var\">X</var>は16進数です。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">?\\u<var class=\"var\">xxxx</var></code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">?\\U<var class=\"var\">xxxxxxxx</var></code>はそれぞれコードポ"
"イント<var class=\"var\">xxxx</var>と<var class=\"var\">xxxxxxxx</var>を表"
"し、各<var class=\"var\">x</var>は1桁の16進数です。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">?\\N{U+E0}</code>、<code class=\"code\">?\\u00e0</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">?\\U000000E0</code>はいずれも<code class=\"code\">?"
"&agrave;</code>および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\N{LATIN SMALL LETTER A "
"WITH GRAVE}</samp>&rsquo;と同等です。Unicode標準ではコードポイントは&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">U+<var class=\"var\">10ffff</var></samp>&rsquo;までしか"
"定義されていないため、それを超えるコードポイントを指定すると、Emacsはエラーを"
"通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"You can specify characters by their hexadecimal character codes.  A "
"hexadecimal escape sequence consists of a backslash, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo;, and the hexadecimal character code.  Thus, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\x41</samp>&rsquo; is the character <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">A</kbd>, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\x1</samp>&rsquo; is "
"the character <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>, and <code class=\"code\">?\\xe0</"
"code> is the character <kbd class=\"kbd\">&agrave;</kbd> (<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> with grave accent).  You can use one or more hex "
"digits after &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo;, so you can "
"represent any character code in this way."
msgstr ""
"文字は16進数の文字コードで指定できます。16進数エスケープシーケンスは、バック"
"スラッシュ、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo;、および16進数の文字"
"コードで構成されます。したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\x41</"
"samp>&rsquo;は文字<kbd class=\"kbd\">A</kbd>、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?"
"\\x1</samp>&rsquo;は文字<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>、そして<code "
"class=\"code\">?\\xe0</code>は文字<kbd class=\"kbd\">&agrave;</kbd>（グレイヴ"
"アクセント付きの<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd>）となります。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo;の後には1つ以上の16進数桁を使用できるため、この"
"方法で任意の文字コードを表現できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-octal-character-code\"></a> You can "
"specify characters by their character code in octal.  An octal escape "
"sequence consists of a backslash followed by up to three octal digits; thus, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\101</samp>&rsquo; for the character <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">A</kbd>, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\001</samp>&rsquo; for "
"the character <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>, and <code class=\"code\">?\\002</"
"code> for the character <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd>.  Only characters up to "
"octal code 777 can be specified this way."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-octal-character-code\"></a> 文字を 10 "
"進数の文字コードで指定できます。  10 進数のエスケープシーケンスは、バックス"
"ラッシュの後に最大 3 桁の 10 進数が続く形式です。したがって、文字 <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">A</kbd> には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\101</samp>&rsquo;、"
"文字 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\001</"
"samp>&rsquo;、文字 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> には <code class=\"code\">?"
"\\002</code> を指定します。  この方法で指定できるのは、10 進数コード 777 まで"
"の文字のみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/General-Escape-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"These escape sequences may also be used in strings.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Non_002dASCII-in-Strings.html\">Non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> Characters in Strings</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらのエスケープシーケンスは、文字列内でも使用できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Non_002dASCII-in-Strings.html\">文字列内の非<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字</a>を参照してください。"

