"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-generators\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-generators\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">generator</em> is a function that produces a potentially-"
"infinite stream of values.  Each time the function produces a value, it "
"suspends itself and waits for a caller to request the next value."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ジェネレータ</em>とは、潜在的に無限に続く値のストリームを生"
"成する関数のことです。この関数は値を生成するたびに処理を一時停止し、呼び出し"
"元が次の値を要求するのを待ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iter-defun</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args [doc] "
"[declare] [interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-iter_002ddefun\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iter-defun</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name args [doc] "
"[declare] [interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-iter_002ddefun\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">iter-defun</code> defines a generator function.  A "
"generator function has the same signature as a normal function, but works "
"differently.  Instead of executing <var class=\"var\">body</var> when "
"called, a generator function returns an iterator object.  That iterator runs "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> to generate values, emitting a value and "
"pausing where <code class=\"code\">iter-yield</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">iter-yield-from</code> appears.  When <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> returns normally, <code class=\"code\">iter-next</"
"code> signals <code class=\"code\">iter-end-of-sequence</code> with <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>&rsquo;s result as its condition data."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">iter-defun</code> はジェネレータ関数を定義します。ジェネ"
"レータ関数は通常の関数と同じシグネチャを持ちますが、動作が異なります。呼び出"
"された際に <var class=\"var\">body</var> を実行するのではなく、ジェネレータ関"
"数はイテレータオブジェクトを返します。そのイテレータは <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> を実行して値を生成し、値を出力して <code "
"class=\"code\">iter-yield</code> または <code class=\"code\">iter-yield-"
"from</code> が現れる箇所で一時停止します。<var class=\"var\">body</var> が正"
"常に終了すると、<code class=\"code\">iter-next</code> は <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> の結果を条件データとして <code class=\"code\">iter-"
"end-of-sequence</code> に通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"Any kind of Lisp code is valid inside <var class=\"var\">body</var>, but "
"<code class=\"code\">iter-yield</code> and <code class=\"code\">iter-yield-"
"from</code> cannot appear inside <code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> 内ではあらゆる種類の Lisp コードが有効ですが、"
"<code class=\"code\">iter-yield</code> や <code class=\"code\">iter-yield-"
"from</code> は <code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code> フォーム内に記述す"
"ることはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iter-lambda</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">args [doc] "
"[interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"iter_002dlambda\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iter-lambda</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">args [doc] "
"[interactive] body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"iter_002dlambda\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">iter-lambda</code> produces an unnamed generator "
"function that works just like a generator function produced with <code "
"class=\"code\">iter-defun</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">iter-lambda</code> は、<code class=\"code\">iter-defun</"
"code> で生成されるジェネレータ関数と全く同様に動作する、名前のないジェネレー"
"タ関数を生成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iter-yield</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">value</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-iter_002dyield\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iter-yield</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">value</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-iter_002dyield\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generators.html
msgid ""
"When it appears inside a generator function, <code class=\"code\">iter-"
"yield</code> indicates that the current iterator should pause and return "
"<var class=\"var\">value</var> from <code class=\"code\">iter-next</code>.  "
"<code class=\"code\">iter-yield</code> evaluates to the <code "
"class=\"code\">value</code> parameter of next call to <code "
"class=\"code\">iter-next</code>."
msgstr ""
"ジェネレータ関数内で現れる場合、<code class=\"code\">iter-yield</code> は現在"
"のイテレータが一時停止し、<code class=\"code\">iter-next</code> から <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> を返すことを示します。<code class=\"code\">iter-"
"yield</code> は、<code class=\"code\">iter-next</code> への次回の呼び出しにお"
"ける <code class=\"code\">value</code> パラメータとして評価されます。"

