# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generic-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to define a command that serves as a &ldquo;generic "
"dispatcher&rdquo; capable of invoking one of a set of commands according to "
"the user&rsquo;s needs.  For example, imagine that you want to define a "
"command named &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">open</samp>&rsquo; that can "
"&ldquo;open&rdquo; and display several different types of objects.  Or you "
"could have a command named &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mua</samp>&rsquo; "
"(which stands for Mail User Agent) that can read and send email using one of "
"several email backends, such as Rmail, Gnus, or MH-E.  The macro <code "
"class=\"code\">define-alternatives</code> can be used to define such <em "
"class=\"dfn\">generic commands</em>.  A generic command is an interactive "
"function whose implementation can be selected from several alternatives, as "
"a matter of user preference."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーのニーズに応じて一連のコマンドのいずれかを呼び出せる「汎用ディスパッ"
"チャ」として機能するコマンドを定義することが有用な場合があります。例えば、数"
"種類の異なるオブジェクトを「開いて」表示できる「<samp class=\"samp\">open</"
"samp>」という名前のコマンドを定義したい場合を考えてみましょう。あるいは、"
"Rmail、Gnus、MH-Eといった複数のメールバックエンドのいずれかを使用してメールの"
"送受信ができる「<samp class=\"samp\">mua</samp>」（Mail User Agentの略）とい"
"うコマンドを用意することもできます。このような<em class=\"dfn\">汎用コマンド"
"</em>を定義するには、マクロ <code class=\"code\">define-alternatives</code> "
"を使用できます。汎用コマンドとは、ユーザーの好みに応じて複数の選択肢から実装"
"を選択できるインタラクティブ関数のことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Generic-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-alternatives</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;rest customizations</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dalternatives\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
