"<code class=\"code\">(declare <var class=\"var\">declarations</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Generic-Functions.html
