# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Global-Break-Condition.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">global break condition</em> stops execution when a "
"specified condition is satisfied, no matter where that may occur.  Edebug "
"evaluates the global break condition at every stop point; if it evaluates to "
"a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, then execution stops or pauses "
"depending on the execution mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-"
"Execution-Modes.html\">Edebug Execution Modes</a>), as if a breakpoint had "
"been hit.  If evaluating the condition gets an error, execution does not "
"stop."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">グローバルブレーク条件</em>は、どこで発生したかにかかわら"
"ず、指定された条件が満たされたときに実行を停止します。Edebugは各停止点でグ"
"ローバルブレーク条件を評価し、その結果が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の"
"値となった場合、実行モードに応じて（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-"
"Execution-Modes.html\">Edebug 実行モード</a>を参照）、あたかもブレークポイン"
"トに到達したかのように実行が停止または一時停止します。条件の評価でエラーが発"
"生した場合、実行は停止しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Global-Break-Condition.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dset_002dglobal_002dbreak_002dcondition\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dset_002dglobal_002dbreak_002dcondition\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Global-Break-Condition.html
msgid ""
"The condition expression is stored in <code class=\"code\">edebug-global-"
"break-condition</code>.  You can specify a new expression using the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">X</kbd> command from the source code buffer while Edebug is "
"active, or using <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x X X</kbd> from any buffer at any "
"time, as long as Edebug is loaded (<code class=\"code\">edebug-set-global-"
"break-condition</code>)."
msgstr ""
"条件式は <code class=\"code\">edebug-global-break-condition</code> に格納され"
"ます。Edebug が有効な間はソースコードバッファから <kbd class=\"kbd\">X</kbd> "
"コマンドを使用して、Edebug がロードされていれば（<code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"set-global-break-condition</code>）いつでも任意のバッファから <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x X X</kbd> を使用して、新しい式を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Global-Break-Condition.html
msgid ""
"The global break condition is the simplest way to find where in your code "
"some event occurs, but it makes code run much more slowly.  So you should "
"reset the condition to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> when not using it."
msgstr ""
"グローバルブレイク条件は、コードのどこで何らかのイベントが発生したかを特定す"
"る最もシンプルな方法ですが、コードの実行速度が大幅に低下します。そのため、使"
"用しないときは条件を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にリセットしてください。"

