msgstr ""
"<span>42.23.5 グリフレス文字表示<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Glyphless-"
"Character-Display\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-glyphless-characters\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-glyphless-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Glyphless characters</em> are characters which are "
"displayed in a special way, e.g., as a box containing a hexadecimal code, "
"instead of being displayed literally.  These include characters which are "
"explicitly defined to be glyphless, as well as characters for which there is "
"no available font (on a graphical display), and characters which cannot be "
"encoded by the terminal&rsquo;s coding system (on a text terminal)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">グリフレス文字</em>とは、文字通りに表示されるのではなく、例"
"えば16進数コードを含むボックスとして表示されるなど、特殊な形式で表示される文"
"字のことである。これには、明示的にグリフレスとして定義された文字のほか、（グ"
"ラフィカルディスプレイにおいて）利用可能なフォントがない文字や、（テキスト"
"ターミナルにおいて）ターミナルの符号化方式でエンコードできない文字が含まれ"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-glyphless_002ddisplay_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-glyphless_002ddisplay_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">glyphless-display-mode</code> minor mode can be "
"used to toggle displaying glyphless characters in a convenient manner in the "
"current buffer.  If this mode is enabled, all the glyphless characters are "
"displayed as boxes that display acronyms of their character names."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">glyphless-display-mode</code> マイナーモードを使用する"
"と、現在のバッファ内でグリフのない文字の表示を便利に切り替えることができま"
"す。このモードを有効にすると、すべてのグリフのない文字は、その文字名の略称を"
"表示するボックスとして表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyphless-char-display</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-glyphless_002dchar_002ddisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyphless-char-display</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-glyphless_002dchar_002ddisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"For more fine-grained (and global) control, this variable can be used.  The "
"value of this variable is a char-table which defines glyphless characters "
"and how they are displayed.  Each entry must be one of the following display "
"methods:"
msgstr ""
"よりきめ細かな（およびグローバルな）制御を行うには、この変数を使用できます。"
"この変数の値は、グリフレス文字とその表示方法を定義する文字テーブルです。各エ"
"ントリは、以下の表示方法のいずれかである必要があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "Display the character in the usual way."
msgstr "文字を通常通りに表示する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">zero-width</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">zero-width</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "Don&rsquo;t display the character."
msgstr "その文字を表示しないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">thin-space</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">thin-space</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Display a thin space, 1-pixel wide on graphical displays, or 1-character "
"wide on text terminals."
msgstr ""
"グラフィックディスプレイでは幅1ピクセル、テキスト端末では幅1文字の細いスペー"
"スを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">empty-box</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">empty-box</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "Display an empty box."
msgstr "空のボックスを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">hex-code</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">hex-code</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Display a box containing the Unicode codepoint of the character, in "
"hexadecimal notation."
msgstr ""
"文字のUnicodeコードポイントを16進数表記で含むボックスを表示してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "an <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> string"
msgstr "<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字列"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Display a box containing that string.  The string should contain at most 6 "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters.  As an exception, if the "
"string includes just one character, on text-mode terminals that character "
"will be displayed without a box; this enables treating such "
"&ldquo;acronyms&rdquo; as replacement characters for characters that cannot "
"be displayed by the terminal."
msgstr ""
"その文字列を含むボックスを表示します。文字列に含まれる<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字は最大6文字までとします。例外として、文字列"
"が1文字のみの場合、テキストモード端末ではその文字がボックスなしで表示されま"
"す。これにより、こうした「頭字語」を、端末で表示できない文字の置換文字として"
"扱うことが可能になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"a cons cell <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">graphical</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">text</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"consセル <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">graphical</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">text</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Display with <var class=\"var\">graphical</var> on graphical displays, and "
"with <var class=\"var\">text</var> on text terminals.  Both <var "
"class=\"var\">graphical</var> and <var class=\"var\">text</var> must be one "
"of the display methods described above."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは <var class=\"var\">graphical</var> で、テキスト"
"端末では <var class=\"var\">text</var> で表示します。<var "
"class=\"var\">graphical</var> と <var class=\"var\">text</var> はいずれも、上"
"述の表示方法のいずれかである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-glyphless_002dchar-face\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-glyphless_002dchar-face\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">thin-space</code>, <code class=\"code\">empty-box</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">hex-code</code>, and <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> string display methods are drawn with the "
"<code class=\"code\">glyphless-char</code> face.  On text terminals, a box "
"is emulated by square brackets, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[]</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">thin-space</code>、<code class=\"code\">empty-box</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">hex-code</code>、および<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字列の表示方法は、<code "
"class=\"code\">glyphless-char</code>のグリフで描画されます。テキスト端末で"
"は、角括弧 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[]</samp>&rsquo; によってボックスがエ"
"ミュレートされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The char-table has one extra slot, which determines how to display any "
"character that cannot be displayed with any available font, or cannot be "
"encoded by the terminal&rsquo;s coding system.  Its value should be one of "
"the above display methods, except <code class=\"code\">zero-width</code>."
msgstr ""
"char-tableには追加のスロットが1つあり、利用可能なフォントで表示できない文字"
"や、端末の符号化方式でエンコードできない文字をどのように表示するかを決定しま"
"す。その値は、<code class=\"code\">zero-width</code>を除く上記の表示方法のい"
"ずれかである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"If a character has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> entry in an active "
"display table, the display table takes effect; in this case, Emacs does not "
"consult <code class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</code> at all."
msgstr ""
"文字がアクティブなディスプレイテーブルに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"のエントリを持っている場合、そのディスプレイテーブルが適用されます。この場"
"合、Emacs は <code class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</code> を一切参照し"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyphless-char-display-control</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-glyphless_002dchar_002ddisplay_002dcontrol\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">glyphless-char-display-control</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"glyphless_002dchar_002ddisplay_002dcontrol\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"This user option provides a convenient way to set <code "
"class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</code> for groups of similar "
"characters.  Do not set its value directly from Lisp code; the value takes "
"effect only via a custom <code class=\"code\">:set</code> function (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Definitions.html\">Defining Customization "
"Variables</a>), which updates <code class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"このユーザーオプションを使用すると、類似した文字のグループに対して <code "
"class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</code> を便利に設定できます。Lisp コー"
"ドから直接値を設定しないでください。この値は、<code class=\"code\">glyphless-"
"char-display</code> を更新するカスタム <code class=\"code\">:set</code> 関数"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Definitions.html\">カスタマイズ変数の定"
"義</a> を参照）を介してのみ有効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Its value should be an alist of elements <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">group</var> . <var class=\"var\">method</var>)</code>, where "
"<var class=\"var\">group</var> is a symbol specifying a group of characters, "
"and <var class=\"var\">method</var> is a symbol specifying how to display "
"them."
msgstr ""
"その値は、要素 <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">group</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">method</var>)</code> のアリストであるべきであり、ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">group</var> は文字のグループを指定するシンボル、<var "
"class=\"var\">method</var> はそれらの表示方法を指定するシンボルである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">group</var> should be one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">group</var> は、以下のいずれかである必要があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">c0-control</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">c0-control</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphless-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> control characters <code "
"class=\"code\">U+0000</code> to <code class=\"code\">U+001F</code>, "
"excluding the newline and tab characters (normally displayed as escape "
"sequences like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^A</samp>&rsquo;; see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Text-Display.html#Text-Display\">How Text Is Displayed</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>制御文字 <code class=\"code\">U+0000</"
"code> から <code class=\"code\">U+001F</code> まで（改行文字とタブ文字を除"
"く。通常は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^A</samp>&rsquo; のようなエスケープ"
"シーケンスとして表示される。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> "
"の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Text-Display.html#Text-Display\">How Text Is Displayed</a> を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
