# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">glyph</em> is a graphical symbol which occupies a single "
"character position on the screen.  Each glyph is represented in Lisp as a "
"<em class=\"dfn\">glyph code</em>, which specifies a character and "
"optionally a face to display it in (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Faces.html\">Faces</a>).  The main use of glyph codes is as the "
"entries of display tables (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Display-"
"Tables.html\">Display Tables</a>).  The following functions are used to "
"manipulate glyph codes:"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">グリフ</em>とは、画面上の単一の文字位置を占める図形記号のこ"
"とです。各グリフはLispでは<em class=\"dfn\">グリフコード</em>として表現され、"
"これにより文字と、必要に応じてそれを表示するためのフェイスが指定されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">フェイス</a>を参照）。グリフコードの主な"
"用途は、ディスプレイテーブルのエントリとして利用することです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Display-Tables.html\">ディスプレイテーブル</a>を参"
"照）。グリフコードを操作するには、以下の関数を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-glyph-code</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char "
"&amp;optional face</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dglyph_002dcode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-glyph-code</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char "
"&amp;optional face</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dglyph_002dcode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a glyph code representing char <var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> with face <var class=\"var\">face</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"glyph uses the default face; in that case, the glyph code is an integer.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">face</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"glyph code is not necessarily an integer object."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、フェイス <var class=\"var\">face</var> で文字 <var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> を表すグリフコードを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> が省略されているか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定されている場合、グリフにはデフォルトのフェイ"
"スが使用され、その場合のグリフコードは整数となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、グリ"
"フコードは必ずしも整数オブジェクトになるとは限りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyph-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">glyph</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-glyph_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyph-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">glyph</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-glyph_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the character of glyph code <var class=\"var\">glyph</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、グリフコード <var class=\"var\">glyph</var> の文字を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyph-face</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">glyph</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-glyph_002dface\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyph-face</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">glyph</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-glyph_002dface\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"This function returns face of glyph code <var class=\"var\">glyph</var>, or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">glyph</var> uses the "
"default face."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、グリフコード <var class=\"var\">glyph</var> のフェイスを返しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">glyph</var> がデフォルトのフェイスを使用する場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"You can set up a <em class=\"dfn\">glyph table</em> to change how glyph "
"codes are actually displayed on text terminals.  This feature is semi-"
"obsolete; use <code class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</code> instead "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Glyphless-Chars.html\">Glyphless Character "
"Display</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">グリフテーブル</em>を設定して、テキスト端末上でのグリフコー"
"ドの実際の表示方法を変更できます。この機能は半ば廃れており、代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">glyphless-char-display</code> を使用してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Glyphless-Chars.html\">グリフレス文字表示</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyph-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"glyph_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">glyph-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"glyph_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Glyphs.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, is the "
"current glyph table.  It takes effect only on character terminals; on "
"graphical displays, all glyphs are displayed literally.  The glyph table "
"should be a vector whose <var class=\"var\">g</var>th element specifies how "
"to display glyph code <var class=\"var\">g</var>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">g</var> is the glyph code for a glyph whose face is "
"unspecified.  Each element should be one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、現在のグリフテー"
"ブルとなります。これは文字端末においてのみ有効であり、グラフィカルディスプレ"
"イでは、すべてのグリフがそのまま表示されます。グリフテーブルはベクトルである"
"必要があり、その <var class=\"var\">g</var> 番目の要素でグリフコード <var "
"class=\"var\">g</var> の表示方法を指定します。ここで <var class=\"var\">g</"
"var> は、フェイスが未指定のグリフのグリフコードです。各要素は、以下のいずれか"
"である必要があります："

