# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid "This function returns the alist of the GnuTLS digest algorithms."
msgstr "この関数は、GnuTLSダイジェストアルゴリズムのalistを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Each entry has a key which represents the algorithm, followed by a plist "
"with internal details about the algorithm.  The plist will have <code "
"class=\"code\">:type gnutls-digest-algorithm</code> and also will have the "
"key <code class=\"code\">:digest-algorithm-length 64</code> to indicate the "
"size, in bytes, of the resulting digest."
msgstr ""
"各エントリには、アルゴリズムを表すキーがあり、それに続いてアルゴリズムの内部"
"詳細を記述したplistが配置されています。このplistには<code "
"class=\"code\">:type gnutls-digest-algorithm</code>が含まれるほか、生成される"
"ダイジェストのサイズ（バイト単位）を示すキー<code class=\"code\">:digest-"
"algorithm-length 64</code>も含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"There is a name parallel between GnuTLS MAC and digest algorithms but they "
"are separate things internally and should not be mixed."
msgstr ""
"GnuTLSのMACアルゴリズムとダイジェストアルゴリズムには名称上の類似点があります"
"が、内部的には別物であり、混同すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
