"name\">gnutls-hash-digest</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">digest-"
"method input</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gnutls_002dhash_002ddigest\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">digest-method</var> can be the whole plist from <code "
"class=\"code\">gnutls-digests</code>, or just the symbol key, or a string "
"with the name of that symbol."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">digest-method</var> には、<code class=\"code\">gnutls-"
"digests</code> の plist 全体、あるいはシンボルキー単体、またはそのシンボル名"
"を含む文字列を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">input</var> can be specified as a buffer or string or "
"in other ways (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-"
"Inputs.html\">Format of GnuTLS Cryptography Inputs</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">input</var> は、バッファや文字列、あるいはその他の形式で指"
"定できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-"
"Inputs.html\">GnuTLS 暗号入力の形式</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> on error, and signals "
"a Lisp error if the <var class=\"var\">digest-method</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">input</var> are invalid.  On success, it returns a list of a "
"binary string (the output) and the IV used."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、エラー時には <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返し、<var "
"class=\"var\">digest-method</var> または <var class=\"var\">input</var> が無"
"効な場合は Lisp エラーを発生させます。成功した場合は、バイナリ文字列（出力）"
"と使用された IV のリストを返します。"

