# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid "This function returns the alist of the GnuTLS ciphers."
msgstr "この関数は、GnuTLS暗号のalistを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Each entry has a key which represents the cipher, followed by a plist with "
"internal details about the algorithm.  The plist will have <code "
"class=\"code\">:type gnutls-symmetric-cipher</code> and also will have the "
"keys <code class=\"code\">:cipher-aead-capable</code> set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or <code class=\"code\">t</code> to indicate AEAD "
"capability; and <code class=\"code\">:cipher-tagsize</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">:cipher-blocksize</code> <code class=\"code\">:cipher-"
"keysize</code> <code class=\"code\">:cipher-ivsize</code> to indicate the "
"size, in bytes, of the tag, block size of the resulting data, the key, and "
"the IV respectively."
msgstr ""
"各エントリには、暗号方式を表すキーがあり、それに続いてアルゴリズムの内部詳細"
"を記したplistが配置されています。このplistには<code class=\"code\">:type "
"gnutls-symmetric-cipher</code>が含まれるほか、AEAD機能を示すために<code "
"class=\"code\">:cipher-aead-capable</code>に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>ま"
"たは<code class=\"code\">t</code>が設定され、さらにタグのサイズ（バイト単"
"位）、生成データのブロックサイズ、キー、およびIVをそれぞれ示す<code "
"class=\"code\">:cipher-tagsize</code>、<code class=\"code\">:cipher-"
"blocksize</code>、<code class=\"code\">:cipher-keysize</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">:cipher-ivsize</code>が含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
