"class=\"code\">gnutls-ciphers</code>, or just the symbol key, or a string "
"with the name of that symbol."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">cipher</var> には、<code class=\"code\">gnutls-ciphers</"
"code> の plist 全体、あるいはシンボルキー単体、またはそのシンボル名を含む文字"
"列を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">iv</var> and <var class=\"var\">input</var> and the "
"optional <var class=\"var\">aead_auth</var> can be specified as a buffer or "
"string or in other ways (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Format-of-GnuTLS-"
"Cryptography-Inputs.html\">Format of GnuTLS Cryptography Inputs</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">iv</var>、<var class=\"var\">input</var>、および省略可能な"
"<var class=\"var\">aead_auth</var>は、バッファや文字列、あるいはその他の形式"
"で指定できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Format-of-GnuTLS-Cryptography-"
"Inputs.html\">GnuTLS暗号入力の形式</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/GnuTLS-Cryptographic-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">aead_auth</var> is only checked with AEAD ciphers, that "
"is, ciphers whose plist has <code class=\"code\">:cipher-aead-capable t</"
"code>.  Otherwise it&rsquo;s ignored."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">aead_auth</var> は AEAD 暗号（つまり、plist に <code "
"class=\"code\">:cipher-aead-capable t</code> が含まれる暗号）でのみチェックさ"
"れます。それ以外の場合は無視されます。"

