# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value in the field number <var class=\"var\">pos</"
"var> of the error descriptor <var class=\"var\">error</var>.  The fields are "
"numbered starting with 1.  E.g., for an error of type <code "
"class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code>, <code class=\"code\">(error-slot-"
"value <var class=\"var\">error</var> 2)</code> returns the object that "
"failed the type test, and <code class=\"code\">(error-slot-value <var "
