# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> to "
"handle the error that results from dividing by zero.  The handler displays "
"the error message (but without a beep), then returns a very large number."
msgstr ""
"以下に、ゼロ除算で発生するエラーを処理するために <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code> を使用する例を示します。ハンドラはエラー"
"メッセージを表示し（ただしビープ音は鳴らしません）、その後、非常に大きな数値"
"を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun safe-divide (dividend divisor)\n"
"  (condition-case err\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">Protected form.</span>\n"
"      (/ dividend divisor)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">The handler.</span>\n"
"    (arith-error                        ; <span class=\"r\">Condition.</span>\n"
"     ;; <span class=\"r\">Display the usual message for this error.</span>\n"
"     (message &quot;%s&quot; (error-message-string err))\n"
"     1000000)))\n"
"&rArr; safe-divide\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(safe-divide 5 0)\n"
"     &#8867; Arithmetic error: (arith-error)\n"
"&rArr; 1000000\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
msgid ""
"The handler specifies condition name <code class=\"code\">arith-error</code> "
"so that it will handle only division-by-zero errors.  Other kinds of errors "
"will not be handled (by this <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code>).  "
"Thus:"
msgstr ""
"ハンドラは、ゼロ除算エラーのみを処理するように条件名 <code "
"class=\"code\">arith-error</code> を指定しています。その他の種類のエラーは"
"（この <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> では）処理されません。した"
"がって："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(safe-divide nil 3)\n"
"     error&rarr; Wrong type argument: number-or-marker-p, nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
msgid ""
"Here is a <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> that catches all kinds "
"of errors, including those from <code class=\"code\">error</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">error</code> によるものも含め、あらゆる種類のエラーを捕"
"捉する <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> がこちらです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq baz 34)\n"
"     &rArr; 34\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(condition-case err\n"
"    (if (eq baz 35)\n"
"        t\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">This is a call to the function <code class=\"code\">error</code>.</span>\n"
"      (error &quot;Rats!  The variable %s was %s, not 35&quot; 'baz baz))\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">This is the handler; it is not a form.</span>\n"
"  (error (princ (format &quot;The error was: %s&quot; err))\n"
"         2))\n"
"&#8867; The error was: (error &quot;Rats!  The variable baz was 34, not 35&quot;)\n"
"&rArr; 2\n"
msgstr ""

