# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Handling-Errors.html
msgid ""
"This construct executes <var class=\"var\">body</var>, ignoring any errors "
"that occur during its execution.  If the execution is without error, <code "
"class=\"code\">ignore-errors</code> returns the value of the last form in "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>; otherwise, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
