# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hash-Access.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the functions for accessing and storing associations "
"in a hash table.  In general, any Lisp object can be used as a hash key, "
"unless the comparison method imposes limits.  Any Lisp object can also be "
"used as the value."
msgstr ""
"本節では、ハッシュテーブルにおける関連へのアクセスおよび格納を行う関数につい"
"て説明します。一般に、比較方法によって制限が設けられていない限り、任意のLisp"
"オブジェクトをハッシュキーとして使用できます。また、任意のLispオブジェクトを"
"値として使用することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Hash-Access.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gethash</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">key table "
"&amp;optional default</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gethash\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">gethash</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">key table "
"&amp;optional default</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"gethash\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hash-Access.html
msgid ""
"This function looks up <var class=\"var\">key</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var>, and returns its associated <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>&mdash;or <var class=\"var\">default</var>, if <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> has no association in <var class=\"var\">table</var>."
msgstr ""
