# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span>25.6 Help Functions<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Help-"
"Functions-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>25.6 ヘルプ関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Help-Functions-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-help-functions\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-help-functions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Emacs provides a variety of built-in help functions, all accessible to the "
"user as subcommands of the prefix <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>.  For more "
"information about them, see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Help.html#Help\">Help</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  Here we describe some "
"program-level interfaces to the same information."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには多彩な組み込みヘルプ機能が用意されており、いずれもプレフィックス "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> のサブコマンドとしてユーザーが利用できます。これ"
"らの詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Help.html#Help\">Help</a> を参照してください。ここでは、同じ"
"情報にアクセスするためのプログラムレベルのインターフェースをいくつか説明しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">apropos</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pattern "
"&amp;optional do-all</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"apropos\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">apropos</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pattern "
"&amp;optional do-all</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"apropos\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function finds all meaningful symbols whose names contain a match for "
"the apropos pattern <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>.  An apropos pattern is "
"either a word to match, a space-separated list of words of which at least "
"two must match, or a regular expression (if any special regular expression "
"characters occur).  A symbol is meaningful if it has a definition as a "
"function, variable, or face, or has properties."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、名称に apropos パターン <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> に一致す"
"る文字列を含む、すべての意味のあるシンボルを検索します。apropos パターンと"
"は、照合対象の単語、少なくとも2つが一致する必要があるスペース区切りの単語リス"
"ト、または正規表現（特殊な正規表現文字が含まれる場合）のいずれかです。シンボ"
"ルは、関数、変数、または face としての定義を持つか、あるいはプロパティを持つ"
"場合に「意味がある」とみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid "The function returns a list of elements that look like this:"
msgstr "この関数は、次のような要素のリストを返します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> <var class=\"var\">score</var> <var class=\"var\">function-doc</var> <var class=\"var\">variable-doc</var>\n"
" <var class=\"var\">plist-doc</var> <var class=\"var\">widget-doc</var> <var class=\"var\">face-doc</var> <var class=\"var\">group-doc</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Here, <var class=\"var\">score</var> is an integer measure of how important "
"the symbol seems to be as a match.  Each of the remaining elements is a "
"documentation string, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, for <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> as a function, variable, etc."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">score</var> は、その記号がマッチとしてどの程度重要"
"であるかを示す整数値です。残りの各要素は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が"
"関数や変数などである場合のドキュメント文字列、すなわち <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"It also displays the symbols in a buffer named <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Apropos*</samp>, each with a one-line description taken from "
"the beginning of its documentation string."
msgstr ""
"また、<samp class=\"file\">*Apropos*</samp> という名前のバッファにシンボルを"
"表示し、それぞれにそのドキュメント文字列の冒頭から引用した1行の説明を添えま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">do-all</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"or if the user option <code class=\"code\">apropos-do-all</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then <code class=\"code\">apropos</code> "
"also shows key bindings for the functions that are found; it also shows <em "
"class=\"emph\">all</em> interned symbols, not just meaningful ones (and it "
"lists them in the return value as well)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">do-all</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である"
"か、あるいはユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">apropos-do-all</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">apropos</code> は見つかった関数のキーバインドも表示します。ま"
"た、意味のあるシンボルだけでなく、<em class=\"emph\">すべて</em>のインターニ"
"ング済みシンボルも表示します（そして、それらを戻り値にも列挙します）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">help-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"help_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">help-map</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"help_002dmap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a local keymap for characters following the "
"Help key, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、ヘルプキー <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> に続く文字用のローカ"
"ルキーマップです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Prefix Command: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">help-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-help_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">接頭辞コマンド: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">help-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-help_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This symbol is not a function; its function definition cell holds the keymap "
"known as <code class=\"code\">help-map</code>.  It is defined in <samp "
"class=\"file\">help.el</samp> as follows:"
msgstr ""
"このシンボルは関数ではなく、その関数定義セルには <code class=\"code\">help-"
"map</code> というキーマップが格納されています。  <samp "
"class=\"file\">help.el</samp> では次のように定義されています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-set global-map (key-description (string help-char)) 'help-command)\n"
"(fset 'help-command help-map)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">help-char</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"help_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">help-char</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-help_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the help character&mdash;the character that "
"Emacs recognizes as meaning Help.  By default, its value is 8, which stands "
"for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>.  When Emacs reads this character, if <code "
"class=\"code\">help-form</code> is a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"Lisp expression, it evaluates that expression, and displays the result in a "
"window if it is a string."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値はヘルプ文字&mdash;Emacsがヘルプを意味するものとして認識する文字"
"です。デフォルトでは値は8であり、これは<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>を表しま"
"す。Emacsがこの文字を読み込む際、<code class=\"code\">help-form</code>が"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外のLisp式であれば、その式を評価し、結果が文"
"字列である場合はウィンドウに表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Usually the value of <code class=\"code\">help-form</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Then the help character has no special meaning "
"at the level of command input, and it becomes part of a key sequence in the "
"normal way.  The standard key binding of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> is a "
"prefix key for several general-purpose help features."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">help-form</code> の値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となります。この場合、ヘルプ文字はコマンド入力レベルでは特別な意味を持"
"たず、通常通りキーシーケンスの一部となります。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> の"
"標準的なキーバインドは、いくつかの汎用的なヘルプ機能のプレフィックスキーと"
"なっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The help character is special after prefix keys, too.  If it has no binding "
"as a subcommand of the prefix key, it runs <code class=\"code\">describe-"
"prefix-bindings</code>, which displays a list of all the subcommands of the "
"prefix key."
msgstr ""
"ヘルプ文字は、プレフィックスキーの後でも特別な扱いとなります。プレフィックス"
"キーのサブコマンドとして割り当てられていない場合は、プレフィックスキーのすべ"
"てのサブコマンド一覧を表示する <code class=\"code\">describe-prefix-"
"bindings</code> が実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">help-event-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"help_002devent_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">help-event-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-help_002devent_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of event types that serve as "
"alternative help characters.  These events are handled just like the event "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">help-char</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、代替ヘルプ文字として機能するイベントタイプのリストです。これ"
"らのイベントは、<code class=\"code\">help-char</code> で指定されたイベントと"
"同様に処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">help-form</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"help_002dform\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">help-form</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"help_002dform\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, its value is a form "
"to evaluate whenever the character <code class=\"code\">help-char</code> is "
"read.  If evaluating the form produces a string, that string is displayed."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その値は文字 <code "
"class=\"code\">help-char</code> が読み込まれた際に評価されるフォームとなりま"
"す。そのフォームを評価して文字列が生成された場合、その文字列が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"A command that calls <code class=\"code\">read-event</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">read-char-choice</code>, <code class=\"code\">read-char</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">read-char-from-minibuffer</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> probably should bind <code "
"class=\"code\">help-form</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"expression while it does input.  (The time when you should not do this is "
"when <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> has some other meaning.)  Evaluating this "
"expression should result in a string that explains what the input is for and "
"how to enter it properly."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-event</code>、<code class=\"code\">read-char-"
"choice</code>、<code class=\"code\">read-char</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-char-from-minibuffer</code>、または<code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code>を呼び出すコマンドは、入力処理を行う間、<code "
"class=\"code\">help-form</code>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の式にバ"
"インドすべきでしょう。（これを避けるべきなのは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>"
"が別の意味を持つ場合です。）この式を評価すると、入力内容とその正しい入力方法"
"を説明する文字列が生成されるはずです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Entry to the minibuffer binds this variable to the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-help-form</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-Misc.html#Definition-of-"
"minibuffer_002dhelp_002dform\">Definition of minibuffer-help-form</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファへの入力により、この変数は <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-help-"
"form</code> の値にバインドされます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"Misc.html#Definition-of-minibuffer_002dhelp_002dform\">minibuffer-help-form "
"の定義</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prefix-help-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"prefix_002dhelp_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prefix-help-command</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"prefix_002dhelp_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a function to print help for a prefix key.  The function "
"is called when the user types a prefix key followed by the help character, "
"and the help character has no binding after that prefix.  The "
"variable&rsquo;s default value is <code class=\"code\">describe-prefix-"
"bindings</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、プレフィックスキーのヘルプを表示する関数が格納されています。"
"ユーザーがプレフィックスキーに続いてヘルプ文字を入力し、かつそのヘルプ文字が"
"そのプレフィックスに対してバインドされていない場合に、この関数が呼び出されま"
"す。この変数のデフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">describe-prefix-bindings</"
"code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">describe-prefix-bindings</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-describe_002dprefix_002dbindings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">describe-prefix-bindings</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-describe_002dprefix_002dbindings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function calls <code class=\"code\">describe-bindings</code> to display "
"a list of all the subcommands of the prefix key of the most recent key "
"sequence.  The prefix described consists of all but the last event of that "
"key sequence.  (The last event is, presumably, the help character.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">describe-bindings</code> を呼び出して、直近の"
"キーシーケンスのプレフィックスキーに属するすべてのサブコマンドの一覧を表示し"
"ます。ここでのプレフィックスとは、そのキーシーケンスの最後のイベントを除くす"
"べてのイベントで構成されます。（最後のイベントは、おそらくヘルプ文字です。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The following two functions are meant for modes that want to provide help "
"without relinquishing control, such as the electric modes.  Their names "
"begin with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Helper</samp>&rsquo; to distinguish "
"them from the ordinary help functions."
msgstr ""
"以下の2つの関数は、電気モードのように、制御権を手放すことなくヘルプを提供した"
"いモード向けに用意されています。通常のヘルプ関数と区別するため、名称は "
