#: build/html/elisp/Help-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This macro evaluates <var class=\"var\">body</var> like <code "
"class=\"code\">with-output-to-temp-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Temporary-Displays.html\">Temporary Displays</a>), inserting any "
