# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span>21.6.4 High-Level Completion Functions<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#High_002dLevel-Completion-Functions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>21.6.4 高レベル完了関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#High_002dLevel-Completion-Functions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the higher-level convenience functions for reading "
"certain sorts of names with completion."
msgstr ""
"本節では、補完機能を用いて特定の種類の名称を読み取るための、より高レベルな便"
"利関数について解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"In most cases, you should not call these functions in the middle of a Lisp "
"function.  When possible, do all minibuffer input as part of reading the "
"arguments for a command, in the <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> "
"specification.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-"
"Commands.html\">Defining Commands</a>."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの場合、Lisp関数の途中でこれらの関数を呼び出すべきではありません。可"
"能な限り、<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> 仕様において、コマンドの引"
"数を読み取る処理の一環として、すべてのミニバッファ入力を行ってください。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Commands.html\">コマンドの定義</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional default require-match predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-read_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional default require-match predicate</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-read_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function reads the name of a buffer and returns it as a string.  It "
"prompts with <var class=\"var\">prompt</var>.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">default</var> is the default name to use, the value to return "
"if the user exits with an empty minibuffer.  If non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should be a string, a list of strings, or a "
"buffer.  If it is a list, the default value is the first element of this "
"list.  It is mentioned in the prompt, but is not inserted in the minibuffer "
"as initial input."
msgstr ""
"この関数はバッファ名を読み込み、文字列として返します。プロンプトには <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> が表示されます。引数 <var class=\"var\">default</"
"var> は使用するデフォルト名であり、ユーザーが空のミニバッファで終了した場合に"
"返される値です。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、文字列、文字列"
"のリスト、またはバッファである必要があります。リストの場合、デフォルト値はそ"
"のリストの最初の要素となります。これはプロンプトに記載されますが、初期入力と"
"してミニバッファに挿入されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> should be a string ending with "
"a colon and a space.  If <var class=\"var\">default</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function inserts it in <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> before the colon to follow the convention for "
"reading from the minibuffer with a default value (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Programming-Tips.html\">Emacs Programming Tips</a>)."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> は、コロンとスペースで終わる文字列である"
"必要があります。<var class=\"var\">default</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、関数はデフォルト値を用いてミニバッファ"
"から読み取るという慣習に従い、コロンの前の <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> に"
"それを挿入します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Programming-Tips.html\">Emacs "
"Programming Tips</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
#: build/html/elisp/Reading-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">require-match</var> has the same "
"meaning as in <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Completion.html\">Completion and the "
"Minibuffer</a>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">require-match</var> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> と同様の意味を持ちます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Completion.html\">補完とミニバッファ</a>を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">predicate</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies a function to filter the buffers that "
"should be considered: the function will be called with every potential "
"candidate as its argument, and should return <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"to reject the candidate, non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> to accept it."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、考慮すべきバッファをフィルタリングする"
"関数を指定します。この関数は、候補となる各バッファを引数として呼び出され、候"
"補を拒否する場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、受け入れる場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, the user enters &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">minibuffer.t</samp>&rsquo;, and then types <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">require-match</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, and the only buffer name starting "
"with the given input is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">minibuffer.texi</"
"samp>&rsquo;, so that name is the value."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、ユーザーが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">minibuffer.t</"
"samp>&rsquo; と入力し、次に <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力します。引数 "
"<var class=\"var\">require-match</var> は <code class=\"code\">t</code> であ"
"り、指定された入力で始まる唯一のバッファ名は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">minibuffer.texi</samp>&rsquo; であるため、その名前が値となりま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(read-buffer &quot;Buffer name: &quot; &quot;foo&quot; t)\n"
msgstr ""

