"class=\"def-name\">read-buffer-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-read_002dbuffer_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies a function "
"for reading buffer names.  <code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code> calls "
"this function instead of doing its usual work, with the same arguments "
"passed to <code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、バッファ名を読み取るた"
"めの関数を指定します。<code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code> は通常の処理を"
"行う代わりにこの関数を呼び出し、<code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code> と同"
"じ引数を渡します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-buffer-completion-ignore-case</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-read_002dbuffer_002dcompletion_002dignore_002dcase\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">read-buffer-completion-ignore-case</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dbuffer_002dcompletion_002dignore_002dcase\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">read-buffer</code> ignores case when performing completion "
"while reading the buffer name."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-buffer</code> はバッファ名を読み込む際の補完処理において"
"大文字小文字を区別しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional default</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional default</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function reads the name of a command and returns it as a Lisp symbol.  "
"The argument <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> is used as in <code "
"class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code>.  Recall that a command is "
"anything for which <code class=\"code\">commandp</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, and a command name is a symbol for which <code "
"class=\"code\">commandp</code> returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数はコマンド名を読み込み、それをLispシンボルとして返します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> は <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</"
"code> と同様に使用されます。コマンドとは <code class=\"code\">commandp</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返すあらゆるものを指し、コマンド名と"
"は <code class=\"code\">commandp</code> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返"
"すシンボルであることを思い出してください。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">インタラクティブ呼び出し</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">default</var> specifies what to return if "
"the user enters null input.  It can be a symbol, a string or a list of "
"strings.  If it is a string, <code class=\"code\">read-command</code> "
"interns it before returning it.  If it is a list, <code class=\"code\">read-"
"command</code> interns the first element of this list.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">default</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means "
"no default has been specified; then if the user enters null input, the "
"return value is <code class=\"code\">(intern &quot;&quot;)</code>, that is, "
"a symbol whose name is an empty string, and whose printed representation is "
"<code class=\"code\">##</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-"
"Type.html\">Symbol Type</a>)."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">default</var> は、ユーザーが null 入力を入力した場合"
"に何を返すかを指定します。これはシンボル、文字列、または文字列のリストのいず"
"れかになります。文字列の場合、<code class=\"code\">read-command</code> は返す"
"前にそれをインターニングします。リストの場合、<code class=\"code\">read-"
"command</code> はこのリストの最初の要素をインターニングします。<var "
"class=\"var\">default</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、"
"デフォルトが指定されていないことを意味します。このとき、ユーザーが null 入力"
"を入力した場合の戻り値は <code class=\"code\">(intern &quot;&quot;)</code> と"
"なります。つまり、名前が空文字列であり、表示形式が <code class=\"code\">##</"
"code> であるシンボルです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Type.html\">シンボ"
"ル型</a> を参照）。"

