# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If the user types <kbd class=\"kbd\">forward-c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>, then this function returns <code class=\"code\">forward-char</code>."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーが <kbd class=\"kbd\">forward-c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と"
"入力すると、この関数は <code class=\"code\">forward-char</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">read-command</code> function is a simplified "
"interface to <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>.  It uses the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">obarray</code> so as to complete in the set of "
"extant Lisp symbols, and it uses the <code class=\"code\">commandp</code> "
"predicate so as to accept only command names:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-command</code> 関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> の簡略化されたインターフェースです。現"
"存する Lisp シンボルの集合内で完結するように変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">obarray</code> を使用し、コマンド名のみを受け付けるように "
"<code class=\"code\">commandp</code> 述語を使用しています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-commandp-example\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-commandp-example\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(read-command <var class=\"var\">prompt</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(intern (completing-read <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> obarray\n"
"                         'commandp t nil))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
