"read_002dvariable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-read_002dvariable\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-read_002dvariable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function reads the name of a customizable variable and returns it as a "
"symbol.  Its arguments have the same form as those of <code "
"class=\"code\">read-command</code>.  It behaves just like <code "
"class=\"code\">read-command</code>, except that it uses the predicate <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-variable-p</code> instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">commandp</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、カスタマイズ可能な変数の名前を読み込み、それをシンボルとして返し"
"ます。引数の形式は <code class=\"code\">read-command</code> と同じです。"
"<code class=\"code\">commandp</code> の代わりに述語 <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-variable-p</code> を使用する点を除けば、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-command</code> と同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-color</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"prompt convert allow-empty display foreground face</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-read_002dcolor\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-color</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"prompt convert allow-empty display foreground face</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-read_002dcolor\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a string that is a color specification, either the "
"color&rsquo;s name or an RGB hex value such as <code "
"class=\"code\">#RRRGGGBBB</code>.  It prompts with <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> (default: <code class=\"code\">&quot;Color (name "
"or #RGB triplet):&quot;</code>)  and provides completion for color names, "
"but not for hex RGB values.  In addition to names of standard colors, "
"completion candidates include the foreground and background colors at point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、色名または <code class=\"code\">#RRRGGGBBB</code> のようなRGB16進"
"数表記のいずれかである色指定文字列を読み込みます。<var class=\"var\">prompt</"
"var>（デフォルト：<code class=\"code\">&quot;Color (name or #RGB "
"triplet):&quot;</code>）でプロンプトを表示し、色名の補完を行いますが、RGB16進"
"数表記の補完は行いません。標準色の名称に加え、補完候補にはポイントにおける前"
"景色と背景色も含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"Valid RGB values are described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Color-"
"Names.html\">Color Names</a>."
msgstr ""
"有効なRGB値については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Color-Names.html\">色名</a>に"
"記載されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The function&rsquo;s return value is the string typed by the user in the "
"minibuffer.  However, when called interactively or if the optional argument "
"<var class=\"var\">convert</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"converts any input color name into the corresponding RGB value string and "
"instead returns that.  This function requires a valid color specification to "
"be input.  Empty color names are allowed when <var class=\"var\">allow-"
"empty</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and the user enters null "
"input."
msgstr ""
"この関数の戻り値は、ユーザーがミニバッファに入力した文字列です。ただし、対話"
"的に呼び出された場合や、オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">convert</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合は、入力された色名を対応するRGB"
"値の文字列に変換し、代わりにそれを返します。この関数の入力には、有効な色指定"
"が必要です。<var class=\"var\">allow-empty</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外で、ユーザーが空の入力を行った場合は、空の色名"
"も許容されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"Interactively, or when <var class=\"var\">display</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the return value is also displayed in the echo "
"area."
msgstr ""
"対話的に、あるいは <var class=\"var\">display</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、戻り値はエコー領域にも表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The optional arguments <var class=\"var\">foreground</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> control the appearance of the completion candidates "
"in the <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffer.  The candidates are "
"displayed in the specified <var class=\"var\">face</var> but with different "
"colors: if <var class=\"var\">foreground</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the foreground color is changed to be the color "
"of the candidate, otherwise the background is changed to the "
"candidate&rsquo;s color."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">foreground</var> および <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> は、<samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> バッ"
"ファにおける補完候補の表示を制御します。候補は指定された <var "
"class=\"var\">face</var> に表示されますが、色はそれぞれ異なります。<var "
"class=\"var\">foreground</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、前景色が候補の色に変更され、それ以外の場合は背景色が候補の色に変更されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/High_002dLevel-Completion.html
msgid ""
"See also the functions <code class=\"code\">read-coding-system</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">read-non-nil-coding-system</code>, in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"User_002dChosen-Coding-Systems.html\">User-Chosen Coding Systems</a>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">read-input-method-name</code>, in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input Methods</a>."
msgstr ""
"また、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"User_002dChosen-Coding-Systems.html\">ユーザー"
"選択のコーディング体系</a>の関数 <code class=\"code\">read-coding-system</"
"code> および <code class=\"code\">read-non-nil-coding-system</code>、ならび"
"に <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">入力メソッド</a> の関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">read-input-method-name</code> も参照してください。"

