# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"You can ask for code to be executed each time Emacs loads a library, by "
"using the variable <code class=\"code\">after-load-functions</code>:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">after-load-functions</code> を使用することで、"
"Emacs がライブラリを読み込むたびに実行されるコードを指定できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">after-load-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"after_002dload_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">after-load-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"after_002dload_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"This abnormal hook is run after loading a file.  Each function in the hook "
"is called with a single argument, the absolute filename of the file that was "
"just loaded."
msgstr ""
"この異常なフックは、ファイルの読み込み後に実行されます。フック内の各関数は、"
"直前に読み込まれたファイルの絶対ファイル名という単一の引数で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"If you want code to be executed when a <em class=\"emph\">particular</em> "
"library is loaded, use the macro <code class=\"code\">with-eval-after-load</"
"code>:"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"emph\">特定の</em>ライブラリが読み込まれた際にコードを実行したい"
"場合は、マクロ <code class=\"code\">with-eval-after-load</code> を使用してく"
"ださい："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-eval-after-load</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">library body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002deval_002dafter_002dload\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-eval-after-load</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">library body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002deval_002dafter_002dload\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"This macro arranges to evaluate <var class=\"var\">body</var> at the end of "
"loading the file <var class=\"var\">library</var>, each time <var "
"class=\"var\">library</var> is loaded.  If <var class=\"var\">library</var> "
"is already loaded, it evaluates <var class=\"var\">body</var> right away."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">library</var>が読み込まれるたびに、ファイル"
"<var class=\"var\">library</var>の読み込み終了時に<var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>を評価するように構成されています。<var class=\"var\">library</var>が既に"
"読み込まれている場合は、直ちに<var class=\"var\">body</var>を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"Usually <var class=\"var\">library</var> is a feature (i.e., a symbol), in "
"which case <var class=\"var\">body</var> is evaluated at the end of any file "
"where <code class=\"code\">(provide <var class=\"var\">library</var>)</code> "
"is called."
msgstr ""
"通常、<var class=\"var\">library</var>はフィーチャー（すなわちシンボル）であ"
"り、その場合、<var class=\"var\">body</var>は<code class=\"code\">(provide "
"<var class=\"var\">library</var>)</code>が呼び出されている任意のファイルの末"
"尾で評価されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">library</var> can be also a file name (i.e., a string).  "
"You don&rsquo;t need to give a directory or extension in the file name <var "
"class=\"var\">library</var>.  Normally, you just give a bare file name, like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">library</var> はファイル名（つまり文字列）としても指定でき"
"ます。ファイル名 <var class=\"var\">library</var> にディレクトリや拡張子を指"
"定する必要はありません。通常は、次のようにファイル名のみを指定します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(with-eval-after-load &quot;js&quot; (keymap-set js-mode-map &quot;C-c C-c&quot; 'js-eval))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"To restrict which files can trigger the evaluation, include a directory or "
"an extension or both in <var class=\"var\">library</var>.  Only a file whose "
"absolute name matches all the given name components will match.  In the "
"following example, <samp class=\"file\">my_inst.elc</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"file\">my_inst.elc.gz</samp> in some directory <code "
"class=\"code\">..../foo/bar</code> will trigger the evaluation, but not "
"<samp class=\"file\">my_inst.el</samp>:"
msgstr ""
"評価のトリガーとなるファイルを制限するには、ディレクトリ、拡張子、またはその"
"両方を <var class=\"var\">library</var> に指定します。絶対ファイル名が指定さ"
"れたすべての名前構成要素と一致するファイルのみが対象となります。以下の例で"
"は、あるディレクトリ <code class=\"code\">..../foo/bar</code> 内の <samp "
"class=\"file\">my_inst.elc</samp> または <samp "
"class=\"file\">my_inst.elc.gz</samp> が評価をトリガーしますが、<samp "
"class=\"file\">my_inst.el</samp> はトリガーされません："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(with-eval-after-load &quot;foo/bar/my_inst.elc&quot; ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"An error in <var class=\"var\">body</var> does not undo the load, but does "
"prevent execution of the rest of <var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> のエラーが発生してもロードは取り消されません"
"が、<var class=\"var\">body</var> の残りの実行は妨げられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Hooks-for-Loading.html
msgid ""
"Normally, well-designed Lisp programs should not use <code "
"class=\"code\">with-eval-after-load</code>.  If you need to examine and set "
"the variables defined in another library (those meant for outside use), you "
"can do it immediately&mdash;there is no need to wait until the library is "
"loaded.  If you need to call functions defined by that library, you should "
"load the library, preferably with <code class=\"code\">require</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Named-Features.html\">Features</a>)."
msgstr ""
"通常、適切に設計されたLispプログラムでは<code class=\"code\">with-eval-after-"
"load</code>を使用すべきではありません。別のライブラリで定義された変数（外部利"
"用を想定したもの）を調べたり設定したりする必要がある場合は、すぐに実行できま"
"す。ライブラリがロードされるまで待つ必要はありません。そのライブラリで定義さ"
"れた関数を呼び出す必要がある場合は、ライブラリをロードしてください。できれば"
"<code class=\"code\">require</code>を使用してロードしてください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Named-Features.html\">Features</a>を参照）。"

