#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Horizontal-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Here is how you can determine whether a given position <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> is off the screen due to horizontal scrolling:"
msgstr ""
"指定した位置 <var class=\"var\">position</var> が水平スクロールによって画面外"
"にあるかどうかを判断する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Horizontal-Scrolling.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun hscroll-on-screen (window position)\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (goto-char position)\n"
"    (and\n"
"     (&gt;= (- (current-column) (window-hscroll window)) 0)\n"
"     (&lt; (- (current-column) (window-hscroll window))\n"
"        (window-width window)))))\n"
msgstr ""

