# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies an alternate expression-reading function for <code "
"class=\"code\">load</code> and <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code> to "
"use instead of <code class=\"code\">read</code>.  The function should accept "
"one argument, just as <code class=\"code\">read</code> does."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">load</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-region</code> が <code class=\"code\">read</code> の代わ"
"りに使用する代替の式読み込み関数を指定します。この関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">read</code> と同様に、1つの引数を受け取る必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"By default, this variable&rsquo;s value is <code class=\"code\">read</"
"code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Functions.html\">Input Functions</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
