"class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Functions.html\">入力関数</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"Instead of using this variable, it is cleaner to use another, newer feature: "
"to pass the function as the <var class=\"var\">read-function</var> argument "
"to <code class=\"code\">eval-region</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Eval.html#Definition-of-eval_002dregion\">Eval</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数を使う代わりに、別のより新しい機能、すなわち関数を<var "
"class=\"var\">read-function</var>の引数として<code class=\"code\">eval-"
"region</code>に渡す方法を用いる方が簡潔です。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Eval.html#Definition-of-eval_002dregion\">Eval</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-path-filter-cache-directory-files</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">path filename suffixes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dpath_002dfilter_002dcache_002ddirectory_002dfiles\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-path-filter-cache-directory-files</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">path filename suffixes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dpath_002dfilter_002dcache_002ddirectory_002dfiles\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"This function filters <var class=\"var\">path</var> to remove any "
"directories that could not hold <var class=\"var\">filename</var> with any "
"of <var class=\"var\">suffixes</var>, and returns the filtered list of "
"directories.  The function caches the directories it scans and the files "
"inside them, and uses the cache in subsequent calls, which speeds up "
"repeated lookups of files in <var class=\"var\">path</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">path</var> をフィルタリングし、<var "
"class=\"var\">suffixes</var> のいずれかと共に <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var> を保持できなかったディレクトリをすべて除外して、フィルタリング後のディレ"
"クトリ一覧を返します。また、スキャンしたディレクトリとその中のファイルを"
"キャッシュし、後続の呼び出しでそのキャッシュを利用することで、<var "
"class=\"var\">path</var> 内のファイルに対する繰り返しのルックアップを高速化し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-path-filter-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dpath_002dfilter_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-path-filter-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dpath_002dfilter_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/How-Programs-Do-Loading.html
msgid ""
"If this variable names a function, <code class=\"code\">load</code> will "
"call that function when it scans <code class=\"code\">load-path</code> to "
"find files.  The function will be called with 3 arguments: the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">load-path</code>, <var class=\"var\">filename</var>, "
"the name of a file being looked up as passed to <code class=\"code\">load</"
"code>, and a list of suffixes to append to <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var>.  It should return a shorter list of directories where <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> can reside, thus making the lookup faster.  The "
"function <code class=\"code\">load-path-filter-cache-directory-files</code> "
"is a good candidate to be such a function."
msgstr ""
"この変数が関数名である場合、<code class=\"code\">load</code> はファイル検索の"
"ために <code class=\"code\">load-path</code> をスキャンする際にその関数を呼び"
"出します。関数には3つの引数が渡されます。<code class=\"code\">load-path</"
"code> の値、<var class=\"var\">filename</var>、<code class=\"code\">load</"
"code> に渡される検索対象のファイル名、および <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var> に付加するサフィックスのリストです。この関数は、<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> が配置され得るディレクトリのより短いリストを返す"
"ことで、検索を高速化させる必要があります。関数 <code class=\"code\">load-"
"path-filter-cache-directory-files</code> は、このような関数の候補として適して"
"います。"

