"current_002didle_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Idle-Timers.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs is idle, this function returns the length of time Emacs has been "
"idle, using the same format as <code class=\"code\">current-time</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacs がアイドル状態の場合、この関数は <code class=\"code\">current-time</"
"code> と同じ形式で、Emacs がアイドル状態であった時間を返します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Idle-Timers.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs is not idle, <code class=\"code\">current-idle-time</code> "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  This is a convenient way to test "
"whether Emacs is idle."
msgstr ""
"Emacs がアイドル状態でないとき、<code class=\"code\">current-idle-time</"
"code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。これは、Emacs がアイドル"
"状態かどうかを判定する便利な方法です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Idle-Timers.html
msgid ""
"The main use of <code class=\"code\">current-idle-time</code> is when an "
"idle timer function wants to &ldquo;take a break&rdquo; for a while.  It can "
"set up another idle timer to call the same function again, after a few "
"seconds more idleness.  Here&rsquo;s an example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">current-idle-time</code>の主な用途は、アイドルタイマー関"
"数がしばらくの間「休憩」したい場合です。これにより、さらに数秒のアイドル状態"
"が続いた後、同じ関数を再度呼び出す別のアイドルタイマーを設定できます。以下に"
"例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Idle-Timers.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar my-resume-timer nil\n"
"  &quot;Timer for `my-timer-function' to reschedule itself, or nil.&quot;)\n"
"\n"
"(defun my-timer-function ()\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">If the user types a command while <code class=\"code\">my-resume-timer</code></span>\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">is active, the next time this function is called from</span>\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">its main idle timer, deactivate <code class=\"code\">my-resume-timer</code>.</span>\n"
"  (when my-resume-timer\n"
"    (cancel-timer my-resume-timer))\n"
"  ...<var class=\"var\">do the work for a while</var>...\n"
"  (when <var class=\"var\">taking-a-break</var>\n"
"    (setq my-resume-timer\n"
"          (run-with-idle-timer\n"
"            ;; Compute an idle time <var class=\"var\">break-length</var>\n"
"            ;; more than the current value.\n"
"            (time-add (current-idle-time) <var class=\"var\">break-length</var>)\n"
"            nil\n"
"            'my-timer-function))))\n"
msgstr ""

