msgstr ""
"<span>42.17.2 画像記述子<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Image-"
"Descriptors-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-image-descriptor\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-image-descriptor\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"An <em class=\"dfn\">image descriptor</em> is a list which specifies the "
"underlying data for an image, and how to display it.  It is typically used "
"as the value of a <code class=\"code\">display</code> overlay or text "
"property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Display-Specs.html\">Other "
"Display Specifications</a>); but See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Showing-"
"Images.html\">Showing Images</a>, for convenient helper functions to insert "
"images into buffers."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">画像記述子</em>とは、画像の基となるデータと、その表示方法を"
"指定するリストのことです。通常、<code class=\"code\">display</code> オーバー"
"レイやテキストプロパティの値として使用されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Other-Display-Specs.html\">その他の表示仕様</a>を参照）。ただし、バッ"
"ファに画像を挿入するための便利なヘルパー関数については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Showing-Images.html\">画像の表示</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"Each image descriptor has the form <code class=\"code\">(image . <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">props</var> is a "
"property list of alternating keyword symbols and values, including at least "
"the pair <code class=\"code\">:type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code> "
"that specifies the image type."
msgstr ""
"各画像記述子は <code class=\"code\">(image . <var class=\"var\">props</"
"var>)</code> という形式をとり、ここで <var class=\"var\">props</var> はキー"
"ワード記号と値が交互に並ぶプロパティリストであり、画像タイプを指定するペア "
"<code class=\"code\">:type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code> が少なくとも"
"含まれている。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"Image descriptors which define image dimensions, <code "
"class=\"code\">:width</code>, <code class=\"code\">:height</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">:max-width</code> and <code class=\"code\">:max-height</"
"code>, may take either an integer, which represents the dimension in pixels, "
"or a pair <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">value</var> . em)</code>, "
"where <var class=\"var\">value</var> is the dimension&rsquo;s length in <em "
"class=\"dfn\">ems</em><a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF36\" "
"href=\"#FOOT36\"><sup>36</sup></a>.  One em is equivalent to the size of the "
"font and <var class=\"var\">value</var> may be an integer or a float.  Also, "
"dimension can be specified in <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> . ch)</code> and <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> . cw)</code> forms, where <code class=\"code\">ch</"
"code> means height of the canonical character and <code class=\"code\">cw</"
"code> means width of the canonical character."
msgstr ""
"画像の寸法を定義する画像記述子 <code class=\"code\">:width</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">:height</code>、<code class=\"code\">:max-width</code>、およ"
"び <code class=\"code\">:max-height</code> には、ピクセル単位の寸法を表す整"
"数、または <var class=\"var\">value</var> が <em class=\"dfn\">ems</em> 単位"
"の寸法長となるペア <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">value</var> . "
"em)</code> のいずれかを指定できます<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF36\" "
"href=\"#FOOT36\"><sup>36</sup></a>。1 em はフォントサイズに相当し、<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> には整数または浮動小数点数を指定できます。また、寸"
"法は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">value</var> . ch)</code> およ"
"び <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">value</var> . cw)</code> の形式で"
"指定することもでき、ここで <code class=\"code\">ch</code> は正準文字の高さ"
"を、<code class=\"code\">cw</code> は正準文字の幅を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"The following is a list of properties that are meaningful for all image "
"types (there are also properties which are meaningful only for certain image "
"types, as documented in the following subsections):"
msgstr ""
"以下は、すべての画像タイプにおいて意味を持つプロパティの一覧です（後述のサブ"
"セクションで説明するように、特定の画像タイプにおいてのみ意味を持つプロパティ"
"もあります）："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
