#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html build/html/elisp/Network.html
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Definitions.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:type <var class=\"var\">type</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"The image type.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Image-Formats.html\">Image "
"Formats</a>.  Every image descriptor must include this property."
msgstr ""
"画像タイプ。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Image-Formats.html\">画像フォーマット</"
"a>を参照してください。すべての画像記述子には、このプロパティを含める必要があ"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html build/html/elisp/Sound-Output.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:file <var class=\"var\">file</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:file <var class=\"var\">file</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"This says to load the image from file <var class=\"var\">file</var>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">file</var> is not an absolute file name, it is expanded "
"relative to each of the directories mentioned by <code class=\"code\">image-"
"load-path</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Defining-"
"Images.html\">Defining Images</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これは、ファイル <var class=\"var\">file</var> から画像を読み込むよう指定して"
"います。<var class=\"var\">file</var> が絶対ファイル名でない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">image-load-path</code> で指定された各ディレクトリを基準として"
"展開されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Defining-Images.html\">画像の定義</a>"
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html build/html/elisp/Sound-Output.html
#: build/html/elisp/XBM-Images.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:data <var class=\"var\">data</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:data <var class=\"var\">data</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"This specifies the raw image data.  Each image descriptor must have either "
"<code class=\"code\">:data</code> or <code class=\"code\">:file</code>, but "
"not both."
msgstr ""
"これは生の画像データを指定します。各画像記述子は、<code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code> または <code class=\"code\">:file</code> のいずれ"
"か一方を持つ必要があり、両方を持つことはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"For most image types, the value of a <code class=\"code\">:data</code> "
"property should be a string containing the image data.  Some image types do "
"not support <code class=\"code\">:data</code>; for some others, <code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code> alone is not enough, so you need to use other "
"image properties along with <code class=\"code\">:data</code>.  See the "
"following subsections for details."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの画像タイプでは、<code class=\"code\">:data</code> プロパティの値は"
"画像データを含む文字列である必要があります。一部の画像タイプでは <code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code> がサポートされておらず、また別のタイプでは <code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code> だけでは不十分なため、<code "
"class=\"code\">:data</code> と併せて他の画像プロパティを使用する必要がありま"
"す。詳細は以下のサブセクションを参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:margin <var class=\"var\">margin</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:margin <var class=\"var\">margin</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"This specifies how many pixels to add as an extra margin around the image.  "
"The value, <var class=\"var\">margin</var>, must be a non-negative number, "
"or a pair <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">y</var>)</code> of such numbers.  If it is a pair, <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> specifies how many pixels to add horizontally, and "
"<var class=\"var\">y</var> specifies how many pixels to add vertically.  If "
"<code class=\"code\">:margin</code> is not specified, the default is zero."
msgstr ""
"これは、画像の周囲に追加の余白として何ピクセル加えるかを指定します。値 <var "
"class=\"var\">margin</var> は、非負の数値、またはそのような数値のペア <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x</var> . <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</"
"code> である必要があります。ペアの場合、<var class=\"var\">x</var> は水平方向"
"に加えるピクセル数を、<var class=\"var\">y</var> は垂直方向に加えるピクセル数"
