# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"Specifies a general edge-detection algorithm.  <var class=\"var\">matrix</"
"var> must be either a nine-element list or a nine-element vector of "
"numbers.  A pixel at position <em class=\"math\">x/y</em> in the transformed "
"image is computed from original pixels around that position.  <var "
"class=\"var\">matrix</var> specifies, for each pixel in the neighborhood of "
"<em class=\"math\">x/y</em>, a factor with which that pixel will influence "
"the transformed pixel; element <em class=\"math\">0</em> specifies the "
"factor for the pixel at <em class=\"math\">x-1/y-1</em>, element <em "
"class=\"math\">1</em> the factor for the pixel at <em class=\"math\">x/y-1</"
"em> etc., as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"一般的なエッジ検出アルゴリズムを指定します。<var class=\"var\">matrix</var>"
"は、9要素のリストまたは9要素の数値ベクトルである必要があります。変換後の画像"
"における位置<em class=\"math\">x/y</em>の画素は、その位置周辺の元の画素から算"
"出されます。<var class=\"var\">matrix</var>は、<em class=\"math\">x/y</em>の"
"近傍にある各画素について、その画素が変換後の画素に及ぼす影響係数を指定しま"
"す。以下に示すように、要素<em class=\"math\">0</em>は<em class=\"math\">x-1/"
"y-1</em>の画素の係数を、要素<em class=\"math\">1</em>は<em class=\"math\">x/"
"y-1</em>の画素の係数を、というように指定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (x-1/y-1  x/y-1  x+1/y-1\n"
"   x-1/y    x/y    x+1/y\n"
"   x-1/y+1  x/y+1  x+1/y+1)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
