# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"This associates an image map of <em class=\"dfn\">hot spots</em> with this "
"image."
msgstr ""
"これにより、この画像に<em class=\"dfn\">ホットスポット</em>のイメージマップが"
"関連付けられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"An image map is an alist where each element has the format <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">area</var> <var class=\"var\">id</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">plist</var>)</code>.  An <var class=\"var\">area</var> is "
"specified as either a rectangle, a circle, or a polygon."
msgstr ""
"イメージマップとは、各要素が <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">area</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">id</var> <var class=\"var\">plist</var>)</code> とい"
"う形式を持つリストのことです。<var class=\"var\">area</var> は、矩形、円、ま"
"たは多角形のいずれかとして指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"A rectangle is a cons <code class=\"code\">(rect . ((<var class=\"var\">x0</"
"var> . <var class=\"var\">y0</var>) . (<var class=\"var\">x1</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var>)))</code> which specifies the pixel coordinates of "
"the upper left and bottom right corners of the rectangle area."
msgstr ""
"矩形とは、矩形領域の左上隅と右下隅のピクセル座標を指定する cons <code "
"class=\"code\">(rect . ((<var class=\"var\">x0</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">y0</var>) . (<var class=\"var\">x1</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var>)))</code> のことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"A circle is a cons <code class=\"code\">(circle . ((<var class=\"var\">x0</"
"var> . <var class=\"var\">y0</var>) . <var class=\"var\">r</var>))</code> "
"which specifies the center and the radius of the circle; <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> may be a float or integer."
msgstr ""
"円とは、円の中心と半径を指定する cons <code class=\"code\">(circle . ((<var "
"class=\"var\">x0</var> . <var class=\"var\">y0</var>) . <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var>))</code> であり、<var class=\"var\">r</var> は浮動小数"
"点数または整数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"A polygon is a cons <code class=\"code\">(poly . [<var class=\"var\">x0</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">y0</var> <var class=\"var\">x1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var> ...])</code> where each pair in the vector describes "
"one corner in the polygon."
msgstr ""
"多角形とは、ベクトル内の各ペアが多角形の頂点を1つずつ表す cons <code "
"class=\"code\">(poly . [<var class=\"var\">x0</var> <var class=\"var\">y0</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">x1</var> <var class=\"var\">y1</var> ...])</code> の"
"ことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"When the mouse pointer lies on a hot-spot area of an image, the <var "
"class=\"var\">plist</var> of that hot-spot is consulted; if it contains a "
"<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property, that defines a tool-tip for "
"the hot-spot, and if it contains a <code class=\"code\">pointer</code> "
"property, that defines the shape of the mouse cursor when it is on the hot-"
"spot.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Pointer-Shape.html\">Pointer Shape</a>, "
"for available pointer shapes."
msgstr ""
"マウスポインタが画像のホットスポット領域上にある場合、そのホットスポットの "
"<var class=\"var\">plist</var> が参照されます。そこに <code "
"class=\"code\">help-echo</code> プロパティが含まれていればホットスポットの"
"ツールチップが定義され、<code class=\"code\">pointer</code> プロパティが含ま"
"れていれば、ホットスポット上にあるときのマウスカーソルの形状が定義されます。"
"利用可能なポインタ形状については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Pointer-"
"Shape.html\">ポインタ形状</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"When you click the mouse when the mouse pointer is over a hot-spot, an event "
"is composed by combining the <var class=\"var\">id</var> of the hot-spot "
"with the mouse event; for instance, <code class=\"code\">[area4 mouse-1]</"
"code> if the hot-spot&rsquo;s <var class=\"var\">id</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">area4</code>."
msgstr ""
"マウスポインタがホットスポット上にあるときにマウスをクリックすると、ホットス"
"ポットの<var class=\"var\">id</var>とマウスイベントが組み合わされてイベントが"
"生成されます。例えば、ホットスポットの<var class=\"var\">id</var>が<code "
"class=\"code\">area4</code>であれば、<code class=\"code\">[area4 mouse-1]</"
"code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"image_002dcompute_002dscaling_002dfactor\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"image_002dcompute_002dscaling_002dfactor\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"Note that the map&rsquo;s coordinates should reflect the displayed image "
"after all transforms have been done (rotation, scaling and so on), and also "
"note that Emacs (by default) performs auto-scaling of images, so to make "
"things match up, you should either specify <code class=\"code\">:scale 1.0</"
"code> when creating the image, or use the result of <code "
"class=\"code\">image-compute-scaling-factor</code> to compute the elements "
"of the map."
msgstr ""
"なお、マップの座標は、すべての変換（回転、拡大縮小など）が適用された後の表示"
"画像を反映している必要がある点にご注意ください。また、Emacsは（デフォルトで）"
"画像の自動拡大縮小を行うため、整合性を取るには、画像作成時に <code "
"class=\"code\">:scale 1.0</code> を指定するか、<code class=\"code\">image-"
"compute-scaling-factor</code> の結果を用いてマップの要素を算出する必要があり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"When an image&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">:scale</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">:rotation</code>, or <code class=\"code\">:flip</code> is "
"changed, <code class=\"code\">:map</code> will be recomputed based on the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">:original-map</code> and the values of those "
"transformation."
msgstr ""
"画像の<code class=\"code\">:scale</code>、<code class=\"code\">:rotation</"
"code>、または<code class=\"code\">:flip</code>が変更されると、<code "
"class=\"code\">:original-map</code>の値とそれらの変換値に基づいて<code "
"class=\"code\">:map</code>が再計算されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Image-Descriptors.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-original-image-map\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:original-"
"map <var class=\"var\">original-map</var></code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-original-image-map\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-original-image-map\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:original-"
