"<span>42.17.5 ImageMagick 画像<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#ImageMagick-"
"Images-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ImageMagick-images\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-images_002c-support-for-more-formats\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ImageMagick-images\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-images_002c-support-for-more-formats\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"If your Emacs build has ImageMagick support, you can use the ImageMagick "
"library to load many image formats (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/File-"
"Conveniences.html#File-Conveniences\">File Conveniences</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>).  The image type symbol for "
"images loaded via ImageMagick is <code class=\"code\">imagemagick</code>, "
"regardless of the actual underlying image format."
msgstr ""
"EmacsのビルドでImageMagickがサポートされている場合は、ImageMagickライブラリを"
"使用して多くの画像形式を読み込むことができます（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/File-Conveniences.html#File-"
"Conveniences\">File Conveniences</a>を参照してください）。ImageMagick経由で読"
"み込まれた画像の画像タイプシンボルは、実際の基盤となる画像形式に関わらず"
"<code class=\"code\">imagemagick</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid "To check for ImageMagick support, use the following:"
msgstr "ImageMagickのサポートを確認するには、以下を使用してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(image-type-available-p 'imagemagick)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imagemagick-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"imagemagick_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imagemagick-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"imagemagick_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of image file extensions supported by the "
"current ImageMagick installation.  Each list element is a symbol "
"representing an internal ImageMagick name for an image type, such as <code "
"class=\"code\">BMP</code> for <samp class=\"file\">.bmp</samp> images."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在の ImageMagick インストールでサポートされている画像ファイル拡"
"張子の一覧を返します。一覧の各要素は、<samp class=\"file\">.bmp</samp> 画像に"
"対する <code class=\"code\">BMP</code> のように、画像タイプを表す "
"ImageMagick 内部名を示すシンボルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imagemagick-enabled-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imagemagick_002denabled_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">imagemagick-enabled-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-imagemagick_002denabled_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of ImageMagick image types which Emacs "
"may attempt to render using ImageMagick.  Each list element should be one of "
"the symbols in the list returned by <code class=\"code\">imagemagick-types</"
"code>, or an equivalent string.  Alternatively, a value of <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> enables ImageMagick for all possible image types.  "
"Regardless of the value of this variable, <code class=\"code\">imagemagick-"
"types-inhibit</code> (see below) takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、EmacsがImageMagickを用いてレンダリングを試みる可能性のある"
"ImageMagick画像タイプのリストです。リストの各要素は、<code "
"class=\"code\">imagemagick-types</code> が返すリストに含まれるシンボルのいず"
"れか、またはそれに相当する文字列である必要があります。あるいは、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を指定すると、考えられるすべての画像タイプで"
"ImageMagickが有効になります。この変数の値にかかわらず、<code "
"class=\"code\">imagemagick-types-inhibit</code>（後述）が優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imagemagick-types-inhibit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imagemagick_002dtypes_002dinhibit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">imagemagick-types-inhibit</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-imagemagick_002dtypes_002dinhibit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable lists the ImageMagick image types which should "
"never be rendered using ImageMagick, regardless of the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">imagemagick-enabled-types</code>.  A value of <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> disables ImageMagick entirely."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値には、<code class=\"code\">imagemagick-enabled-types</code>の値に"
"かかわらず、ImageMagickでレンダリングしてはならないImageMagickの画像タイプが"
"列挙されています。<code class=\"code\">t</code>を指定すると、ImageMagickが完"
"全に無効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">image-format-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-image_002dformat_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">image-format-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-image_002dformat_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"This variable is an alist mapping image types to file name extensions.  "
"Emacs uses this in conjunction with the <code class=\"code\">:format</code> "
"image property (see below) to give a hint to the ImageMagick library as to "
"the type of an image.  Each element has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> <var class=\"var\">extension</var>)</code>, where "
"<var class=\"var\">type</var> is a symbol specifying an image content-type, "
"and <var class=\"var\">extension</var> is a string that specifies the "
"associated file name extension."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、画像タイプをファイル名拡張子にマッピングするalistです。Emacsはこ"
"れを<code class=\"code\">:format</code>画像プロパティ（後述）と組み合わせて使"
"用し、ImageMagickライブラリに画像のタイプに関するヒントを与えます。各要素は"
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">extension</var>)</code>という形式をしており、<var "
"class=\"var\">type</var>は画像のコンテンツタイプを指定するシンボル、<var "
"class=\"var\">extension</var>は対応するファイル名拡張子を指定する文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"Images loaded with ImageMagick support the following additional image "
"descriptor properties:"
msgstr ""
"ImageMagick で読み込まれた画像は、以下の追加の画像記述子プロパティをサポート"
"しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Image-Types.html build/html/elisp/SVG-Images.html
#: build/html/elisp/XBM-Images.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:background <var class=\"var\">background</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:background <var class=\"var\">background</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">background</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"should be a string specifying a color, which is used as the image&rsquo;s "
"background color if the image supports transparency.  If the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the frame&rsquo;s background color."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">background</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、色を指定する文字列である必要があり、画像が透過に対応している場合はその"
"色が画像の背景色として使用されます。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場"
"合は、フレームの背景色がデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:format <var class=\"var\">type</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:format <var class=\"var\">type</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"The value, <var class=\"var\">type</var>, should be a symbol specifying the "
"type of the image data, as found in <code class=\"code\">image-format-"
"suffixes</code>.  This is used when the image does not have an associated "
"file name, to provide a hint to ImageMagick to help it detect the image type."
msgstr ""
"値 <var class=\"var\">type</var> には、<code class=\"code\">image-format-"
"suffixes</code> と同様に、画像データの形式を指定するシンボルを記述します。こ"
"れは、画像に関連付けられたファイル名がない場合に、ImageMagick が画像形式を検"
"出するためのヒントとして利用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:crop <var class=\"var\">geometry</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:crop <var class=\"var\">geometry</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"The value of <var class=\"var\">geometry</var> should be a list of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">width</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">height</var> <var class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</"
"var>)</code>.  <var class=\"var\">width</var> and <var class=\"var\">height</"
"var> specify the width and height of the cropped image.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> is a positive number it specifies the offset of the "
"cropped area from the left of the original image, and if negative the offset "
"from the right.  If <var class=\"var\">y</var> is a positive number it "
"specifies the offset from the top of the original image, and if negative "
"from the bottom.  If <var class=\"var\">x</var> or <var class=\"var\">y</"
"var> are <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or unspecified the crop area will "
"be centered on the original image."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">geometry</var> の値は、<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">width</var> <var class=\"var\">height</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code> 形式のリストである必"
"要があります。<var class=\"var\">width</var> と <var class=\"var\">height</"
"var> は、切り抜き画像の幅と高さを指定します。<var class=\"var\">x</var> が正"
"の数の場合は元画像の左からの切り抜き領域のオフセットを、負の数の場合は右から"
"のオフセットを指定します。<var class=\"var\">y</var> が正の数の場合は元画像の"
"上端からのオフセットを、負の数の場合は下端からのオフセットを指定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> または <var class=\"var\">y</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、あるいは未指定の場合、切り抜き領域は元画"
"像の中央に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid ""
"If the crop area is outside or overlaps the edge of the image it will be "
"reduced to exclude any areas outside of the image.  This means it is not "
"possible to use <code class=\"code\">:crop</code> to increase the size of "
"the image by entering large <var class=\"var\">width</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">height</var> values."
msgstr ""
"クロップ領域が画像の外にあるか、または画像の端と重なっている場合は、画像外の"
"領域を除外するように縮小されます。つまり、大きな <var class=\"var\">width</"
"var> や <var class=\"var\">height</var> の値を入力して画像サイズを拡大するた"
"めに <code class=\"code\">:crop</code> を使用することはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/ImageMagick-Images.html
msgid "Cropping is performed after scaling but before rotation."
msgstr "クロッピングは、スケーリングの後、回転の前に行われます。"

