#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.5 Imenu<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Imenu-1\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.5 Imenu<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Imenu-1\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Imenu\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Imenu\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Imenu</em> is a feature that lets users select a "
"definition or section in the buffer, from a menu which lists all of them, to "
"go directly to that location in the buffer.  Imenu works by constructing a "
"buffer index which lists the names and buffer positions of the definitions, "
"or other named portions of the buffer; then the user can choose one of them "
"and move point to it.  Major modes can add a menu bar item to use Imenu "
"using <code class=\"code\">imenu-add-to-menubar</code>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Imenu</em>は、バッファ内のすべての定義やセクションを一覧表"
"示するメニューから項目を選択することで、バッファ内のその位置へ直接移動できる"
"機能です。Imenuは、定義やその他の名前付きバッファ領域の名称とバッファ上の位置"
"をリスト化したバッファインデックスを構築することで動作し、ユーザーはその中か"
"ら一つを選択してポイントを移動させることができます。メジャーモードでは、"
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-add-to-menubar</code>を使用してImenuを利用するため"
"のメニューバー項目を追加できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-add-to-menubar</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"imenu_002dadd_002dto_002dmenubar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-add-to-menubar</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"imenu_002dadd_002dto_002dmenubar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This function defines a local menu bar item named <var class=\"var\">name</"
"var> to run Imenu."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、Imenuを実行するための<var class=\"var\">name</var>という名前の"
"ローカルメニューバー項目を定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The user-level commands for using Imenu are described in the Emacs Manual "
"(see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Imenu.html#Imenu\">Imenu</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">the Emacs Manual</cite>).  This section explains how to "
"customize Imenu&rsquo;s method of finding definitions or buffer portions for "
"a particular major mode."
msgstr ""
"Imenuを使用するためのユーザーレベルコマンドについては、Emacsマニュアルに記載"
"されています（<cite class=\"cite\">Emacsマニュアル</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Imenu.html#Imenu\">Imenu</a>を参照してください）。本節では、特定のメ"
"ジャーモードにおける定義やバッファ部分の検索方法をImenuでカスタマイズする方法"
"を解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The usual and simplest way is to set the variable <code class=\"code\">imenu-"
"generic-expression</code>:"
msgstr ""
"一般的かつ最も簡単な方法は、変数 <code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-"
"expression</code> を設定することです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-generic-expression</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dgeneric_002dexpression\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-generic-expression</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dgeneric_002dexpression\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, is a list that "
"specifies regular expressions for finding definitions for Imenu.  Simple "
"elements of <code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Imenu の定義を検索する"
"ための正規表現を指定するリストとなります。<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-"
"expression</code> の単純な要素は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> <var class=\"var\">index</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"Here, if <var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it says that the matches for this element should "
"go in a submenu of the buffer index; <var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> "
"itself specifies the name for the submenu.  If <var class=\"var\">menu-"
"title</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the matches for this element "
"go directly in the top level of the buffer index."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、<var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、この要素のマッチ結果はバッファインデックスのサブメニューに"
"配置されることを示しており、<var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> 自体がそのサ"
"ブメニューの名前を指定します。<var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、この要素のマッチ結果はバッファインデックス"
"の最上位レベルに直接配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The second item in the list, <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>, is a regular "
"expression (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regular-Expressions.html\">Regular "
"Expressions</a>); anything in the buffer that it matches is considered a "
"definition, something to mention in the buffer index.  The third item, <var "
"class=\"var\">index</var>, is a non-negative integer that indicates which "
"subexpression in <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> matches the "
"definition&rsquo;s name."
msgstr ""
"リストの2番目の項目 <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> は正規表現（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regular-Expressions.html\">正規表現</a>を参照）であ"
"り、バッファ内でこれに一致するものはすべて定義とみなされ、バッファインデック"
"スに記載すべき内容となります。3番目の項目 <var class=\"var\">index</var> は非"
"負整数で、<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> のどの部分式が定義名に一致するかを"
"示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid "An element can also look like this:"
msgstr "要素は次のような見た目になることもあります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> <var class=\"var\">index</var> <var class=\"var\">function</var> <var class=\"var\">arguments</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"Each match for this element creates an index item, and when the index item "
"is selected by the user, it calls <var class=\"var\">function</var> with "
"arguments consisting of the item name, the buffer position, and <var "
"class=\"var\">arguments</var>."
msgstr ""
"この要素の各マッチはインデックス項目を生成し、ユーザーがそのインデックス項目"
"を選択すると、項目名、バッファ位置、および<var class=\"var\">arguments</var>"
"を引数として<var class=\"var\">function</var>を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"For Emacs Lisp mode, <code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> "
"could look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispモードでは、<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code>は"
"次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"((nil &quot;^\\\\s-*(def\\\\(un\\\\|subst\\\\|macro\\\\|advice\\\\)\\\n"
"\\\\s-+\\\\([-A-Za-z0-9+]+\\\\)&quot; 2)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (&quot;*Vars*&quot; &quot;^\\\\s-*(def\\\\(var\\\\|const\\\\)\\\n"
"\\\\s-+\\\\([-A-Za-z0-9+]+\\\\)&quot; 2)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" (&quot;*Types*&quot;\n"
"  &quot;^\\\\s-*\\\n"
"(def\\\\(type\\\\|struct\\\\|class\\\\|ine-condition\\\\)\\\n"
"\\\\s-+\\\\([-A-Za-z0-9+]+\\\\)&quot; 2))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid "Setting this variable makes it buffer-local in the current buffer."
msgstr "この変数を設定すると、現在のバッファ内でバッファローカルになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-case-fold-search</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dcase_002dfold_002dsearch\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-case-fold-search</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dcase_002dfold_002dsearch\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls whether matching against the regular expressions in "
"the value of <code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> is case-"
"sensitive: <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the default, means matching should "
"ignore case."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> の値に含まれ"
"る正規表現によるマッチングを大文字小文字を区別するかどうかを制御します。デ"
"フォルトの <code class=\"code\">t</code> は、大文字小文字を区別せずにマッチン"
"グすることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-syntax-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"imenu_002dsyntax_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-syntax-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"imenu_002dsyntax_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This variable is an alist of syntax table modifiers to use while processing "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code>, to override the syntax "
"table of the current buffer.  Each element should have this form:"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> の処理中に使"
"用し、現在のバッファの構文テーブルを上書きするための構文テーブル修飾子のalist"
"です。各要素は以下の形式である必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">characters</var> . <var class=\"var\">syntax-description</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">characters</var>, "
"can be either a character or a string.  The element says to give that "
"character or characters the syntax specified by <var class=\"var\">syntax-"
"description</var>, which is passed to <code class=\"code\">modify-syntax-"
"entry</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-"
"Functions.html\">Syntax Table Functions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">characters</var> は、文字"
"または文字列のいずれかになります。この要素は、その文字または複数の文字に "
"<var class=\"var\">syntax-description</var> で指定された構文を適用するように"
"指示しており、その構文は <code class=\"code\">modify-syntax-entry</code> に渡"
"されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-Functions.html\">構文テーブ"
"ル関数</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This feature is typically used to give word syntax to characters which "
"normally have symbol syntax, and thus to simplify <code class=\"code\">imenu-"
"generic-expression</code> and speed up matching.  For example, Fortran mode "
"uses it this way:"
msgstr ""
"この機能は通常、通常は記号構文を持つ文字に単語構文を付与し、それによって "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> を簡略化してマッチングを"
"高速化するために使用されます。例えば、Fortranモードでは次のように利用されてい"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq imenu-syntax-alist '((&quot;_$&quot; . &quot;w&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> regular expressions "
"can then use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\sw+</samp>&rsquo; instead of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\(\\\\sw\\\\|\\\\s_\\\\)+</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Note that this technique may be inconvenient when the mode needs to limit "
"the initial character of a name to a smaller set of characters than are "
"allowed in the rest of a name."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> 正規表現で"
"は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\(\\\\sw\\\\|\\\\s_\\\\)+</samp>&rsquo; の"
"代わりに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\sw+</samp>&rsquo; を使用できるように"
"なります。なお、名前の先頭文字を、名前の残りの部分で許可されている文字よりも"
"少ない文字セットに制限する必要がある場合、この手法は不便なことがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"Another way to customize Imenu for a major mode is to set the variables "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">imenu-extract-index-name-function</code>:"
msgstr ""
"メジャーモード向けにImenuをカスタマイズするもう一つの方法は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">imenu-extract-index-name-function</code> を設定することです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dprev_002dindex_002dposition_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dprev_002dindex_002dposition_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, its value should be "
"a function that finds the next definition to put in the buffer index, "
"scanning backward in the buffer from point.  It should return <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if it doesn&rsquo;t find another definition before "
"point.  Otherwise it should leave point at the place it finds a definition "
"and return any non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その値は、point から"
"バッファを逆方向に走査し、バッファインデックスに格納する次の定義を探す関数で"
"ある必要があります。point より前に別の定義が見つからない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要があります。それ以外の場合は、定義が見つ"
"かった位置に point を保持し、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の任意の値を"
"返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-extract-index-name-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dextract_002dindex_002dname_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-extract-index-name-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dextract_002dindex_002dname_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, its value should be "
"a function to return the name for a definition, assuming point is in that "
"definition as the <code class=\"code\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</"
"code> function would leave it."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その値は、point が "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</code> 関数の挙動通り"
"にその定義内にあると想定して、定義名を返す関数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The last way to customize Imenu for a major mode is to set the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-create-index-function</code>:"
msgstr ""
"メジャーモード向けにImenuをカスタマイズする最後の方法は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">imenu-create-index-function</code> を設定することです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-create-index-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dcreate_002dindex_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">imenu-create-index-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-imenu_002dcreate_002dindex_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the function to use for creating a buffer index.  "
"The function should take no arguments, and return an index alist for the "
"current buffer.  It is called within <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code>, so where it leaves point makes no difference."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、バッファインデックスの作成に使用する関数を指定します。この関数は"
"引数を取らず、現在のバッファのインデックスalistを返す必要があります。この関数"
"は<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>内で呼び出されるため、ポイントを"
"どこに残すかは問いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The index alist can have three types of elements.  Simple elements look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"インデックスのalistには、3種類の要素が含まれます。単純な要素は次のようになり"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">index-name</var> . <var class=\"var\">index-position</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"Selecting a simple element has the effect of moving to position <var "
"class=\"var\">index-position</var> in the buffer.  Special elements look "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"単純な要素を選択すると、バッファ内の位置 <var class=\"var\">index-position</"
"var> に移動します。特殊な要素は以下のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">index-name</var> <var class=\"var\">index-position</var> <var class=\"var\">function</var> <var class=\"var\">arguments</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid "Selecting a special element performs:"
msgstr "特殊な要素を選択すると、以下が実行されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(funcall <var class=\"var\">function</var>\n"
"         <var class=\"var\">index-name</var> <var class=\"var\">index-position</var> <var class=\"var\">arguments</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid "A nested sub-alist element looks like this:"
msgstr "ネストされたサブalist要素は、次のような形式になります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> . <var class=\"var\">sub-alist</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"It creates the submenu <var class=\"var\">menu-title</var> specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">sub-alist</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">sub-alist</var> で指定されたサブメニュー <var "
"class=\"var\">menu-title</var> を作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"The default value of <code class=\"code\">imenu-create-index-function</code> "
"is <code class=\"code\">imenu-default-create-index-function</code>.  This "
"function calls the value of <code class=\"code\">imenu-prev-index-position-"
"function</code> and the value of <code class=\"code\">imenu-extract-index-"
"name-function</code> to produce the index alist.  However, if either of "
"these two variables is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the default function "
"uses <code class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> instead."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-create-index-function</code> のデフォルト値は "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-default-create-index-function</code> です。この関"
"数は <code class=\"code\">imenu-prev-index-position-function</code> の値と "
"<code class=\"code\">imenu-extract-index-name-function</code> の値を呼び出し"
"てインデックスのアリストを生成します。ただし、これら2つの変数のいずれかが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、デフォルト関数は代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">imenu-generic-expression</code> を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"If built with tree-sitter, Emacs can automatically generate an Imenu index "
"if the major mode sets relevant variables."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterでビルドした場合、メジャーモードが関連する変数を設定していれば、"
"EmacsはImenuインデックスを自動的に生成できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-simple-imenu-settings</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002dsimple_002dimenu_002dsettings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-simple-imenu-settings</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002dsimple_002dimenu_002dsettings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This variable instructs Emacs how to generate Imenu indexes.  It should be a "
"list of (<var class=\"var\">category</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">regexp</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">pred</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">name-fn</"
"var>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、EmacsにImenuインデックスの生成方法を指示します。(<var "
"class=\"var\">category</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">regexp</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">pred</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">name-fn</var>) のリストであ"
"る必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">category</var> should be the name of a category, like "
"&quot;Function&quot;, &quot;Class&quot;, etc.  <var class=\"var\">regexp</"
"var> should be a regexp matching the type of nodes that belong to <var "
"class=\"var\">category</var>.  <var class=\"var\">pred</var> should be "
"either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or a function that takes a node as "
"the argument.  It should return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the "
"node is a valid node for <var class=\"var\">category</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if not."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">category</var> は &quot;Function&quot; や "
"&quot;Class&quot; などのカテゴリ名である必要があります。<var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var> は <var class=\"var\">category</var> に属するノー"
"ドの型に一致する正規表現である必要があります。<var class=\"var\">pred</var> "
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> か、ノードを引数として受け取る関数である必"
"要があります。ノードが <var class=\"var\">category</var> の有効なノードであれ"
"ば non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、そうでなければ <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">category</var> could also be <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, in which case the entries matched by <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">pred</var> are not grouped under <var "
"class=\"var\">category</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">category</var> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場"
"合もあり、その場合、<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">pred</var> に一致するエントリは <var class=\"var\">category</"
"var> の下にまとめられません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">name-fn</var> should be either <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> or a function that takes a defun node and returns the name of that "
"defun, e.g., the function name for a function definition.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">name-fn</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-defun-name</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html\">Developing major modes with tree-"
"sitter</a>) is used instead."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">name-fn</var> は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> か、ある"
"いは defun ノードを受け取り、その defun の名前（例えば関数定義の関数名）を返"
"す関数のいずれかである必要があります。<var class=\"var\">name-fn</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-defun-name</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html\">Tree-sitter によるメジャーモードの"
"開発</a> を参照）が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-major-mode-setup</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html\">Developing major modes with tree-"
"sitter</a>)  automatically sets up Imenu if this variable is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-major-mode-setup</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html\">Tree-sitterによるメジャーモードの開"
"発</a>を参照）この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、Imenuが自"
"動的にセットアップされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-aggregated-simple-imenu-settings</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"treesit_002daggregated_002dsimple_002dimenu_002dsettings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-aggregated-simple-imenu-settings</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"treesit_002daggregated_002dsimple_002dimenu_002dsettings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"This variable allows major modes to configure Imenu for multiple languages.  "
"Its value is an alist mapping language symbols to Imenu settings of the form "
"described above for the value of <code class=\"code\">treesit-simple-imenu-"
"settings</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数を使用すると、メジャーモードが複数の言語向けにImenuを設定できるように"
"なります。その値は、言語シンボルを、<code class=\"code\">treesit-simple-"
"imenu-settings</code>の値について前述した形式のImenu設定にマッピングするalist"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Imenu.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it overrides <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-simple-imenu-settings</code> for setting up Imenu."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Imenu の設定において "
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-simple-imenu-settings</code> を上書きします。"

