# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">defun</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">defun</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid ""
"Handle this function like a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">def</samp>&rsquo; "
"construct: treat the second line as the start of a <em class=\"dfn\">body</"
"em>."
msgstr ""
"この関数を「<samp class=\"samp\">def</samp>」構文のように扱ってください。2行"
"目を<em class=\"dfn\">body</em>の開始として解釈します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid "an integer, <var class=\"var\">number</var>"
msgstr "整数、<var class=\"var\">number</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid ""
"The first <var class=\"var\">number</var> arguments of the function are <em "
"class=\"dfn\">distinguished</em> arguments; the rest are considered the body "
"of the expression.  A line in the expression is indented according to "
"whether the first argument on it is distinguished or not.  If the argument "
"is part of the body, the line is indented <code class=\"code\">lisp-body-"
"indent</code> more columns than the open-parenthesis starting the containing "
"expression.  If the argument is distinguished and is either the first or "
"second argument, it is indented <em class=\"emph\">twice</em> that many "
"extra columns.  If the argument is distinguished and not the first or second "
"argument, the line uses the standard pattern."
msgstr ""
"関数の最初の <var class=\"var\">number</var> 個の引数は<em class=\"dfn\">区別"
"された</em>引数であり、残りは式の本体とみなされます。式内の各行は、その行の最"
"初の引数が区別されているか否かに応じてインデントされます。引数が本体の一部で"
"ある場合、その行は、包含する式の開始括弧からさらに <code class=\"code\">lisp-"
"body-indent</code> 列分インデントされます。引数が区別されており、かつ第1引数"
"または第2引数である場合は、その<em class=\"emph\">2倍</em>の列数分だけ追加で"
"インデントされます。引数が区別されており、かつ第1引数または第2引数ではない場"
"合、その行は標準的なパターンに従います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid "a symbol, <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>"
msgstr "記号、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> should be a function name; that function is "
"called to calculate the indentation of a line within this expression.  The "
"function receives two arguments:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> は関数名である必要があります。この関数は、こ"
"の式内における行のインデントを計算するために呼び出されます。この関数は2つの引"
"数を受け取ります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
