msgid "<var class=\"var\">pos</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">pos</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid "The position at which the line being indented begins."
msgstr "インデントされる行が始まる位置。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">state</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">state</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid ""
"The value returned by <code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> (a Lisp "
"primitive for indentation and nesting computation) when it parses up to the "
"beginning of this line."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code>（インデントおよびネスト計算用"
"のLispプリミティブ）がこの行の先頭までパースした際に返す値。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid ""
"It should return either a number, which is the number of columns of "
"indentation for that line, or a list whose car is such a number.  The "
"difference between returning a number and returning a list is that a number "
"says that all following lines at the same nesting level should be indented "
"just like this one; a list says that following lines might call for "
"different indentations.  This makes a difference when the indentation is "
"being computed by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd>; if the value is a number, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> need not recalculate indentation for the "
"following lines until the end of the list."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、その行のインデント列数である数値か、あるいはその数値を car とする"
"リストのいずれかを返す必要があります。数値を返す場合とリストを返す場合の違い"
"は、数値の場合は同じネストレベルにある後続のすべての行をこの行と同様にインデ"
"ントすべきであることを示し、リストの場合は後続の行によって異なるインデントが"
"必要になる可能性があることを示す点にあります。これは、インデントが <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> によって計算される場合に違いが生じます。値が数値で"
"あれば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-q</kbd> はリストの末尾に達するまで、後続の行の"
"インデントを再計算する必要はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indenting-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lisp-indent-local-overrides</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-lisp_002dindent_002dlocal_002doverrides\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
