#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.11 Indirect Buffers<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Indirect-"
"Buffers-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.11 間接バッファ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Indirect-"
"Buffers-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indirect-buffers\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-base-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indirect-buffers\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-base-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"An <em class=\"dfn\">indirect buffer</em> shares the text of some other "
"buffer, which is called the <em class=\"dfn\">base buffer</em> of the "
"indirect buffer.  In some ways it is the analogue, for buffers, of a "
"symbolic link among files.  The base buffer may not itself be an indirect "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">間接バッファ</em>は、別のバッファのテキストを共有しており、"
"そのバッファは間接バッファの<em class=\"dfn\">ベースバッファ</em>と呼ばれま"
"す。ある意味で、これはバッファにおけるファイル間のシンボリックリンクに相当す"
"るものです。ベースバッファ自体が間接バッファであるとは限りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The text of the indirect buffer is always identical to the text of its base "
"buffer; changes made by editing either one are visible immediately in the "
"other.  This includes the text properties as well as the characters "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファのテキストは、常に基となるバッファのテキストと同一であり、いずれ"
"か一方を編集して加えた変更は、もう一方にも即座に反映されます。これには、テキ"
"ストのプロパティだけでなく、文字自体も含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"In all other respects, the indirect buffer and its base buffer are "
"completely separate.  They have different names, independent values of "
"point, independent narrowing, independent markers and overlays (though "
"inserting or deleting text in either buffer relocates the markers and "
"overlays for both), independent major modes, and independent buffer-local "
"variable bindings."
msgstr ""
"それ以外のあらゆる点において、間接バッファとそのベースバッファは完全に分離し"
"ています。名称が異なり、pointの値、ナローイング、マーカーおよびオーバーレイが"
"それぞれ独立しており（ただし、いずれかのバッファでテキストを挿入または削除す"
"ると、両方のマーカーとオーバーレイが再配置されます）、メジャーモードも独立し"
"ており、バッファローカル変数の束縛も独立しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"An indirect buffer cannot visit a file, but its base buffer can.  If you try "
"to save the indirect buffer, that actually saves the base buffer."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファはファイルにアクセスできませんが、そのベースバッファは可能です。"
"間接バッファを保存しようとすると、実際にはベースバッファが保存されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Killing an indirect buffer has no effect on its base buffer.  Killing the "
"base buffer effectively kills the indirect buffer in that it cannot ever "
"again be the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファを破棄しても、そのベースバッファには影響しません。ベースバッファ"
"を破棄すると、その間接バッファは二度とカレントバッファになれなくなるため、実"
"質的に破棄されたことになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-indirect-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">base-"
"buffer name &amp;optional clone inhibit-buffer-hooks</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-indirect-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">base-"
"buffer name &amp;optional clone inhibit-buffer-hooks</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This creates and returns an indirect buffer named <var class=\"var\">name</"
"var> whose base buffer is <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var>.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> may be a live buffer or the "
"name (a string) of an existing buffer.  If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is "
"the name of an existing buffer, an error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"これにより、ベースバッファが <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> である "
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> という名前の間接バッファが生成され、返されま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> には、ライブバッファまたは既存"
"バッファの名前（文字列）を指定できます。<var class=\"var\">name</var> が既存"
"バッファの名前である場合、エラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">clone</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then the indirect buffer originally shares the state of <var "
"class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> such as major mode, minor modes, buffer "
"local variables and so on.  If <var class=\"var\">clone</var> is omitted or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> the indirect buffer&rsquo;s state is set to "
"the default state for new buffers."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">clone</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、間接バッファは本来、メジャーモード、マイナーモード、バッファローカル変数"
"などの <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> の状態を共有します。<var "
"class=\"var\">clone</var> が省略されているか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、間接バッファの状態は新規バッファのデフォル"
"ト状態に設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> is an indirect buffer, its base "
"buffer is used as the base for the new buffer.  If, in addition, <var "
"class=\"var\">clone</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"initial state is copied from the actual base buffer, not from <var "
"class=\"var\">base-buffer</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> が間接バッファである場合、そのベースバッ"
"ファが新しいバッファのベースとして使用されます。さらに、<var "
"class=\"var\">clone</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、"
"初期状態は <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> からではなく、実際のベース"
"バッファからコピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Creating-Buffers.html\">Creating Buffers</a>, "
"for the meaning of <var class=\"var\">inhibit-buffer-hooks</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">inhibit-buffer-hooks</var>の意味については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Creating-Buffers.html\">バッファの作成</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clone-indirect-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">newname display-flag &amp;optional norecord</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clone-indirect-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">newname display-flag &amp;optional norecord</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a new indirect buffer that shares the "
"current buffer&rsquo;s base buffer and copies the rest of the current "
"buffer&rsquo;s attributes.  (If the current buffer is not indirect, it is "
"used as the base buffer.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファのベースバッファを共有し、現在のバッファの残りの属"
"性をコピーした新しい間接バッファを作成して返します。（現在のバッファが間接"
"バッファでない場合は、それがベースバッファとして使用されます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">display-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, as it always is in interactive calls, that means to display the new "
"buffer by calling <code class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</code>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">norecord</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that "
"means not to put the new buffer to the front of the buffer list."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブ呼び出しでは常にそうであるように、<var class=\"var\">display-"
"flag</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</code> を呼び出して新しいバッファを表示すること"
"を意味します。<var class=\"var\">norecord</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外である場合は、新しいバッファをバッファリストの先頭に配置しないこと"
"を意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-base-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002dbase_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-base-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002dbase_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the base buffer of <var class=\"var\">buffer</var>, "
"which defaults to the current buffer.  If <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> is "
"not indirect, the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Otherwise, the "
"value is another buffer, which is never an indirect buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> のベースバッファを返します。デフォ"
"ルトでは現在のバッファとなります。<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> が間接バッ"
"ファでない場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。それ以外の場"
"合、値は別のバッファとなり、それが間接バッファになることはありません。"

