#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.1.3 Debugging Infinite Loops<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Debugging-Infinite-Loops\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.1.3 無限ループのデバッグ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Debugging-Infinite-Loops\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-infinite-loops\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-loops_002c-infinite\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting-from-infinite-loop\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-stopping-an-infinite-loop\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-infinite-loops\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-loops_002c-infinite\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting-from-infinite-loop\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-stopping-an-infinite-loop\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"When a program loops infinitely and fails to return, your first problem is "
"to stop the loop.  On most operating systems, you can do this with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>, which causes a <em class=\"dfn\">quit</em>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting</a>."
msgstr ""
"プログラムが無限ループに陥り、復帰しなくなった場合、まず行うべきことはループ"
"を停止させることです。ほとんどのオペレーティングシステムでは、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> を使用してこれを行うことができ、これにより <em "
"class=\"dfn\">quit</em> が実行されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"Ordinary quitting gives no information about why the program was looping.  "
"To get more information, you can set the variable <code class=\"code\">debug-"
"on-quit</code> to non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Once you have the "
"debugger running in the middle of the infinite loop, you can proceed from "
"the debugger using the stepping commands.  If you step through the entire "
"loop, you may get enough information to solve the problem."
msgstr ""
"通常の終了では、プログラムがなぜループしていたのかに関する情報は得られませ"
"ん。より詳細な情報を得るには、変数 <code class=\"code\">debug-on-quit</code> "
"に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定してください。無限ループの途"
"中でデバッガを起動できれば、そこからステップ実行コマンドを用いて進めることが"
"できます。ループ全体をステップ実行すれば、問題を解決するのに十分な情報が得ら"
"れるかもしれません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"Quitting with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> is not considered an error, and "
"<code class=\"code\">debug-on-error</code> has no effect on the handling of "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>.  Likewise, <code class=\"code\">debug-on-quit</"
"code> has no effect on errors."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> で終了してもエラーとはみなされず、<code "
"class=\"code\">debug-on-error</code> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> の処理に"
"影響を与えません。同様に、<code class=\"code\">debug-on-quit</code> もエラー"
"には影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debug-on-quit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"debug_002don_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">debug-on-quit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-debug_002don_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Infinite-Loops.html
msgid ""
"This variable determines whether the debugger is called when <code "
"class=\"code\">quit</code> is signaled and not handled.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">debug-on-quit</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then the debugger is called whenever you quit (that is, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>).  If <code class=\"code\">debug-on-quit</code> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), then the debugger is not "
"called when you quit."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">quit</code> がシグナルされ、処理されなかった"
"場合にデバッガが呼び出されるかどうかを決定します。<code class=\"code\">debug-"
"on-quit</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、終了するたび"
"（すなわち <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> を入力するたび）にデバッガが呼び出さ"
"れます。<code class=\"code\">debug-on-quit</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）の場合、終了してもデバッガは呼び出され"
"ません。"

