#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span>23.5 Inheritance and Keymaps<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Inheritance-and-Keymaps-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.5 継承とキーマップ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Inheritance-"
"and-Keymaps-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap-inheritance\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inheritance_002c-keymap\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap-inheritance\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inheritance_002c-keymap\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"A keymap can inherit the bindings of another keymap, which we call the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">parent keymap</em>.  Such a keymap looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"キーマップは、別のキーマップ（これを<em class=\"dfn\">親キーマップ</em>と呼び"
"ます）のバインディングを継承できます。このようなキーマップは次のようになりま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap <var class=\"var\">elements</var>... . <var class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The effect is that this keymap inherits all the bindings of <var "
"class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var>, whatever they may be at the time a key is "
"looked up, but can add to them or override them with <var "
"class=\"var\">elements</var>."
msgstr ""
"これにより、このキーマップは、キー参照時にどのような割り当てがなされていよう"
"とも <var class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var> のすべてのバインドを継承し、さら"
"に <var class=\"var\">elements</var> を用いてそれらに追記したり上書きしたりで"
"きるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If you change the bindings in <var class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var> using "
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> or other key-binding functions, these "
"changed bindings are visible in the inheriting keymap, unless shadowed by "
"the bindings made by <var class=\"var\">elements</var>.  The converse is not "
"true: if you use <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> to change bindings "
"in the inheriting keymap, these changes are recorded in <var "
"class=\"var\">elements</var>, but have no effect on <var "
"class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> やその他のキーバインド関数を用いて "
"<var class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var> のバインドを変更すると、<var "
"class=\"var\">elements</var> によるバインドで上書きされない限り、変更されたバ"
"インドは継承先のキーマップに反映されます。その逆は成り立ちません。つまり、"
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> を用いて継承先のキーマップのバインドを"
"変更しても、その変更は <var class=\"var\">elements</var> には記録されますが、"
"<var class=\"var\">parent-keymap</var> には影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The proper way to construct a keymap with a parent is to use <code "
"class=\"code\">set-keymap-parent</code>; if you have code that directly "
"constructs a keymap with a parent, please convert the program to use <code "
"class=\"code\">set-keymap-parent</code> instead."
msgstr ""
"親を持つキーマップを構築する正しい方法は <code class=\"code\">set-keymap-"
"parent</code> を使用することです。親を持つキーマップを直接構築しているコード"
"がある場合は、代わりに <code class=\"code\">set-keymap-parent</code> を使用す"
"るようにプログラムを変換してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keymap_002dparent\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keymap_002dparent\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This returns the parent keymap of <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> has no parent, <code class=\"code\">keymap-"
"parent</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> の親キーマップを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> に親がない場合は、<code class=\"code\">keymap-"
"parent</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-keymap-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"parent</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dkeymap_002dparent\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-keymap-parent</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"parent</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dkeymap_002dparent\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This sets the parent keymap of <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> to <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var>, and returns <var class=\"var\">parent</var>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">parent</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function gives <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> no parent at all."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> の親キーマップが <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> に設定され、<var class=\"var\">parent</var> が返さ"
"れます。<var class=\"var\">parent</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ある場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> に親を一切設定しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> has submaps (bindings for prefix keys), "
"they too receive new parent keymaps that reflect what <var "
"class=\"var\">parent</var> specifies for those prefix keys."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> にサブマップ（プレフィックスキーのバインディ"
"ング）がある場合、それらにも <var class=\"var\">parent</var> がそれらのプレ"
"フィックスキーに対して指定する内容を反映した新しい親キーマップが付与されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example showing how to make a keymap that inherits from <code "
"class=\"code\">text-mode-map</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">text-mode-map</code>を継承するキーマップの作成方法を示す"
"例を以下に挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((map (make-sparse-keymap)))\n"
"  (set-keymap-parent map text-mode-map)\n"
"  map)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"A non-sparse keymap can have a parent too, but this is not very useful.  A "
"non-sparse keymap always specifies something as the binding for every "
"numeric character code without modifier bits, even if it is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, so these character&rsquo;s bindings are never "
"inherited from the parent keymap."
msgstr ""
"非スパースなキーマップにも親を持たせることは可能ですが、あまり有用ではありま"
"せん。非スパースなキーマップでは、修飾ビットを持たないすべての数値文字コード"
"に対して、たとえ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であっても常に何らかのバイン"
"ディングを指定するため、これらの文字のバインディングが親キーマップから継承さ"
"れることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap-inheritance-from-multiple-"
"maps\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap-inheritance-from-multiple-"
"maps\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want to make a keymap that inherits from more than one map.  "
"You can use the function <code class=\"code\">make-composed-keymap</code> "
"for this."
msgstr ""
"複数のマップを継承するキーマップを作成したい場合があります。その際は、<code "
"class=\"code\">make-composed-keymap</code> 関数を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-composed-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">maps "
"&amp;optional parent</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dcomposed_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-composed-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">maps "
"&amp;optional parent</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dcomposed_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new keymap composed of the existing keymap(s)  <var "
"class=\"var\">maps</var>, and optionally inheriting from a parent keymap "
"<var class=\"var\">parent</var>.  <var class=\"var\">maps</var> can be a "
"single keymap or a list of more than one.  When looking up a key in the "
"resulting new map, Emacs searches in each of the <var class=\"var\">maps</"
"var> in turn, and then in <var class=\"var\">parent</var>, stopping at the "
"first match.  A <code class=\"code\">nil</code> binding in any one of <var "
"class=\"var\">maps</var> overrides any binding in <var class=\"var\">parent</"
"var>, but it does not override any non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"binding in any other of the <var class=\"var\">maps</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、既存のキーマップ(s) <var class=\"var\">maps</var> で構成され、必"
"要に応じて親キーマップ <var class=\"var\">parent</var> を継承した新しいキー"
"マップを返します。<var class=\"var\">maps</var> には、単一のキーマップまたは"
"複数のキーマップのリストを指定できます。結果として得られた新しいマップでキー"
"を検索する際、Emacs は <var class=\"var\">maps</var> のそれぞれを順に検索し、"
"次に <var class=\"var\">parent</var> を検索して、最初に一致したもので停止しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">maps</var> のいずれかにある <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> のバインディングは、<var class=\"var\">parent</var> のあらゆるバイン"
"ディングを上書きしますが、<var class=\"var\">maps</var> の他のいずれにある "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のバインディングを上書きすることはありま"
"せん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"For example, here is how Emacs sets the parent of <code class=\"code\">help-"
"mode-map</code>, such that it inherits from both <code class=\"code\">button-"
"buffer-map</code> and <code class=\"code\">special-mode-map</code>:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、Emacsが<code class=\"code\">help-mode-map</code>の親を次のように設定"
"し、<code class=\"code\">button-buffer-map</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">special-mode-map</code>の両方を継承させる例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Inheritance-and-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar-keymap help-mode-map\n"
"  :parent (make-composed-keymap button-buffer-map\n"
"                                special-mode-map)\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

