# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"<span>21.14 Inhibiting Interaction<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Inhibiting-Interaction-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>21.14 相互作用の阻害<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Inhibiting-"
"Interaction-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"It&rsquo;s sometimes useful to be able to run Emacs as a headless server "
"process that responds to commands given over a network connection.  However, "
"Emacs is primarily a platform for interactive usage, so many commands prompt "
"the user for feedback in certain anomalous situations.  This makes this use "
"case more difficult, since the server process will just hang waiting for "
"user input."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク接続経由で与えられるコマンドに応答するヘッドレスサーバープロセス"
"としてEmacsを動作させられると、便利な場合があります。しかし、Emacsは主に対話"
"的な利用を目的としたプラットフォームであるため、多くのコマンドが特定の例外的"
"な状況においてユーザーにフィードバックを求めます。このため、サーバープロセス"
"がユーザー入力を待機したままハングしてしまい、このユースケースの実現はより困"
"難になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inhibit_002dinteraction\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inhibit_002dinteraction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"Binding the <code class=\"code\">inhibit-interaction</code> variable to "
"something non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> makes Emacs signal a <code "
"class=\"code\">inhibited-interaction</code> error instead of prompting, "
"which can then be used by the server process to handle these situations."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-interaction</code> 変数を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のものにバインドすると、Emacs はプロンプトを表"
"示する代わりに <code class=\"code\">inhibited-interaction</code> エラーを通知"
"するようになり、サーバープロセスはこれを利用してこうした状況に対処できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
msgid "Here&rsquo;s a typical use case:"
msgstr "代表的なユースケースは以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((inhibit-interaction t))\n"
"  (respond-to-client\n"
"   (condition-case err\n"
"       (my-client-handling-function)\n"
"     (inhibited-interaction err))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Inhibiting-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">my-client-handling-function</code> ends up calling "
"something that asks the user for something (via <code class=\"code\">y-or-n-"
"p</code> or <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code> or the like), "
"an <code class=\"code\">inhibited-interaction</code> error is signaled "
"instead.  The server code then catches that error and reports it to the "
"client."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">my-client-handling-function</code> が（<code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> や <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</"
"code> などを介して）ユーザーに何らかの入力を求める処理を呼び出した場合、代わ"
"りに <code class=\"code\">inhibited-interaction</code> エラーが通知されます。"
"その後、サーバーコードがそのエラーを捕捉し、クライアントに報告します。"

