# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Init-File.html
msgid ""
"This normal hook is run, once, just after loading all the init files (<samp "
"class=\"file\">site-start.el</samp>, your init file, and <samp "
"class=\"file\">default.el</samp>), before loading the terminal-specific "
