# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-input-focus\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-selected-frame\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-input-focus\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-selected-frame\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"At any time, one frame in Emacs is the <em class=\"dfn\">selected frame</"
"em>.  The selected window (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-"
"Windows.html\">Selecting Windows</a>) always resides on the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、常に1つのフレームが<em class=\"dfn\">選択フレーム</em>となります。"
"選択中のウィンドウ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-Windows.html\">ウィン"
"ドウの選択</a>を参照）は、常に選択フレーム上に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs displays its frames on several terminals (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple Terminals</a>), each terminal has "
"its own selected frame.  But only one of these is <em class=\"emph\">the</"
"em> selected frame: it&rsquo;s the frame that belongs to the terminal from "
"which the most recent input came.  That is, when Emacs runs a command that "
"came from a certain terminal, the selected frame is the one of that "
"terminal.  Since Emacs runs only a single command at any given time, it "
"needs to consider only one selected frame at a time; this frame is what we "
"call <em class=\"dfn\">the selected frame</em> in this manual.  The display "
"on which the selected frame is shown is the <em class=\"dfn\">selected "
"frame&rsquo;s display</em>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが複数のターミナルにフレームを表示する場合（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を参照）、各ターミナルには"
"それぞれ選択済みのフレームがあります。しかし、その中で<em class=\"emph\">唯一"
"の</em>選択済みフレームとなるのが、直近の入力があったターミナルに属するフレー"
"ムです。つまり、Emacsがあるターミナルから届いたコマンドを実行する際、選択済み"
"フレームはそのターミナルのフレームになります。Emacsは一度に一つのコマンドしか"
