# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the frame with the highest use time as reported by "
"<code class=\"code\">frame-use-time</code>.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if no candidate frames are found which usually "
