"name\">handle-focus-in</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">event</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-handle_002dfocus_002din\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">handle-focus-in</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">event</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-handle_002dfocus_002din\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"This function handles focus-in events from window systems and terminals that "
"support explicit focus notifications.  It updates the per-frame focus flags "
"that <code class=\"code\">frame-focus-state</code> queries and calls <code "
"class=\"code\">after-focus-change-function</code>.  In addition, it "
"generates a <code class=\"code\">switch-frame</code> event in order to "
"switch the Emacs notion of the selected frame to the frame most recently "
"focused in some terminal.  It&rsquo;s important to note that this switching "
"of the Emacs selected frame to the most recently focused frame does not mean "
"that other frames do not continue to have the focus in their respective "
"terminals.  Do not invoke this function yourself: instead, attach logic to "
"<code class=\"code\">after-focus-change-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、明示的なフォーカス通知をサポートするウィンドウシステムやターミナ"
"ルからのフォーカスインイベントを処理します。<code class=\"code\">frame-focus-"
"state</code> がクエリするフレームごとのフォーカスフラグを更新し、<code "
"class=\"code\">after-focus-change-function</code> を呼び出します。さらに、"
"Emacs における選択フレームの概念を、いずれかのターミナルで直近にフォーカスさ"
"れたフレームに切り替えるため、<code class=\"code\">switch-frame</code> イベン"
"トを生成します。ここで注意すべき点は、Emacs の選択フレームを直近にフォーカス"
"されたフレームに切り替えるからといって、他のフレームがそれぞれのターミナルで"
"引き続きフォーカスを保持しなくなるわけではないということです。この関数を自身"
"で呼び出さないでください。代わりに、<code class=\"code\">after-focus-change-"
"function</code> にロジックを紐付けてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">handle-switch-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-handle_002dswitch_002dframe\"> "
