# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Focus.html
msgid ""
"It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the frame is known not to be "
"focused, <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the frame is known to be focused, "
"or <code class=\"code\">unknown</code> if Emacs does not know the focus "
