#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-binary-I_002fO-in-batch-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-binary-I_002fO-in-batch-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When reading or writing from the standard input/output streams of the Emacs "
"process in batch mode, it is sometimes required to make sure any arbitrary "
"binary data will be read/written verbatim, and/or that no translation of "
"newlines to or from CR-LF pairs is performed.  This issue does not exist on "
"POSIX hosts, only on MS-Windows and MS-DOS.  The following function allows "
"you to control the I/O mode of any standard stream of the Emacs process."
msgstr ""
"バッチモードでEmacsプロセスの標準入出力ストリームから読み書きを行う際、任意の"
"バイナリデータがそのまま読み書きされること、および／または改行のCR-LFペアへの"
"変換やそこからの変換が行われないことを確実にする必要がある場合があります。こ"
"の問題はPOSIXホストでは発生せず、MS-WindowsおよびMS-DOSでのみ発生します。以下"
"の関数を使用すると、Emacsプロセスの任意の標準ストリームのI/Oモードを制御でき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-binary-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">stream "
"mode</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dbinary_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-binary-mode</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">stream "
"mode</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dbinary_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Switch <var class=\"var\">stream</var> into binary or text I/O mode.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">mode</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, switch "
"to binary mode, otherwise switch to text mode.  The value of <var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var> can be one of <code class=\"code\">stdin</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">stdout</code>, or <code class=\"code\">stderr</code>.  "
"This function flushes any pending output data of <var class=\"var\">stream</"
"var> as a side effect, and returns the previous value of I/O mode for <var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var>.  On POSIX hosts, it always returns a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value and does nothing except flushing pending "
"output."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">stream</var> をバイナリ I/O モードまたはテキスト I/O モー"
"ドに切り替えます。<var class=\"var\">mode</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合はバイナリモードに、それ以外の場合はテキストモードに切り替え"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">stream</var> の値は、<code class=\"code\">stdin</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">stdout</code>、または <code "
"class=\"code\">stderr</code> のいずれかとなります。この関数は、副作用として "
"<var class=\"var\">stream</var> の保留中の出力データをフラッシュし、<var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var> の直前の I/O モードの値を返します。POSIX ホストで"
"は、常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返し、保留中の出力をフラッ"
"シュする以外の処理は行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Functions.html
