# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This predicate says whether <var class=\"var\">object</var> has <em "
"class=\"dfn\">readable syntax</em>, i.e., it can be written out and then "
"read back by the Emacs Lisp reader.  If it can&rsquo;t, this function "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; if it can, this function returns a "
"printed representation (via <code class=\"code\">prin1</code>, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>) of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>."
msgstr ""
"この述語は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が <em class=\"dfn\">読み取り可能"
"な構文</em> を持つか、すなわち書き出すことができ、かつ Emacs Lisp リーダーで"
"読み戻せるかを判定します。読み戻せない場合、この関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返し、読み戻せる場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> の出力表現（<code class=\"code\">prin1</code> 経"
"由。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出力関数</a> を参照）を"
"返します。"

