msgstr "<var class=\"var\">meta</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Modes.html
msgid ""
"is <code class=\"code\">t</code> if Emacs treats the eighth bit of input "
"characters as the Meta bit before decoding input; <code "
"class=\"code\">encoded</code> if Emacs treats the eighth bit of the decoded "
"single-byte characters as the Meta bit; <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"Emacs clears the eighth bit of every input character; any other value means "
"Emacs uses all eight bits as the basic character code."
