"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Finally, here is an example of a stream that is a function, named <code "
"class=\"code\">useless-stream</code>.  Before we use the stream, we "
"initialize the variable <code class=\"code\">useless-list</code> to a list "
"of characters.  Then each call to the function <code class=\"code\">useless-"
"stream</code> obtains the next character in the list or unreads a character "
"by adding it to the front of the list."
msgstr ""
"最後に、<code class=\"code\">useless-stream</code> という名前の関数であるスト"
"リームの例を示します。ストリームを使用する前に、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">useless-list</code> を文字のリストで初期化します。その後、関"
"数 <code class=\"code\">useless-stream</code> が呼び出されるたびに、リスト内"
"の次の文字を取得するか、あるいは文字をリストの先頭に追加して未読状態にしま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq useless-list (append &quot;XY()&quot; nil))\n"
"     &rArr; (88 89 40 41)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun useless-stream (&amp;optional unread)\n"
"  (if unread\n"
"      (setq useless-list (cons unread useless-list))\n"
"    (prog1 (car useless-list)\n"
"           (setq useless-list (cdr useless-list)))))\n"
"     &rArr; useless-stream\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
msgid "Now we read using the stream thus constructed:"
