#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(read 'useless-stream)\n"
"     &rArr; XY\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"useless-list\n"
"     &rArr; (40 41)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Note that the open and close parentheses remain in the list.  The Lisp "
"reader encountered the open parenthesis, decided that it ended the input, "
"and unread it.  Another attempt to read from the stream at this point would "
"read &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">()</samp>&rsquo; and return <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"なお、リストには開き括弧と閉じ括弧がそのまま残っている点に注意してください。"
"Lispリーダーは開き括弧を検出し、それが入力の終端であると判断して、読み飛ばし"
"ました。この時点でストリームから再度読み込もうとすると、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">()</samp>&rsquo;が読み込まれ、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"が返されます。"

