# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span>41.7 Sending Input to Processes<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Sending-Input-to-Processes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>41.7 プロセスへの入力送信<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Sending-"
"Input-to-Processes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-process-input\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-process-input\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Asynchronous subprocesses receive input when it is sent to them by Emacs, "
"which is done with the functions in this section.  You must specify the "
"process to send input to, and the input data to send.  If the subprocess "
"runs a program, the data appears on the standard input of that program; for "
"connections, the data is sent to the connected device or program."
msgstr ""
"非同期サブプロセスは、Emacsから入力が送信された際にそれを受け取ります。この処"
"理は、本節で説明する関数を用いて行われます。入力を送信するプロセスと、送信す"
"る入力データを指定する必要があります。サブプロセスがプログラムを実行する場"
"合、データはそのプログラムの標準入力に現れます。接続の場合は、データは接続先"
"のデバイスまたはプログラムに送信されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Some operating systems have limited space for buffered input in a pty.  On "
"these systems, Emacs sends an <abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> "
"periodically amidst the other characters, to force them through.  For most "
"programs, these <abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr>s do no harm."
msgstr ""
"一部のオペレーティングシステムでは、ptyにおけるバッファリングされた入力用の領"
"域が限られています。こうしたシステムでは、Emacsは他の文字の合間に定期的に"
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr>を送信し、強制的に処理させます。ほとんどの"
"プログラムにとって、これらの<abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr>が悪影響を及ぼ"
"すことはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Subprocess input is normally encoded using a coding system before the "
"subprocess receives it, much like text written into a file.  You can use "
"<code class=\"code\">set-process-coding-system</code> to specify which "
"coding system to use (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-"
"Information.html\">Process Information</a>).  Otherwise, the coding system "
"comes from <code class=\"code\">coding-system-for-write</code>, if that is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>; or else from the defaulting mechanism "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Default-Coding-Systems.html\">Default Coding "
"Systems</a>)."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセスへの入力は、通常、ファイルに書き込まれるテキストと同様に、サブプ"
"ロセスが受け取る前に符号化方式を用いて符号化されます。使用する符号化方式を指"
"定するには <code class=\"code\">set-process-coding-system</code> を使用できま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-Information.html\">プロセス情報</a> を"
"参照）。それ以外の場合、符号化方式は、<code class=\"code\">coding-system-for-"
"write</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でないときはそこから、そうで"
"ない場合はデフォルト設定メカニズム（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Default-Coding-"
"Systems.html\">デフォルト符号化方式</a> を参照）から決定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes the system is unable to accept input for that process, because the "
"input buffer is full.  When this happens, the send functions wait a short "
"while, accepting output from subprocesses, and then try again.  This gives "
"the subprocess a chance to read more of its pending input and make space in "
"the buffer.  It also allows filters (including the one currently running), "
"sentinels and timers to run&mdash;so take account of that in writing your "
"code."
msgstr ""
"入力バッファが一杯であるため、システムがそのプロセスへの入力を受け付けられな"
"いことがあります。このような場合、送信関数は短時間待機してサブプロセスからの"
"出力を受け付けた後、再度試行します。これにより、サブプロセスは保留中の入力を"
"さらに読み込み、バッファに空きを作る機会を得られます。また、フィルター（現在"
"実行中のものを含む）やセンチネル、タイマーの実行も可能になります。コードを記"
"述する際は、この点に留意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"In these functions, the <var class=\"var\">process</var> argument can be a "
"process or the name of a process, or a buffer or buffer name (which stands "
"for a process via <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-process</code>).  <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means the current buffer&rsquo;s process."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数において、<var class=\"var\">process</var> 引数にはプロセスまたは"
"プロセス名、あるいはバッファまたはバッファ名（<code class=\"code\">get-"
"buffer-process</code> を介してプロセスを表す）を指定できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> は現在のバッファのプロセスを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-send-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dsend_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-send-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dsend_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function sends <var class=\"var\">process</var> the contents of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> as standard input.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  For example, to make a Shell buffer list files:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</var>の内容を<var "
"class=\"var\">process</var>として標準入力に送信します。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。例えば、Shellバッファでファイルを一覧表"
"示するには："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(process-send-string &quot;shell&lt;1&gt;&quot; &quot;ls\\n&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-send-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dsend_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-send-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dsend_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function sends the text in the region defined by <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> as standard input "
"to <var class=\"var\">process</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> で"
"定義された領域内のテキストを、<var class=\"var\">process</var> に標準入力とし"
"て送信します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"An error is signaled unless both <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> are integers or markers that indicate positions in "
"the current buffer.  (It is unimportant which number is larger.)"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> がともに整数で"
"あるか、あるいは現在のバッファ内の位置を指定するマーカーである場合を除き、エ"
"ラーが報告されます。（どちらの数値が大きいかは問いません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-send-eof</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002dsend_002deof\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-send-eof</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002dsend_002deof\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function makes <var class=\"var\">process</var> see an end-of-file in "
"its input.  The <abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> comes after any text "
"already sent to it.  The function returns <var class=\"var\">process</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">process</var> が入力内でファイル終端を認識する"
"ようにします。<abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> は、すでに送信された任意のテ"
"キストの後に現れます。この関数は <var class=\"var\">process</var> を返しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(process-send-eof &quot;shell&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;shell&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Input-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-running-child-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-process_002drunning_002dchild_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
