# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Insertion</em> means adding new text to a buffer.  The "
"inserted text goes at point&mdash;between the character before point and the "
"character after point.  Some insertion functions leave point before the "
"inserted text, while other functions leave it after.  We call the former "
"insertion <em class=\"dfn\">after point</em> and the latter insertion <em "
"class=\"dfn\">before point</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">挿入</em>とは、バッファに新しいテキストを追加することを指し"
"ます。挿入されたテキストはポイント&mdash;ポイント前の文字とポイント後の文字の"
"間&mdash;に配置されます。挿入関数によっては、ポイントを挿入後のテキストの前に"
"残すものもあれば、後に残すものもあります。前者の挿入を<em class=\"dfn\">ポイ"
"ント後</em>、後者の挿入を<em class=\"dfn\">ポイント前</em>と呼びます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"Insertion moves markers located at positions after the insertion point, so "
"that they stay with the surrounding text (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Markers.html\">Markers</a>).  When a marker points at the place of "
"insertion, insertion may or may not relocate the marker, depending on the "
"marker&rsquo;s insertion type (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Marker-"
"Insertion-Types.html\">Marker Insertion Types</a>).  Certain special "
"functions such as <code class=\"code\">insert-before-markers</code> relocate "
"all such markers to point after the inserted text, regardless of the "
"markers&rsquo; insertion type."
msgstr ""
"挿入処理では、挿入位置より後ろにあるマーカーを移動させ、周囲のテキストと共に"
"配置します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Markers.html\">マーカー</a>を参照）。"
"マーカーが挿入位置を指している場合、挿入処理によってマーカーが再配置されるか"
"どうかは、そのマーカーの挿入タイプによって異なります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Marker-Insertion-Types.html\">マーカー挿入タイプ</a>を参照）。<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-before-markers</code> などの特定の特殊機能は、マーカー"
"の挿入タイプに関わらず、こうしたすべてのマーカーを挿入後のテキストの後ろを指"
"すように再配置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"Insertion functions signal an error if the current buffer is read-only (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">Read-Only Buffers</a>) or "
"if they insert within read-only text (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">Properties with Special Meanings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"挿入関数は、現在のバッファが読み取り専用である場合（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">読み取り専用バッファ</a>を参照）、または読み"
"取り専用テキスト内に挿入する場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持つプロパティ</a>を参照）に、エラーを通知しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"These functions copy text characters from strings and buffers along with "
"their properties.  The inserted characters have exactly the same properties "
"as the characters they were copied from.  By contrast, characters specified "
"as separate arguments, not part of a string or buffer, inherit their text "
"properties from the neighboring text."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、文字列やバッファからテキスト文字を、そのプロパティとともにコ"
"ピーします。挿入された文字は、コピー元の文字とまったく同じプロパティを持ちま"
"す。これに対し、文字列やバッファの一部ではなく、個別の引数として指定された文"
"字は、隣接するテキストからテキストプロパティを継承します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"The insertion functions convert text from unibyte to multibyte in order to "
"insert in a multibyte buffer, and vice versa&mdash;if the text comes from a "
"string or from a buffer.  However, they do not convert unibyte character "
"codes 128 through 255 to multibyte characters, not even if the current "
"buffer is a multibyte buffer.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Converting-"
"Representations.html\">Converting Text Representations</a>."
msgstr ""
"挿入関数は、テキストをユニバイトからマルチバイトに変換してマルチバイトバッ"
"ファに挿入し、またその逆（テキストが文字列またはバッファから提供される場合）"
"も行います。ただし、現在のバッファがマルチバイトバッファであっても、ユニバイ"
"ト文字コード 128 から 255 をマルチバイト文字に変換することはありません。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Converting-Representations.html\">テキスト表現の変換</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest args</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-insert\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest args</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-insert\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This function inserts the strings and/or characters <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var> into the current buffer, at point, moving point forward.  In other "
"words, it inserts the text before point.  An error is signaled unless all "
"<var class=\"var\">args</var> are either strings or characters.  The value "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列および/または文字 <var class=\"var\">args</var> を現在の"
"バッファのポイント位置に挿入し、ポイントを前方に移動させます。言い換えれば、"
"ポイントより前のテキストを挿入します。すべての <var class=\"var\">args</var> "
"が文字列または文字でない限り、エラーが報告されます。戻り値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-before-markers</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"insert_002dbefore_002dmarkers\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-before-markers</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"insert_002dbefore_002dmarkers\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This function inserts the strings and/or characters <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var> into the current buffer, at point, moving point forward.  An error is "
"signaled unless all <var class=\"var\">args</var> are either strings or "
"characters.  The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列および/または文字 <var class=\"var\">args</var> を現在の"
"バッファのポイント位置に挿入し、ポイントを前方に移動させます。すべての <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> が文字列または文字でない限り、エラーが報告されます。"
"戻り値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This function is unlike the other insertion functions in that it relocates "
"markers initially pointing at the insertion point, to point after the "
"inserted text.  If an overlay begins at the insertion point, the inserted "
"text falls outside the overlay; if a nonempty overlay ends at the insertion "
"point, the inserted text falls inside that overlay."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、挿入箇所を指していたマーカーを、挿入後のテキストの後へと再配置す"
"るという点で、他の挿入関数とは異なります。オーバーレイが挿入箇所から始まる場"
"合、挿入後のテキストはオーバーレイの外側に位置します。一方、空でないオーバー"
"レイが挿入箇所で終わる場合、挿入後のテキストはそのオーバーレイの内側に位置し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">character "
"&amp;optional count inherit</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"insert_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">character "
"&amp;optional count inherit</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"insert_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts <var class=\"var\">count</var> instances of <var "
"class=\"var\">character</var> into the current buffer before point.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">count</var> must be an integer, and <var "
"class=\"var\">character</var> must be a character."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ポイントより前の現在のバッファに <var "
"class=\"var\">character</var> の <var class=\"var\">count</var> 個のインスタ"
"ンスを挿入します。引数 <var class=\"var\">count</var> は整数、<var "
"class=\"var\">character</var> は文字である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"If called interactively, this command prompts for <var "
"class=\"var\">character</var> using its Unicode name or its code point.  See "
"<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Inserting-Text.html#Inserting-Text\">Inserting Text</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"対話的に呼び出された場合、このコマンドは <var class=\"var\">character</var> "
"の Unicode 名またはコードポイントを用いて入力を求めます。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Inserting-"
"Text.html#Inserting-Text\">テキストの挿入</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This function does not convert unibyte character codes 128 through 255 to "
"multibyte characters, not even if the current buffer is a multibyte buffer.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Converting-Representations.html\">Converting "
"Text Representations</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファがマルチバイトバッファである場合であっても、ユニバ"
"イト文字コード 128 から 255 をマルチバイト文字に変換しません。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Converting-Representations.html\">テキスト表現の変換</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">inherit</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the inserted characters inherit sticky text properties from the two "
"characters before and after the insertion point.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Sticky-Properties.html\">Stickiness of Text Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">inherit</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、挿入された文字は、挿入位置の前後2文字からスティッキーなテキストプロパティ"
"を継承します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sticky-Properties.html\">テキストプロ"
"パティのスティッキネス</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-buffer-substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">from-buffer-or-name &amp;optional start end</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-insert_002dbuffer_002dsubstring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-buffer-substring</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">from-buffer-or-name &amp;optional start end</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-insert_002dbuffer_002dsubstring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This function inserts a portion of buffer <var class=\"var\">from-buffer-or-"
"name</var> into the current buffer before point.  The text inserted is the "
"region between <var class=\"var\">start</var> (inclusive) and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> (exclusive).  (These arguments default to the "
"beginning and end of the accessible portion of that buffer.)  This function "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファ <var class=\"var\">from-buffer-or-name</var> の一部をポ"
"イント前の現在のバッファに挿入します。挿入されるテキストは、<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var>（含む）から <var class=\"var\">end</var>（含まな"
"い）までの領域です。（これらの引数のデフォルト値は、そのバッファのアクセス可"
"能な領域の先頭と末尾となります。）この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"In this example, the form is executed with buffer &lsquo;<samp "
