"name\">insert-into-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">to-"
"buffer &amp;optional start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"insert_002dinto_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">insert-into-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">to-"
"buffer &amp;optional start end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"insert_002dinto_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Insertion.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code>, but works "
"in the opposite direction: the text is copied from the current buffer into "
"<var class=\"var\">to-buffer</var>.  The block of text is copied to the "
"buffer point in <var class=\"var\">to-buffer</var> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Point.html\">Point</a>), and the buffer point is advanced to after "
"the end of the copied text.  If <code class=\"code\">start</code>/<code "
"class=\"code\">end</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the entire "
"text in the current buffer is copied over."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> に似ていますが、逆"
"の方向に動作します。現在のバッファから <var class=\"var\">to-buffer</var> へ"
"テキストがコピーされます。テキストのブロックは <var class=\"var\">to-buffer</"
"var> のバッファポイント（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Point.html\">Point</a> を"
"参照）にコピーされ、バッファポイントはコピーされたテキストの末尾の後に進みま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">start</code>/<code class=\"code\">end</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、現在のバッファ内のテキスト全体がコ"
"ピーされます。"

