#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Instrumenting.html
msgid ""
"When you invoke command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-defun</code>) with a prefix argument on a function "
"definition, it instruments the definition before evaluating it.  (This does "
"not modify the source code itself.)  If the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-all-defs</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that inverts the meaning of the prefix argument: in this case, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> instruments the definition <em "
"class=\"emph\">unless</em> it has a prefix argument.  The default value of "
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-all-defs</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x edebug-all-defs</kbd> toggles the "
"value of the variable <code class=\"code\">edebug-all-defs</code>."
msgstr ""

