#: build/html/elisp/Integer-Basics.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the greatest &ldquo;small&rdquo; integer that "
"Emacs Lisp can handle.  Typical values are 2**29 &minus; 1 on 32-bit and "
"2**61 &minus; 1 on 64-bit platforms."
msgstr ""
