# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Integer-Basics.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the numerically least &ldquo;small&rdquo; "
"integer that Emacs Lisp can handle.  It is negative.  Typical values are "
"&minus;2**29 on 32-bit and &minus;2**61 on 64-bit platforms."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、Emacs Lispが扱える数値的に最小の「小さい」整数です。値は負と"
"なります。代表的な値は、32ビットプラットフォームでは &minus;2**29、64ビットプ"
"ラットフォームでは &minus;2**61 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Integer-Basics.html
