# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.3 Interactive Call<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Interactive-"
"Call-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.3 インタラクティブコール<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Interactive-Call-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive-call\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive-call\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"After the command loop has translated a key sequence into a command, it "
"invokes that command using the function <code class=\"code\">command-"
"execute</code>.  If the command is a function, <code class=\"code\">command-"
"execute</code> calls <code class=\"code\">call-interactively</code>, which "
"reads the arguments and calls the command.  You can also call these "
"functions yourself."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"Note that the term &ldquo;command&rdquo;, in this context, refers to an "
"interactively callable function (or function-like object), or a keyboard "
"macro.  It does not refer to the key sequence used to invoke a command (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keymaps.html\">Keymaps</a>)."
msgstr ""
"なお、この文脈における「コマンド」という用語は、対話的に呼び出し可能な関数"
"（または関数のようなオブジェクト）、あるいはキーボードマクロを指します。コマ"
"ンドの実行に使用されるキーシーケンスを指すものではありません（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keymaps.html\">キーマップ</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">commandp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object "
"&amp;optional for-call-interactively</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-commandp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">commandp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object "
"&amp;optional for-call-interactively</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-commandp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a command.  Otherwise, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> がコマンドである場合に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。そうでない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"Commands include strings and vectors (which are treated as keyboard macros), "
"lambda expressions that contain a top-level <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> form (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Using-"
"Interactive.html\">Using <code class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>), byte-"
"code function objects made from such lambda expressions, autoload objects "
"that are declared as interactive (non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> fourth "
"argument to <code class=\"code\">autoload</code>), and some primitive "
"functions.  Also, a symbol is considered a command if it has a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">interactive-form</code> "
"property, or if its function definition satisfies <code "
"class=\"code\">commandp</code>."
msgstr ""
"コマンドには、文字列やベクトル（キーボードマクロとして扱われる）、トップレベ"
"ルの <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> 形式を含むラムダ式（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Using-Interactive.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> の使用</a> を参照）、こうしたラムダ式から生"
"成されたバイトコード関数オブジェクト、インタラクティブとして宣言されたオート"
"ロードオブジェクト（<code class=\"code\">autoload</code> の第4引数が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではないもの）、およびいくつかのプリミティブ関数が"
"含まれます。また、シンボルが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive-form</code> プロパティを持つか、あるいはその関数定"
"義が <code class=\"code\">commandp</code> を満たす場合、そのシンボルはコマン"
"ドとみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">for-call-interactively</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then <code class=\"code\">commandp</code> returns "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> only for objects that <code "
"class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> could call&mdash;thus, not for "
"keyboard macros."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">for-call-interactively</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、<code class=\"code\">commandp</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> が呼び出せるオブジェクトに対しての"
"み <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。つまり、キーボードマクロに対して"
"は返されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"See <code class=\"code\">documentation</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Accessing-Documentation.html\">Access to Documentation Strings</a>, "
"for a realistic example of using <code class=\"code\">commandp</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">commandp</code> の具体的な使用例については、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Accessing-Documentation.html\">ドキュメント文字列へのア"
"クセス</a> の <code class=\"code\">documentation</code> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">call-interactively</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional record-flag keys</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"call_002dinteractively\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">call-interactively</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional record-flag keys</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"call_002dinteractively\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"This function calls the interactively callable function <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var>, providing arguments according to its "
"interactive calling specifications.  It returns whatever <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> returns."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、対話的に呼び出し可能な関数 <var class=\"var\">command</var> を、"
"その対話的呼び出し仕様に従って引数を渡して呼び出します。そして、<var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> が返す値をそのまま返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid "If, for instance, you have a function with the following signature:"
msgstr "例えば、次のようなシグネチャを持つ関数があるとします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo (begin end)\n"
"  (interactive &quot;r&quot;)\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid "then saying"
msgstr "それから言って"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(call-interactively 'foo)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"will call <code class=\"code\">foo</code> with the region (<code "
"class=\"code\">point</code> and <code class=\"code\">mark</code>) as the "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"リージョン（<code class=\"code\">point</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">mark</code>）を引数として will call <code class=\"code\">foo</"
"code> を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"An error is signaled if <var class=\"var\">command</var> is not a function "
"or if it cannot be called interactively (i.e., is not a command).  Note that "
"keyboard macros (strings and vectors) are not accepted, even though they are "
"considered commands, because they are not functions.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> is a symbol, then <code class=\"code\">call-"
"interactively</code> uses its function definition."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">command</var> が関数でない場合、または対話的に呼び出せない"
"（すなわちコマンドではない）場合は、エラーが報告されます。なお、キーボードマ"
"クロ（文字列やベクトル）はコマンドとみなされますが、関数ではないため受け付け"
"られません。<var class=\"var\">command</var> がシンボルである場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> はその関数定義を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-record-command-history\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-record-command-history\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">record-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then this command and its arguments are unconditionally added to the "
"list <code class=\"code\">command-history</code>.  Otherwise, the command is "
"added only if it uses the minibuffer to read an argument.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-History.html\">Command History</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">record-flag</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でな"
"い場合、このコマンドとその引数は無条件にリスト <code class=\"code\">command-"
"history</code> に追加されます。そうでない場合は、ミニバッファを使用して引数を"
"読み取る場合に限り、コマンドが追加されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-"
"History.html\">コマンド履歴</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">keys</var>, if given, should be a vector "
"which specifies the sequence of events to supply if the command inquires "
"which events were used to invoke it.  If <var class=\"var\">keys</var> is "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the default is the return value "
"of <code class=\"code\">this-command-keys-vector</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html#Definition-of-"
"this_002dcommand_002dkeys_002dvector\">Definition of this-command-keys-"
"vector</a>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">keys</var> が指定された場合、コマンドが呼び出しに使用"
"されたイベントを問い合わせた際に提供すべきイベントのシーケンスを指定するベク"
"トルである必要があります。<var class=\"var\">keys</var> が省略された場合、ま"
"たは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合、デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command-keys-vector</code> の戻り値となります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html#Definition-of-"
"this_002dcommand_002dkeys_002dvector\">this-command-keys-vector の定義</a> を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">funcall-interactively</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function &amp;rest arguments</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-funcall_002dinteractively\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">funcall-interactively</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function &amp;rest arguments</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-funcall_002dinteractively\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"This function works like <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Calling-Functions.html\">Calling Functions</a>), but "
"it makes the call look like an interactive invocation: a call to <code "
"class=\"code\">called-interactively-p</code> inside <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> will return <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> is not a command, it is called without "
"signaling an error."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> と同様に動作しますが（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Calling-Functions.html\">関数の呼び出し</a> を参照）、"
"呼び出しが対話的な呼び出しのように見えます。つまり、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> 内で <code class=\"code\">called-interactively-"
"p</code> を呼び出すと <code class=\"code\">t</code> が返されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> がコマンドでない場合は、エラーを通知せずに呼び出"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-execute</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional record-flag keys special</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-command_002dexecute\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-execute</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional record-flag keys special</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-command_002dexecute\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-macro-execution\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-macro-execution\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"This function executes <var class=\"var\">command</var>.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> must satisfy the <code class=\"code\">commandp</"
"code> predicate; i.e., it must be an interactively callable function or a "
"keyboard macro."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">command</var> を実行します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> は <code class=\"code\">commandp</code> 述語を満"
"たす必要があります。すなわち、対話的に呼び出し可能な関数またはキーボードマク"
"ロである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"A string or vector as <var class=\"var\">command</var> is executed with "
"<code class=\"code\">execute-kbd-macro</code>.  A function is passed to "
"<code class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> (see above), along with the "
"<var class=\"var\">record-flag</var> and <var class=\"var\">keys</var> "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">command</var> のような文字列やベクトルは、<code "
"class=\"code\">execute-kbd-macro</code> で実行されます。関数は、<var "
"class=\"var\">record-flag</var> および <var class=\"var\">keys</var> 引数とと"
"もに、<code class=\"code\">call-interactively</code> に渡されます（上記参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">command</var> is a symbol, its function definition is "
"used in its place.  A symbol with an <code class=\"code\">autoload</code> "
"definition counts as a command if it was declared to stand for an "
"interactively callable function.  Such a definition is handled by loading "
"the specified library and then rechecking the definition of the symbol."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">command</var> がシンボルである場合、代わりにその関数定義が"
"使用されます。<code class=\"code\">autoload</code> 定義を持つシンボルは、対話"
"的に呼び出し可能な関数を表すものとして宣言されていれば、コマンドとして扱われ"
"ます。このような定義は、指定されたライブラリをロードした上で、当該シンボルの"
"定義を再チェックすることで処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">special</var>, if given, means to ignore the "
"prefix argument and not clear it.  This is used for executing special events "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Events.html\">Special Events</a>)."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">special</var> が指定された場合、プレフィックス引数を"
"無視し、クリアしないことを意味します。これは、特殊なイベントの実行に使用され"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Events.html\">特殊なイベント</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
