# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a command name from the minibuffer using <code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a>).  Then it uses <code "
"class=\"code\">command-execute</code> to call the specified command.  "
"Whatever that command returns becomes the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> を用いてミニバッファ"
"からコマンド名を読み込みます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a> を参照）。次に、<code "
"class=\"code\">command-execute</code> を使用して指定されたコマンドを呼び出し"
"ます。そのコマンドが返す値が、<code class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</"
"code> の値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-execute-with-prefix-argument\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-execute-with-prefix-argument\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"If the command asks for a prefix argument, it receives the value <var "
"class=\"var\">prefix-argument</var>.  If <code class=\"code\">execute-"
"extended-command</code> is called interactively, the current raw prefix "
"argument is used for <var class=\"var\">prefix-argument</var>, and thus "
"passed on to whatever command is run."
msgstr ""
"コマンドがプレフィックス引数を要求した場合、<var class=\"var\">prefix-"
"argument</var> という値が渡されます。<code class=\"code\">execute-extended-"
"command</code> が対話的に呼び出された場合、現在の生のプレフィックス引数が "
"<var class=\"var\">prefix-argument</var> に使用され、そのまま実行されるコマン"
"ドへと渡されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
