# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code>, but "
"limits the commands offered for completion to those commands that are of "
"particular relevance to the current major mode (and enabled minor modes).  "
"This includes commands that are tagged with the modes (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Using-Interactive.html\">Using <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>), and also commands that are bound to "
"locally active keymaps.  This command is the normal definition of <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-S-x</kbd> (that&rsquo;s &ldquo;meta shift x&rdquo;)."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code> に似ていますが、"
"補完に提供されるコマンドを、現在のメジャーモード（および有効なマイナーモー"
"ド）に特に関連のあるものに限定します。これには、モードのタグが付いたコマンド"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Using-Interactive.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> の使用</a> を参照）や、ローカルで有効なキー"
"マップにバインドされたコマンドが含まれます。このコマンドは、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-S-x</kbd>（すなわち「meta shift x」）の通常の定義です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Call.html
msgid ""
"Both these commands prompt for a command name, but with different completion "
"rules.  You can toggle between these two modes by using the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-S-x</kbd> command while being prompted."
msgstr ""
"これら2つのコマンドはいずれもコマンド名の入力を求めますが、補完ルールが異なり"
"ます。入力中に <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-S-x</kbd> コマンドを使用することで、これ"
"ら2つのモードを切り替えることができます。"

