# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Codes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">k</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">k</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Codes.html
msgid ""
"A key sequence (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">Key "
"Sequences</a>).  This keeps reading events until a command (or undefined "
"command) is found in the current key maps.  The key sequence argument is "
"represented as a string or vector.  The cursor does not move into the echo "
"area.  Prompt."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンス（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">キーシーケンス"
"</a>を参照）。これにより、現在のキーマップ内でコマンド（または未定義のコマン"
"ド）が見つかるまで、読み取りイベントが継続されます。キーシーケンスの引数は、"
"文字列またはベクトルとして指定されます。カーソルはエコーエリアに移動しませ"
"ん。プロンプト。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Codes.html
msgid ""
"If &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">k</samp>&rsquo; reads a key sequence that "
"ends with a down-event, it also reads and discards the following up-event.  "
"You can get access to that up-event with the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">U</"
"samp>&rsquo; code character."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">k</samp>&rsquo;がダウンイベントで終わるキーシーケ"
"ンスを読み取った場合、後続のアップイベントも読み取って破棄します。そのアップ"
"イベントには、コード文字&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">U</samp>&rsquo;でアクセス"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Codes.html
msgid ""
"This kind of input is used by commands such as <code class=\"code\">describe-"
"key</code> and <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code>."
msgstr ""
"この種の入力は、<code class=\"code\">describe-key</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> といったコマンドで使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Codes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">K</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">K</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Interactive-Codes.html
msgid ""
"A key sequence on a form that can be used as input to functions like <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code>.  This works like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">k</samp>&rsquo;, except that it suppresses, for the last "
"input event in the key sequence, the conversions that are normally used "
"(when necessary) to convert an undefined key into a defined one (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">Key Sequence Input</a>), so "
"this form is usually used when prompting for a new key sequence that is to "
"be bound to a command."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> などの関数への入力として使用できる、"
"フォーム上のキーシーケンス。これは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">k</"
"samp>&rsquo; と同様に動作しますが、キーシーケンスの最後の入力イベントにおい"
"て、通常は（必要に応じて）未定義のキーを定義済みのキーに変換するために用いら"
"れる変換処理（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケ"
"ンス入力</a> を参照）を抑制します。そのため、この形式は通常、コマンドにバイン"
