# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.1.11 Internals of the Debugger<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Internals-of-the-Debugger\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.1.11 デバッガの内部<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Internals-of-"
"the-Debugger\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions and variables used internally by the "
"debugger."
msgstr ""
"このセクションでは、デバッガが内部的に使用している関数や変数について説明しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debugger</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-debugger\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debugger</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-debugger\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the function to call to invoke the debugger.  "
"Its value must be a function of any number of arguments, or, more typically, "
"the name of a function.  This function should invoke some kind of debugger.  "
"The default value of the variable is <code class=\"code\">debug</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、デバッガを呼び出すために実行する関数です。その値は、任意の数"
"の引数を取る関数であるか、あるいはより一般的には関数名である必要があります。"
"この関数は、何らかのデバッガを呼び出す必要があります。この変数のデフォルト値"
"は <code class=\"code\">debug</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"The first argument that Lisp hands to the function indicates why it was "
"called.  The convention for arguments is detailed in the description of "
"<code class=\"code\">debug</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Invoking-"
"the-Debugger.html\">Invoking the Debugger</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Lispが関数に渡す第1引数は、なぜその関数が呼び出されたのかを示します。引数に関"
"する規約については、<code class=\"code\">debug</code>の説明に詳しく記載されて"
"います（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Invoking-the-Debugger.html\">デバッガの呼び"
"出し</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backtrace</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backtrace\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backtrace</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backtrace\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-run-time-stack\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-call-stack\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-run-time-stack\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-call-stack\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"This function prints a trace of Lisp function calls currently active.  The "
"trace is identical to the one that <code class=\"code\">debug</code> would "
"show in the <samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> buffer.  The return "
"value is always <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在アクティブなLisp関数呼び出しのトレースを出力します。このト"
"レースは、<code class=\"code\">debug</code> が <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> バッファに表示するものと同一です。戻り値は"
"常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, a Lisp expression calls <code "
"class=\"code\">backtrace</code> explicitly.  This prints the backtrace to "
"the stream <code class=\"code\">standard-output</code>, which, in this case, "
"is the buffer &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">backtrace-output</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"Each line of the backtrace represents one function call.  The line shows the "
"function followed by a list of the values of the function&rsquo;s arguments "
"if they are all known; if they are still being computed, the line consists "
"of a list containing the function and its unevaluated arguments.  Long lists "
"or deeply nested structures may be elided."
msgstr ""
"バックトレースの各行は、1回の関数呼び出しを表します。各行には関数名が記載さ"
"れ、引数がすべて判明している場合はその値の一覧が続きます。引数がまだ計算中の"
"場合は、関数名と未評価の引数を含むリストで構成されます。長いリストや深くネス"
"トされた構造は、省略されることがあります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(with-output-to-temp-buffer &quot;backtrace-output&quot;\n"
"  (let ((var 1))\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      (setq var (eval '(progn\n"
"                         (1+ var)\n"
"                         (list 'testing (backtrace))))))))\n"
"\n"
"     &rArr; (testing nil)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"----------- Buffer: backtrace-output ------------\n"
"  backtrace()\n"
"  (list 'testing (backtrace))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (progn ...)\n"
"  eval((progn (1+ var) (list 'testing (backtrace))))\n"
"  (setq ...)\n"
"  (save-excursion ...)\n"
"  (let ...)\n"
"  (with-output-to-temp-buffer ...)\n"
"  eval((with-output-to-temp-buffer ...))\n"
"  eval-last-sexp-1(nil)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  eval-last-sexp(nil)\n"
"  call-interactively(eval-last-sexp)\n"
"----------- Buffer: backtrace-output ------------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debugger-stack-frame-as-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-debugger_002dstack_002dframe_002das_002dlist\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">debugger-stack-frame-as-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-debugger_002dstack_002dframe_002das_002dlist\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, every stack frame "
"of the backtrace is displayed as a list.  This aims at improving the "
"backtrace readability at the cost of special forms no longer being visually "
"different from regular function calls."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、バックトレースの各ス"
"タックフレームがリスト形式で表示されます。これは、特殊形式が通常の関数呼び出"
"しと視覚的に区別できなくなるという代償と引き換えに、バックトレースの可読性を"
"向上させることを目的としています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"With <code class=\"code\">debugger-stack-frame-as-list</code> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the above example would look as follows:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">debugger-stack-frame-as-list</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、上記の例は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"----------- Buffer: backtrace-output ------------\n"
"  (backtrace)\n"
"  (list 'testing (backtrace))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (progn ...)\n"
"  (eval (progn (1+ var) (list 'testing (backtrace))))\n"
"  (setq ...)\n"
"  (save-excursion ...)\n"
"  (let ...)\n"
"  (with-output-to-temp-buffer ...)\n"
"  (eval (with-output-to-temp-buffer ...))\n"
"  (eval-last-sexp-1 nil)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (eval-last-sexp nil)\n"
"  (call-interactively eval-last-sexp)\n"
"----------- Buffer: backtrace-output ------------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debug-on-next-call</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"debug_002don_002dnext_002dcall\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debug-on-next-call</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"debug_002don_002dnext_002dcall\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval_002c-and-debugging\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-apply_002c-and-debugging\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-funcall_002c-and-debugging\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval_002c-and-debugging\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-apply_002c-and-debugging\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-funcall_002c-and-debugging\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it says to call the "
"debugger before the next <code class=\"code\">eval</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">apply</code> or <code class=\"code\">funcall</code>.  "
"Entering the debugger sets <code class=\"code\">debug-on-next-call</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、次の<code "
"class=\"code\">eval</code>、<code class=\"code\">apply</code>、または<code "
"class=\"code\">funcall</code>の前にデバッガを呼び出すよう指示します。デバッガ"
"に入ると、<code class=\"code\">debug-on-next-call</code>に<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>が設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> command in the debugger works by setting this "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"デバッガの <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> コマンドは、この変数を設定することで動"
"作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backtrace-debug</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">level flag</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-backtrace_002ddebug\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backtrace-debug</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">level flag</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-backtrace_002ddebug\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the debug-on-exit flag of the stack frame <var "
"class=\"var\">level</var> levels down the stack, giving it the value <var "
"class=\"var\">flag</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">flag</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this will cause the debugger to be entered when "
"that frame later exits.  Even a nonlocal exit through that frame will enter "
"the debugger."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、スタックを <var class=\"var\">level</var> レベル遡った位置にある"
"スタックフレームの debug-on-exit フラグを設定し、その値を <var "
"class=\"var\">flag</var> にします。<var class=\"var\">flag</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、そのフレームが後に終了する際にデバッガ"
"が起動します。そのフレームを介した非ローカルな終了であっても、デバッガが起動"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid "This function is used only by the debugger."
msgstr "この関数はデバッガでのみ使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-debug-status</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"command_002ddebug_002dstatus\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-debug-status</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"command_002ddebug_002dstatus\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"This variable records the debugging status of the current interactive "
"command.  Each time a command is called interactively, this variable is "
"bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The debugger can set this "
"variable to leave information for future debugger invocations during the "
"same command invocation."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、現在の対話型コマンドのデバッグ状態を記録します。コマンドが対話的"
"に呼び出されるたびに、この変数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドさ"
"れます。デバッガはこの変数を設定することで、同一のコマンド呼び出しにおける後"
"続のデバッガ呼び出しに向けた情報を残すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"The advantage of using this variable rather than an ordinary global variable "
"is that the data will never carry over to a subsequent command invocation."
msgstr ""
"通常のグローバル変数ではなくこの変数を使用する利点は、データが後続のコマンド"
"呼び出しに引き継がれることがない点にあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid "This variable is obsolete and will be removed in future versions."
msgstr "この変数は非推奨となっており、今後のバージョンで削除される予定です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backtrace-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame-"
"number &amp;optional base</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backtrace_002dframe\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backtrace-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame-"
"number &amp;optional base</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backtrace_002dframe\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">backtrace-frame</code> is intended for use "
"in Lisp debuggers.  It returns information about what computation is "
"happening in the stack frame <var class=\"var\">frame-number</var> levels "
"down."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">backtrace-frame</code> は、Lisp デバッガでの使用を"
"想定しています。この関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame-number</var> レベル下の"
"スタックフレームでどのような計算が行われているかに関する情報を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If that frame has not evaluated the arguments yet, or is a special form, the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">(nil <var class=\"var\">function</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">arg-forms</var>&hellip;)</code>."
msgstr ""
"そのフレームがまだ引数を評価していないか、あるいは特殊形式である場合、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">(nil <var class=\"var\">function</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">arg-forms</var>&hellip;)</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If that frame has evaluated its arguments and called its function already, "
"the return value is <code class=\"code\">(t <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">arg-values</var>&hellip;)</code>."
msgstr ""
"そのフレームがすでに引数を評価し、関数を呼び出している場合、戻り値は <code "
"class=\"code\">(t <var class=\"var\">function</var> <var class=\"var\">arg-"
"values</var>&hellip;)</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"In the return value, <var class=\"var\">function</var> is whatever was "
"supplied as the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of the evaluated list, or a "
"<code class=\"code\">lambda</code> expression in the case of a macro call.  "
"If the function has a <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> argument, that "
"is represented as the tail of the list <var class=\"var\">arg-values</var>."
msgstr ""
"戻り値において、<var class=\"var\">function</var> は評価されたリストの "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> として指定された値、あるいはマクロ呼び出しの"
"場合は <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> 式となります。関数に <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> 引数がある場合は、それがリスト <var "
"class=\"var\">arg-values</var> の末尾として表現されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">base</var> is specified, <var class=\"var\">frame-"
"number</var> counts relative to the topmost frame whose <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> is <var class=\"var\">base</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">base</var> が指定されている場合、<var class=\"var\">frame-"
"number</var> は <var class=\"var\">function</var> が <var "
"class=\"var\">base</var> である最上位フレームを基準にカウントされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">frame-number</var> is out of range, <code "
"class=\"code\">backtrace-frame</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">frame-number</var> が範囲外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">backtrace-frame</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapbacktrace</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function "
"&amp;optional base</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mapbacktrace\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapbacktrace</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function "
"&amp;optional base</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mapbacktrace\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">mapbacktrace</code> calls <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> once for each frame in the backtrace, starting "
"at the first frame whose function is <var class=\"var\">base</var> (or from "
"the top if <var class=\"var\">base</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>)."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">mapbacktrace</code> は、関数 <var "
"class=\"var\">base</var> を持つ最初のフレーム（<var class=\"var\">base</var> "
"が省略されているか <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は最上部）から、バッ"
"クトレースの各フレームに対して <var class=\"var\">function</var> を1回ずつ呼"
"び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> is called with four arguments: <var "
"class=\"var\">evald</var>, <var class=\"var\">func</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var>, and <var class=\"var\">flags</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var>は、<var class=\"var\">evald</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">func</var>、<var class=\"var\">args</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">flags</var>の4つの引数で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If a frame has not evaluated its arguments yet or is a special form, <var "
"class=\"var\">evald</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> is a list of forms."
msgstr ""
"フレームがまだ引数を評価していないか、あるいは特殊形式である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">evald</var> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となり、<var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> は形式のリストとなる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Internals-of-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If a frame has evaluated its arguments and called its function already, <var "
"class=\"var\">evald</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code> and <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> is a list of values.  <var class=\"var\">flags</"
"var> is a plist of properties of the current frame: currently, the only "
"supported property is <code class=\"code\">:debug-on-exit</code>, which is "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> if the stack frame&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">debug-on-exit</code> flag is set."
msgstr ""
"フレームがすでに引数を評価し、関数を呼び出している場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">evald</var> は <code class=\"code\">t</code> となり、<var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> は値のリストとなります。<var class=\"var\">flags</"
"var> は現在のフレームのプロパティのプリリストです。現在、サポートされている唯"
"一のプロパティは <code class=\"code\">:debug-on-exit</code> であり、スタック"
"フレームの <code class=\"code\">debug-on-exit</code> フラグがセットされている"
"場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> となります。"

