# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Intro-Eval.html
msgid ""
"This definition of &ldquo;environment&rdquo; is specifically not intended to "
"include all the data that can affect the result of a program."
msgstr ""
