msgstr "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">atom</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"A character is invisible if its <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> "
"property value is <var class=\"var\">atom</var> or if it is a list with <var "
"class=\"var\">atom</var> as a member; comparison is done with <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">invisible</code>プロパティの値が<var "
"class=\"var\">atom</var>であるか、または<var class=\"var\">atom</var>を要素に"
"持つリストである場合、その文字は不可視となります。比較は<code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>を用いて行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dt>
