msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">atom</var> . t)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"A character is invisible if its <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> "
"property value is <var class=\"var\">atom</var> or if it is a list with <var "
"class=\"var\">atom</var> as a member; comparison is done with <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>.  Moreover, a sequence of such characters displays "
"as an ellipsis."
msgstr ""
"文字の <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> プロパティ値が <var "
"class=\"var\">atom</var> であるか、または <var class=\"var\">atom</var> を要"
"素とするリストである場合、その文字は不可視となり、<code class=\"code\">eq</"
"code> との比較が行われます。さらに、このような文字が連続すると、省略記号とし"
"て表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"Two functions are specifically provided for adding elements to <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> and removing elements from it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> への要素の追加と削除のた"
"めに、2つの関数が特別に用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">add-to-invisibility-spec</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">element</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"add_002dto_002dinvisibility_002dspec\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">add-to-invisibility-spec</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">element</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"add_002dto_002dinvisibility_002dspec\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function adds the element <var class=\"var\">element</var> to <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code>.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> was <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, it changes to a list, <code class=\"code\">(t)</code>, so that text "
"whose <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> property is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> remains invisible."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、要素 <var class=\"var\">element</var> を <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> に追加します。<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> が <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> であった場合、リスト <code class=\"code\">(t)</code> に変更され、<code "
"class=\"code\">invisible</code> プロパティが <code class=\"code\">t</code> で"
"あるテキストは非表示のままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">remove-from-invisibility-spec</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">element</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"remove_002dfrom_002dinvisibility_002dspec\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">remove-from-invisibility-spec</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">element</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"remove_002dfrom_002dinvisibility_002dspec\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"This removes the element <var class=\"var\">element</var> from <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code>.  This does nothing if <var "
"class=\"var\">element</var> is not in the list."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> から要素 "
"<var class=\"var\">element</var> が削除されます。<var class=\"var\">element</"
"var> がリストに含まれていない場合は、何も行われません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
msgid ""
"A convention for use of <code class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> "
"is that a major mode should use the mode&rsquo;s own name as an element of "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> and as the value of the "
"<code class=\"code\">invisible</code> property:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> の使用に関する慣例では、"
"メジャーモードは <code class=\"code\">buffer-invisibility-spec</code> の要素"
"として、また <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> プロパティの値として、その"
"モード自身の名称を使用することになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Invisible-Text.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">If you want to display an ellipsis:</span>\n"
