#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Debugger.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the default, "
"entering the debugger in batch mode shows the backtrace of Lisp functions "
"calls.  Binding the variable to the <code class=\"code\">nil</code> value "
"suppresses the backtrace and shows only the error message."
