#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.8.4 Invoking the Input Method<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Invoking-the-Input-Method-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.8.4 入力メソッドの呼び出し<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Invoking-the-Input-Method-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invoking-input-method\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invoking-input-method\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"The event-reading functions invoke the current input method, if any (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input Methods</a>).  If the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">input-method-function</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should be a function; when <code "
"class=\"code\">read-event</code> reads a printing character (including <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>) with no modifier bits, it calls that function, "
"passing the character as an argument."
msgstr ""
"イベント読み取り関数は、現在の入力メソッドがあればそれを呼び出します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">入力メソッド</a>を参照）。<code "
"class=\"code\">input-method-function</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合は関数である必要があり、<code class=\"code\">read-event</"
"code> が修飾ビットのない印字文字（<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> を含む）を読み"
"取る際は、その文字を引数として渡して当該関数を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">input-method-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-input_002dmethod_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">input-method-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-input_002dmethod_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, its value specifies the "
"current input method function."
msgstr ""
"これが non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、その値は現在の入力メソッド"
"関数を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> don&rsquo;t bind this variable "
"with <code class=\"code\">let</code>.  It is often buffer-local, and if you "
"bind it around reading input (which is exactly when you <em "
"class=\"emph\">would</em> bind it), switching buffers asynchronously while "
"Emacs is waiting will cause the value to be restored in the wrong buffer."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> この変数を <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> でバインドしないでください。この変数はバッファロー"
"カルである場合が多く、入力の読み取り前後でバインドすると（まさにそのようなタ"
"イミングでバインド<em class=\"emph\">しがち</em>ですが）、Emacs が待機してい"
"る間に非同期でバッファを切り替えた際、値が誤ったバッファに復元されてしまいま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"The input method function should return a list of events which should be "
"used as input.  (If the list is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means "
"there is no input, so <code class=\"code\">read-event</code> waits for "
"another event.)  These events are processed before the events in <code "
"class=\"code\">unread-command-events</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Event-Input-Misc.html\">Miscellaneous Event Input Features</a>).  "
"Events returned by the input method function are not passed to the input "
"method function again, even if they are printing characters with no modifier "
"bits."
msgstr ""
"入力メソッド関数は、入力として使用されるイベントのリストを返す必要がありま"
"す。（リストが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は入力がないことを意味す"
"るため、<code class=\"code\">read-event</code> は別のイベントを待機します。）"
"これらのイベントは、<code class=\"code\">unread-command-events</code> 内のイ"
"ベントよりも先に処理されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Event-Input-"
"Misc.html\">その他のイベント入力機能</a>を参照）。入力メソッド関数によって返"
"されたイベントは、たとえ修飾ビットのない文字を出力する場合であっても、再度入"
"力メソッド関数に渡されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"If the input method function calls <code class=\"code\">read-event</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>, it should bind <code "
"class=\"code\">input-method-function</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> first, to prevent recursion."
msgstr ""
"入力メソッド関数が <code class=\"code\">read-event</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> を呼び出す場合は、再帰を防ぐため、ま"
"ず <code class=\"code\">input-method-function</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドすべきである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Invoking-the-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"The input method function is not called when reading the second and "
"subsequent events of a key sequence.  Thus, these characters are not subject "
"to input method processing.  The input method function should test the "
"values of <code class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code>; if either of these "
"variables is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the input method should "
"put its argument into a list and return that list with no further processing."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスの2番目以降のイベントを読み取る際、入力メソッド関数は呼び出され"
"ません。したがって、これらの文字は入力メソッドによる処理の対象となりません。"
"入力メソッド関数は <code class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code> の値を判定し、いずれかの"
"変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合は、その引数をリストに格"
"納し、さらなる処理を行うことなくそのリストを返す必要があります。"

