"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-iteration\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-recursion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-forms_002c-iteration\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"Iteration means executing part of a program repetitively.  For example, you "
"might want to repeat some computation once for each element of a list, or "
"once for each integer from 0 to <var class=\"var\">n</var>.  You can do this "
"in Emacs Lisp with the special form <code class=\"code\">while</code>:"
msgstr ""
"反復とは、プログラムの一部を繰り返し実行することを指します。例えば、リストの"
"各要素に対して、あるいは0から<var class=\"var\">n</var>までの各整数に対して、"
"ある計算を1回ずつ繰り返したい場合があるでしょう。Emacs Lispでは、特殊フォーム"
"<code class=\"code\">while</code>を用いてこれを行うことができます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">while</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-while\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">while</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">condition "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-while\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> first evaluates <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var>.  If the result is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it evaluates <var class=\"var\">forms</var> in "
"textual order.  Then it reevaluates <var class=\"var\">condition</var>, and "
"if the result is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it evaluates <var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var> again.  This process repeats until <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> evaluates to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> はまず <var class=\"var\">condition</var> "
"を評価する。その結果が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、テキスト"
"順に <var class=\"var\">forms</var> を評価する。次に <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> を再評価し、その結果が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、再び <var class=\"var\">forms</var> "
"を評価する。この処理は、<var class=\"var\">condition</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> と評価されるまで繰り返される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"There is no limit on the number of iterations that may occur.  The loop will "
"continue until either <var class=\"var\">condition</var> evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or until an error or <code class=\"code\">throw</"
"code> jumps out of it (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-"
"Exits.html\">Nonlocal Exits</a>)."
msgstr ""
"実行される反復回数に制限はありません。ループは、<var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> と評価される"
"か、あるいはエラーや <code class=\"code\">throw</code> によってループが抜ける"
"まで継続します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">非局所的な終"
"了</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"The value of a <code class=\"code\">while</code> form is always <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> フォームの値は常に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq num 0)\n"
"     &rArr; 0\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (&lt; num 4)\n"
"  (princ (format &quot;Iteration %d.&quot; num))\n"
"  (setq num (1+ num)))\n"
"     &#8867; Iteration 0.\n"
"     &#8867; Iteration 1.\n"
"     &#8867; Iteration 2.\n"
"     &#8867; Iteration 3.\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"To write a repeat-until loop, which will execute something on each iteration "
"and then do the end-test, put the body followed by the end-test in a <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> as the first argument of <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>, as shown here:"
msgstr ""
"各反復で処理を実行し、その後に終了判定を行う repeat-until ループを記述するに"
"は、ここに示すように、本体に続いて終了判定を記述したものを <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> とし、それを <code class=\"code\">while</code> の"
"第1引数として渡します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (progn\n"
"         (forward-line 1)\n"
"         (not (looking-at &quot;^$&quot;))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"This moves forward one line and continues moving by lines until it reaches "
"an empty line.  It is peculiar in that the <code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"has no body, just the end test (which also does the real work of moving "
"point)."
msgstr ""
"これは1行分進み、空行に到達するまで行単位で移動し続けます。<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>に本体がなく、終端判定（これが実際にポイントを移動"
"させる役割も担っています）のみがあるという点で独特です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> and <code class=\"code\">dotimes</"
"code> macros provide convenient ways to write two common kinds of loops."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> と <code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> マ"
"クロを使えば、よくある2種類のループを便利に記述できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dolist</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(var list [result]) "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dolist\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dolist</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(var list [result]) "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dolist\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"This construct executes <var class=\"var\">body</var> once for each element "
"of <var class=\"var\">list</var>, binding the variable <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> locally to hold the current element.  Then it "
"returns the value of evaluating <var class=\"var\">result</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">result</var> is omitted.  "
"For example, here is how you could use <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> to "
"define the <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> function:"
msgstr ""
"この構文は、<var class=\"var\">list</var> の各要素に対して <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> を1回ずつ実行し、変数 <var class=\"var\">var</var> "
"をローカルにバインドして現在の要素を保持します。その後、<var "
"class=\"var\">result</var> を評価した値、あるいは <var class=\"var\">result</"
"var> が省略されている場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を返します。"
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> を使用して <code "
"class=\"code\">reverse</code> 関数を定義する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun reverse (list)\n"
"  (let (value)\n"
"    (dolist (elt list value)\n"
"      (setq value (cons elt value)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dotimes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(var count "
"[result]) body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"dotimes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dotimes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">(var count "
"[result]) body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"dotimes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
msgid ""
"This construct executes <var class=\"var\">body</var> once for each integer "
"from 0 (inclusive) to <var class=\"var\">count</var> (exclusive), binding "
"the variable <var class=\"var\">var</var> to the integer for the current "
"iteration.  Then it returns the value of evaluating <var "
"class=\"var\">result</var>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">result</var> is omitted.  Use of <var class=\"var\">result</"
"var> is deprecated.  Here is an example of using <code "
"class=\"code\">dotimes</code> to do something 100 times:"
msgstr ""
"この構文は、0（含む）から<var class=\"var\">count</var>（除く）までの各整数に"
"対して<var class=\"var\">body</var>を1回ずつ実行し、現在の反復における整数に"
"変数<var class=\"var\">var</var>をバインドします。その後、<var "
"class=\"var\">result</var>を評価した値、あるいは<var class=\"var\">result</"
"var>が省略されている場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">result</var>の使用は非推奨です。以下に、<code "
"class=\"code\">dotimes</code>を使用して何かを100回行う例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Iteration.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(dotimes (i 100)\n"
"  (insert &quot;I will not obey absurd orders\\n&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

