# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-JSON-object-format.html
msgid ""
"JSONRPC JSON objects are exchanged as Lisp plists (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Property-Lists.html\">Property Lists</a>): JSON-compatible plists are "
"handed to the dispatcher functions and, likewise, JSON-compatible plists "
"should be given to <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-notify</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">jsonrpc-request</code>, and <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-"
"async-request</code>."
msgstr ""
"JSONRPC JSONオブジェクトは、Lispのプリスト（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Property-Lists.html\">プロパティリスト</a>を参照）としてやり取りされま"
"す。JSON互換のプリストはディスパッチャ関数に渡され、同様に、JSON互換のプリス"
"トは<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-notify</code>、<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-"
"request</code>、および<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-async-request</code>にも渡"
"される必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-JSON-object-format.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-jsonrpc_002dlambda\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-jsonrpc_002dlambda\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-JSON-object-format.html
msgid ""
"To facilitate handling plists, this library makes liberal use of <code "
"class=\"code\">cl-lib</code> library (see <a data-manual=\"cl\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/cl/"
"index.html#Top\">cl-lib</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">Common Lisp Extensions "
"for GNU Emacs Lisp</cite>) and suggests (but doesn&rsquo;t force) its "
"clients to do the same.  A macro <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-lambda</code> "
"can be used to create a lambda for destructuring a JSON-object like in this "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"plistの扱いを容易にするため、本ライブラリでは<code class=\"code\">cl-lib</"
"code>ライブラリ（<cite class=\"cite\">Common Lisp Extensions for GNU Emacs "
"Lisp</cite>の<a data-manual=\"cl\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/cl/index.html#Top\">cl-lib</a>を参照）を多用しており、クライ"
"アントに対しても同様の手法を推奨（ただし強制はしません）しています。マクロ"
"<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-lambda</code>を使用すると、以下の例のようにJSON"
"オブジェクトを構造分解するためのラムダを作成できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-JSON-object-format.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(jsonrpc-async-request\n"
" myproc :frobnicate `(:foo &quot;trix&quot;)\n"
" :success-fn (jsonrpc-lambda (&amp;key bar baz &amp;allow-other-keys)\n"
"               (message &quot;Server replied back with %s and %s!&quot;\n"
"                        bar baz))\n"
" :error-fn (jsonrpc-lambda (&amp;key code message _data)\n"
"             (message &quot;Sadly, server reports %s: %s&quot;\n"
"                      code message)))\n"
msgstr ""

