# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-deferred-requests.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-JSONRPC-deferred-requests\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-JSONRPC-deferred-requests\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-deferred-requests.html
msgid ""
"In many <abbr class=\"acronym\">RPC</abbr> situations, synchronization "
"between the two communicating endpoints is a matter of correctly designing "
"the RPC application: when synchronization is needed, requests (which are "
"blocking) should be used; when it isn&rsquo;t, notifications should "
"suffice.  However, when Emacs acts as one of these endpoints, asynchronous "
"events (e.g., timer- or process-related) may be triggered while there is "
"still uncertainty about the state of the remote endpoint.  Furthermore, "
"acting on these events may only sometimes demand synchronization, depending "
"on the event&rsquo;s specific nature."
msgstr ""
"多くの<abbr class=\"acronym\">RPC</abbr>の状況において、通信を行う2つのエンド"
"ポイント間の同期は、RPCアプリケーションを適切に設計することで実現されます。同"
"期が必要な場合は（ブロッキングとなる）リクエストを使用すべきであり、不要な場"
"合は通知で十分です。しかし、Emacsがこれらのエンドポイントのいずれかとして動作"
"する場合、リモートエンドポイントの状態が依然として不確定な間に、非同期イベン"
"ト（例：タイマーやプロセス関連）がトリガーされることがあります。さらに、これ"
"らのイベントへの対応に同期が必要となるかどうかは、イベントの具体的な性質に"
"よって異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-deferred-requests.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003adeferred_002c-JSONRPC-"
"keyword\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003adeferred_002c-JSONRPC-"
"keyword\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-deferred-requests.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">:deferred</code> keyword argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">jsonrpc-request</code> and <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-async-"
"request</code> is designed to let the caller indicate that the specific "
"request needs synchronization and its actual issuance may be delayed to the "
"future, until some condition is satisfied.  Specifying <code "
"class=\"code\">:deferred</code> for a request doesn&rsquo;t mean it <em "
"class=\"emph\">will</em> be delayed, only that it <em class=\"emph\">can</"
"em> be.  If the request isn&rsquo;t sent immediately, <code "
"class=\"code\">jsonrpc</code> will make renewed efforts to send it at "
"certain key times during communication, such as when receiving or sending "
"other messages to the endpoint."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-request</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">jsonrpc-async-request</code> のキーワード引数 <code "
"class=\"code\">:deferred</code> は、特定のリクエストに同期が必要であり、何ら"
"かの条件が満たされるまで実際の発行が後日に延期される可能性があることを呼び出"
"し側が指定できるように設計されています。リクエストに <code "
"class=\"code\">:deferred</code> を指定しても、それが<em class=\"emph\">必ず</"
"em>延期されるわけではなく、単に延期<em class=\"emph\">され得る</em>ということ"
"です。リクエストが直ちに送信されない場合、<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc</"
"code> は、エンドポイントへの他のメッセージの送受信時など、通信中の特定の重要"
"なタイミングで再送を試みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-deferred-requests.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"jsonrpc_002dconnection_002dready_002dp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"jsonrpc_002dconnection_002dready_002dp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/JSONRPC-deferred-requests.html
msgid ""
"Before any attempt to send the request, the application-specific conditions "
"are checked.  Since the <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc</code> library "
"can&rsquo;t know what these conditions are, the program can use the <code "
"class=\"code\">jsonrpc-connection-ready-p</code> generic function (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Generic-Functions.html\">Generic Functions</a>) to "
"specify them.  The default method for this function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, but you can add overriding methods that return "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> in some situations, based on the arguments "
"passed to it, which are the <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-connection</code> "
"object (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"JSONRPC-Overview.html\">Overview</a>) "
"and whichever value you passed as the <code class=\"code\">:deferred</code> "
"keyword argument."
msgstr ""
"リクエストを送信しようとする前に、アプリケーション固有の条件がチェックされま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">jsonrpc</code> ライブラリはこれらの条件を把握できな"
"いため、プログラムでは <code class=\"code\">jsonrpc-connection-ready-p</"
"code> 汎用関数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Generic-Functions.html\">汎用関数</"
"a> を参照）を使用してそれらを指定できます。この関数のデフォルトメソッドは "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返しますが、渡された引数（<code "
"class=\"code\">jsonrpc-connection</code> オブジェクト（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"JSONRPC-Overview.html\">概要</a> を参照）および <code "
"class=\"code\">:deferred</code> キーワード引数として渡した値）に基づいて、特"
"定の状況で <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すオーバーライドメソッドを追加"
"することも可能です。"

