# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Jumping.html
msgid ""
"Run the program for one expression (<code class=\"code\">edebug-forward-"
"sexp</code>)."
msgstr ""
"1つの式（<code class=\"code\">edebug-forward-sexp</code>）に対してプログラム"
"を実行してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Jumping.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-edebug_002dstep_002dout\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">o</"
