# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span>23.16 Commands for Binding Keys<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Commands-for-Binding-Keys\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.16 キーバインド用のコマンド<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Commands-for-Binding-Keys\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This section describes some convenient interactive interfaces for changing "
"key bindings.  They work by calling <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">Changing Key "
"Bindings</a>).  In interactive use, these commands prompt for the argument "
"<var class=\"var\">key</var> and expect the user to type a valid key "
"sequence; they also prompt for the <var class=\"var\">binding</var> of the "
"key sequence, and expect the name of a command (i.e., a symbol that "
"satisfies <code class=\"code\">commandp</code>, see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>).  When called from "
"Lisp, these commands expect <var class=\"var\">key</var> to be a string that "
"satisfies <code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">Key Sequences</a>), and <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var> to be any Lisp object that is meaningful in a "
"keymap (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Lookup.html\">Key Lookup</a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節では、キーバインドを変更するための便利なインタラクティブインターフェース"
"をいくつか紹介します。これらは <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> を呼び"
"出すことで動作します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">"
"キーバインドの変更</a> を参照）。インタラクティブに使用する場合、これらのコマ"
"ンドは引数 <var class=\"var\">key</var> の入力を求め、ユーザーが有効なキー"
"シーケンスを入力することを期待します。また、キーシーケンスの <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var> の入力を求め、コマンド名（すなわち、<code "
"class=\"code\">commandp</code> を満たすシンボル。<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">インタラクティブ呼び出し</a> を参照）の入力を"
"期待します。Lisp から呼び出される場合、これらのコマンドは <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> が <code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> を満たす文"
"字列（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">キーシーケンス</a> を参"
"照）であること、および <var class=\"var\">binding</var> がキーマップにおいて"
"意味を持つ任意の Lisp オブジェクト（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Lookup.html\">キールックアップ</a> を参照）であることを期待します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid ""
"People often use <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> in their init "
"files (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Init File</a>) for "
"simple customization.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"簡単なカスタマイズのために、initファイル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">Initファイル</a>を参照）で<code class=\"code\">keymap-global-"
"set</code>がよく使われます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-x C-\\\\&quot; 'next-line)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid "redefines <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-\\</kbd> to move down a line."
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-\\</kbd> を再定義して1行下に移動させる。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;M-&lt;mouse-1&gt;&quot; 'mouse-set-point)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid ""
"redefines the first (leftmost) mouse button, entered with the Meta key, to "
"set point where you click."
msgstr ""
"Metaキーを押しながら押す1番目（一番左）のマウスボタンを、クリックした地点を設"
"定するための操作として再定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-non_002dASCII-text-in-key-"
"bindings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-non_002dASCII-text-in-key-"
"bindings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Binding-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Be careful when using non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> text "
"characters in Lisp specifications of keys to bind.  If these are read as "
"multibyte text, as they usually will be in a Lisp file (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loading-Non_002dASCII.html\">Loading Non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> Characters</a>), you must type the keys as "
"multibyte too.  For instance, if you use this:"
msgstr ""
"バインドするキーをLispで指定する際、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>以外"
"のテキスト文字を使用する場合はご注意ください。Lispファイルでは通常そうである"
"ように、これらがマルチバイトテキストとして読み込まれる場合（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loading-Non_002dASCII.html\">非<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字の読み込み</a>を参照）、キーもマルチバイト"
"で入力する必要があります。例えば、次のように記述した場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
