msgid ""
"<span>22.8.1 Key Sequence Input<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Key-"
"Sequence-Input-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.8.1 キーシーケンス入力<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Key-"
"Sequence-Input-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-sequence-input\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-sequence-input\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"The command loop reads input a key sequence at a time, by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>.  Lisp programs can also call this "
"function; for example, <code class=\"code\">describe-key</code> uses it to "
"read the key to describe."
msgstr ""
"コマンドループは、<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>を呼び出すこと"
"で、一度に1つのキーシーケンスを入力として読み込みます。Lispプログラムでもこの"
"関数を呼び出すことができ、例えば<code class=\"code\">describe-key</code>はこ"
"れを用いて説明対象のキーを読み込みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-key-sequence</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional continue-echo dont-downcase-last switch-frame-ok command-loop "
"disable-text-conversion</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dkey_002dsequence\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-key-sequence</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional continue-echo dont-downcase-last switch-frame-ok command-loop "
"disable-text-conversion</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dkey_002dsequence\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a key sequence and returns it as a string or vector.  It "
"keeps reading events until it has accumulated a complete key sequence; that "
"is, enough to specify a non-prefix command using the currently active "
"keymaps.  (Remember that a key sequence that starts with a mouse event is "
"read using the keymaps of the buffer in the window that the mouse was in, "
"not the current buffer.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数はキーシーケンスを読み込み、文字列またはベクトルとして返します。完全"
"なキーシーケンス――すなわち、現在有効なキーマップを用いてプレフィックスなしの"
"コマンドを指定するのに十分な長さ――が蓄積されるまで、イベントの読み込みを続け"
"ます。（マウスイベントから始まるキーシーケンスは、現在のバッファではなく、そ"
"のマウスが位置していたウィンドウ内のバッファのキーマップを用いて読み込まれる"
"点にご注意ください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"If the events are all characters and all can fit in a string, then <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> returns a string (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Strings-of-Events.html\">Putting Keyboard Events in "
"Strings</a>).  Otherwise, it returns a vector, since a vector can hold all "
"kinds of events&mdash;characters, symbols, and lists.  The elements of the "
"string or vector are the events in the key sequence."
msgstr ""
"イベントがすべて文字であり、かつすべてが文字列に収まる場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> は文字列を返します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Strings-of-Events.html\">キーボードイベントを文字列に"
"まとめる</a>を参照）。そうでない場合は、ベクトルを返します。ベクトルであれ"
"ば、文字、記号、リストなど、あらゆる種類のイベントを保持できるためです。文字"
"列またはベクトルの要素は、キーシーケンスに含まれるイベントとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"Reading a key sequence includes translating the events in various ways.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Translation-Keymaps.html\">Keymaps for Translating "
"Sequences of Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスの読み取りには、さまざまな方法でイベントを解釈することが含まれ"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Translation-Keymaps.html\">イベントシーケンス"
"の解釈用キーマップ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> is either a string to be "
"displayed in the echo area as a prompt, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"meaning not to display a prompt.  The argument <var class=\"var\">continue-"
"echo</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, means to echo this key "
"as a continuation of the previous key."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> は、エコー領域にプロンプトとして表示する"
"文字列か、あるいはプロンプトを表示しないことを意味する <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> のいずれかです。引数 <var class=\"var\">continue-"
"echo</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合は、このキーを直前の"
"キーの続きとしてエコーすることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"Normally any upper case event is converted to lower case if the original "
"event is undefined and the lower case equivalent is defined.  The argument "
"<var class=\"var\">dont-downcase-last</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, means do not convert the last event to lower "
"case.  This is appropriate for reading a key sequence to be defined."
msgstr ""
"通常、元のイベントが未定義で、かつ小文字相当のイベントが定義されている場合、"
"大文字のイベントはすべて小文字に変換されます。引数 <var class=\"var\">dont-"
"downcase-last</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、直前のイベ"
"ントを小文字に変換しないことを意味します。これは、定義済みのキーシーケンスを"
"読み取る際に適切です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">switch-frame-ok</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, means that this function should process a <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-frame</code> event if the user switches frames before "
"typing anything.  If the user switches frames in the middle of a key "
"sequence, or at the start of the sequence but <var class=\"var\">switch-"
"frame-ok</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the event will be "
"put off until after the current key sequence."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">switch-frame-ok</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、ユーザーが何も入力する前にフレームを切り替えた際に、この関"
"数が <code class=\"code\">switch-frame</code> イベントを処理することを意味し"
"ます。ユーザーがキーシーケンスの途中でフレームを切り替えた場合、あるいはシー"
"ケンスの開始時に <var class=\"var\">switch-frame-ok</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、イベントは現在のキーシーケンスが完了す"
"るまで保留されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">command-loop</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, means that this key sequence is being read by "
"something that will read commands one after another.  It should be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if the caller will read just one key sequence."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">command-loop</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、このキーシーケンスは、コマンドを順次読み込む処理によって読"
"み取られることを意味します。呼び出し側が単一のキーシーケンスのみを読み取る場"
"合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> となるべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">disable-text-conversion</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, means that system input methods will not directly "
"perform edits to buffer text while this key sequence is being read; user "
"input will always generated individual key events instead.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-Events.html\">Miscellaneous System Events</a>, "
"for more about text conversion."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">disable-text-conversion</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、このキーシーケンスの読み取り中に、シス"
"テム入力メソッドがバッファテキストを直接編集することはないことを意味します。"
"代わりに、ユーザー入力は常に個別のキーイベントとして生成されます。テキスト変"
"換の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-Events.html\">その他のシス"
"テムイベント</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, Emacs displays the prompt &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo; in the echo area, and then the user types "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、Emacsがエコーエリアにプロンプト &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</"
"samp>&rsquo; を表示し、続いてユーザーが <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> と入"
"力します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(read-key-sequence &quot;?&quot;)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Echo Area ----------\n"
"?<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd>\n"
"---------- Echo Area ----------\n"
"\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;^X^F&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> suppresses "
"quitting: <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> typed while reading with this "
"function works like any other character, and does not set <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> 関数は終了を抑制します。この関"
"数を使用して読み込んでいる際に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力すると、他"
"の文字と同様に動作し、<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> は設定されませ"
"ん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">終了</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
