#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequence-Input.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> except that it "
"always returns the key sequence as a vector, never as a string.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Strings-of-Events.html\">Putting Keyboard Events in "
