# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Key-Sequences.html
msgid ""
"This function converts the text <var class=\"var\">keyseq-text</var> (a "
"string constant)  into a key sequence (a string or vector constant).  The "
"contents of <var class=\"var\">keyseq-text</var> should use the same syntax "
"as in the buffer invoked by the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-macro</"
"code>) command; in particular, you must surround function key names with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;&hellip;&gt;</samp>&rsquo;.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html#Edit-Keyboard-Macro\">Edit Keyboard Macro</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、テキスト <var class=\"var\">keyseq-text</var>（文字列定数）をキー"
"シーケンス（文字列またはベクトル定数）に変換します。<var "
"class=\"var\">keyseq-text</var> の内容は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-macro</"
"code>) コマンドによって呼び出されるバッファと同じ構文を用いる必要があります。"
"特に、関数キー名は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;&hellip;&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo; で囲む必要があります。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html#Edit-Keyboard-"
"Macro\">Edit Keyboard Macro</a> を参照してください。"

