#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.7.1 Keyboard Events<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keyboard-"
"Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.7.1 キーボードイベント<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keyboard-"
"Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-event\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-event\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"There are two kinds of input you can get from the keyboard: ordinary keys, "
"and function keys.  Ordinary keys correspond to (possibly modified) "
"characters; the events they generate are represented in Lisp as characters.  "
"The event type of a <em class=\"dfn\">character event</em> is the character "
"itself (an integer), which might have some modifier bits set; see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Classifying-Events.html\">Classifying Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーボードから得られる入力には、通常キーとファンクションキーの2種類がありま"
"す。通常キーは（修飾されている可能性のある）文字に対応しており、それらが生成"
"するイベントはLispでは文字として表現されます。<em class=\"dfn\">文字イベント"
"</em>のイベント型は文字そのもの（整数）であり、そこにはいくつかの修飾ビットが"
"設定されている場合があります。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Classifying-"
"Events.html\">イベントの分類</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modifier-bits-_0028of-input-"
"character_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-basic-code-"
"_0028of-input-character_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modifier-bits-_0028of-input-"
"character_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-basic-code-"
"_0028of-input-character_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"An input character event consists of a <em class=\"dfn\">basic code</em> "
"between 0 and 524287, plus any or all of these <em class=\"dfn\">modifier "
"bits</em>:"
msgstr ""
"入力文字イベントは、0から524287までの<em class=\"dfn\">基本コード</em>と、以"
"下の<em class=\"dfn\">修飾ビット</em>のいずれか、またはすべてで構成されます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid "meta"
msgstr "メタ"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"The 2**27 bit in the character code indicates a character typed with the "
"meta key held down."
msgstr ""
"文字コードの2**27ビットは、メタキーを押しながら入力された文字を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid "control"
msgstr "制御"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"The 2**26 bit in the character code indicates a non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> control character."
msgstr ""
"文字コードの2**26ビットは、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>以外の制御文字"
"であることを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"<small class=\"sc\">ASCII</small> control characters such as <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> have special basic codes of their own, so Emacs "
"needs no special bit to indicate them.  Thus, the code for <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> is just 1."
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">ASCII</small> 制御文字（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> な"
"ど）は独自の基本コードを持っているため、Emacs ではこれらを示すための特別な"
"ビットは不要です。したがって、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> のコードは単に 1 "
"となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"But if you type a control combination not in <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr>, such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">%</kbd> with the control key, the numeric "
"value you get is the code for <kbd class=\"kbd\">%</kbd> plus 2**26 "
"(assuming the terminal supports non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"control characters), i.e. with the 27th bit set."
msgstr ""
"しかし、コントロールキーを用いて<kbd class=\"kbd\">%</kbd>のように<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>に含まれない制御文字の組み合わせを入力した場"
"合、得られる数値は<kbd class=\"kbd\">%</kbd>のコードに2**26を加えたもの（端末"
"が非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>制御文字をサポートしていると想定した"
"場合）、すなわち27ビット目がセットされた値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid "shift"
msgstr "シフト"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"The 2**25 bit (the 26th bit) in the character event code indicates an <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> control character typed with the shift key "
"held down."
msgstr ""
"文字イベントコードの2**25ビット（26番目のビット）は、Shiftキーを押しながら入"
"力された<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>制御文字を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"For letters, the basic code itself indicates upper versus lower case; for "
"digits and punctuation, the shift key selects an entirely different "
"character with a different basic code.  In order to keep within the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character set whenever possible, Emacs avoids "
"using the 2**25 bit for those character events."
msgstr ""
"文字の場合、基本コード自体で大文字か小文字かが示されます。一方、数字や句読点"
"では、シフトキーを押すことで基本コードが異なる全く別の文字が選択されます。可"
"能な限り<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字セットの範囲内に収めるため、"
"Emacsではこうした文字イベントに2**25ビットを使用することを避けています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"However, <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> provides no way to distinguish "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-A</kbd> from <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>, so Emacs "
"uses the 2**25 bit in <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-A</kbd> and not in <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"しかし、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>では<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-A</kbd>"
"と<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>を区別する手段がないため、Emacsでは<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-A</kbd>の2**25ビットを使用し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>で"
"は使用しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid "hyper"
msgstr "ハイパー"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"The 2**24 bit in the character event code indicates a character typed with "
"the hyper key held down."
msgstr ""
"文字イベントコードの2**24ビットは、ハイパーキーを押したまま入力された文字を示"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid "super"
msgstr "スーパー"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"The 2**23 bit in the character event code indicates a character typed with "
"the super key held down."
msgstr ""
"文字イベントコードの2**23ビットは、スーパーキーを押しながら入力された文字を示"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid "alt"
msgstr "alt"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"The 2**22 bit in the character event code indicates a character typed with "
"the alt key held down.  (The key labeled <kbd class=\"key\">Alt</kbd> on "
"most keyboards is actually treated as the meta key, not this.)"
msgstr ""
"文字イベントコードの 2**22 ビットは、Altキーを押しながら入力された文字を示し"
"ます。（ほとんどのキーボードで <kbd class=\"key\">Alt</kbd> と表記されている"
"キーは、実際にはこれではなくメタキーとして扱われます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Events.html
msgid ""
"It is best to avoid mentioning specific bit numbers in your program.  To "
"test the modifier bits of a character, use the function <code "
"class=\"code\">event-modifiers</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Classifying-Events.html\">Classifying Events</a>).  When making key "
"bindings with <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code>, you specify these "
"events using strings like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-H-x</samp>&rsquo; "
"instead (for &ldquo;control hyper x&rdquo;)  (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">Changing Key Bindings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"プログラム内で具体的なビット番号に言及することは避けるのが最善です。文字の修"
"飾ビットをテストするには、関数 <code class=\"code\">event-modifiers</code> を"
"使用してください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Classifying-Events.html\">イベン"
