"Macros-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.16 キーボードマクロ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keyboard-"
"Macros-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-macros\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keyboard-macros\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">keyboard macro</em> is a canned sequence of input events "
"that can be considered a command and made the definition of a key.  The Lisp "
"representation of a keyboard macro is a string or vector containing the "
"events.  Don&rsquo;t confuse keyboard macros with Lisp macros (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Macros.html\">Macros</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">キーボードマクロ</em>とは、コマンドと見なしてキーの定義に設"
"定できる、あらかじめ用意された入力イベントのシーケンスのことです。キーボード"
"マクロのLispにおける表現は、イベントを含む文字列またはベクトルです。キーボー"
"ドマクロをLispのマクロと混同しないようにしてください（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Macros.html\">マクロ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">execute-kbd-macro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">kbdmacro "
"&amp;optional count loopfunc</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"execute_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">execute-kbd-macro</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">kbdmacro "
"&amp;optional count loopfunc</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"execute_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"This function executes <var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> as a sequence of "
"events.  If <var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> is a string or vector, then "
"the events in it are executed exactly as if they had been input by the "
"user.  The sequence is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> expected to be a single "
"key sequence; normally a keyboard macro definition consists of several key "
"sequences concatenated."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> を一連のイベントとして実行しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> が文字列またはベクトルである場合、そこ"
"に含まれるイベントは、あたかもユーザーが入力したかのようにそのまま実行されま"
"す。このシーケンスが単一のキーシーケンスであることは<em class=\"emph\">想定さ"
"れていません</em>。通常、キーボードマクロの定義は、複数のキーシーケンスを連結"
"して構成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> is a symbol, then its function "
"definition is used in place of <var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var>.  If that "
"is another symbol, this process repeats.  Eventually the result should be a "
"string or vector.  If the result is not a symbol, string, or vector, an "
"error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> がシンボルである場合、その関数定義が <var "
"class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> の代わりに使用されます。それが別のシンボルである"
"場合、この処理が繰り返されます。最終的に、結果は文字列またはベクトルになるは"
"ずです。結果がシンボル、文字列、またはベクトルでない場合は、エラーが通知され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">count</var> is a repeat count; <var "
"class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> is executed that many times.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"<var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> is executed once.  If it is 0, <var "
"class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> is executed over and over until it encounters "
"an error or a failing search."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">count</var> は繰り返し回数であり、<var "
"class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> はその回数分だけ実行されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が省略された場合や <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"の場合は、<var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> が1回実行されます。0 の場合は、エ"
"ラーが発生するか検索に失敗するまで、<var class=\"var\">kbdmacro</var> が繰り"
"返し実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">loopfunc</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it is a function that is called, without arguments, prior to each iteration "
"of the macro.  If <var class=\"var\">loopfunc</var> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then this stops execution of the macro."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">loopfunc</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、それはマクロの各反復前に引数なしで呼び出される関数となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">loopfunc</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すと、マ"
"クロの実行は停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Reading-One-Event.html\">Reading One Event</a>, "
"for an example of using <code class=\"code\">execute-kbd-macro</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">execute-kbd-macro</code> の使用例については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Reading-One-Event.html\">Reading One Event</a> を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">executing-kbd-macro</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"executing_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">executing-kbd-macro</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"executing_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"This variable contains the string or vector that defines the keyboard macro "
"that is currently executing.  It is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if no "
"macro is currently executing.  A command can test this variable so as to "
"behave differently when run from an executing macro.  Do not set this "
"variable yourself."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、現在実行中のキーボードマクロを定義する文字列またはベクトルが格"
"納されます。現在実行中のマクロがない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> と"
"なります。コマンドはこの変数を判定することで、実行中のマクロから呼び出された"
"際に異なる動作をさせることができます。この変数を自身で設定しないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defining-kbd-macro</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defining_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">defining-kbd-macro</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"defining_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"This variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if and only if a "
"keyboard macro is being defined.  A command can test this variable so as to "
"behave differently while a macro is being defined.  The value is <code "
"class=\"code\">append</code> while appending to the definition of an "
"existing macro.  The commands <code class=\"code\">start-kbd-macro</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">kmacro-start-macro</code> and <code class=\"code\">end-"
"kbd-macro</code> set this variable&mdash;do not set it yourself."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でないのは、キーボードマクロが定義"
"されている場合に限られます。コマンドはこの変数を判定することで、マクロの定義"
"中に異なる動作をさせることができます。既存のマクロの定義に追記している間は、"
"値は <code class=\"code\">append</code> となります。コマンド <code "
"class=\"code\">start-kbd-macro</code>、<code class=\"code\">kmacro-start-"
"macro</code>、<code class=\"code\">end-kbd-macro</code> はこの変数を設定しま"
"す。ご自身で設定しないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"The variable is always local to the current terminal and cannot be buffer-"
"local.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple "
"Terminals</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は常に現在のターミナルにローカルであり、バッファローカルにはなり得ま"
"せん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-kbd-macro</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">last-kbd-macro</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"last_002dkbd_002dmacro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"This variable is the definition of the most recently defined keyboard "
"macro.  Its value is a string or vector, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、直近に定義されたキーボードマクロの定義です。その値は、文字列、ベ"
"クトル、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kbd-macro-termination-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-kbd_002dmacro_002dtermination_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
