# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Macros.html
msgid ""
"This normal hook is run when a keyboard macro terminates, regardless of what "
"caused it to terminate (reaching the macro end or an error which ended the "
"macro prematurely)."
msgstr ""
"この通常のフックは、キーボードマクロが終了した際に、終了原因（マクロの終端到"
"達、またはマクロを途中で終了させたエラー）に関わらず実行されます。"

