# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Menus.html
msgid ""
"When a prefix key ending with a keyboard event (a character or function key) "
"has a definition that is a menu keymap, the keymap operates as a keyboard "
"menu; the user specifies the next event by choosing a menu item with the "
"keyboard."
msgstr ""
"キーボードイベント（文字キーまたはファンクションキー）で終わるプレフィックス"
"キーの定義がメニューキーマップである場合、そのキーマップはキーボードメニュー"
"として動作し、ユーザーはキーボードでメニュー項目を選択することで次のイベント"
"を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keyboard-Menus.html
msgid ""
"Emacs displays the keyboard menu with the map&rsquo;s overall prompt string, "
"followed by the alternatives (the item strings of the map&rsquo;s bindings), "
"in the echo area.  If the bindings don&rsquo;t all fit at once, the user can "
"type <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> to see the next line of alternatives.  "
"Successive uses of <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> eventually get to the end of "
"the menu and then cycle around to the beginning.  (The variable <code "
"class=\"code\">menu-prompt-more-char</code> specifies which character is "
"used for this; <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> is the default.)"
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、マップの全体のプロンプト文字列に続き、代替候補（マップのバインディン"
"グの項目文字列）をエコーエリアに表示します。バインディングが一度に収まりきら"
"ない場合は、<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> と入力することで次の行の代替候補を表"
