#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.3.2 Keymaps and Minor Modes<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.3.2 キーマップとマイナーモード<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Each minor mode can have its own keymap, which is active when the mode is "
"enabled.  To set up a keymap for a minor mode, add an element to the alist "
"<code class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Controlling-Active-Maps.html#Definition-of-"
"minor_002dmode_002dmap_002dalist\">Definition of minor-mode-map-alist</a>."
msgstr ""
"各マイナーモードは独自のキーマップを持つことができ、そのモードが有効なときに"
"適用されます。マイナーモードのキーマップを設定するには、alist <code "
"class=\"code\">minor-mode-map-alist</code> に要素を追加します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Controlling-Active-Maps.html#Definition-of-"
"minor_002dmode_002dmap_002dalist\">minor-mode-map-alist の定義</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-self_002dinsert_002dcommand_002c-"
"minor-modes\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-self_002dinsert_002dcommand_002c-"
"minor-modes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html
msgid ""
"One use of minor mode keymaps is to modify the behavior of certain self-"
"inserting characters so that they do something else as well as self-insert.  "
"(Another way to customize <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> is "
"through <code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-hook</code>, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Commands-for-Insertion.html\">User-Level Insertion "
"Commands</a>.  Apart from this, the facilities for customizing <code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> are limited to special cases, "
"designed for abbrevs and Auto Fill mode.  Do not try substituting your own "
"definition of <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> for the "
"standard one.  The editor command loop handles this function specially.)"
msgstr ""
"マイナーモードのキーマップの用途の一つに、特定の自己挿入文字の動作を変更し、"
"自己挿入に加えて別の処理も行わせるというものがあります。（<code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>をカスタマイズするもう一つの方法は"
"<code class=\"code\">post-self-insert-hook</code>経由です。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Commands-for-Insertion.html\">ユーザーレベルの挿入コマンド</a>を参照し"
"てください。これ以外に、<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>をカス"
"タマイズするための機能は、略語やオートフィルモード向けに設計された特殊なケー"
"スに限られています。標準の<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>を独"
"自の定義で置き換えようとしないでください。エディタのコマンドループがこの機能"
"を特別に処理しています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keymaps-and-Minor-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Minor modes may bind commands to key sequences consisting of <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> followed by a punctuation character.  However, "
"sequences consisting of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> followed by one of <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">{}&lt;&gt;:;</kbd>, or a control character or digit, are "
"reserved for major modes.  Also, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <var "
"class=\"var\">letter</var></kbd> is reserved for users.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Binding-Conventions.html\">Key Binding "
"Conventions</a>."
msgstr ""
"マイナーモードでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> に続いて句読点文字が続くキー"
"シーケンスにコマンドをバインドできます。ただし、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> "
"に続いて <kbd class=\"kbd\">{}&lt;&gt;:;</kbd> のいずれか、または制御文字や数"
"字が続くシーケンスは、メジャーモード用に予約されています。また、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <var class=\"var\">letter</var></kbd> はユーザー用に予約さ"
"れています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Binding-Conventions.html\">キーバイ"
"ンドの規約</a>を参照してください。"

