#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"stands for a key sequence that will invoke <var class=\"var\">command</var>, "
"or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-x <var class=\"var\">command</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; if <var class=\"var\">command</var> has no key bindings."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">command</var>を呼び出すキーシーケンス、または<var "
"class=\"var\">command</var>にキーバインドがない場合は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">M-x <var class=\"var\">command</var></samp>&rsquo;を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">\\{<var class=\"var\">mapvar</var>}</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">\\{<var class=\"var\">mapvar</var>}</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"stands for a summary of the keymap which is the value of the variable <var "
"class=\"var\">mapvar</var>.  The summary is made using <code "
"class=\"code\">describe-bindings</code>.  The summary will normally exclude "
"menu bindings, but if the <var class=\"var\">include-menus</var> argument to "
"<code class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the menu bindings will be included."
msgstr ""
"キーマップの概要を表しており、その値は変数 <var class=\"var\">mapvar</var> と"
"なります。概要は <code class=\"code\">describe-bindings</code> を用いて作成さ"
"れます。通常、概要にメニューバインディングは含まれませんが、<code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code> の引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">include-menus</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合は、メニューバインディングも含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">\\&lt;<var class=\"var\">mapvar</var>&gt;</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">\\&lt;<var class=\"var\">mapvar</var>&gt;</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"stands for no text itself.  It is used only for a side effect: it specifies "
"<var class=\"var\">mapvar</var>&rsquo;s value as the keymap for any "
"following &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\[<var class=\"var\">command</var>]</"
"samp>&rsquo; sequences in this documentation string."
msgstr ""
"それ自体はテキストを表しません。あくまで副作用として用いられるもので、このド"
"キュメント文字列内で後続するあらゆる &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\[<var "
"class=\"var\">command</var>]</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスのキーマップとして、"
"<var class=\"var\">mapvar</var> の値を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">\\`<var class=\"var\">KEYSEQ</var>'</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">\\`<var class=\"var\">KEYSEQ</var>'</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"stands for a key sequence <var class=\"var\">KEYSEQ</var>, which will use "
"the same face as a command substitution.  This should be used only when a "
"key sequence has no corresponding command, for example when it is read "
"directly with <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>.  It must be a "
"valid key sequence according to <code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code>.  It "
"can also be used with command names, like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\`M-x "
"foo'</samp>&rsquo;, where you want this to be fontified like a keyboard "
"sequence, but you want to inhibit translating it into a key sequence like "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\[foo]</samp>&rsquo; does."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンス <var class=\"var\">KEYSEQ</var> を表し、コマンド置換と同じフェ"
"イスが使用されます。これは、キーシーケンスに対応するコマンドがない場合（例え"
"ば <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> で直接読み込まれる場合など）"
"にのみ使用してください。また、<code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> に従っ"
"て有効なキーシーケンスである必要があります。さらに、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\`M-x foo'</samp>&rsquo; のようにコマンド名と組み合わせて使用"
"することも可能です。この場合、キーボードシーケンスと同様にフォント化させたい"
"が、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\[foo]</samp>&rsquo; のようにキーシーケンス"
"への変換は抑制したい場合に利用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">`</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">`</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"(grave accent) stands for a left quote.  This generates a left single "
"quotation mark, an apostrophe, or a grave accent depending on the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">text-quoting-style</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Text-Quoting-Style.html\">Text Quoting Style</a>."
msgstr ""
"(grave accent) は左引用符を表します。これにより、<code class=\"code\">text-"
"quoting-style</code> の値に応じて、左シングルクォート、アポストロフィ、または"
"グレイヴアクセントが生成されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Quoting-"
"Style.html\">テキスト引用スタイル</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><table><tbody><tr><td>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
#: build/html/elisp/Rx-Constructs.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">'</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">'</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"(apostrophe) stands for a right quote.  This generates a right single "
"quotation mark or an apostrophe depending on the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">text-quoting-style</code>."
msgstr ""
"(アポストロフィ) は右引用符を表します。これにより、<code class=\"code\">text-"
"quoting-style</code> の値に応じて、右シングルクォートまたはアポストロフィが生"
"成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">\\=</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">\\=</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"quotes the following character and is discarded; thus, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\=`</samp>&rsquo; puts &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">`</"
"samp>&rsquo; into the output, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\=\\[</"
"samp>&rsquo; puts &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\[</samp>&rsquo; into the "
"output, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\=\\=</samp>&rsquo; puts &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\=</samp>&rsquo; into the output."
msgstr ""
"次の文字を引用して破棄します。したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\=`</"
"samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">`</samp>&rsquo;を出力に、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\=\\[</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\[</"
"samp>&rsquo;を出力に、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\=\\=</samp>&rsquo;は"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\=</samp>&rsquo;を出力にそれぞれ入れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
