# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Keys-in-Documentation.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Please note:</strong> Each &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; must be doubled when written in a string in "
"Emacs Lisp (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-for-Strings.html\">Syntax "
"for Strings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">ご注意：</strong> Emacs Lisp の文字列内で記述する場"
"合、各 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; は2回記述する必要がありま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-for-Strings.html\">文字列の構文</a>を参"
"照してください）。"

