# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-killing-buffers\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffers_002c-killing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-killing-buffers\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffers_002c-killing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Killing a buffer</em> makes its name unknown to Emacs and "
"makes the memory space it occupied available for other use."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">バッファの破棄</em>を行うと、その名称がEmacsに知られなくな"
"り、そのバッファが占有していたメモリ領域を他の用途に利用できるようになりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The buffer object for the buffer that has been killed remains in existence "
"as long as anything refers to it, but it is specially marked so that you "
"cannot make it current or display it.  Killed buffers retain their identity, "
"however; if you kill two distinct buffers, they remain distinct according to "
"<code class=\"code\">eq</code> although both are dead."
msgstr ""
"破棄されたバッファのバッファオブジェクトは、何らかの参照がある限り存在し続け"
"ますが、カレントに設定したり表示したりできないよう特別にマークされています。"
"ただし、破棄されたバッファはその識別情報を保持します。2つの異なるバッファを破"
"棄した場合、いずれも破棄された状態ではありますが、<code class=\"code\">eq</"
"code> に従って別々のバッファとして残ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If you kill a buffer that is current or displayed in a window, Emacs "
"automatically selects or displays some other buffer instead.  This means "
"that killing a buffer can change the current buffer.  Therefore, when you "
"kill a buffer, you should also take the precautions associated with changing "
"the current buffer (unless you happen to know that the buffer being killed "
"isn&rsquo;t current).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Current-"
"Buffer.html\">The Current Buffer</a>."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ内でカレントまたは表示されているバッファをキルすると、Emacsは自動的"
"に別のバッファを選択または表示します。つまり、バッファをキルすることでカレン"
"トバッファが変更される可能性があります。したがって、バッファをキルする際は、"
"カレントバッファの変更に伴う注意事項にも留意してください（キルするバッファが"
"カレントではないことが分かっている場合を除きます）。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Current-Buffer.html\">カレントバッファ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If you kill a buffer that is the base buffer of one or more indirect buffers "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Indirect-Buffers.html\">Indirect Buffers</"
"a>), the indirect buffers are automatically killed as well."
msgstr ""
"1つ以上の間接バッファ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Indirect-Buffers.html\">間接"
"バッファ</a>を参照）のベースバッファであるバッファを破棄すると、それらの間接"
"バッファも自動的に破棄されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-live-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-live-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">buffer-name</code> of a buffer is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if, and only if, the buffer is killed.  A buffer "
"that has not been killed is called a <em class=\"dfn\">live</em> buffer.  To "
"test whether a buffer is live or killed, use the function <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-live-p</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"バッファの <code class=\"code\">buffer-name</code> は、バッファがキルされてい"
"る場合に限り <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。キルされていないバッ"
"ファは <em class=\"dfn\">ライブ</em> バッファと呼ばれます。バッファがライブか"
"キルされているかを確認するには、関数 <code class=\"code\">buffer-live-p</"
"code> を使用してください（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function kills the buffer <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>, "
"freeing all its memory for other uses or to be returned to the operating "
"system.  If <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or omitted, it kills the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数はバッファ <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を破棄し、そのメモ"
"リをすべて他の用途に解放するか、オペレーティングシステムに返却します。<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である"
"か、あるいは省略されている場合は、現在のバッファを破棄します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Any processes that have this buffer as the <code class=\"code\">process-"
"buffer</code> are sent the <code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> (hangup) "
"signal, which normally causes them to terminate.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Signals-to-Processes.html\">Sending Signals to Processes</a>."
msgstr ""
"このバッファを<code class=\"code\">process-buffer</code>として持つプロセスに"
"は<code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code>（ハングアップ）シグナルが送信され、通常"
"これによりプロセスは終了します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Signals-to-"
"Processes.html\">プロセスへのシグナル送信</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer is visiting a file and contains unsaved changes, <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> asks the user to confirm before the buffer "
"is killed.  It does this even if not called interactively.  To prevent the "
"request for confirmation, clear the modified flag before calling <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"Modification.html\">Buffer Modification</a>."
msgstr ""
"バッファがファイルを参照しており、未保存の変更が含まれている場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> はバッファが破棄される前にユーザーに確認を"
"求めます。これは、対話的に呼び出されていない場合でも行われます。確認要求を防"
"ぐには、<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> を呼び出す前に変更済みフラグ"
"をクリアしてください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffer-Modification.html\">"
"バッファの変更</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function calls <code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> "
"for cleaning up all windows currently displaying the buffer to be killed."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、終了対象のバッファを現在表示しているすべてのウィンドウを閉じるた"
"め、<code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code>を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid "Killing a buffer that is already dead has no effect."
msgstr "既に消滅しているバッファを破棄しても効果はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if it actually killed "
"the buffer.  It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the user refuses "
"to confirm or if <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> was already dead."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、実際にバッファを破棄した場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返"
"します。ユーザーが確認を拒否した場合、または <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> が既に破棄されていた場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返し"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(kill-buffer &quot;foo.unchanged&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
"(kill-buffer &quot;foo.changed&quot;)\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
"Buffer foo.changed modified; kill anyway? (yes or no) <kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd>\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
"\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer-query-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-kill_002dbuffer_002dquery_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer-query-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-kill_002dbuffer_002dquery_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Before confirming unsaved changes, <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> "
"calls the functions in the list <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-query-"
"functions</code>, in order of appearance, with no arguments.  The buffer "
"being killed is the current buffer when they are called.  The idea of this "
"feature is that these functions will ask for confirmation from the user.  If "
"any of them returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> spares the buffer&rsquo;s life."
msgstr ""
"未保存の変更を確認する前に、<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> はリスト "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-query-functions</code> 内の関数を、出現順に"
"引数なしで呼び出します。呼び出し時に破棄されるバッファは、現在のバッファで"
"す。この機能の意図は、これらの関数がユーザーに確認を求めることにあります。い"
"ずれかの関数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返した場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> はバッファの存続を可能にします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This hook is not run for internal or temporary buffers created by <code "
"class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</code> or <code class=\"code\">generate-new-"
"buffer</code> with a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> argument <var "
"class=\"var\">inhibit-buffer-hooks</var>."
msgstr ""
"このフックは、<code class=\"code\">get-buffer-create</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">generate-new-buffer</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の引数 <var class=\"var\">inhibit-buffer-hooks</var> を用いて作成した内部"
"バッファや一時バッファに対しては実行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dbuffer_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-buffer-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dbuffer_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This is a normal hook run by <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> after "
"asking all the questions it is going to ask, just before actually killing "
"the buffer.  The buffer to be killed is current when the hook functions "
"run.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>.  This variable is "
"a permanent local, so its local binding is not cleared by changing major "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> が尋ねる予定のすべての質問を"
"行った後、実際にバッファを破棄する直前に実行される通常のフックです。破棄対象"
"となるバッファは、フック関数が実行される時点でのものです。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a> を参照してください。この変数は永続的なローカル"
"変数であるため、メジャーモードを変更してもそのローカルバインディングがクリア"
"されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-offer-save</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002doffer_002dsave\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">buffer-offer-save</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002doffer_002dsave\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> in a particular "
"buffer, tells <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</code> to offer "
"to save that buffer, just as it offers to save file-visiting buffers.  If "
"<code class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> is called with the second "
"optional argument set to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, it will also offer "
"to save the buffer.  Lastly, if this variable is set to the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">always</code>, both <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-"
"emacs</code> and <code class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> will always "
"offer to save.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Saving-Buffers.html#Definition-"
"of-save_002dsome_002dbuffers\">Definition of save-some-buffers</a>.  The "
"variable <code class=\"code\">buffer-offer-save</code> automatically becomes "
"buffer-local when set for any reason.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Buffer_002dLocal-Variables.html\">Buffer-Local Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が特定のバッファにおいて <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</code> はファイル参照バッ"
"ファの保存を提案するのと同様に、そのバッファの保存も提案します。<code "
"class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> を呼び出し、第2のオプション引数に "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> を指定した場合も、同様にバッファの保存を提案し"
"ます。最後に、この変数にシンボル <code class=\"code\">always</code> が設定さ"
"れている場合、<code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> の両方が常に保存を提案します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Saving-Buffers.html#Definition-of-"
"save_002dsome_002dbuffers\">save-some-buffers の定義</a> を参照してください。"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">buffer-offer-save</code> は、何らかの理由で設定され"
"ると、自動的にバッファローカルになります。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Buffer_002dLocal-Variables.html\">バッファローカル変数</a> を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-save-without-query</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002dsave_002dwithout_002dquery\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-save-without-query</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002dsave_002dwithout_002dquery\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> in a particular "
"buffer, tells <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> to save this buffer (if it&rsquo;s "
"modified) without asking the user.  The variable automatically becomes "
"buffer-local when set for any reason."
msgstr ""
"この変数が特定のバッファにおいて <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code> は（変更があった場合に）ユーザーに確"
"認することなくこのバッファを保存します。この変数は、何らかの理由で設定される"
"と、自動的にバッファローカルになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
