# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Killing Emacs means ending the execution of the Emacs process.  If you "
"started Emacs from a terminal, the parent process normally resumes control.  "
"The low-level primitive for killing Emacs is <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"emacs</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsを終了させるとは、Emacsプロセスの実行を終了させることを意味します。ター"
"ミナルからEmacsを起動した場合、通常は親プロセスが制御を再開します。Emacsを終"
"了させるための低レベルプリミティブは<code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code>で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-emacs</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"exit-data restart</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002demacs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-emacs</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"exit-data restart</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002demacs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This command calls the hook <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs-hook</code>, "
"then exits the Emacs process and kills it."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドはフック <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs-hook</code> を呼び出し、"
"その後 Emacs プロセスを終了して強制終了させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">exit-data</var> is an integer, that is used as the "
"exit status of the Emacs process.  (This is useful primarily in batch "
"operation; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">Batch Mode</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">exit-data</var> が整数の場合、それが Emacs プロセスの終了"
"ステータスとして用いられます。（これは主にバッチ運用において有用です。<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">バッチモード</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">exit-data</var> is a string, its contents (followed by "
"a newline) are stuffed into the terminal input buffer so that the shell (or "
"whatever program next reads input) can read them.  However, stuffing is "
"silently skipped if Emacs is not running interactively on a terminal, or if "
"stuffing requires special privileges or is not supported on this platform."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">exit-data</var> が文字列の場合、その内容（に続いて改行）が"
"ターミナルの入力バッファに投入され、シェル（または次に入力を読み込むプログラ"
"ム）がそれを読み取れるようになります。ただし、Emacs がターミナル上で対話的に"
"動作していない場合や、投入に特別な権限が必要な場合、あるいはこのプラット"
"フォームでサポートされていない場合は、投入処理は暗黙的にスキップされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">exit-data</var> is neither an integer nor a string, or "
"is omitted, that means to use the (system-specific) exit status which "
"indicates successful program termination."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">exit-data</var> が整数でも文字列でもなく、あるいは省略され"
"ている場合は、プログラムの正常終了を示す（システム固有の）終了ステータスを使"
"用することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">restart</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"instead of just exiting at the end, start a new Emacs process, using the "
"same command line arguments as the currently running Emacs process."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">restart</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合は、単に最後に終了するのではなく、現在実行中の Emacs プロセスと同じコマンド"
"ライン引数を用いて、新しい Emacs プロセスを起動してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SIGTERM\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-SIGHUP\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"SIGINT\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-operating-system-"
"signal\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SIGTERM\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-SIGHUP\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"SIGINT\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-operating-system-"
"signal\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> function is normally called via "
"the higher-level command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-terminal</code>).  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Exiting.html#Exiting\">Exiting</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>.  It is also called automatically if Emacs receives a "
"<code class=\"code\">SIGTERM</code> or <code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> "
"operating system signal (e.g., when the controlling terminal is "
"disconnected), or if it receives a <code class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> signal "
"while running in batch mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Batch-"
"Mode.html\">Batch Mode</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> 関数は通常、より上位のコマンドである "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-"
"terminal</code>) を介して呼び出されます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Exiting.html#Exiting\">Exiting</a> を参"
"照してください。また、Emacs が <code class=\"code\">SIGTERM</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> のオペレーティングシステムシグナルを受信し"
"た場合（例：制御端末が切断された場合）、あるいはバッチモードで動作中に <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> シグナルを受信した場合（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">Batch Mode</a> を参照）にも、自動的に呼び出されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-emacs-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002demacs_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-emacs-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002demacs_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This normal hook is run by <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code>, before it "
"kills Emacs."
msgstr ""
"この通常のフックは、Emacsを終了させる前に <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</"
"code> によって実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Because <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> can be called in situations "
"where user interaction is impossible (e.g., when the terminal is "
"disconnected), functions on this hook should not attempt to interact with "
"the user.  If you want to interact with the user when Emacs is shutting "
"down, use <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs-query-functions</code>, described "
"below."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> はユーザー操作が不可能な状況（例：端末"
"が切断されている場合）でも呼び出されるため、このフックの関数ではユーザーとの"
"対話を試みるべきではありません。Emacs のシャットダウン時にユーザーと対話した"
"い場合は、後述する <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs-query-functions</code> を"
"使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs is killed, all the information in the Emacs process, aside from "
"files that have been saved, is lost.  Because killing Emacs inadvertently "
"can lose a lot of work, the <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-terminal</"
"code> command queries for confirmation if you have buffers that need saving "
"or subprocesses that are running.  It also runs the abnormal hook <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-emacs-query-functions</code>:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsを終了すると、保存済みのファイルを除き、Emacsプロセス内のすべての情報が"
"失われます。誤ってEmacsを終了させると多くの作業内容が失われる可能性があるた"
"め、<code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-terminal</code>コマンドは、保存が"
"必要なバッファや実行中のサブプロセスがあるかどうかの確認を求めます。また、異"
"常フック<code class=\"code\">kill-emacs-query-functions</code>も実行します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-emacs-query-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-kill_002demacs_002dquery_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">kill-emacs-query-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-kill_002demacs_002dquery_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-terminal</code> is killing "
"Emacs, it calls the functions in this hook, after asking the standard "
"questions and before calling <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code>.  The "
"functions are called in order of appearance, with no arguments.  Each "
"function can ask for additional confirmation from the user.  If any of them "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-"
"kill-emacs</code> does not kill Emacs, and does not run the remaining "
"functions in this hook.  Calling <code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> "
"directly does not run this hook."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-terminal</code> が Emacs を終了させる"
"際、標準的な確認を行った後、<code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> を呼び出す"
"前に、このフック内の関数を呼び出します。関数は出現順に、引数なしで呼び出され"
"ます。各関数はユーザーに追加の確認を求めることができます。いずれかの関数が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返した場合、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"buffers-kill-emacs</code> は Emacs を終了させず、このフック内の残りの関数も実"
"行しません。<code class=\"code\">kill-emacs</code> を直接呼び出しても、この"
"フックは実行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">restart-emacs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"restart_002demacs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">restart-emacs</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"restart_002demacs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Killing-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This command does the same as <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</"
"code>, but instead of just killing the current Emacs process at the end, "
"it&rsquo;ll restart a new Emacs process, using the same command line "
"arguments as the currently running Emacs process."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは <code class=\"code\">save-buffers-kill-emacs</code> と同じ動作"
"をしますが、最後に現在の Emacs プロセスを単に終了させるのではなく、現在実行中"
"の Emacs プロセスと同じコマンドライン引数を用いて、新しい Emacs プロセスを再"
"起動します。"

