# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid ""
"<span>13.2.1 Components of a Lambda Expression<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Components-of-a-Lambda-Expression\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13.2.1 ラムダ式の構成要素<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Components-"
"of-a-Lambda-Expression\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid "A lambda expression is a list that looks like this:"
msgstr "ラムダ式とは、次のような形式のリストのことです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(lambda (<var class=\"var\">arg-variables</var>...)\n"
"  [<var class=\"var\">documentation-string</var>]\n"
"  [<var class=\"var\">interactive-declaration</var>]\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lambda-list\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lambda-list\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid ""
"The first element of a lambda expression is always the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">lambda</code>.  This indicates that the list represents a "
"function.  The reason functions are defined to start with <code "
"class=\"code\">lambda</code> is so that other lists, intended for other "
"uses, will not accidentally be valid as functions."
msgstr ""
"ラムダ式の最初の要素は、常に記号 <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> です。こ"
"れは、そのリストが関数を表していることを示しています。関数が <code "
"class=\"code\">lambda</code> から始まるように定義されているのは、他の用途を想"
"定したリストが、誤って関数として有効にならないようにするためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid ""
"The second element is a list of symbols&mdash;the argument variable names "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Argument-List.html\">Features of Argument "
"Lists</a>).  This is called the <em class=\"dfn\">lambda list</em>.  When a "
"Lisp function is called, the argument values are matched up against the "
"variables in the lambda list, which are given local bindings with the values "
"provided.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">Local "
"Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"2つ目の要素はシンボルのリスト――引数変数名（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Argument-List.html\">引数リストの特徴</a>を参照）です。これは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ラムダリスト</em>と呼ばれます。Lisp関数が呼び出されると、引数の"
"値がラムダリスト内の変数と照合され、提供された値でローカル束縛が割り当てられ"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">ローカル変数</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid ""
"The documentation string is a Lisp string object placed within the function "
"definition to describe the function for the Emacs help facilities.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Function-Documentation.html\">Documentation Strings of "
"Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメント文字列とは、Emacsのヘルプ機能向けに関数を説明するため、関数定義内"
"に配置されるLispの文字列オブジェクトのことです。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Function-Documentation.html\">関数のドキュメント文字列</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lambda-Components.html
msgid ""
"The interactive declaration is a list of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(interactive <var class=\"var\">code-string</var>)</code>.  "
"This declares how to provide arguments if the function is used "
"interactively.  Functions with this declaration are called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">commands</em>; they can be called using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x</kbd> or bound to a key.  Functions not intended to be called in this way "
"should not have interactive declarations.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Defining-Commands.html\">Defining Commands</a>, for how to write an "
"interactive declaration."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブ宣言は、形式 <code class=\"code\">(interactive <var "
"class=\"var\">code-string</var>)</code> のリストです。これにより、関数をイン"
"タラクティブに使用する場合の引数の渡し方が指定されます。この宣言を持つ関数は"
