# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"Tree-sitter relies on language grammar to parse text in that language.  In "
"Emacs, a language grammar is represented by a symbol.  For example, the C "
"language grammar is represented as the symbol <code class=\"code\">c</code>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">c</code> can be passed to tree-sitter functions as "
"the <var class=\"var\">language</var> argument."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterは、その言語のテキストを解析するために言語文法を利用します。Emacs"
"では、言語文法はシンボルで表現されます。例えば、C言語の文法はシンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">c</code> として表現され、<code class=\"code\">c</code> を "
"<var class=\"var\">language</var> 引数としてTree-sitter関数に渡すことができま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dextra_002dload_002dpath\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-treesit_002dload_002dlanguage_002derror\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dextra_002dload_002dpath\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-treesit_002dload_002dlanguage_002derror\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"Tree-sitter language grammars are distributed as dynamic libraries.  In "
"order to use a language grammar in Emacs, you need to make sure that the "
"dynamic library is installed on the system.  Emacs looks for language "
"grammars in several places, in the following order:"
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterの言語文法は、動的ライブラリとして配布されています。Emacsで言語文"
"法を使用するには、その動的ライブラリがシステムにインストールされていることを"
"確認する必要があります。Emacsは、以下の順序で複数の場所から言語文法を探しま"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"first, in the list of directories specified by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-extra-load-path</code>;"
msgstr ""
"まず、変数 <code class=\"code\">treesit-extra-load-path</code> で指定された"
"ディレクトリの一覧において；"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"then, in the <samp class=\"file\">tree-sitter</samp> subdirectory of the "
"directory specified by <code class=\"code\">user-emacs-directory</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Init File</a>);"
msgstr ""
"次に、<code class=\"code\">user-emacs-directory</code> で指定されたディレクト"
"リ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Init ファイル</a> を参照）の "
"<samp class=\"file\">tree-sitter</samp> サブディレクトリに；"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"and finally, in the system&rsquo;s default locations for dynamic libraries."
msgstr "そして最後に、システムの動的ライブラリのデフォルト保存先に。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"In each of these directories, Emacs looks for a file with file-name "
"extensions specified by the variable <code class=\"code\">dynamic-library-"
"suffixes</code>."
msgstr ""
"これらの各ディレクトリにおいて、Emacsは変数 <code class=\"code\">dynamic-"
"library-suffixes</code> で指定されたファイル名拡張子を持つファイルを探しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs cannot find the library or has problems loading it, Emacs signals "
"the <code class=\"code\">treesit-load-language-error</code> error.  The data "
"of that signal could be one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsがライブラリを検出できない場合や、読み込みに問題がある場合、Emacsは"
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-load-language-error</code>エラーを発生させます。"
"そのシグナルのデータは、以下のいずれかになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(not-found <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var> "
"&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(not-found <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var> "
"&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid "This means that Emacs could not find the language grammar library."
msgstr "つまり、Emacsが言語文法ライブラリを見つけられなかったということです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(symbol-error <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(symbol-error <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"This means that Emacs could not find in the library the expected function "
"that every language grammar library should export."
msgstr ""
"つまり、Emacsはライブラリの中から、あらゆる言語文法ライブラリがエクスポートす"
"べき想定の関数を見つけられなかったということです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(version-mismatch <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var>)</"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(version-mismatch <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var>)</"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"This means that the version of the language grammar library is incompatible "
"with that of the tree-sitter library."
msgstr ""
"これは、言語文法ライブラリのバージョンがTree-sitterライブラリのバージョンと互"
"換性がないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Language-Grammar.html
msgid ""
"In all of these cases, <var class=\"var\">error-msg</var> might provide "
"additional details about the failure."
msgstr ""
