# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lisp-and-Coding-Systems.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the type of end-of-line (a.k.a. <em class=\"dfn\">eol</"
"em>)  conversion used by <var class=\"var\">coding-system</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">coding-system</var> specifies a certain eol conversion, the "
"return value is an integer 0, 1, or 2, standing for <code "
"class=\"code\">unix</code>, <code class=\"code\">dos</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">mac</code>, respectively.  If <var class=\"var\">coding-"
"system</var> doesn&rsquo;t specify eol conversion explicitly, the return "
"value is a vector of coding systems, each one with one of the possible eol "
"conversion types, like this:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">coding-system</var> で使用される行末（別名 "
"<em class=\"dfn\">eol</em>）変換の型を返します。<var class=\"var\">coding-"
"system</var> で特定の行末変換が指定されている場合、戻り値は <code "
"class=\"code\">unix</code>、<code class=\"code\">dos</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">mac</code> をそれぞれ表す整数 0、1、または 2 となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">coding-system</var> で行末変換が明示的に指定されていない場合、"
"戻り値は以下のような、考えられる行末変換型のいずれかをそれぞれ持つコーディン"
"グシステムのベクトルとなります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Lisp-and-Coding-Systems.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(coding-system-eol-type 'latin-1)\n"
"     &rArr; [latin-1-unix latin-1-dos latin-1-mac]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Lisp-and-Coding-Systems.html
msgid ""
"If this function returns a vector, Emacs will decide, as part of the text "
"encoding or decoding process, what eol conversion to use.  For decoding, the "
"end-of-line format of the text is auto-detected, and the eol conversion is "
"set to match it (e.g., DOS-style CRLF format will imply <code "
"class=\"code\">dos</code> eol conversion).  For encoding, the eol conversion "
"is taken from the appropriate default coding system (e.g., default value of "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-file-coding-system</code> for <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-file-coding-system</code>), or from the default eol "
"conversion appropriate for the underlying platform."
msgstr ""
"この関数がベクトルを返す場合、Emacsはテキストのエンコードまたはデコード処理の"
"一環として、どのEOL変換を使用するかを決定します。デコード時には、テキストの行"
