#: build/html/elisp/List-Elements.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the length of <var class=\"var\">list</var>, with no "
"risk of either an error or an infinite loop.  It generally returns the "
"number of distinct cons cells in the list.  However, for circular lists, the "
"value is just an upper bound; it is often too large."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、エラーや無限ループのリスクなく <var class=\"var\">list</var> の長"
"さを返します。通常、リスト内の異なるコンスセルの数を返します。ただし、循環リ"
"ストの場合、この値は単に上限に過ぎず、大きすぎることがよくあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Elements.html
msgid ""
