"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-butlast\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Elements.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the list <var class=\"var\">x</var> with the last "
"element, or the last <var class=\"var\">n</var> elements, removed.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> is greater than zero it makes a copy of the list so as "
"not to damage the original list.  In general, <code class=\"code\">(append "
"(butlast <var class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">n</var>)  (last <var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">n</var>))</code> will return a list "
"equal to <var class=\"var\">x</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、最後の要素、または最後の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 個の要素を取"
"り除いたリスト <var class=\"var\">x</var> を返します。<var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> が 0 より大きい場合は、元のリストを変更しないようリストのコピーを作成し"
"ます。一般に、<code class=\"code\">(append (butlast <var class=\"var\">x</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">n</var>)  (last <var class=\"var\">x</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>))</code> は <var class=\"var\">x</var> と等しいリストを"
"返します。"

