#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this variable holds a function for "
"finding the beginning of a defun.  The function <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> calls this function instead of "
"using its normal method, passing it its optional argument.  If the argument "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function should move back by "
