# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs is compiled with tree-sitter, it can use the tree-sitter parser "
"information to move across syntax constructs.  Since what exactly is "
"considered a defun varies between languages, a major mode should set <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-defun-type-regexp</code> to determine that.  Then the "
"mode can get navigation-by-defun functionality for free, by using <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-beginning-of-defun</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-end-of-defun</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsをtree-sitter付きでコンパイルすると、tree-sitterのパーサー情報を利用して"
"構文構造間を移動できるようになります。具体的に何がdefunと見なされるかは言語に"
"よって異なるため、メジャーモード側で<code class=\"code\">treesit-defun-type-"
"regexp</code>を設定してそれを判定する必要があります。そうすれば、<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-beginning-of-defun</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-end-of-defun</code>を用いることで、defun単位のナビゲー"
"ション機能を無償で利用できるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-defun-type-regexp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002ddefun_002dtype_002dregexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-defun-type-regexp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002ddefun_002dtype_002dregexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This variable determines which nodes are considered defuns by Emacs.  It can "
"be a regexp that matches the type of defun nodes.  (For &ldquo;node&rdquo; "
"and &ldquo;node type&rdquo;, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Parsing-Program-"
"Source.html\">Parsing Program Source</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、Emacsがどのノードをdefunとみなすかを決定します。defunノードの型に"
"一致する正規表現を指定できます。（「node」および「node type」については、<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Parsing-Program-Source.html\">プログラムソースの解析</"
"a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"For example, <code class=\"code\">python-mode</code> sets this variable to a "
"regexp that matches either &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">function_definition</"
"samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">class_definition</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">python-mode</code> はこの変数を、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">function_definition</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">class_definition</samp>&rsquo; のいずれかにマッチする正規表現"
"に設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes not all nodes matched by the regexp are valid defuns.  Therefore, "
"this variable can also be a cons cell of the form (<var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">pred</var>), where "
"<var class=\"var\">pred</var> should be a function that takes a node as its "
"argument, and returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the node is a "
"valid defun, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it is not valid."
msgstr ""
"正規表現にマッチしたすべてのノードが有効な defun であるとは限りません。そのた"
"め、この変数は (<var class=\"var\">regexp</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">pred</var>) という形式の cons セルである場合もあり、ここで "
"<var class=\"var\">pred</var> はノードを引数として受け取り、そのノードが有効"
"な defun であれば non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、そうでなければ "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す関数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
