# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/List-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The function that is the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"sentence-function</code> determines how to move across syntax constructs "
"known as <em class=\"dfn\">sentences</em>.  Major modes can assign their own "
"functions to this variable to customize the behavior of <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> command.  If Emacs is compiled with "
"tree-sitter, it can use the tree-sitter parser information to move across "
"syntax constructs.  Since what exactly is considered a sentence varies "
"between languages, a major mode should set <code class=\"code\">treesit-"
"thing-settings</code> to determine that.  Then <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"sentence-function</code> will be set to <code class=\"code\">treesit-forward-"
"sentence</code>, and the mode will get navigation-by-sentence functionality "
"for free, by using <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">backward-sentence</code>(see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Moving-by-"
"Sentences.html#Moving-by-Sentences\">Moving by Sentences</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The extensible self-documenting text editor</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence-function</code> の値となる関数は、"
"<em class=\"dfn\">文</em>と呼ばれる構文構造間をどのように移動するかを決定しま"
"す。メジャーモードは、この変数に独自の関数を割り当てることで、<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> コマンドの動作をカスタマイズできます。"
"Emacs が tree-sitter 付きでコンパイルされている場合、tree-sitter のパーサー情"
"報を利用して構文構造間を移動できます。何をもって文とするかは言語によって異な"
"るため、メジャーモード側で <code class=\"code\">treesit-thing-settings</"
"code> を設定してそれを決定すべきです。すると <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"sentence-function</code> が <code class=\"code\">treesit-forward-sentence</"
"code> に設定され、<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">backward-sentence</code> を利用することで、モードは文単位のナ"
"ビゲーション機能を自動的に得ることになります（<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"extensible self-documenting text editor</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Moving-by-"
"Sentences.html#Moving-by-Sentences\">Moving by Sentences</a> を参照）。"

