#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.2 Load Suffixes<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Load-"
"Suffixes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.2 ロードサフィックス<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Load-"
"Suffixes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"We now describe some technical details about the exact suffixes that <code "
"class=\"code\">load</code> tries."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、<code class=\"code\">load</code> が試行する厳密な接尾辞に関する技術"
"的な詳細について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"load_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"load_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"This is a list of suffixes indicating (compiled or source) Emacs Lisp "
"files.  It should not include the empty string.  <code class=\"code\">load</"
"code> uses these suffixes in order when it appends Lisp suffixes to the "
"specified file name.  The standard value is <code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;.elc&quot; &quot;.el&quot;)</code> which produces the "
"behavior described in the previous section."
msgstr ""
"これは、（コンパイル済みまたはソースの）Emacs Lispファイルを示すサフィックス"
"の一覧です。空文字列は含まれないはずです。<code class=\"code\">load</code> "
"は、指定されたファイル名にLispサフィックスを付加する際、これらのサフィックス"
"を順に使用します。標準値は <code class=\"code\">(&quot;.elc&quot; "
"&quot;.el&quot;)</code> であり、前節で説明した動作になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-file-rep-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dfile_002drep_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-file-rep-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dfile_002drep_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"This is a list of suffixes that indicate representations of the same file.  "
"This list should normally start with the empty string.  When <code "
"class=\"code\">load</code> searches for a file it appends the suffixes in "
"this list, in order, to the file name, before searching for another file."
msgstr ""
"これは、同一ファイルの表現を示す接尾辞の一覧です。通常、この一覧は空文字列か"
"ら始まります。<code class=\"code\">load</code> がファイルを検索する際は、別の"
"ファイルを検索する前に、この一覧にある接尾辞を順にファイル名に付加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"Enabling Auto Compression mode appends the suffixes in <code "
"class=\"code\">jka-compr-load-suffixes</code> to this list and disabling "
"Auto Compression mode removes them again.  The standard value of <code "
"class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> if Auto Compression mode is "
"disabled is <code class=\"code\">(&quot;&quot;)</code>.  Given that the "
"standard value of <code class=\"code\">jka-compr-load-suffixes</code> is "
"<code class=\"code\">(&quot;.gz&quot;)</code>, the standard value of <code "
"class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> if Auto Compression mode is "
"enabled is <code class=\"code\">(&quot;&quot; &quot;.gz&quot;)</code>."
msgstr ""
"自動圧縮モードを有効にすると、<code class=\"code\">jka-compr-load-suffixes</"
"code> のサフィックスがこのリストに追加され、自動圧縮モードを無効にすると再び"
"削除されます。自動圧縮モードが無効な場合の <code class=\"code\">load-file-"
"rep-suffixes</code> の標準値は <code class=\"code\">(&quot;&quot;)</code> で"
"す。<code class=\"code\">jka-compr-load-suffixes</code> の標準値が <code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;.gz&quot;)</code> であることから、自動圧縮モードが有効"
"な場合の <code class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> の標準値は <code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;&quot; &quot;.gz&quot;)</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-load-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dload_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-load-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"get_002dload_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the list of all suffixes that <code "
"class=\"code\">load</code> should try, in order, when its <var "
"class=\"var\">must-suffix</var> argument is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  This takes both <code class=\"code\">load-suffixes</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> into account.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">load-suffixes</code>, <code class=\"code\">jka-compr-load-"
"suffixes</code> and <code class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> all "
"have their standard values, this function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;.elc&quot; &quot;.elc.gz&quot; &quot;.el&quot; "
"&quot;.el.gz&quot;)</code> if Auto Compression mode is enabled and <code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;.elc&quot; &quot;.el&quot;)</code> if Auto Compression "
"mode is disabled."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数 <var class=\"var\">must-suffix</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合に、<code class=\"code\">load</code> "
"が順に試行すべきすべてのサフィックスのリストを返します。ここでは <code "
"class=\"code\">load-suffixes</code> と <code class=\"code\">load-file-rep-"
"suffixes</code> の両方が考慮されます。<code class=\"code\">load-suffixes</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">jka-compr-load-suffixes</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> がすべて標準値である場合、この関"
"数は自動圧縮モードが有効なときは <code class=\"code\">(&quot;.elc&quot; "
"&quot;.elc.gz&quot; &quot;.el&quot; &quot;.el.gz&quot;)</code> を、無効なとき"
"は <code class=\"code\">(&quot;.elc&quot; &quot;.el&quot;)</code> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"To summarize, <code class=\"code\">load</code> normally first tries the "
"suffixes in the value of <code class=\"code\">(get-load-suffixes)</code> and "
"then those in <code class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">nosuffix</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"skips the former group, and if <var class=\"var\">must-suffix</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it skips the latter group."
msgstr ""
"まとめると、<code class=\"code\">load</code> は通常、まず <code "
"class=\"code\">(get-load-suffixes)</code> の値に含まれるサフィックスを試し、"
"次に <code class=\"code\">load-file-rep-suffixes</code> に含まれるものを試行"
"します。<var class=\"var\">nosuffix</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の場合は前者のグループをスキップし、<var class=\"var\">must-suffix</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は後者のグループをスキップしま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">load-prefer-newer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"load_002dprefer_002dnewer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">load-prefer-newer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dprefer_002dnewer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Load-Suffixes.html
msgid ""
"If this option is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then rather than "
"stopping at the first suffix that exists, <code class=\"code\">load</code> "
"tests them all, and uses whichever file is the newest."
msgstr ""
"このオプションが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、最初に見つかった"
"サフィックスで停止するのではなく、<code class=\"code\">load</code> はそれらを"
"すべて検証し、最も新しいファイルを使用します。"

