msgid "Macro calls (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Macros.html\">Macros</a>)."
msgstr ""
"マクロ呼び出し（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Macros.html\">マクロ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
