# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Local-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Variables can also have buffer-local bindings (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer_002dLocal-Variables.html\">Buffer-Local Variables</a>); a few "
"variables have terminal-local bindings (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple Terminals</a>).  These kinds of "
"bindings work somewhat like ordinary local bindings, but they are localized "
"depending on where you are in Emacs."
msgstr ""
"変数にはバッファローカルな束縛を持たせることもできます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer_002dLocal-Variables.html\">バッファローカル変数</a>を参照）。ま"
"た、一部の変数にはターミナルローカルな束縛があります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を参照）。こうした束縛は通"
"常のローカル束縛とある程度同様に動作しますが、Emacs内の位置に応じて局所化され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
