"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Logging-Messages-in-_002aMessages_002a\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.4.3 <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp>におけるメッセージのログ記"
"録<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Logging-Messages-in-"
"_002aMessages_002a\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-logging-echo_002darea-messages\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-logging-echo_002darea-messages\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"Almost all the messages displayed in the echo area are also recorded in the "
"<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer so that the user can refer "
"back to them.  This includes all the messages that are output with <code "
"class=\"code\">message</code>.  By default, this buffer is read-only and "
"uses the major mode <code class=\"code\">messages-buffer-mode</code>.  "
"Nothing prevents the user from killing the <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</"
"samp> buffer, but the next display of a message recreates it.  Any Lisp code "
"that needs to access the <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer "
"directly and wants to ensure that it exists should use the function <code "
"class=\"code\">messages-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"エコーエリアに表示されるほぼすべてのメッセージは、ユーザーが後で参照できるよ"
"う、<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファにも記録されます。これに"
"は <code class=\"code\">message</code> で出力されるすべてのメッセージが含まれ"
"ます。デフォルトでは、このバッファは読み取り専用であり、メジャーモード <code "
"class=\"code\">messages-buffer-mode</code> が使用されます。ユーザーが <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファを破棄することを妨げるものは何もあり"
"ませんが、次にメッセージが表示される際に再作成されます。<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファに直接アクセスする必要があり、かつそ"
"の存在を確実にしたい Lisp コードは、関数 <code class=\"code\">messages-"
"buffer</code> を使用する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">messages-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"messages_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">messages-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"messages_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer.  If "
"it does not exist, it creates it, and switches it to <code "
"class=\"code\">messages-buffer-mode</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp>バッファを返します。存在しな"
"い場合はバッファを作成し、<code class=\"code\">messages-buffer-mode</code>に"
"切り替えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">message-log-max</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"message_002dlog_002dmax\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">message-log-max</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-message_002dlog_002dmax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies how many lines to keep in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer.  The value <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> means there is no limit on how many lines to keep.  The value <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> disables message logging entirely.  Here&rsquo;s "
"how to display a message and prevent it from being logged:"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファに保持する行数を指"
"定します。値 <code class=\"code\">t</code> は、保持する行数に制限がないことを"
"意味します。値 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> は、メッセージのログ記録を完全"
"に無効にします。メッセージを表示しつつ、ログに記録されないようにする方法は以"
"下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let (message-log-max)\n"
"  (message ...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">messages-buffer-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"messages_002dbuffer_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">messages-buffer-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"messages_002dbuffer_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"This variable has the name of the buffer where messages should be logged to, "
"and defaults to <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp>.  Some packages may "
"find it useful to temporarily redirect the output to a different buffer "
"(perhaps to write the buffer out to a log file later), and they can bind "
"this variable to a different buffer name.  (Note that this buffer (if it "
"doesn&rsquo;t exist already), will be created and put into <code "
"class=\"code\">messages-buffer-mode</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、メッセージをログ出力するバッファの名前を指定するもので、デフォル"
"トは <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> です。パッケージによっては、出力"
"を一時的に別のバッファにリダイレクトすること（後でバッファの内容をログファイ"
"ルに書き出すためなど）が有用な場合があり、その場合はこの変数を別のバッファ名"
"にバインドできます。（なお、このバッファは（まだ存在しない場合は）作成され、"
"<code class=\"code\">messages-buffer-mode</code> に格納されます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"To make <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> more convenient for the user, "
"the logging facility combines successive identical messages.  It also "
"combines successive related messages for the sake of two cases: question "
"followed by answer, and a series of progress messages."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> をユーザーにとってより使いやすくするた"
"め、ロギング機能では連続する同一メッセージを統合します。また、「質問に続く回"
"答」および「一連の進捗メッセージ」という2つのケースにおいて、関連する連続メッ"
"セージも統合します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"A question followed by an answer has two messages like the ones produced by "
"<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code>: the first is &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">question</var></samp>&rsquo;, and the "
"second is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">question</var>..."
"<var class=\"var\">answer</var></samp>&rsquo;.  The first message conveys no "
"additional information beyond what&rsquo;s in the second, so logging the "
"second message discards the first from the log."
msgstr ""
"質問とそれに続く回答は、<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> によって生成され"
"るものと同様に、2つのメッセージを持ちます。1つ目は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">question</var></samp>&rsquo;、2つ目は "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">question</var>...<var "
"class=\"var\">answer</var></samp>&rsquo; です。1つ目のメッセージは、2つ目の"
"メッセージに含まれる内容以上の追加情報を伝えないため、2つ目のメッセージをログ"
"に記録すると、1つ目のメッセージはログから除外されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"A series of progress messages has successive messages like those produced by "
"<code class=\"code\">make-progress-reporter</code>.  They have the form "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">base</var>...<var "
"class=\"var\">how-far</var></samp>&rsquo;, where <var class=\"var\">base</"
"var> is the same each time, while <var class=\"var\">how-far</var> varies.  "
"Logging each message in the series discards the previous one, provided they "
"are consecutive."
msgstr ""
"一連の進捗メッセージには、<code class=\"code\">make-progress-reporter</code> "
"によって生成されるようなメッセージが連続して含まれます。これらは &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">base</var>...<var class=\"var\">how-"
"far</var></samp>&rsquo; という形式をとり、<var class=\"var\">base</var> は毎"
"回同一で、<var class=\"var\">how-far</var> は変動します。一連の各メッセージを"
"ログに記録すると、それらが連続している限り、直前のメッセージは破棄されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Logging-Messages.html
msgid ""
"The functions <code class=\"code\">make-progress-reporter</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> don&rsquo;t have to do anything special to "
"activate the message log combination feature.  It operates whenever two "
"consecutive messages are logged that share a common prefix ending in &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">...</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"メッセージログの組み合わせ機能を有効にするために、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">make-progress-reporter</code> と <code class=\"code\">y-or-n-"
"p</code> が特別な処理を行う必要はありません。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..."
"</samp>&rsquo; で終わる共通のプレフィックスを持つ2つの連続したメッセージがロ"
"グに記録されるたびに、この機能が動作します。"

