"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Longest-Match.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backtracking-and-POSIX-regular-"
"expressions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backtracking-and-POSIX-regular-"
"expressions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Longest-Match.html
msgid ""
"The usual regular expression functions do backtracking when necessary to "
"handle the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; and repetition "
"constructs, but they continue this only until they find <em "
"class=\"emph\">some</em> match.  Then they succeed and report the first "
"match found."
msgstr ""
"通常の正規表現関数は、「<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>」や繰り返し構文を処理"
"するために必要に応じてバックトラッキングを行いますが、これを行うのは<em "
"class=\"emph\">いずれかの</em>マッチが見つかるまでです。その後、関数は成功"
"し、最初に見つかったマッチを報告します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Longest-Match.html
msgid ""
"This section describes alternative search functions which perform the full "
"backtracking specified by the POSIX standard for regular expression "
"matching.  They continue backtracking until they have tried all "
"possibilities and found all matches, so they can report the longest match, "
"as required by POSIX.  This is much slower, so use these functions only when "
"you really need the longest match."
msgstr ""
"本節では、正規表現マッチングにおいてPOSIX標準で規定されている完全なバックト"
"ラッキングを実行する代替検索関数について説明します。これらの関数は、あらゆる"
"可能性を試してすべてのマッチが見つかるまでバックトラッキングを継続するため、"
"POSIXの規定通りに最長のマッチを報告することができます。この方式は処理速度が大"
"幅に低下するため、本当に最長のマッチが必要な場合にのみこれらの関数を使用して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Longest-Match.html
msgid ""
"Despite their names, the POSIX search and match functions use Emacs regular "
"expressions, not POSIX regular expressions.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"POSIX-Regexps.html\">Emacs versus POSIX Regular Expressions</a>.  "
"Also, they do not properly support the non-greedy repetition operators (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexp-Special.html\">non-greedy</a>).  This is "
"because POSIX backtracking conflicts with the semantics of non-greedy "
"repetition."
msgstr ""
"名称にかかわらず、POSIXの検索・マッチ関数はPOSIX正規表現ではなく、Emacsの正規"
"表現を使用しています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"POSIX-Regexps.html\">Emacsと"
"POSIX正規表現の比較</a>を参照してください。また、これらの関数は非貪欲繰り返し"
"演算子を適切にサポートしていません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexp-"
"Special.html\">非貪欲</a>を参照）。これは、POSIXのバックトラッキングが非貪欲"
"繰り返しのセマンティクスと競合するためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Longest-Match.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">posix-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">regexp "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-posix_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
