# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"Return a new font spec using the specifications in <var "
"class=\"var\">arguments</var>, which should come in <code "
"class=\"code\">property</code>-<code class=\"code\">value</code> pairs.  The "
"possible specifications are as follows:"
msgstr ""
