"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Fonts.html#Fonts\">Fonts</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:slant</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:slant</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"These have the same meanings as the face attributes of the same name.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Face-Attributes.html\">Face Attributes</a>.  <code "
"class=\"code\">:family</code> and <code class=\"code\">:foundry</code> are "
"strings or symbols, while the other three are either symbols or numbers, the "
"numerical values of the valid style symbols.  As example values, <code "
"class=\"code\">:slant</code> may be <code class=\"code\">italic</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">:weight</code> may be <code class=\"code\">bold</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">:width</code> may be <code class=\"code\">normal</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"これらは、同名のフェイス属性と同じ意味を持ちます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Face-Attributes.html\">フェイス属性</a>を参照してください。<code "
"class=\"code\">:family</code> と <code class=\"code\">:foundry</code> は文字"
"列またはシンボルであり、他の3つはシンボルまたは数値（有効なスタイルシンボルの"
"数値）です。値の例として、<code class=\"code\">:slant</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">italic</code>、<code class=\"code\">:weight</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">bold</code>、<code class=\"code\">:width</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">normal</code> となる場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:size</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:size</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The font size&mdash;either a non-negative integer that specifies the pixel "
"size, or a floating-point number that specifies the point size."
msgstr ""
"フォントサイズ&mdash;ピクセルサイズを指定する非負整数、またはポイントサイズを"
"指定する浮動小数点数。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
