# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The charset registry and encoding of the font, such as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">iso8859-1</samp>&rsquo;.  The value should be a string or a "
"symbol."
msgstr ""
"文字セットレジストリおよびフォントのエンコーディング（例：&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">iso8859-1</samp>&rsquo;）。値は文字列またはシンボルである必要"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:dpi</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:dpi</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The resolution in dots per inch for which the font is designed.  The value "
"must be a non-negative number."
msgstr "フォントの設計解像度（dpi）。値は0以上の数値である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:spacing</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:spacing</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The spacing of the font: proportional, dual, mono, or charcell.  The value "
"should be either an integer (0 for proportional, 90 for dual, 100 for mono, "
"110 for charcell) or a one-letter symbol (one of <code class=\"code\">P</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">D</code>, <code class=\"code\">M</code>, or "
"<code class=\"code\">C</code>)."
msgstr ""
"フォントの間隔：proportional、dual、mono、またはcharcell。値は、整数"
"（proportionalの場合は0、dualの場合は90、monoの場合は100、charcellの場合は"
"110）、または1文字の記号（<code class=\"code\">P</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">D</code>、<code class=\"code\">M</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">C</code>のいずれか）とします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:avgwidth</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:avgwidth</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The average width of the font in 1/10 pixel units.  The value should be a "
"non-negative number."
msgstr ""
"フォントの平均幅（1/10ピクセル単位）。値は0以上の数値である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:script</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:script</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "The script that the font must support (a symbol)."
msgstr "フォントが対応すべきスクリプト（記号）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:lang</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:lang</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The language that the font should support.  The value should be a symbol "
"whose name is a two-letter ISO-639 language name.  On X, the value is "
"matched against the &ldquo;Additional Style&rdquo; field of the XLFD name of "
"a font, if it is non-empty.  On MS-Windows, fonts matching the spec are "
"required to support codepages needed for the language.  Currently, only a "
"small set of CJK languages is supported with this property: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ja</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ko</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">zh</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"フォントがサポートすべき言語。値は、2文字のISO-639言語名を持つシンボルである"
"必要があります。Xでは、値が空でない場合、フォントのXLFD名の「Additional "
"Style」フィールドと照合されます。MS-Windowsでは、仕様に一致するフォントは、そ"
"の言語に必要なコードページをサポートする必要があります。現在、このプロパティ"
"でサポートされているCJK言語は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ja</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ko</samp>&rsquo;、および&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">zh</samp>&rsquo;のごく一部のみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-OpenType-font\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:otf</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-OpenType-font\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-OpenType-font\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:otf</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-OpenType-font\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The font must be an OpenType font that supports these OpenType features, "
"provided Emacs is compiled with a library, such as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">libotf</samp>&rsquo; on GNU/Linux, that supports complex text "
"layout for scripts which need that.  The value must be a list of the form"
msgstr ""
"フォントは、これらのOpenType機能をサポートするOpenTypeフォントである必要があ"
"ります。ただし、GNU/Linux上の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">libotf</samp>&rsquo;"
"のように、それを必要とするスクリプト向けの複雑なテキストレイアウトをサポート"
"するライブラリを用いてEmacsがコンパイルされていることが条件となります。値は、"
"以下の形式のリストである必要があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">script-tag</var> <var class=\"var\">langsys-tag</var> <var class=\"var\">gsub</var> <var class=\"var\">gpos</var>)</code>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"where <var class=\"var\">script-tag</var> is the OpenType script tag symbol; "
"<var class=\"var\">langsys-tag</var> is the OpenType language system tag "
"symbol, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to use the default language "
"system; <code class=\"code\">gsub</code> is a list of OpenType GSUB feature "
"tag symbols, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if none is required; and "
"<code class=\"code\">gpos</code> is a list of OpenType GPOS feature tag "
"symbols, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if none is required.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">gsub</code> or <code class=\"code\">gpos</code> is a list, a "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> element in that list means that the font "
"must not match any of the remaining tag symbols.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">gpos</code> element may be omitted.  For the list of OpenType "
"script, language, and feature tags, see <a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/ttoreg\">the list of "
"registered OTF tags</a>."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">script-tag</var> は OpenType スクリプトタグ記号、"
"<var class=\"var\">langsys-tag</var> は OpenType 言語システムタグ記号（または"
"デフォルトの言語システムを使用する場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>）、"
"<code class=\"code\">gsub</code> は OpenType GSUB フィーチャータグ記号のリス"
"ト（いずれも不要な場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>）、<code "
"class=\"code\">gpos</code> は OpenType GPOS フィーチャータグ記号のリスト（い"
"ずれも不要な場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>）です。<code "
"class=\"code\">gsub</code> または <code class=\"code\">gpos</code> がリストで"
"ある場合、そのリスト内の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 要素は、そのフォント"
"が残りのタグ記号のいずれにも一致してはならないことを意味します。<code "
"class=\"code\">gpos</code> 要素は省略可能です。OpenType スクリプト、言語、お"
"よびフィーチャータグの一覧については、<a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://"
"docs.microsoft.com/en-us/typography/opentype/spec/ttoreg\">登録済み OTF タグ"
"の一覧</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font-backend\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:type</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-font-backend\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font-backend\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">:type</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-font-backend\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Font.html
msgid ""
"The symbol that specifies the <em class=\"dfn\">font backend</em> used to "
"draw the characters.  The possible values depend on the platform and on how "
"Emacs was configured at build time.  Typical values include <code "
"class=\"code\">ftcrhb</code> and <code class=\"code\">xfthb</code> on X, "
"<code class=\"code\">harfbuzz</code> on MS-Windows, <code class=\"code\">ns</"
"code> on GNUstep, etc.  It can also be <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"left unspecified, typically in a font-spec."
msgstr ""
"文字の描画に使用する<em class=\"dfn\">フォントバックエンド</em>を指定するシン"
"ボルです。取り得る値は、プラットフォームやビルド時のEmacsの設定によって異なり"
"ます。代表的な値としては、Xでは<code class=\"code\">ftcrhb</code>や<code "
"class=\"code\">xfthb</code>、MS-Windowsでは<code class=\"code\">harfbuzz</"
"code>、GNUstepでは<code class=\"code\">ns</code>などが挙げられます。また、通"
