# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"<span>23.13 Low-Level Key Binding<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.13 低レベルキーバインド<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-low_002dlevel-key-bindings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-low_002dlevel-key-bindings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"Historically, Emacs has supported a number of different syntaxes for "
"defining keys.  The documented way to bind a key today is to use the syntax "
"supported by <code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code>, which is what all the "
"functions like <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code> supports.  This section documents the "
"old-style syntax and interface functions; they should not be used in new "
"code."
msgstr ""
"従来、Emacsではキーを定義するためのさまざまな構文がサポートされてきました。現"
"在、ドキュメントで推奨されているキーバインドの方法は、<code "
"class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code>でサポートされている構文を使用することであ"
"り、これは<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code>や<code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-lookup</code>といったすべての関数でもサポートされていま"
"す。本セクションでは、旧形式の構文およびインターフェース関数について説明しま"
"す。これらを新しいコードで使用すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-meta-character-key-constants\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-control-character-key-constants\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-meta-character-key-constants\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-control-character-key-constants\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">define-key</code> (and other low-level functions that "
"are used to rebind keys) understand a number of different syntaxes for the "
"keys."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">define-key</code>（およびキーの再バインドに使用されるそ"
"の他の低レベル関数）は、キーに関する複数の異なる構文に対応しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid "A vector containing lists of keys."
msgstr "キーのリストを含むベクトル。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"You can use a list containing modifier names plus one base event (a "
"character or function key name).  For example, <code "
"class=\"code\">[(control ?a)  (meta b)]</code> is equivalent to <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a M-b</kbd> and <code class=\"code\">[(hyper control left)]</"
"code> is equivalent to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-H-left</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"修飾子名と1つのベースイベント（文字またはファンクションキー名）を含むリストを"
"使用できます。例えば、<code class=\"code\">[(control ?a)  (meta b)]</code>は"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a M-b</kbd>と同等であり、<code class=\"code\">[(hyper "
"control left)]</code>は<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-H-left</kbd>と同等です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid "A string of characters with modifiers"
msgstr "修飾子付きの文字列"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"Internally, key sequences are often represented as strings using the special "
"escape sequences for shift, control and meta modifiers (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"String-Type.html\">String Type</a>), but this "
"representation can also be used by users when rebinding keys.  A string like "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;\\M-x&quot;</code> is read as containing a single "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>, <code class=\"code\">&quot;\\C-f&quot;</code> "
"is read as containing a single <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;\\M-\\C-x&quot;</code> and <code class=\"code\">&quot;"
"\\C-\\M-x&quot;</code> are both read as containing a single <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"内部的には、キーシーケンスはシフト、コントロール、メタ修飾子用の特殊なエス"
"ケープシーケンスを用いた文字列として表現されることが多いですが（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"String-Type.html\">文字列型</a>を参照）、この表現は"
"ユーザーがキーを再バインドする際にも利用できます。<code class=\"code\">&quot;"
"\\M-x&quot;</code> のような文字列は単一の <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> を含む"
"ものとして、<code class=\"code\">&quot;\\C-f&quot;</code> は単一の <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> を含むものとして、そして <code class=\"code\">&quot;"
"\\M-\\C-x&quot;</code> と <code class=\"code\">&quot;\\C-\\M-x&quot;</code> "
"はともに単一の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> を含むものとして読み込まれま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid "A vector of characters and key symbols"
msgstr "文字とキーシンボルのベクトル"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"This is the other internal representation of key sequences.  It supports a "
"fuller range of modifiers than the string representation, and also support "
"function keys.  An example is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[?\\C-\\H-"
"x&nbsp;home]</samp>&rsquo;, which represents the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-H-"
"x&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">home</kbd></kbd> key sequence.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Character-Type.html\">Character Type</a>."
msgstr ""
"こちらは、キーシーケンスのもう一つの内部表現です。文字列表現よりも幅広い修飾"
"子をサポートしており、ファンクションキーにも対応しています。例として、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-H-x&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">home</kbd></kbd> キーシーケンスを"
"表す &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[?\\C-\\H-x&nbsp;home]</samp>&rsquo; が挙げ"
"られます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Character-Type.html\">文字型</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-key</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"binding &amp;optional remove</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dkey\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-key</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap key "
"binding &amp;optional remove</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dkey\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">Changing Key Bindings</"
"a>, but understands only the legacy key syntaxes."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> のようなものです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-Key-Bindings.html\">キーバインドの変更</a> を"
"参照）。ただし、従来のキー構文のみを認識します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Key-Binding.html
msgid ""
"In addition, this function also has a <var class=\"var\">remove</var> "
"argument.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the definition will "
"be removed.  This is almost the same as setting the definition to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, but makes a difference if the <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> has a parent, and <var class=\"var\">key</var> is "
"shadowing the same binding in the parent.  With <var class=\"var\">remove</"
"var>, subsequent lookups will return the binding in the parent, whereas with "
"a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> definition the lookups will return <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"さらに、この関数には <var class=\"var\">remove</var> 引数もあります。これが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、定義は削除されます。これは定義を "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定するのとほぼ同様ですが、<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> に親があり、<var class=\"var\">key</var> が親にお"
"ける同一のバインディングをシャドウイングしている場合には違いが生じます。<var "
"class=\"var\">remove</var> の場合、それ以降のルックアップでは親のバインディン"
"グが返されますが、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の定義ではルックアップの結"
"果は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
