# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Kill-Ring.html
msgid ""
"These functions and variables provide access to the kill ring at a lower "
"level, but are still convenient for use in Lisp programs, because they take "
"care of interaction with window system selections (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-System-Selections.html\">Window System Selections</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数や変数は、より低レベルでキルリングへのアクセスを提供しますが、"
"ウィンドウシステムの選択とのやり取りを処理してくれるため、Lispプログラムにお"
"いても便利に利用できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-System-"
"Selections.html\">ウィンドウシステムの選択</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
