# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Kill-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> rotates the yanking "
"pointer, which designates the front of the kill ring, by <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> places (from newer kills to older ones), and returns "
"the text at that place in the ring."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> は、キルリングの先頭を示すヤン"
"クポインタを <var class=\"var\">n</var> 箇所分（新しいキルから古いキルへ）回"
"転させ、リング内のその位置にあるテキストを返します。"

