#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span>36.6.4 Low-Level Parsing<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Low_002dLevel-Parsing-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>36.6.4 低レベル構文解析<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Low_002dLevel-Parsing-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"The most basic way to use the expression parser is to tell it to start at a "
"given position with a certain state, and parse up to a specified end "
"position."
msgstr ""
"式パーサーの最も基本的な使い方は、特定の状態で、指定された位置から開始し、指"
"定した終了位置まで解析させるというものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">parse-partial-sexp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"limit &amp;optional target-depth stop-before state stop-comment</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-parse_002dpartial_002dsexp\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">parse-partial-sexp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"limit &amp;optional target-depth stop-before state stop-comment</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-parse_002dpartial_002dsexp\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function parses a sexp in the current buffer starting at <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var>, not scanning past <var class=\"var\">limit</"
"var>.  It stops at position <var class=\"var\">limit</var> or when certain "
"criteria described below are met, and sets point to the location where "
"parsing stops.  It returns a parser state describing the status of the parse "
"at the point where it stops."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内で <var class=\"var\">start</var> から始まる "
"sexp を解析し、<var class=\"var\">limit</var> を越えてスキャンすることはあり"
"ません。位置 <var class=\"var\">limit</var> に達したとき、または以下に述べる"
"特定の条件が満たされたときに解析を停止し、ポイントを解析停止位置に設定しま"
"す。そして、停止位置における解析状態を示すパーサー状態を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parenthesis-depth\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parenthesis-depth\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If the third argument <var class=\"var\">target-depth</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, parsing stops if the depth in parentheses becomes "
"equal to <var class=\"var\">target-depth</var>.  The depth starts at 0, or "
"at whatever is given in <var class=\"var\">state</var>."
msgstr ""
"第3引数 <var class=\"var\">target-depth</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、括弧内の深度が <var class=\"var\">target-depth</var> と等し"
"くなるとパースが停止します。深度は 0、または <var class=\"var\">state</var> "
"で指定された値から始まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If the fourth argument <var class=\"var\">stop-before</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, parsing stops when it comes to any character that "
"starts a sexp.  If <var class=\"var\">stop-comment</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, parsing stops after the start of an unnested "
"comment.  If <var class=\"var\">stop-comment</var> is the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code>, parsing stops after the start of an "
"unnested comment or a string, or after the end of an unnested comment or a "
"string, whichever comes first."
msgstr ""
"第4引数 <var class=\"var\">stop-before</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、sexp を開始する文字が現れた時点でパースが停止します。<var "
"class=\"var\">stop-comment</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、ネストされていないコメントの開始時点でパースが停止します。<var "
"class=\"var\">stop-comment</var> がシンボル <code class=\"code\">syntax-"
"table</code> の場合、ネストされていないコメントまたは文字列の開始時点、あるい"
"はネストされていないコメントまたは文字列の終了時点のいずれか早い方でパースが"
"停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">state</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> is assumed to be at the top level of parenthesis "
"structure, such as the beginning of a function definition.  Alternatively, "
"you might wish to resume parsing in the middle of the structure.  To do "
"this, you must provide a <var class=\"var\">state</var> argument that "
"describes the initial status of parsing.  The value returned by a previous "
"call to <code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> will do nicely."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">state</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">start</var> は関数定義の冒頭など、括弧構造の最上位レベ"
"ルにあるものとみなされます。あるいは、構造の途中でパースを再開したい場合もあ"
"るでしょう。その場合は、パースの初期状態を示す <var class=\"var\">state</"
"var> 引数を指定する必要があります。以前に <code class=\"code\">parse-partial-"
"sexp</code> を呼び出した際に返された値が適しています。"

