#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"<span>10.2.6 Lisp Macro Evaluation<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Lisp-"
"Macro-Evaluation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.2.6 Lispマクロの評価<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Lisp-Macro-"
"Evaluation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-call-evaluation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-forms_002c-macro-call\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-macro-call-evaluation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-forms_002c-macro-call\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"If the first element of a list being evaluated is a macro object, then the "
"list is a <em class=\"dfn\">macro call</em>.  When a macro call is "
"evaluated, the elements of the rest of the list are <em class=\"emph\">not</"
"em> initially evaluated.  Instead, these elements themselves are used as the "
"arguments of the macro.  The macro definition computes a replacement form, "
"called the <em class=\"dfn\">expansion</em> of the macro, to be evaluated in "
"place of the original form.  The expansion may be any sort of form: a self-"
"evaluating constant, a symbol, or a list.  If the expansion is itself a "
"macro call, this process of expansion repeats until some other sort of form "
"results."
msgstr ""
"評価対象のリストの先頭要素がマクロオブジェクトである場合、そのリストは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">マクロ呼び出し</em>となります。マクロ呼び出しが評価される際、リ"
"ストの残りの要素は初期状態では<em class=\"emph\">評価されません</em>。代わり"
"に、これらの要素自体がマクロの引数として使用されます。マクロ定義では、元の形"
"式に代わって評価される、マクロの<em class=\"dfn\">展開</em>と呼ばれる置換形式"
"が計算されます。展開形式は、自己評価定数、シンボル、あるいはリストなど、どの"
"ような形式であっても構いません。もし展開形式自体がマクロ呼び出しである場合、"
"別の形式が得られるまで、この展開プロセスが繰り返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"Ordinary evaluation of a macro call finishes by evaluating the expansion.  "
"However, the macro expansion is not necessarily evaluated right away, or at "
"all, because other programs also expand macro calls, and they may or may not "
"evaluate the expansions."
msgstr ""
"マクロ呼び出しの通常の評価は、展開結果の評価をもって終了します。ただし、他の"
"プログラムもマクロ呼び出しを展開するため、それらが展開結果を評価する場合もあ"
"ればそうでない場合もあり、マクロ展開が直ちに、あるいはそもそも評価されるとは"
"限りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"Normally, the argument expressions are not evaluated as part of computing "
"the macro expansion, but instead appear as part of the expansion, so they "
"are computed when the expansion is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"通常、引数式はマクロ展開の計算過程としては評価されず、代わりに展開の一部とし"
"て現れるため、展開が評価される際に計算されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid "For example, given a macro defined as follows:"
msgstr "例えば、以下のように定義されたマクロがあるとします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro cadr (x)\n"
"  (list 'car (list 'cdr x)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"an expression such as <code class=\"code\">(cadr (assq 'handler list))</"
"code> is a macro call, and its expansion is:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(cadr (assq 'handler list))</code> のような式はマクロ呼"
"び出しであり、その展開は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(car (cdr (assq 'handler list)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Forms.html
msgid ""
"Note that the argument <code class=\"code\">(assq 'handler list)</code> "
"appears in the expansion."
msgstr ""
"展開に引数 <code class=\"code\">(assq 'handler list)</code> が現れることに注"
"意してください。"

