# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Type.html
msgid ""
"<span>2.4.14 Macro Type<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Macro-Type-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.14 マクロ型<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Macro-Type-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">Lisp macro</em> is a user-defined construct that extends "
"the Lisp language.  It is represented as an object much like a function, but "
"with different argument-passing semantics.  A Lisp macro has the form of a "
"list whose first element is the symbol <code class=\"code\">macro</code> and "
"whose <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> is a Lisp function object, including "
"the <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> symbol."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Lispマクロ</em>とは、Lisp言語を拡張するユーザー定義の構成要"
"素である。これは関数によく似たオブジェクトとして表現されるが、引数の渡し方に"
"関するセマンティクスが異なる。Lispマクロはリストの形式をとり、その第1要素はシ"
"ンボル <code class=\"code\">macro</code> であり、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> は <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> シンボルを含むLisp関数オブジェク"
"トである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Type.html
msgid ""
"Lisp macro objects are usually defined with the built-in <code "
"class=\"code\">defmacro</code> macro, but any list that begins with <code "
"class=\"code\">macro</code> is a macro as far as Emacs is concerned.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Macros.html\">Macros</a>, for an explanation of how to "
"write a macro."
msgstr ""
"Lispのマクロオブジェクトは通常、組み込みの<code class=\"code\">defmacro</"
"code>マクロを用いて定義されますが、Emacsにとっては<code "
"class=\"code\">macro</code>で始まるあらゆるリストがマクロとなります。マクロの"
"書き方については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Macros.html\">マクロ</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Macro-Type.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning</strong>: Lisp macros and keyboard macros "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">Keyboard Macros</a>) "
"are entirely different things.  When we use the word &ldquo;macro&rdquo; "
"without qualification, we mean a Lisp macro, not a keyboard macro."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">注意</strong>: Lispマクロとキーボードマクロ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">キーボードマクロ</a>を参照）は"
"全く別物です。特に断りなく「マクロ」という言葉を使う場合は、キーボードマクロ"
"ではなくLispマクロのことを指します。"

