# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span>26.12 Making Certain File Names &ldquo;Magic&rdquo;<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Making-Certain-File-Names-_0060_0060Magic_0027_0027\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>26.12 特定のファイル名を「マジック」にする<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Making-Certain-File-Names-_0060_0060Magic_0027_0027\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-magic-file-names\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-magic-file-names\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"You can implement special handling for certain file names.  This is called "
"making those names <em class=\"dfn\">magic</em>.  The principal use for this "
"feature is in implementing access to remote files (see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Remote-Files.html#Remote-Files\">Remote Files</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"特定のファイル名に対して特別な処理を実装できます。これを、それらの名前を<em "
"class=\"dfn\">マジック</em>にすると呼びます。この機能の主な用途は、リモート"
"ファイルへのアクセスを実現することです（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Remote-Files.html#Remote-Files\">Remote Files</"
"a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"To define a kind of magic file name, you must supply a regular expression to "
"define the class of names (all those that match the regular expression), "
"plus a handler that implements all the primitive Emacs file operations for "
"file names that match."
msgstr ""
"一種のマジックファイル名を定義するには、名前のクラス（その正規表現に一致する"
"ものすべて）を定義する正規表現と、一致するファイル名に対してEmacsのすべてのプ"
"リミティブなファイル操作を実装するハンドラを指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-name-handler\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file_002dname_002dhandler_002dalist\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-name-handler\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file_002dname_002dhandler_002dalist\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">file-name-handler-alist</code> holds a "
"list of handlers, together with regular expressions that determine when to "
"apply each handler.  Each element has this form:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">file-name-handler-alist</code> には、ハンドラのリス"
"トと、各ハンドラを適用するタイミングを決定する正規表現が格納されています。各"
"要素は以下の形式となっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> . <var class=\"var\">handler</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"All the Emacs primitives for file access and file name transformation check "
"the given file name against <code class=\"code\">file-name-handler-alist</"
"code>.  If the file name matches <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>, the "
"primitives handle that file by calling <var class=\"var\">handler</var>."
msgstr ""
"ファイルアクセスおよびファイル名変換を行うすべてのEmacsプリミティブは、指定さ"
"れたファイル名を<code class=\"code\">file-name-handler-alist</code>と照合しま"
"す。ファイル名が<var class=\"var\">regexp</var>に一致する場合、これらのプリミ"
"ティブは<var class=\"var\">handler</var>を呼び出すことでそのファイルを処理し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The first argument given to <var class=\"var\">handler</var> is the name of "
"the primitive, as a symbol; the remaining arguments are the arguments that "
"were passed to that primitive.  (The first of these arguments is most often "
"the file name itself.)  For example, if you do this:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">handler</var> に指定される第1引数は、プリミティブ名をシン"
"ボルとして表したものです。残りの引数は、そのプリミティブに渡された引数となり"
"ます。（これらの引数のうち、最初のものは多くの場合、ファイル名そのもので"
"す。）例えば、次のように記述した場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(file-exists-p <var class=\"var\">filename</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"and <var class=\"var\">filename</var> has handler <var "
"class=\"var\">handler</var>, then <var class=\"var\">handler</var> is called "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"また、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> にハンドラ <var "
"class=\"var\">handler</var> がある場合、<var class=\"var\">handler</var> は次"
"のように呼び出されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(funcall <var class=\"var\">handler</var> 'file-exists-p <var class=\"var\">filename</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"When a function takes two or more arguments that must be file names, it "
"checks each of those names for a handler.  For example, if you do this:"
msgstr ""
"関数がファイル名である必要がある引数を2つ以上受け取る場合、それらのファイル名"
"それぞれについてハンドラの有無を確認します。例えば、次のように記述した場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(expand-file-name <var class=\"var\">filename</var> <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"then it checks for a handler for <var class=\"var\">filename</var> and then "
"for a handler for <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>.  In either case, the "
"<var class=\"var\">handler</var> is called like this:"
msgstr ""
"次に <var class=\"var\">filename</var> 用のハンドラを確認し、続いて <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> 用のハンドラを確認します。いずれの場合も、<var "
"class=\"var\">handler</var> は次のように呼び出されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(funcall <var class=\"var\">handler</var> 'expand-file-name <var class=\"var\">filename</var> <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">handler</var> then needs to figure out whether to "
"handle <var class=\"var\">filename</var> or <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>."
msgstr ""
"次に<var class=\"var\">handler</var>は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var>と"
"<var class=\"var\">dirname</var>のどちらを処理すべきかを判断する必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"If the specified file name matches more than one handler, the one whose "
"match starts last in the file name gets precedence.  This rule is chosen so "
"that handlers for jobs such as uncompression are handled first, before "
"handlers for jobs such as remote file access."
msgstr ""
"指定されたファイル名が複数のハンドラに一致する場合、ファイル名の末尾から一致"
"が始まるハンドラが優先されます。このルールは、解凍などのジョブ用ハンドラが、"
"リモートファイルアクセスなどのジョブ用ハンドラよりも先に処理されるように設定"
"されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid "Here are the operations that a magic file name handler gets to handle:"
msgstr "マジックファイル名ハンドラが処理する操作は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">abbreviate-file-name</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">access-file</code>, <code class=\"code\">add-name-to-file</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">byte-compiler-base-file-name</code>,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">abbreviate-file-name</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">access-file</code>, <code class=\"code\">add-name-to-file</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">byte-compiler-base-file-name</code>,"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p><br>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">copy-directory</code>, <code class=\"code\">copy-file</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">delete-directory</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-file</code>, <code class=\"code\">diff-latest-backup-"
