# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the <em class=\"dfn\">local part</em> of <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>.  This is the part of the file&rsquo;s name "
"that identifies it on the remote host, and is typically obtained by removing "
"from the remote file name the parts that specify the remote host and the "
"method of accessing it.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> の<em class=\"dfn\">ローカル"
"パート</em>を返します。これはファイル名の中でリモートホストを識別する部分であ"
"り、通常はリモートファイル名からリモートホストおよびアクセス方法を指定する部"
"分を取り除くことで得られます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-local-name &quot;/ssh:<var class=\"var\">user</var>@<var class=\"var\">host</var>:/foo/bar&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/foo/bar&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"For a remote <var class=\"var\">filename</var>, this function returns a file "
"name which could be used directly as an argument of a remote process (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">Creating an "
"Asynchronous Process</a>, and see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Synchronous-"
"Processes.html\">Creating a Synchronous Process</a>), and as the program to "
"run on the remote host.  If <var class=\"var\">filename</var> is local, this "
"function returns it unchanged."
msgstr ""
"リモートの <var class=\"var\">filename</var> の場合、この関数は、リモートプロ"
"セスの引数として直接使用できるファイル名（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">非同期プロセスの作成</a> および <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Synchronous-Processes.html\">同期プロセスの作成</a> を"
"参照）と、リモートホスト上で実行するプログラムを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> がローカルの場合、この関数はそれをそのまま返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Magic-File-Names.html
msgid ""
