# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.10 Maintaining Undo Lists<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Maintaining-Undo-Lists\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.10 元に戻すリストの管理<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Maintaining-Undo-Lists\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"This section describes how to enable and disable undo information for a "
"given buffer.  It also explains how the undo list is truncated automatically "
"so it doesn&rsquo;t get too big."
msgstr ""
"本セクションでは、特定のバッファに対してアンドゥ情報の有効化・無効化を行う方"
"法について説明します。また、アンドゥリストが大きくなりすぎないよう、自動的に"
"切り詰められる仕組みについても解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"Recording of undo information in a newly created buffer is normally enabled "
"to start with; but if the buffer name starts with a space, the undo "
"recording is initially disabled.  You can explicitly enable or disable undo "
"recording with the following two functions, or by setting <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-undo-list</code> yourself."
msgstr ""
"新規に作成されたバッファへのアンドゥ情報の記録は、通常、初期状態で有効になっ"
"ています。ただし、バッファ名がスペースで始まる場合、アンドゥ記録は初期状態で"
"無効になります。以下の2つの関数を使用するか、<code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"undo-list</code> を自身で設定することで、アンドゥ記録を明示的に有効または無効"
"にできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-enable-undo</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002denable_002dundo\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-enable-undo</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002denable_002dundo\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"This command enables recording undo information for buffer <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var>, so that subsequent changes can be "
"undone.  If no argument is supplied, then the current buffer is used.  This "
"function does nothing if undo recording is already enabled in the buffer.  "
"It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、バッファ <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> のアンドゥ情"
"報の記録を有効にし、後続の変更を元に戻せるようにします。引数が指定されない場"
"合は、現在のバッファが使用されます。バッファで既にアンドゥ記録が有効になって"
"いる場合、この関数は何も行いません。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"In an interactive call, <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is the "
"current buffer.  You cannot specify any other buffer."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブコールでは、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> が現在の"
"バッファとなります。他のバッファを指定することはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-disable-undo</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002ddisable_002dundo\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-disable-undo</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer-or-name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-buffer_002ddisable_002dundo\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-disabling-undo\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-disabling-undo\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"This function discards the undo list of <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</"
"var>, and disables further recording of undo information.  As a result, it "
"is no longer possible to undo either previous changes or any subsequent "
"changes.  If the undo list of <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is "
"already disabled, this function has no effect."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> の元に戻すリストを破棄し、"
"以降の元に戻す情報の記録を無効にします。その結果、過去の変更およびそれ以降の"
"変更のいずれも元に戻せなくなります。<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> "
"の元に戻すリストが既に無効になっている場合、この関数は効果を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"In an interactive call, BUFFER-OR-NAME is the current buffer.  You cannot "
"specify any other buffer.  This function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"対話型コールでは、BUFFER-OR-NAME は現在のバッファです。他のバッファを指定する"
"ことはできません。この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"As editing continues, undo lists get longer and longer.  To prevent them "
"from using up all available memory space, garbage collection trims them back "
"to size limits you can set.  (For this purpose, the size of an undo list "
"measures the cons cells that make up the list, plus the strings of deleted "
"text.)  Three variables control the range of acceptable sizes: <code "
"class=\"code\">undo-limit</code>, <code class=\"code\">undo-strong-limit</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">undo-outer-limit</code>.  In these variables, "
"size is counted as the number of bytes occupied, which includes both saved "
"text and other data."
msgstr ""
"編集を続けるにつれて、アンドゥリストはどんどん長くなります。利用可能なメモリ"
"空間をすべて使い果たさないよう、ガベージコレクションによって、設定可能なサイ"
"ズ制限までリストが切り詰められます。（この際、アンドゥリストのサイズは、リス"
"トを構成するconsセルと、削除されたテキストの文字列の合計として計測されま"
"す。）許容されるサイズの範囲は、<code class=\"code\">undo-limit</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">undo-strong-limit</code>、<code class=\"code\">undo-"
"outer-limit</code>という3つの変数によって制御されます。これらの変数において、"
"サイズは保存済みテキストとその他のデータの両方を含む、占有バイト数としてカウ"
"ントされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">undo-limit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"undo_002dlimit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">undo-limit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-undo_002dlimit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"This is the soft limit for the acceptable size of an undo list.  The change "
"group at which this size is exceeded is the last one kept."
msgstr ""
"これは、アンドゥリストの許容サイズのソフトリミットです。このサイズを超えた時"
"点の変更グループが、最後に保持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">undo-strong-limit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"undo_002dstrong_002dlimit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">undo-strong-limit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-undo_002dstrong_002dlimit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"This is the upper limit for the acceptable size of an undo list.  The change "
"group at which this size is exceeded is discarded itself (along with all "
"older change groups).  There is one exception: the very latest change group "
"is only discarded if it exceeds <code class=\"code\">undo-outer-limit</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは、アンドゥリストの許容サイズの上限です。このサイズを超えた変更グループ"
"自体（およびそれ以前のすべての変更グループ）は破棄されます。ただし、1点例外が"
"あります。最新の変更グループは、<code class=\"code\">undo-outer-limit</code>"
"を超えた場合にのみ破棄されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">undo-outer-limit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"undo_002douter_002dlimit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">undo-outer-limit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-undo_002douter_002dlimit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"If at garbage collection time the undo info for the current command exceeds "
"this limit, Emacs discards the info and displays a warning.  This is a last "
"ditch limit to prevent memory overflow."
msgstr ""
"ガベージコレクション時に、現在のコマンドのアンドゥ情報がこの制限を超えると、"
"Emacsはその情報を破棄し、警告を表示します。これは、メモリオーバーフローを防ぐ"
"ための最終手段となる制限です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">undo-ask-before-discard</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-undo_002dask_002dbefore_002ddiscard\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">undo-ask-before-discard</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-undo_002dask_002dbefore_002ddiscard\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, when the undo info "
"exceeds <code class=\"code\">undo-outer-limit</code>, Emacs asks in the echo "
"area whether to discard the info.  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means to discard it automatically."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、アンドゥ情報が <code "
"class=\"code\">undo-outer-limit</code> を超えると、Emacs はエコーエリアでその"
"情報を破棄するかどうかを尋ねます。デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> で、これは自動的に破棄することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Maintaining-Undo.html
msgid ""
"This option is mainly intended for debugging.  Garbage collection is "
"inhibited while the question is asked, which means that Emacs might leak "
"memory if the user waits too long before answering the question."
msgstr ""
"このオプションは主にデバッグを目的としています。質問が行われている間はガベー"
"ジコレクションが抑制されるため、ユーザーが回答するまで長時間待機すると、Emacs"
"でメモリリークが発生する可能性があります。"

