# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Major modes specialize Emacs for editing or interacting with particular "
"kinds of text.  Each buffer has exactly one major mode at a time.  Every "
"major mode is associated with a <em class=\"dfn\">major mode command</em>, "
"whose name should end in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-mode</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"This command takes care of switching to that mode in the current buffer, by "
"setting various buffer-local variables such as a local keymap.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">Major Mode Conventions</"
"a>.  Note that unlike minor modes there is no way to &ldquo;turn off&rdquo; "
"a major mode, instead the buffer must be switched to a different one.  "
"However, you can temporarily <em class=\"dfn\">suspend</em> a major mode and "
"later <em class=\"dfn\">restore</em> the suspended mode, see below."
msgstr ""
"メジャーモードは、特定の種類のテキストの編集や操作に特化してEmacsを機能させま"
"す。各バッファには、一度にちょうど1つのメジャーモードが設定されます。すべての"
"メジャーモードには<em class=\"dfn\">メジャーモードコマンド</em>が関連付けられ"
"ており、その名称は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-mode</samp>&rsquo;で終わる必要"
"があります。このコマンドは、ローカルキーマップなどの各種バッファローカル変数"
"を設定することで、現在のバッファをそのモードに切り替えます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">メジャーモードの規約</a>"
"を参照してください。なお、マイナーモードとは異なり、メジャーモードを「オフ」"
"にする方法はなく、代わりにバッファを別のモードに切り替える必要があります。た"
"だし、メジャーモードを一時的に<em class=\"dfn\">サスペンド</em>し、後でそのサ"
"スペンドしたモードを<em class=\"dfn\">復元</em>することも可能です。詳細は以下"
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The least specialized major mode is called <em class=\"dfn\">Fundamental "
"mode</em>, which has no mode-specific definitions or variable settings."
msgstr ""
"最も特化度の低いメジャーモードは<em class=\"dfn\">ファンダメンタルモード</em>"
"と呼ばれ、モード固有の定義や変数設定はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fundamental-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fundamental_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fundamental-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fundamental_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This is the major mode command for Fundamental mode.  Unlike other mode "
"commands, it does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> run any mode hooks (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Mode-Conventions.html\">Major Mode Conventions</"
"a>), since you are not supposed to customize this mode."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">major-mode-suspend</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"major_002dmode_002dsuspend\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">major-mode-suspend</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"major_002dmode_002dsuspend\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function works like <code class=\"code\">fundamental-mode</code>, in "
"that it kills all buffer-local variables, but it also records the major mode "
"in effect, so that it could subsequently be restored.  This function and "
"<code class=\"code\">major-mode-restore</code> (described next) are useful "
"when you need to put a buffer under some specialized mode other than the one "
"Emacs chooses for it automatically (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-"
"Mode.html\">How Emacs Chooses a Major Mode</a>), but would also like to be "
"able to switch back to the original mode later."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">fundamental-mode</code> と同様に、すべての"
"バッファローカル変数を破棄しますが、同時に適用中のメジャーモードを記録し、後"
"で復元できるようにします。この関数と <code class=\"code\">major-mode-"
"restore</code>（次に説明します）は、Emacs が自動的に選択するモード以外の特定"
"のモードにバッファを設定したい場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-"
"Mode.html\">Emacs によるメジャーモードの選択方法</a> を参照）で、かつ後で元の"
"モードに戻したい場合に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">major-mode-restore</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional avoided-modes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-major_002dmode_002drestore\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">major-mode-restore</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional avoided-modes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-major_002dmode_002drestore\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function restores the major mode recorded by <code class=\"code\">major-"
"mode-suspend</code>.  If no major mode was recorded, this function calls "
"<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-"
"Major-Mode.html\">normal-mode</a>), but tries to force it not to choose any "
"modes in <var class=\"var\">avoided-modes</var>, if that argument is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clean-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"clean_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clean-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"clean_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Changing the major mode clears out most local variables, but it "
"doesn&rsquo;t remove all artifacts in the buffer (like text properties and "
"overlays).  It&rsquo;s rare to change a buffer from one major mode to "
"another (except from <code class=\"code\">fundamental-mode</code> to "
"everything else), so this is usually not a concern.  It can sometimes be "
"convenient (mostly when debugging a problem in a buffer) to do a &ldquo;full "
"reset&rdquo; of the buffer, and that&rsquo;s what the <code "
"class=\"code\">clean-mode</code> major mode offers.  It will kill all local "
"variables (even the permanently local ones), and also removes all overlays "
"and text properties."
msgstr ""
"メジャーモードを変更すると、ほとんどのローカル変数はクリアされますが、バッ"
"ファ内のすべてのアーティファクト（テキストプロパティやオーバーレイなど）が削"
"除されるわけではありません。バッファをあるメジャーモードから別のメジャーモー"
"ドへ変更することは稀であるため（<code class=\"code\">fundamental-mode</code>"
"からそれ以外への変更を除く）、通常はこの点を気にする必要はありません。場合に"
"よっては（主にバッファ内の問題をデバッグする際など）、バッファを「フルリセッ"
"ト」することが便利なことがあり、<code class=\"code\">clean-mode</code>メ"
"ジャーモードはまさにそれを実現します。これにより、すべてのローカル変数（永続"
"的なローカル変数を含む）が消去され、すべてのオーバーレイとテキストプロパティ"
"も削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The easiest way to write a major mode is to use the macro <code "
"class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code>, which sets up the new mode as a "
"variant of an existing major mode.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Derived-"
"Modes.html\">Defining Derived Modes</a>.  We recommend using <code "
"class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</code> even if the new mode is not an "
"obvious derivative of another mode, as it automatically enforces many coding "
"conventions for you.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Basic-Major-"
"Modes.html\">Basic Major Modes</a>, for common modes to derive from."
msgstr ""
"メジャーモードを記述する最も簡単な方法は、マクロ <code class=\"code\">define-"
"derived-mode</code> を使用することです。これにより、新しいモードが既存のメ"
"ジャーモードの派生として設定されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Derived-"
"Modes.html\">派生モードの定義</a>を参照してください。新しいモードが他のモード"
"の明らかな派生ではない場合でも、<code class=\"code\">define-derived-mode</"
"code> の使用を推奨します。これにより、多くのコーディング規約が自動的に適用さ"
"れるためです。派生元としてよく使われるモードについては、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Major-Modes.html\">基本メジャーモード</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Writing major modes based on the tree-sitter library has some special "
"aspects and conventions; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Tree_002dsitter-Major-"
"Modes.html\">Developing major modes with tree-sitter</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterライブラリを基盤としたメジャーモードの作成には、いくつかの特有の点"
"や慣習があります。詳細は<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Tree_002dsitter-Major-"
"Modes.html\">Tree-sitterを用いたメジャーモードの開発</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The standard GNU Emacs Lisp directory tree contains the code for several "
"major modes, in files such as <samp class=\"file\">text-mode.el</samp>, "
"<samp class=\"file\">texinfo.el</samp>, <samp class=\"file\">lisp-mode.el</"
"samp>, and <samp class=\"file\">rmail.el</samp>.  You can study these "
"libraries to see how modes are written."
msgstr ""
"標準的なGNU Emacs Lispのディレクトリツリーには、<samp class=\"file\">text-"
"mode.el</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">texinfo.el</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"file\">lisp-mode.el</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">rmail.el</samp>と"
"いったファイルに、いくつかの主要なモードのコードが含まれています。これらのラ"
"イブラリを調べることで、モードがどのように記述されているかを確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">major-mode</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"major_002dmode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
