# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-making-buttons\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-making-buttons\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid ""
"Buttons are associated with a region of text, using an overlay or text "
"properties to hold button-specific information, all of which are initialized "
"from the button&rsquo;s type (which defaults to the built-in button type "
"<code class=\"code\">button</code>).  Like all Emacs text, the appearance of "
"the button is governed by the <code class=\"code\">face</code> property; by "
"default (via the <code class=\"code\">face</code> property inherited from "
"the <code class=\"code\">button</code> button-type)  this is a simple "
"underline, like a typical web-page link."
msgstr ""
"ボタンはテキスト領域に関連付けられており、オーバーレイやテキストプロパティを"
"用いてボタン固有の情報を保持します。これらはすべて、ボタンのタイプ（デフォル"
"トは組み込みのボタンタイプ <code class=\"code\">button</code>）から初期化され"
"ます。他のすべてのEmacsテキストと同様に、ボタンの外観は <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> プロパティによって制御されます。デフォルトでは"
"（<code class=\"code\">button</code> ボタンタイプから継承された <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> プロパティにより）、これは一般的なウェブページのリ"
"ンクのようなシンプルな下線となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid ""
"For convenience, there are two sorts of button-creation functions, those "
"that add button properties to an existing region of a buffer, called <code "
"class=\"code\">make-...button</code>, and those that also insert the button "
"text, called <code class=\"code\">insert-...button</code>."
msgstr ""
"便宜上、ボタン作成関数には、バッファの既存領域にボタンプロパティを追加する"
"<code class=\"code\">make-...button</code>と、ボタンテキストも併せて挿入する"
"<code class=\"code\">insert-...button</code>の2種類があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid ""
"The button-creation functions all take the <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</"
"code> argument <var class=\"var\">properties</var>, which should be a "
"sequence of <var class=\"var\">property value</var> pairs, specifying "
"properties to add to the button; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Button-"
"Properties.html\">Button Properties</a>.  In addition, the keyword argument "
"<code class=\"code\">:type</code> may be used to specify a button-type from "
"which to inherit other properties; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Button-"
"Types.html\">Button Types</a>.  Any properties not explicitly specified "
"during creation will be inherited from the button&rsquo;s type (if the type "
"defines such a property)."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid ""
"The following functions add a button using an overlay (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Overlays.html\">Overlays</a>) to hold the button "
"properties:"
msgstr ""
"以下の関数は、ボタンのプロパティを保持するためのオーバーレイ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Overlays.html\">オーバーレイ</a>を参照）を使用してボタ"
"ンを追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-button</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg end "
"&amp;rest properties</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dbutton\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-button</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg end "
"&amp;rest properties</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
