# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Making-Buttons.html
msgid ""
"This makes a button from <var class=\"var\">beg</var> to <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> in the current buffer, and returns it."
msgstr ""
"これにより、現在のバッファ内に <var class=\"var\">beg</var> から <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> までのボタンが作成され、それが返されます。"

