msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-manager-interaction_002c-and-"
"frame-parameters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The following frame parameters control various aspects of the frame&rsquo;s "
"interaction with the window manager or window system.  They have no effect "
"on text terminals."
msgstr ""
"以下のフレームパラメータは、ウィンドウマネージャやウィンドウシステムとフレー"
"ムとのやり取りに関するさまざまな側面を制御します。テキスト端末には影響しませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-auto_002draise_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">auto-raise</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002draise_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-auto_002draise_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">auto-raise</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002draise_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs automatically raises the frame "
"when it is selected.  Some window managers do not allow this."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は選択時に自動的にフレーム"
"を最前面に表示します。一部のウィンドウマネージャではこれが許可されていませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-auto_002dlower_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">auto-lower</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dlower_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-auto_002dlower_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">auto-lower</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"auto_002dlower_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs automatically lowers the frame "
"when it is deselected.  Some window managers do not allow this."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は選択が解除されると自動的"
"にフレームを下に移動します。一部のウィンドウマネージャではこれが許可されてい"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-icon_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">icon-type</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"icon_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-icon_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">icon-type</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"icon_002dtype_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The type of icon to use for this frame.  If the value is a string, that "
"specifies a file containing a bitmap to use; <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"specifies no icon (in which case the window manager decides what to show); "
"any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value specifies the default "
"Emacs icon."
msgstr ""
"このフレームに使用するアイコンの種類。値が文字列の場合、使用するビットマップ"
"を含むファイルを指定します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> はアイコンを使用"
"しないことを指定します（この場合、ウィンドウマネージャが表示内容を決定しま"
"す）。それ以外の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値は、デフォルトの "
"Emacs アイコンを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-icon_002dname_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">icon-name</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"icon_002dname_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-icon_002dname_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">icon-name</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"icon_002dname_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The name to use in the icon for this frame, when and if the icon appears.  "
"If this is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame&rsquo;s title is used."
msgstr ""
"アイコンが表示される場合に、そのアイコンに使用する名称。これが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、フレームのタイトルが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-window_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">window-id</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-window_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">window-id</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The ID number which the graphical display uses for this frame.  Emacs "
"assigns this parameter when the frame is created; changing the parameter has "
"no effect on the actual ID number."
msgstr ""
"このフレームのグラフィカル表示で使用されるID番号です。Emacsはフレーム作成時に"
"このパラメータを割り当てます。このパラメータを変更しても、実際のID番号には影"
"響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-outer_002dwindow_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">outer-window-id</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-outer_002dwindow_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-outer_002dwindow_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">outer-window-id</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-outer_002dwindow_002did_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The ID number of the outermost window-system window in which the frame "
"exists.  As with <code class=\"code\">window-id</code>, changing this "
"parameter has no actual effect."
msgstr ""
"フレームが存在する最外層のウィンドウシステムウィンドウのID番号。<code "
"class=\"code\">window-id</code>と同様に、このパラメータを変更しても実際の影響"
"はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-wait_002dfor_002dwm_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">wait-for-wm</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"wait_002dfor_002dwm_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-wait_002dfor_002dwm_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">wait-for-wm</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"wait_002dfor_002dwm_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, tell Xt to wait for the window "
"manager to confirm geometry changes.  Some window managers, including "
"versions of Fvwm2 and KDE, fail to confirm, so Xt hangs.  Set this to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> to prevent hanging with those window managers."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、ウィンドウマネージャがジオメト"
"リの変更を確認するまで待機するよう Xt に指示します。Fvwm2 や KDE の一部のバー"
"ジョンを含む一部のウィンドウマネージャは確認を行わないため、Xt がハングしま"
"す。これらのウィンドウマネージャでハングするのを防ぐには、これを <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-sticky_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">sticky</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sticky_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-sticky_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">sticky</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sticky_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame is visible on all virtual "
"desktops on systems with virtual desktops."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、仮想デスクトップ搭載システムで"
"は、すべての仮想デスクトップ上でフレームが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-shaded_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">shaded</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"shaded_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-shaded_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">shaded</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"shaded_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, tell the window manager to display "
"the frame in a way that its contents are hidden, leaving only the title bar."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、ウィンドウマネージャに対し、内"
"容が非表示となりタイトルバーのみが残る形でフレームを表示するよう指示する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-use_002dframe_002dsynchronization_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">use-frame-synchronization</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-use_002dframe_002dsynchronization_002c-"
"a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-use_002dframe_002dsynchronization_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">use-frame-synchronization</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-use_002dframe_002dsynchronization_002c-"
"a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, synchronize the frame redisplay with "
"the refresh rate of the monitor to avoid graphics tearing.  At present, this "
"is only implemented on Haiku and the X window system inside no-toolkit and X "
"toolkit builds, does not work correctly with toolkit scroll bars, and "
"requires a compositing manager supporting the relevant display "
"synchronization protocols.  The <code class=\"code\">synchronizeResize</"
"code> X resource must also be set to the string <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;extended&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、グラフィックスのティアリングを防"
"ぐため、フレームの再表示をモニターのリフレッシュレートに同期させます。現時点"
"では、これは Haiku および no-toolkit と X toolkit ビルド内の X ウィンドウシス"
"テムでのみ実装されており、ツールキットのスクロールバーでは正しく動作せず、ま"
"た関連するディスプレイ同期プロトコルをサポートするコンポジティングマネージャ"
"が必要です。さらに、<code class=\"code\">synchronizeResize</code> X リソース"
"を文字列 <code class=\"code\">&quot;extended&quot;</code> に設定する必要があ"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-inhibit_002ddouble_002dbuffering_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">inhibit-double-buffering</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-inhibit_002ddouble_002dbuffering_002c-"
"a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-inhibit_002ddouble_002dbuffering_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">inhibit-double-buffering</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-inhibit_002ddouble_002dbuffering_002c-"
"a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame is drawn to the screen "
"without double buffering.  Emacs normally attempts to use double buffering, "
"where available, to reduce flicker; nevertheless, this parameter is provided "
"for circumstances where double-buffering induces display corruption, and for "
"those eccentrics wistful for the immemorial flicker that once beset Emacs."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、フレームはダブルバッファリングな"
"しで画面に描画されます。通常、Emacs はフリッカーを軽減するため、利用可能な場"
"合はダブルバッファリングを試みます。とはいえ、このパラメータは、ダブルバッ"
"ファリングによって表示の乱れが生じる場合や、かつての Emacs を悩ませていた古き"
"時代のフリッカーを懐かしむ変わり者のために用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-skip_002dtaskbar_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">skip-taskbar</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"skip_002dtaskbar_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-skip_002dtaskbar_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">skip-taskbar</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"skip_002dtaskbar_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this tells the window manager to "
"remove the frame&rsquo;s icon from the taskbar associated with the "
"frame&rsquo;s display and inhibit switching to the frame&rsquo;s window via "
"the combination <kbd class=\"kbd\">Alt-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>.  "
"On MS-Windows, iconifying such a frame will &quot;roll in&quot; its window-"
"system window at the bottom of the desktop.  Some window managers may not "
"honor this parameter."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、これはウィンドウマネージャに対"
"し、フレームのディスプレイに関連付けられたタスクバーからフレームのアイコンを"
"削除し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">Alt-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> の組み合わ"
"せによるフレームのウィンドウへの切り替えを禁止するよう指示します。MS-Windows "
"では、このようなフレームをアイコン化すると、ウィンドウシステムのウィンドウが"
"デスクトップの下部に「ロールイン」します。一部のウィンドウマネージャでは、こ"
"のパラメータが反映されない場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-no_002dfocus_002don_002dmap_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">no-focus-on-map</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-no_002dfocus_002don_002dmap_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-no_002dfocus_002don_002dmap_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">no-focus-on-map</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-no_002dfocus_002don_002dmap_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means that the frame does not "
"want to receive input focus when it is mapped (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Visibility-of-Frames.html\">Visibility of Frames</a>).  Some window "
"managers may not honor this parameter."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、これはフレームがマッピング時に入"
"力フォーカスを受けたくないことを意味します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Visibility-of-Frames.html\">フレームの可視性</a>を参照）。一部のウィン"
"ドウマネージャでは、このパラメータが反映されない場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-no_002daccept_002dfocus_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">no-accept-focus</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-no_002daccept_002dfocus_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-no_002daccept_002dfocus_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">no-accept-focus</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-no_002daccept_002dfocus_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Management-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means that the frame does not "
"want to receive input focus via explicit mouse clicks or when moving the "
"mouse into it either via <code class=\"code\">focus-follows-mouse</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>) or <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-autoselect-window</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html\">Mouse Window Auto-selection</"
"a>).  This may have the unwanted side-effect that a user cannot scroll a non-"
"selected frame with the mouse.  Some window managers may not honor this "
"parameter.  On Haiku, it also has the side-effect that the window will not "
"be able to receive any keyboard input from the user, not even if the user "
"switches to the frame using the key combination <kbd class=\"kbd\">Alt-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、これはフレームが、明示的なマウス"
"クリックや、<code class=\"code\">focus-follows-mouse</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">入力フォーカス</a> を参照）または "
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-autoselect-window</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html\">マウスウィンドウの自動選択</a> "
"を参照）によるマウスの移動を通じて、入力フォーカスを受け取ることを望まないこ"
