# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns an overlay that belongs to <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var> and ranges from <var class=\"var\">start</var> to "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var>.  Both <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> must specify buffer positions; they may be integers "
"or markers.  If <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> is omitted, the overlay is "
"created in the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> に属し、<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> から <var class=\"var\">end</var> までの範囲を持つ"
"オーバーレイを作成して返します。<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> にはともにバッファ位置を指定する必要があり、整数また"
"はマーカーを指定できます。<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> を省略した場合、"
"オーバーレイは現在のバッファに作成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
