"id=\"empty-overlays\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"An overlay whose <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> specify the same buffer position is known as <em class=\"dfn\">empty</"
"em>.  A non-empty overlay can become empty if the text between its <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> is deleted.  When "
"that happens, the overlay is by default not deleted, but you can cause it to "
"be deleted by giving it the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">evaporate</"
"samp>&rsquo; property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Overlay-"
"Properties.html\">evaporate property</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> が同じバッファ"
"位置を指定するオーバーレイは、<em class=\"dfn\">空</em>と呼ばれます。空ではな"
"いオーバーレイは、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> の間のテキストが削除されると空になることがあります。その際、オーバーレイ"
"はデフォルトでは削除されませんが、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">evaporate</"
"samp>&rsquo; プロパティを指定することで削除させることができます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Overlay-Properties.html\">evaporate プロパティ</a> を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"The arguments <var class=\"var\">front-advance</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">rear-advance</var> specify what happens when text is inserted "
"at the beginning (i.e., before <var class=\"var\">start</var>) and at the "
"end.  If they are both <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the default, then "
"the overlay extends to include any text inserted at the beginning, but not "
"text inserted at the end.  If <var class=\"var\">front-advance</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, text inserted at the beginning of the "
"overlay is excluded from the overlay.  If <var class=\"var\">rear-advance</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, text inserted at the end of the "
"overlay is included in the overlay."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">front-advance</var> と <var class=\"var\">rear-"
"advance</var> は、テキストが先頭（すなわち <var class=\"var\">start</var> の"
"前）および末尾に挿入された際にどうなるかを指定します。両者がデフォルトの "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、オーバーレイは先頭に挿入されたテ"
"キストを含むように拡張されますが、末尾に挿入されたテキストは含まれません。"
"<var class=\"var\">front-advance</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外の場合、オーバーレイの先頭に挿入されたテキストはオーバーレイから除外されま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">rear-advance</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の場合、オーバーレイの末尾に挿入されたテキストはオーバーレイに含まれま"
"す。"

