# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"This function moves <var class=\"var\">overlay</var> to <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var>, and places its bounds at <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> in that buffer.  "
"Both arguments <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> must specify buffer positions; they may be integers or markers."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">overlay</var> を <var class=\"var\">buffer</"
"var> に移動し、その境界を当該バッファの <var class=\"var\">start</var> およ"
"び <var class=\"var\">end</var> に設定します。引数 <var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> はいずれもバッファ位置を指定する必要があ"
"り、整数またはマーカーを指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> is omitted, <var class=\"var\">overlay</"
"var> stays in the same buffer it was already associated with; if <var "
"class=\"var\">overlay</var> was previously deleted (and thus isn&rsquo;t "
"associated with any buffer), it goes into the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> を省略した場合、<var class=\"var\">overlay</"
"var> はそれまで関連付けられていたバッファにそのまま留まります。<var "
"class=\"var\">overlay</var> が以前に削除されていた（したがってどのバッファに"
"も関連付けられていない）場合は、現在のバッファに入ります。"

