# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"This function clears the text in the region between <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> of any overlays "
"whose property named <var class=\"var\">name</var> has the specified <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>, such that no such overlay will affect the text in "
"the region.  To do this, the function can remove overlays in the region, or "
"move their endpoints, or split them, or do some combination of these.  "
"Specifically:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> の"
"間の領域にあるテキストから、プロパティ <var class=\"var\">name</var> に指定さ"
"れた <var class=\"var\">value</var> を持つオーバーレイをすべて削除し、その領"
"域内のテキストにそのようなオーバーレイが影響を及ぼさないようにします。これを"
"実現するために、関数は領域内のオーバーレイを削除したり、その端点を移動させた"
"り、分割したり、あるいはこれらの組み合わせを行ったりすることができます。具体"
"的には："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"Overlays that start at or after <var class=\"var\">start</var> and end "
"before <var class=\"var\">end</var> will be removed completely."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var>以降に始まり、<var class=\"var\">end</var>より"
"前に終わるオーバーレイは、完全に削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"Overlays that start before <var class=\"var\">start</var> and end after <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var>, but before <var class=\"var\">end</var>, will be "
"altered so that they end at <var class=\"var\">start</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> より前に始まり、<var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> より後かつ <var class=\"var\">end</var> より前に終わるオーバーレイは、"
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> で終わるように変更されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"Overlays that start at or after <var class=\"var\">start</var> and end after "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> will be altered so that they start at <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var>以降に始まり、<var class=\"var\">end</var>より"
"後に終わるオーバーレイは、<var class=\"var\">end</var>から始まるように変更さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"Overlays that start before <var class=\"var\">start</var> and end after <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> will be split into two overlays: one that ends at "
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> and the other that begins at <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> より前に始まり <var class=\"var\">end</var> よ"
"り後に終わるオーバーレイは、<var class=\"var\">start</var> で終わるものと "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> から始まるものの2つのオーバーレイに分割されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"Empty overlays (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"#empty-overlays\">empty "
"overlays</a>) will be removed if they are either at <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var>, or strictly between <var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> excluding <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var>, or at <var class=\"var\">end</var> when <var class=\"var\">end</var> "
"denotes the position at the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"空のオーバーレイ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"#empty-overlays\">空のオーバーレ"
"イ</a>を参照）は、<var class=\"var\">start</var>にある場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>を除いた<var class=\"var\">start</var>と<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>の厳密な範囲内にある場合、または<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>がバッファ末尾の位置を示す場合に<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>にある場合に、削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it means to delete/modify all overlays that affect text in the "
"specified region.  If <var class=\"var\">start</var> and/or <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> are omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, they "
"default to the beginning and end of the buffer, respectively.  Therefore, "
"<code class=\"code\">(remove-overlays)</code> removes all the overlays in "
"the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が省略さ"
"れた場合、指定した領域のテキストに影響を与えるすべてのオーバーレイを削除また"
"は変更することを意味します。<var class=\"var\">start</var> および/または "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var>、あるいは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が省略"
"された場合は、それぞれバッファの先頭と末尾がデフォルトとなります。したがっ"
"て、<code class=\"code\">(remove-overlays)</code> は現在のバッファ内のすべて"
"のオーバーレイを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"Values of the named overlay property are compared using <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>, which is important if the values are anything but "
"symbols or fixnums (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Equality-"
"Predicates.html\">Equality Predicates</a>).  It means the values passed to "
"the function must be the same values used to set the overlay property, not "
"their copies; objects which are different will not compare equal even if "
"they have identical contents."
msgstr ""
"名前付きオーバーレイプロパティの値は <code class=\"code\">eq</code> を用いて"
"比較されます。これは、値がシンボルや固定数以外である場合に重要となります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Equality-Predicates.html\">等価述語</a>を参照）。つま"
"り、関数に渡される値は、オーバーレイプロパティの設定に使用された値そのもので"
"ある必要があり、そのコピーであってはなりません。異なるオブジェクトは、たとえ"
"内容が同一であっても等しいとは判定されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"The optional arguments <var class=\"var\">name</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> should either both be passed and non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, or both omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">name</var> と <var class=\"var\">value</"
"var> は、ともに指定して <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外とするか、あるい"
"はともに省略して <code class=\"code\">nil</code> とする必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">copy-overlay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">overlay</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-copy_002doverlay\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">copy-overlay</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">overlay</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-copy_002doverlay\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a copy of <var class=\"var\">overlay</var>.  The copy "
"has the same endpoints and properties as <var class=\"var\">overlay</var>.  "
"However, the text insertion type for the start of the overlay and for the "
"end of the overlay are set to their default values."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">overlay</var> のコピーを返します。このコピーは "
"<var class=\"var\">overlay</var> と同じ端点とプロパティを持ちます。ただし、"
"オーバーレイの開始位置および終了位置におけるテキスト挿入タイプは、デフォルト"
"値に設定されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Create an overlay.</span>\n"
"(setq foo (make-overlay 1 10))\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;overlay from 1 to 10 in display.texi&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(overlay-start foo)\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Managing-Overlays.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(overlay-end foo)\n"
"     &rArr; 10\n"
"(overlay-buffer foo)\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;buffer display.texi&gt;\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">Give it a property we can check later.</span>\n"
"(overlay-put foo 'happy t)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">Verify the property is present.</span>\n"
"(overlay-get foo 'happy)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
