#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-mapcar\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-mapcar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> applies <var class=\"var\">function</var> "
"to each element of <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> in turn, and returns a "
"list of the results."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> は <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> の各"
"要素に対して順に <var class=\"var\">function</var> を適用し、その結果のリスト"
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> can be any kind of sequence "
"except a char-table; that is, a list, a vector, a bool-vector, or a string.  "
"The result is always a list.  The length of the result is the same as the "
"length of <var class=\"var\">sequence</var>.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> には、文字テーブル以外のあらゆる種類の"
"シーケンス（すなわち、リスト、ベクトル、bool-vector、または文字列）が指定可能"
"です。結果は常にリストとなります。結果の長さは <var class=\"var\">sequence</"
"var> の長さと同じです。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mapcar #'car '((a b) (c d) (e f)))\n"
"     &rArr; (a c e)\n"
"(mapcar #'1+ [1 2 3])\n"
"     &rArr; (2 3 4)\n"
"(mapcar #'string &quot;abc&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;a&quot; &quot;b&quot; &quot;c&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Call each function in <code class=\"code\">my-hooks</code>.</span>\n"
"(mapcar 'funcall my-hooks)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun mapcar* (function &amp;rest args)\n"
"  &quot;Apply FUNCTION to successive cars of all ARGS.\n"
"Return the list of results.&quot;\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">If no list is exhausted,</span>\n"
"  (if (not (memq nil args))\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">apply function to <span class=\"sc\">CAR</span>s.</span>\n"
"      (cons (apply function (mapcar #'car args))\n"
"            (apply #'mapcar* function\n"
"                   ;; <span class=\"r\">Recurse for rest of elements.</span>\n"
"                   (mapcar #'cdr args)))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mapcar* #'cons '(a b c) '(1 2 3 4))\n"
"     &rArr; ((a . 1) (b . 2) (c . 3))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapcan</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function sequence</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mapcan\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapcan</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function sequence</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mapcan\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function applies <var class=\"var\">function</var> to each element of "
"<var class=\"var\">sequence</var>, like <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>, "
"but instead of collecting the results into a list, it returns a single list "
"with all the elements of the results (which must be lists), by altering the "
"results (using <code class=\"code\">nconc</code>; see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Rearrangement.html\">Functions that Rearrange Lists</a>).  Like with "
"<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>, <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> can be "
"of any type except a char-table."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>と同様に<var "
"class=\"var\">sequence</var>の各要素に<var class=\"var\">function</var>を適用"
"しますが、その結果をリストにまとめるのではなく、結果（リストである必要があり"
"ます）を変更することで（<code class=\"code\">nconc</code>を使用。<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rearrangement.html\">リストを再配置する関数</a>を参"
"照）、結果のすべての要素を含む単一のリストを返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">mapcar</code>と同様に、<var class=\"var\">sequence</var>は"
"char-table以外の任意の型を指定できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Contrast this:</span>\n"
"(mapcar #'list '(a b c d))\n"
"     &rArr; ((a) (b) (c) (d))\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">with this:</span>\n"
"(mapcan #'list '(a b c d))\n"
"     &rArr; (a b c d)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapc</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function sequence</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mapc\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapc</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function sequence</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mapc\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapc</code> is like <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> "
"except that <var class=\"var\">function</var> is used for side-effects "
"only&mdash;the values it returns are ignored, not collected into a list.  "
"<code class=\"code\">mapc</code> always returns <var class=\"var\">sequence</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapc</code> は <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> と同様"
"ですが、<var class=\"var\">function</var> は副作用にのみ使用されます&mdash;こ"
"れが返す値は無視され、リストに収集されることもありません。  <code "
"class=\"code\">mapc</code> は常に <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapconcat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function sequence "
"&amp;optional separator</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mapconcat\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mapconcat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function sequence "
"&amp;optional separator</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mapconcat\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code> applies <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> to each element of <var class=\"var\">sequence</var>; the results, "
"which must be sequences of characters (strings, vectors, or lists), are "
"concatenated into a single string return value.  Between each pair of result "
"sequences, <code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code> inserts the characters from "
"<var class=\"var\">separator</var>, which also must be a string, or a vector "
"or list of characters; a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> value is treated as "
"the empty string.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sequences-Arrays-"
"Vectors.html\">Sequences, Arrays, and Vectors</a>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">function</var> must be a function that can "
"take one argument and returns a sequence of characters: a string, a vector, "
"or a list.  The argument <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> can be any kind "
"of sequence except a char-table; that is, a list, a vector, a bool-vector, "
"or a string."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">function</var> は、1つの引数を受け取り、文字のシーケ"
"ンス（文字列、ベクトル、またはリスト）を返す関数である必要があります。引数 "
"<var class=\"var\">sequence</var> は、char-table を除くあらゆる種類のシーケン"
"ス、すなわちリスト、ベクトル、bool-vector、または文字列であることができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mapconcat #'symbol-name\n"
"           '(The cat in the hat)\n"
"           &quot; &quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;The cat in the hat&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mapconcat (lambda (x) (format &quot;%c&quot; (1+ x)))\n"
"           &quot;HAL-8000&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;IBM.9111&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

