msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-margins_002c-filling\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-prefix</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fill_002dprefix\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">fill-prefix</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fill_002dprefix\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"specifies a string of text that appears at the beginning of normal text "
"lines and should be disregarded when filling them.  Any line that fails to "
"start with the fill prefix is considered the start of a paragraph; so is any "
"line that starts with the fill prefix followed by additional whitespace.  "
"Lines that start with the fill prefix but no additional whitespace are "
"ordinary text lines that can be filled together.  The resulting filled lines "
"also start with the fill prefix."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、通常の"
"テキスト行の先頭に現れ、行の埋め合わせ時に無視されるべきテキスト文字列を指定"
"します。埋め合わせ用プレフィックスで始まらない行は段落の開始とみなされます。"
"また、埋め合わせ用プレフィックスに続き、さらに空白文字がある行も同様に段落の"
"開始とみなされます。埋め合わせ用プレフィックスで始まり、その後に空白文字がな"
"い行は、まとめて埋め合わせ可能な通常のテキスト行となります。埋め合わせ後の行"
"も、同様に埋め合わせ用プレフィックスで始まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid "The fill prefix follows the left margin whitespace, if any."
msgstr "フィルプレフィックスは、左マージンの空白（もしあれば）の後に続きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fill-column</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fill_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">fill-column</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fill_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable specifies the maximum width of filled lines.  Its "
"value should be an integer, which is a number of columns.  All the filling, "
"justification, and centering commands are affected by this variable, "
"including Auto Fill mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-"
"Filling.html\">Auto Filling</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、塗りつぶし行の最大幅を指定します。値は整数（列"
"数）である必要があります。自動塗りつぶしモード（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Auto-Filling.html\">自動塗りつぶし</a>を参照）を含め、すべての塗りつぶ"
"し、右揃え、および中央揃えのコマンドがこの変数の影響を受けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"As a practical matter, if you are writing text for other people to read, you "
"should set <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> to no more than 70.  "
"Otherwise the line will be too long for people to read comfortably, and this "
"can make the text seem clumsy."
msgstr ""
"実用上の観点から、他人が読むための文章を書く場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> を 70 以下に設定すべきです。そうしないと、"
"行が長くなりすぎて快適に読めなくなり、文章がぎこちなく感じられることがありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"The default value for <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> is 70.  To "
"disable Auto Fill mode in a specific mode, you could say something like:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> のデフォルト値は 70 です。特定のモー"
"ドで自動入力モードを無効にするには、例えば次のように記述できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(add-hook 'foo-mode-hook (lambda () (auto-fill-mode -1))\n"
msgstr ""

