"margin</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dright_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This sets the <code class=\"code\">right-margin</code> property on the text "
"from <var class=\"var\">from</var> to <var class=\"var\">to</var> to the "
"value <var class=\"var\">margin</var>.  If Auto Fill mode is enabled, this "
"command also refills the region to fit the new margin."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<var class=\"var\">from</var>から<var class=\"var\">to</var>まで"
