"current_002dleft_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-left-margin</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dleft_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the proper left margin value to use for filling the "
"text around point.  The value is the sum of the <code class=\"code\">left-"
"margin</code> property of the character at the start of the current line (or "
"zero if none), and the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">left-"
"margin</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、point 周辺のテキストを埋める際に使用すべき適切な左マージン値を返"
"します。この値は、現在の行の先頭にある文字の <code class=\"code\">left-"
"margin</code> プロパティ（存在しない場合は 0）と、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">left-margin</code> の値の和となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-fill-column</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dfill_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-fill-column</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dfill_002dcolumn\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the proper fill column value to use for filling the "
"text around point.  The value is the value of the <code class=\"code\">fill-"
"column</code> variable, minus the value of the <code class=\"code\">right-"
"margin</code> property of the character after point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポイント周辺のテキスト塗りつぶしに使用する適切な塗りつぶし列の値"
"を返します。この値は、<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> 変数の値から、"
"ポイント以降の文字の <code class=\"code\">right-margin</code> プロパティの値"
"を引いたものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">move-to-left-margin</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional n force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-move_002dto_002dleft_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">move-to-left-margin</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional n force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-move_002dto_002dleft_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point to the left margin of the current line.  The "
"column moved to is determined by calling the function <code "
"class=\"code\">current-left-margin</code>.  If the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">move-to-left-margin</code> moves forward <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>&minus;1 lines first."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポイントを現在の行の左マージンに移動します。移動先の列は、関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">current-left-margin</code> を呼び出すことで決定されま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、<code class=\"code\">move-to-left-margin</code> はまず <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>&minus;1 行分前方に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">force</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"that says to fix the line&rsquo;s indentation if that doesn&rsquo;t match "
"the left margin value."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">force</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、行のインデントが左マージンの値と一致しないときに、それを修正することを意"
"味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-to-left-margin</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional from to</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dto_002dleft_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-to-left-margin</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional from to</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dto_002dleft_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
"This function removes left margin indentation from the text between <var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> and <var class=\"var\">to</var>.  The amount of "
"indentation to delete is determined by calling <code class=\"code\">current-"
"left-margin</code>.  In no case does this function delete non-whitespace.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">from</var> and <var class=\"var\">to</var> are "
"omitted, they default to the whole buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">from</var> と <var class=\"var\">to</var> の間"
"のテキストから左マージンのインデントを削除します。削除するインデント量は、"
"<code class=\"code\">current-left-margin</code> を呼び出すことで決定されま"
"す。いかなる場合においても、この関数は空白文字以外の部分を削除することはあり"
"ません。<var class=\"var\">from</var> および <var class=\"var\">to</var> が省"
"略された場合は、デフォルトでバッファ全体が対象となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Margins.html
msgid ""
