# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Marker-Insertion-Types.html
msgid ""
"When you insert text directly at the place where a marker points, there are "
"two possible ways to relocate that marker: it can point before the inserted "
"text, or point after it.  You can specify which one a given marker should do "
"by setting its <em class=\"dfn\">insertion type</em>.  Note that use of "
"<code class=\"code\">insert-before-markers</code> ignores markers&rsquo; "
"insertion types, always relocating a marker to point after the inserted text."
msgstr ""
"マーカーが指している箇所に直接テキストを挿入する場合、そのマーカーを再配置す"
"る方法は2通りあります。挿入されたテキストの手前を指すか、あるいはその後ろを指"
"すかです。特定のマーカーをどちらに配置するかは、<em class=\"dfn\">挿入タイプ"
"</em>を設定することで指定できます。なお、<code class=\"code\">insert-before-"
"markers</code> を使用するとマーカーの挿入タイプは無視され、常に挿入されたテキ"
"ストの後ろを指すように再配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Marker-Insertion-Types.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-marker-insertion-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">marker type</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dmarker_002dinsertion_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-marker-insertion-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">marker type</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dmarker_002dinsertion_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Marker-Insertion-Types.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the insertion type of marker <var class=\"var\">marker</"
"var> to <var class=\"var\">type</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">type</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>, <var class=\"var\">marker</var> will advance "
"when text is inserted at its position.  If <var class=\"var\">type</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var class=\"var\">marker</var> does not "
"advance when text is inserted there."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、マーカー <var class=\"var\">marker</var> の挿入タイプを <var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> に設定します。<var class=\"var\">type</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、その位置にテキストが挿入されると <var "
"class=\"var\">marker</var> が進みます。<var class=\"var\">type</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、そこにテキストが挿入されても <var "
"class=\"var\">marker</var> は進みません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Marker-Insertion-Types.html
msgid ""
