# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Menu-Separators.html
msgid ""
"where <var class=\"var\">separator-type</var> is a string starting with two "
"or more dashes."
msgstr ""
"ここで <var class=\"var\">separator-type</var> は、2つ以上のハイフンで始まる"
"文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Menu-Separators.html
msgid ""
"In the simplest case, <var class=\"var\">separator-type</var> consists of "
"only dashes.  That specifies the default kind of separator.  (For "
"compatibility, <code class=\"code\">&quot;&quot;</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">-</code> also count as separators.)"
msgstr ""
"最も単純な場合、<var class=\"var\">separator-type</var> はハイフンのみで構成"
"されます。これにより、デフォルトの区切り文字が指定されます。（互換性のため、"
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;&quot;</code> および <code class=\"code\">-</"
"code> も区切り文字として扱われます。）"

