#: build/html/elisp/Meta_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"<span>2.4.3.4 Meta-Character Syntax<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Meta_002dCharacter-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.3.4 メタ文字構文<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Meta_002dCharacter-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Meta_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-meta-characters\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-meta-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Meta_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">meta character</em> is a character typed with the <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd> modifier key.  The integer that represents such a "
"character has the 2**27 bit set.  We use high bits for this and other "
"modifiers to make possible a wide range of basic character codes."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">メタ文字</em>とは、<kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd>修飾キーで"
"入力される文字のことです。このような文字を表す整数は、2**27ビットがセットされ"
"ています。このビットおよび他の修飾キーに上位ビットを使用することで、広範な基"
"本文字コードを実現しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Meta_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In a string, the 2**7 bit attached to an <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> character indicates a meta character; thus, the meta characters that "
"can fit in a string have codes in the range from 128 to 255, and are the "
"meta versions of the ordinary <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"characters.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Strings-of-Events.html\">Putting "
"Keyboard Events in Strings</a>, for details about <kbd class=\"key\">META</"
"kbd>-handling in strings."
msgstr ""
"文字列において、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字に付随する2**7ビット"
"はメタ文字であることを示します。したがって、文字列に格納可能なメタ文字のコー"
"ドは128から255の範囲にあり、通常の<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字の"
"メタ版となります。文字列における<kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd>の処理の詳細につ"
"いては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Strings-of-Events.html\">Putting Keyboard "
"Events in Strings</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Meta_002dChar-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"The read syntax for meta characters uses &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  For example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-A</samp>&rsquo; "
"stands for <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-A</kbd>.  You can use &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\M-</samp>&rsquo; together with octal character codes (see "
"below), with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-</samp>&rsquo;, or with any "
"other syntax for a character.  Thus, you can write <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-A</"
"kbd> as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-A</samp>&rsquo;, or as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\M-\\101</samp>&rsquo;.  Likewise, you can write <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-b</kbd> as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-\\C-b</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\C-\\M-b</samp>&rsquo;, or "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-\\002</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"メタ文字の読み取り構文には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-</samp>&rsquo; が"
"使用されます。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-A</samp>&rsquo; は "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-A</kbd> を表します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、8進数の文字コード（後述）、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-"
"</samp>&rsquo; 、またはその他の文字構文と組み合わせて使用できます。したがっ"
"て、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-A</kbd> を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-A</"
"samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\M-\\101</samp>&rsquo; と記述で"
"きます。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-b</kbd> を &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?\\M-\\C-b</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\C-"
