# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This command exits the active minibuffer.  It is normally bound to keys in "
"minibuffer local keymaps.  The command throws an error if the current buffer "
"is a minibuffer, but not the active minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、アクティブなミニバッファを終了します。通常、ミニバッファの"
"ローカルキーマップのキーに割り当てられています。現在のバッファがミニバッファ"
"であっても、それがアクティブなミニバッファでない場合は、エラーが発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">self-insert-and-exit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"self_002dinsert_002dand_002dexit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
