"This command replaces the minibuffer contents with the value of the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th more recent history element.  The position in the "
"history can go beyond the current position and invoke &ldquo;future "
"history&rdquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-from-"
