# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This function puts element of the minibuffer history in the minibuffer.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">nabs</var> specifies the absolute history "
"position in descending order, where 0 means the current element and a "
"positive number <var class=\"var\">n</var> means the <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>th previous element.  NABS being a negative number -<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> means the <var class=\"var\">n</var>th entry of "
"&ldquo;future history&rdquo;.  When this function reaches the end of the "
"default values provided by <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-from-Minibuffer.html\">Reading Text "
"Strings with the Minibuffer</a>)  and <code class=\"code\">completing-read</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Completion.html\">Completion "
"and the Minibuffer</a>), it adds the completion candidates to &ldquo;future "
"history&rdquo;, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"History.html\">minibuffer-default-add-function</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ミニバッファ履歴の要素をミニバッファに配置します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">nabs</var> は、降順での履歴上の絶対位置を指定します。ここで 0 "
"は現在の要素を、正の数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> は <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> 番目前の要素を意味します。NABS が負の数 -<var class=\"var\">n</var> の場"
"合、それは「将来の履歴」の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目のエントリを意味し"
"ます。この関数が、<code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-from-Minibuffer.html\">ミニバッファによるテキスト"
"文字列の読み取り</a> を参照）および <code class=\"code\">completing-read</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Completion.html\">補完とミニバッ"
"ファ</a> を参照）で提供されるデフォルト値の末尾に達すると、補完候補を「将来の"
"履歴」に追加します。詳細は <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"History.html\">minibuffer-default-add-function</a> を参照してください。"

