"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-completion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reading-from-minibuffer-with-"
"completion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the basic interface for reading from the minibuffer "
"with completion."
msgstr ""
"この節では、補完機能を用いてミニバッファから読み出すための基本的なインター"
"フェースについて説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completing-read</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"collection &amp;optional predicate require-match initial history default "
"inherit-input-method</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"completing_002dread\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completing-read</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"collection &amp;optional predicate require-match initial history default "
"inherit-input-method</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"completing_002dread\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a string in the minibuffer, assisting the user by "
"providing completion.  It activates the minibuffer with prompt <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var>, which must be a string."
msgstr ""
"この関数はミニバッファ内の文字列を読み込み、補完機能を提供することでユーザー"
"を支援します。文字列である必要があるプロンプト <var class=\"var\">prompt</"
"var> を用いてミニバッファをアクティブにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The actual completion is done by passing the completion table <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> and the completion predicate <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> to the function <code class=\"code\">try-"
"completion</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>).  This happens in certain "
"commands bound in the local keymaps used for completion.  Some of these "
"commands also call <code class=\"code\">test-completion</code>.  Thus, if "
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it should be compatible with <var class=\"var\">collection</var> and <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-ignore-case</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Completion.html#Definition-of-test_002dcompletion\">Definition "
"of test-completion</a>."
msgstr ""
"実際の補完は、補完テーブル <var class=\"var\">collection</var> と補完述語 "
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> を関数 <code class=\"code\">try-"
"completion</code> に渡すことで行われます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">基本的な補完関数</a> を参照）。これは、補完に使用されるロー"
"カルキーマップにバインドされた特定のコマンドで行われます。これらのコマンドの"
"中には、<code class=\"code\">test-completion</code> を呼び出すものもありま"
"す。したがって、<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、<var class=\"var\">collection</"
"var> および <code class=\"code\">completion-ignore-case</code> と互換性がある"
"必要があります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Basic-Completion.html#Definition-of-"
"test_002dcompletion\">test-completion の定義</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Programmed-Completion.html\">Programmed "
"Completion</a>, for detailed requirements when <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var> is a function."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">collection</var> が関数である場合の詳細な要件については、"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Programmed-Completion.html\">プログラム済み補完</a>"
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value of the optional argument <var class=\"var\">require-match</var> "
"determines how the user may exit the minibuffer:"
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">require-match</var> の値によって、ユーザー"
"がミニバッファを終了する方法が決まります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the usual minibuffer exit commands work "
"regardless of the input in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ミニバッファ内の入力に関わらず、通常"
"のミニバッファ終了コマンドが動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the usual minibuffer exit commands "
"won&rsquo;t exit unless the input completes to an element of <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、入力が <var class=\"var\">collection</"
"var> の要素に達するまで、通常のミニバッファ終了コマンドは機能しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">confirm</code>, the user can exit with any input, "
"but is asked for confirmation if the input is not an element of <var "
"class=\"var\">collection</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">confirm</code> の場合、ユーザーは任意の入力で終了できま"
"すが、入力が <var class=\"var\">collection</var> の要素でない場合は確認を求め"
"られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">confirm-after-completion</code>, the user can exit "
"with any input, but is asked for confirmation if the preceding command was a "
"completion command (i.e., one of the commands in <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-confirm-exit-commands</code>) and the resulting "
"input is not an element of <var class=\"var\">collection</var>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">Minibuffer Commands that Do "
"Completion</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">confirm-after-completion</code> の場合、ユーザーは任意の"
"入力で終了できますが、直前のコマンドが補完コマンド（すなわち <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-confirm-exit-commands</code> に含まれるコマンドのい"
"ずれか）であり、かつその結果得られた入力が <var class=\"var\">collection</"
"var> の要素ではない場合は、確認が求められます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">補完を行うミニバッファコマンド</a> を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If a function, it is called with the input as the only argument.  The "
"function should return a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value if the "
"input is acceptable."
msgstr ""
"関数の場合、入力を唯一の引数として呼び出されます。入力が許容可能な場合は、そ"
"の関数は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"Any other value of <var class=\"var\">require-match</var> behaves like <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, except that the exit commands won&rsquo;t exit if "
"it performs completion."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">require-match</var> のその他の値はすべて <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> と同様に動作しますが、補完が実行された場合には終了コ"
"マンドが終了しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"However, empty input is always permitted, regardless of the value of <var "
"class=\"var\">require-match</var>; in that case, <code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> returns the first element of <var "
"class=\"var\">default</var>, if it is a list; <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;&quot;</code>, if <var class=\"var\">default</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>; or <var class=\"var\">default</var>.  The "
"string or strings in <var class=\"var\">default</var> are also available to "
"the user through the history commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-Commands.html\">Minibuffer Commands</a>).  In addition, "
"the completion candidates are added to the &ldquo;future history&rdquo; when "
"the values in <var class=\"var\">default</var> are exhausted by <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd>; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"History.html\">minibuffer-default-add-function</a>."
msgstr ""
"ただし、<var class=\"var\">require-match</var> の値にかかわらず、空の入力は常"
"に許可されます。その場合、<code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> は、"
"<var class=\"var\">default</var> がリストであればその最初の要素を、<var "
"class=\"var\">default</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であれば "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;&quot;</code> を、あるいは <var "
"class=\"var\">default</var> を返します。<var class=\"var\">default</var> 内の"
"文字列（または複数の文字列）も、履歴コマンド（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-Commands.html\">ミニバッファコマンド</a> を参照）を通じて利"
"用可能です。さらに、<var class=\"var\">default</var> の値が <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> によって使い果たされると、補完候補が「将来の履歴」に"
"追加されます。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">minibuffer-"
"default-add-function</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> uses <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-local-completion-map</code> as the keymap if <var "
"class=\"var\">require-match</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and "
"uses <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-local-must-match-map</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">require-match</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">Minibuffer Commands "
"that Do Completion</a>."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> は、<var "
"class=\"var\">require-match</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-local-completion-map</code> を、<var "
"class=\"var\">require-match</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合は <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-local-must-match-map</code> をキーマップ"
"として使用します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">補完を"
"行うミニバッファコマンド</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">history</var> specifies which history list "
"variable to use for saving the input and for minibuffer history commands.  "
"It defaults to <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-history</code>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">history</var> is the symbol <code class=\"code\">t</code>, "
"history is not recorded.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"History.html\">Minibuffer History</a>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">history</var> は、入力の保存およびミニバッファ履歴コ"
"マンドに使用する履歴リスト変数を指定します。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-history</code> です。<var class=\"var\">history</"
"var> がシンボル <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合、履歴は記録されませ"
"ん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">ミニバッファ履歴</a> "
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">initial</var> is mostly deprecated; we "
"recommend using a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value only in "
"conjunction with specifying a cons cell for <var class=\"var\">history</"
"var>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Initial-Input.html\">Initial Input</a>.  "
"For default input, use <var class=\"var\">default</var> instead."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">initial</var> はほぼ非推奨となっています。<var "
"class=\"var\">history</var> にコンスセルを指定する場合に限り、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を使用することを推奨します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Initial-Input.html\">初期入力</a> を参照してください。"
"デフォルトの入力には、代わりに <var class=\"var\">default</var> を使用してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"If the argument <var class=\"var\">inherit-input-method</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the minibuffer inherits the current input "
"method (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input Methods</"
"a>) and the setting of <code class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-characters</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">Text "
"Representations</a>) from whichever buffer was current before entering the "
"minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">inherit-input-method</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、ミニバッファは、ミニバッファに入る前に"
"有効だったバッファから、現在の入力メソッド（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-"
"Methods.html\">入力メソッド</a> を参照）および <code class=\"code\">enable-"
"multibyte-characters</code> の設定（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-"
"Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a> を参照）を継承します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">completion-ignore-case</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, completion ignores case when comparing the "
"input against the possible matches.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>.  In this mode of "
"operation, <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> must also ignore case, or you "
"will get surprising results."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">completion-ignore-case</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、補完機能は入力と候補を照合する際に大文"
"字小文字を区別しません。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Basic-Completion.html\">基本"
"的な補完機能</a>を参照してください。この動作モードでは、<var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var> も同様に大文字小文字を区別しない必要がありま"
"す。そうしないと、予期しない結果が生じることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s an example of using <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>の使用例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(completing-read\n"
" &quot;Complete a foo: &quot;\n"
" '((&quot;foobar1&quot; 1) (&quot;barfoo&quot; 2) (&quot;foobaz&quot; 3) (&quot;foobar2&quot; 4))\n"
" nil t &quot;fo&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">After evaluation of the preceding expression,</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">the following appears in the minibuffer:</span>\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
"Complete a foo: fo&lowast;\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If the user then types <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> b <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>, <code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> returns <code class=\"code\">barfoo</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"その後、ユーザーが <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> b <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力すると、"
"<code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> は <code class=\"code\">barfoo</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> function binds variables to "
"pass information to the commands that actually do completion.  They are "
"described in the following section."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completing-read</code> 関数は、実際に補完を行うコマンド"
"に情報を渡すための変数をバインドします。これらの変数については、次のセクショ"
"ンで説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completing-read-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completing_002dread_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completing-read-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-completing_002dread_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable must be a function, which is called by <code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> to actually do its work.  It should "
"accept the same arguments as <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>.  "
"This can be bound to a different function to completely override the normal "
"behavior of <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は関数である必要があり、<code class=\"code\">completing-read</"
"code> によって呼び出されて実際に処理を実行します。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> と同じ引数を受け取る必要があります。こ"
"れを別の関数にバインドすることで、<code class=\"code\">completing-read</"
"code> の通常の動作を完全に上書きできます。"

