# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Contents.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the prompt string of the currently active minibuffer.  "
"If no minibuffer is active, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
