#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-history\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-history-list\"></a>"
