"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-history\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-history-list\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">minibuffer history list</em> records previous minibuffer "
"inputs so the user can reuse them conveniently.  It is a variable whose "
"value is a list of strings (previous inputs), most recent first."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ミニバッファ履歴リスト</em>は、ユーザーが便利に再利用できる"
"よう、過去のミニバッファ入力を記録します。これは、値として文字列（過去の入"
"力）のリスト（新しい順）を持つ変数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"There are many separate minibuffer history lists, used for different kinds "
"of inputs.  It&rsquo;s the Lisp programmer&rsquo;s job to specify the right "
"history list for each use of the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"さまざまな種類の入力に対応するため、個別のミニバッファ履歴リストが多数用意さ"
"れています。ミニバッファを使用する場面ごとに適切な履歴リストを指定するのが、"
"Lispプログラマの役割です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"You specify a minibuffer history list with the optional <var "
"class=\"var\">history</var> argument to <code class=\"code\">read-from-"
"minibuffer</code> or <code class=\"code\">completing-read</code>.  Here are "
"the possible values for it:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">completing-read</code> のオプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">history</var> で、ミニバッファ履歴リストを指定します。指定可能"
"な値は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">variable</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">variable</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid "Use <var class=\"var\">variable</var> (a symbol) as the history list."
msgstr ""
"履歴リストとして <var class=\"var\">variable</var>（記号）を使用してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">variable</var> . <var class=\"var\">startpos</var>)"
