"name\">add-to-history</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">history-var "
"newelt &amp;optional maxelt keep-all</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-add_002dto_002dhistory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">add-to-history</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">history-var "
"newelt &amp;optional maxelt keep-all</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-add_002dto_002dhistory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"This function adds a new element <var class=\"var\">newelt</var>, if it "
"isn&rsquo;t the empty string, to the history list stored in the variable "
"<var class=\"var\">history-var</var>, and returns the updated history list.  "
"It limits the list length to the value of <var class=\"var\">maxelt</var> "
"(if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>) or <code class=\"code\">history-"
"length</code> (described below).  The possible values of <var "
"class=\"var\">maxelt</var> have the same meaning as the values of <code "
"class=\"code\">history-length</code>.  <var class=\"var\">history-var</var> "
"cannot refer to a lexical variable."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、空文字列でない場合に新しい要素 <var class=\"var\">newelt</var> を"
"変数 <var class=\"var\">history-var</var> に格納された履歴リストに追加し、更"
"新後の履歴リストを返します。リストの長さは、<var class=\"var\">maxelt</var>"
"（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合）または <code "
"class=\"code\">history-length</code>（後述）の値に制限されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">maxelt</var> に指定可能な値は、<code class=\"code\">history-"
"length</code> の値と同じ意味を持ちます。<var class=\"var\">history-var</var> "
"は字句変数を参照することはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <code class=\"code\">add-to-history</code> removes duplicate "
"members from the history list if <code class=\"code\">history-delete-"
"duplicates</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  However, if <var "
"class=\"var\">keep-all</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that "
"says not to remove duplicates, and to add <var class=\"var\">newelt</var> to "
"the list even if it is empty."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">history-delete-duplicates</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">add-to-history</"
"code> は履歴リストから重複したメンバーを削除します。ただし、<var "
"class=\"var\">keep-all</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合"
"は、重複を削除せず、たとえ空であっても <var class=\"var\">newelt</var> をリス"
"トに追加することを意味します。"

