#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This macro executes <var class=\"var\">body</var> after arranging for the "
"specified <var class=\"var\">function</var> to be called via <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-setup-hook</code>.  By default, <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> is called before the other functions in the "
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-setup-hook</code> list, but if <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> is of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(:append&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">func</var>)</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">func</var> will be called <em class=\"emph\">after</em> the "
"other hook functions."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、指定された <var class=\"var\">function</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-setup-hook</code> 経由で呼び出されるよう手配した上"
"で、<var class=\"var\">body</var> を実行します。デフォルトでは、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> は <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-setup-hook</"
"code> リスト内の他の関数よりも前に呼び出されますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> が <code class=\"code\">(:append&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">func</var>)</code> の形式である場合、<var class=\"var\">func</"
"var> は他のフック関数の<em class=\"emph\">後</em>に呼び出されます。"

