# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This is the major mode used in inactive minibuffers.  It uses keymap <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-inactive-mode-map</code>.  This can be useful if "
"the minibuffer is in a separate frame.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffers-and-Frames.html\">Minibuffers and Frames</a>."
