"href=\"#index-window_002dminibuffer_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-minibuffer-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dminibuffer_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is a minibuffer window.  <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> defaults to the selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> がミニバッファウィンドウである場"
"合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> のデフォルト値は選択中のウィンドウです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
