"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">active-minibuffer-window</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-active_002dminibuffer_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the window of the currently active minibuffer, or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there is no active minibuffer."
