# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"It is not sufficient to determine whether a given window shows the currently "
"active minibuffer by comparing it with the result of <code "
"class=\"code\">(minibuffer-window)</code>, because there can be more than "
"one minibuffer window if there is more than one frame."
msgstr ""
"フレームが複数ある場合、ミニバッファウィンドウが複数存在し得るため、あるウィ"
"ンドウが現在アクティブなミニバッファを表示しているかどうかを <code "
"class=\"code\">(minibuffer-window)</code> の結果と比較するだけで判断するのは"
"不十分です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
