# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">resize-mini-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"resize_002dmini_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">resize-mini-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-resize_002dmini_002dwindows\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This option specifies whether minibuffer windows are resized automatically.  "
"The default value is <code class=\"code\">grow-only</code>, which means that "
"a minibuffer window by default expands automatically to accommodate the text "
"it displays and shrinks back to one line as soon as the minibuffer gets "
"empty.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, Emacs will always try "
"to fit the height of a minibuffer window to the text it displays (with a "
"minimum of one line).  If the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, a "
"minibuffer window never changes size automatically.  In that case the window "
"resizing commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Resizing-"
"Windows.html\">Resizing Windows</a>) can be used to adjust its height."
msgstr ""
"このオプションは、ミニバッファウィンドウが自動的にリサイズされるかどうかを指"
"定します。デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">grow-only</code> で、これはミニ"
"バッファウィンドウがデフォルトで表示テキストに合わせて自動的に拡大し、ミニ"
"バッファが空になるとすぐに1行分に縮小されることを意味します。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、Emacs は常にミニバッファウィンドウの高さを表"
"示テキストに合わせようとします（ただし最低1行分は確保されます）。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ミニバッファウィンドウが自動的にサイズ変更"
"されることはありません。その場合、ウィンドウのリサイズコマンド（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Resizing-Windows.html\">ウィンドウのリサイズ</a> を参"
"照）を使用して高さを調整できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">max-mini-window-height</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-max_002dmini_002dwindow_002dheight\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">max-mini-window-height</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-max_002dmini_002dwindow_002dheight\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This option provides a maximum height for resizing minibuffer windows "
"automatically.  A floating-point number specifies the maximum height as a "
"fraction of the frame&rsquo;s height; an integer specifies the maximum "
"height in units of the frame&rsquo;s canonical character height (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">Frame Font</a>).  The default value "
"is 0.25."
msgstr ""
"このオプションでは、ミニバッファウィンドウを自動的にリサイズする際の最大高さ"
"を指定できます。浮動小数点数を指定すると、フレーム高さに対する割合として最大"
"高さが指定されます。整数を指定すると、フレームの正準文字高さ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレームフォント</a>を参照）を単位と"
"した最大高さが指定されます。デフォルト値は0.25です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that the values of the above two variables take effect at display time, "
"so let-binding them around code which produces echo-area messages will not "
"work.  If you want to prevent resizing of minibuffer windows when displaying "
"long messages, bind the <code class=\"code\">message-truncate-lines</code> "
"variable instead (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Echo-Area-"
"Customization.html\">Echo Area Customization</a>)."
msgstr ""
"なお、上記2つの変数の値は表示時に適用されるため、echo-areaメッセージを生成す"
"るコードの前後でletバインディングを行っても機能しません。長いメッセージを表示"
"する際にミニバッファウィンドウのサイズ変更を防ぎたい場合は、代わりに<code "
"class=\"code\">message-truncate-lines</code>変数をバインドしてください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Echo-Area-Customization.html\">Echo Areaのカスタマイズ"
"</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The option <code class=\"code\">resize-mini-windows</code> does not affect "
"the behavior of minibuffer-only frames (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Layout.html\">Frame Layout</a>).  The following option enables automatically "
"resizing such frames as well."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">resize-mini-windows</code> は、ミニバッファ専"
"用フレームの動作には影響しません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Layout.html\">フレームレイアウト</a> を参照）。以下のオプションは、こうしたフ"
"レームの自動リサイズも有効にします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">resize-mini-frames</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"resize_002dmini_002dframes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">resize-mini-frames</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-resize_002dmini_002dframes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If this is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, minibuffer-only frames are never "
"resized automatically."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ミニバッファ専用フレームが自動"
"的にリサイズされることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If this is a function, that function is called with the minibuffer-only "
"frame to be resized as sole argument.  At the time this function is called, "
"the buffer of the minibuffer window of that frame is the buffer whose "
"contents will be shown the next time that window is redisplayed.  The "
"function is expected to fit the frame to the buffer in some appropriate way."
msgstr ""
"これが関数である場合、リサイズ対象のミニバッファ専用フレームを唯一の引数とし"
"てその関数が呼び出されます。この関数が呼び出される時点で、そのフレームのミニ"
"バッファウィンドウのバッファが、次にそのウィンドウが再表示される際に表示され"
"る内容となるバッファとなります。この関数は、適切な方法でフレームをバッファに"
"適合させることが求められます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Minibuffer-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value means to resize "
"minibuffer-only frames by calling <code class=\"code\">fit-mini-frame-to-"
"buffer</code>, a function that behaves like <code class=\"code\">fit-frame-"
"to-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Resizing-"
"Windows.html\">Resizing Windows</a>) but does not strip leading or trailing "
"empty lines from the buffer text."
msgstr ""

