# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">clicks</var>, if present, is the number of times that the "
"wheel was moved in quick succession.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Repeat-"
"Events.html\">Repeat Events</a>.  <var class=\"var\">lines</var>, if present "
"and not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, is the positive number of screen "
"lines that should be scrolled (either up, when the event is <code "
"class=\"code\">wheel-up</code>, or down when the event is <code "
"class=\"code\">wheel-down</code>).  <var class=\"var\">pixel-delta</var>, if "
"present, is a cons cell of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">x</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code>, where "
"<var class=\"var\">x</var> and <var class=\"var\">y</var> are the numbers of "
"pixels by which to scroll in each axis, a.k.a. <em class=\"dfn\">pixelwise "
"deltas</em>.  Usually, only one of the two will be non-zero, the other will "
"be either zero or very close to zero; the larger number indicates the axis "
"to scroll the window.  When the variable <code class=\"code\">mwheel-"
"coalesce-scroll-events</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the scroll "
"commands ignore the <var class=\"var\">lines</var> element, even if "
"it&rsquo;s non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and use the <var "
"class=\"var\">pixel-delta</var> data instead; in that case, the direction of "
"scrolling is determined by the sign of the pixelwise deltas, and the "
"direction (up or down) implied by the event kind is ignored."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">clicks</var>（存在する場合）は、ホイールが短時間に連続して"
"操作された回数です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Repeat-Events.html\">繰り返しイ"
"ベント</a>を参照してください。<var class=\"var\">lines</var>（存在し、かつ"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>ではない場合）は、スクロールすべき画面行数（イ"
"ベントが<code class=\"code\">wheel-up</code>の場合は上方向へ、<code "
"class=\"code\">wheel-down</code>の場合は下方向へ）です。<var "
"class=\"var\">pixel-delta</var>（存在する場合）は、<code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">y</"
"var>)</code>形式のコンスセルであり、ここで<var class=\"var\">x</var>と<var "
"class=\"var\">y</var>は各軸でスクロールさせるピクセル数（別名<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ピクセル単位のデルタ</em>）です。通常、2つのうち一方のみが非ゼ"
"ロとなり、もう一方はゼロまたはゼロに非常に近い値になります。大きい方の数値"
"が、ウィンドウをスクロールさせる軸を示します。変数<code "
"class=\"code\">mwheel-coalesce-scroll-events</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合、スクロールコマンドは<var "
"class=\"var\">lines</var>要素が非<code class=\"code\">nil</code>であってもそ"
"れを無視し、代わりに<var class=\"var\">pixel-delta</var>データを使用します。"
"この場合、スクロール方向はピクセル単位のデルタの符号によって決定され、イベン"
"ト種別が示す方向（上または下）は無視されます。"

