# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"This kind of event is generated by the user performing a &ldquo;pinch&rdquo; "
"gesture by placing two fingers on a touchpad and moving them towards or away "
"from each other.  <var class=\"var\">position</var> is a mouse position list "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Click-Events.html\">Click Events</a>) that "
"provides the position of the mouse pointer when the event occurred, <var "
"class=\"var\">dx</var> is the change in the horizontal distance between the "
"fingers since the last event in the same sequence, <var class=\"var\">dy</"
"var> is the vertical movement of the fingers since the last event in the "
"same sequence, <var class=\"var\">scale</var> is the ratio of the current "
"distance between the fingers to that distance at the start of the sequence, "
"and <var class=\"var\">angle</var> is the angular difference in degrees "
"between the direction of the line connecting the fingers in this event and "
"the direction of that line in the last event of the same sequence."
msgstr ""
"この種のイベントは、ユーザーがタッチパッド上に2本の指を置き、それらを互いに近"
"づけたり遠ざけたりする「ピンチ」ジェスチャーを行うことで発生します。<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> はマウス位置リスト（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Click-Events.html\">クリックイベント</a>を参照）で、イベント発生時のマ"
"ウスポインタの位置を表します。<var class=\"var\">dx</var> は、同一シーケンス"
"内の直前のイベントからの指間の水平距離の変化、<var class=\"var\">dy</var> "
"は、同一シーケンス内の直前のイベントからの指の垂直方向の移動、<var "
"class=\"var\">scale</var> は、現在の指間距離とシーケンス開始時の距離との比、"
"<var class=\"var\">angle</var> は、今回のイベントにおける指を結ぶ線の方向と、"
"同一シーケンス内の直前のイベントにおけるその線の方向との角度差（度単位）で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"As pinch events are only sent at the beginning or during a pinch sequence, "
"they do not report gestures where the user moves two fingers on a touchpad "
"in a rotating fashion without pinching the fingers."
msgstr ""
"ピンチイベントは開始時またはピンチシーケンス中にのみ送信されるため、ユーザー"
"がタッチパッド上で指をつままずに2本の指を回転させるように動かしたジェスチャー"
"は報告されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"All arguments after <var class=\"var\">position</var> are floating point "
"numbers."
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">position</var> 以降の引数はすべて浮動小数点数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is usually sent as part of a sequence, which begins with the user "
"placing two fingers on the touchpad, and ends with the user removing those "
"fingers.  <var class=\"var\">dx</var>, <var class=\"var\">dy</var>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">angle</var> will be <code class=\"code\">0.0</code> in the "
"first event of a sequence; subsequent events will report non-zero values for "
"these members of the event structure."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは通常、ユーザーがタッチパッドに2本の指を置いた状態から始まり、指"
"を離すまでで終わる一連のシーケンスの一部として送信されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">dx</var>、<var class=\"var\">dy</var>、および<var "
"class=\"var\">angle</var>は、シーケンスの最初のイベントでは<code "
"class=\"code\">0.0</code>となり、それ以降のイベントでは、イベント構造のこれら"
"のメンバに対して0以外の値が報告されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">dx</var> and <var class=\"var\">dy</var> are reported in "
"imaginary relative units, in which <code class=\"code\">1.0</code> is the "
"width and height of the touchpad respectively.  They are usually interpreted "
"as being relative to the size of the object beneath the gesture: image, "
"window, etc."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">dx</var> と <var class=\"var\">dy</var> は仮想的な相対単位"
"として報告されており、ここで <code class=\"code\">1.0</code> はそれぞれタッチ"
"パッドの幅と高さを表します。これらは通常、ジェスチャーの下にあるオブジェクト"
"（画像やウィンドウなど）のサイズに対する相対値として解釈されます。"

