"This event is injected when the device Emacs is running on is about to enter "
"a sleep state, or has just awoken from one.  <var class=\"var\">state</var> "
"will be the symbol <code class=\"code\">pre-sleep</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">post-wake</code>."
