# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"This kind of event is generated on MS-Windows when the input language has "
"changed.  This typically means that the keyboard keys will send to Emacs "
"characters from a different language.  The generated event has this form:"
msgstr ""
"この種のイベントは、MS-Windowsで入力言語が変更された際に発生します。これは通"
"常、キーボードのキーからEmacsに異なる言語の文字が送信されることを意味します。"
"生成されるイベントは以下の形式となります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(language-change <var class=\"var\">frame</var> <var class=\"var\">codepage</var> <var class=\"var\">language-id</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
msgid ""
"Here <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is the frame which was current when the "
"input language changed; <var class=\"var\">codepage</var> is the new "
"codepage number; and <var class=\"var\">language-id</var> is the numerical "
"ID of the new input language.  The coding-system (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">Coding Systems</a>) that corresponds to <var "
"class=\"var\">codepage</var> is <code class=\"code\">cp<var "
"class=\"var\">codepage</var></code> or <code class=\"code\">windows-<var "
"class=\"var\">codepage</var></code>.  To convert <var class=\"var\">language-"
"id</var> to a string (e.g., to use it for various language-dependent "
"features, such as <code class=\"code\">set-language-environment</code>), use "
"the <code class=\"code\">w32-get-locale-info</code> function, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> は入力言語が変更された時点でのフレー"
"ム、<var class=\"var\">codepage</var> は新しいコードページ番号、<var "
"class=\"var\">language-id</var> は新しい入力言語の数値IDです。<var "
"class=\"var\">codepage</var> に対応するコーディングシステム（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">コーディングシステム</a>を参照）"
"は、<code class=\"code\">cp<var class=\"var\">codepage</var></code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">windows-<var class=\"var\">codepage</var></code> です。"
"<var class=\"var\">language-id</var> を文字列に変換する場合（例：<code "
"class=\"code\">set-language-environment</code> などの各種言語依存機能で使用す"
"る場合）、次のように <code class=\"code\">w32-get-locale-info</code> 関数を使"
"用します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Events.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Get the abbreviated language name, such as &quot;ENU&quot; for English\n"
"(w32-get-locale-info language-id)\n"
";; Get the full English name of the language,\n"
";; such as &quot;English (United States)&quot;\n"
"(w32-get-locale-info language-id 4097)\n"
";; Get the full localized name of the language\n"
"(w32-get-locale-info language-id t)\n"
msgstr ""

