# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
msgid ""
"These additional functions are useful for creating and operating on network "
"connections.  Note that they are supported only on some systems."
msgstr ""
"これらの追加機能は、ネットワーク接続の作成や操作に有用です。なお、一部のシス"
"テムでのみサポートされている点にご注意ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">network-interface-list</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional full family</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-network_002dinterface_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">network-interface-list</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional full family</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-network_002dinterface_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list describing the network interfaces of the "
"machine you are using.  The value is an alist whose elements have the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">ifname</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">address</var>)</code>.  <var class=\"var\">ifname</var> is a "
"string naming the interface, <var class=\"var\">address</var> has the same "
"form as the <var class=\"var\">local-address</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">remote-address</var> arguments to <code class=\"code\">make-"
"network-process</code>, i.e. a vector of integers.  By default both IPv4 and "
"IPv6 addresses are returned if possible."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、使用しているマシンのネットワークインターフェースを記述するリスト"
"を返します。戻り値はアリストであり、各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">ifname</var> . <var class=\"var\">address</var>)</code> という"
"形式をしています。<var class=\"var\">ifname</var> はインターフェース名を示す"
"文字列であり、<var class=\"var\">address</var> は <code class=\"code\">make-"
"network-process</code> の引数である <var class=\"var\">local-address</var> お"
"よび <var class=\"var\">remote-address</var> と同じ形式、すなわち整数のベクト"
"ルとなっています。デフォルトでは、可能であれば IPv4 と IPv6 の両方のアドレス"
"が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
msgid ""
"Optional argument <var class=\"var\">full</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means to instead return a list of one or more "
"elements of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">ifname</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">addr</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">bcast</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">netmask</var>)</code>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">ifname</var> is a non-unique string naming the interface.  "
"<var class=\"var\">addr</var>, <var class=\"var\">bcast</var>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">netmask</var> are vectors of integers detailing the IP "
"address, broadcast address, and network mask."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">full</var> が non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、代わりに <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">ifname</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">addr</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">bcast</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">netmask</var>)</code> 形式"
"の要素を1つ以上含むリストを返します。<var class=\"var\">ifname</var> はイン"
"ターフェース名を示す一意ではない文字列です。<var class=\"var\">addr</var>、"
"<var class=\"var\">bcast</var>、および <var class=\"var\">netmask</var> は、"
"IPアドレス、ブロードキャストアドレス、およびネットワークマスクを詳細に示す整"
"数のベクトルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
msgid ""
"Optional argument <var class=\"var\">family</var> specified as symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">ipv4</code> or <code class=\"code\">ipv6</code> restricts the "
"returned information to IPv4 and IPv6 addresses respectively, independently "
"of the value of <var class=\"var\">full</var>.  Specifying <code "
"class=\"code\">ipv6</code> when IPv6 support is not available will result in "
"an error being signaled."
msgstr ""
"シンボル <code class=\"code\">ipv4</code> または <code class=\"code\">ipv6</"
"code> として指定されるオプション引数 <var class=\"var\">family</var> は、"
"<var class=\"var\">full</var> の値にかかわらず、返される情報をそれぞれ IPv4 "
"アドレスおよび IPv6 アドレスに限定します。IPv6 サポートが利用できない状態で "
"<code class=\"code\">ipv6</code> を指定すると、エラーが発生します。"

