"class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var> <var class=\"var\">d</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">p</var>]</code> は、IPv4アドレス <var class=\"var\">a</"
"var>.<var class=\"var\">b</var>.<var class=\"var\">c</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">d</var> とポート番号 <var class=\"var\">p</var> を表します。"
"<code class=\"code\">format-network-address</code> はこれを文字列 <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;<var class=\"var\">a</var>.<var class=\"var\">b</var>."
"<var class=\"var\">c</var>.<var class=\"var\">d</var>:<var class=\"var\">p</"
"var>&quot;</code> に変換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
msgid ""
"A nine-element vector <code class=\"code\">[<var class=\"var\">a</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var> <var class=\"var\">d</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">e</var> <var class=\"var\">f</var> <var class=\"var\">g</"
