"<code class=\"code\">&quot;[<var class=\"var\">a</var>:<var class=\"var\">b</"
"var>:<var class=\"var\">c</var>:<var class=\"var\">d</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">e</var>:<var class=\"var\">f</var>:<var class=\"var\">g</var>:"
"<var class=\"var\">h</var>]:<var class=\"var\">p</var>&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"9要素のベクトル <code class=\"code\">[<var class=\"var\">a</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var> <var class=\"var\">d</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">e</var> <var class=\"var\">f</var> <var class=\"var\">g</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">h</var> <var class=\"var\">p</var>]</code> は、ポート"
"番号とともに IPv6 アドレスを表します。<code class=\"code\">format-network-"
