"var>:<var class=\"var\">g</var>:<var class=\"var\">h</var>]:<var "
"class=\"var\">p</var>&quot;</code> に変換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Misc-Network.html
