"buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-describe_002dmode\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Help.html
msgid ""
"This command displays the documentation of the current buffer&rsquo;s major "
"mode and minor modes.  It uses the <code class=\"code\">documentation</code> "
"function to retrieve the documentation strings of the major and minor mode "
"commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accessing-"
"Documentation.html\">Access to Documentation Strings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、現在のバッファのメジャーモードおよびマイナーモードのドキュメ"
