# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.4.3 The Top Level of Mode Line Control<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-Top-Level-of-Mode-Line-Control\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.4.3 モードライン制御の最上位レベル<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-Top-Level-of-Mode-Line-Control\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"The variable in overall control of the mode line is <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code>."
msgstr ""
"モードラインの全体的な制御変数は<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code>"
"である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-format</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mode_002dline_002dformat\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">mode-line-format</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-mode_002dline_002dformat\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a mode line construct that controls the "
"contents of the mode-line.  It is always buffer-local in all buffers."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、モードラインの内容を制御するモードライン用の構造体です。すべ"
"てのバッファにおいて、常にバッファローカルとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"If you set this variable to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> in a buffer, "
"that buffer does not have a mode line.  (A window that is just one line tall "
"also does not display a mode line.)"
msgstr ""
"バッファでこの変数を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、そのバッ"
"ファにはモードラインが表示されません。（高さが1行しかないウィンドウでも、モー"
"ドラインは表示されません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"The default value of <code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> is "
"designed to use the values of other variables such as <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-position</code> and <code class=\"code\">mode-line-"
"modes</code> (which in turn incorporates the values of the variables <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-name</code> and <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-alist</"
"code>).  Very few modes need to alter <code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</"
"code> itself.  For most purposes, it is sufficient to alter some of the "
"variables that <code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> either directly "
"or indirectly refers to."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> のデフォルト値は、<code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-position</code> や <code class=\"code\">mode-line-"
"modes</code> といった他の変数の値（これらはさらに <code class=\"code\">mode-"
"name</code> や <code class=\"code\">minor-mode-alist</code> という変数の値を"
"組み込んでいます）を利用するように設計されています。<code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> 自体を変更する必要があるモードはごくわ"
"ずかです。ほとんどの場合、<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> が直接"
"的または間接的に参照している変数の一部を変更するだけで十分です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"If you do alter <code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> itself, the new "
"value should use the same variables that appear in the default value (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mode-Line-Variables.html\">Variables Used in the Mode "
"Line</a>), rather than duplicating their contents or displaying the "
"information in another fashion.  This way, customizations made by the user "
"or by Lisp programs (such as <code class=\"code\">display-time</code> and "
"major modes) via changes to those variables remain effective."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> 自体を変更する場合、新しい値には"
"デフォルト値に含まれる変数をそのまま使用すべきであり（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mode-Line-Variables.html\">モードラインで使用される変数</a>を参照）、"
"その内容を重複させたり、別の形式で情報を表示したりすべきではありません。これ"
"により、ユーザーや Lisp プログラム（<code class=\"code\">display-time</code> "
"やメジャーモードなど）がこれらの変数を変更して行ったカスタマイズが、引き続き"
"有効に維持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"Here is a hypothetical example of a <code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</"
"code> that might be useful for Shell mode (in reality, Shell mode does not "
"set <code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code>):"
msgstr ""
"Shellモードで有用と思われる<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code>の仮想"
"的な例を以下に示します（実際には、Shellモードでは<code class=\"code\">mode-"
"line-format</code>は設定されません）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq mode-line-format\n"
"  (list &quot;-&quot;\n"
"   'mode-line-mule-info\n"
"   'mode-line-modified\n"
"   'mode-line-frame-identification\n"
"   &quot;%b--&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   ;; <span class=\"r\">Note that this is evaluated while making the list.</span>\n"
"   ;; <span class=\"r\">It makes a mode line construct which is just a string.</span>\n"
"   (getenv &quot;HOST&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   &quot;:&quot;\n"
"   'default-directory\n"
"   &quot;   &quot;\n"
"   'global-mode-string\n"
"   &quot;   %[(&quot;\n"
"   '(:eval (format-time-string &quot;%F&quot;))\n"
"   'mode-line-process\n"
"   'minor-mode-alist\n"
"   &quot;%n&quot;\n"
"   &quot;)%]--&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   '(which-function-mode (&quot;&quot; which-func-format &quot;--&quot;))\n"
"   '(line-number-mode &quot;L%l--&quot;)\n"
"   '(column-number-mode &quot;C%c--&quot;)\n"
"   '(-3 &quot;%p&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Top.html
msgid ""
"(The variables <code class=\"code\">line-number-mode</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">column-number-mode</code> and <code class=\"code\">which-"
"function-mode</code> enable particular minor modes; as usual, these variable "
"names are also the minor mode command names.)"
msgstr ""
"(変数 <code class=\"code\">line-number-mode</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">column-number-mode</code>、<code class=\"code\">which-"
"function-mode</code> により、特定のマイナーモードが有効になります。通常どお"
"り、これらの変数名はマイナーモードのコマンド名でもあります。)"

