# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.4.4 Variables Used in the Mode Line<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Variables-Used-in-the-Mode-Line\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.4.4 モードラインで使用される変数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Variables-Used-in-the-Mode-Line\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This section describes variables incorporated by the standard value of <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> into the text of the mode line.  "
"There is nothing inherently special about these variables; any other "
"variables could have the same effects on the mode line if the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> is changed to use them.  However, "
"various parts of Emacs set these variables on the understanding that they "
"will control parts of the mode line; therefore, practically speaking, it is "
"essential for the mode line to use them.  Also see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Optional-"
"Mode-Line.html#Optional-Mode-Line\">Optional Mode Line</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"この節では、<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> の標準値によってモー"
"ドラインのテキストに組み込まれる変数について説明します。これらの変数自体に特"
"別な点はありません。<code class=\"code\">mode-line-format</code> の値を変更し"
"てこれらの変数を使用すれば、他の任意の変数でもモードラインに同様の効果をもた"
"らすことができます。しかし、Emacs のさまざまな箇所では、これらの変数がモード"
"ラインの一部を制御することを前提に設定しています。したがって、実用上、モード"
"ラインがこれらの変数を使用することが不可欠です。また、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Optional-"
"Mode-Line.html#Optional-Mode-Line\">Optional Mode Line</a> も参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-mule-info</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mode_002dline_002dmule_002dinfo\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-mule-info</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mode_002dline_002dmule_002dinfo\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds the value of the mode line construct that displays "
"information about the language environment, buffer coding system, and "
"current input method.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Non_002dASCII-"
"Characters.html\">Non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> Characters</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、言語環境、バッファ符号化方式、および現在の入力メソッドに関する"
"情報を表示するモードライン構文の値が格納されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Non_002dASCII-Characters.html\">非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>"
"文字</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-modified</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mode_002dline_002dmodified\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-modified</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mode_002dline_002dmodified\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds the value of the mode line construct that displays "
"whether the current buffer is modified.  Its default value displays &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">**</samp>&rsquo; if the buffer is modified, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">--</samp>&rsquo; if the buffer is not modified, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo; if the buffer is read only, and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%*</samp>&rsquo; if the buffer is read only and "
"modified."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、現在のバッファが変更されているかどうかを表示するモードライン構"
"文の値が格納されます。デフォルト値は、バッファが変更されている場合は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">**</samp>&rsquo;、変更されていない場合は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">--</samp>&rsquo;、読み取り専用の場合は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%%</samp>&rsquo;、そして読み取り専用かつ変更されている場合は "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%*</samp>&rsquo; となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid "Changing this variable does not force an update of the mode line."
msgstr "この変数を変更しても、モードラインの更新が強制されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-frame-identification</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-mode_002dline_002dframe_002didentification\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-frame-identification</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-mode_002dline_002dframe_002didentification\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable identifies the current frame.  Its default value displays "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot; &quot;</code> if you are using a window system "
"which can show multiple frames, or <code class=\"code\">&quot;-%F &quot;</"
"code> on an ordinary terminal which shows only one frame at a time."
msgstr ""
"この変数は現在のフレームを識別します。デフォルト値は、複数のフレームを表示で"
"きるウィンドウシステムを使用している場合は <code class=\"code\">&quot; &quot;"
"</code> を、一度に1つのフレームしか表示しない通常の端末では <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;-%F &quot;</code> を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-buffer-identification</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-mode_002dline_002dbuffer_002didentification\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-buffer-identification</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-mode_002dline_002dbuffer_002didentification\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable identifies the buffer being displayed in the window.  Its "
"default value displays the buffer name, padded with spaces to at least 12 "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、ウィンドウに表示されているバッファを識別します。デフォルト値で"
"は、バッファ名が少なくとも12列になるようスペースで埋められて表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mode-line-position</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mode_002dline_002dposition\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
