"Structure of the Mode Line</a>).  To compute the string that will identify "
"the mode name in the mode line, use <code class=\"code\">format-mode-line</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Emulating-Mode-Line.html\">Emulating "
"Mode Line Formatting</a>)."
msgstr ""
