"global_002dmode_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a mode line construct that, by default, appears in the "
"mode line as part of <code class=\"code\">mode-line-misc-info</code>, just "
"after the <code class=\"code\">which-function-mode</code> information if "
"that minor mode is enabled, else after <code class=\"code\">mode-line-modes</"
"code>.  Elements that are added to this construct should normally end in a "
"space (to ensure that consecutive <code class=\"code\">global-mode-string</"
"code> elements display properly).  For instance, the command <code "
"class=\"code\">display-time</code> sets <code class=\"code\">global-mode-"
"string</code> to refer to the variable <code class=\"code\">display-time-"
"string</code>, which holds a string containing the time and load information."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mode-Line-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%M</samp>&rsquo; construct substitutes the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">global-mode-string</code>.  This construct is "
"not used by the default mode line, as the variable itself is used in <code "
"class=\"code\">mode-line-misc-info</code>."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%M</samp>&rsquo;という構文は、<code "
"class=\"code\">global-mode-string</code>の値を代入します。この構文は、変数自"
"体が<code class=\"code\">mode-line-misc-info</code>で使用されているため、デ"
"フォルトのモードラインでは使用されません。"

