# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.6 Buffer Modification Time<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Buffer-"
"Modification-Time\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.6 バッファ変更時間<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Buffer-"
"Modification-Time\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comparing-file-modification-time\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modification-time-of-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comparing-file-modification-time\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modification-time-of-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"Suppose that you visit a file and make changes in its buffer, and meanwhile "
"the file itself is changed on disk.  At this point, saving the buffer would "
"overwrite the changes in the file.  Occasionally this may be what you want, "
"but usually it would lose valuable information.  Emacs therefore checks the "
"file&rsquo;s modification time using the functions described below before "
"saving the file.  (See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"File-Attributes.html\">File "
"Attributes</a>, for how to examine a file&rsquo;s modification time.)"
msgstr ""
"あるファイルにアクセスしてそのバッファに変更を加え、その間にディスク上のファ"
"イル自体が変更されたとします。このとき、バッファを保存すると、ファイルへの変"
"更内容が上書きされてしまいます。場合によってはこれが意図した動作であることも"
"ありますが、通常は貴重な情報が失われることになります。そのため、Emacsはファイ"
"ルを保存する前に、以下に説明する関数を用いてファイルの更新日時を確認します。"
"（ファイルの更新日時の確認方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"File-"
"Attributes.html\">ファイル属性</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">verify-visited-file-modtime</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-verify_002dvisited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">verify-visited-file-modtime</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-verify_002dvisited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function compares what <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> (by default, the "
"current-buffer) has recorded for the modification time of its visited file "
"against the actual modification time of the file as recorded by the "
"operating system.  The two should be the same unless some other process has "
"written the file since Emacs visited or saved it."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">buffer</var>（デフォルトでは current-buffer）"
"が記録している訪問済みファイルの更新日時と、オペレーティングシステムが記録し"
"ている実際のファイルの更新日時を比較します。Emacsがファイルを訪問または保存し"
"て以降、他のプロセスがファイルに書き込みを行っていない限り、両者は一致するは"
"ずです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"The function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the last actual "
"modification time and Emacs&rsquo;s recorded modification time are the same, "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  It also returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if the buffer has no recorded last modification "
"time, that is if <code class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code> would "
"return zero."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、直近の実際の変更時刻とEmacsが記録している変更時刻が一致する場合は"
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>を、そうでない場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>を返します。また、バッファに記録された直近の変更時刻がない場合、すなわち"
"<code class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code>が0を返す場合には、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"It always returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> for buffers that are not "
"visiting a file, even if <code class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code> "
"returns a non-zero value.  For instance, it always returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> for dired buffers.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> for buffers that are visiting a file that does not "
"exist and never existed, but <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for file-"
"visiting buffers whose file has been deleted."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code> が 0 以外の値を返す場合で"
"も、ファイルを参照していないバッファに対しては常に <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> を返します。例えば、dired バッファに対しては常に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。存在しない、あるいは最初から存在しなかっ"
"たファイルを参照しているバッファに対しては <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返"
"し、ファイルが削除されたファイル参照バッファに対しては <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clear-visited-file-modtime</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-clear_002dvisited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clear-visited-file-modtime</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-clear_002dvisited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function clears out the record of the last modification time of the "
"file being visited by the current buffer.  As a result, the next attempt to "
"save this buffer will not complain of a discrepancy in file modification "
"times."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファが参照しているファイルの最終変更時刻の記録をクリア"
"します。これにより、次にこのバッファを保存しようとする際に、ファイルの変更時"
"刻の不一致に関するエラーが発生しなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function is called in <code class=\"code\">set-visited-file-name</code> "
"and other exceptional places where the usual test to avoid overwriting a "
"changed file should not be done."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">set-visited-file-name</code> や、変更済み"
"ファイルの上書きを回避するための通常のチェックを行うべきではないその他の例外"
"的な箇所で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">visited-file-modtime</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"visited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">visited-file-modtime</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"visited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the current buffer&rsquo;s recorded last file "
"modification time, as a Lisp timestamp (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-"
"of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファに記録されている最終ファイル更新日時を、Lispのタイ"
"ムスタンプとして返します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time "
"of Day</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer has no recorded last modification time, this function returns "
"zero.  This case occurs, for instance, if the buffer is not visiting a file "
"or if the time has been explicitly cleared by <code class=\"code\">clear-"
"visited-file-modtime</code>.  Note, however, that <code "
"class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code> returns a timestamp for some non-"
"file buffers too.  For instance, in a Dired buffer listing a directory, it "
"returns the last modification time of that directory, as recorded by Dired."
msgstr ""
"バッファに最終変更時刻が記録されていない場合、この関数は0を返します。例えば、"
"バッファがファイルを参照していない場合や、<code class=\"code\">clear-visited-"
"file-modtime</code>によって時刻が明示的にクリアされた場合などにこのケースが発"
"生します。ただし、<code class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code>はファイル"
"以外の一部のバッファに対してもタイムスタンプを返す点に注意してください。例え"
"ば、ディレクトリを一覧表示するDiredバッファでは、Diredによって記録されたその"
"ディレクトリの最終変更時刻を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer is visiting a file that doesn&rsquo;t exist, this function "
"returns &minus;1."
msgstr ""
"バッファが存在しないファイルを参照している場合、この関数は-1を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-visited-file-modtime</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional time</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dvisited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-visited-file-modtime</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional time</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dvisited_002dfile_002dmodtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function updates the buffer&rsquo;s record of the last modification "
"time of the visited file, to the value specified by <var class=\"var\">time</"
"var> if <var class=\"var\">time</var> is not <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, and otherwise to the last modification time of the visited file."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファの参照ファイルの最終変更時刻のレコードを、<var "
"class=\"var\">time</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合は "
"<var class=\"var\">time</var> で指定された値に、そうでない場合は参照ファイル"
"の最終変更時刻に更新します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">time</var> is neither <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"nor an integer flag returned by <code class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</"
"code>, it should be a Lisp time value (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-"
"Day.html\">Time of Day</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">time</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でも <code "
"class=\"code\">visited-file-modtime</code> が返す整数フラグでもない場合、それ"
"は Lisp の時刻値であるはずです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-"
"Day.html\">Time of Day</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function is useful if the buffer was not read from the file normally, "
"or if the file itself has been changed for some known benign reason."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファがファイルから正常に読み込まれなかった場合や、既知の無害"
"な理由でファイル自体が変更された場合に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ask-user-about-supersession-threat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"ask_002duser_002dabout_002dsupersession_002dthreat\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ask-user-about-supersession-threat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"ask_002duser_002dabout_002dsupersession_002dthreat\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function is used to ask a user how to proceed after an attempt to "
"modify a buffer visiting file <var class=\"var\">filename</var> when the "
"file is newer than the buffer text.  Emacs detects this because the "
"modification time of the file on disk is newer than the last save-time and "
"its contents have changed.  This means some other program has probably "
"altered the file."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ファイルがバッファのテキストよりも新しい場合に、ファイル <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> を参照するバッファを変更しようとした後、ユーザー"
"にどのように対処すべきかを尋ねるために使用されます。Emacs がこれを検知できる"
"のは、ディスク上のファイルの更新日時が最後の保存時刻よりも新しく、かつ内容が"
"変更されているためです。これは、おそらく他のプログラムがファイルを変更したこ"
"とを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file_002dsupersession\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file_002dsupersession\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"Depending on the user&rsquo;s answer, the function may return normally, in "
"which case the modification of the buffer proceeds, or it may signal a <code "
"class=\"code\">file-supersession</code> error with data <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">filename</var>)</code>, in which case the "
"proposed buffer modification is not allowed."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーの回答に応じて、関数が正常に戻り、その場合はバッファの変更が続行され"
"るか、あるいはデータ <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var>)</code> を伴う <code class=\"code\">file-supersession</code> エラーが通"
"知され、その場合は提案されたバッファの変更は許可されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modification-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function is called automatically by Emacs on the proper occasions.  It "
"exists so you can customize Emacs by redefining it.  See the file <samp "
