# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-menu-modification\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-menu-modification\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
msgid ""
"When you insert a new item in an existing menu, you probably want to put it "
"in a particular place among the menu&rsquo;s existing items.  If you use "
"<code class=\"code\">define-key</code> to add the item, it normally goes at "
"the front of the menu.  To put it elsewhere in the menu, use <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set-after</code>:"
msgstr ""
"既存のメニューに新しい項目を追加する際、メニュー内の既存項目の特定の位置に配"
"置したい場合が多いでしょう。<code class=\"code\">define-key</code> を使用して"
"項目を追加すると、通常はメニューの先頭に配置されます。メニュー内の別の位置に"
"配置するには、<code class=\"code\">keymap-set-after</code> を使用してくださ"
"い："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-set-after</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">map key "
"binding &amp;optional after</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keymap_002dset_002dafter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keymap-set-after</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">map key "
"binding &amp;optional after</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keymap_002dset_002dafter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
msgid ""
"Define a binding in <var class=\"var\">map</var> for <var class=\"var\">key</"
"var>, with value <var class=\"var\">binding</var>, just like <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-Key-"
"Bindings.html\">Changing Key Bindings</a>), but position the binding in <var "
"class=\"var\">map</var> after the binding for the event <var "
"class=\"var\">after</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">key</var> should "
"represent a single menu item or key, and should satisfy <code "
"class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Sequences.html\">Key Sequences</a>).  <var class=\"var\">after</var> should "
"be a single event type&mdash;a symbol or a character, not a sequence.  The "
"new binding goes after the binding for <var class=\"var\">after</var>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">after</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code> or is "
"omitted, then the new binding goes last, at the end of the keymap.  However, "
"new bindings are added before any inherited keymap."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">map</var> に、<code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> と同"
"様に <var class=\"var\">key</var> 用のバインディングを値 <var "
"class=\"var\">binding</var> で定義します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Changing-"
"Key-Bindings.html\">キーバインディングの変更</a> を参照）。ただし、このバイン"
"ディングは <var class=\"var\">map</var> の、イベント <var "
"class=\"var\">after</var> 用のバインディングの後に配置します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> は単一のメニュー項目またはキーを表す必要があり、"
"<code class=\"code\">key-valid-p</code> を満たす必要があります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequences.html\">キーシーケンス</a> を参照）。"
"<var class=\"var\">after</var> は単一のイベントタイプ（シーケンスではなく、シ"
"ンボルまたは文字）である必要があります。新しいバインディングは <var "
"class=\"var\">after</var> 用のバインディングの後に配置されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">after</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> であるか、あるいは"
"省略されている場合、新しいバインディングはキーマップの最後、つまり末尾に配置"
"されます。ただし、新しいバインディングは継承されたキーマップよりも前に追加さ"
"れます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-set-after my-menu &quot;&lt;drink&gt;&quot;\n"
"  '(&quot;Drink&quot; . drink-command) 'eat)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
msgid ""
"makes a binding for the fake function key <kbd class=\"key\">DRINK</kbd> and "
"puts it right after the binding for <kbd class=\"key\">EAT</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"擬似関数キー <kbd class=\"key\">DRINK</kbd> のバインディングを作成し、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">EAT</kbd> のバインディングの直後に配置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
msgid ""
"Here is how to insert an item called &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Work</"
"samp>&rsquo; in the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Signals</samp>&rsquo; menu "
"of Shell mode, after the item <code class=\"code\">break</code>:"
msgstr ""
"シェルモードの&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Signals</samp>&rsquo;メニューにおい"
"て、項目<code class=\"code\">break</code>の後に&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Work</samp>&rsquo;という項目を挿入する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Menus.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-set-after shell-mode-map &quot;&lt;menu-bar&gt; &lt;signals&gt; &lt;work&gt;&quot;\n"
"  '(&quot;Work&quot; . work-command) 'break)\n"
msgstr ""

