# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Strings.html
msgid ""
"You can alter the contents of a mutable string via operations described in "
"this section.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Mutability.html\">Mutability</a>."
msgstr ""
"本節で説明する操作により、可変文字列の内容を変更できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mutability.html\">可変性</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Strings.html
msgid ""
"The most basic way to alter the contents of an existing string is with <code "
"class=\"code\">aset</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Array-"
"Functions.html\">Functions that Operate on Arrays</a>).  <code "
"class=\"code\">(aset&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">string</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">idx</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">char</var>)</code> stores "
"<var class=\"var\">char</var> into <var class=\"var\">string</var> at "
"character index <var class=\"var\">idx</var>.  When <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> is a unibyte string (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text-Representations.html\">Text Representations</a>), <var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> must be a single byte (0&ndash;255); when <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> is multibyte, both <var class=\"var\">char</var> "
"and the previous character at <var class=\"var\">idx</var> must be ASCII "
"(0&ndash;127)."
msgstr ""
"既存の文字列の内容を変更するための最も基本的な方法は、<code "
"class=\"code\">aset</code> を使用することです（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Array-Functions.html\">配列を操作する関数</a>を参照）。<code "
"class=\"code\">(aset&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">string</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">idx</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">char</var>)</code> は、文字イ"
"ンデックス <var class=\"var\">idx</var> の位置にある <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> に <var class=\"var\">char</var> を格納します。"
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> がユニバイト文字列（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text-Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a>を参照）の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> は単一バイト（0&ndash;255）である必要があります。"
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> がマルチバイトの場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> と <var class=\"var\">idx</var> の直前の文字はとも"
"に ASCII（0&ndash;127）である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Strings.html
msgid ""
"To clear out a string that contained a password, use <code "
"class=\"code\">clear-string</code>:"
msgstr ""
"パスワードを含む文字列をクリアするには、<code class=\"code\">clear-string</"
"code>を使用します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
