"name\">clear-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-clear_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">clear-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-clear_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Modifying-Strings.html
msgid ""
"This makes <var class=\"var\">string</var> a unibyte string, clears its "
"contents to null characters, and removes all text properties.  It may also "
"change <var class=\"var\">string</var>&rsquo;s length."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<var class=\"var\">string</var> はユニバイト文字列となり、内容は"
"ヌル文字でクリアされ、すべてのテキストプロパティが削除されます。また、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> の長さが変更される場合もあります。"

