# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"<span>E.7.5 Using Canvas API With Modules<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Using-Canvas-API-With-Modules\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>E.7.5 モジュールでCanvas APIを使用する<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Using-Canvas-API-With-Modules\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"Emacs supports creating image objects called &ldquo;canvas&rdquo; which have "
"a pixel buffer associated with them.  These image objects can be accessed "
"and updated natively via dynamic modules.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Canvas-Images.html\">Canvas Images</a>, for what they are."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、ピクセルバッファが紐付けられた「キャンバス」と呼ばれる画像オブジェ"
"クトを作成できます。これらの画像オブジェクトには、動的モジュールを介してネイ"
"ティブにアクセスし、更新することが可能です。詳細については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Canvas-Images.html\">Canvas Images</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"The following functions allow you to operate on canvas image objects with "
"dynamic modules:"
msgstr ""
"以下の関数を使用すると、動的モジュールを持つキャンバス画像オブジェクトを操作"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"canvas_005fdata\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"canvas_005fdata\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">uint32_t</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">*canvas_data</strong> "
"<code class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <var class=\"var\">canvas</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-_002acanvas_005fdata\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">uint32_t</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">*canvas_data</strong> "
"<code class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <var class=\"var\">canvas</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-_002acanvas_005fdata\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"The function gives access to the pixel buffer of <var class=\"var\">canvas</"
"var>.  The pixel buffer is in row-major order with a size <code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">width</var>x<var class=\"var\">height</"
"var></code>.  The pixel format is ARGB32 on all platforms.  Return <code "
"class=\"code\">NULL</code> in case of error."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">canvas</var>のピクセルバッファへのアクセスを提"
"供します。ピクセルバッファは行優先順で、サイズは<code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">width</var>x<var class=\"var\">height</var></code>です。ピクセ"
"ルフォーマットは、すべてのプラットフォームでARGB32です。エラーが発生した場合"
"は<code class=\"code\">NULL</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"Note that the pixel buffer is only valid as long as the canvas object is "
"alive and its dimensions have not been changed.  If it has changed, Emacs "
"will create a new pixel buffer and automatically resize the canvas."
msgstr ""
"なお、ピクセルバッファは、キャンバスオブジェクトが生存しており、かつそのサイ"
"ズが変更されていない間のみ有効です。サイズが変更された場合、Emacsは新しいピク"
"セルバッファを作成し、キャンバスを自動的にリサイズします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"Once we update the canvas pixel buffer via dynamic modules, we also have to "
"call <code class=\"code\">canvas-refresh</code> for Emacs to redisplay the "
"canvas.  This can be done from the module via an Elisp funcall."
msgstr ""
"ダイナミックモジュール経由でキャンバスのピクセルバッファを更新した後は、Emacs"
"にキャンバスを再表示させるために <code class=\"code\">canvas-refresh</code> "
"を呼び出す必要があります。これは、モジュールから Elisp の funcall を用いて実"
"行できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/* Access the pixel buffer */\n"
"uint32_t *pixel = env-&gt;canvas_data (env, canvas);\n"
"/* Write to the pixel buffer */\n"
"...\n"
"/* Redraw the canvas */\n"
"env-&gt;funcall(env, env-&gt;intern(env, &quot;canvas-refresh&quot;), 2,\n"
"             (emacs_value[]){canvas, Qnil});\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">canvas-refresh</code> has an optional boolean "
"argument to reload the <code class=\"code\">:data</code> vector or string "
"from the canvas image specification.  When called from dynamic modules, the "
"argument should usually be <code class=\"code\">Qnil</code>."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">canvas-refresh</code> には、キャンバス画像の指定か"
"ら <code class=\"code\">:data</code> ベクトルまたは文字列を再読み込みするため"
"のオプションのブール型引数があります。動的モジュールから呼び出される場合、こ"
"の引数は通常 <code class=\"code\">Qnil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Canvas-API.html
msgid ""
"Thus, one can simply define a module function that takes as an argument a "
"canvas image object, following the specification as laid down in <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Canvas-Images.html\">Canvas Images</a>, and then use "
"the above code to manipulate the pixel buffer of the canvas and redraw it."
msgstr ""
"このように、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Canvas-Images.html\">Canvas Images</a> で"
"規定されている仕様に従い、キャンバスの画像オブジェクトを引数に取るモジュール"
"関数を単純に定義し、上記のコードを用いてキャンバスのピクセルバッファを操作し"
"て再描画すればよい。"

