# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function, which is available since Emacs 28, sets the function "
"finalizer associated with the module function represented by <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var> to <var class=\"var\">fin</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var> must refer to a module function, that is, an object "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">make_function</code>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">fin</var> can either be <code class=\"code\">NULL</code> to "
