#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span>E.7.4 Miscellaneous Convenience Functions for Modules<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Miscellaneous-Convenience-Functions-for-"
"Modules\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>E.7.4 モジュール向けの各種便利関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Miscellaneous-Convenience-Functions-for-Modules\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This subsection describes a few convenience functions provided by the module "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">API</abbr>.  Like the functions described in "
"previous subsections, all of them are actually function pointers, and need "
"to be called via the <code class=\"code\">emacs_env</code> pointer.  "
"Description of functions that were introduced after Emacs 25 calls out the "
"first version where they became available."
msgstr ""
"本サブセクションでは、モジュール <abbr class=\"acronym\">API</abbr> が提供す"
"るいくつかの便利な関数について説明します。前のサブセクションで説明した関数と"
"同様に、これらはすべて実際には関数ポインタであり、<code "
"class=\"code\">emacs_env</code> ポインタを介して呼び出す必要があります。"
"Emacs 25 以降に導入された関数については、利用可能になった最初のバージョンを明"
"記しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">bool</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">eq</strong> <code class=\"def-"
"code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, emacs_value <var "
"class=\"var\">a</var>, emacs_value <var class=\"var\">b</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-eq-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">bool</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">eq</strong> <code class=\"def-"
"code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, emacs_value <var "
"class=\"var\">a</var>, emacs_value <var class=\"var\">b</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-eq-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">true</code> if the Lisp objects "
"represented by <var class=\"var\">a</var> and <var class=\"var\">b</var> are "
"identical, <code class=\"code\">false</code> otherwise.  This is the same as "
"the Lisp function <code class=\"code\">eq</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Equality-Predicates.html\">Equality Predicates</a>), but avoids the "
"need to intern the objects represented by the arguments."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">a</var> と <var class=\"var\">b</var> が表す "
"Lisp オブジェクトが同一であれば <code class=\"code\">true</code> を、そうでな"
"ければ <code class=\"code\">false</code> を返します。これは Lisp 関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Equality-"
"Predicates.html\">等価述語</a> を参照）と同等ですが、引数が表すオブジェクトを"
"インターニングする必要がありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"There are no <abbr class=\"acronym\">API</abbr> functions for other equality "
"predicates, so you will need to use <code class=\"code\">intern</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code>, described below, to perform more "
"complex equality tests."
msgstr ""
"その他の等価判定子に対応する<abbr class=\"acronym\">API</abbr>関数は用意され"
"ていないため、より複雑な等価判定を行うには、後述する<code "
"class=\"code\">intern</code>および<code class=\"code\">funcall</code>を使用す"
"る必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">bool</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">is_not_nil</strong> <code "
"class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <var class=\"var\">arg</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-is_005fnot_005fnil\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">bool</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">is_not_nil</strong> <code "
"class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <var class=\"var\">arg</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-is_005fnot_005fnil\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function tests whether the Lisp object represented by <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>; it returns "
"<code class=\"code\">true</code> or <code class=\"code\">false</code> "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">arg</var> で表される Lisp オブジェクトが non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるかどうかを判定し、それに応じて <code "
"class=\"code\">true</code> または <code class=\"code\">false</code> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"Note that you could implement an equivalent test by using <code "
"class=\"code\">intern</code> to get an <code class=\"code\">emacs_value</"
"code> representing <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then use <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>, described above, to test for equality.  But using "
"this function is more convenient."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">intern</code> を用いて <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を表す <code class=\"code\">emacs_value</code> を取得し、前述の <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> を使って等価性を判定するという方法でも、同等のテスト"
"を実装できます。しかし、この関数を使用する方が便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">emacs_value</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">type_of</strong> <code "
"class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <code class=\"code\">arg</code>)</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-type_005fof\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">emacs_value</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">type_of</strong> <code "
"class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <code class=\"code\">arg</code>)</code><a class=\"copiable-"
