# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function returns an interned Emacs symbol whose name is <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>, which should be an <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> null-terminated string.  It creates a new symbol if one does not "
"already exist."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、名前が <var class=\"var\">name</var> である内部化された Emacs シ"
"ンボルを返します。この名前は <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> のヌル終端"
"文字列である必要があります。シンボルが存在しない場合は、新規に作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"Together with <code class=\"code\">funcall</code>, described below, this "
"function provides a means for invoking any Lisp-callable Emacs function, "
"provided that its name is a pure <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"string.  For example, here&rsquo;s how to intern a symbol whose name <code "
"class=\"code\">name_str</code> is non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>, "
"by calling the more powerful Emacs <code class=\"code\">intern</code> "
"function (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-Symbols.html\">Creating and "
"Interning Symbols</a>):"
msgstr ""
"後述する<code class=\"code\">funcall</code>と併せて、この関数は、名称が純粋な"
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字列である限り、Lispから呼び出し可能な"
"任意のEmacs関数を呼び出す手段を提供します。例えば、名称<code "
"class=\"code\">name_str</code>が非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>である"
"シンボルを、より強力なEmacsの<code class=\"code\">intern</code>関数を呼び出す"
"ことでインターニングする方法を以下に示します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Creating-Symbols.html\">シンボルの作成とインターニング</a>を参照）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"emacs_value fintern = env-&gt;intern (env, &quot;intern&quot;);\n"
"emacs_value sym_name =\n"
"  env-&gt;make_string (env, name_str, strlen (name_str));\n"
"emacs_value symbol = env-&gt;funcall (env, fintern, 1, &amp;sym_name);\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">emacs_value</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">funcall</strong> <code "
"class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <var class=\"var\">func</var>, ptrdiff_t <var "
"class=\"var\">nargs</var>, emacs_value *<var class=\"var\">args</var>)</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-funcall-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><code class=\"def-"
"type\">emacs_value</code> <strong class=\"def-name\">funcall</strong> <code "
"class=\"def-code-arguments\">(emacs_env *<var class=\"var\">env</var>, "
"emacs_value <var class=\"var\">func</var>, ptrdiff_t <var "
"class=\"var\">nargs</var>, emacs_value *<var class=\"var\">args</var>)</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-funcall-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function calls the specified <var class=\"var\">func</var> passing it "
"<var class=\"var\">nargs</var> arguments from the array pointed to by <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">func</var> can be "
"a function symbol (e.g., returned by <code class=\"code\">intern</code> "
"described above), a module function returned by <code "
"class=\"code\">make_function</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Module-"
"Functions.html\">Writing Module Functions</a>), a subroutine written in C, "
"etc.  If <var class=\"var\">nargs</var> is zero, <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var> can be a <code class=\"code\">NULL</code> pointer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された <var class=\"var\">func</var> を呼び出し、<var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> が指す配列から <var class=\"var\">nargs</var> 個の引"
"数を渡します。引数 <var class=\"var\">func</var> には、関数シンボル（例：前述"
"の <code class=\"code\">intern</code> によって返されるもの）、<code "
"class=\"code\">make_function</code> によって返されるモジュール関数（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Module-Functions.html\">モジュール関数の記述</a> を参"
"照）、C で記述されたサブルーチンなどが指定可能です。<var "
"class=\"var\">nargs</var> が 0 の場合、<var class=\"var\">args</var> は "
"<code class=\"code\">NULL</code> ポインタを指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"The function returns the value that <var class=\"var\">func</var> returned."
msgstr "この関数は、<var class=\"var\">func</var> が返した値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"If your module includes potentially long-running code, it is a good idea to "
"check from time to time in that code whether the user wants to quit, e.g., "
"by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting</a>).  The following function, which is "
"available since Emacs 26.1, is provided for that purpose."
msgstr ""
"モジュールに長時間実行される可能性のあるコードが含まれている場合は、そのコー"
"ド内で適宜、ユーザーが終了を希望しているか（例えば <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd> と入力するかなど）を確認するのがよいでしょう（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quitting.html\">終了</a> を参照）。そのために、Emacs 26.1 以降で利用可"
"能な以下の関数が用意されています。"

