# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Module-Misc.html
msgid ""
"This function processes pending input events.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs_process_input_quit</code> if the user wants to quit or "
"an error occurred while processing signals.  In that case, we recommend that "
"your module function aborts any on-going processing and returns as soon as "
"possible.  If the module code may continue running, <code "
"class=\"code\">process_input</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs_process_input_continue</code>.  The return value is "
"<code class=\"code\">emacs_process_input_continue</code> if and only if "
"there is no pending nonlocal exit in <code class=\"code\">env</code>.  If "
"the module continues after calling <code class=\"code\">process_input</"
"code>, global state such as variable values and buffer content may have been "
"modified in arbitrary ways."
