# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-and-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point forward across characters having syntax classes "
"mentioned in <var class=\"var\">syntaxes</var> (a string of syntax class "
"characters).  It stops when it encounters the end of the buffer, or position "
"<var class=\"var\">limit</var> (if specified), or a character it is not "
"supposed to skip."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">syntaxes</var>（構文クラス文字の文字列）で指定"
"された構文クラスを持つ文字をまたいで、ポインタを前方に移動させます。バッファ"
"の終端、位置<var class=\"var\">limit</var>（指定されている場合）、またはス"
"キップすべきでない文字に到達した時点で停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-and-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">syntaxes</var> starts with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;, then the function skips characters whose "
"syntax is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> in <var class=\"var\">syntaxes</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">syntaxes</var> が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo; で始まる場合、関数は構文が <var class=\"var\">syntaxes</var> に"
"<em class=\"emph\">含まれない</em>文字をスキップします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
