#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This section describes simple point-motion functions that operate based on "
"parsing expressions."
msgstr ""
"この節では、構文解析式に基づいて動作する単純な点・運動関数について説明しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scan-lists</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from count "
"depth</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-scan_002dlists\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scan-lists</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from count "
"depth</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-scan_002dlists\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function scans forward <var class=\"var\">count</var> balanced "
"parenthetical groupings from position <var class=\"var\">from</var>.  It "
"returns the position where the scan stops.  If <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> is negative, the scan moves backwards."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、位置 <var class=\"var\">from</var> から <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> 個のバランスの取れた括弧グループを前方にスキャンし"
"ます。スキャンが停止した位置を返します。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の"
"場合、スキャンは後方に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">depth</var> is nonzero, treat the starting position as "
"being <var class=\"var\">depth</var> parentheses deep.  The scanner moves "
"forward or backward through the buffer until the depth changes to zero <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> times.  Hence, a positive value for <var "
"class=\"var\">depth</var> has the effect of moving out <var "
"class=\"var\">depth</var> levels of parenthesis from the starting position, "
"while a negative <var class=\"var\">depth</var> has the effect of moving "
"deeper by <var class=\"var\">-depth</var> levels of parenthesis."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">depth</var> が 0 でない場合、開始位置は <var "
"class=\"var\">depth</var> 層分深いものとみなされます。スキャナは、深さが 0 に"
"なるまでバッファ内を前後に移動します <var class=\"var\">count</var> 回。した"
"がって、<var class=\"var\">depth</var> に正の値を指定すると開始位置から <var "
"class=\"var\">depth</var> 層分外側へ移動し、負の <var class=\"var\">depth</"
"var> を指定すると <var class=\"var\">-depth</var> 層分深く移動することになり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"Scanning ignores comments if <code class=\"code\">parse-sexp-ignore-"
"comments</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">parse-sexp-ignore-comments</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、スキャンはコメントを無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If the scan reaches the beginning or end of the accessible part of the "
"buffer before it has scanned over <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"parenthetical groupings, the return value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"if the depth at that point is zero; if the depth is non-zero, a <code "
"class=\"code\">scan-error</code> error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"スキャンが<var class=\"var\">count</var>個の括弧グループを走査する前にバッ"
"ファのアクセス可能な領域の先頭または末尾に達した場合、その時点での深度が0であ"
"れば戻り値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となり、深度が0以外であれば<code "
"class=\"code\">scan-error</code>エラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scan-sexps</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from count</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-scan_002dsexps\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scan-sexps</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from count</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-scan_002dsexps\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function scans forward <var class=\"var\">count</var> sexps from "
"position <var class=\"var\">from</var>.  It returns the position where the "
"scan stops.  If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative, the scan moves "
"backwards."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、位置 <var class=\"var\">from</var> から前方に <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> 個の sexp をスキャンします。スキャンが停止した位置"
"を返します。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の場合、スキャンは後方に移動し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If the scan reaches the beginning or end of (the accessible part of) the "
"buffer while in the middle of a parenthetical grouping, an error is "
"signaled.  If it reaches the beginning or end between groupings but before "
"count is used up, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is returned."
msgstr ""
"括弧によるグループ化の途中で、スキャンがバッファ（アクセス可能な部分）の先頭"
"または末尾に達した場合、エラーが通知されます。グループ化の間で先頭または末尾"
"に達したものの、カウントを使い切る前であれば、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-comment</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-forward_002dcomment\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-comment</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-forward_002dcomment\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point forward across <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"complete comments (that is, including the starting delimiter and the "
"terminating delimiter if any), plus any whitespace encountered on the way.  "
"It moves backward if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative.  If it "
"encounters anything other than a comment or whitespace, it stops, leaving "
"point at the place where it stopped.  This includes (for instance) finding "
"the end of a comment when moving forward and expecting the beginning of "
"one.  The function also stops immediately after moving over the specified "
"number of complete comments.  If <var class=\"var\">count</var> comments are "
"found as expected, with nothing except whitespace between them, it returns "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>; otherwise it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">count</var> 個の完全なコメント（つまり、開始デ"
"リミタと、あれば終了デリミタを含む）と、その間に出現する任意の空白文字をまた"
"いでポイントを前方に移動させます。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の値の場"
"合は後方に移動します。コメントや空白文字以外のものを検出した場合はそこで停止"
"し、停止した位置にポイントを残します。これには（例えば）、前方に移動してコメ"
"ントの開始を期待している際に、コメントの末尾を検出する場合などが含まれます。"
"また、この関数は指定された数の完全なコメントをまたいだ直後にも停止します。期"
"待通りに <var class=\"var\">count</var> 個のコメントが検出され、その間に空白"
"文字以外のものが何も含まれていない場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そ"
"うでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function cannot tell whether the comments it traverses are embedded "
"within a string.  If they look like comments, it treats them as comments."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、走査するコメントが文字列内に埋め込まれているかどうかを判別できま"
"せん。コメントのように見えれば、コメントとして扱います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Motion-via-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"To move forward over all comments and whitespace following point, use <code "
"class=\"code\">(forward-comment (buffer-size))</code>.  <code "
"class=\"code\">(buffer-size)</code> is a good argument to use, because the "
"number of comments in the buffer cannot exceed that many."
msgstr ""
"ポイント以降のすべてのコメントと空白をスキップするには、<code "
"class=\"code\">(forward-comment (buffer-size))</code> を使用します。バッファ"
"内のコメント数がそれを超えることはないため、<code class=\"code\">(buffer-"
"size)</code> が適切な引数となります。"

