# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The parameters described below provide support for resizing a frame by "
"dragging its internal borders with the mouse.  They also allow moving a "
"frame with the mouse by dragging the header or tab line of its topmost or "
"the mode line of its bottommost window."
msgstr ""
"以下に説明するパラメータを使用すると、マウスでフレームの内部境界線をドラッグ"
"してサイズを変更できます。また、最上層ウィンドウのヘッダーやタブ行、あるいは"
"最下層ウィンドウのモード行をマウスでドラッグすることで、フレームを移動させる"
"ことも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"These parameters are mostly useful for child frames (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Child-Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>) that come without window "
"manager decorations.  If necessary, they can be used for undecorated top-"
"level frames as well.  On text terminals these parameters affect child "
"frames only."
msgstr ""
"これらのパラメータは、主にウィンドウマネージャの装飾がない子フレーム（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a>を参照）に有用です。"
"必要に応じて、装飾のないトップレベルフレームにも使用できます。テキスト端末で"
"は、これらのパラメータは子フレームにのみ影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dinternal_002dborder_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-internal-border</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dinternal_002dborder_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dinternal_002dborder_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-internal-border</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dinternal_002dborder_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame can be resized by dragging "
"its internal borders, if present, with the mouse.  On text terminals, the "
"decoration of a child frame must be dragged instead."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、内部ボーダー（存在する場合）をマ"
"ウスでドラッグすることで、フレームのサイズを変更できます。テキスト端末では、"
"代わりに子フレームの装飾部分をドラッグする必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dwith_002dheader_002dline_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-with-header-line</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dwith_002dheader_002dline_002c-a-frame-"
"parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dwith_002dheader_002dline_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-with-header-line</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dwith_002dheader_002dline_002c-a-frame-"
"parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame can be moved with the "
"mouse by dragging the header line of its topmost window."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、最前面ウィンドウのヘッダー行をマ"
"ウスでドラッグすることで、フレームを移動できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dwith_002dtab_002dline_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-with-tab-line</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dwith_002dtab_002dline_002c-a-frame-"
"parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
