"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-with-tab-line</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dwith_002dtab_002dline_002c-a-frame-"
"parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame can be moved with the "
"mouse by dragging the tab line of its topmost window."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、最前面ウィンドウのタブバーをド"
"ラッグすることで、マウスでフレームを移動できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dwith_002dmode_002dline_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-with-mode-line</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dwith_002dmode_002dline_002c-a-frame-"
"parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-drag_002dwith_002dmode_002dline_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">drag-with-mode-line</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-drag_002dwith_002dmode_002dline_002c-a-frame-"
"parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the frame can be moved with the "
"mouse by dragging the mode line of its bottommost window.  Note that such a "
"frame is not allowed to have its own minibuffer window."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、最下段ウィンドウのモードラインを"
"マウスでドラッグすることで、フレームを移動できます。なお、このようなフレーム"
"に独自のミニバッファウィンドウを設けることはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-snap_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">snap-width</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"snap_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-snap_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">snap-width</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"snap_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"A frame that is moved with the mouse will &ldquo;snap&rdquo; at the "
"border(s) of the display or its parent frame whenever it is dragged as near "
"to such an edge as the number of pixels specified by this parameter."
msgstr ""
"マウスで移動するフレームは、このパラメータで指定されたピクセル数分だけ端に近"
"づくようにドラッグされるたびに、ディスプレイまたはその親フレームの境界で「ス"
"ナップ」します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-top_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">top-visible</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"top_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-top_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">top-visible</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"top_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If this parameter is a number, the top edge of the frame never appears above "
"the top edge of its display or parent frame.  Moreover, as many pixels of "
"the frame as specified by that number will remain visible when the frame is "
"moved against any of the remaining edges of its display or parent frame.  "
"Setting this parameter is useful to guard against dragging a child frame "
"with a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">drag-with-"
"header-line</code> parameter completely out of the area of its parent frame."
msgstr ""
"このパラメータが数値の場合、フレームの上端がディスプレイまたは親フレームの上"
"端より上に現れることはありません。さらに、フレームをディスプレイまたは親フ"
"レームの残りの辺のいずれかに沿って移動させた際でも、その数値で指定された数だ"
"けのフレームピクセルが表示されたままになります。このパラメータを設定すること"
"で、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">drag-with-header-"
"line</code> 以外のパラメータを持つ子フレームを、親フレームの領域外まで完全に"
"ドラッグしてしまう事態を防ぐのに役立ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-bottom_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">bottom-visible</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bottom_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-bottom_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">bottom-visible</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"bottom_002dvisible_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Dragging-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If this parameter is a number, the bottom edge of the frame never appears "
"below the bottom edge of its display or parent frame.  Moreover, as many "
"pixels of the frame as specified by that number will remain visible when the "
"frame is moved against any of the remaining edges of its display or parent "
"frame.  Setting this parameter is useful to guard against dragging a child "
"frame with a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">drag-"
"with-mode-line</code> parameter completely out of the area of its parent "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"このパラメータが数値の場合、フレームの下端がディスプレイまたは親フレームの下"
"端より下に表示されることはありません。さらに、フレームをディスプレイまたは親"
"フレームの残りの辺のいずれかに沿って移動させた際でも、その数値で指定された分"
"だけのフレームピクセルが表示されたままになります。このパラメータを設定するこ"
"とで、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">drag-with-mode-"
"line</code> 以外のパラメータを持つ子フレームを、親フレームの領域外まで完全に"
"ドラッグしてしまう事態を防ぐのに役立ちます。"

