# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"The following option enables automatically selecting the window under the "
"mouse pointer.  This accomplishes a policy similar to that of window "
"managers that give focus to a frame (and thus trigger its subsequent "
"selection) whenever the mouse pointer enters its window-system window (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Focus-Events.html\">Focus Events</a>)."
msgstr ""
"以下のオプションを有効にすると、マウスポインタの下にあるウィンドウを自動的に"
"選択できるようになります。これにより、マウスポインタがウィンドウシステムの"
"ウィンドウに入った際に、フレームにフォーカスを与え（ひいてはその後の選択をト"
"リガーする）という、ウィンドウマネージャと同様の動作が実現されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">入力フォーカス</a>、<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Focus-Events.html\">フォーカスイベント</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mouse-autoselect-window</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-mouse_002dautoselect_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">mouse-autoselect-window</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-mouse_002dautoselect_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs will try to "
"automatically select the window under the mouse pointer.  The following "
"values are meaningful:"
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs はマウスポインタ"
"の下にあるウィンドウを自動的に選択しようとします。以下の値が有効です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid "A positive number"
msgstr "正の数"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"This specifies a delay in seconds after which auto-selection triggers.  The "
"window under the mouse pointer is selected after the mouse has remained in "
"it for the entire duration of the delay."
msgstr ""
"これは、自動選択が発動するまでの遅延時間を秒単位で指定します。遅延時間いっぱ"
"いマウスがウィンドウ内に留まった後、マウスポインタの下にあるウィンドウが選択"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid "A negative number"
msgstr "負の数"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"A negative number has a similar effect as a positive number, but selects the "
"window under the mouse pointer only after the mouse pointer has remained in "
"it for the entire duration of the absolute value of that number and in "
"addition has stopped moving."
msgstr ""
"負の数は正の数と同様の動作をしますが、マウスポインタがその数の絶対値に相当す"
"る時間ずっとウィンドウ内に留まり、さらに移動が止まった後になって初めて、マウ"
"スポインタの下にあるウィンドウを選択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid "Other value"
msgstr "その他の価値"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"Any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value means to select a window "
"instantaneously as soon as the mouse pointer enters it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値は、マウスポインタがウィンドウに入っ"
"た瞬間にそのウィンドウを選択することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"In either case, the mouse pointer must enter the text area of a window in "
"order to trigger its selection.  Dragging the scroll bar slider or the mode "
"line of a window conceptually should not cause its auto-selection."
msgstr ""
"いずれの場合も、選択をトリガーするには、マウスポインタがウィンドウのテキスト"
"領域に入る必要があります。ウィンドウのスクロールバーのスライダーやモードライ"
"ンをドラッグしても、概念上は自動選択は起こらないはずです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"Mouse auto-selection selects the minibuffer window only if it is active, and "
"never deselects the active minibuffer window."
msgstr ""
"マウスによる自動選択は、ミニバッファウィンドウがアクティブな場合にのみそれを"
"選択し、アクティブなミニバッファウィンドウの選択を解除することはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mouse-Window-Auto_002dselection.html
msgid ""
"Mouse auto-selection can be used to emulate a focus follows mouse policy for "
"child frames (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">Child "
"Frames</a>) which usually are not tracked by the window manager.  This "
"requires setting the value of <code class=\"code\">focus-follows-mouse</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>) to "
"a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value.  If the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">focus-follows-mouse</code> is <code class=\"code\">auto-"
"raise</code>, entering a child frame with the mouse will raise it "
"automatically above all other child frames of that frame&rsquo;s parent "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"マウスの自動選択を使用すると、通常はウィンドウマネージャによって追跡されない"
"子フレームに対して、「フォーカスはマウスに従う」というポリシーをエミュレート"
"できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a>を参"
"照）。これには、<code class=\"code\">focus-follows-mouse</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">入力フォーカス</a>を参照）の値を"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値に設定する必要があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">focus-follows-mouse</code>の値が<code class=\"code\">auto-"
"raise</code>である場合、マウスで子フレームに入ると、そのフレームの親フレーム"
"にある他のすべての子フレームよりも自動的に上位に配置されます。"

