msgid ""
"This function matches <var class=\"var\">source</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">query</var> and returns the ranges of captured nodes.  The "
"return value is a list of cons cells of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">end</var>)</code>, "
