"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-multiple-yes_002dor_002dno-"
"questions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"When you have a series of similar questions to ask, such as &ldquo;Do you "
"want to save this buffer?&rdquo; for each buffer in turn, you should use "
"<code class=\"code\">map-y-or-n-p</code> to ask the collection of questions, "
"rather than asking each question individually.  This gives the user certain "
"convenient facilities such as the ability to answer the whole series at once."
msgstr ""
"「このバッファを保存しますか？」といった類似の質問を、各バッファに対して順次"
"行う場合は、個々の質問を一つずつ投げるのではなく、<code class=\"code\">map-y-"
"or-n-p</code> を使用して一連の質問をまとめて行うべきです。これにより、ユー"
"ザーは一連の質問に一度で回答できるなど、便利な機能を利用できます。"

