#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"This function asks the user a series of questions, reading a single-"
"character answer in the minibuffer for each one.  However, if <code "
"class=\"code\">y-or-n-p-use-read-key</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">Key Sequence "
