"み取ります。ただし、<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p-use-read-key</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力</a> を参照）、エコー領域"
"からキーシーケンスを読み取ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"The value of <var class=\"var\">list</var> specifies the objects to ask "
"questions about.  It should be either a list of objects or a generator "
"function.  If it is a function, it will be called with no arguments, and "
"should return either the next object to ask about, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, meaning to stop asking questions."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">list</var> の値で、質問対象のオブジェクトを指定します。オ"
"ブジェクトのリストか、ジェネレータ関数のいずれかである必要があります。関数の"
"場合は引数なしで呼び出され、次に質問するオブジェクトか、質問を停止することを"
"意味する <code class=\"code\">nil</code> のいずれかを返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">prompter</var> specifies how to ask each "
"question.  If <var class=\"var\">prompter</var> is a string, the question "
"text is computed like this:"
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">prompter</var> は、各質問の仕方を指定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">prompter</var> が文字列の場合、質問文は次のように計算されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(format <var class=\"var\">prompter</var> <var class=\"var\">object</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"where <var class=\"var\">object</var> is the next object to ask about (as "
"obtained from <var class=\"var\">list</var>).  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">Formatting Strings</a>, for more "
"information about <code class=\"code\">format</code>."
msgstr ""
"ここで <var class=\"var\">object</var> は、次に問い合わせる対象（<var "
"class=\"var\">list</var> から得られたもの）です。<code "
"class=\"code\">format</code> の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">文字列の書式指定</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">prompter</var> is not a string, it should be a "
"function of one argument (the object to ask about) and should return the "
"question text for that object.  If the value <var class=\"var\">prompter</"
"var> returns is a string, that is the question to ask the user.  The "
"function can also return <code class=\"code\">t</code>, meaning to act on "
"this object without asking the user, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"which means to silently ignore this object."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">prompter</var> が文字列でない場合は、1つの引数（問い合わせ"
"対象のオブジェクト）を受け取り、そのオブジェクトに対する質問文を返す関数であ"
"る必要があります。<var class=\"var\">prompter</var> が返す値が文字列である場"
"合、それがユーザーに問いかける質問となります。また、この関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>（ユーザーに問い合わせずにこのオブジェクトを処理する）"
"または <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（このオブジェクトを黙って無視する）を"
"返すこともできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">actor</var> says how to act on the objects "
"for which the user answers yes.  It should be a function of one argument, "
"and will be called with each object from <var class=\"var\">list</var> for "
"which the user answers yes."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">actor</var> は、ユーザーが「はい」と答えたオブジェク"
"トに対してどのように処理を行うかを指定します。これは単一引数の関数である必要"
"があり、ユーザーが「はい」と答えた <var class=\"var\">list</var> 以降の各オブ"
"ジェクトに対して呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"If the argument <var class=\"var\">help</var> is given, it should be a list "
"of this form:"
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">help</var> が指定された場合、以下の形式のリストである"
"必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">singular</var> <var class=\"var\">plural</var> <var class=\"var\">action</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"where <var class=\"var\">singular</var> is a string containing a singular "
"noun that describes a single object to be acted on, <var "
"class=\"var\">plural</var> is the corresponding plural noun, and <var "
"class=\"var\">action</var> is a transitive verb describing what <var "
"class=\"var\">actor</var> does with the objects."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">singular</var>は操作対象となる単一の対象を表す単数"
"名詞を含む文字列、<var class=\"var\">plural</var>はそれに対応する複数名詞、"
"<var class=\"var\">action</var>は<var class=\"var\">actor</var>が対象に対して"
"何を行うかを表す他動詞である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"If you don&rsquo;t specify <var class=\"var\">help</var>, it defaults to the "
"list <code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;object&quot;&nbsp;&quot;objects&quot;&nbsp;&quot;act&nbsp;on&quot;)</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">help</var>を指定しない場合は、デフォルトでリスト<code "
"class=\"code\">(&quot;object&quot;&nbsp;&quot;objects&quot;&nbsp;&quot;act&nbsp;on&quot;)</"
"code>が使用されます。"

