"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002danswer_002dshort\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002danswer_002dshort\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"This function prompts the user with text in <var class=\"var\">question</"
"var>, which should end in the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">SPC</samp>&rsquo; "
"character.  The function includes in the prompt the possible responses in "
"<var class=\"var\">answers</var> by appending them to the end of <var "
"class=\"var\">question</var>.  The possible responses are provided in <var "
"class=\"var\">answers</var> as an alist whose elements are of the following "
"form:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">question</var> にテキストを含むプロンプトを"
"ユーザーに提示します。このテキストは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">SPC</"
"samp>&rsquo; という文字で終わる必要があります。また、<var "
"class=\"var\">question</var> の末尾に追記する形で、考えられる応答を <var "
"class=\"var\">answers</var> としてプロンプトに含めます。考えられる応答は "
"<var class=\"var\">answers</var> にアリストとして提供され、その要素は以下の形"
"式となります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">long-answer</var> <var class=\"var\">short-answer</var> <var class=\"var\">help-message</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"where <var class=\"var\">long-answer</var> is the complete text of the user "
"response, a string; <var class=\"var\">short-answer</var> is a short form of "
"the same response, a single character or a function key; and <var "
"class=\"var\">help-message</var> is the text that describes the meaning of "
"the answer.  If the variable <code class=\"code\">read-answer-short</code> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the prompt will show the short "
"variants of the possible answers and the user is expected to type the single "
"characters/keys shown in the prompt; otherwise the prompt will show the long "
"variants of the answers, and the user is expected to type the full text of "
"one of the answers and end by pressing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>.  If "
"<code class=\"code\">use-dialog-box</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, and this function was invoked by mouse events, the question and the "
"answers will be displayed in a GUI dialog box."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">long-answer</var>はユーザー応答の全文（文字列）、"
"<var class=\"var\">short-answer</var>は同一応答の短縮形式（単一文字またはファ"
"ンクションキー）、<var class=\"var\">help-message</var>は回答の意味を説明する"
"テキストです。変数<code class=\"code\">read-answer-short</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、プロンプトには考えられる回答の短縮形式が"
"表示され、ユーザーはプロンプトに表示された単一の文字/キーを入力することになり"
"ます。それ以外の場合、プロンプトには回答の詳細形式が表示され、ユーザーは回答"
"のいずれかの全文を入力し、最後に<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>を押して終了する"
"ことになります。<code class=\"code\">use-dialog-box</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外であり、かつこの関数がマウスイベントによって呼び"
"出された場合、質問と回答はGUIダイアログボックスに表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid ""
"The function returns the text of the <var class=\"var\">long-answer</var> "
"selected by the user, regardless of whether long or short answers were shown "
"in the prompt and typed by the user."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プロンプトに長文または短文の回答が表示され、ユーザーがそれを入力"
"したかどうかにかかわらず、ユーザーが選択した <var class=\"var\">long-answer</"
"var> のテキストを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
msgid "Here is an example of using this function:"
msgstr "この関数の使用例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Queries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((read-answer-short t))\n"
"  (read-answer &quot;Foo &quot;\n"
"     '((&quot;yes&quot;  ?y &quot;perform the action&quot;)\n"
"       (&quot;no&quot;   ?n &quot;skip to the next&quot;)\n"
"       (&quot;all&quot;  ?! &quot;perform for the rest without more questions&quot;)\n"
"       (&quot;help&quot; ?h &quot;show help&quot;)\n"
