# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"Emacs represents each terminal as a <em class=\"dfn\">terminal object</em> "
"data type (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Terminal-Type.html\">Terminal Type</"
"a>).  On GNU and Unix systems, Emacs can use multiple terminals "
"simultaneously in each session.  On other systems, it can only use a single "
"terminal.  Each terminal object has the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、各端末を<em class=\"dfn\">端末オブジェクト</em>データ型として表現"
"します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Terminal-Type.html\">端末タイプ</a>を参"
"照）。GNUおよびUnixシステムでは、Emacsは各セッションで複数の端末を同時に使用"
"できます。その他のシステムでは、単一の端末しか使用できません。各端末オブジェ"
"クトは、以下の属性を持ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"The name of the device used by the terminal (e.g., &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">:0.0</samp>&rsquo; or <samp class=\"file\">/dev/tty</samp>)."
msgstr ""
"端末で使用されるデバイスの名称（例：&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:0.0</"
"samp>&rsquo; または <samp class=\"file\">/dev/tty</samp>）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"The terminal and keyboard coding systems used on the terminal.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Terminal-I_002fO-Encoding.html\">Terminal I/O "
"Encoding</a>."
msgstr ""
"端末で使用される端末およびキーボードの符号化方式。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Terminal-I_002fO-Encoding.html\">端末入出力符号化</a>を参照。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"The kind of display associated with the terminal.  This is the symbol "
"returned by the function <code class=\"code\">terminal-live-p</code> (i.e., "
"<code class=\"code\">x</code>, <code class=\"code\">t</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">w32</code>, <code class=\"code\">ns</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">pc</code>, <code class=\"code\">haiku</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">pgtk</code>, or <code class=\"code\">android</code>).  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a>."
msgstr ""
"ターミナルに関連する種類の表示。これは、関数 <code class=\"code\">terminal-"
"live-p</code>（すなわち <code class=\"code\">x</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>、<code class=\"code\">w32</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">ns</code>、<code class=\"code\">pc</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">haiku</code>、<code class=\"code\">pgtk</code>、または <code "
"class=\"code\">android</code>）によって返されるシンボルです。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"A list of terminal parameters.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Terminal-"
"Parameters.html\">Terminal Parameters</a>."
msgstr ""
"ターミナルパラメータの一覧。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Terminal-"
"Parameters.html\">ターミナルパラメータ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"There is no primitive for creating terminal objects.  Emacs creates them as "
"needed, such as when you call <code class=\"code\">make-frame-on-display</"
"code> (described below)."
msgstr ""
"端末オブジェクトを生成するためのプリミティブはありません。Emacs は、<code "
"class=\"code\">make-frame-on-display</code>（後述）を呼び出した際など、必要に"
"応じてこれらを生成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">terminal-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"terminal</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-terminal_002dname\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">terminal-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"terminal</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-terminal_002dname\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the file name of the device used by <var "
"class=\"var\">terminal</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">terminal</var> is "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected "
"frame&rsquo;s terminal.  <var class=\"var\">terminal</var> can also be a "
"frame, meaning that frame&rsquo;s terminal."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">terminal</var> で使用されるデバイスのファイル"
"名を返します。<var class=\"var\">terminal</var> が省略された場合、または "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、選択されたフレームの端末"
"がデフォルトとなります。<var class=\"var\">terminal</var> にもフレームを指定"
"でき、その場合はそのフレームの端末を指します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">terminal-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"terminal_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">terminal-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"terminal_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid "This function returns a list of all live terminal objects."
msgstr "この関数は、すべてのライブターミナルオブジェクトの一覧を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-device-terminal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">device</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get_002ddevice_002dterminal\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-device-terminal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">device</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get_002ddevice_002dterminal\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a terminal whose device name is given by <var "
"class=\"var\">device</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">device</var> is a string, "
"it can be either the file name of a terminal device, or the name of an X "
"display of the form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">host</"
"var>:<var class=\"var\">server</var>.<var class=\"var\">screen</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;.  If <var class=\"var\">device</var> is a frame, this function "
"returns that frame&rsquo;s terminal; <code class=\"code\">nil</code> means "
"the selected frame.  Finally, if <var class=\"var\">device</var> is a "
"terminal object that represents a live terminal, that terminal is returned.  "
"The function signals an error if its argument is none of the above."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、デバイス名が <var class=\"var\">device</var> で指定されるターミナ"
"ルを返します。<var class=\"var\">device</var> が文字列の場合、それはターミナ"
"ルデバイスのファイル名、または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var "
"class=\"var\">host</var>:<var class=\"var\">server</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">screen</var></samp>&rsquo; という形式の X ディスプレイ名のいず"
"れかとなります。<var class=\"var\">device</var> がフレームの場合、この関数は"
"そのフレームのターミナルを返します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は選択中"
"のフレームを意味します。最後に、<var class=\"var\">device</var> がライブター"
"ミナルを表すターミナルオブジェクトである場合、そのターミナルが返されます。引"
"数が上記のいずれにも該当しない場合、この関数はエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-terminal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional terminal force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dterminal\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-terminal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional terminal force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dterminal\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"This function deletes all frames on <var class=\"var\">terminal</var> and "
"frees the resources used by it.  It runs the abnormal hook <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-terminal-functions</code>, passing <var "
"class=\"var\">terminal</var> as the argument to each function."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">terminal</var> 上のすべてのフレームを削除し、そ"
"れらが使用していたリソースを解放します。また、異常フック <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-terminal-functions</code> を実行し、各関数に <var "
"class=\"var\">terminal</var> を引数として渡します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">terminal</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it defaults to the selected frame&rsquo;s terminal.  <var "
"class=\"var\">terminal</var> can also be a frame, meaning that frame&rsquo;s "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">terminal</var> が省略された場合や <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、選択されたフレームの端子がデ"
"フォルトとなります。<var class=\"var\">terminal</var> もフレームを指定でき、"
"その場合はそのフレームの端子を意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"Normally, this function signals an error if you attempt to delete the sole "
"active terminal, but if <var class=\"var\">force</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, you are allowed to do so.  Emacs automatically "
"calls this function when the last frame on a terminal is deleted (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-Frames.html\">Deleting Frames</a>)."
msgstr ""
"通常、この関数は、唯一アクティブな端末を削除しようとした場合にエラーを通知し"
"ますが、<var class=\"var\">force</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外であれば、削除が許可されます。Emacs は、端末上の最後のフレームが削除された"
"際に、自動的にこの関数を呼び出します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-"
"Frames.html\">フレームの削除</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-terminal-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dterminal_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">delete-terminal-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-delete_002dterminal_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"An abnormal hook run by <code class=\"code\">delete-terminal</code>.  Each "
"function receives one argument, the <var class=\"var\">terminal</var> "
"argument passed to <code class=\"code\">delete-terminal</code>.  Due to "
"technical details, the functions may be called either just before the "
"terminal is deleted, or just afterwards."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">delete-terminal</code> による異常なフック実行。各関数に"
"は1つの引数が渡され、<var class=\"var\">terminal</var> 引数が <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-terminal</code> に渡される。技術的な詳細により、関数は"
"ターミナルが削除される直前、あるいは削除直後に呼び出される可能性がある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-terminal_002dlocal-variables\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-terminal_002dlocal-variables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"A few Lisp variables are <em class=\"dfn\">terminal-local</em>; that is, "
"they have a separate binding for each terminal.  The binding in effect at "
"any time is the one for the terminal that the currently selected frame "
"belongs to.  These variables include <code class=\"code\">default-minibuffer-"
"frame</code>, <code class=\"code\">defining-kbd-macro</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">last-kbd-macro</code>, and <code class=\"code\">system-key-"
"alist</code>.  They are always terminal-local, and can never be buffer-local "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer_002dLocal-Variables.html\">Buffer-"
"Local Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"一部のLisp変数は<em class=\"dfn\">ターミナルローカル</em>です。つまり、各ター"
"ミナルに対して個別の束縛を持っています。ある時点で有効な束縛は、現在選択され"
"ているフレームが属するターミナルのものです。これらの変数には、<code "
"class=\"code\">default-minibuffer-frame</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">defining-kbd-macro</code>、<code class=\"code\">last-kbd-"
"macro</code>、<code class=\"code\">system-key-alist</code>が含まれます。これ"
"らは常にターミナルローカルであり、バッファローカルになることはありません（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer_002dLocal-Variables.html\">バッファローカル変数"
"</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Multiple-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"On GNU and Unix systems, each X display is a separate graphical terminal.  "
"When Emacs is started from within the X window system, it uses the X display "
"specified by the <code class=\"env\">DISPLAY</code> environment variable, or "
"by the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--display</samp>&rsquo; option (see <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Initial-Options.html#Initial-Options\">Initial Options</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>).  Emacs can connect to "
"other X displays via the command <code class=\"code\">make-frame-on-display</"
"code>.  Each X display has its own selected frame and its own minibuffer "
"windows; however, only one of those frames is <em class=\"emph\">the</em> "
"selected frame at any given moment (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-"
"Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>).  Emacs can even connect to other text "
"terminals, by interacting with the <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</"
"code> program.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Emacs-Server.html#Emacs-Server\">Emacs "
"Server</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"GNUおよびUnixシステムでは、各Xディスプレイは独立したグラフィカル端末となりま"
"す。Xウィンドウシステム内からEmacsを起動する場合、<code "
"class=\"env\">DISPLAY</code>環境変数または&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--"
"display</samp>&rsquo;オプションで指定されたXディスプレイが使用されます"
"（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Initial-"
"Options.html#Initial-Options\">Initial Options</a>を参照）。Emacsは<code "
"class=\"code\">make-frame-on-display</code>コマンドを介して他のXディスプレイ"
"に接続できます。各Xディスプレイには独自の選択フレームと独自のミニバッファウィ"
"ンドウがありますが、ある時点において<em class=\"emph\">唯一の</em>選択フレー"
"ムとなるのはそれらのうちの1つだけです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-"
"Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>を参照）。Emacsは<code "
"class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>プログラムを操作することで、他のテキスト"
"端末に接続することさえ可能です。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Emacs-Server.html#Emacs-Server\">Emacs Server</a>を参"
"照してください。"

