"<span>2.5.10 Mutex Type<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Mutex-Type-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutex-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">mutex</em> is an exclusive lock that threads can own and "
"disown, in order to synchronize between them.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mutexes.html\">Mutexes</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ミューテックス</em>とは、スレッド間で同期を行うために、ス"
"レッドが取得および解放できる排他ロックのことです。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mutexes.html\">ミューテックス</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutex-Type.html
msgid ""
"Mutex objects have no read syntax.  They print in hash notation, giving the "
"name of the mutex (if it has been given a name) or its address in core:"
msgstr ""
"Mutexオブジェクトには読み取り用の構文がありません。ハッシュ表記で出力され、"
"ミューテックスの名前（名前が付与されている場合）、またはcoreにおけるアドレス"
"が表示されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutex-Type.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-mutex &quot;my-mutex&quot;)\n"
"    &rArr; #&lt;mutex my-mutex&gt;\n"
"(make-mutex)\n"
"    &rArr; #&lt;mutex 01c7e4e0&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

