# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"<span>40.2 Mutexes<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Mutexes-1\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>40.2 ミューテックス<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Mutexes-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">mutex</em> is an exclusive lock.  At any moment, zero or "
"one threads may own a mutex.  If a thread attempts to acquire a mutex, and "
"the mutex is already owned by some other thread, then the acquiring thread "
"will block until the mutex becomes available."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ミューテックス</em>とは、排他ロックのことです。任意の時点"
"で、0個または1個のスレッドがミューテックスを保持できます。あるスレッドが"
"ミューテックスの取得を試みた際、そのミューテックスが既に別のスレッドによって"
"保持されている場合、取得を試みるスレッドはミューテックスが利用可能になるまで"
"ブロックされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"Emacs Lisp mutexes are of a type called <em class=\"dfn\">recursive</em>, "
"which means that a thread can re-acquire a mutex it owns any number of "
"times.  A mutex keeps a count of how many times it has been acquired, and "
"each acquisition of a mutex must be paired with a release.  The last release "
"by a thread of a mutex reverts it to the unowned state, potentially allowing "
"another thread to acquire the mutex."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispのミューテックスは<em class=\"dfn\">再帰的</em>と呼ばれるタイプであ"
"り、これはスレッドが自身が所有するミューテックスを何度でも再取得できることを"
"意味します。ミューテックスは取得回数をカウントしており、ミューテックスの取得"
"には必ず解放が伴わなければなりません。スレッドによる最後の解放によってミュー"
"テックスは未所有状態に戻り、これにより別のスレッドがミューテックスを取得でき"
"るようになる可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mutexp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mutexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mutexp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-mutexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> represents an Emacs mutex, <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> が Emacs のミューテックスを表す場"
"合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-mutex</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dmutex\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-mutex</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"name</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dmutex\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
"Create a new mutex and return it.  If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is "
"specified, it is a name given to the mutex.  It must be a string.  The name "
"is for debugging purposes only; it has no meaning to Emacs."
msgstr ""
"新しいミューテックスを作成して返します。<var class=\"var\">name</var> が指定"
"された場合、それはミューテックスに付けられた名前です。文字列である必要があり"
"ます。この名前はデバッグ目的のみであり、Emacs にとっては意味を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Mutexes.html
msgid ""
