"name\">narrow-to-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-narrow_002dto_002dregion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the accessible portion of the current buffer to start at "
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> and end at <var class=\"var\">end</var>.  "
"Both arguments should be character positions."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファのアクセス可能な範囲を、<var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> から始まり <var class=\"var\">end</var> で終わるように設定します。両方の"
"引数は文字位置である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"In an interactive call, <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> are set to the bounds of the current region (point "
"and the mark, with the smallest first)."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブコールでは、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> に現在の領域の境界（点とマークのうち、小さい方を先"
"に）が設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"However, when the narrowing has been set by <code class=\"code\">with-"
"restriction</code> with a label argument (see below), <code "
"class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</code> can be used only within the limits of "
"that narrowing.  If <var class=\"var\">start</var> or <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> are outside these limits, the corresponding limit "
"set by <code class=\"code\">with-restriction</code> is used instead.  To "
"gain access to other portions of the buffer, use <code "
"class=\"code\">without-restriction</code> with the same label."
msgstr ""
"ただし、ラベル引数（後述）を用いて <code class=\"code\">with-restriction</"
"code> で狭域が設定されている場合、<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</"
"code> はその狭域の範囲内でのみ使用可能です。<var class=\"var\">start</var> ま"
"たは <var class=\"var\">end</var> がこれらの範囲外にある場合は、代わりに "
"<code class=\"code\">with-restriction</code> で設定された対応する範囲が使用さ"
"れます。バッファの他の領域にアクセスするには、同じラベルを指定して <code "
"class=\"code\">without-restriction</code> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
