"code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-restriction</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"save_002drestriction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-restriction</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"save_002drestriction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"This special form saves the current bounds of the accessible portion, "
"evaluates the <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms, and finally restores the "
"saved bounds, thus restoring the same state of narrowing (or absence "
"thereof) formerly in effect.  The state of narrowing is restored even in the "
"event of an abnormal exit via <code class=\"code\">throw</code> or error "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">Nonlocal Exits</a>).  "
"Therefore, this construct is a clean way to narrow a buffer temporarily."
msgstr ""
"この特殊な形式は、アクセス可能な部分の現在の境界を保存し、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> 形式を評価し、最後に保存した境界を復元することで、以"
"前に有効だったのと同じ狭窄状態（またはその不在）を復元します。<code "
"class=\"code\">throw</code> による異常終了やエラーが発生した場合でも、狭窄状"
"態は復元されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonlocal-Exits.html\">非局所脱出"
"</a>を参照）。したがって、この構文はバッファを一時的に狭窄させるための簡潔な"
"方法となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"This construct also saves and restores the narrowings that were set by <code "
"class=\"code\">with-restriction</code> with a label argument (see below)."
msgstr ""
"このコンストラクトは、ラベル引数（後述）を用いて <code class=\"code\">with-"
"restriction</code> で設定された狭めの設定を保存し、復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"The value returned by <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> is that "
"returned by the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if no body forms were given."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> が返す値は、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> の最後のフォームが返す値、あるいはボディフォームが指"
"定されていない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が返す値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Caution:</strong> it is easy to make a mistake when "
"using the <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> construct.  Read the "
"entire description here before you try it."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">注意：</strong> <code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> 構文を使用する際は間違いやすくなります。試す前に、こちらの"
"説明を最後までお読みください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">body</var> changes the current buffer, <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> still restores the restrictions on "
"the original buffer (the buffer whose restrictions it saved from), but it "
"does not restore the identity of the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> が現在のバッファを変更する場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> は元のバッファ（制限を保存したバッ"
"ファ）に対する制限を依然として復元しますが、現在のバッファの同一性は復元しま"
"せん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> does <em class=\"emph\">not</"
"em> restore point; use <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> for that.  "
"If you use both <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> together, <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> should come first (i.e., on the outside).  Otherwise, the "
"value for point would be restored with temporary narrowing still in effect.  "
"If the old value for point were outside the limits of the temporary "
"narrowing, this would fail to restore it accurately."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> はポイントを復元<em "
"class=\"emph\">しません</em>。その場合は <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> を使用してください。<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</"
"code> と <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> を併用する場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> が先（つまり外側）に来る必要があります。"
"そうでない場合、一時的な狭窄が有効なままポイントの値が復元されてしまいます。"
"ポイントの旧値が一時的な狭窄の範囲外であった場合、正確に復元できなくなりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Narrowing.html
