msgstr ""
"<span>33.1 点近傍のテキストの検査<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Examining-Text-Near-Point\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-near-point\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-near-point\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"Many functions are provided to look at the characters around point.  Several "
"simple functions are described here.  See also <code class=\"code\">looking-"
"at</code> in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Regexp-Search.html\">Regular Expression "
"Searching</a>."
msgstr ""
"ポイント周辺の文字を調べるための関数が数多く用意されています。ここでは、いく"
"つかのシンプルな関数について説明します。また、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Regexp-"
"Search.html\">正規表現による検索</a>の<code class=\"code\">looking-at</code>"
"も参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"In the following four functions, &ldquo;beginning&rdquo; or "
"&ldquo;end&rdquo; of buffer refers to the beginning or end of the accessible "
"portion."
msgstr ""
"以下の4つの関数において、バッファの「先頭」または「末尾」とは、アクセス可能な"
"領域の先頭または末尾を指します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-after</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dafter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-after</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dafter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the character in the current buffer at (i.e., "
"immediately after) position <var class=\"var\">position</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> is out of range for this purpose, either before "
"the beginning of the buffer, or at or beyond the end, then the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The default for <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> is point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内の位置 <var class=\"var\">position</var>（すなわ"
"ちその直後）にある文字を返します。<var class=\"var\">position</var> がこの目"
"的において範囲外（バッファの先頭より前、または末尾もしくはそれ以降）である場"
"合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> のデフォルト値は point です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, assume that the first character in the buffer is "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、バッファの先頭文字が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</"
"samp>&rsquo; であると仮定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(string (char-after 1))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;@&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-before</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dbefore\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-before</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dbefore\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the character in the current buffer immediately before "
"position <var class=\"var\">position</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">position</"
"var> is out of range for this purpose, either at or before the beginning of "
"the buffer, or beyond the end, then the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  The default for <var class=\"var\">position</var> is point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにおいて位置 <var class=\"var\">position</var> の直"
"前にある文字を返します。<var class=\"var\">position</var> がこの目的において"
"範囲外（バッファの先頭またはそれ以前、あるいは末尾以降）である場合、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。<var class=\"var\">position</"
"var> のデフォルト値は point です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">following-char</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"following_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">following-char</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"following_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the character following point in the current buffer.  "
"This is similar to <code class=\"code\">(char-after (point))</code>.  "
"However, if point is at the end of the buffer, then <code "
"class=\"code\">following-char</code> returns 0."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにおいてポイントの次の文字を返します。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">(char-after (point))</code> と同様です。ただし、ポイントがバッ"
"ファの末尾にある場合、<code class=\"code\">following-char</code> は 0 を返し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"Remember that point is always between characters, and the cursor normally "
"appears over the character following point.  Therefore, the character "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">following-char</code> is the character the "
"cursor is over."
msgstr ""
"その点は常に文字間にあり、通常カーソルはその点の次の文字の上に表示されること"
"に注意してください。したがって、<code class=\"code\">following-char</code> が"
"返す文字は、カーソルが位置している文字となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"In this example, point is between the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</"
"samp>&rsquo; and the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この例では、pointは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;と&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;の間にあります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"Gentlemen may cry ``Pea&lowast;ce! Peace!,''\n"
"but there is no peace.\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(string (preceding-char))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;a&quot;\n"
"(string (following-char))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;c&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">preceding-char</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"preceding_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">preceding-char</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"preceding_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Near-Point.html
msgid ""
