# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"The following network options can be specified when you create a network "
"process.  Except for <code class=\"code\">:reuseaddr</code>, you can also "
"set or modify these options later, using <code class=\"code\">set-network-"
"process-option</code>."
msgstr ""
"ネットワークプロセスを作成する際、以下のネットワークオプションを指定できま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">:reuseaddr</code>を除き、これらのオプションは後から"
"<code class=\"code\">set-network-process-option</code>を使用して設定または変"
"更することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"For a server process, the options specified with <code class=\"code\">make-"
"network-process</code> are not inherited by the client connections, so you "
"will need to set the necessary options for each child connection as it is "
"created."
msgstr ""
"サーバープロセスの場合、<code class=\"code\">make-network-process</code> で指"
"定したオプションはクライアント接続に継承されないため、子接続が作成されるたび"
"に必要となるオプションを設定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:bindtodevice <var class=\"var\">device-name</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:bindtodevice <var class=\"var\">device-name</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
