"network interface name (see <code class=\"code\">network-interface-list</"
"code>), only handle packets received on that interface.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">device-name</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the "
"default), handle packets received on any interface."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">device-name</var> がネットワークインターフェース名（<code "
"class=\"code\">network-interface-list</code> を参照）を識別する空でない文字列"
"である場合は、そのインターフェースで受信したパケットのみを処理します。<var "
"class=\"var\">device-name</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォル"
"ト）である場合は、任意のインターフェースで受信したパケットを処理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid "Using this option may require special privileges on some systems."
msgstr ""
"このオプションを使用するには、一部のシステムで特別な権限が必要な場合がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:broadcast <var class=\"var\">broadcast-flag</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:broadcast <var class=\"var\">broadcast-flag</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">broadcast-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> for a datagram process, the process will receive datagram packet sent "
"to a broadcast address, and be able to send packets to a broadcast address.  "
"This is ignored for a stream connection."
msgstr ""
"データグラムプロセスにおいて <var class=\"var\">broadcast-flag</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、そのプロセスはブロードキャス"
"トアドレス宛てに送信されたデータグラムパケットを受信でき、またブロードキャス"
"トアドレス宛てにパケットを送信できます。ストリーム接続の場合、この動作は無視"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:dontroute <var class=\"var\">dontroute-flag</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:dontroute <var class=\"var\">dontroute-flag</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">dontroute-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the process can only send to hosts on the same network as the local "
"host."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">dontroute-flag</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ない場合、プロセスはローカルホストと同じネットワーク上のホストにのみ送信でき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:keepalive <var class=\"var\">keepalive-flag</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:keepalive <var class=\"var\">keepalive-flag</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">keepalive-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> for a stream connection, enable exchange of low-level keep-alive "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"ストリーム接続において <var class=\"var\">keepalive-flag</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、低レベルの keep-alive メッセージの交換"
"を有効にします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:linger <var class=\"var\">linger-arg</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:linger <var class=\"var\">linger-arg</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">linger-arg</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, wait for successful transmission of all queued packets on the "
"connection before it is deleted (see <code class=\"code\">delete-process</"
"code>).  If <var class=\"var\">linger-arg</var> is an integer, it specifies "
"the maximum time in seconds to wait for queued packets to be sent before "
"closing the connection.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"which means to discard unsent queued packets when the process is deleted."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">linger-arg</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、接続上のすべてのキュー済みパケットの送信が完了するまで待機してから削除"
"されます（<code class=\"code\">delete-process</code> を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">linger-arg</var> が整数の場合、接続を閉じる前にキュー済みパケッ"
"トが送信されるまで待機する最大時間（秒単位）を指定します。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これはプロセス削除時に未送信のキュー済みパケッ"
"トを破棄することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:oobinline <var class=\"var\">oobinline-flag</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:oobinline <var class=\"var\">oobinline-flag</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">oobinline-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> for a stream connection, receive out-of-band data in the normal data "
"stream.  Otherwise, ignore out-of-band data."
msgstr ""
"ストリーム接続において <var class=\"var\">oobinline-flag</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、通常のデータストリーム内で帯域外デー"
"タを受信します。それ以外の場合は、帯域外データを無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:priority <var class=\"var\">priority</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:priority <var class=\"var\">priority</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"Set the priority for packets sent on this connection to the integer <var "
"class=\"var\">priority</var>.  The interpretation of this number is protocol "
"specific; such as setting the TOS (type of service) field on IP packets sent "
"on this connection.  It may also have system dependent effects, such as "
"selecting a specific output queue on the network interface."
msgstr ""
"この接続で送信されるパケットの優先度を整数 <var class=\"var\">priority</var> "
"に設定します。この数値の解釈はプロトコル固有であり、例えばこの接続で送信され"
"る IP パケットの TOS（サービス種別）フィールドを設定する場合などが挙げられま"
"す。また、ネットワークインターフェース上の特定の出力キューを選択するなど、シ"
"ステム依存の影響を及ぼす場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:reuseaddr <var class=\"var\">reuseaddr-flag</var></"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:reuseaddr <var class=\"var\">reuseaddr-flag</var></"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">reuseaddr-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> (the default) for a stream server process, allow this server to reuse "
"a specific port number (see <code class=\"code\">:service</code>), unless "
"another process on this host is already listening on that port.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">reuseaddr-flag</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, there "
"may be a period of time after the last use of that port (by any process on "
"the host) where it is not possible to make a new server on that port."
msgstr ""
"ストリームサーバープロセスにおいて <var class=\"var\">reuseaddr-flag</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外（デフォルト）である場合、このサーバー"
"が特定のポート番号（<code class=\"code\">:service</code> を参照）を再利用する"
"ことを許可します。ただし、このホスト上の別のプロセスが既にそのポートで待ち受"
"けている場合はこの限りではありません。<var class=\"var\">reuseaddr-flag</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、（ホスト上の任意のプロセ"
"スによる）そのポートの最終利用後、そのポートで新しいサーバーを起動できなくな"
"る期間が生じることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:nodelay <var class=\"var\">nodelay-flag</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:nodelay <var class=\"var\">nodelay-flag</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">nodelay-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the <code class=\"code\">TCP_NODELAY</code> option is enabled on the "
"socket.  This disables the Nagle algorithm, meaning that network segments "
"are sent as soon as possible, even when they contain little data.  This "
"reduces network latency on the network connection, but can lead to many "
"small packets being sent."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">nodelay-flag</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"の場合、ソケットで <code class=\"code\">TCP_NODELAY</code> オプションが有効に"
"なります。これにより Nagle アルゴリズムが無効になり、データ量が少なくてもネッ"
"トワークセグメントが可能な限り速やかに送信されるようになります。これにより"
"ネットワーク接続上のレイテンシは低減しますが、大量の小さなパケットが送信され"
"る可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-network-process-option</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process option value &amp;optional no-error</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dnetwork_002dprocess_002doption\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-network-process-option</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process option value &amp;optional no-error</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dnetwork_002dprocess_002doption\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
msgid ""
"This function sets or modifies a network option for network process <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var>.  The accepted options and values are as for "
"<code class=\"code\">make-network-process</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">no-"
"error</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> instead of signaling an error if <var "
"class=\"var\">option</var> is not a supported option.  If the function "
"successfully completes, it returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ネットワークプロセス <var class=\"var\">process</var> のネット"
"ワークオプションを設定または変更します。受け付けられるオプションおよび値は、"
"<code class=\"code\">make-network-process</code> と同様です。<var "
"class=\"var\">no-error</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"<var class=\"var\">option</var> がサポートされていないオプションであっても、"
"この関数はエラーを通知する代わりに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。関数が正常に完了した場合は、<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Options.html
