"<code class=\"code\">:use-external-socket <var class=\"var\">use-external-"
"socket</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">use-external-socket</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> use any sockets passed to Emacs on invocation "
