"ケット有効化を実現するために用いられます。Emacs にソケットが渡されていない場"
"合、このオプションは暗黙的に無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:local <var class=\"var\">local-address</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:local <var class=\"var\">local-address</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid ""
"For a server process, <var class=\"var\">local-address</var> is the address "
"to listen on.  It overrides <var class=\"var\">family</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">host</var> and <var class=\"var\">service</var>, so you might "
"as well not specify them."
msgstr ""
"サーバープロセスの場合、<var class=\"var\">local-address</var> は待ち受けアド"
