"<var class=\"var\">service</var>を上書きするため、これらを指定しなくても構い"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid ""
"For a datagram server, <var class=\"var\">remote-address</var> specifies the "
"initial setting of the remote datagram address."
