# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The format of <var class=\"var\">local-address</var> or <var "
