# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">name</var> argument specifies the name for the "
"process object.  It is modified as necessary to make it unique."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> 引数は、プロセスオブジェクトの名前を指定しま"
"す。一意になるよう、必要に応じて変更されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> argument is the buffer to associate with "
"the connection.  Output from the connection is inserted in the buffer, "
"unless you specify your own filter function to handle the output.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it means that "
"the connection is not associated with any buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> 引数は、接続に関連付けるバッファです。出力を"
"処理するための独自のフィルタ関数を指定しない限り、接続からの出力はこのバッ"
"ファに挿入されます。<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、その接続はどのバッファにも関連付けられ"
"ていないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Network.html
msgid ""
"The arguments <var class=\"var\">host</var> and <var class=\"var\">service</"
"var> specify where to connect to; <var class=\"var\">host</var> is the host "
"name (a string), and <var class=\"var\">service</var> is the name of a "
"defined network service (a string) or a port number (an integer like <code "
"class=\"code\">80</code> or an integer string like <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;80&quot;</code>)."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">host</var> と <var class=\"var\">service</var> は接続"
"先を指定し、<var class=\"var\">host</var> はホスト名（文字列）、<var "
"class=\"var\">service</var> は定義済みネットワークサービスの名前（文字列）ま"
"たはポート番号（<code class=\"code\">80</code> のような整数や <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;80&quot;</code> のような整数文字列）です。"

