# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbered-Backups.html
msgid ""
"If a file&rsquo;s name is <samp class=\"file\">foo</samp>, the names of its "
