"class=\"file\">foo.~<var class=\"var\">v</var>~</samp> となり、次のようになり"
"ます：<samp class=\"file\">foo.~1~</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">foo.~2~</"
"samp>、<samp class=\"file\">foo.~3~</samp>、&hellip;、<samp "
"class=\"file\">foo.~259~</samp> など。"

