# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbered-Backups.html
msgid ""
"The use of numbered backups ultimately leads to a large number of backup "
"versions, which must then be deleted.  Emacs can do this automatically or it "
"can ask the user whether to delete them."
msgstr ""
"番号付きバックアップを使用すると、最終的に大量のバックアップバージョンが蓄積"
"され、それらを削除する必要があります。Emacsはこれを自動的に行うか、あるいは削"
"除するかどうかをユーザーに確認することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbered-Backups.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kept-new-versions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kept_002dnew_002dversions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">kept-new-versions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-kept_002dnew_002dversions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbered-Backups.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the number of newest versions to keep when a "
"new numbered backup is made.  The newly made backup is included in the "
"count.  The default value is&nbsp;2."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、新しい番号付きバックアップを作成する際に保持する最新バージョ"
"ンの数です。新しく作成されたバックアップもこのカウントに含まれます。デフォル"
"ト値は&nbsp;2です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbered-Backups.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
