# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbered-Backups.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies how many of the newest backup versions to keep in "
"the Dired command <kbd class=\"kbd\">.</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-"
"clean-directory</code>).  That&rsquo;s the same thing <code "
"class=\"code\">kept-new-versions</code> specifies when you make a new backup "
