# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Numbers.html
msgid ""
"GNU Emacs supports two numeric data types: <em class=\"dfn\">integers</em> "
"and <em class=\"dfn\">floating-point numbers</em>.  Integers are whole "
"numbers such as &minus;3, 0, 7, 13, and 511.  Floating-point numbers are "
"numbers with fractional parts, such as &minus;4.5, 0.0, and 2.71828.  They "
"can also be expressed in exponential notation: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">1.5e2</samp>&rsquo; is the same as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">150.0</samp>&rsquo;; here, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e2</"
"samp>&rsquo; stands for ten to the second power, and that is multiplied by "
"1.5.  Integer computations are exact.  Floating-point computations often "
"involve rounding errors, as the numbers have a fixed amount of precision."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacsは、<em class=\"dfn\">整数</em>と<em class=\"dfn\">浮動小数点数</em>"
"という2種類の数値データ型をサポートしています。整数とは、&minus;3, 0, 7, 13, "
"511のような整数のことです。浮動小数点数とは、&minus;4.5, 0.0, 2.71828のように"
"小数部分を持つ数値のことです。また、指数表記で表すこともでき、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">1.5e2</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">150.0</"
"samp>&rsquo;と同じです。ここで&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e2</samp>&rsquo;は"
"10の2乗を表し、それに1.5を乗じています。整数演算は厳密に行われます。浮動小数"
"点演算は、数値の精度が固定されているため、しばしば丸め誤差が生じます。"

