# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions for reading Lisp objects with the "
"minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"この節では、ミニバッファを用いてLispオブジェクトを読み込むための関数について"
"説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-minibuffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional initial</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dminibuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-minibuffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional initial</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002dminibuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a Lisp object using the minibuffer, and returns it "
"without evaluating it.  The arguments <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">initial</var> are used as in <code class=\"code\">read-"
"from-minibuffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ミニバッファを用いてLispオブジェクトを読み込み、評価せずにそのま"
"ま返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">initial</var> は <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</"
"code> と同様に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This is a simplified interface to the <code class=\"code\">read-from-"
"minibuffer</code> function:"
msgstr ""
"これは<code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code>関数の簡易インター"
"フェースです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(read-minibuffer <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> <var class=\"var\">initial</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(let (minibuffer-allow-text-properties)\n"
"  (read-from-minibuffer <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> <var class=\"var\">initial</var> nil t))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example in which we supply the string <code class=\"code\">&quot;"
"(testing)&quot;</code> as initial input:"
msgstr ""
"以下に、初期入力として文字列 <code class=\"code\">&quot;(testing)&quot;</"
"code> を与える例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(read-minibuffer\n"
" &quot;Enter an expression: &quot; (format &quot;%s&quot; '(testing)))\n"
"\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">Here is how the minibuffer is displayed:</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
"Enter an expression: (testing)&lowast;\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"The user can type <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> immediately to use the "
"initial input as a default, or can edit the input."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーは、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力してすぐに初期入力をデフォルト"
"として使用することも、入力を編集することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-minibuffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional initial</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"eval_002dminibuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">eval-minibuffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prompt "
"&amp;optional initial</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"eval_002dminibuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a Lisp expression using the minibuffer, evaluates it, "
"then returns the result.  The arguments <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">initial</var> are used as in <code class=\"code\">read-"
"from-minibuffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ミニバッファを用いてLisp式を読み込み、評価した上で結果を返しま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> と <var class=\"var\">initial</var> "
"は <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code> と同様に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This function simply evaluates the result of a call to <code "
"class=\"code\">read-minibuffer</code>:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、単に <code class=\"code\">read-minibuffer</code> の呼び出し結果を"
"評価します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(eval-minibuffer <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> <var class=\"var\">initial</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(eval (read-minibuffer <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> <var class=\"var\">initial</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edit-and-eval-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">prompt form</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edit_002dand_002deval_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edit-and-eval-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">prompt form</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edit_002dand_002deval_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a Lisp expression in the minibuffer, evaluates it, then "
"returns the result.  The difference between this command and <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-minibuffer</code> is that here the initial <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var> is not optional and it is treated as a Lisp object "
"to be converted to printed representation rather than as a string of text.  "
"It is printed with <code class=\"code\">prin1</code>, so if it is a string, "
"double-quote characters (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo;)  "
"appear in the initial text.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Output-"
"Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ミニバッファ内のLisp式を読み込み、評価し、その結果を返します。こ"
"のコマンドと<code class=\"code\">eval-minibuffer</code>との違いは、ここでは先"
"頭の<var class=\"var\">form</var>が省略不可であり、テキスト文字列としてではな"
"く、印刷表現に変換されるLispオブジェクトとして扱われる点です。これは<code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code>を用いて印刷されるため、文字列である場合は、先頭の"
"テキストにダブルクォート文字（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo;）が現れます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出"
"力関数</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, we offer the user an expression with initial text "
"that is already a valid form:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、すでに有効なフォームとなっている初期テキスト付きの式をユーザー"
"に提示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(edit-and-eval-command &quot;Please edit: &quot; '(forward-word 1))\n"
"\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">After evaluation of the preceding expression,</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">the following appears in the minibuffer:</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
"Please edit: (forward-word 1)&lowast;\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Object-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> right away would exit the minibuffer and "
"evaluate the expression, thus moving point forward one word."
msgstr ""
"すぐに <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力すると、ミニバッファを抜けて式が評"
"価され、ポイントが1単語分進みます。"

