# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span>13.13 Declaring Functions Obsolete<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Declaring-Functions-Obsolete\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13.13 関数を廃止として宣言する<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Declaring-Functions-Obsolete\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obsolete-functions\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obsolete-functions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"You can mark a named function as <em class=\"dfn\">obsolete</em>, meaning "
"that it may be removed at some point in the future.  This causes Emacs to "
"warn that the function is obsolete whenever it byte-compiles code containing "
"that function, and whenever it displays the documentation for that "
"function.  In all other respects, an obsolete function behaves like any "
"other function."
msgstr ""
"名前付き関数を<em class=\"dfn\">廃止済み</em>としてマークできます。これは、将"
"来的にその関数が削除される可能性があることを意味します。これにより、Emacsはそ"
"の関数を含むコードをバイトコンパイルする際や、当該関数のドキュメントを表示す"
"る際に、その関数が廃止済みである旨の警告を表示します。それ以外の点では、廃止"
"済み関数は他の関数と同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The easiest way to mark a function as obsolete is to put a <code "
"class=\"code\">(declare (obsolete &hellip;))</code> form in the "
"function&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">defun</code> definition.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\">The <code class=\"code\">declare</"
"code> Form</a>.  Alternatively, you can use the <code class=\"code\">make-"
"obsolete</code> function, described below."
msgstr ""
"関数を廃止済みとしてマークする最も簡単な方法は、関数の<code "
"class=\"code\">defun</code>定義に<code class=\"code\">(declare (obsolete "
"&hellip;))</code>フォームを記述することです。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Declare-Form.html\"><code class=\"code\">declare</code>フォーム</a>を"
"参照してください。あるいは、後述する<code class=\"code\">make-obsolete</code>"
"関数を使用することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"A macro (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Macros.html\">Macros</a>) can also be "
"marked obsolete with <code class=\"code\">make-obsolete</code>; this has the "
"same effects as for a function.  An alias for a function or macro can also "
"be marked as obsolete; this makes the alias itself obsolete, not the "
"function or macro which it resolves to."
msgstr ""
"マクロ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Macros.html\">マクロ</a>を参照）も <code "
"class=\"code\">make-obsolete</code> で廃止済みとしてマークでき、これは関数と"
"同様の効果を持ちます。関数やマクロのエイリアスも廃止済みとしてマークでき、こ"
"れによりエイリアス自体が廃止済みとなり、それが解決先とする関数やマクロが廃止"
"済みになるわけではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-obsolete</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">obsolete-name "
"current-name when</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dobsolete\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-obsolete</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">obsolete-name "
"current-name when</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dobsolete\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function marks <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> as obsolete.  "
"<var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> should be a symbol naming a function "
"or macro, or an alias for a function or macro."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> を廃止済みとしてマークしま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> は、関数やマクロの名前、あるいは関"
"数やマクロのエイリアスである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> is a symbol, the warning message "
"says to use <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> instead of <var "
"class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var>.  <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> "
"does not need to be an alias for <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var>; it "
"can be a different function with similar functionality.  <var "
"class=\"var\">current-name</var> can also be a string, which serves as the "
"warning message.  The message should begin in lower case, and end with a "
"period.  It can also be <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case the "
"warning message provides no additional details."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">current-name</var> がシンボルの場合、警告メッセージには "
"<var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> ではなく <var class=\"var\">current-"
"name</var> を使用するよう記載されます。<var class=\"var\">current-name</var> "
"は <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> のエイリアスである必要はなく、同様"
"の機能を持つ別の関数であっても構いません。<var class=\"var\">current-name</"
"var> は文字列であることもでき、その場合は警告メッセージとして機能します。メッ"
"セージは小文字で始まり、末尾にピリオドを付ける必要があります。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> とすることもでき、その場合は警告メッセージに追加の"
"詳細は記載されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">when</var> should be a string indicating "
"when the function was first made obsolete&mdash;for example, a date or a "
"release number."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">when</var> には、関数が最初に廃止された時期を示す文字"
"列（例えば日付やリリース番号）を指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-obsolete-function-alias</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">obsolete-name current-name when &amp;optional doc</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dobsolete_002dfunction_002dalias\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">define-obsolete-function-alias</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">obsolete-name current-name when &amp;optional doc</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"define_002dobsolete_002dfunction_002dalias\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This convenience macro marks the function <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</"
"var> obsolete and also defines it as an alias for the function <var "
"class=\"var\">current-name</var>.  It is equivalent to the following:"
msgstr ""
"この便利なマクロは、関数 <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> を非推奨と"
"し、同時に関数 <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> のエイリアスとして定義し"
"ます。これは以下と同等です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defalias <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> <var class=\"var\">doc</var>)\n"
"(make-obsolete <var class=\"var\">obsolete-name</var> <var class=\"var\">current-name</var> <var class=\"var\">when</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In addition, you can mark a particular calling convention for a function as "
"obsolete:"
msgstr ""
"さらに、関数の特定の呼び出し規約を廃止済みとしてマークすることもできます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-advertised-calling-convention</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function signature when</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dadvertised_002dcalling_002dconvention\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-advertised-calling-convention</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function signature when</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dadvertised_002dcalling_002dconvention\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function specifies the argument list <var class=\"var\">signature</var> "
"as the correct way to call <var class=\"var\">function</var>.  This causes "
"the Emacs byte compiler to issue a warning whenever it comes across an Emacs "
"Lisp program that calls <var class=\"var\">function</var> any other way "
"(however, it will still allow the code to be byte compiled).  <var "
"class=\"var\">when</var> should be a string indicating when the variable was "
"first made obsolete (usually a version number string)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数リスト <var class=\"var\">signature</var> を <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> の正しい呼び出し方として指定します。これにより、"
"Emacsバイトコンパイラは、<var class=\"var\">function</var> をそれ以外の方法で"
"呼び出している Emacs Lisp プログラムに遭遇するたびに警告を出力します（ただ"
"し、コードのバイトコンパイルは引き続き許可されます）。<var "
"class=\"var\">when</var> は、変数が最初に廃止された時期を示す文字列（通常は"
"バージョン番号の文字列）である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"For instance, in old versions of Emacs the <code class=\"code\">sit-for</"
"code> function accepted three arguments, like this"
msgstr ""
"例えば、旧バージョンのEmacsでは、<code class=\"code\">sit-for</code>関数は次"
"のように3つの引数を受け取っていました。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "  (sit-for seconds milliseconds nodisp)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"During a transition period, the function accepted those three arguments, but "
"declared this old calling convention as deprecated like this:"
msgstr ""
"移行期間中、その関数はこれら3つの引数を受け付けていましたが、この古い呼び出し"
"規約を次のように非推奨として宣言しました。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(set-advertised-calling-convention\n"
"  'sit-for '(seconds &amp;optional nodisp) &quot;22.1&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Obsolete-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The alternative to using this function is the <code "
"class=\"code\">advertised-calling-convention</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> spec, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Declare-"
"Form.html\">The <code class=\"code\">declare</code> Form</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数を使用する代わりの方法として、<code class=\"code\">advertised-"
"calling-convention</code> <code class=\"code\">declare</code> 仕様がありま"
"す。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> 形式</a>を参照してください。"

