# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"An on-screen keyboard is a special kind of pop up provided by the system, "
"with rows of clickable buttons that act as a real keyboard."
msgstr ""
"オンスクリーンキーボードとは、システムが提供する特殊なポップアップの一種で、"
"本物のキーボードとして機能するクリック可能なボタンが列状に配置されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"On certain systems (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/On_002dScreen-"
"Keyboards.html#On_002dScreen-Keyboards\">On-Screen Keyboards</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Manual</cite>), Emacs is supposed to display and "
"hide the on screen keyboard depending on whether or not the user is about to "
"type something."
msgstr ""
"一部のシステム（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html#On_002dScreen-Keyboards\">オンスクリーン"
"キーボード</a>を参照）では、ユーザーが何かを入力しようとしているかどうかに応"
"じて、Emacsがオンスクリーンキーボードを表示・非表示にするようになっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-toggle-on-screen-keyboard</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">frame hide</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"frame_002dtoggle_002don_002dscreen_002dkeyboard\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-toggle-on-screen-keyboard</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">frame hide</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"frame_002dtoggle_002don_002dscreen_002dkeyboard\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"This function displays or hides the on-screen keyboard on behalf of the "
"frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">hide</var> is "
