# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.8.1.2 Operator Precedence Grammars<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Operator-Precedence-Grammars-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.8.1.2 演算子優先順位文法<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Operator-"
"Precedence-Grammars-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"SMIE&rsquo;s precedence grammars simply give to each token a pair of "
"precedences: the left-precedence and the right-precedence.  We say <code "
"class=\"code\">T1 &lt; T2</code> if the right-precedence of token <code "
"class=\"code\">T1</code> is less than the left-precedence of token <code "
"class=\"code\">T2</code>.  A good way to read this <code class=\"code\">&lt;"
"</code> is as a kind of parenthesis: if we find <code class=\"code\">... T1 "
"something T2 ...</code> then that should be parsed as <code "
"class=\"code\">... T1 (something T2 ...</code> rather than as <code "
"class=\"code\">... T1 something) T2 ...</code>.  The latter interpretation "
"would be the case if we had <code class=\"code\">T1 &gt; T2</code>.  If we "
"have <code class=\"code\">T1 = T2</code>, it means that token T2 follows "
"token T1 in the same syntactic construction, so typically we have <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot; = &quot;end&quot;</code>.  Such pairs of "
"precedences are sufficient to express left-associativity or right-"
"associativity of infix operators, nesting of tokens like parentheses and "
"many other cases."
msgstr ""
"SMIEの優先順位文法では、各トークンに左優先順位と右優先順位という一対の優先順"
"位を単純に割り当てます。トークン <code class=\"code\">T1</code> の右優先順位"
"がトークン <code class=\"code\">T2</code> の左優先順位よりも小さい場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">T1 &lt; T2</code> と表記します。この <code "
"class=\"code\">&lt;</code> は、ある種の括弧として解釈するのが適切です。もし "
"<code class=\"code\">... T1 something T2 ...</code> が見つかった場合、それは "
"<code class=\"code\">... T1 something) T2 ...</code> ではなく <code "
"class=\"code\">... T1 (something T2 ...</code> として解析されるべきです。後者"
"の解釈になるのは、<code class=\"code\">T1 &gt; T2</code> がある場合です。"
"<code class=\"code\">T1 = T2</code> がある場合は、同一の構文構造においてトー"
"クン T1 の後にトークン T2 が続くことを意味するため、通常は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot; = &quot;end&quot;</code> となります。このよ"
"うな優先順位のペアがあれば、中置演算子の左結合性や右結合性、括弧のようなトー"
"クンの入れ子構造、およびその他多くのケースを表現するのに十分です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-prec2-&gt;grammar</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dprec2_002d_003egrammar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-prec2-&gt;grammar</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dprec2_002d_003egrammar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"This function takes a <em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> grammar <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> and returns an alist suitable for use in <code "
"class=\"code\">smie-setup</code>.  The <em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> is itself meant to be built by one of the "
"functions below."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> 文法 <var class=\"var\">table</"
"var> を受け取り、<code class=\"code\">smie-setup</code> で使用可能なアリスト"
"を返します。<em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> <var class=\"var\">table</var> 自体"
"は、以下に挙げる関数のいずれかによって構築されることを想定しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-merge-prec2s</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"tables</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dmerge_002dprec2s\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-merge-prec2s</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"tables</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dmerge_002dprec2s\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"This function takes several <em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> <var "
"class=\"var\">tables</var> and merges them into a new <em "
"class=\"emph\">prec2</em> table."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、複数の<em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> <var class=\"var\">tables</"
"var>を受け取り、それらを新しい<em class=\"emph\">prec2</em>テーブルにマージし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-precs-&gt;prec2</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">precs</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dprecs_002d_003eprec2\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-precs-&gt;prec2</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">precs</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dprecs_002d_003eprec2\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"This function builds a <em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> table from a table of "
"precedences <var class=\"var\">precs</var>.  <var class=\"var\">precs</var> "
"should be a list, sorted by precedence (for example <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;+&quot;</code> will come before <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;*&quot;</code>), of elements of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">assoc</var> <var class=\"var\">op</"
"var> ...)</code>, where each <var class=\"var\">op</var> is a token that "
"acts as an operator; <var class=\"var\">assoc</var> is their associativity, "
"which can be either <code class=\"code\">left</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">right</code>, <code class=\"code\">assoc</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nonassoc</code>.  All operators in a given element share the "
"same precedence level and associativity."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、優先順位表 <var class=\"var\">precs</var> から <em "
"class=\"emph\">prec2</em> テーブルを構築します。<var class=\"var\">precs</"
"var> は、優先順位順にソートされた（例えば <code class=\"code\">&quot;+&quot;"
"</code> が <code class=\"code\">&quot;*&quot;</code> より前に来る） <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">assoc</var> <var class=\"var\">op</"
"var> ...)</code> 形式の要素のリストである必要があり、ここで各 <var "
"class=\"var\">op</var> は演算子として機能するトークン、<var "
"class=\"var\">assoc</var> はその結合性（<code class=\"code\">left</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">right</code>、<code class=\"code\">assoc</code>、または "
"<code class=\"code\">nonassoc</code> のいずれか）となります。ある要素内のすべ"
"ての演算子は、同一の優先順位レベルと結合性を持ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-bnf-&gt;prec2</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">bnf "
"&amp;rest resolvers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dbnf_002d_003eprec2\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-bnf-&gt;prec2</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">bnf "
"&amp;rest resolvers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dbnf_002d_003eprec2\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"This function lets you specify the grammar using a BNF notation.  It accepts "
"a <var class=\"var\">bnf</var> description of the grammar along with a set "
"of conflict resolution rules <var class=\"var\">resolvers</var>, and returns "
"a <em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> table."
msgstr ""
"この関数では、BNF記法を用いて文法を指定できます。文法の<var "
"class=\"var\">bnf</var>記述と競合解決ルールの集合<var "
"class=\"var\">resolvers</var>を受け取り、<em class=\"emph\">prec2</em>テーブ"
"ルを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">bnf</var> is a list of nonterminal definitions of the "
"form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">nonterm</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">rhs1</var> <var class=\"var\">rhs2</var> ...)</code> where "
"each <var class=\"var\">rhs</var> is a (non-empty) list of terminals (aka "
"tokens) or non-terminals."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">bnf</var> は <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">nonterm</var> <var class=\"var\">rhs1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">rhs2</var> ...)</code> 形式の非終端記号の定義のリストであり、"
"各 <var class=\"var\">rhs</var> は（空でない）終端記号（別名トークン）または"
"非終端記号のリストである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid "Not all grammars are accepted:"
msgstr "すべての文法が認められているわけではありません："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"An <var class=\"var\">rhs</var> cannot be an empty list (an empty list is "
"never needed, since SMIE allows all non-terminals to match the empty string "
"anyway)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">rhs</var> は空リストになり得ません（SMIEではどの非終端記号"
"も空文字列にマッチできるため、そもそも空リストが必要になることはありませ"
"ん）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"An <var class=\"var\">rhs</var> cannot have 2 consecutive non-terminals: "
"each pair of non-terminals needs to be separated by a terminal (aka token).  "
"This is a fundamental limitation of operator precedence grammars."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">rhs</var> に非終端記号が2つ連続して現れることはありませ"
"ん。非終端記号の各ペアは、終端記号（いわゆるトークン）によって隔てられている"
"必要があります。これは演算子優先順位文法の根本的な制約です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid "Additionally, conflicts can occur:"
msgstr "また、競合が発生することもあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"The returned <em class=\"emph\">prec2</em> table holds constraints between "
"pairs of tokens, and for any given pair only one constraint can be present: "
"T1 &lt; T2, T1 = T2, or T1 &gt; T2."
msgstr ""
"返される<em class=\"emph\">prec2</em>テーブルにはトークンペア間の制約が格納さ"
"れており、任意のペアに対して存在し得る制約は、T1 &lt; T2、T1 = T2、またはT1 "
"&gt; T2のいずれか1つのみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"A token can be an <code class=\"code\">opener</code> (something similar to "
"an open-paren), a <code class=\"code\">closer</code> (like a close-paren), "
"or <code class=\"code\">neither</code> of the two (e.g., an infix operator, "
"or an inner token like <code class=\"code\">&quot;else&quot;</code>)."
msgstr ""
"トークンは、<code class=\"code\">opener</code>（開き括弧のようなもの）、"
"<code class=\"code\">closer</code>（閉じ括弧のようなもの）、あるいはその両方"
"である<code class=\"code\">neither</code>（例：中置演算子や、<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;else&quot;</code>のような内部トークン）のいずれかになり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Operator-Precedence-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"Precedence conflicts can be resolved via <var class=\"var\">resolvers</var>, "
"which is a list of <em class=\"emph\">precs</em> tables (see <code "
"class=\"code\">smie-precs-&gt;prec2</code>): for each precedence conflict, "
"if those <code class=\"code\">precs</code> tables specify a particular "
"constraint, then the conflict is resolved by using this constraint instead, "
"else a conflict is reported and one of the conflicting constraints is picked "
"arbitrarily and the others are simply ignored."
msgstr ""
"優先順位の競合は <var class=\"var\">resolvers</var> によって解決できます。こ"
"れは <em class=\"emph\">precs</em> テーブルのリストです（<code "
"class=\"code\">smie-precs-&gt;prec2</code> を参照）。各優先順位の競合につい"
"て、該当する <code class=\"code\">precs</code> テーブルが特定の制約を指定して"
"いる場合は、その制約を用いて競合を解決します。そうでない場合は競合が報告さ"
"れ、競合する制約のうちいずれか一つが任意に選択され、それ以外は単に無視されま"
"す。"

