#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Char-Bits.html
msgid ""
"<span>2.4.3.5 Other Character Modifier Bits<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Other-Character-Modifier-Bits\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.4.3.5 その他の文字修飾ビット<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Other-"
"Character-Modifier-Bits\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Char-Bits.html
msgid ""
"The case of a graphic character is indicated by its character code; for "
"example, <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> distinguishes between the "
"characters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo;.  But <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"has no way to represent whether a control character is upper case or lower "
"case.  Emacs uses the 2**25 bit to indicate that the shift key was used in "
"typing a control character.  This distinction is possible only on a "
"graphical display such as a GUI display on X; text terminals do not report "
"the distinction.  The Lisp syntax for the shift bit is &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\S-</samp>&rsquo;; thus, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\C-"
"\\S-o</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\C-\\S-O</samp>&rsquo; "
"represents the shifted-control-o character."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカル文字のケースはその文字コードによって示されます。例えば、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>では文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</"
"samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; を区別します。し"
"かし、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>には、制御文字が大文字か小文字かを"
"表す方法はありません。Emacsでは、制御文字の入力時にシフトキーが使用されたこと"
"を示すために2**25ビットを使用します。この区別が可能なのは、X上のGUIディスプレ"
"イのようなグラフィカルディスプレイに限られており、テキスト端末ではこの区別は"
"報告されません。シフトビットのLisp構文は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\S-</"
"samp>&rsquo; であり、したがって &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\C-\\S-o</"
"samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\C-\\S-O</samp>&rsquo; はシフト"
"された制御文字oを表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Char-Bits.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-hyper-characters\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-super-characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-alt-characters\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-hyper-characters\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-super-characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-alt-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Char-Bits.html
msgid ""
"The X Window System defines three other <a class=\"anchor\" id=\"modifier-"
"bits\"></a>modifier bits that can be set in a character: <em "
"class=\"dfn\">hyper</em>, <em class=\"dfn\">super</em> and <em "
"class=\"dfn\">alt</em>.  The syntaxes for these bits are &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\H-</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\s-</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\A-</samp>&rsquo;.  (Case is "
"significant in these prefixes.)  Thus, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\H-\\M-"
"\\A-x</samp>&rsquo; represents <kbd class=\"kbd\">Alt-Hyper-Meta-x</kbd>.  "
"(Note that &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\s</samp>&rsquo; with no following "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; represents the space "
"character.)  Numerically, the bit values are 2**22 for alt, 2**23 for super "
"and 2**24 for hyper."
msgstr ""
"X Window Systemでは、文字に設定可能な他の3つの<a class=\"anchor\" "
"id=\"modifier-bits\"></a>修飾ビットとして、<em class=\"dfn\">hyper</em>、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">super</em>、<em class=\"dfn\">alt</em>が定義されています。これ"
"らのビットの構文は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\H-</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\s-</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\A-</"
"samp>&rsquo;です。（これらの接頭辞では大文字と小文字が区別されます。）した"
"がって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?\\H-\\M-\\A-x</samp>&rsquo;は<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">Alt-Hyper-Meta-x</kbd>を表します。（なお、後続の&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;を伴わない&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\s</"
"samp>&rsquo;は、スペース文字を表します。）数値的には、ビット値はaltが2**22、"
"superが2**23、hyperが2**24となります。"

