"明します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-Basics.html\">Font Lock の基本"
"</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Font-Lock-Variables.html
msgid ""
