msgstr "application/rtfd"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid "STRING"
msgstr "文字列"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid "image/tiff"
msgstr "image/tiff"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">XdndSelection</code> selection is also present "
"under Nextstep, in the form of a repository that records values supplied to "
"<code class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code>.  Its sole purpose is to save "
"such values for the fundamental drag-and-drop function <code "
"class=\"code\">x-begin-drag</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Drag-and-"
"Drop.html\">Drag and Drop</a>); no guarantees exist concerning its value "
"when read by anything else."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">XdndSelection</code> の選択項目は Nextstep においても、"
"<code class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code> に供給された値を記録するリポジ"
"トリという形で存在します。その唯一の目的は、基本的なドラッグ＆ドロップ機能 "
"<code class=\"code\">x-begin-drag</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Drag-and-"
"Drop.html\">ドラッグ＆ドロップ</a> を参照）のためにこうした値を保存することで"
"あり、それ以外のもので読み取られた際の値については一切保証されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Haiku-selections\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Haiku-selections\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Selections on Haiku systems comprise all three selections customary under X "
"and the <code class=\"code\">XdndSelection</code> that records drag-and-drop "
"data."
msgstr ""
"俳句体系に関する選集には、Xで慣習となっている3つの選集すべてと、ドラッグ＆ド"
"ロップデータを記録する<code class=\"code\">XdndSelection</code>が含まれる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code> is called for the former "
"three selections, the data supplied is converted into a window server "
"&ldquo;message&rdquo; by a list of <em class=\"dfn\">selection encoder</em> "
"functions, which is sent to the window server."
msgstr ""
"前述の3つの選択に対して<code class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code>が呼び出"
"されると、渡されたデータは<em class=\"dfn\">選択エンコーダ</em>関数群によって"
"ウィンドウサーバーの「メッセージ」に変換され、ウィンドウサーバーへと送信され"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">haiku-normal-selection-encoders</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-haiku_002dnormal_002dselection_002dencoders\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">haiku-normal-selection-encoders</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-haiku_002dnormal_002dselection_002dencoders\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"List of selection encoder functions.  When <code class=\"code\">gui-set-"
"selection</code> is called, each function in this list is successively "
"called with its <var class=\"var\">selection</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> arguments.  If such a function returns non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, its return value must be a list of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">key</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">type</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>.  In this list, <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> must be the name of the data being transferred, "
"generally that of a MIME type, for example &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;text/plain&quot;</samp>&rsquo;, and <var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> is a symbol or a number designating the type of the "
"data; thus also governing the interpretation of <var class=\"var\">value</"
"var>; following is a list of valid data types and how each of them will "
"cause <var class=\"var\">value</var> to be interpreted."
msgstr ""
"選択エンコーダ関数の一覧。<code class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code> が呼"
"び出されると、この一覧にある各関数が、<var class=\"var\">selection</var> およ"
"び <var class=\"var\">value</var> 引数とともに順次呼び出される。このような関"
"数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返す場合、その戻り値は <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">key</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">type</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code> 形式のリストでなければならな"
"い。このリストにおいて、<var class=\"var\">key</var> は転送されるデータの名称"
"（通常は MIME タイプ、例えば &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;text/"
"plain&quot;</samp>&rsquo;）である必要があり、<var class=\"var\">type</var> は"
"データの種類を指定する記号または数値である。これにより <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> の解釈も決定される。以下に、有効なデータ型の一覧"
"と、それぞれが <var class=\"var\">value</var> の解釈にどのように影響するかを"
"示す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"A unibyte string.  The string is NULL-terminated after being placed in the "
