msgstr "これはUTF-8テキストです：&ldquo;text/plain&rdquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">data-type</var> is a text type such as <code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code> or a MIME type matching the pattern &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">`text/*</samp>&rsquo;, the string data is decoded with "
"the coding system apposite for it before being returned."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">data-type</var> が <code class=\"code\">STRING</code> のよ"
"うなテキスト型、あるいはパターン &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">`text/*</"
"samp>&rsquo; に一致する MIME 型である場合、文字列データは返される前に、それに"
"適した符号化方式でデコードされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Furthermore, the two data types <var class=\"var\">TIMESTAMP</var> and <code "
"class=\"code\">TARGETS</code> are afforded special treatment; the value "
"returned for the first is the number of times the selection has been "
"modified since system startup (<em class=\"emph\">not</em> a timestamp), and "
"that for the other is a vector of available selection data types, as "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"さらに、2つのデータ型 <var class=\"var\">TIMESTAMP</var> と <code "
"class=\"code\">TARGETS</code> には特別な扱いがなされており、前者で返される値"
"はシステム起動以降に選択が変更された回数（タイムスタンプ<em class=\"emph\">で"
"はない</em>）であり、後者は他と同様に、利用可能な選択データ型のベクトルとなっ"
"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Other-Selections.html
