# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.6 Outline Minor Mode<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Outline-"
"Minor-Mode-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.6 マイナーモードの概要<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Outline-"
"Minor-Mode-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Outline-minor-mode\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Outline-minor-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Outline minor mode</em> is a buffer-local minor mode that "
"hides parts of the buffer and leaves only heading lines visible.  This minor "
"mode can be used in conjunction with other major modes (see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Outline-Minor-Mode.html#Outline-Minor-Mode\">Outline Minor Mode</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">the Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">アウトライン・マイナーモード</em>は、バッファの一部を非表示"
"にし、見出し行のみを表示させるバッファローカルなマイナーモードです。このマイ"
"ナーモードは、他のメジャーモードと併用できます（<cite class=\"cite\">Emacsマ"
"ニュアル</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Outline-Minor-Mode.html#Outline-Minor-"
"Mode\">アウトライン・マイナーモード</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"There are two ways to define which lines are headings: with the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code> or <code class=\"code\">outline-"
"search-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"どの行が見出しであるかを定義する方法は、変数 <code class=\"code\">outline-"
"regexp</code> または <code class=\"code\">outline-search-function</code> を用"
"いる2通りあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">outline-regexp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"outline_002dregexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">outline-regexp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"outline_002dregexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a regular expression.  Any line whose beginning has a match "
"for this regexp is considered a heading line.  Matches that start within a "
"line (not at the left margin) do not count."
msgstr ""
"この変数は正規表現です。行頭がこの正規表現に一致する行は、見出し行とみなされ"
"ます。行内（左端ではなく）から始まる一致はカウントされません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">outline-search-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-outline_002dsearch_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">outline-search-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-outline_002dsearch_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, when it&rsquo;s impossible to create a regexp that matches "
"heading lines, you can define a function that helps Outline minor mode to "
"find heading lines."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、見出し行にマッチする正規表現を作成できない場合は、Outlineマイナー"
"モードが見出し行を検出するのを支援する関数を定義することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">outline-search-function</code> specifies "
"the function with four arguments: <var class=\"var\">bound</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">move</var>, <var class=\"var\">backward</var>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">looking-at</var>.  The function completes two tasks: to match "
"the current heading line, and to find the next or the previous heading "
"line.  If the argument <var class=\"var\">looking-at</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> when point is at the beginning of the outline header line.  If the "
"argument <var class=\"var\">looking-at</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the first three arguments are used.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">bound</var> is a buffer position that bounds the search.  The "
"match found must not end after that position.  A value of nil means search "
"to the end of the accessible portion of the buffer.  If the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">move</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the failed "
"search should move to the limit of search and return nil.  If the argument "
"<var class=\"var\">backward</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"this function should search for the previous heading backward."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">outline-search-function</code> は、<var "
"class=\"var\">bound</var>、<var class=\"var\">move</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">backward</var>、<var class=\"var\">looking-at</var> の4つの引数"
"を取る関数を指定します。  この関数は、現在の見出し行に一致させることと、次ま"
"たは前の見出し行を見つけることの2つのタスクを実行します。  引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">looking-at</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、point がアウトライン見出し行の先頭にあるときは、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を返す必要があります。  引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">looking-at</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、最"
"初の3つの引数が使用されます。  引数 <var class=\"var\">bound</var> は、検索範"
"囲を定めるバッファ位置です。  見つかった一致箇所は、その位置より後で終わって"
"はなりません。  nil という値は、バッファのアクセス可能な部分の末尾まで検索す"
"ることを意味します。  引数 <var class=\"var\">move</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、検索に失敗した際は検索範囲の限界まで移"
"動し、nil を返す必要があります。  引数 <var class=\"var\">backward</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、この関数は前の見出しを後方に向"
"かって検索する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">outline-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"outline_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">outline-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"outline_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a function that takes no arguments and should return the "
"level of the current heading.  It&rsquo;s required in both cases: whether "
"you define <code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">outline-search-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は引数を取らず、現在の見出しレベルを返す関数です。<code "
