# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the Lisp functions for printing Lisp "
"objects&mdash;converting objects into their printed representation."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Lispオブジェクトを出力するためのLisp関数――オブジェクトを出力形式に"
"変換する関数――について解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
