"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005c-in-printing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quoting-characters-in-printing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-escape-characters-in-printing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0022-in-printing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005c-in-printing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quoting-characters-in-printing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-escape-characters-in-printing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Some of the Emacs printing functions add quoting characters to the output "
"when necessary so that it can be read properly.  The quoting characters used "
"are &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;; they distinguish strings from symbols, and "
"prevent punctuation characters in strings and symbols from being taken as "
"delimiters when reading.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Printed-"
"Representation.html\">Printed Representation and Read Syntax</a>, for full "
"details.  You specify quoting or no quoting by the choice of printing "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの印刷関数の中には、適切に読み取れるよう、必要に応じて出力にクォート文字"
"を追加するものがあります。使用されるクォート文字は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>&rsquo; で、これらによって文字列とシンボルが区別され、読み取り時に文字列"
"やシンボル内の句読点文字が区切り文字として解釈されるのを防ぎます。詳細につい"
"ては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Printed-Representation.html\">印刷表現と読み取"
"り構文</a>を参照してください。クォートを使用するかどうかは、印刷関数の選択に"
"よって指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If the text is to be read back into Lisp, then you should print with quoting "
"characters to avoid ambiguity.  Likewise, if the purpose is to describe a "
"Lisp object clearly for a Lisp programmer.  However, if the purpose of the "
"output is to look nice for humans, then it is usually better to print "
"without quoting."
msgstr ""
"テキストをLispに読み込ませる場合は、曖昧さを避けるため、クォート文字を用いて"
"出力すべきです。同様に、Lispプログラマー向けにLispオブジェクトを明確に記述す"
"ることが目的である場合も同様です。ただし、出力の目的が人間にとって見栄えを良"
"くすることであるなら、通常はクォートなしで出力する方が適切です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Lisp objects can refer to themselves.  Printing a self-referential object in "
"the normal way would require an infinite amount of text, and the attempt "
"could cause infinite recursion.  Emacs detects such recursion and prints "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#<var class=\"var\">level</var></samp>&rsquo; "
"instead of recursively printing an object already being printed.  For "
"example, here &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#0</samp>&rsquo; indicates a "
"recursive reference to the object at level 0 of the current print operation:"
msgstr ""
"Lispのオブジェクトは自分自身を参照できます。自己参照オブジェクトを通常の方法"
"で出力するとテキストが無限に必要となり、その試みが無限再帰を引き起こす可能性"
"があります。Emacsはこのような再帰を検出し、すでに出力中のオブジェクトを再帰的"
"に出力する代わりに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#<var class=\"var\">level</"
"var></samp>&rsquo; を出力します。例えば、ここでの &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#0</samp>&rsquo; は、現在の出力操作におけるレベル0のオブジェク"
"トへの再帰的な参照を示しています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq foo (list nil))\n"
"     &rArr; (nil)\n"
"(setcar foo foo)\n"
"     &rArr; (#0)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In the functions below, <var class=\"var\">stream</var> stands for an output "
"stream.  (See the previous section for a description of output streams.  "
"Also See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Output-"
"Streams.html#external_002ddebugging_002doutput\">external-debugging-output</"
"a>, a useful stream value for debugging.)  If <var class=\"var\">stream</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or omitted, it defaults to the value "
"of <code class=\"code\">standard-output</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の関数において、<var class=\"var\">stream</var> は出力ストリームを表しま"
"す。（出力ストリームの説明については、前節を参照してください。また、デバッグ"
"に便利なストリーム値である <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Output-"
"Streams.html#external_002ddebugging_002doutput\">external-debugging-output</"
"a> も参照してください。）<var class=\"var\">stream</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、あるいは省略されている場合は、デフォルト"
"で <code class=\"code\">standard-output</code> の値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object &amp;optional "
"stream</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-print\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object &amp;optional "
"stream</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-print\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Lisp-printer\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Lisp-printer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">print</code> function is a convenient way of "
"printing.  It outputs the printed representation of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> to <var class=\"var\">stream</var>, printing in "
"addition one newline before <var class=\"var\">object</var> and another "
"after it.  Quoting characters are used.  <code class=\"code\">print</code> "
"returns <var class=\"var\">object</var>.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">print</code> 関数は、便利な出力手段です。<var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> から <var class=\"var\">stream</var> までの表示形"
"式を出力し、さらに <var class=\"var\">object</var> の前に1行、後にもう1行の改"
"行を出力します。引用符が使用されます。<code class=\"code\">print</code> は "
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> を返します。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(progn (print 'The\\ cat\\ in)\n"
"       (print &quot;the hat&quot;)\n"
"       (print &quot; came back&quot;))\n"
"     &#8867;\n"
"     &#8867; The\\ cat\\ in\n"
"     &#8867;\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;the hat&quot;\n"
"     &#8867;\n"
"     &#8867; &quot; came back&quot;\n"
"     &rArr; &quot; came back&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prin1</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object &amp;optional "
"stream overrides</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prin1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prin1</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object &amp;optional "
"stream overrides</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prin1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function outputs the printed representation of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> to <var class=\"var\">stream</var>.  It does not "
"print newlines to separate output as <code class=\"code\">print</code> does, "
"but it does use quoting characters just like <code class=\"code\">print</"
"code>.  It returns <var class=\"var\">object</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> から <var class=\"var\">stream</"
"var> までの出力結果を出力します。<code class=\"code\">print</code> のように出"
"力を区切るための改行は出力しませんが、<code class=\"code\">print</code> と同"
"様に引用符を使用します。戻り値は <var class=\"var\">object</var> です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(progn (prin1 'The\\ cat\\ in)\n"
"       (prin1 &quot;the hat&quot;)\n"
"       (prin1 &quot; came back&quot;))\n"
"     &#8867; The\\ cat\\ in&quot;the hat&quot;&quot; came back&quot;\n"
"     &rArr; &quot; came back&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">overrides</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it should either be <code class=\"code\">t</code> (which tells <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code> to use the defaults for all printer related "
"variables), or a list of settings.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Output-"
"Overrides.html\">Overriding Output Variables</a>, for details."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">overrides</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、それは <code class=\"code\">t</code>（<code class=\"code\">prin1</"
"code> にすべてのプリンター関連変数のデフォルト値を使用するよう指示するもの）"
"か、あるいは設定のリストである必要があります。詳細は <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Output-Overrides.html\">出力変数のオーバーライド</a> を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">princ</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object &amp;optional "
"stream</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-princ\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">princ</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object &amp;optional "
"stream</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-princ\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function outputs the printed representation of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> to <var class=\"var\">stream</var>.  It returns "
"<var class=\"var\">object</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> から <var class=\"var\">stream</"
"var> までの出力表現を表示します。<var class=\"var\">object</var> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function is intended to produce output that is readable by people, not "
"by <code class=\"code\">read</code>, so it doesn&rsquo;t insert quoting "
"characters and doesn&rsquo;t put double-quotes around the contents of "
"strings.  It does not add any spacing between calls."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">read</code>ではなく人間が読める出力を生成す"
"ることを目的としているため、引用符を挿入せず、文字列の内容にダブルクォートを"
"付けません。また、呼び出し間に空白を挿入することもありません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(progn\n"
"  (princ 'The\\ cat)\n"
"  (princ &quot; in the \\&quot;hat\\&quot;&quot;))\n"
"     &#8867; The cat in the &quot;hat&quot;\n"
"     &rArr; &quot; in the \\&quot;hat\\&quot;&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
