#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<span>20.4 Output Streams<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Output-"
"Streams-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>20.4 出力ストリーム<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Output-"
"Streams-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-stream-_0028for-printing_0029\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-output-stream\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-stream-_0028for-printing_0029\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-output-stream\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"An output stream specifies what to do with the characters produced by "
"printing.  Most print functions accept an output stream as an optional "
"argument.  Here are the possible types of output stream:"
msgstr ""
"出力ストリームは、印刷によって生成された文字をどのように処理するかを指定しま"
"す。ほとんどの印刷関数は、オプション引数として出力ストリームを受け取ります。"
"出力ストリームとして指定可能な型は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-buffer-output-stream\"></a><span><var class=\"var\">buffer</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-buffer-output-stream\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-buffer-output-stream\"></a><span><var class=\"var\">buffer</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-buffer-output-stream\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"The output characters are inserted into <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> at "
"point.  Point advances as characters are inserted."
msgstr ""
"出力文字は、ポイント位置の <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> に挿入されます。文"
"字が挿入されるにつれて、ポイントが進みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-marker-output-stream\"></a><span><var class=\"var\">marker</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-marker-output-stream\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-marker-output-stream\"></a><span><var class=\"var\">marker</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-marker-output-stream\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"The output characters are inserted into the buffer that <var "
"class=\"var\">marker</var> points into, at the marker position.  The marker "
"position advances as characters are inserted.  The value of point in the "
"buffer has no effect on printing when the stream is a marker, and this kind "
"of printing does not move point (except that if the marker points at or "
"before the position of point, point advances with the surrounding text, as "
"usual)."
msgstr ""
"出力文字は、<var class=\"var\">marker</var> が指すバッファのマーカー位置に挿"
"入されます。文字が挿入されるにつれて、マーカー位置は前進します。ストリームが"
"マーカーである場合、バッファ内の point の値は出力に影響せず、この種の出力で"
"は point は移動しません（ただし、マーカーが point の位置またはそれより前の位"
"置を指している場合は、通常通り、point は周囲のテキストとともに前進します）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-function-output-stream\"></a><span><var "
"class=\"var\">function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"function-output-stream\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-function-output-stream\"></a><span><var "
"class=\"var\">function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"function-output-stream\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"The output characters are passed to <var class=\"var\">function</var>, which "
"is responsible for storing them away.  It is called with a single character "
"as argument, as many times as there are characters to be output, and is "
"responsible for storing the characters wherever you want to put them."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-t-output-stream\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">t</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-t-output-stream\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-t-output-stream\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">t</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-t-output-stream\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"The output characters are displayed in the echo area.  If Emacs is running "
"in batch mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">Batch Mode</"
"a>), the output is written to the standard output descriptor instead."
msgstr ""
"出力文字はエコー領域に表示されます。Emacs がバッチモードで動作している場合"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">バッチモード</a>を参照）、出力"
"は代わりに標準出力ディスクリプタに書き出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-nil-output-stream\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-nil-output-stream\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-nil-output-stream\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-nil-output-stream\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> specified as an output stream means to use "
"the value of the <code class=\"code\">standard-output</code> variable "
"instead; that value is the <em class=\"dfn\">default output stream</em>, and "
"must not be <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"出力ストリームとして <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、代わ"
"りに <code class=\"code\">standard-output</code> 変数の値を使用することになり"
"ます。その値は <em class=\"dfn\">デフォルトの出力ストリーム</em> であり、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であってはなりません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"A symbol as output stream is equivalent to the symbol&rsquo;s function "
"definition (if any)."
msgstr ""
"出力ストリームとしてのシンボルは、そのシンボルの関数定義（もしあれば）と同等"
"である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Many of the valid output streams are also valid as input streams.  The "
"difference between input and output streams is therefore more a matter of "
"how you use a Lisp object, than of different types of object."
msgstr ""
"有効な出力ストリームの多くは、入力ストリームとしても有効です。したがって、入"
"力ストリームと出力ストリームの違いは、オブジェクトの種類というよりも、むしろ"
"Lispオブジェクトをどのように利用するかという点にあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of a buffer used as an output stream.  Point is initially "
"located as shown immediately before the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">h</"
"samp>&rsquo; in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">the</samp>&rsquo;.  At the end, "
"point is located directly before that same &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">h</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"以下に、出力ストリームとして使用されるバッファの例を示します。ポイントは最"
"初、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">the</samp>&rsquo;内の&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">h</samp>&rsquo;の直前に位置しています。最後には、ポイントは同"
"じ&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">h</samp>&rsquo;の直前に位置しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
