#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"This is t\n"
"&quot;This is the output&quot;\n"
"&lowast;he contents of foo.\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Now we show a use of a marker as an output stream.  Initially, the marker is "
"in buffer <code class=\"code\">foo</code>, between the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">t</samp>&rsquo; and the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">h</"
"samp>&rsquo; in the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">the</samp>&rsquo;.  At "
"the end, the marker has advanced over the inserted text so that it remains "
"positioned before the same &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">h</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Note that the location of point, shown in the usual fashion, has no effect."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、マーカーを出力ストリームとして使用する例を示します。最初、マーカー"
"は単語 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">the</samp>&rsquo; 内の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">t</samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">h</"
"samp>&rsquo; の間にあるバッファ <code class=\"code\">foo</code> に位置してい"
"ます。最後には、マーカーが挿入されたテキストを越えて移動し、同じ &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">h</samp>&rsquo; の手前に位置したままになります。なお、通"
"常の形式で示されているポイントの位置は、影響を及ぼさないことに注意してくださ"
"い。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"This is the &lowast;output\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq m (copy-marker 10))\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;marker at 10 in foo&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(print &quot;More output for foo.&quot; m)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;More output for foo.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"This is t\n"
"&quot;More output for foo.&quot;\n"
"he &lowast;output\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"m\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;marker at 34 in foo&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid "The following example shows output to the echo area:"
msgstr "以下の例は、エコー領域への出力を示しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(print &quot;Echo Area output&quot; t)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;Echo Area output&quot;\n"
"---------- Echo Area ----------\n"
"&quot;Echo Area output&quot;\n"
"---------- Echo Area ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Finally, we show the use of a function as an output stream.  The function "
"<code class=\"code\">eat-output</code> takes each character that it is given "
"and conses it onto the front of the list <code class=\"code\">last-output</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Building-Lists.html\">Building Cons "
"Cells and Lists</a>).  At the end, the list contains all the characters "
"output, but in reverse order."
msgstr ""
"最後に、関数を出力ストリームとして利用する方法を示します。関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">eat-output</code> は、与えられた各文字を取り出し、それをリス"
"ト <code class=\"code\">last-output</code> の先頭に cons します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Building-Lists.html\">Consセルとリストの構築</a>を参"
"照）。最終的に、リストには出力されたすべての文字が含まれますが、その順序は逆"
"になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq last-output nil)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun eat-output (c)\n"
"  (setq last-output (cons c last-output)))\n"
"     &rArr; eat-output\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(print &quot;This is the output&quot; #'eat-output)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;This is the output&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"last-output\n"
"     &rArr; (10 34 116 117 112 116 117 111 32 101 104\n"
"    116 32 115 105 32 115 105 104 84 34 10)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid "Now we can put the output in the proper order by reversing the list:"
msgstr ""
"これで、リストを逆順にすることで、出力を正しい順序に並べ替えることができま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(concat (nreverse last-output))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;\n"
"\\&quot;This is the output\\&quot;\n"
"&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Streams.html
msgid ""
"Calling <code class=\"code\">concat</code> converts the list to a string so "
"you can see its contents more clearly."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">concat</code> を呼び出すとリストが文字列に変換されるた"
"め、内容をより明確に確認できます。"

