#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>20.6 Variables Affecting Output<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Variables-Affecting-Output\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>20.6 出力に影響を与える変数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Variables-Affecting-Output\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-output_002dcontrolling-variables\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-output_002dcontrolling-variables\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">standard-output</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"standard_002doutput\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">standard-output</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"standard_002doutput\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the default output stream&mdash;the stream "
"that print functions use when the <var class=\"var\">stream</var> argument "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The default is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, meaning display in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値はデフォルトの出力ストリーム&mdash;print関数が<var "
"class=\"var\">stream</var>引数に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を指定した際に"
"使用するストリームです。デフォルトは<code class=\"code\">t</code>で、これはエ"
"コー領域への表示を意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-quoted</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"print_002dquoted\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-quoted</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"print_002dquoted\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means to print quoted "
"forms using abbreviated reader syntax, e.g., <code class=\"code\">(quote "
"foo)</code> prints as <code class=\"code\">'foo</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">(function foo)</code> as <code class=\"code\">#'foo</code>.  "
"The default is <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、短縮されたリーダー構文を用"
"いて引用形式を出力することを意味します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">(quote "
"foo)</code> は <code class=\"code\">'foo</code> として、<code "
"class=\"code\">(function foo)</code> は <code class=\"code\">#'foo</code> と"
"して出力されます。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">t</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-escape-newlines</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-print_002descape_002dnewlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-escape-newlines</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-print_002descape_002dnewlines\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005cn-in-print\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-escape-characters\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005cn-in-print\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-escape-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then newline "
"characters in strings are printed as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</"
"samp>&rsquo; and formfeeds are printed as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\f</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Normally these characters are printed as actual newlines and "
"formfeeds."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、文字列内の改行文字は "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo; として、フォームフィードは "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\f</samp>&rsquo; として出力されます。通常、これ"
"らの文字は実際の改行文字およびフォームフィードとして出力されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable affects the print functions <code class=\"code\">prin1</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">print</code> that print with quoting.  It does not "
"affect <code class=\"code\">princ</code>.  Here is an example using <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code>:"
msgstr ""
"この変数は、クォート付きで出力するprint関数 <code class=\"code\">prin1</"
"code> および <code class=\"code\">print</code> に影響します。<code "
"class=\"code\">princ</code> には影響しません。以下に <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code> を使用した例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(prin1 &quot;a\\nb&quot;)\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;a\n"
"     &#8867; b&quot;\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;a\n"
"b&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((print-escape-newlines t))\n"
"  (prin1 &quot;a\\nb&quot;))\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;a\\nb&quot;\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;a\n"
"b&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"In the second expression, the local binding of <code class=\"code\">print-"
"escape-newlines</code> is in effect during the call to <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code>, but not during the printing of the result."
msgstr ""
"2番目の式では、<code class=\"code\">prin1</code>の呼び出し時には<code "
"class=\"code\">print-escape-newlines</code>のローカル束縛が有効ですが、結果の"
"出力時には有効ではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-escape-control-characters</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-print_002descape_002dcontrol_002dcharacters\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-escape-control-characters</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-print_002descape_002dcontrol_002dcharacters\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, control characters "
"in strings are printed as backslash sequences by the print functions <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1</code> and <code class=\"code\">print</code> that print "
"with quoting.  If this variable and <code class=\"code\">print-escape-"
"newlines</code> are both non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the latter "
"takes precedences for newlines and formfeeds."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、クォート付きで出力する"
"プリント関数 <code class=\"code\">prin1</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">print</code> では、文字列内の制御文字がバックスラッシュのシー"
"ケンスとして出力されます。この変数と <code class=\"code\">print-escape-"
"newlines</code> がともに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、改行およ"
"びフォームフィードについては後者が優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">print-escape-nonascii</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-print_002descape_002dnonascii\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
