# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should be a "
"function that will be called to handle printing of these objects.  The "
"function will be called with two arguments: the object and the <var "
"class=\"var\">noescape</var> flag used by the printing functions (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、これらのオブジェクトの"
"出力処理を行う関数である必要があります。この関数には、オブジェクトと、出力関"
"数で使用される <var class=\"var\">noescape</var> フラグの2つの引数が渡されま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出力関数</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The function should return either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (print the "
"object as usual), or a string (which will be printed), or any other object "
"(don&rsquo;t print the object).  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>（オブジェクトを通常通り出力す"
"る）、文字列（出力される）、またはその他のオブジェクト（出力しない）のいずれ"
"かを返す必要があります。例えば："

