"print_002dnumber_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Output-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a vector used internally by printing to implement the "
"<code class=\"code\">print-circle</code> feature.  You should not use it "
"except to bind it to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> when you bind <code "
