# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/PEX-Definitions.html
msgid "Parsing expressions can be defined using the following syntax:"
msgstr "パース式は、以下の構文で定義できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/PEX-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(and <var class=\"var\">e1</var> <var class=\"var\">e2</"
"var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(and <var class=\"var\">e1</var> <var class=\"var\">e2</"
"var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/PEX-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"A sequence of <abbr class=\"acronym\">PEX</abbr>s that must all be matched.  "
"The <code class=\"code\">and</code> form is optional and implicit."
msgstr ""
"すべて一致させる必要がある<abbr class=\"acronym\">PEX</abbr>のシーケンス。"
"<code class=\"code\">and</code>形式は任意であり、暗黙的です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/PEX-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">e1</var> <var class=\"var\">e2</"
"var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">e1</var> <var class=\"var\">e2</"
"var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/PEX-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"Prioritized choices, meaning that, as in Elisp, the choices are tried in "
"order, and the first successful match is used.  Note that this is distinct "
"from context-free grammars, in which selection between multiple matches is "
"indeterminate."
msgstr ""
"優先選択とは、Elispと同様に、選択肢を順に試行し、最初に一致したものを採用する"
"ことを指します。なお、これは、複数の一致候補からの選択が不定となる文脈自由文"
"法とは異なる点に注意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/PEX-Definitions.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(any)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(any)</code>"

