# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"A package is either a <em class=\"dfn\">simple package</em> or a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">multi-file package</em>.  A simple package is stored in a "
"package archive as a single Emacs Lisp file, while a multi-file package is "
"stored as a tar file (containing multiple Lisp files, and possibly non-Lisp "
"files such as a manual)."
msgstr ""
"パッケージには、<em class=\"dfn\">単純パッケージ</em>と<em class=\"dfn\">マル"
"チファイルパッケージ</em>があります。単純パッケージはパッケージアーカイブに単"
"一のEmacs Lispファイルとして格納され、一方、マルチファイルパッケージはtarファ"
"イル（複数のLispファイルや、場合によってはマニュアルなどの非Lispファイルを含"
"む）として格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"In ordinary usage, the difference between simple packages and multi-file "
"packages is relatively unimportant; the Package Menu interface makes no "
"distinction between them.  However, the procedure for creating them differs, "
"as explained in the following sections."
msgstr ""
"通常の使用においては、単純パッケージと複数ファイルパッケージの違いは比較的重"
"要ではなく、パッケージメニューのインターフェースでは両者を区別しません。ただ"
"し、作成手順は異なり、これについては以下の節で説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Each package (whether simple or multi-file) has certain <em "
"class=\"dfn\">attributes</em>:"
msgstr ""
"各パッケージ（単一ファイルか複数ファイルかを問わず）には、特定の<em "
"class=\"dfn\">属性</em>があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名前"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"A short word (e.g., &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auctex</samp>&rsquo;).  This "
"is usually also the symbol prefix used in the program (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Conventions.html\">Emacs Lisp Coding "
"Conventions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"短い単語（例：&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auctex</samp>&rsquo;）。これは通"
"常、プログラムで使用されるシンボル接頭辞でもあります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Coding-Conventions.html\">Emacs Lisp コーディング規約</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid "Version"
msgstr "バージョン"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"A version number, in a form that the function <code class=\"code\">version-"
"to-list</code> understands (e.g., &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">11.86</"
"samp>&rsquo;).  Each release of a package should be accompanied by an "
"increase in the version number so that it will be recognized as an upgrade "
"by users querying the package archive."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">version-to-list</code> が認識できる形式（例："
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">11.86</samp>&rsquo;）のバージョン番号。パッケージ"
"の各リリースではバージョン番号をインクリメントする必要があり、これによりパッ"
"ケージアーカイブを参照するユーザーがアップグレードとして認識できるようになり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid "Brief description"
msgstr "簡単な説明"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"This is shown when the package is listed in the Package Menu.  It should "
"occupy a single line, ideally in 36 characters or less."
msgstr ""
"これは、パッケージメニューにパッケージが表示されている際に表示されます。1行に"
"収め、理想的には36文字以内とする必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid "Long description"
msgstr "長い説明"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"This is shown in the buffer created by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h P</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-package</code>), following the package&rsquo;s brief "
"description and installation status.  It normally spans multiple lines, and "
"should fully describe the package&rsquo;s capabilities and how to begin "
"using it once it is installed."
msgstr ""
"これは、パッケージの簡潔な説明とインストール状況に続き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"h P</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-package</code>) によって作成された"
"バッファに表示されます。通常は複数行にわたり、パッケージの機能や、インストー"
"ル後の利用開始方法が詳細に記述されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr "依存関係"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"A list of other packages (possibly including minimal acceptable version "
"numbers) on which this package depends.  The list may be empty, meaning this "
"package has no dependencies.  Otherwise, installing this package also "
"automatically installs its dependencies, recursively; if any dependency "
"cannot be found, the package cannot be installed."
msgstr ""
"本パッケージが依存するその他のパッケージの一覧（許容可能な最小バージョン番号"
"が含まれる場合があります）。この一覧は空である場合があり、その場合は本パッ"
"ケージに依存関係がないことを意味します。そうでない場合、本パッケージをインス"
"トールすると、その依存関係も再帰的に自動的にインストールされます。いずれかの"
"依存関係が見つからない場合、本パッケージはインストールできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-content-directory_002c-package\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-content-directory_002c-package\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Installing a package, either via the command <code class=\"code\">package-"
"install-file</code>, or via the Package Menu, creates a subdirectory of "
"<code class=\"code\">package-user-dir</code> named <samp class=\"file\"><var "
"class=\"var\">name</var>-<var class=\"var\">version</var></samp>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is the package&rsquo;s name and <var "
"class=\"var\">version</var> its version (e.g., <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/elpa/auctex-11.86/</samp>).  We call this the "
"package&rsquo;s <em class=\"dfn\">content directory</em>.  It is where Emacs "
"puts the package&rsquo;s contents (the single Lisp file for a simple "
"package, or the files extracted from a multi-file package)."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">package-install-file</code> またはパッケージメ"
"ニュー経由でパッケージをインストールすると、<code class=\"code\">package-"
"user-dir</code> の下に <samp class=\"file\"><var class=\"var\">name</var>-"
"<var class=\"var\">version</var></samp> という名前のサブディレクトリが作成さ"
"れます。ここで <var class=\"var\">name</var> はパッケージ名、<var "
"class=\"var\">version</var> はそのバージョン（例：<samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/elpa/auctex-11.86/</samp>）です。これをパッケージ"
"の <em class=\"dfn\">コンテンツディレクトリ</em> と呼びます。Emacs はここに"
"パッケージの内容（シンプルなパッケージの場合は単一の Lisp ファイル、複数ファ"
"イルからなるパッケージの場合はそこから抽出されたファイル）を格納します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-package-autoloads\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-package-autoloads\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Emacs then searches every Lisp file in the content directory for autoload "
"magic comments (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Autoload.html\">Autoload</"
"a>).  These autoload definitions are saved to a file named <samp "
"class=\"file\"><var class=\"var\">name</var>-autoloads.el</samp> in the "
"content directory.  They are typically used to autoload the principal user "
"commands defined in the package, but they can also perform other tasks, such "
"as adding an element to <code class=\"code\">auto-mode-alist</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-Mode.html\">How Emacs Chooses a Major "
"Mode</a>).  Note that a package typically does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> "
"autoload every function and variable defined within it&mdash;only the "
"handful of commands typically called to begin using the package.  Emacs then "
"byte-compiles every Lisp file in the package."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"After installation, the installed package is <em class=\"dfn\">loaded</em>: "
"Emacs adds the package&rsquo;s content directory to <code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code>, and evaluates the autoload definitions in "
"<samp class=\"file\"><var class=\"var\">name</var>-autoloads.el</samp>."
msgstr ""
"インストール後、インストールされたパッケージが<em class=\"dfn\">ロード</em>さ"
"れます。Emacsはパッケージのコンテンツディレクトリを<code class=\"code\">load-"
"path</code>に追加し、<samp class=\"file\"><var class=\"var\">name</var>-"
"autoloads.el</samp>内のオートロード定義を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Whenever Emacs starts up, it automatically calls the function <code "
"class=\"code\">package-activate-all</code> to make installed packages "
"available to the current session.  This is done after loading the early init "
"file, but before loading the regular init file (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">Summary: Sequence of Actions at Startup</a>).  "
"Packages are not automatically made available if the user option <code "
"class=\"code\">package-enable-at-startup</code> is set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> in the early init file."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが起動するたびに、インストール済みパッケージを現在のセッションで利用でき"
"るよう、関数 <code class=\"code\">package-activate-all</code> が自動的に呼び"
"出されます。これは、初期初期化ファイルの読み込み後、通常の初期化ファイルの読"
"み込み前に行われます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">概要："
"起動時の動作シーケンス</a>を参照）。初期初期化ファイルでユーザーオプション "
"<code class=\"code\">package-enable-at-startup</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されている場合、パッケージは自動的に利用でき"
"なくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">package-activate-all</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"package_002dactivate_002dall\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">package-activate-all</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"package_002dactivate_002dall\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"This function makes the packages available to the current session.  The user "
"option <code class=\"code\">package-load-list</code> specifies which "
"packages to make available; by default, all installed packages are made "
"available.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Package-Installation.html#Package-"
"Installation\">Package Installation</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のセッションでパッケージを利用可能にします。ユーザーオプショ"
"ン <code class=\"code\">package-load-list</code> で利用可能にするパッケージを"
"指定します。デフォルトでは、インストール済みのすべてのパッケージが利用可能に"
"なります。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Package-Installation.html#Package-Installation\">パッケージのインストー"
"ル</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Packaging-Basics.html
msgid ""
"In most cases, you should not need to call <code class=\"code\">package-"
"activate-all</code>, as this is done automatically during startup.  Simply "
"make sure to put any code that should run before <code "
"class=\"code\">package-activate-all</code> in the early init file, and any "
"code that should run after it in the primary init file (see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Init-File.html#Init-File\">Init File</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの場合、起動時に自動的に行われるため、<code class=\"code\">package-"
"activate-all</code>を呼び出す必要はありません。単に、<code "
"class=\"code\">package-activate-all</code>より前に実行すべきコードは初期初期"
"化ファイルに、その後に実行すべきコードはメインの初期化ファイルに記述するよう"
"にしてください（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Init-File.html#Init-File\">初期化ファイル</a>を参照してください）。"

