#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.4.1 Access to Frame Parameters<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Access-to-Frame-Parameters\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.4.1 フレームパラメータへのアクセス<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Access-to-Frame-Parameters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"These functions let you read and change the parameter values of a frame."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数を使用すると、フレームのパラメータ値を読み取ったり変更したりでき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-parameter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame "
"parameter</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"frame_002dparameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-parameter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame "
"parameter</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"frame_002dparameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value of the parameter <var "
"class=\"var\">parameter</var> (a symbol) of <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"returns the selected frame&rsquo;s parameter.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var> has no setting for <var class=\"var\">parameter</var>, this function "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame</var>のパラメータ<var "
"class=\"var\">parameter</var>（シンボル）の値を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合は、選択"
"されたフレームのパラメータを返します。<var class=\"var\">frame</var>に<var "
"class=\"var\">parameter</var>の設定がない場合は、この関数は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-parameters</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-frame_002dparameters\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">frame-parameters</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-frame_002dparameters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">frame-parameters</code> returns an alist "
"listing all the parameters of <var class=\"var\">frame</var> and their "
"values.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> or omitted, this returns the selected frame&rsquo;s parameters"
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">frame-parameters</code> は、<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> のすべてのパラメータとその値を列挙したアリストを返"
"します。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"あるか、あるいは省略されている場合は、選択されたフレームのパラメータを返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">modify-frame-parameters</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">frame alist</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"modify_002dframe_002dparameters\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">modify-frame-parameters</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">frame alist</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"modify_002dframe_002dparameters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"This function alters the frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var> based on the "
"elements of <var class=\"var\">alist</var>.  Each element of <var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var> has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">parm</var> . <var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>, where "
"<var class=\"var\">parm</var> is a symbol naming a parameter.  If you "
"don&rsquo;t mention a parameter in <var class=\"var\">alist</var>, its value "
"doesn&rsquo;t change.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">alist</var>の要素に基づいてフレーム<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>を変更します。<var class=\"var\">alist</var>の各要素"
"は<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">parm</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>の形式をしており、ここで<var "
"class=\"var\">parm</var>はパラメータ名を示すシンボルです。<var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var>でパラメータを指定しない場合、その値は変更されませ"
"ん。<var class=\"var\">frame</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場"
"合、選択されたフレームがデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"Some parameters are only meaningful for frames on certain kinds of display "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a>).  If <var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var> includes parameters that are not meaningful for "
"the <var class=\"var\">frame</var>&rsquo;s display, this function will "
"change its value in the frame&rsquo;s parameter list, but will otherwise "
"ignore it."
msgstr ""
"一部のパラメータは、特定の種類のディスプレイ上のフレームにおいてのみ意味を持"
"ちます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a>を参照）。<var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var>に<var class=\"var\">frame</var>のディスプレイでは意"
"味を持たないパラメータが含まれている場合、この関数はフレームのパラメータリス"
"ト内のその値を変更しますが、それ以外の場合は無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parameter-Access.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">alist</var> specifies more than one parameter whose "
"value can affect the new size of <var class=\"var\">frame</var>, the final "
"size of the frame may differ according to the toolkit used.  For example, "
"specifying that a frame should from now on have a menu and/or tool bar "
"instead of none and simultaneously specifying the new height of the frame "
"will inevitably lead to a recalculation of the frame&rsquo;s height.  "
"Conceptually, in such case, this function will try to have the explicit "
"height specification prevail.  It cannot be excluded, however, that the "
"addition (or removal)  of the menu or tool bar, when eventually performed by "
"the toolkit, will defeat this intention."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">alist</var> で、<var class=\"var\">frame</var> の新しいサ"
"イズに影響を与えうるパラメータを複数指定した場合、フレームの最終的なサイズは"
"使用するツールキットによって異なる可能性があります。例えば、フレームに今後"
"「なし」ではなくメニューおよび/またはツールバーを設けるよう指定し、同時にフ"
"レームの新しい高さを指定した場合、必然的にフレームの高さの再計算が行われま"
"す。概念的には、このような場合、この関数は明示的な高さの指定を優先させようと"
