# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parser-state\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parser-state\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">parser state</em> is a list of (currently) eleven "
"elements describing the state of the syntactic parser, after it parses the "
"text between a specified starting point and a specified end point in the "
"buffer using <code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html\">Low-Level Parsing</a>).  "
"Parsing functions such as <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Position-Parse.html\">Finding the Parse State for a "
"Position</a>)  also return a parser state as the value.  <code "
"class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> can accept a parser state as an "
"argument, for resuming parsing."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">パーサー状態</em>とは、バッファ内の指定された開始点と終了点"
"の間のテキストを<code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code>を用いて解析し"
"た後の、構文パーサーの状態を記述する（現時点で）11個の要素からなるリストのこ"
"とです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html\">低レベル解析</"
"a>を参照）。<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Position-Parse.html\">位置に対応するパーサー状態の取得</a>を参照）など"
"の解析関数も、値としてパーサー状態を返します。<code class=\"code\">parse-"
"partial-sexp</code>は、解析を再開するためにパーサー状態を引数として受け取るこ"
"とができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid "Here are the meanings of the elements of the parser state:"
msgstr "パーサー状態の各要素の意味は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"The depth in parentheses, counting from 0.  <strong class=\"strong\">Warning:"
"</strong> this can be negative if there are more close parens than open "
"parens between the parser&rsquo;s starting point and end point."
msgstr ""
"0から始まる括弧内の深度。  <strong class=\"strong\">注意：</strong> パーサー"
"の開始点と終了点の間に、開き括弧よりも閉じ括弧の方が多い場合、この値は負にな"
"ることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-innermost-containing-parentheses\"></"
"a> The character position of the start of the innermost parenthetical "
"grouping containing the stopping point; <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"none."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-innermost-containing-parentheses\"></"
"a> 停止点を含む最内層の括弧グループの開始位置；<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> ない場合はなし。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-previous-complete-subexpression\"></"
"a> The character position of the start of the last complete subexpression "
"terminated; <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if none."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-previous-complete-subexpression\"></"
"a> 終了した最後の完全な部分式の開始位置；ない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inside-string\"></a> Non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if inside a string.  More precisely, this is the "
"character that will terminate the string, or <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"if a generic string delimiter character should terminate it."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inside-string\"></a> 文字列内の場合は "
"Non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>。より正確には、これは文字列を終端させる文"
"字であり、汎用的な文字列区切り文字で終端させる場合は <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inside-comment\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if inside a non-nestable comment (of any comment "
"style; see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Flags.html\">Syntax Flags</a>); "
"or the comment nesting level if inside a comment that can be nested."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inside-comment\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> ネスト不可能なコメント（コメントスタイルを問わず。<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Flags.html\">構文フラグ</a>を参照）内にある場"
"合、またはネスト可能なコメント内にある場合はそのコメントのネストレベル。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quote-character\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if the end point is just after a quote character."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quote-character\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> 終端点が引用符の直後にある場合。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid "The minimum parenthesis depth encountered during this scan."
msgstr "このスキャン中に検出された最小の括弧の深さ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"What kind of comment is active: <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if not in a "
"comment or in a comment of style &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</"
"samp>&rsquo;; 1 for a comment of style &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b</"
"samp>&rsquo;; 2 for a comment of style &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</"
"samp>&rsquo;; and <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> for a comment "
"that should be ended by a generic comment delimiter character."
msgstr ""
"どのようなコメントが有効か：コメント内でない場合、またはスタイル &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; のコメント内であれば <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>、スタイル &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b</"
"samp>&rsquo; のコメントであれば 1、スタイル &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</"
"samp>&rsquo; のコメントであれば 2、そして汎用的なコメント区切り文字で終了すべ"
"きコメントであれば <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"The string or comment start position.  While inside a comment, this is the "
"position where the comment began; while inside a string, this is the "
"position where the string began.  When outside of strings and comments, this "
"element is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"文字列またはコメントの開始位置。コメント内の場合はコメントが始まった位置、文"
"字列内の場合は文字列が始まった位置となります。文字列やコメントの外にある場"
"合、この要素は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"The list of the positions of the currently open parentheses, starting with "
"the outermost."
msgstr "最外のものから順に、現在開いている括弧の位置の一覧。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"When the last buffer position scanned was the (potential) first character of "
"a two character construct (comment delimiter or escaped/char-quoted "
"character pair), the <var class=\"var\">syntax-code</var> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-Internals.html\">Syntax Table Internals</"
"a>) of that position.  Otherwise <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"最後にスキャンされたバッファ位置が、2文字構成要素（コメント区切り記号、または"
"エスケープ済み/文字引用符で囲まれた文字ペア）の（潜在的な）先頭文字であった場"
"合は、その位置の <var class=\"var\">syntax-code</var>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Syntax-Table-Internals.html\">構文テーブルの内部仕様</a>を参照）。それ"
"以外の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"Elements 1, 2, and 6 are ignored in a state which you pass as an argument to "
"<code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> to continue parsing.  "
"Elements 9 and 10 are mainly used internally by the parser code."
msgstr ""
"要素1、2、6は、パースを継続するために<code class=\"code\">parse-partial-"
"sexp</code>に引数として渡す状態で無視されます。要素9と10は、主にパーサーコー"
"ド内部で使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"Some additional useful information is available from a parser state using "
