# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-ppss-toplevel-pos</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">state</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"syntax_002dppss_002dtoplevel_002dpos\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-ppss-toplevel-pos</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">state</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"syntax_002dppss_002dtoplevel_002dpos\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"This function extracts, from parser state <var class=\"var\">state</var>, "
"the last position scanned in the parse which was at top level in grammatical "
"structure.  &ldquo;At top level&rdquo; means outside of any parentheses, "
"comments, or strings."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、パーサー状態 <var class=\"var\">state</var> から、構文構造のトッ"
"プレベルにあった、パース中に最後にスキャンされた位置を抽出します。「トップレ"
"ベル」とは、括弧、コメント、または文字列の外側であることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">state</"
"var> represents a parse which has arrived at a top level position."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">state</var> がトップレベルの位置に到達した構文解析を表す場"
"合、その値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser-State.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
