#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.7.10 Parser-based Font Lock<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.7.10 パーサーベースのFont Lock<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parser_002dbased-font_002dlock\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font_002dlock_002c-using-"
"tree_002dsitter\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parser_002dbased-font_002dlock\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font_002dlock_002c-using-"
"tree_002dsitter\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Besides simple syntactic font lock and regexp-based font lock, Emacs also "
"provides complete syntactic font lock with the help of a parser.  Currently, "
"Emacs uses the tree-sitter library (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Parsing-"
"Program-Source.html\">Parsing Program Source</a>) for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"単純な構文ベースのフォントロックや正規表現ベースのフォントロックに加え、Emacs"
"ではパーサーを用いた完全な構文ベースのフォントロックも提供しています。現在、"
"Emacsではこの目的でtree-sitterライブラリ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Parsing-"
"Program-Source.html\">プログラムソースの解析</a>を参照）を使用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Parser-based font lock and other font lock mechanisms are not mutually "
"exclusive.  By default, if enabled, parser-based font lock runs first, "
"replacing syntactic font lock, followed by regexp-based font lock."
msgstr ""
"パーサーベースのフォントロックと他のフォントロック機構は、相互に排他的なもの"
"ではありません。デフォルトでは、有効になっている場合、まずパーサーベースの"
"フォントロックが実行されて構文ベースのフォントロックを置き換え、続いて正規表"
"現ベースのフォントロックが実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Although parser-based font lock doesn&rsquo;t share the same customization "
"variables with regexp-based font lock, it uses similar customization "
"schemes.  The tree-sitter counterpart of <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"keywords</code> is <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-settings</code>."
msgstr ""
"パーサーベースのフォントロックは、正規表現ベースのフォントロックと同じカスタ"
"マイズ変数を共有しているわけではありませんが、同様のカスタマイズ方式を採用し"
"ています。<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code>に対応するTree-sitter"
"の表記は<code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-settings</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tree_002dsitter-fontifications_002c-"
"overview\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fontifications-with-"
"tree_002dsitter_002c-overview\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tree_002dsitter-fontifications_002c-"
"overview\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fontifications-with-"
"tree_002dsitter_002c-overview\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "In general, tree-sitter fontification works as follows:"
msgstr "一般的に、Tree-sitterのフォント化は次のように動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"A Lisp program (usually, part of a major mode) provides a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">query</em> consisting of <em class=\"dfn\">patterns</em>, each "
"pattern associated with a <em class=\"dfn\">capture name</em>."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラム（通常はメジャーモードの一部）は、<em class=\"dfn\">パターン</"
"em>からなる<em class=\"dfn\">クエリ</em>を提供し、各パターンには<em "
"class=\"dfn\">キャプチャ名</em>が関連付けられている。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"The tree-sitter library finds the nodes in the parse tree that match these "
"patterns, tags the nodes with the corresponding capture names, and returns "
"them to the Lisp program."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterライブラリは、構文木の中からこれらのパターンに一致するノードを検出"
"し、対応するキャプチャ名をタグ付けして、Lispプログラムに返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"The Lisp program uses the returned nodes to highlight the portions of buffer "
"text corresponding to each node as appropriate, using the tagged capture "
"names of the nodes to determine the correct fontification.  For example, a "
"node tagged <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword</code> would be "
"highlighted in <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword</code> face."
msgstr ""
"このLispプログラムは、返されたノードを用いて、各ノードに対応するバッファテキ"
"ストの箇所を適切にハイライトします。その際、ノードに付与されたキャプチャ名に"
"基づいて、適切なフォントを適用します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"keyword</code> というタグが付いたノードは、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"keyword</code> フォントでハイライトされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"For more information about queries, patterns, and capture names, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Pattern-Matching.html\">Pattern Matching Tree-sitter "
"Nodes</a>."
msgstr ""
"クエリ、パターン、キャプチャ名の詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Pattern-Matching.html\">パターンマッチング Tree-sitter ノード</a>を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"To set up tree-sitter fontification, a major mode should first set <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-settings</code> with the output of <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-rules</code>, then call <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-major-mode-setup</code>."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterのフォント化を設定するには、まずメジャーモードが<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-rules</code>の出力を用いて<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-settings</code>を設定し、次に<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-major-mode-setup</code>を呼び出す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-font-lock-rules</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest query-specs</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002dfont_002dlock_002drules\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-font-lock-rules</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest query-specs</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002dfont_002dlock_002drules\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This function is used to set <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-"
"settings</code>.  It takes care of compiling queries and other post-"
"processing, and outputs a value that <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-"
"settings</code> accepts.  Here&rsquo;s an example:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-settings</code> を設定する"
"ために使用されます。クエリのコンパイルやその他の後処理を行い、<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-settings</code> が受け付ける値を出力します。"
"以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(treesit-font-lock-rules\n"
" :language 'javascript\n"
" :feature 'constant\n"
" :override t\n"
" '((true) @font-lock-constant-face\n"
"   (false) @font-lock-constant-face)\n"
" :language 'html\n"
" :feature 'script\n"
" &quot;(script_element) @font-lock-builtin-face&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This function takes a series of <var class=\"var\">query-spec</var>s, where "
"each <var class=\"var\">query-spec</var> is a <var class=\"var\">query</var> "
"preceded by one or more <var class=\"var\">keyword</var>/<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> pairs.  Each <var class=\"var\">query</var> is a "
"tree-sitter query in either the string, s-expression, or compiled form."
msgstr ""
"この関数は一連の <var class=\"var\">query-spec</var> を受け取ります。ここで"
"各 <var class=\"var\">query-spec</var> は、1つ以上の <var "
"class=\"var\">keyword</var>/<var class=\"var\">value</var> ペアに先行する "
"<var class=\"var\">query</var> です。各 <var class=\"var\">query</var> は、文"
"字列、s-expression、またはコンパイル済み形式のいずれかにおける Tree-sitter ク"
"エリです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"For each <var class=\"var\">query</var>, the <var class=\"var\">keyword</"
"var>/<var class=\"var\">value</var> pairs that precede it add meta "
"information to it.  The <code class=\"code\">:language</code> keyword "
"declares <var class=\"var\">query</var>&rsquo;s language.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">:feature</code> keyword sets the feature name of <var "
"class=\"var\">query</var>.  Users can control which features are enabled "
"with <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-level</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-feature-list</code> (described below).  "
"These two keywords are mandatory (with exceptions)."
msgstr ""
"各<var class=\"var\">query</var>に対して、その前にある<var "
"class=\"var\">keyword</var>/<var class=\"var\">value</var>のペアがメタ情報を"
"付与します。<code class=\"code\">:language</code>キーワードは<var "
"class=\"var\">query</var>の言語を指定します。<code class=\"code\">:feature</"
"code>キーワードは<var class=\"var\">query</var>の機能名を設定します。ユーザー"
"は<code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-level</code>および<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-feature-list</code>（後述）を用いて、どの機"
"能を有効にするかを制御できます。これら2つのキーワードは必須です（例外あり）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "Other keywords are optional:"
