# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><table><tbody><tr><td>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:default-language</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:default-language</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><table><tbody><tr><td>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">language</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">language</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><table><tbody><tr><td>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Every <var class=\"var\">query</var> after this keyword will use <var "
"class=\"var\">language</var> by default."
msgstr ""
"このキーワード以降のすべての <var class=\"var\">query</var> は、デフォルトで "
"<var class=\"var\">language</var> が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Lisp programs mark patterns in <var class=\"var\">query</var> with capture "
"names (names that start with <code class=\"code\">@</code>), and tree-sitter "
"will return matched nodes tagged with those same capture names.  For the "
"purpose of fontification, capture names in <var class=\"var\">query</var> "
"should be face names like <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword-face</"
"code>.  The captured node will be fontified with that face."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラムは<var class=\"var\">query</var>内のパターンにキャプチャ名"
"（<code class=\"code\">@</code>で始まる名前）を付与し、tree-sitterはそれらと"
"同じキャプチャ名がタグ付けされた一致ノードを返します。フォント化にあたって"
"は、<var class=\"var\">query</var>内のキャプチャ名は<code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword-face</code>のようなフェイス名である必要があ"
"ります。キャプチャされたノードは、そのフェイスでフォント化されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dfontify_002dwith_002doverride\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dfontify_002dwith_002doverride\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"A capture name can also be a function name, in which case the function is "
"called with 4 arguments: <var class=\"var\">node</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">override</var>, <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>, where <var class=\"var\">node</var> is the node "
"itself, <var class=\"var\">override</var> is the <code "
"class=\"code\">:override</code> property of the rule which captured this "
"node, and <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> "
"limit the region which this function should fontify.  (If this function "
"wants to respect the <var class=\"var\">override</var> argument, it can use "
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-fontify-with-override</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"キャプチャ名には関数名を指定することもでき、その場合、関数は <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> と <var class=\"var\">override</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> という4つの引数で呼"
