"passing to <code class=\"code\">peg-run</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pexs</var>を、<code class=\"code\">peg-run</code>に渡せる"
"単一のペグマッチャーに変換する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parsing-Expression-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">peg-parse</code> example above expands to a set of "
"calls to these functions, and could be written in full as:"
msgstr ""
"上記の <code class=\"code\">peg-parse</code> の例は、これらの関数への呼び出し"
"群に展開され、全文で記述すると次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Parsing-Expression-Grammars.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(with-peg-rules\n"
"    ((number sign digit (* digit))\n"
"     (sign   (or &quot;+&quot; &quot;-&quot; &quot;&quot;))\n"
"     (digit  [0-9]))\n"
"  (peg-run (peg number)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Parsing-Expression-Grammars.html
msgid ""
"This approach allows more explicit control over the &ldquo;entry-"
"point&rdquo; of parsing, and allows the combination of rules from different "
