# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">query</em> consists of multiple <em "
"class=\"dfn\">patterns</em>.  Each pattern is an s-expression that matches a "
"certain node in the syntax node.  A pattern has the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var>&nbsp;(<var "
"class=\"var\">child</var>&hellip;))</code>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">クエリ</em>は、複数の<em class=\"dfn\">パターン</em>で構成"
"されます。各パターンは、構文ノード内の特定のノードにマッチするs式です。パター"
"ンは<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">type</var>&nbsp;(<var "
"class=\"var\">child</var>&hellip;))</code>という形式をとります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"For example, a pattern that matches a <code "
"class=\"code\">binary_expression</code> node that contains <code "
"class=\"code\">number_literal</code> child nodes would look like"
msgstr ""
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">number_literal</code> 子ノードを含む <code "
"class=\"code\">binary_expression</code> ノードにマッチするパターンは、次のよ"
"うになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(binary_expression (number_literal))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"To <em class=\"dfn\">capture</em> a node using the query pattern above, "
"append <code class=\"code\">@<var class=\"var\">capture-name</var></code> "
"after the node pattern you want to capture.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"上記のクエリパターンを用いてノードを<em class=\"dfn\">キャプチャ</em>するに"
"は、キャプチャしたいノードパターンの後に <code class=\"code\">@<var "
"class=\"var\">capture-name</var></code> を付加します。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(binary_expression (number_literal) @number-in-exp)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"captures <code class=\"code\">number_literal</code> nodes that are inside a "
"<code class=\"code\">binary_expression</code> node with the capture name "
"<code class=\"code\">number-in-exp</code>."
msgstr ""
"キャプチャ名 <code class=\"code\">number-in-exp</code> の <code "
"class=\"code\">binary_expression</code> ノード内にある <code "
"class=\"code\">number_literal</code> ノードをキャプチャします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"We can capture the <code class=\"code\">binary_expression</code> node as "
"well, with, for example, the capture name <code class=\"code\">biexp</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">binary_expression</code> ノードも、例えばキャプチャ名 "
"<code class=\"code\">biexp</code> としてキャプチャできます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(binary_expression\n"
" (number_literal) @number-in-exp) @biexp\n"
msgstr ""

