#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid "Now we can introduce the <em class=\"dfn\">query functions</em>."
msgstr "ここで<em class=\"dfn\">クエリ関数</em>を紹介します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-query-capture</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">node "
"query &amp;optional beg end node-only grouped</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-treesit_002dquery_002dcapture\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-query-capture</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">node "
"query &amp;optional beg end node-only grouped</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-treesit_002dquery_002dcapture\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"This function matches patterns in <var class=\"var\">query</var> within <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">query</var> can "
"be either an s-expression, a string, or a compiled query object.  For now, "
"we focus on the s-expression syntax; string syntax and compiled queries are "
"described at the end of the section."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">node</var> 内の <var class=\"var\">query</"
"var> のパターンにマッチします。引数 <var class=\"var\">query</var> には、s"
"式、文字列、またはコンパイル済みクエリオブジェクトのいずれかを指定できます。"
"ここではまず s式の構文に焦点を当て、文字列の構文とコンパイル済みクエリについ"
"ては本節の最後で説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">node</var> can also be a parser or a "
"language symbol.  A parser means use its root node, a language symbol means "
"find or create a parser for that language in the current buffer, and use the "
"root node."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">node</var> は、パーサーや言語シンボルである場合もあり"
"ます。パーサーとはそのルートノードを使用することを意味し、言語シンボルとは、"
"現在のバッファ内でその言語用のパーサーを検索または作成し、そのルートノードを"
"使用することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"The function returns all the captured nodes in an alist with elements of the "
"form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">capture_name</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;"
"<var class=\"var\">node</var>)</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">node-only</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it returns the list of <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var>s instead.  By default the entire text of <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> is searched, but if <var class=\"var\">beg</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">end</var> are both non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, they specify the region of buffer text where this function should "
"match nodes.  Any matching node whose span overlaps with the region between "
"<var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> is captured; "
"it doesn&rsquo;t have to be completely contained in the region."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、キャプチャされたすべてのノードを、<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">capture_name</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">node</var>)</"
"code> 形式の要素を持つアリストとして返します。<var class=\"var\">node-only</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、代わりに <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> のリストを返します。デフォルトでは <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> のテキスト全体が検索対象となりますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> がともに <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、それらはこの関数がノードをマッチさ"
"せるべきバッファテキストの範囲を指定します。<var class=\"var\">beg</var> と "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> の間の範囲とスパンが重なるマッチしたノードはすべ"
