# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"Tree-sitter recognizes quantification operators &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">:*</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:+</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:?</samp>&rsquo;.  Their "
"meanings are the same as in regular expressions: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">:*</samp>&rsquo; matches the preceding pattern zero or more "
"times, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:+</samp>&rsquo; matches one or more "
"times, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:?</samp>&rsquo; matches zero or one "
"times."
msgstr ""
