# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"The anchor operator <code class=\"code\">:anchor</code> can be used to "
"enforce juxtaposition, i.e., to enforce two things to be directly next to "
"each other.  The two &ldquo;things&rdquo; can be two nodes, or a child and "
"the end of its parent.  For example, to capture the first child, the last "
"child, or two adjacent children:"
msgstr ""
"アンカー演算子 <code class=\"code\">:anchor</code> を使用すると、並置（つま"
"り、2つの要素を直接的に隣接させること）を強制できます。この2つの「要素」と"
"は、2つのノード、あるいは子要素とその親要素の末尾を指します。例えば、最初の子"
"要素、最後の子要素、または隣接する2つの子要素をキャプチャする場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Anchor the child with the end of its parent.\n"
"(compound_expression (_) @last-child :anchor)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Anchor the child with the beginning of its parent.\n"
"(compound_expression :anchor (_) @first-child)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Anchor two adjacent children.\n"
"(compound_expression\n"
" (_) @prev-child\n"
" :anchor\n"
" (_) @next-child)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid "Note that the enforcement of juxtaposition ignores any anonymous nodes."
msgstr "なお、並置の適用では匿名ノードは無視される点に注意してください。"

