# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"tree-sitter only matches arrays where the first element is equal to the last "
"element.  To attach a predicate to a pattern, we need to group them "
"together.  Currently there are three predicates: <code class=\"code\">:eq?</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">:match?</code>, and <code class=\"code\">:pred?</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterは、最初の要素が最後の要素と等しい配列にのみマッチします。パターン"
"に述語を紐付けるには、それらをグループ化する必要があります。現在、<code "
"class=\"code\">:eq?</code>、<code class=\"code\">:match?</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">:pred?</code>の3つの述語があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Predicate: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">:eq?</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg1 arg2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_003aeq_003f\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">述語: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">:eq?</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg1 arg2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_003aeq_003f\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"Matches if <var class=\"var\">arg1</var> is equal to <var "
"class=\"var\">arg2</var>.  Arguments can be either strings or capture "
"names.  Capture names represent the text that the captured node spans in the "
"buffer.  Note that this is more like <code class=\"code\">equal</code> in "
"Elisp, but <code class=\"code\">eq?</code> is the convention used by tree-"
"sitter.  Previously we supported the <code class=\"code\">:equal</code> "
"predicate but it&rsquo;s now considered deprecated."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">arg1</var> が <var class=\"var\">arg2</var> と等しい場合に"
"マッチします。引数には文字列またはキャプチャ名を指定できます。キャプチャ名"
"は、キャプチャされたノードがバッファ内でまたがるテキストを表します。これは "
