"<code class=\"code\">treesit-query-eagerly-compiled-p</code> を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern-Matching.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">query</var> is malformed or language can&rsquo;t be "
"loaded, this function signals <code class=\"code\">treesit-query-error</"
"code>.  Obviously this will only happen when <var class=\"var\">eager</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, since otherwise Emacs doesn&rsquo;t "
"actually compile <var class=\"var\">query</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">query</var> の形式が不正であるか、あるいは言語をロードでき"
