# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.4 Pattern-Matching Conditional<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.4 パターンマッチング Conditional<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pcase\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-pattern-matching_002c-programming-style\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pcase\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-pattern-matching_002c-programming-style\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"Aside from the four basic conditional forms, Emacs Lisp also has a pattern-"
"matching conditional form, the <code class=\"code\">pcase</code> macro, a "
"hybrid of <code class=\"code\">cond</code> and <code class=\"code\">cl-case</"
"code> (see <a data-manual=\"cl\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/cl/Conditionals.html#Conditionals\">Conditionals</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">Common Lisp Extensions</cite>)  that overcomes their "
"limitations and introduces the <em class=\"dfn\">pattern matching "
"programming style</em>.  The limitations that <code class=\"code\">pcase</"
"code> overcomes are:"
msgstr ""
"4つの基本的な条件式形式に加え、Emacs Lispにはパターンマッチング条件式形式であ"
"る<code class=\"code\">pcase</code>マクロがあります。これは<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code>と<code class=\"code\">cl-case</code>のハイブリッド"
"であり（<cite class=\"cite\">Common Lisp Extensions</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"cl\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/cl/"
"Conditionals.html#Conditionals\">Conditionals</a>を参照）、これらの制限を克服"
"して<em class=\"dfn\">パターンマッチング・プログラミングスタイル</em>を導入す"
"るものです。<code class=\"code\">pcase</code>が克服する制限は以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">cond</code> form chooses among alternatives by "
"evaluating the predicate <var class=\"var\">condition</var> of each of its "
"clauses (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Conditionals.html\">Conditionals</"
"a>).  The primary limitation is that variables let-bound in <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> are not available to the clause&rsquo;s <var "
"class=\"var\">body-forms</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> 形式では、各節の述語 <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> を評価することで選択肢を決定します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Conditionals.html\">条件式</a> を参照）。主な制約は、"
"<var class=\"var\">condition</var> で let 束縛された変数が、その節の <var "
"class=\"var\">body-forms</var> では利用できない点です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"Another annoyance (more an inconvenience than a limitation)  is that when a "
"series of <var class=\"var\">condition</var> predicates implement equality "
"tests, there is a lot of repeated code.  (<code class=\"code\">cl-case</"
"code> solves this inconvenience.)"
msgstr ""
"もう一つの煩わしい点（制約というよりはむしろ不便さ）は、一連の<var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var>述語で等価性判定を行う場合、コードの重複が多くな"
"ることです。（<code class=\"code\">cl-case</code>はこの不便さを解消します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">cl-case</code> macro chooses among alternatives by "
"evaluating the equality of its first argument against a set of specific "
"values."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cl-case</code> マクロは、第1引数と一連の特定の値との等価"
"性を判定することで、選択肢の中から一つを選び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid "Its limitations are two-fold:"
msgstr "その限界は2点ある："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid "The equality tests use <code class=\"code\">eql</code>."
msgstr "等価性判定には <code class=\"code\">eql</code> が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid "The values must be known and written in advance."
msgstr "値は事前に把握し、記載しておく必要がある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"These render <code class=\"code\">cl-case</code> unsuitable for strings or "
"compound data structures (e.g., lists or vectors).  (<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> doesn&rsquo;t have these limitations, but it has "
"others, see above.)"
msgstr ""
"これらにより、<code class=\"code\">cl-case</code> は文字列や複合データ構造"
"（リストやベクトルなど）には適しません。（<code class=\"code\">cond</code> に"
"はこうした制限はありませんが、別の制限があります。上記を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"Conceptually, the <code class=\"code\">pcase</code> macro borrows the first-"
"arg focus of <code class=\"code\">cl-case</code> and the clause-processing "
"flow of <code class=\"code\">cond</code>, replacing <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> with a generalization of the equality test "
"which is a variant of <em class=\"dfn\">pattern matching</em>, and adding "
"facilities so that you can concisely express a clause&rsquo;s predicate, and "
"arrange to share let-bindings between a clause&rsquo;s predicate and <var "
"class=\"var\">body-forms</var>."
msgstr ""
"概念的には、<code class=\"code\">pcase</code> マクロは <code "
"class=\"code\">cl-case</code> の第1引数のフォーカスと <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> の節処理フローを継承し、<var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> を <em class=\"dfn\">パターンマッチング</em> の"
"一種である等価性判定の一般化に置き換えるとともに、節の述語を簡潔に表現し、節"
"の述語と <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var> の間で let 束縛を共有できるよう"
"にするための機能を追加しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Pattern_002dMatching-Conditional.html
msgid ""
"The concise expression of a predicate is known as a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">pattern</em>.  When the predicate, called on the value of the "
"first arg, returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, we say that "
"&ldquo;the pattern matches the value&rdquo; (or sometimes &ldquo;the value "
"matches the pattern&rdquo;)."
msgstr ""
"述語の簡潔な表現は<em class=\"dfn\">パターン</em>と呼ばれます。第1引数の値に"
"対して呼び出された述語がnon-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返すとき、「パ"
"ターンが値にマッチする」（あるいは時に「値がパターンにマッチする」）と言いま"
"す。"

