"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>31.1 ポイント<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Point-1\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-point\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-point\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Point</em> is a special buffer position used by many "
"editing commands, including the self-inserting typed characters and text "
"insertion functions.  Other commands move point through the text to allow "
"editing and insertion at different places."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ポイント</em>は、自己挿入される入力文字やテキスト挿入機能な"
"ど、多くの編集コマンドで使用される特殊なバッファ位置です。その他のコマンド"
"は、テキスト内をポイント移動させることで、異なる箇所での編集や挿入を可能にし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid ""
"Like other positions, point designates a place between two characters (or "
"before the first character, or after the last character), rather than a "
"particular character.  Usually terminals display the cursor over the "
"character that immediately follows point; point is actually before the "
"character on which the cursor sits."
msgstr ""
"他の位置指定と同様に、ポイントは特定の文字ではなく、2つの文字の間（あるいは最"
"初の文字の前、または最後の文字の後）の位置を指します。通常、端末はポイントの"
"直後の文字の上にカーソルを表示しますが、実際にはポイントはカーソルが置かれて"
"いる文字の手前にあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-point-with-narrowing\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-point-with-narrowing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid ""
"The value of point is a number no less than 1, and no greater than the "
"buffer size plus 1.  If narrowing is in effect (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>), then point is constrained to fall "
"within the accessible portion of the buffer (possibly at one end of it)."
msgstr ""
"pointの値は、1以上かつバッファサイズに1を加えた値以下の数値です。ナローイング"
"が適用されている場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Narrowing.html\">ナローイング"
"</a>を参照）、pointはバッファのアクセス可能な範囲内（場合によってはその端）に"
"制限されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-point\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-point\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid ""
"A running Emacs session has a single instance of point.<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF26\" href=\"#FOOT26\"><sup>26</sup></a> We distinguish it by saying "
"just &ldquo;point&rdquo; and never &ldquo;the point&rdquo;.  At the same "
"time, each buffer has its own value <em class=\"emph\">for</em> point, which "
"is independent of the value of point for other buffers: the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">buffer point</em>.  The relationship between point and buffer "
"points is that when a buffer becomes current (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Current-Buffer.html\">The Current Buffer</a>), point (the unique "
"one)  is set to that buffer&rsquo;s point.  Conceptually, when a buffer "
"ceases to be current its buffer point is first set to point for later "
"restoration (the actual implementation is more complicated)."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Point.html
msgid ""
"Each window also has a value for point, the <em class=\"dfn\">window point</"
"em>, which is independent of the value of point for other windows showing "
"the same buffer.  This is why the cursor may appear at different positions "
"in various windows that display the same buffer.  When a buffer appears in "
"only one window, its buffer&rsquo;s point and that window&rsquo;s point "
"normally have the same value, so the distinction between buffer points and "
"window points is rarely important.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-"
"Point.html\">Windows and Point</a>, for more details."
msgstr ""
"各ウィンドウには point の値である <em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウポイント</em> "
