# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid ""
"A lot of code uses the old <code class=\"code\">defadvice</code> mechanism, "
"which has been made obsolete by the new <code class=\"code\">advice-add</"
"code>, whose implementation and semantics is significantly simpler."
msgstr ""
"多くのコードで旧来の <code class=\"code\">defadvice</code> 機構が使われていま"
"すが、これは新しい <code class=\"code\">advice-add</code> によって廃止されま"
"した。後者は実装もセマンティクスも大幅に簡素化されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid "An old piece of advice such as:"
msgstr "次のような古くからの助言："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defadvice previous-line (before next-line-at-end\n"
"                                 (&amp;optional arg try-vscroll))\n"
"  &quot;Insert an empty line when moving up from the top line.&quot;\n"
"  (if (and next-line-add-newlines (= arg 1)\n"
"           (save-excursion (beginning-of-line) (bobp)))\n"
"      (progn\n"
"        (beginning-of-line)\n"
"        (newline))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid "could be translated in the new advice mechanism into a plain function:"
msgstr "新しいアドバイス機構では、単純な関数として記述できるでしょう："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun previous-line--next-line-at-end (&amp;optional arg try-vscroll)\n"
"  &quot;Insert an empty line when moving up from the top line.&quot;\n"
"  (if (and next-line-add-newlines (= arg 1)\n"
"           (save-excursion (beginning-of-line) (bobp)))\n"
"      (progn\n"
"        (beginning-of-line)\n"
"        (newline))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid ""
"Obviously, this does not actually modify <code class=\"code\">previous-line</"
"code>.  For that the old advice needed:"
msgstr ""
"当然ながら、これで実際に <code class=\"code\">previous-line</code> が変更され"
"るわけではありません。そのためには、従来の手法が必要でした："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(ad-activate 'previous-line)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid "whereas the new advice mechanism needs:"
msgstr "一方、新しいアドバイス機構には以下が必要です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(advice-add 'previous-line :before #'previous-line--next-line-at-end)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">ad-activate</code> had a global effect: it "
"activated all pieces of advice enabled for that specified function.  If you "
"wanted to only activate or deactivate a particular piece, you needed to <em "
"class=\"emph\">enable</em> or <em class=\"emph\">disable</em> it with <code "
"class=\"code\">ad-enable-advice</code> and <code class=\"code\">ad-disable-"
"advice</code>.  The new mechanism does away with this distinction."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">ad-activate</code>はグローバルな効果を持ち、指定さ"
"れた関数で有効になっていたすべてのアドバイスを有効にしていました。特定のアド"
"バイスのみを有効にしたり無効にしたりしたい場合は、<code class=\"code\">ad-"
"enable-advice</code>や<code class=\"code\">ad-disable-advice</code>を用いてそ"
"れを<em class=\"emph\">有効</em>または<em class=\"emph\">無効</em>にする必要"
"がありました。新しい仕組みでは、この区別が不要になりました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid "Around advice such as:"
msgstr "以下のようなアドバイス："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defadvice foo (around foo-around)\n"
"  &quot;Ignore case in `foo'.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((case-fold-search t))\n"
"    ad-do-it))\n"
"(ad-activate 'foo)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid "could translate into:"
msgstr "次のように翻訳できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo--foo-around (orig-fun &amp;rest args)\n"
"  &quot;Ignore case in `foo'.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((case-fold-search t))\n"
"    (apply orig-fun args)))\n"
"(advice-add 'foo :around #'foo--foo-around)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid ""
"Regarding the advice&rsquo;s <em class=\"emph\">class</em>, note that the "
"new <code class=\"code\">:before</code> is not quite equivalent to the old "
"<code class=\"code\">before</code>, because in the old advice you could "
"modify the function&rsquo;s arguments (e.g., with <code class=\"code\">ad-"
"set-arg</code>), and that would affect the argument values seen by the "
"original function, whereas in the new <code class=\"code\">:before</code>, "
"modifying an argument via <code class=\"code\">setq</code> in the advice has "
"no effect on the arguments seen by the original function.  When porting "
"<code class=\"code\">before</code> advice which relied on this behavior, "
"you&rsquo;ll need to turn it into new <code class=\"code\">:around</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">:filter-args</code> advice instead."
msgstr ""
"アドバイスの<em class=\"emph\">クラス</em>に関して、新しい<code "
"class=\"code\">:before</code>は従来の<code class=\"code\">before</code>と完全"
"には同等ではないことに注意してください。従来のアドバイスでは、関数の引数を変"
"更（例：<code class=\"code\">ad-set-arg</code>を使用）することができ、それが"
"元の関数が受け取る引数の値に影響を与えていましたが、新しい<code "
"class=\"code\">:before</code>では、アドバイス内で<code class=\"code\">setq</"
"code>を介して引数を変更しても、元の関数が受け取る引数には影響しません。この挙"
"動に依存していた<code class=\"code\">before</code>アドバイスを移植する際は、"
"代わりに新しい<code class=\"code\">:around</code>または<code "
"class=\"code\">:filter-args</code>アドバイスに変換する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Porting-Old-Advice.html
msgid ""
"Similarly old <code class=\"code\">after</code> advice could modify the "
"returned value by changing <code class=\"code\">ad-return-value</code>, "
"whereas new <code class=\"code\">:after</code> advice cannot, so when "
"porting such old <code class=\"code\">after</code> advice, you&rsquo;ll need "
"to turn it into new <code class=\"code\">:around</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">:filter-return</code> advice instead."
msgstr ""
"同様に、古い <code class=\"code\">after</code> アドバイスは <code "
"class=\"code\">ad-return-value</code> を変更することで戻り値を変更できました"
"が、新しい <code class=\"code\">:after</code> アドバイスではそれができませ"
"ん。そのため、こうした古い <code class=\"code\">after</code> アドバイスを移植"
"する際は、代わりに新しい <code class=\"code\">:around</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">:filter-return</code> アドバイスに変換する必要があります。"

