# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"The screen position of the top (or bottom) edge, in pixels, with respect to "
"the top (or bottom) edge of the display or parent frame.  It works just like "
"<code class=\"code\">left</code>, except vertically instead of horizontally."
msgstr ""
"ディスプレイまたは親フレームの上端（または下端）を基準とした、上端（または下"
"端）のピクセル単位の画面位置です。水平方向ではなく垂直方向である点を除けば、"
"<code class=\"code\">left</code>と同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parameters.html
msgid ""
