# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"For syntactic analysis, such as in indentation, often the useful thing is to "
"compute the syntactic state corresponding to a given buffer position.  This "
"function does that conveniently."
msgstr ""
"インデントなどの構文解析では、多くの場合、指定されたバッファ位置に対応する構"
"文状態を計算することが有用です。この関数を使えば、それを手軽に行えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-ppss</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"pos</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-syntax_002dppss\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-ppss</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"pos</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-syntax_002dppss\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the parser state that the parser would reach at "
"position <var class=\"var\">pos</var> starting from the beginning of the "
"visible portion of the buffer.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Parser-"
"State.html\">Parser State</a>, for a description of the parser state."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファの可視部分の先頭から位置 <var class=\"var\">pos</var> に"
"おいてパーサーが到達する状態を返します。パーサーの状態に関する説明について"
"は、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Parser-State.html\">パーサーの状態</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"The return value is the same as if you call the low-level parsing function "
"<code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> to parse from the beginning "
"of the visible portion of the buffer to <var class=\"var\">pos</var> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Low_002dLevel-Parsing.html\">Low-Level Parsing</a>).  "
"However, <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> uses caches to speed up the "
"computation.  Due to this optimization, the second value (previous complete "
"subexpression) and sixth value (minimum parenthesis depth) in the returned "
"parser state are not meaningful."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は、低レベル解析関数 <code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> を"
"呼び出してバッファの可視領域の先頭から <var class=\"var\">pos</var> までを解"
"析した場合と同じになります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Low_002dLevel-"
"Parsing.html\">低レベル解析</a> を参照）。ただし、<code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> では計算を高速化するためにキャッシュを使用"
"しています。この最適化により、返されるパーサー状態における2番目の値（直前の完"
"全な部分式）と6番目の値（最小括弧深度）は意味を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"This function has a side effect: it adds a buffer-local entry to <code "
"class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Change-Hooks.html\">Change Hooks</a>) for <code class=\"code\">syntax-"
"ppss-flush-cache</code> (see below).  This entry keeps the cache consistent "
"as the buffer is modified.  However, the cache might not be updated if <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> is called while <code "
"class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> is temporarily let-bound, or "
"if the buffer is modified without running the hook, such as when using <code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-modification-hooks</code>.  In those cases, it is "
"necessary to call <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss-flush-cache</code> "
"explicitly."
msgstr ""
"この関数には副作用があります。<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss-flush-cache</"
"code>（後述）のために、<code class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> に"
"バッファローカルなエントリを追加します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Change-"
"Hooks.html\">Change Hooks</a> を参照）。このエントリにより、バッファが変更さ"
"れてもキャッシュの整合性が保たれます。ただし、<code class=\"code\">before-"
"change-functions</code> が一時的に let-bound されている間に <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> が呼び出された場合や、<code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-modification-hooks</code> を使用する場合のようにフック"
"を実行せずにバッファが変更された場合には、キャッシュが更新されないことがあり"
"ます。そのような場合には、明示的に <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss-flush-"
"cache</code> を呼び出す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-ppss-flush-cache</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg "
"&amp;rest ignored-args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"syntax_002dppss_002dflush_002dcache\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-ppss-flush-cache</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg "
"&amp;rest ignored-args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"syntax_002dppss_002dflush_002dcache\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Position-Parse.html
msgid ""
"This function flushes the cache used by <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</"
"code>, starting at position <var class=\"var\">beg</var>.  The remaining "
"arguments, <var class=\"var\">ignored-args</var>, are ignored; this function "
"accepts them so that it can be directly used on hooks such as <code "
"class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Change-Hooks.html\">Change Hooks</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> で使用されるキャッシュ"
"を、位置 <var class=\"var\">beg</var> からフラッシュします。残りの引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">ignored-args</var> は無視されます。この関数がこれらを受け付ける"
"のは、<code class=\"code\">before-change-functions</code> のようなフックで直"
"接使用できるようにするためです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Change-"
"Hooks.html\">変更フック</a> を参照）。"

