# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"From the past subsections we already know that <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> must be supplied with a number of display actions (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a>) in order to display a buffer.  In a completely "
"uncustomized Emacs, these actions are specified by <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code> in the following order "
"of precedence: Reuse a window, pop up a new window on the same frame, use a "
"window previously showing the buffer, use some window and pop up a new "
"frame.  (Note that the remaining actions named by <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code> are void in an "
"uncustomized Emacs)."
msgstr ""
"前述のサブセクションから、バッファを表示するには <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> に複数の表示アクション（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用のウィンドウの選"
"択</a> を参照）を指定する必要があることが既に分かっています。完全にカスタマイ"
"ズされていない Emacs では、これらのアクションは <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-fallback-action</code> によって、以下の優先順位で指定されます：ウィン"
"ドウの再利用、同一フレーム上への新しいウィンドウのポップアップ、以前にその"
"バッファを表示していたウィンドウの使用、あるウィンドウの使用と新しいフレーム"
"のポップアップ。（なお、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</"
"code> で指定される残りのアクションは、カスタマイズされていない Emacs では無効"
"であることに注意してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid "Consider the following form:"
msgstr "次の形式を考えます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(display-buffer (get-buffer-create &quot;*foo*&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Evaluating this form in the buffer <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> of "
"an uncustomized Emacs session will usually fail to reuse a window that shows "
"<samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> already, but succeed in popping up a new "
"window.  Evaluating the same form again will now not cause any visible "
"changes&mdash;<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> reused the window "
"already showing <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> because that action was "
"applicable and had the highest precedence among all applicable actions."
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズされていないEmacsセッションのバッファ <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> でこのフォームを評価すると、通常、既に <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を表示しているウィンドウの再利用は行われません"
"が、新しいウィンドウをポップアップさせることは可能です。同じフォームを再度評"
"価しても、目に見える変化は生じません&mdash;<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> は、当該操作が適用可能であり、かつ適用可能なすべての操作の中で"
"最優先であったため、既に <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を表示しているウィ"
"ンドウを再利用しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Popping up a new window will fail if there is not enough space on the "
"selected frame.  In an uncustomized Emacs it typically fails when there are "
"already two windows on a frame.  For example, if you now type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> followed by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</"
"kbd> and evaluate the form once more, <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> "
"should show up in the lower window&mdash;<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> just used &ldquo;some&rdquo; window.  If, before typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</kbd> you had typed <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</"
"kbd>, <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> would have been shown in the upper "
"window because &ldquo;some&rdquo; window stands for the &ldquo;least "
"recently used&rdquo; window and the selected window has been least recently "
"used if and only if it is alone on its frame."
msgstr ""
"選択したフレームに十分な空きスペースがない場合、新しいウィンドウを表示するこ"
"とはできません。カスタマイズされていないEmacsでは、通常、1つのフレームにすで"
"に2つのウィンドウが存在する場合に失敗します。例えば、ここで <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> と入力し、続けて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;2</kbd> と入力して再度フォームを評価すると、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> は下のウィンドウに表示されるはずです&mdash;<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は単に「some」ウィンドウを使用しただけで"
"す。もし <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</kbd> と入力する前に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> と入力していたなら、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> は上のウィンドウに表示されていたでしょう。なぜな"
"ら、「some」ウィンドウは「最後に使用されなかった」ウィンドウを指し、選択中の"
"ウィンドウが最後に使用されなかったのは、それがフレーム上に単独で存在する場合"
"に限られるからです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s assume you did not type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> and "
"<samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> is shown in the lower window.  Type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> to get there followed by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;left</kbd> and evaluate the form again.  This should display <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> in the same, lower window because that window "
"had already shown <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> previously and was "
"therefore chosen instead of some other window."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> と入力せず、下のウィンドウに <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されているとしましょう。そこに移動するため"
"に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> と入力し、続けて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;left</kbd> と入力して、再度フォームを評価してください。すると、同じ下"
"のウィンドウに <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されるはずです。という"
"のも、そのウィンドウでは以前に <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されて"
"いたため、他のウィンドウではなくそちらが選ばれたからです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"So far we have only observed the default behavior in an uncustomized Emacs "
"session.  To see how this behavior can be customized, let&rsquo;s consider "
"the option <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code>.  It "
"provides a very coarse customization which conceptually affects the display "
"of <em class=\"emph\">any</em> buffer.  It can be used to supplement the "
"actions supplied by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</"
"code> by reordering them or by adding actions that are not present there but "
"fit more closely the user&rsquo;s editing practice.  However, it can also be "
"used to change the default behavior in a more profound way."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s consider a user who, as a rule, prefers to display buffers on "
"another frame.  Such a user might provide the following customization:"
msgstr ""
"通常、バッファを別のフレームに表示することを好むユーザーを想定してみましょ"
"う。このようなユーザーは、次のようなカスタマイズを行うかもしれません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-base-action\n"
" '((display-buffer-reuse-window display-buffer-pop-up-frame)\n"
"   (reusable-frames . 0)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This setting will cause <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> to first "
"try to find a window showing the buffer on a visible or iconified frame and, "
"if no such frame exists, pop up a new frame.  You can observe this behavior "
"on a graphical system by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> in the "
"window showing <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> and evaluating our "
"canonical <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> form.  This will "
"usually create (and give focus to) a new frame whose root window shows <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp>.  Iconify that frame and evaluate the canonical "
"form again: <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> will reuse the window "
"on the new frame (usually raising the frame and giving it focus too)."
msgstr ""
"この設定により、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> はまず可視またはア"
"イコン化されたフレーム上でバッファを表示しているウィンドウを探し、そのような"
"フレームが存在しない場合は新しいフレームをポップアップさせます。グラフィカル"
"なシステムでは、<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> を表示しているウィンド"
"ウで <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> と入力し、我々の正準形式 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> を評価することで、この挙動を確認できま"
"す。通常、これにより <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を表示しているルート"
"ウィンドウを持つ新しいフレームが作成され（かつフォーカスが当たります）、その"
"フレームをアイコン化して再度正準形式を評価すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は新しいフレーム上のウィンドウを再利用し"
"ます（通常、フレームが最前面に表示され、フォーカスも当たります）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Only if creating a new frame fails, <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code> will apply the actions supplied by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"fallback-action</code> which means to again try reusing a window, popping up "
"a new window and so on.  A trivial way to make frame creation fail is "
"supplied by the following form:"
msgstr ""
"新しいフレームの作成に失敗した場合に限り、<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code> "
"で指定されたアクションを実行します。つまり、再度ウィンドウの再利用を試みた"
"り、新しいウィンドウをポップアップさせたりといった処理が行われます。フレーム"
"作成を失敗させる簡単な方法として、以下の形式が挙げられます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((pop-up-frame-function 'ignore))\n"
"  (display-buffer (get-buffer-create &quot;*foo*&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"We will forget about that form immediately after observing that it fails to "
"create a new frame and uses a fallback action instead."
msgstr ""
"そのフォームが新しいフレームを作成せず、代わりにフォールバックアクションを使"
"用していることが確認でき次第、すぐにそのフォームのことは忘れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-reuse-window</code> appears "
"redundant in the customization of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-"
"action</code> because it is already part of <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-fallback-action</code> and should be tried there anyway.  However, "
"that would fail because due to the precedence of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> over <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>, at that time <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> would have already won the "
"race.  In fact, this:"
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> のカスタマイズに"
"おいて <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-reuse-window</code> が冗長に見える"
"のは、それが既に <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code> "
"の一部であり、いずれにせよそこで試されるべきだからです。しかし、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code> より優先されるため、その"
"時点では既に <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-frame</code> が優先さ"
"れてしまい、これでは失敗します。実際、こちらが："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-base-action\n"
" '(display-buffer-pop-up-frame (reusable-frames . 0)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"would cause <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> to <em "
"class=\"emph\">always</em> pop up a new frame which is probably not what our "
"user wants."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> が<em class=\"emph\">常に</em>新し"
"いフレームをポップアップさせることになり、おそらくそれはユーザーが望んでいる"
"動作ではないでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"So far, we have only shown how <em class=\"emph\">users</em> can customize "
"the default behavior of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>.  Let us "
"now see how <em class=\"emph\">applications</em> can change the course of "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>.  The canonical way to do that is "
"to use the <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> or a function that calls it, like, for "
"example, <code class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">Switching to a Buffer in a Window</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ここまでは、<em class=\"emph\">ユーザー</em>が<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code>のデフォルト動作をカスタマイズする方法についてのみ説明してきまし"
"た。次に、<em class=\"emph\">アプリケーション</em>が<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>の挙動をどのように変更できるかを見てみま"
"しょう。その標準的な方法は、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>の<var "
"class=\"var\">action</var>引数や、それを呼び出す関数（例えば<code "
"class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</code>など）を使用することです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">ウィンドウ内のバッファへの切"
"り替え</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Suppose an application wants to display <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> "
"preferably below the selected window (to immediately attract the attention "
"of the user to the new window) or, if that fails, in a window at the bottom "
"of the frame.  It could do that with a call like this:"
msgstr ""
"あるアプリケーションが <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を、できれば選択中の"
"ウィンドウの下（ユーザーの注意を即座に新しいウィンドウに向けるため）、あるい"
"はそれが不可能な場合はフレーム下部のウィンドウに表示したいとします。これは、"
"次のような呼び出しで実現できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(display-buffer\n"
" (get-buffer-create &quot;*foo*&quot;)\n"
" '((display-buffer-below-selected display-buffer-at-bottom)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In order to see how this new, modified form works, delete any frame showing "
"<samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp>, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> "
"followed by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</kbd> in the window showing <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>, and subsequently evaluate that form.  <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> should split the upper window, and show "
"<samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> in the new window.  Alternatively, if "
"after <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</kbd> you had typed <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;o</kbd>, <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> would have split "
"the window at the bottom instead."
msgstr ""
"この新しく修正された形式がどのように動作するかを確認するには、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されているフレームをすべて削除し、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> が表示されているウィンドウに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;1</kbd> に続いて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</kbd> "
"と入力し、その後その形式を評価してください。<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> によって上のウィンドウが分割され、新しいウィンドウに <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されるはずです。あるいは、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;2</kbd> の後に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;o</kbd> と"
"入力していた場合は、代わりに <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> に"
"よって下のウィンドウが分割されていたでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Suppose now that, before evaluating the new form, you have made the selected "
"window as small as possible, for example, by evaluating the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(fit-window-to-buffer)</code> in that window.  In that case, "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> would have failed to split the "
"selected window and would have split the frame&rsquo;s root window instead, "
"effectively displaying <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> at the bottom of "
"the frame."
msgstr ""
"ここで、新しいフォームを評価する前に、例えばそのウィンドウでフォーム <code "
"class=\"code\">(fit-window-to-buffer)</code> を評価するなどして、選択中のウィ"
"ンドウを可能な限り小さくしたとしましょう。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は選択中のウィンドウを分割できず、代わり"
"にフレームのルートウィンドウを分割することになり、結果として <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> がフレームの下部に表示されることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In either case, evaluating the new form a second time should reuse the "
"window already showing <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> since both "
"functions supplied by the <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument try to "
"reuse such a window first."
msgstr ""
"いずれの場合も、新しいフォームを再度評価する際は、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が既に表示されているウィンドウを再利用するはずで"
"す。というのも、<var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数で指定された両方の関数"
"が、まずそのようなウィンドウを再利用しようとするためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"There are cases, however, where Lisp programs want to modify the default "
"behavior of a <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> call hidden behind "
"another function.  In those cases, setting the <var class=\"var\">action</"
"var> argument is not an option.  Fortunately, the <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code> variable can be used to "
"specify a list of conditional default actions.  Consider the following "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"しかし、Lispプログラムにおいて、別の関数の背後に隠された<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>呼び出しのデフォルト動作を変更したい場合"
"があります。そのような場合、<var class=\"var\">action</var>引数を設定するとい"
"う選択肢はありません。幸いなことに、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"default-alist</code>変数を使用して、条件付きのデフォルト動作のリストを指定で"
"きます。以下の例を考えてみましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo (buffer)\n"
"   (display-buffer\n"
"    buffer\n"
"    '((display-buffer-below-selected display-buffer-at-bottom))))\n"
"\n"
"(defun bar ()\n"
"   (let ((display-buffer-default-alist\n"
"         '((&quot;\\\\*bar\\\\*&quot; (display-buffer-pop-up-frame)))))\n"
"     (foo (get-buffer-create &quot;*bar*&quot;))))\n"
"\n"
"(defun baz ()\n"
"   (let ((display-buffer-default-alist\n"
"         '((&quot;\\\\*baz\\\\*&quot; (display-buffer-same-window)))))\n"
"     (foo (get-buffer-create &quot;*baz*&quot;))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Here, <code class=\"code\">foo</code> calls <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> with a specific <var class=\"var\">action</var>.  Let-binding "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code> allows the "
"functions <code class=\"code\">bar</code> and <code class=\"code\">baz</"
"code> to specify their own action functions."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、<code class=\"code\">foo</code> が特定の <var "
"class=\"var\">action</var> を指定して <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code> を呼び出します。Let 束縛 <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-"
"alist</code> により、関数 <code class=\"code\">bar</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">baz</code> はそれぞれ独自のアクション関数を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"By setting the <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument and/or the <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code> variable, an application "
"effectively overrules any customization of <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-base-action</code>.  Our user can now either accept the choice of the "
"application, or redouble by customizing the option <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> as follows:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数および/または <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-default-alist</code> 変数を設定することで、アプ"
"リケーションは実質的に <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</"
"code> のあらゆるカスタマイズを上書きします。ユーザーは、アプリケーションによ"
"る選択をそのまま受け入れるか、あるいは以下のようにオプション <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> をカスタマイズしてさらに対応するこ"
"とが可能です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-alist\n"
" '((&quot;\\\\*foo\\\\*&quot;\n"
"    (display-buffer-reuse-window display-buffer-pop-up-frame))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Trying this with the new, modified form above in a configuration that does "
"not show <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> anywhere, will display <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> on a separate frame, completely ignoring the "
"<var class=\"var\">action</var> argument of <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"上記の新しく修正したフォームを用い、どこにも <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</"
"samp> が表示されない設定で試すと、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> "
"の <var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数を完全に無視して、別のフレームに "
"<samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Note that we didn&rsquo;t care to specify a <code class=\"code\">reusable-"
"frames</code> action alist entry in our specification of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>.  <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> always takes the first one it finds&mdash;in our case the one "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code>.  If we "
"wanted to use a different specification, for example, to exclude iconified "
"frames showing <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> from the list of reusable "
"ones, we would have to specify that separately, however:"
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> の仕様において、<code "
"class=\"code\">reusable-frames</code> のアクションリスト項目を明示的に指定し"
"なかった点にご留意ください。<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は常に"
"最初に見つかった項目（今回の場合は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-"
"action</code> で指定された項目）を採用します。例えば、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を表示しているアイコン化されたフレームを再利用可"
"能なリストから除外したい場合など、別の仕様を適用したい場合は、それを別途指定"
"する必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-alist\n"
" '((&quot;\\\\*foo\\\\*&quot;\n"
"    (display-buffer-reuse-window display-buffer-pop-up-frame)\n"
"    (reusable-frames . visible))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If you try this, you will notice that repeated attempts to display <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> will succeed to reuse a frame only if that frame "
"is visible."
msgstr ""
"これを試してみると、<samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を表示しようとする操作"
"を繰り返しても、そのフレームが表示されている場合にのみ、フレームの再利用に成"
"功することに気づくでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The above example would allow the conclusion that users customize <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> for the sole purpose to overrule "
"the <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument chosen by applications.  Such a "
"conclusion would be incorrect.  <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</"
"code> is the standard option for users to direct the course of display of "
"specific buffers in a preferred way regardless of whether the display is "
"also guided by an <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument."
msgstr ""
"上記の例からは、ユーザーが <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> "
"をカスタマイズするのは、アプリケーションによって選択された <var "
"class=\"var\">action</var> 引数を上書きするという唯一の目的のためであるという"
"結論が導き出されるだろう。しかし、そのような結論は誤りである。<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> は、表示が <var "
"class=\"var\">action</var> 引数によっても制御されるか否かにかかわらず、ユー"
"ザーが特定のバッファの表示方法を好みの形で指定するための標準的なオプションで"
"ある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"We can, however, reasonably conclude that customizing <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> differs from customizing <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> in two major aspects: it is "
"stronger because it overrides the <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument "
"of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>, and it enables you to "
"explicitly specify the affected buffers.  In fact, displaying other buffers "
"is not affected in any way by a customization for <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp>.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"しかしながら、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> のカスタマイズ"
"は <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> のカスタマイズとは2"
"つの主要な点で異なると合理的に結論付けられます。すなわち、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> の <var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数"
"を上書きするためより強力であること、そして影響を受けるバッファを明示的に指定"
"できることです。実際、他のバッファの表示は <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> "
"のカスタマイズによって一切影響を受けません。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(display-buffer (get-buffer-create &quot;*bar*&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"continues being governed by the settings of <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-base-action</code> and <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-"
"action</code> only."
msgstr ""
"引き続き<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code>および<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-fallback-action</code>の設定のみによって制御さ"
"れる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"We could stop with our examples here but Lisp programs still have an ace up "
"their sleeves which they can use to overrule any customization of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>.  It&rsquo;s the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code> which they can bind "
"around <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> calls as follows:"
msgstr ""
"例を挙げるのはここまでにしてもいいでしょうが、Lispプログラムには、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> のあらゆるカスタマイズを無効化でき"
"る切り札がまだあります。それが変数 <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"overriding-action</code> で、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> の呼"
"び出しを次のように囲むようにバインドできるのです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((display-buffer-overriding-action\n"
"       '((display-buffer-same-window))))\n"
"  (display-buffer\n"
"   (get-buffer-create &quot;*foo*&quot;)\n"
"   '((display-buffer-below-selected display-buffer-at-bottom))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Evaluating this form will usually display <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> "
"in the selected window regardless of the <var class=\"var\">action</var> "
"argument and any user customizations.  (Usually, an application will not "
"bother to also provide an <var class=\"var\">action</var> argument.  Here it "
"just serves to illustrate the fact that it gets overridden.)"
msgstr ""
"このフォームを評価すると、<var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数やユーザーによ"
"るカスタマイズに関わらず、通常は選択中のウィンドウに <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> が表示されます。（通常、アプリケーションがわざわ"
"ざ <var class=\"var\">action</var> 引数まで用意することはありません。ここで"
"は、それが上書きされるという点を示すために用いています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"It might be illustrative to look at the list of action functions <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> would have tried to display <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> with the customizations we provided here.  The "
"list (including comments explaining who added this and the subsequent "
"elements) is:"
msgstr ""
"ここで提供したカスタマイズを適用した場合に、アクション関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> が表示しようとしたであろう <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> の一覧を確認すると、分かりやすいかもしれません。"
"その一覧（誰がこれを追加したか、および後続の要素について説明するコメントを含"
"む）は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(display-buffer-same-window  ;; `display-buffer-overriding-action'\n"
" display-buffer-reuse-window ;; `display-buffer-alist'\n"
" display-buffer-pop-up-frame\n"
" display-buffer-below-selected ;; ACTION argument\n"
" display-buffer-at-bottom\n"
" display-buffer-reuse-window ;; `display-buffer-base-action'\n"
" display-buffer-pop-up-frame\n"
" display-buffer--maybe-same-window ;; `display-buffer-fallback-action'\n"
" display-buffer-reuse-window\n"
" display-buffer--maybe-pop-up-frame-or-window\n"
" display-buffer-in-previous-window\n"
" display-buffer-use-some-window\n"
" display-buffer-pop-up-frame)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Note that among the internal functions listed here, <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer--maybe-same-window</code> is effectively "
"ignored while <code class=\"code\">display-buffer--maybe-pop-up-frame-or-"
"window</code> actually runs <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-pop-up-"
"window</code>."
msgstr ""
"なお、ここに挙げた内部関数のうち、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer--maybe-"
"same-window</code>は実質的に無視され、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer--"
"maybe-pop-up-frame-or-window</code>は実際に<code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-pop-up-window</code>を実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid "The action alist passed in each function call is:"
msgstr "各関数呼び出しで渡されるアクションリストは以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"((reusable-frames . visible)\n"
" (reusable-frames . 0))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"which shows that we have used the second specification of <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> above, overriding the "
"specification supplied by <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</"
"code>.  Suppose our user had written that as"
msgstr ""
"これは、上記で <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> の2番目の指定"
"を使用し、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> で提供された"
"指定を上書きしたことを示しています。仮にユーザーがそれを次のように記述してい"
"たとしましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-alist\n"
" '((&quot;\\\\*foo\\\\*&quot;\n"
"    (display-buffer-reuse-window display-buffer-pop-up-frame)\n"
"    (inhibit-same-window . t)\n"
"    (reusable-frames . visible))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In this case the <code class=\"code\">inhibit-same-window</code> alist entry "
"will successfully invalidate the <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-same-"
"window</code> specification from <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-"
"overriding-action</code> and <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> will "
"show <samp class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> on another frame.  To make <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code> more robust in this "
"regard, the application would have to specify an appropriate <code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-same-window</code> entry too, for example, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"この場合、<code class=\"code\">inhibit-same-window</code> のアリストエントリ"
"によって <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-same-window</code> の仕様が正常"
"に無効化され、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code> "
"と <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> は別のフレームで <samp "
"class=\"file\">*foo*</samp> を表示することになります。この点において <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-overriding-action</code> の堅牢性を高めるには、"
"アプリケーション側で適切な <code class=\"code\">inhibit-same-window</code> エ"
"ントリも指定する必要があり、例えば以下のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((display-buffer-overriding-action\n"
"       '(display-buffer-same-window (inhibit-same-window . nil))))\n"
"  (display-buffer (get-buffer-create &quot;*foo*&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Precedence-of-Action-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This last example shows that while the precedence order of action functions "
"is fixed, as described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Choosing-"
"Window.html\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>, an action alist "
"entry specified by a display action ranked lower in that order can affect "
"the execution of a higher ranked display action."
msgstr ""
"この最後の例は、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用"
"のウィンドウの選択</a>で説明されている通り、アクション関数の優先順位は固定さ"
"れているものの、その順序で下位にランク付けされた表示アクションによって指定さ"
"れたアクションアリストのエントリが、より上位にランク付けされた表示アクション"
"の実行に影響を及ぼし得ることを示しています。"

