# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"Most Emacs commands can use a <em class=\"dfn\">prefix argument</em>, a "
"number specified before the command itself.  (Don&rsquo;t confuse prefix "
"arguments with prefix keys.)  The prefix argument is at all times "
"represented by a value, which may be <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"meaning there is currently no prefix argument.  Each command may use the "
"prefix argument or ignore it."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどのEmacsコマンドでは、コマンド自体の前に指定する数値である<em "
"class=\"dfn\">プレフィックス引数</em>を使用できます。（プレフィックス引数とプ"
"レフィックスキーを混同しないでください。）プレフィックス引数は常に値で表さ"
"れ、その値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となる場合があり、これは現在プレ"
"フィックス引数がないことを意味します。各コマンドは、プレフィックス引数を使用"
"するか、あるいは無視することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"There are two representations of the prefix argument: <em class=\"dfn\">raw</"
"em> and <em class=\"dfn\">numeric</em>.  The editor command loop uses the "
"raw representation internally, and so do the Lisp variables that store the "
"information, but commands can request either representation."
msgstr ""
"接頭辞引数には、<em class=\"dfn\">raw</em>と<em class=\"dfn\">numeric</em>の2"
"つの表現形式があります。エディタのコマンドループは内部的にraw表現を使用してお"
"り、情報を格納するLisp変数も同様ですが、コマンドではどちらの表現形式も指定可"
"能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid "Here are the possible values of a raw prefix argument:"
msgstr "生のプレフィックス引数が取り得る値は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, meaning there is no prefix argument.  Its "
"numeric value is 1, but numerous commands make a distinction between <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and the integer 1."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>、つまり接頭辞引数がないことを意味します。数値"
"としては1ですが、多くのコマンドでは<code class=\"code\">nil</code>と整数の1を"
"区別しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid "An integer, which stands for itself."
msgstr "それ自体を表す整数。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"A list of one element, which is an integer.  This form of prefix argument "
"results from one or a succession of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd>s with no "
"digits.  The numeric value is the integer in the list, but some commands "
"make a distinction between such a list and an integer alone."
msgstr ""
"整数1つの要素からなるリスト。この形式の接頭辞引数は、数字を含まない1つまたは"
"連続した<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd>によって生成されます。数値はリスト内の整"
"数となりますが、一部のコマンドでは、このようなリストと整数単体を区別します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"The symbol <code class=\"code\">-</code>.  This indicates that <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M--</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u -</kbd> was typed, without "
"following digits.  The equivalent numeric value is &minus;1, but some "
"commands make a distinction between the integer &minus;1 and the symbol "
"<code class=\"code\">-</code>."
msgstr ""
"記号 <code class=\"code\">-</code>。これは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M--</kbd> また"
"は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u -</kbd> が後続の数字なしに入力されたことを示しま"
"す。対応する数値は &minus;1 ですが、一部のコマンドでは整数の &minus;1 と記号 "
"<code class=\"code\">-</code> を区別します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"We illustrate these possibilities by calling the following function with "
"various prefixes:"
msgstr ""
"さまざまな接頭辞を付けて以下の関数を呼び出すことで、これらの可能性を例示しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun display-prefix (arg)\n"
"  &quot;Display the value of the raw prefix arg.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;P&quot;)\n"
"  (message &quot;%s&quot; arg))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"Here are the results of calling <code class=\"code\">display-prefix</code> "
"with various raw prefix arguments:"
msgstr ""
"さまざまな生のプレフィックス引数を指定して <code class=\"code\">display-"
"prefix</code> を呼び出した結果がこちらです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        M-x display-prefix  &#8867; nil\n"
"\n"
"C-u     M-x display-prefix  &#8867; (4)\n"
"\n"
"C-u C-u M-x display-prefix  &#8867; (16)\n"
"\n"
"C-u 3   M-x display-prefix  &#8867; 3\n"
"\n"
"M-3     M-x display-prefix  &#8867; 3      ; <span class=\"r\">(Same as <code class=\"code\">C-u 3</code>.)</span>\n"
"\n"
"C-u -   M-x display-prefix  &#8867; -\n"
"\n"
"M--     M-x display-prefix  &#8867; -      ; <span class=\"r\">(Same as <code class=\"code\">C-u -</code>.)</span>\n"
"\n"
"C-u - 7 M-x display-prefix  &#8867; -7\n"
"\n"
"M-- 7   M-x display-prefix  &#8867; -7     ; <span class=\"r\">(Same as <code class=\"code\">C-u -7</code>.)</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"Emacs uses two variables to store the prefix argument: <code "
"class=\"code\">prefix-arg</code> and <code class=\"code\">current-prefix-"
"arg</code>.  Commands such as <code class=\"code\">universal-argument</code> "
"that set up prefix arguments for other commands store them in <code "
"class=\"code\">prefix-arg</code>.  In contrast, <code class=\"code\">current-"
"prefix-arg</code> conveys the prefix argument to the current command, so "
"setting it has no effect on the prefix arguments for future commands."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、プレフィックス引数を格納するために<code class=\"code\">prefix-"
"arg</code>と<code class=\"code\">current-prefix-arg</code>という2つの変数を使"
"用しています。<code class=\"code\">universal-argument</code>のように他のコマ"
"ンド用のプレフィックス引数を設定するコマンドは、それらを<code "
"class=\"code\">prefix-arg</code>に格納します。これに対し、<code "
"class=\"code\">current-prefix-arg</code>は現在のコマンドにプレフィックス引数"
"を渡すため、これを設定しても後続のコマンドのプレフィックス引数には影響しませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"Normally, commands specify which representation to use for the prefix "
"argument, either numeric or raw, in the <code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code> specification.  (See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Using-"
"Interactive.html\">Using <code class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>.)  "
"Alternatively, functions may look at the value of the prefix argument "
"directly in the variable <code class=\"code\">current-prefix-arg</code>, but "
"this is less clean."
msgstr ""
"通常、コマンドは <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の指定において、プレ"
"フィックス引数に数値表現と生表現のどちらを使用するかを指定します。（<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Using-Interactive.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> の使用</a>を参照してください。）あるいは、"
"関数が変数 <code class=\"code\">current-prefix-arg</code> でプレフィックス引"
"数の値を直接参照することもできますが、この方法はあまりすっきりしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prefix-numeric-value</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prefix_002dnumeric_002dvalue\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prefix-numeric-value</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">arg</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prefix_002dnumeric_002dvalue\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the numeric meaning of a valid raw prefix argument "
"value, <var class=\"var\">arg</var>.  The argument may be a symbol, a "
"number, or a list.  If it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value 1 is "
"returned; if it is <code class=\"code\">-</code>, the value &minus;1 is "
"returned; if it is a number, that number is returned; if it is a list, the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of that list (which should be a number) is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、有効な生の接頭辞引数の値 <var class=\"var\">arg</var> の数値的な"
"意味を返します。引数にはシンボル、数値、またはリストを指定できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は値 1 が、<code class=\"code\">-</code> の場"
"合は値 &minus;1 が返されます。数値の場合はその数値が、リストの場合はそのリス"
"トの <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>（数値である必要があります）が返されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-prefix-arg</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dprefix_002darg\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-prefix-arg</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"current_002dprefix_002darg\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds the raw prefix argument for the <em "
"class=\"emph\">current</em> command.  Commands may examine it directly, but "
"the usual method for accessing it is with <code class=\"code\">(interactive "
"&quot;P&quot;)</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、<em class=\"emph\">現在</em>のコマンドに対する生のプレフィック"
"ス引数が格納されています。コマンドはこれを直接参照することもできますが、通常"
"のアクセス方法は <code class=\"code\">(interactive &quot;P&quot;)</code> を用"
"いることです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prefix-arg</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"prefix_002darg\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prefix-arg</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"prefix_002darg\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the raw prefix argument for the <em "
"class=\"emph\">next</em> editing command.  Commands such as <code "
"class=\"code\">universal-argument</code> that specify prefix arguments for "
"the following command work by setting this variable."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<em class=\"emph\">next</em> 編集コマンドの生のプレフィックス"
"引数です。<code class=\"code\">universal-argument</code> のように後続のコマン"
"ドにプレフィックス引数を指定するコマンドは、この変数を設定することで動作しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Prefix-Command-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
