"Representation-and-Read-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Printed-Representation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-printed-representation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read-syntax\"></a>"
