# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-printing-_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-printing-circular-structures\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-printing-_0028Edebug_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-printing-circular-structures\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"If an expression in your program produces a value containing circular list "
"structure, you may get an error when Edebug attempts to print it."
msgstr ""
"プログラム内の式が循環リスト構造を含む値を生成した場合、Edebugがそれを出力し"
"ようとした際にエラーが発生することがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"One way to cope with circular structure is to set <code class=\"code\">print-"
"length</code> or <code class=\"code\">print-level</code> to truncate the "
"printing.  Edebug does this for you; it binds <code class=\"code\">print-"
"length</code> and <code class=\"code\">print-level</code> to the values of "
"the variables <code class=\"code\">edebug-print-length</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-print-level</code> (so long as they have non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> values).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Output-"
"Variables.html\">Variables Affecting Output</a>."
msgstr ""
"循環構造に対処する方法の一つは、<code class=\"code\">print-length</code> また"
"は <code class=\"code\">print-level</code> を設定して出力を切り詰めることで"
"す。Edebug はこの処理を自動で行い、<code class=\"code\">print-length</code> "
"と <code class=\"code\">print-level</code> を変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-print-length</code> と <code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"print-level</code> の値にバインドします（ただし、それらが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値である場合に限ります）。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Output-Variables.html\">出力に影響を与える変数</a> を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-print-length</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dprint_002dlength\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-print-length</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dprint_002dlength\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Edebug binds <code "
"class=\"code\">print-length</code> to this value while printing results.  "
"The default value is <code class=\"code\">50</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Edebug は結果の出力時に <code "
"class=\"code\">print-length</code> をこの値にバインドします。デフォルト値は "
"<code class=\"code\">50</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-print-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dprint_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-print-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dprint_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Edebug binds <code "
"class=\"code\">print-level</code> to this value while printing results.  The "
"default value is <code class=\"code\">50</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Edebug は結果の出力時に <code "
"class=\"code\">print-level</code> をこの値にバインドします。デフォルト値は "
"<code class=\"code\">50</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"You can also print circular structures and structures that share elements "
"more informatively by binding <code class=\"code\">print-circle</code> to a "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">print-circle</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の値にバインドすることで、円形構造や要素を共有する構造をより分かり"
"やすく出力することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid "Here is an example of code that creates a circular structure:"
msgstr "円形構造を作成するコードの例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq a (list 'x 'y))\n"
"(setcar a a)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">print-circle</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, printing functions (e.g., <code class=\"code\">prin1</code>) will "
"print <code class=\"code\">a</code> as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#1=(#1# "
"y)</samp>&rsquo;.  The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#1=</samp>&rsquo; "
"notation labels the structure that follows it with the label &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">1</samp>&rsquo;, and the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#1#</"
"samp>&rsquo; notation references the previously labeled structure.  This "
"notation is used for any shared elements of lists or vectors."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">print-circle</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でない場合、出力関数（例：<code class=\"code\">prin1</code>）は <code "
"class=\"code\">a</code> を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#1=(#1# y)</"
"samp>&rsquo; として出力します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#1=</samp>&rsquo; "
"という表記は、それに続く構造に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1</samp>&rsquo; と"
"いうラベルを付与し、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#1#</samp>&rsquo; という表記"
"は、先にラベル付けされた構造を参照します。この表記は、リストやベクトルの共通"
"要素に対して使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-print-circle</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dprint_002dcircle\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">edebug-print-circle</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-edebug_002dprint_002dcircle\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Printing-in-Edebug.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Edebug binds <code "
"class=\"code\">print-circle</code> to this value while printing results.  "
"The default value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Edebug は結果の出力時に <code "
"class=\"code\">print-circle</code> をこの値にバインドします。デフォルト値は "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> です。"

