# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">process</var> does not have a buffer, <code "
"class=\"code\">process-mark</code> returns a marker that points nowhere."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> にバッファがない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">process-mark</code> はどこにも指さないマーカーを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The default filter function uses this marker to decide where to insert "
"process output, and updates it to point after the inserted text.  That is "
"why successive batches of output are inserted consecutively."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトのフィルタ関数は、このマーカーを用いて処理出力の挿入位置を決定し、"
"挿入後のテキストを指すようにマーカーを更新します。そのため、連続する出力バッ"
"チが連続して挿入されることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Custom filter functions normally should use this marker in the same "
"fashion.  For an example of a filter function that uses <code "
"class=\"code\">process-mark</code>, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html#Process-Filter-Example\">Process Filter Example</a>."
msgstr ""
"カスタムフィルタ関数でも、通常は同様にこのマーカーを使用します。<code "
"class=\"code\">process-mark</code> を使用するフィルタ関数の例については、<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html#Process-Filter-"
"Example\">Process Filter Example</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"When the user is expected to enter input in the process buffer for "
"transmission to the process, the process marker separates the new input from "
"previous output."
msgstr ""
"プロセスへの送信用にプロセスバッファへ入力が行われる場合、プロセスマーカーが"
"新しい入力とそれまでの出力を区切る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
