"(get-buffer-process &quot;*shell*&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;process shell&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Killing the process&rsquo;s buffer deletes the process, which kills the "
"subprocess with a <code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> signal (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Signals-to-Processes.html\">Sending Signals to "
"Processes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"プロセスのバッファをキルするとプロセスが終了し、<code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</"
"code> シグナルによってサブプロセスがキルされます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Signals-to-Processes.html\">プロセスへのシグナル送信</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If the process&rsquo;s buffer is displayed in a window, your Lisp program "
"may wish to tell the process the dimensions of that window, so that the "
"process could adapt its output to those dimensions, much as it adapts to the "
"screen dimensions.  The following functions allow communicating this kind of "
"information to processes; however, not all systems support the underlying "
"functionality, so it is best to provide fallbacks, e.g., via command-line "
"arguments or environment variables."
msgstr ""
"プロセスのバッファがウィンドウに表示される場合、Lispプログラムはプロセスにそ"
"のウィンドウの寸法を伝え、プロセスが画面の寸法に合わせて出力を調整するのと同"
"様に、出力をその寸法に適応させたいと考えることがあります。以下の関数を使用す"
"ると、このような情報をプロセスに伝えることができます。ただし、すべてのシステ"
"ムが基盤となる機能をサポートしているわけではないため、コマンドライン引数や環"
"境変数などを介してフォールバックを用意しておくのが最善です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-process-window-size</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process height width</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dprocess_002dwindow_002dsize\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-process-window-size</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process height width</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-set_002dprocess_002dwindow_002dsize\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Tell <var class=\"var\">process</var> that its logical window size has "
"dimensions <var class=\"var\">width</var> by <var class=\"var\">height</"
"var>, in character units.  If this function succeeds in communicating this "
"information to the process, it returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>; "
"otherwise it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> に対し、その論理ウィンドウサイズが文字単位"
"で <var class=\"var\">width</var> × <var class=\"var\">height</var> であるこ"
"とを通知する。この関数がこの情報をプロセスに伝達できた場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"When windows that display buffers associated with process change their "
"dimensions, the affected processes should be told about these changes.  By "
"default, when the window configuration changes, Emacs will automatically "
"call <code class=\"code\">set-process-window-size</code> on behalf of every "
"process whose buffer is displayed in a window, passing it the smallest "
"dimensions of all the windows displaying the process&rsquo;s buffer.  This "
"works via <code class=\"code\">window-configuration-change-hook</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Hooks.html\">Hooks for Window Scrolling and "
"Changes</a>), which is told to invoke the function that is the value of the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-window-size-function</"
"code> for each process whose buffer is displayed in at least one window.  "
"You can customize this behavior by setting the value of that variable."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-adjust-process-window-size-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dadjust_002dprocess_002dwindow_002dsize_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">window-adjust-process-window-size-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dadjust_002dprocess_002dwindow_002dsize_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable should be a function of two arguments: a process "
"and the list of windows displaying the process&rsquo;s buffer.  When the "
"function is called, the process&rsquo;s buffer is the current buffer.  The "
"function should return a cons cell <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">width</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">height</var>)</"
"code> that describes the dimensions of the logical process window to be "
"passed via a call to <code class=\"code\">set-process-window-size</code>.  "
"The function can also return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case "
"Emacs will not call <code class=\"code\">set-process-window-size</code> for "
"this process."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、プロセスと、そのプロセスのバッファを表示しているウィンドウの"
"リストという2つの引数をとる関数である必要があります。関数が呼び出される際、プ"
"ロセスのバッファは現在のバッファとなります。この関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">set-process-window-size</code> の呼び出しを通じて渡される論理"
"プロセスウィンドウの寸法を表すコンスセル <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">width</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">height</var>)</"
"code> を返す必要があります。また、関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返"
"すこともでき、その場合 Emacs はこのプロセスに対して <code class=\"code\">set-"
"process-window-size</code> を呼び出しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Emacs supplies two predefined values for this variable: <code "
"class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-window-size-smallest</code>, which "
"returns the smallest of all the dimensions of the windows that display a "
"process&rsquo;s buffer; and <code class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-"
"window-size-largest</code>, which returns the largest dimensions.  For more "
"complex strategies, write your own function."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、この変数に対して2つの定義済み値が用意されています。プロセスのバッ"
"ファを表示しているウィンドウの全次元のうち最小値を返す<code "
"class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-window-size-smallest</code>と、最大値を"
"返す<code class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-window-size-largest</code>で"
"す。より複雑な戦略が必要な場合は、独自の関数を記述してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid "This variable can be buffer-local."
msgstr "この変数はバッファローカルになり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If the process has the <code class=\"code\">adjust-window-size-function</"
"code> property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-"
"Information.html\">Process Information</a>), its value overrides the global "
"and buffer-local values of <code class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-window-"
"size-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"プロセスが <code class=\"code\">adjust-window-size-function</code> プロパティ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Process-Information.html\">プロセス情報</a> を参"
"照）を持つ場合、その値は <code class=\"code\">window-adjust-process-window-"
"size-function</code> のグローバル値およびバッファローカル値を上書きします。"

