# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "Several functions return information about processes."
msgstr "いくつかの関数は、プロセスに関する情報を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">list-processes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional query-only buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-list_002dprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">list-processes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional query-only buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-list_002dprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This command displays a listing of all living processes.  In addition, it "
"finally deletes any process whose status was &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Exited</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Signaled</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  It returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、すべての稼働中のプロセスを一覧表示します。さらに、最後にス"
"テータスが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Exited</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Signaled</samp>&rsquo; であったプロセスを削除します。戻"
"り値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"The processes are shown in a buffer named <samp class=\"file\">*Process "
"List*</samp> (unless you specify otherwise using the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var>), whose major mode is Process Menu mode."
msgstr ""
"これらのプロセスは、<samp class=\"file\">*Process List*</samp> という名前の"
"バッファ（オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> で別途指定しない限"
"り）に表示され、そのメジャーモードは Process Menu モードです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">query-only</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it only lists processes whose query flag is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Query-Before-"
"Exit.html\">Querying Before Exit</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">query-only</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、クエリフラグが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であるプロセスのみが"
"一覧表示されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">終了前の"
"クエリ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of all processes that have not been deleted."
msgstr "この関数は、削除されていないすべてのプロセスの一覧を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(process-list)\n"
"     &rArr; (#&lt;process display-time&gt; #&lt;process shell&gt;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">num-processors</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional query</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-num_002dprocessors\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">num-processors</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional query</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-num_002dprocessors\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the number of processors, a positive integer.  Each "
"usable thread execution unit counts as a processor.  By default, the count "
"includes the number of available processors, which you can override by "
"setting the <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://www.openmp.org/spec-html/5.1/"
"openmpse59.html\"><code class=\"env\">OMP_NUM_THREADS</code> environment "
"variable of OpenMP</a>.  If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">query</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">current</code>, this function ignores <code "
"class=\"env\">OMP_NUM_THREADS</code>; if <var class=\"var\">query</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">all</code>, this function also counts processors that "
"are on the system but are not available to the current process."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プロセッサ数を正の整数として返します。利用可能な各スレッド実行単"
"位が1つのプロセッサとしてカウントされます。デフォルトでは、カウントには利用可"
"能なプロセッサ数が含まれますが、<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://"
"www.openmp.org/spec-html/5.1/openmpse59.html\">OpenMPの<code "
"class=\"env\">OMP_NUM_THREADS</code>環境変数</a>を設定することでこの値を上書"
"きできます。オプション引数<var class=\"var\">query</var>が<code "
"class=\"code\">current</code>の場合、この関数は<code "
"class=\"env\">OMP_NUM_THREADS</code>を無視します。また、<var "
"class=\"var\">query</var>が<code class=\"code\">all</code>の場合、この関数は"
"システム上には存在するが現在のプロセスでは利用できないプロセッサもカウントし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">name</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the process named <var class=\"var\">name</var> (a "
"string), or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there is none.  The argument "
"<var class=\"var\">name</var> can also be a process object, in which case it "
"is returned."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">name</var> という名前のプロセス（文字列）を、"
"存在しない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> にはプロセスオブジェクトを指定することもでき、その場"
"合はそのオブジェクトが返されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(get-process &quot;shell&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; #&lt;process shell&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-process_002dcommand\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-process_002dcommand\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the command that was executed to start <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var>.  This is a list of strings, the first string "
"being the program executed and the rest of the strings being the arguments "
"that were given to the program.  For a network, serial, or pipe connection, "
"this is either <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means the process is "
"running or <code class=\"code\">t</code> (process is stopped)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">process</var>を起動するために実行されたコマン"
"ドを返します。これは文字列のリストであり、最初の文字列が実行されたプログラ"
"ム、残りの文字列がそのプログラムに渡された引数となります。ネットワーク、シリ"
"アル、またはパイプ接続の場合、これはプロセスが実行中であることを示す<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>か、プロセスが停止していることを示す<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>のいずれかとなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(process-command (get-process &quot;shell&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;bash&quot; &quot;-i&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-contact</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"&amp;optional key no-block</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dcontact\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-contact</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"&amp;optional key no-block</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dcontact\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This function returns information about how a network, a serial, or a pipe "
"connection was set up.  When <var class=\"var\">key</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it returns <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">hostname</var> <var class=\"var\">service</var>)</code> for a "
"network connection, <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">port</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">speed</var>)</code> for a serial connection, and <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> for a pipe connection.  For an ordinary child "
"process, this function always returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> when "
"called with a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">key</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ネットワーク、シリアル、またはパイプ接続がどのように確立されたか"
"に関する情報を返します。<var class=\"var\">key</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ネットワーク接続では <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">hostname</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">service</var>)</code> を、シリアル接続では <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">port</var> <var class=\"var\">speed</"
"var>)</code> を、パイプ接続では <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。通"
"常の子プロセスの場合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> および <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> を指定してこの関数を呼び出すと、常に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">key</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the value "
"is the complete status information for the connection, server, serial port, "
"or pipe; that is, the list of keywords and values specified in <code "
"class=\"code\">make-network-process</code>, <code class=\"code\">make-serial-"
"process</code>, or <code class=\"code\">make-pipe-process</code>, except "
"that some of the values represent the current status instead of what you "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">key</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、その値"
"は接続、サーバー、シリアルポート、またはパイプに関する完全なステータス情報、"
"すなわち <code class=\"code\">make-network-process</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">make-serial-process</code>、または <code class=\"code\">make-"
"pipe-process</code> で指定されたキーワードと値の一覧となります。ただし、一部"
"の値は、指定した内容ではなく現在のステータスを表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"For a network process, the values include (see <code class=\"code\">make-"
"network-process</code> for a complete list):"
msgstr ""
"ネットワークプロセスの場合、値には以下が含まれます（完全な一覧については "
"<code class=\"code\">make-network-process</code> を参照してください）："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:buffer</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:buffer</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "The associated value is the process buffer."
msgstr "関連付けられた値はプロセスバッファです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:filter</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:filter</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"The associated value is the process filter function.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">Process Filter Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"対応する値はプロセスフィルタ関数です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html\">プロセスフィルタ関数</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:sentinel</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:sentinel</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"The associated value is the process sentinel function.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">Sentinels: Detecting Process Status "
