"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:remote</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:remote</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "In a connection, the address in internal format of the remote peer."
msgstr "関連して、リモートピアの内部形式のアドレス。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:local</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:local</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "The local address, in internal format."
msgstr "内部形式のローカルアドレス。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:service</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:service</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"In a server, if you specified <code class=\"code\">t</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">service</var>, this value is the actual port number."
msgstr ""
"サーバーにおいて、<var class=\"var\">service</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を指定した場合、この値が実際のポート番号となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:local</code> and <code class=\"code\">:remote</code> "
"are included even if they were not specified explicitly in <code "
"class=\"code\">make-network-process</code>."
