"<code class=\"code\">:local</code> と <code class=\"code\">:remote</code> "
"は、<code class=\"code\">make-network-process</code> で明示的に指定されていな"
"くても含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"For a serial connection, see <code class=\"code\">make-serial-process</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">serial-process-configure</code> for the list of "
"keys.  For a pipe connection, see <code class=\"code\">make-pipe-process</"
