#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the terminal name that <var class=\"var\">process</"
"var> is using for its communication with Emacs&mdash;or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if it is using pipes instead of a pty (see <code "
"class=\"code\">process-connection-type</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">Creating an Asynchronous Process</a>).  "
"By default, this function returns the terminal name if any of <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var>&rsquo;s standard streams use a terminal.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">stream</var> is one of <code class=\"code\">stdin</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">stdout</code>, or <code class=\"code\">stderr</code>, "
"this function returns the terminal name (or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"as above) that <var class=\"var\">process</var> uses for that stream "
"specifically.  You can use this to determine whether a particular stream "
"uses a pipe or a pty."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Process-Information.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">process</var> represents a program running on a remote "
"host, this function returns the <em class=\"emph\">local</em> terminal name "
"that communicates with <var class=\"var\">process</var>; you can get the "
"terminal name used by that program on the remote host with the process "
"property <code class=\"code\">remote-tty</code>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> represents a network, serial, or pipe "
"connection, this function always returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> がリモートホスト上で動作するプログラムを表す"
"場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">process</var> と通信する<em "
"class=\"emph\">ローカル</em>端末名を返します。リモートホスト上のそのプログラ"
"ムが使用している端末名は、プロセスプロパティ <code class=\"code\">remote-"
"tty</code> で取得できます。<var class=\"var\">process</var> がネットワーク、"
"シリアル、またはパイプ接続を表す場合、この関数は常に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

