msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uptime-of-Emacs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string representing the Emacs <em "
"class=\"dfn\">uptime</em>&mdash;the elapsed wall-clock time this instance of "
"Emacs is running.  The string is formatted by <code class=\"code\">format-"
"seconds</code> according to the optional argument <var class=\"var\">format</"
"var>.  For the available format descriptors, see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Time-Parsing.html\">format-seconds</a>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">format</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or omitted, it "
"defaults to <code class=\"code\">&quot;%Y, %D, %H, %M, %z%S&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、Emacsの<em class=\"dfn\">uptime</em>――このEmacsインスタンスが動作"
"している経過実時間――を表す文字列を返します。文字列は、オプション引数<var "
"class=\"var\">format</var>に従って<code class=\"code\">format-seconds</code>"
"によってフォーマットされます。利用可能なフォーマット記述子については、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Time-Parsing.html\">format-seconds</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。<var class=\"var\">format</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である"
"か、または省略されている場合は、デフォルトで<code class=\"code\">&quot;%Y, "
"%D, %H, %M, %z%S&quot;</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
msgid "When called interactively, it prints the uptime in the echo area."
msgstr "対話的に呼び出された場合、echo領域に稼働時間を出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-internal-run-time</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-get_002dinternal_002drun_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get-internal-run-time</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-get_002dinternal_002drun_002dtime\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the processor run time used by Emacs, as a Lisp "
"timestamp (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、Emacsで使用されるプロセッサの実行時間を、Lispのタイムスタンプ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>を参照）として"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
msgid ""
"Note that the time returned by this function excludes the time Emacs was not "
"using the processor, and if the Emacs process has several threads, the "
"returned value is the sum of the processor times used up by all Emacs "
"threads."
msgstr ""
"なお、この関数が返す時間にはEmacsがプロセッサを使用していなかった時間は含まれ"
"ず、またEmacsプロセスに複数のスレッドがある場合、返される値はすべてのEmacsス"
"レッドが使用したプロセッサ時間の合計となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
msgid ""
"If the system doesn&rsquo;t provide a way to determine the processor run "
"time, <code class=\"code\">get-internal-run-time</code> returns the same "
"time as <code class=\"code\">current-time</code>."
msgstr ""
"システムがプロセッサの実行時間を判定する手段を提供していない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">get-internal-run-time</code>は<code class=\"code\">current-"
"time</code>と同じ時間を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Processor-Run-Time.html
