# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Profiling.html
msgid ""
"Press <kbd class=\"kbd\">j</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">profiler-report-find-"
"entry</code>) or <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> to jump to the definition "
"of a function at point.  Press <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">profiler-report-describe-entry</code>) to view a "
"function&rsquo;s documentation.  You can save a profile to a file using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">profiler-report-write-"
"profile</code>) and read a saved profile with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x&nbsp;profiler-find-profile</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;profiler-"
"find-profile-other-window</kbd>.  You can compare two profiles using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">=</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">profiler-report-compare-profile</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">j</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">profiler-report-find-entry</"
"code>) または <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> を押すと、指定した位置にある関"
"数の定義へジャンプします。<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">profiler-report-describe-entry</code>) を押すと、関数のドキュ"
"メントを表示します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-w</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">profiler-report-write-profile</code>) でプロファイルをファイル"
"に保存し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;profiler-find-profile</kbd> または "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;profiler-find-profile-other-window</kbd> で保存済"
"みのプロファイルを読み込むことができます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">profiler-report-compare-profile</code>) で2つのプロファイルを"
"比較できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Profiling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-elp_002eel\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
