# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a symbol describing what kind of text the completion "
"function is trying to complete.  If the symbol matches one of the keys in "
"<code class=\"code\">completion-category-overrides</code>, the usual "
"completion behavior is overridden.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-"
"Variables.html\">Completion Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"この値は、補完機能がどのようなテキストを補完しようとしているかを示すシンボル"
"である必要があります。このシンボルが <code class=\"code\">completion-"
"category-overrides</code> のキーのいずれかと一致する場合、通常の補完動作が上"
"書きされます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-Variables.html\">補完変数</"
"a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-annotation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">annotation-function</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-annotation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-annotation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">annotation-function</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-annotation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a function for <em class=\"dfn\">annotating</em> "
"completions.  The function should take one argument, <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, which is a possible completion.  It should "
"return a string, which is displayed after the completion <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> in the <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> "
"buffer.  Unless this function puts own face on the annotation suffix string, "
"the <code class=\"code\">completions-annotations</code> face is added by "
"default to that string."
msgstr ""
"値は、補完を<em class=\"dfn\">アノテーション</em>するための関数である必要があ"
"ります。この関数は、補完候補である<var class=\"var\">string</var>を1つの引数"
"として受け取ります。そして、<samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp>バッファ"
"内の補完<var class=\"var\">string</var>の後に表示される文字列を返す必要があり"
"ます。この関数がアノテーションの接尾辞文字列に独自のフェイスを設定しない限"
"り、デフォルトで<code class=\"code\">completions-annotations</code>フェイスが"
"その文字列に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-affixation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">affixation-function</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-affixation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-affixation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">affixation-function</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-affixation_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a function for adding prefixes and suffixes to "
"completions.  The function should take one argument, <var "
"class=\"var\">completions</var>, which is a list of possible completions.  "
"It should return such a list of <var class=\"var\">completions</var> where "
"each element contains a list of three elements: a completion, a prefix which "
"is displayed before the completion string in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffer, and a suffix displayed after the "
"completion string.  This function takes priority over <code "
"class=\"code\">annotation-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"valueは、補完にプレフィックスとサフィックスを追加するための関数である必要があ"
"ります。この関数は、候補となる補完のリストである<var "
"class=\"var\">completions</var>を1つの引数として受け取ります。そして、<var "
"class=\"var\">completions</var>のリストを返します。各要素は、補完、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp>バッファ内で補完文字列の前に表示されるプレ"
"フィックス、および補完文字列の後に表示されるサフィックスという3つの要素からな"
"るリストです。この関数は<code class=\"code\">annotation-function</code>よりも"
"優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-group_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">group-function</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"group_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-group_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">group-function</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"group_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a function for grouping the completion candidates.  The "
"function must take two arguments, <var class=\"var\">completion</var>, which "
"is a completion candidate and <var class=\"var\">transform</var>, which is a "
"boolean flag.  If <var class=\"var\">transform</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function must return the group title of the "
"group to which the candidate belongs.  The returned title can also be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Otherwise the function must return the "
"transformed candidate.  The transformation can for example remove a "
"redundant prefix, which is displayed in the group title."
msgstr ""
"valueには、補完候補をグループ化するための関数を指定します。この関数は、補完候"
"補である<var class=\"var\">completion</var>と、ブールフラグである<var "
"class=\"var\">transform</var>の2つの引数を取る必要があります。<var "
"class=\"var\">transform</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合、関"
"数はその候補が属するグループのグループタイトルを返す必要があります。返される"
"タイトルは<code class=\"code\">nil</code>であっても構いません。それ以外の場合"
"は、変換後の候補を返す必要があります。変換では、例えばグループタイトルに表示"
"される冗長なプレフィックスを削除することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-display_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">display-sort-function</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-display_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-display_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">display-sort-function</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-display_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a function for sorting completions.  The function should "
"take one argument, a list of completion strings, and return a sorted list of "
"completion strings.  It is allowed to alter the input list destructively."
msgstr ""
"値は、補完候補をソートするための関数である必要があります。この関数は、補完候"
"補文字列のリストを1つの引数として受け取り、ソート済みの補完候補文字列のリスト"
"を返します。入力リストを破壊的に変更しても構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-cycle_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">cycle-sort-function</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-cycle_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-cycle_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">cycle-sort-function</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-cycle_002dsort_002dfunction_002c-in-completion\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The value should be a function for sorting completions, when <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and the user is cycling through completion "
"alternatives.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Completion-Options.html#Completion-"
"Options\">Completion Options</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>.  Its argument list and return value are the same as for <code "
"class=\"code\">display-sort-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"この値は、<code class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく、ユーザーが補完候補を順に切り替えている際"
"の、補完結果をソートするための関数である必要があります。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Completion-"
"Options.html#Completion-Options\">Completion Options</a> を参照してください。"
"その引数リストと戻り値は、<code class=\"code\">display-sort-function</code> "
"の場合と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-table-dynamic</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function &amp;optional switch-buffer</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-completion_002dtable_002ddynamic\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
