"link\" href=\"#index-completion_002dtable_002ddynamic\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function is a convenient way to write a function that can act as a "
"programmed completion function.  The argument <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> should be a function that takes one argument, a string, and returns a "
"completion table (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Completion.html\">Basic Completion Functions</a>) containing all the "
"possible completions.  The table returned by <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> can also include elements that don&rsquo;t match the string argument; "
"they are automatically filtered out by <code class=\"code\">completion-table-"
"dynamic</code>.  In particular, <var class=\"var\">function</var> can ignore "
"its argument and return a full list of all possible completions.  You can "
"think of <code class=\"code\">completion-table-dynamic</code> as a "
"transducer between <var class=\"var\">function</var> and the interface for "
"programmed completion functions."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プログラムによる補完機能として動作する関数を記述するための便利な"
"方法です。引数 <var class=\"var\">function</var> には、1つの引数（文字列）を"
"受け取り、考えられるすべての補完候補を含む補完テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Completion.html\">基本的な補完関数</a> を参照）を返す関数を指定"
"します。<var class=\"var\">function</var> が返すテーブルには、文字列引数に一"
"致しない要素が含まれることもありますが、これらは <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-table-dynamic</code> によって自動的に除外されます。"
"特に、<var class=\"var\">function</var> は引数を無視して、考えられるすべての"
"補完候補の完全なリストを返すことができます。<code class=\"code\">completion-"
"table-dynamic</code> は、<var class=\"var\">function</var> とプログラムによる"
"補完関数用のインターフェースとの間のトランスデューサと考えることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">switch-buffer</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, and completion is performed in the minibuffer, "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> will be called with current buffer set to "
"the buffer from which the minibuffer was entered."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">switch-buffer</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であり、ミニバッファ内で補完が行われる場合、"
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> は現在のバッファにミニバッファに入った際の"
"バッファを設定して呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"The return value of <code class=\"code\">completion-table-dynamic</code> is "
"a function that can be used as the 2nd argument to <code class=\"code\">try-"
"completion</code> and <code class=\"code\">all-completions</code>.  Note "
"that this function will always return empty metadata and trivial boundaries."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completion-table-dynamic</code> の戻り値は、<code "
"class=\"code\">try-completion</code> および <code class=\"code\">all-"
"completions</code> の第2引数として使用できる関数です。なお、この関数は常に空"
"のメタデータと自明な境界を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-table-with-cache</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function &amp;optional ignore-case</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-completion_002dtable_002dwith_002dcache\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-table-with-cache</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">function &amp;optional ignore-case</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-completion_002dtable_002dwith_002dcache\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This is a wrapper for <code class=\"code\">completion-table-dynamic</code> "
"that saves the last argument-result pair.  This means that multiple lookups "
"with the same argument only need to call <var class=\"var\">function</var> "
"once.  This can be useful when a slow operation is involved, such as calling "
"an external process."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">completion-table-dynamic</code> のラッパーで、直"
"前の引数と結果のペアを保存します。これにより、同じ引数による複数回のルック"
"アップでも、<var class=\"var\">function</var> を一度呼び出すだけで済むように"
"なります。外部プロセスの呼び出しなど、処理に時間がかかる操作が含まれる場合に"
"有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-table-with-metadata</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">table metadata</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"completion_002dtable_002dwith_002dmetadata\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">completion-table-with-metadata</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">table metadata</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"completion_002dtable_002dwith_002dmetadata\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Programmed-Completion.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a completion table that behaves like the existing "
"completion table <var class=\"var\">table</var>, except that the new table "
"uses the alist <var class=\"var\">metadata</var> as its completion metadata."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、既存の補完テーブル <var class=\"var\">table</var> と同様に動作す"
"る補完テーブルを作成しますが、新しいテーブルではアリスト <var "
"class=\"var\">metadata</var> を補完メタデータとして使用します。"

