#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.4.2 Reporting Operation Progress<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Reporting-Operation-Progress\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.4.2 操作進捗の報告<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Reporting-"
"Operation-Progress\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-progress-reporting\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-progress-reporting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"When an operation can take a while to finish, you should inform the user "
"about the progress it makes.  This way the user can estimate remaining time "
"and clearly see that Emacs is busy working, not hung.  A convenient way to "
"do this is to use a <em class=\"dfn\">progress reporter</em>."
msgstr ""
"処理の完了に時間がかかる場合は、進捗状況をユーザーに知らせるべきです。そうす"
"ることで、ユーザーは残り時間を見積もることができ、Emacsがハングしているのでは"
"なく、処理中であることが明確に分かります。これを実現する便利な方法は、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">プログレスレポーター</em>を使用することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid "Here is a working example that does nothing useful:"
msgstr "特に役に立つことはないものの、動作する例を以下に示します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((progress-reporter\n"
"       (make-progress-reporter &quot;Collecting mana for Emacs...&quot;\n"
"                               0  500)))\n"
"  (dotimes (k 500)\n"
"    (sit-for 0.01)\n"
"    (progress-reporter-update progress-reporter k))\n"
"  (progress-reporter-done progress-reporter))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-progress-reporter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">message &amp;optional min-value max-value current-value min-"
"change min-time context</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dprogress_002dreporter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-progress-reporter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">message &amp;optional min-value max-value current-value min-"
"change min-time context</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dprogress_002dreporter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a progress reporter object, which you will "
"use as an argument for the other functions listed below.  The idea is to "
"precompute as much data as possible to make progress reporting very fast."
msgstr ""
"この関数は進捗報告用オブジェクトを生成して返します。このオブジェクトを、以下"
"に挙げる他の関数の引数として使用します。その狙いは、可能な限り多くのデータを"
"事前に計算しておくことで、進捗報告を非常に高速に行うことにあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"When this progress reporter is subsequently used, it will display <var "
"class=\"var\">message</var> in the echo area, followed by progress "
"percentage.  <var class=\"var\">message</var> is treated as a simple "
"string.  If you need it to depend on a filename, for instance, use <code "
"class=\"code\">format-message</code> before calling this function."
msgstr ""
"この進捗報告関数をその後使用すると、エコー領域に <var class=\"var\">message</"
"var> が表示され、続いて進捗率が表示されます。<var class=\"var\">message</"
"var> は単なる文字列として扱われます。例えば、ファイル名に依存させる必要がある"
