#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"In this example, if the body takes more than two seconds to execute, the "
"message will be displayed.  If it takes a shorter time than that, the "
"message won&rsquo;t be displayed.  In either case, the body is evaluated as "
"normally, and the return value of the final element in the body is the "
"return value of the macro."
msgstr ""
"この例では、本体の実行に2秒以上かかった場合、メッセージが表示されます。それよ"
"り短い時間で済んだ場合は、メッセージは表示されません。いずれの場合も、本体は"
"通常通り評価され、本体の最後の要素の戻り値がマクロの戻り値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Progress.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">message</var> element is evaluated before <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>, and is always evaluated, whether the message is "
"displayed or not."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">message</var> 要素は <var class=\"var\">body</var> よりも"
"先に評価され、メッセージの表示有無にかかわらず、常に評価されます。"

