# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-searching-text-properties\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-properties_002c-searching\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-searching-text-properties\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-properties_002c-searching\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"In typical use of text properties, most of the time several or many "
"consecutive characters have the same value for a property.  Rather than "
"writing your programs to examine characters one by one, it is much faster to "
"process chunks of text that have the same property value."
msgstr ""
"テキストプロパティの一般的な利用においては、多くの場合、連続する数文字あるい"
"は多数の文字が同じプロパティ値を持ちます。文字を一つずつ調べるようにプログラ"
"ムを組むよりも、同じプロパティ値を持つテキストの塊を処理する方がはるかに高速"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"Here are functions you can use to do this.  They use <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> for comparing property values.  In all cases, <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> defaults to the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"これを実現するために利用できる関数を以下に示します。これらの関数では、プロパ"
"ティ値の比較に <code class=\"code\">eq</code> を使用します。いずれの場合も、"
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> はデフォルトで現在のバッファとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"For good performance, it&rsquo;s very important to use the <var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var> argument to these functions, especially the ones "
"that search for a single property&mdash;otherwise, they may spend a long "
"time scanning to the end of the buffer, if the property you are interested "
"in does not change."
msgstr ""
"良好なパフォーマンスを得るには、これらの関数、特に単一のプロパティを検索する"
"関数に <var class=\"var\">limit</var> 引数を指定することが非常に重要です。そ"
"うしないと、関心のあるプロパティが変化しない場合、バッファの末尾までスキャン"
"するのに長い時間を要する可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"These functions do not move point; instead, they return a position (or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>).  Remember that a position is always between two "
"characters; the position returned by these functions is between two "
"characters with different properties."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数はポイントを移動させず、代わりに位置（または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>）を返します。位置は常に2つの文字の間にあることに留"
"意してください。これらの関数が返す位置は、異なるプロパティを持つ2つの文字の間"
"にあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">next-property-change</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pos "
"&amp;optional object limit</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"next_002dproperty_002dchange\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">next-property-change</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">pos "
"&amp;optional object limit</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"next_002dproperty_002dchange\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"The function scans the text forward from position <var class=\"var\">pos</"
"var> in the string or buffer <var class=\"var\">object</var> until it finds "
"a change in some text property, then returns the position of the change.  In "
"other words, it returns the position of the first character beyond <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> whose properties are not identical to those of the "
"character just after <var class=\"var\">pos</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列またはバッファ <var class=\"var\">object</var> の位置 <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> からテキストを前方にスキャンし、何らかのテキストプロ"
"パティの変化が見つかるまで処理を続け、その変化の位置を返します。言い換えれ"
"ば、<var class=\"var\">pos</var> より後ろにある文字のうち、そのプロパティが "
"<var class=\"var\">pos</var> の直後の文字のプロパティと同一ではない最初の文字"
"の位置を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">limit</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then the scan ends at position <var class=\"var\">limit</var>.  If there is "
"no property change before that point, this function returns <var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">limit</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、スキャンは位置 <var class=\"var\">limit</var> で終了します。その時点まで"
"にプロパティの変更がない場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">limit</var> を返"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the properties remain "
"unchanged all the way to the end of <var class=\"var\">object</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If the value "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it is a position greater than or "
"equal to <var class=\"var\">pos</var>.  The value equals <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> only when <var class=\"var\">limit</var> equals <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> の最後までプロパティが変更されず、かつ <var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、値"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となる。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外である場合、それは <var class=\"var\">pos</var> 以上の位置となる。"
"値が <var class=\"var\">pos</var> と等しくなるのは、<var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var> が <var class=\"var\">pos</var> と等しい場合に限ら"
"れる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of how to scan the buffer by chunks of text within which "
"all properties are constant:"
msgstr ""
"すべてのプロパティが一定であるテキストのチャンク単位でバッファをスキャンする"
"方法の例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (not (eobp))\n"
"  (let ((plist (text-properties-at (point)))\n"
"        (next-change\n"
"         (or (next-property-change (point) (current-buffer))\n"
"             (point-max))))\n"
"    <span class=\"r\">Process text from point to <var class=\"var\">next-change</var>...</span>\n"
"    (goto-char next-change)))\n"
msgstr ""

