# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if at least one "
"character between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> has a property <var class=\"var\">prop</var> whose value is <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>.  More precisely, it returns the position of the "
"first such character.  Otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> の"
"間にある文字のうち、少なくとも1つが値 <var class=\"var\">value</var> のプロパ"
"ティ <var class=\"var\">prop</var> を持つ場合、非 <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。より正確には、そのような最初の文字の位置を返します。それ以"
"外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"The optional fifth argument, <var class=\"var\">object</var>, specifies the "
"string or buffer to scan.  Positions are relative to <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>.  The default for <var class=\"var\">object</var> "
"is the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"省略可能な第5引数 <var class=\"var\">object</var> は、スキャン対象の文字列ま"
"たはバッファを指定します。位置は <var class=\"var\">object</var> を基準としま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">object</var> のデフォルト値は現在のバッファです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">text-property-not-all</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"end prop value &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-text_002dproperty_002dnot_002dall\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">text-property-not-all</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"end prop value &amp;optional object</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-text_002dproperty_002dnot_002dall\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if at least one "
"character between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> does not have a property <var class=\"var\">prop</var> with value <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>.  More precisely, it returns the position of the "
"first such character.  Otherwise, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> の"
"間にある文字のうち、少なくとも1つが値 <var class=\"var\">value</var> のプロパ"
"ティ <var class=\"var\">prop</var> を持たない場合、non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。より正確には、そのような最初の文字の位"
"置を返します。それ以外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">text-property-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">prop &amp;optional value predicate not-current</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"text_002dproperty_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">text-property-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">prop &amp;optional value predicate not-current</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"text_002dproperty_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"Search for the next region of text whose property <var class=\"var\">prop</"
"var> is a match for <var class=\"var\">value</var> (which defaults to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>), according to <var class=\"var\">predicate</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> に従い、プロパティ <var "
"class=\"var\">prop</var> が <var class=\"var\">value</var>（デフォルトは "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>）に一致する次のテキスト領域を検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function is modeled after <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"String-Search.html\">Searching for Strings</"
"a>) and friends, in that it moves point, but it also returns a structure "
"that describes the match instead of returning it in <code "
"class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> and friends."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポイントを移動させる点では <code class=\"code\">search-forward</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"String-Search.html\">文字列の検索</a> を参"
"照）およびその関連関数を踏襲していますが、<code class=\"code\">match-"
"beginning</code> およびその関連関数のようにマッチ結果を返すのではなく、マッチ"
"内容を記述する構造体を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"If the text property whose value is a match can&rsquo;t be found, the "
"function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If it&rsquo;s found, "
"point is placed at the end of the region that has this matching text "
"property, and the function returns a <code class=\"code\">prop-match</code> "
"structure with information about the match."
msgstr ""
"値が一致するテキストプロパティが見つからない場合、関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。見つかった場合は、point はこの一致する"
"テキストプロパティを持つ領域の末尾に配置され、関数は一致に関する情報を含む "
"<code class=\"code\">prop-match</code> 構造体を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> can either be <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> (which is a synonym for <code class=\"code\">equal</code>), <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (which means &ldquo;not equal&rdquo;), or a "
"predicate that will be called with two arguments: <var class=\"var\">value</"
"var> and the value of the text property <var class=\"var\">prop</var> at the "
"buffer position that is a candidate for a match.  The function should return "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there&rsquo;s a match, <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> は、<code class=\"code\">t</code>（<code "
"class=\"code\">equal</code> の同義語）、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>（「等"
"しくない」の意）、または 2 つの引数（<var class=\"var\">value</var> と、マッ"
"チ候補となるバッファ位置における text プロパティ <var class=\"var\">prop</"
"var> の値）で呼び出される述語のいずれかとなります。この関数は、マッチした場合"
"は non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、そうでない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">not-current</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then if point is already in a region where we have a property match, "
"skip past that region and find the next region instead."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">not-current</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でな"
"い場合、ポイントがすでにプロパティマッチのある領域に含まれているなら、その領"
"域をスキップして代わりに次の領域を探す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">prop-match</code> structure has the following "
"accessor functions: <code class=\"code\">prop-match-beginning</code> (the "
"start of the match), <code class=\"code\">prop-match-end</code> (the end of "
"the match), and <code class=\"code\">prop-match-value</code> (the value of "
"<var class=\"var\">property</var> at the start of the match)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">prop-match</code> 構造には、以下のアクセサ関数がありま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">prop-match-beginning</code>（マッチの開始位置）、"
"<code class=\"code\">prop-match-end</code>（マッチの終了位置）、および <code "
"class=\"code\">prop-match-value</code>（マッチ開始位置における <var "
"class=\"var\">property</var> の値）です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid "In the examples below, we use a buffer whose contents is:"
msgstr "以下の例では、次のような内容のバッファを使用します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is a <b class=\"b\">bold</b> and here&rsquo;s <b class=\"b\"><i class=\"i\">bolditalic</i></b> and this is the end.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"That is, the &ldquo;bold&rdquo; words are the <code class=\"code\">bold</"
"code> face, and the &ldquo;italic&rdquo; word is in the <code "
"class=\"code\">italic</code> face."
msgstr ""
"つまり、「太字」の単語は<code class=\"code\">bold</code>フェイスであり、「斜"
"体」の単語は<code class=\"code\">italic</code>フェイスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid "With point at the start:"
msgstr "開始時点での地点："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (setq match (text-property-search-forward 'face 'bold t))\n"
"  (push (buffer-substring (prop-match-beginning match)\n"
"                          (prop-match-end match))\n"
"        words))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"This will pick out all the words that use the <code class=\"code\">bold</"
"code> face."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">bold</code>フェイスを使用しているすべての単"
"語が抽出されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (setq match (text-property-search-forward 'face nil t))\n"
"  (push (buffer-substring (prop-match-beginning match)\n"
"                          (prop-match-end match))\n"
"        words))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"This will pick out all the bits that have no face properties, which will "
"result in the list &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(&quot;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;&quot; "
"&quot;and&nbsp;here's&nbsp;&quot; "
"&quot;and&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&quot;)</samp>&rsquo; (only in "
"reverse order, since we used <code class=\"code\">push</code>, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"List-Variables.html\">Modifying List Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これにより、faceプロパティを持たないすべてのビットが抽出され、結果としてリス"
"ト &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(&quot;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;&quot; "
"&quot;and&nbsp;here's&nbsp;&quot; "
"&quot;and&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;end&quot;)</samp>&rsquo; が得られま"
"す（<code class=\"code\">push</code>を使用したため、逆順になります。詳細は "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"List-Variables.html\">リスト変数の変更</a> を参照し"
"てください）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (setq match (text-property-search-forward 'face nil nil))\n"
"  (push (buffer-substring (prop-match-beginning match)\n"
"                          (prop-match-end match))\n"
"        words))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"This will pick out all the regions where <code class=\"code\">face</code> is "
"set to something, but this is split up into where the properties change, so "
"the result here will be &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(&quot;bold&quot; "
"&quot;bold&quot; &quot;italic&quot;)</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">face</code> に何らかの値が設定されているすべ"
"てのリージョンが抽出されますが、プロパティが変化する箇所ごとに分割されるた"
"め、ここでの結果は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(&quot;bold&quot; "
"&quot;bold&quot; &quot;italic&quot;)</samp>&rsquo; となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Property-Search.html
msgid ""
"For a more realistic example where you might use this, consider that you "
"have a buffer where certain sections represent URLs, and these are tagged "
