# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<span>41.11 Querying Before Exit<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Querying-"
"Before-Exit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>41.11 終了前のクエリ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Querying-Before-"
"Exit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs exits, it terminates all its subprocesses.  For subprocesses that "
"run a program, it sends them the <code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> signal; "
"connections are simply closed.  Because subprocesses may be doing valuable "
"work, Emacs normally asks the user to confirm that it is ok to terminate "
"them.  Each process has a query flag, which, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, says that Emacs should ask for confirmation "
"before exiting and thus killing that process.  The default for the query "
"flag is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, meaning <em class=\"emph\">do</em> "
"query."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが終了する際、すべてのサブプロセスを終了させます。プログラムを実行するサ"
"ブプロセスには<code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code>シグナルを送信し、接続は単に"
"閉じられます。サブプロセスが重要な処理を行っている可能性があるため、通常、"
"Emacsはそれらを終了させてもよいかユーザーに確認を求めます。各プロセスにはクエ"
"リフラグがあり、これが<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、Emacsは終了"
"して当該プロセスを強制終了させる前に確認を求めるべきであることを示します。ク"
"エリフラグのデフォルト値は<code class=\"code\">t</code>であり、これは<em "
"class=\"emph\">確認を行う</em>ことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-query-on-exit-flag</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dquery_002don_002dexit_002dflag\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">process-query-on-exit-flag</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"process_002dquery_002don_002dexit_002dflag\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid "This returns the query flag of <var class=\"var\">process</var>."
msgstr "これは <var class=\"var\">process</var> のクエリフラグを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-process-query-on-exit-flag</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process flag</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dprocess_002dquery_002don_002dexit_002dflag\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-process-query-on-exit-flag</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">process flag</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dprocess_002dquery_002don_002dexit_002dflag\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the query flag of <var class=\"var\">process</var> to "
"<var class=\"var\">flag</var>.  It returns <var class=\"var\">flag</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">process</var> のクエリフラグを <var "
"class=\"var\">flag</var> に設定します。<var class=\"var\">flag</var> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using <code class=\"code\">set-process-query-on-exit-"
"flag</code> on a shell process to avoid querying:"
msgstr ""
"シェルプロセスでクエリを回避するために <code class=\"code\">set-process-"
"query-on-exit-flag</code> を使用する例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
