"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">confirm-kill-processes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-confirm_002dkill_002dprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">confirm-kill-processes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-confirm_002dkill_002dprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Query-Before-Exit.html
msgid ""
"If this user option is set to <code class=\"code\">t</code> (the default), "
"then Emacs asks for confirmation before killing processes on exit.  If it is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs kills processes without confirmation, "
"i.e., the query flag of all processes is ignored."
msgstr ""
"このユーザーオプションが <code class=\"code\">t</code>（デフォルト）に設定さ"
"れている場合、Emacs は終了時にプロセスを終了する前に確認を求めます。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、Emacs は確認なしにプロセスを終了します。"
"つまり、すべてのプロセスのクエリフラグが無視されます。"

