#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.18 Quitting Windows<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Quitting-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.18 Windowsの終了<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Quitting-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"After a command uses <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> to put a "
"buffer on the screen, the user may decide to hide it and return to the "
"previous configuration of the Emacs display.  We call that <em "
"class=\"dfn\">quitting the window</em>.  The way to do this is to call <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-window</code> while the window used by <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> is the selected window."
msgstr ""
"コマンドが <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> を使用してバッファを画"
"面に表示した後、ユーザーはそれを非表示にし、Emacs ディスプレイの以前の状態に"
"戻したい場合があります。これを <em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウを閉じる</em> と呼"
"びます。これを行うには、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> で使用され"
"ているウィンドウが選択中のウィンドウである状態で、<code class=\"code\">quit-"
"window</code> を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The right way to restore the previous configuration of the display depends "
"on what was done to the window where the buffer now appears.  It might be "
"right to delete that window, or delete its frame, or just display another "
"buffer in that window.  One complication is that the user may have changed "
"the window configuration since the act of displaying that buffer, and it "
"would be undesirable to undo the user&rsquo;s explicitly requested changes."
msgstr ""
"ディスプレイの以前の構成を復元する適切な方法は、現在バッファが表示されている"
"ウィンドウに対してどのような操作が行われたかによって異なります。そのウィンド"
"ウを削除するか、フレームを削除するか、あるいは単にそのウィンドウに別のバッ"
"ファを表示させるのが正解かもしれません。一つの厄介な点は、バッファを表示させ"
"た後にユーザーがウィンドウ構成を変更している可能性があり、ユーザーが明示的に"
"要求した変更を取り消すことは望ましくないということです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"To enable <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> to do the right thing, "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> saves information about what it "
"did in the window&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">quit-restore</code> parameter "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">Window Parameters</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> が正しく動作するように、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> はウィンドウの <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-restore</code> パラメータに、自身が行った処理に関する情報"
"を保存します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">ウィンドウパ"
"ラメータ</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"kill window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-quit_002dwindow\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"kill window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-quit_002dwindow\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This command quits <var class=\"var\">window</var> and buries its buffer.  "
"(It could also kill the buffer, subject to <code class=\"code\">quit-window-"
"kill-buffer</code>, see below.)  The argument <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> must be a live window and defaults to the selected one.  With prefix "
"argument <var class=\"var\">kill</var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it kills the buffer instead of burying it."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは <var class=\"var\">window</var> を終了させ、そのバッファを埋め"
"込みます。（<code class=\"code\">quit-window-kill-buffer</code> の条件に従"
"い、バッファを破棄することも可能です。詳細は後述します。）引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> はアクティブなウィンドウである必要があり、デフォル"
"トでは選択中のウィンドウが指定されます。プレフィックス引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">kill</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、バッ"
"ファを埋め込みではなく破棄します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quit_002dwindow_002dhook\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quit_002dwindow_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> first runs <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-window-hook</code>.  Then it calls the function <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code>, described below, which does the "
"hard work."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> はまず <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-window-hook</code> を実行します。次に、後述する関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code> を呼び出し、そこで実際の処理"
"が行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The following option tells <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> whether "
"it should kill or bury <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s buffer when "
"the <var class=\"var\">kill</var> argument is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"以下のオプションは、引数 <var class=\"var\">kill</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合に、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の"
"バッファを破棄するか埋めるかを <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> に指示"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-window-kill-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-quit_002dwindow_002dkill_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">quit-window-kill-buffer</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-quit_002dwindow_002dkill_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls whether <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> kills "
"the buffer of its <var class=\"var\">window</var> argument.  If the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default)  <code class=\"code\">quit-"
"window</code> will kill <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s buffer only "
"if the <var class=\"var\">kill</var> argument is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If this is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-window</code> will try to kill <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s buffer regardless of the value of the "
"<var class=\"var\">kill</var> argument.  Otherwise, this should be a list of "
"major modes; <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> will kill the buffer of "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> regardless of the value of <var "
"class=\"var\">kill</var> if that buffer&rsquo;s major mode is either a "
"member of this list or is derived from a member of this list.  In any other "
"case, <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code> will kill the buffer only if "
"<var class=\"var\">kill</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and "
"bury it otherwise."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"You can get more control by calling <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-"
"window</code> instead of <code class=\"code\">quit-window</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">quit-window</code>の代わりに<code class=\"code\">quit-"
"restore-window</code>を呼び出すことで、より細かく制御できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
