# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> while a Lisp function is running causes "
"Emacs to <em class=\"dfn\">quit</em> whatever it is doing.  This means that "
"control returns to the innermost active command loop."
msgstr ""
"Lisp関数の実行中に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力すると、Emacsは実行中の"
"処理を<em class=\"dfn\">終了</em>します。これにより、制御は最も内側でアクティ"
"ブなコマンドループに戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> while the command loop is waiting for "
"keyboard input does not cause a quit; it acts as an ordinary input "
"character.  In the simplest case, you cannot tell the difference, because "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> normally runs the command <code "
"class=\"code\">keyboard-quit</code>, whose effect is to quit.  However, when "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> follows a prefix key, they combine to form an "
"undefined key.  The effect is to cancel the prefix key as well as any prefix "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"コマンドループがキーボード入力を待機している間に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd> と入力しても、終了は発生せず、通常の入力文字として扱われます。最も単純な"
"ケースでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> が通常は終了処理を行うコマンド "
"<code class=\"code\">keyboard-quit</code> を実行するため、その違いを判別する"
"ことはできません。しかし、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> がプレフィックスキーの"
"後に続く場合、これらが組み合わさって未定義のキーとなります。その結果、プレ"
"フィックスキーおよびあらゆるプレフィックス引数がキャンセルされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"In the minibuffer, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> has a different definition: "
"it aborts out of the minibuffer.  This means, in effect, that it exits the "
"minibuffer and then quits.  (Simply quitting would return to the command "
"loop <em class=\"emph\">within</em> the minibuffer.)  The reason why <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> does not quit directly when the command reader is "
"reading input is so that its meaning can be redefined in the minibuffer in "
"this way.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> following a prefix key is not "
"redefined in the minibuffer, and it has its normal effect of canceling the "
"prefix key and prefix argument.  This too would not be possible if <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> always quit directly."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファにおいて、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> は異なる定義となっており、"
"ミニバッファを中断して終了します。これは実質的に、ミニバッファを抜けてから終"
"了することを意味します。（単に終了した場合は、ミニバッファ<em class=\"emph\">"
"内</em>のコマンドループに戻ることになります。）コマンドリーダーが入力を読み込"
"んでいる際に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> が直接終了しないのは、このようにミ"
"ニバッファ内でその意味を再定義できるようにするためです。プレフィックスキーに"
"続く <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> はミニバッファ内で再定義されず、プレフィッ"
"クスキーとプレフィックス引数をキャンセルするという通常の動作をします。これ"
"も、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> が常に直接終了するのであれば不可能だったで"
"しょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"When <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> does directly quit, it does so by setting "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>.  Emacs checks this variable at appropriate times "
"and quits if it is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Setting <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> in any "
"way thus causes a quit."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> が直接終了する場合、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を代入するこ"
"とで終了します。Emacs は適切なタイミングでこの変数を確認し、それが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合に終了します。したがって、いかなる方法で"
"あれ <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の値を設定すると、終了が引き起こされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"At the level of C code, quitting cannot happen just anywhere; only at the "
"special places that check <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code>.  The reason "
"for this is that quitting at other places might leave an inconsistency in "
"Emacs&rsquo;s internal state.  Because quitting is delayed until a safe "
"place, quitting cannot make Emacs crash."
msgstr ""
"Cコードレベルでは、任意の場所で終了できるわけではなく、<code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code>をチェックする特別な場所でのみ可能です。その理"
"由は、それ以外の場所で終了すると、Emacsの内部状態に不整合が生じる可能性がある"
"ためです。安全な場所まで終了を遅らせることで、終了によってEmacsがクラッシュす"
"ることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"Certain functions such as <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code> prevent quitting entirely even "
"though they wait for input.  Instead of quitting, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd> serves as the requested input.  In the case of <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code>, this serves to bring about the "
"special behavior of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> in the command loop.  In "
"the case of <code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code>, this is so that "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> can be used to quote a <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> や <code class=\"code\">read-"
"quoted-char</code> といった特定の関数は、入力を待機しているにもかかわらず、完"
"全に終了することを妨げます。終了する代わりに、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> が"
"要求された入力として機能します。<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</"
"code> の場合、これによりコマンドループにおける <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> "
"の特殊な動作が実現されます。<code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code> の場"
"合、これは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> を用いて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd> をクォートできるようにするためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-preventing-quitting\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-preventing-quitting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"You can prevent quitting for a portion of a Lisp function by binding the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value.  Then, although <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd> still sets <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> as usual, the usual result of this&mdash;a "
"quit&mdash;is prevented.  Eventually, <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</"
"code> will become <code class=\"code\">nil</code> again, such as when its "
"binding is unwound at the end of a <code class=\"code\">let</code> form.  At "
"that time, if <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> is still non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the requested quit happens immediately.  This "
"behavior is ideal when you wish to make sure that quitting does not happen "
"within a critical section of the program."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の値をバインドすることで、Lisp 関数の一部で終了が発生するのを防ぐこ"
"とができます。これにより、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> は通常通り <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> に設定します"
"が、通常であれば生じる結果――すなわち終了――は回避されます。やがて、<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> フォームの末尾でバインドが解除される際などに、"
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> は再び <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> になります。このとき、<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> が依然とし"
"て <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、要求された終了が直ちに実行さ"
"れます。この動作は、プログラムのクリティカルセクション内で終了が発生しないよ"
"うにしたい場合に最適です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002dquoted_002dchar-quitting\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002dquoted_002dchar-quitting\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"In some functions (such as <code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code>), "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> is handled in a special way that does not "
"involve quitting.  This is done by reading the input with <code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> bound to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, "
"and setting <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> before <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> "
"becomes <code class=\"code\">nil</code> again.  This excerpt from the "
"definition of <code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code> shows how this is "
"done; it also shows that normal quitting is permitted after the first "
"character of input."
msgstr ""
"一部の関数（<code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code>など）では、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>は終了を伴わない特殊な方法で処理されます。これは、"
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code>を<code class=\"code\">t</code>にバイ"
"ンドして入力を読み込み、<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code>が再び<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>になる前に<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code>を"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定することで行われます。<code "
"class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code>の定義からのこの抜粋は、その仕組みを示"
"しており、また、入力の最初の文字の後には通常どおりの終了が許可されることも示"
"しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun read-quoted-char (&amp;optional prompt)\n"
"  &quot;...<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"  (let ((message-log-max nil) done (first t) (code 0) char)\n"
"    (while (not done)\n"
"      (let ((inhibit-quit first)\n"
"            ...)\n"
"        (and prompt (message &quot;%s-&quot; prompt))\n"
"        (setq char (read-event))\n"
"        (if inhibit-quit (setq quit-flag nil)))\n"
"      <span class=\"r\">...set the variable <code class=\"code\">code</code>...</span>)\n"
"    code))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-flag</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"quit_002dflag\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-flag</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"quit_002dflag\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then Emacs quits "
"immediately, unless <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> ordinarily "
"sets <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, regardless of <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外で"
"ない限り、Emacs は直ちに終了します。通常、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力"
"すると、<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> に関わらず <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外に設定"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">inhibit-quit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"inhibit_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">inhibit-quit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"inhibit_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"This variable determines whether Emacs should quit when <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> is set to a value other than <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</"
"code> has no special effect."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値が設定された際に Emacs を終了させるかどうか"
"を決定します。<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> "
"に特別な効果はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-local-quit</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-with_002dlocal_002dquit\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-local-quit</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-with_002dlocal_002dquit\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"This macro executes <var class=\"var\">body</var> forms in sequence, but "
"allows quitting, at least locally, within <var class=\"var\">body</var> even "
"if <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> was non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> outside this construct.  It returns the value of "
"the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</var>, unless exited by quitting, "
"in which case it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは<var class=\"var\">body</var>形式を順次実行しますが、この構文の外"
"で<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code>がnon-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>であったとしても、<var class=\"var\">body</var>内では少なくともローカル"
"に終了することが可能です。終了して抜け出さない限り、<var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>にある最後の形式の値を返し、終了した場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> on entry to <code class=\"code\">with-local-quit</code>, it only "
"executes the <var class=\"var\">body</var>, and setting <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> causes a normal quit.  However, if <code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> so "
"that ordinary quitting is delayed, a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> triggers a special kind of local "
"quit.  This ends the execution of <var class=\"var\">body</var> and exits "
"the <code class=\"code\">with-local-quit</code> body with <code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> still non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"so that another (ordinary) quit will happen as soon as that is allowed.  If "
"<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> is already non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> at the beginning of <var class=\"var\">body</var>, "
"the local quit happens immediately and the body doesn&rsquo;t execute at all."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> が <code class=\"code\">with-local-"
"quit</code> への進入時に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> のみが実行され、<code class=\"code\">quit-flag</"
"code> を設定すると通常の終了が発生します。しかし、<code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外で"
"あるため通常の終了が遅延している場合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外で"
"ある <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> が特殊な種類のローカル終了をトリ"
"ガーします。これにより <var class=\"var\">body</var> の実行が終了し、<code "
"class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> が依然として <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"ではない状態で <code class=\"code\">with-local-quit</code> 本体から抜け出すた"
"め、それが許可され次第、別の（通常の）終了が発生します。<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> の開始時点で <code class=\"code\">quit-flag</code> "
"がすでに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、ローカル終了が直ちに"
"発生し、本体は全く実行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"This macro is mainly useful in functions that can be called from timers, "
"process filters, process sentinels, <code class=\"code\">pre-command-hook</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">post-command-hook</code>, and other places where "
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code> is normally bound to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは主に、タイマー、プロセスフィルタ、プロセスセンチネル、<code "
"class=\"code\">pre-command-hook</code>、<code class=\"code\">post-command-"
"hook</code>、および通常<code class=\"code\">inhibit-quit</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>にバインドされているその他の箇所から呼び出せる関数で有"
"用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keyboard-quit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keyboard_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">keyboard-quit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"keyboard_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"This function signals the <code class=\"code\">quit</code> condition with "
"<code class=\"code\">(signal 'quit nil)</code>.  This is the same thing that "
"quitting does.  (See <code class=\"code\">signal</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Errors.html\">Errors</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">quit</code> 条件を <code "
"class=\"code\">(signal 'quit nil)</code> で通知します。これは終了処理が行う動"
"作と同じです。（<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Errors.html\">Errors</a> の <code "
"class=\"code\">signal</code> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"To quit without aborting a keyboard macro definition or execution, you can "
"signal the <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-quit</code> condition.  This has "
"almost the same effect as the <code class=\"code\">quit</code> condition "
"except that the error handling in the command loop handles it without "
"exiting keyboard macro definition or execution."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロの定義や実行を中断せずに終了するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-quit</code> 条件を指定できます。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">quit</code> 条件とほぼ同様の効果がありますが、コマンドループ内"
"のエラー処理によって、キーボードマクロの定義や実行を終了させることなく処理さ"
"れる点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quitting.html
msgid ""
"You can specify a character other than <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> to use "
"for quitting.  See the function <code class=\"code\">set-input-mode</code> "
"in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Input-Modes.html\">Input Modes</a>."
msgstr ""
"終了に使用する文字として <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> 以外を指定できます。<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Input-Modes.html\">入力モード</a> の関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">set-input-mode</code> を参照してください。"

