# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Quoted-Character-Input.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quoted-character-input\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quoted-character-input\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Quoted-Character-Input.html
msgid ""
"You can use the function <code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code> to ask "
"the user to specify a character, and allow the user to specify a control or "
"meta character conveniently, either literally or as an octal character "
"code.  The command <code class=\"code\">quoted-insert</code> uses this "
"function."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-quoted-char</code> 関数を使用すると、ユーザーに文字"
"の指定を求めることができ、制御文字やメタ文字を、リテラル形式または8進数の文字"
"コードのいずれかで便利に指定させることができます。<code "
"class=\"code\">quoted-insert</code> コマンドはこの関数を使用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Quoted-Character-Input.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-quoted-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional prompt</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-read_002dquoted_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">read-quoted-char</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional prompt</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-read_002dquoted_002dchar\"> &para;</a></span>"

