# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer_002c-read_002donly\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer_002c-read_002donly\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If a buffer is <em class=\"dfn\">read-only</em>, then you cannot change its "
"contents, although you may change your view of the contents by scrolling and "
"narrowing."
msgstr ""
"バッファが<em class=\"dfn\">読み取り専用</em>の場合、その内容を変更することは"
"できませんが、スクロールや範囲の絞り込みによって内容の表示方法を変えることは"
"可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid "Read-only buffers are used in two kinds of situations:"
msgstr "読み取り専用バッファは、2種類の場面で使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid "A buffer visiting a write-protected file is normally read-only."
msgstr ""
"書き込み保護されたファイルにアクセスするバッファは、通常読み取り専用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Here, the purpose is to inform the user that editing the buffer with the aim "
"of saving it in the file may be futile or undesirable.  The user who wants "
"to change the buffer text despite this can do so after clearing the read-"
"only flag with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-q</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、バッファをファイルに保存する目的で編集しても、無意味であったり望ま"
"しくなかったりする場合があることをユーザーに知らせることが目的です。それにも"
"かかわらずバッファの内容を変更したいユーザーは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-q</"
"kbd> で読み取り専用フラグをクリアした後に変更を行うことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Modes such as Dired and Rmail make buffers read-only when altering the "
"contents with the usual editing commands would probably be a mistake."
msgstr ""
"DiredやRmailといったモードでは、通常の編集コマンドで内容を変更するとバッファ"
"が読み取り専用になってしまうため、おそらくそれは間違いでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The special commands of these modes bind <code class=\"code\">buffer-read-"
"only</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (with <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>) or bind <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code> around the places where they "
"themselves change the text."
msgstr ""
"これらのモードの特殊コマンドは、自身がテキストを変更する箇所の周辺で、<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-read-only</code>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"（<code class=\"code\">let</code>と共に）にバインドしたり、<code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code>を<code class=\"code\">t</code>にバイ"
"ンドしたりします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-read-only</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dread_002donly\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-read-only</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dread_002donly\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable specifies whether the buffer is read-only.  The "
"buffer is read-only if this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  However, characters that have the <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-"
"only</code> text property can still be modified.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Special-Properties.html\">inhibit-read-only</a>."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、バッファが読み取り専用であるかどうかを指定しま"
"す。この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、バッファは読み取り"
"専用となります。ただし、<code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> テキス"
"トプロパティを持つ文字は引き続き変更可能です。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Special-Properties.html\">inhibit-read-only</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">inhibit-read-only</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"inhibit_002dread_002donly\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">inhibit-read-only</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"inhibit_002dread_002donly\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then read-only "
"buffers and, depending on the actual value, some or all read-only characters "
"may be modified.  Read-only characters in a buffer are those that have a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> text "
"property.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">Properties "
"with Special Meanings</a>, for more information about text properties."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、読み取り専用バッファに"
"おいて、実際の値に応じて、一部またはすべての読み取り専用文字が変更されること"
"があります。バッファ内の読み取り専用文字とは、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> テキストプロパティを持つ文"
"字のことです。テキストプロパティの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Special-Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持つプロパティ</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, all <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> character properties have "
"no effect.  If <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> is a list, then "
"<code class=\"code\">read-only</code> character properties have no effect if "
"they are members of the list (comparison is done with <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> が <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> の場合、すべての <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> 文字プロパティは"
"効果を持ちません。<code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> がリストであ"
"る場合、<code class=\"code\">read-only</code> 文字プロパティがそのリストの要"
"素であれば効果を持ちません（比較は <code class=\"code\">eq</code> と行われま"
"す）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Read-Only-Buffers.html
