# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.9 Recombining Windows<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Recombining-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.9 ウィンドウの再結合<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Recombining-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recombining-windows\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-windows_002c-recombining\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recombining-windows\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-windows_002c-recombining\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"When deleting the last sibling of a window <var class=\"var\">W</var>, its "
"parent window is deleted too, with <var class=\"var\">W</var> replacing it "
"in the window tree.  This means that <var class=\"var\">W</var> must be "
"recombined with its parent&rsquo;s siblings to form a new window combination "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">Windows and Frames</"
"a>).  In some occasions, deleting a live window may even entail the deletion "
"of two internal windows."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W</var> の最後の兄弟要素を削除すると、その親"
"ウィンドウも同時に削除され、ウィンドウツリー内では <var class=\"var\">W</"
"var> がそれに取って代わります。つまり、<var class=\"var\">W</var> を親の兄弟"
"要素と再結合して、新しいウィンドウの組み合わせを形成する必要があります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">ウィンドウとフレーム</a> を"
"参照）。場合によっては、アクティブなウィンドウを削除することで、2つの内部ウィ"
"ンドウまでもが削除されることがあります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     ______________________________________\n"
"    | ______  ____________________________ |\n"
"    ||      || __________________________ ||\n"
"    ||      ||| ___________  ___________ |||\n"
"    ||      ||||           ||           ||||\n"
"    ||      ||||____W6_____||_____W7____||||\n"
"    ||      |||____________W4____________|||\n"
"    ||      || __________________________ ||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||____________W5____________|||\n"
"    ||__W2__||_____________W3_____________ |\n"
"    |__________________W1__________________|\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Deleting <var class=\"var\">W5</var> in this configuration normally causes "
"the deletion of <var class=\"var\">W3</var> and <var class=\"var\">W4</"
"var>.  The remaining live windows <var class=\"var\">W2</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">W6</var> and <var class=\"var\">W7</var> are recombined to "
"form a new horizontal combination with parent <var class=\"var\">W1</var>."
msgstr ""
"この構成において<var class=\"var\">W5</var>を削除すると、通常は<var "
"class=\"var\">W3</var>と<var class=\"var\">W4</var>も削除されます。残ったアク"
"ティブなウィンドウ<var class=\"var\">W2</var>、<var class=\"var\">W6</var>、"
"<var class=\"var\">W7</var>は再結合され、親<var class=\"var\">W1</var>を持つ"
"新たな水平組み合わせを形成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, however, it makes sense to not delete a parent window like <var "
"class=\"var\">W4</var>.  In particular, a parent window should not be "
"removed when it was used to preserve a combination embedded in a combination "
"of the same type.  Such embeddings make sense to assure that when you split "
"a window and subsequently delete the new window, Emacs reestablishes the "
"layout of the associated frame as it existed before the splitting."
msgstr ""
"しかし、<var class=\"var\">W4</var>のような親ウィンドウを削除しない方が適切な"
"場合もあります。特に、同一タイプの組み合わせの中に埋め込まれた組み合わせを保"
"持するために使用された親ウィンドウは、削除すべきではありません。このような埋"
"め込みは、ウィンドウを分割し、その後新しいウィンドウを削除した際に、Emacsが関"
"連フレームのレイアウトを分割前の状態に復元することを確実にするために有効で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Consider a scenario starting with two live windows <var class=\"var\">W2</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">W3</var> and their parent <var class=\"var\">W1</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"2つのアクティブウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W2</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">W3</var>、およびそれらの親 <var class=\"var\">W1</var> から始ま"
"るシナリオを考えます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     ______________________________________\n"
"    | ____________________________________ |\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||_________________W2_________________||\n"
"    | ____________________________________ |\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||                                    ||\n"
"    ||_________________W3_________________||\n"
"    |__________________W1__________________|\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
