# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This means that the new live window is allowed to share the existing parent "
"window, if one exists, provided the split occurs in the same direction as "
"the existing window combination (otherwise, a new internal window is created "
"anyway)."
msgstr ""
"つまり、新しいライブウィンドウは、既存の親ウィンドウが存在する場合、そのウィ"
"ンドウが既存のウィンドウ構成と同じ方向に分割される限り、親ウィンドウを共有で"
"きるということです（そうでない場合は、いずれにせよ新しい内部ウィンドウが作成"
"されます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">window-size</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">window-size</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This means that <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> makes a new "
"parent window when it splits a window and is passed a <code "
"class=\"code\">window-height</code> or <code class=\"code\">window-width</"
"code> entry in the <var class=\"var\">alist</var> argument (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html\">Action "
"Functions for Buffer Display</a>).  Otherwise, window splitting behaves as "
"for a value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"つまり、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> はウィンドウを分割する際に"
"新しい親ウィンドウを作成し、<var class=\"var\">alist</var> 引数に <code "
"class=\"code\">window-height</code> または <code class=\"code\">window-"
"width</code> のエントリが渡されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"Display-Action-Functions.html\">バッファ表示用のアクション関数</a> を参照）。"
"それ以外の場合、ウィンドウ分割は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値と同様に"
"動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-resize</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-resize</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"In this case <code class=\"code\">with-temp-buffer-window</code> makes a new "
"parent window when it splits a window and <code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-"
