# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"A new internal window <var class=\"var\">W5</var> has been created; its "
"children are <var class=\"var\">W2</var> and the new live window <var "
"class=\"var\">W4</var>.  Now, <var class=\"var\">W2</var> is the only "
"sibling of <var class=\"var\">W4</var>, so enlarging <var class=\"var\">W4</"
