#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Deleting any of the live windows <var class=\"var\">W2</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">W3</var> or <var class=\"var\">W4</var> will distribute its "
"space proportionally among the two remaining live windows."
msgstr ""
"アクティブウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W2</var>、<var class=\"var\">W3</"
"var>、または <var class=\"var\">W4</var> のいずれかを削除すると、その領域は残"
"りの2つのアクティブウィンドウに比例配分されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The following two functions allow to expressly make a new parent window for "
"several adjacent windows and to undo that operation."
msgstr ""
"以下の2つの関数を使用すると、隣接する複数のウィンドウに対して明示的に新しい親"
"ウィンドウを作成したり、その操作を取り消したりすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-combining-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-combining-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">combine-windows</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">first last</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-combine_002dwindows\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">combine-windows</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">first last</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-combine_002dwindows\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function combines the windows from <var class=\"var\">first</var> to "
"<var class=\"var\">last</var> inclusive.  <var class=\"var\">first</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">last</var> must be valid windows in the same combination, "
"that is, windows with the same parent window.  If neither <var "
"class=\"var\">first</var> has a previous nor <var class=\"var\">last</var> "
"has a next sibling, it returns that parent window.  Otherwise, it makes a "
"new parent window whose first child window becomes <var class=\"var\">first</"
"var> and whose last child window becomes <var class=\"var\">last</var>, "
"inserts that parent window in the window tree in lieu of the windows "
"starting with <var class=\"var\">first</var> and ending with <var "
"class=\"var\">last</var> and returns the new parent window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">first</var>から<var class=\"var\">last</var>ま"
"で（両端を含む）のウィンドウを結合します。<var class=\"var\">first</var>と"
"<var class=\"var\">last</var>は、同一の組み合わせにおける有効なウィンドウ、す"
"なわち同じ親ウィンドウを持つウィンドウである必要があります。<var "
"class=\"var\">first</var>に前のウィンドウがなく、かつ<var "
"class=\"var\">last</var>に次の兄弟ウィンドウがない場合、その親ウィンドウを返"
"します。それ以外の場合は、最初の子ウィンドウを<var class=\"var\">first</"
"var>、最後の子ウィンドウを<var class=\"var\">last</var>とする新しい親ウィンド"
"ウを作成し、その親ウィンドウを<var class=\"var\">first</var>から始まり<var "
"class=\"var\">last</var>で終わるウィンドウに代わってウィンドウツリーに挿入"
"し、新しい親ウィンドウを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function is useful to operate on several siblings of the same parent "
"window as a whole.  Consider three sibling windows <var class=\"var\">w1</"
"var>, <var class=\"var\">w2</var> and <var class=\"var\">w3</var> aligned "
"side by side.  To create a window below <var class=\"var\">w1</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">w2</var> but not below <var class=\"var\">w3</var>, first "
"combine <var class=\"var\">w1</var> and <var class=\"var\">w2</var> using "
"this function, and then split the window it returned.  You can also call "
"<code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">Window Configurations</a>) on the return "
"value of <code class=\"code\">combine-windows</code> to obtain the combined "
"state of <var class=\"var\">w1</var> and <var class=\"var\">w2</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、同一の親ウィンドウに属する複数の兄弟ウィンドウをまとめて操作する"
"際に便利です。横に並んだ3つの兄弟ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">w1</var>、"
"<var class=\"var\">w2</var>、<var class=\"var\">w3</var> を考えてみましょう。"
"<var class=\"var\">w1</var> と <var class=\"var\">w2</var> の下にはウィンドウ"
"を作成し、<var class=\"var\">w3</var> の下には作成しないようにするには、まず"
"この関数を使って <var class=\"var\">w1</var> と <var class=\"var\">w2</var> "
"を結合し、次にその結果得られたウィンドウを分割します。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">combine-windows</code> の戻り値に対して <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-get</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ構成</a> を参照）を呼び出すことで、<var "
"class=\"var\">w1</var> と <var class=\"var\">w2</var> の結合状態を取得するこ"
"ともできます。"

