msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uncombining-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uncombining-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uncombine-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uncombine_002dwindow\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uncombine-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uncombine_002dwindow\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function uncombines the specified <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> should be an internal window whose parent "
"window is an internal window of the same type.  This means that <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> and its parent should be either both horizontal "
"or both vertical window combinations.  If this is the case, the function "
"makes the child windows of <var class=\"var\">window</var> become child "
"windows of <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s parent, and returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>.  Otherwise, it leaves the current configuration of "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s frame unchanged and returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された <var class=\"var\">window</var> の組み合わせを解除しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">window</var> は、その親ウィンドウが同タイプの内部ウィ"
"ンドウである内部ウィンドウである必要があります。つまり、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> とその親は、ともに水平方向または垂直方向のウィンド"
"ウの組み合わせである必要があります。この条件を満たす場合、関数は <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> の子ウィンドウを <var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"の親の子ウィンドウとし、<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。そうでない"
"場合は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のフレームの現在の構成をそのまま維持"
"し、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recombining-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function is useful to undo the effect of <code class=\"code\">combine-"
"windows</code>.  For example, to calculate the state of two adjacent windows "
"<var class=\"var\">w1</var> and <var class=\"var\">w2</var>, proceed as "
"follows: first, call <code class=\"code\">combine-windows</code> with <var "
"class=\"var\">w1</var> and <var class=\"var\">w2</var> as arguments, and "
"store the result in <var class=\"var\">w</var>.  Then call <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> with the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">w</var>.  Finally, call <code class=\"code\">uncombine-window</"
"code> with <var class=\"var\">w</var> as its argument to obtain the window "
"configuration that existed before the call to <code class=\"code\">combine-"
"windows</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">combine-windows</code>の効果を取り消すのに便"
"利です。例えば、隣接する2つのウィンドウ<var class=\"var\">w1</var>と<var "
"class=\"var\">w2</var>の状態を計算するには、次のように操作します。まず、<var "
"class=\"var\">w1</var>と<var class=\"var\">w2</var>を引数として<code "
"class=\"code\">combine-windows</code>を呼び出し、その結果を<var "
"class=\"var\">w</var>に格納します。次に、引数<var class=\"var\">w</var>を指定"
"して<code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code>を呼び出します。最後に、<var "
"class=\"var\">w</var>を引数として<code class=\"code\">uncombine-window</code>"
"を呼び出し、<code class=\"code\">combine-windows</code>の呼び出し前に存在して"
"いたウィンドウ構成を取得します。"

