"name\">recent-keys</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"include-cmds</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"recent_002dkeys\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a vector containing the last 300 input events from the "
"keyboard or mouse.  All input events are included, whether or not they were "
"used as parts of key sequences.  Thus, you always get the last 300 input "
"events, not counting events generated by keyboard macros.  (These are "
"excluded because they are less interesting for debugging; it should be "
"enough to see the events that invoked the macros.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、キーボードまたはマウスからの直近300件の入力イベントを含むベクトル"
"を返します。キーシーケンスの一部として使用されたかどうかにかかわらず、すべて"
"の入力イベントが含まれます。したがって、キーボードマクロによって生成されたイ"
"ベントを除いた、常に直近300件の入力イベントを取得できます。（マクロの呼び出し"
"元となったイベントを確認できれば十分であり、マクロはデバッグ上の有用性が低い"
"ため除外されています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">include-cmds</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, complete key sequences in the result vector are interleaved with "
"pseudo-events of the form <code class=\"code\">(nil . <var "
"class=\"var\">COMMAND</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">COMMAND</var> "
"is the binding of the key sequence (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-"
"Overview.html\">Command Loop Overview</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">include-cmds</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でな"
"い場合、結果ベクトル内の完全なキーシーケンスは、<code class=\"code\">(nil . "
"<var class=\"var\">COMMAND</var>)</code> 形式の擬似イベントと交互に配置されま"
"す。ここで <var class=\"var\">COMMAND</var> はキーシーケンスのバインディング"
"です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Overview.html\">コマンドループの概要"
"</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
"A call to <code class=\"code\">clear-this-command-keys</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html\">Information from the Command "
"Loop</a>)  causes this function to return an empty vector immediately "
"afterward."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">clear-this-command-keys</code> への呼び出し（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Loop-Info.html\">コマンドループからの情報</a>"
"を参照）により、この関数は直後に空のベクトルを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">open-dribble-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-open_002ddribble_002dfile\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">open-dribble-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-open_002ddribble_002dfile\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dribble-file\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dribble-file\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
"This function opens a <em class=\"dfn\">dribble file</em> named <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>.  When a dribble file is open, each input event "
"from the keyboard or mouse (but not those from keyboard macros) is written "
"in that file.  A non-character event is expressed using its printed "
"representation surrounded by &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;&hellip;&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Be aware that sensitive information (such as passwords) may "
"end up recorded in the dribble file."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前の <em class=\"dfn\">"
"ドリブファイル</em> を開きます。ドリブファイルが開いている間、キーボードやマ"
"ウスからの各入力イベント（ただしキーボードマクロによるものは除く）がそのファ"
"イルに書き込まれます。文字以外のイベントは、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;&hellip;&gt;</samp>&rsquo; で囲まれた表示形式を用いて表現"
"されます。機密情報（パスワードなど）がドリブファイルに記録される可能性がある"
"点にご注意ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
"You close the dribble file by calling this function with an argument of "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定してこの関数を呼び出すことで、ド"
"リブルファイルを閉じます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recording-Input.html
msgid ""
