# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"This function invokes the editor command loop.  It is called automatically "
"by the initialization of Emacs, to let the user begin editing.  When called "
"from a Lisp program, it enters a recursive editing level."
msgstr ""
"この関数はエディタのコマンドループを呼び出します。ユーザーが編集を開始できる"
"よう、Emacsの初期化時に自動的に呼び出されます。Lispプログラムから呼び出された"
"場合は、再帰的な編集レベルに入ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"If the current buffer is not the same as the selected window&rsquo;s buffer, "
"<code class=\"code\">recursive-edit</code> saves and restores the current "
"buffer.  Otherwise, if you switch buffers, the buffer you switched to is "
"current after <code class=\"code\">recursive-edit</code> returns."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファが選択中のウィンドウのバッファと異なる場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-edit</code> は現在のバッファを保存し、復元します。そ"
"うでない場合、バッファを切り替えると、<code class=\"code\">recursive-edit</"
"code> が戻った後に切り替わったバッファが現在のバッファとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, the function <code class=\"code\">simple-rec</"
"code> first advances point one word, then enters a recursive edit, printing "
"out a message in the echo area.  The user can then do any editing desired, "
"and then type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-c</kbd> to exit and continue executing "
"<code class=\"code\">simple-rec</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、関数 <code class=\"code\">simple-rec</code> がまずポイント1を1"
"単語分進め、次に再帰的な編集に入り、エコー領域にメッセージを出力します。その"
"後、ユーザーは任意の編集を行い、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-c</kbd> と入力して終了"
"し、<code class=\"code\">simple-rec</code> の実行を継続できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun simple-rec ()\n"
"  (forward-word 1)\n"
"  (message &quot;Recursive edit in progress&quot;)\n"
"  (recursive-edit)\n"
"  (forward-word 1))\n"
"     &rArr; simple-rec\n"
"(simple-rec)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

