"exit_002drecursive_002dedit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"This function exits from the innermost recursive edit (including minibuffer "
"input).  Its definition is effectively <code class=\"code\">(throw 'exit "
"nil)</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、最内側の再帰的な編集（ミニバッファ入力を含む）から抜けます。その"
"定義は実質的に <code class=\"code\">(throw 'exit nil)</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abort-recursive-edit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abort_002drecursive_002dedit\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abort-recursive-edit</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"abort_002drecursive_002dedit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"This function aborts the command that requested the innermost recursive edit "
"(including minibuffer input), by signaling <code class=\"code\">quit</code> "
"after exiting the recursive edit.  Its definition is effectively <code "
"class=\"code\">(throw 'exit t)</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、再帰的編集を終了した後に <code class=\"code\">quit</code> をシグ"
"ナルすることで、最内側の再帰的編集（ミニバッファ入力を含む）を要求したコマン"
"ドを中断します。その定義は実質的に <code class=\"code\">(throw 'exit t)</"
"code> となります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">終了</a> を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
