"top_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Editing.html
msgid ""
"This function exits all recursive editing levels; it does not return a "
"value, as it jumps completely out of any computation directly back to the "
"main command loop."
msgstr ""
"この関数はすべての再帰的な編集レベルを終了します。いかなる計算からも完全に抜"
"け出して直接メインのコマンドループに戻るため、値は返しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
