# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"These functions and variables deal with recursive minibuffers (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Recursive-Editing.html\">Recursive Editing</a>):"
msgstr ""
"これらの関数と変数は、再帰的なミニバッファを扱います（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Recursive-Editing.html\">再帰的編集</a>を参照）："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">minibuffer-depth</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"minibuffer_002ddepth\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">minibuffer-depth</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"minibuffer_002ddepth\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the current depth of activations of the minibuffer, a "
"nonnegative integer.  If no minibuffers are active, it returns zero."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ミニバッファのアクティベーションの現在の深度を非負整数として返し"
"ます。アクティブなミニバッファがない場合は、0を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">enable-recursive-minibuffers</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-enable_002drecursive_002dminibuffers\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">enable-recursive-minibuffers</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-enable_002drecursive_002dminibuffers\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, you can invoke "
"commands (such as <code class=\"code\">find-file</code>) that use "
"minibuffers even while the minibuffer is active.  Such invocation produces a "
"recursive editing level for a new minibuffer.  By default, the outer-level "
"minibuffer is invisible while you are editing the inner one.  If you have "
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-follows-selected-frame</code> set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, you can have minibuffers visible on several "
"frames at the same time.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Basic-"
"Minibuffer.html#Basic-Minibuffer\">(emacs)Basic Minibuffer</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、ミニバッファがアクティ"
"ブな状態でも、ミニバッファを使用するコマンド（<code class=\"code\">find-"
"file</code> など）を呼び出すことができます。このような呼び出しを行うと、新し"
"いミニバッファに対して再帰的な編集レベルが生成されます。デフォルトでは、内側"
"のミニバッファを編集している間、外側のミニバッファは非表示になります。<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-follows-selected-frame</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を設定すれば、複数のフレームで同時にミニバッファを"
"表示させることができます。<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Basic-"
"Minibuffer.html#Basic-Minibuffer\">(emacs)Basic Minibuffer</a> を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, you cannot invoke "
"minibuffer commands when the minibuffer is active, not even if you switch to "
"another window to do it."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ミニバッファがアクティブな"
"間は、別のウィンドウに切り替えて操作したとしても、ミニバッファコマンドを呼び"
"出すことはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Recursive-Mini.html
msgid ""
"If a command name has a property <code class=\"code\">enable-recursive-"
"minibuffers</code> that is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the "
"command can use the minibuffer to read arguments even if it is invoked from "
"the minibuffer.  A command can also achieve this by binding <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-recursive-minibuffers</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> in the interactive declaration (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Using-Interactive.html\">Using <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>).  The minibuffer command <code "
"class=\"code\">next-matching-history-element</code> (normally <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-s</kbd> in the minibuffer) does the latter."
msgstr ""
"コマンド名に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のプロパティ <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-recursive-minibuffers</code> がある場合、そのコマンドは"
"ミニバッファから呼び出された場合でも、ミニバッファを使用して引数を読み取るこ"
"とができます。また、インタラクティブ宣言において <code class=\"code\">enable-"
"recursive-minibuffers</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> にバインドする"
"ことでもこれを実現できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Using-"
"Interactive.html\"><code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の使用</a> を参"
"照）。ミニバッファコマンド <code class=\"code\">next-matching-history-"
"element</code>（通常はミニバッファ内では <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s</kbd>）は、後"
"者の方法を採用しています。"

