#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.1 Refreshing the Screen<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Refreshing-the-Screen\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.1 画面の更新<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Refreshing-the-"
"Screen\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-refresh-the-screen\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-screen-refresh\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-refresh-the-screen\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-screen-refresh\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">redraw-frame</code> clears and redisplays "
"the entire contents of a given frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a>).  This is useful if the screen is corrupted."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">redraw-frame</code> は、指定したフレーム（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a> を参照）の全内容をクリアして"
"再表示します。これは、画面が破損している場合に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">redraw-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-redraw_002dframe\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">redraw-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-redraw_002dframe\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"This function clears and redisplays frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it redraws the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"この関数はフレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> をクリアして再表示します。"
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が省略された場合、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、選択中のフレームを再描画しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid "Even more powerful is <code class=\"code\">redraw-display</code>:"
msgstr "さらに強力なのが <code class=\"code\">redraw-display</code> です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">redraw-display</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"redraw_002ddisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">redraw-display</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"redraw_002ddisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid "This function clears and redisplays all visible frames."
msgstr "この関数は、表示されているすべてのフレームをクリアして再表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"In Emacs, processing user input takes priority over redisplay.  If you call "
"these functions when input is available, they don&rsquo;t redisplay "
"immediately, but the requested redisplay does happen eventually&mdash;after "
"all the input has been processed."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、ユーザー入力の処理が再表示よりも優先されます。入力がある状態でこれ"
"らの関数を呼び出しても、すぐに再表示されるわけではなく、すべての入力処理が完"
"了した後に、要求された再表示が行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"On text terminals, suspending and resuming Emacs normally also refreshes the "
"screen.  Some terminal emulators record separate contents for display-"
"oriented programs such as Emacs and for ordinary sequential display.  If you "
"are using such a terminal, you might want to inhibit the redisplay on "
"resumption."
msgstr ""
"テキスト端末では、Emacsをサスペンドして再開すると、通常は画面も更新されます。"
"一部の端末エミュレータでは、Emacsのような表示重視のプログラム用と、通常の逐次"
"表示用で、それぞれ異なる内容を記録しています。このような端末を使用している場"
"合は、再開時の再表示を抑制したい場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">no-redraw-on-reenter</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"no_002dredraw_002don_002dreenter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">no-redraw-on-reenter</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-no_002dredraw_002don_002dreenter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-suspend-_0028cf_002e-"
"no_002dredraw_002don_002dreenter_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-resume-_0028cf_002e-no_002dredraw_002don_002dreenter_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-suspend-_0028cf_002e-"
"no_002dredraw_002don_002dreenter_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-resume-_0028cf_002e-no_002dredraw_002don_002dreenter_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Refresh-Screen.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls whether Emacs redraws the entire screen after it has "
"been suspended and resumed.  Non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means there "
"is no need to redraw, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> means redrawing is "
"needed.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、Emacsをサスペンドして再開した後に、画面全体を再描画するかどうかを"
"制御します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は再描画が不要であり、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は再描画が必要です。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

