# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.3.1.3 Backslash Constructs in Regular Expressions<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Backslash-Constructs-in-Regular-"
"Expressions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.3.1.3 正規表現におけるバックスラッシュ構文<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Backslash-Constructs-in-Regular-Expressions\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backslash-in-regular-expressions\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backslash-in-regular-expressions\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"For the most part, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; followed by "
"any character matches only that character.  However, there are several "
"exceptions: certain sequences starting with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>&rsquo; that have special meanings.  Here is a table of the special "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; constructs."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; に続く任意の文字"
"は、その文字にのみ一致します。ただし、いくつかの例外があります。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; で始まり、特別な意味を持つ特定のシーケンスな"
"どです。以下に、特殊な &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; 構文の表"
"を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-regexp-alternative\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-_007c-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_007c-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-regexp-alternative\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-_007c-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_007c-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"specifies an alternative.  Two regular expressions <var class=\"var\">a</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">b</var> with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</"
"samp>&rsquo; in between form an expression that matches anything that either "
"<var class=\"var\">a</var> or <var class=\"var\">b</var> matches."
msgstr ""
"代替パターンを指定します。<var class=\"var\">a</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">b</var> という2つの正規表現の間に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; を挟んだ表現は、<var class=\"var\">a</var> "
"または <var class=\"var\">b</var> のいずれかにマッチするものすべてにマッチし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"Thus, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo\\|bar</samp>&rsquo; matches either "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo; but no other string."
msgstr ""
"したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo\\|bar</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo;または&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</"
"samp>&rsquo;のいずれかにマッチしますが、それ以外の文字列にはマッチしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; applies to the largest "
"possible surrounding expressions.  Only a surrounding &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>&rsquo; grouping can limit the "
"grouping power of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo;は、取り得る最大の周辺式に適用さ"
"れます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo;のグループ化能力を制限で"
"きるのは、周囲の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>&rsquo;グ"
"ループのみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"If you need full backtracking capability to handle multiple uses of &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo;, use the POSIX regular expression "
"functions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"POSIX-Regexps.html\">Emacs versus "
"POSIX Regular Expressions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo;の複数回の使用に対応する完全な"
"バックトラッキング機能が必要な場合は、POSIX正規表現関数を使用してください"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"POSIX-Regexps.html\">EmacsとPOSIX正規表現の比較</"
"a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{<var class=\"var\">m</var>\\}</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{<var class=\"var\">m</var>\\}</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"is a postfix operator that repeats the previous pattern exactly <var "
"class=\"var\">m</var> times.  Thus, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x\\{5\\}</"
"samp>&rsquo; matches the string &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">xxxxx</"
"samp>&rsquo; and nothing else.  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c[ad]\\{3\\}r</"
"samp>&rsquo; matches string such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">caaar</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cdddr</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cadar</samp>&rsquo;, and so on."
msgstr ""
"は、直前のパターンをちょうど <var class=\"var\">m</var> 回繰り返す後置演算子"
"です。したがって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x\\{5\\}</samp>&rsquo; は文字"
"列 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">xxxxx</samp>&rsquo; にのみマッチし、それ以外に"
"はマッチしません。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c[ad]\\{3\\}r</samp>&rsquo; "
"は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">caaar</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cdddr</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cadar</"
"samp>&rsquo; といった文字列にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{<var class=\"var\">m</var>,<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>\\}</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{<var class=\"var\">m</var>,<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>\\}</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"is a more general postfix operator that specifies repetition with a minimum "
"of <var class=\"var\">m</var> repeats and a maximum of <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> repeats.  If <var class=\"var\">m</var> is omitted, the minimum is 0; "
"if <var class=\"var\">n</var> is omitted, there is no maximum.  For both "
"forms, <var class=\"var\">m</var> and <var class=\"var\">n</var>, if "
"specified, may be no larger than 2**16 &minus; 1 ."
msgstr ""
"は、最小 <var class=\"var\">m</var> 回から最大 <var class=\"var\">n</var> 回"
"までの繰り返しを指定する、より汎用的な後置演算子です。<var class=\"var\">m</"
"var> が省略された場合、最小値は 0 となり、<var class=\"var\">n</var> が省略さ"
"れた場合、最大値は設定されません。<var class=\"var\">m</var> および <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> のいずれの形式においても、指定された場合は 2**16 "
"&minus; 1 以下となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"For example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c[ad]\\{1,2\\}r</samp>&rsquo; "
"matches the strings &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">car</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">cdr</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">caar</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cadr</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cdar</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cddr</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c[ad]\\{1,2\\}r</samp>&rsquo;は、文字列"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">car</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cdr</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">caar</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cadr</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cdar</samp>&rsquo;、および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cddr</"
"samp>&rsquo;にマッチし、それ以外にはマッチしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p><br>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{0,1\\}</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\{,1\\}</samp>&rsquo; is equivalent to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{0,1\\}</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\{,1\\}</samp>&rsquo; は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</"
"samp>&rsquo; と等価です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p><br><br>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{0,\\}</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\{,\\}</samp>&rsquo; is equivalent to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{0,\\}</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\{,\\}</samp>&rsquo; は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</"
"samp>&rsquo; と等価です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p><br><br><br>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{1,\\}</samp>&rsquo; is equivalent to &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\{1,\\}</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo;と等価です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0029-in-regexp\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-regexp-grouping\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"_0028-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_0028-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0029-in-regexp\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-regexp-grouping\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"_0028-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_0028-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid "is a grouping construct that serves three purposes:"
msgstr "は、3つの目的を果たすグループ化構文です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"To enclose a set of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; "
"alternatives for other operations.  Thus, the regular expression &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\(foo\\|bar\\)x</samp>&rsquo; matches either &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">foox</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">barx</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"他の操作のための &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; の選択肢群を囲"
"む。したがって、正規表現 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(foo\\|bar\\)x</"
"samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foox</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">barx</samp>&rsquo; のいずれかにマッチする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"To enclose a complicated expression for the postfix operators &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo; to operate on.  Thus, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">ba\\(na\\)*</samp>&rsquo; matches &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ba</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bana</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">banana</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">bananana</samp>&rsquo;, etc., with any number (zero or more) "
"of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">na</samp>&rsquo; strings."
msgstr ""
"後置演算子 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo;、および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</"
"samp>&rsquo; が作用する複雑な式を囲むため。したがって、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ba\\(na\\)*</samp>&rsquo; は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ba</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bana</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">banana</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bananana</"
"samp>&rsquo; などに、任意の数（0個以上）の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">na</"
"samp>&rsquo; 文字列が一致する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ol><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"To record a matched substring for future reference with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>&rsquo; (see below)."
msgstr ""
"後で参照できるよう、一致した部分文字列を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>&rsquo; で記録する（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"This last application is not a consequence of the idea of a parenthetical "
"grouping; it is a separate feature that was assigned as a second meaning to "
"the same &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>&rsquo; "
"construct because, in practice, there was usually no conflict between the "
"two meanings.  But occasionally there is a conflict, and that led to the "
"introduction of shy groups."
msgstr ""
"この最後の用法は、括弧書きのグループ化という概念から生じたものではなく、同一"
"の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>&rsquo;構造に第二の意味"
"として割り当てられた独立した特徴である。というのも、実際には通常、これら二つ"
"の意味の間に矛盾が生じることはなかったからである。しかし、稀に矛盾が生じるこ"
"とがあり、それがシャイグループの導入へとつながった。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-non_002dcapturing-group\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unnumbered-group\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-_0028_003f_003a-in-regexp\"></a> <a id=\"index-shy-"
"groups\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(?: &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-shy-groups\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-non_002dcapturing-group\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unnumbered-group\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-_0028_003f_003a-in-regexp\"></a> <a id=\"index-shy-"
"groups\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(?: &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-shy-groups\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"is the <em class=\"dfn\">shy group</em> construct.  A shy group serves the "
"first two purposes of an ordinary group (controlling the nesting of other "
"operators), but it does not get a number, so you cannot refer back to its "
"value with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">digit</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Shy groups are particularly useful for mechanically-"
"constructed regular expressions, because they can be added automatically "
"without altering the numbering of ordinary, non-shy groups."
msgstr ""
"は<em class=\"dfn\">シャイグループ</em>という構成です。シャイグループは、通常"
"のグループが持つ最初の2つの目的（他の演算子の入れ子構造の制御）を果たします"
"が、番号は付与されないため、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>&rsquo;を用いてその値を参照することはできませ"
"ん。シャイグループは、通常の非シャイグループの番号付けを変更することなく自動"
"的に追加できるため、機械的に構築される正規表現において特に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"Shy groups are also called <em class=\"dfn\">non-capturing</em> or <em "
"class=\"dfn\">unnumbered groups</em>."
msgstr ""
"シャイ群は、<em class=\"dfn\">非捕捉</em>群や<em class=\"dfn\">非番号付き群</"
"em>とも呼ばれる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(?<var class=\"var\">num</var>: &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(?<var class=\"var\">num</var>: &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"is the <em class=\"dfn\">explicitly numbered group</em> construct.  Normal "
"groups get their number implicitly, based on their position, which can be "
"inconvenient.  This construct allows you to force a particular group "
"number.  There is no particular restriction on the numbering, e.g., you can "
"have several groups with the same number in which case the last one to match "
"(i.e., the rightmost match) will win.  Implicitly numbered groups always get "
"the smallest integer larger than the one of any previous group."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">明示的に番号を指定したグループ</em>という構文です。通常のグ"
"ループは位置に基づいて暗黙的に番号が割り当てられますが、これが不便な場合があ"
"ります。この構文を使用すると、特定のグループ番号を強制的に指定できます。番号"
"付けに関する特別な制限はなく、例えば同じ番号を持つグループが複数ある場合は、"
"最後に一致したもの（つまり最も右側の一致）が優先されます。暗黙的に番号が指定"
"されるグループには、常にそれまでのどのグループの番号よりも大きい最小の整数が"
"割り当てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html build/html/elisp/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the same text that matched the <var class=\"var\">digit</var>th "
"occurrence of a grouping (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</"
"samp>&rsquo;) construct."
msgstr ""
"グルーピング（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>&rsquo;）構"
"文の<var class=\"var\">digit</var>番目の出現箇所に一致したテキストと同一のテ"
"キストに一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"In other words, after the end of a group, the matcher remembers the "
"beginning and end of the text matched by that group.  Later on in the "
"regular expression you can use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; "
"followed by <var class=\"var\">digit</var> to match that same text, whatever "
"it may have been."
msgstr ""
"言い換えれば、グループの終了後、そのマッチャーはそのグループでマッチしたテキ"
"ストの開始位置と終了位置を記憶します。その後、正規表現の中で &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; の後に <var class=\"var\">digit</var> を続け"
"ることで、それがどのようなテキストであったとしても、同じテキストにマッチさせ"
"ることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"The strings matching the first nine grouping constructs appearing in the "
"entire regular expression passed to a search or matching function are "
"assigned numbers 1 through 9 in the order that the open parentheses appear "
"in the regular expression.  So you can use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\1</"
"samp>&rsquo; through &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\9</samp>&rsquo; to refer "
"to the text matched by the corresponding grouping constructs."
msgstr ""
"正規表現全体に現れる最初の9つのグループ化構文に一致する文字列は、正規表現内で"
"開き括弧が現れる順に1から9までの番号が割り当てられます。したがって、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\1</samp>&rsquo;から&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\9</"
"samp>&rsquo;までを用いて、対応するグループ化構文にマッチしたテキストを参照で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"For example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(.*\\)\\1</samp>&rsquo; matches "
"any newline-free string that is composed of two identical halves.  The "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(.*\\)</samp>&rsquo; matches the first half, "
"which may be anything, but the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\1</samp>&rsquo; "
"that follows must match the same exact text."
msgstr ""
"例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(.*\\)\\1</samp>&rsquo;は、同一の2つの"
"部分から構成される改行を含まない任意の文字列にマッチします。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\(.*\\)</samp>&rsquo;は前半部分にマッチし、その内容は任意です"
"が、それに続く&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\1</samp>&rsquo;は全く同じテキスト"
"にマッチしなければなりません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"If a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>&rsquo; construct "
"matches more than once (which can happen, for instance, if it is followed by "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;), only the last match is "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"「<samp class=\"samp\">\\( &hellip; \\)</samp>」という構文が複数回マッチした"
"場合（例えば、その後に「<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>」が続く場合など）、最後"
"のマッチのみが記録されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"If a particular grouping construct in the regular expression was never "
"matched&mdash;for instance, if it appears inside of an alternative that "
"wasn&rsquo;t used, or inside of a repetition that repeated zero "
"times&mdash;then the corresponding &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>&rsquo; construct never matches anything.  "
"To use an artificial example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(foo\\(b*\\)\\|"
"lose\\)\\2</samp>&rsquo; cannot match &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">lose</"
"samp>&rsquo;: the second alternative inside the larger group matches it, but "
"then &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\2</samp>&rsquo; is undefined and "
"can&rsquo;t match anything.  But it can match &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foobb</samp>&rsquo;, because the first alternative matches "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foob</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\2</samp>&rsquo; matches &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">b</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"正規表現内の特定のグループ化構文が一度もマッチしなかった場合――例えば、使用さ"
"れなかった選択肢の中や、0回繰り返された繰り返しの中に現れた場合など――、対応す"
"る「<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">digit</var></samp>」構文は何も"
"マッチしません。あえて例を挙げると、「<samp class=\"samp\">\\(foo\\(b*\\)\\|"
"lose\\)\\2</samp>」は「<samp class=\"samp\">lose</samp>」にマッチしません。大"
"きなグループ内の2番目の選択肢がそれにマッチしますが、その後の「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\2</samp>」は未定義であるため、何もマッチできないからです。し"
"かし、「<samp class=\"samp\">foobb</samp>」にはマッチできます。なぜなら、最初"
"の選択肢が「<samp class=\"samp\">foob</samp>」にマッチし、「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\2</samp>」が「<samp class=\"samp\">b</samp>」にマッチするか"
"らです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cw-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\w</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cw-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cw-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\w</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cw-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches any word-constituent character.  The editor syntax table determines "
"which characters these are.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Tables.html\">Syntax Tables</a>."
msgstr ""
"単語を構成する任意の文字に一致します。どの文字がこれに該当するかは、エディタ"
"の構文テーブルによって決定されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Tables.html\">構文テーブル</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cW-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\W</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cW-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cW-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\W</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cW-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid "matches any character that is not a word constituent."
msgstr "単語構成要素ではない任意の文字に一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cs-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\s<var class=\"var\">code</var></samp>&rsquo;<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cs-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cs-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\s<var class=\"var\">code</var></samp>&rsquo;<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cs-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches any character whose syntax is <var class=\"var\">code</var>.  Here "
"<var class=\"var\">code</var> is a character that represents a syntax code: "
"thus, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">w</samp>&rsquo; for word constituent, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; for whitespace, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(</samp>&rsquo; for open parenthesis, etc.  To represent "
"whitespace syntax, use either &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; or "
"a space character.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-"
"Table.html\">Table of Syntax Classes</a>, for a list of syntax codes and the "
"characters that stand for them."
msgstr ""
"構文が <var class=\"var\">code</var> である任意の文字に一致します。ここで "
"<var class=\"var\">code</var> は構文コードを表す文字です。例えば、単語構成要"
"素には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">w</samp>&rsquo;、空白には &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;、開き括弧には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(</"
"samp>&rsquo; などが用いられます。空白の構文を表すには、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; またはスペース文字を使用してください。構文コー"
"ドとそれらを表す文字の一覧については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-"
"Table.html\">構文クラス表</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
