# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches any character whose category is <var class=\"var\">code</var>.  Here "
"<var class=\"var\">code</var> is a character that represents a category: for "
"example, in the standard category table, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</"
"samp>&rsquo; stands for Chinese characters and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">g</samp>&rsquo; stands for Greek characters.  You can see the "
"list of all the currently defined categories with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x&nbsp;describe-categories&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  You can "
"also define your own categories in addition to the standard ones using the "
"<code class=\"code\">define-category</code> function (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Categories.html\">Categories</a>)."
msgstr ""
"カテゴリが <var class=\"var\">code</var> である任意の文字に一致します。ここ"
"で <var class=\"var\">code</var> はカテゴリを表す文字です。例えば、標準カテゴ"
"リテーブルでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo; は漢字を、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">g</samp>&rsquo; はギリシャ文字を表します。現在定義されて"
"いるすべてのカテゴリの一覧は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;describe-"
"categories&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> で確認できます。また、"
"<code class=\"code\">define-category</code> 関数を使用して、標準カテゴリに加"
"えて独自のカテゴリを定義することも可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Categories.html\">カテゴリ</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
