"カテゴリが <var class=\"var\">code</var> ではない任意の文字に一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"The following regular expression constructs match the empty "
"string&mdash;that is, they don&rsquo;t consume any characters&mdash;but "
"whether they match depends on the context.  For all, the beginning and end "
"of the accessible portion of the buffer are treated as if they were the "
"actual beginning and end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"以下の正規表現構文は空文字列にマッチします――つまり、文字を一切消費しません――"
"が、マッチするかどうかはコンテキストによって異なります。いずれの場合も、バッ"
"ファのアクセス可能な部分の先頭と末尾は、あたかもバッファの実際の先頭と末尾で"
"あるかのように扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_0060-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\`</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_0060-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_0060-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\`</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_0060-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the beginning of the buffer or string "
"being matched against."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、照合対象のバッファまたは文字列の先頭である場合に限"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_0027-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\'</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_0027-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_0027-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\'</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_0027-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the end of the buffer or string being "
"matched against."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、照合対象のバッファまたは文字列の末尾でのみマッチし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_003d-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\=</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_003d-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_003d-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\=</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_003d-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at point.  (This construct is not defined "
"when matching against a string.)"
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、一点のみです。（文字列との照合において、この構文は"
"定義されていません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cb-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\b</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cb-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cb-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\b</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cb-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the beginning or end of a word.  Thus, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\bfoo\\b</samp>&rsquo; matches any occurrence "
"of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; as a separate word.  &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\bballs?\\b</samp>&rsquo; matches &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ball</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">balls</"
"samp>&rsquo; as a separate word."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、単語の先頭または末尾にある場合に限られます。した"
"がって、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\bfoo\\b</samp>&rsquo;は、独立した単語と"
"しての&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo;のあらゆる出現箇所にマッチ"
"します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\bballs?\\b</samp>&rsquo;は、独立した単"
"語としての&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ball</samp>&rsquo;または&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">balls</samp>&rsquo;にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\b</samp>&rsquo; matches at the beginning or "
"end of the buffer (or string)  regardless of what text appears next to it."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\b</samp>&rsquo;は、直後にどのようなテキストが続"
"いていても、バッファ（または文字列）の先頭または末尾にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cB-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\B</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cB-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005cB-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\B</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-_005cB-in-regexp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but <em class=\"emph\">not</em> at the beginning "
"or end of a word, nor at the beginning or end of the buffer (or string)."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、単語の先頭や末尾、あるいはバッファ（または文字列）"
"の先頭や末尾では<em class=\"emph\">マッチしません</em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_003c-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&lt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_003c-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_003c-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&lt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_003c-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the beginning of a word.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&lt;</samp>&rsquo; matches at the beginning of the buffer "
"(or string) only if a word-constituent character follows."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、単語の先頭である場合に限ります。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&lt;</samp>&rsquo;は、単語構成文字が続く場合に限り、バッファ"
"（または文字列）の先頭にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_003e-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&gt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_003e-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_003e-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&gt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_003e-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the end of a word.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&gt;</samp>&rsquo; matches at the end of the buffer (or "
"string) only if the contents end with a word-constituent character."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、単語の末尾に限られます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&gt;</samp>&rsquo;は、内容が単語構成文字で終わっている場合に"
"限り、バッファ（または文字列）の末尾にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_005f_003c-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&lt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_005f_003c-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_005f_003c-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&lt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_005f_003c-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the beginning of a symbol.  A symbol "
"is a sequence of one or more word or symbol constituent characters.  &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\_&lt;</samp>&rsquo; matches at the beginning of the "
"buffer (or string) only if a symbol-constituent character follows."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、シンボルの先頭である場合に限ります。シンボルとは、1"
"つ以上の単語またはシンボル構成文字の並びのことです。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&lt;</samp>&rsquo;は、シンボル構成文字が続く場合に限り、"
"バッファ（または文字列）の先頭にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_005f_003e-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&gt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_005f_003e-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-_005c_005f_003e-in-regexp\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&gt;</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"_005c_005f_003e-in-regexp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches the empty string, but only at the end of a symbol.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&gt;</samp>&rsquo; matches at the end of the buffer (or "
"string) only if the contents end with a symbol-constituent character."
msgstr ""
"空文字列にマッチしますが、シンボルの末尾である場合に限られます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\_&gt;</samp>&rsquo;は、内容がシンボル構成文字で終わっている"
"場合に限り、バッファ（または文字列）の末尾にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
