#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid "These functions operate on regular expressions."
msgstr "これらの関数は正規表現を操作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quote-special-characters-in-"
"regexp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quote-special-characters-in-"
"regexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">regexp-quote</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-regexp_002dquote\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">regexp-quote</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-regexp_002dquote\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a regular expression whose only exact match is <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  Using this regular expression in <code "
"class=\"code\">looking-at</code> will succeed only if the next characters in "
"the buffer are <var class=\"var\">string</var>; using it in a search "
"function will succeed if the text being searched contains <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Regexp-"
"Search.html\">Regular Expression Searching</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、唯一の完全一致が <var class=\"var\">string</var> となる正規表現を"
"返します。この正規表現を <code class=\"code\">looking-at</code> で使用する場"
"合、バッファ内の次の文字が <var class=\"var\">string</var> である場合にのみ成"
"功します。検索関数で使用する場合、検索対象のテキストに <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> が含まれている場合に成功します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Regexp-Search.html\">正規表現による検索</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This allows you to request an exact string match or search when calling a "
"function that wants a regular expression."
msgstr ""
"これにより、正規表現を必要とする関数を呼び出す際に、完全一致や検索を指定でき"
"るようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(regexp-quote &quot;^The cat$&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;\\\\^The cat\\\\$&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"One use of <code class=\"code\">regexp-quote</code> is to combine an exact "
"string match with context described as a regular expression.  For example, "
"this searches for the string that is the value of <var class=\"var\">string</"
"var>, surrounded by whitespace:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">regexp-quote</code> の用途の一つに、厳密な文字列一致と正"
"規表現で記述されたコンテキストを組み合わせるというものがあります。例えば、こ"
"れは <var class=\"var\">string</var> の値であり、かつ前後が空白文字で囲まれた"
"文字列を検索します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(re-search-forward\n"
" (concat &quot;\\\\s-&quot; (regexp-quote string) &quot;\\\\s-&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The returned string may be <var class=\"var\">string</var> itself if it does "
"not contain any special characters."
msgstr ""
"返される文字列に特殊文字が含まれていない場合、<var class=\"var\">string</"
"var> そのものになることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-optimize-regexp\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-optimize-regexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">regexp-opt</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">strings "
"&amp;optional paren</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"regexp_002dopt\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">regexp-opt</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">strings "
"&amp;optional paren</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"regexp_002dopt\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns an efficient regular expression that will match any of "
"the strings in the list <var class=\"var\">strings</var>.  This is useful "
"when you need to make matching or searching as fast as possible&mdash;for "
"example, for Font Lock mode<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF31\" "
"href=\"#FOOT31\"><sup>31</sup></a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、リスト <var class=\"var\">strings</var> に含まれるいずれかの文字"
"列にマッチする効率的な正規表現を返します。これは、マッチングや検索を可能な限"
"り高速化したい場合に有用です&mdash;例えば、Font Lock モード<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF31\" href=\"#FOOT31\"><sup>31</sup></a> などで"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">strings</var> is the empty list, the return value is a "
"regexp that never matches anything."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">strings</var> が空リストの場合、戻り値は何もマッチしない正"
"規表現となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">paren</var> can be any of the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">paren</var> には、以下のいずれかを指定でき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The resulting regexp is preceded by <var class=\"var\">paren</var> and "
"followed by &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\)</samp>&rsquo;.  For example, use "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;\\\\(?1:&quot;</samp>&rsquo; to produce an "
"explicitly numbered group."
msgstr ""
"生成される正規表現の前には <var class=\"var\">paren</var> が、後には &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\)</samp>&rsquo; が付きます。例えば、明示的に番号を振っ"
"たグループを作成するには &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;\\\\(?1:&quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo; を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
