# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Up to reordering, the resulting regexp of <code class=\"code\">regexp-opt</"
"code> is equivalent to but usually more efficient than that of a simplified "
"version:"
msgstr ""
"並べ替え前であれば、<code class=\"code\">regexp-opt</code> から得られる正規表"
"現は、簡略化したバージョンのものと等価でありながら、通常はより効率的です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun simplified-regexp-opt (strings &amp;optional paren)\n"
" (let ((parens\n"
"        (cond\n"
"         ((stringp paren)       (cons paren &quot;\\\\)&quot;))\n"
"         ((eq paren 'words)    '(&quot;\\\\&lt;\\\\(&quot; . &quot;\\\\)\\\\&gt;&quot;))\n"
"         ((eq paren 'symbols) '(&quot;\\\\_&lt;\\\\(&quot; . &quot;\\\\)\\\\_&gt;&quot;))\n"
"         ((null paren)          '(&quot;\\\\(?:&quot; . &quot;\\\\)&quot;))\n"
"         (t                       '(&quot;\\\\(&quot; . &quot;\\\\)&quot;)))))\n"
"   (concat (car parens)\n"
"           (mapconcat 'regexp-quote strings &quot;\\\\|&quot;)\n"
"           (cdr parens))))\n"
msgstr ""

