# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"In GNU Emacs, you can search for the next match for a regular expression "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-of-Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular "
"Expressions</a>) either incrementally or not.  For incremental search "
"commands, see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Regexp-Search.html#Regexp-Search\">Regular "
"Expression Search</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>.  "
"Here we describe only the search functions useful in programs.  The "
"principal one is <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code>."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacsでは、正規表現（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-of-Regexps.html\">"
"正規表現の構文</a>を参照）の次の一致箇所を、インクリメンタルに、あるいは非イ"
"ンクリメンタルに検索できます。インクリメンタル検索コマンドについては、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Regexp-"
"Search.html#Regexp-Search\">正規表現検索</a>を参照してください。ここでは、プ"
"ログラムで有用な検索関数についてのみ説明します。主要なものは<code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"These search functions convert the regular expression to multibyte if the "
"buffer is multibyte; they convert the regular expression to unibyte if the "
"buffer is unibyte.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-"
"Representations.html\">Text Representations</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらの検索機能は、バッファがマルチバイトの場合は正規表現をマルチバイトに変"
"換し、バッファがユニバイトの場合は正規表現をユニバイトに変換します。  <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">re-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">regexp "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-re_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">re-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">regexp "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-re_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function searches forward in the current buffer for a string of text "
"that is matched by the regular expression <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>.  "
"The function skips over any amount of text that is not matched by <var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var>, and leaves point at the end of the first match "
"found.  It returns the new value of point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内で、正規表現 <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> に一"
"致する文字列を前方検索します。<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> に一致しないテ"
"キストは任意の量だけスキップし、最初に見つかった一致箇所の末尾にポイントを置"
"きます。そして、ポイントの新しい値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">limit</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"must be a position in the current buffer.  It specifies the upper bound to "
"the search.  No match extending after that position is accepted.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"defaults to the end of the accessible portion of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">limit</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、それは現在のバッファ内の位置である必要があります。これは検索の上限を指定"
"します。その位置より先に続く一致は受け付けられません。<var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var> が省略されているか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、バッファのアクセス可能な範囲の末尾が"
"デフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"What <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> does when the search "
"fails depends on the value of <var class=\"var\">noerror</var>:"
msgstr ""
"検索に失敗した際に <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> が何を行うか"
"は、<var class=\"var\">noerror</var> の値によって異なります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid "Signal a <code class=\"code\">search-failed</code> error."
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">search-failed</code> エラーを通知する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid "Do nothing and return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr "何もせず、戻る <code class=\"code\">nil</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"Move point to <var class=\"var\">limit</var> (or the end of the accessible "
"portion of the buffer) and return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを <var class=\"var\">limit</var>（またはバッファのアクセス可能な部分"
"の末尾）に移動し、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> only affects valid searches "
"which fail to find a match.  Invalid arguments cause errors regardless of "
"<var class=\"var\">noerror</var>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> は、一致するものが見つからなかった有効"
"な検索にのみ影響します。無効な引数は、<var class=\"var\">noerror</var> に関わ"
"らずエラーを引き起こします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is a positive number <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>, the search is done <var class=\"var\">n</var> times; each successive "
"search starts at the end of the previous match.  If all these successive "
"searches succeed, the function call succeeds, moving point and returning its "
"new value.  Otherwise the function call fails, with results depending on the "
"value of <var class=\"var\">noerror</var>, as described above.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is a negative number &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>, the search is done <var class=\"var\">n</var> times in the opposite "
"(backward) direction."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が正の数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> の場合、検"
"索は <var class=\"var\">n</var> 回行われます。連続する各検索は、直前の一致箇"
"所の末尾から開始されます。これらの連続する検索がすべて成功した場合、関数呼び"
"出しは成功し、ポイントが移動して新しい値が返されます。そうでない場合、関数呼"
"び出しは失敗し、結果は前述の通り <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> の値によっ"
"て決まります。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の数 &minus;<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> の場合、検索は逆方向（後方）に <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> 回行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Regexp-Search.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, point is initially before the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">T</samp>&rsquo;.  Evaluating the search call moves point to "
"the end of that line (between the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">t</"
"samp>&rsquo; of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">hat</samp>&rsquo; and the "
"newline)."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、ポインタは最初 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">T</samp>&rsquo; の前"
"に位置しています。検索呼び出しを評価すると、ポインタはその行の末尾（&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">hat</samp>&rsquo; の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">t</"
"samp>& と改行の間）に移動します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
