# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.17.3 Indenting an Entire Region<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Indenting-an-Entire-Region\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.17.3 領域全体のインデント<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Indenting-an-Entire-Region\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This section describes commands that indent all the lines in the region.  "
"They return unpredictable values."
msgstr ""
"このセクションでは、リージョン内の全行をインデントするコマンドについて説明し"
"ます。これらのコマンドは予測不能な値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"&amp;optional to-column</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"indent_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"&amp;optional to-column</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"indent_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This command indents each nonblank line starting between <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> (inclusive) and <var class=\"var\">end</var> "
"(exclusive).  If <var class=\"var\">to-column</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> indents "
"each nonblank line by calling the current mode&rsquo;s indentation function, "
"the value of <code class=\"code\">indent-line-function</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">start</var>（含む）から<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>（含まない）までの範囲で、各非空白行をインデントしま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">to-column</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である"
"場合、<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code>は現在のモードのインデント関数"
"である<code class=\"code\">indent-line-function</code>の値を呼び出すことで、"
"各非空白行をインデントします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">to-column</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it should be an integer specifying the number of columns of "
"indentation; then this function gives each line exactly that much "
"indentation, by either adding or deleting whitespace."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">to-column</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない"
"場合、それはインデントの列数を指定する整数である必要があります。この関数は、"
"空白文字を追加または削除することで、各行にちょうどその分だけのインデントを付"
"与します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If there is a fill prefix, <code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> indents "
"each line by making it start with the fill prefix."
msgstr ""
"フィルプレフィックスがある場合、<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> は"
"各行をそのフィルプレフィックスで始めることでインデントします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-region-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-indent_002dregion_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-region-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-indent_002dregion_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a function that can be used by <code "
"class=\"code\">indent-region</code> as a short cut.  It should take two "
"arguments, the start and end of the region.  You should design the function "
"so that it will produce the same results as indenting the lines of the "
"region one by one, but presumably faster."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> がショートカットと"
"して利用できる関数です。領域の開始位置と終了位置の2つの引数を取る必要がありま"
"す。領域の各行を1行ずつインデントした場合と同じ結果が得られるよう、ただしおそ"
"らくより高速に動作するように関数を設計してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, there is no short cut, and "
"<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> actually works line by line."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合はショートカットはなく、<code "
"class=\"code\">indent-region</code> は実際に1行ずつ処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"A short-cut function is useful in modes such as C mode and Lisp mode, where "
"the <code class=\"code\">indent-line-function</code> must scan from the "
"beginning of the function definition: applying it to each line would be "
"quadratic in time.  The short cut can update the scan information as it "
"moves through the lines indenting them; this takes linear time.  In a mode "
"where indenting a line individually is fast, there is no need for a short "
"cut."
msgstr ""
"ショートカット機能は、<code class=\"code\">indent-line-function</code> が関数"
"定義の先頭からスキャンする必要がある C モードや Lisp モードなどで有用です。各"
"行にこの機能を適用すると、計算時間が二次的に増大します。ショートカット機能"
"は、行をインデントしながらスキャン情報を更新できるため、線形時間で処理できま"
"す。行を個別にインデントする処理が高速なモードでは、ショートカット機能は不要"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> with a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> argument <var class=\"var\">to-column</var> has a "
"different meaning and does not use this variable."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の引数 <var class=\"var\">to-column</var> が指定された場合は別の意味とな"
"り、この変数は使用されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-rigidly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-indent_002drigidly\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-rigidly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-indent_002drigidly\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This function indents all lines starting between <var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> (inclusive) and <var class=\"var\">end</var> (exclusive) sideways by "
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> columns.  This preserves the shape of the "
"affected region, moving it as a rigid unit."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var>（含む）から<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>（含まない）までの範囲で始まるすべての行を、<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var>列分横方向にインデントします。これにより、影響を受け"
"る領域の形状が維持され、剛性体として移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This is useful not only for indenting regions of unindented text, but also "
"for indenting regions of formatted code.  For example, if <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is 3, this command adds 3 columns of indentation "
"to every line that begins in the specified region."
msgstr ""
"これは、インデントされていないテキストの領域をインデントするだけでなく、書式"
"設定されたコードの領域をインデントする場合にも有用です。例えば、<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が 3 の場合、このコマンドは指定した領域で始まるすべ"
"ての行に 3 列分のインデントを追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If called interactively with no prefix argument, this command invokes a "
"transient mode for adjusting indentation rigidly.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Indentation-Commands.html#Indentation-Commands\">Indentation Commands</"
"a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"接頭辞引数なしで対話的に呼び出された場合、このコマンドはインデントを厳格に調"
"整するための一時モードを起動します。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html#Indentation-"
"Commands\">インデントコマンド</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-code-rigidly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start "
"end columns &amp;optional nochange-regexp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-indent_002dcode_002drigidly\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
