"href=\"#index-indent_002dcode_002drigidly\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">indent-rigidly</code>, except that it "
"doesn&rsquo;t alter lines that start within strings or comments."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">indent-rigidly</code> に似ていますが、文字列やコ"
"メント内で始まる行は変更しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-Indent.html
msgid ""
"In addition, it doesn&rsquo;t alter a line if <var class=\"var\">nochange-"
"regexp</var> matches at the beginning of the line (if <var "
"class=\"var\">nochange-regexp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>)."
msgstr ""
