#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.7.9.2 Region to Fontify after a Buffer Change<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Region-to-Fontify-after-a-Buffer-Change\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.7.9.2 バッファ変更後のリージョンのフォント化<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Region-to-Fontify-after-a-Buffer-Change\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"When a buffer is changed, the region that Font Lock refontifies is by "
"default the smallest sequence of whole lines that spans the change.  While "
"this works well most of the time, sometimes it doesn&rsquo;t&mdash;for "
"example, when a change alters the syntactic meaning of text on an earlier "
"line."
msgstr ""
"バッファが変更された際、Font Lock が再フォント化する範囲は、デフォルトではそ"
"の変更にまたがる最小の完全な行の連なりとなります。多くの場合はこれでうまく機"
"能しますが、時にはうまくいかないこともあります。例えば、変更によって前の行に"
"あるテキストの構文的な意味が変わってしまう場合などです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"You can enlarge (or even reduce) the region to refontify by setting the "
"following variable:"
msgstr ""
"以下の変数を設定することで、リフォント対象の領域を拡大（あるいは縮小）できま"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-extend-after-change-region-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"font_002dlock_002dextend_002dafter_002dchange_002dregion_002dfunction\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-extend-after-change-region-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"font_002dlock_002dextend_002dafter_002dchange_002dregion_002dfunction\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable is either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or a "
"function for Font Lock mode to call to determine the region to scan and "
"fontify."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるか、あるい"
"は Font Lock モードがスキャンおよびフォント化を行う領域を決定するために呼び出"
"す関数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"The function is given three parameters, the standard <var class=\"var\">beg</"
"var>, <var class=\"var\">end</var>, and <var class=\"var\">old-len</var> "
"from <code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Change-Hooks.html\">Change Hooks</a>).  It should "
"return either a cons of the beginning and end buffer positions (in that "
"order) of the region to fontify, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (which "
"means choose the region in the standard way).  This function needs to "
"preserve point, the match-data, and the current restriction.  The region it "
"returns may start or end in the middle of a line."
msgstr ""
"この関数には3つの引数が渡されます。標準の <var class=\"var\">beg</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>、および <code class=\"code\">after-change-functions</"
"code> からの <var class=\"var\">old-len</var> です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Change-Hooks.html\">Change Hooks</a> を参照）。関数は、フォント化対象"
"領域の開始および終了バッファ位置（この順）を含む cons か、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>（標準的な方法で領域を選択することを意味します）のい"
"ずれかを返す必要があります。この関数は、point、match-data、および現在の制限を"
"保持する必要があります。返される領域は、行の途中から始まり、または終わる場合"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Region-to-Refontify.html
msgid ""
"Since this function is called after every buffer change, it should be "
"reasonably fast."
msgstr ""
"この関数はバッファが変更されるたびに呼び出されるため、それなりに高速なはずで"
"す。"

