"name\">register-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"register_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">register-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"register_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Registers.html
msgid ""
"This variable is an alist of elements of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> .  <var class=\"var\">contents</var>)</code>.  "
"Normally, there is one element for each Emacs register that has been used."
