"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"Given a possibly relative file name, you can expand any leading &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; and convert the result to an absolute name "
"using <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html\">Functions that Expand Filenames</a>).  "
"This function converts absolute file names to relative names:"
msgstr ""
"相対パスである可能性のあるファイル名が与えられた場合、先頭の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; を展開し、その結果を <code "
"class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> を用いて絶対パスに変換できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html\">ファイル名を展開する関数</"
"a>を参照）。この関数は、絶対ファイル名を相対ファイル名に変換します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-relative-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"&amp;optional directory</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"file_002drelative_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-relative-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"&amp;optional directory</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"file_002drelative_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function tries to return a relative name that is equivalent to <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>, assuming the result will be interpreted "
"relative to <var class=\"var\">directory</var> (an absolute directory name "
"or directory file name).  If <var class=\"var\">directory</var> is omitted "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the current "
"buffer&rsquo;s default directory."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、結果が <var class=\"var\">directory</var>（絶対ディレクトリ名また"
"はディレクトリファイル名）を基準として解釈されることを前提に、<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> と等価な相対名を返そうとします。<var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> が省略された場合や <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> が指定された場合は、現在のバッファのデフォルトディレクトリが使用されま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"On some operating systems, an absolute file name begins with a device name.  "
"On such systems, <var class=\"var\">filename</var> has no relative "
"equivalent based on <var class=\"var\">directory</var> if they start with "
"two different device names.  In this case, <code class=\"code\">file-"
"relative-name</code> returns <var class=\"var\">filename</var> in absolute "
"form."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-relative-name &quot;/foo/bar&quot; &quot;/foo/&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;bar&quot;\n"
"(file-relative-name &quot;/foo/bar&quot; &quot;/hack/&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;../foo/bar&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

