# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This section describes two commands that indent the current line based on "
"the contents of previous lines."
msgstr ""
"この節では、前の行の内容に基づいて現在の行をインデントする2つのコマンドについ"
"て説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-relative</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional first-only unindented-ok</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-indent_002drelative\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">indent-relative</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional first-only unindented-ok</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-indent_002drelative\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-Indent.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts whitespace at point, extending to the same column as "
"the next <em class=\"dfn\">indent point</em> of the previous nonblank line.  "
"An indent point is a non-whitespace character following whitespace.  The "
"next indent point is the first one at a column greater than the current "
"column of point.  For example, if point is underneath and to the left of the "
"first non-blank character of a line of text, it moves to that column by "
"inserting whitespace."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドはポイントに空白を挿入し、直前の非空白行の次の<em class=\"dfn\">"
"インデントポイント</em>と同じ列まで拡張します。インデントポイントとは、空白に"
"続く非空白文字のことです。次のインデントポイントとは、ポイントの現在の列より"
"も右側にある最初のインデントポイントのことです。例えば、ポイントがテキスト行"
"の最初の非空白文字の下方かつ左側にある場合、空白を挿入することでその列に移動"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If the previous nonblank line has no next indent point (i.e., none at a "
"great enough column position), <code class=\"code\">indent-relative</code> "
"either does nothing (if <var class=\"var\">unindented-ok</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>) or calls <code class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</"
"code>.  Thus, if point is underneath and to the right of the last column of "
"a short line of text, this command ordinarily moves point to the next tab "
"stop by inserting whitespace."
msgstr ""
"直前の非空白行に次のインデント位置がない場合（すなわち、十分に右側の列位置に"
"位置がない場合）、<code class=\"code\">indent-relative</code> は何も行わない"
"（<var class=\"var\">unindented-ok</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でない場合）か、あるいは <code class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code> を呼び出"
"す。したがって、ポイントが短いテキスト行の最終列の下方かつ右側にある場合、こ"
"のコマンドは通常、空白を挿入することでポイントを次のタブストップに移動させ"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Relative-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">first-only</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, only the first indent point is considered."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">first-only</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない"
"場合、最初のインデントポイントのみが考慮されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
