"Commands-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.14 コマンドの再割り当て<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Remapping-"
"Commands-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-remapping-commands\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-remapping-commands\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"A special kind of key binding can be used to <em class=\"dfn\">remap</em> "
"one command to another, without having to refer to the key sequence(s) bound "
"to the original command.  To use this feature, make a key binding for a key "
"sequence that starts with the dummy event <code class=\"code\">remap</code>, "
"followed by the command name you want to remap; for the binding, specify the "
"new definition (usually a command name, but possibly any other valid "
"definition for a key binding)."
msgstr ""
"特殊な種類のキーバインドを使用すると、元のコマンドに割り当てられたキーシーケ"
"ンスを参照することなく、あるコマンドを別のコマンドに<em class=\"dfn\">リマッ"
"プ</em>できます。この機能を利用するには、ダミーイベント <code "
"class=\"code\">remap</code> で始まり、その後にリマップしたいコマンド名が続く"
"キーシーケンスのキーバインドを作成します。その際、バインドに新しい定義（通常"
"はコマンド名ですが、キーバインドとして有効な他の定義でも構いません）を指定し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"For example, suppose My mode provides a special command <code "
"class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code>, which should be invoked instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-line</code>.  To establish this, its mode keymap should "
"contain the following remapping:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、My modeが<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>の代わりに呼び出すべき"
"特殊なコマンド<code class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code>を提供しているとしま"
"す。これを実現するには、そのモードのキーマップに以下のリマッピングを記述する"
"必要があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-set my-mode-map &quot;&lt;remap&gt; &lt;kill-line&gt;&quot; 'my-kill-line)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Then, whenever <code class=\"code\">my-mode-map</code> is active, if the "
"user types <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (the default global key sequence for "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>) Emacs will instead run <code "
"class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code>."
msgstr ""
"すると、<code class=\"code\">my-mode-map</code> が有効な状態でユーザーが "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd>（<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code> のデフォ"
"ルトのグローバルキーシーケンス）を入力すると、Emacs は代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code> を実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Note that remapping only takes place through active keymaps; for example, "
"putting a remapping in a prefix keymap like <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</"
"code> typically has no effect, as such keymaps are not themselves active.  "
"In addition, remapping only works through a single level; in the following "
"example,"
msgstr ""
"なお、リマッピングはアクティブなキーマップを通じてのみ行われる点に注意してく"
"ださい。例えば、<code class=\"code\">ctl-x-map</code>のようなプレフィックス"
"キーマップにリマッピングを設定しても、通常は効果がありません。こうしたキー"
"マップ自体はアクティブではないためです。また、リマッピングは単一レベルでしか"
"機能しません。以下の例では、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-set my-mode-map &quot;&lt;remap&gt; &lt;kill-line&gt;&quot; 'my-kill-line)\n"
"(keymap-set my-mode-map &quot;&lt;remap&gt; &lt;my-kill-line&gt;&quot; 'my-other-kill-line)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code> is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> "
"remapped to <code class=\"code\">my-other-kill-line</code>.  Instead, if an "
"ordinary key binding specifies <code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>, it is "
"remapped to <code class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code>; if an ordinary binding "
"specifies <code class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code>, it is remapped to <code "
"class=\"code\">my-other-kill-line</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code> は <code class=\"code\">my-other-kill-"
"line</code> に再マッピング<em class=\"emph\">されません</em>。代わりに、通常"
"のキーバインドで <code class=\"code\">kill-line</code> が指定されている場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code> に、通常のバインドで <code "
"class=\"code\">my-kill-line</code> が指定されている場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">my-other-kill-line</code> に再マッピングされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"To undo the remapping of a command, remap it to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>; e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"コマンドの再マッピングを取り消すには、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> に再"
"マッピングします。例："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-set my-mode-map &quot;&lt;remap&gt; &lt;kill-line&gt;&quot; nil)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-remapping</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional position keymaps</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"command_002dremapping\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">command-remapping</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional position keymaps</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"command_002dremapping\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the remapping for <var class=\"var\">command</var> (a "
"symbol), given the current active keymaps.  If <var class=\"var\">command</"
"var> is not remapped (which is the usual situation), or not a symbol, the "
"function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  <code "
"class=\"code\">position</code> can optionally specify a buffer position or "
"an event position to determine the keymaps to use, as in <code "
"class=\"code\">key-binding</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在有効なキーマップに基づき、<var class=\"var\">command</var>"
"（シンボル）のリマッピングを返します。<var class=\"var\">command</var> がリ"
"マッピングされていない（通常はこのケースです）か、あるいはシンボルでない場合"
"は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">position</code> では、<code class=\"code\">key-binding</code> "
"と同様に、使用するキーマップを決定するためのバッファ位置またはイベント位置を"
"任意で指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Remapping-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <code class=\"code\">keymaps</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies a list of keymaps to search in.  "
"This argument is ignored if <code class=\"code\">position</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <code class=\"code\">keymaps</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、検索対象とするキーマップのリストを指定"
"します。<code class=\"code\">position</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合は、この引数は無視されます。"

