# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs always makes "
"backup files by copying.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は常にコピーに"
"よってバックアップファイルを作成します。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"The following three variables, when non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"cause the second method to be used in certain special cases.  They have no "
"effect on the treatment of files that don&rsquo;t fall into the special "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"以下の3つの変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、特定の特殊なケー"
"スにおいて2番目のメソッドが使用されます。これらの変数は、特殊なケースに該当し"
"ないファイルの処理には影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backup-by-copying-when-linked</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-backup_002dby_002dcopying_002dwhen_002dlinked\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">backup-by-copying-when-linked</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-backup_002dby_002dcopying_002dwhen_002dlinked\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs makes backups "
"by copying for files with multiple names (hard links).  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は複数の名前を持"
"つファイル（ハードリンク）について、コピーによるバックアップを作成します。デ"
"フォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"This variable is significant only if <code class=\"code\">backup-by-copying</"
"code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, since copying is always used when "
"that variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が有意となるのは、<code class=\"code\">backup-by-copying</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合に限られる。というのも、この変数が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は常にコピーが用いられるからであ"
"る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backup-by-copying-when-mismatch</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-backup_002dby_002dcopying_002dwhen_002dmismatch\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">backup-by-copying-when-mismatch</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backup_002dby_002dcopying_002dwhen_002dmismatch\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), Emacs "
"makes backups by copying in cases where renaming would change either the "
"owner or the group of the file."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外（デフォルト）の場合、Emacs "
"は、ファイル名の変更によってファイルの所有者またはグループのいずれかが変わっ"
"てしまうケースにおいて、コピーによってバックアップを作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"The value has no effect when renaming would not alter the owner or group of "
"the file; that is, for files which are owned by the user and whose group "
"matches the default for a new file created there by the user."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名を変更してもファイルの所有者やグループが変わらない場合、この値は影"
"響しません。つまり、ユーザーが所有し、かつそのグループがユーザーによって新た"
"に作成されるファイルのデフォルトグループと一致するファイルが対象となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backup-by-copying-when-privileged-mismatch</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backup_002dby_002dcopying_002dwhen_002dprivileged_002dmismatch\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">backup-by-copying-when-privileged-mismatch</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"backup_002dby_002dcopying_002dwhen_002dprivileged_002dmismatch\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies the same "
"behavior as <code class=\"code\">backup-by-copying-when-mismatch</code>, but "
"only for certain user-id and group-id values: namely, those less than or "
"equal to a certain number.  You set this variable to that number."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">backup-by-copying-when-mismatch</code> と同じ動作を規定します"
"が、対象となるのは特定の user-id および group-id の値、すなわちある数値以下の"
"値のみです。この変数に、その数値を設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid ""
"Thus, if you set <code class=\"code\">backup-by-copying-when-privileged-"
"mismatch</code> to 0, backup by copying is done for the superuser and group "
"0 only, when necessary to prevent a change in the owner of the file."
msgstr ""
"したがって、<code class=\"code\">backup-by-copying-when-privileged-mismatch</"
"code> を 0 に設定すると、ファイルの所有者変更を防ぐ必要がある場合に、スーパー"
"ユーザーおよびグループ 0 に対してのみコピーによるバックアップが行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rename-or-Copy.html
msgid "The default is 200."
msgstr "デフォルトは200です。"

