#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.16.1 Display Specs That Replace The Text<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Display-Specs-That-Replace-The-Text\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.16.1 テキストに代わる表示仕様<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Display-Specs-That-Replace-The-Text\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replacing-display-specs\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replacing-display-specs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"Some kinds of display specifications specify something to display instead of "
"the text that has the property.  These are called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">replacing</em> display specifications.  Emacs does not allow "
"the user to interactively move point into the middle of buffer text that is "
"replaced in this way."
msgstr ""
"一部の表示仕様では、そのプロパティを持つテキストの代わりに表示する内容を指定"
"します。これらは<em class=\"dfn\">置換</em>表示仕様と呼ばれます。Emacsでは、"
"このように置換されたバッファテキストの途中に、ユーザーが対話的にポイントを移"
"動させることはできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-properties_002c-and-invisible-"
"text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-composition-property_002c-"
"and-replacing-display-specs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-properties_002c-and-invisible-"
"text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-composition-property_002c-"
"and-replacing-display-specs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"If a list of display specifications includes more than one replacing display "
"specification, the first overrides the rest.  Replacing display "
"specifications make most other display specifications irrelevant, since "
"those don&rsquo;t apply to the replacement.  In addition, any <code "
"class=\"code\">invisible</code> and <code class=\"code\">composition</code> "
"properties of the text that is replaced are ignored, because the replaced "
"text is skipped and its properties are not processed."
msgstr ""
"表示仕様のリストに複数の置換用表示仕様が含まれている場合、最初の仕様がそれ以"
"外の仕様に優先します。置換用表示仕様は、他のほとんどの表示仕様を無効にしま"
"す。なぜなら、それらの仕様は置換対象には適用されないためです。さらに、置換さ"
"れるテキストの <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">composition</code> プロパティは無視されます。これは、置換され"
"るテキストがスキップされ、そのプロパティが処理されないためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"For replacing display specifications, <em class=\"dfn\">the text that has "
"the property</em> means all the consecutive characters that have the same "
"Lisp object as their <code class=\"code\">display</code> property; these "
"characters are replaced as a single unit.  If two characters have different "
"Lisp objects as their <code class=\"code\">display</code> properties (i.e., "
"objects which are not <code class=\"code\">eq</code>), they are handled "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"表示仕様の置換において、<em class=\"dfn\">プロパティを持つテキスト</em>とは、"
"<code class=\"code\">display</code>プロパティとして同一のLispオブジェクトを持"
"つ連続するすべての文字を指し、これらの文字は一つの単位として置換されます。2つ"
"の文字の<code class=\"code\">display</code>プロパティとして異なるLispオブジェ"
"クト（すなわち、<code class=\"code\">eq</code>ではないオブジェクト）が指定さ"
"れている場合は、それぞれ個別に処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example which illustrates this point.  A string serves as a "
"replacing display specification, which replaces the text that has the "
"property with the specified string (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-"
"Display-Specs.html\">Other Display Specifications</a>).  Consider the "
"following function:"
msgstr ""
"この点を説明する例を以下に示します。文字列は置換表示指定として機能し、指定さ"
"れた文字列で当該プロパティを持つテキストを置換します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Other-Display-Specs.html\">その他の表示指定</a>を参照）。次の関数を考"
"えてみましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun foo ()\n"
"  (dotimes (i 5)\n"
"    (let ((string (concat &quot;A&quot;))\n"
"          (start (+ i i (point-min))))\n"
"      (put-text-property start (1+ start) 'display string)\n"
"      (put-text-property start (+ 2 start) 'display string))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"This function gives each of the first ten characters in the buffer a <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> property which is a string <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;A&quot;</code>, but they don&rsquo;t all get the same "
"string object.  The first two characters get the same string object, so they "
"are replaced with one &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo;; the fact "
"that the display property was assigned in two separate calls to <code "
"class=\"code\">put-text-property</code> is irrelevant.  Similarly, the next "
"two characters get a second string (<code class=\"code\">concat</code> "
"creates a new string object), so they are replaced with one &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo;; and so on.  Thus, the ten characters appear "
"as five A&rsquo;s."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファ内の最初の10文字それぞれに、文字列 <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;A&quot;</code> である <code class=\"code\">display</"
"code> プロパティを付与しますが、すべての文字に同じ文字列オブジェクトが割り当"
"てられるわけではありません。最初の2文字には同じ文字列オブジェクトが割り当てら"
"れるため、1つの &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; に置き換えられま"
"す。display プロパティが <code class=\"code\">put-text-property</code> への2"
"回の個別の呼び出しで割り当てられたという事実は関係ありません。同様に、次の2文"
"字には2つ目の文字列（<code class=\"code\">concat</code> は新しい文字列オブ"
"ジェクトを作成します）が割り当てられるため、1つの &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo; に置き換えられます。以下同様です。したがって、"
"10文字は5つの A として表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-box-face-attribute_002c-and-display-"
"properties\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-box-face-attribute_002c-and-display-"
"properties\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
msgid ""
"Note: Using <code class=\"code\">:box</code> face attribute (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-Attributes.html\">Face Attributes</a>) on a "
"replacing <code class=\"code\">display</code> string that is adjacent to "
"normal text with the same <code class=\"code\">:box</code> style can lead to "
"display artifacts when moving the cursor across the text with this face "
"attribute.  These can be avoided by applying the <code class=\"code\">:box</"
"code> attribute directly to the text being replaced, rather than (or in "
"addition to) the <code class=\"code\">display</code> string itself.  "
"Here&rsquo;s an example:"
msgstr ""
"注意：同一の <code class=\"code\">:box</code> スタイルを持つ通常テキストに隣"
"接する置換用の <code class=\"code\">display</code> 文字列に <code "
"class=\"code\">:box</code> フェイス属性（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-"
"Attributes.html\">フェイス属性</a> を参照）を使用すると、このフェイス属性を持"
"つテキスト上でカーソルを移動させた際に表示上の不具合が生じることがあります。"
"これらは、<code class=\"code\">display</code> 文字列自体に（あるいはそれに加"
"えて）ではなく、置換対象のテキストに直接 <code class=\"code\">:box</code> 属"
"性を適用することで回避できます。以下に例を示します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Causes display artifacts when moving the cursor across text\n"
"(progn\n"
"  (put-text-property 1 2 'display (propertize &quot;  [&quot; 'face '(:box t)))\n"
"  (put-text-property 2 3 'face '(:box t))\n"
"  (put-text-property 3 4 'display (propertize &quot;]  &quot; 'face '(:box t))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing-Specs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; No display artifacts due to `:box'\n"
"(progn\n"
"  (add-text-properties 1 2 '(face (:box t) display &quot;  [&quot;))\n"
"  (put-text-property 2 3 'face '(:box t))\n"
"  (add-text-properties 3 4 '(face (:box t) display &quot;]  &quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

