"<span>33.23 バッファテキストの置換<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Replacing-Buffer-Text\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"You can use the following function to replace some the text of the current "
"buffer:"
msgstr "以下の関数を使用して、現在のバッファ内のテキストの一部を置換できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">replace-region-contents</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg "
"end source &amp;optional max-secs max-costs inherit</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-replace_002dregion_002dcontents\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">replace-region-contents</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg "
"end source &amp;optional max-secs max-costs inherit</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-replace_002dregion_002dcontents\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces the region between <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> of the current buffer with the text found in "
"<var class=\"var\">source</var> which is usually a string or a buffer, in "
"which case it will use the accessible portion of that buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファの <var class=\"var\">beg</var> から <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> までの範囲を、<var class=\"var\">source</var> に含ま"
"れるテキスト（通常は文字列またはバッファ）で置き換えます。その際、バッファの"
"場合はアクセス可能な部分のみが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"This function attempts to keep point, markers, text properties, and overlays "
"in the current buffer intact.  One potential case where this behavior is "
"useful is external code formatting programs: they typically write the "
"reformatted text into a temporary buffer or file, and using <code "
"class=\"code\">insert</code> and <code class=\"code\">delete-region</code> "
"would destroy these properties."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内のポイント、マーカー、テキストプロパティ、および"
"オーバーレイをそのまま保持しようとします。この動作が有用なケースの一つとし"
"て、外部のコード整形プログラムが挙げられます。こうしたプログラムは通常、整形"
"後のテキストを一時バッファやファイルに書き出しますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">insert</code> や <code class=\"code\">delete-region</code> を"
"使用すると、これらのプロパティが破壊されてしまいます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"However, in order to do that, <code class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</"
"code> needs to compare the contents of the original buffer with that of <var "
"class=\"var\">source</var>, using a costly algorithm which makes the "
"operation much slower than a simple <code class=\"code\">insert</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">delete-region</code>.  In many cases, you may not need "
"that refinement, and you will then want to pass 0 as <var class=\"var\">max-"
"secs</var> argument, so as to short-circuit that costly algorithm: It will "
"then be just as fast as <code class=\"code\">insert</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-region</code> while still preserving point and markers "
"marginally better."
msgstr ""
"しかし、そうするためには、<code class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</"
"code> が元のバッファの内容と <var class=\"var\">source</var> の内容を、計算コ"
"ストの高いアルゴリズムを用いて比較する必要があり、その結果、単純な <code "
"class=\"code\">insert</code> や <code class=\"code\">delete-region</code> に"
"比べて処理速度が大幅に低下します。多くの場合、このような精緻な処理は不要であ"
"り、その場合は <var class=\"var\">max-secs</var> の引数に 0 を渡すことで、そ"
"のコストの高いアルゴリズムをスキップさせたいところでしょう。そうすれば、ポイ"
"ントやマーカーをわずかに良好に保持しつつ、<code class=\"code\">insert</code> "
"や <code class=\"code\">delete-region</code> と同等の速度で処理できるようにな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"Beyond that basic usage, if you need to use as source a subset of the "
"accessible portion of a buffer, <var class=\"var\">source</var> can also be "
"a vector <code class=\"code\">[<var class=\"var\">sbuf</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">sbeg</var> <var class=\"var\">send</var>]</code> where the "
"region between <var class=\"var\">sbeg</var> and <var class=\"var\">send</"
"var> in buffer <var class=\"var\">sbuf</var> is the text you want to use as "
"source."
msgstr ""
"こうした基本的な使い方に加え、バッファのアクセス可能な領域の一部をソースとし"
"て使用する必要がある場合、<var class=\"var\">source</var> はベクトル <code "
"class=\"code\">[<var class=\"var\">sbuf</var> <var class=\"var\">sbeg</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">send</var>]</code> にもなり得ます。この場合、バッファ "
"<var class=\"var\">sbuf</var> の <var class=\"var\">sbeg</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">send</var> の間の領域が、ソースとして使用したいテキストとなりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"If you need the inserted text to inherit text-properties from the adjoining "
"text, you can pass a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value as <var "
"class=\"var\">inherit</var> argument."
msgstr ""
"挿入したテキストに隣接するテキストの文字プロパティを継承させたい場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">inherit</var> 引数として <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"値を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"When you do want the costly refined replacement, in order to keep <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</code>&rsquo;s runtime in bounds, it "
"has two optional arguments."
msgstr ""
"コストの高い洗練された代替手段を利用したい場合、<code class=\"code\">replace-"
"region-contents</code>の実行時間を範囲内に収めるため、2つのオプション引数が用"
"意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">max-secs</var> defines a hard boundary in terms of "
"seconds.  If given and exceeded, it will fall back to <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-region</code> and <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-"
"substring</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">max-secs</var> は秒単位のハードバウンダリを定義します。こ"
"れが指定され、かつ超過した場合は、<code class=\"code\">delete-region</code> "
"および <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> にフォールバックし"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">max-costs</var> defines the quality of the difference "
"computation.  If the actual costs exceed this limit, heuristics are used to "
"provide a faster but suboptimal solution.  The default value is 1000000."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">max-costs</var> は差分計算の品質を定義します。実際のコスト"
"がこの上限を超える場合は、ヒューリスティックを用いて、より高速ながらも最適で"
"はない解を提供します。デフォルト値は 1000000 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if a non-destructive replacement could be "
"performed.  Otherwise, i.e., if <var class=\"var\">max-secs</var> was "
"exceeded or too much memory would have been needed, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</code> は、非破壊的な置換が可能"
"であれば <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。そうでない場合、すなわち "
"<var class=\"var\">max-secs</var> を超えたか、あるいは過剰なメモリが必要と"
"なった場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"Note: When using the refined replacement algorithm, if the replacement is a "
"string, it will be internally copied to a temporary buffer.  Therefore, all "
"else being equal, it is preferable to pass a buffer than a string as <var "
"class=\"var\">source</var> argument."
msgstr ""
"注：改良版置換アルゴリズムを使用する際、置換対象が文字列である場合、内部的に"
"一時バッファにコピーされます。したがって、他の条件が同じであれば、<var "
"class=\"var\">source</var> の引数として文字列ではなくバッファを渡すことが推奨"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes <code class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</code> is unable to "
"understand the nature of the change in which case information such as "
"overlays and markers will not be preserved as well as we would like.  If "
"this is important and you have enough knowledge about the change, you can "
"preserve this information manually.  For example, when sorting the lines of "
"a region, you can start by collecting all the overlays and markers in the "
"affected region using <code class=\"code\">overlays-in</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">markers-in</code> as well as recording a description of the "
"line on which they were found.  After inserting the sorted lines, you can "
"then move the objects back to their rightful position."
msgstr ""
"場合によっては <code class=\"code\">replace-region-contents</code> が変更の性"
"質を認識できず、オーバーレイやマーカーなどの情報が期待通りに保持されないこと"
"があります。この点が重要であり、かつ変更内容について十分な知識がある場合は、"
"これらの情報を手動で保持することが可能です。例えば、領域内の行をソートする場"
"合、まず <code class=\"code\">overlays-in</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">markers-in</code> を用いて影響を受ける領域内のすべてのオーバー"
"レイとマーカーを収集し、それらが見つかった行の説明を記録することから始めま"
"す。ソート済みの行を挿入した後、オブジェクトを本来の位置に戻すことができま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">markers-in</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"beg end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-markers_002din\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">markers-in</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"beg end</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-markers_002din\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Replacing.html
msgid ""
"Return a list of all the markers found between <var class=\"var\">beg</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">end</var> in the current buffer.  <var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> defaults the <code class=\"code\">point-min</code> "
"and <var class=\"var\">end</var> defaults to <code class=\"code\">point-max</"
"code>.  Do not rely on the order of the markers in the list, because it is "
"unspecified."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファ内で <var class=\"var\">beg</var> から <var class=\"var\">end</"
"var> の間に見つかったすべてのマーカーのリストを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> のデフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">point-min</"
"code> であり、<var class=\"var\">end</var> のデフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">point-max</code> です。リスト内のマーカーの順序は規定されてい"
"ないため、それに依存しないでください。"

