# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions for resizing a window without changing the "
"size of its frame.  Because live windows do not overlap, these functions are "
"meaningful only on frames that contain two or more windows: resizing a "
"window also changes the size of at least one other window.  If there is just "
"one window on a frame, its size cannot be changed except by resizing the "
"frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Size.html\">Frame Size</a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節では、フレームのサイズを変更せずにウィンドウのサイズを変更する関数につい"
"て説明します。ライブウィンドウは重なり合わないため、これらの関数が意味を持つ"
"のは、2つ以上のウィンドウを含むフレームに限られます。ウィンドウのサイズを変更"
"すると、少なくとももう1つのウィンドウのサイズも変化するためです。フレームに"
"ウィンドウが1つしかない場合、フレーム自体のサイズを変更しない限り、そのウィン"
"ドウのサイズを変更することはできません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Size.html\">フレームサイズ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Except where noted, these functions also accept internal windows as "
"arguments.  Resizing an internal window causes its child windows to be "
"resized to fit the same space."
msgstr ""
"特記のない限り、これらの関数は内部ウィンドウも引数として受け付けます。内部"
"ウィンドウのサイズを変更すると、その子ウィンドウも同じ領域に収まるようにサイ"
"ズが変更されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-resizable</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"delta &amp;optional horizontal ignore pixelwise</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002dresizable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-resizable</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"delta &amp;optional horizontal ignore pixelwise</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002dresizable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <var class=\"var\">delta</var> if the size of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> can be changed vertically by <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> lines.  If the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">horizontal</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"instead returns <var class=\"var\">delta</var> if <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> can be resized horizontally by <var class=\"var\">delta</var> columns.  "
"It does not actually change the window size."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のサイズを <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> 行分垂直方向に変更できる場合に <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> を返します。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">horizontal</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、代わりに <var class=\"var\">window</var> を <var class=\"var\">delta</"
"var> 列分水平方向にリサイズできる場合に <var class=\"var\">delta</var> を返し"
"ます。実際にウィンドウサイズを変更することはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"defaults to the selected window."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、選"
"択中のウィンドウがデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"A positive value of <var class=\"var\">delta</var> means to check whether "
"the window can be enlarged by that number of lines or columns; a negative "
"value of <var class=\"var\">delta</var> means to check whether the window "
"can be shrunk by that many lines or columns.  If <var class=\"var\">delta</"
"var> is non-zero, a return value of 0 means that the window cannot be "
"resized."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">delta</var> の正の値は、ウィンドウをその行数または列数分だ"
"け拡大できるかを確認することを意味し、<var class=\"var\">delta</var> の負の値"
"は、ウィンドウをその行数または列数分だけ縮小できるかを確認することを意味しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">delta</var> が 0 以外の場合、戻り値 0 はウィンドウのサ"
"イズ変更ができないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Normally, the variables <code class=\"code\">window-min-height</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">window-min-width</code> specify the smallest allowable "
"window size (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">Window Sizes</"
"a>).  However, if the optional argument <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function ignores <code "
"class=\"code\">window-min-height</code> and <code class=\"code\">window-min-"
"width</code>, as well as <code class=\"code\">window-size-fixed</code>.  "
"Instead, it considers the minimum height of a window as the sum of its top "
"and bottom decorations plus the text of one line; and its minimum width as "
"the sum of its left and right decorations plus text that takes two columns."
msgstr ""
"通常、変数 <code class=\"code\">window-min-height</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">window-min-width</code> は、許容される最小のウィンドウサイズを"
"指定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Sizes.html\">ウィンドウサイズ</"
"a> を参照）。ただし、オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> が <code "
