# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function resizes <var class=\"var\">window</var> by <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> increments.  If <var class=\"var\">horizontal</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it changes the height by <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> lines; otherwise, it changes the width by <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> columns.  A positive <var class=\"var\">delta</"
"var> means to enlarge the window, and a negative <var class=\"var\">delta</"
"var> means to shrink it."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> を <var class=\"var\">delta</"
"var> 刻みでリサイズします。<var class=\"var\">horizontal</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は高さを <var class=\"var\">delta</var> 行分"
"変更し、それ以外の場合は幅を <var class=\"var\">delta</var> 列分変更します。"
"正の <var class=\"var\">delta</var> はウィンドウを拡大することを、負の <var "
"class=\"var\">delta</var> は縮小することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"defaults to the selected window.  If the window cannot be resized as "
"demanded, an error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、選"
"択中のウィンドウがデフォルトとなります。ウィンドウを要求通りにリサイズできな"
"い場合は、エラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
