"as for the function <code class=\"code\">window-resizable</code> above."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> は、上記の関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">window-resizable</code> と同様の意味を持ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var class=\"var\">delta</var> will be "
"interpreted as pixels."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">pixelwise</var> が <code "
