"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">adjust-window-trailing-edge</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">window delta &amp;optional horizontal pixelwise</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"adjust_002dwindow_002dtrailing_002dedge\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">adjust-window-trailing-edge</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">window delta &amp;optional horizontal pixelwise</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"adjust_002dwindow_002dtrailing_002dedge\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function moves <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s bottom edge by "
"<var class=\"var\">delta</var> lines.  If optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">horizontal</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"instead moves the right edge by <var class=\"var\">delta</var> columns.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"defaults to the selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var>の下端を<var class=\"var\">delta</"
