# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this option is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs "
"resizes windows in units of pixels.  This currently affects functions like "
"<code class=\"code\">split-window</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Splitting-Windows.html\">Splitting Windows</a>), <code "
"class=\"code\">maximize-window</code>, <code class=\"code\">minimize-window</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">fit-frame-to-buffer</code> and <code class=\"code\">shrink-"
"window-if-larger-than-buffer</code> (all listed below)."
msgstr ""
"このオプションの値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs はピク"
"セル単位でウィンドウのサイズを変更します。これは現在、<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Splitting-"
"Windows.html\">ウィンドウの分割</a> を参照）、<code class=\"code\">maximize-"
"window</code>、<code class=\"code\">minimize-window</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer</code>、<code class=\"code\">fit-frame-"
"to-buffer</code>、および <code class=\"code\">shrink-window-if-larger-than-"
"buffer</code>（すべて以下に列挙）といった関数に影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that when a frame&rsquo;s pixel size is not a multiple of its character "
"size, at least one window may get resized pixelwise even if this option is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"なお、フレームのピクセルサイズが文字サイズの倍数でない場合、このオプションが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であっても、少なくとも1つのウィンドウがピクセ"
"ル単位でリサイズされることがあります。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The following commands resize windows in more specific ways.  When called "
"interactively, they act on the selected window."
msgstr ""
