# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This command adjusts the height or width of <var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"to fit the text in it.  It returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it "
"was able to resize <var class=\"var\">window</var>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected "
"window.  Otherwise, it should be a live window."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の高さまたは幅を、内部のテキ"
"ストに合わせて調整します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> のサイズ変更に成功"
"した場合は non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、それ以外の場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が省略"
"されているか、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定されている場合は、"
"選択中のウィンドウがデフォルトとなります。それ以外の場合は、ライブウィンドウ"
"である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is part of a vertical combination, this "
"function adjusts <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s height.  The new "
"height is calculated from the actual height of the accessible portion of its "
"buffer.  The optional argument <var class=\"var\">max-height</var>, if non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies the maximum total height that "
"this function can give <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  The optional "
"argument <var class=\"var\">min-height</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies the minimum total height that it can "
"give, which overrides the variable <code class=\"code\">window-min-height</"
"code>.  Both <var class=\"var\">max-height</var> and <var class=\"var\">min-"
"height</var> are specified in lines and include any top or bottom "
"decorations of <var class=\"var\">window</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が垂直方向の組み合わせの一部である場合、この"
"関数は <var class=\"var\">window</var> の高さを調整します。新しい高さは、バッ"
"ファのアクセス可能な部分の実際の高さから算出されます。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">max-height</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、この関数が <var class=\"var\">window</var> に設定できる最大の合計高さを指"
"定します。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">min-height</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、設定可能な最小の合計高さを指定し、これ"
"は変数 <code class=\"code\">window-min-height</code> よりも優先されます。"
"<var class=\"var\">max-height</var> と <var class=\"var\">min-height</var> は"
"ともに行単位で指定され、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の上部または下部の装"
"飾を含みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is part of a horizontal combination and "
"the value of the option <code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer-"
"horizontally</code> (see below) is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function adjusts <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s width.  The new "
"width of <var class=\"var\">window</var> is calculated from the maximum "
"length of its buffer&rsquo;s lines that follow the current start position of "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>.  The optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">max-width</var> specifies a maximum width and defaults to the "
"width of <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s frame.  The optional "
"argument <var class=\"var\">min-width</var> specifies a minimum width and "
"defaults to <code class=\"code\">window-min-width</code>.  Both <var "
"class=\"var\">max-width</var> and <var class=\"var\">min-width</var> are "
"specified in columns and include any left or right decorations of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が水平方向の組み合わせの一部であり、オプショ"
"ン <code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer-horizontally</code>（後述）の値"
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、この関数は <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> の幅を調整します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"の新しい幅は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の現在の開始位置に続くバッファ"
"内の行の最大長から算出されます。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">max-width</"
"var> は最大幅を指定し、デフォルトでは <var class=\"var\">window</var> のフ"
"レーム幅となります。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">min-width</var> は最小"
"幅を指定し、デフォルトでは <code class=\"code\">window-min-width</code> とな"
"ります。<var class=\"var\">max-width</var> と <var class=\"var\">min-width</"
"var> はともに列単位で指定され、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の左右の装飾を"
"含みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">preserve-size</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, will install a parameter to preserve the size of "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> during future resize operations (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Preserving-Window-Sizes.html\">Preserving Window "
"Sizes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">preserve-size</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、今後のリサイズ操作時に <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> のサイズを保持するためのパラメータが設定されます"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Preserving-Window-Sizes.html\">ウィンドウサイズの"
"保持</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the option <code class=\"code\">fit-frame-to-buffer</code> (see below) is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function will try to resize the "
"frame of <var class=\"var\">window</var> to fit its contents by calling "
"<code class=\"code\">fit-frame-to-buffer</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">fit-frame-to-buffer</code>（後述）が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、この関数は <code class=\"code\">fit-"
"frame-to-buffer</code>（後述）を呼び出すことで、<var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> のフレームをその内容に合わせてリサイズしようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">fit-window-to-buffer-horizontally</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-fit_002dwindow_002dto_002dbuffer_002dhorizontally\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">fit-window-to-buffer-horizontally</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fit_002dwindow_002dto_002dbuffer_002dhorizontally\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">fit-"
"window-to-buffer</code> can resize windows horizontally.  If this is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default)  <code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-"
"buffer</code> never resizes windows horizontally.  If this is <code "
"class=\"code\">only</code>, it can resize windows horizontally only.  Any "
"other value means <code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer</code> can "
"resize windows in both dimensions."
msgstr ""
"これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">fit-"
"window-to-buffer</code> はウィンドウを水平方向にリサイズできます。これが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">fit-window-to-buffer</code> はウィンドウを水平方向にリサイズし"
"ません。これが <code class=\"code\">only</code> の場合、ウィンドウを水平方向"
"のみにリサイズできます。それ以外の値は、<code class=\"code\">fit-window-to-"
"buffer</code> が両方向でウィンドウをリサイズできることを意味します。"

