# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resizing-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function attempts to make <var class=\"var\">window</var> as large as "
"possible, in both dimensions, without resizing its frame or deleting other "
"windows.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected window."
