# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.28 X Resources<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#X-Resources\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.28 X リソース<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#X-Resources\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"This section describes some of the functions and variables for querying and "
"using X resources, or their equivalent on your operating system.  See <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/X-Resources.html#X-Resources\">X Resources</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for more information about X "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Xリソース（またはお使いのオペレーティングシステムにおける同等の機"
"能）を照会・利用するための関数や変数の一部について説明します。Xリソースの詳細"
"については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/X-Resources.html#X-Resources\">X Resources</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">x-get-resource</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">attribute "
"class &amp;optional component subclass</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-x_002dget_002dresource\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-name\">x-"
"get-resource</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">attribute class "
"&amp;optional component subclass</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-x_002dget_002dresource\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">x-get-resource</code> retrieves a resource "
"value from the X Window defaults database."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">x-get-resource</code> は、X Window のデフォルトデー"
"タベースからリソース値を取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"Resources are indexed by a combination of a <em class=\"dfn\">key</em> and a "
"<em class=\"dfn\">class</em>.  This function searches using a key of the "
"form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">instance</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">attribute</var></samp>&rsquo; (where <var "
"class=\"var\">instance</var> is the name under which Emacs was invoked), and "
"using &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Emacs.<var class=\"var\">class</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; as the class."
msgstr ""
"リソースは、<em class=\"dfn\">キー</em>と<em class=\"dfn\">クラス</em>の組み"
"合わせによってインデックス付けされています。この関数は、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">instance</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">attribute</var></samp>&rsquo;（ここで<var "
"class=\"var\">instance</var>はEmacsが起動された際の名前）という形式のキーと、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Emacs.<var class=\"var\">class</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;をクラスとして検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"The optional arguments <var class=\"var\">component</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">subclass</var> add to the key and the class, respectively.  "
"You must specify both of them or neither.  If you specify them, the key is "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">instance</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">component</var>.<var class=\"var\">attribute</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;, and the class is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Emacs.<var "
"class=\"var\">class</var>.<var class=\"var\">subclass</var></samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">component</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">subclass</var> は、それぞれキーとクラスに追加されます。両方を指"
"定するか、あるいはどちらも指定しないかのいずれかとなります。これらを指定した"
"場合、キーは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">instance</var>."
"<var class=\"var\">component</var>.<var class=\"var\">attribute</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; となり、クラスは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Emacs.<var "
"class=\"var\">class</var>.<var class=\"var\">subclass</var></samp>&rsquo; と"
"なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">x-resource-class</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"x_002dresource_002dclass\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-name\">x-"
"resource-class</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"x_002dresource_002dclass\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the application name that <code class=\"code\">x-get-"
"resource</code> should look up.  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;Emacs&quot;</code>.  You can examine X resources for "
"other application names by binding this variable to some other string, "
"around a call to <code class=\"code\">x-get-resource</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">x-get-resource</code> が参照すべきアプリケー"
"ション名を指定します。デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">&quot;Emacs&quot;</"
"code> です。<code class=\"code\">x-get-resource</code> の呼び出しの前後でこの"
"変数を別の文字列にバインドすることで、他のアプリケーション名に対する X リソー"
"スを確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">x-resource-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"x_002dresource_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-name\">x-"
"resource-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"x_002dresource_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resources.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the instance name that <code class=\"code\">x-get-"
"resource</code> should look up.  The default value is the name Emacs was "
"invoked with, or the value specified with the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-"
"name</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-rn</samp>&rsquo; switches."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">x-get-resource</code> が参照すべきインスタン"
"ス名を指定します。デフォルト値は、Emacs の起動時に指定された名前、または "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-name</samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-rn</samp>&rsquo; スイッチで指定された値となります。"

