# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.10 Resurrecting Windows<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Resurrecting-Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.10 Windowsの復活<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Resurrecting-"
"Windows-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-resurrecting-deleted-windows\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-restoring-deleted-windows\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-resurrecting-deleted-windows\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-restoring-deleted-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"After a window has been deleted (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-"
"Windows.html\">Deleting Windows</a>) it cannot be used any more by functions "
"that require a valid window as their argument even if some Lisp variable "
"still references that window.  When the last reference to a window has "
"ceased to exist, the window&rsquo;s Lisp object will be eventually recycled "
"by the garbage collector (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Garbage-"
"Collection.html\">Garbage Collection</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウが削除された後（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-Windows.html\">"
"ウィンドウの削除</a>を参照）、たとえ一部のLisp変数が依然としてそのウィンドウ"
"を参照していたとしても、有効なウィンドウを引数として必要とする関数では、その"
"ウィンドウをそれ以上使用できなくなります。ウィンドウへの最後の参照が消滅する"
"と、そのウィンドウのLispオブジェクトは最終的にガベージコレクタによって回収さ"
"れます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Garbage-Collection.html\">ガベージコレク"
"ション</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"There are two ways to resurrect a deleted window whose object has not been "
"yet recycled by the collector: The first is to keep a reference to that "
"window in a saved window configuration (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Configurations.html\">Window Configurations</a>) and then call <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> with that configuration as "
"argument.  The second one is to keep a reference to that window in a "
"variable or let-bind it and then use that reference as <var "
"class=\"var\">refer</var> argument in <code class=\"code\">split-window</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Splitting-Windows.html\">Splitting "
"Windows</a>)."
msgstr ""
"コレクタによってオブジェクトがまだ回収されていない削除済みウィンドウを復活さ"
"せるには、2つの方法があります。1つ目は、保存済みのウィンドウ構成（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ構成</a>を参"
"照）にそのウィンドウへの参照を保持し、その構成を引数として<code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code>を呼び出す方法です。2つ目は、変"
"数にそのウィンドウへの参照を保持するかlet-bindし、その参照を<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window</code>の<var class=\"var\">refer</var>引数として"
"使用する方法です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Splitting-Windows.html\">ウィンド"
"ウの分割</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"The major difference between these two is that <code class=\"code\">set-"
"window-configuration</code> restores the frame layout as it existed before "
"deleting the window.  The <code class=\"code\">split-window</code> approach, "
"on the other hand, allows for arbitrary variations of the layout."
msgstr ""
"これら2つの主な違いは、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code>が"
"ウィンドウを削除する前のフレームレイアウトを復元する点にあります。一方、"
"<code class=\"code\">split-window</code>の手法では、レイアウトを任意に変更す"
"ることが可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Consider the following example starting with a frame containing a single "
"window showing the buffer <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>:"
msgstr ""
"バッファ <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> を表示する単一のウィンドウを含"
"むフレームから始まる、以下の例を考えてみましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let* ((old (selected-window))\n"
"       (new (split-window old nil 'right))\n"
"       overlay)\n"
"  (with-current-buffer (get-buffer-create &quot;*Messages*&quot;)\n"
"    (set-window-buffer new (current-buffer))\n"
"    (setq overlay (make-overlay (point-min) (point-max)))\n"
"    (overlay-put overlay 'face 'highlight)\n"
"    (overlay-put overlay 'window new)\n"
"    (message &quot;new %s parent %s&quot; new (window-parent new))\n"
"    (sit-for 3))\n"
"  (delete-window new)\n"
"  (setq new (split-window old nil 'left))\n"
"  (set-window-buffer new (get-buffer-create &quot;*Messages*&quot;))\n"
"  (format &quot;new %s parent %s&quot; new (window-parent new)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"When you run that code in <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> it will "
"first split the window showing <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> to "
"display <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> in a new window on the "
"right.  It also sets up an overlay with a window property to highlight the "
"text of <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> in the new window and "
"displays a message showing the new window and its parent in the window "
"tree.  It then deletes the new window and resurrects it on the left of the "
"<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> window again displaying a message "
"showing the new window and its parent in the window tree."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> でそのコードを実行すると、まず <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> を表示しているウィンドウを分割し、右側の新し"
"いウィンドウに <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> を表示します。また、新"
"しいウィンドウ内の <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> のテキストを強調表"
"示するためのウィンドウプロパティを持つオーバーレイを設定し、ウィンドウツリー"
"における新しいウィンドウとその親ウィンドウを示すメッセージを表示します。その"
"後、新しいウィンドウを削除して <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> ウィンド"
"ウの左側に再び表示させ、ウィンドウツリーにおける新しいウィンドウとその親ウィ"
"ンドウを示すメッセージを再度表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Resurrecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that both, new window and its parent have changed after moving the "
"<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> window to the left.  Also, the "
"highlighting disappears because any properties set up for the new window on "
"the right are lost when the new window is re-created on the left."
msgstr ""
"なお、<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp>ウィンドウを左側に移動させた後、"
"新しいウィンドウとその親ウィンドウの両方が変更されている点に注意してくださ"
"い。また、右側の新しいウィンドウに設定されたプロパティは、左側で新しいウィン"
"ドウが再作成される際に失われるため、ハイライトが消えます。"

