# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Retrieving-Nodes.html
msgid ""
"The printed representation of a tree-sitter node uses the hash notation "
"described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Printed-Representation.html\">Printed "
"Representation and Read Syntax</a>.  It looks like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#&lt;treesit-node&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">type</"
"var>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">pos1</var>-<var class=\"var\">pos2</"
"var>&gt;</samp>&rsquo;, where <var class=\"var\">type</var> is the type of "
"the node (which comes from the tree-sitter grammar used by the buffer), and "
"<var class=\"var\">pos1</var> and <var class=\"var\">pos2</var> are buffer "
"positions of the node&rsquo;s span.  Tree-sitter nodes have no read syntax."
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterノードの印刷表現では、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Printed-"
"Representation.html\">印刷表現と読み取り構文</a>で説明されているハッシュ表記"
"が用いられます。形式は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#&lt;treesit-node&nbsp;"
"<var class=\"var\">type</var>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">pos1</var>-"
"<var class=\"var\">pos2</var>&gt;</samp>&rsquo; となり、ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> はノードの型（バッファで使用されるTree-sitter文法に"
"由来します）、<var class=\"var\">pos1</var> と <var class=\"var\">pos2</var> "
"はノードのスパンのバッファ位置となります。Tree-sitterノードに読み取り構文はあ"
"りません。"

