# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Retrieving-Nodes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the highest parent of <var class=\"var\">node</var> "
"that has the same type as <var class=\"var\">node</var>.  If no such parent "
"exists, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Therefore this function "
"is also useful for testing whether <var class=\"var\">node</var> is top-"
"level."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">node</var> の最上位親のうち、<var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> と同じ型を持つものを返します。そのような親が存在しな"
"い場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。したがって、この関数は "
"<var class=\"var\">node</var> がトップレベルであるかどうかを判定する際にも有"
"用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Retrieving-Nodes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"this function uses <var class=\"var\">node</var>&rsquo;s type to find the "
"parent.  If <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function searches the parent that satisfies "
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">include-node</"
"var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function returns <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var> if <var class=\"var\">node</var> satisfies <var "
"class=\"var\">predicate</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場"
"合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">node</var> の型を用いて親を特定します。"
"<var class=\"var\">predicate</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> を満たす親を検索します。"
"<var class=\"var\">include-node</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"の場合、<var class=\"var\">node</var> が <var class=\"var\">predicate</var> "
"を満たすなら、この関数は <var class=\"var\">node</var> を返します。"

