# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reverting-buffers\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reverting-buffers\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"If you have made extensive changes to a file and then change your mind about "
"them, you can get rid of them by reading in the previous version of the file "
"with the <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> command.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Reverting.html#Reverting\">Reverting a Buffer</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"ファイルに大幅な変更を加えた後、その変更を取り消したい場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code>コマンドでファイルの以前のバージョンを読み"
"込むことで、それらの変更を取り消すことができます。<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Reverting.html#Reverting\">バッファの復"
"元</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"ignore-auto noconfirm preserve-modes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"ignore-auto noconfirm preserve-modes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"This command replaces the buffer text with the text of the visited file on "
"disk.  This action undoes all changes since the file was visited or saved."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、バッファの内容をディスク上の参照済みファイルの内容で置き換え"
"ます。この操作により、ファイルを参照または保存して以降のすべての変更が取り消"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"By default, if the latest auto-save file is more recent than the visited "
"file, and the argument <var class=\"var\">ignore-auto</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> asks "
"the user whether to use that auto-save instead.  When you invoke this "
"command interactively, <var class=\"var\">ignore-auto</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if there is no numeric prefix argument; thus, the "
"interactive default is not to check the auto-save file."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、最新の自動保存ファイルが閲覧中のファイルよりも新しく、かつ引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">ignore-auto</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ある場合、<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> はその自動保存ファイルを"
"代わりに使用するかどうかをユーザーに確認します。このコマンドを対話的に実行す"
"る場合、数値の接頭辞引数がなければ <var class=\"var\">ignore-auto</var> は "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> となります。したがって、対話時のデフォルトでは"
"自動保存ファイルの確認は行われません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> asks for confirmation "
"before it changes the buffer; but if the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">noconfirm</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> does not ask for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> はバッファを変更する前に確認"
"を求めますが、引数 <var class=\"var\">noconfirm</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</"
"code> は確認を求めません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"Normally, this command reinitializes the buffer&rsquo;s major and minor "
"modes using <code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code>.  But if <var "
"class=\"var\">preserve-modes</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the modes remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"通常、このコマンドは<code class=\"code\">normal-mode</code>を用いてバッファの"
"メジャーモードとマイナーモードを再設定します。ただし、<var "
"class=\"var\">preserve-modes</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合"
"は、モードは変更されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"Reverting tries to preserve marker positions in the buffer by using the "
"replacement feature of <code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code>.  If "
"the buffer contents and the file contents are identical before the revert "
"operation, reverting preserves all the markers.  If they are not identical, "
"reverting does change the buffer; in that case, it preserves the markers in "
"the unchanged text (if any) at the beginning and end of the buffer.  "
"Preserving any additional markers would be problematic."
msgstr ""
"リバート処理では、<code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code> の置換機能"
"を利用して、バッファ内のマーカー位置を保持しようとします。リバート操作前に"
"バッファの内容とファイルの内容が同一であれば、すべてのマーカーが保持されま"
"す。同一でない場合は、バッファの内容が変更されるため、バッファの先頭と末尾に"
"ある変更されていないテキスト（もしあれば）内のマーカーが保持されます。それ以"
"外の追加マーカーを保持すると、問題が生じる可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"When reverting from non-file sources, markers are usually not preserved, but "
"this is up to the specific <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer-function</"
"code> implementation."
msgstr ""
"ファイル以外のソースから戻す際、通常はマーカーは保持されませんが、これは具体"
"的な <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer-function</code> の実装次第です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer-in-progress</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dbuffer_002din_002dprogress\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer-in-progress</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dbuffer_002din_002dprogress\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> binds this variable to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value while it is working."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> は、動作中はこの変数を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値にバインドします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"You can customize how <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> does its "
"work by setting the variables described in the rest of this section."
msgstr ""
"本節の後半で説明する変数を設定することで、<code class=\"code\">revert-"
"buffer</code> の動作をカスタマイズできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-without-query</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"revert_002dwithout_002dquery\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">revert-without-query</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dwithout_002dquery\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds a list of files that should be reverted without query.  "
"The value is a list of regular expressions.  If the visited file name "
"matches one of these regular expressions, and the file has changed on disk "
"but the buffer is not modified, then <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</"
"code> reverts the file without asking the user for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、確認なしに復元すべきファイルのリストが格納されています。値は正"
"規表現のリストです。参照したファイル名がこれらの正規表現のいずれかに一致し、"
"かつディスク上のファイルは変更されているがバッファは変更されていない場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> はユーザーに確認を求めることなく"
"ファイルを復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"Some major modes customize <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> by "
"making buffer-local bindings for these variables:"
msgstr ""
"主要なモードの中には、これらの変数に対してバッファローカルなバインディングを"
"作成することで <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> をカスタマイズするも"
"のがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dbuffer_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-revert_002dbuffer_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-revert_002dbuffer_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Definition-of-revert_002dbuffer_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the function to use to revert this buffer.  It "
"should be a function with two optional arguments to do the work of "
"reverting.  The two optional arguments, <var class=\"var\">ignore-auto</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">noconfirm</var>, are the arguments that <code "
"class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> received."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、このバッファを復元するために使用する関数です。復元処理を行う"
"ための、2つのオプション引数を持つ関数である必要があります。これら2つのオプ"
"ション引数 <var class=\"var\">ignore-auto</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">noconfirm</var> は、<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> "
"が受け取った引数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"Modes such as Dired mode, in which the text being edited does not consist of "
"a file&rsquo;s contents but can be regenerated in some other fashion, can "
"give this variable a buffer-local value that is a special function to "
"regenerate the contents."
msgstr ""
"Diredモードのように、編集中のテキストがファイルの内容ではなく、別の方法で再生"
"成可能なモードでは、この変数に、内容を再生成するための特殊な関数というバッ"
"ファローカルな値が設定されることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer-insert-file-contents-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"revert_002dbuffer_002dinsert_002dfile_002dcontents_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">revert-buffer-insert-file-contents-function</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"revert_002dbuffer_002dinsert_002dfile_002dcontents_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable specifies the function to use to insert the "
"updated contents when reverting this buffer.  The function receives two "
"arguments: first the file name to use; second, <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"if the user has asked to read the auto-save file."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、このバッファを復元する際に更新後の内容を挿入する関数を指定し"
"ます。この関数には2つの引数が渡されます。1つ目は使用するファイル名、2つ目は、"
"ユーザーが自動保存ファイルの読み込みを要求した場合には <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"The reason for a mode to change this variable instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">revert-buffer-function</code> is to avoid duplicating or "
"replacing the rest of what <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> does: "
"asking for confirmation, clearing the undo list, deciding the proper major "
"mode, and running the hooks listed below."
msgstr ""
"モードが <code class=\"code\">revert-buffer-function</code> ではなくこの変数"
"を変更する理由は、<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> が行うその他の処"
"理――確認の要求、元に戻すリストのクリア、適切なメジャーモードの決定、および以"
"下に挙げるフックの実行――の重複や置き換えを避けるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Reverting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">before-revert-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"before_002drevert_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">before-revert-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
