"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rings.html
msgid ""
"This inserts <var class=\"var\">object</var> into <var class=\"var\">ring</"
"var>, making it the newest element, and returns <var class=\"var\">object</"
