# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rounding-Operations.html
msgid ""
"The functions <code class=\"code\">ffloor</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">fceiling</code>, <code class=\"code\">fround</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">ftruncate</code> take a floating-point argument and "
"return a floating-point result whose value is a nearby integer.  <code "
"class=\"code\">ffloor</code> returns the nearest integer below; <code "
"class=\"code\">fceiling</code>, the nearest integer above; <code "
"class=\"code\">ftruncate</code>, the nearest integer in the direction "
"towards zero; <code class=\"code\">fround</code>, the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">ffloor</code>、<code class=\"code\">fceiling</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">fround</code>、および <code "
"class=\"code\">ftruncate</code> は、浮動小数点数の引数を受け取り、値が近傍の"
"整数となる浮動小数点数の結果を返します。<code class=\"code\">ffloor</code> は"
"それより小さい方の最近接整数を、<code class=\"code\">fceiling</code> はそれよ"
"り大きい方の最近接整数を、<code class=\"code\">ftruncate</code> は 0 方向の最"
"近接整数を、<code class=\"code\">fround</code> は最近接整数を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Rounding-Operations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ffloor</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">float</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-ffloor\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">ffloor</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">float</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-ffloor\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rounding-Operations.html
msgid ""
"This function rounds <var class=\"var\">float</var> to the next lower "
"integral value, and returns that value as a floating-point number."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">float</var> を次に小さい整数値に丸め、その値を"
"浮動小数点数として返します。"

