# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Rounding-Operations.html
msgid ""
"This function rounds <var class=\"var\">float</var> towards zero to an "
"integral value, and returns that value as a floating-point number."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">float</var> を 0 方向に丸めて整数値とし、その"
"値を浮動小数点数として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
