# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.1.1 Running Hooks<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Running-"
"Hooks-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.1.1 フックの実行<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Running-"
"Hooks-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"In this section, we document the <code class=\"code\">run-hooks</code> "
"function, which is used to run a normal hook.  We also document the "
"functions for running various kinds of abnormal hooks."
msgstr ""
"本節では、通常のフックを実行するために使用される <code class=\"code\">run-"
"hooks</code> 関数について解説します。また、さまざまな種類の異常フックを実行す"
"るための関数についても解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hooks</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"hookvars</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-run_002dhooks\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hooks</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"hookvars</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-run_002dhooks\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This function takes one or more normal hook variable names as arguments, and "
"runs each hook in turn.  Each argument should be a symbol that is a normal "
"hook variable.  These arguments are processed in the order specified."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、1つ以上の通常のフック変数名を引数として受け取り、各フックを順に実"
"行します。各引数は、通常のフック変数であるシンボルである必要があります。これ"
"らの引数は、指定された順序で処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"If a hook variable has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, that "
"value should be a list of functions.  <code class=\"code\">run-hooks</code> "
"calls all the functions, one by one, with no arguments."
msgstr ""
"フック変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を持つ場合、その値は関数の"
"リストである必要があります。<code class=\"code\">run-hooks</code>は、すべての"
"関数を引数なしで一つずつ呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"The hook variable&rsquo;s value can also be a single function&mdash;either a "
"lambda expression or a symbol with a function definition&mdash;which <code "
"class=\"code\">run-hooks</code> calls.  But this usage is obsolete."
msgstr ""
"フック変数の値には、<code class=\"code\">run-hooks</code> が呼び出す単一の関"
"数（ラムダ式、または関数定義を持つシンボル）を指定することもできます。ただ"
"し、この用法は非推奨となっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"If the hook variable is buffer-local, the buffer-local variable will be used "
"instead of the global variable.  However, if the buffer-local variable "
"contains the element <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the global hook variable "
"will be run as well."
msgstr ""
"hook変数がバッファローカルな場合、グローバル変数の代わりにバッファローカル変"
"数が使用されます。ただし、バッファローカル変数に要素 <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> が含まれている場合は、グローバルのhook変数も実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hook-with-args</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">hook "
"&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"run_002dhook_002dwith_002dargs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hook-with-args</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">hook "
"&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"run_002dhook_002dwith_002dargs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This function runs an abnormal hook by calling all the hook functions in "
"<var class=\"var\">hook</var>, passing each one the arguments <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">hook</var> 内のすべてのフック関数を呼び出し、"
"それぞれに引数 <var class=\"var\">args</var> を渡すことで、異常なフックを実行"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hook-with-args-until-failure</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">hook &amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-run_002dhook_002dwith_002dargs_002duntil_002dfailure\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hook-with-args-until-failure</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">hook &amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-run_002dhook_002dwith_002dargs_002duntil_002dfailure\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This function runs an abnormal hook by calling each hook function in turn, "
"stopping if one of them fails by returning <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"Each hook function is passed the arguments <var class=\"var\">args</var>.  "
"If this function stops because one of the hook functions fails, it returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>; otherwise it returns a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、各フック関数を順に呼び出して異常なフックを実行し、いずれかの関数"
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返して失敗した場合には処理を停止します。"
"各フック関数には引数 <var class=\"var\">args</var> が渡されます。いずれかの"
"フック関数が失敗してこの関数が停止した場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返し、それ以外の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hook-with-args-until-success</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">hook &amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-run_002dhook_002dwith_002dargs_002duntil_002dsuccess\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">run-hook-with-args-until-success</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">hook &amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-run_002dhook_002dwith_002dargs_002duntil_002dsuccess\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
"This function runs an abnormal hook by calling each hook function, stopping "
"if one of them succeeds by returning a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value.  Each hook function is passed the arguments <var class=\"var\">args</"
"var>.  If this function stops because one of the hook functions returns a "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, it returns that value; otherwise "
"it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、各フック関数を呼び出すことで異常なフックを実行し、いずれかの関数"
"が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返して成功した場合に処理を終了しま"
"す。各フック関数には引数<var class=\"var\">args</var>が渡されます。いずれかの"
"フック関数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返してこの関数が終了した"
"場合はその値を返し、それ以外の場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Running-Hooks.html
msgid ""
