# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.8.1.8 Sample Indentation Rules<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Sample-Indentation-Rules\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.8.1.8 インデント規則の例<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Sample-"
"Indentation-Rules\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid "Here is an example of an indentation function:"
msgstr "インデント関数の例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun sample-smie-rules (kind token)\n"
"  (pcase (cons kind token)\n"
"    (`(:elem . basic) sample-indent-basic)\n"
"    (`(,_ . &quot;,&quot;) (smie-rule-separator kind))\n"
"    (`(:after . &quot;:=&quot;) sample-indent-basic)\n"
"    (`(:before . ,(or `&quot;begin&quot; `&quot;(&quot; `&quot;{&quot;))\n"
"     (if (smie-rule-hanging-p) (smie-rule-parent)))\n"
"    (`(:before . &quot;if&quot;)\n"
"     (and (not (smie-rule-bolp)) (smie-rule-prev-p &quot;else&quot;)\n"
"          (smie-rule-parent)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"The first case indicates the basic indentation increment to use.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">sample-indent-basic</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then SMIE uses the global setting <code class=\"code\">smie-indent-"
"basic</code>.  The major mode could have set <code class=\"code\">smie-"
"indent-basic</code> buffer-locally instead, but that is discouraged."
msgstr ""
"最初のケースで、使用する基本的なインデント増分が指定されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">sample-indent-basic</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"の場合、SMIE はグローバル設定の <code class=\"code\">smie-indent-basic</"
"code> を使用します。メジャーモードが代わりにバッファローカルに <code "
"class=\"code\">smie-indent-basic</code> を設定することも可能ですが、それは推"
"奨されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"The rule for the token <code class=\"code\">&quot;,&quot;</code> make SMIE "
"try to be more clever when the comma separator is placed at the beginning of "
"lines.  It tries to outdent the separator so as to align the code after the "
"comma; for example:"
msgstr ""
"トークン <code class=\"code\">&quot;,&quot;</code> のルールにより、カンマ区切"
"り記号が行頭に配置された場合、SMIEはより巧妙な処理を試みます。具体的には、カ"
"ンマ以降のコードを揃えるために、区切り記号をインデントして配置しようとしま"
"す。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x = longfunctionname (\n"
"        arg1\n"
"      , arg2\n"
"    );\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"The rule for indentation after <code class=\"code\">&quot;:=&quot;</code> "
"exists because otherwise SMIE would treat <code class=\"code\">&quot;:=&quot;"
"</code> as an infix operator and would align the right argument with the "
"left one."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;:=&quot;</code> 以降のインデントに関する規則が存在"
"するのは、そうしないと SMIE が <code class=\"code\">&quot;:=&quot;</code> を"
"中置演算子として扱い、右引数を左引数と揃えてしまうためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"The rule for indentation before <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</"
"code> is an example of the use of virtual indentation: This rule is used "
"only when <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> is hanging, which "
"can happen only when <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> is not at "
"the beginning of a line.  So this is not used when indenting <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> itself but only when indenting "
"something relative to this <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code>.  "
"Concretely, this rule changes the indentation from:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> の前のインデントに関するルール"
"は、仮想インデントの使用例です。このルールは、<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> がぶら下がっている場合にのみ適用され"
"ますが、これは <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> が行頭にない場合"
"にのみ起こり得ます。したがって、このルールは <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> 自体をインデントする際に使われるので"
"はなく、この <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> を基準として何かを"
"インデントする際にのみ使用されます。具体的には、このルールによってインデント"
"が次のように変更されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    if x &gt; 0 then begin\n"
"            dosomething(x);\n"
"        end\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid "to"
msgstr "へ"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    if x &gt; 0 then begin\n"
"        dosomething(x);\n"
"    end\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"The rule for indentation before <code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code> "
"is similar to the one for <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code>, but "
"where the purpose is to treat <code class=\"code\">&quot;else if&quot;</"
"code> as a single unit, so as to align a sequence of tests rather than "
"indent each test further to the right.  This function does this only in the "
"case where the <code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code> is not placed on a "
"separate line, hence the <code class=\"code\">smie-rule-bolp</code> test."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code> より前のインデントに関するルール"
"は <code class=\"code\">&quot;begin&quot;</code> の場合と同様ですが、ここで"
"は <code class=\"code\">&quot;else if&quot;</code> を一つの単位として扱い、各"
"テストをさらに右にインデントするのではなく、一連のテストを揃えることを目的と"
"しています。この機能は、<code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code> が別行に配"
"置されていない場合にのみ適用され、それによって <code class=\"code\">smie-"
"rule-bolp</code> のテストが実現されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"If we know that the <code class=\"code\">&quot;else&quot;</code> is always "
"aligned with its <code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code> and is always at "
"the beginning of a line, we can use a more efficient rule:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;else&quot;</code>が常に<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code>と揃っており、かつ常に行頭にあることが分"
"かっているなら、より効率的なルールを使用できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"((equal token &quot;if&quot;)\n"
" (and (not (smie-rule-bolp))\n"
"      (smie-rule-prev-p &quot;else&quot;)\n"
"      (save-excursion\n"
"        (sample-smie-backward-token)\n"
"        (cons 'column (current-column)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Example.html
msgid ""
"The advantage of this formulation is that it reuses the indentation of the "
"previous <code class=\"code\">&quot;else&quot;</code>, rather than going all "
"the way back to the first <code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;</code> of the "
"sequence."
msgstr ""
"この記述方式の利点は、シーケンスの最初の <code class=\"code\">&quot;if&quot;"
"</code> まで遡るのではなく、直前の <code class=\"code\">&quot;else&quot;</"
"code> のインデントを再利用する点にあります。"

