# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.8.1.7 Helper Functions for Indentation Rules<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Helper-Functions-for-Indentation-Rules\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.8.1.7 インデント規則用のヘルパー関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Helper-Functions-for-Indentation-Rules\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"SMIE provides various functions designed specifically for use in the "
"indentation rules function (several of those functions break if used in "
"another context).  These functions all start with the prefix <code "
"class=\"code\">smie-rule-</code>."
msgstr ""
"SMIEは、インデント規則機能での使用に特化して設計された各種関数を提供していま"
"す（これらの関数の中には、別のコンテキストで使用すると動作しなくなるものがい"
"くつかあります）。これらの関数はすべて、接頭辞 <code class=\"code\">smie-"
"rule-</code> で始まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-bolp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dbolp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-bolp</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dbolp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the current token is the first "
"on the line."
msgstr ""
"現在のトークンが行の先頭である場合は、non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-hanging-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dhanging_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-hanging-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dhanging_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the current token is <em "
"class=\"emph\">hanging</em>.  A token is <em class=\"emph\">hanging</em> if "
"it is the last token on the line and if it is preceded by other tokens: a "
"lone token on a line is not hanging."
msgstr ""
"現在のトークンが<em class=\"emph\">ハング</em>状態である場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返します。トークンが<em class=\"emph\">ハ"
"ング</em>状態であるとは、そのトークンが行の最後のトークンであり、かつその前に"
"他のトークンが存在することを指します。行内に単独で存在するトークンはハング状"
"態ではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-next-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"tokens</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dnext_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-next-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"tokens</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dnext_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the next token is among <var "
"class=\"var\">tokens</var>."
msgstr ""
"次のトークンが <var class=\"var\">tokens</var> に含まれる場合は、non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-prev-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"tokens</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dprev_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-prev-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"tokens</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dprev_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the previous token is among "
"<var class=\"var\">tokens</var>."
msgstr ""
"直前のトークンが <var class=\"var\">tokens</var> に含まれる場合は、非 <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-parent-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest parents</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dparent_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-parent-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest parents</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dparent_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the current token&rsquo;s "
"parent is among <var class=\"var\">parents</var>."
msgstr ""
"現在のトークンの親が <var class=\"var\">parents</var> に含まれる場合は、non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-sibling-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dsibling_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-rule-sibling-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002drule_002dsibling_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Indentation-Helpers.html
msgid ""
"Return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the current token&rsquo;s "
"parent is actually a sibling.  This is the case for example when the parent "
"of a <code class=\"code\">&quot;,&quot;</code> is just the previous <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;,&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"現在のトークンの親が実際には兄弟である場合は、non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">&quot;,&quot;</code> の親が単"
"に直前の <code class=\"code\">&quot;,&quot;</code> である場合などがこれに該当"
"します。"

