# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SMIE-lexer\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-tokens_002c-SMIE\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SMIE-lexer\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-defining-tokens_002c-SMIE\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
msgid ""
"SMIE comes with a predefined lexical analyzer which uses syntax tables in "
"the following way: any sequence of characters that have word or symbol "
"syntax is considered a token, and so is any sequence of characters that have "
"punctuation syntax.  This default lexer is often a good starting point but "
"is rarely actually correct for any given language.  For example, it will "
"consider <code class=\"code\">&quot;2,+3&quot;</code> to be composed of 3 "
"tokens: <code class=\"code\">&quot;2&quot;</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;,+&quot;</code>, and <code class=\"code\">&quot;3&quot;"
"</code>."
msgstr ""
"SMIEには、構文テーブルを次のように利用する事前定義済みの字句解析器が搭載され"
"ています。単語または記号の構文を持つ任意の文字列はトークンとみなされ、句読点"
"の構文を持つ任意の文字列も同様にトークンとみなされます。このデフォルトの字句"
"解析器は出発点としては有用であることが多いものの、特定の言語において実際に正"
"しいことは稀です。例えば、<code class=\"code\">&quot;2,+3&quot;</code> は "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;2&quot;</code>、<code class=\"code\">&quot;,"
"+&quot;</code>、<code class=\"code\">&quot;3&quot;</code> という3つのトークン"
"で構成されているとみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
msgid ""
"To describe the lexing rules of your language to SMIE, you need 2 functions, "
"one to fetch the next token, and another to fetch the previous token.  Those "
"functions will usually first skip whitespace and comments and then look at "
"the next chunk of text to see if it is a special token.  If so it should "
"skip the token and return a description of this token.  Usually this is "
"simply the string extracted from the buffer, but it can be anything you "
"want.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"SMIEに言語の字句解析ルールを説明するには、次のトークンを取得する関数と、直前"
"のトークンを取得する関数の2つが必要です。これらの関数は通常、まず空白やコメン"
"トをスキップし、次に次のテキストチャンクを確認して、それが特殊トークンである"
"かどうかを判定します。特殊トークンである場合は、そのトークンをスキップして、"
"このトークンの説明を返す必要があります。通常、これは単にバッファから抽出され"
"た文字列になりますが、任意の内容にすることも可能です。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar sample-keywords-regexp\n"
"  (regexp-opt '(&quot;+&quot; &quot;*&quot; &quot;,&quot; &quot;;&quot; &quot;&gt;&quot; &quot;&gt;=&quot; &quot;&lt;&quot; &quot;&lt;=&quot; &quot;:=&quot; &quot;=&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun sample-smie-forward-token ()\n"
"  (forward-comment (point-max))\n"
"  (cond\n"
"   ((looking-at sample-keywords-regexp)\n"
"    (goto-char (match-end 0))\n"
"    (match-string-no-properties 0))\n"
"   (t (buffer-substring-no-properties\n"
"       (point)\n"
"       (progn (skip-syntax-forward &quot;w_&quot;)\n"
"              (point))))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun sample-smie-backward-token ()\n"
"  (forward-comment (- (point)))\n"
"  (cond\n"
"   ((looking-back sample-keywords-regexp (- (point) 2) t)\n"
"    (goto-char (match-beginning 0))\n"
"    (match-string-no-properties 0))\n"
"   (t (buffer-substring-no-properties\n"
"       (point)\n"
"       (progn (skip-syntax-backward &quot;w_&quot;)\n"
"              (point))))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-Lexer.html
msgid ""
"Notice how those lexers return the empty string when in front of "
"parentheses.  This is because SMIE automatically takes care of the "
"parentheses defined in the syntax table.  More specifically if the lexer "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or an empty string, SMIE tries to "
"handle the corresponding text as a sexp according to syntax tables."
msgstr ""
"これらのレクサーが、括弧の前にある場合に空文字列を返す点に注目してください。"
"これは、SMIEが構文テーブルで定義された括弧を自動的に処理するためです。より具"
"体的には、レクサーが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> または空文字列を返した場"
"合、SMIEは構文テーブルに従って、対応するテキストを sexp として処理しようとし"
"ます。"

