#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.8.1.1 SMIE Setup and Features<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#SMIE-Setup-and-Features\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.8.1.1 SMIEのセットアップと機能<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#SMIE-Setup-and-Features\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"SMIE is meant to be a one-stop shop for structural navigation and various "
"other features which rely on the syntactic structure of code, in particular "
"automatic indentation.  The main entry point is <code class=\"code\">smie-"
"setup</code> which is a function typically called while setting up a major "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"SMIEは、構造的なナビゲーションや、コードの構文構造に依存する各種機能（特に自"
"動インデント）をワンストップで提供することを目的としています。主なエントリポ"
"イントは<code class=\"code\">smie-setup</code>であり、これは通常、メジャー"
"モードの設定時に呼び出される関数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-setup</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">grammar rules-"
"function &amp;rest keywords</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dsetup\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-setup</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">grammar rules-"
"function &amp;rest keywords</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dsetup\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"Setup SMIE navigation and indentation.  <var class=\"var\">grammar</var> is "
"a grammar table generated by <code class=\"code\">smie-prec2-&gt;grammar</"
"code>.  <var class=\"var\">rules-function</var> is a set of indentation "
"rules for use on <code class=\"code\">smie-rules-function</code>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">keywords</var> are additional arguments, which can include the "
"following keywords:"
msgstr ""
"SMIEのナビゲーションとインデントを設定します。<var class=\"var\">grammar</"
"var>は<code class=\"code\">smie-prec2-&gt;grammar</code>によって生成された文"
"法テーブルです。<var class=\"var\">rules-function</var>は<code "
"class=\"code\">smie-rules-function</code>で使用するインデントルールのセットで"
"す。<var class=\"var\">keywords</var>は追加の引数であり、以下のキーワードを含"
"めることができます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:forward-token</code> <var class=\"var\">fun</var>: "
"Specify the forward lexer to use."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:forward-token</code> <var class=\"var\">fun</var>: 使用"
"するフォワードレクサーを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:backward-token</code> <var class=\"var\">fun</var>: "
"Specify the backward lexer to use."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:backward-token</code> <var class=\"var\">fun</var>: 使"
"用する逆方向レクサーを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"Calling this function is sufficient to make commands such as <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code>, <code class=\"code\">backward-sexp</"
"code>, and <code class=\"code\">transpose-sexps</code> be able to properly "
"handle structural elements other than just the paired parentheses already "
"handled by syntax tables.  For example, if the provided grammar is precise "
"enough, <code class=\"code\">transpose-sexps</code> can correctly transpose "
"the two arguments of a <code class=\"code\">+</code> operator, taking into "
"account the precedence rules of the language."
msgstr ""
"この関数を呼び出すだけで、<code class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">backward-sexp</code>、<code class=\"code\">transpose-sexps</"
"code> といったコマンドが、構文テーブルで既に処理されている対になった括弧以外"
"の構造要素も適切に扱えるようになります。例えば、提供された文法が十分に精緻で"
"あれば、<code class=\"code\">transpose-sexps</code> は言語の優先順位規則を考"
"慮して、<code class=\"code\">+</code> 演算子の2つの引数を正しく転置することが"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"Calling <code class=\"code\">smie-setup</code> is also sufficient to make "
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> indentation work in the expected way, extends "
"<code class=\"code\">blink-matching-paren</code> to apply to elements like "
"<code class=\"code\">begin...end</code>, and provides some commands that you "
"can bind in the major mode keymap."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">smie-setup</code> を呼び出すだけでも、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> のインデントが期待通りに動作し、<code "
"class=\"code\">blink-matching-paren</code> を拡張して <code "
"class=\"code\">begin...end</code> のような要素にも適用できるほか、メジャー"
"モードのキーマップにバインド可能なコマンドもいくつか提供されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-close-block</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dclose_002dblock\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">smie-close-block</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002dclose_002dblock\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"This command closes the most recently opened (and not yet closed) block."
msgstr "このコマンドは、直近で開いた（まだ閉じていない）ブロックを閉じます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
