"arguments\">&amp;optional arg</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"smie_002ddown_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE-setup.html
msgid ""
"This command is like <code class=\"code\">down-list</code> but it also pays "
