#: build/html/elisp/SMIE.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.8.1 Simple Minded Indentation Engine<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Simple-Minded-Indentation-Engine\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.8.1 Simple Minded Indentation Engine<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Simple-Minded-Indentation-Engine\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SMIE\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SMIE\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE.html
msgid ""
"SMIE is a package that provides a generic navigation and indentation "
"engine.  Based on a very simple parser using an operator precedence grammar, "
"it lets major modes extend the sexp-based navigation of Lisp to non-Lisp "
"languages as well as provide a simple to use but reliable auto-indentation."
msgstr ""
"SMIEは、汎用的なナビゲーションおよびインデントエンジンを提供するパッケージで"
"す。演算子優先順位文法を用いた非常にシンプルなパーサーを基盤としており、メ"
"ジャーモードがLispのsexpベースのナビゲーションを非Lisp言語にも拡張できるほ"
"か、使いやすく信頼性の高い自動インデント機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SMIE.html
msgid ""
"Operator precedence grammar is a very primitive technology for parsing "
"compared to some of the more common techniques used in compilers.  It has "
"the following characteristics: its parsing power is very limited, and it is "
"largely unable to detect syntax errors, but it has the advantage of being "
"algorithmically efficient and able to parse forward just as well as "
"backward.  In practice that means that SMIE can use it for indentation based "
"on backward parsing, that it can provide both <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"sexp</code> and <code class=\"code\">backward-sexp</code> functionality, and "
"that it will naturally work on syntactically incorrect code without any "
"extra effort.  The downside is that it also means that most programming "
"languages cannot be parsed correctly using SMIE, at least not without "
"resorting to some special tricks (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"SMIE-"
"Tricks.html\">Living With a Weak Parser</a>)."
msgstr ""
"演算子優先順位文法は、コンパイラで用いられるより一般的な手法に比べると、構文"
"解析において非常に原始的な技術です。これには次のような特徴があります。構文解"
"析能力が極めて限定的であり、構文エラーの検出もほぼ不可能ですが、アルゴリズム"
"的に効率的で、後方解析と同様に前方解析も行えるという利点があります。実際に"
"は、これによりSMIEは後方解析に基づくインデント処理に利用でき、<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code>と<code class=\"code\">backward-sexp</code>"
"の両方の機能を提供できるほか、特別な工夫をせずとも構文的に誤ったコードに対し"
"ても自然に動作します。欠点は、ほとんどのプログラミング言語をSMIEで正しく解析"
"できないことであり、少なくとも何らかの特殊な手法を用いない限りは不可能です"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"SMIE-Tricks.html\">Living With a Weak Parser</a>"
"を参照）。"

