# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/SVG-Images.html
msgid ""
"Add an embedded (raster) image to <var class=\"var\">svg</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">datap</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">image</var> should be a file name; otherwise it should be a "
"string containing the image data as raw bytes.  <var class=\"var\">image-"
"type</var> should be a <abbr class=\"acronym\">MIME</abbr> image type, for "
"instance <code class=\"code\">&quot;image/jpeg&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">svg</var> に埋め込み（ラスター）画像を追加します。<var "
"class=\"var\">datap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は <var "
"class=\"var\">image</var> をファイル名とし、それ以外の場合は画像データを生バ"
"イトとして含む文字列とします。<var class=\"var\">image-type</var> は <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">MIME</abbr> 画像タイプ（例：<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;image/jpeg&quot;</code>）とします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/SVG-Images.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(svg-embed svg &quot;~/rms.jpg&quot; &quot;image/jpeg&quot; nil\n"
"           :width &quot;100px&quot; :height &quot;100px&quot;\n"
"           :x &quot;50px&quot; :y &quot;75px&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

