#: build/html/elisp/SVG-Images.html
msgid ""
"Using the first element in <var class=\"var\">coordinate-sets</var>, draw a "
"cubic B&eacute;zier curve from the current point.  If there are multiple "
"coordinate sets, draw a polybezier.  Each coordinate set is a list of the "
"form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var> <var class=\"var\">x2</var> <var class=\"var\">y2</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code>, where "
"(<var class=\"var\">x</var>,&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">y</var>) is the "
"curve&rsquo;s end point.  (<var class=\"var\">x1</var>,&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var>) and (<var class=\"var\">x2</var>,&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">y2</var>) are control points at the beginning and at the end, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">coordinate-sets</var> の最初の要素を使用して、現在の点から"
"3次ベジェ曲線を描画します。座標セットが複数ある場合は、ポリベジェ曲線を描画し"
"ます。各座標セットは <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var> <var class=\"var\">x2</var> <var class=\"var\">y2</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code> 形式のリス"
"トであり、(<var class=\"var\">x</var>,&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">y</var>) が曲"
"線の終点となります。(<var class=\"var\">x1</var>,&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">y1</var>) と (<var class=\"var\">x2</var>,&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">y2</var>) は、それぞれ始点と終点の制御点です。"

