#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.6.4 Saving and Restoring the Match Data<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Saving-and-Restoring-the-Match-Data\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.6.4 試合データの保存と復元<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Saving-"
"and-Restoring-the-Match-Data\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"When you call a function that may search, you may need to save and restore "
"the match data around that call, if you want to preserve the match data from "
"an earlier search for later use.  Here is an example that shows the problem "
"that arises if you fail to save the match data:"
msgstr ""
"検索を行う可能性のある関数を呼び出す際、以前の検索で得られたマッチデータを後"
"で利用するために保持しておきたい場合は、その呼び出し前後でマッチデータを保"
"存・復元する必要があるかもしれません。以下に、マッチデータの保存を怠った場合"
"に生じる問題を示す例を挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(re-search-forward &quot;The \\\\(cat \\\\)&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; 48\n"
"(foo)                   ; <span class=\"r\"><code class=\"code\">foo</code> does more searching.</span>\n"
"(match-end 0)\n"
"     &rArr; 61              ; <span class=\"r\">Unexpected result&mdash;not 48!</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"You can save and restore the match data with <code class=\"code\">save-match-"
"data</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-match-data</code> でマッチデータを保存・復元できま"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-match-data</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-save_002dmatch_002ddata\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">save-match-data</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">body&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-save_002dmatch_002ddata\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This macro executes <var class=\"var\">body</var>, saving and restoring the "
"match data around it.  The return value is the value of the last form in "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは<var class=\"var\">body</var>を実行し、その前後のマッチデータを保"
"存・復元します。戻り値は<var class=\"var\">body</var>内の最後のフォームの値と"
"なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"You could use <code class=\"code\">set-match-data</code> together with <code "
"class=\"code\">match-data</code> to imitate the effect of the special form "
"<code class=\"code\">save-match-data</code>.  Here is how:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">set-match-data</code> と <code class=\"code\">match-"
"data</code> を併用することで、特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">save-match-data</"
"code> の効果を再現できます。方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((data (match-data)))\n"
"  (unwind-protect\n"
"      ...   ; <span class=\"r\">Ok to change the original match data.</span>\n"
"    (set-match-data data)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Saving-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"Emacs automatically saves and restores the match data when it runs process "
"filter functions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html\">Process Filter Functions</a>) and process sentinels (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">Sentinels: Detecting Process Status "
"Changes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、プロセスフィルタ関数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html\">プロセスフィルタ関数</a>を参照）やプロセスセンチネル（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sentinels.html\">センチネル：プロセス状態の変化の検出"
"</a>を参照）を実行する際、マッチデータを自動的に保存・復元します。"

