#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scanning-for-character-sets\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-set_002c-searching\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scanning-for-character-sets\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-set_002c-searching\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to find out which character set a particular "
"character belongs to.  One use for this is in determining which coding "
"systems (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">Coding Systems</"
"a>) are capable of representing all of the text in question; another is to "
"determine the font(s) for displaying that text."
msgstr ""
"特定の文字がどの文字セットに属しているかを確認することが有用な場合がありま"
"す。その用途の一つとして、対象となるすべてのテキストを表現できる符号化方式"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">符号化方式</a>を参照）を特"
"定することが挙げられます。また、そのテキストを表示するためのフォントを決定す"
"ることも挙げられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">charset-after</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"pos</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-charset_002dafter\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">charset-after</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"pos</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-charset_002dafter\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the charset of highest priority containing the "
"character at position <var class=\"var\">pos</var> in the current buffer.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">pos</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it defaults to the current value of point.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> is out of range, the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファの位置 <var class=\"var\">pos</var> にある文字を含"
"む、最優先の文字セットを返します。<var class=\"var\">pos</var> が省略された場"
"合、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、point の現在の"
"値がデフォルトとなります。<var class=\"var\">pos</var> が範囲外の場合、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-charset-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg end "
"&amp;optional translation</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dcharset_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-charset-region</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">beg end "
"&amp;optional translation</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dcharset_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of the character sets of highest priority that "
"contain characters in the current buffer between positions <var "
"class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファの位置 <var class=\"var\">beg</var> から <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> までの間にある文字を含む、優先度の高い文字セットの一"
"覧を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">translation</var> specifies a "
"translation table to use for scanning the text (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Translation-of-Characters.html\">Translation of Characters</a>).  If "
"it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then each character in the region "
"is translated through this table, and the value returned describes the "
"translated characters instead of the characters actually in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">translation</var> は、テキストのスキャンに"
"使用する変換テーブルを指定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Translation-of-"
"Characters.html\">文字の変換</a>を参照）。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、領域内の各文字はこのテーブルを通じて変換され、返される値は"
"バッファに実際に含まれている文字ではなく、変換後の文字を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-charset-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional translation</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dcharset_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-charset-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional translation</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dcharset_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Charsets.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of character sets of highest priority that "
"contain characters in <var class=\"var\">string</var>.  It is just like "
"<code class=\"code\">find-charset-region</code>, except that it applies to "
"the contents of <var class=\"var\">string</var> instead of part of the "
"current buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> に含まれる文字を包含する、優先度"
"の最も高い文字セットの一覧を返します。<code class=\"code\">find-charset-"
"region</code> と同様ですが、現在のバッファの一部ではなく、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> の内容に適用される点が異なります。"

