# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions used to scan all the current keymaps for "
"the sake of printing help information.  To display the bindings in a "
"particular keymap, you can use the <code class=\"code\">describe-keymap</"
"code> command (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Misc-Help.html#Misc-Help\">Other Help "
"Commands</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)"
msgstr ""
"本節では、ヘルプ情報を出力するために現在のすべてのキーマップを走査する関数に"
"ついて説明します。特定のキーマップ内のバインディングを表示するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-keymap</code>コマンドを使用できます（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Misc-"
"Help.html#Misc-Help\">その他のヘルプコマンド</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">accessible-keymaps</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"&amp;optional prefix</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"accessible_002dkeymaps\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">accessible-keymaps</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">keymap "
"&amp;optional prefix</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"accessible_002dkeymaps\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list of all the keymaps that can be reached (via "
"zero or more prefix keys) from <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  The value "
"is an association list with elements of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> .  <var class=\"var\">map</var>)</code>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> is a prefix key whose definition in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> is <var class=\"var\">map</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var>から（0個以上のプレフィックスキー"
"を介して）到達可能なすべてのキーマップのリストを返します。戻り値は連想リスト"
"であり、要素は<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">key</var> .  <var "
"class=\"var\">map</var>)</code>という形式をしています。ここで<var "
"class=\"var\">key</var>はプレフィックスキーであり、<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>におけるその定義は<var class=\"var\">map</var>とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The elements of the alist are ordered so that the <var class=\"var\">key</"
"var> increases in length.  The first element is always <code "
"class=\"code\">([] . <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>)</code>, because the "
"specified keymap is accessible from itself with a prefix of no events."
msgstr ""
"alistの要素は、<var class=\"var\">key</var>の長さが増加するように順序付けられ"
"ています。最初の要素は常に<code class=\"code\">([] . <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>)</code>となります。これは、指定されたキーマップ"
"が、イベントを伴わないプレフィックスを用いて自身からアクセス可能であるためで"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> is given, it should be a prefix key "
"sequence; then <code class=\"code\">accessible-keymaps</code> includes only "
"the submaps whose prefixes start with <var class=\"var\">prefix</var>.  "
"These elements look just as they do in the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">(accessible-keymaps)</code>; the only difference is that some "
"elements are omitted."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">prefix</var> が指定されている場合、それはプレフィックス"
"キーシーケンスである必要があります。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">accessible-keymaps</code> にはプレフィックスが <var "
"class=\"var\">prefix</var> で始まるサブマップのみが含まれます。これらの要素"
"は <code class=\"code\">(accessible-keymaps)</code> の値と同様に見え、唯一の"
"違いは、一部の要素が省略されている点です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"In the example below, the returned alist indicates that the key <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>, which is displayed as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^[</samp>&rsquo;, is a prefix key whose definition is the "
"sparse keymap <code class=\"code\">(keymap (83 . center-paragraph)  (115 . "
"foo))</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、返されたalistは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^[</samp>&rsquo;と"
"表示されるキー<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>が、定義がスパースキーマップ<code "
"class=\"code\">(keymap (83 . center-paragraph)  (115 . foo))</code>であるプレ"
"フィックスキーであることを示しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(accessible-keymaps (current-local-map))\n"
"&rArr;(([] keymap\n"
"      (27 keymap   ; <span class=\"r\">Note this keymap for <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> is repeated below.</span>\n"
"          (83 . center-paragraph)\n"
"          (115 . center-line))\n"
"      (9 . tab-to-tab-stop))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   (&quot;^[&quot; keymap\n"
"    (83 . center-paragraph)\n"
"    (115 . foo)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> is a prefix key that "
"uses a sparse keymap starting with <code class=\"code\">(keymap (118 . "
"describe-variable)&hellip;)</code>.  Another prefix, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"4</kbd>, uses a keymap which is also the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">ctl-x-4-map</code>.  The event <code class=\"code\">mode-"
"line</code> is one of several dummy events used as prefixes for mouse "
"actions in special parts of a window."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> は <code class=\"code\">(keymap "
"(118 . describe-variable)&hellip;)</code> から始まるスパースキーマップを使用"
"するプレフィックスキーです。別のプレフィックスである <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"4</kbd> は、変数 <code class=\"code\">ctl-x-4-map</code> の値でもあるキーマッ"
"プを使用します。イベント <code class=\"code\">mode-line</code> は、ウィンドウ"
"の特殊な領域におけるマウス操作のプレフィックスとして使用される、複数のダミー"
"イベントのひとつです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(accessible-keymaps (current-global-map))\n"
"&rArr; (([] keymap [set-mark-command beginning-of-line ...\n"
"                   delete-backward-char])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (&quot;^H&quot; keymap (118 . describe-variable) ...\n"
"     (8 . help-for-help))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (&quot;^X&quot; keymap [x-flush-mouse-queue ...\n"
"     backward-kill-sentence])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (&quot;^[&quot; keymap [mark-sexp backward-sexp ...\n"
"     backward-kill-word])\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "    (&quot;^X4&quot; keymap (15 . display-buffer) ...)\n"
msgstr ""

