#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ([mode-line] keymap\n"
"     (S-mouse-2 . mouse-split-window-horizontally) ...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid "These are not all the keymaps you would see in actuality."
msgstr "これらは、実際に目にするキーマップのすべてではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">map-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function keymap</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-map_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">map-keymap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">function keymap</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-map_002dkeymap\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">map-keymap</code> calls <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> once for each binding in <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  It passes two arguments, the event type and the "
"value of the binding.  If <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> has a parent, the "
"parent&rsquo;s bindings are included as well.  This works recursively: if "
"the parent has itself a parent, then the grandparent&rsquo;s bindings are "
"also included and so on."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">map-keymap</code> は、<var class=\"var\">keymap</"
"var> 内の各バインディングに対して <var class=\"var\">function</var> を1回呼び"
"出します。このとき、そのイベントタイプとバインディングの値という2つの引数を渡"
"します。<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> に親がある場合は、その親のバインディ"
"ングも含まれます。これは再帰的に動作します。つまり、親にさらに親がある場合"
"は、その祖父母のバインディングも含まれる、といった具合です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function is the cleanest way to examine all the bindings in a keymap."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、キーマップ内のすべてのバインディングを確認する最も簡潔な方法で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">where-is-internal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional keymap firstonly noindirect no-remap</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-where_002dis_002dinternal\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">where-is-internal</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">command "
"&amp;optional keymap firstonly noindirect no-remap</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-where_002dis_002dinternal\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"This function is a subroutine used by the <code class=\"code\">where-is</"
"code> command (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Help.html#Help\">Help</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>).  It returns a list of all key "
"sequences (of any length) that are bound to <var class=\"var\">command</var> "
"in a set of keymaps."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">where-is</code>コマンド（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Help.html#Help\">ヘルプ</a>を参照）で使用されるサブルーチンです。キーマップの"
"集合において<var class=\"var\">command</var>にバインドされているすべてのキー"
"シーケンス（長さを問わず）のリストを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">command</var> can be any object; it is "
"compared with all keymap entries using <code class=\"code\">eq</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">command</var> には任意のオブジェクトを指定でき、"
"<code class=\"code\">eq</code> を用いてすべてのキーマップエントリと比較されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then "
"the maps used are the current active keymaps, disregarding <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code> (that is, pretending its value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>).  If <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is a "
"keymap, then the maps searched are <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> and the "
"global keymap.  If <var class=\"var\">keymap</var> is a list of keymaps, "
"only those keymaps are searched."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、使"
"用されるマップは <code class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code> を無視した"
"現在のアクティブなキーマップとなります（つまり、その値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> であるものとして扱われます）。<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> がキーマップの場合、検索対象となるマップは <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> とグローバルキーマップです。<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> がキーマップのリストである場合、それらのキーマップ"
"のみが検索対象となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Usually it&rsquo;s best to use <code class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</"
"code> as the expression for <var class=\"var\">keymap</var>.  Then <code "
"class=\"code\">where-is-internal</code> searches precisely the keymaps that "
"are active.  To search only the global map, pass the value <code "
"class=\"code\">(keymap)</code> (an empty keymap) as <var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var>."
msgstr ""
"通常、<var class=\"var\">keymap</var> の式には <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-local-map</code> を使用するのが最適です。これによ"
"り、<code class=\"code\">where-is-internal</code> はアクティブなキーマップの"
"みを正確に検索します。グローバルマップのみを検索する場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">keymap</var> に値 <code class=\"code\">(keymap)</code>（空の"
"キーマップ）を指定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">firstonly</var> is <code class=\"code\">non-ascii</"
"code>, then the value is a single vector representing the first key sequence "
"found, rather than a list of all possible key sequences.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">firstonly</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, then the "
"value is the first key sequence, except that key sequences consisting "
"entirely of <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters (or meta "
"variants of <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters) are preferred "
"to all other key sequences and that the return value can never be a menu "
"binding."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">firstonly</var> が <code class=\"code\">non-ascii</code> "
"の場合、値は考えられるすべてのキーシーケンスのリストではなく、最初に見つかっ"
"たキーシーケンスを表す単一のベクトルとなります。<var "
"class=\"var\">firstonly</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、値は最"
"初のキーシーケンスとなります。ただし、すべて <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> 文字（または <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字のメタバリアン"
"ト）で構成されるキーシーケンスは、他のすべてのキーシーケンスよりも優先され、"
"また戻り値がメニューバインディングになることは決してありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">noindirect</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">where-is-internal</code> doesn&rsquo;t look "
"inside menu-items to find their commands.  This makes it possible to search "
"for a menu-item itself."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">noindirect</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない"
"場合、<code class=\"code\">where-is-internal</code> はメニュー項目の内部を調"
"べてコマンドを探すことはありません。これにより、メニュー項目自体を検索するこ"
"とが可能になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"The fifth argument, <var class=\"var\">no-remap</var>, determines how this "
"function treats command remappings (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remapping-"
"Commands.html\">Remapping Commands</a>).  There are two cases of interest:"
msgstr ""
"5番目の引数 <var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> は、この関数がコマンドのリマッ"
"ピングをどのように扱うかを決定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remapping-"
"Commands.html\">コマンドのリマッピング</a>を参照）。注目すべきケースは2つあり"
"ます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If a command <var class=\"var\">other-command</var> is remapped to <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var>:"
msgstr ""
"コマンド <var class=\"var\">other-command</var> が <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> に再マッピングされた場合："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"find the bindings for <var class=\"var\">other-command</var> and treat them "
"as though they are also bindings for <var class=\"var\">command</var>.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"include the vector <code class=\"code\">[remap <var class=\"var\">other-"
"command</var>]</code> in the list of possible key sequences, instead of "
"finding those bindings."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">other-command</var> のバインディングを特定し、それら"
"を <var class=\"var\">command</var> のバインディングでもあるものとして扱う。"
"<var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であ"
"る場合、それらのバインディングを特定する代わりに、ベクトル <code "
"class=\"code\">[remap <var class=\"var\">other-command</var>]</code> を可能な"
"キーシーケンスのリストに含める。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">command</var> is remapped to <var class=\"var\">other-"
"command</var>:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">command</var> が <var class=\"var\">other-command</var> に"
"再マッピングされた場合："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"return the bindings for <var class=\"var\">other-command</var> rather than "
"<var class=\"var\">command</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, return the bindings for <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var>, ignoring the fact that it is remapped."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、"
"<var class=\"var\">command</var> ではなく <var class=\"var\">other-command</"
"var> のバインディングを返す。<var class=\"var\">no-remap</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、リマップされている点は無視して、<var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> のバインディングを返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If a command maps to a key binding like <code class=\"code\">[some-event]</"
