"class=\"var\">prefix</var> で始まるキーのみが含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"When several characters with consecutive <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> codes have the same definition, they are shown together, as &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">firstchar</var>..<var "
"class=\"var\">lastchar</var></samp>&rsquo;.  In this instance, you need to "
"know the <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> codes to understand which "
"characters this means.  For example, in the default global map, the "
"characters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> .. ~</"
"samp>&rsquo; are described by a single line.  <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> "
"is <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 32, <kbd class=\"kbd\">~</kbd> is "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 126, and the characters between them "
"include all the normal printing characters, (e.g., letters, digits, "
"punctuation, etc.); all these characters are bound to <code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>."
msgstr ""
"連続する<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>コードを持つ複数の文字が同じ定義"
"を持つ場合、それらは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var "
"class=\"var\">firstchar</var>..<var class=\"var\">lastchar</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;のようにまとめて表示されます。この場合、どの文字を指しているのか"
"を理解するには、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>コードを知っておく必要が"
"あります。例えば、デフォルトのグローバルマップでは、文字&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> .. ~</samp>&rsquo;は1行で記述され"
"ています。<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>は<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"32、<kbd class=\"kbd\">~</kbd>は<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 126であ"
"り、その間の文字にはすべての通常の印字文字（例：英字、数字、句読点など）が含"
"まれます。これらの文字はすべて<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>"
"に紐付けられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Scanning-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
