# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">move-to-window-line</code>, "
"except that when the selected window is a part of a group of windows (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-Windows.html#Window-Group\">Window Group</"
"a>), <code class=\"code\">move-to-window-group-line</code> will move to a "
"position with respect to the entire group, not just the single window.  This "
"condition holds when the buffer local variable <code class=\"code\">move-to-"
"window-group-line-function</code> is set to a function.  In this case, <code "
"class=\"code\">move-to-window-group-line</code> calls the function with the "
"argument <var class=\"var\">count</var>, then returns its result."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">move-to-window-line</code> と同様ですが、選択"
"されたウィンドウがウィンドウグループ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-"
"Windows.html#Window-Group\">ウィンドウグループ</a> を参照）の一部である場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">move-to-window-group-line</code> は単一のウィンドウだけ"
"でなく、グループ全体に対する相対位置へ移動します。この条件は、バッファローカ"
"ル変数 <code class=\"code\">move-to-window-group-line-function</code> に関数"
"が設定されている場合に成立します。この場合、<code class=\"code\">move-to-"
"window-group-line</code> は引数 <var class=\"var\">count</var> を指定してその"
"関数を呼び出し、その結果を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compute-motion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from frompos "
"to topos width offsets window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"compute_002dmotion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">compute-motion</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">from frompos "
"to topos width offsets window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"compute_002dmotion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"This function scans the current buffer, calculating screen positions.  It "
"scans the buffer forward from position <var class=\"var\">from</var>, "
"assuming that is at screen coordinates <var class=\"var\">frompos</var>, to "
"position <var class=\"var\">to</var> or coordinates <var "
"class=\"var\">topos</var>, whichever comes first.  It returns the ending "
"buffer position and screen coordinates."
msgstr ""
"この関数は現在のバッファを走査し、画面位置を算出します。位置 <var "
"class=\"var\">from</var>（画面座標 <var class=\"var\">frompos</var> にあると"
"想定）から位置 <var class=\"var\">to</var> または座標 <var "
"class=\"var\">topos</var> のいずれか早い方まで、バッファを前方に走査します。"
"そして、終了したバッファ位置と画面座標を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"The coordinate arguments <var class=\"var\">frompos</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">topos</var> are cons cells of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> . <var class=\"var\">vpos</"
"var>)</code>."
msgstr ""
"座標引数 <var class=\"var\">frompos</var> と <var class=\"var\">topos</var> "
"は、<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">vpos</var>)</code> 形式のコンスセルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">width</var> is the number of columns "
"available to display text; this affects handling of continuation lines.  "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means the actual number of usable text "
"columns in the window, which is equivalent to the value returned by <code "
"class=\"code\">(window-width window)</code>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">width</var> はテキスト表示に利用可能な列数であり、こ"
"れは継続行の処理に影響します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> はウィンドウ内"
"で実際に使用可能なテキスト列数を表し、<code class=\"code\">(window-width "
"window)</code> が返す値と同等です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">offsets</var> is either <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or a cons cell of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">hscroll</var> . <var class=\"var\">tab-"
"offset</var>)</code>.  Here <var class=\"var\">hscroll</var> is the number "
"of columns not being displayed at the left margin; most callers get this by "
"calling <code class=\"code\">window-hscroll</code>.  Meanwhile, <var "
"class=\"var\">tab-offset</var> is the offset between column numbers on the "
"screen and column numbers in the buffer.  This can be nonzero in a "
"continuation line, when the previous screen lines&rsquo; widths do not add "
"up to a multiple of <code class=\"code\">tab-width</code>.  It is always "
"zero in a non-continuation line."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">offsets</var> は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> ま"
"たは <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">hscroll</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">tab-offset</var>)</code> 形式のコンスセルのいずれかです。ここ"
"で <var class=\"var\">hscroll</var> は左マージンに表示されない列数であり、ほ"
"とんどの呼び出し元は <code class=\"code\">window-hscroll</code> を呼び出すこ"
"とでこの値を取得します。一方、<var class=\"var\">tab-offset</var> は画面上の"
"列番号とバッファ内の列番号とのオフセットです。継続行において、直前の画面行の"
"幅の合計が <code class=\"code\">tab-width</code> の倍数にならない場合、この値"
"は 0 以外になることがあります。継続行でない場合は、常に 0 となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"The window <var class=\"var\">window</var> serves only to specify which "
"display table to use.  <code class=\"code\">compute-motion</code> always "
"operates on the current buffer, regardless of what buffer is displayed in "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window</var> は、どのディスプレイテーブルを使用"
"するかを指定するためだけに用いられます。<code class=\"code\">compute-motion</"
"code> は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> にどのバッファが表示されていても、"
"常に現在のバッファに対して動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid "The return value is a list of five elements:"
msgstr "戻り値は5つの要素からなるリストです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">pos</var> <var class=\"var\">hpos</var> <var class=\"var\">vpos</var> <var class=\"var\">prevhpos</var> <var class=\"var\">contin</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Here <var class=\"var\">pos</var> is the buffer position where the scan "
"stopped, <var class=\"var\">vpos</var> is the vertical screen position, and "
"<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> is the horizontal screen position."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">pos</var>はスキャンが停止したバッファ位置、<var "
"class=\"var\">vpos</var>は画面の垂直位置、<var class=\"var\">hpos</var>は画面"
"の水平位置です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"The result <var class=\"var\">prevhpos</var> is the horizontal position one "
"character back from <var class=\"var\">pos</var>.  The result <var "
"class=\"var\">contin</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the last line "
"was continued after (or within) the previous character."
msgstr ""
"結果 <var class=\"var\">prevhpos</var> は、<var class=\"var\">pos</var> から1"
"文字戻った水平位置となります。結果 <var class=\"var\">contin</var> は、最終行"
"が直前の文字の後（または内部）で継続されていた場合の <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"For example, to find the buffer position of column <var class=\"var\">col</"
"var> of screen line <var class=\"var\">line</var> of a certain window, pass "
"the window&rsquo;s display start location as <var class=\"var\">from</var> "
"and the window&rsquo;s upper-left coordinates as <var class=\"var\">frompos</"
"var>.  Pass the buffer&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">(point-max)</code> as "
"<var class=\"var\">to</var>, to limit the scan to the end of the accessible "
"portion of the buffer, and pass <var class=\"var\">line</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">col</var> as <var class=\"var\">topos</var>.  Here&rsquo;s a "
"function that does this:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、あるウィンドウの画面行 <var class=\"var\">line</var> の列 <var "
"class=\"var\">col</var> のバッファ位置を求めるには、ウィンドウの表示開始位置"
"を <var class=\"var\">from</var> として、ウィンドウの左上座標を <var "
"class=\"var\">frompos</var> として渡します。バッファの <code "
"class=\"code\">(point-max)</code> を <var class=\"var\">to</var> として渡すこ"
"とで、スキャン範囲をバッファのアクセス可能な領域の末尾までに制限し、<var "
"class=\"var\">line</var> と <var class=\"var\">col</var> を <var "
"class=\"var\">topos</var> として渡します。これを実現する関数を以下に示しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun coordinates-of-position (col line)\n"
"  (car (compute-motion (window-start)\n"
"                       '(0 . 0)\n"
"                       (point-max)\n"
"                       (cons col line)\n"
"                       (window-width)\n"
"                       (cons (window-hscroll) 0)\n"
"                       (selected-window))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Screen-Lines.html
msgid ""
"When you use <code class=\"code\">compute-motion</code> for the minibuffer, "
"you need to use <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-prompt-width</code> to get "
"the horizontal position of the beginning of the first screen line.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Contents.html\">Minibuffer Contents</a>."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファに <code class=\"code\">compute-motion</code> を使用する場合、最"
"初の画面行の先頭の水平位置を取得するには <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-"
"prompt-width</code> を使用する必要があります。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-Contents.html\">ミニバッファの内容</a>を参照してください。"

