# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"If you want to find all matches for a regexp in part of the buffer and "
"replace them, the most flexible way is to write an explicit loop using <code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> and <code class=\"code\">replace-"
"match</code>, like this:"
msgstr ""
"バッファの一部で正規表現に一致する箇所をすべて検索して置換したい場合、最も柔"
"軟な方法は、次のように <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> を用いて明示的なループを記述するこ"
"とです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (re-search-forward &quot;foo[ \\t]+bar&quot; nil t)\n"
"  (replace-match &quot;foobar&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

