# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces all the occurrences of <var class=\"var\">regexp</"
"var> with <var class=\"var\">replacement</var> in the region of buffer text "
"between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>; "
"<var class=\"var\">start</var> defaults to position of point, and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> defaults to the last accessible position of the "
"buffer.  The search for <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> is case-sensitive, "
"and <var class=\"var\">replacement</var> is inserted without changing its "
"letter-case.  The <var class=\"var\">replacement</var> string can use the "
"same special elements starting with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>&rsquo; as <code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> does.  The "
"function returns the number of replaced occurrences, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> is not found.  "
"The function preserves the position of point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファテキスト内の <var class=\"var\">start</var> から <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> までの範囲において、<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> "
"のすべての出現箇所を <var class=\"var\">replacement</var> に置換します。<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> はデフォルトでポイントの位置となり、<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> はデフォルトでバッファの最後にアクセス可能な位置とな"
"ります。<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> の検索は大文字小文字を区別し、<var "
"class=\"var\">replacement</var> は大文字小文字を変更せずに挿入されます。<var "
