# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"This function copies <var class=\"var\">string</var> and searches it for "
"matches for <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>, and replaces them with <var "
"class=\"var\">rep</var>.  It returns the modified copy.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the search "
"for matches starts at that index in <var class=\"var\">string</var>, and the "
"returned value does not include the first <var class=\"var\">start</var> "
"characters of <var class=\"var\">string</var>.  To get the whole transformed "
"string, concatenate the first <var class=\"var\">start</var> characters of "
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> with the return value."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">string</var> をコピーし、その中で <var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var> に一致する箇所を検索して <var class=\"var\">rep</"
"var> に置換します。そして、修正後のコピーを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、一致"
"箇所の検索は <var class=\"var\">string</var> のそのインデックスから開始され、"
"返される値には <var class=\"var\">string</var> の先頭 <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> 文字は含まれません。変換後の文字列全体を取得するに"
"は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> の先頭 <var class=\"var\">start</var> 文"
"字を返値に連結してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"This function uses <code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> to do the "
"replacement, and it passes the optional arguments <var "
"class=\"var\">fixedcase</var>, <var class=\"var\">literal</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp</var> along to <code class=\"code\">replace-match</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> を使用して置換を行い、オ"
"プション引数の <var class=\"var\">fixedcase</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">literal</var>、<var class=\"var\">subexp</var> を <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-match</code> に渡します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"Instead of a string, <var class=\"var\">rep</var> can be a function.  In "
"that case, <code class=\"code\">replace-regexp-in-string</code> calls <var "
"class=\"var\">rep</var> for each match, passing the text of the match as its "
"sole argument.  It collects the value <var class=\"var\">rep</var> returns "
"and passes that to <code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> as the "
"replacement string.  The match data at this point are the result of matching "
"<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> against a substring of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>."
msgstr ""
"文字列の代わりに、<var class=\"var\">rep</var> は関数にすることもできます。そ"
"の場合、<code class=\"code\">replace-regexp-in-string</code> はマッチごとに "
"<var class=\"var\">rep</var> を呼び出し、マッチしたテキストを唯一の引数として"
"渡します。<var class=\"var\">rep</var> が返す値を収集し、それを置換文字列とし"
"て <code class=\"code\">replace-match</code> に渡します。この時点でのマッチ"
"データは、<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> を <var class=\"var\">string</var> "
"の部分文字列にマッチさせた結果となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
