"string_002dreplace\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces all occurrences of <var class=\"var\">from-string</"
"var> with <var class=\"var\">to-string</var> in <var class=\"var\">in-"
"string</var> and returns the result.  It may return one of its arguments "
"unchanged, a constant string or a new string.  Case is significant, and text "
"properties are ignored."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">in-string</var> 内の <var class=\"var\">from-"
"string</var> をすべて <var class=\"var\">to-string</var> に置換し、その結果を"
"返します。引数のいずれかをそのまま、あるいは定数文字列や新しい文字列として返"
"す場合があります。大文字と小文字は区別され、テキストプロパティは無視されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"If you want to write a command along the lines of <code class=\"code\">query-"
"replace</code>, you can use <code class=\"code\">perform-replace</code> to "
"do the work."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code>のようなコマンドを書きたい場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">perform-replace</code>を使って処理できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
