"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code class=\"code\">query-replace-"
"map</code> の代わりに使用するキーマップを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"Non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">region-noncontiguous-"
"p</var> means that the region between <var class=\"var\">start</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> is composed of noncontiguous pieces.  The most "
"common example of this is a rectangular region, where the pieces are "
"separated by newline characters."
msgstr ""
"Non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <var class=\"var\">region-noncontiguous-"
"p</var> は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> の"
"間の領域が非連続な断片で構成されていることを意味します。最も一般的な例は矩形"
"領域で、断片同士が改行文字によって区切られています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search-and-Replace.html
msgid ""
"This function uses one of two functions to search for the next occurrence of "
"<var class=\"var\">from-string</var>.  These functions are specified by the "
"values of two variables: <code class=\"code\">replace-re-search-function</"
