msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Highlight occurrences of the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo;</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">using <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword-face</code>.</span>\n"
"&quot;\\\\&lt;foo\\\\&gt;&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"Be careful when composing these regular expressions; a poorly written "
"pattern can dramatically slow things down! The function <code "
"class=\"code\">regexp-opt</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexp-"
"Functions.html\">Regular Expression Functions</a>) is useful for calculating "
"optimal regular expressions to match several keywords."
msgstr ""
"これらの正規表現を記述する際はご注意ください。パターンの記述が不適切だと、処"
"理速度が著しく低下することがあります！関数 <code class=\"code\">regexp-opt</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexp-Functions.html\">正規表現関数</a>を参"
"照）は、複数のキーワードにマッチする最適な正規表現を算出する際に便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">function</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">function</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"Find text by calling <var class=\"var\">function</var>, and highlight the "
"matches it finds using <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword-face</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var>を呼び出してテキストを検索し、見つかった一致"
"箇所を<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword-face</code>でハイライトしてくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">function</var> is called, it receives one argument, "
"the limit of the search; it should begin searching at point, and not search "
"beyond the limit.  It should return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"it succeeds, and set the match data to describe the match that was found.  "
"Returning <code class=\"code\">nil</code> indicates failure of the search."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> が呼び出されると、探索の上限という1つの引数"
"を受け取ります。点から探索を開始し、上限を超えて探索してはなりません。成功し"
"た場合は non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返し、マッチデータに見つかった"
"マッチの内容を設定します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すことは、探索"
"の失敗を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"Fontification will call <var class=\"var\">function</var> repeatedly with "
"the same limit, and with point where the previous invocation left it, until "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> fails.  On failure, <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> need not reset point in any particular way."
msgstr ""
"Fontificationは、<var class=\"var\">function</var>を同一の制限値で、かつ前回"
"の呼び出しが終了した位置から、<var class=\"var\">function</var>が失敗するまで"
"繰り返し呼び出す。失敗時、<var class=\"var\">function</var>は特定の方法で"
"pointをリセットする必要はない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> can also take on the responsibility of "
"performing the highlighting of the region between point and the limit "
"argument it receives.  In that case, it should return <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, otherwise font-lock will highlight the match "
"described by the match data and may call the function again with the same "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> は、受け取った point と limit 引数の間の領"
"域をハイライトする処理を担うこともあります。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要があります。そうでない場合、font-lock は "
"match データで記述されたマッチ箇所をハイライトし、同じ limit を指定して再度こ"
"の関数を呼び出す可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"In this kind of element, <var class=\"var\">matcher</var> is either a "
"regular expression or a function, as described above.  The <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>, <var class=\"var\">subexp</var>, specifies which "
"subexpression of <var class=\"var\">matcher</var> should be highlighted "
"(instead of the entire text that <var class=\"var\">matcher</var> matched)."
msgstr ""
"この種の要素では、<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> は前述の通り、正規表現また"
"は関数のいずれかとなります。<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> である <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp</var> は、<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> がマッチした"
"テキスト全体ではなく、<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> のどの部分式をハイライ"
"トすべきかを指定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Highlight the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo; in each occurrence of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fubar</samp>&rsquo;,</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">using <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keyword-face</code>.</span>\n"
"(&quot;fu\\\\(bar\\\\)&quot; . 1)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">facespec</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">facespec</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"In this kind of element, <var class=\"var\">facespec</var> is an expression "
"whose value specifies the face to use for highlighting.  In the simplest "
"case, <var class=\"var\">facespec</var> is a Lisp variable (a symbol) whose "
"value is a face name."
msgstr ""
"この種の要素において、<var class=\"var\">facespec</var> はハイライトに使用す"
"るフェイスを指定する値を持つ式です。最も単純な例では、<var "
"class=\"var\">facespec</var> は Lisp 変数（シンボル）であり、その値はフェイス"
"名となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Highlight occurrences of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fubar</samp>&rsquo;,</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">using the face which is the value of <code class=\"code\">fubar-face</code>.</span>\n"
"(&quot;fubar&quot; . fubar-face)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"However, <var class=\"var\">facespec</var> can also evaluate to a list of "
"this form:"
msgstr ""
"ただし、<var class=\"var\">facespec</var> はこのような形式のリストとして評価"
"されることもあります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(<var class=\"var\">subexp</var>\n"
" (face <var class=\"var\">face</var> <var class=\"var\">prop1</var> <var class=\"var\">val1</var> <var class=\"var\">prop2</var> <var class=\"var\">val2</var>...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"to specify the face <var class=\"var\">face</var> and various additional "
"text properties to put on the text that matches.  If you do this, be sure to "
"add the other text property names that you set in this way to the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-extra-managed-props</code> so that the "
"properties will also be cleared out when they are no longer appropriate.  "
"Alternatively, you can set the variable <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"unfontify-region-function</code> to a function that clears these "
"properties.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Other-Font-Lock-"
"Variables.html\">Other Font Lock Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"一致するテキストに適用するフェイス <var class=\"var\">face</var> および各種追"
"加のテキストプロパティを指定します。このように設定する場合は、不要になった際"
"にプロパティもクリアされるよう、この方法で設定した他のテキストプロパティ名も"
"必ず <code class=\"code\">font-lock-extra-managed-props</code> の値に追加して"
"ください。あるいは、変数 <code class=\"code\">font-lock-unfontify-region-"
"function</code> にこれらのプロパティをクリアする関数を設定することも可能で"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Other-Font-Lock-Variables.html\">その他の Font "
"Lock 変数</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"In this kind of element, <var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var> is a "
"list which specifies how to highlight matches found by <var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var>.  It has the form:"
msgstr ""
"この種の要素において、<var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var>は<var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var>で見つかったマッチをどのようにハイライトするかを指"
"定するリストです。その形式は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">subexp</var> <var class=\"var\">facespec</var> [<var class=\"var\">override</var> [<var class=\"var\">laxmatch</var>]])\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"The <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">subexp</var>, is an "
"integer specifying which subexpression of the match to fontify (0 means the "
"entire matching text).  The second subelement, <var class=\"var\">facespec</"
"var>, is an expression whose value specifies the face, as described above."
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">subexp</var> は、マッチし"
"た部分式のうちどれをフォント化するかを指定する整数です（0 はマッチしたテキス"
"ト全体を意味します）。2番目のサブ要素 <var class=\"var\">facespec</var> は、"
"前述の通り、その値でフォントを指定する式です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"The last two values in <var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">override</var> and <var class=\"var\">laxmatch</var>, are "
"optional flags.  If <var class=\"var\">override</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, this element can override existing fontification "
"made by previous elements of <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</"
"code>.  If it is <code class=\"code\">keep</code>, then each character is "
"fontified if it has not been fontified already by some other element.  If it "
"is <code class=\"code\">prepend</code>, the face specified by <var "
"class=\"var\">facespec</var> is added to the beginning of the <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code> property.  If it is <code "
"class=\"code\">append</code>, the face is added to the end of the <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code> property."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var>、<var class=\"var\">override</"
"var>、<var class=\"var\">laxmatch</var> の最後の2つの値は、オプションのフラグ"
"です。<var class=\"var\">override</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場"
"合、この要素は <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> の先行する要素"
"によって行われた既存のフォント化を上書きできます。<code class=\"code\">keep</"
"code> の場合、他の要素によって既にフォント化されていない各文字がフォント化さ"
"れます。<code class=\"code\">prepend</code> の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">facespec</var> で指定されたフェイスが <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code> プロパティの先頭に追加されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">append</code> の場合、フェイスが <code class=\"code\">font-"
"lock-face</code> プロパティの末尾に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">laxmatch</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it means there should be no error if there is no subexpression numbered <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp</var> in <var class=\"var\">matcher</var>.  Obviously, "
"fontification of the subexpression numbered <var class=\"var\">subexp</var> "
"will not occur.  However, fontification of other subexpressions (and other "
"regexps) will continue.  If <var class=\"var\">laxmatch</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, and the specified subexpression is missing, then "
"an error is signaled which terminates search-based fontification."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">laxmatch</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> 内に番号 <var class=\"var\">subexp</"
"var> の部分式が存在しなければ、エラーは発生しないことになります。当然ながら、"
"番号 <var class=\"var\">subexp</var> の部分式のフォント化は行われません。ただ"
"し、他の部分式（および他の正規表現）のフォント化は継続されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">laxmatch</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であり、指定"
"された部分式が存在しない場合は、エラーが通知され、検索ベースのフォント化が終"
"了します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
