# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"In this kind of element, <var class=\"var\">anchored-highlighter</var> "
"specifies how to highlight text that follows a match found by <var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var>.  So a match found by <var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var> acts as the anchor for further searches "
"specified by <var class=\"var\">anchored-highlighter</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">anchored-highlighter</var> is a list of the following form:"
msgstr ""
"この種の要素では、<var class=\"var\">anchored-highlighter</var> は <var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var> で見つかったマッチに続くテキストをどのように強調"
"するかを指定します。つまり、<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> で見つかったマッ"
"チが、<var class=\"var\">anchored-highlighter</var> で指定される後続の検索の"
"アンカーとして機能します。<var class=\"var\">anchored-highlighter</var> は以"
"下の形式のリストです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> <var class=\"var\">post-form</var> <var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighters</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"Here, <var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var>, like <var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var>, is either a regular expression or a function.  "
"After a match of <var class=\"var\">matcher</var> is found, point is at the "
"end of the match.  Now, Font Lock evaluates the form <var class=\"var\">pre-"
"form</var>.  Then it searches for matches of <var class=\"var\">anchored-"
"matcher</var> and uses <var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighters</var> to "
"highlight these.  A <var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var> is as "
"described above.  Finally, Font Lock evaluates <var class=\"var\">post-form</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> は <var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var> と同様に、正規表現または関数のいずれかです。<var "
"class=\"var\">matcher</var> のマッチが見つかると、ポインタはマッチの末尾に位"
"置します。次に、Font Lock は形式 <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> を評価しま"
"す。その後、<var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> のマッチを検索し、<var "
"class=\"var\">subexp-highlighters</var> を用いてそれらをハイライトします。"
"<var class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var> は前述の通りです。最後に、Font "
"Lock は <var class=\"var\">post-form</var> を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"The forms <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> and <var class=\"var\">post-"
"form</var> can be used to initialize before, and cleanup after, <var "
"class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> is used.  Typically, <var "
"class=\"var\">pre-form</var> is used to move point to some position relative "
"to the match of <var class=\"var\">matcher</var>, before starting with <var "
"class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var>.  <var class=\"var\">post-form</var> "
"might be used to move back, before resuming with <var class=\"var\">matcher</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> および <var class=\"var\">post-form</var> "
"という形式は、<var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> を使用する前の初期化"
"と、使用後のクリーンアップに利用できます。通常、<var class=\"var\">anchored-"
"matcher</var> を開始する前に、<var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> を用いてポイ"
"ントを <var class=\"var\">matcher</var> のマッチに対するある位置に移動させま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> で再開する前に、<var class=\"var\">post-"
"form</var> を用いて戻ることもあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"After Font Lock evaluates <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var>, it does not "
"search for <var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> beyond the end of the "
"line.  However, if <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> returns a buffer "
"position that is greater than the position of point after <var "
"class=\"var\">pre-form</var> is evaluated, then the position returned by "
"<var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> is used as the limit of the search "
"instead.  It is generally a bad idea to return a position greater than the "
"end of the line; in other words, the <var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</"
"var> search should not span lines."
msgstr ""
"Font Lock は <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> を評価した後、行末を超えて "
"<var class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> を検索することはありません。ただ"
"し、<var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> が返すバッファ位置が、<var "
"class=\"var\">pre-form</var> の評価後の point の位置よりも大きい場合、代わり"
"に <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> が返す位置が検索の上限として用いられま"
"す。一般的に、行末を超える位置を返すことは避けるべきです。言い換えれば、<var "
"class=\"var\">anchored-matcher</var> の検索は行をまたいではなりません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Highlight occurrences of the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">item</samp>&rsquo; following</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">an occurrence of the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">anchor</samp>&rsquo; (on the same line)</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">in the value of <code class=\"code\">item-face</code>.</span>\n"
"(&quot;\\\\&lt;anchor\\\\&gt;&quot; &quot;\\\\&lt;item\\\\&gt;&quot; nil nil (0 item-face))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"Here, <var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> and <var class=\"var\">post-form</"
"var> are <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Therefore searching for &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">item</samp>&rsquo; starts at the end of the match of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">anchor</samp>&rsquo;, and searching for "
"subsequent instances of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">anchor</samp>&rsquo; "
"resumes from where searching for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">item</"
"samp>&rsquo; concluded."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、<var class=\"var\">pre-form</var> と <var class=\"var\">post-form</"
"var> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。したがって、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">item</samp>&rsquo; の検索は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">anchor</samp>&rsquo; のマッチの末尾から始まり、それ以降の "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">anchor</samp>&rsquo; の検索は、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">item</samp>&rsquo; の検索が終了した箇所から再開されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">highlighters</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">matcher</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">highlighters</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"This sort of element specifies several <var class=\"var\">highlighter</var> "
"lists for a single <var class=\"var\">matcher</var>.  A <var "
"class=\"var\">highlighter</var> list can be of the type <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var> or <var class=\"var\">anchored-"
"highlighter</var> as described above."
msgstr ""
"この種の要素は、単一の <var class=\"var\">matcher</var> に対して複数の <var "
"class=\"var\">highlighter</var> リストを指定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">highlighter</var> リストは、前述の通り <var "
"class=\"var\">subexp-highlighter</var> 型または <var class=\"var\">anchored-"
"highlighter</var> 型のいずれかになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Highlight occurrences of the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">anchor</samp>&rsquo; in the value</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">of <code class=\"code\">anchor-face</code>, and subsequent occurrences of the word</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">item</samp>&rsquo; (on the same line) in the value of <code class=\"code\">item-face</code>.</span>\n"
"(&quot;\\\\&lt;anchor\\\\&gt;&quot; (0 anchor-face)\n"
"                (&quot;\\\\&lt;item\\\\&gt;&quot; nil nil (0 item-face)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(eval . <var class=\"var\">form</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(eval . <var class=\"var\">form</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"Here <var class=\"var\">form</var> is an expression to be evaluated the "
"first time this value of <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> is "
"used in a buffer.  Its value should have one of the forms described in this "
"table."
msgstr ""
"ここで <var class=\"var\">form</var> は、バッファ内でこの <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> の値が最初に使用された際に評価される"
"式です。その値は、この表に記載されている形式のいずれかである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> Do not design an element of <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> to match text which spans lines; "
"this does not work reliably.  For details, see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Multiline-Font-Lock.html\">Multiline Font Lock Constructs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"keywords</code> の要素を、複数行にわたるテキストに一致させるように設計しない"
"でください。この方法では確実に動作しません。詳細については、<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Multiline-Font-Lock.html\">複数行フォントロック構文</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Search_002dbased-Fontification.html
msgid ""
"You can use <var class=\"var\">case-fold</var> in <code class=\"code\">font-"
