# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Searching-Keymaps.html
msgid "Here is a pseudo-Lisp summary of how Emacs searches the active keymaps:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsがアクティブなキーマップをどのように検索するかについて、擬似Lispによるま"
"とめを以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Searching-Keymaps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(or (if overriding-terminal-local-map\n"
"        (<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> overriding-terminal-local-map))\n"
"    (if overriding-local-map\n"
"        (<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> overriding-local-map)\n"
"      (or (<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> (get-char-property (point) 'keymap))\n"
"          (<var class=\"var\">find-in-any</var> emulation-mode-map-alists)\n"
"          (<var class=\"var\">find-in-any</var> minor-mode-overriding-map-alist)\n"
"          (<var class=\"var\">find-in-any</var> minor-mode-map-alist)\n"
"          (if (get-char-property (point) 'local-map)\n"
"              (<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> (get-char-property (point) 'local-map))\n"
"            (<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> (current-local-map)))))\n"
"    (<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> (current-global-map)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Searching-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Here, <var class=\"var\">find-in</var> and <var class=\"var\">find-in-any</"
"var> are pseudo functions that search in one keymap and in an alist of "
"keymaps, respectively.  Note that the <code class=\"code\">set-transient-"
"map</code> function works by setting <code class=\"code\">overriding-"
"terminal-local-map</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Controlling-Active-"
"Maps.html\">Controlling the Active Keymaps</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ここで、<var class=\"var\">find-in</var> と <var class=\"var\">find-in-any</"
"var> は、それぞれ1つのキーマップとキーマップのalistを検索する擬似関数です。な"
"お、<code class=\"code\">set-transient-map</code> 関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">overriding-terminal-local-map</code> を設定することで動作しま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Controlling-Active-Maps.html\">アクティブなキー"
"マップの制御</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Searching-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"In the above pseudo-code, if a key sequence starts with a mouse event (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Events.html\">Mouse Events</a>), that "
"event&rsquo;s position is used instead of point, and the event&rsquo;s "
"buffer is used instead of the current buffer.  In particular, this affects "
"how the <code class=\"code\">keymap</code> and <code class=\"code\">local-"
"map</code> properties are looked up.  If a mouse event occurs on a string "
"embedded with a <code class=\"code\">display</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">before-string</code>, or <code class=\"code\">after-string</"
"code> property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html\">Properties with Special Meanings</a>), and the string has "
"a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">keymap</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">local-map</code> property, that overrides the "
"corresponding property in the underlying buffer text (i.e., the property "
"specified by the underlying text is ignored)."
msgstr ""
"上記の擬似コードにおいて、キーシーケンスがマウスイベント（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mouse-Events.html\">マウスイベント</a>を参照）で始まる場合、point の代"
"わりにそのイベントの位置が使用され、現在のバッファの代わりにそのイベントの"
"バッファが使用されます。特に、これは <code class=\"code\">keymap</code> およ"
"び <code class=\"code\">local-map</code> プロパティの参照方法に影響します。"
"<code class=\"code\">display</code>、<code class=\"code\">before-string</"
"code>、または <code class=\"code\">after-string</code> プロパティが埋め込まれ"
"た文字列（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html\">特殊な意味を持"
"つプロパティ</a>を参照）でマウスイベントが発生し、かつその文字列に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>、<code class=\"code\">keymap</code>、または <code "
"class=\"code\">local-map</code> 以外のプロパティがある場合、それが基底となる"
"バッファテキスト内の対応するプロパティを上書きします（つまり、基底テキストで"
"指定されたプロパティは無視されます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Searching-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"When a key binding is found in one of the active keymaps, and that binding "
"is a command, the search is over&mdash;the command is executed.  However, if "
"the binding is a symbol with a value or a string, Emacs replaces the input "
"key sequences with the variable&rsquo;s value or the string, and restarts "
"the search of the active keymaps.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-"
"Lookup.html\">Key Lookup</a>."
msgstr ""
"アクティブなキーマップのいずれかにキーバインドが見つかり、そのバインドがコマ"
