msgstr ""
"<span>12.10.4 Lisp方言の選択<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Selecting-"
"Lisp-Dialect-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"When loading an Emacs Lisp file or evaluating a Lisp buffer, the Lisp "
"dialect is selected using the buffer-local variable <code "
"class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispファイルを読み込んだりLispバッファを評価したりする際、バッファロー"
"カル変数 <code class=\"code\">lexical-binding</code> を用いてLisp方言が選択さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lexical-binding</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"lexical_002dbinding\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">lexical-binding</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"lexical_002dbinding\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"If this buffer-local variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs "
"Lisp files and buffers are evaluated using the modern Lisp dialect that by "
"default uses lexical binding instead of dynamic binding.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the old dialect is used that uses dynamic binding "
"for all local variables.  This variable is typically set for a whole Emacs "
"Lisp file, as a file-local variable (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-"
"Local-Variables.html\">File Local Variables</a>).  Note that unlike other "
"such variables, this one must be set in the first line of a file."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs "
"Lisp のファイルおよびバッファは、デフォルトで動的束縛ではなく字句束縛を用いる"
"モダンな Lisp 方言で評価されます。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、"
"すべてのローカル変数に動的束縛を用いる旧来の方言が使用されます。この変数は通"
"常、ファイルローカル変数として Emacs Lisp ファイル全体に設定されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Local-Variables.html\">ファイルローカル変数</a> "
"を参照）。なお、他の同様の変数とは異なり、この変数はファイルの1行目で設定する"
"必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lexical_002dbinding-cookie\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lexical_002dbinding-cookie\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"In practice, dialect selection means that the first line in an Emacs Lisp "
"file looks like:"
msgstr ""
"実際には、方言の選択とは、Emacs Lispファイルの1行目が次のようになることを意味"
"します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ";;; ...  -*- lexical-binding: t -*-\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid "for the modern lexical-binding dialect, and"
msgstr "現代の語彙結合方言、および"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ";;; ...  -*- lexical-binding: nil -*-\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"for the old dynamic-only dialect.  (This is known as the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">lexical-binding cookie</em>.)  When no declaration is present "
"the old dialect is used, but this may change in a future release.  The "
"compiler will warn if no declaration is present."
msgstr ""
"従来の動的型付け専用ダイアレクト向け。（これは<em class=\"dfn\">レキシカルバ"
"インディング・クッキー</em>として知られています。）宣言がない場合は従来のダイ"
"アレクトが使用されますが、これは将来のリリースで変更される可能性があります。"
"宣言がない場合は、コンパイラが警告を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"When evaluating Emacs Lisp code directly using an <code class=\"code\">eval</"
"code> call, lexical binding is enabled if the <var class=\"var\">lexical</"
"var> argument to <code class=\"code\">eval</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Eval.html\">Eval</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">eval</code> 呼び出しを用いて Emacs Lisp コードを直接評価"
"する場合、<code class=\"code\">eval</code> の引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">lexical</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、"
"字句束縛が有効になります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Eval.html\">Eval</a> を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval_002dexpression_002c-and-"
"lexical_002dbinding\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eval_002dexpression_002c-and-"
"lexical_002dbinding\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Lisp-Dialect.html
msgid ""
"Lexical binding is also enabled in Lisp Interaction and IELM mode, used in "
"the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">*ielm*</"
"samp> buffers, and also when evaluating expressions via <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">eval-expression</code>), when "
"processing the <samp class=\"option\">--eval</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-"
"x</samp>, and <samp class=\"option\">--script</samp> command-line options of "
"Emacs (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Action-Arguments.html#Action-Arguments\">Action "
"Arguments</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>), and when "
"processing the <samp class=\"option\">--eval</samp> command-line option of "
"<code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/emacsclient-"
"Options.html#emacsclient-Options\">emacsclient Options</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"レキシカルバインディングは、<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> および "
"<samp class=\"file\">*ielm*</samp> バッファで使用される Lisp Interaction およ"
"び IELM モードでも、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">eval-"
"expression</code>) 経由で式を評価する場合でも、Emacs の <samp "
"class=\"option\">--eval</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-x</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">--script</samp> コマンドラインオプションを処理する場合"
"（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Action-Arguments.html#Action-Arguments\">Action Arguments</a> を参"
"照）、および <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> の <samp "
"class=\"option\">--eval</samp> コマンドラインオプションを処理する場合（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/emacsclient-"
"Options.html#emacsclient-Options\">emacsclient Options</a> を参照）でも有効に"
"なります。"

