# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This macro selects <var class=\"var\">window</var>, executes <var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var> in sequence, then restores the previously selected "
"window and current buffer.  The ordering of recently selected windows and "
"the buffer list remain unchanged unless you deliberately change them within "
"<var class=\"var\">forms</var>; for example, by calling <code "
"class=\"code\">select-window</code> with argument <var "
"class=\"var\">norecord</var> <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Hence, this "
"macro is the preferred way to temporarily work with <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> as the selected window without needlessly running "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-list-update-hook</code>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは <var class=\"var\">window</var> を選択し、<var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var> を順次実行した後、以前に選択していたウィンドウと現"
"在のバッファを復元します。最近選択したウィンドウとバッファリストの順序は、"
"<var class=\"var\">forms</var> 内で意図的に変更しない限り（例えば、引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">norecord</var> <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定して "
"<code class=\"code\">select-window</code> を呼び出す場合など）、変更されませ"
"ん。したがって、このマクロは、不必要に <code class=\"code\">buffer-list-"
"update-hook</code> を実行することなく、<var class=\"var\">window</var> を選択"
"ウィンドウとして一時的に扱うための推奨される方法です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"Note that this macro temporarily puts the window management code in an "
"unstable state.  In particular, the most recently used window (see below)  "
"will not necessarily match the selected one.  Hence, functions like <code "
"class=\"code\">get-lru-window</code> and <code class=\"code\">get-mru-"
"window</code> may return unexpected results when called from the body of "
"this macro."
msgstr ""
"なお、このマクロはウィンドウ管理コードを一時的に不安定な状態にします。特に、"
"直近で使用されたウィンドウ（後述）は、必ずしも選択中のウィンドウと一致すると"
"は限りません。そのため、このマクロの本体内で <code class=\"code\">get-lru-"
"window</code> や <code class=\"code\">get-mru-window</code> といった関数を呼"
"び出すと、予期しない結果が返される可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-selected-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dselected_002dframe\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-selected-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">frame "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dselected_002dframe\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This macro executes <var class=\"var\">forms</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> as the selected frame.  The value returned is the "
"value of the last form in <var class=\"var\">forms</var>.  This macro saves "
"and restores the selected frame, and changes the order of neither the "
"recently selected windows nor the buffers in the buffer list."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">frame</var>を選択中のフレームとして<var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var>を実行します。返される値は、<var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var>内の最後のフォームの値です。このマクロは選択中のフ"
"レームを保存・復元し、最近選択したウィンドウおよびバッファリスト内のバッファ"
"の順序を変更しません。"

