# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to examine an existing buffer or string as multibyte "
"when it was unibyte, or vice versa."
msgstr ""
"既存のバッファや文字列を、ユニバイトであったものをマルチバイトとして、あるい"
"はその逆に解析することが有用な場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-buffer-multibyte</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">multibyte</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dbuffer_002dmultibyte\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-buffer-multibyte</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">multibyte</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dbuffer_002dmultibyte\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"Set the representation type of the current buffer.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">multibyte</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"buffer becomes multibyte.  If <var class=\"var\">multibyte</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the buffer becomes unibyte."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファの表現型を設定します。<var class=\"var\">multibyte</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、バッファはマルチバイトになりま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">multibyte</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の"
"場合、バッファはユニバイトになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"This function leaves the buffer contents unchanged when viewed as a sequence "
"of bytes.  As a consequence, it can change the contents viewed as "
"characters; for instance, a sequence of three bytes which is treated as one "
"character in multibyte representation will count as three characters in "
"unibyte representation.  Eight-bit characters representing raw bytes are an "
"exception.  They are represented by one byte in a unibyte buffer, but when "
"the buffer is set to multibyte, they are converted to two-byte sequences, "
"and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファの内容をバイト列として見た場合には変更しません。その結"
"果、文字として見た場合の内容が変更されることがあります。例えば、マルチバイト"
"表現では1文字として扱われる3バイトのシーケンスは、ユニバイト表現では3文字とし"
"てカウントされます。生のバイトを表す8ビット文字は例外です。これらはユニバイト"
"バッファでは1バイトで表現されますが、バッファがマルチバイトに設定されると2バ"
"イトのシーケンスに変換され、その逆も同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"This function sets <code class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-characters</code> "
"to record which representation is in use.  It also adjusts various data in "
"the buffer (including overlays, text properties and markers) so that they "
"cover the same text as they did before."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、どの表現が使用されているかを記録するために <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-characters</code> を設定します。また、バッ"
"ファ内の各種データ（オーバーレイ、テキストプロパティ、マーカーなど）を調整"
"し、以前と同じテキストをカバーするようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"This function signals an error if the buffer is narrowed, since the "
"narrowing might have occurred in the middle of multibyte character sequences."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファが狭められた場合にエラーを通知します。これは、マルチバイ"
"ト文字シーケンスの途中で狭めが行われた可能性があるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"This function also signals an error if the buffer is an indirect buffer.  An "
"indirect buffer always inherits the representation of its base buffer."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファが間接バッファである場合にもエラーを通知します。間接バッ"
"ファは常に、基となるバッファの表現を継承します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"The following two functions are obsolete and will be removed in a future "
"version of Emacs; use <code class=\"code\">encode-coding-string</code> "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"以下の2つの関数は廃止されており、今後のEmacsのバージョンで削除される予定で"
