# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selecting-a-Representation.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">string</var> is a multibyte string, this function "
