# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.7 Selective Display<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Selective-"
"Display-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.7 選択的表示<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Selective-"
"Display-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Selective display</em> refers to a pair of related "
"features for hiding certain lines on the screen."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">選択的表示</em>とは、画面上の特定の行を非表示にするための、"
"関連する一対の機能を指します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-explicit-selective-display\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-explicit-selective-display\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"The first variant, explicit selective display, was designed for use in a "
"Lisp program: it controls which lines are hidden by altering the text.  This "
"kind of hiding is now obsolete and deprecated; instead you should use the "
"<code class=\"code\">invisible</code> property (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Invisible-Text.html\">Invisible Text</a>) to get the same effect."
msgstr ""
"最初のバリエーションである明示的な選択的表示は、Lispプログラムでの使用を想定"
"して設計されました。これはテキストを変更することで、どの行を非表示にするかを"
"制御するものです。このような非表示の手法は現在では廃れており、非推奨となって"
"います。代わりに、<code class=\"code\">invisible</code> プロパティ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Invisible-Text.html\">Invisible Text</a> を参照）を使"
"用して同様の効果を得るようにしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"In the second variant, the choice of lines to hide is made automatically "
"based on indentation.  This variant is designed to be a user-level feature."
msgstr ""
"2つ目のバリエーションでは、非表示にする行の選択がインデントに基づいて自動的に"
"行われます。このバリエーションは、ユーザーレベルの機能として設計されていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"The way you control explicit selective display is by replacing a newline "
"(control-j) with a carriage return (control-m).  The text that was formerly "
"a line following that newline is now hidden.  Strictly speaking, it is "
"temporarily no longer a line at all, since only newlines can separate lines; "
"it is now part of the previous line."
msgstr ""
"明示的な選択的表示を制御する方法は、改行（control-j）をキャリッジリターン"
"（control-m）に置き換えることです。その改行に続く行だったテキストは、非表示に"
"なります。厳密に言えば、行を区切れるのは改行のみであるため、一時的に行ではな"
"くなり、前の行の一部となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"Selective display does not directly affect editing commands.  For example, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-char</code>) "
"moves point unhesitatingly into hidden text.  However, the replacement of "
"newline characters with carriage return characters affects some editing "
"commands.  For example, <code class=\"code\">next-line</code> skips hidden "
"lines, since it searches only for newlines.  Modes that use selective "
"display can also define commands that take account of the newlines, or that "
"control which parts of the text are hidden."
msgstr ""
"選択的表示は、編集コマンドに直接影響しません。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-char</code>) は迷わずポイントを非表示テ"
"キスト内へ移動させます。しかし、改行文字をキャリッジリターン文字に置換する"
"と、一部の編集コマンドに影響が出ます。例えば、<code class=\"code\">next-"
"line</code> は改行のみを検索するため、非表示行をスキップします。選択的表示を"
"利用するモードでは、改行を考慮したコマンドや、テキストのどの部分を非表示にす"
"るかを制御するコマンドを定義することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"When you write a selectively displayed buffer into a file, all the control-"
"m&rsquo;s are output as newlines.  This means that when you next read in the "
"file, it looks OK, with nothing hidden.  The selective display effect is "
"seen only within Emacs."
msgstr ""
"選択的に表示されたバッファをファイルに書き出すと、すべての Control-M が改行と"
"して出力されます。つまり、次にそのファイルを読み込む際は、何も隠されることな"
"く正常に表示されます。選択的表示の効果は、Emacs 内でのみ確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">selective-display</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"selective_002ddisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">selective-display</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"selective_002ddisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable enables selective display.  This means that "
"lines, or portions of lines, may be made hidden."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数により、選択的な表示が可能になります。つまり、行や行"
"の一部を非表示にすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"If the value of <code class=\"code\">selective-display</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, then the character control-m marks the start of "
"hidden text; the control-m, and the rest of the line following it, are not "
"displayed.  This is explicit selective display."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">selective-display</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> である場合、文字 control-m は非表示テキストの開始を示し、control-m およ"
"びそれに続く行の残りの部分は表示されません。これは明示的な選択的表示です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"If the value of <code class=\"code\">selective-display</code> is a positive "
"integer, then lines that start with more than that many columns of "
"indentation are not displayed."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">selective-display</code> の値が正の整数である場合、それ"
"より多い列数のインデントから始まる行は表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"When some portion of a buffer is hidden, the vertical movement commands "
"operate as if that portion did not exist, allowing a single <code "
"class=\"code\">next-line</code> command to skip any number of hidden lines.  "
"However, character movement commands (such as <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"char</code>) do not skip the hidden portion, and it is possible (if tricky) "
"to insert or delete text in a hidden portion."
msgstr ""
"バッファの一部が非表示になっている場合、垂直移動コマンドはその部分が存在しな"
"いものとして動作するため、単一の <code class=\"code\">next-line</code> コマン"
"ドで任意の数の非表示行をスキップできます。ただし、文字移動コマンド（<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-char</code> など）は非表示部分をスキップせず、（少々工"
"夫すれば）非表示部分にテキストを挿入したり削除したりすることが可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"In the examples below, we show the <em class=\"emph\">display appearance</"
"em> of the buffer <code class=\"code\">foo</code>, which changes with the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">selective-display</code>.  The <em "
"class=\"emph\">contents</em> of the buffer do not change."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、<code class=\"code\">selective-display</code>の値に応じて変化す"
"るバッファ<code class=\"code\">foo</code>の<em class=\"emph\">表示上の外観</"
"em>を示します。バッファの<em class=\"emph\">内容</em>は変わりません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq selective-display nil)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"1 on this column\n"
" 2on this column\n"
"  3n this column\n"
"  3n this column\n"
" 2on this column\n"
"1 on this column\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq selective-display 2)\n"
"     &rArr; 2\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"1 on this column\n"
" 2on this column\n"
" 2on this column\n"
"1 on this column\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">selective-display-ellipses</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-selective_002ddisplay_002dellipses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">selective-display-ellipses</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-selective_002ddisplay_002dellipses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Selective-Display.html
msgid ""
"If this buffer-local variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then "
"Emacs displays &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&hellip;</samp>&rsquo; at the end "
"of a line that is followed by hidden text.  This example is a continuation "
"of the previous one."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs "
