#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sentinels.html
msgid ""
"This function associates <var class=\"var\">sentinel</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">sentinel</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the process will have the default sentinel, "
"which inserts a message in the process&rsquo;s buffer when the process "
