# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the element of <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> "
"indexed by <var class=\"var\">index</var>.  Legitimate values of <var "
"class=\"var\">index</var> are integers ranging from 0 up to one less than "
"the length of <var class=\"var\">sequence</var>.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">sequence</var> is a list, out-of-range values behave as for "
"<code class=\"code\">nth</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"List-"
"Elements.html#Definition-of-nth\">Definition of nth</a>.  Otherwise, out-of-"
"range values trigger an <code class=\"code\">args-out-of-range</code> error."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">sequence</var> の <var class=\"var\">index</"
"var> 番目の要素を返します。<var class=\"var\">index</var> の有効な値は、0 か"
"ら <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> の長さより 1 小さい値までの整数です。"
"<var class=\"var\">sequence</var> がリストの場合、範囲外の値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nth</code> と同様に扱われます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"List-"
"Elements.html#Definition-of-nth\">第 n 要素の定義</a> を参照してください。そ"
"れ以外の場合、範囲外の値は <code class=\"code\">args-out-of-range</code> エ"
"ラーを発生させます。"

