# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-sequences\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-sequences\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a copy of <var class=\"var\">seqr</var>, which should "
"be either a sequence or a record.  The copy is the same type of object as "
"the original, and it has the same elements in the same order.  However, if "
"<var class=\"var\">seqr</var> is empty, like a string or a vector of zero "
"length, the value returned by this function might not be a copy, but an "
"empty object of the same type and identical to <var class=\"var\">seqr</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、シーケンスまたはレコードである<var class=\"var\">seqr</var>のコ"
"ピーを返します。このコピーは元のオブジェクトと同じ型であり、同じ要素を同じ順"
"序で保持しています。ただし、<var class=\"var\">seqr</var>が文字列や長さ0のベ"
"クトルのように空である場合、この関数が返す値はコピーではなく、同じ型で<var "
"class=\"var\">seqr</var>と同一の空のオブジェクトとなる場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Storing a new element into the copy does not affect the original <var "
"class=\"var\">seqr</var>, and vice versa.  However, the elements of the copy "
"are not copies; they are identical (<code class=\"code\">eq</code>) to the "
"elements of the original.  Therefore, changes made within these elements, as "
"found via the copy, are also visible in the original."
msgstr ""
"コピーに新しい要素を格納しても元の <var class=\"var\">seqr</var> には影響せ"
"ず、その逆も同様です。ただし、コピー内の要素はコピーではなく、元の要素と同一"
"（<code class=\"code\">eq</code>）です。したがって、コピーを介して行われたこ"
"れらの要素内の変更は、元の要素でも確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If the argument is a string with text properties, the property list in the "
"copy is itself a copy, not shared with the original&rsquo;s property list.  "
"However, the actual values of the properties are shared.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Properties.html\">Text Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"引数がテキストプロパティを持つ文字列である場合、コピー内のプロパティリスト自"
"体もコピーとなり、元のプロパティリストとは共有されません。ただし、プロパティ"
"の実際の値は共有されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Properties.html\">テ"
"キストプロパティ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function does not work for dotted lists.  Trying to copy a circular "
"list may cause an infinite loop."
msgstr ""
"この関数はドット付きリストには対応していません。循環リストをコピーしようとす"
"ると、無限ループが発生する可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
