# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Numbers are compared using <code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Comparison-of-Numbers.html#definition-of-"
"_003c\">definition of &lt;</a>)."
msgstr ""
"数値の比較には <code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> を使用します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Comparison-of-Numbers.html#definition-of-_003c\">&lt; "
"の定義</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Strings are compared using <code class=\"code\">string-lessp</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Comparison.html#definition-of-"
"string_002dlessp\">definition of string-lessp</a>) and symbols are compared "
"by comparing their names as strings."
msgstr ""
"文字列は <code class=\"code\">string-lessp</code> を用いて比較され（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Comparison.html#definition-of-"
"string_002dlessp\">string-lessp の定義</a> を参照）、シンボルは名前を文字列と"
"して比較することで比較されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Conses, lists, vectors and records are compared lexicographically.  This "
"means that the two sequences are compared element-wise from left to right "
"until they differ, and the result is then that of <code "
"class=\"code\">value&lt;</code> on the first pair of differing elements.  If "
"one sequence runs out of elements before the other, the shorter sequence "
"comes before the longer."
msgstr ""
"集合、リスト、ベクトル、およびレコードは、辞書順に比較されます。つまり、2つの"
"シーケンスは、異なる要素が現れるまで左から右へ要素ごとに比較され、その結果"
"は、最初に異なる要素が現れたペアにおける <code class=\"code\">value&lt;</"
"code> の値となります。一方のシーケンスがもう一方より先に要素を使い切った場"
"合、短い方のシーケンスが長い方よりも前に来ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid "Markers are compared first by buffer, then by position."
msgstr "マーカーは、まずバッファで、次に位置で比較されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Buffers and processes are compared by comparing their names as strings.  "
"Dead buffers (whose name is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>) will compare "
"before any live buffer."
msgstr ""
"バッファとプロセスは、名称を文字列として比較することで比較されます。デッド"
"バッファ（名称が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> のもの）は、いかなるライブ"
"バッファよりも優先して比較されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Other types are considered unordered and the return value will be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"その他の型は順序なしとみなされ、戻り値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> とな"
"ります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(value&lt; -4 3.5) &rArr; t\n"
"(value&lt; &quot;dog&quot; &quot;cat&quot;) &rArr; nil\n"
"(value&lt; 'yip 'yip) &rArr; nil\n"
"(value&lt; '(3 2) '(3 2 0)) &rArr; t\n"
"(value&lt; [3 2 &quot;a&quot;] [3 2 &quot;b&quot;]) &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

