#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"There is no limit to the length of sequences (lists, vectors and so on)  "
"that can be compared, but <code class=\"code\">value&lt;</code> may fail "
"with an error if used to compare circular or deeply nested data structures."
msgstr ""
