#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the element of <var class=\"var\">sequence</var> at "
"the specified <var class=\"var\">index</var>, which is an integer whose "
"valid value range is zero to one less than the length of <var "
"class=\"var\">sequence</var>.  For out-of-range values on built-in sequence "
"types, <code class=\"code\">seq-elt</code> behaves like <code "
"class=\"code\">elt</code>.  For the details, see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"#Definition-of-elt\">Definition of elt</a>."
