# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This macro binds the variables defined in <var class=\"var\">var-sequence</"
"var> to the values that are the corresponding elements of <var "
"class=\"var\">val-sequence</var>.  This is known as <em "
"class=\"dfn\">destructuring binding</em>.  The elements of <var "
"class=\"var\">var-sequence</var> can themselves include sequences, allowing "
"for nested destructuring."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">var-sequence</var> で定義された変数を、<var "
"class=\"var\">val-sequence</var> の対応する要素の値にバインドします。これは "
"<em class=\"dfn\">構造分解バインディング</em> と呼ばれます。<var "
"class=\"var\">var-sequence</var> の要素自体にシーケンスを含めることができるた"
"め、入れ子構造の構造分解が可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">var-sequence</var> sequence can also include the "
"<code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> marker followed by a variable name to "
"be bound to the rest of <var class=\"var\">val-sequence</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">var-sequence</var> シーケンスには、<code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> マーカーに続き、<var class=\"var\">val-"
"sequence</var> の残りの部分にバインドされる変数名を含めることもできます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequence-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
