#: build/html/elisp/Sequences-Arrays-Vectors.html
msgid ""
"<span>6 Sequences, Arrays, and Vectors<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Sequences_002c-Arrays_002c-and-Vectors\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>6 シーケンス、配列、ベクトル<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Sequences_002c-Arrays_002c-and-Vectors\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequences-Arrays-Vectors.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sequence\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sequence\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequences-Arrays-Vectors.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">sequence</em> type is the union of two other Lisp "
"types: lists and arrays.  In other words, any list is a sequence, and any "
"array is a sequence.  The common property that all sequences have is that "
"each is an ordered collection of elements."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">シーケンス</em>型は、Lispの他の2つの型であるリストと配列の"
"和集合です。言い換えれば、あらゆるリストはシーケンスであり、あらゆる配列も"
"シーケンスです。すべてのシーケンスに共通する特性は、それぞれが要素の順序付き"
"集合であるということです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequences-Arrays-Vectors.html
msgid ""
"An <em class=\"dfn\">array</em> is a fixed-length object with a slot for "
"each of its elements.  All the elements are accessible in constant time.  "
"The four types of arrays are strings, vectors, char-tables and bool-vectors."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">配列</em>とは、各要素に対応するスロットを持つ固定長のオブ"
"ジェクトです。すべての要素に定数時間でアクセスできます。配列には、文字列、ベ"
"クトル、文字テーブル、ブールベクトルの4種類があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequences-Arrays-Vectors.html
msgid ""
"A list is a sequence of elements, but it is not a single primitive object; "
"it is made of cons cells, one cell per element.  Finding the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th element requires looking through <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> cons cells, so elements farther from the beginning of "
"the list take longer to access.  But it is possible to add elements to the "
"list, or remove elements."
msgstr ""
"リストは要素の並びですが、単一のプリミティブオブジェクトではなく、要素ごとに1"
"つのコンスセルで構成されています。<var class=\"var\">n</var>番目の要素を探す"
"には<var class=\"var\">n</var>個のコンスセルを調べる必要があるため、リストの"
"先頭から遠い要素ほどアクセスに時間がかかります。ただし、リストに要素を追加し"
"たり、要素を削除したりすることは可能です。"

