"id\" id=\"index-forms-for-sequential-execution\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"Evaluating forms in the order they appear is the most common way control "
"passes from one form to another.  In some contexts, such as in a function "
"body, this happens automatically.  Elsewhere you must use a control "
"structure construct to do this: <code class=\"code\">progn</code>, the "
"simplest control construct of Lisp."
msgstr ""
"出現順にフォームを評価することは、あるフォームから別のフォームへ制御が移る最"
"も一般的な方法です。関数本体などの一部のコンテキストでは、これは自動的に行わ"
"れます。それ以外の場合は、これを実現するために制御構造の構文である <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code>（Lispで最も単純な制御構文）を使用する必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid "A <code class=\"code\">progn</code> special form looks like this:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">progn</code> 特殊形式は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(progn <var class=\"var\">a</var> <var class=\"var\">b</var> <var class=\"var\">c</var> ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"and it says to execute the forms <var class=\"var\">a</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">b</var>, <var class=\"var\">c</var>, and so on, in that "
"order.  These forms are called the <em class=\"dfn\">body</em> of the <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> form.  The value of the last form in the body "
"becomes the value of the entire <code class=\"code\">progn</code>.  <code "
"class=\"code\">(progn)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"また、フォーム <var class=\"var\">a</var>、<var class=\"var\">b</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">c</var> などをその順に実行するように記述されています。これらの"
"フォームは、<code class=\"code\">progn</code> フォームの<em class=\"dfn\">ボ"
"ディ</em>と呼ばれます。ボディ内の最後のフォームの値が、<code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> 全体の値となります。<code "
"class=\"code\">(progn)</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-implicit-progn\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-implicit-progn\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"In the early days of Lisp, <code class=\"code\">progn</code> was the only "
"way to execute two or more forms in succession and use the value of the last "
"of them.  But programmers found they often needed to use a <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> in the body of a function, where (at that time) "
"only one form was allowed.  So the body of a function was made into an "
"implicit <code class=\"code\">progn</code>: several forms are allowed just "
"as in the body of an actual <code class=\"code\">progn</code>.  Many other "
"control structures likewise contain an implicit <code class=\"code\">progn</"
"code>.  As a result, <code class=\"code\">progn</code> is not used as much "
"as it was many years ago.  It is needed now most often inside an <code "
"class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>, <code class=\"code\">and</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code>, or in the <var class=\"var\">then</var>-part of an "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code>."
msgstr ""
"Lispの黎明期には、2つ以上のフォームを連続して実行し、そのうち最後のフォームの"
"値を利用する唯一の方法が<code class=\"code\">progn</code>であった。しかしプロ"
"グラマは、（当時）1つのフォームしか許可されていなかった関数本体の中で、しばし"
"ば<code class=\"code\">progn</code>を用いる必要があることに気づいた。そこで、"
"関数本体は暗黙的な<code class=\"code\">progn</code>となり、実際の<code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code>の本体と同様に、複数のフォームが許可されるように"
"なった。他の多くの制御構造も同様に、暗黙的な<code class=\"code\">progn</code>"
"を備えている。その結果、<code class=\"code\">progn</code>は何年も前ほどは使わ"
"れなくなった。現在では、主に<code class=\"code\">unwind-protect</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">and</code>、<code class=\"code\">or</code>の内部、あるい"
"は<code class=\"code\">if</code>の<var class=\"var\">then</var>部分で必要とさ"
"れる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">progn</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">forms&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-progn\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">progn</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">forms&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-progn\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"This special form evaluates all of the <var class=\"var\">forms</var>, in "
"textual order, returning the result of the final form."
msgstr ""
"この特殊形式は、すべての <var class=\"var\">forms</var> をテキスト順に評価"
"し、最終的な形式の結果を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(progn (print &quot;The first form&quot;)\n"
"       (print &quot;The second form&quot;)\n"
"       (print &quot;The third form&quot;))\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;The first form&quot;\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;The second form&quot;\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;The third form&quot;\n"
"&rArr; &quot;The third form&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"Two other constructs likewise evaluate a series of forms but return "
"different values:"
msgstr ""
"他の2つのコンストラクトも同様に一連のフォームを評価しますが、異なる値を返しま"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prog1</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form1 forms&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prog1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prog1</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form1 forms&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prog1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"This special form evaluates <var class=\"var\">form1</var> and all of the "
"<var class=\"var\">forms</var>, in textual order, returning the result of "
"<var class=\"var\">form1</var>."
msgstr ""
"この特殊形式は、<var class=\"var\">form1</var> とすべての <var "
"class=\"var\">forms</var> をテキスト順に評価し、<var class=\"var\">form1</"
"var> の結果を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(prog1 (print &quot;The first form&quot;)\n"
"       (print &quot;The second form&quot;)\n"
"       (print &quot;The third form&quot;))\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;The first form&quot;\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;The second form&quot;\n"
"     &#8867; &quot;The third form&quot;\n"
"&rArr; &quot;The first form&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"Here is a way to remove the first element from a list in the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">x</code>, then return the value of that former element:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">x</code> 内のリストから最初の要素を削除し、その元の"
"要素の値を返す方法を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(prog1 (car x) (setq x (cdr x)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Sequencing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">prog2</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">form1 form2 "
"forms&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-prog2\"> &para;</"
