# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can communicate with serial ports.  For interactive use, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x serial-term</kbd> opens a terminal window.  In a Lisp "
"program, <code class=\"code\">make-serial-process</code> creates a process "
"object."
msgstr ""
"Emacsはシリアルポートと通信できます。対話的に使用する場合、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x serial-term</kbd>はターミナルウィンドウを開きます。Lispプロ"
"グラムでは、<code class=\"code\">make-serial-process</code>はプロセスオブジェ"
"クトを作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"The serial port can be configured at run-time, without having to close and "
"re-open it.  The function <code class=\"code\">serial-process-configure</"
"code> lets you change the speed, bytesize, and other parameters.  In a "
"terminal window created by <code class=\"code\">serial-term</code>, you can "
"click on the mode line for configuration."
msgstr ""
"シリアルポートは、一度閉じて開き直すことなく、実行時に設定可能です。関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">serial-process-configure</code> を使用すると、通信速度や"
"バイトサイズ、その他のパラメータを変更できます。<code class=\"code\">serial-"
"term</code> で作成されたターミナルウィンドウでは、モードラインをクリックして"
"設定を行うことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"A serial connection is represented by a process object, which can be used in "
"a similar way to a subprocess or network process.  You can send and receive "
"data, and configure the serial port.  A serial process object has no process "
"ID, however, and you can&rsquo;t send signals to it, and the status codes "
"are different from other types of processes.  <code class=\"code\">delete-"
"process</code> on the process object or <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</"
"code> on the process buffer close the connection, but this does not affect "
"the device connected to the serial port."
msgstr ""
"シリアル接続はプロセスオブジェクトで表され、サブプロセスやネットワークプロセ"
"スと同様に利用できます。データの送受信や、シリアルポートの設定が可能です。た"
"だし、シリアルプロセスオブジェクトにはプロセスIDがなく、シグナルを送信するこ"
"とはできず、ステータスコードも他の種類のプロセスとは異なります。プロセスオブ"
"ジェクトの <code class=\"code\">delete-process</code> またはプロセスバッファ"
"の <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> で接続を閉じますが、これによりシリ"
"アルポートに接続されているデバイスに影響が出ることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">process-type</code> returns the symbol "
"<code class=\"code\">serial</code> for a process object representing a "
"serial port connection."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">process-type</code> は、シリアルポート接続を表すプ"
"ロセスオブジェクトに対して、シンボル <code class=\"code\">serial</code> を返"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "Serial ports are available on GNU/Linux, Unix, and MS Windows systems."
msgstr ""
"シリアルポートは、GNU/Linux、Unix、およびMS Windowsシステムで利用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">serial-term</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">port speed "
"&amp;optional line-mode</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"serial_002dterm\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">serial-term</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">port speed "
"&amp;optional line-mode</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"serial_002dterm\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"Start a terminal-emulator for a serial port in a new buffer.  <var "
"class=\"var\">port</var> is the name of the serial port to connect to.  For "
"example, this could be <samp class=\"file\">/dev/ttyS0</samp> on Unix.  On "
"MS Windows, this could be <samp class=\"file\">COM1</samp>, or <samp "
"class=\"file\">\\\\.\\COM10</samp> (double the backslashes in Lisp strings)."
msgstr ""
"新しいバッファでシリアルポート用のターミナルエミュレータを起動します。<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var> は接続先のシリアルポート名です。例えば、Unix では "
"<samp class=\"file\">/dev/ttyS0</samp> となります。MS Windows では <samp "
"class=\"file\">COM1</samp> や <samp class=\"file\">\\\\.\\COM10</samp>（Lisp "
"文字列におけるバックスラッシュを2つにしたもの）となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">speed</var> is the speed of the serial port in bits per "
"second.  9600 is a common value.  The buffer is in Term mode; see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Term-Mode.html#Term-Mode\">Term Mode</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for the commands to use in that buffer.  You can "
"change the speed and the configuration in the mode line menu.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">line-mode</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">term-line-mode</code> is used; otherwise <code "
"class=\"code\">term-raw-mode</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">speed</var> はシリアルポートの速度（ビット毎秒）です。"
"9600 は一般的な値です。バッファは Term モードです。そのバッファで使用するコマ"
"ンドについては、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Term-Mode.html#Term-Mode\">Term Mode</a> を参照してください。速度と設定"
"は、モードラインメニューで変更できます。<var class=\"var\">line-mode</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は <code class=\"code\">term-"
"line-mode</code> が、それ以外の場合は <code class=\"code\">term-raw-mode</"
"code> が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-serial-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dserial_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-serial-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dserial_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a process and a buffer.  Arguments are specified as "
"keyword/argument pairs.  Here&rsquo;s the list of the meaningful keywords, "
"with the first two (<var class=\"var\">port</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">speed</var>) being mandatory:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プロセスとバッファを作成します。引数はキーワードと引数のペアとし"
"て指定します。意味のあるキーワードの一覧を以下に示します。なお、最初の2つ"
"（<var class=\"var\">port</var> と <var class=\"var\">speed</var>）は必須で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:port <var class=\"var\">port</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:port <var class=\"var\">port</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"This is the name of the serial port.  On Unix and GNU systems, this is a "
"file name such as <samp class=\"file\">/dev/ttyS0</samp>.  On Windows, this "
"could be <samp class=\"file\">COM1</samp>, or <samp class=\"file\">\\\\."
"\\COM10</samp> for ports higher than <samp class=\"file\">COM9</samp> "
"(double the backslashes in Lisp strings)."
msgstr ""
"これはシリアルポートの名称です。UnixおよびGNUシステムでは、<samp "
"class=\"file\">/dev/ttyS0</samp>のようなファイル名になります。Windowsでは、"
"<samp class=\"file\">COM1</samp>、あるいは<samp class=\"file\">COM9</samp>よ"
"り上位のポートであれば<samp class=\"file\">\\\\.\\COM10</samp>となる場合があ"
"ります（Lisp文字列におけるバックスラッシュを2つにします）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:speed <var class=\"var\">speed</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:speed <var class=\"var\">speed</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"The speed of the serial port in bits per second.  This function calls <code "
"class=\"code\">serial-process-configure</code> to handle the speed; see the "
"following documentation of that function for more details."
msgstr ""
"シリアルポートの通信速度（ビット毎秒）。この関数は通信速度の処理に <code "
"class=\"code\">serial-process-configure</code> を呼び出します。詳細について"
"は、当該関数の以下のドキュメントを参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"The name of the process.  If <var class=\"var\">name</var> is not given, "
"<var class=\"var\">port</var> will serve as the process name as well."
msgstr ""
"プロセス名。<var class=\"var\">name</var> が指定されていない場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var> もプロセス名として扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"The buffer to associate with the process.  The value can be either a buffer "
"or a string that names a buffer.  Process output goes at the end of that "
"buffer, unless you specify an output stream or filter function to handle the "
"output.  If <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> is not given, the process "
"buffer&rsquo;s name is taken from the value of the <code "
"class=\"code\">:name</code> keyword."
msgstr ""
"プロセスに関連付けるバッファ。値には、バッファそのもの、またはバッファ名を指"
"定する文字列のいずれかを指定できます。出力を処理するための出力ストリームや"
"フィルタ関数を指定しない限り、プロセスの出力はそのバッファの末尾に書き込まれ"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">buffer</var> が指定されていない場合、プロセスバッ"
"ファの名前は <code class=\"code\">:name</code> キーワードの値から取得されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">coding</var> is a symbol, it specifies the coding "
"system used for both reading and writing for this process.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">coding</var> is a cons <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">decoding</var> . <var class=\"var\">encoding</var>)</code>, "
"<var class=\"var\">decoding</var> is used for reading, and <var "
"class=\"var\">encoding</var> is used for writing.  If not specified, the "
"default is to determine the coding systems from the data itself."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">coding</var> がシンボルの場合、この処理における読み書きの"
"両方で使用する符号系を指定します。  <var class=\"var\">coding</var> がコンス "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">decoding</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">encoding</var>)</code> の場合、読み出しには <var "
"class=\"var\">decoding</var> が、書き込みには <var class=\"var\">encoding</"
"var> が使用されます。  指定がない場合は、データ自体から符号系を決定するのがデ"
"フォルトです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"Initialize the process query flag to <var class=\"var\">query-flag</var>.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">Querying Before Exit</"
"a>.  The flags defaults to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if unspecified."
msgstr ""
"プロセスクエリフラグを <var class=\"var\">query-flag</var> に初期化します。"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Query-Before-Exit.html\">終了前のクエリ</a> を参照し"
"てください。フラグが指定されていない場合、デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:stop <var class=\"var\">bool</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:stop <var class=\"var\">bool</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"Start process in the stopped state if <var class=\"var\">bool</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In the stopped state, a serial process "
"does not accept incoming data, but you can send outgoing data.  The stopped "
"state is cleared by <code class=\"code\">continue-process</code> and set by "
"<code class=\"code\">stop-process</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">bool</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"停止状態でプロセスを開始します。停止状態では、シリアルプロセスは受信データを"
"受け付けませんが、送信データは送信可能です。停止状態は <code "
"class=\"code\">continue-process</code> によって解除され、<code "
"class=\"code\">stop-process</code> によって設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid "Install <var class=\"var\">filter</var> as the process filter."
msgstr ""
"プロセスフィルタとして <var class=\"var\">filter</var> をインストールします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
