msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:process <var class=\"var\">process</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"Any of these arguments can be given to identify the process that is to be "
"configured.  If none of these arguments is given, the current buffer&rsquo;s "
"process is used."
msgstr ""
"設定対象のプロセスを特定するには、これらの引数のいずれかを指定できます。いず"
"れの引数も指定されない場合は、現在のバッファのプロセスが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Serial-Ports.html
msgid ""
"The speed of the serial port in bits per second, a.k.a. <em "
"class=\"dfn\">baud rate</em>.  The value can be any number, but most serial "
"ports work only at a few defined values between 1200 and 115200, with 9600 "
"being the most common value.  If <var class=\"var\">speed</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the function ignores all other arguments and does "
"not configure the port.  This may be useful for special serial ports such as "
"Bluetooth-to-serial converters, which can only be configured through &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">AT</samp>&rsquo; commands sent through the connection.  "
"The value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var class=\"var\">speed</"
"var> is valid only for connections that were already opened by a previous "
"call to <code class=\"code\">make-serial-process</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">serial-term</code>."
msgstr ""
"シリアルポートの速度（ビット毎秒）、別名<em class=\"dfn\">ボーレート</em>。値"
"は任意の数値を指定できますが、ほとんどのシリアルポートは1200から115200までの"
"定義済みの少数の値でのみ動作し、9600が最も一般的な値です。<var "
"class=\"var\">speed</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合、この関数は"
"他のすべての引数を無視し、ポートの設定を行いません。これは、接続経由で送信さ"
"れる&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">AT</samp>&rsquo;コマンドを通じてのみ設定可能"
"なBluetooth-to-シリアルコンバータなどの特殊なシリアルポートにおいて有用です。"
"<var class=\"var\">speed</var>に対する<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の値は、"
"以前に<code class=\"code\">make-serial-process</code>または<code "
"class=\"code\">serial-term</code>を呼び出して既に開かれた接続に対してのみ有効"
"です。"

