# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
msgid ""
"Changing the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of a cons cell is done with "
"<code class=\"code\">setcar</code>.  When used on a list, <code "
"class=\"code\">setcar</code> replaces one element of a list with a different "
"element."
msgstr ""
"コンスセルの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>を変更するには<code "
"class=\"code\">setcar</code>を使用します。リストに対して使用した場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">setcar</code>はリストの1つの要素を別の要素に置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setcar</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cons object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setcar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setcar</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cons object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setcar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
msgid ""
"This function stores <var class=\"var\">object</var> as the new <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of <var class=\"var\">cons</var>, replacing its "
"previous <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>.  In other words, it changes the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> slot of <var class=\"var\">cons</var> to "
"refer to <var class=\"var\">object</var>.  It returns the value <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">cons</var> の新しい <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> として <var class=\"var\">object</var> を格納し、それまでの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を置き換えます。言い換えれば、<var "
"class=\"var\">cons</var> の <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> スロットを <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> を指すように変更します。そして、値 <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> を返します。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq x (list 1 2))\n"
"     &rArr; (1 2)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setcar x 4)\n"
"     &rArr; 4\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x\n"
"     &rArr; (4 2)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
msgid ""
"When a cons cell is part of the shared structure of several lists, storing a "
"new <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> into the cons changes one element of "
"each of these lists.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"コンスセルが複数のリストの共有構造の一部となっている場合、新しい<small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small>をコンスに格納すると、これらの各リストの要素が1つずつ"
"変更されます。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Create two lists that are partly shared.</span>\n"
"(setq x1 (list 'a 'b 'c))\n"
"     &rArr; (a b c)\n"
"(setq x2 (cons 'z (cdr x1)))\n"
"     &rArr; (z b c)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Replace the <span class=\"sc\">CAR</span> of a shared link.</span>\n"
"(setcar (cdr x1) 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; foo\n"
"x1                           ; <span class=\"r\">Both lists are changed.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; (a foo c)\n"
"x2\n"
"     &rArr; (z foo c)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">Replace the <span class=\"sc\">CAR</span> of a link that is not shared.</span>\n"
"(setcar x1 'baz)\n"
"     &rArr; baz\n"
"x1                           ; <span class=\"r\">Only one list is changed.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; (baz foo c)\n"
"x2\n"
"     &rArr; (z foo c)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
msgid ""
"Here is a graphical depiction of the shared structure of the two lists in "
"the variables <code class=\"code\">x1</code> and <code class=\"code\">x2</"
"code>, showing why replacing <code class=\"code\">b</code> changes them both:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">x1</code> と <code class=\"code\">x2</code> に含ま"
"れる2つのリストの共通構造を図示したものです。これにより、<code "
"class=\"code\">b</code> を置き換えると両方のリストが変化する理由が分かりま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        --- ---        --- ---      --- ---\n"
"x1---&gt; |   |   |----&gt; |   |   |--&gt; |   |   |--&gt; nil\n"
"        --- ---        --- ---      --- ---\n"
"         |        --&gt;   |            |\n"
"         |       |      |            |\n"
"          --&gt; a  |       --&gt; b        --&gt; c\n"
"                 |\n"
"       --- ---   |\n"
"x2--&gt; |   |   |--\n"
"       --- ---\n"
"        |\n"
"        |\n"
"         --&gt; z\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
msgid ""
"Here is an alternative form of box diagram, showing the same relationship:"
msgstr "同じ関係を示す、ボックス図の別の形式を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x1:\n"
" --------------       --------------       --------------\n"
"| car   | cdr  |     | car   | cdr  |     | car   | cdr  |\n"
"|   a   |   o-------&gt;|   b   |   o-------&gt;|   c   |  nil |\n"
"|       |      |  --&gt;|       |      |     |       |      |\n"
" --------------  |    --------------       --------------\n"
"                 |\n"
"x2:              |\n"
" --------------  |\n"
"| car   | cdr  | |\n"
"|   z   |   o----\n"
"|       |      |\n"
" --------------\n"
msgstr ""

