msgstr ""
"<span>5.6.2 List<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Altering-the-CDR-of-a-"
"List\"> &para;</a>のCDRを変更する</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replace-part-of-list\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replace-part-of-list\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"The lowest-level primitive for modifying a <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"is <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を変更するための最も低レベルなプリミティブは "
"<code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setcdr</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cons object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setcdr\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setcdr</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">cons object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setcdr\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"This function stores <var class=\"var\">object</var> as the new <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of <var class=\"var\">cons</var>, replacing its "
"previous <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>.  In other words, it changes the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> slot of <var class=\"var\">cons</var> to "
"refer to <var class=\"var\">object</var>.  It returns the value <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">cons</var> の新しい <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> として <var class=\"var\">object</var> を格納し、それまでの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を置き換えます。言い換えれば、<var "
"class=\"var\">cons</var> の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> スロットを <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> を指すように変更します。そして、値 <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of replacing the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of a "
"list with a different list.  All but the first element of the list are "
"removed in favor of a different sequence of elements.  The first element is "
"unchanged, because it resides in the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of the "
"list, and is not reached via the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>."
msgstr ""
"以下に、リストの<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を別のリストに置き換える例を示"
"します。リストの最初の要素を除くすべての要素が削除され、代わりに別の要素列が"
"配置されます。最初の要素はリストの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>に格納されて"
"おり、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>経由では到達できないため、変更されませ"
"ん。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setcdr x '(4))\n"
"     &rArr; (4)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x\n"
"     &rArr; (1 4)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"You can delete elements from the middle of a list by altering the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>s of the cons cells in the list.  For example, here "
"we delete the second element, <code class=\"code\">b</code>, from the list "
"<code class=\"code\">(a b c)</code>, by changing the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the first cons cell:"
msgstr ""
"リスト内のコンスセルの<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を変更することで、リスト"
"の途中にある要素を削除できます。例えば、ここでは最初のコンスセルの<small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を変更することで、リスト<code class=\"code\">(a b "
"c)</code>から2番目の要素<code class=\"code\">b</code>を削除します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq x1 (list 'a 'b 'c))\n"
"     &rArr; (a b c)\n"
"(setcdr x1 (cdr (cdr x1)))\n"
"     &rArr; (c)\n"
"x1\n"
"     &rArr; (a c)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid "Here is the result in box notation:"
msgstr "ボックス表記での結果は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                   --------------------\n"
"                  |                    |\n"
" --------------   |   --------------   |    --------------\n"
"| car   | cdr  |  |  | car   | cdr  |   --&gt;| car   | cdr  |\n"
"|   a   |   o-----   |   b   |   o--------&gt;|   c   |  nil |\n"
"|       |      |     |       |      |      |       |      |\n"
" --------------       --------------        --------------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"The second cons cell, which previously held the element <code "
"class=\"code\">b</code>, still exists and its <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> is still <code class=\"code\">b</code>, but it no longer forms part "
"of this list."
msgstr ""
"以前は要素 <code class=\"code\">b</code> を保持していた2番目の cons セルは依"
"然として存在し、その <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> も依然として <code "
"class=\"code\">b</code> であるが、もはやこのリストの一部を構成していない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setcdr.html
msgid ""
"It is equally easy to insert a new element by changing <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>s:"
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を変更することで、同様に簡単に新しい要素を挿入"
"できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
