# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sets-And-Lists.html
msgid ""
"If you want to delete elements that are <code class=\"code\">equal</code> to "
"a given value, use <code class=\"code\">delete</code> (see below)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">equal</code> から指定した値までの要素を削除したい場合"
"は、<code class=\"code\">delete</code> を使用してください（以下を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Sets-And-Lists.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">remq</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object list</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-remq\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">remq</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object list</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-remq\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sets-And-Lists.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a copy of <var class=\"var\">list</var>, with all "
"elements removed which are <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>.  The letter &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">q</"
"samp>&rsquo; in <code class=\"code\">remq</code> says that it uses <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> to compare <var class=\"var\">object</var> against "
"the elements of <code class=\"code\">list</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">list</var> のコピーから、<code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> から <var class=\"var\">object</var> までのすべての"
"要素を除去して返します。<code class=\"code\">remq</code> 内の文字 &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">q</samp>&rsquo; は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> を "
"<code class=\"code\">list</code> の要素と比較する際に <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> を使用することを示しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sets-And-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq sample-list (list 'a 'b 'c 'a 'b 'c))\n"
"     &rArr; (a b c a b c)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sets-And-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(remq 'a sample-list)\n"
"     &rArr; (b c b c)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Sets-And-Lists.html
