# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>12.8 Setting Variable Values<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Setting-"
"Variable-Values\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>12.8 変数の値の設定<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Setting-Variable-"
"Values\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The usual way to change the value of a variable is with the special form "
"<code class=\"code\">setq</code>.  When you need to compute the choice of "
"variable at run time, use the function <code class=\"code\">set</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数の値を変更する一般的な方法は、特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">setq</code> "
"を用いることです。実行時に変数の値を決定する必要がある場合は、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">set</code> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setq</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">[symbol form]&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setq\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setq</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">[symbol form]&hellip;</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setq\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This special form is the most common method of changing a variable&rsquo;s "
"value.  Each <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is given a new value, which is "
"the result of evaluating the corresponding <var class=\"var\">form</var>.  "
"The current binding of the symbol is changed."
msgstr ""
"この特殊な形式は、変数の値を変更する最も一般的な方法です。各<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>には、対応する<var class=\"var\">form</var>を評価し"
"た結果である新しい値が代入されます。これにより、シンボルの現在の束縛が変更さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">setq</code> does not evaluate <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>; it sets the symbol that you write.  We say that "
"this argument is <em class=\"dfn\">automatically quoted</em>.  The &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">q</samp>&rsquo; in <code class=\"code\">setq</code> "
"stands for &ldquo;quoted&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setq</code> は <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> を評価せ"
"ず、記述したシンボルを設定します。この引数は<em class=\"dfn\">自動的にクォー"
"トされる</em>と言います。<code class=\"code\">setq</code> 内の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">q</samp>&rsquo; は &ldquo;クォート済み&rdquo; を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The value of the <code class=\"code\">setq</code> form is the value of the "
"last <var class=\"var\">form</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setq</code> 形式の値は、直前の <var class=\"var\">form</"
"var> の値となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq x (1+ 2))\n"
"     &rArr; 3\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x                   ; <span class=\"r\"><code class=\"code\">x</code> now has a global value.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 3\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((x 5))\n"
"  (setq x 6)        ; <span class=\"r\">The local binding of <code class=\"code\">x</code> is set.</span>\n"
"  x)\n"
"     &rArr; 6\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x                   ; <span class=\"r\">The global value is unchanged.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 3\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Note that the first <var class=\"var\">form</var> is evaluated, then the "
"first <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is set, then the second <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var> is evaluated, then the second <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> is set, and so on:"
msgstr ""
"なお、まず最初の <var class=\"var\">form</var> が評価され、次に最初の <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> が設定され、続いて2番目の <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var> が評価され、次に2番目の <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var> が設定される、という具合に続きます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq x 10          ; <span class=\"r\">Notice that <code class=\"code\">x</code> is set before</span>\n"
"      y (1+ x))     ;   <span class=\"r\">the value of <code class=\"code\">y</code> is computed.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 11\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol value</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-set\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol value</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-set\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function puts <var class=\"var\">value</var> in the value cell of <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>.  Since it is a function rather than a special "
"form, the expression written for <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is "
"evaluated to obtain the symbol to set.  The return value is <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の値セルに <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> を代入します。特殊形式ではなく関数であるため、<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> に書かれた式が評価され、設定するシンボルが得られま"
"す。戻り値は <var class=\"var\">value</var> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"When dynamic variable binding is in effect (the default), <code "
"class=\"code\">set</code> has the same effect as <code class=\"code\">setq</"
"code>, apart from the fact that <code class=\"code\">set</code> evaluates "
"its <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> argument whereas <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> does not.  But when a variable is lexically "
"bound, <code class=\"code\">set</code> affects its <em "
"class=\"emph\">dynamic</em> value, whereas <code class=\"code\">setq</code> "
"affects its current (lexical) value.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Scoping.html\">Scoping Rules for Variable Bindings</a>."
msgstr ""
"動的変数束縛が有効な場合（デフォルト）、<code class=\"code\">set</code> は "
"<code class=\"code\">setq</code> と同じ効果を持ちますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">set</code> は引数 <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> を評価するの"
"に対し、<code class=\"code\">setq</code> は評価しないという点が異なります。一"
"方、変数が字句的に束縛されている場合、<code class=\"code\">set</code> はその "
"<em class=\"emph\">動的</em> 値に影響を与えますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> は現在の（字句的な）値に影響を与えます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">変数束縛のスコープ規則</a> を参"
"照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(set one 1)\n"
"error&rarr; Symbol's value as variable is void: one\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(set 'one 1)\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(set 'two 'one)\n"
"     &rArr; one\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(set two 2)         ; <span class=\"r\"><code class=\"code\">two</code> evaluates to symbol <code class=\"code\">one</code>.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"one                 ; <span class=\"r\">So it is <code class=\"code\">one</code> that was set.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 2\n"
"(let ((one 1))      ; <span class=\"r\">This binding of <code class=\"code\">one</code> is set,</span>\n"
"  (set 'one 3)      ;   <span class=\"r\">not the global value.</span>\n"
"  one)\n"
"     &rArr; 3\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"one\n"
"     &rArr; 2\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is not actually a symbol, a <code "
"class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code> error is signaled."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が実際にはシンボルでない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">wrong-type-argument</code> エラーが報告されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(set '(x y) 'z)\n"
"error&rarr; Wrong type argument: symbolp, (x y)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setopt</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">[symbol form]&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setopt\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setopt</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">[symbol form]&hellip;"
"</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setopt\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This is like <code class=\"code\">setq</code> (see above), but meant for "
"user options.  This macro uses the Customize machinery to set the "
"variable(s)  (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Definitions.html\">Defining Customization Variables</a>).  In particular, "
"<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> will run the setter function associated "
"with the variable.  For instance, if you have:"
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">setq</code>（上記参照）と同様ですが、ユーザーオプ"
"ション向けのものです。このマクロはカスタマイズ機構を利用して変数を設定します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Definitions.html\">カスタマイズ変数の定"
"義</a>を参照）。具体的には、<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> はその変数に関"
"連付けられたセッター関数を実行します。例えば、次のような場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defcustom my-var 1\n"
"  &quot;My var.&quot;\n"
"  :type 'number\n"
"  :set (lambda (var val)\n"
"         (set-default var val)\n"
"         (message &quot;We set %s to %s&quot; var val)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"then the following, in addition to setting <code class=\"code\">my-var</"
"code> to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">2</samp>&rsquo;, will also issue a "
"message:"
msgstr ""
"すると、<code class=\"code\">my-var</code> を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">2</"
"samp>&rsquo; に設定するほか、以下でもメッセージが出力されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setopt my-var 2)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> also checks whether the value is valid "
"for the user option.  For instance, using <code class=\"code\">setopt</code> "
"to set a user option defined with a <code class=\"code\">number</code> type "
"to a string will signal an error."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> はまた、値がユーザーオプションとして有効か"
"どうかも判定します。例えば、<code class=\"code\">number</code> 型で定義された"
"ユーザーオプションを文字列に設定するために <code class=\"code\">setopt</"
"code> を使用すると、エラーが発生します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Unlike <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> and related customization "
"commands, such as <code class=\"code\">customize-variable</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">setopt</code> is meant for non-interactive use, in particular "
"in the user init file.  For that reason, it doesn&rsquo;t record the "
"standard, saved, and user-set values, and doesn&rsquo;t mark the variable as "
"candidate for saving in the custom file."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Setting-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">setopt</code> macro can be used on regular, non-"
"user option variables, but is much less efficient than <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code>.  The main use case for this macro is setting "
"user options in the user&rsquo;s init file."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> マクロは、通常の非ユーザーオプション変数に"
"対しても使用できますが、<code class=\"code\">setq</code> に比べると効率が大幅"
"に劣ります。このマクロの主な用途は、ユーザーの init ファイルでユーザーオプ"
"ションを設定することです。"

