# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Shorthands.html
msgid ""
"The symbol <em class=\"dfn\">shorthands</em>, sometimes known as <em "
"class=\"dfn\">renamed symbols</em>, are symbolic forms found in Lisp "
"source.  They&rsquo;re just like regular symbolic forms, except that when "
"the Lisp reader encounters them, it produces symbols which have a different "
"and usually longer <em class=\"dfn\">print name</em> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Symbol-Components.html\">Symbol Components</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ショートハンド</em>（時に<em class=\"dfn\">リネーム済みシン"
"ボル</em>とも呼ばれる）というシンボルは、Lispのソースコードに見られるシンボ"
"リック形式です。これらは通常のシンボリック形式と同様ですが、Lispリーダーがこ"
"れらに遭遇した際に、異なる、通常はより長い<em class=\"dfn\">プリント名</em>を"
"持つシンボルを生成するという点が異なります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-"
"Components.html\">シンボルの構成要素</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Shorthands.html
msgid ""
"It is useful to think of shorthands as <em class=\"emph\">abbreviating</em> "
"the full names of intended symbols.  Despite this, do not confuse shorthands "
"with the Abbrev system (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abbrevs.html\">Abbrevs "
"and Abbrev Expansion</a>)."
msgstr ""
"略記は、意図する記号の正式名称を<em class=\"emph\">省略</em>したものと考える"
"と分かりやすいでしょう。とはいえ、略記をAbbrevシステム（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrevs.html\">AbbrevsとAbbrev Expansion</a>を参照）と混同しないようご"
"注意ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Shorthands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-namespace-etiquette\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-namespace-etiquette\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Shorthands.html
msgid ""
"Shorthands make Emacs Lisp&rsquo;s <em class=\"dfn\">namespacing etiquette</"
"em> easier to work with.  Since all symbols are stored in a single obarray "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-Symbols.html\">Creating and "
"Interning Symbols</a>), programmers commonly prefix each symbol name with "
"the name of the library where it originates.  For example, the functions "
"<code class=\"code\">text-property-search-forward</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">text-property-search-backward</code> both belong to the <samp "
"class=\"file\">text-property-search.el</samp> library (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loading.html\">Loading</a>).  By properly prefixing "
"symbol names, one effectively prevents clashes between similarly named "
"symbols which belong to different libraries and thus do different things.  "
"However, this practice commonly originates very long symbols names, which "
"are inconvenient to type and read after a while.  Shorthands solve these "
"issues in a clean way."
msgstr ""
"ショートハンドを用いることで、Emacs Lispの<em class=\"dfn\">名前空間の作法</"
"em>をより扱いやすくできます。すべてのシンボルは単一のobarrayに格納されるため"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-Symbols.html\">シンボルの作成とインター"
"ニング</a>を参照）、プログラマは通常、各シンボル名の先頭に、そのシンボルの由"
"来となるライブラリ名を付加します。例えば、関数<code class=\"code\">text-"
"property-search-forward</code>と<code class=\"code\">text-property-search-"
"backward</code>はいずれも<samp class=\"file\">text-property-search.el</samp>"
"ライブラリに属しています（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loading.html\">ロード</a>"
"を参照）。シンボル名に適切に接頭辞を付けることで、異なるライブラリに属し、し"
"たがって異なる役割を持つ、似た名前のシンボル同士の衝突を効果的に防ぐことがで"
"きます。しかし、こうした慣習では通常、非常に長いシンボル名が生成され、次第に"
"入力や読解が不便になります。ショートハンドは、こうした問題を簡潔に解決しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Shorthands.html
