# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Showing-Images.html
msgid ""
"Internally, this function creates an overlay, and gives it a <code "
"class=\"code\">before-string</code> property containing text that has a "
