"accesskey=\"1\">Displaying Buffers in Side Windows</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"Displaying-Buffers-in-Side-Windows.html\" accesskey=\"1\">サイド"
"ウィンドウへのバッファ表示</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
