# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Sending a signal</em> to a subprocess is a way of "
"interrupting its activities.  There are several different signals, each with "
"its own meaning.  The set of signals and their names is defined by the "
"operating system.  For example, the signal <code class=\"code\">SIGINT</"
"code> means that the user has typed <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>, or that "
"some analogous thing has happened."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセスに<em class=\"dfn\">シグナルを送信する</em>ことは、その動作を中断"
"させる一つの方法です。シグナルにはいくつかの種類があり、それぞれに固有の意味"
"があります。シグナルのセットとその名称は、オペレーティングシステムによって定"
"義されています。例えば、シグナル <code class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> は、ユー"
"ザーが <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> を入力したか、あるいはそれに類する事象が"
"発生したことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Each signal has a standard effect on the subprocess.  Most signals kill the "
"subprocess, but some stop (or resume) execution instead.  Most signals can "
"optionally be handled by programs; if the program handles the signal, then "
"we can say nothing in general about its effects."
msgstr ""
"各シグナルは、サブプロセスに対して標準的な影響を及ぼす。ほとんどのシグナルは"
"サブプロセスを強制終了させるが、中には代わりに実行を停止（または再開）させる"
"ものもある。ほとんどのシグナルは、プログラムによって任意に処理することが可能"
"である。プログラムがシグナルを処理する場合、その影響について一般的に述べるこ"
"とはできない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"You can send signals explicitly by calling the functions in this section.  "
"Emacs also sends signals automatically at certain times: killing a buffer "
"sends a <code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> signal to all its associated "
"processes; killing Emacs sends a <code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> signal "
"to all remaining processes.  (<code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code> is a signal "
"that usually indicates that the user &ldquo;hung up the phone&rdquo;, i.e., "
"disconnected.)"
msgstr ""
"本節の関数を呼び出すことで、明示的にシグナルを送信できます。また、Emacsは特定"
"のタイミングで自動的にシグナルを送信します。バッファを終了すると、それに関連"
"付けられたすべてのプロセスに<code class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code>シグナルが送信"
"され、Emacsを終了すると、残っているすべてのプロセスに<code "
"class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code>シグナルが送信されます。（<code "
"class=\"code\">SIGHUP</code>は通常、ユーザーが「電話を切った」、つまり切断し"
"たことを示すシグナルです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Each of the signal-sending functions takes two optional arguments: <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> and <var class=\"var\">current-group</var>."
msgstr ""
"各信号送信関数は、<var class=\"var\">process</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">current-group</var> という2つのオプション引数を取ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">process</var> must be either a process, a "
"process name, a buffer, a buffer name, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"A buffer or buffer name stands for a process through <code "
"class=\"code\">get-buffer-process</code>.  <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"stands for the process associated with the current buffer.  Except with "
"<code class=\"code\">stop-process</code> and <code class=\"code\">continue-"
"process</code>, an error is signaled if <var class=\"var\">process</var> "
"does not identify an active process, or if it represents a network, serial, "
"or pipe connection."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">process</var> は、プロセス、プロセス名、バッファ、"
"バッファ名、または <code class=\"code\">nil</code> のいずれかである必要があり"
"ます。バッファまたはバッファ名は、<code class=\"code\">get-buffer-process</"
"code> までのプロセスを表します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は、現在の"
"バッファに関連付けられたプロセスを表します。<code class=\"code\">stop-"
"process</code> および <code class=\"code\">continue-process</code> を除き、"
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> がアクティブなプロセスを指さない場合、または"
"ネットワーク、シリアル、パイプ接続を表す場合には、エラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> is a flag that makes a "
"difference when you are running a job-control shell as an Emacs subprocess.  "
"If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the signal is sent to the "
"current process-group of the terminal that Emacs uses to communicate with "
"the subprocess.  If the process is a job-control shell, this means the "
"shell&rsquo;s current subjob.  If <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the signal is sent to the process group of "
"the immediate subprocess of Emacs.  If the subprocess is a job-control "
"shell, this is the shell itself.  If <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> "
"is <code class=\"code\">lambda</code>, the signal is sent to the process-"
"group that owns the terminal, but only if it is not the shell itself."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> は、Emacs のサブプロセスとして"
"ジョブ制御シェルを実行している場合に挙動を左右するフラグです。これが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、シグナルは Emacs がサブプロセスとの通信"
"に使用するターミナルの現在のプロセスグループに送信されます。そのプロセスが"
"ジョブ制御シェルである場合、これはシェルの現在のサブジョブを意味します。<var "
"class=\"var\">current-group</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、"
"シグナルは Emacs の直属のサブプロセスのプロセスグループに送信されます。そのサ"
"ブプロセスがジョブ制御シェルである場合、これはシェル自身を指します。<var "
"class=\"var\">current-group</var> が <code class=\"code\">lambda</code> の場"
"合、シグナルはターミナルを所有するプロセスグループに送信されますが、これは"
"シェル自身ではない場合に限られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The flag <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> has no effect when a pipe is "
"used to communicate with the subprocess, because the operating system does "
"not support the distinction in the case of pipes.  For the same reason, job-"
"control shells won&rsquo;t work when a pipe is used.  See <code "
"class=\"code\">process-connection-type</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">Creating an Asynchronous Process</a>."
msgstr ""
"パイプを用いてサブプロセスと通信する場合、オペレーティングシステムがパイプに"
"おける区別をサポートしていないため、フラグ <var class=\"var\">current-group</"
"var> は効果を発揮しません。同様の理由で、パイプを使用するとジョブ制御シェルは"
"動作しません。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">非同期プ"
"ロセスの作成</a> の <code class=\"code\">process-connection-type</code> を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">interrupt-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-interrupt_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">interrupt-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-interrupt_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function interrupts the process <var class=\"var\">process</var> by "
"sending the signal <code class=\"code\">SIGINT</code>.  Outside of Emacs, "
"typing the interrupt character (normally <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> on "
"some systems, and <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> on others) sends this "
"signal.  When the argument <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, you can think of this function as typing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> on the terminal by which Emacs talks to the "
"subprocess."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、シグナル <code class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> を送信することでプロ"
"セス <var class=\"var\">process</var> を中断します。Emacs 以外では、中断文字"
"（システムによっては通常 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>、また別のシステムでは "
"<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>）を入力することで、このシグナルが送信されます。"
"引数 <var class=\"var\">current-group</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、この関数は、Emacs がサブプロセスと通信する際に使用する端末"
"で <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> を入力することと同等であると考えることができ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">kill-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This command kills the process <var class=\"var\">process</var> by sending "
"the signal <code class=\"code\">SIGKILL</code>.  This signal kills the "
"subprocess immediately, and cannot be handled by the subprocess.  "
"Interactively, it&rsquo;ll prompt the user for a process name, defaulting to "
"the process (if any) in the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、シグナル <code class=\"code\">SIGKILL</code> を送信することで"
"プロセス <var class=\"var\">process</var> を終了させます。このシグナルはサブ"
"プロセスを即座に終了させ、サブプロセス側で処理することはできません。対話モー"
"ドでは、ユーザーにプロセス名の入力を求め、デフォルトでは現在のバッファにある"
"プロセス（もしあれば）が指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"quit_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">quit-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"quit_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function sends the signal <code class=\"code\">SIGQUIT</code> to the "
"process <var class=\"var\">process</var>.  This signal is the one sent by "
"the quit character (usually <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd>) when you are not "
"inside Emacs."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プロセス <var class=\"var\">process</var> にシグナル <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGQUIT</code> を送信します。このシグナルは、Emacs 外にいると"
"きに終了文字（通常は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd>）によって送信されるもので"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">stop-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"stop_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">stop-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"stop_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function stops the specified <var class=\"var\">process</var>.  If it "
"is a real subprocess running a program, it sends the signal <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGTSTP</code> to that subprocess.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> represents a network, serial, or pipe "
"connection, this function inhibits handling of the incoming data from the "
"connection; for a network server, this means not accepting new connections.  "
"Use <code class=\"code\">continue-process</code> to resume normal execution."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定された <var class=\"var\">process</var> を停止します。それが"
"プログラムを実行中の実際のサブプロセスである場合、そのサブプロセスにシグナル "
"<code class=\"code\">SIGTSTP</code> を送信します。<var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> がネットワーク、シリアル、またはパイプ接続を表す"
"場合、この関数はその接続からの受信データの処理を抑制します。ネットワークサー"
"バーの場合、これは新規接続を受け付けないことを意味します。通常の実行を再開す"
"るには <code class=\"code\">continue-process</code> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Outside of Emacs, on systems with job control, the stop character (usually "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd>) normally sends the <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGTSTP</code> signal to a subprocess.  When <var "
"class=\"var\">current-group</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"you can think of this function as typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd> on the "
"terminal Emacs uses to communicate with the subprocess."
msgstr ""
"Emacs以外で、ジョブ制御機能を持つシステムでは、停止文字（通常は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd>）は通常、サブプロセスに <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGTSTP</code> シグナルを送信します。<var "
"class=\"var\">current-group</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、この関数は、Emacsがサブプロセスと通信するために使用するターミナルに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd> を入力することに相当すると考えることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">continue-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-continue_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">continue-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional process current-group</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-continue_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function resumes execution of the process <var class=\"var\">process</"
"var>.  If it is a real subprocess running a program, it sends the signal "
"<code class=\"code\">SIGCONT</code> to that subprocess; this presumes that "
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> was stopped previously.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> represents a network, serial, or pipe "
"connection, this function resumes handling of the incoming data from the "
"connection.  For serial connections, data that arrived during the time the "
"process was stopped might be lost."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プロセス <var class=\"var\">process</var> の実行を再開します。プ"
"ログラムを実行している実際のサブプロセスである場合、そのサブプロセスにシグナ"
"ル <code class=\"code\">SIGCONT</code> を送信します。これは、事前に <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> が停止されていたことを前提としています。<var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> がネットワーク、シリアル、またはパイプ接続を表す"
"場合、この関数はその接続からの受信データの処理を再開します。シリアル接続の場"
"合、プロセスが停止していた間に受信したデータが失われる可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">signal-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"signal &amp;optional remote</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"signal_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">signal-process</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process "
"signal &amp;optional remote</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"signal_002dprocess\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This function sends a signal to process <var class=\"var\">process</var>.  "
"The argument <var class=\"var\">signal</var> specifies which signal to send; "
"it should be an integer, or a symbol whose name is a signal."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、プロセス <var class=\"var\">process</var> にシグナルを送信しま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">signal</var> で送信するシグナルを指定します。値は"
"整数、または名称がシグナルであるシンボルである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">process</var> argument can be a system process <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ID</abbr> (an integer); that allows you to send signals to "
"processes that are not children of Emacs.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"System-Processes.html\">Accessing Other Processes</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> 引数にはシステムプロセスの <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ID</abbr>（整数）を指定できます。これにより、Emacs の子プロ"
"セスではないプロセスにシグナルを送信できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"System-Processes.html\">他のプロセスへのアクセス</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">process</var> is a process object which contains the "
"property <code class=\"code\">remote-pid</code>, or <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> is a number and <var class=\"var\">remote</var> "
"is a remote file name, <var class=\"var\">process</var> is interpreted as "
"process on the respective remote host, which will be the process to signal."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> がプロパティ <code class=\"code\">remote-"
"pid</code> を持つプロセスオブジェクトである場合、あるいは <var "
"class=\"var\">process</var> が数値で <var class=\"var\">remote</var> がリモー"
"トファイル名である場合、<var class=\"var\">process</var> はそれぞれのリモート"
"ホスト上のプロセスとして解釈され、それがシグナルを送信するプロセスとなりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">process</var> is a string, it is interpreted as "
"process object with the respective process name, or as a number."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">process</var> が文字列の場合、対応するプロセス名を持つプロ"
"セスオブジェクト、または数値として解釈されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is necessary to send a signal to a non-local asynchronous "
"process.  This is possible by writing an own <code class=\"code\">interrupt-"
"process</code> or <code class=\"code\">signal-process</code> "
"implementation.  This function must be added then to <code "
"class=\"code\">interrupt-process-functions</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">signal-process-functions</code>, respectively."
msgstr ""
"非ローカルな非同期プロセスにシグナルを送信する必要がある場合があります。これ"
"は、独自の <code class=\"code\">interrupt-process</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">signal-process</code> 実装を記述することで実現可能です。その"
"後、この関数をそれぞれ <code class=\"code\">interrupt-process-functions</"
"code> または <code class=\"code\">signal-process-functions</code> に追加する"
"必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">interrupt-process-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-interrupt_002dprocess_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">interrupt-process-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-interrupt_002dprocess_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Signals-to-Processes.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a list of functions to be called for <code "
"class=\"code\">interrupt-process</code>.  The arguments of the functions are "
"the same as for <code class=\"code\">interrupt-process</code>.  These "
"functions are called in the order of the list, until one of them returns non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The default function, which shall always "
