# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid ""
"<span>13.2.2 A Simple Lambda Expression Example<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#A-Simple-Lambda-Expression-Example\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13.2.2 シンプルなラムダ式の例<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#A-"
"Simple-Lambda-Expression-Example\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid "Consider the following example:"
msgstr "次の例を考えてみましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(lambda (a b c) (+ a b c))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid ""
"We can call this function by passing it to <code class=\"code\">funcall</"
"code>, like this:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、次のように<code class=\"code\">funcall</code>に渡すことで呼び出す"
"ことができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(funcall (lambda (a b c) (+ a b c))\n"
"         1 2 3)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid ""
"This call evaluates the body of the lambda expression with the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">a</code> bound to 1, <code class=\"code\">b</code> "
"bound to 2, and <code class=\"code\">c</code> bound to 3.  Evaluation of the "
"body adds these three numbers, producing the result 6; therefore, this call "
"to the function returns the value 6."
msgstr ""
"この呼び出しでは、変数 <code class=\"code\">a</code> に 1、<code "
"class=\"code\">b</code> に 2、<code class=\"code\">c</code> に 3 が束縛された"
"状態で、ラムダ式の本体が評価されます。本体の評価ではこれら 3 つの数値が加算さ"
"れ、結果 6 が得られます。したがって、この関数呼び出しは値 6 を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid ""
"Note that the arguments can be the results of other function calls, as in "
"this example:"
msgstr ""
"なお、この例のように、引数に他の関数呼び出しの結果を指定することも可能です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(funcall (lambda (a b c) (+ a b c))\n"
"         1 (* 2 3) (- 5 4))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid ""
"This evaluates the arguments <code class=\"code\">1</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">(* 2 3)</code>, and <code class=\"code\">(- 5 4)</code> from "
"left to right.  Then it applies the lambda expression to the argument values "
"1, 6 and 1 to produce the value 8."
msgstr ""
"これは、引数 <code class=\"code\">1</code>、<code class=\"code\">(* 2 3)</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">(- 5 4)</code> を左から順に評価します。次に、引数"
"の値 1、6、1 にラムダ式を適用し、値 8 を算出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Lambda.html
msgid ""
"As these examples show, you can use a form with a lambda expression as its "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> to make local variables and give them "
"values.  In the old days of Lisp, this technique was the only way to bind "
"and initialize local variables.  But nowadays, it is clearer to use the "
"special form <code class=\"code\">let</code> for this purpose (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">Local Variables</a>).  Lambda "
"expressions are mainly used as anonymous functions for passing as arguments "
"to other functions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Anonymous-"
"Functions.html\">Anonymous Functions</a>), or stored as symbol function "
"definitions to produce named functions (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Function-Names.html\">Naming a Function</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これらの例が示すように、ラムダ式を<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>とするフォー"
"ムを用いて、ローカル変数を生成し、値を代入することができます。かつてのLispで"
"は、この手法がローカル変数を束縛し初期化する唯一の方法でした。しかし現在で"
"は、この目的には特殊フォーム<code class=\"code\">let</code>を使用する方が明快"
"です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">ローカル変数</a>を参"
"照）。ラムダ式は主に、他の関数に引数として渡すための無名関数として（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Anonymous-Functions.html\">無名関数</a>を参照）、ある"
"いは名前付き関数を生成するためのシンボル関数定義として格納される（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Function-Names.html\">関数の命名</a>を参照）ために用い"
"られます。"

