# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.6.2 Simple Match Data Access<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Simple-Match-Data-Access\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.6.2 簡易マッチデータアクセス<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Simple-Match-Data-Access\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This section explains how to use the match data to find out what was matched "
"by the last search or match operation, if it succeeded."
msgstr ""
"本セクションでは、直近の検索またはマッチ操作が成功した場合に、マッチデータを"
"用いて何がマッチしたかを確認する方法について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"You can ask about the entire matching text, or about a particular "
"parenthetical subexpression of a regular expression.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> argument in the functions below specifies which.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is zero, you are asking about the entire "
"match.  If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is positive, it specifies which "
"subexpression you want."
msgstr ""
"マッチしたテキスト全体について、あるいは正規表現の特定の括弧で囲まれた部分式"
"について問い合わせることができます。以下の関数における <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> 引数で、どちらを指定するかを決定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が 0 の場合は、マッチしたテキスト全体について問い合"
"わせます。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が正の値の場合は、どの部分式を指定す"
"るかを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"Recall that the subexpressions of a regular expression are those expressions "
"grouped with escaped parentheses, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(&hellip;"
"\\)</samp>&rsquo;.  The <var class=\"var\">count</var>th subexpression is "
"found by counting occurrences of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(</"
"samp>&rsquo; from the beginning of the whole regular expression.  The first "
"subexpression is numbered 1, the second 2, and so on.  Only regular "
"expressions can have subexpressions&mdash;after a simple string search, the "
"only information available is about the entire match."
msgstr ""
"正規表現の部分式とは、エスケープされた括弧 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\"
"(&hellip;\\)</samp>&rsquo; でグループ化された式のことであることを思い出してく"
"ださい。<var class=\"var\">count</var>番目の部分式は、正規表現全体の先頭から "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\(</samp>&rsquo; の出現回数を数えることで求めら"
"れます。最初の部分式は1、2番目は2というように番号が振られます。部分式を持つこ"
"とができるのは正規表現のみです。単純な文字列検索の後では、得られる情報はマッ"
"チした全体に関する情報に限られるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"Every successful search sets the match data.  Therefore, you should query "
"the match data immediately after searching, before calling any other "
"function that might perform another search.  Alternatively, you may save and "
"restore the match data (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Saving-Match-"
"Data.html\">Saving and Restoring the Match Data</a>) around the call to "
"functions that could perform another search.  Or use the functions that "
"explicitly do not modify the match data; e.g., <code class=\"code\">string-"
"match-p</code>."
msgstr ""
"検索が成功するたびに、マッチデータが設定されます。したがって、検索直後にマッ"
"チデータをクエリし、別の検索を行う可能性のある他の関数を呼び出す前に取得して"
"ください。あるいは、別の検索を行う可能性のある関数の呼び出し前後で、マッチ"
"データを保存・復元することもできます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Saving-Match-"
"Data.html\">マッチデータの保存と復元</a>を参照）。または、明示的にマッチデー"
"タを変更しない関数（例：<code class=\"code\">string-match-p</code>）を使用し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"A search which fails may or may not alter the match data.  In the current "
"implementation, it does not, but we may change it in the future.  "
"Don&rsquo;t try to rely on the value of the match data after a failing "
"search."
msgstr ""
"検索に失敗した場合、マッチデータが変更されることもあれば、されないこともあり"
"ます。現在の実装では変更されませんが、将来的には変更される可能性があります。"
"検索に失敗した後のマッチデータの値に依存しないようにしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional in-string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"match_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count "
"&amp;optional in-string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"match_002dstring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This function returns, as a string, the text matched in the last search or "
"match operation.  It returns the entire text if <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> is zero, or just the portion corresponding to the <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var>th parenthetical subexpression, if <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is positive."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、直前の検索またはマッチ操作で一致したテキストを文字列として返しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が 0 の場合はテキスト全体を、<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が正の場合は <var class=\"var\">count</var> 番目の"
"括弧付き部分式に対応する部分のみを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If the last such operation was done against a string with <code "
"class=\"code\">string-match</code>, then you should pass the same string as "
"the argument <var class=\"var\">in-string</var>.  After a buffer search or "
"match, you should omit <var class=\"var\">in-string</var> or pass <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> for it; but you should make sure that the current "
"buffer when you call <code class=\"code\">match-string</code> is the one in "
"which you did the searching or matching.  Failure to follow this advice will "
"lead to incorrect results."
msgstr ""
"前回の同様の操作が <code class=\"code\">string-match</code> を含む文字列に対"
"して行われた場合は、引数として同じ文字列を <var class=\"var\">in-string</"
"var> に渡す必要があります。バッファの検索または照合後は、<var "
"class=\"var\">in-string</var> を省略するか、代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を渡してください。ただし、<code "
"class=\"code\">match-string</code> を呼び出す際の現在のバッファが、検索または"
"照合を行った際のものであることを確認してください。この手順に従わない場合、"
"誤った結果を招くことになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> is out of range, or for a subexpression inside a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; alternative that wasn&rsquo;t used or a "
"repetition that repeated zero times."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が範囲外である場合、または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; 代替表現内の部分式が使用されなかった場合、あ"
"るいは繰り返しが 0 回であった場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-string-no-properties</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">count &amp;optional in-string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-match_002dstring_002dno_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-string-no-properties</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">count &amp;optional in-string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-match_002dstring_002dno_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">match-string</code> except that "
"the result has no text properties."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">match-string</code> と同様ですが、結果にテキ"
"ストプロパティが付与されない点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-beginning</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-match_002dbeginning\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-beginning</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-match_002dbeginning\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If the last regular expression search found a match, this function returns "
"the position of the start of the matching text or of a subexpression of it."
msgstr ""
"直前の正規表現検索でマッチが見つかった場合、この関数はマッチしたテキストまた"
"はその部分式の開始位置を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is zero, then the value is the position of "
"the start of the entire match.  Otherwise, <var class=\"var\">count</var> "
"specifies a subexpression in the regular expression, and the value of the "
"function is the starting position of the match for that subexpression."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が 0 の場合、その値はマッチ全体の開始位置とな"
"ります。そうでない場合、<var class=\"var\">count</var> は正規表現内の部分式を"
"指定し、関数の値はその部分式のマッチ開始位置となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"The value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for a subexpression inside a "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; alternative that wasn&rsquo;t "
"used or a repetition that repeated zero times."
msgstr ""
"値は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\|</samp>&rsquo; の選択枝内の部分式で使用"
"されなかった場合、または0回繰り返された繰り返しの場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-end</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-match_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">match-end</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">count</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-match_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> except "
"that it returns the position of the end of the match, rather than the "
"position of the beginning."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> と同様ですが、開始位置"
"ではなくマッチの終了位置を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of using the match data, with a comment showing the "
"positions within the text:"
msgstr ""
"以下に、マッチデータの使用例と、テキスト内での位置を示すコメントを記載しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(string-match &quot;\\\\(qu\\\\)\\\\(ick\\\\)&quot;\n"
"              &quot;The quick fox jumped quickly.&quot;)\n"
"              ;0123456789\n"
"     &rArr; 4\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(match-string 0 &quot;The quick fox jumped quickly.&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;quick&quot;\n"
"(match-string 1 &quot;The quick fox jumped quickly.&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;qu&quot;\n"
"(match-string 2 &quot;The quick fox jumped quickly.&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;ick&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(match-beginning 1)       ; <span class=\"r\">The beginning of the match</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 4                 ;   <span class=\"r\">with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">qu</samp>&rsquo; is at index 4.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(match-beginning 2)       ; <span class=\"r\">The beginning of the match</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 6                 ;   <span class=\"r\">with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ick</samp>&rsquo; is at index 6.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(match-end 1)             ; <span class=\"r\">The end of the match</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 6                 ;   <span class=\"r\">with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">qu</samp>&rsquo; is at index 6.</span>\n"
"\n"
"(match-end 2)             ; <span class=\"r\">The end of the match</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 9                 ;   <span class=\"r\">with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ick</samp>&rsquo; is at index 9.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"Here is another example.  Point is initially located at the beginning of the "
"line.  Searching moves point to between the space and the word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">in</samp>&rsquo;.  The beginning of the entire match is at "
"the 9th character of the buffer (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">T</"
"samp>&rsquo;), and the beginning of the match for the first subexpression is "
"at the 13th character (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;)."
msgstr ""
"別の例を挙げます。ポイントは最初、行の先頭に位置しています。検索により、ポイ"
"ントはスペースと単語 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">in</samp>&rsquo; の間に移動"
"します。マッチ全体の開始位置はバッファの9文字目（&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">T</samp>&rsquo;）であり、最初の部分式のマッチ開始位置は13文字"
"目（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;）です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(list\n"
"  (re-search-forward &quot;The \\\\(cat \\\\)&quot;)\n"
"  (match-beginning 0)\n"
"  (match-beginning 1))\n"
"    &rArr; (17 9 13)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"I read &quot;The cat &lowast;in the hat comes back&quot; twice.\n"
"        ^   ^\n"
"        9  13\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Match-Data.html
msgid ""
"(In this case, the index returned is a buffer position; the first character "
"of the buffer counts as 1.)"
msgstr ""
"（この場合、返されるインデックスはバッファ位置であり、バッファの先頭文字が1と"
"してカウントされます。）"

