# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<span>23.18.1.1 Simple Menu Items<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Simple-"
"Menu-Items-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.18.1.1 シンプルなメニュー項目<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Simple-Menu-Items-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The simpler (and original) way to define a menu item is to bind some event "
"type (it doesn&rsquo;t matter what event type) to a binding like this:"
msgstr ""
"メニュー項目を定義するよりシンプルで（かつ本来的な）方法は、何らかのイベント"
"タイプ（どのイベントタイプでも構いません）を、次のようなバインディングに紐付"
"けることです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">item-string</var> . <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">item-string</var>, "
"is the string to be displayed in the menu.  It should be "
"short&mdash;preferably one to three words.  It should describe the action of "
"the command it corresponds to.  Note that not all graphical toolkits can "
"display non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> text in menus (it will work "
"for keyboard menus and will work to a large extent with the GTK+ toolkit)."
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, <var class=\"var\">item-string</var>, はメ"
"ニューに表示される文字列です。短く、できれば1〜3語程度にしてください。対応す"
"るコマンドの動作を説明する内容にする必要があります。なお、すべてのグラフィカ"
"ルツールキットがメニュー内で非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>テキストを"
"表示できるわけではありません（キーボードメニューでは動作し、GTK+ツールキット"
"でも概ね動作します）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"You can also supply a second string, called the help string, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"また、ヘルプ文字列と呼ばれる2つ目の文字列を、次のように指定することもできま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">item-string</var> <var class=\"var\">help</var> . <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">help</var> specifies a help-echo string to display while "
"the mouse is on that item in the same way as <code class=\"code\">help-echo</"
"code> text properties (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Properties.html#Help-display\">Help display</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">help</var> は、<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> テキ"
"ストプロパティと同様に、マウスがその項目上にある間に表示されるヘルプエコー文"
"字列を指定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Properties.html#Help-"
"display\">ヘルプ表示</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"As far as <code class=\"code\">define-key</code> is concerned, <var "
"class=\"var\">item-string</var> and <var class=\"var\">help-string</var> are "
"part of the event&rsquo;s binding.  However, <code class=\"code\">lookup-"
"key</code> returns just <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var>, and only <var "
"class=\"var\">real-binding</var> is used for executing the key."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">define-key</code>に関しては、<var class=\"var\">item-"
"string</var>と<var class=\"var\">help-string</var>はイベントのバインディング"
"の一部となります。ただし、<code class=\"code\">lookup-key</code>は<var "
"class=\"var\">real-binding</var>のみを返し、キーの実行に使用されるのは<var "
"class=\"var\">real-binding</var>のみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then <var class=\"var\">item-string</var> appears in the menu but cannot be "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">real-binding</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">item-string</var>はメニューに表示されますが、選択でき"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-menu_002denable-_0028symbol-"
"property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-menu_002denable-_0028symbol-"
"property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">real-binding</var> is a symbol and has a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">menu-enable</code> property, "
"that property is an expression that controls whether the menu item is "
"enabled.  Every time the keymap is used to display a menu, Emacs evaluates "
"the expression, and it enables the menu item only if the expression&rsquo;s "
"value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  When a menu item is disabled, "
"it is displayed in a fuzzy fashion, and cannot be selected."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">real-binding</var> がシンボルであり、かつ <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の <code class=\"code\">menu-enable</code> プロ"
"パティを持つ場合、そのプロパティはメニュー項目の有効・無効を制御する式となり"
"ます。キーマップを用いてメニューを表示するたびに Emacs はこの式を評価し、式の"
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合にのみメニュー項目を有効に"
"します。メニュー項目が無効な状態では、ぼやけた状態で表示され、選択することは"
"できません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Menu-Items.html
msgid ""
"The menu bar does not recalculate which items are enabled every time you "
"look at a menu.  This is because the X toolkit requires the whole tree of "
"menus in advance.  To force recalculation of the menu bar, call <code "
"class=\"code\">force-mode-line-update</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mode-Line-Format.html\">Mode Line Format</a>)."
msgstr ""
"メニューバーは、メニューを確認するたびにどの項目が有効になっているかを再計算"
"するわけではありません。これは、Xツールキットがメニューのツリー全体を事前に必"
"要とするためです。メニューバーの再計算を強制するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">force-mode-line-update</code>を呼び出してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mode-Line-Format.html\">モードライン形式</a>を参照）。"

