# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"<span>15.4.1 Simple Types<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Simple-"
"Types-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>15.4.1 単純型<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Simple-Types-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"This section describes all the simple customization types.  For several of "
"these customization types, the customization widget provides inline "
"completion with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"本セクションでは、すべてのシンプルなカスタマイズタイプについて説明します。こ"
"れらのカスタマイズタイプのうちいくつかについては、カスタマイズウィジェットが "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> によるインライン補完を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">sexp</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">sexp</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value may be any Lisp object that can be printed and read back.  You can "
"use <code class=\"code\">sexp</code> as a fall-back for any option, if you "
"don&rsquo;t want to take the time to work out a more specific type to use."
msgstr ""
"値には、出力および再読み込みが可能な任意のLispオブジェクトを指定できます。よ"
"り具体的な型を検討する手間を省きたい場合は、どのオプションにおいてもフォール"
"バックとして <code class=\"code\">sexp</code> を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be an integer."
msgstr "値は整数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">natnum</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">natnum</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be a nonnegative integer."
msgstr "値は非負の整数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be a number (floating point or integer)."
msgstr "値は数値（浮動小数点数または整数）である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be floating point."
msgstr "値は浮動小数点数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a string.  The customization buffer shows the string "
"without delimiting &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; "
"characters or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; quotes."
msgstr ""
"値は文字列である必要があります。カスタマイズバッファには、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo;文字や&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>&rsquo;クォートで区切ることなく、文字列が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">regexp</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">regexp</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">string</code> except that the string must be a "
"valid regular expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">string</code>と同様ですが、文字列は有効な正規表現である"
"必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">character</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">character</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a character code.  A character code is actually an "
"integer, but this type shows the value by inserting the character in the "
"buffer, rather than by showing the number."
msgstr ""
"値は文字コードである必要があります。文字コードは実際には整数ですが、この型で"
"は数値を表示するのではなく、バッファに文字を挿入することで値を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">file</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">file</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be a file name.  The widget provides completion."
msgstr ""
"値はファイル名である必要があります。ウィジェットは補完機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(file :must-match t)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(file :must-match t)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a file name for an existing file.  The widget provides "
"completion."
msgstr ""
"値は、既存ファイルのファイル名である必要があります。ウィジェットは補完機能を"
"提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be a directory.  The widget provides completion."
msgstr ""
"値はディレクトリである必要があります。ウィジェットは補完機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">hook</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">hook</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a list of functions.  This customization type is used for "
"hook variables.  You can use the <code class=\"code\">:options</code> "
"keyword in a hook variable&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> to "
"specify a list of functions recommended for use in the hook; See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Variable-Definitions.html\">Defining Customization "
"Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"値は関数のリストである必要があります。このカスタマイズタイプはフック変数に使"
"用されます。フック変数の<code class=\"code\">defcustom</code>で<code "
"class=\"code\">:options</code>キーワードを使用すると、そのフックでの使用が推"
"奨される関数のリストを指定できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Definitions.html\">カスタマイズ変数の定義</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a symbol.  It appears in the customization buffer as the "
"symbol name.  The widget provides completion."
msgstr ""
"値はシンボルである必要があります。カスタマイズバッファにはシンボル名として表"
"示されます。ウィジェットは補完機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be either a lambda expression or a function name.  The widget "
"provides completion for function names."
msgstr ""
"値はラムダ式または関数名のいずれかである必要があります。ウィジェットは関数名"
"の補完機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">buffer-predicate</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">buffer-predicate</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid ""
"The value must be a form suitable for the <var class=\"var\">condition</var> "
"argument of the <code class=\"code\">buffer-match-p</code> function (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer List</a>).  This is "
"handy for options whose value is submitted to <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"match-p</code> to select suitable buffers."
msgstr ""
"値は、<code class=\"code\">buffer-match-p</code> 関数の <var "
"class=\"var\">condition</var> 引数に適した形式である必要があります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">バッファリスト</a> を参照）。これ"
"は、値が <code class=\"code\">buffer-match-p</code> に渡されて適切なバッファ"
"を選択するオプションに便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">variable</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">variable</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "The value must be a variable name.  The widget provides completion."
msgstr "値は変数名である必要があります。ウィジェットは補完機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Simple-Types.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">face</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">face</code>"

