#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.4.3.3 Size Parameters<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Size-"
"Parameters-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.4.3.3 サイズパラメータ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Size-"
"Parameters-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-size-on-display\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-size-on-display\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"Frame parameters usually specify frame sizes in character units.  On "
"graphical displays, the <code class=\"code\">default</code> face determines "
"the actual pixel sizes of these character units (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Face-Attributes.html\">Face Attributes</a>).  On text terminals size "
"parameters affect child frames only."
msgstr ""
"フレームパラメータでは通常、フレームサイズを文字単位で指定します。グラフィカ"
"ルディスプレイでは、<code class=\"code\">default</code> フェイスがこれらの文"
"字単位の実際のピクセルサイズを決定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-"
"Attributes.html\">フェイス属性</a>を参照）。テキスト端末では、サイズパラメー"
"タは子フレームにのみ影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-width_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">width</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"width_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-width_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">width</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"width_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"This parameter specifies the width of the frame.  It can be specified as in "
"the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"このパラメータは、フレームの幅を指定します。  以下のような方法で指定できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"A positive integer specifies the width of the frame&rsquo;s text area (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">Frame Geometry</a>) in "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"正の整数で、フレームのテキスト領域の幅（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Geometry.html\">フレームのジオメトリ</a>を参照）を文字数で指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid "a cons cell"
msgstr "consセル"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"If this is a cons cell with the symbol <code class=\"code\">text-pixels</"
"code> in its <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>, the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> of that cell specifies the width of the frame&rsquo;s text area in "
"pixels."
msgstr ""
"これが <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> にシンボル <code class=\"code\">text-"
"pixels</code> を持つ cons セルである場合、そのセルの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> はフレームのテキスト領域の幅をピクセル単位で指定しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frame-height-ratio\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-frame-width-ratio\"></a><span>a floating-point value<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-frame-width-ratio\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frame-height-ratio\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-frame-width-ratio\"></a><span>浮動小数点数<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-frame-width-ratio\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"A floating-point number between 0.0 and 1.0 can be used to specify the width "
"of a frame via its <em class=\"dfn\">width ratio</em>&mdash;the ratio of its "
"outer width (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">Frame "
"Geometry</a>) to the width of the frame&rsquo;s workarea (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple Terminals</a>) or "
"its parent frame&rsquo;s (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-"
"Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>) native frame.  Thus, a value of 0.5 makes "
"the frame occupy half of the width of its workarea or parent frame, a value "
"of 1.0 the full width.  Similarly, the <em class=\"dfn\">height ratio</em> "
"of a frame is the ratio of its outer height to the height of its workarea or "
"its parent&rsquo;s native frame."
msgstr ""
"0.0から1.0までの浮動小数点数を用いて、フレームの<em class=\"dfn\">幅比</em>――"
"すなわち、フレームの外幅（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Geometry.html\">フ"
"レームの幾何学</a>を参照）と、フレームの作業領域（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を参照）または親フレーム"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a>を参照）のネイ"
"ティブフレームの幅との比――を指定できます。したがって、値が0.5の場合、フレーム"
"は作業領域または親フレームの幅の半分を占め、値が1.0の場合は全幅を占めます。同"
"様に、フレームの<em class=\"dfn\">高さ比</em>とは、フレームの外高と、作業領域"
"または親フレームのネイティブフレームの高さとの比のことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"Emacs will try to keep the width and height ratio of a child frame unaltered "
"if that frame has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">keep-ratio</code> parameter (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html\">Frame Interaction Parameters</a>) "
"and its parent frame is resized."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、子フレームに<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">keep-ratio</code>以外のパラメータが設定されており（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html\">フレーム相互作用パ"
"ラメータ</a>を参照）、かつその親フレームがリサイズされた場合、子フレームの幅"
"と高さの比率を維持しようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"Since the outer size of a frame is usually unavailable before a frame has "
"been made visible, it is generally not advisable to use floating-point "
"values when creating decorated frames.  Floating-point values are more "
"suited to ensure that a child frame always fits within the area of its "
"parent frame as, for example, when customizing <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer-alist</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-"
"Window.html\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>) via <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-in-child-frame</code>."
msgstr ""
"フレームが表示されるまでは通常その外形サイズが不明であるため、装飾付きフレー"
"ムを作成する際に浮動小数点値を使用することは一般的に推奨されません。浮動小数"
"点値は、例えば <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-in-child-frame</code> を介"
"して <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用のウィンドウの選択</a> を参照）を"
"カスタマイズする場合など、子フレームが常に親フレームの領域内に収まるようにす"
"るためにより適しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"Regardless of how this parameter was specified, functions reporting the "
"value of this parameter like <code class=\"code\">frame-parameters</code> "
"always report the width of the frame&rsquo;s text area in characters as an "
"integer rounded, if necessary, to a multiple of the frame&rsquo;s default "
"character width.  That value is also used by the desktop saving routines."
msgstr ""
"このパラメータがどのように指定されたかにかかわらず、<code "
"class=\"code\">frame-parameters</code> のようにこのパラメータの値を報告する関"
"数は、常にフレームのテキスト領域の幅を文字単位で報告し、必要に応じてフレーム"
"のデフォルト文字幅の倍数に丸めた整数値として返します。この値は、デスクトップ"
"保存ルーチンでも使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-height_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">height</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"height_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-height_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">height</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"height_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"This parameter specifies the height of the frame.  It works just like <code "
"class=\"code\">width</code>, except vertically instead of horizontally."
msgstr ""
"このパラメータはフレームの高さを指定します。水平方向ではなく垂直方向である点"
"を除けば、<code class=\"code\">width</code>と同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-user_002dsize_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">user-size</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dsize_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-user_002dsize_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">user-size</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dsize_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"This does for the size parameters <code class=\"code\">height</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">width</code> what the <code class=\"code\">user-"
"position</code> parameter (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Position-"
"Parameters.html\">user-position</a>) does for the position parameters <code "
"class=\"code\">top</code> and <code class=\"code\">left</code>.  This "
"parameter has no meaning on a text terminal."
msgstr ""
"これは、サイズパラメータ <code class=\"code\">height</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">width</code> に対して、パラメータ <code class=\"code\">user-"
"position</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Position-Parameters.html\">ユー"
"ザー位置</a> を参照）が位置パラメータ <code class=\"code\">top</code> および "
"<code class=\"code\">left</code> に対して果たす役割と同様の働きをします。この"
"パラメータは、テキスト端末では意味を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-min_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">min-width</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"min_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-min_002dwidth_002c-a-frame-parameter\"></a><span><code "
