#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"This parameter specifies the desired fullscreen state of the frame after "
"invoking the <code class=\"code\">toggle-frame-fullscreen</code> command "
"(see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
