#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the width in columns of the character <var "
"class=\"var\">char</var>, if it were displayed in the current buffer (i.e., "
"taking into account the buffer&rsquo;s display table, if any; see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Display-Tables.html\">Display Tables</a>).  The width "
