# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the width in columns of the string <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, if it were displayed in the current buffer and "
"the selected window.  Optional arguments <var class=\"var\">from</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">to</var> specify the substring of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> to consider, and are interpreted as in <code "
"class=\"code\">substring</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-"
"Strings.html\">Creating Strings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、文字列 <var class=\"var\">string</var> を現在のバッファおよび選択"
"中のウィンドウに表示した場合の列数を返します。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> および <var class=\"var\">to</var> は、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> の中で考慮する部分文字列を指定し、<code "
"class=\"code\">substring</code> と同様に解釈されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Creating-Strings.html\">文字列の作成</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"The return value is an approximation: it only considers the values returned "
"by <code class=\"code\">char-width</code> for the constituent characters, "
"always takes a tab character as taking <code class=\"code\">tab-width</code> "
"columns, ignores display properties and fonts, etc.  For these reasons, we "
"recommend using <code class=\"code\">window-text-pixel-size</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">string-pixel-width</code>, described below, instead."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は近似値です。構成文字については <code class=\"code\">char-width</"
"code> が返す値のみを考慮し、常にタブ文字を <code class=\"code\">tab-width</"
"code> 列分として扱い、表示プロパティやフォントなどは無視します。こうした理由"
"から、代わりに後述する <code class=\"code\">window-text-pixel-size</code> ま"
"たは <code class=\"code\">string-pixel-width</code> の使用を推奨します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">truncate-string-to-width</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">string width &amp;optional start-column padding ellipsis "
"ellipsis-text-property</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"truncate_002dstring_002dto_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">truncate-string-to-width</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">string width &amp;optional start-column padding ellipsis "
"ellipsis-text-property</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"truncate_002dstring_002dto_002dwidth\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new string that is a truncation of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> which fits within <var class=\"var\">width</var> "
"columns on display."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、画面上の<var class=\"var\">width</var>列に収まるように<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>を切り捨てた新しい文字列を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">string</var> is narrower than <var "
"class=\"var\">width</var>, the result is equal to <var class=\"var\">string</"
"var>; otherwise excess characters are omitted from the result.  If a multi-"
"column character in <var class=\"var\">string</var> exceeds the goal <var "
"class=\"var\">width</var>, that character is omitted from the result.  Thus, "
"the result can sometimes fall short of <var class=\"var\">width</var>, but "
"cannot go beyond it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> が <var class=\"var\">width</var> よりも狭い"
"場合、結果は <var class=\"var\">string</var> と等しくなります。そうでない場合"
"は、結果から余分な文字が省略されます。<var class=\"var\">string</var> の複数"
"列文字が目標 <var class=\"var\">width</var> を超える場合、その文字は結果から"
"省略されます。したがって、結果は時に <var class=\"var\">width</var> に満たな"
"いことがありますが、それを超えることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">start-column</var> specifies the "
"starting column; it defaults to zero.  If this is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the first <var class=\"var\">start-column</"
"var> columns of the string are omitted from the result.  If one multi-column "
"character in <var class=\"var\">string</var> extends across the column <var "
"class=\"var\">start-column</var>, that character is omitted."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">start-column</var> は開始列を指定し、デフォ"
"ルトは 0 です。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、文字列の先"
"頭 <var class=\"var\">start-column</var> 列が結果から除外されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> 内の複数列にわたる文字が列 <var "
"class=\"var\">start-column</var> にまたがっている場合、その文字は除外されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">padding</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, is a padding character added at the beginning and "
"end of the result string, to extend it to exactly <var class=\"var\">width</"
"var> columns.  The padding character is appended at the end of the result if "
"it falls short of <var class=\"var\">width</var>, as many times as needed to "
"reach <var class=\"var\">width</var>.  It is also prepended at the beginning "
"of the result if a multi-column character in <var class=\"var\">string</var> "
"extends across the column <var class=\"var\">start-column</var>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">padding</var> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、結果文字列の先頭と末尾に追加されるパ"
"ディング文字であり、文字列をちょうど <var class=\"var\">width</var> 列まで拡"
"張します。結果文字列が <var class=\"var\">width</var> に満たない場合は、<var "
"class=\"var\">width</var> に達するまで必要な回数だけ、パディング文字が末尾に"
"付加されます。また、<var class=\"var\">string</var> の複数列文字が列 <var "
"class=\"var\">start-column</var> にまたがる場合は、結果文字列の先頭に付加され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it should be a string which will replace the end of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> when it is truncated.  In this case, more "
"characters will be removed from <var class=\"var\">string</var> to free "
"enough space for <var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> to fit within <var "
"class=\"var\">width</var> columns.  However, if the display width of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> is less than the display width of <var "
"class=\"var\">ellipsis</var>, <var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> will not be "
"appended to the result.  If <var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and not a string, it stands for the value returned "
"by the function <code class=\"code\">truncate-string-ellipsis</code>, "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、それは <var class=\"var\">string</var> が切り詰められた際にその末尾を置き"
"換える文字列である必要があります。この場合、<var class=\"var\">ellipsis</"
"var> が <var class=\"var\">width</var> 列に収まる十分なスペースを確保するた"
"め、<var class=\"var\">string</var> からさらに多くの文字が削除されます。ただ"
"し、<var class=\"var\">string</var> の表示幅が <var class=\"var\">ellipsis</"
"var> の表示幅よりも小さい場合、<var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> は結果に付加"
"されません。<var class=\"var\">ellipsis</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外かつ文字列でない場合、それは後述する関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">truncate-string-ellipsis</code> によって返される値を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">ellipsis-text-property</var>, if "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, means hide the excess parts of <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> with a <code class=\"code\">display</code> text "
"property (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Display-Property.html\">The <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> Property</a>) showing the ellipsis, instead of "
"actually truncating the string."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">ellipsis-text-property</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、文字列を実際に切り詰めるのではなく、省"
"略記号を表示する <code class=\"code\">display</code> テキストプロパティ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Display-Property.html\"><code class=\"code\">display</"
"code> プロパティ</a> を参照）を用いて <var class=\"var\">string</var> の超過"
"部分を隠すことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"See also the function <code class=\"code\">truncate-string-pixelwise</code> "
"for pixel-level resolution."
msgstr ""
"ピクセルレベルの解像度については、関数 <code class=\"code\">truncate-string-"
"pixelwise</code> も参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
#, no-wrap
