"値です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Size-of-Displayed-Text.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">left</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and "
"<var class=\"var\">inverse</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
