msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-skipping-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"The following two functions move point over a specified set of characters.  "
"For example, they are often used to skip whitespace.  For related functions, "
"see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Motion-and-Syntax.html\">Motion and Syntax</a>."
msgstr ""
"以下の2つの関数は、指定した文字集合上でポイントを移動させます。例えば、空白を"
"スキップする際によく使われます。関連する関数については、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Motion-and-Syntax.html\">移動と構文</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"These functions convert the set string to multibyte if the buffer is "
"multibyte, and they convert it to unibyte if the buffer is unibyte, as the "
"search functions do (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Searching-and-"
"Matching.html\">Searching and Matching</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、検索関数と同様に、バッファがマルチバイトであればセット文字列"
"をマルチバイトに変換し、バッファがユニバイトであればユニバイトに変換します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Searching-and-Matching.html\">検索とマッチング</"
"a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">skip-chars-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">character-set &amp;optional limit</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-skip_002dchars_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">skip-chars-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">character-set &amp;optional limit</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-skip_002dchars_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point in the current buffer forward, skipping over a "
"given set of characters.  It examines the character following point, then "
"advances point if the character matches <var class=\"var\">character-set</"
"var>.  This continues until it reaches a character that does not match.  The "
"function returns the number of characters moved over."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内で指定した文字セットをスキップしながら、ポイント"
"を前方に移動させます。ポイントの次の文字を確認し、その文字が <var "
"class=\"var\">character-set</var> に一致する場合にポイントを前進させます。こ"
"の処理は、一致しない文字に到達するまで繰り返されます。関数は、移動した文字数"
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">character-set</var> is a string, like the "
"inside of a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[&hellip;]</samp>&rsquo; in a "
"regular expression except that &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo; "
"does not terminate it, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; "
"quotes &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Thus, <code class=\"code\">&quot;a-zA-Z&quot;</code> skips "
"over all letters, stopping before the first nonletter, and <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;^a-zA-Z&quot;</code> skips nonletters stopping before "
"the first letter (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regular-"
"Expressions.html\">Regular Expressions</a>).  Character classes can also be "
"used, e.g., <code class=\"code\">&quot;[:alnum:]&quot;</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char-Classes.html\">Character Classes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">character-set</var> は、正規表現における &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">[&hellip;]</samp>&rsquo; の内部のような文字列ですが、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo; はそこで終了せず、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; をクォートします。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;a-zA-Z&quot;</code> はすべての文字をスキップして最初の非"
"文字の前で停止し、<code class=\"code\">&quot;^a-zA-Z&quot;</code> は非文字を"
"スキップして最初の文字の前で停止します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regular-"
"Expressions.html\">正規表現</a>を参照）。文字クラスも使用でき、例えば <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;[:alnum:]&quot;</code> などがあります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char-Classes.html\">文字クラス</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">limit</var> is supplied (it must be a number or a "
"marker), it specifies the maximum position in the buffer that point can be "
"skipped to.  Point will stop at or before <var class=\"var\">limit</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">limit</var> が指定された場合（数値またはマーカーである必要"
"があります）、これは Point がスキップ可能なバッファ内の最大位置を指定します。"
"Point は <var class=\"var\">limit</var> またはその手前で停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, point is initially located directly before the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">T</samp>&rsquo;.  After the form is evaluated, "
"point is located at the end of that line (between the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">t</samp>&rsquo; of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">hat</"
"samp>&rsquo; and the newline).  The function skips all letters and spaces, "
"but not newlines."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、ポイントは最初、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">T</samp>&rsquo; の"
"直前に位置しています。フォームが評価されると、ポイントはその行の末尾（&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">hat</samp>&rsquo; の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">t</"
"samp>& と改行の間）に位置します。この関数はすべての文字とスペースをスキップし"
"ますが、改行はスキップしません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(skip-chars-forward &quot;a-zA-Z &quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; 18\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"I read &quot;The cat in the hat&lowast;\n"
"comes back&quot; twice.\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">skip-chars-backward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">character-set &amp;optional limit</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-skip_002dchars_002dbackward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">skip-chars-backward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">character-set &amp;optional limit</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-skip_002dchars_002dbackward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Skipping-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point backward, skipping characters that match <var "
"class=\"var\">character-set</var>, until <var class=\"var\">limit</var>.  It "
"is just like <code class=\"code\">skip-chars-forward</code> except for the "
"direction of motion."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">character-set</var>に一致する文字をスキップし"
"ながら、<var class=\"var\">limit</var>までポイントを後方に移動させます。移動"
"方向を除けば、<code class=\"code\">skip-chars-forward</code>と全く同じです。"

