#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"This command sorts lines in the region between <var class=\"var\">start</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>, comparing them alphabetically by the "
"<var class=\"var\">field</var>th field of each line.  Fields are separated "
"by whitespace and numbered starting from 1.  If <var class=\"var\">field</"
"var> is negative, sorting is by the &minus;<var class=\"var\">field</var>th "
"field from the end of the line.  This command is useful for sorting tables."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">start</var>から<var class=\"var\">end</"
