"var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>, comparing them alphabetically by a "
"certain range of columns.  The column positions of <var class=\"var\">beg</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> bound the range of columns to sort on."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<var class=\"var\">beg</var>から<var class=\"var\">end</var>"
"までの範囲の行を、特定の列範囲に基づいてアルファベット順にソートします。<var "
