# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sound-Output.html
msgid ""
"To play sound using Emacs, use the function <code class=\"code\">play-sound</"
"code>.  Only certain systems are supported; if you call <code "
"class=\"code\">play-sound</code> on a system which cannot really do the job, "
"it gives an error."
msgstr ""
"Emacsで音声を再生するには、関数 <code class=\"code\">play-sound</code> を使用"
"します。サポートされているシステムは一部に限られており、実際に動作しないシス"
"テムで <code class=\"code\">play-sound</code> を呼び出すとエラーが発生しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sound-Output.html
msgid ""
"The sound must be stored as a file in RIFF-WAVE format (&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.wav</samp>&rsquo;)  or Sun Audio format (&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.au</samp>&rsquo;)."
msgstr ""
"音声は、RIFF-WAVE形式（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.wav</samp>&rsquo;）または"
"Sun Audio形式（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.au</samp>&rsquo;）のファイルとし"
"て保存する必要があります。"

