# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Sound-Output.html
msgid ""
"This function plays a specified sound.  The argument, <var "
"class=\"var\">sound</var>, has the form <code class=\"code\">(sound <var "
"class=\"var\">properties</var>...)</code>, where the <var "
"class=\"var\">properties</var> consist of alternating keywords (particular "
"symbols recognized specially) and values corresponding to them."
