# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Events.html
msgid ""
"This function inserts the special <var class=\"var\">event</var> into the "
"input event queue.  Only event types which are contained in the <code "
"class=\"code\">special-event-map</code> keymap are accepted.  As a result, "
