#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.19.4 Properties with Special Meanings<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Properties-with-Special-Meanings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.19.4 特別な意味を持つプロパティ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Properties-with-Special-Meanings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Here is a table of text property names that have special built-in meanings.  "
"The following sections list a few additional special property names that "
"control filling and property inheritance.  All other names have no standard "
"meaning, and you can use them as you like."
msgstr ""
"以下に、組み込みの特別な意味を持つテキストプロパティ名の一覧を示します。次の"
"セクションでは、塗りつぶしやプロパティの継承を制御する、その他の特別なプロパ"
"ティ名をいくつか挙げます。それ以外の名前には標準的な意味はなく、自由に使用で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Note: the properties <code class=\"code\">composition</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code>, <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">intangible</code> can also cause point to move to an "
"acceptable place, after each Emacs command.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Adjusting-Point.html\">Adjusting Point After Commands</a>."
msgstr ""
"注：プロパティ <code class=\"code\">composition</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">display</code>、<code class=\"code\">invisible</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">intangible</code> によっても、各 Emacs コマンドの実行後にポイ"
"ントを適切な位置に移動させることができます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Adjusting-Point.html\">コマンド実行後のポイント調整</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category-_0028text-property_0029\"></"
"a> <a id=\"index-property-category-of-text-character\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">category</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"property-category-of-text-character\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category-_0028text-property_0029\"></"
"a> <a id=\"index-property-category-of-text-character\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">category</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"property-category-of-text-character\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If a character has a <code class=\"code\">category</code> property, we call "
"it the <em class=\"dfn\">property category</em> of the character.  It should "
"be a symbol.  The properties of this symbol serve as defaults for the "
"properties of the character."
msgstr ""
"文字に <code class=\"code\">category</code> プロパティがある場合、それをその"
"文字の<em class=\"dfn\">プロパティカテゴリ</em>と呼びます。これはシンボルであ"
"る必要があります。このシンボルのプロパティは、文字のプロパティのデフォルトと"
"して機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-_0028text-property_0029\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-face-codes-of-text\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">face</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-face-codes-of-text\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-_0028text-property_0029\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-face-codes-of-text\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">face</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-face-codes-of-text\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">face</code> property controls the appearance of the "
"character (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">Faces</a>).  The value "
"of the property can be the following:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">face</code> プロパティは、文字の外観を制御します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">Faces</a> を参照）。このプロパティの値に"
"は、以下が指定可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"A cons cell of the form <code class=\"code\">(:filtered&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">filter</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">face-spec</var>)</code>, "
"that specifies the face given by <var class=\"var\">face-spec</var>, but "
"only if <var class=\"var\">filter</var> matches when the face is used for "
"display.  The <var class=\"var\">face-spec</var> can use any of the forms "
"mentioned above.  The <var class=\"var\">filter</var> should be of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(:window&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">param</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>)</code>, which matches for windows whose parameter "
"<var class=\"var\">param</var> is <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>.  If the variable <code class=\"code\">face-"
"filters-always-match</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, all face "
"filters are deemed to have matched."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(:filtered&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">filter</var>&nbsp;"
"<var class=\"var\">face-spec</var>)</code> 形式の cons セルで、<var "
"class=\"var\">face-spec</var> で指定されたフェイスを規定するが、これはフェイ"
"スが表示に使用される際に <var class=\"var\">filter</var> が一致する場合に限ら"
"れる。<var class=\"var\">face-spec</var> には前述のいずれの形式も使用可能であ"
"る。<var class=\"var\">filter</var> は <code class=\"code\">(:window&nbsp;"
"<var class=\"var\">param</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">value</var>)</code> 形"
"式である必要があり、これはパラメータ <var class=\"var\">param</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> から <var class=\"var\">value</var> であるウィンドウ"
"に対して一致する。変数 <code class=\"code\">face-filters-always-match</code> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、すべてのフェイスフィルタが"
"一致したものとみなされる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Font Lock mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-Mode.html\">Font "
"Lock Mode</a>) works in most buffers by dynamically updating the <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> property of characters based on the context."
msgstr ""
"Font Lockモード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-Mode.html\">Font Lock "
"Mode</a>を参照）は、ほとんどのバッファにおいて、コンテキストに基づいて文字の"
"<code class=\"code\">face</code>プロパティを動的に更新することで動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">add-face-text-property</code> function provides a "
"convenient way to set this text property.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Changing-Properties.html\">Changing Text Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">add-face-text-property</code> 関数を使用すると、このテキ"
"ストプロパティを簡単に設定できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Changing-"
"Properties.html\">テキストプロパティの変更</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dlock_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This property specifies a value for the <code class=\"code\">face</code> "
"property that Font Lock mode should apply to the underlying text.  It is one "
"of the fontification methods used by Font Lock mode, and is useful for "
"special modes that implement their own highlighting.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Precalculated-Fontification.html\">Precalculated Fontification</a>.  "
"When Font Lock mode is disabled, <code class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code> "
"has no effect."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、Font Lock モードが基となるテキストに適用すべき <code "
"class=\"code\">face</code> プロパティの値を指定します。これは Font Lock モー"
"ドで使用されるフォント化手法の一つであり、独自のハイライト機能を実装する特殊"
"なモードにおいて有用です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Precalculated-"
"Fontification.html\">事前計算済みフォント化</a>を参照してください。Font Lock "
"モードが無効な場合、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-face</code> は効果を持ちま"
"せん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-face</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-face</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This property is used instead of <code class=\"code\">face</code> when the "
"mouse pointer hovers over the text which has this property.  When this "
"happens, the entire stretch of text that has the same <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> property value, not just the character "
"under the mouse, is highlighted."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、マウスポインタがこのプロパティを持つテキスト上にあるとき"
"に、<code class=\"code\">face</code>の代わりに使用されます。このとき、マウス"
"直下の文字だけでなく、同じ<code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code>プロパティ値"
"を持つテキストの範囲全体がハイライトされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Emacs ignores all face attributes from the <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</"
"code> property that alter the text size (e.g., <code class=\"code\">:height</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">:weight</code>, and <code class=\"code\">:slant</"
"code>).  Those attributes are always the same as for the unhighlighted text."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、テキストサイズを変更する<code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code>プロパ"
"ティのすべてのフェイス属性（例：<code class=\"code\">:height</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">:weight</code>、<code class=\"code\">:slant</code>）を無視しま"
"す。これらの属性は、ハイライトされていないテキストの場合と常に同一です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"cursor_002dface_002dhighlight_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-cursor_002dface_002dhighlight_002dnonselected_002dwindow\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-cursor_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">cursor-face</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"cursor_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"cursor_002dface_002dhighlight_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-cursor_002dface_002dhighlight_002dnonselected_002dwindow\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-cursor_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">cursor-face</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"cursor_002dface-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This property is similar to <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code>, but it "
"is used when point (not the mouse) is inside text that has this property.  "
"The highlighting happens only if the mode <code class=\"code\">cursor-face-"
"highlight-mode</code> is enabled.  When the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">cursor-face-highlight-nonselected-window</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the text with this face is highlighted even if "
"the window is not selected, similarly to what <code class=\"code\">highlight-"
"nonselected-windows</code> does for the region (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Mark.html#Mark\">The Mark and the Region</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは <code class=\"code\">mouse-face</code> に似ていますが、（マ"
"ウスではなく）ポイントがこのプロパティを持つテキスト内にある場合に使用されま"
"す。ハイライトは、モード <code class=\"code\">cursor-face-highlight-mode</"
"code> が有効な場合にのみ行われます。変数 <code class=\"code\">cursor-face-"
"highlight-nonselected-window</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合、ウィンドウが選択されていなくても、このフェイスを持つテキストがハイライ"
"トされます。これは <code class=\"code\">highlight-nonselected-windows</code> "
"がリージョンに対して行う動作と同様です（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Mark.html#Mark\">The Mark and the "
"Region</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-fontified-_0028text-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">fontified</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fontified-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-fontified-_0028text-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">fontified</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"fontified-_0028text-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This property says whether the text is ready for display.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs&rsquo;s redisplay routine calls the "
"functions in <code class=\"code\">fontification-functions</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Faces.html\">Automatic Face Assignment</a>) to "
"prepare this part of the buffer before it is displayed.  It is used "
"internally by the just-in-time font locking code."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、テキストが表示可能な状態であるかどうかを示します。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、Emacs の再表示ルーチンは <code "
"class=\"code\">fontification-functions</code> の関数（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Auto-Faces.html\">自動フェイス割り当て</a> を参照）を呼び出し、バッ"
"ファのこの部分が表示される前に準備を行います。これは、ジャストインタイム・"
"フォントロックコードによって内部的に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">display</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">display</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This property activates various features that change the way text is "
"displayed.  For example, it can make text appear taller or shorter, higher "
"or lower, wider or narrow, or replaced with an image.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Display-Property.html\">The <code class=\"code\">display</code> "
"Property</a>."
msgstr ""
"このプロパティは、テキストの表示方法を変更するさまざまな機能を有効にします。"
"例えば、テキストをより高く、あるいは低く、より高く、あるいは低く、より広く、"
"あるいは狭く表示したり、画像に置き換えたりすることができます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-Property.html\"><code class=\"code\">display</"
"code> プロパティ</a>を参照してください。"

