# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If text has a string as its <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property, "
"then when you move the mouse onto that text, Emacs displays that string in "
"the echo area, or in the tooltip window (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Tooltips.html\">Tooltips</a>), after passing it through <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code>."
msgstr ""
"テキストの <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> プロパティに文字列が指定され"
"ている場合、そのテキストの上にマウスを移動させると、Emacs はその文字列を "
"<code class=\"code\">substitute-command-keys</code> 経由でエコーエリアまたは"
"ツールチップウィンドウ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Tooltips.html\">ツールチッ"
"プ</a> を参照）に表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value of the <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property is a "
"function, that function is called with three arguments, <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>, <var class=\"var\">object</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> and should return a help string or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> for none.  The first argument, <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is the window in which the help was found.  The "
"second, <var class=\"var\">object</var>, is the buffer, overlay or string "
"which had the <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> argument is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> プロパティの値が関数である場合、その関"
"数は <var class=\"var\">window</var>、<var class=\"var\">object</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> の3つの引数で呼び出され、ヘルプ文字列、または該当がな"
"い場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す必要があります。第1引数の "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> は、ヘルプが見つかったウィンドウです。第2引数"
"の <var class=\"var\">object</var> は、<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> "
"プロパティを持っていたバッファ、オーバーレイ、または文字列です。<var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> 引数は以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a buffer, <var class=\"var\">pos</var> "
"is the position in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> がバッファの場合、<var class=\"var\">pos</"
"var> はバッファ内の位置となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is an overlay, that overlay has a <code "
"class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property, and <var class=\"var\">pos</var> "
"is the position in the overlay&rsquo;s buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> がオーバーレイである場合、そのオーバーレイに"
"は <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> プロパティがあり、<var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> はオーバーレイのバッファ内における位置となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">object</var> is a string (an overlay string or a "
"string displayed with the <code class=\"code\">display</code> property), "
"<var class=\"var\">pos</var> is the position in that string."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">object</var> が文字列（オーバーレイ文字列、または <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> プロパティで表示される文字列）の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> はその文字列内の位置を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value of the <code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> property is "
"neither a function nor a string, it is evaluated to obtain a help string."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">help-echo</code> プロパティの値が関数でも文字列でもない"
"場合、評価されてヘルプ文字列が得られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"You can alter the way help text is displayed by setting the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">show-help-function</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"#Help-display\">Help display</a>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">show-help-function</code> を設定することで、ヘルプ"
"テキストの表示方法を変更できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"#Help-display\">"
"ヘルプの表示</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid "This feature is used in the mode line and for other active text."
msgstr "この機能は、モードラインやその他のアクティブなテキストで使用されます。"

