# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> property overrides what the "
"syntax table says about this particular character.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Syntax-Properties.html\">Syntax Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> プロパティは、この特定の文字に関する"
"構文テーブルの記述を上書きします。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Properties.html\">構文プロパティ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-_0028text-"
"property_0029\"></a> <a id=\"index-read_002donly-character\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">read-only</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002donly-character\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-_0028text-"
"property_0029\"></a> <a id=\"index-read_002donly-character\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">read-only</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"read_002donly-character\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If a character has the property <code class=\"code\">read-only</code>, then "
"modifying that character is not allowed.  Any command that would do so gets "
"an error, <code class=\"code\">text-read-only</code>.  If the property value "
"is a string, that string is used as the error message."
msgstr ""
"文字にプロパティ <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> が設定されている場合、"
"その文字を変更することは許可されません。そのような操作を行うコマンドは、エ"
"ラー <code class=\"code\">text-read-only</code> を返します。プロパティの値が"
"文字列である場合、その文字列がエラーメッセージとして使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Insertion next to a read-only character is an error if inserting ordinary "
"text there would inherit the <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> property "
"due to stickiness.  Thus, you can control permission to insert next to read-"
"only text by controlling the stickiness.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Sticky-Properties.html\">Stickiness of Text Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"読み取り専用文字の直後に挿入を行う際、そこに通常のテキストを挿入するとス"
"ティッキネスによって <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> プロパティが継承さ"
"れてしまう場合はエラーとなります。したがって、スティッキネスを制御すること"
"で、読み取り専用テキストの直後への挿入許可を制御できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Sticky-Properties.html\">テキストプロパティのスティッキネス</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Since changing properties counts as modifying the buffer, it is not possible "
"to remove a <code class=\"code\">read-only</code> property unless you know "
"the special trick: bind <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> to a "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value and then remove the property.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">Read-Only Buffers</a>."
msgstr ""
"プロパティの変更はバッファの変更とみなされるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外の値にバインドしてからプロパティを削除するという特殊な手法を知らない限り、"
"<code class=\"code\">read-only</code> プロパティを削除することはできません。"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">読み取り専用バッファ</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-inhibit_002dread_002donly-_0028text-property_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-inhibit_002dread_002donly-_0028text-property_0029\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-inhibit_002dread_002donly-_0028text-property_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-inhibit_002dread_002donly-_0028text-property_0029\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Characters that have the property <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</"
"code> can be edited even in read-only buffers.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Read-Only-Buffers.html\">Read-Only Buffers</a>."
msgstr ""
"プロパティ <code class=\"code\">inhibit-read-only</code> を持つ文字は、読み取"
"り専用バッファでも編集可能です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Read-Only-"
"Buffers.html\">読み取り専用バッファ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
