# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"A newline can have a <code class=\"code\">line-height</code> text or overlay "
"property that controls the total height of the display line ending in that "
"newline.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Line-Height.html\">Line Height</a>."
