# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The special properties <code class=\"code\">point-entered</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">point-left</code> record hook functions that report motion of "
"point.  Each time point moves, Emacs compares these two property values:"
msgstr ""
"特殊プロパティ <code class=\"code\">point-entered</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">point-left</code> には、ポイントの移動を報告するフック関数が登"
"録されています。ポイントが移動するたびに、Emacs はこれら2つのプロパティ値を比"
"較します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"the <code class=\"code\">point-left</code> property of the character after "
"the old location, and"
msgstr ""
"旧位置の後の文字の <code class=\"code\">point-left</code> プロパティ、および"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"the <code class=\"code\">point-entered</code> property of the character "
"after the new location."
msgstr ""
"新しい位置の後の文字の <code class=\"code\">point-entered</code> プロパティ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If these two values differ, each of them is called (if not <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>)  with two arguments: the old value of point, and "
"the new one."
msgstr ""
"これら2つの値が異なる場合、それぞれ（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限"
"り）、点の旧値と新値という2つの引数とともに呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The same comparison is made for the characters before the old and new "
"locations.  The result may be to execute two <code class=\"code\">point-"
"left</code> functions (which may be the same function) and/or two <code "
"class=\"code\">point-entered</code> functions (which may be the same "
"function).  In any case, all the <code class=\"code\">point-left</code> "
"functions are called first, followed by all the <code class=\"code\">point-"
"entered</code> functions."
msgstr ""
"新旧のロケーションより前の文字についても、同様の比較が行われます。その結果、2"
"つの<code class=\"code\">point-left</code>関数（同一の関数である場合もありま"
"す）および／または2つの<code class=\"code\">point-entered</code>関数（同一の"
"関数である場合もあります）が実行される可能性があります。いずれの場合も、まず"
"すべての<code class=\"code\">point-left</code>関数が呼び出され、続いてすべて"
"の<code class=\"code\">point-entered</code>関数が呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"It is possible to use <code class=\"code\">char-after</code> to examine "
"characters at various buffer positions without moving point to those "
"positions.  Only an actual change in the value of point runs these hook "
"functions."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">char-after</code> を使用することで、ポイントを各バッファ"
"位置に移動させることなく、さまざまなバッファ位置にある文字を調べることができ"
"ます。これらのフック関数が実行されるのは、ポイントの値が実際に変化した場合の"
"みです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Special-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">inhibit-point-motion-hooks</code> by "
"default inhibits running the <code class=\"code\">point-left</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">point-entered</code> hooks, see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"#Inhibit-point-motion-hooks\">Inhibit point motion hooks</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">inhibit-point-motion-hooks</code> はデフォルトで "
