# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"If the symbol has an Edebug specification, this <em class=\"dfn\">indirect "
"specification</em> should be either a list specification that is used in "
