"arguments\">element specification</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-def_002dedebug_002delem_002dspec\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"Define the <var class=\"var\">specification</var> to use in place of the "
