# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the symbol should be a predicate.  The predicate is called with "
"the argument, and if the predicate returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the specification fails and the argument is not instrumented."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の場合、シンボルは述語である必要があります。その述語に引数を渡して呼"
"び出し、述語が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返した場合、仕様は失敗し、引"
"数はインストルメントされません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"Some suitable predicates include <code class=\"code\">symbolp</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">integerp</code>, <code class=\"code\">stringp</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">vectorp</code>, and <code class=\"code\">atom</code>."
