# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"A vector of elements groups the elements into a single <em "
"class=\"dfn\">group specification</em>.  Its meaning has nothing to do with "
"vectors."
msgstr ""
"要素のベクトルは、要素を単一の<em class=\"dfn\">グループ指定</em>にまとめま"
"す。その意味はベクトルとは無関係です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">&quot;<var class=\"var\">string</var>&quot;</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;<var class=\"var\">string</var>&quot;</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"The argument should be a symbol named <var class=\"var\">string</var>.  This "
"specification is equivalent to the quoted symbol, <code class=\"code\">'<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var></code>, where the name of <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> is the <var class=\"var\">string</var>, but the "
"string form is preferred."
msgstr ""
"引数は <var class=\"var\">string</var> という名前のシンボルである必要がありま"
"す。この仕様は、クォートされたシンボル <code class=\"code\">'<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var></code>（ここで <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の"
"名前は <var class=\"var\">string</var> となります）と同等ですが、文字列形式が"
"推奨されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(vector <var class=\"var\">elements</var>&hellip;)</"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(vector <var class=\"var\">elements</var>&hellip;)</"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"The argument should be a vector whose elements must match the <var "
"class=\"var\">elements</var> in the specification.  See the backquote "
"example."
msgstr ""
"引数は、要素が仕様の <var class=\"var\">elements</var> と一致する必要があるベ"
