# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">&amp;name</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">&amp;name</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
msgid ""
"Extracts the name of the current defining form from the code.  It takes the "
"form <code class=\"code\">&amp;name [<var class=\"var\">prestring</var>] "
"<var class=\"var\">spec</var> [<var class=\"var\">poststring</var>] <var "
"class=\"var\">fun</var> <var class=\"var\">args...</var></code> and means "
"that Edebug will match <var class=\"var\">spec</var> against the code and "
"then call <var class=\"var\">fun</var> with the concatenation of the current "
"name, <var class=\"var\">args...</var>, <var class=\"var\">prestring</var>, "
"the code that matched <code class=\"code\">spec</code>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">poststring</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">fun</var> is absent, "
"it defaults to a function that concatenates the arguments (with an <code "
"class=\"code\">@</code> between the previous name and the new)."
msgstr ""
"コードから現在の定義形式の名前を抽出します。形式は <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;name [<var class=\"var\">prestring</var>] <var "
"class=\"var\">spec</var> [<var class=\"var\">poststring</var>] <var "
"class=\"var\">fun</var> <var class=\"var\">args...</var></code> となり、これ"
"は Edebug が <var class=\"var\">spec</var> をコードに照合し、その後、現在の名"
"前、<var class=\"var\">args...</var>、<var class=\"var\">prestring</var>、"
"<code class=\"code\">spec</code> に一致したコード、および <var "
"class=\"var\">poststring</var> を連結した文字列を <var class=\"var\">fun</"
"var> に渡すことを意味します。<var class=\"var\">fun</var> が指定されていない"
"場合は、引数を連結する関数（前の名前と新しい名前の間に <code "
"class=\"code\">@</code> を挟む）がデフォルトで使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specification-List.html
