# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"To display a space of specified width and/or height, use a display "
"specification of the form <code class=\"code\">(space . <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">props</var> is a "
"property list (a list of alternating properties and values).  You can put "
"this property on one or more consecutive characters; a space of the "
"specified height and width is displayed in place of <em class=\"emph\">all</"
"em> of those characters.  These are the properties you can use in <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var> to specify the weight of the space:"
msgstr ""
"指定した幅および／または高さのスペースを表示するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">(space . <var class=\"var\">props</var>)</code> という形式の表"
"示指定を使用します。ここで <var class=\"var\">props</var> はプロパティリスト"
"（プロパティと値が交互に並ぶリスト）です。このプロパティを1つ以上の連続する文"
"字に指定すると、それら<em class=\"emph\">すべて</em>の文字の代わりに、指定し"
"た高さと幅のスペースが表示されます。<var class=\"var\">props</var> でスペース"
"の太さを指定する際に使用できるプロパティは以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:width <var class=\"var\">width</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:width <var class=\"var\">width</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">width</var> is a number, it specifies that the space "
"width should be <var class=\"var\">width</var> times the normal character "
"width.  <var class=\"var\">width</var> can also be a <em class=\"dfn\">pixel "
"width</em> specification (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-"
"Specification.html\">Pixel Specification for Spaces</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">width</var> が数値の場合、スペースの幅を通常の文字幅の "
"<var class=\"var\">width</var> 倍に指定します。<var class=\"var\">width</"
"var> は <em class=\"dfn\">ピクセル幅</em> の指定としても記述できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-Specification.html\">スペースのピクセル指定</a> "
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:relative-width <var class=\"var\">factor</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:relative-width <var class=\"var\">factor</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"Specifies that the width of the stretch should be computed from the first "
"character in the group of consecutive characters that have the same <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> property.  The space width is the pixel width "
"of that character, multiplied by <var class=\"var\">factor</var>.  (On text-"
"mode terminals, the &ldquo;pixel width&rdquo; of a character is usually 1, "
"but it could be more for TABs and double-width CJK characters.)"
msgstr ""
"同一の <code class=\"code\">display</code> プロパティを持つ連続する文字群の先"
"頭文字から、ストレッチ幅を算出することを指定します。スペース幅は、その文字の"
"ピクセル幅に <var class=\"var\">factor</var> を乗じた値となります。（テキスト"
"モード端末では、文字の「ピクセル幅」は通常 1 ですが、TAB や倍幅の CJK 文字の"
"場合はそれ以上になることがあります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:align-to <var class=\"var\">hpos</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:align-to <var class=\"var\">hpos</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"Specifies that the space should be wide enough to reach the column <var "
"class=\"var\">hpos</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">hpos</var> is a number, it "
"is a column number, and is measured in units of the canonical character "
"width (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">Frame Font</a>).  "
"<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> can also be a <em class=\"dfn\">pixel width</"
"em> specification (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-"
"Specification.html\">Pixel Specification for Spaces</a>).  When the current "
"line is wider than the window, and is either displayed by one or more "
"continuation lines, or is truncated and possibly scrolled horizontally (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Horizontal-Scrolling.html\">Horizontal Scrolling</"
"a>), <var class=\"var\">hpos</var> is measured from the beginning of the "
"logical line, not from the visual beginning of the screen line.  This way, "
"alignment produced by <code class=\"code\">:align-to</code> is consistent "
"with functions that count columns, such as <code class=\"code\">current-"
"column</code> and <code class=\"code\">move-to-column</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Columns.html\">Counting Columns</a>).  (There&rsquo;s "
"a single exception from this rule: when <code class=\"code\">:align-to</"
"code> is used to specify whitespace of the <code class=\"code\">wrap-prefix</"
"code> variable or text property, see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Truncation.html\">Truncation</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"スペースを、列 <var class=\"var\">hpos</var> に達するのに十分な幅に指定しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> が数値の場合は列番号となり、正準文字幅（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレームフォント</a> を参照）単位で"
"測定されます。<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> は <em class=\"dfn\">ピクセル幅</"
"em> の指定も可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-Specification.html\">ス"
"ペースのピクセル指定</a> を参照）。現在の行がウィンドウよりも広く、1つ以上の"
"継続行によって表示されるか、あるいは切り捨てられて水平方向にスクロールされる"
"可能性がある場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Horizontal-Scrolling.html\">水平"
"スクロール</a> を参照）、<var class=\"var\">hpos</var> は画面行の視覚的な開始"
"位置ではなく、論理行の先頭から測定されます。これにより、<code "
"class=\"code\">:align-to</code> によって行われるアライメントが、<code "
"class=\"code\">current-column</code> や <code class=\"code\">move-to-column</"
"code> といった列をカウントする関数と整合性を保つようになります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Columns.html\">列のカウント</a> を参照）。（このルール"
"には唯一の例外があります。<code class=\"code\">:align-to</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">wrap-prefix</code> 変数またはテキストプロパティの空白の指定に"
"使用する場合です。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Truncation.html\">切り捨て</a> を"
"参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"You should use one and only one of the above properties.  You can also "
"specify the height of the space, with these properties:"
msgstr ""
"上記のプロパティのうち、いずれか1つだけを使用してください。また、以下のプロパ"
"ティでスペースの高さを指定することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">:height <var class=\"var\">height</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">:height <var class=\"var\">height</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"Specifies the height of the space.  If <var class=\"var\">height</var> is a "
"number, it specifies that the space height should be <var "
"class=\"var\">height</var> times the normal character height.  The <var "
"class=\"var\">height</var> may also be a <em class=\"dfn\">pixel height</em> "
"specification (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-"
"Specification.html\">Pixel Specification for Spaces</a>)."
msgstr ""
"スペースの高さを指定します。<var class=\"var\">height</var> が数値の場合、ス"
"ペースの高さを通常の文字高さの <var class=\"var\">height</var> 倍に指定しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">height</var> には <em class=\"dfn\">ピクセル高さ</em> "
"の指定も可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-Specification.html\">スペー"
"スのピクセル指定</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:relative-height <var class=\"var\">factor</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:relative-height <var class=\"var\">factor</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"Specifies the height of the space, multiplying the ordinary height of the "
"text having this display specification by <var class=\"var\">factor</var>."
msgstr ""
"この表示指定を持つテキストの通常の高さに <var class=\"var\">factor</var> を乗"
"じて、スペースの高さを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"If the value of <var class=\"var\">ascent</var> is a non-negative number no "
"greater than 100, it specifies that <var class=\"var\">ascent</var> percent "
"of the height of the space should be considered as the ascent of the "
"space&mdash;that is, the part above the baseline.  The ascent may also be "
"specified in pixel units with a <em class=\"dfn\">pixel ascent</em> "
"specification (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-"
"Specification.html\">Pixel Specification for Spaces</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ascent</var> の値が 100 以下の非負数である場合、スペースの"
"高さの <var class=\"var\">ascent</var> パーセントをスペースのアセント（すなわ"
"ちベースラインより上の部分）として扱うことを指定します。アセントは、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ピクセルアセント</em> 指定を用いてピクセル単位で指定することも"
"可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pixel-Specification.html\">スペースのピク"
"セル指定</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"Don&rsquo;t use both <code class=\"code\">:height</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">:relative-height</code> together."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:height</code> と <code class=\"code\">:relative-"
"height</code> を併用しないでください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">:width</code> and <code class=\"code\">:align-to</"
"code> properties are supported on non-graphic terminals, but the other space "
"properties in this section are not."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:width</code> および <code class=\"code\">:align-to</"
"code> プロパティは非グラフィカル端末でサポートされていますが、本節にあるその"
"他のスペースプロパティはサポートされていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Specified-Space.html
msgid ""
"Note that space properties are treated as paragraph separators for the "
"purposes of reordering bidirectional text for display.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">Bidirectional Display</"
"a>, for the details."
msgstr ""
"なお、表示用に双方向テキストの順序を入れ替える際、スペース属性は段落区切りと"
"して扱われます。詳細は<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">"
"双方向表示</a>を参照してください。"

