#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
msgid ""
"<span>17.1 Performance of Byte-Compiled Code<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Performance-of-Byte_002dCompiled-Code\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>17.1 バイトコンパイル済みコードのパフォーマンス<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Performance-of-Byte_002dCompiled-Code\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
msgid ""
"A byte-compiled function is not as efficient as a primitive function written "
"in C, but runs much faster than the version written in Lisp.  Here is an "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"バイトコンパイルされた関数は、C言語で書かれたプリミティブ関数ほど効率的ではあ"
"りませんが、Lispで書かれたバージョンよりははるかに高速に動作します。以下に例"
"を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun silly-loop (n)\n"
"  &quot;Return the time, in seconds, to run N iterations of a loop.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((t1 (current-time)))\n"
"    (while (&gt; (setq n (1- n)) 0))\n"
"    (float-time (time-since t1))))\n"
"&rArr; silly-loop\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(silly-loop 100000000)\n"
"&rArr; 2.236908583\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(byte-compile 'silly-loop)\n"
"&rArr; <span class=\"r\">[Compiled code not shown]</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(silly-loop 100000000)\n"
"&rArr; 0.374873305\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Speed-of-Byte_002dCode.html
msgid ""
"In this example, the interpreted code was about six times slower than the "
"byte-compiled code.  These results are representative, but actual results "
"may vary."
msgstr ""
"この例では、インタプリタ形式のコードはバイトコンパイル形式のコードに比べて約6"
"倍低速でした。これらの結果は代表的なものですが、実際の結果は異なる場合があり"
"ます。"

