#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"<span>15.4.3 Splicing into Lists<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Splicing-"
"into-Lists-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>15.4.3 リストへのスプライシング<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Splicing-into-Lists-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">:inline</code> feature lets you splice a variable "
"number of elements into the middle of a <code class=\"code\">list</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">vector</code> customization type.  You use it by adding "
"<code class=\"code\">:inline t</code> to a type specification which is "
"contained in a <code class=\"code\">list</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">vector</code> specification."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:inline</code> 機能を使用すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">list</code> または <code class=\"code\">vector</code> のカスタ"
"マイズタイプの途中に、可変個の要素を挿入できます。<code class=\"code\">list</"
"code> または <code class=\"code\">vector</code> の指定に含まれるタイプ指定に "
"<code class=\"code\">:inline t</code> を追加することで利用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"Normally, each entry in a <code class=\"code\">list</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">vector</code> type specification describes a single element "
"type.  But when an entry contains <code class=\"code\">:inline t</code>, the "
"value it matches is merged directly into the containing sequence.  For "
"example, if the entry matches a list with three elements, those become three "
"elements of the overall sequence.  This is analogous to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">,@</samp>&rsquo; in a backquote construct (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Backquote.html\">Backquote</a>)."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">list</code> または <code class=\"code\">vector</"
"code> 型指定の各エントリは、単一の要素型を記述します。しかし、エントリに "
"<code class=\"code\">:inline t</code> が含まれている場合、それに一致する値は"
"包含するシーケンスに直接マージされます。例えば、そのエントリが3つの要素を持つ"
"リストに一致する場合、それらは全体のシーケンスの3つの要素となります。これは、"
"バッククォート構文における &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,@</samp>&rsquo; と同"
"様です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Backquote.html\">バッククォート</a> を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"For example, to specify a list whose first element must be <code "
"class=\"code\">baz</code> and whose remaining arguments should be zero or "
"more of <code class=\"code\">foo</code> and <code class=\"code\">bar</code>, "
"use this customization type:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、最初の要素が <code class=\"code\">baz</code> でなければならず、残りの"
"引数が <code class=\"code\">foo</code> と <code class=\"code\">bar</code> を "
"0 個以上とするリストを指定するには、次のカスタマイズタイプを使用します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(list (const baz) (set :inline t (const foo) (const bar)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"This matches values such as <code class=\"code\">(baz)</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">(baz foo)</code>, <code class=\"code\">(baz bar)</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">(baz foo bar)</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">(baz)</code>、<code class=\"code\">(baz foo)</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">(baz bar)</code>、<code class=\"code\">(baz foo "
"bar)</code> といった値に一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-choice_002c-customization-types\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-choice_002c-customization-types\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"When the element-type is a <code class=\"code\">choice</code>, you use <code "
"class=\"code\">:inline</code> not in the <code class=\"code\">choice</code> "
"itself, but in (some of) the alternatives of the <code "
"class=\"code\">choice</code>.  For example, to match a list which must start "
"with a file name, followed either by the symbol <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> or two strings, use this customization type:"
msgstr ""
"要素タイプが <code class=\"code\">choice</code> の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">:inline</code> を <code class=\"code\">choice</code> 自体では"
"なく、<code class=\"code\">choice</code> の代替パターン（の一部）で使用しま"
"す。例えば、ファイル名で始まり、その後に記号 <code class=\"code\">t</code> ま"
"たは2つの文字列が続くリストにマッチさせるには、次のカスタマイズタイプを使用し"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(list file\n"
"      (choice (const t)\n"
"              (list :inline t string string)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"If the user chooses the first alternative in the choice, then the overall "
"list has two elements and the second element is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>.  If the user chooses the second alternative, then the overall list "
"has three elements and the second and third must be strings."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーが選択肢の1番目を選んだ場合、全体のリストは2つの要素を持ち、2番目の要"
"素は<code class=\"code\">t</code>となります。ユーザーが2番目の選択肢を選んだ"
"場合、全体のリストは3つの要素を持ち、2番目と3番目は文字列である必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splicing-into-Lists.html
msgid ""
"The widgets can specify predicates to say whether an inline value matches "
"the widget with the <code class=\"code\">:match-inline</code> element."
msgstr ""
"ウィジェットでは、インライン値が<code class=\"code\">:match-inline</code>要素"
"を持つウィジェットに一致するかどうかを判定する述語を指定できます。"

