# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions for creating a new window by <em "
"class=\"dfn\">splitting</em> an existing one.  Note that some windows are "
"special in the sense that these functions may fail to split them as "
"described here.  Examples of such windows are side windows (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Side-Windows.html\">Side Windows</a>) and atomic "
"windows (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Atomic-Windows.html\">Atomic Windows</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節では、既存のウィンドウを<em class=\"dfn\">分割</em>して新しいウィンドウを"
"作成する関数について説明します。なお、一部のウィンドウは特殊な性質を持ってお"
"り、これらの関数ではここで説明されている通りに分割できない場合があります。そ"
"のようなウィンドウの例としては、サイドウィンドウ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Side-Windows.html\">サイドウィンドウ</a>を参照）やアトミックウィンドウ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Atomic-Windows.html\">アトミックウィンドウ</a>を"
"参照）が挙げられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window size side pixelwise refer</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-split_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
