"    |__________________W1__________________|\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"A new live window <var class=\"var\">W2</var> is created, to the left of the "
"internal window <var class=\"var\">W3</var>.  A new internal window <var "
"class=\"var\">W1</var> is created, becoming the new root window."
msgstr ""
"内部ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W3</var> の左側に、新しいライブウィンドウ "
"<var class=\"var\">W2</var> が作成されます。新しい内部ウィンドウ <var "
"class=\"var\">W1</var> が作成され、新たなルートウィンドウとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"For interactive use, Emacs provides two commands which always split the "
"selected window.  These call <code class=\"code\">split-window</code> "
"internally."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブな操作用に、Emacsには選択中のウィンドウを常に分割する2つのコ"
"マンドが用意されています。これらは内部的に<code class=\"code\">split-window</"
"code>を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-right</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size window-to-split</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dright\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-right</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size window-to-split</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dright\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function splits the window <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> "
"into two side-by-side windows, putting <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</"
"var> on the left.  <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> defaults to the "
"selected window.  If <var class=\"var\">size</var> is positive, the left "
"window gets <var class=\"var\">size</var> columns; if <var "
"class=\"var\">size</var> is negative, the right window gets &minus;<var "
"class=\"var\">size</var> columns."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> を左右に並ん"
"だ2つのウィンドウに分割し、左側に <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> を"
"配置します。<var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> のデフォルト値は選択中の"
"ウィンドウです。<var class=\"var\">size</var> が正の場合、左側のウィンドウに"
"は <var class=\"var\">size</var> 列が割り当てられ、<var class=\"var\">size</"
"var> が負の場合、右側のウィンドウには &minus;<var class=\"var\">size</var> 列"
"が割り当てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-below</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size window-to-split</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dbelow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-window-below</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size window-to-split</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-split_002dwindow_002dbelow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function splits the window <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> "
"into two windows, one above the other, leaving the upper window selected.  "
"<var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> defaults to the selected window.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">size</var> is positive, the upper window gets <var "
"class=\"var\">size</var> lines; if <var class=\"var\">size</var> is "
"negative, the lower window gets &minus;<var class=\"var\">size</var> lines."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> を上下2つの"
"ウィンドウに分割し、上のウィンドウを選択した状態にします。<var "
"class=\"var\">window-to-split</var> のデフォルト値は、選択中のウィンドウで"
"す。<var class=\"var\">size</var> が正の場合、上のウィンドウには <var "
"class=\"var\">size</var> 行が割り当てられ、<var class=\"var\">size</var> が負"
"の場合、下のウィンドウには &minus;<var class=\"var\">size</var> 行が割り当て"
"られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-root-window-below</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"split_002droot_002dwindow_002dbelow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-root-window-below</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"split_002droot_002dwindow_002dbelow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function splits the whole frame in two.  The current window "
"configuration is retained on the top, and a new window is created below, "
"taking up the whole width of the frame.  <var class=\"var\">size</var> is "
"treated as by <code class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数はフレーム全体を2つに分割します。現在のウィンドウ構成は上部に保持さ"
"れ、下部にはフレームの全幅を占める新しいウィンドウが作成されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">size</var>は<code class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>と同"
"様に扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-root-window-right</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"split_002droot_002dwindow_002dright\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">split-root-window-right</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional size</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"split_002droot_002dwindow_002dright\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"This function splits the whole frame in two.  The current window "
"configuration is retained on the left, and a new window is created on the "
"right, taking up the whole height of the frame.  <var class=\"var\">size</"
"var> is treated as by <code class=\"code\">split-window-right</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数はフレーム全体を2つに分割します。現在のウィンドウ構成は左側に保持さ"
"れ、右側にはフレームの全高を占める新しいウィンドウが作成されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">size</var>は<code class=\"code\">split-window-right</code>と同"
"様に扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
