# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the "
"default), <code class=\"code\">split-window-below</code> behaves as "
"described above."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）の場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">split-window-below</code> は上述のように動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Splitting-Windows.html
msgid ""
"If it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">split-window-"
"below</code> adjusts point in each of the two windows to minimize "
"redisplay.  (This is useful on slow terminals.)  It selects whichever window "
"contains the screen line that point was previously on.  Note that this only "
"affects <code class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>, not the lower-level "
"<code class=\"code\">split-window</code> function."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<code class=\"code\">split-window-"
"below</code> は再表示を最小限に抑えるため、2つのウィンドウそれぞれのポイント"
"を調整します。（これは低速な端末で有用です。）前回ポイントがあった画面行を含"
"む方のウィンドウを選択します。なお、これは <code class=\"code\">split-window-"
"below</code> にのみ影響し、下位レベルの <code class=\"code\">split-window</"
"code> 関数には影響しません。"

