# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"Here we list the variables that hold the abbrev tables for the preloaded "
"major modes of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、Emacsのプリロード済みメジャーモードの略語テーブルを保持する変数を列"
"挙します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">global-abbrev-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"global_002dabbrev_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">global-abbrev-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"global_002dabbrev_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"This is the abbrev table for mode-independent abbrevs.  The abbrevs defined "
"in it apply to all buffers.  Each buffer may also have a local abbrev table, "
"whose abbrev definitions take precedence over those in the global table."
msgstr ""
"これはモード非依存の略記用の略記テーブルです。ここで定義される略記はすべての"
"バッファに適用されます。また、各バッファはローカルな略記テーブルを持つことが"
"でき、その略記定義はグローバルテーブルの定義よりも優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">local-abbrev-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"local_002dabbrev_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">local-abbrev-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"local_002dabbrev_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The value of this buffer-local variable is the (mode-specific)  abbreviation "
"table of the current buffer.  It can also be a list of such tables."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数の値は、現在のバッファの（モード固有の）略語テーブル"
"です。また、こうしたテーブルのリストである場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-minor-mode-table-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dminor_002dmode_002dtable_002dalist\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">abbrev-minor-mode-table-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-abbrev_002dminor_002dmode_002dtable_002dalist\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a list of elements of the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">mode</var> . <var class=\"var\">abbrev-"
"table</var>)</code> where <var class=\"var\">mode</var> is the name of a "
"variable: if the variable is bound to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value, then the <var class=\"var\">abbrev-table</var> is active, otherwise "
"it is ignored.  <var class=\"var\">abbrev-table</var> can also be a list of "
"abbrev tables."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">mode</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">abbrev-table</var>)</code> 形式の要素のリストであり、ここで "
"<var class=\"var\">mode</var> は変数名です。変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の値に束縛されている場合、<var class=\"var\">abbrev-table</var> が"
"有効となり、そうでない場合は無視されます。また、<var class=\"var\">abbrev-"
"table</var> は略語テーブルのリストである場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Abbrev-Tables.html
