# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Errors.html
msgid ""
"The message is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Args out of range</samp>&rsquo;.  "
