# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"These properties are used to record a face&rsquo;s standard, saved, "
"customized, and themed face specs.  Do not set them directly; they are "
