# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"These properties help find the definition of a symbol in the source code "
"when it might be hard to find the definition by textual search of the source "
"file, as when the symbol is defined by a macro.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Finding-Definitions.html\">Finding Definitions</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらのプロパティは、シンボルがマクロで定義されている場合など、ソースファイ"
"ルのテキスト検索では定義の特定が困難な場合に、ソースコード内でのシンボルの定"
"義を見つけるのに役立ちます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Finding-"
"Definitions.html\">定義の検索</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the named function is "
"disabled as a command.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Disabling-"
"Commands.html\">Disabling Commands</a>."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、指定された関数はコマンドとし"
"て無効になります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Disabling-Commands.html\">コマンド"
"の無効化</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">face-documentation</code>"
