"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-important_002dreturn_002dvalue-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"A non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value makes the byte compiler warn "
"about code that calls the named function without using its returned value.  "
"This is useful for functions where doing so is likely to be a mistake.  This "
"property is normally added to a function with <code class=\"code\">declare</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\">The <code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> Form</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定すると、バイトコンパイラは、指"
"定された関数を呼び出した際にその戻り値を利用しないコードに対して警告を出しま"
"す。これは、そうすることが誤りとなる可能性が高い関数において有用です。この属"
"性は通常、<code class=\"code\">declare</code> を用いて関数に追加されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\"><code class=\"code\">declare</"
"code> 形式</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">interactive-form</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">interactive-form</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The value is an interactive form for the named function.  Normally, you "
"should not set this directly; use the <code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code> special form instead.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Using-"
"Interactive.html\">Using <code class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>."
msgstr ""
"この値は、指定された関数用のインタラクティブフォームです。通常、これを直接設"
"定すべきではなく、代わりに<code class=\"code\">interactive</code>特殊フォーム"
"を使用してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Using-Interactive.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code>の使用</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">interactive-only</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">interactive-only</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the named function "
"should not be called from Lisp.  The value is an error string or the "
"function to call instead.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-"
"Commands.html\">Defining Commands</a>."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Lisp からその名前の関数を呼"
"び出すべきではありません。この値はエラー文字列、あるいは代わりに呼び出すべき"
"関数となります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Defining-Commands.html\">コマンドの"
"定義</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">menu-alias</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">menu-alias</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If non-nil, this symbol is an alias menu entry, and its own key binding "
"should not be shown.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Alias-Menu-"
