"モードの規約</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">ignored-mouse-command</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">ignored-mouse-command</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">mouse-1-menu-command</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">mouse-1-menu-command</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"These properties affect how commands bound to <code class=\"code\">down-"
