"Events.html\">タッチスクリーンイベント</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">permanent-local</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">permanent-local</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the named variable is a "
"buffer-local variable whose value should not be reset when changing major "
"modes.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Creating-"
"Buffer_002dLocal.html\">Creating and Deleting Buffer-Local Bindings</a>."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その名前付き変数はバッファ"
