"カルバインディングの作成と削除</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">permanent-local-hook</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">permanent-local-hook</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the named function "
"should not be deleted from the local value of a hook variable when changing "
"major modes.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Setting-Hooks.html\">Setting "
