"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Setting-Hooks.html\">フックの設定</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-pure-_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pure</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-pure-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-pure-_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pure</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-pure-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the named function is "
"considered to be pure (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"What-Is-a-"
"Function.html\">What Is a Function?</a>).  Calls with constant arguments can "
"be evaluated at compile time.  This may shift run time errors to compile "
"time.  This property is normally added to a function with <code "
"class=\"code\">declare</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-"
"Form.html\">The <code class=\"code\">declare</code> Form</a>)."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その名前付き関数は純粋である"
"とみなされます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"What-Is-a-Function.html\">関数とは"
"何か？</a> を参照）。定数引数による呼び出しは、コンパイル時に評価可能です。こ"
"れにより、実行時エラーがコンパイル時にシフトすることがあります。この特性は通"
"常、<code class=\"code\">declare</code> を持つ関数に追加されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Declare-Form.html\"><code class=\"code\">declare</"
"code> 形式</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">risky-local-variable</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">risky-local-variable</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the named variable is "
"considered risky as a file-local variable.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"File-Local-Variables.html\">File Local Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
