# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">page-delimiter</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"page_002ddelimiter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">page-delimiter</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-page_002ddelimiter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"This is the regular expression describing line-beginnings that separate "
"pages.  The default value is <code class=\"code\">&quot;^\\014&quot;</code> "
"(i.e., <code class=\"code\">&quot;^^L&quot;</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;^\\C-l&quot;</code>); this matches a line that starts "
"with a formfeed character."
msgstr ""
"これは、ページを区切る行頭を記述する正規表現です。既定値は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;^\\014&quot;</code>（すなわち <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;^^L&quot;</code> または <code class=\"code\">&quot;^\\C-"
"l&quot;</code>）で、フォームフィード文字で始まる行にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"The following two regular expressions should <em class=\"emph\">not</em> "
"assume the match always starts at the beginning of a line; they should not "
"use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; to anchor the match.  Most "
"often, the paragraph commands do check for a match only at the beginning of "
"a line, which means that &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; would "
"be superfluous.  When there is a nonzero left margin, they accept matches "
"that start after the left margin.  In that case, a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; would be incorrect.  However, a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; is harmless in modes where a left margin is "
"never used."
msgstr ""
"以下の2つの正規表現は、マッチが常に行頭から始まると<em class=\"emph\">想定し"
"てはならず</em>、マッチを固定するために&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo;を使用してはなりません。多くの場合、段落コマンドは行頭でのみマッ"
"チを確認するため、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;は不要となりま"
"す。左マージンが0以外の場合、左マージンの後から始まるマッチも許容されます。そ"
"の場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;は不適切です。ただし、左"
"マージンが一切使用されないモードでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo;を使用しても問題はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">paragraph-separate</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"paragraph_002dseparate\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">paragraph-separate</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-paragraph_002dseparate\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"This is the regular expression for recognizing the beginning of a line that "
"separates paragraphs.  (If you change this, you may have to change <code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> also.)  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;[&nbsp;\\t\\f]*$&quot;</code>, which matches a line "
"that consists entirely of spaces, tabs, and form feeds (after its left "
"margin)."
msgstr ""
"これは、段落を区切る行の先頭を認識するための正規表現です。（これを変更した場"
"合は、<code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> も変更する必要があるかもし"
"れません。）既定値は <code class=\"code\">&quot;[&nbsp;\\t\\f]*$&quot;</"
"code> で、これは（左マージンの後に続く）スペース、タブ、フォームフィードのみ"
"で構成される行に一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">paragraph-start</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"paragraph_002dstart\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">paragraph-start</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-paragraph_002dstart\"> &para;</a></span>"

#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"This is the regular expression for recognizing the beginning of a line that "
"starts <em class=\"emph\">or</em> separates paragraphs.  The default value "
"is <code class=\"code\">&quot;\\f\\\\|[&nbsp;\\t]*$&quot;</code>, which "
"matches a line containing only whitespace or starting with a form feed "
"(after its left margin)."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sentence-end</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sentence_002dend-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">sentence-end</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-sentence_002dend-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value should be a regular "
"expression describing the end of a sentence, including the whitespace "
"following the sentence.  (All paragraph boundaries also end sentences, "
"regardless.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、値は文末（文に続く空白文字を含"
"む）を記述する正規表現である必要があります。（なお、すべての段落境界も文末と"
"なります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"If the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, as it is by default, then "
"the function <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> constructs the "
"regexp.  That is why you should always call the function <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> to obtain the regexp to be used to "
"recognize the end of a sentence."
msgstr ""
"値がデフォルトの <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> が正規表現を構築します。そのため、文末を判"
"定するために使用する正規表現を取得するには、常に関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> を呼び出す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sentence-end</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sentence_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sentence-end</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sentence_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Standard-Regexps.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"Otherwise it returns a default value based on the values of the variables "
"<code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filling.html#Definition-of-"
"sentence_002dend_002ddouble_002dspace\">Definition of sentence-end-double-"
"space</a>), <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-space</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合はその値を返します。そうでない場合は、変"
"数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Filling.html#Definition-of-"
"sentence_002dend_002ddouble_002dspace\">sentence-end-double-space の定義</a>"
"を参照）、<code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</code>、および "
"<code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-space</code> の値に基づくデフォルト"
"値を返します。"

