#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span>4.6 Conversion of Characters and Strings<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Conversion-of-Characters-and-Strings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>4.6 文字と文字列の変換<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Conversion-of-"
"Characters-and-Strings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Conversion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-conversion-of-strings\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-conversion-of-strings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"This section describes functions for converting between characters, strings "
"and integers.  <code class=\"code\">format</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">Formatting Strings</a>) and <code "
"class=\"code\">prin1-to-string</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-"
"Functions.html\">Output Functions</a>) can also convert Lisp objects into "
"strings.  <code class=\"code\">read-from-string</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Functions.html\">Input Functions</a>) can "
"convert a string representation of a Lisp object into an object.  The "
"functions <code class=\"code\">string-to-multibyte</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">string-to-unibyte</code> convert the text representation of a "
"string (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Converting-"
"Representations.html\">Converting Text Representations</a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節では、文字、文字列、および整数間の変換を行う関数について説明します。"
"<code class=\"code\">format</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Formatting-"
"Strings.html\">文字列の書式設定</a>を参照）および<code class=\"code\">prin1-"
"to-string</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Output-Functions.html\">出力関数"
"</a>を参照）でも、Lispオブジェクトを文字列に変換できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">read-from-string</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-"
"Functions.html\">入力関数</a>を参照）では、Lispオブジェクトの文字列表現をオブ"
"ジェクトに変換できます。関数<code class=\"code\">string-to-multibyte</code>お"
"よび<code class=\"code\">string-to-unibyte</code>は、文字列のテキスト表現を変"
"換します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Converting-Representations.html\">テキス"
"ト表現の変換</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Documentation.html\">Documentation</a>, for "
"functions that produce textual descriptions of text characters and general "
"input events (<code class=\"code\">single-key-description</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">text-char-description</code>).  These are used primarily for "
"making help messages."
msgstr ""
"テキスト文字や一般的な入力イベント（<code class=\"code\">single-key-"
