# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"These are the primitive functions for searching through the text in a "
"buffer.  They are meant for use in programs, but you may call them "
"interactively.  If you do so, they prompt for the search string; the "
"arguments <var class=\"var\">limit</var> and <var class=\"var\">noerror</"
"var> are <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and <var class=\"var\">repeat</"
"var> is 1.  For more details on interactive searching, see <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Search.html#Search\">Searching and Replacement</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"これらは、バッファ内のテキストを検索するためのプリミティブ関数です。プログラ"
"ムでの使用を想定していますが、対話的に呼び出すことも可能です。その場合、検索"
"文字列の入力が求められ、引数 <var class=\"var\">limit</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">noerror</var> には <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が、<var "
"class=\"var\">repeat</var> には 1 が指定されます。対話的な検索の詳細について"
"は、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Search.html#Search\">Searching and Replacement</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"These search functions convert the search string to multibyte if the buffer "
"is multibyte; they convert the search string to unibyte if the buffer is "
"unibyte.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">Text "
"Representations</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらの検索機能は、バッファがマルチバイトの場合は検索文字列をマルチバイトに"
"変換し、バッファがユニバイトの場合は検索文字列をユニバイトに変換します。  <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-search_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-search_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function searches forward from point for an exact match for <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  If successful, it sets point to the end of the "
"occurrence found, and returns the new value of point.  If no match is found, "
"the value and side effects depend on <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> (see "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、point から前方に向かって <var class=\"var\">string</var> と完全一"
"致する箇所を検索します。一致した場合は、point を見つかった箇所の末尾に設定"
"し、point の新しい値を返します。一致しなかった場合の値および副作用は <var "
"class=\"var\">noerror</var> に依存します（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"In the following example, point is initially at the beginning of the line.  "
"Then <code class=\"code\">(search-forward &quot;fox&quot;)</code> moves "
"point after the last letter of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fox</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、pointは最初、行の先頭にあります。その後、<code "
"class=\"code\">(search-forward &quot;fox&quot;)</code>がpointを&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">fox</samp>&rsquo;の最後の文字の後に移動させます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"&lowast;The quick brown fox jumped over the lazy dog.\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(search-forward &quot;fox&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; 20\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"The quick brown fox&lowast; jumped over the lazy dog.\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">limit</var> specifies the bound to the "
"search, and should be a position in the current buffer.  No match extending "
"after that position is accepted.  If <var class=\"var\">limit</var> is "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the end of the "
"accessible portion of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">limit</var> は検索範囲の境界を指定し、現在のバッファ"
"内の位置である必要があります。その位置より後方に延びるマッチは認識されませ"
"ん。<var class=\"var\">limit</var> が省略された場合、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、バッファのアクセス可能な範囲の"
"末尾がデフォルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002dfailed\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002dfailed\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"What happens when the search fails depends on the value of <var "
"class=\"var\">noerror</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, a <code class=\"code\">search-failed</code> error "
"is signaled.  If <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and does nothing.  If <var class=\"var\">noerror</"
"var> is neither <code class=\"code\">nil</code> nor <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, then <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> moves point to the "
"upper bound and returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"検索に失敗した際に何が起こるかは、<var class=\"var\">noerror</var>の値によっ"
"て決まります。<var class=\"var\">noerror</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>の場合、<code class=\"code\">search-failed</code>エラーが通知されます。"
"<var class=\"var\">noerror</var>が<code class=\"code\">t</code>の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code>は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返し、"
"何も行いません。<var class=\"var\">noerror</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>でも<code class=\"code\">t</code>でもない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code>はポインタを上限に移動させ、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">search-backward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-search_002dbackward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">search-backward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-search_002dbackward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function searches backward from point for <var class=\"var\">string</"
"var>.  It is like <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code>, except that it "
"searches backwards rather than forwards.  Backward searches leave point at "
"the beginning of the match."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、point から後方に向かって <var class=\"var\">string</var> を検索し"
"ます。<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> と同様ですが、前方ではなく後"
"方を検索する点が異なります。後方検索を行うと、point はマッチの先頭に残りま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">word-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-word_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">word-search-forward</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"&amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-word_002dsearch_002dforward\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"This function searches forward from point for a word match for <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  If it finds a match, it sets point to the end "
"of the match found, and returns the new value of point."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポイントから前方を検索して <var class=\"var\">string</var> に一致"
"する単語を探します。一致するものが見つかった場合、ポイントをその一致箇所の末"
"尾に設定し、ポイントの新しい値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"Word matching regards <var class=\"var\">string</var> as a sequence of "
"words, disregarding punctuation that separates them.  It searches the buffer "
"for the same sequence of words.  Each word must be distinct in the buffer "
"(searching for the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ball</samp>&rsquo; does "
"not match the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">balls</samp>&rsquo;), but the "
"details of punctuation and spacing are ignored (searching for &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ball boy</samp>&rsquo; does match &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ball.  Boy!</samp>&rsquo;)."
msgstr ""
"単語マッチングでは、<var class=\"var\">string</var> を単語の並びとして扱い、"
"単語を区切る句読点は無視します。バッファ内から同一の単語列を検索します。バッ"
"ファ内では各単語が一意である必要がありますが（単語 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ball</samp>&rsquo; の検索は単語 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">balls</samp>&rsquo; とは一致しません）、句読点や空白の詳細は無"
"視されます（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ball boy</samp>&rsquo; の検索は "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ball.  Boy!</samp>&rsquo; と一致します）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"In this example, point is initially at the beginning of the buffer; the "
"search leaves it between the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">y</samp>&rsquo; and "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この例では、pointは最初バッファの先頭にあります。検索の結果、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">y</samp>&rsquo;と&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo;の"
"間に位置することになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"&lowast;He said &quot;Please!  Find\n"
"the ball boy!&quot;\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(word-search-forward &quot;Please find the ball, boy.&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; 39\n"
"\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
"He said &quot;Please!  Find\n"
"the ball boy&lowast;!&quot;\n"
"---------- Buffer: foo ----------\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">limit</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"must be a position in the current buffer; it specifies the upper bound to "
"the search.  The match found must not extend after that position."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">limit</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、それは現在のバッファ内の位置である必要があり、検索の上限を指定します。見"
"つかったマッチは、その位置を超えて広がってはなりません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then "
"<code class=\"code\">word-search-forward</code> signals an error if the "
"search fails.  If <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, then it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"instead of signaling an error.  If <var class=\"var\">noerror</var> is "
"neither <code class=\"code\">nil</code> nor <code class=\"code\">t</code>, "
"it moves point to <var class=\"var\">limit</var> (or the end of the "
"accessible portion of the buffer) and returns <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">noerror</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、"
"検索に失敗すると <code class=\"code\">word-search-forward</code> がエラーを通"
"知します。<var class=\"var\">noerror</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"の場合、エラーを通知する代わりに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"
"<var class=\"var\">noerror</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でも "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> でもない場合、ポインタを <var "
"class=\"var\">limit</var>（またはバッファのアクセス可能な部分の末尾）に移動"
"し、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is a positive number, it specifies how "
"many successive occurrences to search for.  Point is positioned at the end "
"of the last match.  If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is a negative number, "
"the search is backward and point is positioned at the beginning of the last "
"match."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が正の数の場合、連続して何回検索するかを指定し"
"ます。ポイントは最後のマッチの末尾に配置されます。<var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> が負の数の場合、検索は逆方向に行われ、ポイントは最後のマッチの先頭に配置"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-word_002dsearch_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-word_002dsearch_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"Internally, <code class=\"code\">word-search-forward</code> and related "
"functions use the function <code class=\"code\">word-search-regexp</code> to "
"convert <var class=\"var\">string</var> to a regular expression that ignores "
"punctuation."
msgstr ""
"内部的には、<code class=\"code\">word-search-forward</code> および関連関数は"
"関数 <code class=\"code\">word-search-regexp</code> を用いて、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> を句読点を無視する正規表現に変換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">word-search-forward-lax</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">string &amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-word_002dsearch_002dforward_002dlax\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">word-search-forward-lax</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">string &amp;optional limit noerror count</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-word_002dsearch_002dforward_002dlax\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/String-Search.html
msgid ""
"This command is identical to <code class=\"code\">word-search-forward</"
"code>, except that the beginning or the end of <var class=\"var\">string</"
"var> need not match a word boundary, unless <var class=\"var\">string</var> "
"begins or ends in whitespace.  For instance, searching for &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ball boy</samp>&rsquo; matches &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ball boyee</samp>&rsquo;, but does not match &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">balls boy</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは <code class=\"code\">word-search-forward</code> と同一ですが、"
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> が空白文字で始まったり終わったりしない限り、"
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> の先頭または末尾が単語境界に一致する必要はあ"
"りません。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ball boy</samp>&rsquo; を検索す"
"ると &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ball boyee</samp>&rsquo; には一致しますが、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">balls boy</samp>&rsquo; には一致しません。"

