#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<span>41.1 Functions that Create Subprocesses<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Functions-that-Create-Subprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>41.1 サブプロセスを生成する関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Functions-that-Create-Subprocesses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-create-subprocess\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-process-creation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-create-subprocess\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-process-creation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"There are three primitives that create a new subprocess in which to run a "
"program.  One of them, <code class=\"code\">make-process</code>, creates an "
"asynchronous process and returns a process object (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">Creating an Asynchronous Process</a>).  "
"The other two, <code class=\"code\">call-process</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">call-process-region</code>, create a synchronous process and "
"do not return a process object (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Synchronous-"
"Processes.html\">Creating a Synchronous Process</a>).  There are various "
"higher-level functions that make use of these primitives to run particular "
"types of process."
msgstr ""
"プログラムを実行するための新しいサブプロセスを作成するプリミティブが3種類あり"
"ます。そのうちの1つである<code class=\"code\">make-process</code>は、非同期プ"
"ロセスを作成し、プロセスオブジェクトを返します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Asynchronous-Processes.html\">非同期プロセスの作成</a>を参照）。残りの"
"2つである<code class=\"code\">call-process</code>と<code class=\"code\">call-"
"process-region</code>は、同期プロセスを作成し、プロセスオブジェクトは返しませ"
"ん（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Synchronous-Processes.html\">同期プロセスの作成"
"</a>を参照）。これらのプリミティブを利用して、特定の種類のプロセスを実行する"
"さまざまな高レベル関数が用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"Synchronous and asynchronous processes are explained in the following "
"sections.  Since the three functions are all called in a similar fashion, "
"their common arguments are described here."
msgstr ""
"同期処理と非同期処理については、以下の節で説明します。3つの関数はいずれも同様"
"の形式で呼び出されるため、ここでは共通の引数について記述します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-execute-program\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-PATH-environment-variable\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-HOME-environment-variable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-execute-program\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-PATH-environment-variable\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-HOME-environment-variable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"In all cases, the functions specify the program to be run.  An error is "
"signaled if the file is not found or cannot be executed.  If the file name "
"is relative, the variable <code class=\"code\">exec-path</code> contains a "
"list of directories to search.  Emacs initializes <code class=\"code\">exec-"
"path</code> when it starts up, based on the value of the environment "
"variable <code class=\"env\">PATH</code>.  The standard file name "
"constructs, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</"
"samp>&rsquo;, are interpreted as usual in <code class=\"code\">exec-path</"
"code>, but environment variable substitutions (&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">$HOME</samp>&rsquo;, etc.) are not recognized; use <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> to perform them (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html\">Functions that Expand "
"Filenames</a>).  <code class=\"code\">nil</code> in this list refers to "
"<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>."
msgstr ""
"いずれの場合も、関数は実行するプログラムを指定します。ファイルが見つからない"
"か、あるいは実行できない場合はエラーが通知されます。ファイル名が相対パスの場"
"合、変数 <code class=\"code\">exec-path</code> には検索対象のディレクトリ一覧"
"が格納されます。Emacs は起動時に、環境変数 <code class=\"env\">PATH</code> の"
"値に基づいて <code class=\"code\">exec-path</code> を初期化します。標準的な"
"ファイル名構成要素である &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo;、および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、<code class=\"code\">exec-path</code> 内で通常通り解釈されま"
"すが、環境変数の置換（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$HOME</samp>&rsquo; など）"
"は認識されません。置換を行うには <code class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-"
"name</code> を使用してください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Name-"
"Expansion.html\">ファイル名を展開する関数</a> を参照）。このリスト内の <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> は <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> を"
"参照します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid "Executing a program can also try adding suffixes to the specified name:"
msgstr ""
"プログラムの実行時に、指定した名前に接尾辞を追加してみることもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">exec-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"exec_002dsuffixes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">exec-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-exec_002dsuffixes-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a list of suffixes (strings) to try adding to the specified "
"program file name.  The list should include <code class=\"code\">&quot;&quot;"
"</code> if you want the name to be tried exactly as specified.  The default "
"value is system-dependent."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、指定したプログラムファイル名に追加を試みる接尾辞（文字列）のリス"
"トです。ファイル名を指定通りにそのまま試したい場合は、リストに <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;&quot;</code> を含めてください。デフォルト値はシステムに"
"よって異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">exec-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"exec_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">exec-suffixes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"exec_002dsuffixes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the connection-local value of variable <code "
"class=\"code\">exec-suffixes</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、変数 <code class=\"code\">exec-suffixes</code> の接続ローカル値を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Please note:</strong> The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">program</var> contains only the name of the program file; it "
"may not contain any command-line arguments.  You must use a separate "
"argument, <var class=\"var\">args</var>, to provide those, as described "
"below."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">ご注意：</strong> 引数 <var class=\"var\">program</"
"var> にはプログラムファイル名のみが含まれており、コマンドライン引数を含めるこ"
"とはできません。これらを指定するには、後述の通り、別途引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var> を使用する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"Each of the subprocess-creating functions has a <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> argument that specifies where the output from the program will "
"go.  It should be a buffer or a buffer name; if it is a buffer name, that "
"will create the buffer if it does not already exist.  It can also be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which says to discard the output, unless a custom "
"filter function handles it.  (See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-"
"Functions.html\">Process Filter Functions</a>, and <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Read-and-Print.html\">Reading and Printing Lisp Objects</a>.)  "
"Normally, you should avoid having multiple processes send output to the same "
"buffer because their output would be intermixed randomly.  For synchronous "
"processes, you can send the output to a file instead of a buffer (and the "
"corresponding argument is therefore more appropriately called <var "
"class=\"var\">destination</var>).  By default, both standard output and "
"standard error streams go to the same destination, but all the 3 primitives "
"allow optionally to direct the standard error stream to a different "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセスを生成する各関数には、プログラムの出力先を指定する <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> 引数があります。これはバッファまたはバッ"
"ファ名である必要があります。バッファ名を指定した場合、バッファが存在しないと"
"きは新たに作成されます。また、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すること"
"もでき、この場合はカスタムフィルタ関数で処理されない限り、出力が破棄されま"
"す。（<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">プロセスフィルタ関数</"
"a> および <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Read-and-Print.html\">Lispオブジェクトの読"
"み込みと出力</a> を参照してください。）通常、複数のプロセスが同じバッファに出"
"力を送ることは、出力がランダムに混在してしまうため避けるべきです。同期プロセ"
"スの場合は、バッファの代わりにファイルに出力を送ることができます（そのため、"
"対応する引数は <var class=\"var\">destination</var> と呼ぶのがより適切で"
"す）。デフォルトでは、標準出力と標準エラーストリームはどちらも同じ出力先に向"
"かいますが、これら3つのプリミティブはいずれも、標準エラーストリームを別の出力"
"先に任意で指定することが可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-program-arguments\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-program-arguments\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"All three of the subprocess-creating functions allow specifying command-line "
"arguments for the process to run.  For <code class=\"code\">call-process</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">call-process-region</code>, these come in the "
"form of a <code class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> argument, <var "
"class=\"var\">args</var>.  For <code class=\"code\">make-process</code>, "
"both the program to run and its command-line arguments are specified as a "
"list of strings.  The command-line arguments must all be strings, and they "
"are supplied to the program as separate argument strings.  Wildcard "
"characters and other shell constructs have no special meanings in these "
"strings, since the strings are passed directly to the specified program."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセス生成関数3つはいずれも、実行するプロセスのコマンドライン引数を指定"
"できます。<code class=\"code\">call-process</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">call-process-region</code> の場合、これらは <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;rest</code> 引数である <var class=\"var\">args</var> の形"
"式で指定されます。<code class=\"code\">make-process</code> の場合、実行するプ"
"ログラムとそのコマンドライン引数の両方が、文字列のリストとして指定されます。"
"コマンドライン引数はすべて文字列である必要があり、個別の引数文字列としてプロ"
"グラムに渡されます。これらの文字列は指定されたプログラムに直接渡されるため、"
"ワイルドカード文字やその他のシェル構文は特別な意味を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-environment-variables_002c-"
"subprocesses\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-environment-variables_002c-"
"subprocesses\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"The subprocess inherits its environment from Emacs, but you can specify "
"overrides for it with <code class=\"code\">process-environment</code>.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"System-Environment.html\">Operating System "
"Environment</a>.  The subprocess gets its current directory from the value "
"of <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>."
msgstr ""
"サブプロセスはEmacsから環境を継承しますが、<code class=\"code\">process-"
"environment</code> で上書きを指定できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"System-"
"Environment.html\">オペレーティングシステム環境</a>を参照してください。サブプ"
"ロセスは <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> の値からカレントディレ"
"クトリを取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">exec-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"exec_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">exec-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"exec_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-movemail\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-movemail\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is a string, the name of a directory that "
"contains programs that come with GNU Emacs and are intended for Emacs to "
"invoke.  The program <code class=\"code\">movemail</code> is an example of "
"such a program; Rmail uses it to fetch new mail from an inbox."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は文字列であり、GNU Emacsに付属し、Emacsが呼び出すことを想定した"
"プログラムが格納されているディレクトリ名です。プログラム <code "
"class=\"code\">movemail</code> はその一例であり、Rmail はこれを用いて受信トレ"
"イから新着メールを取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
