#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"When starting a program that is part of the Emacs distribution, you must "
"take into account that the program may have been renamed in order to comply "
"with executable naming restrictions present on the system."
msgstr ""
"Emacsディストリビューションに含まれるプログラムを起動する際は、システム上の実"
"行ファイルの命名制限に準拠するため、プログラム名が変更されている可能性がある"
"ことに留意する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subprocess-Creation.html
msgid ""
"Instead of starting <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>, for example, "
"you should specify the value of <code class=\"code\">emacsclient-program-"
"name</code> instead.  Likewise, instead of starting <code "
"class=\"command\">movemail</code>, you must start <code "
"class=\"code\">movemail-program-name</code>, and the same goes for <code "
"class=\"command\">etags</code>, <code class=\"command\">hexl</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">rcs2log</code>, and <code class=\"command\">ebrowse</code>."
msgstr ""
"例えば <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> から始めるのではなく、代わ"
"りに <code class=\"code\">emacsclient-program-name</code> の値を指定すべきで"
"す。同様に、<code class=\"command\">movemail</code> から始めるのではなく、"
"<code class=\"code\">movemail-program-name</code> から始めなければならず、"
"<code class=\"command\">etags</code>、<code class=\"command\">hexl</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">rcs2log</code>、<code class=\"command\">ebrowse</code> "
"についても同様です。"

