# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> function uses two "
"important subroutines which are sometimes useful in user Lisp code: <code "
"class=\"code\">create-file-buffer</code> and <code class=\"code\">after-find-"
"file</code>.  This section explains how to use them."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> 関数は、User Lisp のコードで時"
"折有用な 2 つの重要なサブルーチン、<code class=\"code\">create-file-buffer</"
"code> と <code class=\"code\">after-find-file</code> を使用しています。本節で"
"は、これらの使用方法について解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">create-file-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"create_002dfile_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">create-file-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"create_002dfile_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a suitably named buffer for visiting <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>, and returns it.  It uses <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> (sans directory)  as the name if that name is "
"free; otherwise, it appends a string such as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;2&gt;</samp>&rsquo; to get an unused name.  See also <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Creating-Buffers.html\">Creating Buffers</a>.  Note "
"that the <samp class=\"file\">uniquify</samp> library affects the result of "
"this function.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Uniquify.html#Uniquify\">Uniquify</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> を参照するための適切な名前の"
"バッファを作成し、それを返します。<var class=\"var\">filename</var>（ディレク"
"トリなし）という名前が未使用であればそれを使用し、そうでない場合は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;2&gt;</samp>&rsquo; のような文字列を付加して、未使用"
"の名前を生成します。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Creating-Buffers.html\">バッファ"
"の作成</a>も参照してください。なお、<samp class=\"file\">uniquify</samp> ライ"
"ブラリがこの関数の結果に影響を与える点に注意してください。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Uniquify.html#Uniquify\">Uniquify</a> を参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Please note:</strong> <code class=\"code\">create-"
"file-buffer</code> does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> associate the new buffer "
"with a file and does not select the buffer.  It also does not use the "
"default major mode."
msgstr ""

