msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">after-find-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional error warn noauto after-find-file-from-revert-"
"buffer nomodes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"after_002dfind_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the buffer major mode, and parses local variables (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-Mode.html\">How Emacs Chooses a Major "
"Mode</a>).  It is called by <code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> "
"and by the default revert function (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Reverting.html\">Reverting</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数はバッファのメジャーモードを設定し、ローカル変数を解析します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Auto-Major-Mode.html\">Emacsがメジャーモードを選択する"
"仕組み</a>を参照）。この関数は<code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code>"
"およびデフォルトのリバート関数（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reverting.html\">リ"
"バート</a>を参照）によって呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-new-file-message\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-open-error\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-new-file-message\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-open-error\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"If reading the file got an error because the file does not exist, but its "
"directory does exist, the caller should pass a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value for <var class=\"var\">error</var>.  In that case, <code "
"class=\"code\">after-find-file</code> issues a warning: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(New file)</samp>&rsquo;.  For more serious errors, the "
"caller should usually not call <code class=\"code\">after-find-file</code>."
msgstr ""
"ファイルが存在しないため読み込み時にエラーが発生したが、そのディレクトリは存"
"在する場合、呼び出し側は <var class=\"var\">error</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を渡す必要があります。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">after-find-file</code> は警告 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(New file)</samp>&rsquo; を発行します。より深刻なエラーが発生"
"した場合、通常、呼び出し側は <code class=\"code\">after-find-file</code> を呼"
"び出すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">warn</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then this function issues a warning if an auto-save file exists and is more "
"recent than the visited file."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">warn</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、"
"この関数は、自動保存ファイルが存在し、かつ閲覧中のファイルよりも新しいときに"
"警告を出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">noauto</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"that says not to enable or disable Auto-Save mode.  The mode remains enabled "
"if it was enabled before."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">noauto</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、自動保存モードを有効または無効にしないことを意味します。以前に有効になっ"
"ていた場合は、そのまま有効な状態が維持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Subroutines-of-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">after-find-file-from-revert-buffer</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means this call was from <code "
"class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code>.  This has no direct effect, but some "
"mode functions and hook functions check the value of this variable."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">after-find-file-from-revert-buffer</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、この呼び出しは <code "
"class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code> から行われたことになります。これに直接的"
"な影響はありませんが、一部のモード関数やフック関数はこの変数の値を確認しま"
"す。"

