#: build/html/elisp/Substitution.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces all occurrences of the character <var "
"class=\"var\">old-char</var> with the character <var class=\"var\">new-char</"
"var> in the region of the current buffer defined by <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>.  Both characters "
"must have the same length of their multibyte form."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> で"
"定義される現在のバッファ領域内において、文字 <var class=\"var\">old-char</"
"var> のすべての出現箇所を文字 <var class=\"var\">new-char</var> に置換しま"
"す。両文字は、マルチバイト形式において同じ長さである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
