# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Substitution.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces all occurrences of the character <var "
"class=\"var\">fromchar</var> with <var class=\"var\">tochar</var> in <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>.  By default, substitution occurs in a copy of "
"<var class=\"var\">string</var>, but if the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">inplace</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"function modifies the <var class=\"var\">string</var> itself.  In any case, "
"the function returns the resulting string."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</var> 内の文字 <var "
"class=\"var\">fromchar</var> をすべて <var class=\"var\">tochar</var> に置換"
"します。デフォルトでは <var class=\"var\">string</var> のコピーに対して置換が"
"行われますが、オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">inplace</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、関数は <var class=\"var\">string</var> "
"自体を変更します。いずれの場合も、関数は結果の文字列を返します。"

