# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
msgid ""
"In the previous section, the definition of <code class=\"code\">for</code> "
"was fixed as follows to make the expansion evaluate the macro arguments the "
"proper number of times:"
msgstr ""
