#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro for (var from init to final do &amp;rest body)\n"
"  &quot;Execute a simple for loop: (for i from 1 to 10 do (print i)).&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  `(let ((,var ,init)\n"
"         (max ,final))\n"
"     (while (&lt;= ,var max)\n"
"       ,@body\n"
"       (inc ,var))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
msgid ""
"The new definition of <code class=\"code\">for</code> has a new problem: it "
"introduces a local variable named <code class=\"code\">max</code> which the "
"user does not expect.  This causes trouble in examples such as the following:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">for</code> の新しい定義には新たな問題があります。それ"
"は、ユーザーが想定していない <code class=\"code\">max</code> という名前のロー"
"カル変数を導入することです。これにより、以下のような例で問題が生じます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((max 0))\n"
"  (for x from 0 to 10 do\n"
"    (let ((this (frob x)))\n"
"      (if (&lt; max this)\n"
"          (setq max this)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
msgid ""
"The references to <code class=\"code\">max</code> inside the body of the "
"<code class=\"code\">for</code>, which are supposed to refer to the "
"user&rsquo;s binding of <code class=\"code\">max</code>, really access the "
"binding made by <code class=\"code\">for</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">for</code>のボディ内にある<code class=\"code\">max</"
"code>への参照は、本来ユーザーによる<code class=\"code\">max</code>のバインド"
"を指すはずですが、実際には<code class=\"code\">for</code>によるバインドにアク"
"セスしています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
msgid ""
"The way to correct this is to use an uninterned symbol instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">max</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-"
"Symbols.html\">Creating and Interning Symbols</a>).  The uninterned symbol "
"can be bound and referred to just like any other symbol, but since it is "
"created by <code class=\"code\">for</code>, we know that it cannot already "
"appear in the user&rsquo;s program.  Since it is not interned, there is no "
"way the user can put it into the program later.  It will never appear "
"anywhere except where put by <code class=\"code\">for</code>.  Here is a "
"definition of <code class=\"code\">for</code> that works this way:"
msgstr ""
"これを修正するには、<code class=\"code\">max</code> の代わりにアンインターニ"
"ングされたシンボルを使用します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-"
"Symbols.html\">シンボルの作成とインターニング</a>を参照）。アンインターニング"
"されたシンボルは、他のシンボルと同様にバインドや参照が可能ですが、<code "
"class=\"code\">for</code> によって作成されるため、ユーザーのプログラム内に既"
"に存在することはないと分かります。インターニングされていないため、ユーザーが"
"後からこれをプログラムに組み込む方法はありません。<code class=\"code\">for</"
"code> によって配置された場所以外には、決して現れません。以下に、この方式で動"
"作する <code class=\"code\">for</code> の定義を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defmacro for (var from init to final do &amp;rest body)\n"
"  &quot;Execute a simple for loop: (for i from 1 to 10 do (print i)).&quot;\n"
"  (let ((tempvar (make-symbol &quot;max&quot;)))\n"
"    `(let ((,var ,init)\n"
"           (,tempvar ,final))\n"
"       (while (&lt;= ,var ,tempvar)\n"
"         ,@body\n"
"         (inc ,var)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Surprising-Local-Vars.html
msgid ""
"This creates an uninterned symbol named <code class=\"code\">max</code> and "
"puts it in the expansion instead of the usual interned symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">max</code> that appears in expressions ordinarily."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">max</code> という名前のアンインターニングさ"
"れたシンボルが生成され、通常の式に現れる一般的なインターニング済みシンボル "
"<code class=\"code\">max</code> の代わりに展開に組み込まれます。"

