#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span>43.2.2 Suspending Emacs<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Suspending-"
"Emacs-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>43.2.2 Emacsの一時停止<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Suspending-"
"Emacs-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-suspending-Emacs\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-suspending-Emacs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"On text terminals, it is possible to <em class=\"dfn\">suspend Emacs</em>, "
"which means stopping Emacs temporarily and returning control to its superior "
"process, which is usually the shell.  This allows you to resume editing "
"later in the same Emacs process, with the same buffers, the same kill ring, "
"the same undo history, and so on.  To resume Emacs, use the appropriate "
"command in the parent shell&mdash;most likely <code class=\"code\">fg</code>."
msgstr ""
"テキスト端末では、<em class=\"dfn\">Emacsをサスペンド</em>することが可能で"
"す。これは、Emacsを一時的に停止し、制御を上位プロセス（通常はシェル）に戻すこ"
"とを意味します。これにより、同じEmacsプロセス内で、同じバッファ、同じキルリン"
"グ、同じアンドゥ履歴などを保持したまま、後で編集を再開できます。Emacsを再開す"
"るには、親シェルで適切なコマンド（おそらく <code class=\"code\">fg</code>）を"
"使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-controlling-terminal\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-controlling-terminal\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Suspending works only on a terminal device from which the Emacs session was "
"started.  We call that device the <em class=\"dfn\">controlling terminal</"
"em> of the session.  Suspending is not allowed if the controlling terminal "
"is a graphical terminal.  Suspending is usually not relevant in graphical "
"environments, since you can simply switch to another application without "
"doing anything special to Emacs."
msgstr ""
"サスペンドは、Emacsセッションを開始した端末デバイス上でのみ可能です。このデバ"
"イスを、セッションの<em class=\"dfn\">制御端末</em>と呼びます。制御端末がグラ"
"フィカル端末である場合、サスペンドは許可されません。グラフィカル環境では、"
"Emacsに特別な操作を加えることなく単に別のアプリケーションに切り替えられるた"
"め、通常サスペンドは関係ありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SIGTSTP\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SIGTSTP\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Some operating systems (those without <code class=\"code\">SIGTSTP</code>, "
"or MS-DOS) do not support suspension of jobs; on these systems, suspension "
"actually creates a new shell temporarily as a subprocess of Emacs.  Then you "
"would exit the shell to return to Emacs."
msgstr ""
"一部のオペレーティングシステム（<code class=\"code\">SIGTSTP</code> を持たな"
"いものや MS-DOS）では、ジョブの中断をサポートしていません。こうしたシステムで"
"は、中断を行うと、実際には Emacs のサブプロセスとして一時的に新しいシェルが生"
"成されます。その後、そのシェルを終了することで Emacs に戻ることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">suspend-emacs</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-suspend_002demacs\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">suspend-emacs</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-suspend_002demacs\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This function stops Emacs and returns control to the superior process.  If "
"and when the superior process resumes Emacs, <code class=\"code\">suspend-"
"emacs</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to its caller in Lisp."
msgstr ""
"この関数はEmacsを停止し、制御を上位プロセスに戻します。上位プロセスがEmacsを"
"再開すると、<code class=\"code\">suspend-emacs</code>はLispの呼び出し元に"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This function works only on the controlling terminal of the Emacs session; "
"to relinquish control of other tty devices, use <code class=\"code\">suspend-"
"tty</code> (see below).  If the Emacs session uses more than one terminal, "
"you must delete the frames on all the other terminals before suspending "
"Emacs, or this function signals an error.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple Terminals</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数はEmacsセッションの制御端末でのみ動作します。他のttyデバイスの制御権"
"を解放するには、<code class=\"code\">suspend-tty</code>を使用してください（後"
"述）。Emacsセッションで複数の端末を使用している場合は、Emacsをサスペンドする"
"前に、他のすべての端末のフレームを削除する必要があります。そうしないと、この"
"関数はエラーを返します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複"
"数の端末</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">string</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"its characters are sent to Emacs&rsquo;s superior shell, to be read as "
"terminal input.  However, this action is skipped if Emacs is not running "
"interactively on a terminal, or if stuffing characters into the terminal "
"input requires special privileges or is not supported on this platform."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、その文字は Emacs の上位シェルに送られ、ターミナル入力として読み込まれま"
"す。ただし、Emacs がターミナル上で対話的に動作していない場合や、ターミナル入"
"力への文字の投入に特別な権限が必要な場合、あるいはこのプラットフォームでサ"
"ポートされていない場合は、この処理はスキップされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Before suspending, <code class=\"code\">suspend-emacs</code> runs the normal "
"hook <code class=\"code\">suspend-hook</code>.  After the user resumes "
"Emacs, <code class=\"code\">suspend-emacs</code> runs the normal hook <code "
"class=\"code\">suspend-resume-hook</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>."
msgstr ""
"サスペンド前には、<code class=\"code\">suspend-emacs</code> が通常のフック "
"<code class=\"code\">suspend-hook</code> を実行します。ユーザーが Emacs を再"
"開した後は、<code class=\"code\">suspend-emacs</code> が通常のフック <code "
"class=\"code\">suspend-resume-hook</code> を実行します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Hooks.html\">フック</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"The next redisplay after resumption will redraw the entire screen, unless "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">no-redraw-on-reenter</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Refresh-"
"Screen.html\">Refreshing the Screen</a>."
msgstr ""
"再開後の次の再表示では、変数 <code class=\"code\">no-redraw-on-reenter</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限り、画面全体が再描画されま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Refresh-Screen.html\">画面の更新</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid "Here is an example of how you could use these hooks:"
msgstr "これらのフックの使用例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'suspend-hook\n"
"          (lambda () (or (y-or-n-p &quot;Really suspend?&quot;)\n"
"                         (error &quot;Suspend canceled&quot;))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'suspend-resume-hook (lambda () (message &quot;Resumed!&quot;)\n"
"                                 (sit-for 2)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Here is what you would see upon evaluating <code class=\"code\">(suspend-"
"emacs)</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(suspend-emacs)</code>を評価すると、以下のように表示され"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
"Really suspend? <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>\n"
"---------- Buffer: Minibuffer ----------\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Parent Shell ----------\n"
"bash$ fg\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---------- Echo Area ----------\n"
"Resumed!\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"Note that on some operating systems, sending <var class=\"var\">string</var> "
"to the Emacs parent shell might require special privileges, in which case it "
"might silently fail to send <var class=\"var\">string</var> to the shell for "
"execution.  On other systems this is not supported, and Emacs will signal an "
"error if you try.  Also, <var class=\"var\">string</var> might not be "
"echoed, even if it is executed by the shell.  So we don&rsquo;t recommend "
"relying on this feature in portable Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"なお、一部のオペレーティングシステムでは、Emacsの親シェルに <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> を送信する際に特別な権限が必要となる場合があり、そ"
"の場合、シェルへの実行指示として <var class=\"var\">string</var> がサイレント"
"に失敗することがあります。他のシステムではこれはサポートされておらず、実行を"
"試みるとEmacsがエラーを通知します。また、<var class=\"var\">string</var> は"
"シェルによって実行されたとしても、エコーされない場合があります。したがって、"
"移植性の高いLispプログラムにおいて、この機能に依存することは推奨しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">suspend-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"suspend_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">suspend-hook</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"suspend_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid "This variable is a normal hook that Emacs runs before suspending."
msgstr "この変数は、Emacsがサスペンドする前に実行する通常のフックです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
