"suspend_002dresume_002dhook\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspending-Emacs.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a normal hook that Emacs runs on resuming after a "
