# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspicious-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function is the high-level interface function that packages should "
"use.  It respects the <code class=\"code\">textsec-check</code> user option, "
"which allows the user to disable the checks."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、パッケージが使用すべき高レベルインターフェース関数です。<code "
"class=\"code\">textsec-check</code> ユーザーオプションに対応しており、これに"
"よりユーザーはチェックを無効化できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspicious-Text.html
msgid ""
"This function checks <var class=\"var\">object</var> (whose data type "
"depends on <var class=\"var\">type</var>) to see if it looks suspicious when "
"interpreted as a thing of <var class=\"var\">type</var>.  The available "
"types and the corresponding <var class=\"var\">object</var> data types are:"
