#: build/html/elisp/Suspicious-Text.html
msgid ""
"Check whether a domain (e.g., &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">www.gnu.org</"
"samp>&rsquo; looks suspicious.  <var class=\"var\">object</var> should be a "
