# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Suspicious-Text.html
msgid ""
"Check whether an <abbr class=\"acronym\">HTML</abbr> link (e.g., &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;a href='http://gnu.org'&gt;fsf.org&lt;/a&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo; looks suspicious.  In this case, <var class=\"var\">object</"
"var> should be a <code class=\"code\">cons</code> cell where the <code "
"class=\"code\">car</code> is the <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr> string, "
"and the <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> is the link text.  The link is "
"deemed suspicious if the link text contains a domain name, and that domain "
"name points to something other than the <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">HTML</abbr>リンク（例：&lsquo;<samp "
