#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function displays the buffer specified by <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-"
"name</var> in a new frame.  It uses the function <code class=\"code\">pop-to-"
"buffer</code> internally (see below)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> で指定されたバッファを新"
"しいフレームに表示します。内部的には関数 <code class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</"
"code> を使用しています（後述）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If the specified buffer is already displayed in another window, in any frame "
"on the current terminal, this switches to that window instead of creating a "
"new frame.  However, the selected window is never used for this."
msgstr ""
"指定したバッファが既に別のウィンドウ（現在の端末の任意のフレーム内）に表示さ"
"れている場合、新しいフレームを作成する代わりにそのウィンドウに切り替わりま"
"す。ただし、この際に選択中のウィンドウが使用されることはありません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The above commands use the function <code class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</"
"code>, which flexibly displays a buffer in some window and selects that "
"window for editing.  In turn, <code class=\"code\">pop-to-buffer</code> uses "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> for displaying the buffer.  "
"Hence, all the variables affecting <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code> will affect it as well.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Choosing-"
"Window.html\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>, for the "
"documentation of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pop-to-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-"
"name &amp;optional action norecord</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dto_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">pop-to-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">buffer-or-"
"name &amp;optional action norecord</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pop_002dto_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"This function makes <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> the current "
"buffer and displays it in some window, preferably not the window currently "
"selected.  It then selects the displaying window.  If that window is on a "
"different graphical frame, that frame is given input focus if possible (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">Input Focus</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> を現在のバッファとし、それ"
"を何らかのウィンドウ（できれば現在選択されているウィンドウではないもの）に表"
"示します。その後、表示中のウィンドウを選択します。そのウィンドウが別のグラ"
"フィカルフレームにある場合は、可能であればそのフレームに入力フォーカスが与え"
"られます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Focus.html\">入力フォーカス</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it defaults to the buffer returned by <code class=\"code\">other-"
"buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The Buffer "
"List</a>).  If <var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> is a string that is "
"not the name of any existing buffer, this function creates a new buffer with "
"that name; the new buffer&rsquo;s major mode is determined by the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">major-mode</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-"
"Modes.html\">Major Modes</a>).  In any case, that buffer is made current and "
"returned, even when no suitable window was found to display it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ある場合、<code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> が返すバッファがデフォルト"
"となります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">バッファリスト</a> "
"を参照）。<var class=\"var\">buffer-or-name</var> が既存のどのバッファの名前"
"でもない文字列である場合、この関数はその名前で新しいバッファを作成します。新"
"しいバッファのメジャーモードは変数 <code class=\"code\">major-mode</code> に"
"よって決定されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Modes.html\">メジャーモー"
"ド</a> を参照）。いずれの場合も、表示に適したウィンドウが見つからなかったとし"
"ても、そのバッファがカレント状態となり、返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">action</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"it should be a display action to pass to <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">Choosing "
"a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a>).  Alternatively, a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, non-list value means to pop to a window other "
"than the selected one&mdash;even if the buffer is already displayed in the "
"selected window."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">action</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、それは <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> に渡す表示アクションで"
"あるべきです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用"
"のウィンドウの選択</a> を参照）。あるいは、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"もリストでもない値は、たとえバッファがすでに選択済みのウィンドウに表示されて"
"いても、選択済み以外のウィンドウにポップすることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Switching-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code>, this function updates the "
"buffer list unless <var class=\"var\">norecord</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code>と同様に、この関数は<var "
"class=\"var\">norecord</var>がnon-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない限り、"
"バッファリストを更新します。"

