"href=\"#Accessing-Symbol-Properties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid "The following functions can be used to access symbol properties."
msgstr "シンボルのプロパティにアクセスするには、以下の関数を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol property</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">get</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol property</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-get\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value of the property named <var "
"class=\"var\">property</var> in <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>&rsquo;s "
"property list.  If there is no such property, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Thus, there is no distinction between a value of "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and the absence of the property."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>のプロパティリストにある<var "
"class=\"var\">property</var>という名前のプロパティの値を返します。そのような"
"プロパティが存在しない場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。した"
"がって、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の値とプロパティが存在しないこととの間"
"に区別はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"The name <var class=\"var\">property</var> is compared with the existing "
"property names using <code class=\"code\">eq</code>, so any object is a "
"legitimate property."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">property</var> という名前は <code class=\"code\">eq</"
"code> を用いて既存のプロパティ名と比較されるため、任意のオブジェクトが有効な"
"プロパティとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid "See <code class=\"code\">put</code> for an example."
msgstr "例については <code class=\"code\">put</code> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">put</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol property value</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-put\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">put</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol property value</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-put\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"This function puts <var class=\"var\">value</var> onto <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>&rsquo;s property list under the property name "
"<var class=\"var\">property</var>, replacing any previous property value.  "
"The <code class=\"code\">put</code> function returns <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>のプロパティリストのプロパティ名"
"<var class=\"var\">property</var>の下に<var class=\"var\">value</var>を格納"
"し、それまでのプロパティ値を上書きします。<code class=\"code\">put</code>関数"
"は<var class=\"var\">value</var>を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(put 'fly 'verb 'transitive)\n"
"     &rArr;'transitive\n"
"(put 'fly 'noun '(a buzzing little bug))\n"
"     &rArr; (a buzzing little bug)\n"
"(get 'fly 'verb)\n"
"     &rArr; transitive\n"
"(symbol-plist 'fly)\n"
"     &rArr; (verb transitive noun (a buzzing little bug))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-plist</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dplist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">symbol-plist</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-symbol_002dplist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the property list of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> のプロパティリストを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setplist</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol plist</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setplist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">setplist</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol plist</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-setplist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"This function sets <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>&rsquo;s property list to "
"<var class=\"var\">plist</var>.  Normally, <var class=\"var\">plist</var> "
"should be a well-formed property list, but this is not enforced.  The return "
"value is <var class=\"var\">plist</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>のプロパティリストを<var "
"class=\"var\">plist</var>に設定します。通常、<var class=\"var\">plist</var>は"
"正しく形式化されたプロパティリストである必要がありますが、これは強制されませ"
"ん。戻り値は<var class=\"var\">plist</var>です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setplist 'foo '(a 1 b (2 3) c nil))\n"
"     &rArr; (a 1 b (2 3) c nil)\n"
"(symbol-plist 'foo)\n"
"     &rArr; (a 1 b (2 3) c nil)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"For symbols in special obarrays, which are not used for ordinary purposes, "
"it may make sense to use the property list cell in a nonstandard fashion; in "
"fact, the abbrev mechanism does so (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrevs.html\">Abbrevs and Abbrev Expansion</a>)."
msgstr ""
"通常の用途では用いられない特殊なオブアレイ内のシンボルについては、プロパティ"
"リストセルを非標準的な方法で使用することが妥当な場合があります。実際、abbrev"
"機構はまさにそのように動作しています（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrevs.html\">AbbrevsとAbbrev Expansion</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
msgid ""
"You could define <code class=\"code\">put</code> in terms of <code "
