"follows:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">put</code>を<code class=\"code\">setplist</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">plist-put</code>を用いて、次のように定義できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Symbol-Plists.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun put (symbol prop value)\n"
