"This function sets <var class=\"var\">property</var> of <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> to <var class=\"var\">value</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> should be a symbol.  This function is preferred "
"to calling <code class=\"code\">put</code> for setting properties of a "
"function, because it will allow us some day to implement remapping of old "
"properties to new ones."
msgstr ""
