# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Synchronous-Processes.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of the use of <code class=\"code\">call-process</code>, "
"as used to be found in the definition of the <code class=\"code\">insert-"
"directory</code> function:"
msgstr ""
"かつて <code class=\"code\">insert-directory</code> 関数の定義に見られた "
