"Font-Lock-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.7.8 構文用Font Lock<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Syntactic-"
"Font-Lock-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntactic-font-lock\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntactic-font-lock\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Syntactic fontification uses a syntax table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Syntax-Tables.html\">Syntax Tables</a>) to find and highlight "
"syntactically relevant text.  If enabled, it runs prior to search-based "
"fontification.  The variable <code class=\"code\">font-lock-syntactic-face-"
"function</code>, documented below, determines which syntactic constructs to "
"highlight.  There are several variables that affect syntactic fontification; "
"you should set them by means of <code class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-Basics.html\">Font Lock "
"Basics</a>)."
msgstr ""
"構文ベースのフォント化では、構文テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Tables.html\">構文テーブル</a>を参照）を使用して、構文的に関連のあるテキスト"
"を特定し、ハイライトします。有効になっている場合は、検索ベースのフォント化よ"
"りも前に実行されます。以下で説明する変数 <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"syntactic-face-function</code> は、どの構文構造をハイライトするかを決定しま"
"す。構文ベースのフォント化に影響を与える変数がいくつかあり、これらは <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</code> を用いて設定する必要があります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-Basics.html\">Font Lock の基本</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Whenever Font Lock mode performs syntactic fontification on a stretch of "
"text, it first calls the function specified by <code class=\"code\">syntax-"
"propertize-function</code>.  Major modes can use this to apply <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> text properties to override the "
"buffer&rsquo;s syntax table in special cases.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Syntax-Properties.html\">Syntax Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"Font Lockモードがテキストの一部分に構文的なフォント化を行う際は、まず<code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-propertize-function</code>で指定された関数を呼び出しま"
"す。メジャーモードはこれを利用して、特殊なケースにおいてバッファの構文テーブ"
"ルを上書きする<code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code>テキストプロパティを適"
"用できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-Properties.html\">構文プロパティ"
"</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-keywords-only</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dkeywords_002donly\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-keywords-only</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dkeywords_002donly\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Font "
"Lock does not do syntactic fontification, only search-based fontification "
"based on <code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code>; this will usually "
"have the effect of not fontifying comments and strings.  This variable is "
"normally set by Font Lock mode based on the <var class=\"var\">keywords-"
"only</var> element in <code class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</code>.  If "
"the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Font Lock will call <code "
"class=\"code\">jit-lock-register</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-"
"Font-Lock-Variables.html\">Other Font Lock Variables</a>) to set up for "
"automatic refontification of buffer text following a modified line to "
"reflect the new syntactic context due to the change."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Font Lock は構文"
"ベースのフォント化を行わず、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> に"
"基づく検索ベースのフォント化のみを行います。これにより、通常はコメントや文字"
"列がフォント化されないことになります。この変数は通常、Font Lock モードによっ"
"て <code class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</code> 内の <var "
"class=\"var\">keywords-only</var> 要素に基づいて設定されます。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、Font Lock は <code class=\"code\">jit-lock-"
"register</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Font-Lock-Variables.html\">"
"その他の Font Lock 変数</a> を参照）を呼び出し、変更によって生じた新しい構文"
"コンテキストを反映させるため、変更された行に続くバッファテキストの自動再フォ"
"ント化の設定を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"To use only syntactic fontification, both this variable and <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-keywords</code> should be set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-"
"Basics.html\">Font Lock Basics</a>)."
msgstr ""
"構文的なフォント化のみを使用する場合は、この変数と <code class=\"code\">font-"
"lock-keywords</code> の両方を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してくだ"
"さい（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock-Basics.html\">Font Lock の基本</a> "
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-syntax-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dsyntax_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-syntax-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dsyntax_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This variable holds the syntax table to use for fontification of comments "
"and strings.  It is normally set by Font Lock mode based on the <var "
"class=\"var\">syntax-alist</var> element in <code class=\"code\">font-lock-"
"defaults</code>.  If this value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"syntactic fontification uses the buffer&rsquo;s syntax table (the value "
"returned by the function <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code>; see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-Functions.html\">Syntax Table Functions</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、コメントや文字列のフォント化に使用する構文テーブルが格納されま"
"す。通常、Font Lockモードによって <code class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</"
"code> 内の <var class=\"var\">syntax-alist</var> 要素に基づいて設定されます。"
"この値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、構文フォント化にはバッファの"
"構文テーブル（関数 <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> が返す値。<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-Functions.html\">構文テーブル関数</a> を"
"参照）が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-syntactic-face-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dsyntactic_002dface_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">font-lock-syntactic-face-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dlock_002dsyntactic_002dface_002dfunction\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it should be a "
"function to determine which face to use for a given syntactic element (a "
"string or a comment)."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、指定された構文要素（文"
"字列またはコメント）に対してどの面を使用するかを決定する関数である必要があり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"The function is called with one argument, the parse state at point returned "
"by <code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code>, and should return a "
"face.  The default value returns <code class=\"code\">font-lock-comment-"
"face</code> for comments and <code class=\"code\">font-lock-string-face</"
"code> for strings (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces-for-Font-"
"Lock.html\">Faces for Font Lock</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">parse-partial-sexp</code> が返す位置における"
"パース状態を1つの引数として受け取り、フェイスを返す必要があります。デフォルト"
"値では、コメントに対しては <code class=\"code\">font-lock-comment-face</"
"code> を、文字列に対しては <code class=\"code\">font-lock-string-face</code> "
"を返します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces-for-Font-Lock.html\">Faces for "
"Font Lock</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This variable is normally set through the &ldquo;other&rdquo; elements in "
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</code>:"
msgstr ""
"この変数は通常、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-defaults</code>内の「other」要"
"素を通じて設定されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntactic-Font-Lock.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq-local font-lock-defaults\n"
"            `(,python-font-lock-keywords\n"
"              nil nil nil\n"
"              (font-lock-syntactic-face-function\n"
"               . python-font-lock-syntactic-face-function)))\n"
msgstr ""

