msgstr ""
"<span>19.3 不正なLisp構文のデバッグ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Debugging-Invalid-Lisp-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Errors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-debugging-invalid-Lisp-syntax\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-debugging-invalid-Lisp-syntax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Errors.html
msgid ""
"The Lisp reader reports invalid syntax, but cannot say where the real "
"problem is.  For example, the error &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">End of file "
"during parsing</samp>&rsquo; in evaluating an expression indicates an excess "
"of open parentheses (or square brackets).  The reader detects this imbalance "
"at the end of the file, but it cannot figure out where the close parenthesis "
"should have been.  Likewise, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Invalid read "
"syntax: &quot;)&quot;</samp>&rsquo; indicates an excess close parenthesis or "
"missing open parenthesis, but does not say where the missing parenthesis "
"belongs.  How, then, to find what to change?"
msgstr ""
"Lispリーダーは構文エラーを報告しますが、実際の問題がどこにあるかまでは特定で"
"きません。例えば、式の評価におけるエラー &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">End of "
"file during parsing</samp>&rsquo; は、開き括弧（または角括弧）が多すぎること"
"を示しています。リーダーはファイルの末尾でこの不均衡を検出しますが、閉じ括弧"
"がどこにあるべきかまでは判断できません。同様に、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Invalid read syntax: &quot;)&quot;</samp>&rsquo; は閉じ括弧の"
"過剰または開き括弧の欠落を示しますが、欠落している括弧がどこにあるべきかまで"
"は示しません。では、何を修正すべきかをどうやって見つければよいのでしょうか。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Errors.html
msgid ""
"If the problem is not simply an imbalance of parentheses, a useful technique "
"is to try <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</"
"code>, see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Moving-by-Defuns.html#Moving-by-Defuns\">Moving "
"by Defuns</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>) at the "
"beginning of each defun, and see if it goes to the place where that defun "
"appears to end.  If it does not, there is a problem in that defun."
msgstr ""
"問題が単なる括弧のバランスの崩れではない場合、各defunの冒頭に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code>、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Moving-by-"
"Defuns.html#Moving-by-Defuns\">Moving by Defuns</a> を参照) を試して、その"
"defunが終わると思われる箇所まで移動できるか確認するという手法が有効です。もし"
"移動できなければ、そのdefunに問題があることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Errors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unbalanced-parentheses\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parenthesis-mismatch_002c-debugging\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unbalanced-parentheses\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parenthesis-mismatch_002c-debugging\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Errors.html
msgid ""
"However, unmatched parentheses are the most common syntax errors in Lisp, "
"and we can give further advice for those cases.  (In addition, just moving "
"point through the code with Show Paren mode enabled might find the mismatch.)"
msgstr ""
"しかし、不対応の括弧はLispにおいて最も頻出する構文エラーであり、こうしたケー"
"スに対するさらなるアドバイスを提示できます。  （加えて、Show Parenモードを有"
"効にした状態でコード内をポイント移動させるだけでも、不対応箇所が見つかるかも"
"しれません。）"

