# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Flags.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo; identifies an additional prefix "
"character for Lisp syntax.  These characters are treated as whitespace when "
"they appear between expressions.  When they appear within an expression, "
"they are handled according to their usual syntax classes."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo;は、Lisp構文における追加の接頭辞文"
"字を指定します。これらの文字が式の間に現れる場合は、空白文字として扱われま"
"す。式の中に現れる場合は、通常の構文クラスに従って処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Flags.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">backward-prefix-chars</code> moves back "
