# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax_002dtable-_0028text-"
"property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax_002dtable-_0028text-"
"property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"When the syntax table is not flexible enough to specify the syntax of a "
"language, you can override the syntax table for specific character "
"occurrences in the buffer, by applying a <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</"
"code> text property.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-"
"Properties.html\">Text Properties</a>, for how to apply text properties."
msgstr ""
"構文テーブルでは言語の構文を規定するのに十分な柔軟性がない場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> テキストプロパティを適用することで、バッ"
"ファ内の特定の文字出現箇所に対して構文テーブルを上書きできます。テキストプロ"
"パティの適用方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Properties.html\">"
"テキストプロパティ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The valid values of <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> text property "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> テキストプロパティの有効な値は以下の"
"通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">syntax-table</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">syntax-table</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the property value is a syntax table, that table is used instead of the "
"current buffer&rsquo;s syntax table to determine the syntax for the "
"underlying text character."
msgstr ""
"プロパティ値が構文テーブルである場合、基となるテキスト文字の構文を決定するた"
"めに、現在のバッファの構文テーブルの代わりにそのテーブルが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">syntax-code</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">matching-char</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">syntax-code</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">matching-char</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"A cons cell of this format is a raw syntax descriptor (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-Internals.html\">Syntax Table Internals</"
"a>), which directly specifies a syntax class for the underlying text "
"character."
msgstr ""
"この形式の cons セルは生の構文記述子（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Table-"
"Internals.html\">構文テーブルの内部構造</a>を参照）であり、基となるテキスト文"
"字の構文クラスを直接指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If the property is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the character&rsquo;s "
"syntax is determined from the current syntax table in the usual way."
msgstr ""
"プロパティが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、文字の構文は通常の手順で"
"現在の構文テーブルから決定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">parse-sexp-lookup-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-parse_002dsexp_002dlookup_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">parse-sexp-lookup-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-parse_002dsexp_002dlookup_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"If this is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the syntax scanning "
"functions, like <code class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code>, pay attention to "
"<code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> text properties.  Otherwise they "
"use only the current syntax table."
msgstr ""
"これが non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sexp</code> などの構文スキャン関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> のテキストプロパティを参照します。そうでな"
"い場合は、現在の構文テーブルのみを使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-propertize-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-syntax_002dpropertize_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-propertize-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-syntax_002dpropertize_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, should store a "
"function for applying <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> properties to "
"a specified stretch of text.  It is intended to be used by major modes to "
"install a function which applies <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> "
"properties in some mode-appropriate way."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、指定されたテキスト範囲"
"に <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> プロパティを適用するための関数を"
"格納する必要があります。これは、メジャーモードが、モードに適した方法で <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> プロパティを適用する関数をインストールする"
"ために使用することを想定しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The function is called by <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Position-Parse.html\">Finding the Parse State for a "
"Position</a>), and by Font Lock mode during syntactic fontification (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntactic-Font-Lock.html\">Syntactic Font Lock</a>).  "
"It is called with two arguments, <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>, which are the starting and ending positions of the "
"text on which it should act.  It is allowed to arbitrarily move point within "
"the region delimited by <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>; such motions don&rsquo;t need to use <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Excursions.html\">Excursions</a>).  It is also allowed to call <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> on any position before <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>, but if a Lisp program calls <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code> on some position and later modifies the "
"buffer at some earlier position, then it is that program&rsquo;s "
"responsibility to call <code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss-flush-cache</code> "
"to flush the now obsolete info from the cache."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Position-Parse.html\">位置のパース状態の特定</a>を参照）によって呼び出"
"されるほか、構文的なフォント化（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntactic-Font-"
"Lock.html\">構文的フォントロック</a>を参照）の際にFont Lockモードによっても呼"
"び出されます。この関数は、処理対象となるテキストの開始位置と終了位置である2つ"
"の引数、<var class=\"var\">start</var>と<var class=\"var\">end</var>を指定し"
"て呼び出されます。また、<var class=\"var\">start</var>と<var "
"class=\"var\">end</var>で区切られた領域内で、ポイントを任意に移動させることが"
"できます。このような移動に<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>を使用す"
"る必要はありません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Excursions.html\">エクスカー"
"ション</a>を参照）。さらに、<var class=\"var\">end</var>より前の任意の位置で"
"<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code>を呼び出すこともできますが、Lispプログ"
"ラムがある位置で<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss</code>を呼び出し、その後さら"
"に前の位置にあるバッファを変更した場合は、キャッシュから不要になった情報をフ"
"ラッシュするために<code class=\"code\">syntax-ppss-flush-cache</code>を呼び出"
"す責任はそのプログラムにあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Caution:</strong> When this variable is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs removes <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</"
"code> text properties arbitrarily and relies on <code class=\"code\">syntax-"
"propertize-function</code> to reapply them.  Thus if this facility is used "
"at all, the function must apply <strong class=\"strong\">all</strong> <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> text properties used by the major mode.  "
"In particular, Modes derived from a CC Mode mode must not use this variable, "
"since CC Mode uses other means to apply and remove these text properties."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">注意：</strong> この変数が non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、Emacs は <code class=\"code\">syntax-"
"table</code> テキストプロパティを任意に削除し、<code class=\"code\">syntax-"
"propertize-function</code> を用いてそれらを再適用します。したがって、この機能"
"を利用する場合、関数はメジャーモードで使用される<strong class=\"strong\">すべ"
"て</strong>の <code class=\"code\">syntax-table</code> テキストプロパティを適"
"用しなければなりません。特に、CC Mode モードから派生したモードはこの変数を使"
"用してはいけません。CC Mode は、これらのテキストプロパティの適用および削除に"
"別の手段を用いるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-propertize-extend-region-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"syntax_002dpropertize_002dextend_002dregion_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">syntax-propertize-extend-region-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"syntax_002dpropertize_002dextend_002dregion_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"This abnormal hook is run by the syntax parsing code prior to calling <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-propertize-function</code>.  Its role is to help "
"locate safe starting and ending buffer positions for passing to <code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-propertize-function</code>.  For example, a major mode "
"can add a function to this hook to identify multi-line syntactic constructs, "
"and ensure that the boundaries do not fall in the middle of one."
msgstr ""
"この特殊なフックは、<code class=\"code\">syntax-propertize-function</code>を"
"呼び出す前に構文解析コードによって実行されます。その役割は、<code "
"class=\"code\">syntax-propertize-function</code>に渡すための安全な開始・終了"
"バッファ位置を特定する手助けをすることです。例えば、メジャーモードはこのフッ"
"クに関数を追加して複数行にわたる構文構造を識別し、境界がそれらの途中に位置し"
"ないようにすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Each function in this hook should accept two arguments, <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var>.  It should "
"return either a cons cell of two adjusted buffer positions, <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">new-start</var> . <var class=\"var\">new-"
"end</var>)</code>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if no adjustment is "
"necessary.  The hook functions are run in turn, repeatedly, until they all "
"return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"このフック内の各関数は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> の2つの引数を受け取る必要があります。また、調整後の2"
"つのバッファ位置 <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">new-start</var> . "
"<var class=\"var\">new-end</var>)</code> を含むコンスセルを返すか、調整が不要"
"な場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。フック関数は、すべてが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すまで、順次繰り返し実行されます。"

