# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span>36.3 Syntax Table Functions<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Syntax-"
"Table-Functions-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>36.3 構文表関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Syntax-Table-"
"Functions-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In this section we describe functions for creating, accessing and altering "
"syntax tables."
msgstr ""
"本節では、構文テーブルの作成、参照、および変更を行う関数について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-syntax-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dsyntax_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-syntax-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dsyntax_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a new syntax table.  If <var class=\"var\">table</var> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the parent of the new syntax table "
"is <var class=\"var\">table</var>; otherwise, the parent is the standard "
"syntax table."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、新しい構文テーブルを作成します。<var class=\"var\">table</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、新しい構文テーブルの親は <var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> となり、そうでない場合は標準の構文テーブルが親とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In the new syntax table, all characters are initially given the "
"&ldquo;inherit&rdquo; (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo;) syntax "
"class, i.e., their syntax is inherited from the parent table (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">Table of Syntax Classes</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"新しい構文テーブルでは、すべての文字に初期状態で「inherit」（<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@</samp>）構文クラスが割り当てられています。つまり、その構文は"
"親テーブルから継承されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-"
"Table.html\">構文クラス表</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">copy-syntax-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-copy_002dsyntax_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">copy-syntax-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-copy_002dsyntax_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function constructs a copy of <var class=\"var\">table</var> and "
"returns it.  If <var class=\"var\">table</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it returns a copy of the standard syntax table.  "
"Otherwise, an error is signaled if <var class=\"var\">table</var> is not a "
"syntax table."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">table</var> のコピーを作成して返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">table</var> が省略されているか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定されている場合は、標準構文テーブルのコピーを"
"返します。それ以外の場合、<var class=\"var\">table</var> が構文テーブルでない"
"ときはエラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">modify-syntax-entry</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char "
"syntax-descriptor &amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-modify_002dsyntax_002dentry\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">modify-syntax-entry</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">char "
"syntax-descriptor &amp;optional table</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-modify_002dsyntax_002dentry\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-entry_002c-setting\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-entry_002c-setting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the syntax entry for <var class=\"var\">char</var> "
"according to <var class=\"var\">syntax-descriptor</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> must be a character, or a cons cell of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">min</var> . <var class=\"var\">max</"
"var>)</code>; in the latter case, the function sets the syntax entries for "
"all characters in the range between <var class=\"var\">min</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">max</var>, inclusive."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">syntax-descriptor</var> に従って <var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> の構文エントリを設定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">char</var> は文字、または <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">min</var> . <var class=\"var\">max</var>)</code> 形式のコンスセ"
"ルである必要があります。後者の場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">min</var> "
"から <var class=\"var\">max</var> までの範囲（両端を含む）にあるすべての文字"
"の構文エントリを設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The syntax is changed only for <var class=\"var\">table</var>, which "
"defaults to the current buffer&rsquo;s syntax table, and not in any other "
"syntax table."
msgstr ""
"構文が変更されるのは<var class=\"var\">table</var>のみであり、これはデフォル"
"トで現在のバッファの構文テーブルが適用され、それ以外の構文テーブルでは変更さ"
"れません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">syntax-descriptor</var> is a syntax "
"descriptor, i.e., a string whose first character is a syntax class "
"designator and whose second and subsequent characters optionally specify a "
"matching character and syntax flags.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Descriptors.html\">Syntax Descriptors</a>.  An error is signaled if <var "
"class=\"var\">syntax-descriptor</var> is not a valid syntax descriptor."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">syntax-descriptor</var> は構文記述子です。すなわち、"
"先頭文字が構文クラス指定子であり、2文字目以降の文字で任意に一致する文字と構文"
"フラグを指定する文字列のことです。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Descriptors.html\">構文記述子</a> を参照してください。<var "
"class=\"var\">syntax-descriptor</var> が有効な構文記述子でない場合は、エラー"
"が通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function always returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The old "
"syntax information in the table for this character is discarded."
msgstr ""
"この関数は常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。この文字のテーブル"
"にある古い構文情報は破棄されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span class=\"r\">Examples:</span>\n"
msgstr ""

