";; <span class=\"r\">Make &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo; a punctuation character,</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">the first character of a start-comment sequence,</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">and the second character of an end-comment sequence.</span>\n"
";;   <span class=\"r\">This is used in C mode.</span>\n"
"(modify-syntax-entry ?/ &quot;. 14&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-syntax</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">character</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dsyntax\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">char-syntax</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">character</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-char_002dsyntax\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the syntax class of <var class=\"var\">character</"
"var>, represented by its designator character (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">Table of Syntax Classes</a>).  This returns "
"<em class=\"emph\">only</em> the class, not its matching character or syntax "
"flags."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、指定文字で表される <var class=\"var\">character</var> の構文クラ"
"スを返します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">構文クラス"
"表</a>を参照）。これにより、クラス<em class=\"emph\">のみ</em>が返され、対応"
"する文字や構文フラグは返されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The following examples apply to C mode.  (We use <code "
"class=\"code\">string</code> to make it easier to see the character returned "
"by <code class=\"code\">char-syntax</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"以下の例はCモードに適用されます。（<code class=\"code\">char-syntax</code> が"
"返す文字を確認しやすくするため、<code class=\"code\">string</code> を使用して"
"います。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Space characters have whitespace syntax class.\n"
"(string (char-syntax ?\\s))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot; &quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Forward slash characters have punctuation syntax.\n"
";; Note that this <code class=\"code\">char-syntax</code> call does not reveal\n"
";; that it is also part of comment-start and -end sequences.\n"
"(string (char-syntax ?/))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Open parenthesis characters have open parenthesis syntax.\n"
";; Note that this <code class=\"code\">char-syntax</code> call does not reveal that\n"
";; it has a matching character, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo;.\n"
"(string (char-syntax ?\\())\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;(&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

