# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Internals.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-table-internals\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-table-internals\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Syntax tables are implemented as char-tables (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>), but most Lisp programs "
"don&rsquo;t work directly with their elements.  Syntax tables do not store "
"syntax data as syntax descriptors (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Descriptors.html\">Syntax Descriptors</a>); they use an internal format, "
"which is documented in this section.  This internal format can also be "
"assigned as syntax properties (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Properties.html\">Syntax Properties</a>)."
msgstr ""
"構文テーブルは文字テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">"
"文字テーブル</a>を参照）として実装されていますが、ほとんどのLispプログラムは"
"その要素を直接操作することはありません。構文テーブルは、構文データを構文記述"
"子（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Descriptors.html\">構文記述子</a>を参"
"照）として格納するのではなく、本節で説明する内部形式を採用しています。この内"
"部形式は、構文プロパティ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Properties.html\">"
"構文プロパティ</a>を参照）として割り当てることも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Internals.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-code\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-raw-syntax-descriptor\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-code\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-raw-syntax-descriptor\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Each entry in a syntax table is a <em class=\"dfn\">raw syntax descriptor</"
"em>: a cons cell of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">syntax-"
"code</var> . <var class=\"var\">matching-char</var>)</code>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">syntax-code</var> is an integer which encodes the syntax class "
"and syntax flags, according to the table below.  <var class=\"var\">matching-"
"char</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies a matching "
"character (similar to the second character in a syntax descriptor)."
msgstr ""
"構文テーブルの各エントリは<em class=\"dfn\">生の構文記述子</em>であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">syntax-code</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">matching-char</var>)</code> という形式のコンスセルです。<var "
"class=\"var\">syntax-code</var> は、以下の表に従って構文クラスと構文フラグを"
"エンコードする整数です。<var class=\"var\">matching-char</var> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、対応する文字（構文記述子の2番目の文字に"
"相当）を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Internals.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-tables-_0028accessing-elements-"
"of_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-syntax-tables-_0028accessing-elements-"
"of_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Table-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Use <code class=\"code\">aref</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Array-"
"Functions.html\">Functions that Operate on Arrays</a>) to get the raw syntax "
"descriptor of a character, for example <code class=\"code\">(aref&nbsp;"
"(syntax-table)&nbsp;ch)</code>."
msgstr ""
"文字の生の構文記述子（例：<code class=\"code\">(aref&nbsp;(syntax-"
"table)&nbsp;ch)</code>）を取得するには、<code class=\"code\">aref</code> を使"
"用してください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Array-Functions.html\">配列を操作す"
"る関数</a>を参照）。"

