#: build/html/elisp/Syntax-Tables.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">syntax table</em> specifies the syntactic role of each "
"character in a buffer.  It can be used to determine where words, symbols, "
"and other syntactic constructs begin and end.  This information is used by "
"many Emacs facilities, including Font Lock mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Font-Lock-Mode.html\">Font Lock Mode</a>) and the various complex "
"movement commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Motion.html\">Motion</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">構文テーブル</em>は、バッファ内の各文字の構文上の役割を規定"
"します。これを用いて、単語や記号、その他の構文構造がどこから始まりどこで終わ"
"るかを判定できます。この情報は、Font Lockモード（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Font-Lock-Mode.html\">Font Lockモード</a>を参照）やさまざまな複雑な移"
"動コマンド（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Motion.html\">移動</a>を参照）など、多"
"くのEmacs機能で利用されています。"

