"software configuration of your system, as a string.  For example, a typical "
"value for a 64-bit GNU/Linux system is &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu&quot;</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
