# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the value of the environment variable <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var>, as a string.  <var class=\"var\">var</var> should "
"be a string.  If <var class=\"var\">var</var> is undefined in the "
"environment, <code class=\"code\">getenv</code> returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It returns &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;&quot;</samp>&rsquo; if <var class=\"var\">var</var> is "
"set but null.  Within Emacs, a list of environment variables and their "
"values is kept in the variable <code class=\"code\">process-environment</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、環境変数 <var class=\"var\">var</var> の値を文字列として返しま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">var</var> は文字列である必要があります。環境内で <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> が未定義の場合、<code class=\"code\">getenv</code> "
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">var</var> "
"が設定されていても null の場合は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;&quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo; を返します。Emacs 内では、環境変数とその値のリストが変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">process-environment</code> に保持されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"Optional argument <var class=\"var\">frame</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies a frame, in which case the function "
"searches <var class=\"var\">frame</var>&rsquo;s parameter <code "
"class=\"code\">environment</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-"
"Parameters.html\">Basic Parameters</a>) for <var class=\"var\">var</var> "
"instead of looking for it in <code class=\"code\">process-environment</code>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">frame</var> は、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合はフレームを指定します。この場合、関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">process-environment</code> ではなく <var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var> のパラメータ <code class=\"code\">environment</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Parameters.html\">基本パラメータ</a> を参照）の"
"中から <var class=\"var\">var</var> を検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DISPLAY-environment-variable-"
"search\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DISPLAY-environment-variable-"
"search\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">DISPLAY</samp>&rsquo; environment variable "
"is treated specially when <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>: if that variable is not found in <code "
"class=\"code\">process-environment</code>, the function looks at the "
"selected-frame&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">display</code> parameter, and if "
"that is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it also looks in <code "
"class=\"code\">initial-environment</code>."
msgstr ""
"環境変数「<samp class=\"samp\">DISPLAY</samp>」は、<var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var> が省略されているか、あるいは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合"
"に特別な扱いを受けます。<code class=\"code\">process-environment</code> にそ"
"の変数が見つからない場合、関数は selected-frame の <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> パラメータを確認し、それが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> であれば <code class=\"code\">initial-environment</"
"code> も確認します。"

