# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"This function takes a search path string such as the value of the <code "
"class=\"env\">PATH</code> environment variable, and splits it at the "
"separators, returning a list of directories.  <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> in this list means the current directory.  Although the "
"function&rsquo;s name says &ldquo;colon&rdquo;, it actually uses the value "
