# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the current 1-minute, 5-minute, and 15-minute system "
"load averages, in a list.  The load average indicates the number of "
"processes trying to run on the system."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在の1分、5分、および15分のシステム負荷平均をリスト形式で返しま"
"す。負荷平均は、システム上で実行を試みているプロセス数を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"By default, the values are integers that are 100 times the system load "
"averages, but if <var class=\"var\">use-float</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then they are returned as floating-point numbers "
"without multiplying by 100."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、値はシステムのロードアベレージの100倍の整数となりますが、"
"<var class=\"var\">use-float</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"場合は、100倍せずに浮動小数点数として返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"If it is impossible to obtain the load average, this function signals an "
"error.  On some platforms, access to load averages requires installing Emacs "
"as setuid or setgid so that it can read kernel information, and that usually "
"isn&rsquo;t advisable."
msgstr ""
"load average の取得が不可能な場合、この関数はエラーを通知します。一部のプラッ"
"トフォームでは、load average へのアクセスに、カーネル情報を読み取れるよう "
"Emacs を setuid または setgid としてインストールする必要がありますが、これは"
"通常推奨されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Environment.html
msgid ""
"If the 1-minute load average is available, but the 5- or 15-minute averages "
"are not, this function returns a shortened list containing the available "
