# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid "This function blocks the system from entering its idle sleep state."
msgstr "この関数は、システムがアイドルスリープ状態に入るのを阻止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"It returns a token that must be passed to <code class=\"code\">system-sleep-"
"unblock-sleep</code> to unblock this specific block (other sleep blocks may "
"be simultaneously in force for other purposes).  Otherwise, it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if the sleep blocking fails."
msgstr ""
"この特定のブロックの解除には、<code class=\"code\">system-sleep-unblock-"
"sleep</code> に渡す必要があるトークンを返します（他の目的で、別のスリープブ"
"ロックが同時に有効になっている場合があります）。スリープブロックの解除に失敗"
"した場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">why</var> is a string and, when non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, is used to identify the sleep block as it may "
"appear on the system&rsquo;s inspectable block lists.  It defaults to &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Emacs</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">why</var> は文字列であり、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"以外の場合は、システムの検査可能なブロックリストに表示される可能性があるた"
"め、スリープブロックを識別するために使用されます。デフォルトは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Emacs</samp>&rsquo; です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">allow-display-sleep</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, allow the display to sleep.  By default, the "
"display is kept active."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">allow-display-sleep</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、ディスプレイのスリープを許可します。デフォルトでは、ディス"
"プレイはアクティブな状態に保たれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"Note that when the Emacs process terminates, blocks are released on all "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"なお、Emacs プロセスが終了すると、すべてのプラットフォームでブロックが解放さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-unblock-sleep</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">token</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"system_002dsleep_002dunblock_002dsleep\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-unblock-sleep</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">token</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"system_002dsleep_002dunblock_002dsleep\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"This function unblocks the sleep block associated with <var "
"class=\"var\">token</var>.  It returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"on success, otherwise it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">token</var> に関連付けられたスリープブロックの"
"解除を行います。成功した場合は non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、それ以"
"外の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-system-sleep-block</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">(&amp;optional why allow-display-sleep) body&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-with_002dsystem_002dsleep_002dblock\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-system-sleep-block</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">(&amp;optional why allow-display-sleep) body&hellip;</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-with_002dsystem_002dsleep_002dblock\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"This is a convenience macro that lets you wrap the forms in <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> with a sleep block that is unblocked for you when "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> completes.  This guarantees that the system "
"will never go to sleep while <var class=\"var\">body</var> executes.  The "
"arguments have the same meaning as in <code class=\"code\">system-sleep-"
"block-sleep</code>, above."
msgstr ""
"これは、フォームを <var class=\"var\">body</var> で囲み、<var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> が完了した際に解除されるスリープブロックを付加できる"
"便利なマクロです。これにより、<var class=\"var\">body</var> の実行中にシステ"
"ムがスリープ状態になることがないことが保証されます。引数の意味は、前述の "
"<code class=\"code\">system-sleep-block-sleep</code> と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-sleep-blocked-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-system_002dsleep_002dsleep_002dblocked_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-sleep-blocked-p</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-system_002dsleep_002dsleep_002dblocked_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"This predicate function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there "
"are any active <code class=\"code\">system-sleep</code> blocks, otherwise it "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この述語関数は、アクティブな<code class=\"code\">system-sleep</code>ブロック"
"が存在する場合はnon-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を、そうでない場合は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-unblock-all-sleep-blocks</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"system_002dsleep_002dunblock_002dall_002dsleep_002dblocks\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-unblock-all-sleep-blocks</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"system_002dsleep_002dunblock_002dall_002dsleep_002dblocks\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"This function unblocks all active sleep blocks.  It is unlikely that you "
"will need to call this function."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、アクティブなすべてのスリープブロックのロックを解除します。この関"
"数を呼び出す必要はほとんどないでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-sleep-event-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-system_002dsleep_002devent_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">system-sleep-event-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-system_002dsleep_002devent_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"When the system is about to enter a sleep state or after it wakes from one, "
"each function on this abnormal hook is called with one argument, <var "
"class=\"var\">event</var>, a sleep event.  Its state can be retrieved via "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><code class=\"code\">(sleep-event-state event)</"
"code></samp>&rsquo;.  State will be one of the symbols <code "
"class=\"code\">pre-sleep</code> or <code class=\"code\">post-wake</code>."
msgstr ""
"システムがスリープ状態に入ろうとする際、あるいはそこから復帰した際、この異常"
"フック上の各関数は、スリープイベントである単一の引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">event</var> とともに呼び出されます。その状態は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><code class=\"code\">(sleep-event-state event)</code></"
"samp>&rsquo; 経由で取得可能です。状態はシンボル <code class=\"code\">pre-"
"sleep</code> または <code class=\"code\">post-wake</code> のいずれかとなりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"Handling <code class=\"code\">pre-sleep</code> events should be done as fast "
"as possible and avoid user prompting.  Systems often grant a very short pre-"
"sleep processing interval, typically ranging between 2 and 5 seconds.  The "
"system may sleep even if your processing is not complete, so be sure you do "
"as little as possible.  For example, your function could close active "
"connections or serial ports."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">pre-sleep</code> イベントの処理は可能な限り迅速に行い、"
"ユーザーに確認を求めることは避けてください。システムは通常、スリープ前の処理"
"時間として2〜5秒程度の非常に短い間隔を設けています。処理が完了していなくても"
"システムがスリープ状態になる可能性があるため、可能な限り最小限の処理にとどめ"
"るようにしてください。例えば、関数内でアクティブな接続やシリアルポートを閉じ"
"るといった対応が考えられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"Handling <code class=\"code\">post-wake</code> events offers more leeway.  "
"Use this, for example, to reestablish connections."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">post-wake</code> イベントを処理する方が余裕があります。"
"例えば、接続の再確立などに利用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Sleep.html
msgid ""
"Note: Your code, or the functions it calls, should not raise any signals or "
"all hooks will be halted.  You can wrap your code in a <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code> block (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Errors.html\">Errors</a>)."
msgstr ""
"注意：コードやその呼び出し先の関数でシグナルを発生させないようにしてくださ"
"い。そうしないと、すべてのフックが停止します。コードを <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code> ブロックで囲むことができます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Errors.html\">エラー</a>を参照してください）。"

