"href=\"#index-system_002dtaskbar_002dattention\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"This function flashes or bounces system taskbar Emacs icon and/or its frame "
"to alert the user."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ユーザーに通知するため、システムのタスクバーにあるEmacsアイコンお"
"よび／またはそのフレームを点滅またはバウンドさせます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">urgency</var> can be one of the symbols <code "
"class=\"code\">informational</code>, or <code class=\"code\">critical</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">urgency</var>は、記号<code class=\"code\">informational</"
"code>または<code class=\"code\">critical</code>のいずれかになり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">urgency</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"clear the attention indicator."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">urgency</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合、アテ"
"ンションインジケーターをクリアする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"The attention indicator is cleared by the earliest of bringing the Emacs GUI "
"into focus, or after <var class=\"var\">timeout</var> seconds.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">timeout</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the system "
"GUI behavior has priority."
msgstr ""
"アテンションインジケーターは、Emacs GUIがフォーカスされた時点、または<var "
"class=\"var\">timeout</var>秒後のいずれか早い方でクリアされます。<var "
"class=\"var\">timeout</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合は、シ"
"ステムGUIの動作が優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"On some back ends, <code class=\"code\">critical</code> has the same effect "
"as <code class=\"code\">informational</code>."
msgstr ""
"一部のバックエンドでは、<code class=\"code\">critical</code>は<code "
"class=\"code\">informational</code>と同じ効果を持ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"On some back ends, attention will be displayed only if Emacs is not the "
"currently focused application."
msgstr ""
