# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"This function displays a progress indicator overlay on the system taskbar "
"Emacs icon."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、システムのタスクバーにあるEmacsアイコンに進捗インジケーターのオー"
"バーレイを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/System-Taskbar.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">progress</var> is a float in the range 0.0 to 1.0.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">progress</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, remove "
"the progress indicator."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">progress</var> は 0.0 から 1.0 の範囲の浮動小数点数です。"
"<var class=\"var\">progress</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、"
