# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">contents</var> is a vector with the same number of "
"elements as <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-format</code>.  Each vector "
"element is either a string, which is inserted into the buffer as-is; an "
"image descriptor, which is used to insert an image (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Image-Descriptors.html\">Image Descriptors</a>); or a list <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">label</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">properties</var>)</code>, which means to insert a text button "
"by calling <code class=\"code\">insert-text-button</code> with <var "
"class=\"var\">label</var> and <var class=\"var\">properties</var> as "
"arguments (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Making-Buttons.html\">Making "
"Buttons</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">contents</var> は、<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-"
"format</code> と同じ要素数を持つベクトルです。各ベクトル要素は、そのままバッ"
"ファに挿入される文字列、画像の挿入に使用される画像記述子（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Image-Descriptors.html\">画像記述子</a>を参照）、またはリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">label</var>&nbsp;.&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">properties</var>)</code>（<var class=\"var\">label</var> と "
"<var class=\"var\">properties</var> を引数として <code class=\"code\">insert-"
"text-button</code> を呼び出すことでテキストボタンを挿入することを意味します）"
"のいずれかです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Making-Buttons.html\">ボタンの作成"
"</a>を参照）。"

