# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the function called to insert an entry at "
"point, including its terminating newline.  The function should accept two "
"arguments, <var class=\"var\">id</var> and <var class=\"var\">contents</"
"var>, having the same meanings as in <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-"
"entries</code>.  The default value is a function which inserts an entry in a "
"straightforward way; a mode which uses Tabulated List mode in a more complex "
"way can specify another function."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、終端の改行文字を含めてポイントにエントリを挿入するために呼び"
"出される関数です。この関数は、<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-entries</"
"code> と同様の意味を持つ2つの引数 <var class=\"var\">id</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">contents</var> を受け取る必要があります。デフォルト値は、単純な"
"方法でエントリを挿入する関数です。表形式リストモードをより複雑な方法で利用す"
"るモードでは、別の関数を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tabulated-list-sort-key</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-tabulated_002dlist_002dsort_002dkey\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
