"href=\"#index-tabulated_002dlist_002dsort_002dkey\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable specifies the current sort key for the Tabulated "
"List buffer.  If it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, no sorting is done.  "
"Otherwise, it should have the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> . <var class=\"var\">flip</var>)</code>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is a string matching one of the column names in "
"<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-format</code>, and <var "
"class=\"var\">flip</var>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, means to "
"invert the sort order."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、Tabulated Listバッファの現在のソートキーを指定します。値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、ソートは行われません。それ以外の場合"
"は、<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">flip</var>)</code> という形式である必要があり、ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> は <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-format</"
"code> に含まれる列名のいずれかに一致する文字列であり、<var "
"class=\"var\">flip</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合はソー"
"ト順を反転させることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
