# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This function computes and sets <code class=\"code\">header-line-format</"
"code> for the Tabulated List buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Header-"
"Lines.html\">Window Header Lines</a>), and assigns a keymap to the header "
"line to allow sorting entries by clicking on column headers."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、表形式リストバッファ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Header-"
"Lines.html\">ウィンドウヘッダー行</a>を参照）の<code class=\"code\">header-"
"line-format</code>を計算して設定し、列ヘッダーをクリックしてエントリをソート"
"できるように、ヘッダー行にキーマップを割り当てます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Modes derived from Tabulated List mode should call this after setting the "
"above variables (in particular, only after setting <code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-format</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Tabulated Listモードから派生したモードでは、上記の変数を設定した後（特に"
"<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-format</code>を設定した後のみ）にこれを呼"
"び出す必要があります。"

