"link\" href=\"#index-tabulated_002dlist_002dprint\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This function populates the current buffer with entries.  It should be "
"called by the listing command.  It erases the buffer, sorts the entries "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-entries</code> according to "
"<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-sort-key</code>, then calls the function "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-printer</code> to insert "
"each entry."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにエントリを格納します。リスティングコマンドから呼"
"び出す必要があります。バッファを消去し、<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-"
"entries</code>で指定されたエントリを<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-sort-"
"key</code>に従ってソートした後、<code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-printer</"
"code>で指定された関数を呼び出して各エントリを挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">remember-pos</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function looks for the <var "
"class=\"var\">id</var> element on the current line, if any, and tries to "
"move to that entry after all the entries are (re)inserted."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">remember-pos</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、この関数は現在の行に <var "
"class=\"var\">id</var> 要素があればそれを探し、すべてのエントリが（再）挿入さ"
"れた後、そのエントリへ移動しようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">update</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function will only erase or add entries that "
"have changed since the last print.  This is several times faster if most "
"entries haven&rsquo;t changed since the last time this function was called.  "
"The only difference in outcome is that tags placed via <code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-put-tag</code> will not be removed from "
"entries that haven&rsquo;t changed (normally all tags are removed)."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">update</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、この関数は前回の出力以降に変更があったエントリのみを削除ま"
"たは追加します。前回この関数が呼び出されて以来、ほとんどのエントリに変更がな"
"い場合は、処理速度が数倍向上します。結果における唯一の違いは、<code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-put-tag</code> で付与されたタグが、変更のないエ"
"ントリからは削除されない点です（通常はすべてのタグが削除されます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
