# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This function puts <var class=\"var\">tag</var> in the padding area of the "
"current line.  The padding area can be empty space at the beginning of the "
"line, the width of which is governed by <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-"
"padding</code>.  <var class=\"var\">tag</var> should be a string, with a "
"length less than or equal to <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-padding</"
"code>.  If <var class=\"var\">advance</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, this function advances point by one line."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在の行のパディング領域に <var class=\"var\">tag</var> を挿入し"
"ます。パディング領域は行頭の空白領域となり得、その幅は <code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-padding</code> によって規定されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">tag</var> は文字列である必要があり、その長さは <code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-padding</code> 以下でなければなりません。<var "
"class=\"var\">advance</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、こ"
"の関数はポイントを1行分進めます。"

