# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"This function changes the tabulated list entry at point, setting <var "
"class=\"var\">col</var> to <var class=\"var\">desc</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">col</var> is the column number to change, or the name of the "
"column to change.  <var class=\"var\">desc</var> is the new column "
"descriptor, which is inserted via <code class=\"code\">tabulated-list-print-"
"col</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポイントにある表形式リストのエントリを変更し、<var "
"class=\"var\">col</var> を <var class=\"var\">desc</var> に設定します。<var "
"class=\"var\">col</var> は変更対象の列番号、または変更対象の列名です。<var "
"class=\"var\">desc</var> は新しい列記述子であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-print-col</code> を介して挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tabulated-List-Mode.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">change-entry-data</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function modifies the underlying data "
"(usually the column descriptor in the list <code class=\"code\">tabulated-"
"list-entries</code>) by setting the column descriptor of the vector to <code "
"class=\"code\">desc</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">change-entry-data</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、この関数はベクトルの列記述子を <code class=\"code\">desc</"
"code> に設定することで、基礎となるデータ（通常はリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">tabulated-list-entries</code> 内の列記述子）を変更します。"

