# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"Temporary displays are used by Lisp programs to put output into a buffer and "
"then present it to the user for perusal rather than for editing.  Many help "
"commands use this feature."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラムでは、出力をバッファに格納し、編集ではなく閲覧用としてユーザー"
"に提示するために、一時的な表示機能が利用されます。多くのヘルプコマンドがこの"
"機能を利用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-output-to-temp-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">buffer-name body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002doutput_002dto_002dtemp_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-output-to-temp-buffer</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">buffer-name body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-with_002doutput_002dto_002dtemp_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"This function executes the forms in <var class=\"var\">body</var> while "
"arranging to insert any output they print into the buffer named <var "
"class=\"var\">buffer-name</var>, which is first created if necessary, and "
"put into Help mode.  (See the similar form <code class=\"code\">with-temp-"
"buffer-window</code> below.)  Finally, the buffer is displayed in some "
"window, but that window is not selected."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">body</var> 内のフォームを実行し、それらが出力"
"する内容を、必要に応じて最初に作成される <var class=\"var\">buffer-name</"
"var> という名前のバッファに挿入してヘルプモードに移行させます。（後述の同様の"
"フォーム <code class=\"code\">with-temp-buffer-window</code> を参照してくださ"
"い。）最後に、バッファがあるウィンドウに表示されますが、そのウィンドウが選択"
"されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"If the forms in <var class=\"var\">body</var> do not change the major mode "
"in the output buffer, so that it is still Help mode at the end of their "
"execution, then <code class=\"code\">with-output-to-temp-buffer</code> makes "
"this buffer read-only at the end, and also scans it for function and "
"variable names to make them into clickable cross-references.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Documentation-Tips.html#Docstring-hyperlinks\">Tips "
"for Documentation Strings</a>, in particular the item on hyperlinks in "
"documentation strings, for more details."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> のフォームが出力バッファのメジャーモードを変更"
"せず、実行終了時も Help モードのままである場合、<code class=\"code\">with-"
"output-to-temp-buffer</code> はこのバッファを終了時に読み取り専用にし、さらに"
