"class=\"code\">standard-output</code> to the temporary buffer, then it "
"evaluates the forms in <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  Output using the Lisp "
"output functions within <var class=\"var\">body</var> goes by default to "
"that buffer (but screen display and messages in the echo area, although they "
