"buffer.  It can be either a buffer, which must already exist, or a string, "
"in which case a buffer of that name is created, if necessary.  The buffer is "
"marked as unmodified and read-only when <code class=\"code\">with-temp-"
"buffer-window</code> exits."
msgstr ""
