"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用のウィンドウの選"
"択</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"The value of the last form in <var class=\"var\">body</var> is returned, "
"unless the argument <var class=\"var\">quit-function</var> is specified.  In "
"that case, it is called with two arguments: the window showing the buffer "
