# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Terminal-I_002fO-Encoding.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the coding system that is in use for encoding terminal "
"output from <var class=\"var\">terminal</var>.  A value of <code "
"class=\"code\">no-conversion</code> means no encoding is done.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">terminal</var> is a frame, it means that frame&rsquo;s "
"terminal; if it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, that means the currently "
"selected frame&rsquo;s terminal."
