"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/DEL-Does-Not-Delete.html#DEL-Does-Not-"
"Delete\">DEL Does Not Delete</a> を参照してください。"

