"Accessibility-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>26.6.1 アクセシビリティのテスト<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Testing-Accessibility-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-accessibility-of-a-file\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-accessibility\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-accessibility-of-a-file\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-accessibility\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"These functions test for permission to access a file for reading, writing, "
"or execution.  Unless explicitly stated otherwise, they follow symbolic "
"links.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Kinds-of-Files.html\">Distinguishing "
"Kinds of Files</a>."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、ファイルへの読み取り、書き込み、または実行の権限を確認しま"
"す。特に明記されていない限り、シンボリックリンクを辿ります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Kinds-of-Files.html\">ファイル種類の区別</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"On some operating systems, more complex sets of access permissions can be "
"specified, via mechanisms such as Access Control Lists (ACLs).  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Extended-Attributes.html\">Extended File Attributes</"
"a>, for how to query and set those permissions."
msgstr ""
"一部のオペレーティングシステムでは、アクセス制御リスト（ACL）などの仕組みを通"
"じて、より複雑なアクセス権限セットを指定できます。これらの権限の照会および設"
"定方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Extended-Attributes.html\">拡張"
"ファイル属性</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-exists-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dexists_002dp\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-exists-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dexists_002dp\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if a file named <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> appears to exist.  This does not mean you can "
"necessarily read the file, only that you can probably find out its "
"attributes.  (On GNU and other POSIX-like systems, this is true if the file "
"exists and you have execute permission on the containing directories, "
"regardless of the permissions of the file itself.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前のファイルが存在する"
"ように見える場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。これは、必ずしも"
"そのファイルを読み取れることを意味するわけではなく、単にその属性を確認できる"
"可能性が高いということだけです。（GNU やその他の POSIX 系システムでは、ファイ"
"ル自体の権限に関わらず、ファイルが存在し、かつ格納先ディレクトリに対して実行"
"権限があればこのようになります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"If the file does not exist, or if there was trouble determining whether the "
"file exists, this function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"ファイルが存在しない場合、またはファイルの有無の判定に問題が生じた場合、この"
"関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-empty-file-name_002c-and-"
"file_002dexists_002dp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-empty-file-name_002c-and-"
"file_002dexists_002dp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"Since a file name that is an empty string is interpreted relative to the "
"current buffer&rsquo;s default directory (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Relative-File-Names.html\">Absolute and Relative File Names</a>), "
"calling <code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code> with an argument that is "
"an empty string will report about the buffer&rsquo;s default directory."
msgstr ""
"空文字列のファイル名は現在のバッファのデフォルトディレクトリを基準として解釈"
"されるため（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Relative-File-Names.html\">絶対ファイル"
"名と相対ファイル名</a>を参照）、空文字列を引数として<code "
"class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code>を呼び出すと、バッファのデフォルトディレク"
"トリに関する情報が報告されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dangling-symlinks_002c-testing-for-"
"existence\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dangling-symlinks_002c-testing-for-"
"existence\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"Directories are files, so <code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code> can "
"return <code class=\"code\">t</code> when given a directory.  However, "
"because <code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code> follows symbolic links, it "
"returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> for a symbolic link name only if the "
"target of the link exists; if your Lisp program needs to consider <em "
"class=\"dfn\">dangling symlinks</em> whose target doesn&rsquo;t exist as "
"existing files, use <code class=\"code\">file-attributes</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Attributes.html\">File Attributes</a>) instead "
"of <code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code>."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリはファイルであるため、<code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code> "
"はディレクトリを指定されると <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返すことがありま"
"す。ただし、<code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code> はシンボリックリンクを"
"辿るため、リンク先が存在する場合にのみシンボリックリンク名に対して <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。Lispプログラムで、リンク先が存在しない "
"<em class=\"dfn\">ダングリングシンボリックリンク</em> を既存のファイルとして"
"扱う必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">file-exists-p</code> ではなく "
"<code class=\"code\">file-attributes</code> を使用してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Attributes.html\">ファイル属性</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-readable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dreadable_002dp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-readable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dreadable_002dp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if a file named <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> exists and you can read it.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前のファイルが存在し、"
"かつ読み取り可能な場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。それ以外の"
"場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-executable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dexecutable_002dp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-executable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dexecutable_002dp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if a file named <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> exists and you can execute it.  It returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  On GNU and other POSIX-like "
"systems, if the file is a directory, execute permission means you can check "
"the existence and attributes of files inside the directory, and open those "
"files if their modes permit."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> という名前のファイルが存在し、"
"かつ実行可能な場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。それ以外の場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。GNU やその他の POSIX 系システ"
"ムでは、ファイルがディレクトリである場合、実行権限とは、ディレクトリ内のファ"
"イルの存在や属性を確認でき、かつモードが許可していればそれらのファイルを開く"
"ことができることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-writable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dwritable_002dp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-writable-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dwritable_002dp\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the file <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> can be written or created by you, and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise.  A file is writable if the file exists "
"and you can write it.  It is creatable if it does not exist, but its parent "
"directory does exist and you can write in that directory."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ファイル <var class=\"var\">filename</var> を自身が書き込みまたは"
"作成できる場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、そうでない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。ファイルが書き込み可能であるとは、その"
"ファイルが存在し、かつ自身が書き込み可能であることを指します。作成可能である"
"とは、そのファイルは存在しないが、親ディレクトリが存在し、かつそのディレクト"
"リに書き込み可能であることを指します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"In the example below, <samp class=\"file\">foo</samp> is not writable "
"because the parent directory does not exist, even though the user could "
"create such a directory."
msgstr ""
"以下の例では、ユーザーがそのようなディレクトリを作成できたとしても、親ディレ"
"クトリが存在しないため、<samp class=\"file\">foo</samp> は書き込みできませ"
"ん。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-writable-p &quot;~/no-such-dir/foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-accessible-directory-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">dirname</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"file_002daccessible_002ddirectory_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-accessible-directory-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">dirname</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"file_002daccessible_002ddirectory_002dp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if you have permission "
"to open existing files in the directory whose name as a file is <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var>; otherwise (e.g., if there is no such "
"directory), it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The value of <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> may be either a directory name (such as <samp "
"class=\"file\">/foo/</samp>) or the file name of a file which is a directory "
"(such as <samp class=\"file\">/foo</samp>, without the final slash)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ファイル名が <var class=\"var\">dirname</var> であるディレクトリ"
"内の既存ファイルを開く権限がある場合に <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返し、"
"そうでない場合（例：そのようなディレクトリが存在しない場合）には <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> の値"
"は、ディレクトリ名（<samp class=\"file\">/foo/</samp> など）、またはディレク"
"トリであるファイルのファイル名（<samp class=\"file\">/foo</samp> など、末尾の"
"スラッシュを除いたもの）のいずれかとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"For example, from the following we deduce that any attempt to read a file in "
"<samp class=\"file\">/foo/</samp> will give an error:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、以下から、<samp class=\"file\">/foo/</samp> でファイルを読み込もうと"
"すると必ずエラーが発生することが分かります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-accessible-directory-p &quot;/foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-existing-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dexisting_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">with-existing-directory</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"with_002dexisting_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"This macro ensures that <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> is "
"bound to an existing directory before executing <var class=\"var\">body</"
"var>.  If <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> already exists, "
"that&rsquo;s preferred, and otherwise some other directory is used.  This "
"macro can be useful, for instance, when calling an external command that "
"requires that it&rsquo;s running in a directory that exists.  The chosen "
"directory is not guaranteed to be writable."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">body</var> を実行する前に、<code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> が既存のディレクトリにバインドされて"
"いることを保証します。<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> が既に存"
"在する場合はそれが適用され、そうでない場合は別のディレクトリが使用されます。"
"このマクロは、例えば、存在するディレクトリ内での実行を必要とする外部コマンド"
"を呼び出す際などに有用です。選択されるディレクトリが書き込み可能であることは"
"保証されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">access-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-access_002dfile\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">access-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"string</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-access_002dfile\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Testing-Accessibility.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"remote_002dfile_002dname_002daccess_002dtimeout\"></a>"
