# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"This function compares two strings a character at a time.  It scans both the "
"strings at the same time to find the first pair of corresponding characters "
"that do not match.  If the lesser character of these two is the character "
"from <var class=\"var\">string1</var>, then <var class=\"var\">string1</var> "
"is less, and this function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  If the "
"lesser character is the one from <var class=\"var\">string2</var>, then <var "
"class=\"var\">string1</var> is greater, and this function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If the two strings match entirely, the value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、2つの文字列を1文字ずつ比較します。両方の文字列を同時に走査し、最"
"初に一致しない対応する文字のペアを探します。これら2つの文字のうち小さい方が "
"<var class=\"var\">string1</var> の文字である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">string1</var> の方が小さく、この関数は <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> を返します。小さい方が <var class=\"var\">string2</var> の文字である場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">string1</var> の方が大きく、この関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。2つの文字列が完全に一致する場合、値は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"Pairs of characters are compared according to their character codes.  Keep "
"in mind that lower case letters have higher numeric values in the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character set than their upper case "
"counterparts; digits and many punctuation characters have a lower numeric "
"value than upper case letters.  An <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"character is less than any non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"character. However, as unibyte and multibyte strings only have the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character set in common, it is usually not "
"meaningful to compare other characters between those two types of strings "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">Text "
"Representations</a>)."
msgstr ""
"文字のペアは、それぞれの文字コードに基づいて比較されます。<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字セットでは、小文字は対応する大文字よりも数"
"値が大きくなる点に注意してください。また、数字や多くの句読点文字は、大文字よ"
"りも数値が小さくなります。<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字は、いかな"
"る非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字よりも小さい値となります。ただ"
"し、ユニバイト文字列とマルチバイト文字列に共通しているのは<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 文字セットのみであるため、通常、これら2種類の"
"文字列間で他の文字を比較することに意味はありません（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text-Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a>を参照）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(string-lessp &quot;abc&quot; &quot;abd&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
"(string-lessp &quot;abd&quot; &quot;abc&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"(string-lessp &quot;123&quot; &quot;abc&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"When the strings have different lengths, and they match up to the length of "
"<var class=\"var\">string1</var>, then the result is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>.  If they match up to the length of <var class=\"var\">string2</var>, "
"the result is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  A string of no characters is "
"less than any other string."
msgstr ""
"文字列の長さが異なり、<var class=\"var\">string1</var>の長さまで一致した場"
"合、結果は<code class=\"code\">t</code>となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">string2</var>の長さまで一致した場合、結果は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。文字を含まない文字列は、他のどの文字列よ"
"りも短くなります。"

