# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">string1</var> is less than <var class=\"var\">string2</var> in "
"collation order of the specified <var class=\"var\">locale</var>, which "
"defaults to your current system locale.  A collation order is not only "
"determined by the lexicographic order of the characters contained in <var "
"class=\"var\">string1</var> and <var class=\"var\">string2</var>, but also "
"by further rules about relations between these characters.  Usually, it is "
"defined by the locale environment with which Emacs is running, and by the "
"Standard C library against which Emacs was linked."
msgstr ""
