"class=\"code\">&quot;enu_USA.1252&quot;</code> on MS-Windows systems.  The "
"<var class=\"var\">locale</var> value of <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;POSIX&quot;</code> or <code class=\"code\">&quot;C&quot;"
"</code> lets <code class=\"code\">string-collate-lessp</code> behave like "
