#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"Return the position of the first instance of <var class=\"var\">needle</var> "
"in <var class=\"var\">haystack</var>, both of which are strings.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">start-pos</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, start "
"searching from that position in <var class=\"var\">haystack</var>.  Return "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if no match was found.  This function only "
"considers the characters in the strings when doing the comparison; text "
"properties are ignored.  Matching is always case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
