# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"This function compares a specified part of <var class=\"var\">string1</var> "
"with a specified part of <var class=\"var\">string2</var>.  The specified "
"part of <var class=\"var\">string1</var> runs from index <var "
"class=\"var\">start1</var> (inclusive) up to index <var class=\"var\">end1</"
"var> (exclusive); <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">start1</var> means the start of the string, while <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var class=\"var\">end1</var> means the length "
"of the string.  Likewise, the specified part of <var class=\"var\">string2</"
"var> runs from index <var class=\"var\">start2</var> up to index <var "
"class=\"var\">end2</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string1</var> の指定した部分と <var "
"class=\"var\">string2</var> の指定した部分を比較します。<var "
"class=\"var\">string1</var> の指定した部分は、インデックス <var "
"class=\"var\">start1</var>（含む）からインデックス <var class=\"var\">end1</"
"var>（除く）までです。<var class=\"var\">start1</var> における <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> は文字列の先頭を、<var class=\"var\">end1</var> に"
"おける <code class=\"code\">nil</code> は文字列の長さを表します。同様に、"
"<var class=\"var\">string2</var> の指定した部分は、インデックス <var "
"class=\"var\">start2</var> からインデックス <var class=\"var\">end2</var> ま"
"でです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"The strings are compared by the numeric values of their characters.  For "
"instance, <var class=\"var\">str1</var> is considered less than <var "
"class=\"var\">str2</var> if its first differing character has a smaller "
"numeric value.  If <var class=\"var\">ignore-case</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, characters are converted to upper-case, using the "
"current buffer&rsquo;s case-table (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case-"
"Tables.html\">The Case Table</a>), before comparing them.  Unibyte strings "
"are converted to multibyte for comparison (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text-Representations.html\">Text Representations</a>), so that a "
"unibyte string and its conversion to multibyte are always regarded as equal."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Comparison.html
msgid ""
"If the specified portions of the two strings match, the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>.  Otherwise, the value is an integer which indicates "
"how many leading characters agree, and which string is less.  Its absolute "
"value is one plus the number of characters that agree at the beginning of "
"the two strings.  The sign is negative if <var class=\"var\">string1</var> "
"(or its specified portion) is less."
msgstr ""
"2つの文字列の指定された部分が一致する場合、値は <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> となります。そうでない場合、値は、先頭の何文字が一致し、どちらの文字列"
"がより小さいかを示す整数となります。その絶対値は、2つの文字列の先頭で一致する"
"文字数に1を加えたものです。<var class=\"var\">string1</var>（またはその指定さ"
"れた部分）の方が小さい場合、符号は負となります。"

