# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Lines.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the number of lines between the positions <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> in the current "
"buffer.  If <var class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> "
"are equal, then it returns 0.  Otherwise it returns at least 1, even if <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> are on the same "
"line.  This is because the text between them, considered in isolation, must "
"contain at least one line unless it is empty."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファにおける位置 <var class=\"var\">start</var> と "
"<var class=\"var\">end</var> の間にある行数を返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> と <var class=\"var\">end</var> が等しい場合は 0 を"
"返します。それ以外の場合は、<var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> が同じ行にある場合であっても、少なくとも 1 を返しま"
"す。これは、その間のテキストを単独で考えた場合、空でない限り少なくとも 1 行含"
"まれている必要があるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Lines.html
msgid ""
"If the optional <var class=\"var\">ignore-invisible-lines</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, invisible lines will not be included in the count."
msgstr ""
"オプションの <var class=\"var\">ignore-invisible-lines</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、不可視の線はカウントに含まれません。"

