# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Quoting-Style.html
msgid ""
"You should not read the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">text-"
"quoting-style</code> directly.  Instead, use this function with the same "
"name to dynamically compute the correct quoting style on the current "
"terminal in the <code class=\"code\">nil</code> case described above."
