#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"<span>34.1 Text Representations<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Text-"
"Representations-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>34.1 テキスト表現<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Text-"
"Representations-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-representation\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-representation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"Emacs buffers and strings support a large repertoire of characters from many "
"different scripts, allowing users to type and display text in almost any "
"known written language."
msgstr ""
"Emacsのバッファや文字列は、多種多様な文字体系にわたる膨大な文字レパートリーを"
"サポートしており、ユーザーは既知のほぼあらゆる書き言葉でテキストを入力・表示"
"することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-codepoint\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-codespace\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-Unicode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-codepoint\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-codespace\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-Unicode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"To support this multitude of characters and scripts, Emacs closely follows "
"the <em class=\"dfn\">Unicode Standard</em>.  The Unicode Standard assigns a "
"unique number, called a <em class=\"dfn\">codepoint</em>, to each and every "
"character.  The range of codepoints defined by Unicode, or the Unicode <em "
"class=\"dfn\">codespace</em>, is <code class=\"code\">0..#x10FFFF</code> (in "
"hexadecimal notation), inclusive.  Emacs extends this range with codepoints "
"in the range <code class=\"code\">#x110000..#x3FFFFF</code>, which it uses "
"for representing characters that are not unified with Unicode and <em "
"class=\"dfn\">raw 8-bit bytes</em> that cannot be interpreted as "
"characters.  Thus, a character codepoint in Emacs is a 22-bit integer."
msgstr ""
"こうした膨大な数の文字やスクリプトに対応するため、Emacsは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">Unicode標準</em>に厳密に準拠しています。Unicode標準では、あらゆ"
"る文字に対して<em class=\"dfn\">コードポイント</em>と呼ばれる一意の番号を割り"
"当てています。Unicodeで定義されているコードポイントの範囲、すなわちUnicodeの"
"<em class=\"dfn\">コードスペース</em>は、<code class=\"code\">0..#x10FFFF</"
"code>（16進表記）までを含みます。Emacsはこの範囲を<code "
"class=\"code\">#x110000..#x3FFFFF</code>までのコードポイントで拡張しており、"
"Unicodeに統一されていない文字や、文字として解釈できない<em class=\"dfn\">生の"
"8ビットバイト</em>の表現にこれを利用しています。したがって、Emacsにおける文字"
"のコードポイントは22ビットの整数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-internal-representation-of-"
"characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-characters_002c-"
"representation-in-buffers-and-strings\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-multibyte-text\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-internal-representation-of-"
"characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-characters_002c-"
"representation-in-buffers-and-strings\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-multibyte-text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"To conserve memory, Emacs does not hold fixed-length 22-bit numbers that are "
"codepoints of text characters within buffers and strings.  Rather, Emacs "
"uses a variable-length internal representation of characters, that stores "
"each character as a sequence of 1 to 5 8-bit bytes, depending on the "
"magnitude of its codepoint<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF28\" "
"href=\"#FOOT28\"><sup>28</sup></a>.  For example, any <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character takes up only 1 byte, a Latin-1 "
"character takes up 2 bytes, etc.  We call this representation of text <em "
"class=\"dfn\">multibyte</em>."
msgstr ""
"メモリを節約するため、Emacsはバッファや文字列内のテキスト文字のコードポイント"
"として、固定長の22ビット数値を保持しません。その代わりに、Emacsは文字の可変長"
"内部表現を採用しており、コードポイントの大きさに応じて、各文字を1〜5個の8ビッ"
"トバイトのシーケンスとして格納します<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF28\" "
"href=\"#FOOT28\"><sup>28</sup></a>。例えば、任意の<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字は1バイト、Latin-1文字は2バイトを占有しま"
"す。このようなテキストの表現方式を<em class=\"dfn\">マルチバイト</em>と呼びま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"Outside Emacs, characters can be represented in many different encodings, "
"such as ISO-8859-1, GB-2312, Big-5, etc.  Emacs converts between these "
"external encodings and its internal representation, as appropriate, when it "
"reads text into a buffer or a string, or when it writes text to a disk file "
"or passes it to some other process."
msgstr ""
"Emacs外部では、文字はISO-8859-1、GB-2312、Big-5など、さまざまなエンコーディン"
"グで表現できます。Emacsは、テキストをバッファや文字列に読み込む際、あるいはテ"
"キストをディスクファイルに書き込んだり他のプロセスに渡したりする際に、状況に"
"応じてこれらの外部エンコーディングと内部表現との間で変換を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"Occasionally, Emacs needs to hold and manipulate encoded text or binary non-"
"text data in its buffers or strings.  For example, when Emacs visits a file, "
"it first reads the file&rsquo;s text verbatim into a buffer, and only then "
"converts it to the internal representation.  Before the conversion, the "
"buffer holds encoded text."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、バッファや文字列内でエンコード済みテキストやバイナリの非テキスト"
"データを保持・操作する必要がある場合があります。例えば、Emacsがファイルを読み"
"込む際は、まずファイルのテキストをそのままバッファに読み込み、その後になって"
"初めて内部表現に変換します。変換前、バッファにはエンコード済みテキストが保持"
"されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unibyte-text\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unibyte-text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"Encoded text is not really text, as far as Emacs is concerned, but rather a "
"sequence of raw 8-bit bytes.  We call buffers and strings that hold encoded "
"text <em class=\"dfn\">unibyte</em> buffers and strings, because Emacs "
"treats them as a sequence of individual bytes.  Usually, Emacs displays "
"unibyte buffers and strings as octal codes such as <code "
"class=\"code\">\\237</code>.  We recommend that you never use unibyte "
"buffers and strings except for manipulating encoded text or binary non-text "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Emacsにとって、エンコードされたテキストは本来の意味でのテキストではなく、むし"
"ろ生の8ビットバイト列です。エンコードされたテキストを保持するバッファや文字列"
"を<em class=\"dfn\">ユニバイト</em>バッファや文字列と呼ぶのは、Emacsがそれら"
"を個々のバイト列として扱うためです。通常、Emacsはユニバイトバッファや文字列を"
"<code class=\"code\">\\237</code>のような8進数コードで表示します。エンコード"
"されたテキストやバイナリの非テキストデータを扱う場合を除き、ユニバイトバッ"
"ファや文字列は決して使用しないことを推奨します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"In a buffer, the buffer-local value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-characters</code> specifies the "
"representation used.  The representation for a string is determined and "
"recorded in the string when the string is constructed."
msgstr ""
"バッファにおいて、変数 <code class=\"code\">enable-multibyte-characters</"
"code> のバッファローカル値が、使用される表現を指定します。文字列の表現は、文"
"字列が構築される際に決定され、文字列に記録されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">enable-multibyte-characters</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-enable_002dmultibyte_002dcharacters\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">enable-multibyte-characters</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-enable_002dmultibyte_002dcharacters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the current buffer&rsquo;s text representation.  If "
"it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the buffer contains multibyte "
"text; otherwise, it contains unibyte encoded text or binary non-text data."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、現在のバッファのテキスト表現を指定します。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、バッファにはマルチバイトテキストが含ま"
"れています。それ以外の場合は、ユニバイト符号化テキストまたはバイナリの非テキ"
"ストデータが含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"You cannot set this variable directly; instead, use the function <code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer-multibyte</code> to change a buffer&rsquo;s "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"この変数を直接設定することはできません。代わりに、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer-multibyte</code> を使用してバッファの表現を変更して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">position-bytes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-position_002dbytes\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">position-bytes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">position</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-position_002dbytes\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"Buffer positions are measured in character units.  This function returns the "
"byte-position corresponding to buffer position <var class=\"var\">position</"
"var> in the current buffer.  This is 1 at the start of the buffer, and "
"counts upward in bytes.  If <var class=\"var\">position</var> is out of "
"range, the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"バッファ位置は文字単位で計測されます。この関数は、現在のバッファにおけるバッ"
"ファ位置 <var class=\"var\">position</var> に対応するバイト位置を返します。こ"
"れはバッファの先頭で 1 となり、バイト単位で順に増加します。<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> が範囲外の場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-to-position</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">byte-"
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"byte_002dto_002dposition\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">byte-to-position</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">byte-"
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"byte_002dto_002dposition\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-Representations.html
msgid ""
"Return the buffer position, in character units, corresponding to given <var "
"class=\"var\">byte-position</var> in the current buffer.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">byte-position</var> is out of range, the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In a multibyte buffer, an arbitrary value of "
"<var class=\"var\">byte-position</var> can be not at character boundary, but "
"inside a multibyte sequence representing a single character; in this case, "
"this function returns the buffer position of the character whose multibyte "
"sequence includes <var class=\"var\">byte-position</var>.  In other words, "
"the value does not change for all byte positions that belong to the same "
"character."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファにおいて、指定された <var class=\"var\">byte-position</var> に"
"対応するバッファ位置を文字単位で返します。<var class=\"var\">byte-position</"
"var> が範囲外の場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。マルチ"
"バイトバッファでは、<var class=\"var\">byte-position</var> の値が文字境界では"
"なく、単一の文字を表すマルチバイトシーケンスの内部にある場合があります。この"
