# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This function reads a string from the minibuffer and returns it.  The "
"arguments <var class=\"var\">prompt</var>, <var class=\"var\">initial</var>, "
"<var class=\"var\">history</var> and <var class=\"var\">inherit-input-"
"method</var> are used as in <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</"
"code>.  The keymap used is <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-local-map</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数はミニバッファから文字列を読み込み、それを返します。引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var>、<var class=\"var\">initial</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">history</var>、<var class=\"var\">inherit-input-method</var> "
"は <code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code> と同様に使用されます。使"
"用されるキーマップは <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-local-map</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"The optional argument <var class=\"var\">default</var> is used as in <code "
"class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code>, except that, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it also specifies a default value to return if "
"the user enters null input.  As in <code class=\"code\">read-from-"
"minibuffer</code> it should be a string, a list of strings, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which is equivalent to an empty string.  When "
"<var class=\"var\">default</var> is a string, that string is the default "
"value.  When it is a list of strings, the first string is the default "
"value.  (All these strings are available to the user in the &ldquo;future "
"minibuffer history&rdquo;.)"
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">default</var> は <code class=\"code\">read-"
"from-minibuffer</code> と同様に使用されますが、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合は、ユーザーが null 入力を入力した際に返されるデフォルト値も"
"指定します。<code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code> と同様に、文字"
"列、文字列のリスト、または空文字列と同等の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"指定できます。<var class=\"var\">default</var> が文字列の場合、その文字列がデ"
"フォルト値となります。文字列のリストの場合、最初の文字列がデフォルト値となり"
"ます。（これらの文字列はすべて、ユーザーは「future minibuffer history」で利用"
"可能です。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"This function works by calling the <code class=\"code\">read-from-"
"minibuffer</code> function:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">read-from-minibuffer</code>関数を呼び出すこ"
"とで動作します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(read-string <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> <var class=\"var\">initial</var> <var class=\"var\">history</var> <var class=\"var\">default</var> <var class=\"var\">inherit</var>)\n"
"&equiv;\n"
"(let ((value\n"
"       (read-from-minibuffer <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> <var class=\"var\">initial</var> nil nil\n"
"                             <var class=\"var\">history</var> <var class=\"var\">default</var> <var class=\"var\">inherit</var>)))\n"
