# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">format-args</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"<var class=\"var\">prompt</var> is used as a literal string.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">format-args</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> is used as a format control string, and <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> and <var class=\"var\">format-args</var> are "
"passed to <code class=\"code\">format</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">Formatting Strings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">format-args</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">prompt</var> はリテラル文字列として使用されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">format-args</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、<var class=\"var\">prompt</var> は書式制御文字列として使用され、<var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> と <var class=\"var\">format-args</var> は <code "
"class=\"code\">format</code> に渡されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">書式文字列</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-default-prompt-format</code> can be &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;&quot;</samp>&rsquo;, in which case no default "
"values are displayed."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-default-prompt-format</code> は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;&quot;</samp>&rsquo; となる場合があり、その場合はデフォ"
"ルト値は表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">default</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"there is no default value, and therefore no &ldquo;default value&rdquo; "
"string is included in the result value.  If <var class=\"var\">default</var> "
"is a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> list, the first element of the list "
"is used in the prompt."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">default</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、"
"デフォルト値は存在せず、したがって結果の値に「デフォルト値」文字列は含まれま"
"せん。<var class=\"var\">default</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外のリストである場合、リストの最初の要素がプロンプトに使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Text-from-Minibuffer.html
msgid ""
"Both <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> and <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-"
"default-prompt-format</code> are run through <code class=\"code\">substitute-"
"command-keys</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys-in-"
"Documentation.html\">Substituting Key Bindings in Documentation</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">prompt</var> と <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-default-"
"prompt-format</code> はどちらも <code class=\"code\">substitute-command-"
"keys</code> を経由します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys-in-"
"Documentation.html\">ドキュメントにおけるキーバインドの置換</a> を参照）。"

