"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dup_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This behaves like <code class=\"code\">scroll-up</code>, except that if the "
"selected window cannot be scrolled any further and the value of the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-error-top-bottom</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, it tries to move to the end of the buffer instead.  "
"If point is already there, it signals an error."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">scroll-up</code> と同様に動作しますが、選択中の"
"ウィンドウをそれ以上スクロールできず、かつ変数 <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"error-top-bottom</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合は、代"
"わりにバッファの末尾へ移動しようとします。ポイントがすでにそこにある場合は、"
"エラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-down-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002ddown_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-down-command</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002ddown_002dcommand\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This behaves like <code class=\"code\">scroll-down</code>, except that if "
"the selected window cannot be scrolled any further and the value of the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">scroll-error-top-bottom</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, it tries to move to the beginning of the buffer "
"instead.  If point is already there, it signals an error."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">scroll-down</code> と同様に動作しますが、選択され"
"たウィンドウがそれ以上スクロールできず、かつ変数 <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"error-top-bottom</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合は、代"
"わりにバッファの先頭に移動しようとします。ポイントがすでにそこにある場合は、"
"エラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-other-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dother_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-other-window</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dother_002dwindow\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This function scrolls the text in another window upward <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> lines.  Negative values of <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, are handled "
"as in <code class=\"code\">scroll-up</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、別のウィンドウ内のテキストを<var class=\"var\">count</var>行分上"
"方向にスクロールします。<var class=\"var\">count</var>や<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>の負の値は、<code class=\"code\">scroll-up</code>と"
"同様に処理されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"You can specify which buffer to scroll by setting the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">other-window-scroll-buffer</code> to a buffer.  If that "
"buffer isn&rsquo;t already displayed, <code class=\"code\">scroll-other-"
"window</code> displays it in some window."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">other-window-scroll-buffer</code> にバッファを指定"
"することで、どのバッファをスクロールするかを指定できます。そのバッファがまだ"
"表示されていない場合、<code class=\"code\">scroll-other-window</code> が何ら"
"かのウィンドウにそれを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"When the selected window is the minibuffer, the next window is normally the "
"leftmost one immediately above it.  You can specify a different window to "
"scroll, when the minibuffer is selected, by setting the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-scroll-window</code>.  This variable has no effect "
"when any other window is selected.  When it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> and the minibuffer is selected, it takes precedence over <code "
"class=\"code\">other-window-scroll-buffer</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-Misc.html#Definition-of-"
"minibuffer_002dscroll_002dwindow\">Definition of minibuffer-scroll-window</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"選択中のウィンドウがミニバッファである場合、通常、次のウィンドウはその直上に"
"ある最も左側のウィンドウになります。ミニバッファが選択されているときに、スク"
"ロールする別のウィンドウを指定するには、変数 <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-"
"scroll-window</code> を設定します。この変数は、他のウィンドウが選択されている"
"場合には効果がありません。この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であ"
"り、かつミニバッファが選択されている場合は、<code class=\"code\">other-"
"window-scroll-buffer</code> よりも優先されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-Misc.html#Definition-of-"
"minibuffer_002dscroll_002dwindow\">minibuffer-scroll-window の定義</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-other-window-down</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dother_002dwindow_002ddown\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-other-window-down</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dother_002dwindow_002ddown\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This function scrolls the text in another window downward <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> lines.  Negative values of <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var>, or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, are handled "
"as in <code class=\"code\">scroll-down</code>.  In other respects, it "
"behaves the same way as <code class=\"code\">scroll-other-window</code> does."
msgstr ""
