# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This option specifies the size of the scroll margin&mdash;a minimum number "
"of lines between point and the top or bottom of a window.  Whenever point "
"gets within this many lines of the top or bottom of the window, redisplay "
"scrolls the text automatically (if possible) to move point out of the "
"margin, closer to the center of the window."
msgstr ""
"このオプションはスクロールマージンのサイズ（pointとウィンドウの上端または下端"
"との間の最小行数）を指定します。pointがウィンドウの上端または下端からこの行数"
"分以内に近づいたとき、redisplayは（可能な場合は）自動的にテキストをスクロール"
"し、pointをマージンの外、ウィンドウの中央寄りに移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">maximum-scroll-margin</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-maximum_002dscroll_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">maximum-scroll-margin</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-maximum_002dscroll_002dmargin\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This variable limits the effective value of <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"margin</code> to a fraction of the current window line height.  For example, "
"if the current window has 20 lines and <code class=\"code\">maximum-scroll-"
"margin</code> is 0.1, then the scroll margins will never be larger than 2 "
"lines, no matter how big <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> is."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> の実効値を現在のウィン"
"ドウの行高さの一定割合に制限します。例えば、現在のウィンドウが20行で <code "
"class=\"code\">maximum-scroll-margin</code> が 0.1 の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> がどれほど大きくても、スクロールマージン"
"が2行を超えることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">maximum-scroll-margin</code> itself has a maximum value "
"of 0.5, which allows setting margins large to keep the cursor at the middle "
"line of the window (or two middle lines if the window has an even number of "
"lines).  If it&rsquo;s set to a larger value (or any value other than a "
"float between 0.0 and 0.5) then the default value of 0.25 will be used "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">maximum-scroll-margin</code> 自体の最大値は 0.5 であり、"
"これによりマージンを大きく設定して、カーソルをウィンドウの中央行（ウィンドウ"
"の行数が偶数の場合は中央の 2 行）に保持することができます。より大きな値（また"
"は 0.0 から 0.5 の間の浮動小数点数以外の値）に設定した場合は、代わりにデフォ"
"ルト値の 0.25 が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-conservatively</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dconservatively\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">scroll-conservatively</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dconservatively\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls how scrolling is done automatically when point moves "
"off the screen (or into the scroll margin).  If the value is a positive "
"integer <var class=\"var\">n</var>, then redisplay scrolls the text up to "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var> lines in either direction, if that will bring "
"point back into proper view.  This behavior is called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">conservative scrolling</em>.  Otherwise, scrolling happens in "
"the usual way, under the control of other variables such as <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</code> and <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"down-aggressively</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、ポイントが画面外（またはスクロールマージン内）に移動した際に、自"
"動的に行われるスクロールの動作を制御します。値が正の整数 <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> の場合、redisplay は、ポイントが適切な表示範囲内に戻る"
"のであれば、上下いずれかの方向に <var class=\"var\">n</var> 行分までテキスト"
"をスクロールします。この動作は <em class=\"dfn\">保守的スクロール</em> と呼ば"
"れます。それ以外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</code> "
"や <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> などの他の変数の制御"
"により、通常の方法でスクロールが行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"The default value is zero, which means that conservative scrolling never "
"happens."
msgstr ""
"デフォルト値は0であり、これはコンサバティブスクロールが一切行われないことを意"
"味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-down-aggressively</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002ddown_002daggressively\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">scroll-down-aggressively</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-scroll_002ddown_002daggressively\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable should be either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"or a fraction <var class=\"var\">f</var> between 0 and 1.  If it is a "
"fraction, that specifies where on the screen to put point when scrolling "
"down.  More precisely, when a window scrolls down because point is above the "
"window start, the new start position is chosen to put point <var "
"class=\"var\">f</var> part of the window height from the top.  The larger "
"<var class=\"var\">f</var>, the more aggressive the scrolling."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> または 0 から 1 の間の分数 "
"<var class=\"var\">f</var> である必要があります。分数の場合、スクロールダウン"
"時にポイントを画面上のどこに配置するかを指定します。より正確には、ポイントが"
"ウィンドウの開始位置より上にあるためにウィンドウがスクロールダウンする場合、"
"新しい開始位置は、ウィンドウ高さの上端から <var class=\"var\">f</var> の位置"
"にポイントを配置するように選択されます。<var class=\"var\">f</var> の値が大き"
"いほど、スクロールはより急激に行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"A value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is equivalent to .5, since its "
"effect is to center point.  This variable automatically becomes buffer-local "
"when set in any fashion."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値は点を中央に配置する効果があるため、.5 と"
"同等です。この変数は、どのような方法で設定しても自動的にバッファローカルにな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-up-aggressively</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dup_002daggressively\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">scroll-up-aggressively</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dup_002daggressively\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, for scrolling up.  The value, <var class=\"var\">f</var>, "
"specifies how far point should be placed from the bottom of the window; "
"thus, as with <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code>, a larger "
"value scrolls more aggressively."
msgstr ""
"同様に、上にスクロールする場合も同様です。値 <var class=\"var\">f</var> は、"
"ウィンドウの下端からポイントをどの程度離すかを指定します。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> と同様に、値が大きいほどより大"
"きくスクロールします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-step</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"scroll_002dstep\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">scroll-step</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dstep\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This variable is an older variant of <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"conservatively</code>.  The difference is that if its value is <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>, that permits scrolling only by precisely <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> lines, not a smaller number.  This feature does not "
"work with <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code>.  The default value is "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"この変数は <code class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code> の旧バージョンで"
"す。違いは、値が <var class=\"var\">n</var> の場合、それより少ない行数ではな"
"く、正確に <var class=\"var\">n</var> 行分のみスクロールが可能になる点です。"
"この機能は <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> では動作しません。デフォ"
"ルト値は 0 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dcommand-property\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dcommand-property\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-preserve-screen-position</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002dpreserve_002dscreen_002dposition\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">scroll-preserve-screen-position</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"scroll_002dpreserve_002dscreen_002dposition\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If this option is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, whenever a scrolling "
"command moves point off-window, Emacs tries to adjust point to keep the "
"cursor at its old vertical position in the window, rather than the window "
"edge."
msgstr ""
"このオプションが <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、スクロールコマンドに"
"よってポイントがウィンドウ外に移動するたびに、Emacs はカーソルをウィンドウの"
"端ではなく、ウィンドウ内の元の垂直位置に維持するようにポイントを調整しようと"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and not <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, Emacs adjusts point to keep the cursor at the same "
"vertical position, even if the scrolling command didn&rsquo;t move point off-"
"window."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"でもない場合、スクロールコマンドによってポイントがウィンドウ外に移動しなかっ"
"たとしても、Emacs はカーソルを同じ垂直位置に維持するようにポイントを調整しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This option affects all scroll commands that have a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">scroll-command</code> symbol "
"property."
msgstr ""
"このオプションは、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-command</code> 以外のシンボルプロパティを持つすべてのス"
"クロールコマンドに影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">next-screen-context-lines</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-next_002dscreen_002dcontext_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">next-screen-context-lines</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-next_002dscreen_002dcontext_002dlines\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the number of lines of continuity to retain "
"when scrolling by full screens.  For example, <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"up</code> with an argument of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> scrolls so "
"that this many lines at the bottom of the window appear instead at the top.  "
"The default value is <code class=\"code\">2</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、フルスクリーンでスクロールする際に保持する連続行数です。例え"
"ば、引数に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定した <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up</code> では、ウィンドウ下部のこの行数分の表示が代わ"
"りに上部に現れるようにスクロールします。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">2</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">scroll-error-top-bottom</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-scroll_002derror_002dtop_002dbottom\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">scroll-error-top-bottom</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-scroll_002derror_002dtop_002dbottom\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If this option is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up-command</code> and <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-"
"command</code> simply signal an error when no more scrolling is possible."
msgstr ""
"このオプションが <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）、<code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up-command</code>、および <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"down-command</code> の場合、これ以上スクロールできなくなると単にエラーを通知"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If the value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, these commands instead move "
"point to the beginning or end of the buffer (depending on scrolling "
"direction); only if point is already on that position do they signal an "
"error."
msgstr ""
"値が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、これらのコマンドは代わりにポイント"
"をバッファの先頭または末尾（スクロール方向に応じて）に移動させます。ポイント"
"がすでにその位置にある場合にのみ、エラーが報告されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">recenter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count redisplay</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-recenter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">recenter</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count redisplay</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-recenter\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-centering-point\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-centering-point\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This function scrolls the text in the selected window so that point is "
"displayed at a specified vertical position within the window.  It does not "
"move point with respect to the text."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、選択したウィンドウ内のテキストをスクロールし、ポイントがウィンド"
"ウ内の指定した垂直位置に表示されるようにします。テキストに対するポイントの位"
"置は移動しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is a non-negative number, that puts the "
"line containing point <var class=\"var\">count</var> lines down from the top "
"of the window.  If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is a negative number, then "
"it counts upward from the bottom of the window, so that &minus;1 stands for "
"the last usable line in the window."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が非負の数である場合、点 <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> を含む行はウィンドウの上端から下に向かって配置され"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の数である場合は、ウィンドウの下端か"
"ら上に向かって数えられるため、&minus;1 がウィンドウ内で最後に利用可能な行とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">count</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (or a "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> list), <code class=\"code\">recenter</"
"code> puts the line containing point in the middle of the window.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and <var "
"class=\"var\">redisplay</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function may redraw the frame, according to the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-redisplay</code>.  Thus, omitting the second "
"argument can be used to countermand the effect of <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-redisplay</code> being non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  Interactive calls pass non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> for <var "
"class=\"var\">redisplay</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（または "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のリスト）である場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">recenter</code> は点を含む行をウィンドウの中央に配置します。"
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であり、か"
"つ <var class=\"var\">redisplay</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"である場合、この関数は <code class=\"code\">recenter-redisplay</code> の値に"
"応じてフレームを再描画することがあります。したがって、第2引数を省略すること"
"で、<code class=\"code\">recenter-redisplay</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であることによる影響を打ち消すことができます。"
"インタラクティブな呼び出しでは、<var class=\"var\">redisplay</var> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外が渡されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">recenter</code> is called interactively, <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is the raw prefix argument.  Thus, typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> as the prefix sets the <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> list, while typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 4</kbd> sets <var class=\"var\">count</var> to 4, which "
"positions the current line four lines from the top."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">recenter</code> を対話的に呼び出すと、<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> は生のプレフィックス引数となります。したがって、プ"
"レフィックスとして <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> と入力すると <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> に non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> リストが設定"
"され、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 4</kbd> と入力すると <var class=\"var\">count</"
"var> に 4 が設定され、現在の行が上から 4 行目に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"With an argument of zero, <code class=\"code\">recenter</code> positions the "
"current line at the top of the window.  The command <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-top-bottom</code> offers a more convenient way to "
"achieve this."
msgstr ""
"引数に0を指定すると、<code class=\"code\">recenter</code> は現在の行をウィン"
"ドウの最上部に配置します。<code class=\"code\">recenter-top-bottom</code> と"
"いうコマンドを使えば、より簡便にこれを実現できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
