"href=\"#index-recenter_002dwindow_002dgroup\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">recenter</code>, except that when "
"the selected window is part of a group of windows (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Selecting-Windows.html#Window-Group\">Window Group</a>), <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-window-group</code> scrolls the entire group.  This "
"condition holds when the buffer local variable <code class=\"code\">recenter-"
"window-group-function</code> is set to a function.  In this case, <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-window-group</code> calls the function with the "
"argument <var class=\"var\">count</var>, then returns its result.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">count</var> has the same meaning as in <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter</code>, but with respect to the entire window group."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">recenter</code> と同様ですが、選択されたウィ"
"ンドウがウィンドウグループ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-"
"Windows.html#Window-Group\">ウィンドウグループ</a> を参照）の一部である場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">recenter-window-group</code> はグループ全体をスクロール"
"します。この条件は、バッファローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">recenter-"
"window-group-function</code> に関数が設定されている場合に成立します。この場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">recenter-window-group</code> は引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> を指定してその関数を呼び出し、その結果を返します。"
"引数 <var class=\"var\">count</var> は <code class=\"code\">recenter</code> "
"と同様の意味を持ちますが、ウィンドウグループ全体に対して適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">recenter-redisplay</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"recenter_002dredisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">recenter-redisplay</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-recenter_002dredisplay\"> &para;</a></span>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, calling <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter</code> with a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> argument and non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"<var class=\"var\">redisplay</var> argument redraws the frame.  The default "
"value is <code class=\"code\">tty</code>, which means only redraw the frame "
"if it is a tty frame."
msgstr ""

