# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This command, which is the default binding for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-l</kbd>, "
"acts like <code class=\"code\">recenter</code>, except if called with no "
"argument.  In that case, successive calls place point according to the "
"cycling order defined by the variable <code class=\"code\">recenter-"
"positions</code>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-l</kbd> のデフォルトバインディングであるこのコマンドは、"
"引数なしで呼び出された場合を除き、<code class=\"code\">recenter</code> と同様"
"に動作します。その場合、連続して呼び出すと、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-positions</code> で定義された巡回順に従ってポイントが"
"移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">recenter-positions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"recenter_002dpositions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">recenter-positions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-recenter_002dpositions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Textual-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls how <code class=\"code\">recenter-top-bottom</code> "
"behaves when called with no argument.  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">(middle top bottom)</code>, which means that successive calls "
"of <code class=\"code\">recenter-top-bottom</code> with no argument cycle "
"between placing point at the middle, top, and bottom of the window."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、引数なしで呼び出された際の <code class=\"code\">recenter-top-"
"bottom</code> の動作を制御します。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">(middle top bottom)</code> であり、これは引数なしで <code "
"class=\"code\">recenter-top-bottom</code> を繰り返し呼び出すと、ポイントが"
"ウィンドウの中央、上部、下部のどこに配置されるかが循環することを意味します。"

