"name\">deactivate-mark</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-deactivate_002dmark\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">deactivate-mark</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-deactivate_002dmark\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Mark.html
msgid ""
"If Transient Mark mode is enabled or <var class=\"var\">force</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function deactivates the mark and runs "
"the normal hook <code class=\"code\">deactivate-mark-hook</code>.  "
"Otherwise, it does nothing."
msgstr ""
"Transient Markモードが有効であるか、または<var class=\"var\">force</var>が"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合、この関数はマークを解除し、通常の"
"フック<code class=\"code\">deactivate-mark-hook</code>を実行します。それ以外"
"の場合は、何も行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Mark.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mark-active</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mark_002dactive\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">mark-active</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mark_002dactive\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Mark.html
msgid ""
"The mark is active when this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  This variable is always buffer-local in each buffer.  Do <em "
"class=\"emph\">not</em> use the value of this variable to decide whether a "
"command that normally operates on text near point should operate on the "
"region instead.  Use the function <code class=\"code\">use-region-p</code> "
"for that (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-Region.html\">The Region</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、マークは有効になりま"
"す。この変数は、各バッファにおいて常にバッファローカルです。通常はポイント付"
"近のテキストに対して動作するコマンドを、代わりにリージョンに対して動作させる"
"かどうかの判断に、この変数の値を<em class=\"emph\">使用しないでください</"
"em>。その場合は関数 <code class=\"code\">use-region-p</code> を使用してくださ"
"い（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-Region.html\">リージョン</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Mark.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
