# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Mark.html
msgid ""
"When Delete Selection mode (see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Using-Region.html#Using-"
"Region\">Delete Selection</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</"
"cite>) is enabled, commands that operate on the active region (a.k.a. "
"&ldquo;selection&rdquo;) behave slightly differently.  This works by adding "
"the function <code class=\"code\">delete-selection-pre-hook</code> to the "
"<code class=\"code\">pre-command-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Command-Overview.html\">Command Loop Overview</a>).  That function "
"calls <code class=\"code\">delete-selection-helper</code> to delete the "
"selection as appropriate for the command.  If you want to adapt a command to "
"Delete Selection mode, put the <code class=\"code\">delete-selection</code> "
"property on the function&rsquo;s symbol (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Symbol-Plists.html\">Accessing Symbol Properties</a>); commands that "
"don&rsquo;t have this property on their symbol won&rsquo;t delete the "
"selection.  This property can have one of several values to tailor the "
"behavior to what the command is supposed to do; see the doc strings of <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-selection-pre-hook</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-selection-helper</code> for the details."
msgstr ""
"「選択範囲の削除」モード（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の"
"<a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Using-Region.html#Using-Region\">Delete Selection</a>を参照）"
"が有効な場合、アクティブなリージョン（いわゆる「選択範囲」）を操作するコマン"
"ドの動作がわずかに異なります。これは、<code class=\"code\">pre-command-hook</"
"code>に関数<code class=\"code\">delete-selection-pre-hook</code>を追加するこ"
"とで実現されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Command-Overview.html\">コマンド"
"ループの概要</a>を参照）。この関数は、コマンドに応じて選択範囲を削除するため"
"に<code class=\"code\">delete-selection-helper</code>を呼び出します。コマンド"
"を「選択範囲の削除」モードに適応させたい場合は、その関数のシンボルに<code "
"class=\"code\">delete-selection</code>プロパティを付与してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Plists.html\">シンボルプロパティへのアクセス</"
"a>を参照）。シンボルにこのプロパティが設定されていないコマンドは、選択範囲を"
"削除しません。このプロパティには、コマンドが意図する動作に合わせて調整するた"
"めの複数の値のいずれかを指定できます。詳細は<code class=\"code\">delete-"
"selection-pre-hook</code>および<code class=\"code\">delete-selection-helper</"
"code>のドキュメント文字列を参照してください。"

