# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-region\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-region\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"The text between point and the mark is known as <em class=\"dfn\">the "
"region</em>.  Various functions operate on text delimited by point and the "
"mark, but only those functions specifically related to the region itself are "
"described here."
msgstr ""
"ポイントとマークの間のテキストは、<em class=\"dfn\">リージョン</em>と呼ばれま"
"す。ポイントとマークで区切られたテキストに対してさまざまな関数が動作します"
"が、ここではリージョン自体に特に関連する関数についてのみ説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"The next two functions signal an error if the mark does not point anywhere.  "
"If Transient Mark mode is enabled and <code class=\"code\">mark-even-if-"
"inactive</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, they also signal an "
"error if the mark is inactive."
msgstr ""
"次の2つの関数は、マークがどこにも指していない場合にエラーを通知します。一時"
"マークモードが有効で、<code class=\"code\">mark-even-if-inactive</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、マークが非アクティブなときにもエ"
"ラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">region-beginning</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"region_002dbeginning\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">region-beginning</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"region_002dbeginning\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the position of the beginning of the region (as an "
"integer).  This is the position of either point or the mark, whichever is "
"smaller."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、領域の開始位置（整数）を返します。これは、ポイントとマークのう"
"ち、小さい方の位置となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">region-end</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"region_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">region-end</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"region_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the position of the end of the region (as an "
"integer).  This is the position of either point or the mark, whichever is "
"larger."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、領域の終端位置（整数）を返します。これは、ポイントとマークのう"
"ち、大きい方の位置となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Region.html
msgid ""
"Instead of using <code class=\"code\">region-beginning</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">region-end</code>, a command designed to operate on a region "
"should normally use <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> with either a "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">R</samp>&rsquo; code letter to find the beginning and end of "
"the region.  This lets other Lisp programs specify the bounds explicitly as "
"arguments.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive-Codes.html\">Code "
"Characters for <code class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">region-beginning</code> や <code class=\"code\">region-"
"end</code> を使用する代わりに、領域を操作するためのコマンドでは通常、<code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</"
"samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">R</samp>&rsquo; のコード文字"
"を組み合わせて、領域の開始位置と終了位置を特定します。これにより、他の Lisp "
"プログラムが引数として境界を明示的に指定できるようになります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive-Codes.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> のコード文字</a>を参照してください。"

