# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Thread-List.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">list-threads</code> command lists all the currently "
"alive threads.  In the resulting buffer, each thread is identified either by "
"the name passed to <code class=\"code\">make-thread</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Thread-Functions.html\">Basic Thread Functions</"
"a>), or by its unique internal identifier if it was not created with a "
"name.  The status of each thread at the time of the creation or last update "
"of the buffer is shown, in addition to the object the thread was blocked on "
"at the time, if it was blocked."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">list-threads</code> コマンドは、現在生存しているすべての"
"スレッドを一覧表示します。結果のバッファでは、各スレッドは <code "
"class=\"code\">make-thread</code> に渡された名前（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Thread-Functions.html\">基本スレッド関数</a> を参照）、または名"
"前を指定して作成されていない場合はその一意の内部識別子によって識別されます。"
"バッファの作成時または最終更新時点における各スレッドの状態に加え、ブロックさ"
"れていた場合はそのブロック元のオブジェクトも表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Thread-List.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thread-list-refresh-seconds</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-thread_002dlist_002drefresh_002dseconds\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">thread-list-refresh-seconds</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-thread_002dlist_002drefresh_002dseconds\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Thread-List.html
msgid ""
"The <samp class=\"file\">*Threads*</samp> buffer will automatically update "
"twice per second.  You can make the refresh rate faster or slower by "
"customizing this variable."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*Threads*</samp> バッファは1秒間に2回自動的に更新されま"
"す。この変数をカスタマイズすることで、更新頻度を上げたり下げたりできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/The-Thread-List.html
msgid "Here are the commands available in the thread list buffer:"
msgstr "スレッド一覧バッファで利用可能なコマンドは以下の通りです。"

