# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Thread-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">thread</em> in Emacs represents a separate thread of "
"Emacs Lisp execution.  It runs its own Lisp program, has its own current "
"buffer, and can have subprocesses locked to it, i.e. subprocesses whose "
"output only this thread can accept.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Threads.html\">Threads</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsにおける<em class=\"dfn\">スレッド</em>は、Emacs Lisp実行の独立したス"
"レッドを表します。独自のLispプログラムを実行し、独自のカレントバッファを持"
"ち、自身にロックされたサブプロセス（すなわち、このスレッドのみが出力を受け取"
"れるサブプロセス）を持つことができます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Threads.html\">スレッド</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Thread-Type.html
