# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"These functions perform calendrical computations using time values (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>).  As with any "
"time value, a value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for any of their time-"
"value arguments stands for the current system time, and a finite number "
"stands for the number of seconds since the epoch."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、時刻値（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">時刻</a>"
"を参照）を用いて暦計算を行います。他の時刻値と同様に、時刻値引数のいずれかに "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は現在のシステム時刻を、有限"
"の数値が指定された場合はエポックからの経過秒数を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-less-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dless_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-less-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dless_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"This returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the time value <var "
"class=\"var\">t1</var> is less than the time value <var class=\"var\">t2</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"時刻値 <var class=\"var\">t1</var> が時刻値 <var class=\"var\">t2</var> より"
"小さい場合、<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-equal-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dequal_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-equal-p</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dequal_002dp\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"This returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the two time values <var "
"class=\"var\">t1</var> and <var class=\"var\">t2</var> are equal.  The "
"result is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if either argument is a NaN.  For "
"the purpose of comparison, a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> argument "
"represents the current time with infinite resolution, so this function "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if one argument is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and the other is not, and callers can therefore "
"use <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to represent an unknown time value that "
"does not equal any timestamp."
msgstr ""
"2つの時刻値 <var class=\"var\">t1</var> と <var class=\"var\">t2</var> が等し"
"い場合、<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。いずれかの引数が NaN である"
"場合、結果は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。比較においては、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 引数は無限の分解能を持つ現在時刻を表すため、"
"一方の引数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で他方がそうでない場合、この関数"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。したがって、呼び出し側は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を用いて、いかなるタイムスタンプとも等しくな"
"い未知の時刻値を表すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-subtract</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dsubtract\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-subtract</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dsubtract\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"This returns the time difference <var class=\"var\">t1</var> &minus; <var "
"class=\"var\">t2</var> between two time values, as a Lisp timestamp.  The "
"result is exact and its clock resolution is no worse than the worse of its "
"two arguments&rsquo; resolutions.  If you need the difference in units of "
"elapsed seconds, you can convert it with <code class=\"code\">time-convert</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">float-time</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Time-Conversion.html\">Time Conversion</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、2つの時刻値の時間差 <var class=\"var\">t1</var> &minus; <var "
"class=\"var\">t2</var> をLispのタイムスタンプとして返します。結果は厳密であ"
"り、クロック分解能は2つの引数のうち低い方の分解能を下回ることはありません。経"
"過秒単位での差が必要な場合は、<code class=\"code\">time-convert</code> また"
"は <code class=\"code\">float-time</code> を用いて変換できます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Time-Conversion.html\">時刻変換</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-add</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dadd\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">time-add</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">t1 t2</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-time_002dadd\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Calculations.html
msgid ""
"This returns the sum of two time values, using the same conversion rules as "
"<code class=\"code\">time-subtract</code>.  One argument should represent a "
"time difference rather than a point in time, as a time value that is often "
"just a single number of elapsed seconds.  Here is how to add a number of "
"seconds to a time value:"
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">time-subtract</code>と同じ変換ルールを用いて、2"
"つの時刻値の和を返します。時刻値は多くの場合、単に経過秒数という単一の数値で"
"あるため、1つの引数は特定の時点ではなく、時刻の差を表す必要があります。時刻値"
"に秒数を加算する方法は以下の通りです。"

