# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> element is a Lisp timestamp that is "
"nonnegative and less than 61; it is less than 60 except during positive leap "
"seconds (assuming the operating system supports leap seconds).  If the "
"optional <var class=\"var\">form</var> argument is <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> uses the same precision as <var "
"class=\"var\">time</var>; if <var class=\"var\">form</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">integer</code>, <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> is truncated "
"to an integer.  For example, if <var class=\"var\">time</var> is the "
"timestamp <code class=\"code\">(1566009571321 . 1000)</code>, which "
"represents 2019-08-17 02:39:31.321 UTC on typical systems that lack leap "
"seconds, then <code class=\"code\">(decode-time <var class=\"var\">time</"
"var> t t)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">((31321 . 1000)  39 2 17 8 "
"2019 6 nil 0)</code>, whereas <code class=\"code\">(decode-time <var "
"class=\"var\">time</var> t 'integer)</code> returns <code class=\"code\">(31 "
"39 2 17 8 2019 6 nil 0)</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">form</var> is omitted "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it currently defaults to <code "
"class=\"code\">integer</code> but this default may change in future Emacs "
"releases, so callers requiring a particular form should specify <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">seconds</var> 要素は Lisp のタイムスタンプであり、非負か"
"つ 61 未満です。正の閏秒の期間を除き（オペレーティングシステムが閏秒をサポー"
"トしている場合）、60 未満となります。オプションの <var class=\"var\">form</"
"var> 引数が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">seconds</var> は <var class=\"var\">time</var> と同じ精度を用い"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">form</var> が <code class=\"code\">integer</code> の"
"場合、<var class=\"var\">seconds</var> は整数に切り捨てられます。例えば、"
"<var class=\"var\">time</var> がタイムスタンプ <code "
"class=\"code\">(1566009571321 . 1000)</code> であり、これが閏秒のない一般的な"
"システムにおいて 2019-08-17 02:39:31.321 UTC を表す場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">(decode-time <var class=\"var\">time</var> t t)</code> は "
"<code class=\"code\">((31321 . 1000)  39 2 17 8 2019 6 nil 0)</code> を返し、"
"一方で <code class=\"code\">(decode-time <var class=\"var\">time</var> t "
"'integer)</code> は <code class=\"code\">(31 39 2 17 8 2019 6 nil 0)</code> "
"を返します。<var class=\"var\">form</var> が省略されるか <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、現在はデフォルトで <code "
"class=\"code\">integer</code> となりますが、このデフォルトは今後の Emacs リ"
"リースで変更される可能性があるため、特定の形式を必要とする呼び出し元は <var "
"class=\"var\">form</var> を指定すべきです。"

