# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"These functions convert time values to text in a string, and vice versa.  "
"Time values are either represented as a Lisp timestamp (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>) or a decoded time "
"structure (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-Conversion.html\">Time "
"Conversion</a>)."
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、時刻値を文字列に変換し、またその逆も行います。時刻値は、Lisp"
"のタイムスタンプ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</"
"a>を参照）またはデコード済みの時刻構造体（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-"
"Conversion.html\">Time Conversion</a>を参照）のいずれかで表現されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">date-to-time</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-date_002dto_002dtime\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">date-to-time</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-date_002dto_002dtime\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function parses the time-string <var class=\"var\">string</var> and "
"returns the corresponding Lisp timestamp.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> should represent a date-time, and should be in "
"one of the forms recognized by <code class=\"code\">parse-time-string</code> "
"(see below).  This function assumes local time if <var class=\"var\">string</"
"var> lacks explicit time zone information, and assumes earliest values if "
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> lacks month, day, or time.  The operating "
"system limits the range of time and zone values."
msgstr ""
"この関数は時刻文字列 <var class=\"var\">string</var> を解析し、対応する Lisp "
"タイムスタンプを返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">string</var> は日時を表す必"
"要があり、<code class=\"code\">parse-time-string</code> で認識される形式のい"
"ずれかである必要があります（後述）。この関数は、<var class=\"var\">string</"
"var> に明示的なタイムゾーン情報がない場合はローカル時刻を、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> に月、日、または時刻の指定がない場合は最も早い値を"
"想定します。オペレーティングシステムによって、時刻およびゾーン値の範囲が制限"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">parse-time-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-parse_002dtime_002dstring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">parse-time-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-parse_002dtime_002dstring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function parses the time-string <var class=\"var\">string</var> into a "
"decoded time structure (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-"
"Conversion.html\">Time Conversion</a>).  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> should resemble an RFC 822 (or later) or ISO 8601 "
"string, like &ldquo;Fri, 25 Mar 2016 16:24:56 +0100&rdquo; or "
"&ldquo;1998-09-12T12:21:54-0200&rdquo;, but this function will attempt to "
"parse less well-formed time strings as well.  It parses an incomplete string "
"like &ldquo;2024-08-13&rdquo; to an incomplete structure like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(nil nil nil 13 8 2024 nil -1 nil)</samp>&rsquo;, in which an "
"unknown DST value is &minus;1 and other unknown values are <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、時刻文字列 <var class=\"var\">string</var> をデコード済みの時刻構"
"造体に解析します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-Conversion.html\">時刻変換</"
"a> を参照）。引数 <var class=\"var\">string</var> は、&ldquo;Fri, 25 Mar "
"2016 16:24:56 +0100&rdquo; や &ldquo;1998-09-12T12:21:54-0200&rdquo; のよう"
"に、RFC 822（またはそれ以降）や ISO 8601 形式の文字列である必要がありますが、"
"この関数は形式が不完全な時刻文字列の解析も試みます。&ldquo;2024-08-13&rdquo; "
"のような不完全な文字列を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(nil nil nil 13 8 2024 "
"nil -1 nil)</samp>&rsquo; のような不完全な構造体に解析し、そこでは未知の DST "
"値が &minus;1 となり、その他の未知の値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"Note that, unlike <code class=\"code\">decode-time</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-Conversion.html\">Time Conversion</a>), this "
"function does not interpret the time string, and in particular the values of "
"daylight-saving and timezone or UTC offset parts of the <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> argument do not affect the returned value of date "
"and time, they only affect the last two members of the returned decoded time "
"structure.  For example, if the time-zone information is present in <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>, the decoded time structure will include it; "
"otherwise the time-zone member of the returned value will be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  In other words, this function simply parses the "
"textual representation of date and time into separate numerical values, and "
"doesn&rsquo;t care whether the input time is local or UTC."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">decode-time</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Time-Conversion.html\">時刻変換</a>を参照）とは異なり、この関数は時刻"
"文字列を解釈しません。特に、<var class=\"var\">string</var> 引数の daylight-"
"saving および timezone または UTC offset 部分の値は、返される日時の値には影響"
"せず、返されるデコード済み時刻構造体の最後の2つのメンバにのみ影響します。例え"
"ば、<var class=\"var\">string</var> にタイムゾーン情報が含まれている場合、デ"
"コード済み時刻構造体にはその情報が含まれます。そうでない場合、返される値のタ"
"イムゾーンメンバは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。言い換えれば、"
"この関数は単に日時のテキスト表現を個別の数値に変換するものであり、入力時刻が"
"ローカルか UTC かは問いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"If a Lisp program passes the return value of this function to some other "
"time-related API, it should make sure the <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"members of the decoded time structure are interpreted correctly, and in "
"particular the lack of time-zone information is interpreted as UTC or local "
"time, according to the needs of the calling program."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラムがこの関数の戻り値を他の時刻関連APIに渡す場合は、デコードされた"
"時刻構造体の<code class=\"code\">nil</code>メンバが正しく解釈されるようにし、"
"特にタイムゾーン情報の欠如が、呼び出し元プログラムの要件に応じてUTCまたはロー"
"カル時刻として解釈されるようにする必要がある。"

