# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This stands for the time zone abbreviation (e.g., &lsquo;<samp "
