"これはタイムゾーンの略称（例：&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">IST</samp>&rsquo;）"
"を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%z</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%z</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This stands for the time zone numerical offset.  The &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">z</samp>&rsquo; can be preceded by one, two, or three colons; "
"if plain &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%z</samp>&rsquo; stands for &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-0500</samp>&rsquo;, then &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%:z</samp>&rsquo; stands for &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-05:00</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%::z</"
"samp>&rsquo; stands for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-05:00:00</samp>&rsquo;, "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%:::z</samp>&rsquo; is like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%::z</samp>&rsquo; except it suppresses trailing instances of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:00</samp>&rsquo; so it stands for &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-05</samp>&rsquo; in the same example."
msgstr ""
"これはタイムゾーンの数値オフセットを表します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">z</"
"samp>&rsquo; の前には、1つ、2つ、または3つのコロンを置くことができます。単な"
"る &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%z</samp>&rsquo; が &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-0500</samp>&rsquo; を表すなら、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%:z</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-05:00</"
"samp>&rsquo; を、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%::z</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-05:00:00</samp>&rsquo; を表し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%:::z</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%::z</"
"samp>&rsquo; と同様ですが、末尾の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:00</"
"samp>&rsquo; を省略するため、同じ例では &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-05</"
"samp>&rsquo; を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid "This stands for a single &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr "これは単一の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"One or more flag characters can appear immediately after the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;.  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; "
"pads with zeros, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; pads with zeros "
"and also puts &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; before nonnegative "
"year numbers with more than four digits, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">_</"
"samp>&rsquo; pads with blanks, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; "
"suppresses padding, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; upper-cases "
"letters, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; reverses the case "
"of letters."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;の直後には、1つ以上のフラグ文字を"
"指定できます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;は0でパディングし、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo;は0でパディングするとともに4桁を超"
"える非負の年号の前に&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo;を挿入し、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">_</samp>&rsquo;は空白でパディングし、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;はパディングを抑制し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;は文字を大文字にし、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo;は文字の大文字・小文字を反転させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"You can also specify the field width and type of padding for any of these "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequences.  This works as in "
"<code class=\"code\">printf</code>: you write the field width as digits in a "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequence, after any flags.  For "
"example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo; specifies the number "
"of seconds since the minute; &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%03S</samp>&rsquo; "
"means to pad this with zeros to 3 positions, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%_3S</samp>&rsquo; to pad with spaces to 3 positions.  Plain "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%3S</samp>&rsquo; pads with zeros, because that "
"is how &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo; normally pads to two "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"また、これらの &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスのいずれ"
"においても、フィールド幅とパディングの種類を指定できます。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">printf</code> と同様に動作し、フラグの後に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスとしてフィールド幅を数字で記述しま"
"す。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo; は分経過後の秒数を指"
"定し、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%03S</samp>&rsquo; はこれを0で3桁にパディン"
"グし、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%_3S</samp>&rsquo; はスペースで3桁にパディ"
"ングすることを意味します。単なる &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%3S</"
"samp>&rsquo; は0でパディングされます。これは、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%S</samp>&rsquo; が通常2桁にパディングする方法であるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"The characters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">E</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">O</samp>&rsquo; act as modifiers when used after any flags "
"and field widths in a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequence.  "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">E</samp>&rsquo; specifies using the current "
"locale&rsquo;s alternative version of the date and time.  In a Japanese "
"locale, for example, <code class=\"code\">%Ex</code> might yield a date "
"format based on the Japanese Emperors&rsquo; reigns.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">E</samp>&rsquo; is allowed in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%Ec</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%EC</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%Ex</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%EX</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%Ey</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%EY</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">E</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">O</samp>&rsquo; は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo; シーケンス内で任意のフラグやフィールド幅の後に使用された場合、修"
"飾子として機能します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">E</samp>&rsquo; は、現在の"
"ロケールの日付・時刻の代替形式を使用することを指定します。例えば、日本語ロ"
"ケールでは、<code class=\"code\">%Ex</code> によって日本の天皇の在位期間に基"
"づく日付形式が出力されることがあります。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">E</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%Ec</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%EC</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%Ex</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%EX</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%Ey</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%EY</"
"samp>&rsquo; で使用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">O</samp>&rsquo; means to use the current "
"locale&rsquo;s alternative representation of numbers, instead of the "
"ordinary decimal digits.  This is allowed with most letters, all the ones "
"that output numbers."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">O</samp>&rsquo;は、通常の10進数の数字の代わりに、"
"現在のロケールにおける数値の代替表記を使用することを意味します。これは、ほと"
"んどの文字、つまり数値を出力するすべての文字で使用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"To help debug programs, unrecognized &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo;-sequences stand for themselves and are output as-is.  Programs "
"should not rely on this behavior, as future versions of Emacs may recognize "
"new &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequences as extensions."
msgstr ""
"プログラムのデバッグを容易にするため、認識されない &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスはそのままの形で出力されます。今後"
"の Emacs のバージョンでは、新しい &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo; シーケンスが拡張機能として認識される可能性があるため、プログラム"
"はこの動作に依存すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function uses the C library function <code class=\"code\">strftime</"
"code> (see <a data-manual=\"libc\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/libc/"
"manual/html_node/Formatting-Calendar-Time.html#Formatting-Calendar-"
"Time\">Formatting Calendar Time</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU C "
"Library Reference Manual</cite>) to do most of the work.  In order to "
"communicate with that function, it first converts <var class=\"var\">time</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">zone</var> to internal form; the operating "
"system limits the range of time and zone values.  This function also encodes "
"<var class=\"var\">format-string</var> using the coding system specified by "
"<code class=\"code\">locale-coding-system</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Locales.html\">Locales</a>); after <code class=\"code\">strftime</"
"code> returns the resulting string, this function decodes the string using "
"that same coding system."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、処理の大部分にCライブラリ関数 <code class=\"code\">strftime</"
"code>（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU C Library Reference Manual</cite> の <a "
"data-manual=\"libc\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/libc/manual/"
"html_node/Formatting-Calendar-Time.html#Formatting-Calendar-"
"Time\">Formatting Calendar Time</a> を参照）を使用しています。当該関数と連携"
"するため、まず <var class=\"var\">time</var> と <var class=\"var\">zone</"
"var> を内部形式に変換します。なお、オペレーティングシステムによって時刻および"
"タイムゾーンの値の範囲が制限されています。また、この関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">locale-coding-system</code> で指定された符号化方式（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Locales.html\">Locales</a> を参照）を用いて <var "
"class=\"var\">format-string</var> を符号化します。<code "
"class=\"code\">strftime</code> が結果の文字列を返した後、この関数は同じ符号化"
"方式を用いてその文字列を復号します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">format-seconds</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">format-"
"string seconds</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"format_002dseconds\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">format-seconds</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">format-"
"string seconds</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"format_002dseconds\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"This function converts its argument <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> into a "
"string of years, days, hours, etc., according to <var class=\"var\">format-"
"string</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> is a time value "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>).  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">format-string</var> may contain &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequences which control the conversion.  Here "
"is a table of what the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequences "
"mean:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数 <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> を <var "
"class=\"var\">format-string</var> に従って年、日、時などの文字列に変換しま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> は時刻値です（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">時刻</a> を参照）。引数 <var class=\"var\">format-"
"string</var> には、変換を制御する &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo; シーケンスを含めることができます。以下に、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスの意味をまとめた表を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid "The integer number of 365-day years."
msgstr "365日の年の整数。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid "The integer number of days."
msgstr "整数日。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid "The integer number of hours."
msgstr "整数時間。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid "The integer number of minutes."
msgstr "分単位の整数。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"The number of seconds.  If the optional &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</"
"samp>&rsquo; parameter is used, it&rsquo;s a floating point number, and the "
"number after the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</samp>&rsquo; specifies how "
"many decimals to be used.  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%,2s</samp>&rsquo; "
"means &ldquo;use two decimals&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"秒数。オプションの &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</samp>&rsquo; パラメータを使"
"用する場合、それは浮動小数点数となり、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</"
"samp>&rsquo; の後の数値で小数点以下に何桁使用するかを指定します。&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%,2s</samp>&rsquo; は「小数点以下2桁を使用する」ことを意"
"味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"Non-printing control flag.  When it is used, other specifiers must be given "
"in the order of decreasing size, i.e., years before days, hours before "
"minutes, etc.  Nothing will be produced in the result string to the left of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%z</samp>&rsquo; until the first non-zero "
"conversion is encountered.  For example, the default format used by <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs-uptime</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Processor-"
"Run-Time.html\">emacs-uptime</a>)  <code class=\"code\">&quot;%Y,&nbsp;"
"%D,&nbsp;%H,&nbsp;%M,&nbsp;%z%S&quot;</code> means that the number of "
"seconds will always be produced, but years, days, hours, and minutes will "
"only be shown if they are non-zero."
msgstr ""
"非印字制御フラグ。使用する場合、他の指定子はサイズの大きい順（すなわち、日よ"
"りも年が先、分よりも時間が先など）に指定する必要があります。最初の非ゼロの変"
"換が行われるまで、結果文字列の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%z</samp>&rsquo; "
"より左側には何も出力されません。例えば、<code class=\"code\">emacs-uptime</"
"code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Processor-Run-Time.html\">emacs-uptime</a> "
"を参照）で使用されるデフォルト形式では、<code class=\"code\">&quot;%Y,&nbsp;"
"%D,&nbsp;%H,&nbsp;%M,&nbsp;%z%S&quot;</code> は秒数が常に出力されることを意味"
"しますが、年、日、時間、分は非ゼロの場合にのみ表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
