# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-Parsing.html
msgid ""
"You can also specify the field width by following the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; with a number; shorter numbers will be padded "
"with blanks.  An optional period before the width requests zero-padding "
"instead.  For example, <code class=\"code\">&quot;%.3Y&quot;</code> might "
"produce <code class=\"code\">&quot;004 years&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
