#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"There are currently three forms of Lisp timestamps, each of which represents "
"a number of seconds:"
msgstr ""
"現在、Lispのタイムスタンプには3つの形式があり、それぞれが秒数を表しています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"An integer.  Although this is the simplest form, it cannot represent "
"subsecond timestamps."
msgstr ""
"整数。最もシンプルな形式ですが、1秒未満のタイムスタンプを表現することはできま"
"せん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"A pair of integers <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">ticks</var> . "
"<var class=\"var\">hz</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">hz</var> is "
"positive.  This represents <var class=\"var\">ticks</var>/<var "
"class=\"var\">hz</var> seconds, which is the same time as plain <var "
"class=\"var\">ticks</var> if <var class=\"var\">hz</var> is 1.  A common "
"value for <var class=\"var\">hz</var> is 1000000000, for a nanosecond-"
"resolution clock."
msgstr ""
"一対の整数 <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">ticks</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">hz</var>)</code> で、<var class=\"var\">hz</var> は正である。こ"
"れは <var class=\"var\">ticks</var>/<var class=\"var\">hz</var> 秒を表し、"
"<var class=\"var\">hz</var> が 1 の場合は単なる <var class=\"var\">ticks</"
"var> と同じ時間となる。<var class=\"var\">hz</var> の一般的な値は、ナノ秒分解"
"能の時計における 1000000000 である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"A list of four integers <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">high</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">low</var> <var class=\"var\">micro</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">pico</var>)</code>, where 0&le;<var class=\"var\">low</"
"var>&lt;65536, 0&le;<var class=\"var\">micro</var>&lt;1000000, and 0&le;<var "
"class=\"var\">pico</var>&lt;1000000.  This represents the number of seconds "
"using the formula: <var class=\"var\">high</var> * 2**16 + <var "
"class=\"var\">low</var> + <var class=\"var\">micro</var> * 10**&minus;6 + "
"<var class=\"var\">pico</var> * 10**&minus;12.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">current-time-list</code> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, "
"some functions may default to returning two- or three-element lists, with "
"omitted <var class=\"var\">micro</var> and <var class=\"var\">pico</var> "
"components defaulting to zero.  On all current machines <var "
"class=\"var\">pico</var> is a multiple of 1000, but this may change as "
"higher-resolution clocks become available."
msgstr ""
"4つの整数 <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">high</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">low</var> <var class=\"var\">micro</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">pico</var>)</code> のリスト。ここで 0&le;<var "
"class=\"var\">low</var>&lt;65536, 0&le;<var class=\"var\">micro</"
"var>&lt;1000000, および 0&le;<var class=\"var\">pico</var>&lt;1000000 であ"
"る。これは以下の式で表される秒数である：<var class=\"var\">high</var> * "
"2**16 + <var class=\"var\">low</var> + <var class=\"var\">micro</var> * "
"10**&minus;6 + <var class=\"var\">pico</var> * 10**&minus;12。<code "
"class=\"code\">current-time-list</code> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場"
"合、一部の関数はデフォルトで2要素または3要素のリストを返すことがあり、省略さ"
"れた <var class=\"var\">micro</var> および <var class=\"var\">pico</var> の要"
"素はデフォルトで 0 となる。現在のすべてのマシンにおいて <var "
"class=\"var\">pico</var> は 1000 の倍数であるが、より高分解能なクロックが利用"
"可能になるにつれて変更される可能性がある。"

