# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the current time as a Lisp timestamp.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">current-time-list</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the timestamp has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">ticks</"
