# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the current time as a floating-point number of seconds "
"since the epoch.  The optional argument <var class=\"var\">time</var>, if "
"given, specifies a time to convert instead of the current time."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在時刻をエポックからの経過秒数を表す浮動小数点数として返しま"
"す。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">time</var> を指定した場合は、現在時刻の"
"代わりに変換対象の時刻を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"emph\">Warning</em>: Since the result is floating point, it may "
"not be exact.  Do not use this function if precise time stamps are "
"required.  For example, on typical systems <code class=\"code\">(float-time "
"'(1 . 10))</code> displays as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0.1</samp>&rsquo; "
"but is slightly greater than 1/10."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"emph\">警告</em>: 結果は浮動小数点数となるため、厳密な値にならな"
"い場合があります。正確なタイムスタンプが必要な場合は、この関数を使用しないで"
"ください。例えば、一般的なシステムでは <code class=\"code\">(float-time "
"'(1 . 10))</code> は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0.1</samp>&rsquo; と表示され"
"ますが、実際には 1/10 をわずかに上回ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Time-of-Day.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">time-to-seconds</code> is an alias for this function."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">time-to-seconds</code> はこの関数のエイリアスです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
