# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tips-for-Defining.html
msgid ""
"When you define a variable whose value is a function, or a list of "
"functions, use a name that ends in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-function</"
"samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-functions</samp>&rsquo;, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"値として関数または関数のリストを持つ変数を定義する際は、それぞれ &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-function</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-functions</samp>&rsquo; で終わる名前を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
