#: build/html/elisp/Tool-Bar.html
msgid ""
"This function is used for making non-global tool bar items.  Use it like "
"<code class=\"code\">tool-bar-add-item-from-menu</code> except that <var "
"class=\"var\">in-map</var> specifies the local map to make the definition "
"in.  The argument <var class=\"var\">from-map</var> is like the <var "
