# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.7.9 Touchscreen Events<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Touchscreen-Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.7.9 タッチスクリーンイベント<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Touchscreen-Events-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-touchscreen-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-support-for-touchscreens\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-touchscreen-events\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-support-for-touchscreens\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Some window systems provide support for input devices that react to the "
"user&rsquo;s touching the screen and moving fingers while touching the "
"screen.  These input devices are known as touchscreens, and Emacs reports "
"the events they generate as <em class=\"dfn\">touchscreen events</em>."
msgstr ""
"一部のウィンドウシステムでは、ユーザーが画面に触れたり、触れたまま指を動かし"
"たりすることに反応する入力デバイスをサポートしています。こうした入力デバイス"
"はタッチスクリーンと呼ばれ、Emacsはそれらが発生させるイベントを<em "
"class=\"dfn\">タッチスクリーンイベント</em>として報告します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Most individual events generated by a touchscreen only have meaning as part "
"of a larger sequence of other events: for instance, the simple operation of "
"tapping the touchscreen involves the user placing and raising a finger on "
"the touchscreen, and swiping the display to scroll it involves placing a "
"finger, moving it many times upwards or downwards, and then raising the "
"finger."
msgstr ""
"タッチスクリーンによって生成される個々のイベントの多くは、他のイベントが連な"
"るより大きなシーケンスの一部として初めて意味を持つ。例えば、タッチスクリーン"
"をタップするという単純な操作では、ユーザーがタッチスクリーン上に指を置いて持"
"ち上げ、ディスプレイをスワイプしてスクロールさせる際には、指を置き、それを上"
"下に何度も動かし、その後指を離すという動作を伴う。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-touch-point_002c-in-touchscreen-"
"events\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-touch-point_002c-in-touchscreen-"
"events\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"While a simplistic model consisting of one finger is adequate for taps and "
"scrolling, more complicated gestures require support for keeping track of "
"multiple fingers, where the position of each finger is represented by a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">touch point</em>.  For example, a &ldquo;pinch to zoom&rdquo; "
"gesture might consist of the user placing two fingers and moving them "
"individually in opposite directions, where the distance between the "
"positions of their individual points determine the amount by which to zoom "
"the display, and the center of an imaginary line between those positions "
"determines where to pan the display after zooming."
msgstr ""
"タップやスクロールであれば指1本のシンプルなモデルで十分ですが、より複雑なジェ"
"スチャーでは、各指の位置を<em class=\"dfn\">タッチポイント</em>で表現し、複数"
"の指を追跡する機能が必要になります。例えば、「ピンチズーム」ジェスチャーで"
"は、ユーザーが2本の指を置き、それらを個別に反対方向へ動かすことがあります。こ"
"のとき、個々のポイントの位置間の距離によってディスプレイのズーム倍率が決ま"
"り、それらの位置を結ぶ仮想線の中心によって、ズーム後のディスプレイのパン位置"
"が決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"The low-level touchscreen events described below can be used to implement "
"all the touch sequences described above.  In those events, each point is "
"represented by a cons of an arbitrary number identifying the touch point and "
"a mouse position list (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Click-"
"Events.html\">Click Events</a>)  specifying the position of the finger when "
"the event occurred."
msgstr ""
"以下に説明する低レベルのタッチスクリーンイベントを使用することで、上述のすべ"
"てのタッチシーケンスを実装できます。これらのイベントでは、各点は、タッチポイ"
"ントを識別する任意の数値と、イベント発生時の指の位置を指定するマウス位置リス"
"ト（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Click-Events.html\">クリックイベント</a>を参"
"照）からなるコンスで表現されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dbegin-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-begin <var class=\"var\">point</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dbegin-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dbegin-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-begin <var class=\"var\">point</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dbegin-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is sent when <var class=\"var\">point</var> is created by the "
"user pressing a finger against the touchscreen."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、ユーザーがタッチスクリーンに指を押し当てて <var "
"class=\"var\">point</var> が生成された際に送信されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Imaginary prefix keys are also affixed to these events <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> when they originate on top of a "
"special part of a frame or window.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-"
"Sequence-Input.html\">Key Sequence Input</a>."
msgstr ""
"フレームやウィンドウの特殊な領域上で発生する場合、これらのイベント <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> にも仮想プレフィックスキーが付加され"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力</"
"a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dupdate-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-update <var class=\"var\">points</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dupdate-event\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dupdate-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-update <var class=\"var\">points</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dupdate-event\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is sent when a point on the touchscreen has changed position.  "
"<var class=\"var\">points</var> is a list of touch points containing the up-"
"to-date positions of each touch point currently on the touchscreen."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、タッチスクリーン上の点の位置が変化した際に送信されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">points</var> は、現在タッチスクリーン上にある各タッチポイントの"
"最新位置を含むタッチポイントのリストです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dend-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-end <var class=\"var\">point</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">canceled</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"touchscreen_002dend-event\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dend-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-end <var class=\"var\">point</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">canceled</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"touchscreen_002dend-event\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is sent when <var class=\"var\">point</var> is no longer present "
"on the display, because another program took the grab, or because the user "
"raised the finger from the touchscreen."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、別のプログラムがグラブを取得したか、あるいはユーザーがタッチ"
"スクリーンから指を離したことにより、ディスプレイ上に<var "
"class=\"var\">point</var>が存在しなくなった際に送信されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">canceled</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if "
"the touch sequence has been intercepted by another program (such as the "
"window manager), and Emacs should undo or avoid any editing commands that "
"would otherwise result from the touch sequence."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">canceled</var> は、タッチシーケンスが別のプログラム（ウィ"
"ンドウマネージャなど）によってインターセプトされた場合に non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となり、Emacs は、そのままではタッチシーケンスに"
"よって発生するあらゆる編集コマンドを取り消すか、あるいは回避する必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Imaginary prefix keys are also affixed to these events <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> when they originate on top of a "
"special part of a frame or window."
msgstr ""
"これらのイベントがフレームやウィンドウの特殊な領域上で発生する場合、仮想的な"
"プレフィックスキー <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> も付加されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If a touchpoint is pressed against the menu bar, then Emacs will not "
"generate any corresponding <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> events; instead, the menu bar "
"may be displayed after <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> would "
"have been delivered under other circumstances."
msgstr ""
"タッチポイントがメニューバーに押し当てられた場合、Emacsは対応する<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code>や<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-"
"end</code>イベントを生成しません。その代わりに、通常であれば<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code>が送信されるはずの状況でも、メニューバー"
"が表示されることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-emulation-from-touch-screen-"
"events\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-emulation-from-touch-screen-"
"events\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"When no command is bound to <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code>, Emacs calls a &ldquo;key "
"translation function&rdquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Translation-"
"Keymaps.html\">Keymaps for Translating Sequences of Events</a>) to translate "
"key sequences containing touch screen events into ordinary mouse events (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Events.html\">Mouse Events</a>.)  Since "
"Emacs doesn&rsquo;t support distinguishing events originating from separate "
"mouse devices, it assumes that a maximum of two touchpoints are active while "
"translation takes place, and does not place any guarantees on the results of "
"event translation when that restriction is overstepped."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code>、または<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code>にコマンドが割り当てられていない場"
"合、Emacsは「キー変換関数」（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Translation-"
"Keymaps.html\">イベントシーケンス変換用のキーマップ</a>を参照）を呼び出し、"
"タッチスクリーンイベントを含むキーシーケンスを通常のマウスイベントに変換しま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Events.html\">マウスイベント</a>を参"
"照）。Emacsは個別のマウスデバイスから発生するイベントを区別することをサポート"
"していないため、変換処理中は最大2つのタッチポイントがアクティブであると想定し"
"ており、この制限を超えた場合のイベント変換結果については一切保証しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Emacs applies two different strategies for translating touch events into "
"mouse events, contingent on factors such as the commands bound to keymaps "
"that are active at the location of the <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-"
"begin</code> event.  If a command is bound to <code class=\"code\">down-"
"mouse-1</code> at that location, the initial translation consists of a "
"single <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> event, with subsequent <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> events translated to mouse motion "
"events (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Motion-Events.html\">Motion Events</"
"a>), and a final <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> event "
"translated to a <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">drag-mouse-1</code> event (unless the <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> event indicates that the touch "
"sequence has been intercepted by another program.)  This is dubbed "
"&ldquo;simple translation&rdquo;, and produces a simple correspondence "
"between touchpoint motion and mouse motion."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code>イベントの発生箇所で有"
"効なキーマップにバインドされているコマンドなどの要因に応じて、タッチイベント"
"をマウスイベントに変換する際に2つの異なる戦略を採用します。その箇所で<code "
"class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code>にコマンドがバインドされている場合、初期の"
"変換は単一の<code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code>イベントとなり、後続の"
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code>イベントはマウスモーションイベ"
"ント（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Motion-Events.html\">モーションイベント</a>を"
"参照）に、最後の<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code>イベントは<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>または<code class=\"code\">drag-mouse-1</code>イ"
"ベントに変換されます（ただし、<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code>イベ"
"ントがタッチシーケンスを別のプログラムがインターセプトしたことを示している場"
"合はこの限りではありません）。これは「単純変換」と呼ばれ、タッチポイントの移"
"動とマウスの移動との間に単純な対応関係をもたらします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ignored_002dmouse_002dcommand-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ignored_002dmouse_002dcommand-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"However, some commands bound to <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</"
"code>&ndash;<code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-region</code>, for "
"example&ndash;either conflict with defined touch screen gestures (such as "
"&ldquo;long-press to drag&rdquo;), or with user expectations for touch "
"input, and should not subject the touch sequence to simple translation.  If "
"a command whose name contains the property (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Symbol-Properties.html\">Symbol Properties</a>)  <code "
"class=\"code\">ignored-mouse-command</code> is encountered or there is no "
"command bound to <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code>, a more irregular "
"form of translation takes place: here, Emacs processes touch screen gestures "
"(see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Touchscreens.html#Touchscreens\">Touchscreens</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>) first, and finally "
"attempts to translate touch screen events into mouse events if no gesture "
"was detected prior to a closing <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> "
"event (with its <var class=\"var\">canceled</var> parameter <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, as with simple translation) and a command is "
"bound to <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> at the location of that event.  "
"Before generating the <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> event, point is "
"also set to the location of the <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> "
"event, and the window containing the position of that event is selected, as "
"a compromise for packages which assume <code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-"
"region</code> has already set point to the location of any mouse click and "
"selected the window where it took place."
msgstr ""
"しかし、<code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code>&ndash;<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-drag-region</code>にバインドされた一部のコマンド（例えば"
"&ndash;「長押ししてドラッグ」など）は、定義済みのタッチスクリーンジェスチャー"
"やタッチ入力に対するユーザーの期待と競合する場合があり、タッチシーケンスを単"
"純な変換に委ねるべきではありません。名称にプロパティ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Symbol-Properties.html\">シンボルプロパティ</a>を参照）<code "
"class=\"code\">ignored-mouse-command</code>を含むコマンドが見つかった場合、あ"
"るいは<code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code>にバインドされたコマンドが存在"
"しない場合は、より不規則な形式の変換が行われます。この場合、Emacsはまずタッチ"
"スクリーンジェスチャー（<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Touchscreens.html#Touchscreens\">Touchscreens</a>を参照）を処"
"理し、最後に、終了<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code>イベント（単純な"
"変換と同様に<var class=\"var\">canceled</var>パラメータ<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>を伴う）の前にジェスチャーが検出されず、かつそのイベ"
"ントの位置で<code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>にコマンドがバインドされている"
"場合に、タッチスクリーンイベントをマウスイベントに変換しようと試みます。"
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code>イベントを生成する前に、ポイントも<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code>イベントの位置に設定され、そのイベントの"
"位置を含むウィンドウが選択されます。これは、<code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-"
"region</code>がすでにマウスクリックの位置にポイントを設定し、クリックが発生し"
"たウィンドウを選択済みであると想定するパッケージへの妥協策です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"To prevent unwanted <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> events from arriving "
"after a mouse menu is dismissed (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-"
"Menus.html\">Menus and the Mouse</a>), Emacs also disables simple "
"translation if <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> is bound to a "
"keymap, making it a prefix key.  In lieu of simple translation, it "
"translates the closing <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> to a "
"<code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> event with the starting position of "
"the touch sequence, consequently displaying the mouse menu."
msgstr ""
"マウスメニューを閉じた後に不要な <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> イベント"
"が発生するのを防ぐため（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Menus.html\">メニュー"
"とマウス</a> を参照）、Emacs では <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> が"
"キーマップにバインドされている場合、単純変換を無効にしてそれをプレフィックス"
"キーとして扱います。単純変換の代わりに、終了を示す <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> をタッチシーケンスの開始位置を持つ "
"<code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> イベントに変換し、結果としてマウスメ"
"ニューを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"touch_002dscreen_002dsimple_002dmouse_002dconversion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"touch_002dscreen_002dsimple_002dmouse_002dconversion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Simple conversion will be enabled without regard to the existence of command "
"or menu bindings if the variable <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-simple-"
"mouse-conversion</code> is bound or set to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value, as, for example, it may be by a caller of <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key</code> expecting to receive <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-movement</code> and <code class=\"code\">drag-mouse-1</"
"code> events."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-simple-mouse-conversion</code> がバイ"
"ンドされているか、あるいは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定され"
"ている場合、コマンドやメニューのバインディングの有無にかかわらず、単純な変換"
"が有効になります。例えば、<code class=\"code\">read-key</code> の呼び出し側"
"が <code class=\"code\">mouse-movement</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">drag-mouse-1</code> イベントの受信を想定している場合などがこれ"
"に該当します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002d1_002dmenu_002dcommand-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002d1_002dmenu_002dcommand-"
"_0028symbol-property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Since certain commands are also bound to <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</"
"code> for the purpose of displaying pop-up menus, Emacs additionally behaves "
"as illustrated in the last paragraph if <code class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</"
"code> is bound to a command whose name has the property <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-1-menu-command</code>."
msgstr ""
"一部のコマンドはポップアップメニューを表示する目的で <code "
"class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> にもバインドされているため、<code "
"class=\"code\">down-mouse-1</code> が名前に <code class=\"code\">mouse-1-"
"menu-command</code> というプロパティを持つコマンドにバインドされている場合、"
"Emacs はさらに最終段落に示すように動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pinch_002dto_002dzoom-touchscreen-"
"gesture-translation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pinch_002dto_002dzoom-touchscreen-"
"gesture-translation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"When a second touch point is registered as a touch point is already being "
"translated, gesture translation is terminated, and the distance from the "
"second touch point (the <em class=\"dfn\">ancillary tool</em>) to the first "
"is measured.  Subsequent motion from either of those touch points will yield "
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-pinch</code> events incorporating the ratio "
"formed by the distance between their new positions and the distance measured "
"at the outset, as illustrated in the following table."
msgstr ""
"すでにタッチポイントの変換が行われている状態で2つ目のタッチポイントが登録され"
"ると、ジェスチャー変換は終了し、2つ目のタッチポイント（<em class=\"dfn\">補助"
"ツール</em>）から1つ目のタッチポイントまでの距離が計測されます。その後、いず"
"れかのタッチポイントから行われた操作では、以下の表に示すように、新しい位置間"
"の距離と開始時に計測された距離との比を組み込んだ<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-pinch</code>イベントが生成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-touchscreen-gesture-events\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-touchscreen-gesture-events\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If touch gestures are detected during translation, one of the following "
"input events may be generated:"
msgstr ""
"翻訳中にタッチジェスチャーが検出された場合、以下の入力イベントのいずれかが生"
"成されることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dscroll-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-scroll <var class=\"var\">window</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">dx</var> <var class=\"var\">dy</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dscroll-event\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dscroll-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-scroll <var class=\"var\">window</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">dx</var> <var class=\"var\">dy</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dscroll-event\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If a &ldquo;scrolling&rdquo; gesture is detected during the translation "
"process, each subsequent <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> "
"event is translated to a <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-scroll</code> "
"event, where <var class=\"var\">dx</var> and <var class=\"var\">dy</var> "
"specify, in pixels, the relative motion of the touchpoint from the position "
"of the <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> event that started the "
"sequence or the last <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-scroll</code> event, "
"whichever came later."
msgstr ""
"翻訳処理中に「スクロール」ジェスチャーが検出された場合、それ以降の各<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code>イベントは<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-scroll</code>イベントに変換されます。ここで、<var "
"class=\"var\">dx</var>および<var class=\"var\">dy</var>は、シーケンスを開始し"
"た<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code>イベントの位置、または直前の"
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-scroll</code>イベントのいずれか遅い方からの"
"タッチポイントの相対的な移動量をピクセル単位で指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dhold-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-hold <var class=\"var\">posn</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dhold-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dhold-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-hold <var class=\"var\">posn</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dhold-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If the single active touchpoint remains stationary for more than <code "
"class=\"code\">touch-screen-delay</code> seconds after a <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> is generated, a &ldquo;long-"
"press&rdquo; gesture is detected during the translation process, and a <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-hold</code> event is sent, with <var "
"class=\"var\">posn</var> set to a mouse position list containing the "
"position of the <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> event."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> が生成された後、単一のアクティ"
"ブなタッチポイントが <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-delay</code> 秒を超え"
"て静止したままの場合、変換処理中に「長押し」ジェスチャが検出され、<var "
"class=\"var\">posn</var> に <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> イ"
"ベントの位置を含むマウス位置リストが設定された状態で <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-hold</code> イベントが送信されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002ddrag-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-drag <var class=\"var\">posn</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002ddrag-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002ddrag-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-drag <var class=\"var\">posn</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002ddrag-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If a &ldquo;long-press&rdquo; gesture is detected while translating the "
"current touch sequence or &ldquo;drag-to-select&rdquo; is being resumed as a "
"result of the <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-extend-selection</code> user "
"option, a <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-drag</code> event is sent upon "
"each subsequent <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> event with "
"<var class=\"var\">posn</var> set to the new position of the touchpoint."
msgstr ""
"現在のタッチシーケンスの翻訳中に「長押し」ジェスチャーが検出された場合、また"
"は<code class=\"code\">touch-screen-extend-selection</code>ユーザーオプション"
"により「ドラッグして選択」が再開された場合、後続の<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code>イベントが発生するたびに<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-drag</code>イベントが送信され、<var "
"class=\"var\">posn</var>にはタッチポイントの新しい位置が設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002drestart_002ddrag-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-restart-drag <var class=\"var\">posn</var>)</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"touchscreen_002drestart_002ddrag-event\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002drestart_002ddrag-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-restart-drag <var class=\"var\">posn</var>)</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"touchscreen_002drestart_002ddrag-event\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is sent upon the start of a touch sequence resulting in the "
"continuation of a &ldquo;drag-to-select&rdquo; gesture (subject to the "
"aforementioned user option) with <var class=\"var\">posn</var> set to the "
"position list of the initial <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> "
"event within that touch sequence."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、「ドラッグして選択」ジェスチャー（前述のユーザーオプションに"
"よる）の継続となるタッチシーケンスの開始時に送信され、<var "
"class=\"var\">posn</var> にはそのタッチシーケンス内における最初の <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> イベントの位置リストが設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dpinch-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-pinch <var class=\"var\">posn</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">ratio</var> <var class=\"var\">pan-x</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">pan-y</var> <var class=\"var\">ratio-diff</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dpinch-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-touchscreen_002dpinch-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(touchscreen-pinch <var class=\"var\">posn</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">ratio</var> <var class=\"var\">pan-x</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">pan-y</var> <var class=\"var\">ratio-diff</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touchscreen_002dpinch-event\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is delivered upon significant changes to the positions of either "
"active touch point when an ancillary tool is active."
msgstr ""
"本イベントは、補助ツールが有効な状態で、いずれかのアクティブなタッチポイント"
"の位置に大幅な変化が生じた際に発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">posn</var> is a mouse position list for the midpoint of a "
"line drawn from the ancillary tool to the other touch point being observed."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">posn</var>は、補助ツールから観測対象のもう一方のタッチポイ"
"ントまで引いた線の中点のマウス位置リストです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">ratio</var> is the distance between both touch points "
"being observed divided by that distance when the ancillary point was first "
"registered; which is to say, the scale of the &ldquo;pinch&rdquo; gesture."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ratio</var>は、観測対象となっている両タッチポイント間の距"
"離を、補助点が最初に登録された際のその距離で除した値、すなわち「ピンチ」ジェ"
"スチャーのスケールである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">pan-x</var> and <var class=\"var\">pan-y</var> are the "
"difference between the pixel position of <var class=\"var\">posn</var> and "
"this position within the last event delivered appertaining to this series of "
"touch events, or in the case that no such event exists, the centerpoint "
"between both touch points when the ancillary tool was first registered."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pan-x</var> および <var class=\"var\">pan-y</var> は、一連"
"のタッチイベントに関連して配信された直近のイベントにおける <var "
"class=\"var\">posn</var> のピクセル位置と本位置との差、あるいはそのようなイベ"
"ントが存在しない場合には、補助ツールが最初に登録された際の両タッチポイントの"
"中心点である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">ratio-diff</var> is the difference between this "
"event&rsquo;s ratio and <var class=\"var\">ratio</var> in the last event "
"delivered; it is <var class=\"var\">ratio</var> if no such event exists."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">ratio-diff</var> は、このイベントの比率と、直前に配信され"
"たイベントの <var class=\"var\">ratio</var> との差であり、そのようなイベント"
"が存在しない場合は <var class=\"var\">ratio</var> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Such events are sent when the magnitude of the changes they represent will "
"yield a <var class=\"var\">ratio</var> which differs by more than <code "
"class=\"code\">0.2</code> from that in the previous event, or the sum of "
"<var class=\"var\">pan-x</var> and <var class=\"var\">pan-y</var> will "
"surpass half the frame&rsquo;s character width in pixels (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">Frame Font</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このようなイベントは、それが表す変化の大きさによって、<var "
"class=\"var\">ratio</var> が直前のイベントの値と <code class=\"code\">0.2</"
"code> を超える差を持つ場合、あるいは <var class=\"var\">pan-x</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">pan-y</var> の和がフレームの文字幅の半分（ピクセル単位）を超え"
"る場合に送信されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレーム"
"フォント</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-handling-touch-screen-events\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tap-and-drag_002c-touch-screen-"
"gestures\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-handling-touch-screen-events\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tap-and-drag_002c-touch-screen-"
"gestures\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Several functions are provided for Lisp programs that handle touch screen "
"events.  The intended use of the first two functions described below is from "
"commands bound directly to <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> "
"events; they allow responding to commonly used touch screen gestures "
"separately from mouse event translation."
msgstr ""
"タッチスクリーンイベントを処理するLispプログラム向けに、いくつかの関数が提供"
"されています。以下に説明する最初の2つの関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code>イベントに直接バインドされたコマンドで"
"の使用を想定しており、マウスイベントの変換とは別に、よく使われるタッチスク"
"リーンジェスチャーに対応させることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">touch-screen-track-tap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">event &amp;optional update data threshold</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touch_002dscreen_002dtrack_002dtap\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">touch-screen-track-tap</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">event &amp;optional update data threshold</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-touch_002dscreen_002dtrack_002dtap\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This function is used to track a single &ldquo;tap&rdquo; gesture "
"originating from the <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> event "
"<var class=\"var\">event</var>, often used to set point or to activate a "
"button.  It waits for a <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> event "
"with the same touch identifier to arrive, at which point it returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, signifying the end of the gesture."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> イベント <var "
"class=\"var\">event</var> を起点とする単一の「タップ」ジェスチャーを追跡する"
"ために使用され、多くの場合、ポイントの設定やボタンの押下に利用されます。同じ"
"タッチ識別子を持つ <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-end</code> イベントの到来"
"を待機し、その時点でジェスチャーの終了を示す <code class=\"code\">t</code> を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If a <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> event arrives in the "
"mean time and contains at least one touchpoint with the same identifier as "
"in <var class=\"var\">event</var>, the function <var class=\"var\">update</"
"var> is called with two arguments, the list of touchpoints in that <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> event, and <var class=\"var\">data</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"その間に <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> イベントが発生し、そ"
"の中に <var class=\"var\">event</var> と同じ識別子を持つタッチポイントが少な"
"くとも1つ含まれている場合、関数 <var class=\"var\">update</var> は、その "
"<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-update</code> イベント内のタッチポイントのリ"
"ストと <var class=\"var\">data</var> の2つの引数で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">threshold</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"and such an event indicates that the touchpoint represented by <var "
"class=\"var\">event</var> has moved beyond a threshold of either <var "
"class=\"var\">threshold</var> or 10 pixels if it is not a number from the "
"position of <var class=\"var\">event</var>, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"is returned and mouse event translation is resumed for that touchpoint, so "
"as not to impede the recognition of any subsequent touchscreen gesture "
"arising from its sequence."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">threshold</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではな"
"く、かつ当該イベントが、<var class=\"var\">event</var> で表されるタッチポイン"
"トが、<var class=\"var\">event</var> の位置からの数値でない場合には <var "
"class=\"var\">threshold</var> または 10 ピクセルのいずれかの閾値を超えて移動"
"したことを示す場合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が返され、そのタッチポイ"
"ントに対するマウスイベントの変換が再開される。これは、そのシーケンスから生じ"
"る後続のタッチスクリーンジェスチャの認識を妨げないようにするためである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"If any other event arrives in the mean time, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"is returned.  The caller should not perform any action in that case."
msgstr ""
"その間に他のイベントが発生した場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が返さ"
"れます。その場合、呼び出し元はいかなる処理も行わないようにしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">touch-screen-track-drag</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">event update &amp;optional data</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-touch_002dscreen_002dtrack_002ddrag\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">touch-screen-track-drag</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">event update &amp;optional data</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-touch_002dscreen_002dtrack_002ddrag\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This function is used to track a single &ldquo;drag&rdquo; gesture "
"originating from the <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> event "
"<code class=\"code\">event</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-begin</code> イベント <code "
"class=\"code\">event</code> を起点とする単一の「ドラッグ」ジェスチャーを追跡"
"するために使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"It behaves like <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-track-tap</code>, except "
"that it returns <code class=\"code\">no-drag</code> and refrains from "
"calling <var class=\"var\">update</var> if the touchpoint in <code "
"class=\"code\">event</code> did not move far enough (by default, 5 pixels "
"from its position in <code class=\"code\">event</code>) to qualify as an "
"actual drag."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">touch-screen-track-tap</code>と同様に動作しますが、"
"<code class=\"code\">event</code>内のタッチポイントが実際のドラッグとして判定"
"されるほど十分に移動しなかった場合（デフォルトでは<code "
"class=\"code\">event</code>内の位置から5ピクセル）、<code class=\"code\">no-"
"drag</code>を返し、<var class=\"var\">update</var>の呼び出しは行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"In addition to those two functions, a function is provided for commands "
"bound to some types of events generated through mouse event translation to "
"prevent unwanted events from being generated after it is called."
msgstr ""
"これら2つの機能に加え、マウスイベントの変換によって発生する一部の種類のイベン"
"トに紐付けられたコマンドに対して、呼び出し後に意図しないイベントが発生しない"
"ようにするための機能が用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">touch-screen-inhibit-drag</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-touch_002dscreen_002dinhibit_002ddrag\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">touch-screen-inhibit-drag</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-touch_002dscreen_002dinhibit_002ddrag\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"This function inhibits the generation of <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-"
"drag</code> events during mouse event translation for the duration of the "
"touch sequence being translated after it is called.  It must be called from "
"a command which is bound to a <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-hold</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-drag</code> event, and signals an error "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、呼び出し後、変換対象となっているタッチシーケンスの期間中、マウス"
"イベント変換時の <code class=\"code\">touchscreen-drag</code> イベントの発生"
"を抑制します。<code class=\"code\">touchscreen-hold</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">touchscreen-drag</code> イベントにバインドされたコマンドから呼"
"び出す必要があり、それ以外の場合はエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Touchscreen-Events.html
msgid ""
"Since this function can only be called after a gesture is already recognized "
"during mouse event translation, no mouse events will be generated from touch "
"events constituting the previously mentioned touch sequence after it is "
"called."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、マウスイベントの変換時にすでにジェスチャーが認識された後でなけれ"
"ば呼び出せないため、呼び出し後は、前述のタッチシーケンスを構成するタッチイベ"
"ントからマウスイベントが発生することはありません。"

