# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Edebug can record an execution trace, storing it in a buffer named <samp "
"class=\"file\">*edebug-trace*</samp>.  This is a log of function calls and "
"returns, showing the function names and their arguments and values.  To "
"enable trace recording, set <code class=\"code\">edebug-trace</code> to a "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug Options</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Edebug は実行トレースを記録し、<samp class=\"file\">*edebug-trace*</samp> と"
"いう名前のバッファに保存できます。  これは関数呼び出しと戻りのログであり、関"
"数名とその引数および値が表示されます。  トレース記録を有効にするには、<code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-trace</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"値を設定してください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Options.html\">Edebug "
"オプション</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Making a trace buffer is not the same thing as using trace execution mode "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Execution-Modes.html\">Edebug "
"Execution Modes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"トレースバッファを作成することは、トレース実行モードを使用することとは異なり"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Edebug-Execution-Modes.html\">Edebug 実行モー"
"ド</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"When trace recording is enabled, each function entry and exit adds lines to "
"the trace buffer.  A function entry record consists of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">::::{</samp>&rsquo;, followed by the function name and "
"argument values.  A function exit record consists of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">::::}</samp>&rsquo;, followed by the function name and result "
"of the function."
msgstr ""
"トレース記録が有効な場合、関数のエントリおよびエグジットのたびにトレースバッ"
"ファに行が追加されます。関数エントリレコードは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">::::{</samp>&rsquo; で始まり、続いて関数名と引数の値が記述され"
"ます。関数エグジットレコードは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">::::}</"
"samp>&rsquo; で始まり、続いて関数名と関数の結果が記述されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The number of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">:</samp>&rsquo;s in an entry shows "
"its recursion depth.  You can use the braces in the trace buffer to find the "
"matching beginning or end of function calls."
msgstr ""
"エントリ内の「<samp class=\"samp\">:</samp>」の数は、その再帰深度を示します。"
"トレースバッファ内の波括弧を使えば、関数呼び出しの対応する開始位置や終了位置"
"を特定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dprint_002dtrace_002dbefore\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-edebug_002dprint_002dtrace_002dafter\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edebug_002dprint_002dtrace_002dbefore\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-edebug_002dprint_002dtrace_002dafter\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"You can customize trace recording for function entry and exit by redefining "
"the functions <code class=\"code\">edebug-print-trace-before</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-print-trace-after</code>."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">edebug-print-trace-before</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-print-trace-after</code> を再定義することで、関数のエン"
"トリおよびエグジット時のトレース記録をカスタマイズできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Macro: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-tracing</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dtracing\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">マクロ: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-tracing</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">string "
"body&hellip;</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dtracing\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"This macro requests additional trace information around the execution of the "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var> forms.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> specifies text to put in the trace buffer, after "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">{</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">}</samp>&rsquo;.  All the arguments are evaluated, and <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-tracing</code> returns the value of the last form in "
"<var class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"このマクロは、<var class=\"var\">body</var> フォームの実行前後に関する追加の"
"トレース情報を要求します。引数 <var class=\"var\">string</var> は、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">{</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">}</"
"samp>&rsquo; の後にトレースバッファに格納するテキストを指定します。すべての引"
"数が評価され、<code class=\"code\">edebug-tracing</code> は <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> 内の最後のフォームの値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-trace</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">format-string "
"&amp;rest format-args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dtrace\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">edebug-trace</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">format-string "
"&amp;rest format-args</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"edebug_002dtrace\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"This function inserts text in the trace buffer.  It computes the text with "
"<code class=\"code\">(apply&nbsp;'format&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">format-"
"string</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">format-args</var>)</code>.  It also "
"appends a newline to separate entries."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、トレースバッファにテキストを挿入します。<code "
"class=\"code\">(apply&nbsp;'format&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">format-string</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">format-args</var>)</code> を用いてテキストを算出"
"します。また、エントリを区切るために改行を付加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Trace-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-tracing</code> and <code class=\"code\">edebug-"
"trace</code> insert lines in the trace buffer whenever they are called, even "
"if Edebug is not active.  Adding text to the trace buffer also scrolls its "
"window to show the last lines inserted."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">edebug-tracing</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">edebug-trace</code> は、Edebug がアクティブでない場合でも、呼"
