#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"<span>41.13 Transaction Queues<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Transaction-"
"Queues-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>41.13 トランザクションキュー<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Transaction-Queues-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transaction-queue\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transaction-queue\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"You can use a <em class=\"dfn\">transaction queue</em> to communicate with a "
"subprocess using transactions.  First use <code class=\"code\">tq-create</"
"code> to create a transaction queue communicating with a specified process.  "
"Then you can call <code class=\"code\">tq-enqueue</code> to send a "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">トランザクションキュー</em>を使用すると、トランザクションを"
"介してサブプロセスと通信できます。まず<code class=\"code\">tq-create</code>を"
"使用して、指定したプロセスと通信するトランザクションキューを作成します。次"
"に、<code class=\"code\">tq-enqueue</code>を呼び出してトランザクションを送信"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tq-create</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-tq_002dcreate\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tq-create</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">process</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-tq_002dcreate\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a transaction queue communicating with "
"<var class=\"var\">process</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">process</"
"var> should be a subprocess capable of sending and receiving streams of "
"bytes.  It may be a child process, or it may be a TCP connection to a "
"server, possibly on another machine."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">process</var> と通信するトランザクションキュー"
"を作成して返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">process</var> には、バイトスト"
"リームの送受信が可能なサブプロセスを指定する必要があります。これは子プロセス"
"であってもよいですし、別のマシン上にある可能性のあるサーバーへの TCP 接続で"
"あっても構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tq-enqueue</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">queue question "
"regexp closure fn &amp;optional delay-question</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-tq_002denqueue\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tq-enqueue</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">queue question "
"regexp closure fn &amp;optional delay-question</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-tq_002denqueue\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"This function sends a transaction to queue <var class=\"var\">queue</var>.  "
"Specifying the queue has the effect of specifying the subprocess to talk to."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、トランザクションをキュー <var class=\"var\">queue</var> に送信し"
"ます。キューを指定することで、通信先のサブプロセスを指定することになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">question</var> is the outgoing message that "
"starts the transaction.  The argument <var class=\"var\">fn</var> is the "
"function to call when the corresponding answer comes back; it is called with "
"two arguments: <var class=\"var\">closure</var>, and the answer received."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">question</var> は、トランザクションを開始する送信メッ"
"セージです。引数 <var class=\"var\">fn</var> は、対応する応答が返ってきた際に"
"呼び出す関数であり、<var class=\"var\">closure</var> と受信した応答という2つ"
"の引数で呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> is a regular expression that "
"should match text at the end of the entire answer, but nothing before; "
"that&rsquo;s how <code class=\"code\">tq-enqueue</code> determines where the "
"answer ends."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> は、回答全体の末尾にあるテキストに一致"
"し、それより前の部分には一致しない正規表現です。これにより、<code "
"class=\"code\">tq-enqueue</code> は回答の終了位置を判定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"If the argument <var class=\"var\">delay-question</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, delay sending this question until the process has "
"finished replying to any previous questions.  This produces more reliable "
"results with some processes."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">delay-question</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、プロセスがそれまでの質問への回答を完了するまで、この質問の"
"送信を待機してください。これにより、一部のプロセスにおいてより信頼性の高い結"
"果が得られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tq-close</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">queue</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-tq_002dclose\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">tq-close</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">queue</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-tq_002dclose\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"Shut down transaction queue <var class=\"var\">queue</var>, waiting for all "
"pending transactions to complete, and then terminate the connection or child "
"process."
msgstr ""
"トランザクションキュー <var class=\"var\">queue</var> をシャットダウンし、保"
"留中のすべてのトランザクションが完了するのを待ってから、接続または子プロセス"
"を終了します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transaction-Queues.html
msgid ""
"Transaction queues are implemented by means of a filter function.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">Process Filter Functions</a>."
msgstr ""
"トランザクションキューは、フィルタ関数を用いて実装されます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Filter-Functions.html\">フィルタ関数の処理</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

