# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"When the <code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> function reads a key "
"sequence (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">Key "
"Sequence Input</a>), it uses <em class=\"dfn\">translation keymaps</em> to "
"translate certain event sequences into others.  The translation keymaps are "
"<code class=\"code\">input-decode-map</code>, <code class=\"code\">local-"
"function-key-map</code>, and <code class=\"code\">key-translation-map</code> "
"(in order of priority)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> 関数がキーシーケンスを読み取る"
"際（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-Sequence-Input.html\">キーシーケンス入力</"
"a>を参照）、<em class=\"dfn\">変換キーマップ</em>を使用して、特定のイベント"
"シーケンスを別のシーケンスに変換します。変換キーマップは、<code "
"class=\"code\">input-decode-map</code>、<code class=\"code\">local-function-"
"key-map</code>、<code class=\"code\">key-translation-map</code>（優先順位順）"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Translation keymaps have the same structure as other keymaps, but are used "
"differently: they specify translations to make while reading key sequences, "
"rather than bindings for complete key sequences.  As each key sequence is "
"read, it is checked against each translation keymap.  If one of the "
"translation keymaps binds <var class=\"var\">k</var> to a vector <var "
"class=\"var\">v</var>, then whenever <var class=\"var\">k</var> appears as a "
"sub-sequence <em class=\"emph\">anywhere</em> in a key sequence, that sub-"
"sequence is replaced with the events in <var class=\"var\">v</var>."
msgstr ""
"翻訳キーマップは他のキーマップと同様の構造を持ちますが、用途が異なります。完"
"全なキーシーケンスに対するバインドではなく、キーシーケンスの読み取り時に行う"
"翻訳を指定するものです。各キーシーケンスが読み込まれるたびに、それぞれの翻訳"
"キーマップと照合されます。もしいずれかの翻訳キーマップが <var "
"class=\"var\">k</var> をベクトル <var class=\"var\">v</var> にバインドしてい"
"る場合、キーシーケンスの<em class=\"emph\">どこであっても</em> <var "
"class=\"var\">k</var> が部分シーケンスとして出現するたびに、その部分シーケン"
"スは <var class=\"var\">v</var> のイベントに置き換えられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"For example, VT100 terminals send <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</"
"kbd> O P</kbd> when the keypad key <kbd class=\"key\">PF1</kbd> is pressed.  "
"On such terminals, Emacs must translate that sequence of events into a "
"single event <code class=\"code\">pf1</code>.  This is done by binding <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> O P</kbd> to <code "
"class=\"code\">[pf1]</code> in <code class=\"code\">input-decode-map</"
"code>.  Thus, when you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">PF1</"
"kbd></kbd> on the terminal, the terminal emits the character sequence <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> O P</kbd>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> translates this back into <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">PF1</kbd></kbd> and returns it as the "
"vector <code class=\"code\">[?\\C-c pf1]</code>."
msgstr ""
"例えば、VT100端末では、キーパッドのキー <kbd class=\"key\">PF1</kbd> が押され"
"ると <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> O P</kbd> を送信します。"
"このような端末では、Emacsはその一連のイベントを単一のイベント <code "
"class=\"code\">pf1</code> に変換する必要があります。これは、<code "
"class=\"code\">input-decode-map</code> において <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> O P</kbd> を <code class=\"code\">[pf1]</code> にバイ"
"ンドすることで行われます。したがって、端末で <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd "
"class=\"key\">PF1</kbd></kbd> を入力すると、端末は文字シーケンス <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> O P</kbd> を出力し、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-key-sequence</code> がこれを再び <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c "
"<kbd class=\"key\">PF1</kbd></kbd> に変換して、ベクトル <code "
"class=\"code\">[?\\C-c pf1]</code> として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"Translation keymaps take effect only after Emacs has decoded the keyboard "
"input (via the input coding system specified by <code "
"class=\"code\">keyboard-coding-system</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Terminal-I_002fO-Encoding.html\">Terminal I/O Encoding</a>."
msgstr ""
"翻訳キーマップは、Emacsが（<code class=\"code\">keyboard-coding-system</code>"
"で指定された入力コーディングシステムを用いて）キーボード入力をデコードした後"
"にのみ有効になります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Terminal-I_002fO-"
"Encoding.html\">ターミナル入出力エンコーディング</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-Keymaps.html
