# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">translation table</em> is a char-table (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>) that "
"specifies a mapping of characters into characters.  These tables are used in "
"encoding and decoding, and for other purposes.  Some coding systems specify "
"their own particular translation tables; there are also default translation "
"tables which apply to all other coding systems."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">変換テーブル</em>とは、文字から文字へのマッピングを規定する"
"文字テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">文字テーブル</"
"a>を参照）のことです。これらのテーブルは、エンコードやデコード、およびその他"
"の目的で使用されます。一部の符号化方式では独自の変換テーブルを規定しています"
"が、他のすべての符号化方式に適用されるデフォルトの変換テーブルも存在します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"A translation table has two extra slots.  The first is either <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or a translation table that performs the reverse "
"translation; the second is the maximum number of characters to look up for "
"translating sequences of characters (see the description of <code "
"class=\"code\">make-translation-table-from-alist</code> below)."
msgstr ""
"変換テーブルには2つの追加スロットがあります。1つ目は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> または逆変換を行う変換テーブルであり、2つ目は文字"
"シーケンスの変換時に参照する最大文字数です（後述の <code class=\"code\">make-"
"translation-table-from-alist</code> の説明を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-translation-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest translations</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dtranslation_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-translation-table</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;rest translations</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dtranslation_002dtable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a translation table based on the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">translations</var>.  Each element of <var "
"class=\"var\">translations</var> should be a list of elements of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">from</var> . <var class=\"var\">to</"
"var>)</code>; this says to translate the character <var class=\"var\">from</"
"var> into <var class=\"var\">to</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数 <var class=\"var\">translations</var> に基づく変換テーブルを"
"返します。<var class=\"var\">translations</var> の各要素は <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">from</var> . <var class=\"var\">to</"
"var>)</code> 形式の要素のリストである必要があり、これは文字 <var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> を <var class=\"var\">to</var> に変換することを意味"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"The arguments and the forms in each argument are processed in order, and if "
"a previous form already translates <var class=\"var\">to</var> to some other "
"character, say <var class=\"var\">to-alt</var>, <var class=\"var\">from</"
"var> is also translated to <var class=\"var\">to-alt</var>."
msgstr ""
"引数および各引数内の形式は順に処理され、先行する形式で既に <var "
"class=\"var\">to</var> が別の文字（例えば <var class=\"var\">to-alt</var>）に"
"変換されている場合、<var class=\"var\">from</var> も <var class=\"var\">to-"
"alt</var> に変換される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"During decoding, the translation table&rsquo;s translations are applied to "
"the characters that result from ordinary decoding.  If a coding system has "
"the property <code class=\"code\">:decode-translation-table</code>, that "
"specifies the translation table to use, or a list of translation tables to "
"apply in sequence.  (This is a property of the coding system, as returned by "
"<code class=\"code\">coding-system-get</code>, not a property of the symbol "
"that is the coding system&rsquo;s name.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Coding-"
"System-Basics.html\">Basic Concepts of Coding Systems</a>.)  Finally, if "
"<code class=\"code\">standard-translation-table-for-decode</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the resulting characters are translated by "
"that table."
msgstr ""
"デコード時には、通常のデコードによって得られた文字に対して、変換テーブルの変"
"換が適用されます。符号化方式が<code class=\"code\">:decode-translation-"
"table</code>というプロパティを持つ場合、そこには使用する変換テーブル、あるい"
"は順次適用する変換テーブルのリストが指定されます。（これは<code "
"class=\"code\">coding-system-get</code>によって返される符号化方式のプロパティ"
"であり、符号化方式の名称であるシンボルのプロパティではありません。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Coding-System-Basics.html\">符号化方式の基本概念</a>を"
"参照してください。）最後に、<code class=\"code\">standard-translation-table-"
"for-decode</code>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合、得られた文字は"
"そのテーブルによって変換されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"During encoding, the translation table&rsquo;s translations are applied to "
"the characters in the buffer, and the result of translation is actually "
"encoded.  If a coding system has property <code class=\"code\">:encode-"
"translation-table</code>, that specifies the translation table to use, or a "
"list of translation tables to apply in sequence.  In addition, if the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">standard-translation-table-for-encode</code> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it specifies the translation table "
"to use for translating the result."
msgstr ""
"エンコード時には、変換テーブルの変換がバッファ内の文字に適用され、変換結果が"
"実際にエンコードされます。コーディングシステムがプロパティ <code "
"class=\"code\">:encode-translation-table</code> を持つ場合、これにより使用す"
"る変換テーブル、または順次適用する変換テーブルのリストが指定されます。さら"
"に、変数 <code class=\"code\">standard-translation-table-for-encode</code> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、結果の変換に使用する変換"
"テーブルが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">standard-translation-table-for-decode</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"standard_002dtranslation_002dtable_002dfor_002ddecode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">standard-translation-table-for-decode</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-"
"standard_002dtranslation_002dtable_002dfor_002ddecode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This is the default translation table for decoding.  If a coding system "
"specifies its own translation tables, the table that is the value of this "
"variable, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, is applied after them."
msgstr ""
"これはデコード用のデフォルト変換テーブルです。コーディングシステムが独自の変"
"換テーブルを指定している場合、この変数の値（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"でない場合）が、それらの後に適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
