# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"Self-inserting characters are translated through this translation table "
"before they are inserted.  Search commands also translate their input "
"through this table, so they can compare more reliably with what&rsquo;s in "
"the buffer."
msgstr ""
"自己挿入文字は、挿入される前にこの変換テーブルを介して変換されます。検索コマ"
"ンドも入力をこのテーブルで変換するため、バッファ内の内容とより確実に照合でき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid "This variable automatically becomes buffer-local when set."
msgstr "この変数は、設定されると自動的にバッファローカルになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-translation-table-from-vector</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">vec</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dtranslation_002dtable_002dfrom_002dvector\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-translation-table-from-vector</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">vec</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"make_002dtranslation_002dtable_002dfrom_002dvector\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a translation table made from <var class=\"var\">vec</"
"var> that is an array of 256 elements to map bytes (values 0 through #xFF) "
"to characters.  Elements may be <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for "
"untranslated bytes.  The returned table has a translation table for reverse "
"mapping in the first extra slot, and the value <code class=\"code\">1</code> "
"in the second extra slot."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バイト（値 0 から #xFF）を文字にマッピングするための、<var "
"class=\"var\">vec</var> で構成される 256 要素の配列である変換テーブルを返しま"
"す。要素には、未変換のバイトを示す <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が含まれる"
"場合があります。返されるテーブルの最初の追加スロットには逆マッピング用の変換"
"テーブルが、2 番目の追加スロットには値 <code class=\"code\">1</code> が格納さ"
"れています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function provides an easy way to make a private coding system that maps "
"each byte to a specific character.  You can specify the returned table and "
"the reverse translation table using the properties <code "
"class=\"code\">:decode-translation-table</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">:encode-translation-table</code> respectively in the <var "
"class=\"var\">props</var> argument to <code class=\"code\">define-coding-"
"system</code>."
msgstr ""
