# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Translation-of-Characters.html
msgid ""
"This function is similar to <code class=\"code\">make-translation-table</"
"code> but returns a complex translation table rather than a simple one-to-"
"one mapping.  Each element of <var class=\"var\">alist</var> is of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">from</var> . <var class=\"var\">to</"
"var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">from</var> and <var class=\"var\">to</"
"var> are either characters or vectors specifying a sequence of characters.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">from</var> is a character, that character is "
"translated to <var class=\"var\">to</var> (i.e., to a character or a "
"character sequence).  If <var class=\"var\">from</var> is a vector of "
"characters, that sequence is translated to <var class=\"var\">to</var>.  The "
"returned table has a translation table for reverse mapping in the first "
"extra slot, and the maximum length of all the <var class=\"var\">from</var> "
"character sequences in the second extra slot."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">make-translation-table</code> に似ています"
"が、単純な一対一のマッピングではなく、複雑な変換テーブルを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">alist</var> の各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> . <var class=\"var\">to</var>)</code> の形式であり、"
"ここで <var class=\"var\">from</var> と <var class=\"var\">to</var> は文字、"
"または文字シーケンスを指定するベクトルのいずれかです。<var "
"class=\"var\">from</var> が文字の場合、その文字は <var class=\"var\">to</var>"
"（すなわち文字または文字シーケンス）に変換されます。<var class=\"var\">from</"
"var> が文字のベクトルの場合、そのシーケンスは <var class=\"var\">to</var> に"
"変換されます。返されるテーブルの最初の追加スロットには逆マッピング用の変換"
"テーブルが、2番目の追加スロットにはすべての <var class=\"var\">from</var> 文"
"字シーケンスの最大長が格納されています。"

