# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transposition.html
msgid "This function can be used to transpose stretches of text:"
msgstr "この関数を使うと、テキストの一部分を転置できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Transposition.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">transpose-regions</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start1 "
"end1 start2 end2 &amp;optional leave-markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-transpose_002dregions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">transpose-regions</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start1 "
"end1 start2 end2 &amp;optional leave-markers</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-transpose_002dregions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transposition.html
msgid ""
"This function exchanges two nonoverlapping portions of the buffer (if they "
"overlap, the function signals an error).  Arguments <var "
"class=\"var\">start1</var> and <var class=\"var\">end1</var> specify the "
"bounds of one portion and arguments <var class=\"var\">start2</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end2</var> specify the bounds of the other portion."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、バッファの重なり合わない2つの領域を入れ替えます（重なりがある場合"
"は、エラーを通知します）。引数 <var class=\"var\">start1</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end1</var> で一方の領域の範囲を、引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">start2</var> と <var class=\"var\">end2</var> でもう一方の領域"
"の範囲を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Transposition.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <code class=\"code\">transpose-regions</code> relocates markers "
"with the transposed text; a marker previously positioned within one of the "
"two transposed portions moves along with that portion, thus remaining "
"between the same two characters in their new position.  However, if <var "
"class=\"var\">leave-markers</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">transpose-regions</code> does not do this&mdash;it "
"leaves all markers unrelocated."
msgstr ""
"通常、<code class=\"code\">transpose-regions</code> は転置されたテキストとと"
"もにマーカーを移動させます。転置された2つの部分のいずれかに配置されていたマー"
"カーは、その部分とともに移動するため、新しい位置においても同じ2文字の間に留ま"
"ります。ただし、<var class=\"var\">leave-markers</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、<code class=\"code\">transpose-"
"regions</code> はこの処理を行わず、すべてのマーカーを移動させないままにしま"
"す。"

