# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This section covers some general guidelines on developing tree-sitter "
"integration for a major mode."
msgstr ""
"本節では、メジャーモード向けのTree-sitter連携開発に関する一般的なガイドライン"
"について解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"A major mode supporting tree-sitter features should roughly follow this "
"pattern:"
msgstr ""
"Tree-sitterの機能をサポートするメジャーモードは、概ね次のような構成になりま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(define-derived-mode woomy-mode prog-mode &quot;Woomy&quot;\n"
"  &quot;A mode for Woomy programming language.&quot;\n"
"  (when (treesit-ready-p 'woomy)\n"
"    (setq-local treesit-variables ...)\n"
"    ...\n"
"    (treesit-major-mode-setup)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-ready-p</code> automatically emits a warning if "
"conditions for enabling tree-sitter aren&rsquo;t met."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-ready-p</code> は、Tree-sitterを有効にするための"
"条件が満たされていない場合、自動的に警告を出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"If a tree-sitter major mode shares setup with its &ldquo;native&rdquo; "
"counterpart, one can create a &ldquo;base mode&rdquo; that contains the "
"common setup, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ツリーシッターのメジャーモードが「ネイティブ」な対応モードと設定を共有してい"
"る場合、次のように共通の設定を含む「ベースモード」を作成できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(define-derived-mode woomy--base-mode prog-mode &quot;Woomy&quot;\n"
"  &quot;An internal mode for Woomy programming language.&quot;\n"
"  (common-setup)\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(define-derived-mode woomy-mode woomy--base-mode &quot;Woomy&quot;\n"
"  &quot;A mode for Woomy programming language.&quot;\n"
"  (native-setup)\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
