# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function checks for conditions for activating tree-sitter.  It checks "
"whether Emacs was built with tree-sitter, whether the buffer&rsquo;s size is "
"not too large for tree-sitter to handle, and whether the grammar for <var "
"class=\"var\">language</var> is available on the system (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-Grammar.html\">Tree-sitter Language Grammar</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、Tree-sitterを有効にするための条件を確認します。具体的には、Emacs"
"がTree-sitter付きでビルドされているか、バッファのサイズがTree-sitterで処理可"
"能な範囲に収まっているか、そして<var class=\"var\">language</var>の文法がシス"
"テム上で利用可能であるか（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-"
"Grammar.html\">Tree-sitter Language Grammar</a>を参照）を確認します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function emits a warning if tree-sitter cannot be activated.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">quiet</var> is <code class=\"code\">message</code>, the "
"warning is turned into a message; if <var class=\"var\">quiet</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, no warning or message is displayed."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、tree-sitter を有効化できない場合に警告を出力します。<var "
"class=\"var\">quiet</var> が <code class=\"code\">message</code> の場合は警告"
"がメッセージになり、<var class=\"var\">quiet</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> の場合は警告もメッセージも表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
