"れています。<code class=\"code\">treesit-defun-at-point</code> はポイントにあ"
"る defun ノードを返し、<code class=\"code\">treesit-defun-name</code> は "
"defun ノードの名前を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-defun-at-point</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002ddefun_002dat_002dpoint\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-defun-at-point</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002ddefun_002dat_002dpoint\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the defun node at point, or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> if none is found.  It respects <code class=\"code\">treesit-defun-"
"tactic</code>: if its value is <code class=\"code\">top-level</code>, this "
"function returns the top-level defun, and if its value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nested</code>, it returns the immediate enclosing defun."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、point にある defun ノードを返すか、見つからない場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。また、<code class=\"code\">treesit-"
"defun-tactic</code> の値も考慮し、その値が <code class=\"code\">top-level</"
"code> であれば最上位の defun を、<code class=\"code\">nested</code> であれば"
"その直下の defun を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function requires <code class=\"code\">treesit-defun-type-regexp</code> "
"to work.  If it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function simply "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数が動作するには <code class=\"code\">treesit-defun-type-regexp</code> "
"が必要です。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、単に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
