"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Tree_002dsitter-Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the defun name of <var class=\"var\">node</var>.  It "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if there is no defun name for <var "
"class=\"var\">node</var>, or if <var class=\"var\">node</var> is not a defun "
