"<span>26.6.3 Truenames<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Truenames-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>26.6.3 Truenames<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Truenames-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-truename-_0028of-file_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-truename-_0028of-file_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">truename</em> of a file is the name that you get by "
"following symbolic links at all levels until none remain, then simplifying "
"away &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; appearing as name components.  This results "
"in a sort of canonical name for the file.  A file does not always have a "
"unique truename; the number of distinct truenames a file has is equal to the "
"number of hard links to the file.  However, truenames are useful because "
"they eliminate symbolic links as a cause of name variation."
msgstr ""
"ファイルの<em class=\"dfn\">truename</em>とは、すべての階層でシンボリックリン"
"クを辿り、リンクがなくなるまで進んだ後、名前の構成要素として現れる&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo;や&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</"
"samp>&rsquo;を簡略化して取り除いた名前のことである。これにより、ファイルの一"
"種の正準名が得られる。ファイルが常に一意のtruenameを持つとは限らず、ファイル"
"が持つ異なるtruenameの数は、そのファイルへのハードリンクの数に等しい。しか"
"し、truenameは名前の変動要因となるシンボリックリンクを排除できるため、有用で"
"ある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-truename</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dtruename\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">file-truename</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-file_002dtruename\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the truename of the file <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var>.  If the argument is not an absolute file name, this function first "
"expands it against <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ファイル <var class=\"var\">filename</var> の真名を返します。引数"
"が絶対ファイル名でない場合、この関数はまずそれを <code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> に照らして展開します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"This function does not expand environment variables.  Only <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> does that.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html#Definition-of-"
"substitute_002din_002dfile_002dname\">Definition of substitute-in-file-name</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は環境変数を展開しません。展開を行うのは <code "
"class=\"code\">substitute-in-file-name</code> のみです。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"File-Name-Expansion.html#Definition-of-"
"substitute_002din_002dfile_002dname\">ファイル名内の置換の定義</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"If you may need to follow symbolic links preceding &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; appearing as a name component, call <code "
"class=\"code\">file-truename</code> without prior direct or indirect calls "
"to <code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code>.  Otherwise, the file name "
"component immediately preceding &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; "
"will be simplified away before <code class=\"code\">file-truename</code> is "
"called.  To eliminate the need for a call to <code class=\"code\">expand-"
"file-name</code>, <code class=\"code\">file-truename</code> handles &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo; in the same way that <code "
"class=\"code\">expand-file-name</code> does."
msgstr ""
"名前構成要素として現れる &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; より前"
"のシンボリックリンクを辿る必要がある場合は、<code class=\"code\">expand-file-"
"name</code> への直接的または間接的な呼び出しを事前に行わずに <code "
"class=\"code\">file-truename</code> を呼び出してください。そうでない場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">file-truename</code> が呼び出される前に、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">..</samp>&rsquo; の直前にあるファイル名構成要素が簡略化されま"
