# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"This function follows symbolic links, starting with <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>, until it finds a file name which is not the "
"name of a symbolic link.  Then it returns that file name.  This function "
"does <em class=\"emph\">not</em> follow symbolic links at the level of "
"parent directories."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">filename</var> を起点として、シンボリックリン"
"クではないファイル名が見つかるまでシンボリックリンクを辿ります。その後、その"
"ファイル名を返します。この関数は、親ディレクトリレベルのシンボリックリンクは"
"辿り<em class=\"emph\">ません</em>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"If you specify a number for <var class=\"var\">limit</var>, then after "
"chasing through that many links, the function just returns what it has even "
"if that is still a symbolic link."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">limit</var> に数値を指定すると、その数だけリンクを辿った"
"後、たとえそれが依然としてシンボリックリンクであっても、関数は単に現在の値を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
msgid ""
"To illustrate the difference between <code class=\"code\">file-chase-links</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">file-truename</code>, suppose that <samp "
"class=\"file\">/usr/foo</samp> is a symbolic link to the directory <samp "
"class=\"file\">/home/foo</samp>, and <samp class=\"file\">/home/foo/hello</"
"samp> is an ordinary file (or at least, not a symbolic link) or "
"nonexistent.  Then we would have:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">file-chase-links</code> と <code class=\"code\">file-"
"truename</code> の違いを説明するため、<samp class=\"file\">/usr/foo</samp> が"
"ディレクトリ <samp class=\"file\">/home/foo</samp> へのシンボリックリンクであ"
"り、<samp class=\"file\">/home/foo/hello</samp> が通常のファイル（あるいは少"
"なくともシンボリックリンクではない）であるか、または存在しないと仮定します。"
"すると、次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Truenames.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(file-chase-links &quot;/usr/foo/hello&quot;)\n"
"     ;; <span class=\"r\">This does not follow the links in the parent directories.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/usr/foo/hello&quot;\n"
"(file-truename &quot;/usr/foo/hello&quot;)\n"
"     ;; <span class=\"r\">Assuming that <samp class=\"file\">/home</samp> is not a symbolic link.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/home/foo/hello&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

