"The most general way to check the type of an object is to call the function "
"<code class=\"code\">type-of</code>.  Recall that each object belongs to one "
"and only one primitive type; <code class=\"code\">type-of</code> tells you "
"which one (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Data-Types.html\">Lisp Data "
"Types</a>).  But <code class=\"code\">type-of</code> knows nothing about non-"
"primitive types.  In most cases, it is preferable to use type predicates "
"than <code class=\"code\">type-of</code>."
msgstr ""
"オブジェクトの型を確認する最も一般的な方法は、関数 <code class=\"code\">type-"
"of</code> を呼び出すことです。各オブジェクトはただ一つのプリミティブ型に属す"
"ることを思い出してください。<code class=\"code\">type-of</code> を使えば、そ"
"れがどの型であるかが分かります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Data-"
"Types.html\">Lispのデータ型</a>を参照）。しかし、<code class=\"code\">type-"
"of</code> は非プリミティブ型については何も知りません。ほとんどの場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">type-of</code> よりも型述語を使用する方が好ましいでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Type-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">type-of</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-type_002dof\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">type-of</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-type_002dof\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Type-Predicates.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a symbol naming the primitive type of <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var>.  The value is one of the symbols <code "
"class=\"code\">bool-vector</code>, <code class=\"code\">buffer</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">char-table</code>, <code class=\"code\">compiled-function</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">condition-variable</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">cons</code>, <code class=\"code\">finalizer</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">float</code>, <code class=\"code\">font-entity</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">font-object</code>, <code class=\"code\">font-spec</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">frame</code>, <code class=\"code\">hash-table</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">integer</code>, <code class=\"code\">marker</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">mutex</code>, <code class=\"code\">obarray</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">overlay</code>, <code class=\"code\">process</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">string</code>, <code class=\"code\">subr</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">symbol</code>, <code class=\"code\">thread</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">vector</code>, <code class=\"code\">window</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">window-configuration</code>.  However, if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a record, the type specified by its first slot "
"is returned; <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Records.html\">Records</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> のプリミティブ型を示すシンボルを"
"返します。値は、<code class=\"code\">bool-vector</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer</code>、<code class=\"code\">char-table</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">compiled-function</code>、<code class=\"code\">condition-"
"variable</code>、<code class=\"code\">cons</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">finalizer</code>、<code class=\"code\">float</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">font-entity</code>、<code class=\"code\">font-object</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">font-spec</code>、<code class=\"code\">frame</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">hash-table</code>、<code class=\"code\">integer</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">marker</code>、<code class=\"code\">mutex</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">obarray</code>、<code class=\"code\">overlay</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">process</code>、<code class=\"code\">string</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">subr</code>、<code class=\"code\">symbol</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">thread</code>、<code class=\"code\">vector</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">window</code>、または <code class=\"code\">window-"
"configuration</code> のいずれかのシンボルです。ただし、<var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> がレコードである場合は、その第1スロットで指定され"
"た型が返されます。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Records.html\">レコード</a>。"

