msgstr ""
"<span>41.21.2 UUID変換<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#UUID-"
"Conversion-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uuid-conversion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-uuid-conversion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"To use a UUID, typically it is converted to a string, and sometimes to a "
"binary representation.  This is done using <code class=\"code\">uuid-to-"
"string</code> function."
msgstr ""
"UUIDを使用する場合、通常は文字列に変換され、場合によってはバイナリ表現に変換"
"されます。これは<code class=\"code\">uuid-to-string</code>関数を用いて行われ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-to-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dto_002dstring\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-to-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dto_002dstring\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Return the standard string value, with hex values and dashes, of Lisp object "
"<code class=\"code\">uuid</code>."
msgstr ""
"Lispオブジェクト <code class=\"code\">uuid</code> の16進数値とハイフンを含む"
"標準的な文字列値を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(uuid-to-string (uuid-v4))     ; <span class=\"r\">&quot;230156d4-488a-45d1-93c9-507ec8be37ca&quot;</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Binary can also be generated, which generates a unibyte string, using <code "
"class=\"code\">uuid-to-bytes</code>, and a numeric representation of a UUID "
"can be generated with <code class=\"code\">uuid-to-number</code>."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">uuid-to-bytes</code> を用いてユニバイト文字列を生"
"成したり、<code class=\"code\">uuid-to-number</code> を用いて UUID の数値表現"
"を生成したりすることも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-to-bytes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dto_002dbytes\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-to-bytes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dto_002dbytes\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Return a unibyte string representing the binary value of <code "
"class=\"code\">uuid</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">uuid</code> の2進数値を表す1バイト文字列を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-to-number</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dto_002dnumber\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-to-number</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dto_002dnumber\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Return a numeric representation of the value of <code class=\"code\">uuid</"
"code>."
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">uuid</code>の値を数値で返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"String UUIDs can also be converted to a UUID Lisp object, with <code "
"class=\"code\">uuid-from-string</code>, and bytes can be converted with "
"<code class=\"code\">uuid-from-bytes</code>.  These work with all UUIDs, not "
"just the ones this module can generate."
msgstr ""
"文字列形式のUUIDも <code class=\"code\">uuid-from-string</code> を用いてUUID "
"Lispオブジェクトに変換でき、バイト列は <code class=\"code\">uuid-from-bytes</"
"code> で変換可能です。これらは、本モジュールで生成可能なUUIDに限らず、すべて"
"のUUIDで動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-from-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid-str</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dfrom_002dstring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-from-string</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid-str</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dfrom_002dstring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Return a UUID Lisp object that represents <var class=\"var\">uuid-str</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">uuid-str</var>を表すUUID Lispオブジェクトを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-from-bytes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid-bytes</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dfrom_002dbytes\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">uuid-from-bytes</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">uuid-bytes</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-uuid_002dfrom_002dbytes\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Return a UUID Lisp object that represents <var class=\"var\">uuid-bytes</"
"var>, which is expected to be a unibyte string."
msgstr ""
"ユニバイト文字列であることが想定される <var class=\"var\">uuid-bytes</var> を"
"表す UUID Lisp オブジェクトを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"Valid UUIDs have types, which can be used with <code class=\"code\">cl-"
"typep</code>, <code class=\"code\">cl-check-type</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">cl-typecase</code>.  The type is specified with the type "
"specifier <code class=\"code\">(uuid-v &lt;version&gt;)</code>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">version</var> can be any version of UUID, but we make sure the "
"UUID variant is correctly <code class=\"code\">2</code>; any other value is "
"not a valid version."
msgstr ""
"有効なUUIDにはタイプがあり、<code class=\"code\">cl-typep</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">cl-check-type</code>、<code class=\"code\">cl-typecase</code>"
"と組み合わせて使用できます。タイプはタイプ指定子<code class=\"code\">(uuid-v "
"&lt;version&gt;)</code>で指定します。<var class=\"var\">version</var>は任意の"
"バージョンのUUIDで構いませんが、UUIDバリアントが正しく<code "
"class=\"code\">2</code>であることを確認します。それ以外の値は有効なバージョン"
"ではありません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(when (cl-typep my-uuid '(uuid-v 4))\n"
"    (process-v4-uuid my-uuid))\n"
"\n"
"(defun process-v4-uuid (uuid)\n"
"    ;; Error if not the correct type\n"
"    (cl-check-type uuid (uuid-v 4))\n"
"    ;; Proceed to process the UUIDv4.\n"
"    (more-processing uuid))\n"
msgstr ""

