# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Generation.html
msgid ""
"To generate UUIDs, call <code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">uuid-v5</code> or <code class=\"code\">uuid-v7</code>.  UUID "
"v4 and v7 will by default use the normal elisp <em class=\"dfn\">random</em> "
"for random numbers, but a different random number generator can be passed "
"in, as long as it can be called with an arg of the end of the range of "
"acceptable integers to generate (exclusive), and returns an integer."
msgstr ""
"UUIDを生成するには、<code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">uuid-v5</code>、または<code class=\"code\">uuid-v7</code>を呼"
"び出します。UUID v4およびv7では、デフォルトで通常のelisp <em "
"class=\"dfn\">random</em>が乱数として使用されますが、生成可能な整数の範囲の上"
"限（排他的）を引数として呼び出し、整数を返すものであれば、別の乱数生成器を渡"
"すことも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
