# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Generation.html
msgid ""
"Return a <code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code> Lisp object representing a new "
"UUIDv4.  <var class=\"var\">rng</var>, if provided, is a function that will, "
"when called with a numeric argument, return a random number between 0 and "
"that number (exclusive)."
msgstr ""
"新しいUUIDv4を表す<code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code> Lispオブジェクトを返し"
"ます。<var class=\"var\">rng</var>が指定されている場合は、数値引数を指定して"
"呼び出した際に、0からその数値まで（両端を除く）の乱数を返す関数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
