# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Generation.html
msgid ""
"Similar to <code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code> but returns a <code "
"class=\"code\">uuid-v7</code>, which is generated with a timestamp in "
"addition to random numbers (generated from <var class=\"var\">rng</var> in a "
"similar manner as <code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code>と同様ですが、乱数に加えてタイムスタンプを"
"用いて生成される<code class=\"code\">uuid-v7</code>を返します（乱数は<code "
"class=\"code\">uuid-v4</code>と同様に<var class=\"var\">rng</var>から生成され"
"ます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Generation.html
msgid ""
"These use random numbers, which should be cryptographically secure.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Random-Numbers.html\">Random Numbers</a>, but "
"generally these random numbers are not sufficient to generate sufficiently "
"random UUIDs.  For private uses, the default behavior should be sufficient, "
"but for professional uses, <var class=\"var\">rng</var> should be used, and "
"provide cryptographically secure random numbers."
msgstr ""
"これらは乱数を使用しており、暗号学的に安全であるはずです。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Random-Numbers.html\">乱数</a>を参照してください。ただし、一般的にこれ"
"らの乱数では、十分にランダムなUUIDを生成するには不十分です。個人利用であれば"
"デフォルトの動作で十分ですが、業務利用の場合は<var class=\"var\">rng</var>を"
"使用し、暗号学的に安全な乱数を提供する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/UUID-Generation.html
msgid ""
