# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Undo.html
msgid ""
"Most buffers have an <em class=\"dfn\">undo list</em>, which records all "
"changes made to the buffer&rsquo;s text so that they can be undone.  (The "
"buffers that don&rsquo;t have one are usually special-purpose buffers for "
"which Emacs assumes that undoing is not useful.  In particular, any buffer "
"whose name begins with a space has its undo recording off by default; see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Buffer-Names.html\">Buffer Names</a>.)  All the "
"primitives that modify the text in the buffer automatically add elements to "
"the front of the undo list, which is in the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-undo-list</code>."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどのバッファには<em class=\"dfn\">アンドゥリスト</em>があり、バッファの"
"テキストに加えられたすべての変更が記録され、それらを元に戻せるようになってい"
"ます。（アンドゥリストを持たないバッファは通常、Emacsがアンドゥを有用ではない"
"とみなす特殊目的のバッファです。特に、名前がスペースで始まるバッファは、デ"
"フォルトでアンドゥ記録がオフになっています。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"Names.html\">バッファ名</a>を参照してください。）バッファ内のテキストを変更す"
"るすべてのプリミティブは、変数<code class=\"code\">buffer-undo-list</code>に"
"あるアンドゥリストの先頭に要素を自動的に追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Undo.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-undo-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dundo_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">buffer-undo-list</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"buffer_002dundo_002dlist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Undo.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable&rsquo;s value is the undo list of the current "
"buffer.  A value of <code class=\"code\">t</code> disables the recording of "
"undo information."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数の値は、現在のバッファのアンドゥリストです。<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> という値を指定すると、アンドゥ情報の記録が無効になり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Undo.html
msgid "Here are the kinds of elements an undo list can have:"
msgstr ""
