"<span>26.9.5 一意のファイル名の生成<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Generating-Unique-File-Names\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unique-file-names\"></a> <a "
