# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"Some programs need to write temporary files.  Here is the usual way to "
"construct a name for such a file:"
msgstr ""
"プログラムによっては、一時ファイルを作成する必要があります。こうしたファイル"
"の名前を付ける一般的な方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(make-temp-file <var class=\"var\">name-of-application</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The job of <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> is to prevent two "
"different users or two different jobs from trying to use the exact same file "
"name."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code>の役割は、2人の異なるユーザーまたは"
"2つの異なるジョブが、全く同じファイル名を使用しようとするのを防ぐことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-temp-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prefix "
"&amp;optional dir-flag suffix text</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dtemp_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-temp-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">prefix "
"&amp;optional dir-flag suffix text</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dtemp_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function creates a temporary file and returns its name.  Emacs creates "
"the temporary file&rsquo;s name by adding to <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> "
"some random characters that are different in each Emacs job.  The result is "
"guaranteed to be a newly created file, containing <var class=\"var\">text</"
"var> if that&rsquo;s given as a string and empty otherwise.  On MS-DOS, this "
"function can truncate <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> to fit into the 8+3 "
"file-name limits.  If <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> is a relative file "
"name, it is expanded against <code class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は一時ファイルを作成し、そのファイル名を返します。Emacsは、<var "
"class=\"var\">prefix</var> に、Emacsのジョブごとに異なるランダムな文字を付加"
"することで一時ファイル名を生成します。結果として得られるのは、必ず新しく作成"
"されたファイルであり、<var class=\"var\">text</var> が文字列として指定されて"
"いればその内容を含み、そうでなければ空となります。MS-DOSでは、この関数は "
"<var class=\"var\">prefix</var> を8+3のファイル名制限に収まるように切り詰める"
"ことができます。<var class=\"var\">prefix</var> が相対ファイル名である場合、"
"それは <code class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</code> を基準として展開"
"されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-temp-file &quot;foo&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/tmp/foo232J6v&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> returns, the file has been "
"created and is empty.  At that point, you should write the intended contents "
"into the file."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> が返る時点で、ファイルは作成されて"
"おり、中身は空です。その時点で、意図した内容をファイルに書き込むべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">dir-flag</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> creates an empty directory "
"instead of an empty file.  It returns the file name, not the directory name, "
"of that directory.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Directory-"
"Names.html\">Directory Names</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">dir-flag</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> は空のファイルではなく空のディ"
"レクトリを作成します。そのディレクトリのディレクトリ名ではなく、ファイル名を"
"返します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Directory-Names.html\">ディレクトリ名</a> "
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">suffix</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> adds it at the end of the file "
"name."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">suffix</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> はそれをファイル名の末尾に追加"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">text</var> is a string, <code class=\"code\">make-temp-"
"file</code> inserts it in the file."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">text</var> が文字列の場合、<code class=\"code\">make-temp-"
"file</code> はそれをファイルに挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"On Posix systems, Emacs creates the file with permissions that limit its "
"access to the current user."
msgstr ""
"Posixシステムでは、Emacsは現在のユーザーにのみアクセスが制限される権限でファ"
"イルを作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"To prevent conflicts among different libraries running in the same Emacs, "
"each Lisp program that uses <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> "
"should have its own <var class=\"var\">prefix</var>.  The number added to "
"the end of <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> distinguishes between the same "
"application running in different Emacs jobs.  Additional added characters "
"permit a large number of distinct names even in one Emacs job."
msgstr ""
"同一のEmacs内で動作する異なるライブラリ間の競合を防ぐため、<code "
"class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code>を使用する各Lispプログラムには、それぞれ"
"固有の<var class=\"var\">prefix</var>を持たせる必要があります。<var "
"class=\"var\">prefix</var>の末尾に付加される数値によって、同一アプリケーショ"
"ンが異なるEmacsジョブで動作している場合に区別されます。さらに文字を追加するこ"
"とで、単一のEmacsジョブ内であっても、多数の個別の名称を設定することが可能にな"
"ります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The default directory for temporary files is controlled by the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</code>.  This variable gives "
"the user a uniform way to specify the directory for all temporary files.  "
"Some programs use <code class=\"code\">small-temporary-file-directory</code> "
"instead, if that is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  To use it, you "
"should expand the prefix against the proper directory before calling <code "
"class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">temporary-file-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-temporary_002dfile_002ddirectory-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">temporary-file-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-temporary_002dfile_002ddirectory-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TMPDIR-environment-variable\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TMP-environment-variable\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TEMP-environment-variable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TMPDIR-environment-variable\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TMP-environment-variable\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TEMP-environment-variable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the directory name for creating temporary files.  "
"Its value should be a directory name (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Directory-Names.html\">Directory Names</a>), but it is good for Lisp "
"programs to cope if the value is a directory&rsquo;s file name instead.  "
"Using the value as the second argument to <code class=\"code\">expand-file-"
"name</code> is a good way to achieve that."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、一時ファイルを作成する際のディレクトリ名を指定します。値はディレ"
"クトリ名（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Directory-Names.html\">ディレクトリ名</a>"
"を参照）である必要がありますが、値がディレクトリのファイル名であってもLispプ"
"ログラムは適切に処理できます。値を<code class=\"code\">expand-file-name</"
"code>の第2引数として指定するのが、これを実現する有効な方法です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The default value is determined in a reasonable way for your operating "
"system; it is based on the <code class=\"env\">TMPDIR</code>, <code "
"class=\"env\">TMP</code> and <code class=\"env\">TEMP</code> environment "
"variables, with a fall-back to a system-dependent name if none of these "
"variables is defined."
msgstr ""
"デフォルト値は、お使いのオペレーティングシステムに合わせて適切な方法で決定さ"
"れます。これは環境変数 <code class=\"env\">TMPDIR</code>、<code "
"class=\"env\">TMP</code>、<code class=\"env\">TEMP</code> に基づいており、こ"
"れらの変数がいずれも定義されていない場合は、システム依存の名称が代替として使"
"用されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"Even if you do not use <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> to create "
"the temporary file, you should still use this variable to decide which "
"directory to put the file in.  However, if you expect the file to be small, "
"you should use <code class=\"code\">small-temporary-file-directory</code> "
"first if that is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">small-temporary-file-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-small_002dtemporary_002dfile_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">small-temporary-file-directory</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"small_002dtemporary_002dfile_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the directory name for creating certain temporary "
"files, which are likely to be small."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、サイズが小さくなる可能性が高い特定の一時ファイルを作成するための"
"ディレクトリ名を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"If you want to write a temporary file which is likely to be small, you "
"should compute the directory like this:"
msgstr ""
"サイズが小さくなる見込みの一時ファイルを作成したい場合は、次のようにディレク"
"トリを算出してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(make-temp-file\n"
"  (expand-file-name <var class=\"var\">prefix</var>\n"
"                    (or small-temporary-file-directory\n"
"                        temporary-file-directory)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-temp-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">base-name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dtemp_002dname\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-temp-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">base-name</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dtemp_002dname\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function generates a string that might be a unique file name.  The name "
"starts with <var class=\"var\">base-name</var>, and has several random "
"characters appended to it, which are different in each Emacs job.  It is "
"like <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> except that (i) it just "
"constructs a name and does not create a file, (ii) <var class=\"var\">base-"
"name</var> should be an absolute file name that is not magic, and (iii) if "
"the returned file name is magic, it might name an existing file.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Magic-File-Names.html\">Making Certain File Names "
"&ldquo;Magic&rdquo;</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、一意のファイル名となる可能性のある文字列を生成します。ファイル名"
"は <var class=\"var\">base-name</var> で始まり、その後にいくつかのランダムな"
"文字が付加されますが、これらの文字は Emacs のジョブごとに異なります。これは "
"<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> に似ていますが、(i) 単に名前を構築"
"するだけでファイルは作成しない、(ii) <var class=\"var\">base-name</var> はマ"
"ジックではない絶対ファイル名であるべきである、(iii) 返されたファイル名がマ"
"ジックである場合、既存のファイルに名前が付けられる可能性がある、という点が異"
"なります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Magic-File-Names.html\">特定のファイル名を"
"「マジック」にする</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> In most cases, you should not use "
"this function; use <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> instead! This "
"function is susceptible to a race condition, between the <code "
"class=\"code\">make-temp-name</code> call and the creation of the file, "
"which in some cases may cause a security hole."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> ほとんどの場合、この関数は使用せず、"
"代わりに <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> を使用してください！この"
"関数は、<code class=\"code\">make-temp-name</code> の呼び出しとファイルの作成"
"との間で競合状態が発生しやすく、場合によってはセキュリティ上の脆弱性を招く恐"
"れがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, it is necessary to create a temporary file on a remote host or a "
"mounted directory.  The following two functions support this."
msgstr ""
"リモートホストやマウント済みディレクトリ上に一時ファイルを作成する必要が生じ"
"ることがあります。以下の2つの関数がこれに対応しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-temporary-file-on-a-remote-host\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-temporary-file-on-a-remote-host\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-nearby-temp-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">prefix &amp;optional dir-flag suffix</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-make_002dnearby_002dtemp_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-nearby-temp-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">prefix &amp;optional dir-flag suffix</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-make_002dnearby_002dtemp_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"This function is similar to <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code>, but "
"it creates a temporary file as close as possible to <code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> "
"is a relative file name, and <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> "
"is a remote file name or located on a mounted file systems, the temporary "
"file is created in the directory returned by the function <code "
"class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</code>.  Otherwise, the function "
"<code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> is used.  <var "
"class=\"var\">prefix</var>, <var class=\"var\">dir-flag</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">suffix</var> have the same meaning as in <code "
"class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> と同様ですが、<code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> に可能な限り近い一時ファイルを作成し"
"ます。  <var class=\"var\">prefix</var> が相対ファイル名であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> がリモートファイル名であるか、または"
"マウントされたファイルシステム上にある場合、一時ファイルは関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</code> が返すディレクトリに作成されま"
"す。  それ以外の場合は、関数 <code class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> が使"
"用されます。  <var class=\"var\">prefix</var>、<var class=\"var\">dir-flag</"
"var> および <var class=\"var\">suffix</var> の意味は <code "
"class=\"code\">make-temp-file</code> と同様です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((default-directory &quot;/ssh:remotehost:&quot;))\n"
"  (make-nearby-temp-file &quot;foo&quot;))\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;/ssh:remotehost:/tmp/foo232J6v&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">temporary-file-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-temporary_002dfile_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">temporary-file-directory</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-temporary_002dfile_002ddirectory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"The directory for writing temporary files via <code class=\"code\">make-"
"nearby-temp-file</code>.  In case of a remote <code class=\"code\">default-"
"directory</code>, this is a directory for temporary files on that remote "
"host.  If such a directory does not exist, or <code class=\"code\">default-"
"directory</code> ought to be located on a mounted file system (see <code "
"class=\"code\">mounted-file-systems</code>), the function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code>.  For a non-remote and non-mounted "
"<code class=\"code\">default-directory</code>, the value of the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</code> is returned."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">make-nearby-temp-file</code> 経由で一時ファイルを書き込"
"むためのディレクトリ。リモートの <code class=\"code\">default-directory</"
"code> の場合は、そのリモートホスト上の一時ファイル用ディレクトリとなります。"
"そのようなディレクトリが存在しない場合、または <code class=\"code\">default-"
"directory</code> がマウント済みファイルシステム上にある必要がある場合（<code "
"class=\"code\">mounted-file-systems</code> を参照）、この関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> を返します。リモートでもマウント済み"
"でもない <code class=\"code\">default-directory</code> の場合は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">temporary-file-directory</code> の値が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Unique-File-Names.html
msgid ""
"In order to extract the local part of the file&rsquo;s name of a temporary "
"file, use <code class=\"code\">file-local-name</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Magic-File-Names.html\">Making Certain File Names "
"&ldquo;Magic&rdquo;</a>)."
msgstr ""
"一時ファイルのファイル名からローカル部分を抽出するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">file-local-name</code> を使用してください（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Magic-File-Names.html\">特定のファイル名を「マジック」にする</a>を参"
"照）。"

