# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid "This holds the email address of the user who is using Emacs."
msgstr ""
"ここにはEmacsを使用しているユーザーのメールアドレスが格納されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">user-login-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional uid</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dlogin_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">user-login-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional uid</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dlogin_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the name under which the user is logged in.  It uses "
"the environment variables <code class=\"env\">LOGNAME</code> or <code "
"class=\"env\">USER</code> if either is set.  Otherwise, the value is based "
"on the effective <abbr class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr>, not the real <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ユーザーがログインしている名前を返します。環境変数 <code "
"class=\"env\">LOGNAME</code> または <code class=\"env\">USER</code> が設定さ"
"れている場合は、それらが使用されます。そうでない場合は、実際の <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr> ではなく、実効 <abbr class=\"acronym\">UID</"
"abbr> に基づいて値が決定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"If you specify <var class=\"var\">uid</var> (a number), the result is the "
"user name that corresponds to <var class=\"var\">uid</var>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if there is no such user."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">uid</var>（数値）を指定した場合、結果は<var "
"class=\"var\">uid</var>に対応するユーザー名となり、該当するユーザーがいない場"
"合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">user-real-login-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dreal_002dlogin_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">user-real-login-name</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dreal_002dlogin_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the user name corresponding to Emacs&rsquo;s real "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr>.  This ignores the effective <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr>, and the environment variables <code "
"class=\"env\">LOGNAME</code> and <code class=\"env\">USER</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、Emacsの実際の<abbr class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr>に対応するユーザー"
"名を返します。実効<abbr class=\"acronym\">UID</abbr>、および環境変数<code "
"class=\"env\">LOGNAME</code>と<code class=\"env\">USER</code>は無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">user-full-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional uid</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dfull_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">user-full-name</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional uid</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"user_002dfull_002dname\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the full name of the logged-in user&mdash;or the value "
"of the environment variable <code class=\"env\">NAME</code>, if that is set."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ログインユーザーのフルネーム、あるいは環境変数 <code "
"class=\"env\">NAME</code> が設定されている場合はその値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"If the Emacs process&rsquo;s user-id does not correspond to any known user "
"(and provided <code class=\"env\">NAME</code> is not set), the result is "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;unknown&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"EmacsプロセスのユーザーIDが既知のユーザーに該当せず（かつ<code "
"class=\"env\">NAME</code>が設定されていない）場合、結果は<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;unknown&quot;</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User-Identification.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">uid</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then "
"it should be a number (a user-id)  or a string (a login name).  Then <code "
"class=\"code\">user-full-name</code> returns the full name corresponding to "
"that user-id or login name.  If you specify a user-id or login name that "
"isn&rsquo;t defined, it returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">uid</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、"
"数値（ユーザーID）または文字列（ログイン名）である必要があります。このとき、"
"<code class=\"code\">user-full-name</code> はそのユーザーIDまたはログイン名に"
"対応するフルネームを返します。定義されていないユーザーIDまたはログイン名を指"
"定した場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
