# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002dLevel-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This function joins the line point is on to the previous line, deleting any "
"whitespace at the join and in some cases replacing it with one space.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">join-following-p</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">delete-indentation</code> joins this line to the "
"following line instead.  Otherwise, if <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> are non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this "
"function joins all lines in the region they define."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、line point が位置する行を直前の行に結合し、結合箇所の空白を削除"
"し、場合によってはそれを1つのスペースに置き換えます。<var class=\"var\">join-"
"following-p</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">delete-indentation</code> は代わりにこの行を次の行に結合しま"
"す。そうでない場合、<var class=\"var\">beg</var> および <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、この"
"関数はそれらが定義する領域内のすべての行を結合します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002dLevel-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"In an interactive call, <var class=\"var\">join-following-p</var> is the "
"prefix argument, and <var class=\"var\">beg</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> are, respectively, the start and end of the region "
"if it is active, else <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The function returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブコールにおいて、<var class=\"var\">join-following-p</var>は接"
