# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002dLevel-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"This function replaces all the horizontal whitespace surrounding point with "
