# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002ddefined-Things.html
msgid ""
"You can define things with <var class=\"var\">treesit-thing-settings</var>, "
"retrieve the predicate of a defined thing with <code class=\"code\">treesit-"
"thing-definition</code>, and test if a thing is defined with <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-thing-defined-p</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">treesit-thing-settings</var> で要素を定義し、<code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-thing-definition</code> で定義済み要素の述語を取得し、"
"<code class=\"code\">treesit-thing-defined-p</code> で要素が定義されているか"
"を判定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002ddefined-Things.html
msgid ""
