# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002ddefined-Things.html
msgid ""
"This is an alist of thing definitions for each language supported by the "
"grammar used in a buffer; it should be defined by the buffer&rsquo;s major "
"mode (the default value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>).  The key of "
"each entry is a language symbol (e.g., <code class=\"code\">c</code> for C, "
"<code class=\"code\">cpp</code> for C<code class=\"t\">++</code>, etc.), and "
"the value is a list of thing definitions of the form <code "
