#: build/html/elisp/User_002ddefined-Things.html
msgid ""
"This function is similar to <code class=\"code\">treesit-thing-prev</code>, "
"only it returns the first node <em class=\"emph\">after</em> <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> that&rsquo;s the <var class=\"var\">thing</"
