"終了位置は <var class=\"var\">position</var> 以上である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/User_002ddefined-Things.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">strict</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
