"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive-spec_002c-using\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"This section describes how to write the <code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code> form that makes a Lisp function an interactively-callable command, and "
"how to examine a command&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> "
"form."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Lisp関数を対話的に呼び出し可能なコマンドにするための<code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code>形式の書き方と、コマンドの<code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code>形式の確認方法について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Special Form: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">interactive</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"arg-descriptor &amp;rest modes</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"interactive\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">特殊形式: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">インタラクティブ</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional arg-descriptor &amp;rest modes</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-interactive\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"This special form declares that a function is a command, and that it may "
"therefore be called interactively (via <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> or by "
"entering a key sequence bound to it).  The argument <var class=\"var\">arg-"
"descriptor</var> declares how to compute the arguments to the command when "
"the command is called interactively."
msgstr ""
"この特殊形式は、関数がコマンドであり、したがって対話的に呼び出せる（<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> 経由、またはそれにバインドされたキーシーケンスの入力"
"による）ことを宣言します。引数 <var class=\"var\">arg-descriptor</var> は、コ"
"マンドが対話的に呼び出された際に、そのコマンドへの引数をどのように計算するか"
"を宣言します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"A command may be called from Lisp programs like any other function, but then "
"the caller supplies the arguments and <var class=\"var\">arg-descriptor</"
"var> has no effect."
msgstr ""
"コマンドは、他の関数と同様にLispプログラムから呼び出すことができますが、その"
"場合、呼び出し側が引数を指定するため、<var class=\"var\">arg-descriptor</"
"var> は効果を発揮しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive_002dform-_0028symbol-"
"property_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive_002dform-_0028symbol-"
"property_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> form must be located at top-"
"level in the function body, or in the function symbol&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive-form</code> property (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Symbol-Properties.html\">Symbol Properties</a>).  It has its effect "
"because the command loop looks for it before calling the function (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">Interactive Call</a>).  Once "
"the function is called, all its body forms are executed; at this time, if "
"the <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> form occurs within the body, the "
"form simply returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> without even evaluating "
"its argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> フォームは、関数本体のトップレベル、"
"または関数シンボルの <code class=\"code\">interactive-form</code> プロパティ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Properties.html\">シンボルプロパティ</a> "
"を参照）に配置されている必要があります。コマンドループが関数を呼び出す前にこ"
"のフォームを探すため、効果を発揮します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Call.html\">インタラクティブ呼び出し</a> を参照）。関数が"
"呼び出されると、その本体内のすべてのフォームが実行されます。このとき、本体内"
"に <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> フォームが存在する場合、そのフォー"
"ムは引数を評価することなく単に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"The <var class=\"var\">modes</var> list allows specifying which modes the "
"command is meant to be used in.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-"
"Modes.html\">Specifying Modes For Commands</a>, for more details about the "
"effect of specifying <var class=\"var\">modes</var>, and when to use it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">modes</var> リストを使用すると、コマンドをどのモードで使用"
"させるかを指定できます。<var class=\"var\">modes</var> を指定した際の効果や使"
"用タイミングの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Command-Modes.html\">"
"コマンドのモード指定</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"By convention, you should put the <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> "
"form in the function body, as the first top-level form.  If there is an "
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> form in both the <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive-form</code> symbol property and the function "
"body, the former takes precedence.  The <code class=\"code\">interactive-"
"form</code> symbol property can be used to add an interactive form to an "
"existing function, or change how its arguments are processed interactively, "
"without redefining the function."
msgstr ""
"慣例として、<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> フォームは関数本体の最初"
"のトップレベルフォームとして配置すべきです。<code class=\"code\">interactive-"
"form</code> シンボルプロパティと関数本体の両方に <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> フォームが存在する場合、前者が優先されま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">interactive-form</code> シンボルプロパティを使用する"
"と、関数を再定義することなく、既存の関数にインタラクティブフォームを追加した"
"り、引数のインタラクティブな処理方法を変更したりできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"There are three possibilities for the argument <var class=\"var\">arg-"
"descriptor</var>:"
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">arg-descriptor</var> には3つの可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"It may be omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; then the command is "
"called with no arguments.  This leads quickly to an error if the command "
"requires one or more arguments."
msgstr ""
"省略可能、あるいは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> と指定でき、その場合は引数"
"なしでコマンドが呼び出されます。コマンドが1つ以上の引数を必要とする場合、すぐ"
"にエラーが発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"It may be a string; its contents are a sequence of elements separated by "
"newlines, one for each argument<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF19\" "
"href=\"#FOOT19\"><sup>19</sup></a>.  Each element consists of a code "
"character (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Codes.html\">Code "
"Characters for <code class=\"code\">interactive</code></a>) optionally "
"followed by a prompt (which some code characters use and some ignore).  Here "
"is an example:"
msgstr ""
"文字列である場合があり、その内容は改行で区切られた要素の並びで、引数ごとに1つ"
"ずつ配置されます<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF19\" "
"href=\"#FOOT19\"><sup>19</sup></a>。各要素はコード文字（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Codes.html\"><code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の"
"コード文字</a>を参照）で構成され、その後に任意でプロンプトが続きます（一部の"
"コード文字ではプロンプトを使用し、一部では無視します）。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(interactive &quot;P\\nbFrobnicate buffer: &quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"The code letter &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">P</samp>&rsquo; sets the "
"command&rsquo;s first argument to the raw command prefix (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-Command-Arguments.html\">Prefix Command "
"Arguments</a>).  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bFrobnicate buffer: </"
"samp>&rsquo; prompts the user with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Frobnicate "
"buffer: </samp>&rsquo; to enter the name of an existing buffer, which "
"becomes the second and final argument."
msgstr ""
"コード文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">P</samp>&rsquo; は、コマンドの第1引数"
"を生のコマンドプレフィックスに設定します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Prefix-"
"Command-Arguments.html\">プレフィックスコマンド引数</a>を参照）。&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">bFrobnicate buffer: </samp>&rsquo; は、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Frobnicate buffer: </samp>&rsquo; を用いてユーザーに既存バッ"
"ファ名の入力を促し、その名前が第2引数かつ最後の引数となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"The prompt string can use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; to "
"include previous argument values (starting with the first argument) in the "
"prompt.  This is done using <code class=\"code\">format-message</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">Formatting Strings</"
"a>).  For example, here is how you could read the name of an existing buffer "
"followed by a new name to give to that buffer:"
msgstr ""
"プロンプト文字列では、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; を使用し"
"て、直前の引数の値（第1引数から）をプロンプトに含めることができます。これは "
"<code class=\"code\">format-message</code> を用いて行われます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Formatting-Strings.html\">書式指定文字列</a>を参照）。"
"例えば、既存のバッファ名を読み取った後、そのバッファに指定する新しい名前を入"
"力する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(interactive &quot;bBuffer to rename: \\nsRename buffer %s to: &quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002a-in-interactive\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-buffers-in-interactive\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002a-in-interactive\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-buffers-in-interactive\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"If &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; appears at the beginning of "
"the string, then an error is signaled if the buffer is read-only."
msgstr ""
"文字列の先頭に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; が現れる場合、バッ"
"ファが読み取り専用であればエラーが通知されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0040-in-interactive\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0040-in-interactive\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"If &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo; appears at the beginning of "
"the string, and if the key sequence used to invoke the command includes any "
"mouse events, then the window associated with the first of those events is "
"selected before the command is run."
msgstr ""
"文字列の先頭に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo; が現れ、かつコマン"
"ドの実行に用いられるキーシーケンスにマウスイベントが含まれている場合、コマン"
"ドが実行される前に、それらのイベントのうち最初のものに関連付けられたウィンド"
"ウが選択されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005e-in-interactive\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shift_002dselection_002c-and-interactive-"
"spec\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_005e-in-interactive\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shift_002dselection_002c-and-interactive-"
"spec\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"If &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; appears at the beginning of "
"the string, and if the command was invoked through <em class=\"dfn\">shift-"
"translation</em>, set the mark and activate the region temporarily, or "
"extend an already active region, before the command is run.  If the command "
"was invoked without shift-translation, and the region is temporarily active, "
"deactivate the region before the command is run.  Shift-translation is "
"controlled on the user level by <code class=\"code\">shift-select-mode</"
"code>; see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Shift-Selection.html#Shift-Selection\">Shift "
"Selection</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"文字列の先頭に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; があり、かつコマン"
"ドが <em class=\"dfn\">シフト変換</em> 経由で呼び出された場合は、コマンドを実"
"行する前にマークを設定し、一時的にリージョンをアクティブにするか、あるいは既"
"にアクティブなリージョンを拡張します。シフト変換なしでコマンドが呼び出され、"
"かつリージョンが一時的にアクティブな場合は、コマンドを実行する前にリージョン"
"を非アクティブにします。シフト変換はユーザーレベルで <code "
"class=\"code\">shift-select-mode</code> によって制御されます。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Shift-"
"Selection.html#Shift-Selection\">Shift Selection</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"You can use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo;, and <code class=\"code\">^</code> together; "
"the order does not matter.  Actual reading of arguments is controlled by the "
"rest of the prompt string (starting with the first character that is not "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</"
"samp>&rsquo;, or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;)."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</"
"samp>&rsquo;、および<code class=\"code\">^</code>は組み合わせて使用でき、順序"
"は問いません。引数の実際の読み取りは、プロンプト文字列の残りの部分（&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</"
"samp>&rsquo;、または&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;以外の最初の文"
"字から始まる部分）によって制御されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"It may be a Lisp expression that is not a string; then it should be a form "
"that is evaluated to get a list of arguments to pass to the command.  "
"Usually this form will call various functions to read input from the user, "
"most often through the minibuffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffers.html\">Minibuffers</a>)  or directly from the keyboard "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-Input.html\">Reading Input</a>)."
msgstr ""
"文字列ではないLisp式である場合、それはコマンドに渡す引数のリストを得るために"
"評価されるフォームである必要があります。通常、このフォームはさまざまな関数を"
"呼び出してユーザーから入力を読み取ります。その多くはミニバッファ（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffers.html\">ミニバッファ</a>を参照）経由、ある"
"いはキーボードから直接行われます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-"
"Input.html\">入力の読み取り</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"Providing point or the mark as an argument value is also common, but if you "
"do this <em class=\"emph\">and</em> read input (whether using the minibuffer "
"or not), be sure to get the integer values of point or the mark after "
"reading.  The current buffer may be receiving subprocess output; if "
"subprocess output arrives while the command is waiting for input, it could "
"relocate point and the mark."
msgstr ""
"引数の値として point や the mark を指定することも一般的ですが、そうする<em "
"class=\"emph\">とともに</em>入力を読み取る場合（ミニバッファを使用するかどう"
"かにかかわらず）、読み取り後に point や the mark の整数値を必ず取得するように"
"してください。現在のバッファにはサブプロセスの出力が届いている可能性があり、"
"コマンドが入力を待機している間にサブプロセスの出力が届くと、point や the "
"mark が移動してしまう恐れがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid "Here&rsquo;s an example of what <em class=\"emph\">not</em> to do:"
msgstr "<em class=\"emph\">やってはいけない</em>例を以下に挙げます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(interactive\n"
" (list (region-beginning) (region-end)\n"
"       (read-string &quot;Foo: &quot; nil 'my-history)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s how to avoid the problem, by examining point and the mark after "
"reading the keyboard input:"
msgstr ""
"キーボード入力を読み取った後、ポイントとマークを確認することで、この問題を回"
"避する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(interactive\n"
" (let ((string (read-string &quot;Foo: &quot; nil 'my-history)))\n"
"   (list (region-beginning) (region-end) string)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> the argument values should not "
"include any data types that can&rsquo;t be printed and then read.  Some "
"facilities save <code class=\"code\">command-history</code> in a file to be "
"read in the subsequent sessions; if a command&rsquo;s arguments contain a "
"data type that prints using &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#&lt;&hellip;&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo; syntax, those facilities won&rsquo;t work."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> 引数の値に、出力後に読み込むことがで"
"きないデータ型を含めてはいけません。一部の機能では、後続のセッションで読み込"
"むために <code class=\"code\">command-history</code> をファイルに保存します"
"が、コマンドの引数に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#&lt;&hellip;&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo; 構文で出力されるデータ型が含まれている場合、それらの機能は動作し"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Interactive.html
msgid ""
"There are, however, a few exceptions: it is ok to use a limited set of "
"expressions such as <code class=\"code\">(point)</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">(mark)</code>, <code class=\"code\">(region-beginning)</"
"code>, and <code class=\"code\">(region-end)</code>, because Emacs "
"recognizes them specially and puts the expression (rather than its value) "
"into the command history.  To see whether the expression you wrote is one of "
"these exceptions, run the command, then examine <code class=\"code\">(car "
"command-history)</code>."
msgstr ""
"ただし、いくつか例外があります。<code class=\"code\">(point)</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">(mark)</code>、<code class=\"code\">(region-beginning)</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">(region-end)</code>といった限定的な表現セットは使"
"用可能です。これは、Emacsがこれらを特別に認識し、（値ではなく）表現そのものを"
"コマンド履歴に記録するためです。記述した表現がこれらの例外に該当するかどうか"
"を確認するには、コマンドを実行し、<code class=\"code\">(car command-"
"history)</code>を確認してください。"

