# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"This section describes how to create and configure a tree-sitter parser.  In "
"Emacs, each tree-sitter parser is associated with a buffer.  As the user "
"edits the buffer, the associated parser and syntax tree are automatically "
"kept up-to-date."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Tree-sitterパーサーの作成と設定方法について説明します。Emacsでは、"
"各Tree-sitterパーサーがバッファに関連付けられています。ユーザーがバッファを編"
"集すると、関連付けられたパーサーと構文木が自動的に最新の状態に保たれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-max-buffer-size</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002dmax_002dbuffer_002dsize\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-max-buffer-size</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-treesit_002dmax_002dbuffer_002dsize\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"This variable contains the maximum size of buffers in which tree-sitter can "
"be activated.  Major modes should check this value when deciding whether to "
"enable tree-sitter features."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、Tree-sitterを有効にできるバッファの最大サイズが格納されていま"
"す。メジャーモードは、Tree-sitterの機能を有効にするかどうかを判断する際に、こ"
"の値を確認する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-languages-require-line-column-tracking</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"treesit_002dlanguages_002drequire_002dline_002dcolumn_002dtracking\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">treesit-languages-require-line-column-tracking</strong><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"treesit_002dlanguages_002drequire_002dline_002dcolumn_002dtracking\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"Emacs by default doesn&rsquo;t keep track of line and column numbers for "
"positions in a buffer.  However, some language grammars utilize the line and "
"column information for parsing.  If parsers of these languages are created "
"in a buffer, Emacs will turn on line and column tracking and report these "
"information to these parsers.  Once the buffer starts tracking line and "
"column, it never stops doing so.  And once a parser is created as tracking/"
"not-tracking line and column, it stays that way regardless of changes to "
"this variable."
msgstr ""
"Emacsはデフォルトでは、バッファ内の位置に対する行番号や列番号を追跡しません。"
"しかし、一部の言語の文法では、構文解析に行番号や列番号の情報を利用します。こ"
"れらの言語のパーサーをバッファ内で作成した場合、Emacsは行番号と列番号の追跡を"
"有効にし、これらの情報をパーサーに報告します。一度バッファが行番号と列番号の"
"追跡を開始すると、それ以降は追跡を停止しません。また、パーサーが行番号・列番"
"号を追跡する／しない設定で作成されると、この変数の変更に関わらず、その設定が"
"維持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a list of languages that require line and column tracking.  "
"The vast majority of languages don&rsquo;t need line and column "
"information.  So far, only Haskell is known to need it."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、行・列番号の追跡を必要とする言語のリストです。大多数の言語では、"
"行・列番号の情報は必要ありません。これまでのところ、それを必要とすることが分"
"かっているのはHaskellのみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dtracking_002dline_002dcolumn_002dp\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dparser_002dtracking_002dline_002dcolumn_002dp\"></a>"
