# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"Given a parser, we can query information about it: <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-parser-buffer</code> returns the buffer associated "
"with a parser, and <code class=\"code\">treesit-parser-language</code> "
"returns the language used by the parser.  A parser&rsquo;s tag can be "
"retrieved by <code class=\"code\">treesit-parser-tag</code>.  Each parser "
"also optionally carries an embed level that can be set by <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-parser-set-embed-level</code> and retrieved by <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-parser-embed-level</code> (see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Multiple-Languages.html#parser_002dembed_002dlevel\">parser-embed-"
"level</a>, for more about embed level).  Finally, <code "
