#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
"When a parser does parse, it checks for the size of the buffer.  Tree-sitter "
"can only handle buffers no larger than about 4GB.  If the size exceeds that, "
"Emacs signals the <code class=\"code\">treesit-buffer-too-large</code> error "
"with signal data being the buffer size."
msgstr ""
"パーサーが解析を行う際は、バッファのサイズを確認します。Tree-sitterで扱える"
"バッファは、約4GBまでです。サイズがこれを超える場合、Emacsはバッファサイズを"
"シグナルデータとして<code class=\"code\">treesit-buffer-too-large</code>エ"
"ラーを発生させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Using-Parser.html
msgid ""
