#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Usual-Display.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable controls how control characters are displayed.  "
"If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, they are displayed as a caret "
"followed by the character: &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^A</samp>&rsquo;.  If "
"it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, they are displayed as octal escapes: "
"a backslash followed by three octal digits, as in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\001</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"このバッファローカル変数は、制御文字の表示方法を制御します。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、キャレットに続いて文字が表示されます："
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^A</samp>&rsquo;。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、8進エスケープとして表示されます：&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\001</samp>&rsquo; のように、バックスラッシュに続いて3桁の8進"
"数が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
