# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes a problem with a function is due to a wrong setting of a "
"variable.  Setting up the debugger to trigger whenever the variable is "
"changed is a quick way to find the origin of the setting."
msgstr ""
"関数の不具合が、変数の設定ミスに起因することがあります。変数が変更されるたび"
"にデバッガが作動するように設定しておけば、設定の原因を迅速に特定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debug-on-variable-change</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">variable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"debug_002don_002dvariable_002dchange\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">debug-on-variable-change</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">variable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"debug_002don_002dvariable_002dchange\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"This function arranges for the debugger to be called whenever <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> is modified."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> が変更されるたびにデバッガが呼"
"び出されるようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"It is implemented using the watchpoint mechanism, so it inherits the same "
"characteristics and limitations: all aliases of <var class=\"var\">variable</"
"var> will be watched together, only dynamic variables can be watched, and "
"changes to the objects referenced by variables are not detected.  For "
"details, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Watching-Variables.html\">Running a "
"function when a variable is changed.</a>."
msgstr ""
"ウォッチポイント機構を用いて実装されているため、同様の特性と制限があります。"
"すなわち、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> のすべてのエイリアスがまとめて監"
"視され、動的変数のみが監視可能であり、変数が参照するオブジェクトへの変更は検"
"出されません。詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Watching-"
"Variables.html\">変数が変更されたときに関数を実行する</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">cancel-debug-on-variable-change</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional variable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-cancel_002ddebug_002don_002dvariable_002dchange\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">cancel-debug-on-variable-change</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional variable</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-cancel_002ddebug_002don_002dvariable_002dchange\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"This function undoes the effect of <code class=\"code\">debug-on-variable-"
"change</code> on <var class=\"var\">variable</var>.  When called "
"interactively, it prompts for <var class=\"var\">variable</var> in the "
"minibuffer.  If <var class=\"var\">variable</var> is omitted or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it cancels break-on-change for all variables.  "
"Calling <code class=\"code\">cancel-debug-on-variable-change</code> does "
"nothing to a variable which is not currently set up to break on change."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">variable</var> に対する <code "
"class=\"code\">debug-on-variable-change</code> の効果を解除します。対話的に呼"
"び出された場合は、ミニバッファに <var class=\"var\">variable</var> の入力を求"
"めます。<var class=\"var\">variable</var> が省略された場合、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、すべての変数に対する break-on-"
"change を解除します。<code class=\"code\">cancel-debug-on-variable-change</"
"code> を呼び出しても、現在 break-on-change が設定されていない変数に対しては何"
"も行われません。"

