# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"When setting variables according to saved customizations, make sure to set "
"the variables <var class=\"var\">variables</var> before this one; i.e., "
"delay setting this variable until after those others have been handled.  Use "
"<code class=\"code\">:set-after</code> if setting this variable won&rsquo;t "
"work properly unless those other variables already have their intended "
"values."
msgstr ""
"保存済みのカスタマイズに従って変数を設定する際は、この変数よりも前に<var "
"class=\"var\">variables</var>を設定するようにしてください。つまり、他の変数の"
"処理が終わるまで、この変数の設定を遅らせてください。他の変数がすでに意図した"
"値になっていない限り、この変数の設定が正常に動作しない場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">:set-after</code>を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"It is useful to specify the <code class=\"code\">:require</code> keyword for "
"an option that turns on a certain feature.  This causes Emacs to load the "
"feature, if it is not already loaded, whenever the option is set.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Common-Keywords.html\">Common Item Keywords</a>.  Here "
"is an example:"
msgstr ""
"特定の機能を有効にするオプションに <code class=\"code\">:require</code> キー"
"ワードを指定すると便利です。これにより、オプションが設定されるたびに、その機"
"能がまだロードされていない場合に Emacs がロードを行います。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Common-Keywords.html\">共通項目キーワード</a>を参照してください。以下"
"に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Definitions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defcustom frobnicate-automatically nil\n"
"  &quot;Non-nil means automatically frobnicate all buffers.&quot;\n"
"  :type 'boolean\n"
"  :require 'frobnicate-mode\n"
"  :group 'frobnicate)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Definitions.html
msgid ""
"If a customization item has a type such as <code class=\"code\">hook</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">alist</code>, which supports <code "
"class=\"code\">:options</code>, you can add additional values to the list "
"from outside the <code class=\"code\">defcustom</code> declaration by "
"calling <code class=\"code\">custom-add-frequent-value</code>.  For example, "
"if you define a function <code class=\"code\">my-lisp-mode-initialization</"
"code> intended to be called from <code class=\"code\">emacs-lisp-mode-hook</"
"code>, you might want to add that to the list of reasonable values for <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs-lisp-mode-hook</code>, but not by editing its "
"definition.  You can do it thus:"
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズ項目に、<code class=\"code\">:options</code>をサポートする<code "
"class=\"code\">hook</code>や<code class=\"code\">alist</code>といった型がある"
"場合、<code class=\"code\">custom-add-frequent-value</code>を呼び出すことで、"
"<code class=\"code\">defcustom</code>宣言の外部からリストに値を追加できます。"
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">emacs-lisp-mode-hook</code>から呼び出すことを想"
"定した関数<code class=\"code\">my-lisp-mode-initialization</code>を定義した場"
"合、それを<code class=\"code\">emacs-lisp-mode-hook</code>の妥当な値のリスト"
"に追加したいが、定義を編集して行いたくないといったケースが考えられます。その"
"場合は次のように行えます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Variable-Definitions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(custom-add-frequent-value 'emacs-lisp-mode-hook\n"
"   'my-lisp-mode-initialization)\n"
msgstr ""

