# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variables-with-Restricted-Values.html
msgid ""
"Ordinary Lisp variables can be assigned any value that is a valid Lisp "
"object.  However, certain Lisp variables are not defined in Lisp, but in C.  "
"Most of these variables are defined in the C code using <code "
"class=\"code\">DEFVAR_LISP</code>.  Like variables defined in Lisp, these "
"can take on any value.  However, some variables are defined using <code "
"class=\"code\">DEFVAR_INT</code> or <code class=\"code\">DEFVAR_BOOL</"
"code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html#Defining-"
"Lisp-variables-in-C\">Writing Emacs Primitives</a>, in particular the "
"description of functions of the type <code class=\"code\">syms_of_<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var></code>, for a brief discussion of the C "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"通常のLisp変数には、有効なLispオブジェクトであればどのような値でも代入できま"
"す。ただし、一部のLisp変数はLispではなくCで定義されています。これらの変数の多"
"くは、Cコード内で<code class=\"code\">DEFVAR_LISP</code>を用いて定義されてい"
"ます。Lispで定義された変数と同様に、これらも任意の値を取ることができます。し"
"かし、一部の変数は<code class=\"code\">DEFVAR_INT</code>または<code "
"class=\"code\">DEFVAR_BOOL</code>を用いて定義されています。Cによる実装に関す"
"る簡潔な解説については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Writing-Emacs-"
"Primitives.html#Defining-Lisp-variables-in-C\">Writing Emacs Primitives</a>、"
"特に<code class=\"code\">syms_of_<var class=\"var\">filename</var></code>型の"
"関数に関する記述を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variables-with-Restricted-Values.html
msgid ""
"Variables of type <code class=\"code\">DEFVAR_BOOL</code> can only take on "
"the values <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>.  Attempting to assign them any other value will set them to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">DEFVAR_BOOL</code>型の変数は、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>または<code class=\"code\">t</code>のいずれかの値しか取り得ません。それ"
"以外の値を代入しようとすると、<code class=\"code\">t</code>に設定されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Variables-with-Restricted-Values.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((display-hourglass 5))\n"
"  display-hourglass)\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

