# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Variables.html
msgid ""
"To be precise, under the default <em class=\"dfn\">dynamic scoping</em> "
"rule, the value cell always holds the variable&rsquo;s current value, but "
"this is not the case under the <em class=\"dfn\">lexical scoping</em> rule.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">Scoping Rules for "
"Variable Bindings</a>, for details."
msgstr ""
