# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid "Here are some functions that relate to vectors:"
msgstr "ベクトルに関連する関数をいくつか紹介します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">vectorp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-vectorp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">vectorp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">object</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-vectorp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">object</var> is a vector."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">object</var> がベクトルである場合に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(vectorp [a])\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
"(vectorp &quot;asdf&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">vector</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest objects</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-vector\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">vector</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest objects</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-vector\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function creates and returns a vector whose elements are the arguments, "
"<var class=\"var\">objects</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、引数を要素とするベクトル <var class=\"var\">objects</var> を生成"
"して返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(vector 'foo 23 [bar baz] &quot;rats&quot;)\n"
"     &rArr; [foo 23 [bar baz] &quot;rats&quot;]\n"
"(vector)\n"
"     &rArr; []\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-vector</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">length object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dvector\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-vector</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">length object</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-make_002dvector\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new vector consisting of <var class=\"var\">length</"
"var> elements, each initialized to <var class=\"var\">object</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、各要素が <var class=\"var\">object</var> で初期化された <var "
"class=\"var\">length</var> 個の要素からなる新しいベクトルを返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq sleepy (make-vector 9 'Z))\n"
"     &rArr; [Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z Z]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">vconcat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"sequences</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-vconcat\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">vconcat</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;rest "
"sequences</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-vconcat\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-vectors\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-vectors\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new vector containing all the elements of <var "
"class=\"var\">sequences</var>.  The arguments <var class=\"var\">sequences</"
"var> may be proper lists, vectors, strings or bool-vectors.  If no <var "
"class=\"var\">sequences</var> are given, the empty vector is returned."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">sequences</var> のすべての要素を含む新しいベク"
"トルを返します。引数 <var class=\"var\">sequences</var> には、適切なリスト、"
"ベクトル、文字列、または bool-vector を指定できます。<var "
"class=\"var\">sequences</var> が指定されない場合は、空のベクトルが返されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The value is either the empty vector, or is a newly constructed nonempty "
"vector that is not <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to any existing vector."
msgstr ""
"値は、空ベクトルであるか、あるいは既存のどのベクトルとも <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> とならない、新たに構築された非空ベクトルのいずれかで"
"ある。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq a (vconcat '(A B C) '(D E F)))\n"
"     &rArr; [A B C D E F]\n"
"(eq a (vconcat a))\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(vconcat)\n"
"     &rArr; []\n"
"(vconcat [A B C] &quot;aa&quot; '(foo (6 7)))\n"
"     &rArr; [A B C 97 97 foo (6 7)]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">vconcat</code> function also allows byte-code "
"function objects as arguments.  This is a special feature to make it easy to "
"access the entire contents of a byte-code function object.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Closure-Objects.html\">Closure Function Objects</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">vconcat</code> 関数は、バイトコード関数オブジェクトを引"
"数として受け取ることもできます。これは、バイトコード関数オブジェクトの全内容"
"に容易にアクセスできるようにするための特別な機能です。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Closure-Objects.html\">クロージャ関数オブジェクト</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"For other concatenation functions, see <code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code> "
"in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Mapping-Functions.html\">Mapping Functions</a>, "
"<code class=\"code\">concat</code> in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Creating-"
"Strings.html\">Creating Strings</a>, and <code class=\"code\">append</code> "
"in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Building-Lists.html\">Building Cons Cells and "
"Lists</a>."
msgstr ""
"その他の連結関数については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Mapping-Functions.html\">"
"マッピング関数</a>の<code class=\"code\">mapconcat</code>、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Creating-Strings.html\">文字列の作成</a>の<code "
"class=\"code\">concat</code>、および<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Building-"
"Lists.html\">Consセルとリストの構築</a>の<code class=\"code\">append</code>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">append</code> function also provides a way to "
"convert a vector into a list with the same elements:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append</code> 関数は、ベクトルを同じ要素を持つリストに変"
"換する手段も提供しています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Vector-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq avector [1 two (quote (three)) &quot;four&quot; [five]])\n"
