# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Version-Info.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a string describing the version of Emacs that is "
"running.  It is useful to include this string in bug reports."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、実行中のEmacsのバージョンを示す文字列を返します。バグレポートにこ"
"の文字列を記載すると便利です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Version-Info.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(emacs-version)\n"
"  &rArr; &quot;GNU Emacs 26.1 (build 1, x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu,\n"
"             GTK+ Version 3.16) of 2017-06-01&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Version-Info.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">here</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"inserts the text in the buffer before point, and returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  When this function is called interactively, it "
"prints the same information in the echo area, but giving a prefix argument "
"makes <var class=\"var\">here</var> non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
