# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Version-Info.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable indicates the time at which Emacs was built.  It "
"uses the style of <code class=\"code\">current-time</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-Day.html\">Time of Day</a>), or is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if the information is not available."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、Emacsがビルドされた時刻を示します。形式は<code "
"class=\"code\">current-time</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Time-of-"
"Day.html\">Time of Day</a>を参照）で、情報が利用できない場合は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Version-Info.html
#, no-wrap
