# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vertical-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"This function sets <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s vertical scroll "
"position to <var class=\"var\">lines</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the selected window is used.  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">lines</var> should be zero or positive; if not, "
"it is taken as zero."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var>の垂直スクロール位置を<var "
"class=\"var\">lines</var>に設定します。<var class=\"var\">window</var>が"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の場合、選択中のウィンドウが使用されます。引数"
"<var class=\"var\">lines</var>は0または正の値である必要があり、そうでない場合"
"は0として扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vertical-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"The actual vertical scroll position must always correspond to an integral "
"number of pixels, so the value you specify is rounded accordingly."
msgstr ""
"実際の垂直スクロール位置は常に整数ピクセルである必要があるため、指定した値は"
"適宜丸められます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vertical-Scrolling.html
msgid "The return value is the result of this rounding."
