"は <var class=\"var\">lines</var> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Vertical-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Normally, the vscroll does not take effect on windows that aren&rsquo;t the "
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-scroll-window</code> or the selected window "
"when the mini-window is resized (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"Windows.html\">Minibuffer Windows</a>).  This &ldquo;frozen&rdquo; behavior "
"is disabled when the <var class=\"var\">preserve-vscroll-p</var> parameter "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means to set the vscroll as "
"usual."
msgstr ""
"通常、ミニウィンドウのサイズ変更時、vscrollは<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-"
"scroll-window</code>または選択中のウィンドウ以外のウィンドウには適用されませ"
"ん（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Windows.html\">ミニバッファウィンド"
"ウ</a>を参照）。この「フリーズ」動作は、<var class=\"var\">preserve-vscroll-"
"p</var>パラメータが<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外である場合に無効とな"
"り、これにより通常通りvscrollが設定されます。"

