# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the visibility status of frame <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>.  The value is <code class=\"code\">t</code> if "
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var> is visible, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"if it is invisible, and <code class=\"code\">icon</code> if it is iconified."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、フレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> の表示状態を返します。"
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が表示されている場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>、非表示の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code>、アイ"
"コン化されている場合は <code class=\"code\">icon</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"Note that the visibility status of a frame as reported by this function (and "
"by the <code class=\"code\">visibility</code> frame parameter, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html\">Frame Interaction "
"Parameters</a>) does not necessarily tell whether the frame is actually seen "
"on display.  Any such frame can be partially or completely obscured by other "
"window manager windows on the same graphical terminal.  Whether that "
"completely hides the frame may then depend on the transparency of the "
"obscuring window.  A frame may also reside on a virtual desktop different "
"from the current one and can be seen only when making that desktop the "
"current one.  One notable restriction holds for child frames (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>): A child frame "
"can be seen if and only if this function returns true for all its ancestors "
"including the frame itself and its root frame."
msgstr ""
"なお、この関数（および <code class=\"code\">visibility</code> フレームパラ"
"メータ、<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Interaction-Parameters.html\">フレー"
"ム相互作用パラメータ</a> を参照）によって報告されるフレームの可視状態は、必ず"
"しもそのフレームが実際にディスプレイ上に表示されていることを意味するわけでは"
"ない点に注意してください。このようなフレームは、同一のグラフィカル端末上の他"
"のウィンドウマネージャウィンドウによって、部分的または完全に遮蔽されることが"
"あります。フレームが完全に隠れるかどうかは、遮蔽しているウィンドウの透明度に"
"依存する場合があります。また、フレームが現在のものとは異なる仮想デスクトップ"
"上に存在し、そのデスクトップを現在のものにした場合にのみ表示されることもあり"
"ます。子フレームに関しては、一つの顕著な制限があります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a> を参照）。子フレームが表示されるの"
"は、この関数が、フレーム自身およびそのルートフレームを含むすべての祖先フレー"
"ムに対して true を返す場合に限られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"On a text terminal only that terminal&rsquo;s top frame and its child frames "
"can be actually seen.  Other root frames and their child frames cannot be "
"seen even if they are considered visible by this function."
msgstr ""
"テキスト端末においては、その端末の最上位フレームとその子フレームのみが実際に"
"表示されます。その他のルートフレームおよびその子フレームは、本関数によって可"
"視と判定されていても表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iconify-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-iconify_002dframe\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">iconify-frame</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-iconify_002dframe\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function iconifies frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var>.  If you omit "
"<var class=\"var\">frame</var>, it iconifies the selected frame.  This "
"function also removes any child frames (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-"
"Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>) of <var class=\"var\">frame</var> and their "
"descendants from display.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is a child "
"frame itself, the behavior depends on the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">iconify-child-frame</code>.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var> is the top frame of a text terminal (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Frames.html\">Frames</a>), this function has no effect."
msgstr ""
"この関数はフレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> をアイコン化します。<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> を省略すると、選択中のフレームがアイコン化されま"
"す。また、この関数は <var class=\"var\">frame</var> の子フレーム（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フレーム</a> を参照）およびその"
"子孫を非表示にします。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> 自体が子フレームである場"
"合、その動作は変数 <code class=\"code\">iconify-child-frame</code> の値によっ"
"て決まります。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> がテキスト端末の最上位フレーム"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frames.html\">フレーム</a> を参照）である場合、こ"
"の関数は効果を持ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-frame-visible</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dframe_002dvisible\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-frame-visible</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dframe_002dvisible\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function makes frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var> visible.  If you "
"omit <var class=\"var\">frame</var>, it makes the selected frame visible.  "
"This does not raise the frame, but you can do that with <code "
"class=\"code\">raise-frame</code> if you wish (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Raising-and-Lowering.html\">Raising, Lowering and Restacking Frames</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数はフレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> を表示します。<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> を省略すると、選択中のフレームが表示されます。これ"
"によりフレームが上昇することはありませんが、必要に応じて <code "
"class=\"code\">raise-frame</code> で上昇させることも可能です（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Raising-and-Lowering.html\">フレームの上昇、下降、およ"
"び再スタック</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"Making a frame visible makes all its child frames with visible ancestors "
"appear on display again (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-"
"Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>)."
msgstr ""
"フレームを可視状態にすると、祖先が可視状態にあるそのすべての子フレームも再び"
"表示されるようになります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">子フ"
"レーム</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-frame-invisible</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dframe_002dinvisible\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">make-frame-invisible</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame force</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dframe_002dinvisible\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function makes frame <var class=\"var\">frame</var> invisible.  If you "
"omit <var class=\"var\">frame</var>, it makes the selected frame invisible.  "
"Usually, this makes all child frames of <var class=\"var\">frame</var> (and "
"their descendants) invisible too (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-"
"Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、フレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> を非表示にします。<var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> を省略すると、選択中のフレームが非表示になります。"
"通常、これにより <var class=\"var\">frame</var> のすべての子フレーム（および"
"その子孫）も非表示になります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">"
"子フレーム</a> を参照）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"Unless <var class=\"var\">force</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, this function refuses to make <var class=\"var\">frame</var> "
"invisible if all other frames are invisible.  On a text terminal this will "
"make <var class=\"var\">frame</var> invisible if and only if it is a child "
"frame (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Child-Frames.html\">Child Frames</a>).  "
"In this case, if <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is selected, it will select "
"the first visible ancestor of <var class=\"var\">frame</var> instead.  In "
"addition, it will remove all child frames with <var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var> as their ancestor from display."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visibility-of-Frames.html
msgid ""
"The visibility status of a frame is also available as a frame parameter.  "
"You can read or change it as such.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Interaction-Parameters.html\">Frame Interaction Parameters</a>.  The user "
"can also iconify and deiconify frames with the window manager.  This happens "
"below the level at which Emacs can exert any control, but Emacs does provide "
"events that you can use to keep track of such changes.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-Events.html\">Miscellaneous System Events</a>."
msgstr ""
"フレームの可視状態は、フレームパラメータとしても利用可能です。これにより、状"
