# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the functions normally used to visit files.  For "
"historical reasons, these functions have names starting with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">find-</samp>&rsquo; rather than &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">visit-</samp>&rsquo;.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffer-"
"File-Name.html\">Buffer File Name</a>, for functions and variables that "
"access the visited file name of a buffer or that find an existing buffer by "
"its visited file name."
msgstr ""
"本節では、通常ファイルを参照する際に使用される関数について説明します。歴史的"
"な経緯により、これらの関数の名前は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">visit-</"
"samp>&rsquo; ではなく &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find-</samp>&rsquo; で始"
"まっています。バッファの参照ファイル名にアクセスする関数や変数、あるいは参照"
"ファイル名から既存のバッファを検索する関数や変数については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffer-File-Name.html\">バッファファイル名</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"In a Lisp program, if you want to look at the contents of a file but not "
"alter it, the fastest way is to use <code class=\"code\">insert-file-"
"contents</code> in a temporary buffer.  Visiting the file is not necessary "
"and takes longer.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Reading-from-"
"Files.html\">Reading from Files</a>."
msgstr ""
"Lispプログラムにおいて、ファイルの内容を参照したいが変更は行わない場合、最も"
"高速な方法は一時バッファで<code class=\"code\">insert-file-contents</code>を"
"使用することです。ファイルへのアクセスは不要であり、かえって時間がかかりま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Reading-from-Files.html\">ファイルからの読み込み"
"</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"&amp;optional wildcards</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">filename "
"&amp;optional wildcards</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This command selects a buffer visiting the file <var class=\"var\">filename</"
"var>, using an existing buffer if there is one, and otherwise creating a new "
"buffer and reading the file into it.  It also returns that buffer."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ファイル <var class=\"var\">filename</var> を参照するバッファ"
"を選択します。既存のバッファがある場合はそれを使用し、ない場合は新しいバッ"
"ファを作成してファイルの内容を読み込みます。また、そのバッファを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Aside from some technical details, the body of the <code class=\"code\">find-"
"file</code> function is basically equivalent to:"
msgstr ""
"いくつかの技術的な詳細を除けば、<code class=\"code\">find-file</code> 関数の"
"本体は基本的に以下と同等です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(switch-to-buffer (find-file-noselect filename nil nil wildcards))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"(See <code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">Switching to a Buffer in a Window</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"（<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">ウィンドウ内のバッファへの"
"切り替え</a>の<code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code>を参照してくださ"
"い。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">wildcards</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, which is always true in an interactive call, then <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> expands wildcard characters in <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> and visits all the matching files."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">wildcards</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外で"
"ある場合（対話型呼び出しでは常にこの条件が成立します）、<code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> は <var class=\"var\">filename</var> 内のワイ"
"ルドカード文字を展開し、一致するすべてのファイルを参照します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">find-file</code> is called interactively, it "
"prompts for <var class=\"var\">filename</var> in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">find-file</code> を対話的に呼び出すと、ミニバッファで "
"<var class=\"var\">filename</var> の入力が求められます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-file-literally</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dfile_002dliterally\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-file-literally</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"find_002dfile_002dliterally\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This command visits <var class=\"var\">filename</var>, like <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> does, but it does not perform any format "
"conversions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Format-Conversion.html\">File "
"Format Conversion</a>), character code conversions (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">Coding Systems</a>), or end-of-line conversions "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-System-Basics.html\">End of line "
"conversion</a>).  The buffer visiting the file is made unibyte, and its "
"major mode is Fundamental mode, regardless of the file name.  File local "
"variable specifications in the file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-"
"Local-Variables.html\">File Local Variables</a>) are ignored, and automatic "
"decompression and adding a newline at the end of the file due to <code "
"class=\"code\">require-final-newline</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Saving-Buffers.html\">require-final-newline</a>) are also disabled."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、<code class=\"code\">find-file</code>と同様に<var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>を訪れますが、書式変換（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Format-Conversion.html\">ファイル書式変換</a>を参照）、文字コード変換"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">符号化方式</a>を参照）、ま"
"たは行末変換（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-System-Basics.html\">行末変換"
"</a>を参照）は行いません。ファイルを訪れるバッファはユニバイトとなり、ファイ"
"ル名に関わらずメジャーモードはFundamentalモードになります。ファイル内のファイ"
"ルローカル変数の指定（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Local-Variables.html\">"
"ファイルローカル変数</a>を参照）は無視され、<code class=\"code\">require-"
"final-newline</code>による自動解凍およびファイル末尾への改行追加（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Saving-Buffers.html\">require-final-newline</a>を参"
"照）も無効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"Note that if Emacs already has a buffer visiting the same file non-"
"literally, it will not visit the same file literally, but instead just "
"switch to the existing buffer.  If you want to be sure of accessing a "
"file&rsquo;s contents literally, you should create a temporary buffer and "
"then read the file contents into it using <code class=\"code\">insert-file-"
"contents-literally</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-from-"
"Files.html\">Reading from Files</a>)."
msgstr ""
"なお、Emacs がすでに同じファイルを非リテラル形式で参照しているバッファを持っ"
"ている場合、同じファイルをリテラル形式で参照するのではなく、単に既存のバッ"
"ファに切り替える点に注意してください。ファイルの内容をリテラル形式で確実に参"
"照したい場合は、一時的なバッファを作成し、<code class=\"code\">insert-file-"
"contents-literally</code> を用いてファイルの内容をそこに読み込む必要がありま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Reading-from-Files.html\">ファイルからの読み込"
"み</a>を参照してください）。"

