# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Visiting-Functions.html
msgid ""
"This buffer-local variable, if set to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value, makes <code class=\"code\">save-buffer</code> behave as if the buffer "
