#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>12.4 When a Variable is Void<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#When-a-"
"Variable-is-Void\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>12.4 変数が void の場合<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#When-a-"
"Variable-is-Void\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void_002dvariable-error\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void-variable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void_002dvariable-error\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-void-variable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"We say that a variable is void if its symbol has an unassigned value cell "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Components.html\">Symbol Components</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"変数のシンボルに未割り当ての値セルがある場合、その変数は void であると言いま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Components.html\">シンボルの構成要素</a>"
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Under Emacs Lisp&rsquo;s default dynamic scoping rule (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">Scoping Rules for Variable "
"Bindings</a>), the value cell stores the variable&rsquo;s current (local or "
"global) value.  Note that an unassigned value cell is <em "
"class=\"emph\">not</em> the same as having <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"in the value cell.  The symbol <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is a Lisp "
"object and can be the value of a variable, just as any other object can be; "
"but it is still a value.  If a variable is void, trying to evaluate the "
"variable signals a <code class=\"code\">void-variable</code> error, instead "
"of returning a value."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispのデフォルトの動的スコープ規則（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Scoping.html\">変数束縛のスコープ規則</a>を参照）では、値セルに変数の現在の"
"（ローカルまたはグローバル）値が格納されます。なお、値が未割り当ての状態であ"
"ることは、値セルに<code class=\"code\">nil</code>が入っていることとは<em "
"class=\"emph\">異なります</em>。シンボル<code class=\"code\">nil</code>はLisp"
"オブジェクトであり、他のあらゆるオブジェクトと同様に変数の値となり得ますが、"
"それでもあくまで値であることに変わりはありません。変数がvoidである場合、その"
"変数を評価しようとすると、値を返す代わりに<code class=\"code\">void-"
"variable</code>エラーが発生します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Under the optional lexical scoping rule, the value cell holds only the "
"variable&rsquo;s global value&mdash;the value outside of any lexical binding "
"construct.  When a variable is lexically bound, the local value is "
"determined by the lexical environment; hence, variables can have local "
"values even if their symbols&rsquo; value cells are unassigned."
msgstr ""
"オプションの字句スコープ規則では、値セルには変数のグローバル値――すなわち、い"
"かなる字句束縛構文の外側にある値――のみが格納される。変数が字句的に束縛されて"
"いる場合、ローカル値は字句環境によって決定される。したがって、変数のシンボル"
"の値セルが未代入であっても、その変数はローカル値を持ち得る。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">makunbound</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-makunbound\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">makunbound</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-makunbound\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function empties out the value cell of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>, "
"making the variable void.  It returns <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は値セルを<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>で空にし、変数をvoidにしま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"When applied to a variable alias (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Aliases.html\">Variable Aliases</a>), it first disconnects the variable from "
"its alias, thereby undoing the effect of <code class=\"code\">defvaralias</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"変数エイリアス（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Aliases.html\">変数エイリ"
"アス</a>を参照）に適用すると、まず変数をそのエイリアスから切り離し、それに"
"よって <code class=\"code\">defvaralias</code> の効果を打ち消します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> has a dynamic local binding, <code "
"class=\"code\">makunbound</code> voids the current binding, and this "
"voidness lasts only as long as the local binding is in effect.  Afterwards, "
"the previously shadowed local or global binding is reexposed; then the "
"variable will no longer be void, unless the reexposed binding is void too."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が動的なローカルバインディングを持つ場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">makunbound</code> は現在のバインディングを無効にし、この"
"無効状態はローカルバインディングが有効である間のみ持続します。その後、以前に"
"シャドウされていたローカルまたはグローバルバインディングが再び参照されるよう"
"になり、その参照されたバインディング自体も無効でない限り、変数はもはや無効で"
"はなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid "Here are some examples (assuming dynamic binding is in effect):"
msgstr "以下に例を挙げます（動的バインディングが有効な場合を想定しています）。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq x 1)               ; <span class=\"r\">Put a value in the global binding.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
"(let ((x 2))             ; <span class=\"r\">Locally bind it.</span>\n"
"  (makunbound 'x)        ; <span class=\"r\">Void the local binding.</span>\n"
"  x)\n"
"error&rarr; Symbol's value as variable is void: x\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"x                        ; <span class=\"r\">The global binding is unchanged.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 1\n"
"\n"
"(let ((x 2))             ; <span class=\"r\">Locally bind it.</span>\n"
"  (let ((x 3))           ; <span class=\"r\">And again.</span>\n"
"    (makunbound 'x)      ; <span class=\"r\">Void the innermost-local binding.</span>\n"
"    x))                  ; <span class=\"r\">And refer: it&rsquo;s void.</span>\n"
"error&rarr; Symbol's value as variable is void: x\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((x 2))\n"
"  (let ((x 3))\n"
"    (makunbound 'x))     ; <span class=\"r\">Void inner binding, then remove it.</span>\n"
"  x)                     ; <span class=\"r\">Now outer <code class=\"code\">let</code> binding is visible.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; 2\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">boundp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variable</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-boundp\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">boundp</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">variable</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-boundp\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var> (a symbol) is not void, and <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if it is void."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">variable</var>（シンボル）が void でない場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">t</code> を、void の場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(boundp 'abracadabra)          ; <span class=\"r\">Starts out void.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((abracadabra 5))         ; <span class=\"r\">Locally bind it.</span>\n"
"  (boundp 'abracadabra))\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(boundp 'abracadabra)          ; <span class=\"r\">Still globally void.</span>\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Void-Variables.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq abracadabra 5)           ; <span class=\"r\">Make it globally nonvoid.</span>\n"
