#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.10 Waiting for Elapsed Time or Input<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Waiting-for-Elapsed-Time-or-Input\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.10 経過時間または入力の待機<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Waiting-for-Elapsed-Time-or-Input\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-waiting\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-waiting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"The wait functions are designed to wait for a certain amount of time to pass "
"or until there is input.  For example, you may wish to pause in the middle "
"of a computation to allow the user time to view the display.  <code "
"class=\"code\">sit-for</code> pauses and updates the screen, and returns "
"immediately if input comes in, while <code class=\"code\">sleep-for</code> "
"pauses without updating the screen."
msgstr ""
"wait関数は、一定時間が経過するか、または入力があるまで待機するように設計され"
"ています。例えば、ユーザーがディスプレイを確認する時間を確保するため、計算の"
"途中で一時停止させたい場合があります。<code class=\"code\">sit-for</code>は一"
"時停止して画面を更新し、入力があれば直ちに復帰しますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">sleep-for</code>は画面を更新せずに一時停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sit-for</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">seconds "
"&amp;optional nodisp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sit_002dfor\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sit-for</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">seconds "
"&amp;optional nodisp</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"sit_002dfor\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"This function performs redisplay (provided there is no pending input from "
"the user), then waits <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> seconds, or until "
"input is available.  The usual purpose of <code class=\"code\">sit-for</"
"code> is to give the user time to read text that you display.  The value is "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> if <code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> waited "
"the full time with no input arriving (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Event-"
"Input-Misc.html\">Miscellaneous Event Input Features</a>).  Otherwise, the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は再表示を行い（ユーザーからの入力待ちがない場合）、その後 <var "
"class=\"var\">seconds</var> 秒間、または入力が可能になるまで待機します。"
"<code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> の一般的な目的は、表示したテキストをユー"
"ザーが読むための時間を確保することです。<code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> "
"が入力のない状態で全待機時間経過した場合、値は <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"となります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Event-Input-Misc.html\">その他のイベン"
"ト入力機能</a> を参照）。それ以外の場合、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> need not be an integer.  If it "
"is floating point, <code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> waits for a "
"fractional number of seconds.  Some systems support only a whole number of "
"seconds; on these systems, <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> is rounded down."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> は整数である必要はありません。浮動小数"
"点数の場合、<code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> は小数点以下の秒数を待機しま"
"す。一部のシステムでは整数秒のみをサポートしており、こうしたシステムでは "
"<var class=\"var\">seconds</var> は切り捨てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"The expression <code class=\"code\">(sit-for 0)</code> is equivalent to "
"<code class=\"code\">(redisplay)</code>, i.e., it requests a redisplay, "
"without any delay, if there is no pending input.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Forcing-Redisplay.html\">Forcing Redisplay</a>."
msgstr ""
"式 <code class=\"code\">(sit-for 0)</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">(redisplay)</code> と同等です。つまり、保留中の入力がない場"
"合、遅延なく再表示を要求します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Forcing-"
"Redisplay.html\">再表示の強制</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">nodisp</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"then <code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> does not redisplay, but it still "
"returns as soon as input is available (or when the timeout elapses)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">nodisp</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> は再表示されませんが、入力が利用可能"
"になるとすぐに（またはタイムアウトが経過すると）戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"In batch mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">Batch Mode</"
"a>), <code class=\"code\">sit-for</code> cannot be interrupted, even by "
"input from the standard input descriptor.  It is thus equivalent to <code "
"class=\"code\">sleep-for</code>, which is described below."
msgstr ""
"バッチモード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Batch-Mode.html\">バッチモード</a>を"
"参照）では、標準入力ディスクリプタからの入力であっても、<code "
"class=\"code\">sit-for</code>を中断することはできません。したがって、これは後"
"述する<code class=\"code\">sleep-for</code>と同等となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">sleep-for</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">seconds</var><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-sleep_002dfor\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
