"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-sleep_002dfor\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"This function simply pauses for <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> seconds "
"without updating the display.  It pays no attention to available input.  It "
"returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ディスプレイを更新せずに単に<var class=\"var\">seconds</var>秒間"
"一時停止します。利用可能な入力は無視します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"The argument <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> need not be an integer.  If it "
"is floating point, <code class=\"code\">sleep-for</code> waits for a "
"fractional number of seconds."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> は整数である必要はありません。浮動小数"
"点数の場合、<code class=\"code\">sleep-for</code> は小数点以下の秒数を待機し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Waiting.html
msgid ""
"It is also possible to call <code class=\"code\">sleep-for</code> with two "
"arguments, as <code class=\"code\">(sleep-for <var class=\"var\">seconds</"
