#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warning-options\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warning-options\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"These variables are used by users to control what happens when a Lisp "
"program reports a warning."
msgstr ""
"これらの変数は、Lispプログラムが警告を出力した際にどのような動作を行うかを"
"ユーザーが制御するために使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-display-at-bottom</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002ddisplay_002dat_002dbottom\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">warning-display-at-bottom</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-warning_002ddisplay_002dat_002dbottom\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"This user option controls the window in which the warnings buffer is shown.  "
"By default, the value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, and Emacs displays "
"the warnings buffer in a window at the bottom of the selected frame, "
"creating a new window there if needed.  If customized to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the warnings buffer will be shown using the "
"default rules of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a>); in that case the <code class=\"code\">warning</"
"code> category can be used in <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</"
"code> to customize how <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> will "
"display these buffers (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Alists.html\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このユーザーオプションは、警告バッファを表示するウィンドウを制御します。デ"
"フォルトでは値は <code class=\"code\">t</code> となっており、Emacs は選択中の"
"フレームの下部にあるウィンドウに警告バッファを表示し、必要に応じてそこに新し"
"いウィンドウを作成します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> にカスタマイズした"
"場合、警告バッファは <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> のデフォルト"
"ルール（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Choosing-Window.html\">バッファ表示用ウィン"
"ドウの選択</a> を参照）に従って表示されます。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> で <code class=\"code\">warning</"
"code> カテゴリを使用して、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> がこれら"
"のバッファをどのように表示するかをカスタマイズできます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html\">バッファ表示用のアクションアリスタ"
"</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-minimum-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dminimum_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">warning-minimum-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dminimum_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"This user option specifies the minimum severity level that should be shown "
"immediately to the user, by popping the warnings buffer in some window.  The "
"default is <code class=\"code\">:warning</code>, which means to show the "
"warning buffer for any warning severity except <code class=\"code\">:debug</"
"code>.  The warnings of lower severity levels will still be written into the "
"warnings buffer, but the buffer will not be forced onto display."
msgstr ""
"このユーザーオプションは、何らかのウィンドウに警告バッファをポップアップ表示"
"することで、ユーザーに即座に提示すべき最小の深刻度レベルを指定します。デフォ"
"ルトは <code class=\"code\">:warning</code> であり、これは <code "
"class=\"code\">:debug</code> 以外のすべての警告深刻度に対して警告バッファを表"
"示することを意味します。より低い深刻度レベルの警告も引き続き警告バッファに書"
"き込まれますが、バッファが強制的に表示されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-minimum-log-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dminimum_002dlog_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">warning-minimum-log-level</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-warning_002dminimum_002dlog_002dlevel\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"This user option specifies the minimum severity level that should be logged "
"in the warnings buffer.  Warnings of lower severity will be completely "
"ignored: not written to the warnings buffer and not displayed.  The default "
"is <code class=\"code\">:warning</code>, which means to log warnings of any "
"severity except <code class=\"code\">:debug</code>."
msgstr ""
"このユーザーオプションは、警告バッファに記録すべき最小の深刻度レベルを指定し"
"ます。これより深刻度の低い警告は完全に無視され、警告バッファに書き込まれるこ"
"とも、表示されることもありません。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">:warning</code> で、これは <code class=\"code\">:debug</code> "
"以外のあらゆる深刻度の警告を記録することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-suppress-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dsuppress_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">warning-suppress-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dsuppress_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"This list specifies which warning types should not be displayed immediately "
"when they occur.  Each element of the list should be a list of symbols.  If "
"an element of this list has the same elements as the first elements in a "
"warning type, then the warning of that type will not be shown on display by "
"popping the warnings buffer in some window (the warning will still be logged "
"in the warnings buffer)."
msgstr ""
"このリストでは、どの警告タイプが発生した際に即座に表示すべきでないかを指定し"
"ます。リストの各要素はシンボルのリストである必要があります。このリストの要素"
"が、ある警告タイプの先頭要素と同じ要素を持つ場合、そのタイプの警告はいずれか"
"のウィンドウの警告バッファをポップしてディスプレイに表示されることはありませ"
"ん（ただし、警告は引き続き警告バッファに記録されます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid "For example, if the value of this variable is a list like this:"
msgstr "例えば、この変数の値が次のようなリストである場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "((foo) (bar subtype))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"then warnings whose types are <code class=\"code\">foo</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">(foo)</code> or <code class=\"code\">(foo&nbsp;something)</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">(bar&nbsp;subtype&nbsp;other)</code> will not "
"be shown to the user."
msgstr ""
"その場合、型が <code class=\"code\">foo</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">(foo)</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">(foo&nbsp;something)</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">(bar&nbsp;subtype&nbsp;other)</code> である警告は、ユーザーに"
"表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-suppress-log-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dsuppress_002dlog_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">warning-suppress-log-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-warning_002dsuppress_002dlog_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"This list specifies which warning types should be ignored: not logged in the "
"warnings buffer and not shown to the user.  The structure and the matching "
"of warning types are the same as for <code class=\"code\">warning-suppress-"
"types</code> above."
msgstr ""
"このリストでは、どの警告タイプを無視すべきか（警告バッファに記録せず、ユー"
"ザーにも表示しない）を指定します。警告タイプの構造と照合方法は、前述の <code "
"class=\"code\">warning-suppress-types</code> と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warnings_002c-suppressing-during-"
"startup\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prevent-warnings-in-"
"init-files\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warnings_002c-suppressing-during-"
"startup\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prevent-warnings-in-"
"init-files\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Options.html
msgid ""
"During startup, Emacs delays showing any warnings until after it loads and "
"processes the site-wide and user&rsquo;s init files (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">Summary: Sequence of Actions at Startup</a>).  "
"Let-binding (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">Local "
"Variables</a>) the values of these options around some code in your init "
"files which might emit a warning will therefore not work, because it will "
"not be in effect by the time the warning is actually processed.  Thus, if "
"you want to suppress some warnings during startup, change the values of the "
"above options in your init file early enough, or put those let-binding forms "
"in your <code class=\"code\">after-init-hook</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs-startup-hook</code> functions.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Init-File.html\">The Init File</a>."
msgstr ""
"起動時、Emacsはサイト全体およびユーザーのinitファイルを読み込んで処理するま"
"で、警告の表示を保留します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Startup-Summary.html\">"
"概要：起動時の動作シーケンス</a>を参照）。そのため、警告を発生させる可能性の"
"あるinitファイル内のコード周辺で、これらのオプションの値をlet-binding（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Local-Variables.html\">ローカル変数</a>を参照）で定義"
"しても、実際に警告が処理される時点ではその設定が有効になっていないため、機能"
"しません。したがって、起動時に一部の警告を抑制したい場合は、initファイル内で"
"上記のオプションの値を十分に早い段階で変更するか、それらのlet-binding形式を"
"<code class=\"code\">after-init-hook</code>または<code class=\"code\">emacs-"
"startup-hook</code>関数内に記述してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">initファイル</a>を参照してください。"

