# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.5.2 Warning Variables<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Warning-"
"Variables-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.5.2 警告変数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Warning-"
"Variables-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warning-variables\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warning-variables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Programs can customize how their warnings appear by binding the variables "
"described in this section."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは、本節で説明する変数をバインドすることで、警告の表示方法をカスタ"
"マイズできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-levels</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"warning_002dlevels\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-levels</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"warning_002dlevels\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This list defines the meaning and severity order of the warning severity "
"levels.  Each element defines one severity level, and they are arranged in "
"order of decreasing severity."
msgstr ""
"このリストでは、警告の深刻度レベルの意味と深刻度の順序を定義しています。各要"
"素は1つの深刻度レベルを定義しており、深刻度の降順で並べられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Each element has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">level</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">string</var>&nbsp;[<var class=\"var\">function</"
"var>])</code>, where <var class=\"var\">level</var> is the severity level it "
"defines.  <var class=\"var\">string</var> specifies the textual description "
"of this level.  <var class=\"var\">string</var> should use &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; to specify where to put the warning type "
"information, or it can omit the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; "
"so as not to include that information."
msgstr ""
"各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">level</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>&nbsp;[<var class=\"var\">function</var>])</code> "
"という形式をとり、ここで <var class=\"var\">level</var> はその要素が定義する"
"深刻度レベルです。<var class=\"var\">string</var> はこのレベルのテキストによ"
"る説明を指定します。<var class=\"var\">string</var> では、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; を用いて警告タイプ情報の記載場所を指定する"
"か、あるいは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; を省略してその情報"
"を含まないようにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The optional <var class=\"var\">function</var>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, is a function to call with no arguments, to get "
"the user&rsquo;s attention.  A notable example is <code class=\"code\">ding</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Beeping.html\">Beeping</a>)."
msgstr ""
"オプションの <var class=\"var\">function</var> は、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、ユーザーの注意を引くために引数なしで呼び出す関数となりま"
"す。代表的な例として <code class=\"code\">ding</code> が挙げられます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Beeping.html\">Beeping</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid "Normally you should not change the value of this variable."
msgstr "通常、この変数の値は変更すべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-prefix-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dprefix_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-prefix-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-warning_002dprefix_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value is a function to generate "
"prefix text for warnings.  Programs can bind the variable to a suitable "
"function.  <code class=\"code\">display-warning</code> calls this function "
"with the warnings buffer the current buffer, and the function can insert "
"text into it.  That text becomes the beginning of the warning message."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その値は警告用のプレフィックステ"
"キストを生成する関数となります。プログラムはこの変数に適切な関数をバインドで"
"きます。<code class=\"code\">display-warning</code> は、警告バッファを現在の"
"バッファとしてこの関数を呼び出し、関数はそこにテキストを挿入できます。そのテ"
"キストが警告メッセージの冒頭となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The function is called with two arguments, the severity level and its entry "
"in <code class=\"code\">warning-levels</code>.  It should return a list to "
"use <em class=\"emph\">instead</em> of that entry (the value need not be an "
"actual member of <code class=\"code\">warning-levels</code>, but it must "
"have the same structure).  By constructing this value, the function can "
"change the severity of the warning, or specify different handling for a "
"given severity level."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、深刻度レベルと<code class=\"code\">warning-levels</code>における"
"そのエントリという2つの引数で呼び出されます。この関数は、当該エントリ<em "
"class=\"emph\">の代わりに</em>使用するリストを返す必要があります（値は必ずし"
"も<code class=\"code\">warning-levels</code>の実際のメンバである必要はありま"
"せんが、同じ構造である必要があります）。この値を構築することで、関数は警告の"
"深刻度を変更したり、特定の深刻度レベルに対して異なる処理を指定したりすること"
"ができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If the variable&rsquo;s value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"there&rsquo;s no prefix text, before the warning is displayed, starting with "
"the <var class=\"var\">string</var> part of the entry in <code "
"class=\"code\">warning-levels</code> corresponding to the warning&rsquo;s "
"level."
msgstr ""
"変数の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、警告が表示される前にプレ"
"フィックステキストは存在せず、警告レベルに対応する <code "
"class=\"code\">warning-levels</code> 内のエントリの <var "
"class=\"var\">string</var> 部分から始まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-series</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"warning_002dseries\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">warning-series</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"warning_002dseries\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Programs can bind this variable to <code class=\"code\">t</code> to say that "
"the next warning should begin a series.  When several warnings form a "
"series, that means to leave point on the first warning of the series, rather "
"than keep moving it for each warning so that it appears on the last one.  "
"The series ends when the local binding of this variable is unbound and <code "
"class=\"code\">warning-series</code> becomes <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"again."
msgstr ""
"プログラムはこの変数を <code class=\"code\">t</code> にバインドすることで、次"
"の警告を一連の警告の開始とすることができます。複数の警告が一連の警告を構成す"
"る場合、警告ごとにポイントを移動させて最後の警告に表示させるのではなく、その"
"系列の最初の警告にポイントを留めておくことを意味します。この系列は、この変数"
"のローカルバインドが解除され、<code class=\"code\">warning-series</code> が再"
"び <code class=\"code\">nil</code> になったときに終了します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The value can also be a symbol with a function definition.  That is "
"equivalent to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, except that the next warning "
"will also call the function with no arguments with the warnings buffer the "
"current buffer.  The function can, for example, insert text which will serve "
"as a header for the series of warnings."
msgstr ""
"値には、関数定義を持つシンボルを指定することもできます。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> と同等ですが、次の警告時に引数なしで関数が呼び出さ"
"れ、warnings が現在のバッファをバッファとして使用する点が異なります。例えば、"
"この関数を用いて、一連の警告のヘッダーとなるテキストを挿入することができま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Once a series has begun, the value of this variable is a marker which points "
"to the buffer position in the warnings buffer of the start of the series."
msgstr ""
"シリーズが開始されると、この変数の値は、シリーズ開始時点における警告バッファ"
"内のバッファ位置を示すマーカーとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Warning-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The variable&rsquo;s normal value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which "
"means to handle each warning separately."
msgstr ""
