# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"It is sometimes useful to take some action when a variable changes its "
"value.  The <em class=\"dfn\">variable watchpoint</em> facility provides the "
"means to do so.  Some possible uses for this feature include keeping display "
"in sync with variable settings, and invoking the debugger to track down "
"unexpected changes to variables (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Debugging.html\">Entering the debugger when a variable is modified</a>)."
msgstr ""
"変数の値が変更された際に、何らかの処理を行うことが有用な場合があります。<em "
"class=\"dfn\">変数ウォッチポイント</em>機能は、そのための手段を提供します。こ"
"の機能の活用例としては、表示を変数の設定と同期させたり、デバッガを呼び出して"
"変数への予期しない変更を追跡したりすることなどが挙げられます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Debugging.html\">変数が変更された際にデバッガ"
"に入る</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The following functions may be used to manipulate and query the watch "
"functions for a variable."
msgstr "変数のウォッチ関数を操作・照会するには、以下の関数を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">add-variable-watcher</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol "
"watch-function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"add_002dvariable_002dwatcher\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">add-variable-watcher</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">symbol "
"watch-function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"add_002dvariable_002dwatcher\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function arranges for <var class=\"var\">watch-function</var> to be "
"called whenever <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is modified.  Modifications "
"through aliases (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-"
"Aliases.html\">Variable Aliases</a>) will have the same effect."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が変更されるたびに <var "
"class=\"var\">watch-function</var> が呼び出されるようにします。エイリアス"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Aliases.html\">変数エイリアス</a> を参"
"照）による変更でも、同様の効果が得られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">watch-function</var> will be called, just before changing "
"the value of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>, with 4 arguments: <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>, <var class=\"var\">newval</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">operation</var>, and <var class=\"var\">where</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> is the variable being changed.  <var "
"class=\"var\">newval</var> is the value it will be changed to.  (The old "
"value is available to <var class=\"var\">watch-function</var> as the value "
"of <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>, since it was not yet changed to <var "
"class=\"var\">newval</var>.)  <var class=\"var\">operation</var> is a symbol "
"representing the kind of change, one of: <code class=\"code\">set</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">let</code>, <code class=\"code\">unlet</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">makunbound</code>, or <code class=\"code\">defvaralias</"
"code>.  <var class=\"var\">where</var> is a buffer if the buffer-local value "
"of the variable is being changed, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">watch-function</var> は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> "
"の値を変更する直前に、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">newval</var>、<var class=\"var\">operation</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">where</var> の 4 つの引数とともに呼び出されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> は変更対象の変数です。<var class=\"var\">newval</"
"var> は変更後の値です。（元の値は、まだ <var class=\"var\">newval</var> に変"
"更されていないため、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> の値として <var "
"class=\"var\">watch-function</var> から参照可能です。）<var "
"class=\"var\">operation</var> は変更の種類を表すシンボルで、<code "
"class=\"code\">set</code>、<code class=\"code\">let</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">unlet</code>、<code class=\"code\">makunbound</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">defvaralias</code> のいずれかです。<var class=\"var\">where</"
"var> は、変数のバッファローカルな値が変更される場合はバッファ、それ以外の場合"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">remove-variable-watcher</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">symbol watch-function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-remove_002dvariable_002dwatcher\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">remove-variable-watcher</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">symbol watch-function</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-remove_002dvariable_002dwatcher\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"This function removes <var class=\"var\">watch-function</var> from <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>&rsquo;s list of watchers."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>のウォッチャーリストから<var "
"class=\"var\">watch-function</var>を削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
