# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"There are a couple of ways in which a variable could be modified (or at "
"least appear to be modified) without triggering a watchpoint."
msgstr ""
"ウォッチポイントをトリガーせずに、変数を変更（あるいは少なくとも変更されたよ"
"うに見せ）る方法がいくつかあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Since watchpoints are attached to symbols, modification to the objects "
"contained within variables (e.g., by a list modification function see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Modifying-Lists.html\">Modifying Existing List "
"Structure</a>) is not caught by this mechanism."
msgstr ""
"ウォッチポイントはシンボルに紐付いているため、変数に含まれるオブジェクトへの"
"変更（例：リスト変更関数による変更。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Modifying-"
"Lists.html\">既存のリスト構造の変更</a>を参照）は、この仕組みでは検知されませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Additionally, C code can modify the value of variables directly, bypassing "
"the watchpoint mechanism."
msgstr ""
"さらに、C言語のコードではウォッチポイント機構を介さずに、変数の値を直接変更で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Watching-Variables.html
msgid ""
"A minor limitation of this feature, again because it targets symbols, is "
"that only variables of dynamic scope may be watched.  This poses little "
"difficulty, since modifications to lexical variables can be discovered "
"easily by inspecting the code within the scope of the variable (unlike "
"dynamic variables, which can be modified by any code at all, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">Scoping Rules for Variable "
"Bindings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この機能のわずかな制限として、やはりシンボルを対象としているがゆえに、動的ス"
"コープの変数のみが監視可能であるという点が挙げられます。レキシカル変数への変"
"更は、その変数のスコープ内のコードを検査することで容易に検出できるため、この"
"点はほとんど問題になりません（あらゆるコードによって変更され得る動的変数とは"
"異なります。詳細は<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variable-Scoping.html\">変数束縛"
"のスコープ規則</a>を参照してください）。"

