# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configuration-Type.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">window configuration</em> stores information about the "
"positions, sizes, and contents of the windows in a frame, so you can "
"recreate the same arrangement of windows later."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウ構成</em>は、フレーム内のウィンドウの位置、サイ"
"ズ、内容に関する情報を保持するため、後で同じウィンドウ配置を再現できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configuration-Type.html
msgid ""
"Window configurations do not have a read syntax; their print syntax looks "
"like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#&lt;window-configuration&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-"
"Configurations.html\">Window Configurations</a>, for a description of "
"several functions related to window configurations."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ構成には読み取り構文がなく、出力構文は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#&lt;window-configuration&gt;</samp>&rsquo; のようになります。"
"ウィンドウ構成に関連するいくつかの関数の説明については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Window-Configurations.html\">ウィンドウ構成</a>を参照してください。"

