# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-configurations\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saving-window-information\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-configurations\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saving-window-information\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">window configuration</em> records the entire layout of "
"one frame&mdash;all windows, their sizes, their decorations, which buffers "
"they contain, how those buffers are scrolled, and their value of point, It "
"also includes the value of <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-scroll-window</"
"code>.  As a special exception, the window configuration does not record the "
"value of point in the selected window for the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウ構成</em>は、1つのフレームのレイアウト全体――すべ"
"てのウィンドウ、そのサイズ、装飾、どのバッファを含んでいるか、それらのバッ"
"ファがどのようにスクロールされているか、およびpointの値――を記録します。また、"
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-scroll-window</code>の値も含まれます。特別な"
"例外として、ウィンドウ構成は、現在のバッファにおける選択済みウィンドウのpoint"
"の値は記録しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"You can bring back an entire frame layout by restoring a previously saved "
"window configuration.  If you want to record the layout of all frames "
"instead of just one, use a frame configuration instead of a window "
"configuration.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Configurations.html\">Frame Configurations</a>."
msgstr ""
"以前に保存したウィンドウ設定を復元することで、フレームレイアウト全体を元に戻"
"すことができます。単一のフレームではなく、すべてのフレームのレイアウトを記録"
"したい場合は、ウィンドウ設定ではなくフレーム設定を使用してください。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Frame-Configurations.html\">フレーム設定</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-window-configuration</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-current_002dwindow_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">current-window-configuration</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-current_002dwindow_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a new object representing <var class=\"var\">frame</"
"var>&rsquo;s current window configuration.  The default for <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var> is the selected frame.  The variable <code "
"class=\"code\">window-persistent-parameters</code> specifies which window "
"parameters (if any) are saved by this function.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">Window Parameters</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">frame</var>の現在のウィンドウ構成を表す新しい"
"オブジェクトを返します。<var class=\"var\">frame</var>のデフォルト値は選択中"
"のフレームです。変数<code class=\"code\">window-persistent-parameters</code>"
"では、この関数によって保存されるウィンドウパラメータ（もしあれば）を指定しま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">ウィンドウパラメータ</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-configuration</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">configuration &amp;optional dont-set-frame dont-set-miniwindow</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dwindow_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-configuration</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">configuration &amp;optional dont-set-frame dont-set-miniwindow</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dwindow_002dconfiguration\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function restores the configuration of windows and buffers as specified "
"by <var class=\"var\">configuration</var>, for the frame that <var "
"class=\"var\">configuration</var> was created for, regardless of whether "
"that frame is selected or not.  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">configuration</var> must be a value that was previously "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">current-window-configuration</code> for "
"that frame.  Normally the function also selects the frame which is recorded "
"in the configuration, but if <var class=\"var\">dont-set-frame</var> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it leaves selected the frame which was "
"already selected at the start of the function."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">configuration</var> が作成されたフレームについ"
"て、そのフレームが選択されているか否かにかかわらず、<var "
"class=\"var\">configuration</var> で指定されたウィンドウおよびバッファの設定"
"を復元します。引数 <var class=\"var\">configuration</var> には、当該フレーム"
"に対して <code class=\"code\">current-window-configuration</code> が以前に返"
"した値を指定する必要があります。通常、この関数は設定に記録されているフレーム"
"も選択しますが、<var class=\"var\">dont-set-frame</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は、関数開始時に既に選択されていたフレー"
"ムを選択したままにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Normally the function restores the saved minibuffer (if any), but if <var "
"class=\"var\">dont-set-miniwindow</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the minibuffer current at the start of the function (if any) remains "
"in the mini-window."
msgstr ""
"通常、この関数は保存済みのミニバッファ（もしあれば）を復元しますが、<var "
"class=\"var\">dont-set-miniwindow</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ない場合は、関数開始時のミニバッファのカレント（もしあれば）がミニウィンドウ"
"に残ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"If the frame from which <var class=\"var\">configuration</var> was saved is "
"dead, all this function does is to restore the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-scroll-window</code> and to adjust the value "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-selected-window</code>.  In this "
"case, the function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Otherwise, it "
"returns <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">configuration</var> が保存されたフレームが消滅している場"
"合、この関数が行うのは、変数 <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-scroll-window</"
"code> の値を復元し、<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-selected-window</code> が"
"返す値を調整することだけである。この場合、関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返す。それ以外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function consults the variable <code class=\"code\">window-restore-"
"killed-buffer-windows</code> (see below) when it tries to restore a window "
"whose buffer was killed after <var class=\"var\">configuration</var> was "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
