# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the state of <var class=\"var\">window</var> as a Lisp "
"object.  The argument <var class=\"var\">window</var> must be a valid window "
"and defaults to the root window of the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var>の状態をLispオブジェクトとして返し"
"ます。引数<var class=\"var\">window</var>は有効なウィンドウである必要があり、"
"デフォルトでは選択中のフレームのルートウィンドウが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">writable</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means to not use markers for sampling "
"positions like <code class=\"code\">window-point</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">window-start</code>.  This argument should be non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> when the state will be written to disk and read "
"back in another session."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">writable</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、これは <code class=\"code\">window-"
"point</code> や <code class=\"code\">window-start</code> のようなサンプリング"
"位置用のマーカーを使用しないことを意味します。状態をディスクに書き込み、別の"
"セッションで読み込む場合は、この引数を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外に"
"する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Together, <var class=\"var\">writable</var> and the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">window-persistent-parameters</code> specify which window "
"parameters are saved by this function.  The default is to save the <code "
"class=\"code\">clone-of</code> parameter if <var class=\"var\">writable</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">Window Parameters</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">writable</var> と変数 <code class=\"code\">window-"
"persistent-parameters</code> を組み合わせることで、この関数で保存するウィンド"
"ウパラメータを指定します。デフォルトでは、<var class=\"var\">writable</var> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合に <code class=\"code\">clone-of</"
"code> パラメータを保存します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-"
"Parameters.html\">ウィンドウパラメータ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002dstate_002dnormalize_002dbuffer_002dname\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002dstate_002dnormalize_002dbuffer_002dname\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Bind <code class=\"code\">window-state-normalize-buffer-name</code> to non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> to normalize buffer names under <samp "
"class=\"file\">uniquify</samp> management by removing its prefixes and "
"suffixes.  This helps restore window buffers across Emacs sessions.  See <a "
"data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/emacs/Uniquify.html#Uniquify\">Uniquify</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">window-state-normalize-buffer-name</code> を non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドすることで、<samp "
"class=\"file\">uniquify</samp> 管理下のバッファ名から接頭辞と接尾辞を取り除"
"き、正規化します。これにより、Emacs セッションをまたいでウィンドウバッファを"
"復元できます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Uniquify.html#Uniquify\">Uniquify</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"The value returned by <code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> can be "
"used in the same session to clone a window (see below).  It can be also "
"written to disk and read back in another session.  In either case, use the "
"following function to restore the state of the window."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> が返す値は、同一セッション内で"
"ウィンドウをクローンする際に使用できます（後述）。また、ディスクに書き込んで"
"別のセッションで読み込むことも可能です。いずれの場合も、以下の関数を使用して"
"ウィンドウの状態を復元してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-state-put</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">state "
"&amp;optional window ignore</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dstate_002dput\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-state-put</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">state "
"&amp;optional window ignore</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dstate_002dput\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function puts the window state <var class=\"var\">state</var> into <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">state</var> "
"should be the state of a window returned by an earlier invocation of <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-get</code>, see above.  The optional argument "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> can be either a live window or an internal "
"window (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">Windows and "
"Frames</a>).  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is not a live window, it is "
"replaced by a new live window created on the same frame before putting <var "
"class=\"var\">state</var> into it.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it puts the window state into a new window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウの状態 <var class=\"var\">state</var> を <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> に格納します。引数 <var class=\"var\">state</var> "
"には、前述の <code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> の呼び出しによって"
"返されたウィンドウの状態を指定する必要があります。オプション引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> には、ライブウィンドウまたは内部ウィンドウのいずれ"
"かを指定できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows-and-Frames.html\">ウィン"
"ドウとフレーム</a> を参照）。<var class=\"var\">window</var> がライブウィンド"
"ウでない場合は、<var class=\"var\">state</var> を格納する前に、同じフレーム上"
"に作成された新しいライブウィンドウに置き換えられます。<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、"
"ウィンドウの状態が新しいウィンドウに格納されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function assigns all window parameters that have been stored in <var "
"class=\"var\">state</var>.  By default, this is the <code "
"class=\"code\">clone-of</code> parameter provided <var class=\"var\">state</"
"var> was obtained from an invocation of <code class=\"code\">window-state-"
"get</code> with the argument <var class=\"var\">writable</var> <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-"
"Parameters.html\">Window Parameters</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">state</var> に格納されているすべてのウィンドウ"
"パラメータを割り当てます。デフォルトでは、<var class=\"var\">state</var> が引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">writable</var> および <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を指定して <code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> を呼び出した際に取得"
"された場合、このパラメータは <code class=\"code\">clone-of</code> となりま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Parameters.html\">ウィンドウパラメータ</"
"a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This function consults the variable <code class=\"code\">window-restore-"
"killed-buffer-windows</code> (see below) when it tries to restore a window "
"whose buffer was killed after <var class=\"var\">state</var> was recorded."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">state</var> の記録後にバッファが破棄されたウィ"
"ンドウを復元しようとする際、変数 <code class=\"code\">window-restore-killed-"
"buffer-windows</code>（後述）を参照します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it means to ignore minimum window sizes and fixed-"
"size restrictions.  If <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">safe</code>, this means windows can get as small as one line "
"and/or two columns."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、最小ウィンドウサイズおよび固定サイズの制限を無視することを"
"意味します。<var class=\"var\">ignore</var> が <code class=\"code\">safe</"
"code> の場合、ウィンドウは1行および/または2列まで小さくなることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-clone\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-clone-of-window\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-clone\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-clone-of-window\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"In the context of window states, the <em class=\"dfn\">clone of a window</"
"em> is a window that has the same decorations and contents as the window "
"whose state was used to produce it, but is actually represented by another "
"window object.  Hence it does not have the same identity as the original "
"window.  Operating on the original or the clone of a window does not affect "
"the other in any way."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウの状態という観点では、<em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウのクローン</em>と"
"は、その状態を用いて生成されたウィンドウと同じ装飾と内容を持ちながら、実際に"
"は別のウィンドウオブジェクトによって表現されているウィンドウのことである。し"
"たがって、元のウィンドウとは同一のアイデンティティを持たない。元のウィンドウ"
"またはそのクローンに対して操作を行っても、他方に何ら影響を及ぼすことはない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Note that while <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> always "
"restores the identity of the windows it puts back into their frame, <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> never does that.  Note also that "
"while <code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> clones existing windows, "
"these clones are not yet valid windows.  They become valid only after <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> has put them into a live frame."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> はフレームに戻した"
"ウィンドウの同一性を常に復元しますが、<code class=\"code\">window-state-put</"
"code> は決してそうしません。また、<code class=\"code\">window-state-get</"
"code> は既存のウィンドウをクローンしますが、これらのクローンはまだ有効なウィ"
"ンドウではありません。<code class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> がそれらを"
"ライブフレームに配置して初めて、有効なウィンドウとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"By default, <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> may delete a window from the restored "
"configuration or state when they find out that its buffer was killed since "
"the corresponding configuration or state has been recorded.  The variable "
"described next can be used to fine-tune that behavior."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、対応する設定や状態が記録されて以降、バッファが破棄されたこと"
"が判明した場合、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> および "
"<code class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> は復元された設定や状態からウィン"
"ドウを削除することがあります。次に説明する変数を使用することで、この動作を微"
"調整できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-restoring-windows-whose-buffers-have-"
"been-killed\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-restoring-windows-whose-buffers-have-"
"been-killed\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-restore-killed-buffer-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002drestore_002dkilled_002dbuffer_002dwindows\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-restore-killed-buffer-windows</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002drestore_002dkilled_002dbuffer_002dwindows\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies how <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> shall handle a window "
"whose buffer has been killed since the corresponding configuration or state "
"was recorded.  Any such window may be live&mdash;in which case it shows some "
"other buffer&mdash;or dead at the time one of these functions is called.  "
"Usually, <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> leaves the "
"window alone if it is live while <code class=\"code\">window-state-put</"
"code> deletes it."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、対応する設定または状態が記録されて以降にバッファが破棄されたウィ"
"ンドウを、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> がどのように扱うかを指定します。このよ"
"うなウィンドウは、これらの関数のいずれかが呼び出された時点で、ライブ状態（そ"
"の場合は別のバッファが表示される）であるか、あるいはデッド状態であるかのいず"
"れかです。通常、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> はウィン"
"ドウがライブ状態であればそのままにしますが、<code class=\"code\">window-"
"state-put</code> はそれを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"The following values can be used to override the default behavior for dead "
"windows in the case of <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> "
"and for dead and live windows in the case of <code class=\"code\">window-"
"state-put</code>."
msgstr ""
"以下の値を使用することで、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</"
"code> の場合はデッドウィンドウの、<code class=\"code\">window-state-put</"
"code> の場合はデッドウィンドウおよびライブウィンドウの既定の動作を上書きでき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This value means to unconditionally restore the window and show some other "
"buffer in it."
msgstr ""
"この値は、ウィンドウを無条件に復元し、その中に別のバッファを表示することを意"
"味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">delete</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">delete</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid "This means to unconditionally try to delete the window."
msgstr "これは、無条件にウィンドウを削除しようとすることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This means to try to delete the window if and only if it is dedicated to its "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"つまり、ウィンドウが自身のバッファ専用である場合に限り、そのウィンドウを削除"
"しようとするということです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This is the default, and it means that <code class=\"code\">set-window-"
"configuration</code> will try to delete the window if and only if it is "
"dedicated to its buffer, and <code class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> "
"will unconditionally try to delete it."
msgstr ""
"これがデフォルトの設定であり、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</"
"code> はそのウィンドウが自身のバッファ専用である場合に限り削除を試み、<code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> は無条件に削除を試みることを意味しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This means to restore the window and show some other buffer in it, like if "
"the value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, and also add an entry for that "
"window to a list that will be later passed as the second argument to that "
"function."
msgstr ""
"これは、ウィンドウを復元し、値が <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合など"
"に別のバッファをそこに表示し、さらにそのウィンドウのエントリを、後で当該関数"
"の第2引数として渡されるリストに追加することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"If a window cannot be deleted (typically, because it is the last window on "
"its frame), <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> will show another buffer in it."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウを削除できない場合（通常は、フレーム上の最後のウィンドウであるた"
"め）、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> には別のバッファが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"If the value of this variable is a function, that function should take three "
"arguments.  The first argument specifies the frame whose windows have been "
"restored.  The third argument is either the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">configuration</code> if the windows are restored by <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code>, or the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">state</code> if the windows are restored by <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値が関数である場合、その関数は3つの引数を取る必要があります。第1引"
"数は、ウィンドウが復元されたフレームを指定します。第3引数は、ウィンドウが "
"<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> によって復元された場合は"
"シンボル <code class=\"code\">configuration</code> を、<code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> によって復元された場合はシンボル "
"<code class=\"code\">state</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"The second argument specifies a list of entries for <em class=\"emph\">all</"
"em> windows whose previous buffers have been found dead at the time <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> tried to restore them (minibuffer "
"windows are excluded).  This means that the function may also delete windows "
"which were found live by <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"第2引数には、<code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> が復元を試みた時点で、以前のバッ"
"ファがデッド状態であった<em class=\"emph\">すべての</em>ウィンドウのエントリ"
"リストを指定します（ミニバッファウィンドウは除外されます）。つまり、この関数"
"は <code class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> によってライブ状態で"
"あると判定されたウィンドウも削除する可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Each entry in the list that is passed as the second argument to the function "
"is itself a list of six values: the window whose buffer was found dead, the "
"dead buffer or its name, the positions of window start (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Start-and-End.html\">The Window Start and End "
"Positions</a>) and window point (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Point.html\">Windows and Point</a>)  of the buffer in that window, the "
"dedicated state of the window as previously reported by <code "
"class=\"code\">window-dedicated-p</code> and a flag that is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if the window has been found to be alive by <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> and <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"関数の第2引数として渡されるリストの各要素は、それ自体が6つの値からなるリスト"
"です。具体的には、バッファがデッドであると判定されたウィンドウ、デッドバッ"
"ファまたはその名称、そのウィンドウ内のバッファのウィンドウ開始位置（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Start-and-End.html\">ウィンドウの開始・終了位置"
"</a>を参照）およびウィンドウポイント（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-"
"Point.html\">ウィンドウとポイント</a>を参照）、<code class=\"code\">window-"
"dedicated-p</code> で以前に報告されたウィンドウの専用状態、そして <code "
"class=\"code\">set-window-configuration</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> によってウィンドウが生存していると判定された場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> となるフラグです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"The functions <code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> also allow exchanging the contents of "
"two live windows.  The following function does precisely that:"
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">window-state-get</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-put</code> を使えば、2つのライブウィンドウの内容"
"を入れ替えることもできます。以下の関数は、まさにそれを行うものです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-swap-states</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window-1 window-2 size</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002dswap_002dstates\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-swap-states</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window-1 window-2 size</var><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-window_002dswap_002dstates\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"This command swaps the states of the two live windows <var "
"class=\"var\">window-1</var> and <var class=\"var\">window-2</var>.  <var "
"class=\"var\">window-1</var> must specify a live window and defaults to the "
"selected one.  <var class=\"var\">window-2</var> must specify a live window "
"and defaults to the window following <var class=\"var\">window-1</var> in "
"the cyclic ordering of windows, excluding minibuffer windows and including "
"live windows on all visible frames."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、2つのライブウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window-1</var> と "
"<var class=\"var\">window-2</var> の状態を入れ替えます。<var "
"class=\"var\">window-1</var> にはライブウィンドウを指定する必要があり、デフォ"
"ルトでは選択中のウィンドウが指定されます。<var class=\"var\">window-2</var> "
"にはライブウィンドウを指定する必要があり、デフォルトでは、ミニバッファウィン"
"ドウを除外し、すべての可視フレーム上のライブウィンドウを含めたウィンドウの循"
"環順において、<var class=\"var\">window-1</var> の次のウィンドウが指定されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Configurations.html
msgid ""
"Optional argument <var class=\"var\">size</var> non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means to try swapping the sizes of <var "
"class=\"var\">window-1</var> and <var class=\"var\">window-2</var> as well.  "
"A value of <code class=\"code\">height</code> means to swap heights only, a "
"value of <code class=\"code\">width</code> means to swap widths only, while "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> means to swap both widths and heights, if "
"possible.  Frames are not resized by this function."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">size</var> が non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、<var class=\"var\">window-1</var> と "
"<var class=\"var\">window-2</var> のサイズも入れ替えようとします。<code "
"class=\"code\">height</code> は高さのみを、<code class=\"code\">width</code> "
"は幅のみを入れ替え、<code class=\"code\">t</code> は可能であれば幅と高さの両"
"方を入れ替えます。この関数でフレームのサイズは変更されません。"

