# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"Each window remembers in a list the buffers it has previously displayed, and "
"the order in which these buffers were removed from it.  This history is "
"used, for example, by <code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-windows</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-and-Windows.html\">Buffers and "
"Windows</a>), and when quitting windows (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quitting-Windows.html\">Quitting Windows</a>).  The list is "
"automatically maintained by Emacs, but you can use the following functions "
"to explicitly inspect or alter it:"
msgstr ""
"各ウィンドウは、過去に表示したバッファと、それらのバッファが削除された順序を"
"リストに記録しています。この履歴は、例えば <code class=\"code\">replace-"
"buffer-in-windows</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffers-and-"
"Windows.html\">バッファとウィンドウ</a>を参照）や、ウィンドウを終了する際"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quitting-Windows.html\">ウィンドウの終了</a>を参"
"照）に使用されます。このリストはEmacsによって自動的に管理されますが、以下の関"
"数を使用して明示的に確認したり変更したりすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-prev-buffers</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dprev_002dbuffers\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-prev-buffers</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dprev_002dbuffers\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list specifying the previous contents of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>.  The optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> should be a live window and defaults to the "
"selected one."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の以前の内容を示すリストを返しま"
"す。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">window</var> にはアクティブなウィンドウ"
"を指定する必要があり、デフォルトでは選択中のウィンドウが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"Each list element has the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">buffer</var> <var class=\"var\">window-start</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">window-pos</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">buffer</"
"var> is a buffer previously shown in the window, <var class=\"var\">window-"
"start</var> is a marker that gives the window start position (see <a "
