#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"The list is ordered so that earlier elements correspond to more recently-"
"shown buffers, and the first element usually corresponds to the buffer most "
"recently removed from the window."
msgstr ""
