# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"This command displays the previous buffer in <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">window</var> should be a live window "
"or <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (meaning the selected window).  If the "
"optional argument <var class=\"var\">bury-or-kill</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means that the buffer currently shown in "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> is about to be buried or killed and "
"consequently should not be switched to in future invocations of this command."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、直前のバッファを <var class=\"var\">window</var> に表示しま"
"す。引数 <var class=\"var\">window</var> にはライブウィンドウを、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> には（選択中の）ウィンドウを指定します。オプション"
"引数 <var class=\"var\">bury-or-kill</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外である場合、現在 <var class=\"var\">window</var> に表示されている"
"バッファが破棄または終了されようとしていることを意味し、したがって、このコマ"
"ンドを再度実行した際にそのバッファに切り替わることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"The previous buffer is usually the buffer shown before the buffer currently "
"shown in <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  However, a buffer that has been "
"buried or killed, or has been already shown by a recent invocation of <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code>, does not qualify as previous "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"直前のバッファとは、通常、<var class=\"var\">window</var>で現在表示されている"
"バッファの前に表示されていたバッファを指します。ただし、埋もれたり破棄された"
"りしたバッファ、あるいは最近の<code class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</"
"code>の呼び出しですでに表示されたバッファは、直前のバッファとはみなされませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"If repeated invocations of this command have already shown all buffers "
"previously shown in <var class=\"var\">window</var>, further invocations "
"will show buffers from the buffer list of the frame <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> appears on (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-"
