# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"A function that takes three arguments&mdash;the <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> argument of <code class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code>, a buffer "
"<code class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code> intends to switch to and "
"the <var class=\"var\">bury-or-kill</var> argument of <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code>.  If that function returns non-"
