# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"code\">switch-to-next-buffer</code> obeys this "
"option in a similar way.  If this option specifies a function, <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-next-buffer</code> will call that function with the "
"third argument always <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">switch-to-next-buffer</code> も同様にこのオプ"
"ションに従います。このオプションで関数が指定されている場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-next-buffer</code> はその関数を呼び出し、第3引数には"
"常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が渡されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"Note that since <code class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code> is called "
"by <code class=\"code\">bury-buffer</code>, <code class=\"code\">replace-"
"buffer-in-windows</code> and <code class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code> "
"as well, customizing this option may also affect the behavior of Emacs when "
"a window is quit or a buffer gets buried or killed."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">switch-to-prev-buffer</code>は<code "
"class=\"code\">bury-buffer</code>、<code class=\"code\">replace-buffer-in-"
"windows</code>、<code class=\"code\">quit-restore-window</code>からも呼び出さ"
"れるため、このオプションをカスタマイズすると、ウィンドウを終了したり、バッ"
"ファが埋もれたり殺されたりした際のEmacsの動作にも影響が及ぶ可能性がある点に注"
"意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-History.html
msgid ""
"Note also that under certain circumstances <code class=\"code\">switch-to-"
"prev-buffer</code> and <code class=\"code\">switch-to-next-buffer</code> may "
"ignore this option, for example, when there is only one buffer left these "
