# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The fields of a window (for a complete list, see the definition of <code "
"class=\"code\">struct window</code> in <samp class=\"file\">window.h</samp>) "
"include:"
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウのフィールド（完全な一覧については、<samp class=\"file\">window.h</"
"samp> 内の <code class=\"code\">struct window</code> の定義を参照）には以下が"
"含まれます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "The frame that this window is on, as a Lisp object."
msgstr "このウィンドウが配置されているフレームを、Lispオブジェクトとして。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">mini</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">mini</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Non-zero if this window is a minibuffer window, a window showing the "
"minibuffer or the echo area."
msgstr ""
"このウィンドウがミニバッファウィンドウ、すなわちミニバッファまたはエコーエリ"
"アを表示するウィンドウである場合に非ゼロとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-pseudo-window\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pseudo_window_p</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pseudo-window\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-pseudo-window\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pseudo_window_p</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-pseudo-window\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Non-zero if this window is a <em class=\"dfn\">pseudo window</em>.  A pseudo "
"window is either a window used to display the menu bar or the tool bar (when "
"Emacs uses toolkits that don&rsquo;t display their own menu bar and tool "
"bar) or the tab bar or a window showing a tooltip on a tooltip frame.  "
"Pseudo windows are in general not accessible from Lisp code."
msgstr ""
"このウィンドウが<em class=\"dfn\">擬似ウィンドウ</em>である場合は0以外となり"
"ます。擬似ウィンドウとは、メニューバーやツールバーを表示するためのウィンドウ"
"（Emacsが独自のメニューバーやツールバーを表示しないツールキットを使用している"
"場合）、あるいはタブバー、またはツールチップフレーム上にツールチップを表示す"
"るウィンドウのことです。一般に、擬似ウィンドウはLispコードからアクセスできま"
"せん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">parent</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">parent</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Internally, Emacs arranges windows in a tree; each group of siblings has a "
"parent window whose area includes all the siblings.  This field points to "
"the window&rsquo;s parent in that tree, as a Lisp object.  For the root "
"window of the tree and a minibuffer window this is always <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacs内部では、ウィンドウはツリー構造で配置されており、兄弟ウィンドウの各グ"
"ループには、その領域にすべての兄弟ウィンドウを含む親ウィンドウが存在します。"
"このフィールドは、そのツリーにおけるウィンドウの親をLispオブジェクトとして指"
"します。ツリーのルートウィンドウおよびミニバッファウィンドウの場合、この値は"
"常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Parent windows do not display buffers, and play little role in display "
"except to shape their child windows.  Emacs Lisp programs cannot directly "
"manipulate parent windows; they operate on the windows at the leaves of the "
"tree, which actually display buffers."
msgstr ""
"親ウィンドウはバッファを表示せず、子ウィンドウの形状を規定する以外、表示にお"
"いてほとんど役割を果たしません。Emacs Lispプログラムは親ウィンドウを直接操作"
"することはできず、実際にバッファを表示するツリーの葉ノードにあるウィンドウを"
"操作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">contents</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">contents</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"For a leaf window and windows showing a tooltip, this is the buffer, as a "
"Lisp object, that the window is displaying.  For an internal "
"(&ldquo;parent&rdquo;) window, this is its first child window.  For a pseudo "
"window showing a menu or tool bar this is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"It is also <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for a window that has been "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"リーフウィンドウやツールチップを表示するウィンドウの場合、これはそのウィンド"
"ウが表示しているバッファ（Lispオブジェクト）となります。内部（「親」）ウィン"
"ドウの場合は、その最初の子ウィンドウとなります。メニューやツールバーを表示す"
"る擬似ウィンドウの場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。また、削"
"除されたウィンドウの場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">prev</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">prev</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The next and previous sibling of this window as Lisp objects.  <code "
"class=\"code\">next</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the window "
"is the right-most or bottom-most in its group; <code class=\"code\">prev</"
"code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it is the left-most or top-most "
"in its group.  Whether the sibling is left/right or up/down is determined by "
"the <code class=\"code\">horizontal</code> field of the sibling&rsquo;s "
"parent: if it&rsquo;s non-zero, the siblings are arranged horizontally."
msgstr ""
"このウィンドウの次および前の兄弟ウィンドウをLispオブジェクトとして表します。"
"ウィンドウがグループ内で最右端または最下端にある場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">next</code>は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>となり、最左端また"
"は最上端にある場合は<code class=\"code\">prev</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。兄弟ウィンドウが左右か上下かは、当該兄弟"
"ウィンドウの親の<code class=\"code\">horizontal</code>フィールドによって決定"
"されます。この値が0以外の場合、兄弟ウィンドウは水平方向に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"As a special case, <code class=\"code\">next</code> of a frame&rsquo;s root "
"window points to the frame&rsquo;s minibuffer window, provided this is not a "
"minibuffer-only or minibuffer-less frame.  On such frames <code "
"class=\"code\">prev</code> of the minibuffer window points to that "
"frame&rsquo;s root window.  In any other case, the root window&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">next</code> and the minibuffer window&rsquo;s (if present)  "
"<code class=\"code\">prev</code> fields are <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"特殊なケースとして、フレームのルートウィンドウの <code class=\"code\">next</"
"code> は、そのフレームがミニバッファ専用またはミニバッファなしのフレームでな"
"い限り、当該フレームのミニバッファウィンドウを指します。このようなフレームで"
"は、ミニバッファウィンドウの <code class=\"code\">prev</code> がそのフレーム"
"のルートウィンドウを指します。それ以外の場合は、ルートウィンドウの <code "
"class=\"code\">next</code> および（存在する場合の）ミニバッファウィンドウの "
"<code class=\"code\">prev</code> フィールドは <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">left_col</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">left_col</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The left-hand edge of the window, measured in columns, relative to the "
"leftmost column (column 0) of the window&rsquo;s native frame."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウのネイティブフレームの最左列（列0）を基準とした、列単位で計測した"
"ウィンドウの左端。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">top_line</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">top_line</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The top edge of the window, measured in lines, relative to the topmost line "
"(line 0) of the window&rsquo;s native frame."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウの元のフレームの最上行（行0）を基準とした、行単位で計測したウィンド"
"ウの上端。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">pixel_left</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">pixel_left</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">pixel_top</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">pixel_top</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The left-hand and top edges of this window, measured in pixels, relative to "
"the top-left corner (0, 0) of the window&rsquo;s native frame."
msgstr ""
"このウィンドウの左端および上端のエッジを、ウィンドウのネイティブフレームの左"
"上隅 (0, 0) を基準としてピクセル単位で測定したもの。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">total_cols</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">total_cols</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">total_lines</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">total_lines</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The total width and height of the window, measured in columns and lines "
"respectively.  The values include scroll bars and fringes, dividers and/or "
"the separator line on the right of the window (if any)."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウの全幅および全高（それぞれ列数と行数で表記）。これらの値には、スク"
"ロールバーやフリンジ、区切り線、および／またはウィンドウ右側の区切り線（ある"
"場合）が含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">pixel_width;</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">pixel_width;</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">pixel_height;</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">pixel_height;</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "The total width and height of the window measured in pixels."
msgstr "ピクセル単位で計測したウィンドウの全幅と全高。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"A marker pointing to the position in the buffer that is the first character "
"(in the logical order, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bidirectional-"
"Display.html\">Bidirectional Display</a>)  displayed in the window."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウに表示される最初の文字（論理順、<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Bidirectional-Display.html\">双方向表示</a>を参照）に対応するバッファ"
"内の位置を指し示すマーカー。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-window-point-internals\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pointm</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window-"
"point-internals\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-window-point-internals\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">pointm</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window-"
"point-internals\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"This is the value of point in the current buffer when this window is "
"selected; when it is not selected, it retains its previous value."
msgstr ""
"このウィンドウが選択されているときの現在のバッファにおけるポイントの値で、選"
"択されていないときは前回の値を保持します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">old_pointm</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">old_pointm</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"The value of <code class=\"code\">pointm</code> at the last redisplay time."
msgstr "前回の再表示時の <code class=\"code\">pointm</code> の値。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">force_start</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">force_start</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"If this flag is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it says that the window "
"has been scrolled explicitly by the Lisp program, and the value of the "
"window&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">start</code> was set for redisplay to "
"honor.  This affects what the next redisplay does if point is off the "
"screen: instead of scrolling the window to show the text around point, it "
"moves point to a location that is on the screen."
msgstr ""
"このフラグが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、ウィンドウが Lisp プ"
"ログラムによって明示的にスクロールされ、再表示時に反映されるようウィンドウの "
"<code class=\"code\">start</code> の値が設定されたことを示します。これは、"
"point が画面外にある場合の次回の再表示の動作に影響します。具体的には、point "
"周辺のテキストを表示するためにウィンドウをスクロールするのではなく、point を"
"画面内の位置に移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">optional_new_start</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">optional_new_start</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"This is similar to <code class=\"code\">force_start</code>, but the next "
"redisplay will only obey it if point stays visible."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">force_start</code> と同様ですが、次の再表示でこれ"
"が反映されるのは、ポイントが表示されたままの場合に限られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">start_at_line_beg</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">start_at_line_beg</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"Non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means current value of <code "
"class=\"code\">start</code> was the beginning of a line when it was chosen."
msgstr ""
"Non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>は、<code class=\"code\">start</code>が選"
"択された時点での値が行頭であったことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">use_time</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">use_time</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Internals.html
msgid ""
"This is the last time that the window was selected.  The function <code "
"class=\"code\">get-lru-window</code> uses this field."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウが選択されたのはこれが最後です。関数 <code class=\"code\">get-lru-"
