msgid ""
"This means that the parameter is saved unconditionally by both <code "
"class=\"code\">current-window-configuration</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">window-state-get</code>.  This value should not be used for "
"parameters whose values do not have a read syntax.  Otherwise, invoking "
