# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"Emacs displays the cursor, by default as a rectangular block, in each window "
"at the position of that window&rsquo;s point.  When the user switches to "
"another buffer in a window, Emacs moves that window&rsquo;s cursor to where "
"point is in that buffer.  If the exact position of point is hidden behind "
"some display element, such as a display string or an image, Emacs displays "
"the cursor immediately before or after that display element."
msgstr ""
"Emacsはデフォルトで、各ウィンドウのポイントの位置に、矩形のブロックとしてカー"
"ソルを表示します。ユーザーがウィンドウ内の別のバッファに切り替えると、Emacsは"
"そのウィンドウのカーソルを、そのバッファにおけるポイントの位置に移動させま"
"す。ポイントの正確な位置が、表示文字列や画像などの表示要素の背後に隠れている"
"場合、Emacsはその表示要素の直前または直後にカーソルを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-point</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dpoint\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-point</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dpoint\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the window point for <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  "
"For a nonselected window, this is the value point would have (in that "
"window&rsquo;s buffer) if that window were selected.  The default for <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> is the selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> に対応するウィンドウポイントを返"
"します。選択されていないウィンドウの場合、これは、そのウィンドウが選択されて"
"いた場合に（そのウィンドウのバッファ内で）ポイントが示す値となります。<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> のデフォルトは、選択中のウィンドウです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">window</var> is the selected window, the value "
"returned is the value of point in that window&rsquo;s buffer.  Strictly "
"speaking, it would be more correct to return the top-level value of point, "
"outside of any <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> forms.  But that "
"value is hard to find."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が選択中のウィンドウである場合、返される値は"
"そのウィンドウのバッファにおける point の値となります。厳密に言えば、いかな"
"る <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> フォームの外側にある point の"
"トップレベルの値を返す方がより正確でしょう。しかし、その値を特定するのは困難"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-point</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dwindow_002dpoint\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-point</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">window "
"position</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dwindow_002dpoint\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"This function positions point in <var class=\"var\">window</var> at position "
"<var class=\"var\">position</var> in <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s "
"buffer.  It returns <var class=\"var\">position</var>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var>のバッファ内の位置<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var>に点<var class=\"var\">window</var>を配置します。"
"戻り値は<var class=\"var\">position</var>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is selected, this simply does <code "
"class=\"code\">goto-char</code> in <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> が選択された場合、これは単に <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> のバッファ内で <code class=\"code\">goto-char</"
"code> を実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-point-insertion-type</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dpoint_002dinsertion_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-point-insertion-type</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dpoint_002dinsertion_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the marker insertion type (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Marker-Insertion-Types.html\">Marker Insertion Types</a>) of <code "
"class=\"code\">window-point</code>.  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, so <code class=\"code\">window-point</code> will "
"stay behind text inserted there."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">window-point</code> のマーカー挿入タイプ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Marker-Insertion-Types.html\">マーカー挿入タイプ"
"</a>を参照）を指定します。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である"
"ため、<code class=\"code\">window-point</code> はそこに挿入されたテキストの後"
"ろに配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-cursor-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">window type</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dwindow_002dcursor_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">set-window-cursor-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">window type</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"set_002dwindow_002dcursor_002dtype\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"This function sets the cursor shape for <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  "
"This setting takes precedence over the <code class=\"code\">cursor-type</"
"code> variable, and <var class=\"var\">type</var> has the same format as the "
"value of that variable.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Cursor-"
"Parameters.html\">Cursor Parameters</a>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it means to set the cursor type for the "
"selected window."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> のカーソル形状を設定します。この"
"設定は <code class=\"code\">cursor-type</code> 変数よりも優先され、<var "
"class=\"var\">type</var> はその変数の値と同じ形式となります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Cursor-Parameters.html\">カーソルパラメータ</a> を参照"
"してください。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、選択中のウィンドウのカーソルタイプを設定することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"The initial value for new windows is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, which "
"says to respect the buffer-local value of <code class=\"code\">cursor-type</"
"code>.  The value set by this function persists across buffers shown in <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>, so <code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> "
"does not reset it.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffers-and-"
"Windows.html\">Buffers and Windows</a>."
msgstr ""
"新規ウィンドウの初期値は <code class=\"code\">t</code> であり、これはバッファ"
"ローカルな値 <code class=\"code\">cursor-type</code> を尊重することを意味しま"
"す。この関数で設定された値は <var class=\"var\">window</var> で表示されるバッ"
"ファ間でも保持されるため、<code class=\"code\">set-window-buffer</code> に"
"よってリセットされることはありません。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Buffers-and-"
"Windows.html\">バッファとウィンドウ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Point.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-cursor-type</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
