# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"Emacs provides miscellaneous functions for finding the height and width of a "
"window.  The return value of many of these functions can be specified either "
"in units of pixels or in units of canonical lines and columns.  On a "
"graphical display, the latter actually correspond to the height and width of "
"a default character specified by the frame&rsquo;s default font as returned "
"by <code class=\"code\">frame-char-height</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">frame-char-width</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-"
"Font.html\">Frame Font</a>).  Thus, if a window is displaying text with a "
"different font or size, the reported line height and column width for that "
"window may differ from the actual number of text lines or columns displayed "
"within it."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、ウィンドウの高さと幅を取得するための各種関数が提供されています。こ"
"れらの関数の多くは、戻り値をピクセル単位、または正準行・列単位で指定できま"
"す。グラフィカルディスプレイでは、後者は実際には <code class=\"code\">frame-"
"char-height</code> および <code class=\"code\">frame-char-width</code> で返さ"
"れるフレームのデフォルトフォントで指定されたデフォルト文字の高さと幅に対応し"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Frame-Font.html\">フレームフォント</a>を参"
"照）。したがって、ウィンドウに異なるフォントやサイズのテキストが表示されてい"
"る場合、そのウィンドウで報告される行高さや列幅は、実際に表示されているテキス"
"トの行数や列数とは異なる場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-height-of-a-window\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-total-height-of-a-window\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-height\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-height-of-a-window\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-total-height-of-a-window\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">total height</em> of a window is the number of lines "
"comprising its body and its top and bottom decorations (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Windows.html\">Basic Concepts of Emacs Windows</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウの<em class=\"dfn\">全高</em>とは、その本体と上下の装飾からなる行数"
"のことです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Windows.html\">Emacsウィンドウの"
"基本概念</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-total-height</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window round</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dtotal_002dheight\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-total-height</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional window round</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-window_002dtotal_002dheight\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the total height, in canonical lines, of the window "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is "
"omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected "
"window.  If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is an internal window, the "
"return value is the total height occupied by its descendant windows."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">window</var> の総高さを正準行単位で"
"返します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が省略された場合、または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、選択中のウィンドウがデフォルト"
"となります。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が内部ウィンドウである場合、戻り"
"値はその子孫ウィンドウが占める総高さとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"If a window&rsquo;s pixel height is not an integral multiple of its "
"frame&rsquo;s default character height, the number of lines occupied by the "
"window is rounded internally.  This is done in a way such that, if the "
"window is a parent window, the sum of the total heights of all its child "
"windows internally equals the total height of their parent.  This means that "
"although two windows have the same pixel height, their internal total "
"heights may differ by one line.  This means also, that if a window is "
"vertically combined and has a next sibling, the topmost row of that sibling "
"can be calculated as the sum of this window&rsquo;s topmost row and total "
"height (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coordinates-and-"
"Windows.html\">Coordinates and Windows</a>)"
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウのピクセル高さが、フレームのデフォルト文字高さの整数倍でない場合、"
"ウィンドウが占有する行数は内部的に丸められます。これは、ウィンドウが親ウィン"
"ドウである場合、すべての子ウィンドウの合計高さの総和が、内部的に親ウィンドウ"
"の合計高さと等しくなるように行われます。つまり、2つのウィンドウのピクセル高さ"
"が同じであっても、内部的な合計高さは1行分異なる場合があります。また、ウィンド"
"ウが垂直方向に結合されており、次の兄弟ウィンドウが存在する場合、その兄弟ウィ"
"ンドウの最上行は、このウィンドウの最上行と合計高さの和として計算できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coordinates-and-Windows.html\">座標とウィンドウ</a>を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">round</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">ceiling</code>, this function returns the smallest integer "
"larger than <var class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s pixel height divided by "
"the canonical character height of its frame; if it is <code "
"class=\"code\">floor</code>, it returns the largest integer smaller than "
"said value; with any other value of <var class=\"var\">round</var> it "
"returns the internal value of <var class=\"var\">windows</var>&rsquo;s total "
"height."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">round</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">ceiling</code> の場合、この関数は <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> のピクセル高さをそのフレームの正準文字高さで除した値より大きい最小の整数"
"を返します。<code class=\"code\">floor</code> の場合は、当該値より小さい最大"
"の整数を返します。それ以外の <var class=\"var\">round</var> の値が指定された"
"場合は、<var class=\"var\">windows</var> の総高さの内部値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-width-of-a-window\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-total-width-of-a-window\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-width\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-width-of-a-window\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
