# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Sizes.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">total width</em> of a window is the number of columns "
"comprising its body and its left and right decorations (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Windows.html\">Basic Concepts of Emacs Windows</"
