"window_002dgroup_002dstart_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002dgroup_002dstart_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Start-and-End.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">window-start</code>, except that "
"when <var class=\"var\">window</var> is a part of a group of windows (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selecting-Windows.html#Window-Group\">Window Group</"
"a>), <code class=\"code\">window-group-start</code> returns the start "
"position of the entire group.  This condition holds when the buffer local "
"variable <code class=\"code\">window-group-start-function</code> is set to a "
"function.  In this case, <code class=\"code\">window-group-start</code> "
"calls the function with the single argument <var class=\"var\">window</var>, "
"then returns its result."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">window-start</code> と同様ですが、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> がウィンドウグループ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Selecting-Windows.html#Window-Group\">ウィンドウグループ</a> を参照）"
"の一部である場合、<code class=\"code\">window-group-start</code> はグループ全"
"体の開始位置を返します。この条件は、バッファローカル変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">window-group-start-function</code> に関数が設定されている場合"
"に成立します。この場合、<code class=\"code\">window-group-start</code> は単一"
"の引数 <var class=\"var\">window</var> を指定してその関数を呼び出し、その結果"
"を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
