# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Start-and-End.html
msgid ""
"This function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> is within the range of text currently visible "
"on the screen in <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  It returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">position</var> is scrolled "
"vertically out of view.  Locations that are partially obscured are not "
"considered visible unless <var class=\"var\">partially</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">position</var> "
"defaults to the current position of point in <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var>; <var class=\"var\">window</var> defaults to the selected window.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">position</var> is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, that "
"means to check either the first visible position of the last screen line in "
"<var class=\"var\">window</var>, or the end-of-buffer position, whichever "
"comes first."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">position</var> が <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> の画面上で現在表示されているテキストの範囲内にある場合、non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<var class=\"var\">position</var> が垂"
"直方向にスクロールして表示範囲外にある場合は、<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。部分的に隠れている位置は、<var class=\"var\">partially</"
"var> が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限り、表示されているとはみ"
"なされません。引数 <var class=\"var\">position</var> のデフォルト値は <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> における point の現在の位置であり、<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> のデフォルト値は選択中のウィンドウです。<var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</code> である場合は、"
"<var class=\"var\">window</var> の最後の画面行の最初の表示位置か、バッファ終"
"端位置のいずれか早い方を確認することを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Start-and-End.html
msgid ""
"This function considers only vertical scrolling.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var> is out of view only because <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> has been scrolled horizontally, <code "
"class=\"code\">pos-visible-in-window-p</code> returns non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> anyway.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Horizontal-"
"Scrolling.html\">Horizontal Scrolling</a>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は垂直スクロールのみを考慮します。<var class=\"var\">window</var> が"
"水平方向にスクロールされたために <var class=\"var\">position</var> が表示範囲"
"外になった場合でも、<code class=\"code\">pos-visible-in-window-p</code> はい"
"ずれにせよ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Horizontal-Scrolling.html\">水平スクロール</a> を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Start-and-End.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">position</var> is visible, <code class=\"code\">pos-"
"visible-in-window-p</code> returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if <var "
"class=\"var\">partially</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; if <var "
"class=\"var\">partially</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and "
"the character following <var class=\"var\">position</var> is fully visible, "
"it returns a list of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">x</var> "
"and <var class=\"var\">y</var> are the pixel coordinates relative to the top "
"left corner of the window; otherwise it returns an extended list of the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">rtop</var> <var class=\"var\">rbot</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">rowh</var> <var class=\"var\">vpos</var>)</code>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">rtop</var> and <var class=\"var\">rbot</var> specify the "
"number of off-window pixels at the top and bottom of the row at <var "
"class=\"var\">position</var>, <var class=\"var\">rowh</var> specifies the "
"visible height of that row, and <var class=\"var\">vpos</var> specifies the "
"vertical position (zero-based row number) of that row."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">position</var> が表示されている場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">partially</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であれば "
"<code class=\"code\">pos-visible-in-window-p</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返し、<var class=\"var\">partially</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であり、かつ <var class=\"var\">position</var> "
"の次の文字が完全に表示されている場合は、<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</var>)</code> の形式のリストを返し"
"ます。ここで <var class=\"var\">x</var> と <var class=\"var\">y</var> はウィ"
"ンドウの左上隅を基準としたピクセル座標です。それ以外の場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">x</var> <var class=\"var\">y</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">rtop</var> <var class=\"var\">rbot</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">rowh</var> <var class=\"var\">vpos</var>)</code> の形式の拡張リ"
"ストを返します。ここで <var class=\"var\">rtop</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">rbot</var> は <var class=\"var\">position</var> の行の上下にあ"
"るウィンドウ外ピクセル数を指定し、<var class=\"var\">rowh</var> はその行の表"
"示高さを、<var class=\"var\">vpos</var> はその行の垂直位置（0始まりの行番号）"
"を指定します。"

