# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid ""
"<span>42.25 Window Systems<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Window-"
"Systems-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>42.25 ウィンドウシステム<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Window-"
"Systems-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid ""
"Emacs works with several window systems, most notably the X Window System.  "
"Both Emacs and X use the term &ldquo;window&rdquo;, but use it differently.  "
"An Emacs frame is a single window as far as X is concerned; the individual "
"Emacs windows are not known to X at all."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは複数のウィンドウシステムに対応しており、中でも特に代表的なのがX "
"Window Systemです。EmacsとXはともに「ウィンドウ」という用語を用いますが、その"
"使い方は異なります。Xの観点から見れば、Emacsのフレームは単一のウィンドウであ"
"り、個々のEmacsウィンドウはX側では認識されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-system</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dsystem-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-system</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"window_002dsystem-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid ""
"This terminal-local variable tells Lisp programs what window system Emacs is "
"using for displaying the frame.  The possible values are"
msgstr ""
"この端末ローカル変数は、Emacsがフレームの表示にどのウィンドウシステムを使用し"
"ているかをLispプログラムに知らせます。取り得る値は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-X-Window-System\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">x</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-X-Window-System\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-X-Window-System\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">x</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-X-Window-System\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid "Emacs is displaying the frame using X."
msgstr "EmacsはXを使用してフレームを表示しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid "Emacs is displaying the frame using native MS-Windows GUI."
msgstr "EmacsはネイティブのMS-Windows GUIを使用してフレームを表示しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid ""
"Emacs is displaying the frame using the Nextstep interface (used on GNUstep "
"and macOS)."
msgstr ""
"EmacsはNextstepインターフェース（GNUstepやmacOSで使用）を用いてフレームを表示"
"しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid "Emacs is displaying the frame using MS-DOS direct screen writes."
msgstr ""
"EmacsはMS-DOSのダイレクト画面書き込みを用いてフレームを表示しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Window-Systems.html
msgid "Emacs is displaying the frame using the Application Kit on Haiku."
msgstr "EmacsはHaiku上のApplication Kitを使用してフレームを表示しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
