# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the parent window of <var class=\"var\">window</var>.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">window</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it defaults to the selected window.  The return value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if <var class=\"var\">window</var> has no parent "
"(i.e., it is a minibuffer window or the root window of its frame)."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <var class=\"var\">window</var> の親ウィンドウを返します。<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> が省略された場合や <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> が指定された場合は、選択中のウィンドウがデフォルトとなります。<var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> に親がない場合（すなわちミニバッファウィンドウまた"
"はそのフレームのルートウィンドウである場合）、戻り値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"A parent window always has at least two child windows.  If this number were "
"to fall to one as a result of window deletion (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Deleting-Windows.html\">Deleting Windows</a>), Emacs automatically "
"deletes the parent window too, and its sole remaining child window takes its "
"place in the window tree."
msgstr ""
"親ウィンドウには常に少なくとも2つの子ウィンドウが存在します。ウィンドウの削除"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Deleting-Windows.html\">ウィンドウの削除</a>を参"
"照）によってこの数が1つになった場合、Emacsは自動的に親ウィンドウも削除し、唯"
"一残った子ウィンドウがウィンドウツリーにおけるその位置を引き継ぎます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"A child window can be either a live window, or an internal window (which in "
"turn would have its own child windows).  Therefore, each internal window can "
"be thought of as occupying a certain rectangular <em class=\"dfn\">screen "
"area</em>&mdash;the union of the areas occupied by the live windows that are "
"ultimately descended from it."
msgstr ""
"子ウィンドウには、ライブウィンドウと内部ウィンドウ（さらに独自の子ウィンドウ"
"を持つ）のいずれかがあります。したがって、各内部ウィンドウはある矩形の<em "
"class=\"dfn\">画面領域</em>――最終的にそこから派生するライブウィンドウが占める"
"領域の和集合――を占有していると考えることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-combination\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vertical-combination\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-horizontal-combination\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window-combination\"></a> <a "
