"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-horizontal-combination\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"For each internal window, the screen areas of the immediate children are "
"arranged either vertically or horizontally (never both).  If the child "
"windows are arranged one above the other, they are said to form a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">vertical combination</em>; if they are arranged side by side, "
"they are said to form a <em class=\"dfn\">horizontal combination</em>.  "
"Consider the following example:"
msgstr ""
"各内部ウィンドウにおいて、直下の子ウィンドウの画面領域は、垂直方向または水平"
"方向のいずれかに配置されます（両方に配置されることはありません）。子ウィンド"
"ウが上下に配置されている場合は<em class=\"dfn\">垂直組み合わせ</em>、左右に配"
"置されている場合は<em class=\"dfn\">水平組み合わせ</em>を形成すると言います。"
"次の例を考えてみましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     ______________________________________\n"
"    | ______  ____________________________ |\n"
"    ||      || __________________________ ||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||____________W4____________|||\n"
"    ||      || __________________________ ||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||                          |||\n"
"    ||      |||____________W5____________|||\n"
"    ||__W2__||_____________W3_____________ |\n"
"    |__________________W1__________________|\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"The root window of this frame is an internal window, <var class=\"var\">W1</"
"var>.  Its child windows form a horizontal combination, consisting of the "
"live window <var class=\"var\">W2</var> and the internal window <var "
"class=\"var\">W3</var>.  The child windows of <var class=\"var\">W3</var> "
"form a vertical combination, consisting of the live windows <var "
"class=\"var\">W4</var> and <var class=\"var\">W5</var>.  Hence, the live "
"windows in this window tree are <var class=\"var\">W2</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">W4</var>, and <var class=\"var\">W5</var>."
msgstr ""
"このフレームのルートウィンドウは、内部ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W1</var> "
"です。その子ウィンドウは、ライブウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W2</var> と内部"
"ウィンドウ <var class=\"var\">W3</var> からなる水平方向の組み合わせを形成して"
"います。<var class=\"var\">W3</var> の子ウィンドウは、ライブウィンドウ <var "
"class=\"var\">W4</var> と <var class=\"var\">W5</var> からなる垂直方向の組み"
"合わせを形成しています。したがって、このウィンドウツリーにおけるライブウィン"
"ドウは <var class=\"var\">W2</var>、<var class=\"var\">W4</var>、および <var "
"class=\"var\">W5</var> となります。"

