# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function returns the nearest live window in direction <var "
"class=\"var\">direction</var> as seen from the position of <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var>&rsquo;s point (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-Point.html\">Windows and Point</a>).  The argument <var "
"class=\"var\">direction</var> must be one of <code class=\"code\">above</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">below</code>, <code class=\"code\">left</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">right</code>.  The optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">window</var> must denote a live window and defaults to the "
"selected one."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の点の位置から見た方向 <var "
"class=\"var\">direction</var> における最も近いアクティブウィンドウを返します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Point.html\">ウィンドウと点</a> を参照）。"
"引数 <var class=\"var\">direction</var> は、<code class=\"code\">above</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">below</code>、<code class=\"code\">left</code>、"
"または <code class=\"code\">right</code> のいずれかである必要があります。オプ"
"ション引数 <var class=\"var\">window</var> はアクティブウィンドウを指定する必"
"要があり、デフォルトでは選択中のウィンドウが指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function does not return a window for which <code class=\"code\">window-"
"no-other-p</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-"
"Ordering.html\">Cyclic Ordering of Windows</a>) returns non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If the nearest window&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">no-other-window</code> parameter is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function tries to find another window in the "
"indicated direction whose <code class=\"code\">no-other-window</code> "
"parameter is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  However, if the optional "
"argument <var class=\"var\">ignore</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, a window may be returned even if its <code class=\"code\">no-other-"
"window</code> parameter is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、<code class=\"code\">window-no-other-p</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cyclic-Window-Ordering.html\">ウィンドウの循環順序</a>"
"を参照）が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外を返すウィンドウを返しません。最"
"も近いウィンドウの<code class=\"code\">no-other-window</code>パラメータが"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外である場合、この関数は指定された方向におい"
"て、<code class=\"code\">no-other-window</code>パラメータが<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>である別のウィンドウを探そうとします。ただし、オプ"
"ション引数<var class=\"var\">ignore</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以"
"外である場合は、<code class=\"code\">no-other-window</code>パラメータが<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外であってもウィンドウが返されることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">sign</var> is a negative number, "
"it means to use the right or bottom edge of <var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"as reference position instead of <code class=\"code\">window-point</code>.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">sign</var> is a positive number, it means to use the "
"left or top edge of <var class=\"var\">window</var> as reference position."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">sign</var> が負の数の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">window-point</code> の代わりに <var class=\"var\">window</"
"var> の右端または下端を参照位置として使用します。<var class=\"var\">sign</"
"var> が正の数の場合、<var class=\"var\">window</var> の左端または上端を参照位"
"置として使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">wrap</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means to wrap <var class=\"var\">direction</"
"var> around frame borders.  For example, if <var class=\"var\">window</var> "
"is at the top of the frame and <var class=\"var\">direction</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">above</code>, then this function usually returns the "
"frame&rsquo;s minibuffer window if it&rsquo;s active and a window at the "
"bottom of the frame otherwise."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">wrap</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、これは <var class=\"var\">direction</var> をフレームの枠線"
"で囲むことを意味します。例えば、<var class=\"var\">window</var> がフレームの"
"上部にあり、<var class=\"var\">direction</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">above</code> である場合、この関数は通常、フレームのミニバッ"
"ファウィンドウがアクティブであればそれを、そうでなければフレーム下部のウィン"
"ドウを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"If the optional argument <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, this function may return the minibuffer window even "
"when it&rsquo;s not active.  If the optional argument <var "
"class=\"var\">minibuf</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this means "
"to return the minibuffer window if and only if it is currently active.  If "
"<var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> is neither <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"nor <code class=\"code\">t</code>, this function never returns the "
"minibuffer window.  However, if <var class=\"var\">wrap</var> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it always acts as if <var class=\"var\">minibuf</"
"var> were <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> が <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> の場合、この関数はミニバッファウィンドウがアクティブでないときでも、そ"
"れを返すことがあります。オプション引数 <var class=\"var\">minibuf</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、これはミニバッファウィンドウが現在ア"
"クティブである場合に限り、それを返すことを意味します。<var "
"class=\"var\">minibuf</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> でも <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> でもない場合、この関数がミニバッファウィンドウを返す"
"ことはありません。ただし、<var class=\"var\">wrap</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、常に <var class=\"var\">minibuf</"
"var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるかのように動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"If it doesn&rsquo;t find a suitable window, this function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"適切なウィンドウが見つからない場合、この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"Don&rsquo;t use this function to check whether there is <em "
"class=\"emph\">no</em> window in <var class=\"var\">direction</var>.  "
"Calling <code class=\"code\">window-at-side-p</code> described above is a "
"much more efficient way to do that."
msgstr ""
"この関数を使って <var class=\"var\">direction</var> にウィンドウが<em "
"class=\"emph\">ない</em>かどうかを判定しないでください。前述の <code "
"class=\"code\">window-at-side-p</code> を呼び出す方が、はるかに効率的な方法で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid "The following function retrieves the entire window tree of a frame:"
msgstr "以下の関数は、フレームのウィンドウツリー全体を取得します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-tree</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dtree\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">window-tree</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"frame</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-window_002dtree\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"This function returns a list representing the window tree for frame <var "
"class=\"var\">frame</var>.  If <var class=\"var\">frame</var> is omitted or "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it defaults to the selected frame."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、フレーム <var class=\"var\">frame</var> のウィンドウツリーを表す"
"リストを返します。<var class=\"var\">frame</var> が省略された場合、または "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が指定された場合は、選択中のフレームがデフォ"
"ルトとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"The return value is a list of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">root</var> <var class=\"var\">mini</var>)</code>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">root</var> represents the window tree of the frame&rsquo;s "
"root window, and <var class=\"var\">mini</var> is the frame&rsquo;s "
"minibuffer window."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">root</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">mini</var>)</code> 形式のリストであり、<var "
"class=\"var\">root</var> はフレームのルートウィンドウのウィンドウツリーを、"
"<var class=\"var\">mini</var> はフレームのミニバッファウィンドウを表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Windows-and-Frames.html
msgid ""
"If the root window is live, <var class=\"var\">root</var> is that window "
"itself.  Otherwise, <var class=\"var\">root</var> is a list <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">dir</var> <var class=\"var\">edges</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">w1</var> <var class=\"var\">w2</var> ...)</code> where "
"<var class=\"var\">dir</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> for a "
"horizontal combination and <code class=\"code\">t</code> for a vertical "
"combination, <var class=\"var\">edges</var> gives the size and position of "
"the combination, and the remaining elements are the child windows.  Each "
"child window may again be a window object (for a live window) or a list with "
"the same format as above (for an internal window).  The <var "
"class=\"var\">edges</var> element is a list <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">left</var> <var class=\"var\">top</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">right</var> <var class=\"var\">bottom</var>)</code>, similar "
"to the value returned by <code class=\"code\">window-edges</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coordinates-and-Windows.html\">Coordinates and "
"Windows</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ルートウィンドウがライブウィンドウである場合、<var class=\"var\">root</var>は"
"そのウィンドウ自身となります。そうでない場合、<var class=\"var\">root</var>は"
"リスト<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">dir</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">edges</var> <var class=\"var\">w1</var> <var class=\"var\">w2</"
"var> ...)</code>となり、水平方向の組み合わせでは<var class=\"var\">dir</var>"
"が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>、垂直方向の組み合わせでは<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>となります。<var class=\"var\">edges</var>は組み合わせ"
"のサイズと位置を指定し、残りの要素は子ウィンドウとなります。各子ウィンドウ"
"は、再びウィンドウオブジェクト（ライブウィンドウの場合）、または上記と同じ形"
"式のリスト（内部ウィンドウの場合）となります。<var class=\"var\">edges</var>"
"要素はリスト<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">left</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">top</var> <var class=\"var\">right</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">bottom</var>)</code>であり、<code class=\"code\">window-edges</"
"code>が返す値と同様です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coordinates-and-"
"Windows.html\">座標とウィンドウ</a>を参照）。"

