# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The functions for parsing words described below use the syntax table and "
"<code class=\"code\">char-script-table</code> to decide whether a given "
"character is part of a word.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-"
"Tables.html\">Syntax Tables</a>, and see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Character-"
"Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>."
msgstr ""
"以下に説明する単語解析関数では、構文テーブルと<code class=\"code\">char-"
"script-table</code>を用いて、特定の文字が単語の一部であるかどうかを判定しま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Syntax-Tables.html\">構文テーブル</a>および<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-word</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-forward_002dword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-word</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-forward_002dword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This function moves point forward <var class=\"var\">count</var> words (or "
"backward if <var class=\"var\">count</var> is negative).  If <var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> is omitted or <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"defaults to 1.  In an interactive call, <var class=\"var\">count</var> is "
"specified by the numeric prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、ポインタを <var class=\"var\">count</var> 単語分前方に移動させま"
"す（<var class=\"var\">count</var> が負の場合は後方に移動させます）。<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var> が省略された場合、または <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> が指定された場合は、デフォルトで 1 となります。対話的な呼び出しでは、"
"<var class=\"var\">count</var> は数値プレフィックス引数で指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"&ldquo;Moving one word&rdquo; means moving until point crosses a word-"
"constituent character, which indicates the beginning of a word, and then "
"continue moving until the word ends.  By default, characters that begin and "
"end words, known as <em class=\"dfn\">word boundaries</em>, are defined by "
"the current buffer&rsquo;s syntax table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Syntax-Class-Table.html\">Table of Syntax Classes</a>), but modes can "
"override that by setting up a suitable <code class=\"code\">find-word-"
"boundary-function-table</code>, described below.  Characters that belong to "
"different scripts (as defined by <code class=\"code\">char-script-table</"
"code>), also define a word boundary (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-"
"Properties.html\">Character Properties</a>).  In any case, this function "
"cannot move point past the boundary of the accessible portion of the buffer, "
"or across a field boundary (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Fields.html\">Defining and Using Fields</a>).  The most common case "
"of a field boundary is the end of the prompt in the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"「1単語分移動する」とは、ポイントが単語の開始を示す単語構成文字を通過するまで"
"移動し、その後、単語が終わるまで移動し続けることを意味します。デフォルトで"
"は、<em class=\"dfn\">単語境界</em>と呼ばれる単語の開始および終了を示す文字"
"は、現在のバッファの構文テーブル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Syntax-Class-"
"Table.html\">構文クラス表</a>を参照）によって定義されますが、モードでは後述す"
"る適切な<code class=\"code\">find-word-boundary-function-table</code>を設定す"
"ることで、これを上書きできます。異なるスクリプトに属する文字（<code "
"class=\"code\">char-script-table</code>で定義）も単語境界を定義します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Character-Properties.html\">文字プロパティ</a>を参"
"照）。いずれの場合においても、この関数でポイントをバッファのアクセス可能な範"
"囲の境界を超えて移動させたり、フィールド境界（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Fields.html\">フィールドの定義と使用</a>を参照）を越えさせたりすること"
"はできません。フィールド境界の最も一般的な例は、ミニバッファにおけるプロンプ"
"トの末尾です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If it is possible to move <var class=\"var\">count</var> words, without "
"being stopped prematurely by the buffer boundary or a field boundary, the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  Otherwise, the return value is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and point stops at the buffer boundary or "
"field boundary."
msgstr ""
"バッファ境界やフィールド境界によって途中で停止することなく、<var "
"class=\"var\">count</var>単語分移動できる場合、値は<code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>となります。そうでない場合、戻り値は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>とな"
"り、ポインタはバッファ境界またはフィールド境界で停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">inhibit-field-text-motion</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, this function ignores field boundaries."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">inhibit-field-text-motion</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、この関数はフィールド境界を無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backward-word</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
"count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-backward_002dword\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">backward-word</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional "
