"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This function is just like <code class=\"code\">forward-word</code>, except "
"that it moves backward until encountering the front of a word, rather than "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"この関数は<code class=\"code\">forward-word</code>とほぼ同じですが、前方では"
"なく単語の先頭に到達するまで後方に移動する点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">words-include-escapes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-words_002dinclude_002descapes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">words-include-escapes</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-words_002dinclude_002descapes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This variable affects the behavior of <code class=\"code\">forward-word</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">backward-word</code>, and everything that "
"uses them.  If it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then characters in "
"the escape and character-quote syntax classes count as part of words.  "
"Otherwise, they do not."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">forward-word</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">backward-word</code>、ならびにそれらを使用するすべての要素の動"
"作に影響します。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、エスケープお"
"よび文字クォート構文クラスに属する文字は単語の一部としてカウントされます。そ"
"れ以外の場合は、カウントされません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">inhibit-field-text-motion</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-inhibit_002dfield_002dtext_002dmotion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">inhibit-field-text-motion</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-inhibit_002dfield_002dtext_002dmotion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, certain motion "
"functions including <code class=\"code\">forward-word</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>, and <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"paragraph</code> ignore field boundaries."
msgstr ""
"この変数が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-word</code>、<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</code>を含む特定のモーション関"
"数はフィールド境界を無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-word-boundary-function-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-find_002dword_002dboundary_002dfunction_002dtable\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">find-word-boundary-function-table</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-find_002dword_002dboundary_002dfunction_002dtable\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This variable affects the behavior of <code class=\"code\">forward-word</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">backward-word</code>, and everything that "
"uses them.  Its value is a char-table (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">Char-Tables</a>) of functions to search for "
"word boundaries.  If a character has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"entry in this table, then when a word starts or ends with that character, "
"the corresponding function will be called with 2 arguments: <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> and <var class=\"var\">limit</var>.  The function "
"should return the position of the other word boundary.  Specifically, if "
"<var class=\"var\">pos</var> is smaller than <var class=\"var\">limit</var>, "
"then <var class=\"var\">pos</var> is at the beginning of a word, and the "
"function should return the position after the last character of the word; "
"otherwise, <var class=\"var\">pos</var> is at the last character of a word, "
"and the function should return the position of that word&rsquo;s first "
"character."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">forward-word</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">backward-word</code>、ならびにそれらを使用するすべての要素の動"
"作に影響します。その値は、単語境界を検索するための関数を格納した文字テーブル"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Char_002dTables.html\">文字テーブル</a>を参照）で"
"す。ある文字についてこのテーブルに <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のエン"
"トリがある場合、その文字で単語が開始または終了すると、対応する関数が <var "
"class=\"var\">pos</var> と <var class=\"var\">limit</var> の2つの引数とともに"
"呼び出されます。この関数は、もう一方の単語境界の位置を返すべきです。具体的に"
"は、<var class=\"var\">pos</var> が <var class=\"var\">limit</var> より小さい"
"場合、<var class=\"var\">pos</var> は単語の先頭にあり、関数は単語の最後の文字"
"の後の位置を返す必要があります。そうでない場合、<var class=\"var\">pos</var> "
"は単語の最後の文字にあり、関数はその単語の最初の文字の位置を返すべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-word-strictly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-forward_002dword_002dstrictly\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">forward-word-strictly</strong> <var class=\"def-var-"
"arguments\">&amp;optional count</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-forward_002dword_002dstrictly\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"This function is like <code class=\"code\">forward-word</code>, but it is "
"not affected by <code class=\"code\">find-word-boundary-function-table</"
"code>.  Lisp programs that should not change behavior when word movement is "
"modified by modes which set that table, such as <code class=\"code\">subword-"
"mode</code>, should use this function instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-word</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は <code class=\"code\">forward-word</code> と同様ですが、<code "
"class=\"code\">find-word-boundary-function-table</code> の影響は受けません。"
"<code class=\"code\">subword-mode</code> のように当該テーブルを設定するモード"
"によってワード移動が変更された際にも動作を変えてはならない Lisp プログラムで"
"は、<code class=\"code\">forward-word</code> の代わりにこの関数を使用する必要"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Word-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
