# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Dynamic-Modules.html
msgid ""
"Once your module is written, compile it to produce a shared library, "
"according to the conventions of the underlying platform.  Then place the "
"shared library in a directory mentioned in <code class=\"code\">load-path</"
