# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"Lisp primitives are Lisp functions implemented in C.  The details of "
"interfacing the C function so that Lisp can call it are handled by a few C "
"macros.  The only way to really understand how to write new C code is to "
"read the source, but we can explain some things here."
msgstr ""
"Lispプリミティブは、C言語で実装されたLisp関数です。Lispから呼び出せるようにC"
"関数をインターフェースする詳細は、いくつかのCマクロによって処理されています。"
"新しいCコードの書き方を真に理解するにはソースコードを読むしかありませんが、こ"
"こではいくつかの点について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"An example of a special form is the definition of <code class=\"code\">or</"
"code>, from <samp class=\"file\">eval.c</samp>.  (An ordinary function would "
"have the same general appearance.)"
msgstr ""
"特殊な形式の一例として、<samp class=\"file\">eval.c</samp> から <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> を定義する場合が挙げられます。（通常の関数でも、概ね"
"同様の外観になります。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DEFUN (&quot;or&quot;, For, Sor, 0, UNEVALLED, 0,\n"
"       doc: /* Eval args until one of them yields non-nil,\n"
"then return that value.\n"
"The remaining args are not evalled at all.\n"
"If all args return nil, return nil.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"usage: (or CONDITIONS...)  */)\n"
"  (Lisp_Object args)\n"
"{\n"
"  Lisp_Object val = Qnil;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  while (CONSP (args))\n"
"    {\n"
"      val = eval_sub (XCAR (args));\n"
"      if (!NILP (val))\n"
"        break;\n"
"      args = XCDR (args);\n"
"      maybe_quit ();\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  return val;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DEFUN_002c-C-macro-to-define-Lisp-"
"primitives\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DEFUN_002c-C-macro-to-define-Lisp-"
"primitives\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-Emacs-Primitives.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s start with a precise explanation of the arguments to the <code "
"class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> macro.  Here is a template for them:"
msgstr ""
"まずは、<code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> マクロの引数について正確に説明しま"
"しょう。以下にそのテンプレートを示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
