# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-to-Files.html
msgid ""
"You can write the contents of a buffer, or part of a buffer, directly to a "
"file on disk using the <code class=\"code\">append-to-file</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">write-region</code> functions.  Don&rsquo;t use these "
"functions to write to files that are being visited; that could cause "
"confusion in the mechanisms for visiting."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-file</code> および <code class=\"code\">write-"
"region</code> 関数を使用すると、バッファの内容、またはバッファの一部をディス"
"ク上のファイルに直接書き込むことができます。現在参照中のファイルにこれらの関"
"数を使用して書き込まないでください。参照メカニズムに混乱を招く恐れがありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-to-Files.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">append-to-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"append_002dto_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">append-to-file</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">start end "
"filename</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"append_002dto_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-to-Files.html
msgid ""
"This function appends the contents of the region delimited by <var "
"class=\"var\">start</var> and <var class=\"var\">end</var> in the current "
"buffer to the end of file <var class=\"var\">filename</var>.  If that file "
"does not exist, it is created.  This function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、現在のバッファ内で <var class=\"var\">start</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">end</var> で区切られた領域の内容を、ファイル <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> の末尾に追加します。そのファイルが存在しない場合"
"は、作成されます。この関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-to-Files.html
msgid ""
"An error is signaled if you cannot write or create <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var>."
msgstr ""
