# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-to-Files.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">with-temp-file</code> macro evaluates the <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> forms with a temporary buffer as the current "
"buffer; then, at the end, it writes the buffer contents into file <var "
"class=\"var\">file</var>.  It kills the temporary buffer when finished, "
"restoring the buffer that was current before the <code class=\"code\">with-"
"temp-file</code> form.  Then it returns the value of the last form in <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">with-temp-file</code> マクロは、一時的なバッファを現在の"
"バッファとして <var class=\"var\">body</var> 形式を評価し、最後にそのバッファ"
"の内容をファイル <var class=\"var\">file</var> に書き込みます。処理が完了する"
"と一時的なバッファを破棄し、<code class=\"code\">with-temp-file</code> 形式の"
"前に現在のバッファであったものを復元します。その後、<var class=\"var\">body</"
"var> にある最後の形式の値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Writing-to-Files.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">with-temp-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Current-Buffer.html#Definition-of-with_002dtemp_002dbuffer\">Current "
"Buffer</a>), the temporary buffer used by this macro does not run the hooks "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"buffer-query-functions</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing-"
"Buffers.html\">Killing Buffers</a>), and <code class=\"code\">buffer-list-"
"update-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Buffer-List.html\">The "
"Buffer List</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">with-temp-buffer</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Current-Buffer.html#Definition-of-with_002dtemp_002dbuffer\">カレント"
"バッファ</a>を参照）と同様に、このマクロで使用される一時バッファでは、フック "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code>、<code class=\"code\">kill-"
"buffer-query-functions</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing-"
"Buffers.html\">バッファの削除</a>を参照）、および <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-list-update-hook</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Buffer-List.html\">バッファリスト</a>を参照）は実行されません。"

