# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Together, these four targets return integer data necessary to make use of a "
"bitmap image stored on the X server: the pixel value of the bitmap&rsquo;s "
