# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns a string containing the user name of the machine on "
"which the selection owner is running."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、選択オーナーが動作しているマシンのユーザー名を含む文字列を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">LENGTH</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">LENGTH</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns an unsigned 32-bit or 16-bit integer containing the "
"length of the selection data."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、選択データの長さを含む符号なし32ビットまたは16ビット整数を"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">LINE_NUMBER</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">LINE_NUMBER</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns two unsigned 32-bit integers of type <code "
"class=\"code\">SPAN</code> describing the line numbers corresponding to the "
"start and end positions of the selection data in the text field containing "
"it."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、それを格納するテキストフィールド内の選択データの開始位置お"
"よび終了位置に対応する行番号を示す、<code class=\"code\">SPAN</code>型の符号"
"なし32ビット整数を2つ返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">MODULE</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">MODULE</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns the name of any function containing the selection data.  "
"It is principally requested by text editors."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、選択データを含む任意の関数名を返します。主にテキストエディ"
"タから利用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns the selection data as a string of type <code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code>, encoded in ISO Latin-1 format, with Unix "
"newline characters."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、選択データをISO Latin-1形式でエンコードし、Unix形式の改行文"
"字を含む<code class=\"code\">STRING</code>型の文字列として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">C_STRING</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">C_STRING</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns the selection data as a &ldquo;C string&rdquo;.  This "
"has been interpreted as meaning the raw selection data in whatever encoding "
"used by the owner, either terminated with a NULL byte or not at all, or an "
"ASCII string which may or may not be terminated."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、選択データを「C文字列」として返します。これは、所有者が使用"
"しているエンコーディングによる生の選択データ（NULLバイトで終端されているか否"
"かを問わず）、あるいは終端されているか否かを問わないASCII文字列である、と解釈"
"されてきました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This returns the selection data as a string of type <code "
"class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</code>, encoded in UTF-8, with unspecified EOL "
"format."
msgstr ""
"これにより、選択データがUTF-8でエンコードされ、EOL形式が未指定の<code "
"class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</code>型の文字列として返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">TIMESTAMP</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">TIMESTAMP</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This target returns the X server time at which the selection owner took "
"ownership over the selection as a 16-bit or 32-bit word of type <code "
"class=\"code\">CARDINAL</code>."
msgstr ""
"このターゲットは、セレクションの所有者が所有権を取得した時点のXサーバー時刻"
"を、<code class=\"code\">CARDINAL</code>型の16ビットまたは32ビットワードとし"
"て返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">TEXT</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">TEXT</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This polymorphic target returns selection data as a string, either <code "
"class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>, <code class=\"code\">STRING</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">C_STRING</code>, or <code class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</"
"code>, whichever data type is convenient for the selection owner."
msgstr ""
"このポリモーフィックなターゲットは、選択オーナーにとって都合の良いデータ型に"
"応じて、<code class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code>、<code class=\"code\">C_STRING</code>、または"
"<code class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</code>のいずれかの文字列として選択データを返"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"When a request for the targets <code class=\"code\">STRING</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>, or <code class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</"
"code> is made using the function <code class=\"code\">gui-get-selection</"
"code>, and neither <code class=\"code\">selection-coding-system</code> nor "
"<code class=\"code\">next-selection-coding-system</code> is set, the "
"resultant strings are decoded by the proper coding systems for those "
"targets: <code class=\"code\">iso-8859-1</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">compound-text-with-extensions</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">utf-8</code> respectively."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">gui-get-selection</code> を用いてターゲット <code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code>、<code class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>、また"
"は <code class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</code> のリクエストが行われ、かつ <code "
"class=\"code\">selection-coding-system</code> も <code class=\"code\">next-"
"selection-coding-system</code> も設定されていない場合、生成された文字列は、そ"
"れぞれのターゲットに対応する適切な符号化方式（<code "
"class=\"code\">iso-8859-1</code>、<code class=\"code\">compound-text-with-"
"extensions</code>、<code class=\"code\">utf-8</code>）でデコードされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the targets specified above (and the many targets used by "
"various programs for their own purposes), several popular programs and "
"toolkits have defined selection data types of their own, without consulting "
"the appropriate X standards bodies.  These targets are generally named after "
"such MIME types as <code class=\"code\">text/html</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">image/jpeg</code>; they have been witnessed returning the "
"following forms of data:"
msgstr ""
"上述のターゲット（および各種プログラムが独自の目的で利用している数多くのター"
"ゲット）に加え、いくつかの普及しているプログラムやツールキットは、適切なX標準"
"策定機関に諮ることなく、独自の選択データ型を定義しています。これらのターゲッ"
"トは一般に <code class=\"code\">text/html</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">image/jpeg</code> といったMIMEタイプにちなんで命名されており、"
"以下のような形式のデータを返すことが確認されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Unterminated, newline terminated, or NULL character terminated file names of "
"an image or text file."
msgstr ""
"画像ファイルまたはテキストファイルの、終端なし・改行終端・NULL文字終端のファ"
"イル名。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "Image or text data in the appropriate format."
msgstr "適切な形式の画像またはテキストデータ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">file://</code> URIs (or conceivably newline or NUL "
"terminated lists of URIs) identifying files in the appropriate format."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">file://</code> 適切な形式のファイルを識別するURI（あるい"
"は、想定される改行またはNUL終端のURIリスト）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"These selection targets were first used by Netscape, but are now proffered "
"by all kinds of programs, especially those based on recent versions of the "
"GTK+ or Qt toolkits."
msgstr ""
"これらの選択ターゲットは当初Netscapeで採用されていましたが、現在ではあらゆる"
"種類のプログラム、特に最新バージョンのGTK+やQtツールキットをベースとしたもの"
"で提供されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Emacs is also capable of serving as a selection owner.  When <code "
"class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code> is called, the selection data "
"provided is recorded internally and Emacs obtains ownership of the selection "
"being set."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは選択範囲のオーナーとなることもできます。<code class=\"code\">gui-set-"
"selection</code>が呼び出されると、提供された選択範囲のデータが内部的に記録さ"
"れ、Emacsは設定対象の選択範囲の所有権を取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">selection-converter-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-selection_002dconverter_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">selection-converter-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-selection_002dconverter_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Alist of selection targets to &ldquo;selection converter&rdquo; functions.  "
"When a selection request is received, Emacs looks up the selection converter "
"pertaining to the requested selection target."
msgstr ""
"「選択コンバータ」関数への選択対象の一覧。選択リクエストを受信すると、Emacsは"
"要求された選択対象に対応する選択コンバータを参照します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"Selection converters are called with three arguments: the symbol "
"corresponding to the atom identifying the selection being requested, the "
"selection target that is being requested, and the value set with <code "
"class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code>.  The values which they must return "
"are either conses of symbols designating the data type and numbers, symbols, "
"vectors of numbers or symbols, or the cdrs of such conses by themselves."
msgstr ""
"選択コンバータは、要求される選択を識別するアトムに対応するシンボル、要求され"
"る選択対象、および<code class=\"code\">gui-set-selection</code>で設定された値"
"という3つの引数で呼び出されます。返すべき値は、データ型と数値を指定するシンボ"
"ル、シンボル、数値またはシンボルのベクトル、あるいはそれらのコンス自体のcdrの"
"いずれかとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If a selection converter&rsquo;s value is the special symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">NULL</code>, the data type returned to its requestor is set "
"to <code class=\"code\">NULL</code>, and no data is sent in response."
msgstr ""
"選択コンバータの値が特殊記号 <code class=\"code\">NULL</code> の場合、リクエ"
"スト元に返されるデータ型は <code class=\"code\">NULL</code> に設定され、応答"
"としてデータは送信されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If such a value is a string, it must be a unibyte string; should no data "
"type be explicitly specified, the data is transferred to its requestor with "
"the type <code class=\"code\">STRING</code>."
msgstr ""
"このような値が文字列である場合、それはユニバイト文字列でなければなりません。"
"データ型が明示的に指定されていない場合、データはタイプ <code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code> として要求元に転送されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If it is a symbol, its &ldquo;atom&rdquo; is retrieved, and it is "
"transferred to its requestor as a 32-bit value&mdash;if no data type is "
"specified, its type is <code class=\"code\">ATOM</code>."
msgstr ""
"シンボルである場合は、その「アトム」が取得され、リクエスト元に32ビット値とし"
"て転送されます――データ型が指定されていない場合、その型は<code "
"class=\"code\">ATOM</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If it is a number between <code class=\"code\">-32769</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">32768</code>, it is transferred to its requestor as a 16 bit "
"value&mdash;if no data type is specified, its type is <code "
"class=\"code\">INTEGER</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">-32769</code>から<code class=\"code\">32768</code>までの"
"数値である場合、リクエスト元に16ビット値として転送されます。データ型が指定さ"
"れていない場合、その型は<code class=\"code\">INTEGER</code>となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If it is any other number, it is accounted a 32 bit value.  Even if the "
"number returned is unsigned, its requestor will treat words of type <code "
"class=\"code\">INTEGER</code> as signed.  To return an unsigned value, "
"specify the type <code class=\"code\">CARDINAL</code> in its place."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の数値の場合は、32ビット値として扱われます。返される数値が符号なしで"
"あっても、要求元は<code class=\"code\">INTEGER</code>型のワードを符号付きとし"
"て扱います。符号なし値を返すには、代わりに<code class=\"code\">CARDINAL</"
"code>型を指定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"If it is a vector of symbols or numbers, the response to its requestor will "
"be a list of multiple atoms or numbers.  The data type returned when not "
"expressly set is that of the list&rsquo;s first element."
msgstr ""
"記号や数値のベクトルである場合、その要求元への応答は、複数のアトムまたは数値"
"のリストとなります。明示的に設定されていない場合に返されるデータ型は、リスト"
"の最初の要素の型となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"By default, Emacs is configured with selection converters for the following "
"selection targets:"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、Emacsは以下の選択対象に対して選択コンバータが設定されていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "This selection converter returns selection data as:"
msgstr "この選択コンバータは、選択データを以下のように返します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"A string of type <code class=\"code\">C_STRING</code>, if the selection "
"contents contain no multibyte characters, or contain &ldquo;raw 8-bit "
"bytes&rdquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">Text "
"Representations</a>)."
msgstr ""
"選択内容にマルチバイト文字が含まれていないか、あるいは「生の8ビットバイト」が"
"含まれている場合の <code class=\"code\">C_STRING</code> 型の文字列（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Representations.html\">テキスト表現</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"A string of type <code class=\"code\">STRING</code>, if the selection "
"contents can be represented as ISO-Latin-1 text."
msgstr ""
"選択内容をISO-Latin-1テキストで表現できる場合の、<code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code>型の文字列。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"A string of type <code class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>, if the selection "
"contents can be encoded in the X Consortium&rsquo;s Compound Text Encoding, "
"and <code class=\"code\">selection-coding-system</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">next-selection-coding-system</code> is set to a coding system "
"whose <code class=\"code\">:mime-charset</code> property is <code "
"class=\"code\">x-ctext</code>."
msgstr ""
"選択内容を X Consortium の Compound Text Encoding でエンコードできる場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code> 型の文字列を、<code "
"class=\"code\">:mime-charset</code> プロパティが <code class=\"code\">x-"
"ctext</code> である符号化方式が <code class=\"code\">selection-coding-"
"system</code> または <code class=\"code\">next-selection-coding-system</"
"code> に設定されている場合はその方式を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><ul><li>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "A string of type <code class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</code> otherwise."
msgstr "それ以外の場合は、<code class=\"code\">UTF8_STRING</code> 型の文字列。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This selection converter returns selection data as a string of type <code "
"class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>."
msgstr ""
"この選択コンバータは、選択データを<code class=\"code\">COMPOUND_TEXT</code>型"
"の文字列として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid ""
"This selection converter returns selection data as a string of type <code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code>, encoded in ISO-Latin-1 format."
msgstr ""
"この選択コンバータは、選択データをISO-Latin-1形式でエンコードされた<code "
"class=\"code\">STRING</code>型の文字列として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
msgid "This selection converter returns selection data in UTF-8 format."
msgstr "この選択コンバータは、選択データをUTF-8形式で返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X-Selections.html
