msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-X11-keysyms\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X11-Keysyms.html
msgid ""
"To define system-specific X11 keysyms, set the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">system-key-alist</code>."
msgstr ""
"システム固有の X11 keysym を定義するには、変数 <code class=\"code\">system-"
"key-alist</code> を設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/X11-Keysyms.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-key-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"system_002dkey_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">system-key-alist</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"system_002dkey_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X11-Keysyms.html
msgid ""
"This variable&rsquo;s value should be an alist with one element for each "
"system-specific keysym.  Each element has the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">code</var> . <var class=\"var\">symbol</"
"var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">code</var> is the numeric keysym code "
"(not including the vendor-specific bit, &minus;2**28), and <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> is the name for the function key."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、システム固有の各キーシンボルを要素とするalistである必要があり"
"ます。各要素は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">code</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var>)</code> という形式をとり、ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">code</var> は数値のキーシンボルコード（ベンダー固有ビット "
"&minus;2**28 を除く）、<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> はファンクションキーの"
"名称となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X11-Keysyms.html
msgid ""
"For example <code class=\"code\">(168 . mute-acute)</code> defines a system-"
"specific key (used by HP X servers) whose numeric code is &minus;2**28 + 168."
msgstr ""
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">(168 . mute-acute)</code>はシステム固有のキー"
"（HP Xサーバーで使用）を定義しており、その数値コードは&minus;2**28 + 168とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X11-Keysyms.html
msgid ""
"It is not crucial to exclude from the alist the keysyms of other X servers; "
"those do no harm, as long as they don&rsquo;t conflict with the ones used by "
"the X server actually in use."
msgstr ""
"alistから他のXサーバーのkeysymsを除外する必要はありません。実際に使用している"
"Xサーバーのkeysymsと競合しない限り、特に問題はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/X11-Keysyms.html
msgid ""
"The variable is always local to the current terminal, and cannot be buffer-"
"local.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">Multiple "
"Terminals</a>."
msgstr ""
"この変数は常に現在のターミナルにローカルであり、バッファローカルにはなり得ま"
"せん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Multiple-Terminals.html\">複数ターミナル</a>を"
"参照してください。"

