# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/XPM-Images.html
msgid ""
"To use XPM format, specify <code class=\"code\">xpm</code> as the image "
"type.  The additional image property <code class=\"code\">:color-symbols</"
"code> is also meaningful with the <code class=\"code\">xpm</code> image type:"
msgstr ""
"XPM形式を使用するには、画像タイプとして<code class=\"code\">xpm</code>を指定"
"してください。追加の画像プロパティ<code class=\"code\">:color-symbols</code>"
"も、画像タイプ<code class=\"code\">xpm</code>において有効です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/XPM-Images.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:color-symbols <var class=\"var\">symbols</var></code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:color-symbols <var class=\"var\">symbols</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/XPM-Images.html
msgid ""
"The value, <var class=\"var\">symbols</var>, should be an alist whose "
"elements have the form <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">name</var> . "
"<var class=\"var\">color</var>)</code>.  In each element, <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> is the name of a color as it appears in the image "
"file, and <var class=\"var\">color</var> specifies the actual color to use "
"for displaying that name."
msgstr ""
"値 <var class=\"var\">symbols</var> は、要素が <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> . <var class=\"var\">color</var>)</code> の形式を持"
"つアリストである必要があります。各要素において、<var class=\"var\">name</"
"var> は画像ファイルに現れる色名であり、<var class=\"var\">color</var> はその"
"色名を表示する際に実際に使用する色を指定します。"

