# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"Xwidgets (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Xwidgets.html\">Embedded Native "
"Widgets</a>) can send events to update Lisp programs on their status.  These "
"events are dubbed <code class=\"code\">xwidget-events</code>, and contain "
"various data describing the nature of the change."
msgstr ""
"Xwidgets（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Xwidgets.html\">組み込みネイティブウィ"
"ジェット</a>を参照）は、Lispプログラムにステータスを更新するためのイベントを"
"送信できます。これらのイベントは<code class=\"code\">xwidget-events</code>と"
"呼ばれ、変更の内容を示すさまざまなデータを含んでいます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-xwidget_002devent-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(xwidget-event <var class=\"var\">kind</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">xwidget</var> <var class=\"var\">arg</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-xwidget_002devent-event\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-xwidget_002devent-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(xwidget-event <var class=\"var\">kind</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">xwidget</var> <var class=\"var\">arg</var>)</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-xwidget_002devent-event\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is sent whenever some kind of update occurs in <var "
"class=\"var\">xwidget</var>.  There are several types of updates, identified "
"by their <var class=\"var\">kind</var>."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> で何らかの更新が発生するたび"
"に送信されます。更新にはいくつかの種類があり、それぞれ <var "
"class=\"var\">kind</var> で識別されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
