# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"It is a special event (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-"
"Events.html\">Special Events</a>), which should be handled by adding a "
"callback to an xwidget that is called whenever an xwidget event for <var "
"class=\"var\">xwidget</var> is received."
msgstr ""
"これは特殊なイベント（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Special-Events.html\">特殊イ"
"ベント</a>を参照）であり、<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> の xwidget イベン"
"トを受信するたびに呼び出されるコールバックを xwidget に追加することで処理する"
"必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"You can add a callback by setting the <code class=\"code\">callback</code> "
"of an xwidget&rsquo;s property list, which should be a function that accepts "
"<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> and <var class=\"var\">kind</var> as "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"xwidgetのプロパティリストの<code class=\"code\">callback</code>にコールバック"
"を設定することで追加できます。このコールバックは、<var "
"class=\"var\">xwidget</var>と<var class=\"var\">kind</var>を引数として受け取"
"る関数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dchanged-xwidget-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">load-changed</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"load_002dchanged-xwidget-event\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dchanged-xwidget-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">load-changed</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"load_002dchanged-xwidget-event\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This xwidget event indicates that the <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> has "
"reached a particular point of the page-loading process.  When these events "
"are sent, <var class=\"var\">arg</var> will contain a string that further "
"describes the status of the widget:"
msgstr ""
"このxwidgetイベントは、<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>がページ読み込みプロセ"
"スの特定の時点に達したことを示します。これらのイベントが送信されると、<var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>にはウィジェットの状態をさらに詳細に記述する文字列が含"
"まれます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dstarted-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-started</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dstarted-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dstarted-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-started</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dstarted-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid "This means the widget has begun a page-loading operation."
msgstr "これは、ウィジェットがページ読み込み処理を開始したことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
