"<a id=\"index-load_002dfinished-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-finished</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dfinished-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dfinished-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-finished</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dfinished-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This means the <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> has finished processing "
"whatever page-loading operation that it was previously performing."
msgstr ""
"これは、<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> がそれまで行っていたページ読み込み処"
"理を完了したことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dredirected-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-redirected</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dredirected-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dredirected-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-redirected</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dredirected-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This means the <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> has encountered and followed "
"a redirect during the page-loading operation."
msgstr ""
"これは、ページ読み込み処理中に <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> がリダイレク"
"トを検知し、それに従ったことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dcommitted-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-committed</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dcommitted-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-load_002dcommitted-in-xwidgets\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">load-committed</samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-load_002dcommitted-in-xwidgets\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This means the <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> has committed to a given URL "
"during the page-loading operation, i.e. the URL is the final URL that will "
"be rendered by <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> during the current page-"
"loading operation."
msgstr ""
"これは、ページ読み込み処理中に <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> が特定のURLを"
"確定したことを意味します。つまり、そのURLが、現在のページ読み込み処理におい"
"て <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> によってレンダリングされる最終的なURLとな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-download_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">download-callback</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-download_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-download_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">download-callback</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-download_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid "This event indicates that a download of some kind has been completed."
msgstr "このイベントは、何らかのダウンロードが完了したことを示しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"In the above events, there can be arguments after <var class=\"var\">arg</"
"var>, which itself indicates the URL from which the download file was "
"retrieved: the first argument after <var class=\"var\">arg</var> indicates "
"the MIME type of the download, as a string, while the second argument "
"contains the full file name of the downloaded file."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-download_002dstarted-xwidget-events\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">download-started</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-download_002dstarted-xwidget-events\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-download_002dstarted-xwidget-events\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">download-started</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-download_002dstarted-xwidget-events\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event indicates that a download has been started.  In these events, "
"<var class=\"var\">arg</var> contains the URL of the file that is currently "
"being downloaded."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、ダウンロードが開始されたことを示します。これらのイベントで"
"は、<var class=\"var\">arg</var> に現在ダウンロード中のファイルの URL が含ま"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-javascript_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">javascript-callback</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-javascript_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-javascript_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">javascript-callback</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-javascript_002dcallback-xwidget-events\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event contains JavaScript callback data.  These events are used "
"internally by <code class=\"code\">xwidget-webkit-execute-script</code>."
msgstr ""
"このイベントにはJavaScriptのコールバックデータが含まれています。これらのイベ"
"ントは<code class=\"code\">xwidget-webkit-execute-script</code>で内部的に使用"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-xwidget_002ddisplay_002devent-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(xwidget-display-event <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">source</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"xwidget_002ddisplay_002devent-event\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-xwidget_002ddisplay_002devent-event\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">(xwidget-display-event <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">source</var>)</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"xwidget_002ddisplay_002devent-event\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"This event is sent whenever an xwidget requests that another xwidget be "
"displayed.  <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> is the xwidget that should be "
"displayed, and <var class=\"var\">source</var> is the xwidget that asked to "
"display <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>."
msgstr ""
"このイベントは、あるxwidgetが別のxwidgetの表示を要求するたびに送信されます。"
"<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>は表示されるべきxwidgetであり、<var "
"class=\"var\">source</var>は<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>の表示を要求した"
"xwidgetです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"It is also a special event which should be handled through callbacks.  You "
"can add such a callback by setting the <code class=\"code\">display-"
"callback</code> of <var class=\"var\">source</var>&rsquo;s property list, "
"which should be a function that accepts <var class=\"var\">xwidget</var> and "
"<var class=\"var\">source</var> as arguments."
msgstr ""
"また、これはコールバックを通じて処理すべき特殊なイベントでもあります。このよ"
"うなコールバックは、<var class=\"var\">source</var>のプロパティリストの<code "
"class=\"code\">display-callback</code>に設定することで追加でき、そのプロパ"
"ティリストには<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>と<var class=\"var\">source</"
"var>を引数として受け取る関数を指定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidget-Events.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>&rsquo;s buffer will be set to a temporary "
"buffer.  When displaying the widget, care should be taken to replace the "
"buffer with the buffer in which the xwidget will be displayed, using <code "
"class=\"code\">set-xwidget-buffer</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Xwidgets.html\">Embedded Native Widgets</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">xwidget</var>のバッファは一時バッファに設定されます。ウィ"
"ジェットを表示する際は、<code class=\"code\">set-xwidget-buffer</code>を用い"
"て、バッファをxwidgetが表示されるバッファに置き換えるよう注意してください"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Xwidgets.html\">組み込みネイティブウィジェット</"
"a>を参照）。"

