"class=\"var\">case-insensitive</var> denotes whether or not the search is "
"case-insensitive, <var class=\"var\">backwards</var> determines if the "
"search is performed backwards towards the start of the document, and <var "
"class=\"var\">wrap-around</var> determines whether or not the search "
"terminates at the end of the document."
msgstr ""
