# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidgets.html
msgid ""
"The returned value is a list of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">back</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">here</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">forward</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">here</var> is "
"the current navigation item, while <var class=\"var\">back</var> is a list "
"of items containing the items recorded by WebKit before the current "
"navigation item, and <var class=\"var\">forward</var> is a list of items "
"recorded after the current navigation item.  <var class=\"var\">back</var>, "
"<var class=\"var\">here</var> and <var class=\"var\">forward</var> can all "
"be <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"戻り値は <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">back</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">here</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">forward</var>)</code> 形式の"
"リストであり、<var class=\"var\">here</var> は現在のナビゲーション項目、<var "
"class=\"var\">back</var> は現在のナビゲーション項目より前に WebKit が記録した"
"項目のリスト、<var class=\"var\">forward</var> は現在のナビゲーション項目より"
"後に記録された項目のリストとなります。<var class=\"var\">back</var>、<var "
"class=\"var\">here</var>、<var class=\"var\">forward</var> はいずれも <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> となり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
