msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">here</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"means that no items have been recorded yet; if <var class=\"var\">back</var> "
"or <var class=\"var\">forward</var> are <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it "
"means that there is no history recorded before or after the current item "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">here</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合は、"
"まだ項目が記録されていないことを意味し、<var class=\"var\">back</var>または"
"<var class=\"var\">forward</var>が<code class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合"
"は、それぞれ現在の項目の前後に記録された履歴がないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Xwidgets.html
msgid ""
"Navigation items are themselves lists of the form <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">idx</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">title</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">uri</var>)</code>.  In these lists, <var class=\"var\">idx</"
"var> is an index that can be passed to <code class=\"code\">xwidget-webkit-"
"goto-history</code>, <var class=\"var\">title</var> is the human-readable "
"title of the item, and <var class=\"var\">uri</var> is the URI of the item.  "
"The user should normally have no reason to load <var class=\"var\">uri</var> "
"manually to reach a specific history item.  Instead, <var class=\"var\">idx</"
"var> should be passed as an index to <code class=\"code\">xwidget-webkit-"
"goto-history</code>."
msgstr ""
"ナビゲーション項目自体は、<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">idx</"
"var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">title</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">uri</var>)</"
"code> 形式のリストとなっています。これらのリストにおいて、<var "
"class=\"var\">idx</var> は <code class=\"code\">xwidget-webkit-goto-history</"
"code> に渡すことができるインデックス、<var class=\"var\">title</var> は項目の"
"人間が読みやすいタイトル、<var class=\"var\">uri</var> は項目のURIです。通"
"常、ユーザーが特定の履歴項目にアクセスするために <var class=\"var\">uri</"
"var> を手動で読み込む必要はありません。代わりに、<var class=\"var\">idx</"
"var> をインデックスとして <code class=\"code\">xwidget-webkit-goto-history</"
"code> に渡す必要があります。"

