# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.8.4 Functions for Yanking<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Functions-for-Yanking\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.8.4 ヤンク用の関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Functions-for-"
"Yanking\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This section describes higher-level commands for yanking, which are intended "
"primarily for the user but useful also in Lisp programs.  Both <code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code> and <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> honor "
"the <code class=\"code\">yank-excluded-properties</code> variable and <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> text property (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Yanking.html\">Yanking</a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節では、主にユーザー向けでありながら、Lispプログラムにおいても有用な、ヤン"
"ク用の上位レベルコマンドについて説明します。<code class=\"code\">yank</code> "
"と <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> はいずれも、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-excluded-properties</code> とテキストプロパティ <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> に従います（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Yanking.html\">ヤンク</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional arg</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-yank\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional arg</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-yank\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inserting-killed-text\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inserting-killed-text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts before point the text at the front of the kill ring.  "
"It sets the mark at the beginning of that text, using <code "
"class=\"code\">push-mark</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-"
"Mark.html\">The Mark</a>), and puts point at the end."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、キルリングの先頭にあるテキストをポイントの前に挿入します。"
"<code class=\"code\">push-mark</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"The-"
"Mark.html\">マーク</a>を参照）を用いてそのテキストの先頭にマークを設定し、ポ"
"イントを末尾に配置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">arg</var> is a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"list (which occurs interactively when the user types <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</"
"kbd> with no digits), then <code class=\"code\">yank</code> inserts the text "
"as described above, but puts point before the yanked text and sets the mark "
"after it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のリスト"
"である場合（ユーザーが数字を含まずに <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> と入力した"
"際にインタラクティブに発生します）、<code class=\"code\">yank</code> は上述の"
"通りにテキストを挿入しますが、ポイントをヤンクしたテキストの前に置き、マーク"
"をその後ろに設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">arg</var> is a number, then <code class=\"code\">yank</"
"code> inserts the <var class=\"var\">arg</var>th most recently killed "
"text&mdash;the <var class=\"var\">arg</var>th element of the kill ring list, "
"counted cyclically from the front, which is considered the first element for "
"this purpose."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が数値の場合、<code class=\"code\">yank</code> "
"は直近に削除された <var class=\"var\">arg</var> 番目のテキスト――先頭から循環"
"的に数えてキルリングリストの <var class=\"var\">arg</var> 番目の要素（この目"
"的においては最初の要素とみなされる）――を挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> does not alter the contents of the kill "
"ring, unless it used text provided by another program, in which case it "
"pushes that text onto the kill ring.  However if <var class=\"var\">arg</"
"var> is an integer different from one, it rotates the kill ring to place the "
"yanked string at the front."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> は、別のプログラムから提供されたテキストを使"
"用している場合を除き、キルリングの内容を変更しません。その場合、当該テキスト"
"をキルリングにプッシュします。ただし、<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が 1 以外"
"の整数である場合、キルリングを回転させてヤンクした文字列を先頭に配置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Command: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-pop</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional arg</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-yank_002dpop\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">コマンド: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-pop</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">&amp;optional arg</"
"var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-yank_002dpop\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"When invoked immediately after a <code class=\"code\">yank</code> or another "
"<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code>, this command replaces the just-yanked "
"entry from the kill ring with a different entry from the kill ring.  When "
"this command is invoked like that, the region contains text that was just "
"inserted by another yank command.  <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> "
"deletes that text and inserts in its place a different piece of killed "
"text.  It does not add the deleted text to the kill ring, since it is "
"already in the kill ring somewhere.  It does however rotate the kill ring to "
"place the newly yanked string at the front."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> または別の <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</"
"code> の直後にこのコマンドを呼び出すと、キルリングから直前にヤンクされたエン"
"トリを、キルリング内の別のエントリで置き換えます。このようにコマンドを呼び出"
"した場合、リージョンには別のヤンクコマンドによって挿入されたばかりのテキスト"
"が含まれています。<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> はそのテキストを削除"
"し、代わりにキルリング内の別のテキストを挿入します。削除されたテキストはすで"
"にキルリングのどこかに存在するため、キルリングに追加することはありません。た"
"だし、新しくヤンクされた文字列を先頭に配置するため、キルリングを回転させま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">arg</var> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the "
"replacement text is the previous element of the kill ring.  If <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var> is numeric, the replacement is the <var "
"class=\"var\">arg</var>th previous kill.  If <var class=\"var\">arg</var> is "
"negative, a more recent kill is the replacement."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、置換"
"テキストはキルリングの直前の要素となります。<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が数"
"値の場合、置換内容は <var class=\"var\">arg</var> 番目の直前のキルとなりま"
"す。<var class=\"var\">arg</var> が負の値の場合、より最近のキルが置換内容とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The sequence of kills in the kill ring wraps around, so if <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> is invoked repeatedly and reaches the oldest "
"kill, the one that comes after it is the newest one, and the one before the "
"newest one is the oldest one."
msgstr ""
"キルリングのキル順は循環するため、<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> が繰り"
"返し呼び出されて最古のキルに到達した場合、その後に続くものが最新となり、最新"
"のキルの直前にあるものが最古となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yank-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This command can also be invoked after a command that is not a yank "
"command.  In that case, it prompts in the minibuffer for a kill-ring entry, "
"with completion, and uses the kill ring elements as the minibuffer history "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">Minibuffer History</"
"a>).  This allows the user to interactively select one of the previous kills "
"recorded in the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、ヤンクコマンドではないコマンドの後でも実行できます。その場"
"合、ミニバッファにキルリングのエントリを補完付きでプロンプト表示し、キルリン"
"グの要素をミニバッファの履歴として使用します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">ミニバッファ履歴</a>を参照）。これにより、"
"ユーザーはキルリングに記録された過去のキル履歴の中から、対話的に一つを選択で"
"きます。"

