msgstr ""
"<span>30.24 メディアのヤンキング<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Yanking-"
"Media-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yank-media-from-window_002dsystem-"
"selections\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yank-media-from-window_002dsystem-"
"selections\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"Data saved within window system selections and the MS-Windows clipboard is "
"not restricted to plain text.  It is possible for selection data to "
"encompass images or other binary data of the like, as well as rich text "
"content instanced by HTML, and also PostScript.  Since the selection data "
"types incident to this data are at variance with those for plain text, the "
"insertion of such data is facilitated by a set of functions dubbed <em "
"class=\"dfn\">yank-media handlers</em>, which are registered by each major "
"mode undertaking its insertion and called where warranted upon the execution "
"of the <code class=\"code\">yank-media</code> command."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウシステムの選択範囲およびMS-Windowsのクリップボードに保存されるデー"
"タは、プレーンテキストに限定されません。選択データには、画像やその他の同様の"
"バイナリデータのほか、HTMLやPostScriptでインスタンス化されたリッチテキストコ"
"ンテンツが含まれる場合があります。これらのデータに関連する選択データの型はプ"
"レーンテキストの型とは異なるため、こうしたデータの挿入は、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">yank-media handlers</em>と呼ばれる一連の関数によって容易に行わ"
"れます。これらの関数は、挿入を担う各メジャーモードによって登録され、<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-media</code>コマンドの実行時に必要に応じて呼び出されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Function: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-media-handler</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">types "
"handler</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"yank_002dmedia_002dhandler\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">関数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-media-handler</strong> <var class=\"def-var-arguments\">types "
"handler</var><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"yank_002dmedia_002dhandler\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid "Register a yank-media handler which applies to the current buffer."
msgstr "現在のバッファに適用されるヤンクメディアハンドラを登録します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">types</var> can be a symbol designating a selection data "
"type (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accessing-Selections.html\">Accessing "
"Selections</a>), a regexp against which such types are matched, or a list of "
"these symbols and regexps.  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">types</var> は、選択データ型を指定するシンボル（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accessing-Selections.html\">選択へのアクセス</a> を参"
"照）、そのような型と照合するための正規表現、あるいはこれらのシンボルと正規表"
"現のリストのいずれかになります。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(yank-media-handler 'text/html #'my-html-handler)\n"
"(yank-media-handler &quot;image/.*&quot; #'my-image-handler)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"When a selection offers a data type matching <var class=\"var\">types</var>, "
"the function <var class=\"var\">handler</var> is called to insert its data, "
"with the symbol designating the matching selection data type, and the data "
"returned by <code class=\"code\">gui-get-selection</code>."
msgstr ""
"選択が <var class=\"var\">types</var> に一致するデータ型を提供する場合、関数 "
"<var class=\"var\">handler</var> が呼び出されてそのデータが挿入される。このと"
"き、シンボルは一致する選択のデータ型を指定し、データは <code "
"class=\"code\">gui-get-selection</code> によって返される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">yank-media</code> command auto selects the "
"preferred <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> type by default.  The rules used "
"for the selection can be controlled through the variables <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-media-autoselect-function</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-media-preferred-types</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank-media</code> コマンドは、デフォルトで優先される "
"<small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> タイプを自動的に選択します。選択に使用される"
"ルールは、変数 <code class=\"code\">yank-media-autoselect-function</code> お"
"よび <code class=\"code\">yank-media-preferred-types</code> で制御できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-media-autoselect-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dmedia_002dautoselect_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-media-autoselect-function</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dmedia_002dautoselect_002dfunction\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"This variable should specify a function that will be called with the list of "
"<small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> types available for the current major mode, "
"and should return a list of preferred <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> types "
"to use.  The first <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> type in the list will "
"always be used by the <code class=\"code\">yank-media</code> command when "
"auto selection is requested."
msgstr ""
"この変数には、現在のメジャーモードで利用可能な<small class=\"sc\">MIME</"
"small>タイプの一覧を引数として受け取り、使用すべき優先的な<small "
"class=\"sc\">MIME</small>タイプの一覧を返す関数を指定する必要があります。自動"
"選択が要求された場合、リストの先頭にある<small class=\"sc\">MIME</small>タイ"
"プが常に<code class=\"code\">yank-media</code>コマンドによって使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-media-preferred-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dmedia_002dpreferred_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-media-preferred-types</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dmedia_002dpreferred_002dtypes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"This variable changes the default selection process of <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-media-autoselect-function</code>.  It is a list that "
"should contain the sole <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> type to choose in "
"the order of their preference.  It can also contain a function in which case "
"it is called with the list of available <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> "
"types and must return a list of preferred <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> "
"types in order of their preference.  This list is passed onto the <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-media</code> command so the first element of the "
"returned list is chosen when auto selection is requested."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、<code class=\"code\">yank-media-autoselect-function</code> のデ"
"フォルトの選択プロセスを変更します。これは、選択すべき唯一の <small "
"class=\"sc\">MIME</small> タイプを優先順位順に並べたリストです。また、関数を"
"指定することも可能で、その場合は利用可能な <small class=\"sc\">MIME</small> "
"タイプのリストを引数として渡され、優先順位順に好ましい <small "
"class=\"sc\">MIME</small> タイプのリストを返す必要があります。このリストは "
"<code class=\"code\">yank-media</code> コマンドに渡されるため、自動選択が要求"
"された際には、返されたリストの先頭要素が選択されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking-Media.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">yank-media-types</code> command presents a list of "
"selection data types that are currently available, which is useful when "
"implementing yank-media handlers; for programs generally offer an eclectic "
"and seldom consistent medley of data types."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank-media-types</code> コマンドは、現在利用可能な選択"
"データ型の一覧を表示します。これは yank-media ハンドラを実装する際に有用で"
"す。というのも、プログラムでは一般的に、多種多様で一貫性に欠けるデータ型が混"
"在しているためです。"

