# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"This function works like <code class=\"code\">insert</code>, except that it "
"processes the text in <var class=\"var\">string</var> according to the <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> text property, as well as the variables "
