# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">function</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">function</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"When <var class=\"var\">function</var> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, it is called instead of <code class=\"code\">insert</code> to insert "
"the string, with one argument&mdash;the string to insert."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではない"
"場合、文字列を挿入するために <code class=\"code\">insert</code> の代わりに呼"
"び出され、挿入する文字列という1つの引数が渡されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">param</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">param</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">param</var> is present and non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it replaces <var class=\"var\">string</var> (or "
"the substring of <var class=\"var\">string</var> being processed) as the "
"object passed to <var class=\"var\">function</var> (or <code "
"class=\"code\">insert</code>).  For example, if <var class=\"var\">function</"
"var> is <code class=\"code\">yank-rectangle</code>, <var "
"class=\"var\">param</var> should be a list of strings to insert as a "
"rectangle."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">param</var> が存在し、かつ <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、それは <var class=\"var\">function</var>（または <code "
"class=\"code\">insert</code>）に渡されるオブジェクトとして、<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>（または処理中の <var class=\"var\">string</var> の"
"部分文字列）を置き換えます。例えば、<var class=\"var\">function</var> が "
"<code class=\"code\">yank-rectangle</code> である場合、<var "
"class=\"var\">param</var> は矩形として挿入する文字列のリストである必要があり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">noexclude</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">noexclude</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">noexclude</var> is present and non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, that disables the normal action of <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handled-properties</code> and <code class=\"code\">yank-"
"excluded-properties</code> on the inserted string."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">noexclude</var> が存在し、かつ <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、挿入された文字列に対する <code class=\"code\">yank-handled-"
"properties</code> および <code class=\"code\">yank-excluded-properties</"
"code> の通常の動作が無効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">undo</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">undo</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">undo</var> is present and non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it is a function that will be called by <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> to undo the insertion of the current object.  "
"It is called with two arguments, the start and end of the current region.  "
"<var class=\"var\">function</var> can set <code class=\"code\">yank-undo-"
"function</code> to override the <var class=\"var\">undo</var> value."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">undo</var> が存在し、かつ <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"ではない場合、それは <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> によって呼び出さ"
"れ、現在のオブジェクトの挿入を取り消す関数となります。この関数には、現在の領"
"域の開始位置と終了位置という2つの引数が渡されます。<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var> は、<var class=\"var\">undo</var> の値を上書きす"
"るように <code class=\"code\">yank-undo-function</code> を設定できます。"

