#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-handled-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dhandled_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">yank-handled-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-yank_002dhandled_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies special text property handling conditions for yanked "
"text.  It takes effect after the text has been inserted (either normally, or "
"via the <code class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> property), and prior to "
"<code class=\"code\">yank-excluded-properties</code> taking effect."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、ヤンクされたテキストに対する特殊なテキストプロパティ処理条件を指"
"定します。テキストが挿入された後（通常の挿入、または<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handler</code>プロパティ経由）、かつ<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-excluded-properties</code>が効力を発揮する前に適用されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"The value should be an alist of elements <code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">prop</var> . <var class=\"var\">fun</var>)</code>.  Each alist "
"element is handled in order.  The inserted text is scanned for stretches of "
"text having text properties <code class=\"code\">eq</code> to <var "
"class=\"var\">prop</var>; for each such stretch, <var class=\"var\">fun</"
"var> is called with three arguments: the value of the property, and the "
"start and end positions of the text."
msgstr ""
"値は要素 <code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">prop</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">fun</var>)</code> のアリストである必要があります。各アリスト要"
"素は順に処理されます。挿入されたテキストから、テキストプロパティ <code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> から <var class=\"var\">prop</var> を持つテキストの"
"連続箇所がスキャンされ、そのような連続箇所ごとに、プロパティの値、およびテキ"
"ストの開始位置と終了位置の3つの引数を用いて <var class=\"var\">fun</var> が呼"
"び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">User Option: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-excluded-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dexcluded_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">ユーザーオプション: </span><span><strong "
"class=\"def-name\">yank-excluded-properties</strong><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-yank_002dexcluded_002dproperties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is the list of properties to remove from inserted "
"text.  Its default value contains properties that might lead to annoying "
"results, such as causing the text to respond to the mouse or specifying key "
"bindings.  It takes effect after <code class=\"code\">yank-handled-"
"properties</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、挿入テキストから削除するプロパティのリストです。デフォルト値"
"には、テキストをマウスに反応させたりキーバインドを指定したりするなど、不都合"
"な結果を招く可能性のあるプロパティが含まれています。<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handled-properties</code> の後に適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-transform-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dtransform_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">yank-transform-functions</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-yank_002dtransform_002dfunctions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"This variable is a list of functions.  Each function is called (in order) "
"with the string to be yanked as the argument, and should return a (possibly "
"transformed) string.  This variable can be set globally, but can also be "
"used to create new commands that are variations on <code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code>.  For instance, to create a command that works "
"like <code class=\"code\">yank</code>, but cleans up whitespace before "
"inserting, you could say something like:"
msgstr ""
"この変数は関数のリストです。各関数は、ヤンク対象の文字列を引数として（順に）"
"呼び出され、（場合によっては変換された）文字列を返す必要があります。この変数"
"はグローバルに設定できるほか、<code class=\"code\">yank</code> のバリエーショ"
"ンとなる新しいコマンドを作成する際にも利用できます。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code> と同様に動作しつつ、挿入前に空白文字を除去するコマ"
"ンドを作成するには、次のように記述できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/elisp/Yanking.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun yank-with-clean-whitespace ()\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (let ((yank-transform-functions\n"
"\t '(string-clean-whitespace)))\n"
"    (call-interactively #'yank)))\n"
msgstr ""

