# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"This function asks the user a question, expecting input in the minibuffer.  "
"It returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if the user types <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>, <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the user types "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>.  This function also accepts <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> to mean yes and <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> to mean "
"no.  It accepts <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-]</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd> to quit, because the question uses the minibuffer and for that reason "
"the user might try to use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-]</kbd> to get out.  The "
"answer is a single character, with no <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> needed to "
"terminate it.  Upper and lower case are equivalent."
msgstr ""
"この関数はユーザーに質問を行い、ミニバッファへの入力を待機します。ユーザーが "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> と入力した場合は <code class=\"code\">t</code> "
"を、<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> と入力した場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。また、<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> を「はい」、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> を「いいえ」として受け付けます。質問にミニバッファを"
"使用しているため、ユーザーが <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-]</kbd> を使って終了しよう"
"とする可能性があり、終了用の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-]</kbd> および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> も受け付けます。回答は単一の文字であり、終了させるた"
"めの <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> は不要です。大文字と小文字は区別されませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"&ldquo;Asking the question&rdquo; means printing <var class=\"var\">prompt</"
"var> in the minibuffer, followed by the string &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(y&nbsp;or&nbsp;n)&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo;.  If the input is not "
"one of the expected answers (<kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></"
"kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd>, or something "
"that quits), the function responds &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Please answer "
"y or n.</samp>&rsquo;, and repeats the request."
msgstr ""
"「質問する」とは、ミニバッファに <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> を出力し、続"
"いて文字列 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(y&nbsp;or&nbsp;n)&nbsp;</"
"samp>&rsquo; を出力することを意味します。入力が想定される回答（<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DEL</"
"kbd></kbd>、または終了させるもの）のいずれでもない場合、関数は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Please answer y or n.</samp>&rsquo; と応答し、リクエストを繰り"
"返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> is a non-empty string, and it ends with a "
"non-space character, a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">SPC</samp>&rsquo; "
"character will be appended to it."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">prompt</var> が空でない文字列であり、かつ末尾がスペース以"
"外の文字である場合、そこに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">SPC</samp>&rsquo; とい"
"う文字が付加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"This function actually uses the minibuffer, but does not allow editing of "
"the answer.  The cursor moves to the minibuffer while the question is being "
"asked."
msgstr ""
"この関数は実際にミニバッファを使用しますが、回答の編集はできません。質問が行"
"われている間、カーソルはミニバッファに移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"The answers and their meanings, even &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">y</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">n</samp>&rsquo;, are not "
"hardwired, and are specified by the keymap <code class=\"code\">query-"
"replace-map</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Search-and-"
"Replace.html\">Search and Replace</a>).  In particular, if the user enters "
"the special responses <code class=\"code\">recenter</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up</code>, <code class=\"code\">scroll-down</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-other-window</code>, or <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-other-window-down</code> (respectively bound to <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-l</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"v</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-v</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-S-v</kbd> "
"in <code class=\"code\">query-replace-map</code>), this function performs "
"the specified window recentering or scrolling operation, and poses the "
"question again."
msgstr ""
"回答とその意味（「<samp class=\"samp\">y</samp>」や「<samp class=\"samp\">n</"
"samp>」でさえも）はハードコードされておらず、キーマップ <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace-map</code> によって指定されています（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Search-and-Replace.html\">検索と置換</a> を参照）。特"
"に、ユーザーが特殊応答 <code class=\"code\">recenter</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up</code>、<code class=\"code\">scroll-down</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-other-window</code>、または <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-other-window-down</code>（それぞれ <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace-map</code> 内の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-l</kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-v</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-S-v</kbd> にバインドされて"
"います）を入力した場合、この関数は指定されたウィンドウの再センタリングまたは"
"スクロール操作を実行し、再度質問を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"If you bind <code class=\"code\">help-form</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Help-Functions.html\">Help Functions</a>) to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value while calling <code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</"
"code>, then pressing <code class=\"code\">help-char</code> causes it to "
"evaluate <code class=\"code\">help-form</code> and display the result.  "
"<code class=\"code\">help-char</code> is automatically added to <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> を呼び出す際に <code "
"class=\"code\">help-form</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Help-"
"Functions.html\">ヘルプ関数</a> を参照）を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以"
"外の値にバインドすると、<code class=\"code\">help-char</code> を押すことで "
"<code class=\"code\">help-form</code> が評価され、その結果が表示されます。"
"<code class=\"code\">help-char</code> は <var class=\"var\">prompt</var> に自"
"動的に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
