# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code>, except that if the user fails to "
"answer within <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> seconds, this function stops "
"waiting and returns <var class=\"var\">default</var>.  It works by setting "
"up a timer; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Timers.html\">Timers for Delayed "
"Execution</a>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">seconds</var> should be a "
"number."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code>と同様ですが、ユーザーが<var "
"class=\"var\">seconds</var>秒以内に応答しなかった場合、この関数は待機を停止し"
"て<var class=\"var\">default</var>を返します。タイマーを設定することで動作し"
"ます。詳細は<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Timers.html\">遅延実行用のタイマー</a>を"
"参照してください。引数<var class=\"var\">seconds</var>には数値を指定する必要"
"があります。"

