#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-p</code> starts by displaying <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> in the minibuffer, followed by the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">yes-or-no-prompt</code> (default&nbsp;&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(yes&nbsp;or&nbsp;no)&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo;).  The user must "
"type one of the expected responses; otherwise, the function responds &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Please&nbsp;answer&nbsp;yes&nbsp;or&nbsp;no.</"
"samp>&rsquo;, waits about two seconds and repeats the request."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-p</code> は、まずミニバッファに <var "
"class=\"var\">prompt</var> を表示し、続いて <code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-"
"prompt</code> の値（デフォルトは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(yes&nbsp;or&nbsp;no)&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo;）を表示します。ユー"
"ザーは想定される応答のいずれかを入力する必要があります。そうでない場合、関数"
"は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Please&nbsp;answer&nbsp;yes&nbsp;or&nbsp;no.</"
"samp>&rsquo; と応答し、約2秒間待機した後、リクエストを繰り返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/Yes_002dor_002dNo-Queries.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-p</code> requires more work from the user "
"than <code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code> and is appropriate for more "
"crucial decisions."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-p</code>は<code class=\"code\">y-or-n-p</code>"
"よりもユーザーの手間がかかり、より重要な判断に適しています。"

