# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/_0025_002dConstructs.html
msgid ""
"The percentage of the buffer text above the <strong class=\"strong\">top</"
