# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/_0025_002dConstructs.html
msgid ""
"The percentages of text above both the <strong class=\"strong\">top</strong> "
"and the <strong class=\"strong\">bottom</strong> of the window, separated by "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;, or &lsquo;<samp "
