# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches any value and binds <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> to that value.  "
"If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> has been matched and bound earlier in "
"this pattern, it matches here the same value that it matched before."
msgstr ""
"任意の値にマッチし、その値に <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> をバインドしま"
"す。このパターン内で既に <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> がマッチしてバインド"
"されている場合、ここでは以前にマッチしたのと同じ値にマッチします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches a string if <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> matches it.  The match "
"must cover the entire string from its first char to its last."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> が一致する場合、文字列にマッチします。マッチ"
"範囲は、文字列の先頭文字から末尾文字まで全体を網羅する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"(Meaning any other kind of non-list not described above.)  Matches anything "
"&lsquo;equal&rsquo; to it."
msgstr ""
"（上記で説明されていない、その他のあらゆる種類の非リストを指す。）  それに"
"「等しい」あらゆるものにマッチする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(rx <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(rx <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
