"string&nbsp;0&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">datum</var>)</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">(match-string&nbsp;1&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">datum</var>)</"
"code> などにバインドします。正規表現のマッチングがサポートする限り、任意の数"
"の <var class=\"var\">sym</var> を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">`<var class=\"var\">object</var></code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">`<var class=\"var\">object</var></code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
