"<code class=\"code\">(cons <var class=\"var\">carpat</var> <code "
"class=\"code\">cdrpat</code>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches a cons cell if <var class=\"var\">carpat</var> matches its <code "
