# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(list <var class=\"var\">eltpats</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(list <var class=\"var\">eltpats</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches a list if the <var class=\"var\">eltpats</var> match its elements.  "
"The first <var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> should match the list&rsquo;s "
"first element.  The second <var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> should match the "
"list&rsquo;s second element.  And so on."
