"の <var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> はリストの2番目の要素に、というようにマッ"
"チします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(vector <var class=\"var\">eltpats</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(vector <var class=\"var\">eltpats</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches a vector if the <var class=\"var\">eltpats</var> match its "
"elements.  The first <var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> should match the "
"vector&rsquo;s first element.  The second <var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> "
"should match the vector&rsquo;s second element.  And so on."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">eltpats</var> が要素にマッチすれば、ベクトルにマッチしま"
"す。最初の <var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> はベクトルの第1要素に、2番目の "
"<var class=\"var\">eltpat</var> はベクトルの第2要素に、というようにマッチしま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(cdr <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(cdr <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> with strict checking of <code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code>s.  That means that <code class=\"code\">list</"
"code> patterns verify that the final <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Strict checking is the default."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pattern</var> にマッチし、<code class=\"code\">cdr</code> "
"を厳密にチェックします。つまり、<code class=\"code\">list</code> パターンは最"
"後の <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であ"
"ることを検証します。厳密なチェックがデフォルトです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(cdr-ignore <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(cdr-ignore <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> with lax checking of <code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code>s.  That means that <code class=\"code\">list</"
"code> patterns do not examine the final <code class=\"code\">cdr</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pattern</var> にマッチし、<code class=\"code\">cdr</code> "
"のチェックは緩やかに行われます。つまり、<code class=\"code\">list</code> パ"
"ターンは最後の <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> を検証しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(and <var class=\"var\">conjuncts</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(and <var class=\"var\">conjuncts</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches each of the <var class=\"var\">conjuncts</var> against the same "
"data.  If all of them match, this pattern succeeds.  If one <var "
"class=\"var\">conjunct</var> fails, this pattern fails and does not try more "
"<var class=\"var\">conjuncts</var>."
msgstr ""
"各 <var class=\"var\">conjuncts</var> を同一のデータと照合します。すべて一致"
"すれば、このパターンは成功します。いずれか一つの <var "
"class=\"var\">conjunct</var> が失敗すると、このパターンは失敗し、以降の <var "
"class=\"var\">conjuncts</var> は試行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">disjuncts</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">disjuncts</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Matches each of the <var class=\"var\">disjuncts</var> against the same "
"data.  If one <var class=\"var\">disjunct</var> succeeds, this pattern "
"succeeds and does not try more <var class=\"var\">disjuncts</var>.  If all "
"of them fail, this pattern fails."
msgstr ""
"各 <var class=\"var\">disjuncts</var> を同一のデータと照合します。いずれか一"
"つの <var class=\"var\">disjunct</var> が成功すれば、このパターンは成功し、以"
"降の <var class=\"var\">disjuncts</var> は試行されません。すべて失敗した場"
"合、このパターンは失敗します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">cond*-expander</var> &hellip;)</"
"code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">cond*-expander</var> &hellip;)</"
"code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/cond_002a-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Here the <code class=\"code\">car</code> is a symbol that has a <code "
"class=\"code\">cond*-expander</code> property which defines how to handle it "
"in a pattern.  The property value is a function.  Trying to match such a "
"pattern calls that function with one argument, the pattern in question "
"(including its <code class=\"code\">car</code>).  The function should return "
"an equivalent pattern to be matched instead."
