# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Each clause in <var class=\"var\">clauses</var> has the form: <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">pattern</var>&nbsp;<var "
"class=\"var\">body-forms</var>&hellip;)</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">clauses</var>の各節は、<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">pattern</var>&nbsp;<var class=\"var\">body-forms</"
"var>&hellip;)</code>という形式である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate <var class=\"var\">expression</var> to determine its value, <var "
"class=\"var\">expval</var>.  Find the first clause in <var "
"class=\"var\">clauses</var> whose <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> matches "
"<var class=\"var\">expval</var> and pass control to that clause&rsquo;s <var "
"class=\"var\">body-forms</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">expression</var>を評価してその値<var "
"class=\"var\">expval</var>を求める。<var class=\"var\">clauses</var>の中で、"
"<var class=\"var\">pattern</var>が<var class=\"var\">expval</var>と一致する最"
"初の節を探し、その節の<var class=\"var\">body-forms</var>に制御を移す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"If there is a match, the value of <code class=\"code\">pcase</code> is the "
"value of the last of <var class=\"var\">body-forms</var> in the successful "
"clause.  Otherwise, <code class=\"code\">pcase</code> evaluates to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"マッチした場合、<code class=\"code\">pcase</code> の値は、成功節における "
"<var class=\"var\">body-forms</var> の最後の値となります。そうでない場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">pcase</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> と評価さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pcase-pattern\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pcase-pattern\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Each <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> has to be a <em class=\"dfn\">pcase "
"pattern</em>, which can use either one of the core patterns defined below, "
"or one of the patterns defined via <code class=\"code\">pcase-defmacro</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Extending-pcase.html\">Extending <code "
"class=\"code\">pcase</code></a>)."
msgstr ""
"各 <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> は <em class=\"dfn\">pcase パターン</em> "
"である必要があり、以下で定義されているコアパターンのいずれか、または <code "
"class=\"code\">pcase-defmacro</code> 経由で定義されているパターンのいずれかを"
"使用できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Extending-pcase.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">pcase</code> の拡張</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
