# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">sequencing pattern</em> (also known as <var "
"class=\"var\">seqpat</var>) is a pattern that processes its sub-pattern "
"arguments in sequence.  There are two for <code class=\"code\">pcase</code>: "
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> and <code class=\"code\">or</code>.  They "
"behave in a similar manner to the special forms that share their name (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Combining-Conditions.html\">Constructs for "
"Combining Conditions</a>), but instead of processing values, they process "
"sub-patterns."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">シーケンシングパターン</em>（<var class=\"var\">seqpat</"
"var>とも呼ばれる）とは、サブパターンの引数を順次処理するパターンのことです。"
"<code class=\"code\">pcase</code>には、<code class=\"code\">and</code>と"
"<code class=\"code\">or</code>の2種類があります。これらは、同名の特殊形式"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Combining-Conditions.html\">条件を組み合わせるた"
"めの構文</a>を参照）と同様の動作をしますが、値を処理する代わりにサブパターン"
"を処理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(and <var class=\"var\">pattern1</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(and <var class=\"var\">pattern1</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Attempts to match <var class=\"var\">pattern1</var>&hellip;, in order, until "
"one of them fails to match.  In that case, <code class=\"code\">and</code> "
"likewise fails to match, and the rest of the sub-patterns are not tested.  "
"If all sub-patterns match, <code class=\"code\">and</code> matches."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pattern1</var>&hellip;を順に照合し、いずれかが一致しなくな"
"るまで試みます。その場合、同様に<code class=\"code\">and</code>も一致しなくな"
"り、残りの部分パターンは検証されません。すべての部分パターンが一致すれば、"
"<code class=\"code\">and</code>が一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">pattern1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">pattern2</var>&hellip;)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(or <var class=\"var\">pattern1</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">pattern2</var>&hellip;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Attempts to match <var class=\"var\">pattern1</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">pattern2</var>, &hellip;, in order, until one of them "
"succeeds.  In that case, <code class=\"code\">or</code> likewise matches, "
"and the rest of the sub-patterns are not tested."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">pattern1</var>、<var class=\"var\">pattern2</var>、"
"&hellip; を順にマッチさせ、いずれかが成功するまで試行します。その場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">or</code>も同様にマッチし、残りの部分パターンは検証されませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/elisp/pcase-Macro.html
msgid ""
"To present a consistent environment (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Intro-"
"Eval.html\">Introduction to Evaluation</a>)  to <var class=\"var\">body-"
"forms</var> (thus avoiding an evaluation error on match), the set of "
"variables bound by the pattern is the union of the variables bound by each "
"sub-pattern.  If a variable is not bound by the sub-pattern that matched, "
"then it is bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">body-forms</var> に一貫した環境（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Intro-Eval.html\">評価入門</a>を参照）を提示し（これによりマッチ時の評"
"価エラーを回避する）、パターンによって束縛される変数の集合は、各サブパターン"
"によって束縛される変数の和集合となる。マッチしたサブパターンによって変数が束"
"縛されていない場合、その変数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に束縛される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
